            "text": "Grove Avocado Oil | Premium New Zealand Avocado Oil\n\nGet your Free Sweet Recipe Booklet now!\n\nShop\n\nHealth Benefits\n\nRecipes\n\nShop\n\nHealth Benefits\n\nRecipes\n\nNew Zealand\n\nAustralia\n\nHome\n\nShop\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nChilli Avocado Oil\n\nGarlic Avocado Oil\n\nLemon Pepper Avocado Oil\n\nLime Avocado Oil\n\nOrganic Avocado Oil\n\nGOOD By Grove\n\nHealth Benefits\n\nRecipes\n\nOur Story\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nDistributors\n\nDelivery Info\n\nPayment Info\n\nRefunds &amp; Returns\n\nSecurity &amp; Privacy\n\nMy Account\n\nNew Zealand\n\nAustralia\n\nHome\n\nShop\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nChilli Avocado Oil\n\nGarlic Avocado Oil\n\nLemon Pepper Avocado Oil\n\nLime Avocado Oil\n\nOrganic Avocado Oil\n\nGOOD By Grove\n\nHealth Benefits\n\nRecipes\n\nOur Story\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nDistributors\n\nDelivery Info\n\nPayment Info\n\nRefunds &amp; Returns\n\nSecurity &amp; Privacy\n\nMy Account\n\nNew Zealand\n\nAustralia\n\nMY ACCOUNT\n\nOur Story\n\nArticles\n\nContact\n\nContact Us\n\nDistributors\n\nWholesale Enquiries\n\nDelivery Info\n\nPayment Info\n\nRefunds &amp; Returns\n\nSecurity &amp; Privacy\n\nOur Story\n\nArticles\n\nContact\n\nContact Us\n\nDistributors\n\nWholesale Enquiries\n\nDelivery Info\n\nPayment Info\n\nRefunds &amp; Returns\n\nSecurity &amp; Privacy\n\nALL NEW &amp; AVO-LUTELY DELICIOUS!\nMeet our new Mayo range made with pure Avocado oil\n\nCreamy, bold, full of good taste &amp; healthy fats without any seed oils!\nDISCOVER\n\nWHICH TASTE ADVENTURE DO YOU CHOOSE?\nJoin us on a taste adventure with Chef Mark Southon.\n\nCreate deliciously healthy dishes at home with award-winning Grove Avocado Oil.\ncreate!\n\nCold pressed from a super fruit\nOur Story\n\nYour ultimate baking partner\nRecipes\n\nGet your free recipe book now!\n\nClick Here\n\nProud recipients of the Superior Award from\n\nthe International Institute of Taste, Belgium\n\nProud recipients of the Superior Award from the International Institute of Taste, Belgium\n\nHealth Benefits\n\nIT\u2019S GOOD FOR YOU\n\nThe amazing avocado has many distinctive health benefits and is classed as a superfood by many.\nOn top of the many health benefits here are a few:\nIt may reduce cholesterol, improve heart health and lower blood pressure.\nIt\u2019s high in rich Oleic Acid, a very healthy fat. The essential fats found avocados are essential for digestion and nutrient absorption because they nourish the lining of the gut. It\u2019s an all-round super food!\n\nIT HAS A HIGH SMOKE POINT\n\nNot every oil is created equal. The benefit of avocado oil is that it can be heated to very high temperatures. Why is this good? When oil is heated past its smoke point, the fat starts to break down, releasing free radicals and any health benefit that the oil had is lost.\n\nEXTRA VIRGIN COLD PRESSED\n\nExtra Virgin is the highest grade of avocado oil, produced from the pressing of good quality avocados.\n\nProduced at low temperatures, without chemicals the oil is 100% pure and natural.\nCold pressing from the first press of the avocado fruit means retains the same high\nlevel of nutrients, natural flavour, aroma and colour found in fresh avocado.\n\n16 AVOCADOS IN EVERY BOTTLE\n\nEvery one of our 250ml bottles contains 16 cold pressed avocados.\nQuality Avocado Oil should have a taste and colour characteristics of the fresh avocado fruit and be a dark vibrant green. We house our oil in dark glass bottles, which keeps out light\nand oxygen retaining the quality of the oil\n\nIT\u2019S GOOD FOR YOU\n\nThe amazing avocado has many distinctive health benefits and is classed as a superfood by many.\nOn top of the many health benefits here are a few:\nIt may reduce cholesterol, improve heart health and lower blood pressure.\nIt\u2019s high in rich Oleic Acid, a very healthy fat. The essential fats found avocados are essential for digestion and nutrient absorption because they nourish the lining of the gut. It\u2019s an all-round super food!\n\nEXTRA VIRGIN COLD PRESSED\n\nExtra Virgin is the highest grade of avocado oil, produced from the pressing of good quality avocados.\n\nProduced at low temperatures, without chemicals the oil is 100% pure and natural.\nCold pressing from the first press of the avocado fruit means retains the same high\nlevel of nutrients, natural flavour, aroma and colour found in fresh avocado.\n\nIT HAS A HIGH SMOKE POINT\n\nNot every oil is created equal. The benefit of avocado oil is that it can be heated to very high temperatures. Why is this good? When oil is heated past its smoke point, the fat starts to break down, releasing free radicals and any health benefit that the oil had is lost.\n\n16 AVOCADOS IN EVERY BOTTLE\n\nEvery one of our 250ml bottles contains 16 cold pressed avocados.\nQuality Avocado Oil should have a taste and colour characteristics of the fresh avocado fruit and be a dark vibrant green. We house our oil in dark glass bottles, which keeps out light\nand oxygen retaining the quality of the oil\n\nWhy Avocado Oil?\n\nOur Story\n\nBe Inspired\n\nAvocado Oil inspired recipes\n\nHearty Mushroom Bolognese\n\nVegan &amp; GF Cinnamon Sugar Doughnuts\n\nSmoked Salmon\n\nBlackberry, Thyme and Cheese Avocado Oil Cake\n\nAvocanana-Bread\n\nSee More\n\nReviews\n\nLast year I made the switch from using Olive Oil to using Grove Avocado Oil.\nI have never looked back - I love using it in cooking and for salad dressings.\n\nGrace L\n\nTrouble is I use it in everything. So I go through 2-3 bottles a week!\n\nChristine C\n\nWhen cooking rice for an Asian dish; I always put Lime Avocado Oil in the rice. One tablespoon per cup of rice.\n\nCarla G\n\nEasily the best oil for cooking. I use it regularly and have done for a few years now. Totally recommend it.\n\nJohn H\n\nMy pantry staple. I won\u2019t use any other oil now.\n\nTracey C\n\nI love it with Dukkah and bread, it brings so much flavour to every meal.\n\nViv C\n\nThe Lime Avo Oil is my favourite. Drizzled over salads \u2013 yum!\n\nSue C\n\nUnmatched anywhere in the world. The most incredible taste experience I have ever had!\n\nBea M\n\nWeeknight dinner just got a glow-up: juicy meatbal\n\n\u2728 Ready to glow naturally? Here are 3 easy ways to\n\nCREAMY SPICY CHICKEN AVO LIME TACOS Spice up tac\n\nNothing says winter comfort like creamy Leek &amp; Pot\n\nCraving a snack that\u2019s both wholesome and full of\n\nHigh smoke point \u2705\u2060 Cold-pressed \u2705\u2060 Good fats galo\n\n[CLOSED] - \ud83c\udf38\ud83c\udf38 MOTHER\u2019S DAY GIVEAWAY \ud83c\udf38\ud83c\udf38\u2060 \u2060 This Mot\n\nCraving something easy but delicious for lunch?\u2060 \u2060\n\nParsley, basil, chives, chilli \u2014 mix and match you\n\nThese Polish croquettes bring the crunch. Filled w\n\nLoad More...\n\nFollow on Instagram\n\nWeeknight dinner just got a glow-up: juicy meatbal\n\n\u2728 Ready to glow naturally? Here are 3 easy ways to\n\nCREAMY SPICY CHICKEN AVO LIME TACOS Spice up tac\n\nLoad More...\n\nFollow on Instagram\n\nAvocado Oil New Zealand Ltd\n\n1 Armstrong Road,\n\nTe Puna 3174\n\nNew Zealand\n\n+64 (0)7 552 6365\n\ninfo@avocado-oil.co.nz\n\nSHOP\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\nLime Avocado Oil\nGarlic Avocado Oil\nChilli Avocado Oil\nLemon Pepper Avocado Oil\n\nHEALTH BENEFITS\n\nWhy Extra Virgin Avocado Oil?\n\nRECIPES\nSweet &amp; Savoury Recipes\nOUR STORY\nGrove Avocado Oil Story\nQuality Guarantee\n\nDISTRIBUTION\n\nDistributors\n\nCONTACT\n\nContact Us\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nAvocado Oil New Zealand Ltd\n1 Armstrong Road,\nTe Puna 3174\nNew Zealand\n+64 (0)7 552 6365\ninfo@avocado-oil.co.nz\n\nSHOP\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nLime Avocado Oil\n\nGarlic Avocado Oil\n\nChilli Avocado Oil\n\nLemon Pepper Avocado Oil\n\nHEALTH BENEFITS\n\nWhy Extra Virgin Avocado Oil?\n\nRECIPES\nSweet &amp; Savoury Recipes\nOUR STORY\nGrove Avocado Oil Story\nQuality Guarantee\n\nDISTRIBUTION\n\nDistributors\n\nCONTACT\n\nContact Us\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nI