            "text": "[ Get your Free Sweet Recipe Booklet now! ][1]\n* [Shop][2]\n* [Health Benefits][3]\n* [Recipes][4]\n* [Shop][5]\n* [Health Benefits][6]\n* [Recipes][7]\n* [New Zealand][8]\n* [Home][9]\n* [Shop][10]\n* [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][11]\n* [Chilli Avocado Oil][12]\n* [Garlic Avocado Oil][13]\n* [Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][14]\n* [Lime Avocado Oil][15]\n* [Organic Avocado Oil][16]\n* [GOOD By Grove][17]\n* [Health Benefits][18]\n* [Recipes][19]\n* [Our Story][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Contact Us][22]\n* [Distributors][23]\n* [Delivery Info][24]\n* [Payment Info][25]\n* [Refunds & Returns][26]\n* [Security & Privacy][27]\n* [My Account][28]\n* [New Zealand][29]\n* [Home][30]\n* [Shop][31]\n* [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][32]\n* [Chilli Avocado Oil][33]\n* [Garlic Avocado Oil][34]\n* [Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][35]\n* [Lime Avocado Oil][36]\n* [Organic Avocado Oil][37]\n* [GOOD By Grove][38]\n* [Health Benefits][39]\n* [Recipes][40]\n* [Our Story][41]\n* [Blog][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n* [Distributors][44]\n* [Delivery Info][45]\n* [Payment Info][46]\n* [Refunds & Returns][47]\n* [Security & Privacy][48]\n* [My Account][49]\n[ [Grove Avocado Oil Logo] ][50]\n\n* [ New Zealand][51]\n\n[MY ACCOUNT][52]\n* [Our Story][53]\n* [Articles][54]\n* [Contact][55]\n* [Contact Us][56]\n* [Distributors][57]\n* [Wholesale Enquiries][58]\n* [Delivery Info][59]\n* [Payment Info][60]\n* [Refunds & Returns][61]\n* [Security & Privacy][62]\n* [Our Story][63]\n* [Articles][64]\n* [Contact][65]\n* [Contact Us][66]\n* [Distributors][67]\n* [Wholesale Enquiries][68]\n* [Delivery Info][69]\n* [Payment Info][70]\n* [Refunds & Returns][71]\n* [Security & Privacy][72]\n[AvoYeahMayo_web]\n[AvoYeahMayo_back_web]\n[Mayo details]\n[AvoYeahMayo_web]\n[AvoYeahMayo_back_web]\n[Mayo details]\n\n#### AvoYeah! Avocado Mayo\n\n## MAYO\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFlavo\u2502Choose an optionMayoGarlic AioliPickle MayoSriracha MayoBurger Sauce\nur \u2502Mayo\n\u2502Garlic Aioli\n\u2502Pickle Mayo\n\u2502Sriracha Mayo\n\u2502Burger Sauce\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSize \u2502Choose an option235ml\n\u2502235ml\n\u2502[Clear][73]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAvoYeah! Avocado Mayo quantity\nAdd to cart\n\n## Reviews\n\nLast year I made the switch from using Olive Oil to using Grove Avocado Oil. I have never looked\nback - I love using it in cooking and for salad dressings.\n[Grace L.]\nGrace L.\nTrouble is I use it in everything. So I go through 2-3 bottles a week!\n[Christine C.]\nChristine C.\nWhen cooking rice for an asian dish; I always put Lime Avocado Oil in the rice. One tablespoon per\ncup of rice!\n[Carla G.]\nCarla G.\n\n#### WHY NOT TRY\n\n## Avocado Chocolate Cake\n\nShare your creations with us @grove.avocado.oil\n\n[ Get Inspired ][74]\n\n# You May Also Like\n\n[ Truffle ][75]\n[ AvoYeah! Discovery Bundle ][76]\n[ AvoYeah! Burger Sauce ][77]\n[ AvoYeah! Sriracha Mayo ][78]\n[ AvoYeah! Pickle Mayo ][79]\n[ AvoYeah! Garlic Aioli ][80]\n[Grove Avocado Oil Logo]\n\nAvocado Oil New Zealand Ltd\n1 Armstrong Road,\nTe Puna 3174\nNew Zealand\n\n+64 (0)7 552 6365\n[info@avocado-oil.co.nz][81]\n\n### SHOP\n\n[Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][82]\n[Lime Avocado Oil][83]\n[Garlic Avocado Oil][84]\n[Chilli Avocado Oil][85]\n[Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][86]\n\n### HEALTH BENEFITS\n\n[Why Extra Virgin Avocado Oil?][87]\n\n### RECIPES\n\n[Sweet & Savoury Recipes][88]\n\n### OUR STORY\n\n[Grove Avocado Oil Story][89]\n[Quality Guarantee][90]\n\n### DISTRIBUTION\n\n[Distributors][91]\n\n### CONTACT\n\n[Contact Us][92]\n[Privacy Policy][93]\n\n[ Instagram ][94] [ Facebook ][95]\n[Grove Avocado Oil Logo]\n\nAvocado Oil New Zealand Ltd\n1 Armstrong Road,\nTe Puna 3174\nNew Zealand\n\n+64 (0)7 552 6365\n[info@avocado-oil.co.nz][96]\n\n### SHOP\n\n[Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][97]\n[Lime Avocado Oil][98]\n[Garlic Avocado Oil][99]\n[Chilli Avocado Oil][100]\n[Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][101]\n\n### HEALTH BENEFITS\n\n[Why Extra Virgin Avocado Oil?][102]\n\n### RECIPES\n\n[Sweet & Savoury Recipes][103]\n\n### OUR STORY\n\n[Grove Avocado Oil Story][104]\n[Quality Guarantee][105]\n\n### DISTRIBUTION\n\n[Distributors][106]\n\n### CONTACT\n\n[Contact Us][107]\n[Privacy Policy][108]\n\n[ Instagram ][109] [ Facebook ][110]\nGet free recipe book popup\n\n### **GET