            "text": "[ Get your Free Sweet Recipe Booklet now! ][1]\n* [Shop][2]\n* [Health Benefits][3]\n* [Recipes][4]\n* [Shop][5]\n* [Health Benefits][6]\n* [Recipes][7]\n* [New Zealand][8]\n* [Australia][9]\n* [Home][10]\n* [Shop][11]\n* [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][12]\n* [Chilli Avocado Oil][13]\n* [Garlic Avocado Oil][14]\n* [Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][15]\n* [Lime Avocado Oil][16]\n* [Organic Avocado Oil][17]\n* [GOOD By Grove][18]\n* [Health Benefits][19]\n* [Recipes][20]\n* [Our Story][21]\n* [Blog][22]\n* [Contact Us][23]\n* [Distributors][24]\n* [Delivery Info][25]\n* [Payment Info][26]\n* [Refunds & Returns][27]\n* [Security & Privacy][28]\n* [My Account][29]\n* [New Zealand][30]\n* [Australia][31]\n* [Home][32]\n* [Shop][33]\n* [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][34]\n* [Chilli Avocado Oil][35]\n* [Garlic Avocado Oil][36]\n* [Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][37]\n* [Lime Avocado Oil][38]\n* [Organic Avocado Oil][39]\n* [GOOD By Grove][40]\n* [Health Benefits][41]\n* [Recipes][42]\n* [Our Story][43]\n* [Blog][44]\n* [Contact Us][45]\n* [Distributors][46]\n* [Delivery Info][47]\n* [Payment Info][48]\n* [Refunds & Returns][49]\n* [Security & Privacy][50]\n* [My Account][51]\n[ [Grove Avocado Oil Logo] ][52]\n\n* [ New Zealand][53]\n* [ Australia][54]\n\n[MY ACCOUNT][55]\n* [Our Story][56]\n* [Articles][57]\n* [Contact][58]\n* [Contact Us][59]\n* [Distributors][60]\n* [Wholesale Enquiries][61]\n* [Delivery Info][62]\n* [Payment Info][63]\n* [Refunds & Returns][64]\n* [Security & Privacy][65]\n* [Our Story][66]\n* [Articles][67]\n* [Contact][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n* [Distributors][70]\n* [Wholesale Enquiries][71]\n* [Delivery Info][72]\n* [Payment Info][73]\n* [Refunds & Returns][74]\n* [Security & Privacy][75]\n\n# Our Story\n\n## Our Story\n\n## We wanted to share the health giving properties of Avocado Oil with others\n\nOur story came to fruition 20 years ago, in Tauranga. The Bay of Plenty is situated on the east\ncoast of New Zealand\u2019s north island. It\u2019s renowned for having nutrient rich volcanic soil and a warm\nclimate, which plays a pivotal role in growing the finest Haas avocados.\n\nWe had a vision to deliver the highest quality avocado oil and for food lovers to reap the\nhealth-giving benefits. We set our goal and with a dose of Kiwi ingenuity, innovation and hard work\nwe began to press and extract the oily goodness from this superfood into its concentrated form.\n\nWe\u2019re proud to be named the first producers of 100% natural, virgin cold-pressed avocado oil. Our\nworld-class production process ensures that the oil extracted reaches your table at its purest. The\ndelicate aroma, colour and distinct flavour cocoons the abundance of well-being benefits found in\nthis nutrient dense oil \u2013 something we\u2019re honoured to produce and share with the world.\n\n[ ][76]\n\n## Watch Our Story\n\n## The Process\n\nThe team at Grove sources avocado fruit from fully certified suppliers in compliance with industry\nstandards, established and monitored by the Avocado Industry Council. Grove have perfected the\nextraction of avocado oil by cold pressing in a single extraction to produce their extra virgin\navocado oil.\n\nOnly the delicate flesh is used in the process resulting in a vibrant, green, pure oil which is then\nbottled into light sensitive glass bottles to preserve the freshness and flavour, and fitted with an\neasy pourer.\n\n## Our Quality Guarantee\n\nThe Grove Avocado Oil process of sourcing fruit from orchards, ripening, processing and bottling is\nmanaged under a stringent quality management system. Avocado Oil NZ Limited operates under a hazard\nanalysis critical control point system (HACCP) food safety programme, which is audited annually and\ncertified by SGS Australia Pty. Ltd. The SQF Certification is the world\u2019s leading inspection,\nverification, testing and certification company.\n\nOur oil is tested by an independent laboratory, and a certificate of analysis can be provided with a\nshipment on request. Grove Avocado Oil is also a registered member of the American Oil Chemists\u2019\nSociety (AOCS, Registration No. 000000592862).\n\nThe ongoing research, development and investment in technology together with global awareness around\nthe avocado fruit has resulted in increased demand for avocado oil.\n\nWe proudly display the New Zealand FernMark. It directly connects our customers to the stories and\nproducts that make us part of New Zealand\u2019s outstanding clean, green and sustainable global\nreputation.\n\nSearch Search for:\nRecent Posts\n* [The Beauty Oil \u2013 4 Skin + Body Benefits of Avocado Oil][77]\n* [Which foods and oils contain \u2018good\u2019 fats?][78]\n* [8 Amazing Benefits of Avocado Oil][79]\n* [Top 4 reasons to pick Avocado Oil over Olive Oil][80]\nRecent Comments\nArchives\n* [September 2023][81]\n* [April 2020][82]\nCategories\n* [Blog][83]\nMeta\n* [Log in][84]\n* [Entries feed][85]\n* [Comments feed][86]\n* [WordPress.org][87]\n[Grove Avocado Oil Logo]\n\nAvocado Oil New Zealand Ltd\n1 Armstrong Road,\nTe Puna 3174\nNew Zealand\n\n+64 (0)7 552 6365\n[info@avocado-oil.co.nz][88]\n\n### SHOP\n\n[Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][89]\n[Lime Avocado Oil][90]\n[Garlic Avocado Oil][91]\n[Chilli Avocado Oil][92]\n[Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][93]\n\n### HEALTH BENEFITS\n\n[Why Extra Virgin Avocado Oil?][94]\n\n### RECIPES\n\n[Sweet & Savoury Recipes][95]\n\n### OUR STORY\n\n[Grove Avocado Oil Story][96]\n[Quality Guarantee][97]\n\n### DISTRIBUTION\n\n[Distributors][98]\n\n### CONTACT\n\n[Contact Us][99]\n[Privacy Policy][100]\n\n[ Instagram ][101] [ Facebook ][102]\n[Grove Avocado Oil Logo]\n\nAvocado Oil New Zealand Ltd\n1 Armstrong Road,\nTe Puna 3174\nNew Zealand\n\n+64 (0)7 552 6365\n[info@avocado-oil.co.nz][103]\n\n### SHOP\n\n[Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][104]\n[Lime Avocado Oil][105]\n[Garlic Avocado Oil][106]\n[Chilli Avocado Oil][107]\n[Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][108]\n\n### HEALTH BENEFITS\n\n[Why Extra Virgin Avocado Oil?][109]\n\n### RECIPES\n\n[Sweet & Savoury Recipes][110]\n\n### OUR STORY\n\n[Grove Avocado Oil Story][111]\n[Quality Guarantee][112]\n\n### DISTRIBUTION\n\n[Distributors][113]\n\n### CONTACT\n\n[Contact Us][114]\n[Privacy Policy][115]\n\n[ Instagram ][116] [ Facebook ][117]\nGet free recipe book popup\n\n### **GET A FREE RECIPE BOOK**\n\nSign up for our newsletter and get a free recipe book.\n\n### Sweet Recipes Download\n* Phone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Last\n* Email*\n* Select country*\nSelect CountryNew ZealandAustraliaUnited States of AmericaUnited KingdomOthers\n* Receive occasional emails from us?\nYes, I wish to receive occasional emails from Grove Avocado Oil\n\nCLOSE\nYour Cart\n* [ New Zealand][118]\n* [ Australia][119]\n\n[1]: #\n[2]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/view-all-products/\n[3]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/health-benefits/\n[4]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/recipes/\n[5]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/view-all-products/\n[6]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/health-benefits/\n[7]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/recipes/\n[8]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/our-story/\n[9]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/au/our-story/\n[10]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/\n[11]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/view-all-products/\n[12]: /product/extra-virgin-avocado-oil\n[13]: /product/chilli-avocado-oil\n[14]: /product/garlic-avocado-oil\n[15]: /product/lemon-pepper-avocado-oil\n[16]: /product/lime-avocado-oil\n[17]: /product/organic-avocado-oil\n[18]: /product/good-by-grove\n[19]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/health-benefits/\n[20]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/grove-recipes\n[21]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/our-story/\n[22]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/category/blog/\n[23]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/contact-us/\n[24]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/distributors/\n[25]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/delivery-info/\n[26]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/payment-info/\n[27]: https://groveavocadooil.co.nz/refunds-