        "crawl_text": "Bella Vado Extra Virgin Avocado Oil Compliant with food safety standards USA USDA Organic Non-GMO Vegan Gluten-Free First U.S. producer of unrefined, unfiltered avocado oil Family-owned and operated Commitment to quality and traditional methods 100% extra virgin avocado oil Handcrafted products Focus on natural ingredients Food safety standards compliance Southern California, USA USA Southern California California North America Bella Vado Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nSHOP\n\nExpand submenu SHOP\n\nCollapse submenu SHOP\n\nCulinary\n\nBody\n\nBundles &amp; Gifts\n\nPerfect Pairings\n\nAccessories\n\nContact Us\n\nQuality &amp; Standards\n\nExpand submenu Quality &amp; Standards\n\nCollapse submenu Quality &amp; Standards\n\nExtra Virgin vs. Refined Avocado Oil\n\nWhy FFA Matters in Avocado Oil\n\nThird-Party Testing\n\nLog In\n\nCreate Account\n\nSearch\n\nOur Process\n\nAbout California Avocado Oil\n\nContact Us\n\nFAQ's\n\nBlog\n\nReturns & Exchanges\n\nMedia Coverage\n\nIngredients of Integrity\n\nCertifications\n\nTerms & Conditions\n\nTrack Your Order\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nYour cart\n\nClose Cart\n\nFREE SHIPPING on orders of $50 or more\n\nSite navigation\n\nSHOP\n\nCulinary\n\nBody\n\nBundles &amp; Gifts\n\nPerfect Pairings\n\nAccessories\n\nContact Us\n\nQuality &amp; Standards\n\nExtra Virgin vs. Refined Avocado Oil\n\nWhy FFA Matters in Avocado Oil\n\nThird-Party Testing\n\nLog In\n\nSearch\n\nCart\n\nCart\n\nThe World&#39;s Standard for Quality\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nShop now\n\nNourish your body inside &amp; out\n\nNatural Avocado Lotion\n\nShop now\n\nBella Vado\u00ae Avocado Oil\n\nAt Bella Vado, we proudly craft America\u2019s original cold-pressed avocado oil\u2014right here on our family farm in Southern California. Every drop of our golden-green oil begins with hand-selected, California-grown avocados, harvested at peak ripeness and cold-pressed within hours to preserve their full flavor, vibrant color, and powerful nutrients. As the first U.S. producer of unrefined, unfiltered avocado oil, we\u2019ve stayed true to what matters: quality, integrity, and real food. Our oil is never chemically extracted, deodorized, or altered\u2014just 100% pure, extra virgin avocado oil made the traditional way. Bella Vado avocado oil is: USA-made, from California-grown avocados Cold-pressed, unrefined, and unfiltered Naturally Non-GMO, vegan, gluten-free, and high in heart-healthy fats A versatile culinary oil perfect for dressings, saut\u00e9ing, roasting, and more From our grove to your table, we invite you to taste the difference that freshness, family values, and California sunshine make.\n\nThe Heart of the Avocado\n\nLooking back, it\u2019s hard to believe how quickly it all flew by. Late-night bottling parties where we called in all our kids and their friends\u2014well bribed with pizza and music. Grueling 72-hour oil pressing marathons with rotating sleep shifts\u2014while half of us still worked full-time jobs. We were all in. We hustled. We stayed heads down. We loved the craft of turning our avocados into oil. We poured ourselves into perfecting our oil, always analyzing, adjusting, and improving our process year after year. To us, It was always more than a product available on store shelves, quietly traveling in your shopping cart and then patiently sitting on your kitchen counter.\nBella Vado is the heart of the avocado!\n\nSHOP\n\nCulinary\n\nBody\n\nBundles &amp; Gifts\n\nCASE DISCOUNTS AVAILABLE!\n\nAre you loving the Avocado Oil so much that you want to buy 6 bottles at a time?! We have you covered! Select your favorite 6 bottles of Avocado Oil and the discount will be applied in your cart.\n\nCase of Oil\n\nFeatured Item\n\nSave\nRs. 400\n\nBread Dip Bundle\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 2,900\n\nUSDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)\n\nRegular price\n\nRs. 2,000\n\nSave\nRs. 100\n\nOriginal Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)\n\nSale price\n\nRs. 1,400\n\nBulk Extra Virgin Avocado 