vocado Oil ][38]\n* [ Third-Party Testing ][39]\n* [ Log In ][40]\n* [ Search ][41]\n* [ Cart ][42]\n\n[ Cart ][43]\n\nThe World's Standard for Quality\n\n## Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n[ Shop now ][44]\n\nNourish your body inside & out\n\n## Natural Avocado Lotion\n\n[ Shop now ][45]\n\n## Bella Vado\u00ae Avocado Oil\n\nAt Bella Vado, we proudly craft America\u2019s original cold-pressed avocado oil\u2014right here on our family\nfarm in Southern California. Every drop of our golden-green oil begins with hand-selected,\nCalifornia-grown avocados, harvested at peak ripeness and cold-pressed within hours to preserve\ntheir full flavor, vibrant color, and powerful nutrients.\n\nAs the first U.S. producer of unrefined, unfiltered avocado oil, we\u2019ve stayed true to what matters:\nquality, integrity, and real food. Our oil is never chemically extracted, deodorized, or\naltered\u2014just 100% pure, extra virgin avocado oil made the traditional way.\n\nBella Vado avocado oil is:\n\nUSA-made, from California-grown avocados\n\nCold-pressed, unrefined, and unfiltered\n\nNaturally Non-GMO, vegan, gluten-free, and high in heart-healthy fats\n\nA versatile culinary oil perfect for dressings, saut\u00e9ing, roasting, and more\n\nFrom our grove to your table, we invite you to taste the difference that freshness, family values,\nand California sunshine make.\n\n## The Heart of the Avocado\n\nLooking back, it\u2019s hard to believe how quickly it all flew by. Late-night bottling parties where we\ncalled in all our kids and their friends\u2014well bribed with pizza and music. Grueling 72-hour oil\npressing marathons with rotating sleep shifts\u2014while half of us still worked full-time jobs. We were\nall in. We hustled. We stayed heads down. We loved the craft of turning our avocados into oil.\n\nWe poured ourselves into perfecting our oil, always analyzing, adjusting, and improving our process\nyear after year.\n\nTo us, It was always more than a product available on store shelves, quietly traveling in your\nshopping cart and then patiently sitting on your kitchen counter.\n\n**Bella Vado is the heart of the avocado!**\n\n## SHOP\n\nCulinary\n][46]\nBody\n][47]\nBundles & Gifts\n][48]\n\n## CASE DISCOUNTS AVAILABLE!\n\nAre you loving the Avocado Oil so much that you want to buy 6 bottles at a time?! We have you\ncovered! Select your favorite 6 bottles of Avocado Oil and the discount will be applied in your\ncart.\n\n[ Case of Oil ][49]\n\n## Featured Item\n\n[Bread Dip Bundle]\n[Bread Dip Bundle] ][50]\n\nSave\nRs. 400\n\n[ Bread Dip Bundle \u2014 Sale price Rs. 2,900 ][51]\n[USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)]\n[USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)] ][52]\n[ USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml) \u2014 Regular price Rs. 2,000 + ][53]\n[Original Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)]\n[Original Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)] ][54]\n\nSave\nRs. 100\n\n[ Original Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml) \u2014 Sale price Rs. 1,400 + ][55]\n[Bulk Extra Virgin Avocado Oil - Gallon Jug]\n[Bulk Extra Virgin Avocado Oil - Gallon Jug] ][56]\n[ Bulk Extra Virgin Avocado Oil - Gallon Jug \u2014 Regular price Rs. 15,000 ][57]\n[Barrel Aged Balsamic (10 Years - 250 ml)]\n[Barrel Aged Balsamic (10 Years - 250 ml)] ][58]\n[ Barrel Aged Balsamic (10 Years - 250 ml) \u2014 Regular price Rs. 1,500 + ][59]\n[Gift Card]\n[Gift Card] ][60]\n[ Gift Card \u2014 Regular price Rs. 2,404.71 + ][61]\n\n## Subscribe to receive news, updates, and special offerings!\n\nSign up and receive a discount on your first order. Introductory offer does not apply to case\nquantities or gallon jugs.\n\nSign up to our mailing list\nSubscribe\n* [Search][62]\n* [Our Process][63]\n* [About California Avocado Oil][64]\n* [Contact Us][65]\n* [FAQ's][66]\n* [Blog][67]\n* [Returns & Exchanges][68]\n* [Media Coverage][69]\n* [Ingredients of Integrity][70]\n* [Certifications][71]\n* [Terms & Conditions][72]\n* [Track Your Order][73]\n* [Privacy Policy][74]\n* [ 