            "text": "* [SHOP][1]\nExpand submenu SHOP Collapse submenu SHOP\n* [ Culinary ][2]\n* [ Body ][3]\n* [ Bundles & Gifts ][4]\n* [ Perfect Pairings ][5]\n* [ Accessories ][6]\n* [ Contact Us ][7]\n* [Quality & Standards][8]\nExpand submenu Quality & Standards Collapse submenu Quality & Standards\n* [ Extra Virgin vs. Refined Avocado Oil ][9]\n* [ Why FFA Matters in Avocado Oil ][10]\n* [ Third-Party Testing ][11]\n* [Log In][12]\n* [Create Account][13]\n* [Search][14]\n* [Our Process][15]\n* [About California Avocado Oil][16]\n* [Contact Us][17]\n* [FAQ's][18]\n* [Blog][19]\n* [Returns & Exchanges][20]\n* [Media Coverage][21]\n* [Ingredients of Integrity][22]\n* [Certifications][23]\n* [Terms & Conditions][24]\n* [Track Your Order][25]\n* [Privacy Policy][26]\nYour cart\nClose Cart\n\nFREE SHIPPING on orders of $50 or more\n\n][27]\nSite navigation\n[ [Bella Vado Extra Virgin Avocado Oil] ][28]\n* [ SHOP ][29]\n* [ Culinary ][30]\n* [ Body ][31]\n* [ Bundles & Gifts ][32]\n* [ Perfect Pairings ][33]\n* [ Accessories ][34]\n* [ Contact Us ][35]\n* [ Quality & Standards ][36]\n* [ Extra Virgin vs. Refined Avocado Oil ][37]\n* [ Why FFA Matters in Avocado Oil ][38]\n* [ Third-Party Testing ][39]\n* [ Log In ][40]\n* [ Search ][41]\n* [ Cart ][42]\n[ Cart ][43]\n[USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)] [USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)]\n[USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)] [USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)]\n\n# USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)\n\nRegular price Rs. 2,000.00\n\n#### Loading.. Please Wait..\n\nSelection By the Bottle By the Case (6 bottles)\nBy the Bottle - Rs. 2,000.00 INR By the Case (6 bottles) - Rs. 11,600.00 INR\nAdd to Cart\n\n#### **ABOUT OUR CERTIFIED ORGANIC AVOCADO OIL:**\n\nCalifornia avocados, at the peak of perfection, cold-pressed and bottled on our California family\nfarm.\n\nBella Vado is proud to be the ORIGINAL USA avocado oil producer of cold-pressed, unrefined,\nunfiltered, NON-GMO, vegan, gluten-free, Certified Organic, extra virgin avocado oil (say that 10\ntimes fast).\n\nEach bottle is hand filled, sealed, labeled and packaged by the Bella Vado family. We take great\ncare in the pressing of our avocado oil using old-world artisan techniques combined with new world\ntechnology.\n\n**Please note: **We are **unable to offer a case discount** on Organic avocado oil at this time.\n\n#### **HOW TO USE IT:**\n\nAvocado oil is one of the most versatile oils on the planet, it makes an especially delicious and\nhealthy culinary oil. It can be used for salads, grilling, drizzling, finishing, bread dips and\nstir-frying. Avocado oil can withstand the high heat of at least 450 degrees Fahrenheit.\n\n#### **WHY IT'S HEALTHY:**\n\nAvocado oil is high in mono-unsaturated fats, Vitamin A, B1, B2, D, E and K. It also is a great\nsource of Omega-3 Fatty Acids, Lutein, and Oleic Acid.\n\nBella Vado avocado oil is 100% natural with no additives, preservatives or refinement. We never\ndilute our oil with cheaper refined oils, you will always receive the highest quality extra-virgin\noil.\n\nFor more information on how Avocado oil compares to other oils please reference this chart\nby [Information is Beautiful][44].\n\nFor details about the standards follow to produce our avocado oil, check out Bella Vado\u2019s pressing\nguidelines at [AOCS.org][45]\n\n[ Share Share on Facebook ][46] [ Pin it Pin on Pinterest ][47]\n* [Search][48]\n* [Our Process][49]\n* [About California Avocado Oil][50]\n* [Contact Us][51]\n* [FAQ's][52]\n* [Blog][53]\n* [Returns & Exchanges][54]\n* [Media Coverage][55]\n* [Ingredients of Integrity][56]\n* [Certifications][57]\n* [Terms & Conditions][58]\n* [Track Your Order][59]\n* [Privacy Policy][60]\n* [ Facebook ][61]\n* [ Instagram ][62]\n\n\u00a9 2026, [Bella Vado Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][63]\n[Powered by Shopify][64]\n* american express\n* apple pay\n* diners club\n* discover\n* master\n* paypal\n* shopify pay\n* v