            "text": "* [SHOP][1]\nExpand submenu SHOP Collapse submenu SHOP\n* [ Culinary ][2]\n* [ Body ][3]\n* [ Bundles & Gifts ][4]\n* [ Perfect Pairings ][5]\n* [ Accessories ][6]\n* [ Contact Us ][7]\n* [Quality & Standards][8]\nExpand submenu Quality & Standards Collapse submenu Quality & Standards\n* [ Extra Virgin vs. Refined Avocado Oil ][9]\n* [ Why FFA Matters in Avocado Oil ][10]\n* [ Third-Party Testing ][11]\n* [Log In][12]\n* [Create Account][13]\n* [Search][14]\n* [Our Process][15]\n* [About California Avocado Oil][16]\n* [Contact Us][17]\n* [FAQ's][18]\n* [Blog][19]\n* [Returns & Exchanges][20]\n* [Media Coverage][21]\n* [Ingredients of Integrity][22]\n* [Certifications][23]\n* [Terms & Conditions][24]\n* [Track Your Order][25]\n* [Privacy Policy][26]\nYour cart\nClose Cart\n\nFREE SHIPPING on orders of $50 or more\n\n][27]\nSite navigation\n[ [Bella Vado Extra Virgin Avocado Oil] ][28]\n* [ SHOP ][29]\n* [ Culinary ][30]\n* [ Body ][31]\n* [ Bundles & Gifts ][32]\n* [ Perfect Pairings ][33]\n* [ Accessories ][34]\n* [ Contact Us ][35]\n* [ Quality & Standards ][36]\n* [ Extra Virgin vs. Refined Avocado Oil ][37]\n* [ Why FFA Matters in Avocado Oil ][38]\n* [ Third-Party Testing ][39]\n* [ Log In ][40]\n* [ Search ][41]\n* [ Cart ][42]\n[ Cart ][43]\n[Avocado Lip Cream - .4 fl oz] [Avocado Lip Cream - .4 fl oz]\n\n# Avocado Lip Cream - .4 fl oz\n\nRegular price Rs. 800.00\n\n#### Loading.. Please Wait..\n\nFlavor Original (no flavor) Orange Peppermint\nOriginal (no flavor) - Sold Out Orange - Sold Out Peppermint - Rs. 800.00 INR\nAdd to Cart\n\n#### We\u2019re excited to introduce our newly repackaged lip balms \u2014 now in eco-friendly cardboard\n#### push-up tubes that are over 2.5 times larger than before, offering more to love while reducing\n#### plastic waste.\n\nOur creamy lip balms are the best deal on the market. We have simple, food grade ingredients that\nleave your lips creamy and moisturized\u2013not waxy. We offer high end, spa quality lip creams at a\nreasonable price.\n\nTake our lip balm with you when you travel to the mountains in the winter to keep your lips\nhydrated. It\u2019s also a perfect conditioner for your lips during the scorching California summers. Our\nlip creams are hand-made in small batches to ensure freshness. We use only the finest ingredients.\n\nIn production, we always take care to protect each of the ingredients, especially our avocado oil.\nBecause of this, we minimize the amount of heat when producing our lip balms. We also always use\nunrefined, unfiltered ingredients. The beeswax comes straight from our grove which ensures the\nquality of the unbleached wax. Our lip creams contain no preservatives or chemicals.\n\nFrom our lips to yours\u2013pucker up!\n\n*Ingredients: Made with edible, unrefined, gourmet Bella Vado Avocado Oil*, Cocoa Butter, unrefined,\nunfiltered Beeswax*, Mango Butter, Jojoba Oil, Raspberry Seed Oil.*\n\n**Certified Organic*\n\n*Orange Flavor - Citrus Sinensis*\n\n*Mint Flavor - Spearmint and Peppermint Oils*\n\n*Original Flavor - no flavor*\n\n[ Share Share on Facebook ][44] [ Pin it Pin on Pinterest ][45]\n* [Search][46]\n* [Our Process][47]\n* [About California Avocado Oil][48]\n* [Contact Us][49]\n* [FAQ's][50]\n* [Blog][51]\n* [Returns & Exchanges][52]\n* [Media Coverage][53]\n* [Ingredients of Integrity][54]\n* [Certifications][55]\n* [Terms & Conditions][56]\n* [Track Your Order][57]\n* [Privacy Policy][58]\n* [ Facebook ][59]\n* [ Instagram ][60]\n\n\u00a9 2026, [Bella Vado Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][61]\n[Powered by Shopify][62]\n* american express\n* apple pay\n* diners club\n* discover\n* master\n* paypal\n* shopify pay\n* visa\n\nSearch\n\n[1]: /collections/all\n[2]: /collections/culinary-avocado-oil\n[3]: /collections/nourish-your-body\n[4]: /collections/gift-travel-items\n[5]: /collections/spice-salt-balsamic-popcorn\n[6]: /collections/accessories\n[7]: /pages/contact-us\n[8]: /pages/bella-vado-standards-quality\n[9]: /pages/extra-