            "url": "https://bellavado.com/products/mothers-day-luxury-body-set",
            "text": "* [SHOP][1]\nExpand submenu SHOP Collapse submenu SHOP\n* [ Culinary ][2]\n* [ Body ][3]\n* [ Bundles & Gifts ][4]\n* [ Perfect Pairings ][5]\n* [ Accessories ][6]\n* [ Contact Us ][7]\n* [Quality & Standards][8]\nExpand submenu Quality & Standards Collapse submenu Quality & Standards\n* [ Extra Virgin vs. Refined Avocado Oil ][9]\n* [ Why FFA Matters in Avocado Oil ][10]\n* [ Third-Party Testing ][11]\n* [Log In][12]\n* [Create Account][13]\n* [Search][14]\n* [Our Process][15]\n* [About California Avocado Oil][16]\n* [Contact Us][17]\n* [FAQ's][18]\n* [Blog][19]\n* [Returns & Exchanges][20]\n* [Media Coverage][21]\n* [Ingredients of Integrity][22]\n* [Certifications][23]\n* [Terms & Conditions][24]\n* [Track Your Order][25]\n* [Privacy Policy][26]\nYour cart\nClose Cart\n\nFREE SHIPPING on orders of $50 or more\n\n][27]\nSite navigation\n[ [Bella Vado Extra Virgin Avocado Oil] ][28]\n* [ SHOP ][29]\n* [ Culinary ][30]\n* [ Body ][31]\n* [ Bundles & Gifts ][32]\n* [ Perfect Pairings ][33]\n* [ Accessories ][34]\n* [ Contact Us ][35]\n* [ Quality & Standards ][36]\n* [ Extra Virgin vs. Refined Avocado Oil ][37]\n* [ Why FFA Matters in Avocado Oil ][38]\n* [ Third-Party Testing ][39]\n* [ Log In ][40]\n* [ Search ][41]\n* [ Cart ][42]\n[ Cart ][43]\n[Luxury Body Set] [Luxury Body Set]\n\n# Luxury Body Set\n\nRegular price Rs. 4,100.00 Sale price Rs. 3,600.00\n\n#### Loading.. Please Wait..\n\nScent Honey Almond Luxury Body Set\nHoney Almond Luxury Body Set - Rs. 3,600.00 INR\nAdd to Cart\n\nSurprise that Avocado lover in your life and give them a handmade gift of luxurious, natural and\nhealthy body products.\n\nPamper someone special by choosing an assortment of our best selling body products. Treat them to\nsome of the most skin loving delicacies you can buy. They'll definitely feel special knowing they\nare handcrafted, right here in California, by a family-owned business.\n\nBella Vado Luxury Body Set - includes one Handcrafted Avocado Soap Bar, one Avocado Hand & Body\nCream, and one Avocado Skin & Hair Oil.\n\nThis beautiful set comes already boxed and ready to gift! Simply add your personalized message at\ncheckout.\n\nEach product is made in California with the highest percentage possible of cold-pressed, unrefined,\nunfiltered, food grade Bella Vado\u00ae Extra Virgin Avocado Oil.\n\n[ Share Share on Facebook ][44] [ Pin it Pin on Pinterest ][45]\n* [Search][46]\n* [Our Process][47]\n* [About California Avocado Oil][48]\n* [Contact Us][49]\n* [FAQ's][50]\n* [Blog][51]\n* [Returns & Exchanges][52]\n* [Media Coverage][53]\n* [Ingredients of Integrity][54]\n* [Certifications][55]\n* [Terms & Conditions][56]\n* [Track Your Order][57]\n* [Privacy Policy][58]\n* [ Facebook ][59]\n* [ Instagram ][60]\n\n\u00a9 2026, [Bella Vado Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][61]\n[Powered by Shopify][62]\n* american express\n* apple pay\n* diners club\n* discover\n* master\n* paypal\n* shopify pay\n* visa\n\nSearch\n\n[1]: /collections/all\n[2]: /collections/culinary-avocado-oil\n[3]: /collections/nourish-your-body\n[4]: /collections/gift-travel-items\n[5]: /collections/spice-salt-balsamic-popcorn\n[6]: /collections/accessories\n[7]: /pages/contact-us\n[8]: /pages/bella-vado-standards-quality\n[9]: /pages/extra-virgin-vs-refined-avocado-oil-what-consumers-should-know\n[10]: /pages/why-ffa-matters-in-avocado-oil\n[11]: /pages/third-party-testing\n[12]: https://bellavado.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=IN\n[13]: https://account.bellavado.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJiZWxsYS12Y\nWRvLWF2b2NhZG8tb2lsLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODA1MiwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjEzMjUyf\nQ.n1jWpm4spu_3Z4UUk4h60EnBF8wASq8ewEZ-hrWw8Oo\n[14]: /search\n[15]: /pages/our-process\n[16]: /pages/about-california-avocado-oil\n[17]: /pages/contact-us\n[18]: /pages/faqs\n[19]: /blogs/the-bella-vado-family-blog\n[20]: /pages/exchanges-returns\n[21]: /pages/in-the-media\n[22]: /pages/ingredients