        "crawl_text": "Calavo Growers, Inc. Publicly traded company North America Over 100 years of experience Strong brand recognition Innovative practices in food safety and quality USDA standards FDA regulations 1141A Cummings Road Santa Paula 41 Kipper St., Suite B, Rio Rico, AZ 85648 655 W. Main Street, Santa Paula, CA 93060 4267 JP Hall Boulevard, Green Cove Springs, FL 32043 16-664 Milo Street, Keaau, HI 96749 100 Dartmouth Drive, Suite 150, Swedesboro, NJ 08085 2600 McCree Road, Garland, TX 75041 8901 San Mateo Drive, Laredo, TX 78045 Libramiento Oriente No. 2650 Col Quirindavaya, Uruapan, Michoac\u00e1n, M\u00e9xico Av. Tecnol\u00f3gico No. 390, Cuidad Guzm\u00e1n, Jalisco, M\u00e9xico United States Mexico Michoac\u00e1n, Mexico Jalisco, Mexico North America Calavo Growers has been a leader in the avocado market for nearly 100 years, evolving from a cooperative to a publicly traded company. The company emphasizes sustainability and innovation in its practices, ensuring high-quality products for consumers. Expansion of product lines to include organic options and ready-to-eat products. Continued investment in technology for food safety and quality assurance. Market fluctuations in produce pricing due to weather and supply chain issues. Competition from other fresh produce suppliers. Growing demand for healthy and organic food options. Expansion into new markets and product categories. Calavo Growers is positioned as a leading supplier of avocados and fresh produce in North America, with a strong brand reputation. Increasing consumer demand for fresh and healthy food options. Expansion of distribution channels and partnerships with retailers. Home | Calavo Growers\n\nHome\n\nCompany\n\nAbout\n\nOur People\n\nCareers\n\nProducts\n\nOur Products\n\nFarm to Table\n\nRecipes\n\nAvo Fun Facts\n\nINVESTORS\n\nContact\n\nTrade\n\nHome\n\nCompany\n\nAbout\n\nOur People\n\nCareers\n\nProducts\n\nOur Products\n\nFarm to Table\n\nRecipes\n\nAvo Fun Facts\n\nINVESTORS\n\nContact\n\nTrade\n\nAVOCADOS\n\nTOMATOES\n\nHAWAIIAN PAPAYAS\n\nGUACAMOLE &amp; DIPS\n\nORGANICS\n\nFor over 100 years, our passion has always been bringing delicious and nutritious food to your dinner table.\n\nAbout\n\nThe Calavo way\n\nOur core values are our guiding principles: Drive, Respect, Innovation, Stewardship, and Quality.\n\nFabulously\nfresh\n\nFarm-fresh produce\nfrom our family to yours.\n\nConvenience\nwithout\ncompromise\n\nReady-to-eat guacamole, dips &amp; spreads.\nSave time, with peace of mind.\n\nfresh avocados\n\nfarm fresh tomatoes\n\nhawaiian papayas\n\nguacamole & dips\n\norganics\n\nQuality you can\ncount on\n\nOur standards match yours. Rest assured that you are getting the very best.\n\nFARM TO TABLE\n\nMore\n\npartners\n\nMore\n\nrecipes\n\nMore\n\nIntegrity - Dependability - Trust\n\nDelivering the highest quality products for over 100 years\n\nMore\n\nHeadquarters\n\nCalavo Growers, Inc.\n1141A Cummings Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\nhello@calavo.com\n805.525.1245\n\ninvestor relations\n\nFinancial Profiles\nAlex Villalta\ncalavo@finprofiles.com\n\nCalavo is an Equal Opportunity and E-Verify Employer\n\nGrowers\n\ncareers\n\n\u00a9 2025 Calavo Growers, Inc. / Terms of Use / Transportation Terms / Privacy Policy / Site Map\n\nClick for our Codes of Conduct\n\nFollow\nFollow\nFollow\nFollow\nFollow\n\nWe use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your preferences and repeat visits. By clicking \u201cAccept All\u201d, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies. However, you may visit \"Cookie Settings\" to provide a controlled consent.\nCookie Settings Accept All\nManage consent\n\nClose\n\nPrivacy Overview\n\nThis website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of these, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are essential for the working of basic functionalities of the website. We also use third-party cookies that help us analyze and understand how you use this website. These cookies will be stored in your browser only with your consent. You also have the option to opt-out of these cookies. But opting out of some of these cookies may affect your browsing experience.\n\nNecessary\n\nNecessary\n\nAlways Enabled\n\nNecessary cookies are absolutely essential for the website to function properly. These cookies ensure basic functionalities and security features of the website, anonymously.\n\nCookie Duration Description\ncookielawinfo-checkbox-analytics 11 months This cookie is set by GDPR Cookie Consent plugin. The cookie is used to store the user consent for the cookies in the category \"Analytics\".\ncookielawinfo-checkbox-functional 11 months The cookie is set by GDPR cookie consent to record the user consent for the cookies in the category \"Functional\".\ncookielawinfo-checkbox-necessary 11 months This cookie is set by GDPR Cookie Consent plugin. The cookies is used to store the user consent for the cookies in the category \"Necessary\".\ncookielawinfo-checkbox-others 11 months This cookie is set by GDPR Cookie Consent plugin. The cookie is used to store the user consent for the cookies in the category \"Other.\ncookielawinfo-checkbox-performance 11 months This cookie is set by GDPR Cookie Consent plugin. The cookie is used to store the user consent for the cookies in the category \"Performance\".\nviewed_cookie_policy 11 months The cookie is set by the GDPR Cookie Consent plugin and is used to store whether or not user has consented to the use of cookies. It does not store any personal data.\n\nFunctional\n\nFunctional\n\nFunctional cookies help to perform certain functionalities like sharing the content of the website on social media platforms, collect feedbacks, and other third-party features.\n\nPerformance\n\nPerformance\n\nPerformance cookies are used to understand and analyze the key performance indexes of the website which helps in delivering a better user experience for the visitors.\n\nAnalytics\n\nAnalytics\n\nAnalytical cookies are used to understand how visitors interact with the website. These cookies help provide information on metrics the number of visitors, bounce rate, traffic source, etc.\n\nAdvertisement\n\nAdvertisement\n\nAdvertisement cookies are used to provide visitors with relevant ads and marketing campaigns. These cookies track visitors across websites and collect information to provide customized ads.\n\nOthers\n\nOthers\n\nOther uncategorized cookies are those that are being analyzed and have not been classified into a category as yet.\n\nSAVE &amp; ACCEPT [[Calavo logo]][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Company][3]\n* [About][4]\n* [Our People][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Products][7]\n* [Our Products][8]\n* [Farm to Table][9]\n* [Recipes][10]\n* [Avo Fun Facts][11]\n* [INVESTORS][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [Trade][14]\n[[Calavo logo]][15]\n* [Home][16]\n* [Company][17]\n* [About][18]\n* [Our People][19]\n* [Careers][20]\n* [Products][21]\n* [Our Products][22]\n* [Farm to Table][23]\n* [Recipes][24]\n* [Avo Fun Facts][25]\n* [INVESTORS][26]\n* [Contact][27]\n* [Trade][28]\n\n## Our passion\n\nTo provide fresh, high-quality, healthy food.\n\n## About us\n\n**Calavo** has a rich culture of constant innovation, sustainable practices and market growth. We\nhave evolved from *\u201cthe first name in avocados\u201d * into a global leader of quality produce, including\ntomatoes, Hawaiian papayas, and fresh guacamole.\n\nWe are proud of our storied history and excited for Calavo\u2019s next chapter!\n\n## Calavo:\n## Over 100 years of milestones\n\nThe California Avocado Growers Exchange is founded as a grower-member owned cooperative.\n\n1924\n\n1926\n\nA national naming contest provides the birth of our \u201cCalavo\u201d brand that becomes synonymous with\navocados.\n\nExpanded our product line to include Hawaiian papayas and market them under the Calavo Gold name.\n\n1949\n\n1955\n\nBroke ground on the Santa Paula packing house we still use today as our primary packing facility in\nCalifornia.\n\nLaunched Calavo \u201cAvocado Dip\u201d (guacamole) as our first processed consumer product.\n\n1965\n\n1998\n\nExpanded our market opportunity as the first U.S. company to open an avocado packinghouse in Mexico.\n\nBegan trading on the Nasdaq as the first publicly traded avocado marketer and distributor in the\nU.S.\n\n2002\n\n2005\n\nAmong the first in the industry to leverage new ripening and sorting technology.\n\nTomatoes are added to our fresh product line. Partnerships with greenhouse facilities in Mexico\nprovide year-round fresh produce.\n\n2007\n\n2016\n\n[Jalisco factory]\nOpened state of the art avocado packinghouse in the state of Jalisco, Mexico\n[Calavo logo]\n\nToday our brand encompasses the strength and longevity that we have sustained for over 100 years.\n\nToday\n\n[[Calavo logo]][29]\n\n#### Headquarters\n\nCalavo Growers, Inc.\n1141A Cummings Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\n[hello@calavo.com][30]\n[805.525.1245][31]\n\n#### investor relations\n\nFinancial Profiles\nAlex Villalta\n[calavo@finprofiles.com][32]\n\n#### *Calavo is an Equal Opportunity and [E-Verify][33] Employer*\n\nGrowers\n\ncareers\n\n\u00a9 2025 Calavo Growers, Inc. / [Terms of Use][34] / [Transportation Terms][35] / [Privacy Policy][36]\n/ [Site Map][37]\n\n[Click for our Codes of Conduct][38]\n* [Follow][39]\n* [Follow][40]\n* [Follow][41]\n* [Follow][42]\n* [Follow][43]\n\nWe use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your\npreferences and repeat visits. By clicking \u201cAccept All\u201d, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies.\nHowever, you may visit \"Cookie Settings\" to provide a controlled consent.\nCookie SettingsAccept All\nManage consent\nClose\n\n#### Privacy Overview\n\nThis website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of\nthese, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they 