            "url": "https://calavo.com/products",
            "text": "[[Calavo logo]][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Company][3]\n* [About][4]\n* [Our People][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Products][7]\n* [Our Products][8]\n* [Farm to Table][9]\n* [Recipes][10]\n* [Avo Fun Facts][11]\n* [INVESTORS][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [Trade][14]\n[[Calavo logo]][15]\n* [Home][16]\n* [Company][17]\n* [About][18]\n* [Our People][19]\n* [Careers][20]\n* [Products][21]\n* [Our Products][22]\n* [Farm to Table][23]\n* [Recipes][24]\n* [Avo Fun Facts][25]\n* [INVESTORS][26]\n* [Contact][27]\n* [Trade][28]\n\n## Our products\n\nCalavo is a global leader of the finest avocados and quality fresh produce. Our Fresh Foods division\nproduces a wide portfolio of guacamole, dips and avocado based foods.\n\n#### avocados\n\nWe were founded as the original avocado company in North America. For nearly 100 years, Calavo brand\navocados have been recognized and respected as the finest in the world.\n\n#### tomatoes\n\nOur year-round supply of vine ripened rounds and Romas are 100% greenhouse grown. Innovation with\nthe highest food safety standards.\n\n#### hawaiian papayas\n\nThe gold standard of papayas. 75% of all Hawaiian papayas are imported and marketed by Calavo.\n\n#### guacamole & dips\n\nCalavo brand and private label guacamole, salsas and plant-based dips are sold to grocery retailers\nand foodservice providers.\n\n#### organics\n\nWe offer a portfolio of USDA Certified-Organic Hass avocados and guacamole.\n\n## Our valued partners\n\n## Our valued\n\n## partners\n\nIt just may surprise you how Calavo is a part of your daily life. We are proud of our long-standing\nrelationships with leading retailers, food service operators, food manufacturers, deli suppliers,\nand wholesalers worldwide. **Look for Calavo in your favorite grocery stores and restaurants!**\n\n[[Calavo logo]][29]\n\n#### Headquarters\n\nCalavo Growers, Inc.\n1141A Cummings Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\n[hello@calavo.com][30]\n[805.525.1245][31]\n\n#### investor relations\n\nFinancial Profiles\nAlex Villalta\n[calavo@finprofiles.com][32]\n\n#### *Calavo is an Equal Opportunity and [E-Verify][33] Employer*\n\nGrowers\n\ncareers\n\n\u00a9 2025 Calavo Growers, Inc. / [Terms of Use][34] / [Transportation Terms][35] / [Privacy Policy][36]\n/ [Site Map][37]\n\n[Click for our Codes of Conduct][38]\n* [Follow][39]\n* [Follow][40]\n* [Follow][41]\n* [Follow][42]\n* [Follow][43]\n\nWe use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your\npreferences and repeat visits. By clicking \u201cAccept All\u201d, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies.\nHowever, you may visit \"Cookie Settings\" to provide a controlled consent.\nCookie SettingsAccept All\nManage consent\nClose\n\n#### Privacy Overview\n\nThis website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of\nthese, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are\nessential for the working of basic functionalities of the website. We also use third-party cookies\nthat help us analyze and understand how you use this website. These cookies will be stored in your\nbrowser only with your consent. You also have the option to opt-out of these cookies. But opting out\nof some of these cookies may affect your browsing experience.\nNecessary\nNecessary\nAlways Enabled\nNecessary cookies are absolutely essential for the website to function properly. These cookies\nensure basic functionalities and security features of the website, anonymously.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\