            "text": "[[Calavo logo]][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Company][3]\n* [About][4]\n* [Our People][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Products][7]\n* [Our Products][8]\n* [Farm to Table][9]\n* [Recipes][10]\n* [Avo Fun Facts][11]\n* [INVESTORS][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [Trade][14]\n[[Calavo logo]][15]\n* [Home][16]\n* [Company][17]\n* [About][18]\n* [Our People][19]\n* [Careers][20]\n* [Products][21]\n* [Our Products][22]\n* [Farm to Table][23]\n* [Recipes][24]\n* [Avo Fun Facts][25]\n* [INVESTORS][26]\n* [Contact][27]\n* [Trade][28]\n\n## Contact us\n\nThank you for your interest in Calavo.\nYou can reach us at:\n\n#### Headquarters\n\n**Calavo Growers, Inc.**\n1141A Cummings Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\nhello@calavo.com\n\n[1-800-4CALAVO][29]\n\n#### Headquarters\n\n**Calavo Growers, Inc.**\n1141A Cummings Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\nhello@calavo.com\n\n[1-800-4CALAVO][30]\n\n[Sales Contact][31]\n\n## Our facilities\n\n#### arizona\n\nWarehouse, office:\n41 Kipper St., Suite B\nRio Rico, AZ 85648\n520.281.2644\n\n#### California\n\n**Santa Paula\n** Corporate Headquarters:\n1141A Cummings Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\n805.525.1245\n\nPacking, distribution:\n655 W. Main Street\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\n805.525.4461\n\nField office, growers:\n655 W. Main Street\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\n805.933.9960\n\nDistribution, repacking, ripening, shipping:\n15765 W. Telegraph Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\n805.421.5000\n\n#### florida\n\nDistribution, repacking, ripening, shipping:\n4267 JP Hall Boulevard\nGreen Cove Springs, FL 32043\n904.364.0324\n\n#### hawaii\n\nPackinghouse, processing, office:\n16-664 Milo Street\nKeaau, HI 96749\n808.982.8880\n\n#### new jersey\n\nDistribution, repacking, ripening, shipping:\n100 Dartmouth Drive, Suite 150\nSwedesboro, NJ 08085\n856.467.8951\n\n#### texas\n\n**Garland**\nDistribution, repacking, ripening, shipping:\n2600 McCree Road\nGarland, TX 75041\n214.427.4716\n\n**Laredo**\nLibrado Pi\u00f1a, Inc.:\n8901 San Mateo Drive\nLaredo, TX 78045\n956.723.6396\n\n#### mexico\n\n**Michoac\u00e1n**\nFresh avocado packing plant:\nLibramiento Oriente No. 2650 Col Quirindavaya\nUruapan, Michoac\u00e1n, M\u00e9xico CP 60180\n011.52.452.527.5020\n\nAvocado processing unit:\nCarretera Uruapan, Carapan No. 6555 Col La Basilla\nUruapan, Michoac\u00e1n, M\u00e9xico CP 60015\n011.52.452.519.8700\n\n**Jalisco**\nFresh avocado packing plant:\nAv. Tecnol\u00f3gico No. 390\nCol. Centro\nCuidad Guzm\u00e1n, Jalisco, M\u00e9xico CP 49000\n011.52.341.575.2170\n\n[[Calavo logo]][32]\n\n#### Headquarters\n\nCalavo Growers, Inc.\n1141A Cummings Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\n[hello@calavo.com][33]\n[805.525.1245][34]\n\n#### investor relations\n\nFinancial Profiles\nAlex Villalta\n[calavo@finprofiles.com][35]\n\n#### *Calavo is an Equal Opportunity and [E-Verify][36] Employer*\n\nGrowers\n\ncareers\n\n\u00a9 2025 Calavo Growers, Inc. / [Terms of Use][37] / [Transportation Terms][38] / [Privacy Policy][39]\n/ [Site Map][40]\n\n[Click for our Codes of Conduct][41]\n* [Follow][42]\n* [Follow][43]\n* [Follow][44]\n* [Follow][45]\n* [Follow][46]\n\nWe use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your\npreferences and repeat visits. By clicking \u201cAccept All\u201d, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies.\nHowever, you may visit \"Cookie Settings\" to provide a controlled consent.\nCookie SettingsAccept All\nManage consent\nClose\n\n#### Privacy Overview\n\nThis website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of\nthese, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are\nessential for the working of basic functionalities of the website. We also use third-party cookies\nthat help us analyze and understand how you use this website. These cookies will be stored in your\nbrowser only with your consent. You also have the option to opt-out of these cookies. But opting out\nof some of these cookies may affect your browsing experience.\nNecessary\nNecessary\nAlways Enabled\nNecessary cookies are absolutely essential for the website to function properly. These cookies\nensure basic functionalities and security features of the website, anonymously.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCookie \u2502Dura\u2502Description\n\u2502tion\u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\ncookielawinfo-ch\u250211 \u2502This cookie is set by GDPR Cookie Consent plugin. The cookie is used to store\neckbox-analytics\u2502mont\u2502the user consent for the cookies in the category \"Analytics\".\n\u2502hs \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500