n\nPress and Awards\n\nJoin us!\n\nMill Tour and Oil Tasting\n\nBulk, Private Label and Food Service\n\nLanguage\n\nEnglish\n\nEspa\u00f1ol\n\nSearch\n\nAccount\n\nCart\n\n- 0\n\nMenu\n\nSearch\n\nCart\n\nBetter in tin.\n\nPerfecting the art of oil-making since 1867, we know the best oils deserve the best packaging. Our tin blocks 100% of light, keeping your oil fresher longer.\n\nShop Now\n\nFind Us In Store\n\nFamily-Owned Since 1867\n\nWe are passionate about crafting the highest quality oils, made from carefully sourced, non-GMO virgin oils rich in flavor and nutrients. With a deep respect for tradition, we embrace small-batch, artisan production to ensure authenticity and excellence in every bottle.\nFor us, good food isn\u2019t just about taste\u2014it\u2019s about nourishing people, supporting communities, and protecting the planet. Through regenerative farming, sustainable practices, and recyclable packaging, we\u2019re here to empower home cooks to create with care.\n\nDiscover The Story\n\nWhy is Our Oil Better?\n\nCalifornia Walnut Oil\n\nOur Roasted Walnut Oil is slowly roasted, expeller-pressed from California walnuts for a tempting nutty flavor that elevates salad dressings, baked goods and any dish it\u2019s drizzled over.\n\nShop Now\n\nWhy is Our Oil Better?\n\nToasted Sesame Oil\n\nOur Toasted Sesame Oil has a delightfully bold and complex flavor that doesn\u2019t overpower. Golden-brown and delicious, it adds rich nutty flavors to your vinaigrette, stir fry or marinade.\n\nShop Now\n\nWhy is Our Oil Better?\n\nSmooth & Fruity\n\nVersatile, fresh, and sourced from the best, this olive oil is bursting with antioxidants and beautifully balanced flavors. It\u2019s always cold pressed from early harvested, organic Spanish Olives.\n\nShop Now\n\nWhy is Our Oil Better?\n\nBright & Peppery\n\nThis cold-pressed, organic Spanish olive oil boasts high antioxidants and a peppery finish. Each batch is made from early harvested olives, lab-tested and packaged in our signature light-blocking tins.\n\nShop Now\n\nWhy is Our Oil Better?\n\nFull & Vibrant\n\nWe partner with small farms in southern Greece to create are generative certified oil, made exclusively from olives grown using sustainable practices for full flavor you can feel good about.\n\nShop Now\n\nWhy is Our Oil Better?\n\nRich & Robust\n\nSourced from the sun-kissed groves of California, this Extra Virgin Olive Oil brings a taste of golden warmth to your kitchen. With a medium-high smoke point, it\u2019s as versatile as it is delightful.\n\nShop Now\n\nWhy is Our Oil Better?\n\nSalads & Saut\u00e9\n\nPressed from the pulp of premium Avocados, this emerald-green oil combines Extra Virgin and refined Avocado Oils. It\u2019s balanced flavor and high-quality make it perfect for medium heat applications.\n\nShop Now\n\nPrev\n\nNext\n\nAvocado Oil for Every Occasion\n\nSalads & Saut\u00e9\n\nCooking Temperature: Medium-High Cooking Uses: Saut\u00e9, salads, bake Flavor: Mild\n\nShop Now\n\nAvocado Oil for Every Occasion\n\nDrip & Drizzle\n\nCooking Temperature: Medium Cooking Uses: Drizzle, dips, salads Flavor: Bold\n\nShop Now\n\nAvocado Oil for Every Occasion\n\nSear & Sizzle\n\nCooking Temperature: High Cooking Uses: Sear, fry, everyday cooking Flavor: Neutral\n\nShop Now\n\nPrev\n\nNext\n\nExplore Our Full Collection\n\nGarlic Infused Oil\n\nCooking Temperature: High Cooking Uses: Drizzle, dip, saut\u00e9 Flavor: Extra bold & aromatic\n\nExplore Our Full Collection\n\nRoasted Pistachio Oil\n\nCooking Temperature: Medium-High Cooking Uses: Drizzle, dress, bake Flavor: Nutty & subtly salty\n\nExplore Our Full Collection\n\nInfused Basil Oil\n\nCooking Temperature: High Cooking Uses: Drizzle, dip, saut\u00e9 Flavor: Bold, mint & anise\n\nExplore Our Full Collection\n\nToasted Pumpkin Seed Oil\n\nCooking Temperature: Low Cooking Uses: Drizzle, dip, dress Flavor: Mildly earthy & nutty\n\nExplore Our Full Collection\n\nOrganic Flaxseed Oil\n\nCooking Temperature: Low Cooking Uses: Drizzle, dress, blend Flavor: Extra bold\n\nPrev\n\nNext\n\nOur Values\n\nOUR COMMITMENT TO SUSTAINABILITY\n\nTHE LA TOURANGELLE FOUNDATION\n\nSee What\u2019s Cooking\n\nFollow along for bold flavors and fresh recipes, delivered straight to your feed.\n\n@latourangelle\n\nAs seen on\n\nContact\n\ncontact@latourangelle.com\nGeneral Inquiries: +1 (510) 970 9960\nToll-Free 1.866.NUT.OILS\n\nRecipes\n\nBreakfast\n\nQuick Meal\n\nSalad\n\nSide\n\nEntr\u00e9e\n\nBBQ\n\nCocktail\n\nDessert\n\nCompany\n\nCareers\n\nFood Service, Bulk, Private Label & Wholesale\n\nShop Our French Site\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nRefund policy\n\nFAQs\n\nContact Us\n\nShipping & Return Policy\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nNutrition\n\nFind Us\n\nOur Commitment to Accessibility\n\nLanguage\n\nEnglish\n\nEspa\u00f1ol\n\n&copy; 2026, La Tourangelle\n\nAccessibility Options\n\nWrap to top\n\nPromotional popup window entered\n\nSubscribe for 10% Off Your Next Order!\n\nGet inspired with special discounts & insider tips.\n\nSubscribe for 10% Off Your Next Order!\n\nGet inspired with special discounts & insider tips.\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.\n\n{\"themeColor\":\"#574CD5\",\"iconColor\":\"#574CD5\",\"showLogo\":true,\"topBottomPosition\":10,\"rightLeftPosition\":10,\"iconSize\":\"small\",\"iconCustomSize\":64,\"position\":\"middle-right\"}\n\n\"6580773552318\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580772208830\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580772405438\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580772700350\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580773257406\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6862718435518\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6862791278782\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6725798297790\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6725804523710\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580773683390\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580773814462\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580774502590\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580774863038\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580775059646\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580774535358\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580774633662\"}{\"product_id\"=>\"6580776