D\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nloading... Add to cart Added Sold out Unavailable Add to cart\nClick [**here**][32] to be notified by email when Mantova Flavored Olive Oil Spray Variety Pack:\nGarlic, Lemon, Truffle, and Chili becomes available.\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][33] and [Terms of Service][34]\napply.\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][35] and [Terms of Service][36]\napply.\n\nThrough the generations, the Mantova family has become recognized as premier testers and tasters,\ncurating only the finest oils to bear the family name. Mantova proudly offers a pure, healthy oils\nin a convenient spray bottle that are sure to give your food exquisite flavor and taste with a\nlittle extra kick of flavor, whether it's chili, black truffle, lemon, or garlic that you prefer.\n\n\u2705 Our 100% pure oils are a rich in flavor with lots of health benefits. It\u2019s perfect for\nworry-free, everyday use in the kitchen, whether cooking, seasoning, grilling, or baking. The oil\npreserves its full flavor because of the spray bottle, specifically designed to preserve taste,\naroma, and healthy attributes of the oil. Our \u201cbag in bottle\u201d system protects the natural oil, so\nyou can spray lightly and evenly, without propellants, aerosol, or additives. The bag also protects\nthe oil from exposure to air and light, keeping it fresher longer.\n\n\u2705 Mantova Oil Sprays are non-GMO, gluten free, cholesterol free, and rich with healthy fats and\nantioxidants; perfect for adding to every meal. No need to feel timid about spraying onto finished\nfoods for a beautiful appearance as well as great taste. Mantova spray bottles bring all of the\nhealthy benefits of pure oils to your dishes \u2014 in just the right amounts for the recipes you love.\n\n\u2705 This variety set includes four spray oil bottles (5 oz. each): Garlic, Lemon, Truffle, and Chili\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West C