he finest sauces to bear the family name. Our authentic Mantova Pomodoro Sauce is\nproduced in Abruzzo, Italy, a region known for sweet, flavorful pasta sauces.\n\n\u201cPomodoro\u201d means \u201ctomato\u201d in Italian. And that\u2019s exactly what this is, a simple, yet delicious\ntomato sauce. Made with all-natural, high-quality ingredients: 100% Italian tomatoes. No additives,\npreservatives, processed foods, or artificial flavors. Simply add spices (onion, garlic, pepper),\nfresh herbs (oregano, basil, parsley), and extra virgin olive oil to the pomodoro sauce and gently\ncoat cooked pasta for a quick and delicious meal that the whole family will love.\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][37]\n* [Shop Now][38]\n* [Pastas][39]\n* [Olive Oils][40]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][41]\n* [Tomato Sauces][42]\n* [Shipping Policy][43]\n* [Refund Policy][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Terms of Service][46]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][47]\n* [Powered by Shopify][48]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODMwMCwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE\nzNTAwfQ.NiiAtmlgvKpUTwZNAlg8q_gca-88XTtu8DwFzIJmjd8&consent=s0\n[12]: /\n[13]: /collections\n[14]: /pages/private-label-1\n[15]: /pages/contact-us\n[16]: /\n[17]: /collections\n[18]: /pages/private-label-1\n[19]: /pages/contact-us\n[20]: /\n[21]: /search\n[22]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[23]: /cart\n[24]: /\n[25]: /search\n