become recognized as premier testers and tasters,\ncurating only the finest sauces to bear the family name. Our authentic Mantova Yellow Tomato Sauce\nis produced in Abruzzo, Italy, a region known for sweet, flavorful pasta sauces.\n\nMade with all-natural, high-quality ingredients: Italian yellow tomatoes and salt. No additives,\npreservatives, processed foods, or artificial flavors. Yellow tomatoes are known to be less acidic,\nsweeter, and more tolerable for sensitive stomachs. Simply add meat, veggies, and pasta for a quick,\ndelicious meal that the whole family will love.\n* \u2705 Product of Italy\n* \u2705 High-quality ingredients; no preservatives or artificial flavors\n* \u2705 Made with Italian yellow tomatoes; sweeter and less acidic\n* \u2705 Add meat or fresh veggies for a quick and easy, delicious meal\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][37]\n* [Shop Now][38]\n* [Pastas][39]\n* [Olive Oils][40]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][41]\n* [Tomato Sauces][42]\n* [Shipping Policy][43]\n* [Refund Policy][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Terms of Service][46]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][47]\n* [Powered by Shopify][48]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODMwOCwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE\nzNTA4fQ.Ougpj_5-TUoULjzKPUrha8AR2VT4hZRAUK6epzYIFFM\n[12]: /\n[13]: /collections\n[14]: /pages/private-label-1\n[15]: /pages/contact-us\n[16]: /\n[17]: /collections\n[18]: /pages/private-label-1\n[19]: /pages/contact-us\n[20]: /