an blend of fresh basil, garlic, cheese substitute, cashews, pine nuts, extra virgin olive\noil. Our vegan-friendly pesto is carefully crafted to maintain traditional Italian flavor without\nthe cheese. Easily enhance a simple pasta dish with a satisfying blend of flavors that\u2019s perfectly\nauthentic. Simply toss into spaghetti, macaroni, linguine, or any other pasta that you love. Or\nspread on top of pizza, toast or crusty bread. Instantly add authentic, exciting flavor no matter\nhow you choose to enjoy it.\n* \u2705 Product of Italy\n* \u2705 Vegan blend of fresh basil, garlic, cheese substitute, nuts, extra virgin olive oil\n* \u2705 Traditional pesto flavor\n* \u2705 Base for pasta sauces, spreads, and dips\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][37]\n* [Shop Now][38]\n* [Pastas][39]\n* [Olive Oils][40]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][41]\n* [Tomato Sauces][42]\n* [Shipping Policy][43]\n* [Refund Policy][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Terms of Service][46]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][47]\n* [Powered by Shopify][48]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODMxNiwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE\nzNTE2fQ.bk10BQxm-HMDBcqcYDWWQ3UWFLduJF0bbvo6NYnwdyU\n[12]: /\n[13]: /collections\n[14]: /pages/private-label-1\n[15]: /pages/contact-us\n[16]: /\n[17]: /collections\n[18]: /pages/private-label-1\n[19]: /pages/contact-us\n[20]: /\n[21]: /search\n[22]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_