ience result in a\ntraditional, short-grain rice that creates perfectly creamy, al dente risotto. Arborio rice boasts a\nhigher protein and starch content than other rice, which is why it is famous for use in slow-cooking\ndishes like risotto, flan, and rice pudding. Riso di Molinella is shipped in a vacuum-pack bag for\nfreshness.\n* \u2705 Product of Italy, vacuum-packed for freshness\n* \u2705 Superfino Arborio rice, traditional, short-grain famous for risotto, flan and rice pudding\n* \u2705 Grown in Molinella in the Po Valley of northern Italy\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][37]\n* [Shop Now][38]\n* [Pastas][39]\n* [Olive Oils][40]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][41]\n* [Tomato Sauces][42]\n* [Shipping Policy][43]\n* [Refund Policy][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Terms of Service][46]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][47]\n* [Powered by Shopify][48]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODMyNCwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE\nzNTI0fQ.RMFcn2qBmUj9efAvXlJOINU4-IR3Y7HM9jPQ6E_FDYE\n[12]: /\n[13]: /collections\n[14]: /pages/private-label-1\n[15]: /pages/contact-us\n[16]: /\n[17]: /collections\n[18]: /pages/private-label-1\n[19]: /pages/contact-us\n[20]: /\n[21]: /search\n[22]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[23]: /cart\n[24]: /\n[25]: /search\n[26]: /cart\n[27]: #\n[28]: #\n[29]: #\n[30]: #\n[31]: #\n[32]: #\n[33]: https://hcaptcha.com/privacy\n[34]: https://hcaptc