organic coconut oil.\n\nOur 100% pure coconut oil has a delicate, fruity flavor with a low smoke point and lots of health\nbenefits. It\u2019s perfect for worry-free, everyday use in the kitchen, whether cooking, seasoning, or\nbaking. Coconut oil is non-GMO, gluten free, cholesterol free, and rich with a natural source of\nbeneficial fats, vitamins and antioxidants; perfect for adding to every meal. No worries about using\nour pure coconut oil in plant-based diets, like Keto, vegan, or vegetarian. Our oil brings the\nhealthy benefits of coconuts to the dishes you love.\n\n* \u2705 100% coconut oil is gluten-free, cholesterol free, and rich with a natural source of beneficial\nfats, vitamins and antioxidants.\n* \u2705 Perfect for Keto, vegan, vegetarian, or other plant-based diets.\n* \u2705 Great for everyday use with frying, baking, and as a substitute for butter.\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][37]\n* [Shop Now][38]\n* [Pastas][39]\n* [Olive Oils][40]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][41]\n* [Tomato Sauces][42]\n* [Shipping Policy][43]\n* [Refund Policy][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Terms of Service][46]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][47]\n* [Powered by Shopify][48]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODMyOSwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE\nzNTI5fQ.NiCr4x3BPtMi-OqmY__42n1Xg1UDC19_TXjp0PWwQTY\n[12]: /\n[13]: /collections\n[14]: /pages/private-label-1\n[15]: /pages/contact-us\n[16]: /\n[17]: /collections\n[18]: /pag