 of Service][36]\napply.\n\nPair your pasta with a delicious tomato sauce [here][37]!\n\n## A Taste of Italian Tradition\n\nThrough the generations, the Mantova family has become recognized as premier testers and tasters,\ncurating only the finest pasta to bear the family name. Our Mantova Bronze Cut Spaghetti Pasta is\nmade from durum wheat flour, harvested and processed from the sunny, fertile soil of Apulia in\nSouthern Italy\u2014a region renowned for producing nutrient rich, flavorful grains.\n\nOur durum wheat pasta is properly prepared and dried, which creates a consistent golden color that\nturns lighter when cooked. Durum wheat has a higher content of protein than whole wheat. The result\nis rich texture, beautiful flavor, and a satisfied appetite. Easily whip up a fresh, healthy,\nauthentic Italian meal that the whole family will love.\n* \u2705 Product of Italy\n* \u2705 Traditional Italian durum wheat pasta\n* \u2705 All-natural, high-quality ingredients packaged for long shelf life\n* \u2705 Fresh, healthy, easy to cook, and ready within minutes\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][38]\n* [Shop Now][39]\n* [Pastas][40]\n* [Olive Oils][41]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][42]\n* [Tomato Sauces][43]\n* [Shipping Policy][44]\n* [Refund Policy][45]\n* [Privacy Policy][46]\n* [Terms of Service][47]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][48]\n* [Powered by Shopify][49]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODM0NS