s, the Mantova family has become recognized as premier testers and tasters,\ncurating only the finest products to bear the family name. Mantova proudly offers an oil and vinegar\nsalad dressing in a convenient spray bottle.\n\nA beautifully blended dressing of extra virgin olive oil and balsamic vinegar of Modena is perfect\nfor any salad. The oil and vinegar combination preserves its full flavor because of the spray\nbottle, specifically designed to preserve taste, aroma, and healthy attributes of the oil. Our \u201cbag\nin bottle\u201d system protects the natural oil, so you can spray lightly and evenly, without\npropellants, aerosol, or additives. The bag also protects the oil from exposure to air and light,\nkeeping it fresher longer.\n\nEnjoy an easy, convenient way to dress food, control portions for lower calories, and limit waste.\nJust spray what you need on top of salads, vegetables, fruits, cheese, risotto, pasta, or\nsandwiches.\n* \u2705 Product of Italy: a perfect balance of oil and balsamic vinegar to easily dress any salad or\ndish\n* \u2705 Our \u201cbag in bottle\u201d system helps you spray lightly and evenly without any propellants,\naerosols, or additives\n* \u2705 Great for everyday use with cooking and spraying onto finished foods for a beautiful look and a\ngreat taste\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][37]\n* [Shop Now][38]\n* [Pastas][39]\n* [Olive Oils][40]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][41]\n* [Tomato Sauces][42]\n* [Shipping Policy][43]\n* [Refund Policy][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Terms of Service][46]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][47]\n* [Powered by Shopify][48]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer