antova Extra Virgin Olive Oil Spray preserves all the genuine qualities of a\ntraditional bottle of oil while giving you greater control in adding just the right amount for your\ndish. Our \u201cbag in bottle\u201d system protects the oil, so you can spray lightly and evenly, without\npropellants, aerosol, or additives. The bag also protects the oil from exposure to air and light,\nkeeping it fresher longer. Mantova oil spray is non-GMO and full of powerful antioxidants and\nmonounsaturated fatty acids; perfect for adding to every meal. Also spray onto finished foods for a\nbeautiful appearance as well as great taste. Mantova spray bottles bring all of the healthy benefits\nof extra virgin olive oil to your dishes \u2014 in just the right amounts for the recipes you love.\n* \u2705 Made in Italy (Product of Italy)\n* \u2705 A set of three spray oil bottles (8.5 oz. each) for everyday use as a seasoning and as a\nfinishing spray\n* \u2705 \u201cBag in bottle\u201d technology sprays lightly and evenly without any propellants, aerosols, or\nadditives\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][37]\n* [Shop Now][38]\n* [Pastas][39]\n* [Olive Oils][40]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][41]\n* [Tomato Sauces][42]\n* [Shipping Policy][43]\n* [Refund Policy][44]\n* [Privacy Policy][45]\n* [Terms of Service][46]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][47]\n* [Powered by Shopify][48]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODM2NSwibmJmIjoxN