il when Mantova White Glaze with \u201cBalsamic Vinegar of\nModena PGI\u201d, 8.5 oz becomes available.\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][33] and [Terms of Service][34]\napply.\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][35] and [Terms of Service][36]\napply.\n\nPair your white glaze with a delicious olive oil [here][37]!\n\n## A Taste of Italian Tradition\n\nOur Mantova White Glaze with Balsamic Vinegar has all the flavorful characteristics of a traditional\nbalsamic vinegar but without the dark color. The lighter color creates a softer honey-hued sheen on\nany meal. Brush onto white meats or fish, or drizzle onto fruit, ice cream, brownies, salads, pizza,\nveggies, or cheese. Stir into a white sauce or risotto for a perfectly creamy dish or swirl the\nglaze onto a plate to add a touch of drama to any meal.\n* \u2705 Made in Italy, comes from one of the world\u2019s exclusive producers of the finest quality balsamic\nvinegars\n* \u2705 Traditional balsamic vinegar, reduced to a silky, golden-hued, mellow-flavored glaze\n* \u2705 Reasonably priced for everyday use; desserts, pasta sauces, marinades, salad dressings, and\nvinaigrettes\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][38]\n* [Shop Now][39]\n* [Pastas][40]\n* [Olive Oils][41]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][42]\n* [Tomato Sauces][43]\n* [Shipping Policy][44]\n* [Refund Policy][45]\n* [Privacy Policy][46]\n* [Terms of Service][47]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][48]\n* [Powered by Shopify][49]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?loca