e][36]\napply.\n\nPair your apple glaze with a delicious olive oil [here][37]!\n\n## A Taste of Italian Tradition\n\nThrough the generations, the Mantova family has become recognized as premier testers and tasters,\ncurating only the finest vinegars to bear the family name. Our Mantova Raw Unfiltered Organic Apple\nGlaze is a smooth, velvety reduction made from organic apple juice and apple cider vinegar. It\u2019s\nnever filtered to ensure a pure, authentic taste and experience. This sweet and tangy condiment will\nenhance the flavor of meats, salads, fruits, and sweet dishes like donuts or cake. It\u2019s quick and\neasy to add to any recipe for a pop of tangy apple flavor.\n* \u2705 Product of Italy\n* \u2705 Never filtered to ensure a pure, authentic taste and experience\n* \u2705 Smooth, velvety reduction made from organic apple juice and apple cider vinegar\n* \u2705 Easily add a pop of tangy apple flavor to meats, salads, fruits, cakes, or donuts\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][38]\n* [Shop Now][39]\n* [Pastas][40]\n* [Olive Oils][41]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][42]\n* [Tomato Sauces][43]\n* [Shipping Policy][44]\n* [Refund Policy][45]\n* [Privacy Policy][46]\n* [Terms of Service][47]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][48]\n* [Powered by Shopify][49]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODQwMSwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE\nzNjAxfQ.DDhOvgXmcOG9G82yXYjbhPd_Z6VM5Cuzrblo8At4zA4\n[12]: /\n[13]: /collections\n[14]: 