rvice][34]\napply.\n\n**Le Specialit\u00e0 Italiane Soft Toffee with Licorice of Calabria PDO **is a **silky, soft toffee made\nwith whole milk and delicate, rich extract of the famous licorice of Calabria PDO **\u2014 the best of\nItaly! Our delicate, tasty toffee is made with **100% Italian unrefined\nsugar** and **other ****high-quality, all-natural ingredients sourced from\nItaly**, has **no artificial coloring or flavoring**, and comes **i****ndividually wrapped** to\nmaintain freshness. Enjoy our **Soft Toffee with Licorice of Calabria PDO**** **on your own, use\nthem to fill candy dishes at home or in the office break room, or gift them to family and friends at\nEaster, Christmas, and other holidays. Perfect for on-the-go snacking. **Buon appetito!**\n* **Product of Italy**\n* **All-natural, high-quality ingredients, including 100% Italian unrefined sugar, pasteurized fresh\nmilk, 100% extract of licorice of Calabria PDO, whole milk powder, and more**\n* **No artificial coloring or flavoring**\n* **Gluten-free**\n* **Vegan-friendly**\n\nIf you like our** Soft Toffee with Licorice of Calabria PDO **by **Le Specialit\u00e0 Italiane**,** **you\nshould try** **our** delicate, oven-baked cookies **by** Campiello! **Click here to see\nour [**Campiello Cookies!**][35]\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][36]\n* [Shop Now][37]\n* [Pastas][38]\n* [Olive Oils][39]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][40]\n* [Tomato Sauces][41]\n* [Shipping Policy][42]\n* [Refund Policy][43]\n* [Privacy Policy][44]\n* [Terms of Service][45]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][46]\n* [Powered by Shopify][47]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?