e recognized as premier testers and tasters,\ncurating only the finest pasta to bear the family name. Our Mantova Bronze Cut Egg Pasta is made\nfrom durum wheat flour and Free range eggs, harvested and processed from the sunny, fertile soil of\nApulia in Southern Italy\u2014a region renowned for producing nutrient-rich, flavorful grains.\n\nOur high-quality farm fresh egg pasta is properly prepared and slowly dried with no preservatives,\nGMO's or colorants, which creates a consistent golden color that maintains its quality when cooked.\nMade with durum wheat which has a high content of protein, the result is rich texture, beautiful\nflavor, and a satisfied appetite. Easily whip up a fresh, healthy, authentic Italian meal that the\nwhole family will love.\n* \u2705Made with Farm Fresh, Free Range Eggs\n* \u2705Traditional Bronze Die extruded\n* \u2705NON-GMO, No Preservatives, No Colorants\n* \u2705 Product of Italy\n\nMantova Food\n\nsupport@mantovafood.com\n\n590 West Crossroads Parkway\nBolingbrook, IL 60440\n\nHours: Monday-Friday\n9:00 am-4:00 pm CST\n\nLinks\n* [Search][36]\n* [Shop Now][37]\n* [Pastas][38]\n* [Olive Oils][39]\n* [Balsamic Vinegars][40]\n* [Tomato Sauces][41]\n* [Shipping Policy][42]\n* [Refund Policy][43]\n* [Privacy Policy][44]\n* [Terms of Service][45]\nFollow us on social media!\n* [\u00a9 2026, Mantova Fine Italian Food][46]\n* [Powered by Shopify][47]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /collections\n[3]: /pages/private-label-1\n[4]: /pages/contact-us\n[5]: /\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections\n[8]: /pages/private-label-1\n[9]: /pages/contact-us\n[10]: https://www.mantovafood.com/customer_authentication/redirect?locale=en&region_country=US\n[11]: https://account.mantovafood.com?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJtYW50b3Z\nhLWZpbmUtaXRhbGlhbi1mb29kLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgxODQzMSwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE\nzNjMxfQ.MsXiGR9Gb8OCmNFON-L0bzjmSIPnaaztKEiy5oCABEo&consent=s0\n[12]: /\n[13]: /collections\n[14]: /pages/private-label-1\n[15