Refined Almond Oil, providing monounsaturated fat, is expeller-pressed oil with a pure,\nclean flavor. It is perfect for stir-frying or saut\u00e9ing; as a complement to your favorite\nvinaigrette drizzled over crisp salad greens; or in baked goodies like brownies.\n\n8 FL OZ\n\n## Buy Now\n* [Amazon][34]\n* [Target][35]\n* [Kroger][36]\n* [Walmart][37]\n* [iHerb][38]\n\nNutrition Facts\n\n### Ingredients\n\nEXPELLER PRESSED REFINED ALMOND OIL.\n\nNutritional Facts modal\n\n## Nutrition Facts\n* Serving Size: 1 Tbsp (15ml)\n* Amount Per Serving\n* * Calorie"
