            "url": "https://www.spectrumorganics.com/about/",
            "text": "[ [Spectrum logo] Spectrum ][1]\n[ Mobile Navigation trigger ][2] [ Mobile Search trigger ][3]\n* [Products][4][Expands the navigation menu][5]\n* [\n[Spectrum Culinary\u2122 products]\nSpectrum Culinary\u2122\n][6][Expands the navigation menu][7]\n* [\n[Spectrum Essentials\u00ae products]\nSpectrum Essentials\u00ae\n][8][Expands the navigation menu][9]\n* [Recipes][10][Expands the navigation menu][11]\n* [About][12][Expands the navigation menu][13]\n* [Buy Now][14][Expands the navigation menu][15]\n* [Amazon][16][Expands the navigation menu][17]\n* [Target][18][Expands the navigation menu][19]\n* [Kroger][20][Expands the navigation menu][21]\n* [Walmart][22][Expands the navigation menu][23]\n* [iHerb][24][Expands the navigation menu][25]\n* [Contact Us][26][Expands the navigation menu][27]\n* [Search][28][Expands the navigation menu][29]\nSearch Search [ Close Search Box ][30]\n\n# About\n\n**OUR STORY**\n\nIn 1986, Spectrum Naturals\u00ae brand was founded in Petaluma, CA to bring nutrition and quality into\nthe vegetable oil market. Soon after Spectrum Naturals\u00ae brand was founded, Spectrum Essentials\u00ae\nbrand was created to produce and market dietary supplements. Both brands were committed to offering\npremium, wholesome alternatives to conventional products. This commitment stemmed from the brand\u2019s\nuse of organic, non-GMO ingredients and its chemical-free extraction of oils.\n\nSpectrum Naturals\u00ae brand soon became a leading innovator in the development of expeller-pressed and\ncertified organic vegetable oils, as well as a leading proponent of testing and verifying the\nabsence of genetically modified organisms in its culinary oils. In 2005, Hain Celestial Group\nacquired Spectrum\u00ae Organic Products, and today, Spectrum\u00ae brand is the #1 Natural and Organic\nCulinary Oil brand!\u00b9\n\n**OUR COMMITMENT**\n\nSpectrum\u00ae brand was founded for one simple reason: to provide a reliable source of high quality,\nwholesome products. Our brand offers 30+ varieties of Non-GMO Project Verified culinary oils,\nsourced from worldwide geographies including Spain and Italy. This collection of oils feature\npremium expeller-pressed and cold-pressed products. As your culinary partner, we are here to\neducate, guide, and inspire you with tips and resources that will take your dishes to new heights.\nExplore our products and our website to learn how to give your healthful lifestyle a boost.\n\n**HAIN CELESTIAL GROUP** Spectrum Culinary\u2122 and Spectrum Essentials\u00ae are owned by Spectrum Organic\nProducts, LLC, a subsidiary of the Hain Celestial Group (Nasdaq: HAIN) and is headquartered in\nBoulder, CO. Hain Celestial is a leading natural and organic food and personal care products\ncompany in North America and Europe. Hain Celestial participates in almost all natural food\ncategories. Spectrum Culinary\u2122 brand\u2019s purpose is to provide and deliver a premium line of culinary\noils, vinegars, mayonnaise, spread and shortening that adhere to high quality standards. We are\nvigilant about the sourcing, production, and packaging of our products \u2013 with the goal of leaving as\nsmall a footprint as possible, and sustaining resources for the future..\n\n\u00a92026 Spectrum Organic Products, LLC\n* [Privacy Policy][31]\n* [Terms of Use][32]\n* [Contact Us][33]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][34]\n* [Limit the Use of My Sensitive Personal Information][35]\n* [Facebook][36]\n* [Instagram][37]\n* [YouTube][38]\n[ [Hain Celestial logo] ][39]\n\n[1]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/\n[2]: #menu-primary\n[3]: #site-search\n[4]: #\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/products/culinary/\n[7]: #\n[8]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/products/essentials/\n[9]: #\n[10]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/recipes/\n[11]: #\n[12]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/about/\n[13]: #\n[14]: #\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss_2?url=search-alias%3Daps&field-keywords=Spectrum%20Cul\ninary\n[17]: #\n[18]: https://www.target.com/s?searchTerm=Spectrum%20Culinary\n[19]: #\n[20]: https://www.kroger.com/search?tab=0&query=Spectrum%20Culinary\n[21]: #\n[22]: https://www.walmart.com/search/?query=Spectrum%20Culinary\n[23]: #\n[24]: https://www.iherb.com/c/spectrum-culinary?rank=0&rawkw=spectrum%20culin&refererLocation=sugges\ntion\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/contact/\n[27]: #\n[28]: #\n[29]: #\n[30]: #\n[31]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/privacy-policy/\n[32]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/terms-of-use/\n[33]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/contact/\n[34]: https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/e49b8fe9-2ebe-4502-a100-4ff1c182b34e/7638fc62-41f1-\n4315-b595-0ac508197f8e\n[35]: https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/e49b8fe9-2ebe-4502-a100-4ff1c182b34e/55631285-45da-\n400b-877a-395a6ec4a45c\n[36]: https://www.facebook.com/spectrumorganics/\n[37]: https://www.instagram.com/spectrumorganic/\n[38]: https://www.youtube.com/user/SpectrumCookingOils\n[39]: http://www.hain.com/"
