            "url": "https://www.spectrumorganics.com/product/organic-all-vegetable-shortening/",
            "text": "[ [Spectrum logo] Spectrum ][1]\n[ Mobile Navigation trigger ][2] [ Mobile Search trigger ][3]\n* [Products][4][Expands the navigation menu][5]\n* [\n[Spectrum Culinary\u2122 products]\nSpectrum Culinary\u2122\n][6][Expands the navigation menu][7]\n* [\n[Spectrum Essentials\u00ae products]\nSpectrum Essentials\u00ae\n][8][Expands the navigation menu][9]\n* [Recipes][10][Expands the navigation menu][11]\n* [About][12][Expands the navigation menu][13]\n* [Buy Now][14][Expands the navigation menu][15]\n* [Amazon][16][Expands the navigation menu][17]\n* [Target][18][Expands the navigation menu][19]\n* [Kroger][20][Expands the navigation menu][21]\n* [Walmart][22][Expands the navigation menu][23]\n* [iHerb][24][Expands the navigation menu][25]\n* [Contact Us][26][Expands the navigation menu][27]\n* [Search][28][Expands the navigation menu][29]\nSearch Search [ Close Search Box ][30]\n[Products][31] > [Culinary\u2122][32] > [Organic Shortening][33]\n\n# Organic All Vegetable Shortening\n\nUp to 450\u00b0F High\n\nFor baking & cooking with a neutral taste\n\nWhen we say our Organic Shortening is good, we really mean good for all your baking and cooking\nneeds with 0g trans fat per serving and never hydrogenated. Even better are the dozens of producers\nin Colombia, who with funds and investments from your purchase of Fair Trade Certified\u2122 Organic\nShortening, are able to harvest and press our palm oil in a sustainable manner, ensuring prosperous\nlivelihoods for the Earth and producer both. It\u2019s the right choice for you, the farmers and the\nearth\u2026 just imagine what it does for a pie crust.\n\n24 OZ\n\n## Buy Now\n* [Amazon][34]\n* [Target][35]\n* [Kroger][36]\n* [Walmart][37]\n* [iHerb][38]\n\nNutrition Facts\n\n### Ingredients\n\nORGANIC PALM OIL.* *Fair Trade Certified\u2122 by Fair Trade USA.\n\nNutritional Facts modal\n\n## Nutrition Facts\n* Serving Size: 1 Tbsp (12g)\n* Amount Per Serving\n* * Calories: 110\n* % Daily Value*\n* * 