            "text": "[ [Spectrum logo] Spectrum ][1]\n[ Mobile Navigation trigger ][2] [ Mobile Search trigger ][3]\n* [Products][4][Expands the navigation menu][5]\n* [\n[Spectrum Culinary\u2122 products]\nSpectrum Culinary\u2122\n][6][Expands the navigation menu][7]\n* [\n[Spectrum Essentials\u00ae products]\nSpectrum Essentials\u00ae\n][8][Expands the navigation menu][9]\n* [Recipes][10][Expands the navigation menu][11]\n* [About][12][Expands the navigation menu][13]\n* [Buy Now][14][Expands the navigation menu][15]\n* [Amazon][16][Expands the navigation menu][17]\n* [Target][18][Expands the navigation menu][19]\n* [Kroger][20][Expands the navigation menu][21]\n* [Walmart][22][Expands the navigation menu][23]\n* [iHerb][24][Expands the navigation menu][25]\n* [Contact Us][26][Expands the navigation menu][27]\n* [Search][28][Expands the navigation menu][29]\nSearch Search [ Close Search Box ][30]\n[Products][31] > [Culinary\u2122][32] > [Mayonnaise][33]\n\n# Canola Mayonnaise \u2013 Squeeze\n\nSpectrum\u00ae Squeeze Bottle Canola Mayonnaise has all the good-for-you benefits and great-for-you taste\nas our jar version, but in an easy, squeeze-y bottle. Try it mixed with a splash of balsamic vinegar\nas a sweet and savory dressing for potato salad.\n\n11.25 FL OZ\n\n## Buy Now\n* [Amazon][34]\n* [Target][35]\n* [Kroger][36]\n* [Walmart][37]\n* [iHerb][38]\n\n[Canola Mayonnaise]\nNutrition Facts\n\n### Ingredients\n\nExpeller pressed canola oil, pasteurized whole eggs, filtered water, honey, distilled white vinegar,\nsea salt, mustard (distilled vinegar, water, mustard seed, salt), lemon juice concentrate. CONTAINS:\nEGGS GLUTEN FREE\n\nNutritional Facts modal\n\n## Nutrition Facts\n* Serving Size: 1 Tbsp (14g)\n* Amount Per Serving\n* * Calories: 100\n* % Daily Value*\n* * Total Fat 11g\n* 14%\n* * Saturated Fat 1.5g\n* 8%\n* * Polyunsaturated Fat 6g\n* * Monounsaturated Fat 2.5g\n* * Cholesterol 10mg\n* 3%\n* * Sodium 95mg\n* 4%\n* Not a significant source of dietary fiber, total sugars, added sugars, vitamin D, calcium, iron\nand potassium.\n\n* The % Daily Value (DV) tells you how much a nutrient in a serving of food contributes to a daily\ndiet. 2,000 calories a day is used for general nutrition advice.\n\n* The most accurate information is always on the actual product label. We may periodically update\nour labels and the website does not necessarily get updated at the same time. The values on the\nwebsite are intended to be a general guide to consumers. For absolute values, the actual label on\nthe product at hand should be relied upon.\n\n\u00a92026 Spectrum Organic Products, LLC\n* [Privacy Policy][39]\n* [Terms of Use][40]\n* [Contact Us][41]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][42]\n* [Limit the Use of My Sensitive Personal Information][43]\n* [Facebook][44]\n* [Instagram][45]\n* [YouTube][46]\n[ [Hain Celestial logo] ][47]\n\n[1]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/\n[2]: #menu-primary\n[3]: #site-search\n[4]: #\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/products/culinary/\n[7]: #\n[8]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/products/essentials/\n[9]: #\n[10]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/recipes/\n[11]: #\n[12]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/about/\n[13]: #\n[14]: #\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss_2?url=search-alias%3Daps&field-keywords=Spectrum%20Cul\ninary\n[17]: #\n[18]: https://www.target.com/s?searchTerm=Spectrum%20Culinary\n[19]: #\n[20]: https://www.kroger.com/search?tab=0&query=Spectrum%20Culinary\n[21]: #\n[22]: https://www.walmart.com/search/?query=Spectrum%20Culinary\n[23]: #\n[24]: https://www.iherb.com/c/spectrum-culinary?rank=0&rawkw=spectrum%20culin&refererLocation=sugges\ntion\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/contact/\n[27]: #\n[28]: #\n[29]: #\n[30]: #\n[31]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/products/\n[32]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/products/culinary/\n[33]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/products/mayonnaise/\n[34]: https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss_2?url=search-alias%3Daps&field-keywords=Spectrum Canol\na Mayonnaise \u2013 Squeeze\n[35]: https://www.target.com/s?searchTerm=Spectrum Canola Mayonnaise \u2013 Squeeze\n[36]: https://www.kroger.com/search?tab=0&query=Spectrum Canola Mayonnaise \u2013 Squeeze\n[37]: https://www.walmart.com/search/?query=Spectrum Canola Mayonnaise \u2013 Squeeze\n[38]: https://www.iherb.com/c/spectrum-culinary?rank=0&rawkw=spectrum%20culin&refererLocation=sugges\ntion Canola Mayonnaise \u2013 Squeeze\n[39]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/privacy-policy/\n[40]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/terms-of-use/\n[41]: https://www.spectrumorganics.com/contact/\n[42]: https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/e49b8fe9-2ebe-4502-a100-4ff1c182b34e/7638fc62-41f1-\n4315-b595-0ac508197f8e\n[43]: https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/e49b8fe9-2ebe-4502-a100-4ff1c182b34e/55631285-45da-\n400b-877a-395a6ec4a45c\n[44]: https://www.facebook.com/spectrumorganics/\n[45]: https://www.instagram.com/spectrumorganic/\n[46]: https://www.youtube.com/user/SpectrumCookingOils\n[47]: http://www.hain.com/"
