        "crawl_text": "Westfalia Fruit International Limited Global Vertically integrated supply chain from research to consumer Diverse global network of farms and partner growers Sustainable farming techniques Tzaneen, South Africa Rungis, France Graveson, France Munich, Germany Poeldijk, Netherlands Spalding, United Kingdom Kings Hill, United Kingdom \u00d3bidos, Portugal Tzaneen, South Africa Everdon, South Africa Midrand, South Africa Kempton Park, South Africa Parktown, South Africa Bairro, Mozambique Hyderabad, India France Germany Netherlands United Kingdom Portugal South Africa Mozambique India Chile Colombia Peru USA Global Westfalia Fruit - The Avocado Experts - Westfalia Fruit\n\nOur story\n\nOur products\n\nFor growers\n\nNews\n\nCareers\nContact us\n\nWe are a leading global avocado company.\n\nFor over 75 years we have been the trusted supplier of avocados, fresh fruits, and plant based products to international retail, foodservice, and wholesale customers.\n\nSee our products\n\nAbout our company\n\n\u201cA global avocado leader, but that\u2019s only one aspect, we do so much more.\u201d\n\nChris Bush\nGroup CEO at Westfalia Fruit\n\nSee all our products\n\n\u201cA global avocado leader, but that\u2019s only one aspect, we do so much more.\u201d\n\nChris Bush\nGroup CEO at Westfalia Fruit\n\nSee all our products\n\nSustainability\n\nWe strive to minimise our environmental impact.\n\nWe do so by reducing waste, carbon emissions, and the use of hazardous materials wherever possible while using resources more efficiently.\n\nLearn more about our sustainability approach\n\nWe are proud to maintain the most diverse avocado-growing footprint in the world.\n\nChris Bush\nGroup CEO at Westfalia Fruit\n\nOur history\n\nAiming for excellence since 1949.\nAs we've grown and evolved over 75 years, our dedication to our founders legacy remains unwavering.\n\nDiscover our history\n\nOur Story\nDiscover our fruits journey from pit to plate\n\nExplore our commitment to sustainability and discover how we are making a positive impact on the environment and communities.\n\nLearn more\n\nFor growers\n\nWorld-class trees based on science\nLearn about our avocado trees\n\nInnovations\n\nPioneering is in our DNA\nLearn about our innovations\n\nOur news\n\nSee all news\n\nWestfalia Fruit Appoints Avocado Industry Expert Tommy Padilla as President, North America\n\n19 Jun 2026\n\nCompany\n\nAvocado all day, every day: Westfalia Fruit unlocks new consumption moments at PLMA 2026\n\n19 May 2026\n\nInnovation &amp; Market\n\nWestfalia Fruit Continues to Unlock Value in the Supply Chain through its \u2018Whole Tree\u2019 Approach\n\n17 Feb 2026\n\nSustainability &amp; Innovation\n\nWe love avocados.\n\nDiscover our range of avocado based recipes and the health benefits.&nbsp;\n\nSee our recipes\n\nWestfalia Fruit is a leading global avocado company.\n\nOur story\n\nCompany overview\nSustainability\nOur history\nCommunity Support\nInnovation\nAccreditations\n\nOur products\n\nSee all our products\nAvocados\nFresh produce\nProcessed products\n\nFor growers\n\nEverything for growers\n\nNews\n\nOur news\n\nCareers\n\nOur careers\n\nContact\n\nContact us\n\n\u00a9 2026 Westfalia Fruit\n\nDisclaimer\nPrivacy policy &amp; Terms of Use\nModern Slavery Act\nPPN0621 CRP\nOfficial documents\n\u00a9 2026 Westfalia Fruit ][1]\n* Our story\n* Our products\n* [\nFor growers\n][2]\n* [\nNews\n][3]\n* [\nCareers\n][4]\n[Contact us][5]\nContact us.\n\nGet in touch, we are all ears.\n\nBuy\nContact us to buy our products.\n][6][\nSell\nContact us to sell your products.\n][7][\nMedia\nContact us about media enquiries.\n][8][\nOther\nContact us with general questions.\n][9]\nWe have locations across the globe.\nIn 17 countries around the world, we have offices, packhouses, warehouses, nurseries & orchards.\nEurope\n[chevron]\nFrance\n[chevron]\n\nRungis Office\n\n+33 (0)1 46 86 71 77\n\n[[email protected]][10]\n\n5 Boulevard du Delta, Zone Euro Delta Min de Ru