+Merlot+Cl,+Glen+marais,+Kempton+\nPark,+1619,+South+Africa!3b1!8m2!3d-26.0711917!4d28.2778149!3m5!1s0x1e95158d23d7a1e7:0x1e6109719f709\n862!8m2!3d-26.0715846!4d28.2780934!16s%2Fg%2F11pysmm72t?entry=ttu\n[32]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[33]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/HANS+MERENSKY+HOLDINGS+PTY+LTD/@-26.1796,28.0318538,66m/data\n=!3m1!1e3!4m15!1m8!3m7!1s0x1e950c12b54df64b:0xa9454b6a9344df3e!2s9+Eton+Rd,+Parktown,+Johannesburg,+\n2193,+South+Africa!3b1!8m2!3d-26.1795646!4d28.0317131!16s%2Fg%2F11c22q0n_4!3m5!1s0x1e950c12b5a93bcf:\n0xe610530dcb3279e9!8m2!3d-26.1794862!4d28.0317341!16s%2Fg%2F1xnz22r1?entry=ttu\n[34]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[35]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/33%C2%B049'01.0%22S+18%C2%B052'44.2%22E/@-33.8137649,18.8761\n788,235m/data=!3m1!1e3!4m4!3m3!8m2!3d-33.8169444!4d18.8789444?entry=ttu\n[36]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[37]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[38]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Sam+Agritech+Limited/@17.4209187,78.4427646,20z/data=!4m6!3m\n5!1s0x3bcb9b07c2a6f8eb:0xe547d3a9311c2767!8m2!3d17.4210725!4d78.4429032!16s%2Fg%2F1wj_4hb1?entry=ttu\n[39]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[40]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Agricom+Apples+%26+Pears+S.A./@-33.414944,-70.591424,20z/dat\na=!4m6!3m5!1s0x9662cf3e03e07521:0x6355f1d75e751232!8m2!3d-33.4149383!4d-70.5918325!16s%2Fg%2F1td_jg5\nw?hl=en-GB&entry=ttu\n[41]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[42]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Westfalia+fruits/@6.2228551,-75.3896601,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m\n6!3m5!1s0x8e4421007ada913f:0xc1e1e8f15df1dfc4!8m2!3d6.2228551!4d-75.3896601!16s%2Fg%2F11vpwsr65h?ent\nry=ttu\n[43]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[44]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/12%C2%B007'31.0%22S+77%C2%B001'30.3%22W/@-12.1253587,-77.024\n9664,19.41z/data=!4m4!3m3!8m2!3d-12.125263!4d-77.02509?entry=ttu\n[45]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[46]: https://westfaliafruit.com/report-unethical-behaviour\n[47]: https://www.instagram.com/avoexperts/\n[48]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/westfalia-fruit-international-limited/\n[49]: https://www.facebook.com/WestfaliaFruit/\n[50]: https://za.pinterest.com/westfaliafruitp/\n[51]: https://westfaliafruit.com/company-overview\n[52]: https://westfaliafruit.com/sustainability\n[53]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-history\n[54]: https://westfaliafruit.com/community-support\n[55]: https://westfaliafruit.com/innovation\n[56]: https://westfaliafruit.com/accreditations\n[57]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products\n[58]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products/avocado-products\n[59]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products/fresh-fruits\n[60]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products/plant-based-products\n[61]: https://westfaliafruit.com/for-growers\n[62]: https://westfaliafruit.com/news\n[63]: https://westfaliafruit.com/careers\n[64]: https://westfaliafruit.com/contact-us\n[65]: home\n[66]: https://westfaliafruit.com/disclaimer\n[67]: https://westfaliafruit.com/privacy-policy-and-terms-of-use\n[68]: https://westfaliafruit.com/modern-slavery-act\n[69]: https://westfaliafruit.com/ppn0621-crp\n[70]: https://westfaliafruit.com/official-documents"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://westfaliafruit.com/about-us",
            "text": "][1]\n* Our story\n* Our products\n* [\nFor growers\n][2]\n* [\nNews\n][3]\n* [\nCareers\n][4]\n[Contact us][5]\nWe are a leading global avocado company.\nFor over 75 years we have been the trusted supplier of fresh fruits and plant based products.\n\nWestfalia Fruit is recognised as the \u2018AvoExpert\u2019. In addition to our wide range of avocado products,\nwe supply other fresh produce including citrus, cherries, blueberries, & many others, to\ninternational markets.\n\n1st\nVertically integrated avocado supply chain from research to consumer.\n8000\nColleagues across 5 continents.\n1949\nFounded by Dr. Hans Merensky.\n2049\nThe year we complete our journey to lifetime net zero.\nCountries where we have offices, warehouses and orchards.\nWhy are we the AvoExperts? Let us tell you why.\nWe research & develop\n[chevron]\n\nInvesting in research & development (R&D) has opened up a world of possibilities for Westfalia\nFruit. It has enabled us to enhance our farming practices and sustainability efforts, develop new\nfruit varieties, improve crop resilience, and reduce our use of natural resources like water.\n\nWe grow\n[chevron]\n\nWe have a diverse global network of farms, partner growers and nurseries across different\ncontinents. This ensures our ability to deliver a wide variety of high-quality fruits. Westfalia\nFruit uses sustainable farming techniques like mulching, integrated pest management and water\nconservation.\n\nWe ripen\n[chevron]\n\nSpecialised ripening technologies ensure our fruit reaches optimal ripeness and flavour before being\nshipped to retail and foodservice customers. We provide a superior eating experience by delivering\nready-to-eat avocados year-round while extending shelf life and reducing food waste.\n\nWe ship\n[chevron]\n\nOur precious fruit is transported in a timely manner by shipping efficiently. The freshness is\nmaintained by optimising the logistics and controlling the climate during transport. By choosing\nlow-carbon shipping methods, we help to reduce carbon emissions.\n\nWe process\n[chevron]\n\nAt our modern processing facilities we carefully sort, clean, process and package our fruit to the\nhighest standards of quality and food safety. We implement energy- and water-saving measures in\nthese processes. Our whole fruit approach minimises waste and promotes circularity.\n\nWe pack\n[chevron]\n\nOur fruits are protected during transportation and in storage. We use sustainable packaging\nmaterials and minimise waste to reduce our environmental impact. Biodegradable, compostable or\nrecyclable packaging materials are prioritised.\n\nWe sell\n[chevron]\n\nOur experienced commercial teams manage the entire sales process, from sourcing fruit to ensuring\nsafe transport to its final destination. We advise our customers to make informed decisions that\nsupport them and a more sustainable planet.\n\nWe distribute\n[chevron]\n\nOur well-established distribution network ensures our fruit reaches markets in a timely manner,\nproviding consumers with delicious, fresh and sustainably grown products. Thanks to our global\npresence and integrated approach, we are able to distribute efficiently to our local partners.\n\nOur dedication to innovation and development is showcased through a wide range of innovations.\n\nServiced by our technical departments, we continually focus on new cultivar developments, product\ninnovation, ecologically conscious packaging, and other sustainability initiatives.\n\n[Learn more about our innovations][6]\nOur purpose is to do good with every avocado.\nVision\n[chevron]\n\nTo be the world\u2019s avocado leader, making the difference for our customers, partners, people and the\nplanet.\n\nMission\n[chevron]\n\nWe work with our customers and growers to ignite a passion for avocados in every consumer by\ndelivering exceptional avocado experiences that help people to live healthy lives.\n\nThe people in Westfalia Fruit live our purpose every day.\n\nOur team at Westfalia Fruit has the talent, commitment, and passion to do good. They truly live that\npurpose and make us a leading and innovative avocado company.\n\n[Learn more about a career in Westfalia Fruit][7]\nMeet the Executive Team leading the AvoExperts.\n[profile picture]\nChris Bush\nGroup CEO\n[profile picture]\nPaul Chaytor\nChief Supply Chain Officer\n[profile picture]\nHans Eben\nChief Sourcing & Operations Officer\n[profile picture]\nRian du Toit\nChief Financial Officer\n[profile picture]\nMichelle Boniface\nChief Legal & Governance Officer\n[profile picture]\nKaren McEwan\nChief People Officer\n[profile picture]\nJohnathan Sutton\nChief R&D and Sustainability Officer\n[profile picture]\nAndre Oosthuisen\nChief Technology Officer\n[profile picture]\nPaulina Criticos\nChief M&A and Growth Officer\nAs we have grown and evolved over 75 years, our dedication to our founders legacy remains\nunwavering.\n\nOur founder is Dr. Hans Merensky. His purpose was to do good. During his lifetime, he experimented\nwith many environmentally sustainable agricultural systems. The success of these initiatives helped\nshape the environmental ethos of the company. It is maintained ever since.\n\n[Learn more about our history][8]\nWestfalia Fruit strives to minimise its environmental impact\n\nWe do so by reducing waste, carbon emissions, and the use of hazardous materials while using\nresources efficiently.\n\n[Our sustainability initiatives][9]\nOur commitment to quality and sustainability is reflected in the extensive array of accreditations\nand certifications we hold.\n\nThese accreditations and certifications play a pivotal role in guaranteeing that Westfalia Fruit's\nproducts consistently surpass industry and customer expectations.\n\n[Learn more about our accreditations][10]\nGlobal presence\nWe grow our avocados across the world.\n\nYou can find Westfalia Fruit farms in major origins, including southern Africa, Chile, Colombia,\nPeru, Portugal, the USA, and India. Our global presence allows us to serve both retail and wholesale\ncustomers. Get in contact to learn what we can do for you.\n\n[Get in contact][11]\n[background illustration]\nWestfalia Fruit is a leading global avocado company.\n][12][\n][13][\n][14][\n][15]\n\nOur story\n\n[Company overview][16]\n[Sustainability][17]\n[Our history][18]\n[Community Support][19]\n[Innovation][20]\n[Accreditations][21]\n\nOur products\n\n[See all our products][22]\n[Avocados][23]\n[Fresh produce][24]\n[Processed products][25]\n\nFor growers\n\n[Everything for growers][26]\n\nNews\n\n[Our news][27]\n\nCareers\n\n[Our careers][28]\n\nContact\n\n[Contact us][29]\n[[Westfalia Fruit logo]][30]\n\u00a9 2026 Westfalia Fruit\n[Disclaimer][31]\n[Privacy policy & Terms of Use][32]\n[Modern Slavery Act][33]\n[PPN0621 CRP][34]\n[Official documents][35]\n\u00a9 2026 Westfalia Fruit\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://westfaliafruit.com/for-growers\n[3]: https://westfaliafruit.com/news\n[4]: https://westfaliafruit.com/careers\n[5]: https://westfaliafruit.com/contact-us\n[6]: https://westfaliafruit.com/innovation\n[7]: https://westfaliafruit.com/careers\n[8]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-history\n[9]: https://westfaliafruit.com/sustainability\n[10]: https://westfaliafruit.com/accreditations\n[11]: https://westfaliafruit.com/contact-us\n[12]: https://www.instagram.com/avoexperts/\n[13]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/westfalia-fruit-international-limited/\n[14]: https://www.facebook.com/WestfaliaFruit/\n[15]: https://za.pinterest.com/westfaliafruitp/\n[16]: https://westfaliafruit.com/company-overview\n[17]: https://westfaliafruit.com/sustainability\n[18]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-history\n[19]: https://westfaliafruit.com/community-support\n[20]: https://westfaliafruit.com/innovation\n[21]: https://westfaliafruit.com/accreditations\n[22]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products\n[23]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products/avocado-products\n[24]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products/fresh-fruits\n[25]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products/plant-based-products\n[26]: https://westfaliafruit.com/for-growers\n[27]: https://westfaliafruit.com/news\n[28]: https://westfaliafruit.com/careers\n[29]: https://westfaliafruit.com/contact-us\n[30]: home\n[31]: https://westfaliafruit.com/disclaimer\n[32]: https://westfaliafruit.com/privacy-policy-and-terms-of-use\n[33]: https://westfaliafruit.com/modern-slavery-act\n[34]: https://westfaliafruit.com/ppn0621-crp\n[35]: https://westfaliafruit.com/official-documents"
