11]\n* [\nNewsletter\n][112]\n* [\nRequest a briefing\n][113]\n* [\nAbout us\n][114]\n[Pricing][115]\n[Start free trial][116] [Contact sales][117] [Log in][118]\n\n# We\u2019re on a mission to bring insight to all\n\n[See job openings][119]\n\n## We innovate at warp speed. Here\u2019s a snapshot by the numbers.\n\n12M+\ncompanies tracked and compared\n70+\nfeatures and datasets released last year\n200+\nemployees making it happen\nOur mission\n\n## We\u2019re building a new frontier for predictive intelligence:\n## Generative AI, data science, and machine learning\n## working together to deliver instant insight.\n\n[market icon]\n\n#### Spot the best opportunities\n\nIdentify momentum and opportunities to accelerate your strategy and drive growth faster.\n\n[trophy icon]\n\n#### Stay ahead of competitors\n\nInform business decisions and product roadmaps to outpace peers and protect your market positions.\n\n[building icon]\n\n#### Source the right companies\n\nScale success with comprehensive company target lists backed by data and strategic rationale.\n\nLeadership Principles\n\n## We are what we repeatedly do. Our principles empower\n## employees to succeed individually and together.\n* Good judgement.\nLeaders have it.\n[scale icon]\n* Data informs.\nInsight transforms.\n[books icon]\n* Think BIG!\nStart small.\n[tree icon]\n* Go and see with\nyour own eyes.\n[eyes icon]\n* Priorities:\nChoose one.\n[priorities icon]\n* Help others.\n[help icon]\n* Live off the land.\nBe resourceful.\n[resourceful icon]\n* Insist on excellence.\n[excellence icon]\n* Danger Zones: Bureaucracy | Complexity |\nNo commitment | Leaving what\u2019s\nimportant unsaid or undone\n[danger icon]\n* Solve customer\nproblems.\n[solve icon]\n\nEmployee Perks\n\n## Smart people.\n## Exceptional perks.\n## A future driven by insight.\n\n[Employee Perks Context]\n\n### Ready to be a part of this?\n\nTake a look at our open positions\n\n[See open jobs][120]\n\n[ [CB Insights Logo] ][121]\n\n**Foll