            "url": "https://www.cbinsights.com/company/center-point-manufacturing",
            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n# Center Point Manufacturing\n\nUnclaimed\n[centerpointmfg.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][61]\n\n## About Center Point Manufacturing\n\nCenter Point Manufacturing specializes in the production of security-focused trash receptacles\ndesigned to mitigate the effects of explosive devices in public spaces. Their products are\nengineered to contain primary fragments, prevent secondary fragmentation, and reduce the impact of\nexplosions, offering a safer environment in areas susceptible to such threats. The company primarily\nserves sectors that require heightened security measures, such as transportation hubs, educational\ninstitutions, and commercial facilities. It is based in Robertsdale, Alabama.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\nRobertsdale Industrial Park 17175 John Glenn Ave\n\nRobertsdale, Alabama, 36567,\n\nUnited States\n\n251-591-0011\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n### Center Point Manufacturing Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* Where is Center Point Manufacturing's headquarters?\n\nCenter Point Manufacturing's headquarters is located at Robertsdale Industrial Park, Robertsdale.\n* Who are Center Point Manufacturing's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Center Point Manufacturing include Mission Critical Electronics and 6 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Center Point Manufacturing to Competitors\n\n[Poly Union Group Corporation Logo]\n[Poly Union Group Corporation][62]\n\nPoly Jiulian Holdings Group is a leading company in the chemical industry, primarily focused on the\nproduction and development of civil explosives and related products. It is based in Guiyang, China.\n\n[Personal Safety][63]\n\nPersonal Safety Corporation manufactures safety products for sectors such as Nursing Homes,\nHospitals, and Law Enforcement. The company provides fall management and wandering prevention\nsolutions, along with personal protection items including pepper sprays. Personal Safety\nCorporation's clientele consists of healthcare facilities, law enforcement agencies, and consumers.\nIt was founded in 1991 and is based in Hiawatha, Iowa.\n\n[Impol Group Logo]\n[Impol Group][64]\n\nImpol Group processes aluminium into semi-finished products for various industries. The company\noffers extruded, rolled, and cast aluminium products for sectors such as automotive,\npharmaceuticals, food processing, transport, electrical, renewable resources, consumer goods,\nconstruction, and aerospace. It was founded in 1825 and is based in Slovenska Bistrica, Slovenia.\n\n[Plegium Logo]\n[Plegium][65]\n\nPlegium operates within the security technology sector, providing bluetooth-enabled defense sprays\nand emergency alert systems that connect to the plegium application for location sharing and alerts.\nIts products are utilized in high-risk professions, including home health, schools, court judges,\nand property management. It was founded in 2016 and is based in Stockholm, Sweden.\n\n[Applied Research Associates Logo]\n[Applied Research Associates][66]\n\nApplied Research Associates, Inc. (ARA) is a research and engineering company that specializes in\nproviding solutions to complex problems in the physical sciences across different sectors. The\ncompany offers services including national security, infrastructure security, health solutions, and\nenergy & environmental research. ARA's products and services are aimed at government and industry\nneeds. It was founded in 1979 and is based in Albuquerque, New Mexico.\n\n[George Industries Logo]\n[George Industries][67]\n\nGeorge Industries manufactures components for the aerospace, defense, transportation, and industrial\nsectors. The company offers services including dip brazing, vacuum brazing, CNC machining, sheet\nmetal fabrication, welding, painting, and mechanical assembly. George Industries serves sectors that\nrequire engineered products and thermal management solutions. It was founded in 1954 and is based in\nEndicott, New York.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][68]\n[212 292 3148][69]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][70][[Linkedin]][71][[Facebook]][72]\n\n### [About][73]\n* [About Us][74]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][75]\n* [Contact Us][76]\n\n### [How We Help][77]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][78]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][79]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][80]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][81]\n* [Digital Transformation][82]\n\n### [What We Offer][83]\n* [Platform][84]\n* [Data][85]\n* [Research Overview][86]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][87]\n* [Pricing][88]\n\n### [Popular Research][89]\n* [AI 100][90]\n* [Fintech 100][91]\n* [Digital Health 50][92]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][93]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][94]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][95]\n* [VC Glossary][96]\n* [Company List Applications][97]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][98]\n* [Privacy Policy][99]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][100]\n* [Partnership][101]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][102].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industri