            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[Zenverge company logo]\n\n# Zenverge\n\nUnclaimed\n[zenverge.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Stage\n\nAcquired | Acquired\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$101.3M\n\n## About Zenverge\n\nZenverge is a fabless semiconductor company that delivers advanced, cost-effective solutions for\ncontent storage, playback, interoperability, mobility, and networking in digital media products. It\nis based in Santa Clara, California.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n3960 Freedom Circle Suite 100\n\nSanta Clara, California, 95054,\n\nUnited States\n\n408-350-5052\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Expert Collections containing Zenverge\n\nExpert Collections are analyst-curated lists that highlight the companies you need to know in the\nmost important technology spaces.\n\nZenverge is included in **1 Expert Collection,** including **Semiconductors, Chips, and Advanced\nElectronics**.\n\n# Semiconductors, Chips, and Advanced Electronics\n\n7,592 items\n\nCompanies in the semiconductors & HPC space, including integrated device manufacturers (IDMs),\nfabless firms, semiconductor production equipment manufacturers, electronic design automation (EDA),\nadvanced semiconductor material companies, and more\n\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Zenverge Patents\n\nZenverge has filed 31 patents.\n\n[patents chart]\nView Patents Chart\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplicati\u2502Grant\u2502Title \u2502Related Topics \u2502Sta\non Date \u2502Date \u2502 \u2502 \u2502tus\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n11/27/201\u25028/15/\u2502[Decoding for high efficiency\u2502Video codecs, Video compression, Videotelephony, \u2502Gra\n3 \u25022017 \u2502video transcoding][64] \u2502Lossy compression algorithms, IEC standards \u2502nt\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication \u250211/27/2013\nDate \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGrant Date \u25028/15/2017\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTitle \u2502[Decoding for high efficiency video transcoding][65]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRelated Topics\u2502Video codecs, Video compression, Videotelephony, Lossy compression algorithms, IEC\n\u2502standards\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStatus \u2502Grant\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Latest Zenverge News\n\n[Freescale buys Zenverge, which was backed by Norwest, DCM][66]\n\nDec 3, 2014\n\nSign Up to receive Silicon Valley Business Journal's Morning Edition and Afternoon Edition\nnewsletters and breaking news alerts. Sign Up Freescale buys Zenverge, which was backed by Norwest,\nDCM Dec 3, 2014, 9:12am PST Updated: Dec 3, 2014, 9:23am PST Send this to a friend Email address of\nfriend (insert comma between multiple addresses): Your email address: Email | Twitter | Google+\nFreescale Semiconductor has acquired Zenverge, a fabless semiconductor company that had raised\nnearly $100 million from investors including Norwest Venture Partners and DCM Ventures. No financial\nterms were disclosed in the acquisition of Santa Clara-based Zenverge, which was founded in 2005 by\nCEO Amir Mobini and Chief Technology Officer Tony Masterson . The company's technology can convert a\nsingle media stream into multiple streams, all formatted and optimized for various\nInternet-connected devices or platforms. Geoff Lees , senior vice president and general manager for\nAustin-Texas-based Freescale's microcontroller product group, said the transaction will enhance his\ncompany's content processing, storage and interoperability capabilities for a range of video\nInternet of Things applications and markets. \"Zenverge is a recognized leader in the secure\noptimization, unification, storage and distribution of rich digital content,\" he said in a press\nrelease. \"The company's highly advanced technologies present growth opportunities for Freescale in\nnew markets, while providing compelling and highly differentiated functionality for future\ngenerations of many popular Freescale product portfolios. \" Key members of Zenverge have joined\nFreescale (NYSE: FSL), the companies said without specifying which ones. In addition to Norwest and\nDCM, which invested in all of Zenverge's funding rounds, other backers included Motorola Solutions\nVenture Capital, Verizon Ventures, Woodside Fund and Battery Ventures. Freescale was spun out of\nMotorola Inc. in 2006. Norwest's Bob Abbott and DCM's Carl Amdahl were on the board of Zenprise.\nPage 1\n\nDec 2, 2014\n[Freescale Acquires Zenverge and Its Market-Leading Transcoding Technology][67]\nDec 2, 2014\n[Freescale Acquires Zenverge for Video Internet of Things][68]\nDec 2, 2014\n[Freescale Acquires Zenverge and Its Market-Leading Transcoding Technology][69]\nDec 10, 2013\n[Zenverge Closes $11M Round][70]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Zenverge Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* Where is Zenverge's headquarters?\n\nZenverge's headquarters is located at 3960 Freedom Circle, Santa Clara.\n* What is Zenverge's latest funding round?\n\nZenverge's latest funding round is Acquired.\n* How much did Zenverge raise?\n\nZenverge raised a total of $101.3M.\n* Who are the investors of Zenverge?\n\nInvestors of Zenverge include Freescale, Norwest Venture Partners, DCM Ventures, Verizon Ventures,\nBattery Ventures and 7 more.\n* Who are Zenverge's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Zenverge include Wilocity and 1 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Zenverge to Competitors\n\n[Wilocity][71]\n\nWilocity develops 60 GHz multi-gigabit wireless chipsets. It provides greater wireless performance\nin short-range wireless networking, docking, point-to-point outdoor links, and more. The company was\nfounded in 2007 and is based in Caesarea, Israel. In July 2014, Wilocity was acquired by Qualcomm.\n\n[SuVolta][72]\n\nSuVolta provides low-power technology for semiconductor designers. It develops complementary\nmetal-oxide semiconductor (CMOS)-based transistors and enables circuit technologies. It was founded\nin 2006 and is based in Los Gatos, California.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][73]\n[212 292 3148][74]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][75][[Linkedin]][76][[Facebook]][77]\n\n### [About][78]\n* [About Us][79]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][80]\n* [Contact Us][81]\n\n### [How We Help][82]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][83]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][84]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][85]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][86]\n* [Digital Transformation][87]\n\n### [What We Offer][88]\n* [Platform][89]\n* [Data][90]\n* [Research Overview][91]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][92]\n* [Pricing][93]\n\n### [Popular Research][94]\n* [AI 100][95]\n* [Fintech 100][96]\n* [Digital Health 50][97]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][98]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][99]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][100]\n* [VC Glossary][101]\n* [Company List Applications][102]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][103]\n* [Privacy Policy][104]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][105]\n* [Partnership][106]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][107].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[28]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-search-engine/\n[29]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/market-analytics-and-visualizations/\n[30]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/team-management-and-collaboration/\n[31]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[32]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/data/\n[33]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/research/\n[34]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/personal-briefing/\n[35]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/instant-insights/\n[36]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/public-company-data/\n[37]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/buyer-interviews\n[38]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors//\n[39]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/api/\n[40]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrat"
