            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[3VR company logo]\n\n# 3VR\n\nUnclaimed\n[3vr.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n2002\n\n## Stage\n\nAcquired | Acquired\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$73.45M\n\n## About 3VR\n\n3VR operates as a video intelligence company. It enables organizations to search, mine, and leverage\nvideo to bolster security, identify and mitigate fraud, and better serve customers. It offers\nVisionPoint, video management software (VMS), network video recorders, and video analytics to enable\nvideo surveillance systems to reach their full potential and deliver a measurable, sustainable\nreturn on investment. It was formerly known as 3VR Security. The company was founded in 2002 and is\nbased in San Francisco, California. On 14-Feb-2018, it was acquired by Identiv.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n475 Brannan Street Suite 430\n\nSan Francisco, California, 94107,\n\nUnited States\n\n415-495-5790\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## 3VR Patents\n\n3VR has filed 18 patents.\n\n[patents chart]\nView Patents Chart\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplicatio\u2502Grant \u2502Title \u2502Related Topics \u2502Sta\nn Date \u2502Date \u2502 \u2502 \u2502tus\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u