            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n# Accelerated Pictures\n\nUnclaimed\n[acceleratedpictures.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Stage\n\nIncubator/Accelerator | Alive\n\n## About Accelerated Pictures\n\nAccelerated Pictures is a company that provides tools for storytellers in the filmmaking industry.\nTheir main product, Filmmaker Live, is a visual planning tool intended for collaboration among\ncreative, business, and production teams. The company serves the creative and production sectors of\nthe film industry. It is based in Salt Lake City, Utah.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n770 Komas Drive\n\nSalt Lake City, Utah, 84108,\n\nUnited States\n\n801-588-1000\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Accelerated Pictures Patents\n\nAccelerated Pictures has filed 1 patent.\n\n[patents chart]\nView Patents Chart\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplicatio\u2502Grant \u2502Title \u2502Related Topics \u2502Sta\nn Date \u2502Date \u2502 \u2502 \u2502tus\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n7/27/2007 \u25022/1/20\u2502[Camera \u2502Computing input devices, Electronic circuits, Pointing devices, \u2502Gra\n\u250211 \u2502control][64\u2502Video game controllers, Electronic amplifiers \u2502nt\n\u2502 \u2502] \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication \u25027/27/2007\nDate \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGrant Date \u25022/1/2011\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTitle \u2502[Camera control][65]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRelated \u2502Computing input devices, Electronic circuits, Pointing devices, Video game controllers,\nTopics \u2502Electronic amplifiers\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStatus \u2502Grant\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Accelerated Pictures Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* Where is Accelerated Pictures's headquarters?\n\nAccelerated Pictures's headquarters is located at 770 Komas Drive, Salt Lake City.\n* What is Accelerated Pictures's latest funding round?\n\nAccelerated Pictures's latest funding round is Incubator/Accelerator.\n* Who are the investors of Accelerated Pictures?\n\nInvestors of Accelerated Pictures include Microsoft ScaleUp.\n* Who are Accelerated Pictures's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Accelerated Pictures include RivetAI and 8 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Accelerated Pictures to Competitors\n\n[Lockit Network][66]\n\nLockit Network provides digital workflow solutions for the film production industry. The company has\na script supervising app that assists Script Supervisors with data entry and report generation, and\noffers services that prepare captured metadata for editing tools in the post-production process.\nLockit Network serves the film production sector. It was founded in 2009 and is based in M\u00fcnchen,\nGermany.\n\n[ScriptHop][67]\n\nScriptHop provides a platform for script endorsements from industry professionals, which may help in\nincreasing the visibility of screenplays to studios and production companies. ScriptHop serves the\nscreenwriting and film production sectors. It was founded in 2014 and is based in Portland, Oregon.\n\n[Scriptation Logo]\n[Scriptation][68]\n\nScriptation is a company that develops solutions for the film and television production industry.\nThe company offers tools for annotating, breaking down, and managing scripts digitally, aimed at\nenhancing workflow and collaboration for cast and crew. Scriptation serves the film, television, and\nvideo production sectors with its software. It is based in Malibu, California.\n\n[RivetAI][69]\n\nRivetAI provides tools for pre-production processes in the film industry through AI-powered\ntechnology. The company offers a platform that assists with script breakdowns, budgeting, and\nscheduling, with the goal of improving workflow for filmmakers. RivetAI's services are focused on\nthe film production sector, offering tools that support project planning. It was founded in 2018 and\nis based in Culver City, California.\n\n[Drylab][70]\n\nDrylab offers a dailies distribution platform in the film and television (TV) production industry.\nIt offers applications designed to simplify the production process by enabling professionals to work\nremotely and stay connected, including features for viewing, metadata handling, and collaboration.\nIt primarily serves the film and TV production sectors with its digital workflow solutions. It was\nformerly known as Drylab A/S. It was founded in 2014 and s based in London, United Kingdom.\n\n[Dramatify Logo]\n[Dramatify][71]\n\nDramatify provides cloud-based production management solutions for the film, television, and video\nproduction industries. The company offers a platform for budgeting, scheduling, and collaboration\nfor production teams. Dramatify serves sectors within the entertainment industry, including drama,\nsports, non-fiction, and children's programming. It was founded in 2014 and is based in Stockholm,\nSweden.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][72]\n[212 292 3148][73]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][74][[Linkedin]][75][[Facebook]][76]\n\n### [About][77]\n* [About Us][78]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][79]\n* [Contact Us][80]\n\n### [How We Help][81]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][82]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][83]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][84]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][85]\n* [Digital Transformation][86]\n\n### [What We Offer][87]\n* [Platform][88]\n* [Data][89]\n* [Research Overview][90]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][91]\n* [Pricing][92]\n\n### [Popular Research][93]\n* [AI 100][94]\n* [Fintech 100][95]\n* [Digital Health 50][96]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][97]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][98]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][99]\n* [VC Glossary][100]\n* [Company List Applications][101]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][102]\n* [Privacy Policy][103]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][104]\n* [Partnership][105]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][106].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[28]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-search-engine/\n[29]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/market-analytics-and-visualizations/\n[30]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/team-management-and-collaboration/\n[31]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[32]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/data/\n[33]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/research/\n[34]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/personal-briefing/\n[35]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/instant-insights/\n[36]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/public-company-data/\n[37]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/buyer-interviews\n[38]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors//\n[39]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/api/\n[40]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/\n[41]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/chrome-and-edge-extension/\n[42]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/salesforce-integration/\n[43]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/affinity-integration/\n[44]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/microsoft-excel/\n[45]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/google-sheets/\n[46]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/microsoft-teams/\n[47]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/slack/\n[48]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/google-slides/\n[49]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/app-partners/\n[50]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/chrome-and-edge-extension/\n[51]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/pricing/\n[52]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/\n[53]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/business-development/\n[54]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/engineering/\n[55]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/operations/\n[56]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/produ"
