            "url": "https://www.cbinsights.com/company/apisphere",
            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[Apisphere company logo]\n\n# Apisphere\n\nUnclaimed\n[apisphere.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n2006\n\n## Stage\n\nSeries B | Alive\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$4.6M\n\n## About Apisphere\n\nApisphere provides location-awareness services for mobile business applications and devices. The\ncompany's products enable organizations to mobilize business processes with location-aware on-demand\ncapabilities. It allows organizations to mobilize from field service applications, mobile\ninspection, and proximity-based advertising. It was founded in 2006 and is based in Berkeley,\nCalifornia.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n2107 Dwight Way Suite 2100\n\nBerkeley, California, 94704,\n\nUnited States\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n### Apisphere Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was Apisphere founded?\n\nApisphere was founded in 2006.\n* Where is Apisphere's headquarters?\n\nApisphere's headquarters is located at 2107 Dwight Way, Berkeley.\n* What is Apisphere's latest funding round?\n\nApisphere's latest funding round is Series B.\n* How much did Apisphere raise?\n\nApisphere raised a total of $4.6M.\n* Who are Apisphere's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Apisphere include Sodtrack and 4 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Apisphere to Competitors\n\n[Tamr Logo]\n[Tamr][64]\n\nTamr is a company focused on AI-native Master Data Management (MDM) solutions within the data\nmanagement and analytics industry. The company provides services that allow the establishment and\nupkeep of master data, often referred to as golden records, to assist in decision-making. Tamr's\nsolutions aim to address data quality, governance, and accessibility across various sectors,\nincluding healthcare, B2B and B2C businesses, and supplier management. Tamr was formerly known as\nDataTamer. It was founded in 2013 and is based in Cambridge, Massachusetts.\n\n[DQPro][65]\n\nDQPro provides data monitoring solutions for the specialty insurance sector. The company offers\nservices that assist insurance firms in detecting and managing data issues to address costs,\ninefficiencies, and compliance risks. DQPro's products support the underwriting process by ensuring\ncompliance with market controls. It was founded in 2016 and is based in London, United Kingdom.\n\n[The Gartrell Group Logo]\n[The Gartrell Group][66]\n\nThe Gartrell Group is a geospatial consulting firm focused on location intelligence and GIS\nstrategy. The company provides services including geospatial strategies, application development,\nand managed cloud services for GIS platforms. The Gartrell Group serves sectors that require\nlocation-based decision-making and geo-integration. It is based in Portland, Oregon.\n\n[Innovative Routines International (IRI)][67]\n\nInnovative Routines International (IRI) provides data manipulation and data masking solutions for\ndifferent sectors. The company offers tools for data integration, transformation, migration, and\ngovernance, aimed at supporting ETL processes and ensuring data privacy and compliance. IRI's\nproducts serve various industries, focusing on managing and protecting sensitive data. It is based\nin Melbourne, Florida.\n\n[Mily Technologies][68]\n\nMily Technologies is a company focused on delivery analytics within the logistics sector. It offers\na platform that collects and processes delivery data, providing insights and visualizations to\nimprove last-mile delivery performance. The company primarily serves the logistics and ecommerce\nindustries, enhancing the efficiency of delivery companies. It was founded in 2021 and is based in\nMunich, Germany.\n\n[Developmate][69]\n\nDevelopmate is a company that focuses on data aggregation and analytics in the real estate\ndevelopment process. The company provides tools that aggregate real estate development data and\noffer analytics, visualizations, and reports to assist development and investment professionals with\ncapital allocation. These services serve the real estate development and investment sectors. It was\nfounded in 2022 and is based in San Antonio, Texas.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][70]\n[212 292 3148][71]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][72][[Linkedin]][73][[Facebook]][74]\n\n### [About][75]\n* [About Us][76]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][77]\n* [Contact Us][78]\n\n### [How We Help][79]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][80]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][81]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][82]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][83]\n* [Digital Transformation][84]\n\n### [What We Offer][85]\n* [Platform][86]\n* [Data][87]\n* [Research Overview][88]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][89]\n* [Pricing][90]\n\n### [Popular Research][91]\n* [AI 100][92]\n* [Fintech 100][93]\n* [Digital Health 50][94]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][95]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][96]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][97]\n* [VC Glossary][98]\n* [Company List Applications][99]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][100]\n* [Privacy Policy][101]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][102]\n* [Partnership][103]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][104].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corpo