            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[MyYearbook company logo]\n\n# MyYearbook\n\nUnclaimed\n[myyearbook.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n2005\n\n## Stage\n\nAcquired | Acquired\n\n## Total Raised\n\n$17.1M\n\n## Valuation\n\n$0000 View\n\n## About MyYearbook\n\nMyYearbook is a social networking platform primarily for teens. It is similar to other social\nnetworking sites but has generally been less polished according to observers than prominent social\nnetwork sites. It was founded in 2005 and is based in New Hope, Pennsylvania. In July 2011,\nMyYearbook was acquired by The Meet Group.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n280 Union Square Drive\n\nNew Hope, Pennsylvania, 18938,\n\nUnited States\n\n215-862-1162\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Latest MyYearbook News\n\n[\u6295\u8cc7\u4eba\u5fc5\u770b\uff01\u5144\u59b915\u6b72\u6253\u9020\u5104\u7d1a\u793e\u4ea4\u5e73\u53f0 MyYearbook\u6848\u4f8b\u6559\u4f60\u5982\u4f55\u8a55\u4f30\u5e02\u5834\u672a\u4f86\u6f5b\u529b][64]\n\nAug 6, 2025\n\n\u79d1\u6280 \u200c\u5728\u5275\u696d\u6295\u8cc7\u7684\u5ee3\u95ca\u5929\u5730\u88e1\uff0c\u6210\u529f\u7684\u6545\u4e8b\u5b9b\u5982\u7480\u74a8\u661f\u8fb0\uff0c\u800c 15 \u6b72\u7684 Catherine Cook \u8207\u54e5\u54e5 David Cook\n\u5171\u540c\u5275\u5efa MyYearbook\n\u7684\u7d93\u6b77\uff0c\u7121\u7591\u662f\u5176\u4e2d\u4e00\u9846\u8000\u773c\u4e14\u6975\u5177\u50b3\u5947\u8272\u5f69\u7684\u661f\u3002\u9019\u500b\u539f\u672c\u53ea\u662f\u6578\u4f4d\u5e74\u9451\u7684\u5c0f\u5275\u610f\uff0c\u6700\u5f8c\u6416\u8eab\u4e00\u8b8a\u6210\u70ba\u5750\u64c1\u6578\u767e\n\u842c\u7528\u6236\u3001\u4ee5 1 \u5104\u7f8e\u5143\u9ad8\u50f9\u88ab\u6536\u8cfc\u7684\u793e\u4ea4\u7db2\u7d61\uff0c\u70ba\u5275\u696d\u8005\u5e36\u4f86\u8a31\u591a\u5bf6\u8cb4\u7d93\u9a57\u8207\u6df1\u523b\u555f\u793a\u3002\n\u6295\u8cc7\u4eba\u5fc5\u770b\uff01\u5144\u59b915\u6b72\u5275\u696d\u6253\u9020\u5104\u7d1a\u793e\u4ea4\u5e73\u53f0 MyYearbook\u6848\u4f8b\u6559\u4f60\u5982\u4f55\u8a55\u4f30\u5e02\u5834\u672a\u4f86\u6f5b\u529b\uff08\u5716\uff1aShutterstock\uff09\nMyYearbook \u7684\u8a95\u751f\uff0c\u6e90\u81ea\u65bc\u4e00\u500b\u6975\u70ba\u5177\u9ad4\u4e14\u666e\u904d\u7684\u75db\u9ede\u30022005 \u5e74\uff0c15 \u6b72\u7684 Catherine \u548c 16 \u6b72\u7684\u54e5\u54e5 David\n\u8f49\u5b78\u5f8c\uff0c\u5728\u65b0\u74b0\u5883\u88e1\u82e6\u65bc\u96e3\u4ee5\u7d50\u8b58\u670b\u53cb\u3002\u4ed6\u5011\u5f9e\u5c0b\u627e\u7562\u696d\u7d00\u5ff5\u518a\u4f86\u8a8d\u8b58\u540c\u5b78\u9019\u4e00\u884c\u70ba\u4e2d\uff0c\u654f\u92b3\u5730\u6355\u6349\u5230\u4eba\u5011\u5728\u7db2\u8def\n\u4e0a\u5206\u4eab\u500b\u4eba\u8cc7\u8a0a\u7684\u9700\u6c42\u3002\n\u200c\u5c08\u5bb6\u8a8d\u70ba\uff0c\u5c0d\u5275\u696d\u6295\u8cc7\u4eba\u800c\u8a00\uff0c\u6df1\u5165\u6316\u6398\u7528\u6236\u7684\u75db\u9ede\u548c\u6f5b\u5728\u9700\u6c42\uff0c\u662f\u5c0b\u8993\u512a\u8cea\u5275\u696d\u8a08\u756b\u7684\u6838\u5fc3\u6240\u5728\uff0c\u50cf\u662f\u5916\u9001\u5e73\u53f0\n\u89e3\u6c7a\u4eba\u5011\u4fbf\u6377\u7528\u9910\u9700\u6c42\u3001\u5171\u4eab\u55ae\u8eca\u89e3\u6c7a\u57ce\u5e02\u77ed\u7a0b\u51fa\u884c\u300c\u6700\u5f8c\u4e00\u516c\u91cc\u300d\u554f\u984c\uff0c\u90fd\u662f\u7cbe\u6e96\u638c\u63e1\u5e02\u5834\u9700\u6c42\u7684\u5178\u7bc4\u3002\n\u5728\u5546\u696d\u6a21\u5f0f\u65b9\u9762\uff0cMyYearbook\n\u5f9e\u6700\u521d\u7684\u6578\u4f4d\u5e74\u9451\u61c9\u7528\u9010\u6b65\u6f14\u8b8a\u70ba\u793e\u4ea4\u7db2\u8def\u3002\u5b83\u900f\u904e\u4e0d\u65b7\u589e\u52a0\u904a\u6232\u4e0b\u8f09\u3001\u5f71\u7247\u4e0a\u50b3\u3001\u9752\u5c11\u5e74\u71b1\u9580\u8a71\u984c\u7dda\u4e0a\u8abf\u67e5\u7b49\u529f\n\u80fd\uff0c\u5438\u5f15\u4e86\u5927\u91cf\u5e74\u8f15\u7528\u6236\u3002MyYearbook \u5f8c\u4f86\u66f4\u540d\u70ba MeetMe\u3002\n\u5f9e\u7d93\u6fdf\u5b78\u7406\u8ad6\u4e2d\u7684\u898f\u6a21\u7d93\u6fdf\u548c\u7bc4\u570d\u7d93\u6fdf\u89d2\u5ea6\u4f86\u770b\uff0cMyYearbook\n\u5438\u5f15\u773e\u591a\u7528\u6236\u5be6\u73fe\u4e86\u898f\u6a21\u7d93\u6fdf\uff0c\u62d3\u5c55\u696d\u52d9\u7bc4\u570d\u9054\u6210\u4e86\u7bc4\u570d\u7d93\u6fdf\uff0c\u5ee3\u544a\u5e74\u6536\u5165\u9ad8\u9054 1000\n\u842c\u7f8e\u5143\uff0c\u5145\u5206\u986f\u793a\u7576\u7528\u6236\u898f\u6a21\u9054\u5230\u4e00\u5b9a\u91cf\u7d1a\u5f8c\uff0c\u5546\u696d\u6a21\u5f0f\u7684\u591a\u5143\u5316\u80fd\u5e36\u4f86\u986f\u8457\u7684\u7d93\u6fdf\u6548\u76ca\uff0c\u4e5f\u70ba\u6295\u8cc7\u4eba\u5e36\u4f86\u8c50\u539a\u56de\n\u5831\u3002 \u6b64\u5916\uff0c\u5718\u968a\u7d44\u5efa\u548c\u8cc7\u6e90\u6574\u5408\u5c0d MyYearbook \u7684\u6210\u529f\u540c\u6a23\u529f\u4e0d\u53ef\u6c92\u3002\u51f1\u745f\u7433\u5f97\u5230\u5927\u54e5 Geoff \u7684\u652f\u6301\u81f3\u95dc\u91cd\u8981\u3002\nGeoff \u4e0d\u50c5\u6ce8\u5165 25\n\u842c\u7f8e\u5143\u555f\u52d5\u8cc7\u91d1\uff0c\u9019\u7b46\u9322\u662f\u4ed6\u65e9\u5e74\u5275\u8fa6\u7db2\u7ad9\u8cfa\u53d6\u7684\u300c\u7b2c\u4e00\u6876\u91d1\u300d\uff0c\u9084\u6191\u85c9\u81ea\u8eab\u7d93\u9a57\uff0c\u5e6b\u52a9\u8058\u8acb\u7de8\u7a0b\u5718\u968a\uff0c\u6307\u5c0e\u8207\u98a8\n\u96aa\u6295\u8cc7\u5bb6\u8ac7\u5224\u4ee5\u53ca\u79df\u7528\u7db2\u7d61\u670d\u52d9\u5668\u7b49\u3002\u9019\u51f8\u986f\u4e86\u5275\u696d\u5718\u968a\u4e2d\u591a\u5143\u5316\u6280\u80fd\u548c\u8cc7\u6e90\u6574\u5408\u7684\u91cd\u8981\u6027\u3002\n\u512a\u79c0\u7684\u5275\u696d\u5718\u968a\uff0c\u4e0d\u50c5\u8981\u6709\u5275\u65b0\u60f3\u6cd5\uff0c\u9084\u5fc5\u9808\u5177\u5099\u6280\u8853\u3001\u8cc7\u91d1\u3001\u71df\u904b\u7b49\u591a\u9762\u5411\u80fd\u529b\u3002\u6295\u8cc7\u4eba\u5728\u8a55\u4f30\u5c08\u6848\u6642\uff0c\u5718\u968a\u7684\n\u7d9c\u5408\u7d20\u8cea\u548c\u8cc7\u6e90\u6574\u5408\u80fd\u529b\u662f\u91cd\u8981\u7684\u8003\u91cf\u3002 MyYearbook \u4ee5 1\n\u5104\u7f8e\u5143\u88ab\u6536\u8cfc\uff0c\u9019\u8d77\u4e8b\u4ef6\u70ba\u5275\u696d\u6295\u8cc7\u8005\u5e36\u4f86\u66f4\u70ba\u6df1\u9060\u7684\u555f\u793a\u3002\u5275\u696d\u8005\u8981\u660e\u78ba\u4f01\u696d\u7b56\u7565\u65b9\u5411\uff0c\u601d\u8003\u662f\u9577\u671f\u7368\u7acb\u767c\u5c55\u6253\n\u9020\u7522\u696d\u5de8\u982d\uff0c\u9084\u662f\u5728\u9069\u7576\u6642\u6a5f\u9078\u64c7\u88ab\u6536\u8cfc\u5be6\u73fe\u50f9\u503c\u6700\u5927\u5316\u3002\u6295\u8cc7\u4eba\u5247\u8981\u7cbe\u6e96\u5224\u65b7\u4f01\u696d\u50f9\u503c\u548c\u767c\u5c55\u6f5b\u529b\uff0c\u4e0d\u50c5\u95dc\u6ce8\u77ed\n\u671f\u7372\u5229\uff0c\u66f4\u8981\u8457\u773c\u65bc\u9577\u671f\u767c\u5c55\u524d\u666f\u3001\u5e02\u5834\u4f54\u6709\u7387\u3001\u7528\u6236\u9ecf\u6027\u7b49\u56e0\u7d20\uff0c\u904b\u7528\u91d1\u878d\u4f30\u503c\u6a21\u578b\u5408\u7406\u4f30\u503c\uff0c\u907f\u514d\u6295\u8cc7\u5931\u8aa4\u3002\nCatherine\n\u8ddf\u54e5\u54e5\u5011\u7684\u5275\u696d\u6b77\u7a0b\u986f\u793a\uff0c\u53ea\u8981\u5584\u65bc\u767c\u73fe\u3001\u52c7\u65bc\u5275\u65b0\u3001\u5408\u7406\u898f\u5283\uff0c\u5c0f\u5275\u610f\u4e5f\u80fd\u64ac\u52d5\u5927\u5e02\u5834\uff0c\u5275\u9020\u9a5a\u4eba\u5546\u696d\u5947\u8e5f\u3002\u5728\n\u8b8a\u5e7b\u83ab\u6e2c\u7684\u5546\u696d\u4e16\u754c\u4e2d\uff0c\u4fdd\u6301\u654f\u92b3\u6d1e\u5bdf\u529b\u548c\u7406\u6027\u5206\u6790\u80fd\u529b\uff0c\u662f\u5275\u696d\u6295\u8cc7\u8005\u8d70\u5411\u6210\u529f\u7684\u95dc\u9375\u3002\n\nOct 19, 2022\n[How Innovation Really Works Based on Lessons From Nature][65]\nFeb 1, 2020\n[8 famous companies that were started by teenagers][66]\nOct 14, 2019\n[7 famous companies that were started by teenagers][67]\nOct 14, 2019\n[7 famous companies that were started by teenagers][68]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### MyYearbook Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was MyYearbook founded?\n\nMyYearbook was founded in 2005.\n* Where is MyYearbook's headquarters?\n\nMyYearbook's headquarters is located at 280 Union Square Drive, New Hope.\n* What is MyYearbook's latest funding round?\n\nMyYearbook's latest funding round is Acquired.\n* How much did MyYearbook raise?\n\nMyYearbook raised a total of $17.1M.\n* Who are the investors of MyYearbook?\n\nInvestors of MyYearbook include The Meet Group, U.S. Venture Partners, First Round Capital and\nNorwest Venture Partners.\n* Who are MyYearbook's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of MyYearbook include X and 6 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare MyYearbook to Competitors\n\n[StoryJumper Logo]\n[StoryJumper][69]\n\nStoryJumper is an educational technology company that provides a platform for creating and\npublishing children's storybooks. The company includes tools for writing, illustrating, and\nnarrating stories. StoryJumper serves the education sector, including students, teachers, and\nparents who create and publish storybooks. It is based in Palo Alto, California.\n\n[Recruit Logo]\n[Recruit][70]\n\nRecruit specializes in staffing and recruitment within the human resources industry. The company\nprovides services such as job listing platforms, candidate search databases, and employment\ninformation. Recruit caters to sectors including corporate services, new businesses, and research\nand development (R&D). It was founded in 2012 and is based in Tokyo, Japan.\n\n[Snapigram][71]\n\nSnapigram is a social network where Influencers and businesses can post photos and short videos. The\ncompany is based in England, United Kingdom.\n\n[Mastodon Logo]\n[Mastodon][72]\n\nMastodon operates as a decentralized social networking platform. It allows users to engage in\nmicroblogging and share various content such as text, links, pictures, and videos across a federated\nnetwork of independently managed servers. The platform offers features like chronological feeds,\ncustom emojis, and tools for creative expression. It was founded in 2016 and is based in Dulmen,\nGermany.\n\n[WeChat Logo]\n[WeChat][73]\n\nWeChat is a mobile messaging and calling application that operates in the technology sector. The app\nallows users to send messages, make voice and video calls, share photos, and engage in group chats.\nWeChat integrates digital payment services through WeChat Pay and Weixin Pay. It is based in United\nStates.\n\n[Telegram Logo]\n[Telegram][74]\n\nTelegram operates a cloud-based mobile and desktop messaging application. It offers features such as\nencrypted communication, self-destructing messages, and synchronization across multiple devices. It\nsupports large chat groups and allows for various media sizes in chats. It was founded in 2013 and\nis based in Dubai, United Arab Emirates.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][75]\n[212 292 3148][76]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][77][[Linkedin]][78][[Facebook]][79]\n\n### [About][80]\n* [About Us][81]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][82]\n* [Contact Us][83]\n\n### [How We Help][84]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][85]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][86]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][87]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][88]\n* [Digital Transformation][89]\n\n### [What We Offer][90]\n* [Platform][91]\n* [Data][92]\n* [Research Overview][93]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][94]\n* [Pricing][95]\n\n### [Popular Research][96]\n* [AI 100][97]\n* [Fintech 100][98]\n* [Digital Health 50][99]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][100]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][101]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][102]\n* [VC Glossary][103]\n* [Company List Applications][104]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][105]\n* [Privacy Policy][106]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][107]\n* [Partnership][108]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][109].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[28]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-search-engine/\n[29]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/market-analytics-and-visualizations/\n[30]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/team-management-and-collaboration/\n[31]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[32]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/data/\n[33]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/research/\n[34]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/personal-briefing/\n[35]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/instant-insights/\n[36]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/public-company-data/\n[37]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/buyer-interviews\n[38]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors//\n[39]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/api/\n[40]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/\n[41]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/chrome-and-edge-extension/\n[42]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/salesforce-integration/\n[43]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/affinity-integration/\n[44]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/microsoft-excel/\n[45]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/google-sheets/\n[46]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/microsoft-teams/\n[47]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/slack/\n[48]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/google-slides/\n[49]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/app-partners/\n[50]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/chrome-and-edge-extension/\n[51]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/pricing/\n[52]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/\n[53]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/business-development/\n[54]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/engineering/\n[55]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/operations/\n[56]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/product/\n[57]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/#work-with-us\n[58]: https://www.cbinsights.com/about/#work-with-us\n[59]: https://myyearbook.com\n[60]: /company/myyearbook/\n[61]: /company/myyearbook/financi"
