tion/\n[43]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/affinity-integration/\n[44]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/microsoft-excel/\n[45]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/google-sheets/\n[46]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/microsoft-teams/\n[47]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/slack/\n[48]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-"
