            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n# Telehealth Broadband\n\nUnclaimed\n[atsecurity.net][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][62]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n1999\n\n## Stage\n\nOther Investors | Acquired\n\n## About Telehealth Broadband\n\nTelehealth Broadband was formed to provide the health care industry with a service infrastructure\nfor delivering care to the 125 million Americans with chronic diseases and post-surgical patients.\nThe Healthium service aims to reduce cost of care and improve health outcomes by delivering\ninteractive health services directly to patient's television sets in their homes.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n600 Congress Avenue\n\nAustin, Texas, 78701,\n\nUnited States\n\n512-391-4444\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Expert Collections containing Telehealth Broadband\n\nExpert Collections are analyst-curated lists that highlight the companies you need to know in the\nmost important technology spaces.\n\nTelehealth Broadband is included in **1 Expert Collection,** including **Telehealth**.\n\n# Telehealth\n\n3,186 items\n\nCompanies developing, offering, or using electronic and telecommunication technologies to facilitate\nthe delivery of health & wellness services from a distance. *Columns updated as regularly as\npossible; priority given to companies with the most and/or most recent funding.\n\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Telehealth Broadband Patents\n\nTelehealth Broadband has filed 1 patent.\n\n[patents chart]\nView Patents Chart\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplic\u2502Gran\u2502Title \u2502Related Topics \u2502Sta\nation \u2502t \u2502 \u2502 \u2502tus\nDate \u2502Date\u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n8/29/2\u250211/1\u2502[Method for conducting a home health session \u2502Telehealth, Telemedicine, Health \u2502Gra\n002 \u25026/20\u2502using an integrated television-based broadband\u2502informatics, Videotelephony, \u2502nt\n\u250210 \u2502home health system][63] \u2502Telecommunication services \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication \u25028/29/2002\nDate \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGrant Date \u250211/16/2010\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTitle \u2502[Method for conducting a home health session using an integrated television-based\n\u2502broadband home health system][64]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRelated \u2502Telehealth, Telemedicine, Health informatics, Videotelephony, Telecommunication\nTopics \u2502services\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStatus \u2502Grant\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Telehealth Broadband Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was Telehealth Broadband founded?\n\nTelehealth Broadband was founded in 1999.\n* Where is Telehealth Broadband's headquarters?\n\nTelehealth Broadband's headquarters is located at 600 Congress Avenue, Austin.\n* What is Telehealth Broadband's latest funding round?\n\nTelehealth Broadband's latest funding round is Other Investors.\n* Who are the investors of Telehealth Broadband?\n\nInvestors of Telehealth Broadband include Adelphia Communications.\n* Who are Telehealth Broadband's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Telehealth Broadband include Amwell, ArKridge HomeCare, Critical Signal\nTechnologies, Healthcare At Home, GlobalCare and 7 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Telehealth Broadband to Competitors\n\n[Healthcare At Home Logo]\n[Healthcare At Home][65]\n\nHealthcare At Home, also known as Sciensus, provides integrated commercial services within the life\nsciences sector. The company focuses on patient access to medicines, product launches, and\ncommercialisation through services including supply chain management, digital solutions, and market\naccess support. Sciensus serves the healthcare and biopharmaceutical industries, offering services\nsuch as clinical homecare, real-world data collection, and regulatory approval consulting. It is\nbased in Staffordshire, England.\n\n[AssistGuide Information Services Network Logo]\n[AssistGuide Information Services Network][66]\n\nAssistGuide Information Services Network focuses on providing information resources for eldercare,\nlong term care, and caregiving within the healthcare sector. The company includes caregiving topics,\nchecklists, and connections to facilities and services for caregivers and their loved ones. AGIS\nprimarily serves the eldercare and caregiving community by providing information to navigate the\nchallenges of aging. It was founded in 1998 and is based in San Ramon, California.\n\n[Heritage Health Systems Logo]\n[Heritage Health Systems][67]\n\nHeritage Health Systems operates as a Medicare-managed care and medical management organization. The\ncompany focuses on claims adjudication, eligibility and enrollment, credentialing, provider\nservices, member services, and medical management. Heritage Health Systems primarily serves the\nMedicare Advantage market. It was founded in 1995 and is based in Houston, Texas.\n\n[Leaning Tree Home Care Agency][68]\n\nLeaning Tree aims to offer skilled and personal care services designed to help patients regain\noptimum functioning in the comfort of their homes.\n\n[Signature In-Home Care Logo]\n[Signature In-Home Care][69]\n\nSignature In-Home Care provides in-home care services for seniors within the senior care industry.\nThe company offers caregiving plans and adheres to ethical decision-making principles. They assist\nseniors who need help in their daily lives. It is based in Oxford, Alabama.\n\n[Paradigm Holdings][70]\n\nParadigm Holdings provides cybersecurity and enterprise IT solutions to clients in federal civilian\nagencies, the Department of Defense, and the Intelligence Community. In July 2011, Paradigm Holdings\nwas acquired by CACI International. The valuation of Paradigm Holdings was undisclosed. Other terms\nof the deal were not released.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][71]\n[212 292 3148][72]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][73][[Linkedin]][74][[Facebook]][75]\n\n### [About][76]\n* [About Us][77]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][78]\n* [Contact Us][79]\n\n### [How We Help][80]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][81]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][82]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][83]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][84]\n* [Digital Transformation][85]\n\n### [What We Offer][86]\n* [Platform][87]\n* [Data][88]\n* [Research Overview][89]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][90]\n* [Pricing][91]\n\n### [Popular Research][92]\n* [AI 100][93]\n* [Fintech 100][94]\n* [Digital Health 50][95]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][96]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][97]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][98]\n* [VC Glossary][99]\n* [Company List Applications][100]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][101]\n* [Privacy Policy][102]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][103]\n* [Partnership][104]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites and\nservices. Use of these cookies, which may be stored on your device, permits us to improve and\ncustomize your experience. You can read more about your cookie choices at [our privacy policy][105].\nBy continuing to use this site you are consenting to these choices.\n\nI ACCEPT\nI DO NOT ACCEPT\n\n[1]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors/\n[2]: https://www.cbinsights.com/research/\n[3]: https://www.cbinsights.com/newsletter/\n[4]: https://www.cbinsights.com/media-support/\n[5]: https://www.cbinsights.com/login\n[6]: https://www.cbinsights.com\n[7]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-strategy/\n[8]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-venture-capital/\n[9]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/venture-capital/\n[10]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/head-of-it/\n[11]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/function/corporate-innovation/\n[12]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-vcs-use-cb-insights/\n[13]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/consumer/\n[14]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/tech/\n[15]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/insurance/\n[16]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/healthcare/\n[17]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/industrials/\n[18]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/financial-services/\n[19]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[20]: https://www.cbinsights.com/who-we-serve/industries/professional-services/\n[21]: https://www.cbinsights.com/resources/case-studies/\n[22]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/understand-tech-markets/\n[23]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/competitor-strategy/\n[24]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/create-tech-strategy/\n[25]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/find-tech-vendors/\n[26]: https://www.cbinsights.com/how-we-help/digital-transformation/\n[27]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[28]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-search-engine/\n[29]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/market-analytics-and-visualizations/\n[30]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/team-management-and-collaboration/\n[31]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/platform/\n[32]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/data/\n[33]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/research/\n[34]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/personal-briefing/\n[35]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/instant-insights/\n[36]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/public-company-data/\n[37]: https://www.cbinsights.com/learn/buyer-interviews\n[38]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/technology-vendors//\n[39]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/api/\n[40]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/\n[41]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/integrations/chrome-and-edge-extension/\n[42]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/salesforce-integration/\n[43]: https://www.cbinsights.com/what-we-offer/i"
