            "url": "https://www.cbinsights.com/company/bango",
            "text": "* [Technology Vendors][1]\n* [Recent Research][2]\n* [Newsletter][3]\n* [Media Support][4]\n* [Login][5]\n[[CB Insights]][6]\n* Who We Serve\n* Function\n* [Corporate Strategy][7]\n* [Corporate Venture Capital][8]\n* [Venture Capital][9]\n* [IT][10]\n* [Corporate Innovation][11]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### How VCs Use CB Insights\n\n[Go to the video gallery \u2192][12]\n* Industries\n* [Consumer & Retail][13]\n* [Tech][14]\n* [Insurance][15]\n* [Healthcare][16]\n* [Industrials][17]\n* [Financial Services][18]\n* [Professional Services][19]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Learn More\u2192][20]\n* [Success Stories][21]\n* How We Help\n* [Understand Tech Markets][22]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][23]\n* [Determine Tech Strategy][24]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors & Partners][25]\n* [Turbocharge Digital Transformation][26]\n* What We Offer\n* Platform\n* [Overview][27]\n* [Technology Search Engine][28]\n* [Market Analytics and Visualizations][29]\n* [Team Management and Collaboration][30]\n* [Featured Item]\n\n### Platform Overview\n\n[Learn More\u2192][31]\n* [Data][32]\n* [Research][33]\n* [Personal Briefing][34]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][35]\n* [Public Equity Data][36]\n* [Buyer Interview Transcripts][37]\n* [Analyst Briefings][38]\n* [API & Data Feeds][39]\n* Integrations\n* [Overview][40]\n* [Chrome and Edge][41]\n* [Salesforce][42]\n* [Affinity][43]\n* [Microsoft Excel][44]\n* [Google Sheets][45]\n* [Microsoft Teams][46]\n* [Slack][47]\n* [Google Slides][48]\n* [App Partners][49]\n* [Browser Extension][50]\n* [Pricing][51]\n* About Us\n* [Overview][52]\n* Our teams\n* [Business Development][53]\n* [Engineering][54]\n* [Operations][55]\n* [Product][56]\n* [See all \u2192][57]\n* [Open Jobs][58]\n\nLoading...\n\n[Bango company logo]\n\n# Bango\n\nUnclaimed\n[bango.com][59]\n* [Overview & Products][60]\n* [Financials][61]\n* [People][62]\n* [Alternatives & Competitors][63]\n\n## Founded Year\n\n1999\n\n## Stage\n\nCorporate Minority - P2P | IPO\n\n## Market Cap\n\n0.05B\n\n## Stock Price\n\n61.00\n\n## Revenue\n\n$0000 View\n\n## About Bango\n\nBango is a company involved in the subscriptions economy through its Digital Vending Machine,\noperating within the digital content monetization and payment solutions industry. The company\nprovides a platform that enables subscription bundling and carrier billing, allowing content\nproviders and other businesses to package their offerings. Bango serves sectors such as\ntelecommunications, content provision, financial services, and retail. It was founded in 1999 and is\nbased in Cambridge, England.\n\n## Headquarters Location\n\n326 Cambridge Science Park\n\nCambridge, England, CB4 1YG,\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\n+443330770247\n\nLoading...\n\nLoading...\n\n## Expert Collections containing Bango\n\nExpert Collections are analyst-curated lists that highlight the companies you need to know in the\nmost important technology spaces.\n\nBango is included in **2 Expert Collections,** including **Payments**.\n\n# Payments\n\n3,459 items\n\nCompanies in this collection provide technology that enables consumers and businesses to pay,\ncollect, automate, and settle transfers of currency, both online and at the physical point-of-sale.\n\n# Fintech\n\n14,587 items\n\nExcludes US-based companies\n\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Bango Patents\n\nBango has filed 1 patent.\n\n[patents chart]\nView Patents Chart\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplicati\u2502Grant\u2502Title \u2502Related Topics \u2502Sta\non Date \u2502Date \u2502 \u2502 \u2502tus\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\n4/16/2013\u25022/16/\u2502[Payment \u2502Personal computers, Computer network security, Mobile \u2502Gra\n\u25022016 \u2502authentication \u2502computers, Wireless networking, Classes of computers \u2502nt\n\u2502 \u2502systems][64] \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nApplication \u25024/16/2013\nDate \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nGrant Date \u25022/16/2016\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTitle \u2502[Payment authentication systems][65]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nRelated \u2502Personal computers, Computer network security, Mobile computers, Wireless networking,\nTopics \u2502Classes of computers\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nStatus \u2502Grant\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n## Latest Bango News\n\n[Bango profits from subscriptions pivot][66]\n\nJun 3, 2026\n\nBango turned cash EBITDA positive in FY25 for the first time. The twelve months ended 31 December\n2025 saw revenue from the Cambridge-based e-commerce platform provider\u2019s higher margin subscription\nsegment increase by 22% year-on-year to $22.2m. This, together with the operational efficiencies\nachieved across the business, drove a 7% improvement in Adjusted EBITA to $16.4m despite total\nturnover dipping by 2% to $52.2m. The 21-year-old company operates two distinct areas: a\ncash-generative payments segment and a rapidly scaling subscriptions segment. Payments relates to\nDirect Carrier Billing (DCB) and wallets where revenue is derived by charging a percentage of the\nretail price paid by the consumer and one-off fees and Subscriptions, which encompasses all revenues\nrelated to Bango\u2019s Digital Vending Machine (DVM) product. The latter is a full-lifecycle\nsubscription bundling platform that acts as middleware, connecting subscription content providers\n(like Amazon, Google, Microsoft) with distribution channels \u2014 primarily Telcos \u2014 so they can offer\nbundled subscription packages to consumers. FY25 saw Bango pull back from a number of lower-margin\npayment routes, prioritising revenue quality over volume. The 15% year-on-year decline in revenue\nfrom the segment to $30m masked a 5% growth in turnover in the more valuable parts of this business.\nIn parallel, expansion of the company\u2019s subscription segment gathered pace. The number of DVM\nenterprise customers rose to 39 (27 in FY24), the number of active subscriptions managed surged by\n60% to 24 million and annual recurring revenue increased by 30% to $18.2m. Despite the growing\nmacro-economic headwinds, Bango is confident that its subscriptions-led strategy can sustain growth\nin ARR and profit margins going forward. The company entered FY26 with what it describes as a\n\u201cstrong\u201d prospect pipeline and a balance sheet bolstered by an enhanced loan facility from NHN and a\n$15M Revolving Credit Facility with NatWest. The new financial year is reported to have started\nwell. Revenue for Q1 FY26 was up 13% year-on-year and Adjusted EBITDA increased 39%. Bango\u2019s\nfundamentals look increasingly healthy. The DVM platform is well positioned to capitalise on the\ngrowing appetite among consumers for simpler, more flexible and cost-effective ways of managing\nnumerous individual subscriptions. The company\u2019s vision of becoming \"the place where people\nsubscribe\" may be ambitious, but it is not without substance.\n\nMay 12, 2026\n[Bango appoints Darcy Antonellis as non-exec chair][67]\nMay 12, 2026\n[EARNINGS AND TRADING: Frontier Developments lifts profit outlook][68]\nMay 9, 2026\n[Bango targets AI and productivity subscription growth - ICYMI][69]\nMay 7, 2026\n[LinkedIn partners with the Digital Vending Machine\u00ae from Bango to expand Premium reach through\nbundling][70]\nLearn more by requesting a demo\n\n### Bango Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n* When was Bango founded?\n\nBango was founded in 1999.\n* Where is Bango's headquarters?\n\nBango's headquarters is located at 326 Cambridge Science Park, Cambridge.\n* What is Bango's latest funding round?\n\nBango's latest funding round is Corporate Minority - P2P.\n* Who are the investors of Bango?\n\nInvestors of Bango include NHN and ET Capital.\n* Who are Bango's competitors?\n\nCompetitors of Bango include DOCOMO Digital and 1 more.\n\nLoading...\n\n## Compare Bango to Competitors\n\n[Offerpal Media Logo]\n[Offerpal Media][71]\n\nOfferpal Media develops digital solutions for website creation and management within the content\nmanagement system domain. The company provides products including Joomla and WordPress extensions,\ntools for website optimization, and solutions for online store checkout experiences. Offerpal Media\nserves the ecommerce, web development, and digital marketing sectors by providing tools for website\nfunctionality and user experience. It was founded in 2007 and is based in Fremont, California.\n\n[Paymentwall Logo]\n[Paymentwall][72]\n\nPaymentwall is a payment platform that provides various payment methods for businesses in sectors\nsuch as e-commerce, travel, SaaS, fintech, enterprise, and gaming. The company offers services\nincluding credit card processing, local payment method integration, digital invoice management, and\nrisk management solutions. Paymentwall was formerly known as Boomerang Networks. It was founded in\n2010 and is based in San Francisco, California.\n\n[Boku Logo]\n[Boku][73]\n\nBoku provides a local payment network for global enterprises across various sectors. The company\noffers services that include automated charges, electronic payment services with multi-factor\nauthentication, and solutions for large enterprises. Boku's network connects global merchants to\nlocal payment methods. It was founded in 2008 and is based in San Francisco, California.\n\n[Trialpay Logo]\n[Trialpay][74]\n\nTrialPay offers a transactional advertising platform. It offers a payment solution for e-commerce\nbusinesses across various sectors, such as gaming, online services, publishing, retail, and social\nnetworking. The company was founded in 2006 and is based in Mountain View, California. In February\n2015, TrialPay was acquired by Visa.\n\n[Danal][75]\n\nDanal specializes in user verification and authentication solutions within the technology sector.\nThe company provides for passwordless authentication, allowing for user onboarding and user\nverification across multiple channels. Danal's services are applicable to various industries that\nrequire user verification and identity management solutions. It was founded in 2006 and is based in\nSan Jose, California. In December 2018, Danal was acquired by Boku at a valuation between $68M and\n$112M.\n\n[Zong][76]\n\nZong is a mobile payments platform operating within the gaming and social networking sectors. The\ncompany provides payment solutions for online merchants, enabling transactions for digital content,\ngaming, and social networking services. Zong primarily caters to the ecommerce industry, focusing on\ngaming and social networking companies. It was founded in 2000 and is based in Menlo Park,\nCalifornia. In July 2011, Zong was acquired by PayPal at a valuation of $240M.\n\nLoading...\n\n[CB Insights]\n498 Seventh Avenue 12th floor\nNew York, NY 10018[info@cbinsights.com][77]\n[212 292 3148][78]\n\nFollow Us On Social\n\n[[Twitter]][79][[Linkedin]][80][[Facebook]][81]\n\n### [About][82]\n* [About Us][83]\n* [Upcoming Webinars][84]\n* [Contact Us][85]\n\n### [How We Help][86]\n* [Understand Tech Markets][87]\n* [Anticipate Competitor Strategy][88]\n* [Create Tech Strategy][89]\n* [Connect with Tech Vendors][90]\n* [Digital Transformation][91]\n\n### [What We Offer][92]\n* [Platform][93]\n* [Data][94]\n* [Research Overview][95]\n* [GenAI Instant Insights][96]\n* [Pricing][97]\n\n### [Popular Research][98]\n* [AI 100][99]\n* [Fintech 100][100]\n* [Digital Health 50][101]\n* [Tech Trends 2024][102]\n* [Generative AI Predictions][103]\n* [Unicorn Tracker][104]\n* [VC Glossary][105]\n* [Company List Applications][106]\n* [CB Insights Website Terms of Use][107]\n* [Privacy Policy][108]\n* [Do Not Sell My Info][109]\n* [Partnership][110]\n\nCopyright 2026 CB Information Services, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nCBI websites generally use certain cookies to enable better interactions with our sites"
          }
