111]\nNow in its fourth year, Food & Wine's Global Tastemakers Awards celebrates the best in culinary\ntravel, including the top restaurants, bars, cruises, hotels, airlines, and airports. Voted on by\nover 400 chefs, travel experts, and food and travel writers from across the world, and ranked by our\nGlobal Advisory Board, let the winners inspire your next delicious trip.\nBy Karla Alindahao, Ashley Day, Sean Flynn, Melanie Hansche, Stacey Leasca, and Prairie Rose\nStart Saving These Dishes\nKeep all your Food & Wine favorites in MyRecipes for free.\n* [Lemon Pepper Wings with Curry-Butter Sauce]\n  Lemon Pepper Wings with Curry-Butter Sauce\n  2 Ratings\n  3 hrs 20 mins\n  Next Level\n  Save Recipe\n  \n  **Our community loves this recipe**\n  * Five-star reviewed\n  * Make-ahead option\n  \n  [View Recipe][112]\n  Save Recipe\n* [GRILLED SALMON WITH SALSA VERDE AND FARRO]\n  Grilled Salmon with Salsa Verde and Farro\n  2 Ratings\n  1 hr\n  Weeknight Inspo\n  Save Recipe\n  \n  **Our community loves this recipe**\n  * Five-star reviewed\n  * Ready in an hour\n  \n  [View Recipe][113]\n  Save Recipe\n* [Caprese Dense Bean Salad]\n  Caprese Dense Bean Salad\n  4 Ratings\n  10 mins\n  Summery Side\n  Save Recipe\n  \n  **Our community loves this recipe**\n  * Ready in 10 minutes\n  * Five-star reviewed\n  \n  [View Recipe][114]\n  Save Recipe\n* [Crab Rangoon Taquitos]\n  Crab Rangoon Taquitos\n  5 Ratings\n  45 mins\n  Two Crowd Favorites\n  Save Recipe\n  \n  **Our community loves this recipe**\n  * Ready in 45 minutes\n  * Make ahead option\n  \n  [View Recipe][115]\n  Save Recipe\n* [Power Cookies]\n  Power Cookies\n  5 Ratings\n  2 hrs\n  Dessert of the Week\n  Save Recipe\n  \n  **Our community loves this recipe**\n  * Freeze the dough for up to a month\n  * Protein-packed energy bar\n  \n  [View Recipe][116]\n  Save Recipe\n* [Piragua de Crema (Puerto Rican Cream Shaved Ice)]\n  Piragua de Crema (Puerto Rican Shaved Ice)\n  1 Rating\n  30 mins\n  Tropical Treat\n  Save Recipe\n  \n  **Our community loves this recipe**\n  * Five-star reviewed\n  * Ready in 30 minutes\n  \n  [View Recipe][117]\n  Save Recipe\nClick the cards to flip!\n\n## Top Stories\n\n[\n[Caramelized Onion Dip]\n26 All-American Appetizers for Every Party, From Potato Skins to Fried Pickles\n][118] [\n[Shrimp stirfried with vegetables and noodles on a plate]\nThe 1-Ingredient Trick Chinese Chefs Use for Juicier Shrimp, Chicken, and Beef\n][119] [\n[A freshly baked pizza with toppings such as cheese tomato sauce sausage and green onions served on\na marble table next to salad and drinks]\nThis Pizzeria Was Named the Best in America for the 5th Year in a Row\n][120] [\n[A decanter and a wine glass filled with white wine on an outdoor surface]\nWhy You Should Decant White Wine\n][121]\n[\n[A glass of clear liquid next to orange slices on a slate platter]\n][122]\n[ It's Not Your Imagination \u2014 Tequila Is Getting Stronger, and Here's Why ][123]\n\n## Who We Are\n\nFood & Wine is the global authority on food and drink culture. We share and celebrate the best\nrecipes, experiences, and culinary talent in the world, inspiring and empowering curious\nfood-obsessed people to eat, drink, host, and travel better.\n* [\n  [Headshot of Hunter Lewis]\n  \n  Hunter Lewis\n  \n  Editor in Chief\n  \n  ][124] [\n  [Portrait of Michelle Edelbaum]\n  \n  Michelle Edelbaum\n  \n  SVP, Associate Group General Manager\n  \n  ][125] [\n  [Portrait of Sean Flynn]\n  \n  Sean Flynn\n  \n  Associate General Manager\n  \n  ][126] [\n  [Melanie Hansche]\n  \n  Melanie Hansche\n  \n  Editorial Director, Special Projects\n  \n  ][127]\n* [\n  [Headshot of Dylan Garret, smiling and facing forward, wearing black sweater and glasses on solid\n  dark gray background]\n  \n  Dylan Garret\n  \n  Editorial Director\n  \n  ][128] [\n  [Headshot of Ashley Day]\n  \n  Ashley Day\n  \n  Associate Editorial Director\n  \n  ][129] [\n  [A person smiling wearing a blazer and shirt posed again