illion by 2034, at a CAGR of 6.4% during the forecast period...\n  \n  Published Date: Jun, 2026 | $ 4,850.00 | [ Read More ][92]\n* #### [ Medical Device Contract Manufacturing Market Size, Share & Indust... ][93]\n  \n  The global medical device contract manufacturing market size is projected to grow from $92.86\n  billion in 2026 to $153.13 billion by 2034, at a CAGR of 6.5%...\n  \n  Published Date: Jun, 2026 | $ 4,850.00 | [ Read More ][94]\nView All Reports\nHealthcare Information & Technology Machinery & Equipment Food & Beverages Energy & Power\nAgriculture Chemicals & Materials Aerospace & Defense\n\n### Industry Blogs\n\n23 JUN 26\n[\n\nTop Fuel Delivery System Companies Advancing Modern Automotive Engineering\n\n][95]\n23 JUN 26\n[\n\nTop Heat Meter Companies Driving Smart Energy Management Solutions\n\n][96]\n22 JUN 26\n[\n\nTop Endovascular Robotic Systems Companies Driving the Future of Vascular Care\n\n][97]\n22 JUN 26\n[\n\nTop Fruit Purees Companies Driving Innovation in Natural Food Ingredients\n\n][98]\n[View All][99]\n\n### Press Release\n\n18 JUN 26\n[\n\nNetwork as a Service Market to Grow at a Significant CAGR of 23.5% During Forecast Period;\nEliminati...\n\n][100]\n11 JUN 26\n[\n\nRemote Desktop Software Market to Grow at a CAGR of 19.6% over 2026 to 2034; Growing cybersecurity\nC...\n\n][101]\n04 JUN 26\n[\n\nDialysis Market to Grow at a CAGR of 5.7% During the Forecast Period; Growing Shift to Home\nDialysis...\n\n][102]\n31 MAY 26\n[\n\nEstimation for Refractories Market for 2034 is USD 64.60 Billion; Industrial Importance and\nFunction...\n\n][103]\n[View All][104]\n\n### Consulting Services\n\nGrowth Consultation with Actionable Insights and Tailor - Made Solutions\n\n[Request a Quote][105] [Contact Us][106]\n\n### SERVICES WE OFFER\n\n#### Consulting Services\n\nAt Fortune Business Insights, our consulting services are fine-tuned to answer your commercial\nqueries with relevant data derived from trusted industrial sources. [ Read More][107]\n\n#### Tailored Insights\n\nOur tailored researches cover actionable insights to help clients identify and capitalize on\nprevailing opportunities. Our aim is to enable them stay ahead in competition. [ Read More][108]\n\n#### Syndicated Market Research\n\nBusinesses today operate in a dynamic environment. In order to pace up with prevailing trends and\nsteer growth they require refined forecasts. This is exactly what we offer in our syndicated\nreports! [ Read More][109]\n\n#### Competitive Intelligence\n\nWith competition getting fiercer each passing day, organizations around the world are in need of\nvaluable insights and accurate competitive intelligence - now more than ever. [ Read More][110]\n\n#### Emerging Technologies\n\nAt Fortune Business Insights we believe in empowering our clients with information on the latest and\nemerging technologies, enabling them join the automation bandwagon. [ Read More][111]\n\n#### Customer Research\n\nImpressive brand image can catapult a company to a market\u2019s fore, irrespective of the prevailing\ncompetition. This however needs the support of in-depth customer research. [ Read More][112]\n\n[close]\n\n##### Please fill out the form to enable our research representatives to contact you at the\n##### earliest.\n\n[man icon]\n[Mail icon]\n[Mail icon]\nSecurity Code\n[Captcha] [refresh]\n[loader] Submit\n\nSubscribe News Letter\n\nSubmit\n\nTrust Online\n\n[ [DMCA.com Protection Status] ][113] [Comodo Secure]\n\nContact Us\n\nUS [+1 833 909 2966 ( Toll Free )][114]\nUK [ +44 808 502 0280 (Toll Free )][115]\nAPAC [ +91 744 740 1245][116]\n[sales@fortunebusinessinsights.com][117]\n\nConnect with us\n\nInformation\n* [FAQs ][118]\n* [Testimonials][119]\n* [Terms of Use][120]\n* [Privacy Policy][121]\n* [Careers][122]\n* [How To Order][123]\n\nRecognized By\n\n[ [Comodo Secure] ][124]\n\nD&B D-U-N-S^{\u00ae}\nNumber: 861494523\n\n[ [Great place to work] ][125]\n[ISO 1] [ISO 1]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Fortune Business Insights . 