        "crawl_text": "Healthline Media LLC Digital Media Part of RVO Health, backed by Red Ventures and UnitedHealth Group\u2019s Optum. San Francisco, California Healthline is the fastest growing health information site with over 50 million monthly visitors. [[Healthline]][1]\n* Health Conditions\nHealth Conditions\n[All][2]\n* [Breast Cancer][3]\n* [Cancer Care][4]\n* [Caregiving for Alzheimer's Disease][5]\n* [Chronic Kidney Disease][6]\n* [Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD)][7]\n* [Digestive Health][8]\n* [Eye Health][9]\n* [Heart Health][10]\n* [Menopause][11]\n* [Mental Health][12]\n* [Migraine][13]\n* [Multiple Sclerosis (MS)][14]\n* [Parkinson\u2019s Disease][15]\n* [Psoriasis][16]\n* [Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA)][17]\n* [Sleep Health][18]\n* [Type 2 Diabetes][19]\n* [Weight Management][20]\nCondition Spotlight\n[All][21]\n* [\nControlling Ulcerative Colitis\n][22]\n* [\nNavigating Life with Bipolar Disorder\n][23]\n* [\nMastering Geographic Atrophy\n][24]\n* [\nManaging Type 2 Diabetes\n][25]\n* Wellness\nWellness Topics\n[All][26]\n* [CBD][27]\n* [Fitness][28]\n* [Healthy Aging][29]\n* [Hearing][30]\n* [Mental Well-Being][31]\n* [Nutrition][32]\n* [Parenthood][33]\n* [Recipes][34]\n* [Sexual Health][35]\n* [Skin Care][36]\n* [Sleep Health][37]\n* [Vitamins and Supplements][38]\n* [Women's Wellness][39]\nProduct Reviews\n[All][40]\n* [At-Home Testing][41]\n* [Men's Health][42]\n* [Mental Health][43]\n* [Nutrition][44]\n* [Sleep][45]\n* [Vitamins and Supplements][46]\n* [Women's Health][47]\nFeatured Programs\n[All][48]\n* [\nYour Guide to Glucose Health\n][49]\n* [\nInflammation and Aging\n][50]\n* [\nCold & Flu Season Survival Guide\n][51]\n* [\nShe\u2019s Good for Real\n][52]\n* Tools\nFeatured\n* [Video Series][53]\n* [Pill Identifier][54]\n* [FindCare][55]\n* [Drugs A-Z][56]\n* [Medicare Plans by State][57]\nLessons\n[All][58]\n* [Crohn\u2019s and Ulcerative Colitis Essentials][59]\n* [Diabetes Nutrition][60]\n* [High Cholesterol][61]\n* [Taming Inflammation in Psoriasis][62]\n* [Taming Inflammation in Psoriatic Arthritis][63]\nNewsletters\n[All][64]\n* [Anxiety and Depression][65]\n* [Digestive Health][66]\n* [Heart Health][67]\n* [Migraine][68]\n* [Nutrition Edition][69]\n* [Type 2 Diabetes][70]\n* [Wellness Wire][71]\nLifestyle Quizzes\n* [Find a Diet][72]\n* [Find Healthy Snacks][73]\n* [Weight Management][74]\n* [How Well Do You Sleep?][75]\n* [Are You a Workaholic?][76]\n* Featured\nHealth News\n[All][77]\n* [Medicare 2026 Changes][78]\n* [Can 6-6-6 Walking Workout Help You Lose Weight?][79]\n* [This Couple Lost 118 Pounds Together Without Medication][80]\n* [5 Science-Backed Ways to Live a Longer Life][81]\n* [Morning Coffee May Help You Live Longer][82]\nThis Just In\n* [5 Tips for a Healthy Lifestyle][83]\n* [How to Disinfect Your House After the Flu][84]\n* [Best Vegan and Plant-Based Meal Delivery for 2025][85]\n* [Does Medicare Cover Pneumonia Shots?][86]\n* [Chromosomes, Genetics, and Your Health][87]\nTop Reads\n* [Best Multivitamins for Women][88]\n* [Best Multivitamins for Men][89]\n* [Best Online Therapy Services][90]\n* [Online Therapy That Takes Insurance][91]\n* [Buy Ozempic Online][92]\n* [Mounjaro Overview][93]\nVideo Series\n* [Youth in Focus][94]\n* [Healthy Harvest][95]\n* [Through an Artist's Eye][96]\n* [Future of Health][97]\n* Connect\nFind Your Bezzy Community\n\nBezzy communities provide meaningful connections with others living with chronic conditions. Join\nBezzy on the web or mobile app.\n\n[All][98]\n* [\nInflammatory Bowel Disease\n][99]\n* [\nMultiple Sclerosis\n][100]\n* [\nDepression\n][101]\n* [\nMigraine\n][102]\n* [\nType 2 Diabetes\n][103]\n* [\nPsoriasis\n][104]\nFollow us on social media\n\nCan't get enough? Connect with us for all things health.\nSubscribe\n\n# ABOUT US\n\n[Healthline logo]\n\nYou\u2019re on a journey to health and wellness. And we\u2019re right there with you.\n\nHow you feel affects every single day of your life, which is why you work so hard to get well and\nstay well. No matter your journey, we\u2019re here to support, guide, and inspire you.\n\nWe cut through the confusion with straightforward, expert-reviewed, person-first experiences \u2014 all\ndesigned to help you make the best decisions for yourself and the people you love.\n\n**Our mission is to help you live better, longer.**\n\nHealthline covers all facets of physical and mental health openly and objectively because we\u2019re here\nfor the whole person \u2014 for your whole life. We listen closely to your unique challenges and\nempathize with you. Compassion moves us to go the extra mile, and we\u2019re always here to help you take\nthat next step in your health journey.\n\nWe hope you tap into all of Healthline\u2019s resources \u2014 from our health and wellness library and\nnewsletters to our apps, podcasts, and communities.\n\nThanks for being here,\n\nThe Healthline Team\n\nHealthline is part of RVO Health, a company backed by Red Ventures and UnitedHealth Group\u2019s Optum.\nTogether under RVO Health, select brands that were previously operated by Red Ventures and Optum are\nnow being independently operated.\n\nTo learn more about RVO Health, please click [here][105].\n\n## Health seekers have made us the fastest growing health information site. Over 50 million people\n## turn to Healthline every month.\n\nWhether you\u2019re here to learn more about a health condition, research a medication, tap into one of\nour communities, or get some tips for a healthier lifestyle, you\u2019re in the right place. You\u2019ll find\ncontent that\u2019s informative, easy to understand, and engaging. You\u2019ll also find a compassionate team\nof professionals who genuinely care about people.\n\nSource: Comscore, May 2024\n\n## ABOUT US\n\n## Medical Integrity\n\nHealthline\u2019s Medical Integrity team ensures that Healthline\u2019s content, products, and services uphold\nthe highest standards of medical accuracy and integrity. Our dedicated team manages an extensive\nmedical network of healthcare professionals providing medical review, expert POVs, and clinical\nguidance. Healthline\u2019s healthcare professionals help ensure that the information we publish is\naccurate, evidence-based, current, person-centric, and trustworthy.\n\n[Read more about our Medical Integrity team.][106]\n\n## Healthline Editorial\n\nHealthline is dedicated to making health and wellness information accessible, understandable, and\nactionable so that readers can make the [best possible decisions][107] about their health. Our\ncontent is created, fact-checked, and reviewed by qualified writers, editors, clinicians, and other\ncontributors.\n\n[Read more about our approach to content integrity.][108]\n\nEach piece of clinical content undergoes a robust review process from our network of healthcare\nprofessionals to ensure accuracy. We have strict sourcing guidelines and cite or link to primary\nsources in each article. Our experts continually monitor the health and wellness space, and we\nupdate our articles when new information becomes available.\n\n[Read more about how we create our content.][109]\n\n## **Chronic Condition Communities**\n\nThe mission of Healthline Media\u2019s [Bezzy][110] communities is to empower people who are living with\nchronic conditions to live beyond their diagnosis through community support, shared experiences,\ncompassion, and knowledge. Our platform offers a safe place for each community to give and receive\nadvice through one-on-one messaging and group discussions, all while offering members access to the\nlatest news and research updates. Currently we have ten communities:\n* [Bezzy MS][111]\n* [Bezzy Breast Cancer][112]\n* [Bezzy Migraine][113]\n* [Bezzy IBD][114]\n* [Bezzy PsA][115]\n* [Bezzy T2D][116]\n* [Bezzy RA][117]\n* [Bezzy Psoriasis][118]\n* [Bezzy Depression][119]\n* [Bezzy COPD][120]\n\n## Follow Us\n\nAs your ally, we promise to never leave you stranded in your journey to well-being. Follow us on\nsocial media for health and wellness tips, videos, and the latest articles.\n* [Facebook][121]\n* [Flipboard][122]\n* [Instagram][123]\n* [LinkedIn][124]\n* [Pinterest][125]\n* [TikTok][126]\n* [Twitter][127]\n* [YouTube][128]\n\n## POLICIES\n\n## Ad & Sponsorship Policy\n\nHealthline receives funding from advertisements, sponsored content, and other partnerships, such as\naffiliate programs. The reality is that funding from our advertisers allows us to cover more\nconditions and provide more powerful experiences, including video, animations, and input from a\nrange of experts. Be assured that we\u2019re absolutely inflexible a [[Healthline]][1]\n* Health Conditions\nHealth Conditions\n[All][2]\n* [Breast Cancer][3]\n* [Cancer Care][4]\n* [Caregiving for Alzheimer's Disease][5]\n* [Chronic Kidney Disease][6]\n* [Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD)][7]\n* [Digestive Health][8]\n* [Eye Health][9]\n* [Heart Health][10]\n* [Menopause][11]\n* [Mental Health][12]\n* [Migraine][13]\n* [Multiple Sclerosis (MS)][14]\n* [Parkinson\u2019s Disease][15]\n* [Psoriasis][16]\n* [Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA)][17]\n* [Sleep Health][18]\n* [Type 2 Diabetes][19]\n* [Weight Management][20]\nCondition Spotlight\n[All][21]\n* [\nControlling Ulcerative Colitis\n][22]\n* [\nNavigating Life with Bipolar Disorder\n][23]\n* [\nMastering Geographic Atrophy\n][24]\n* [\nManaging Type 2 Diabetes\n][25]\n* Wellness\nWellness Topics\n[All][26]\n* [CBD][27]\n* [Fitness][28]\n* [Healthy Aging][29]\n* [Hearing][30]\n* [Mental Well-Being][31]\n* [Nutrition][32]\n* [Parenthood][33]\n* [Recipes][34]\n* [Sexual Health][35]\n* [Skin Care][36]\n* [Sleep Health][37]\n* [Vitamins and Supplements][38]\n* [Women's Wellness][39]\nProduct Reviews\n[All][40]\n* [At-Home Testing][41]\n* [Men's Health][42]\n* [Mental Health][43]\n* [Nutrition][44]\n* [Sleep][45]\n* [Vitamins and Supplements][46]\n* [Women's Health][47]\nFeatured Programs\n[All][48]\n* [\nYour Guide to Glucose Health\n][49]\n* [\nInfla