pe 2 Diabetes][70]\n* [Wellness Wire][71]\nLifestyle Quizzes\n* [Find a Diet][72]\n* [Find Healthy Snacks][73]\n* [Weight Management][74]\n* [How Well Do You Sleep?][75]\n* [Are You a Workaholic?][76]\n* Featured\nHealth News\n[All][77]\n* [Medicare 2026 Changes][78]\n* [Can 6-6-6 Walking Workout Help You Lose Weight?][79]\n* [This Couple Lost 118 Pounds Together Without Medication][80]\n* [5 Science-Backed Ways to Live a Longer Life][81]\n* [Morning Coffee May Help You Live Longer][82]\nThis Just In\n* [5 Tips for a Healthy Lifestyle][83]\n* [How to Disinfect Your House After the Flu][84]\n* [Best Vegan and Plant-Based Meal Delivery for 2025][85]\n* [Does Medicare Cover Pneumonia Shots?][86]\n* [Chromosomes, Genetics, and Your Health][87]\nTop Reads\n* [Best Multivitamins for Women][88]\n* [Best Multivitamins for Men][89]\n* [Best Online Therapy Services][90]\n* [Online Therapy That Takes Insurance][91]\n* [Buy Ozempic Online][92]\n* [Mounjaro Overview][93]\nVideo Series\n* [Youth in Focus][94]\n* [Healthy Harvest][95]\n* [Through an Artist's Eye][96]\n* [Future of Health][97]\n* Connect\nFind Your Bezzy Community\n\nBezzy communities provide meaningful connections with others living with chronic conditions. Join\nBezzy on the web or mobile app.\n\n[All][98]\n* [\nInflammatory Bowel Disease\n][99]\n* [\nMultiple Sclerosis\n][100]\n* [\nDepression\n][101]\n* [\nMigraine\n][102]\n* [\nType 2 Diabetes\n][103]\n* [\nPsoriasis\n][104]\nFollow us on social media\n\nCan't get enough? Connect with us for all things health.\nSubscribe\n\n# Contact Us\n\nAbout [Healthline][105]\n\nOur goal is to deliver the highest caliber content that provides a sense of clarity and inspires\nhealthy actions for our readers along their health and well-being journeys. When a reader alerts us\nto a potential issue with our content, such as incomplete, inaccurate, outdated, unclear, or\ncontradictory information, our editorial and medical teams research the feedback, determine the\nopportunities for improvement, and republish our content with necessary revisions.\n\nFor sponsorship and advertising opportunities with Healthline, please see our [Healthline Media\nAdvertising page][106].\n\nHealthline is a digital publisher and does not offer personal health or medical advice. If you\u2019re\nfacing a medical emergency, call your local emergency services immediately, or visit the nearest\nemergency room or urgent care center. You should consult your healthcare provider before starting\nany nutrition, diet, exercise, fitness, medical, or wellness program.\n\n\u00a9 2026 Healthline Media LLC. All rights reserved. Healthline Media is an RVO Health Company. Our\nwebsite services, content, and products are for informational purposes only. Healthline Media does\nnot provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. [See additional information][107].\n* [About Us][108]\n* [Contact Us][109]\n* [Privacy Notice][110]\n* Privacy Settings\n* [Advertising Policy][111]\n* [Health Topics][112]\n* [Sitemap][113]\n* [Medical Affairs][114]\n* [Content Integrity][115]\n* [Newsletters][116]\n* \u00a9 2026 Healthline Media LLC. All rights reserved. Healthline Media is an RVO Health Company. Our\nwebsite services, content, and products are for informational purposes only. Healthline Media does\nnot provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. [See additional information][117].\n\u00a9 2026 Healthline Media LLC. All rights reserved. Healthline Media is an RVO Health Company. Our\nwebsite services, content, and products are for informational purposes only. Healthline Media does\nnot provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. [See additional information][118].\n[About][119][Careers][120][Advertise with us][121]\n\nOUR BRANDS\n\n[Healthline][122][Medical News Today][123][Greatist][124][Psych Central][125][Bezzy][126]\n\n[1]: https://www.healthline.com/\n[2]: https://www.healthline.com/directory/topics\n[3]: https://www.healthline.com/breast-cancer\n[4]: https://www.healthli