[111]\n[Dossier 360][112]\n[Go To Market Strategy][113]\n[Paid Press Release][114]\n\n## Expertise & Services\n\n[Industry Speaks][115]\n[Terms & Conditions][116]\n[Privacy Policy][117]\n[Disclaimer][118]\n[FAQ's][119]\n[Site Map][120]\n[IT Support][121]\n[Website Issue][122]\n\n## How We Are Different?\n\n[Ken Research Vs. BCC Research][123]\n[Ken Research Vs. Euromonitor Int.][124]\n[Ken Research Vs. Nielsen][125]\n[Ken Research Vs. Marketsand Markets][126]\n[Ken Research Vs. McKinsey][127]\n[Ken Research Vs. Mordor][128]\n[Ken Research Vs. S&P Global][129]\n[Ken Research Vs. Grand View Research][130]\n[Ken Research Vs. Frost & Sullivan][131]\n\n## Company Overview\n\n## India\n\n[Unit 14, Tower B3, Spaze I Tech Business Park, Sohna Road, sector 49 Gurgaon, Haryana - 122001,\nIndia][132]\n\n## UAE\n\n[105, Al Jaz1b, Street no 2 the Greens Dubai United Arab Emirates][133]\n\n## Indonesia\n\n[The Icon BSD City, Jl. Verdant View IIIA No.15, Tangerang Regency, Province Banten-15345,\nIndonesia][134]\n\n## QATAR\n\n[Office no. 9, Building no. 171 Zone no. 42, Street no. 230, Al-Rehab Complex, C-Ring road,\nDoha][135]\n\nKen\n\nKen\n\nFor Sale Enquiries: +91-9015378249\n\n][136][\n\nankur.gupta@kenresearch.com\n\n][137]\n\nSubscribe to our Newsletter\n\nNever miss out on an update from us\n\nSubscribe\n[Terms & Conditions][138][Privacy Policy][139][Cookie Policy][140]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026, Ken Research Pvt. Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\nIndia Sports Equipment Market Analysis 2025 \u2013 Growth, Trends, Competition\n\n# How a Leading Indian Sports Brand Strengthened Its Market Position with Data-Driven Insights\n\nKen Research\n\nOctober 29, 2025 - 2 min read\n\n[India Sports Equipment Market]\n\n###### October 29, 2025 by Khushi Rastogi\n\n## Who\n\nA **leading **[**Indian manufacturer of sports equipment**][141], with a strong presence across\nmultiple product categories and nationwide distribution, sought to gain a deeper understanding of\nthe **sports equipment market landscape in India**. The company has long been recognized for its\nquality products, widespread usage in tournaments, and contribution to the growth of India\u2019s sports\ngoods industry.\n\n## What\n\nThe client wanted to **evaluate the market size, segmentation, and competitive positioning** within\nIndia\u2019s sports equipment industry. Despite its strong heritage and product range, the company faced\nincreasing competition from both local and international brands. They needed a fact-based assessment\nto identify **growth opportunities, market share trends**, and the **relative performance of their\nproducts** across categories such as fitness, outdoor, and indoor sports.\n\n## When\n\nThe engagement was conducted at a time when the [**Indian sports sector was expanding\nrapidly**][142], supported by government initiatives, growing fitness awareness, and the rising\ninfluence of organized sports leagues. As new entrants emerged and e-commerce reshaped consumer\nbuying behavior, the client wanted to align its strategy to sustain growth in this evolving\nenvironment.\n\n## Where\n\nThe project focused on **India**, covering both **urban and semi-urban regions**, where sports and\nfitness adoption trends were diversifying. The assessment included insights from **key manufacturing\nclusters, distribution networks**, and **retail channels**, both offline and online.\n\n## Why\n\nAlthough the company was a recognized brand in the market, it lacked **granular visibility into its\nmarket position** compared to competitors. Key challenges included:\n* Unclear segmentation across different sports categories.\n* Limited understanding of **sales distribution and pricing structures** of rival brands.\n* Absence of **comprehensive industry benchmarks** on performance metrics, revenue share, and\nregional presence.\n\nThese gaps made it difficult to formulate data-driven marketing and expansion strategies.\n\n## How\n\nKen Research executed a **multi-stage Market Intelligence and Competitive Analysis** framework\ncombining both **primary and secondary research** methods:\n\n### Market Assessment:\n\n### Competitive Landscape Study:\n\n### Future Market Projections:\n\n### Data Sources and Methodology:\n\n## Results and Impact\n* Ken Research\u2019s analysis provided **data-driven insights** that enabled the client to benchmark its\nperformance against major competitors.\n* The findings helped refine **product development and marketing strategies**, ensuring better\nalignment with fast-growing sports segments.\n* The study also guided the client in **optimizing expansion plans**, identifying new opportunities\nin underpenetrated product categories and regions.\n* Ultimately, the project enabled the client to **enhance its market positioning and\ncompetitiveness** in India\u2019s dynamic sports equipment market.\n\nA statement from the **Business Development Manager** summarized the value delivered:\n\n\u201c[**Ken Research**][143]\u2019s insights were instrumental in helping us refine our market strategy and\nidentify new growth avenues. Their detailed analysis of the sports equipment sector gave us a clear\nperspective on where we stand and how we can expand effectively.\u201d\n\nKen Research\u2019s market intelligence and competitor benchmarking study provided the client with\n**clarity, direction, and actionable insights** to navigate India\u2019s competitive sports equipment\nindustry. The engagement transformed strategic decision-making by identifying clear market gaps,\noptimizing pricing approaches, and driving long-term business growth.\n\n## Related tags\n\nSports Goods\n\nSports Equipments\n\nConsumer Products and Retail\n\n### Get started\n\nWe've helped companies around the world future-proof\ntheir businesses - and we can do the same for you.\n\nGet started\n\n[1]: /procurement-research\n[2]: /expert-panel\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /careers#leadership\n[5]: /careers\n[6]: /contact-us\n[7]: /terms-and-conditions#privacyPoli