[111]\n[Dossier 360][112]\n[Go To Market Strategy][113]\n[Paid Press Release][114]\n\n## Expertise & Services\n\n[Industry Speaks][115]\n[Terms & Conditions][116]\n[Privacy Policy][117]\n[Disclaimer][118]\n[FAQ's][119]\n[Site Map][120]\n[IT Support][121]\n[Website Issue][122]\n\n## How We Are Different?\n\n[Ken Research Vs. BCC Research][123]\n[Ken Research Vs. Euromonitor Int.][124]\n[Ken Research Vs. Nielsen][125]\n[Ken Research Vs. Marketsand Markets][126]\n[Ken Research Vs. McKinsey][127]\n[Ken Research Vs. Mordor][128]\n[Ken Research Vs. S&P Global][129]\n[Ken Research Vs. Grand View Research][130]\n[Ken Research Vs. Frost & Sullivan][131]\n\n## Company Overview\n\n## India\n\n[Unit 14, Tower B3, Spaze I Tech Business Park, Sohna Road, sector 49 Gurgaon, Haryana - 122001,\nIndia][132]\n\n## UAE\n\n[105, Al Jaz1b, Street no 2 the Greens Dubai United Arab Emirates][133]\n\n## Indonesia\n\n[The Icon BSD City, Jl. Verdant View IIIA No.15, Tangerang Regency, Province Banten-15345,\nIndonesia][134]\n\n## QATAR\n\n[Office no. 9, Building no. 171 Zone no. 42, Street no. 230, Al-Rehab Complex, C-Ring road,\nDoha][135]\n\nKen\n\nKen\n\nFor Sale Enquiries: +91-9015378249\n\n][136][\n\nankur.gupta@kenresearch.com\n\n][137]\n\nSubscribe to our Newsletter\n\nNever miss out on an update from us\n\nSubscribe\n[Terms & Conditions][138][Privacy Policy][139][Cookie Policy][140]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026, Ken Research Pvt. Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\nUAE Steel Manufacturer Achieves 55% Cost Reduction & Continuity\n\n# How a Leading UAE Steel Manufacturer Improved Operational Continuity and Reduced Expert Costs by\n# 55% During Lockdown\n\nKen Research\n\nOctober 30, 2025 - 2 min read\n\n[UAE steel industry]\n\n###### October 30, 2025 by Ananya Singh\n\n## Who\n\nA **major steel and building materials producer in the United Arab Emirates**, recognized for its\nlarge-scale operations and integrated facilities, sought external expertise to enhance its\n**operational efficiency and crisis response** during a challenging period. As a publicly listed\nentity under a major industrial conglomerate, the company faced complex demands in maintaining\nproduction, sales, and maintenance continuity amid unprecedented disruptions.\n(*Client identity withheld under NDA.*)\n\n## What\n\nThe client needed a reliable, on-ground, and remote **expert support system** to address\n**operational bottlenecks, maintenance challenges, and workforce coordination issues** across its\nproduction lines. During the COVID-19 lockdown, the company faced sudden performance slowdowns,\nincreased downtime risk, and a shortage of skilled on-site staff.\n\nTheir core challenges included:\n* Maintaining continuity in **blast furnace, steel making, and raw material handling systems**.\n* Ensuring **timely decision-making** in operations and maintenance functions.\n* Reducing **escalating expert engagement costs** amid limited mobility and supply chain\nconstraints.\n\n## When\n\nThe engagement took place during the **lockdown phase of 2020\u20132021**, when the steel industry\nglobally was facing delayed shipments, restricted on-site workforce access, and operational\nuncertainty. The company needed an immediate yet cost-effective expert deployment mechanism to\nsustain its production without compromising safety or efficiency.\n\n## Where\n\nThe engagement was executed in the **United Arab Emirates**, covering the client\u2019s **core steel\nproduction and handling facilities**. Experts were stationed both **on-site** and **remotely**,\nensuring continuity in monitoring, technical guidance, and decision-making support for critical\noperations.\n\n## Why\n\nWith restricted on-ground access and heightened pressure to sustain production levels, the company\nstruggled to find **industry-ready experts quickly** and at a **manageable cost**.\nEach day of downtime translated into significant production losses and potential contractual\npenalties. Traditional expert hiring models were **slow, expensive, and geographically\nconstrained**, which risked derailing the company\u2019s output and maintenance schedules.\n\nThey required a **scalable expert-on-demand model** capable of rapid response, virtual coordination,\nand specialized expertise deployment to manage crisis situations effectively.\n\n## How\n\nKen Research deployed its **On-Ground Expert Panel Program**, designed for **rapid, precision-based\nexpert matching** and cost optimization.\n\n**Approach & Execution:**\n* **Expert Onboarding & Support:** Deployed domain specialists across **Blast Furnace, Steel Making\nShop, Raw Material Handling, and Sales & Distribution**.\n* **Selection & Matching Process:** Screened and shortlisted **28 experts**, sharing the first\nconfirmed expert profile within **2 hours** to ensure zero downtime.\n* **Immediate Turnaround Tasks:** Organized **workshops, virtual consultations, and training\nsessions** to address urgent performance issues and modify Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs).\n* **Rapid Response Operations:** When an operational breakdown occurred at the **Blast Furnace\nplant**, the expert travelled **interstate and reached on-site within 8 hours**, ensuring\nimmediate resumption of activities.\n\nKen Research\u2019s integrated expert database and fast-track screening model minimized response time\nwhile maintaining quality assurance in technical support.\n\n## Results & Impact\n* **55% cost savings** (~INR 70 lakhs) in expert engagement and deployment costs over 12 months.\n* **90% conversion rate** between shared and finalized expert profiles, reflecting strong alignment\nwith client requirements.\n* **8 critical incidents** managed effectively, including a major plant disruption resolved within\nhours, avoiding prolonged downtime.\n* Enhanced **operational continuity** and **performance efficiency**, even under restricted working\nconditions.\n\nKen Research\u2019s rapid-response expert engagement program allowed the client to sustain operations,\ncut costs, and reduce downtime during one of the most operationally challenging periods in the steel\nindustry. By combining **on-site agility with virtual expertise**, the solution redefined how\nindustrial players manage real-time crises with speed and precision.\n\n## Related tags\n\nSteel\n\nConstruction Materials\n\nManufacturing and Construction\n\n### Get started\n\nWe've helped companies around the world future-proof\ntheir businesses - and we can do the same for you.\n\nGet started\n\n[1]: /procurement-research\n[2]: /expert-panel\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /careers#leadership\n[5]: /careers\n[6]: /contact-us\n[7]: /terms-and-conditions#privacyPolicy\n[8]: /\n[9]: /report-store\n[10]: /report-store\n[11]: /report-store#Segements\n[12]: /report-store#beseSellingReports\n[13]: /report-store#latestInsights\n[14]: /report-store\n[15]: /report-store?reportTypes=global-market-research-reports\n[16]: /country-reports\n[17]: /report-store?reportTypes=competition_benchmarking\n[18]: /custom-form\n[19]: /talk-to-us\n[20]: /report-store\n[21]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market\n[22]: /report-store?industry=automotive-transportation-and-warehousing-market\n[23]: /report-store?industry=banking-financial-services-and-insurance-market\n[24]: /report-store?industry=consumer-products-and-retail-market\n[25]: /report-store?industry=defense-and-security-market\n[26]: /report-store?industry=education-and-recruitment-market\n[27]: /report-store?industry=energy-and-utilities-market\n[28]: /report-store?industry=food-beverage-and-tobacco-market\n[29]: /report-store?industry=healthcare-market\n[30]: /report-store?industry=metal-mining-and-chemicals-market\n[31]: /report-store?industry=manufacturing-and-construction-market\n[32]: /report-store?industry=media-and-entertainment-market\n[33]: /report-store?industry=public-sector-and-administration-market\n[34]: /report-store?industry=technology-and-telecom-market\n[35]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=agriculture-chemical\n[36]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=fertilizer\n[37]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=protected-cultivation\n[38]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=net-wrap\n[39]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=agricultural-implements-and-equip\nments\n[40]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=combine-harvesters\n[41]: /"
