[111]\n[Dossier 360][112]\n[Go To Market Strategy][113]\n[Paid Press Release][114]\n\n## Expertise & Services\n\n[Industry Speaks][115]\n[Terms & Conditions][116]\n[Privacy Policy][117]\n[Disclaimer][118]\n[FAQ's][119]\n[Site Map][120]\n[IT Support][121]\n[Website Issue][122]\n\n## How We Are Different?\n\n[Ken Research Vs. BCC Research][123]\n[Ken Research Vs. Euromonitor Int.][124]\n[Ken Research Vs. Nielsen][125]\n[Ken Research Vs. Marketsand Markets][126]\n[Ken Research Vs. McKinsey][127]\n[Ken Research Vs. Mordor][128]\n[Ken Research Vs. S&P Global][129]\n[Ken Research Vs. Grand View Research][130]\n[Ken Research Vs. Frost & Sullivan][131]\n\n## Company Overview\n\n## India\n\n[Unit 14, Tower B3, Spaze I Tech Business Park, Sohna Road, sector 49 Gurgaon, Haryana - 122001,\nIndia][132]\n\n## UAE\n\n[105, Al Jaz1b, Street no 2 the Greens Dubai United Arab Emirates][133]\n\n## Indonesia\n\n[The Icon BSD City, Jl. Verdant View IIIA No.15, Tangerang Regency, Province Banten-15345,\nIndonesia][134]\n\n## QATAR\n\n[Office no. 9, Building no. 171 Zone no. 42, Street no. 230, Al-Rehab Complex, C-Ring road,\nDoha][135]\n\nKen\n\nKen\n\nFor Sale Enquiries: +91-9015378249\n\n][136][\n\nankur.gupta@kenresearch.com\n\n][137]\n\nSubscribe to our Newsletter\n\nNever miss out on an update from us\n\nSubscribe\n[Terms & Conditions][138][Privacy Policy][139][Cookie Policy][140]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026, Ken Research Pvt. Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\nHow India Skill Council Transformed Vocational Training\n\n# How a National Skill Council Revamped India\u2019s Vocational Training Landscape through Data-Driven\n# Insights\n\nKen Research\n\nOctober 30, 2025 - 2 min read\n\n[India Vocational Training Market]\n\n###### October 30, 2025 by Ananya Singh\n\n## Who\n\nA leading national skill development council representing the **rubber, chemical, and petrochemical\nindustries** sought to strengthen the impact of its vocational training ecosystem. The council works\nclosely with industry bodies, training institutions, and policymakers to design standards, bridge\nemployability gaps, and ensure that the workforce is aligned with the evolving needs of Indian\nmanufacturing and allied sectors.\n(*Client identity withheld under NDA.*)\n\n## What\n\nThe council faced persistent **skill mismatches** between training outcomes and industry\nexpectations. While training centres operated nationwide, many lacked updated curricula aligned with\nemerging technologies like **digital manufacturing, process automation, and sustainable\nproduction**. Moreover, enrolment stagnation and limited job placement success indicated that the\ntraining ecosystem wasn\u2019t adequately responding to real-time labour market dynamics.\n\n## When\n\nThe engagement began during a period of **post-pandemic industrial recovery**, when India\u2019s\nmanufacturing and chemical sectors were recalibrating their workforce requirements. The need for an\nevidence-backed strategy to realign vocational training became critical to meet the rising demand\nfor skilled labor and achieve the government\u2019s **Skill India 2025** objectives.\n\n## Where\n\nThe project was executed **pan-India**, with focused assessments across major industrial clusters,\nincluding **Maharashtra, Gujarat, Tamil Nadu, and Uttar Pradesh**. Over **150 training centres** and\n**5,000 industrial units** participated, offering comprehensive regional insights into training\neffectiveness, skill utilization, and employability readiness.\n\n## Why\n\nThe council identified that **outdated training programs and fragmented stakeholder feedback** were\nleading to inefficiencies in skill delivery. Employers reported low job-readiness among graduates,\nwhile trainees expressed dissatisfaction with the curriculum\u2019s relevance. Without a structured\nmechanism to measure and respond to these gaps, the council risked diminishing credibility and\ndeclining enrolment\u2014threatening the sustainability of its nationwide training initiatives.\n\n## How\n\n[**Ken Research**][141] designed and executed a **multi-layered Skill Gap Assessment and Voice of\nCustomer (VoC) Survey** covering training centres, employers, and trainees.\n\nThe methodology involved:\n* **VoC Survey** with 5,000+ industrial units to understand expectations, satisfaction, and evolving\ncompetency needs.\n* **Skill Council Effectiveness Review** across 150+ training centres to evaluate reach, enrolment\npatterns, and placement outcomes.\n* **Gap Analysis Framework** to identify outdated modules, benchmark training standards, and\nrecommend curriculum redesign priorities.\n* **Advanced Data Analytics** to quantify linkages between skill training investments and job\nplacement outcomes, ensuring decisions were evidence-based.\n\nKen Research synthesized findings into **actionable strategies**\u2014prioritizing curriculum\nmodernization, industry-led apprenticeships, and data-driven monitoring systems to measure progress\nover time.\n\n## Results & Impact\n* **~20% improvement** in curriculum relevance across 30+ training centres through updates aligned\nwith current industrial standards.\n* **10% increase** in new enrolments\u2014equivalent to over **5,000 additional students** in the\nfollowing academic cycle.\n* **~15% projected growth** in job placement rates within six months post-implementation.\n* Enhanced stakeholder confidence and stronger industry-academia collaboration, leading to a\nmeasurable rise in employability outcomes.\n\nBy transforming stakeholder feedback into quantifiable action, the council evolved from a training\nfacilitator into a **data-driven workforce enabler**. The initiative not only improved program\nefficiency but also laid a replicable model for **sector-wide skill development reforms** across\nIndia\u2019s industrial landscape\n\n## Related tags\n\nVocational Education\n\nChemicals\n\nEducation and Recruitment\n\n### Get started\n\nWe've helped companies around the world future-proof\ntheir businesses - and we can do the same for you.\n\nGet started\n\n[1]: /procurement-research\n[2]: /expert-panel\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /careers#leadership\n[5]: /careers\n[6]: /contact-us\n[7]: /terms-and-conditions#privacyPolicy\n[8]: /\n[9]: /report-store\n[10]: /report-store\n[11]: /report-store#Segements\n[12]: /report-store#beseSellingReports\n[13]: /report-store#latestInsights\n[14]: /report-store\n[15]: /report-store?reportTypes=global-market-research-reports\n[16]: /country-reports\n[17]: /report-store?reportTypes=competition_benchmarking\n[18]: /custom-form\n[19]: /talk-to-us\n[20]: /report-store\n[21]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market\n[22]: /report-store?industry=automotive-transportation-and-warehousing-market\n[23]: /report-store?industry=banking-financial-services-and-insurance-market\n[24]: /report-store?industry=consumer-products-and-retail-market\n[25]: /report-store?industry=defense-and-security-market\n[26]: /report-store?industry=education-and-recruitment-market\n[27]: /report-store?industry=energy-and-utilities-market\n[28]: /report-store?industry=food-beverage-and-tobacco-market\n[29]: /report-store?industry=healthcare-market\n[30]: /report-store?industry=metal-mining-and-chemicals-market\n[31]: /report-store?industry=manufacturing-and-construction-market\n[32]: /report-store?industry=media-and-entertainment-market\n[33]: /report-store?industry=public-sector-and-administration-market\n[34]: /report-store?industry=technology-and-telecom-market\n[35]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=agriculture-chemical\n[36]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=fertilizer\n[37]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=protected-cultivation\n[38]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=net-wrap\n[39]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=agricultural-implements-and-equip\nments\n[40]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=combine-harvesters\n[41]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=tillers\n[42]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=hybrid-seed\n[43]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=pest-and-disease-control-solution\n[44]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=tractors\n[45]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=combine-harvesters\n[46]: /report-store?industry=agriculture"
