[111]\n[Dossier 360][112]\n[Go To Market Strategy][113]\n[Paid Press Release][114]\n\n## Expertise & Services\n\n[Industry Speaks][115]\n[Terms & Conditions][116]\n[Privacy Policy][117]\n[Disclaimer][118]\n[FAQ's][119]\n[Site Map][120]\n[IT Support][121]\n[Website Issue][122]\n\n## How We Are Different?\n\n[Ken Research Vs. BCC Research][123]\n[Ken Research Vs. Euromonitor Int.][124]\n[Ken Research Vs. Nielsen][125]\n[Ken Research Vs. Marketsand Markets][126]\n[Ken Research Vs. McKinsey][127]\n[Ken Research Vs. Mordor][128]\n[Ken Research Vs. S&P Global][129]\n[Ken Research Vs. Grand View Research][130]\n[Ken Research Vs. Frost & Sullivan][131]\n\n## Company Overview\n\n## India\n\n[Unit 14, Tower B3, Spaze I Tech Business Park, Sohna Road, sector 49 Gurgaon, Haryana - 122001,\nIndia][132]\n\n## UAE\n\n[105, Al Jaz1b, Street no 2 the Greens Dubai United Arab Emirates][133]\n\n## Indonesia\n\n[The Icon BSD City, Jl. Verdant View IIIA No.15, Tangerang Regency, Province Banten-15345,\nIndonesia][134]\n\n## QATAR\n\n[Office no. 9, Building no. 171 Zone no. 42, Street no. 230, Al-Rehab Complex, C-Ring road,\nDoha][135]\n\nKen\n\nKen\n\nFor Sale Enquiries: +91-9015378249\n\n][136][\n\nankur.gupta@kenresearch.com\n\n][137]\n\nSubscribe to our Newsletter\n\nNever miss out on an update from us\n\nSubscribe\n[Terms & Conditions][138][Privacy Policy][139][Cookie Policy][140]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026, Ken Research Pvt. Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\nIndia Off-Road Vehicle Market 2025: OEM Landscape, Segmentation, and Growth Insights\n\n# How a Global Industrial Conglomerate Evaluated Growth Opportunities in India\u2019s Off-Road Vehicle\n# Market\n\nKen Research\n\nOctober 29, 2025 - 2 min read\n\n[India off-road vehicle market]\n\n###### October 29, 2025 by Ananya Singh\n\n## Who\n\nA **leading global industrial and consumer goods conglomerate headquartered in Germany** sought to\nexpand its footprint in India\u2019s high-growth [**off-road vehicle segment**][141]. With a diverse\nportfolio spanning **adhesive technologies, beauty care, and home care**, the company is known for\nits innovation-driven and sustainability-focused operations. The study was commissioned by the\n**Category Head** to guide strategic decisions on product applications and partnerships in India\u2019s\nmobility ecosystem.\n\n## What\n\nThe client aimed to **quantify the market size and segmentation** of India\u2019s **off-road vehicle\nindustry** and to **identify potential OEMs, distributors, and aftermarket suppliers** aligned with\nits technology and product portfolio. Despite global expertise in industrial solutions, the company\nlacked clarity on the Indian off-road segment\u2019s structure, growth drivers, and channel dynamics.\n\n## When\n\nThe engagement took place amid India\u2019s rapid infrastructure expansion and mechanization phase, when\n**agriculture, construction, and defence sectors** were witnessing increasing adoption of off-road\nvehicles (tractors, ATVs, loaders, etc.). Timely intelligence was crucial for the client\u2019s\nFY2024\u20132025 investment roadmap.\n\n## Where\n\nThe study focused exclusively on **India**, one of the fastest-growing off-road vehicle markets in\nAsia. It evaluated regional demand centres, OEM clusters, and distribution footprints across Tier-1\nand Tier-2 cities.\n\n## Why\n\nWhile India\u2019s [**off-road vehicle ecosystem**][142] offers significant opportunities, it remains\n**fragmented**, with **limited visibility across application sub-segments** (agriculture, sports,\ndefence) and **a wide variance in distribution models**. The client needed **a fact-based\nframework** to benchmark competitors, assess manufacturing capacities, and uncover **white-space\nopportunities** that could be leveraged through B2B partnerships.\n\n## How\n\nKen Research executed a **two-tiered research program**:\n\n### 1. Secondary Research\n* Reviewed **company websites, industry reports, annual filings, and trade articles** to establish\nmarket baselines.\n* Mapped 50+ active players across OEMs, dealers, and component suppliers.\n\n### 2. Primary Research\n* Conducted **structured interviews** with:\n* **Manufacturers (5+)**\n* **Dealers and Distributors (10+)**\n* **Aftermarket suppliers (10+)**\n* Collected insights on **vehicle types, production capacities, SKU portfolios, distribution\nmodels**, and **after-sales infrastructure**.\n\n### 3. Analytical Framework\n* Segmented the market by **vehicle type, application, and end-use sector**.\n* Benchmarked **competition intensity**, **capacity utilization**, and **innovation trends**\n(electric, hybrid, and compact off-road models).\n* Assessed **policy and regulatory factors** influencing adoption.\n\n## Results & Impact\n\n[**Ken Research**][143] delivered:\n* A **comprehensive market size and opportunity matrix** across agriculture, defense, and\nrecreational off-road segments.\n* A **quantifiable evaluation of competitor positioning** and market share potential.\n* Clear identification of **white-space opportunities** where the client\u2019s industrial adhesives and\nsurface technologies could be integrated into OEM and aftermarket supply chains.\n\nArmed with this analysis, the client **revised its India entry strategy**, prioritizing high-growth\napplication clusters and aligning product development with identified partners.\n\nKen Research\u2019s integrated market intelligence enabled the client to translate fragmented data into\nactionable strategy\u2014bridging the gap between **market potential** and **commercial execution** in\nIndia\u2019s evolving off-road vehicle space.\n\n## Related tags\n\nAutomobiles\n\nAutomotive and Automotive Components\n\nAutomotive, Transportation and Warehousing\n\n### Get started\n\nWe've helped companies around the world future-proof\ntheir businesses - and we can do the same for you.\n\nGet started\n\n[1]: /procurement-research\n[2]: /expert-panel\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /careers#leadership\n[5]: /careers\n[6]: /contact-us\n[7]: /terms-and-conditions#privacyPolicy\n[8]: /\n[9]: /report-store\n[10]: /report-store\n[11]: /report-store#Segements\n[12]: /report-store#beseSellingReports\n[13]: /report-store#latestInsights\n[14]: /report-store\n[15]: /report-store?reportTypes=global-market-research-reports\n[16]: /country-reports\n[17]: /report-store?reportTypes=competition_benchmarking\n[18]: /custom-form\n[19]: /talk-to-us\n[20]: /report-store\n[21]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market\n[22]: /report-store?industry=automotive-transportation-and-warehousing-market\n[23]: /report-store?industry=banking-financial-services-and-insurance-market\n[24]: /report-store?industry=consumer-products-and-retail-market\n[25]: /report-store?industry=defense-and-security-market\n[26]: /report-store?industry=education-and-recruitment-market\n[27]: /report-store?industry=energy-and-utilities-market\n[28]: /report-store?industry=food-beverage-and-tobacco-market\n[29]: /report-store?industry=healthcare-market\n[30]: /report-store?industry=metal-mining-and-chemicals-market\n[31]: /report-store?industry=manufacturing-and-construction-market\n[32]: /report-store?industry=media-and-entertainment-market\n[33]: /report-store?industry=public-sector-and-administration-market\n[34]: /report-store?industry=technology-and-telecom-market\n[35]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=agriculture-chemical\n[36]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=fertilizer\n[37]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=protected-cultivation\n[38]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=net-wrap\n[39]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=agricultural-implements-and-equip\nments\n[40]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=combine-harvesters\n[41]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=tillers\n[42]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-car