[111]\n[Dossier 360][112]\n[Go To Market Strategy][113]\n[Paid Press Release][114]\n\n## Expertise & Services\n\n[Industry Speaks][115]\n[Terms & Conditions][116]\n[Privacy Policy][117]\n[Disclaimer][118]\n[FAQ's][119]\n[Site Map][120]\n[IT Support][121]\n[Website Issue][122]\n\n## How We Are Different?\n\n[Ken Research Vs. BCC Research][123]\n[Ken Research Vs. Euromonitor Int.][124]\n[Ken Research Vs. Nielsen][125]\n[Ken Research Vs. Marketsand Markets][126]\n[Ken Research Vs. McKinsey][127]\n[Ken Research Vs. Mordor][128]\n[Ken Research Vs. S&P Global][129]\n[Ken Research Vs. Grand View Research][130]\n[Ken Research Vs. Frost & Sullivan][131]\n\n## Company Overview\n\n## India\n\n[Unit 14, Tower B3, Spaze I Tech Business Park, Sohna Road, sector 49 Gurgaon, Haryana - 122001,\nIndia][132]\n\n## UAE\n\n[105, Al Jaz1b, Street no 2 the Greens Dubai United Arab Emirates][133]\n\n## Indonesia\n\n[The Icon BSD City, Jl. Verdant View IIIA No.15, Tangerang Regency, Province Banten-15345,\nIndonesia][134]\n\n## QATAR\n\n[Office no. 9, Building no. 171 Zone no. 42, Street no. 230, Al-Rehab Complex, C-Ring road,\nDoha][135]\n\nKen\n\nKen\n\nFor Sale Enquiries: +91-9015378249\n\n][136][\n\nankur.gupta@kenresearch.com\n\n][137]\n\nSubscribe to our Newsletter\n\nNever miss out on an update from us\n\nSubscribe\n[Terms & Conditions][138][Privacy Policy][139][Cookie Policy][140]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026, Ken Research Pvt. Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\nHow Ken Research Boosted IPO Readiness for an Asian Manufacturing Firm\n\n# How a Leading Asian Manufacturing Firm Strengthened Governance and Investor Confidence Ahead of\n# IPO\n\nKen Research\n\nOctober 21, 2025 - 2 min read\n\n[Furnishing Industry]\n\n###### October 21, 2025 by Ananya Singh\n\n## Client Background\n\nA diversified **USD 3.2 Bn industrial conglomerate** with operations across 10+ Asian markets was\npreparing for a **USD 1.5 Bn IPO** to fund capacity expansion and entry into sustainable\ninfrastructure manufacturing. The company had grown steadily at a **5-year CAGR of 11%**, but faced\n**valuation discounts, governance gaps, and investor skepticism**, limiting its ability to achieve\nthe desired IPO pricing and oversubscription levels.\n\n## Business Challenge\n\n[IPO Risks in Furnishing Market]IPO Risks in Furnishing Market\n* **Valuation Discount:** The company traded at **9.8x EV/EBITDA**, nearly **20% lower** than global\npeers (12x).\n* **Governance Weakness:** Only **36% independent directors** on its board, below SEBI\u2019s 50%\nmandate.\n* **Disclosure Gaps:** Limited segmental and ESG reporting, creating concerns about transparency.\n* **Investor Skepticism:** Pre-IPO investor surveys showed **62% questioned export scalability**,\nwhile **54% flagged compliance readiness**.\nIf unresolved, these issues risked reducing IPO fundraising potential by **USD 250\u2013300 Mn**.\n\n## Strategic Questions\n1. How could the company **bridge valuation gaps** and align with global benchmarks?\n2. What **growth story** would resonate with Tier-1 global investors?\n3. How should **governance and compliance gaps** be resolved to ensure SEBI/SGX readiness?\n4. What **investor positioning insights** were critical to secure strong roadshow traction?\n\n[Contact Us ][141]\n\n## Ken Research\u2019s Intervention\n* **Peer Benchmarking:** Analyzed **15 recent global IPOs** in industrial manufacturing to identify\noperational gaps and margin expansion opportunities worth **220 bps EBITDA improvement**.\n* **Market Validation:** Sized a **USD 20 Bn APAC sustainable manufacturing opportunity**, showing\nclient\u2019s potential to capture **USD 1.2 Bn incremental revenues by 2028**.\n* **Governance Transformation:** Increased board independence from **36% to 55%**, closed **25+\ncompliance gaps**, and aligned disclosures with SEBI and SGX requirements.\n* **Investor Perception Study:** Engaged **20+ institutional investors** (USD 500 Bn+ AUM) to test\nIPO messaging; refined equity story to emphasize ESG, ROIC improvement, and capital-light\nexpansion.\n* **IPO Readiness Pack:** Delivered SEBI-compliant industry assessments, valuation models, and\ninvestor FAQs integrated into DRHP and roadshow materials.\n\n## Outcomes & Impact\n* **15% Valuation Uplift:** EV/EBITDA improved from **9.8x to 11.3x** pre-IPO.\n* **Oversubscription Achieved:** IPO oversubscribed **2.6x**, led by Tier-1 funds across US, EU, and\nAsia.\n* **Full Compliance:** **30+ governance and disclosure gaps** resolved, ensuring regulatory\napproval.\n* **Expanded Investor Base:** **40% increase in coverage**, with 12 new global institutions\nparticipating.\n* **Post-Listing Performance:** Stock traded **12% above IPO price** in the first quarter,\nconfirming investor confidence.\n\nKen Research\u2019s IPO advisory enabled the client to **bridge valuation gaps, strengthen governance,\nand deliver an investor-ready equity story**. The result was a **successful USD 1.5 Bn IPO** that\nnot only achieved its fundraising objectives but also established the company as a credible,\nglobally competitive industrial player.\n\n*Client identity withheld under NDA.*\n\n## Related tags\n\nHome and Office Furnishings\n\n### Get started\n\nWe've helped companies around the world future-proof\ntheir businesses - and we can do the same for you.\n\nGet started\n\n[1]: /procurement-research\n[2]: /expert-panel\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /careers#leadership\n[5]: /careers\n[6]: /contact-us\n[7]: /terms-and-conditions#privacyPolicy\n[8]: /\n[9]: /report-store\n[10]: /report-store\n[11]: /report-store#Segements\n[12]: /report-store#beseSellingReports\n[13]: /report-store#latestInsights\n[14]: /report-store\n[15]: /report-store?reportTypes=global-market-research-reports\n[16]: /country-reports\n[17]: /report-store?reportTypes=competition_benchmarking\n[18]: /custom-form\n[19]: /talk-to-us\n[20]: /report-store\n[21]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market\n[22]: /report-store?industry=automotive-transportation-and-warehousing-market\n[23]: /report-store?industry=banking-financial-services-and-insurance-market\n[24]: /report-store?industry=consumer-products-and-retail-market\n[25]: /report-store?industry=defense-and-security-market\n[26]: /report-store?industry=education-and-recruitment-market\n[27]: /report-store?industry=energy-and-utilities-market\n[28]: /report-store?industry=food-beverage-and-tobacco-market\n[29]: /report-store?industry=healthcare-market\n[30]: /report-store?industry=metal-mining-and-chemicals-market\n[31]: /report-store?industry=manufacturing-and-construction-market\n[32]: /report-store?industry=media-and-entertainment-market\n[33]: /report-store?industry=public-sector-and-administration-market\n[34]: /report-store?industry=technology-and-telecom-market\n[35]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=agriculture-chemical\n[36]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=fertilizer\n[37]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=protected-cultivation\n[38]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=net-wrap\n[39]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=agricultural-implements-and-equip\nments\n[40]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=combine-harvesters\n[41]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=tillers\n[42]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=hybrid-seed\n[43]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=pest-and-disease-control-solution\n[44]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=tractors\n[45]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=combine-harvesters\n[46]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=conventional-seed\n[47]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market&topics=farm-automation-industry\n[48]: /report-store?industry=agriculture-animal-care-market\n[49]: /report-sto