 Impact\n][59][\nArticles\n][60][\nPerspective\n][61]\nQUICK ACCESS[\nExplore SurveysBrowse all templates\n][62][\nCustom SurveyTailored Research\n][63]\nNeed help choosing?\n\nOur research team can recommend the right approach.\n\n[Talk to an expert ][64]\n[Consulting][65]\nCAPABILITIES\nStrategy Consulting\n][66][\nDeals & IPO Advisory\n][67]\nSTRATEGY CONSULTING\n[Market Entry][68]\n[Market Penetration][69]\n[Product Strategy][70]\n[Startup Acceleration Strategy][71]\nPUBLICATIONS\nClient Impact\n][72][\nDeal Spotlight\n][73][\nArticles\n][74][\nPerspective\n][75]\nGET IN TOUCH\n[Talk to Consultant][76]\nFEATURED\nCASE STUDY\nIsrael Logistics Market\n\nDiscover the growth opportunities in Israel's road freight and warehousing market\n\n[Read more ][77]\n[Request on demand][78]\nInsights\nBROWSE\nBy Industry\nFeatured\nBY INDUSTRY\n[Agriculture & Animal Care][79]\n[Automotive, Transportation & Warehousing][80]\n[BFSI][81]\n[Consumer Products & Retail][82]\n[Defense & Security][83]\n[Education & Recruitment][84]\n[Energy & Utilities][85]\n[Food, Beverage & Tobacco][86]\n[Healthcare][87]\n[Metal, Mining and Chemicals][88]\n[Manufacturing & Construction][89]\n[Media & Entertainment][90]\n[Public Sector and Administration][91]\n[Technology & Telecom][92]\nPUBLICATIONS\nArticles\n][93][\nCase studies\n][94][\nPerspective\n][95][\nBlogs\n][96]\nFEATURED\nLATEST\nMarket Penetration Strategy for Al-Dawaa in the KSA Retail Pharmacy Market\n\nExplore Al-Dawaa\u2019s strategy in the KSA retail pharmacy market\n\n[Read more ][97]\nSubscribe to Updates\nSearch\n[Book discovery call][98]\n[Book discovery call][99]\n\nWelcome\n\nAccess your account\n\nSign inExisting account\nSign upCreate free account\n\n# Leading the Future\n\n## of Market Intelligence & Consulting\n\nKen Research, a market intelligence leader since 2011, has delivered over 15,000 reports and 10,000\nprojects.\n\nWe empower businesses across industries, with 70% of our clients from the Fortune 2000, ensuring\ntailored solutions and high satisfaction.\n\n[ Book a Discovery Call][100]\n\n### What We Believe\n\nAt Ken Research, our clients come first. Since 2011, we have empowered businesses with high-quality\ninsights for lasting success.\n\nOur global team of experts collaborates with clients to address unique challenges, offering reliable\nsolutions across sectors like healthcare, finance, and technology. We prioritize integrity,\ntransparency, and dedication, ensuring excellence in every project.\n\nWe measure our success by our clients' success, consistently delivering precise research that drives\ncompetitive advantage. Our commitment to quality and client satisfaction makes us a trusted partner\nworldwide.\n\n## A Global\n## Consulting Firm\n\nOur Journey of Excellence, Achievements, and Impact\n* Founded in2011\n* Served clients2000+\n* Reports Delivered15,000+\n* Client from Fortune\n2000 companies70%\n* Industries Served340+\n\n### Our Mission\n\nTo help ambitious change-makers define the future, making a meaningful impact by fostering trust and\nconfidence with our services to drive distinctive, lasting improvements and to build the\norganizations of tomorrow.\n\n[/OurMission.png]\n\n### Our Capabilities\n\nAt Ken Research, we specialize in providing comprehensive market research services and strategic\nconsulting to maximize revenue growth and competitive advantage. We utilize our deep industry\nknowledge and data-driven insights to deliver solutions that meet our clients' unique needs and\nchallenges.\n\n[https://kenresearch.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/next_assets/public/weBelieve.png][https://kenresear\nch.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/next_assets/public/weBelieve.png]\n[https://kenresearch.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/next_assets/public/weBelieve.png]\n[https://kenresearch.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/next_assets/public/weBelieve.png]\n[https://kenresearch.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/next_assets/public/weBelieve.png]\n* ### Strategy Consulting\n\nOur strategy consulting guides companies through disruption with creative solutions and expert\nadvice, helping you achieve long-term growth and success.\n* ### M&A / Deals\n\nExpert M&A consulting guiding you from strategic planning to seamless integration for optimal\ngrowth and value.\n* ### Economic Consulting\n\nCapitalize on expert economic analysis to empower strategic financial decisions and market\npositioning. Our consultants provide deep insights for effective financial planning.\n* ### Organizational Consulting\n\nImprove your organizational efficiency and growth potential with our expert advice. We align your\nstructure with market demands to deliver value, optimizing your operations for peak performance.\n* ### Digital Transformation\n\nExpertly bring your business into the digital age. We simplify technology, making it easy and\naccessible, and help you improve every aspect of your operations for a digital-first world.\n* ### Business Optimization\n\nIncrease efficiency and productivity across your business with our expert business optimization\nsolutions. Adapted to your core processes, our strategies ensure profitability and streamlined\noperations.\n* ### Supply Chain Management\n\nExpertly streamline your supply chain with our guidance. Enhance flexibility, reduce costs, and\nimprove service levels in real-time to achieve a more resilient and efficient supply network.\n* ### Brand Consulting\n\nCraft a powerful brand identity with our expert strategic insights. Stand out from the competition\nand resonate with your target audience through our innovative branding strategies.\n* ### Industry Networking\n\nExpand your professional landscape with expert networking solutions. Connect, collaborate, and\ncreate opportunities with key industry players through our exclusive networking services.\n\n### Our True North Star\n\nExcellence in Every Insight, Unity in Every Effort. Your Success,\n* ## 95%\n\n### Client satisfaction\n\n#### Precision and Reliability:\n\nOur methodologies have ensured 95% client satisfaction with the accuracy and dependability of our\ninsights.\n* ## 500+\n\n### Seasoned analysts\n\n#### One Team:\n\nWith over 500 seasoned analysts, our team delivers thorough and actionable research, recognized\nfor excellence with numerous industry awards.\n* ## 90%\n\n### Client retention rate\n\n#### Client-First Approach:\n\nYour success is our priority, with personalized solutions and continuous support driving a 90%\nclient retention rate.\n* ## 70+\n\n### Market relevance\n\n#### Global Reach, Local Expertise:\n\nOperating in 70+ countries, we combine global reach with local expertise, ensuring 98% market\nrelevance and real impact.\n\n## Industries We Serve\n\n### Tailored Solutions for 14 Diverse Sectors\n\nExplore our expertise across various industries, delivering insights and strategies that drive\nsuccess.\n* [Agriculture and Animal Care][Agriculture and Animal Care][101]\n* [Automotive, Transportation and Warehousing][Automotive, Transportation and Warehousing][102]\n* [Banking Financial Services and Insurance][Banking Financial Services and Insurance][103]\n* [Consumer Products and Retail][Consumer Products and Retail][104]\n* [Defense and Security][Defense and Security][105]\n* [Education and Recruitment][Education and Recruitment][106]\n* [Energy and Utilities][Energy and Utilities][107]\n* [Food, Beverage and Tobacco][Food, Beverage and Tobacco][108]\n\n[ Explore More Industries][109]\n\nMeet Our Leadership Team\n\nMeet the visionary leaders behind our success stories, where strategy and expertise come together to\ndrive our mission and inspire real-world impact, fostering an environment of innovation.\n\nFounder & Director\n\nAnkur Gupta\n\nFounder & Director\n\nNamit Goel\n\nChief Digital Officer\n\nAvdhesh Singh\n\nAVP Consulting\n\nHarsh Saxena\n\nAVP Research\n\nPranav Mangla\n\nHead of HR\n\nApurva\n\n## About Ken Research\n\n[Home][110]\n[About Us][111]\n[Services][112]\n[Categories][113]\n[News][114]\n[Careers][115]\n[Contact Us][116]\n\n## Resources\n\n[Blogs][117]\n[Industry Reports][118]\n[Company Research Reports][119]\n[Country Research Reports][120]\n[Bundle Reports][121]\n[Dossier 360][122]\n[Go To Market Strategy][123]\n[Paid Press Release][124]\n\n## Expertise & Services\n\n[Industry Speaks][125]\n[Terms & Conditions][126]\n[Privacy Policy][127]\n[Disclaimer][128]\n[FAQ's][129]\n[Site Map][130]\n[IT Support][131]\n[Website Issue][132]\n\n## How We Are Different?\n\n[Ken Research Vs. BCC Research][133]\n[Ken Research Vs. Euromonitor Int.][134]\n[Ken Research Vs. Nielsen][135]\n[Ken Research Vs. Marketsand Markets][136]\n[Ken Research Vs. McKinsey][137]\n[Ken Research Vs. Mordor][138]\n[Ken Research Vs. S&P Global][139]\n[Ken Research Vs. Grand View Research][140]\n[Ken Research Vs. Frost & Sullivan][141]\n\n## Company Overview\n\n## India\n\n[Unit 14, Tower B3, Spaze I Tech Business Park, Sohna Road, sector 49 Gurgaon, Haryana - 122001,\nIndia][142]\n\n## UAE\n\n[105, Al Jaz1b, Street no 2 the Greens Dubai United Arab Emirates][143]\n\n## Indonesia\n\n[The Icon BSD City, Jl. Verdant View IIIA No.15, Tangerang Regency, Province Banten-15345,\nIndonesia][144]\n\n## QATAR\n\n[Office no. 9, Building no. 171 Zone no. 42, Street no. 230, Al-Rehab Complex, C-Ring road,\nDoha][145]\n\nKen\n\nKen\n\nFor Sale Enquiries: +91-9015378249\n\n][146][\n\nankur.gupta@kenresearch.com\n\n][147]\n\nSubscribe to our Newsletter\n\nNever miss out on an update from us\n\nSubscribe\n[Terms & Conditions][148][Privacy Policy][149][Cookie Policy][150]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026, Ken Research Pvt. Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\n# Leading the Future\n\n## of Market Intelligence & Consulting\n\n[1]: /procurement-research\n[2]: /expert-panel\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /careers#leadership\n[5]: /careers\n[6]: /contact-us\n[7]: /terms-and-conditions#privacyPolicy\n[8]: /\n[9]: /report-store\n[10]: /report-store\n[11]: /report-store#Segements\n[12]: /report-store#beseSellingReports\n[13]: /repor