\n* [Blog][147]\n* [Customer Stories][148]\n* [Reports & Insights][149]\n* [Webinars][150]\n* [Events][151]\n* [About Us][152]\n* [Our Data][153]\n* [Investor Relations][154]\n* [Top Holiday 2026 Shopper Trends][155]\n* [Contact sales][156]\n* [Start free trial][157]\nNow live[tag icon]\nAI created more apps than ever, but 75% won't make it. Find out how to win. [Download the\nreport[banner icon]][158]\n* [Home][159]\n* Company Profile Checker\n\n# Company Profile Analytics\n\nAnalyze any company\u2019s market, audience, and digital footprints\n\nAnalyze Company\n\nPopular now: Google, Facebook, Tesla\n\n## Check any company\u2019s performance and digital market share\n\nSee any company\u2019s latest stock data, revenue, and traffic & engagement data to spot new\nopportunities and risks\n* Enter a company name into the search bar above\n* Click the 'Analyze' button\n* Get data & insight into the company\u2019s total traffic stats, subsidiaries and competitors, stock\nperformance, audience interests, and more!\n\n## Analyze any company\u2019s entire business portfolio\n\n[business portfolio]\n\nEasily analyze the full set of products of any company with Similarweb. See the entire portfolio\u2019s\ndigital performance, revenue, and growth signals to make better data-driven business decisions.\n\n[Check a business portfolio now][160]\n\n## Analyze the historical data of any company\n\n[historical data]\n\nAccess over 3 years of historical digital data. Analyze traffic & engagement trends over time for\nthe entire business portfolio or drill into specific asset data to understand long-term potential\nand risks.\n\n[See 3 years of data][161]\n\n## Check any company\u2019s stock performance\n\n[company stock]\n\nAnalyze ticker performance combined with Similarweb\u2019s Digital Data on any website or app. Track\nseasonality, engaged users, and traffic signals to estimate upcoming stock trends and business\nopportunities.\n\n[Analyze company stock now][162]\n\n## Track sales signals from any company\n\n[sales signals]\n\nTrack your prospects and stay ahead of the game! Get alerted on new buying signals and\nopportunities, and easily identify changes in a company\u2019s digital footprint and business profile.\n\n[See all signals][163]\n\n## Monitor the tech stack of any company\n\n[tech stack]\n\nMonitor changes in technologies and software used by companies. Analyze a company's technology stack\nin one click and get an alert when it's time to act.\n\n[Monitor tech stack now][164]\n\n## Company Intelligence Resources & Guides\n\nDiscover how Similarweb Company Intelligence drives growth through digital traffic and audience\ninsights. Analyze opportunities and risks, and build winning digital strategies \u2013 all using one\nplatform.\n\n[[research-companies]How to Research a Company: The Ultimate GuideMaster the art of researching and\nbenchmarking companies online. Analyze competitor audiences, revenue, and strategies to capture more\nmarket share.Read more][165][[alternative-data]What is Alternative Data and How to Use ItDiscover\nthe power of alternative data to enhance your investment strategies. Learn how to combine and\nanalyze the right datasets for smarter business decisions.Read more][166][[market-sizing]Market\nSizing: Measuring Your TAM, SAM, and SOMAccurately size any market\u2019s potential. Discover how to\nestimate risks, identify opportunities, and make smarter decisions with confidence.Read more][167]\n\n## FAQ\n\nHow many markets does Similarweb cover?\nSimilarweb Industry Trends provides online traffic data for 200+ industries. Use the Traffic Share\nfeature to analyze up to 10 domains within an industry and see their traffic share (percentage or\nvolume). Each industry report is based on an index of the top 100 websites in the chosen industry.\n\n## Find the right companies \u2013 faster\n\nSearch and filter from 20.3M+ online businesses using competitive tech, detailed traffic metrics,\nmarketing channels, and more. Pinpoint opportunities in seconds.\n\n[Start your free trial today][168]\nFollow us on:\n\n[6 E 32nd St, New York, NY 10016, 8 Floor][169]\n\n[Get our free extension][170]\n* Rankings\n* [Top Websites][171]\n* [Top Android Apps][172]\n* [Top iOS Apps][173]\n* [Top Amazon Products & Brands][174]\n* [Digital 100][175]\n* [Mobile vs. Desktop][176]\nFree Tools\n* [Website Traffic Checker][177]\n* [AI Traffic Checker][178]\n* [Free App Analytics][179]\n* [Keyword Generator][180]\n* [SERP Seismometer][181]\n* Solutions\n* [Enterprise][182]\n* [Web Intelligence][183]\n* [App Intelligence][184]\n* [Retail Intelligence][185]\n* [Sales Intelligence][186]\n* [Stock Intelligence][187]\n* [Data-as-a-Service][188]\n* [Advisory Services][189]\n* [Custom Reporting][190]\nData\n* [Our Data][191]\n* [Verify Your Website][192]\n* [Browser Extension][193]\n* Resources\n* [Blog][194]\n* [Reports][195]\n* [Webinars][196]\n* [Events][197]\n* [Knowledge Center & Support][198]\n* [Insights][199]\n* About us\n* [Company][200]\n* [Partners][201]\n* [Customers][202]\n* [Leadership][203]\n* [Acquisitions][204]\n* [Careers][205]\n* [Press][206]\n* [Engineering][207]\n* [Pricing][208]\n* [Investor Relations][209]\n* [Media Data Access][210]\n* [Customer Reviews][211]\nOur OfficesSee all Similarweb offices\n* Givatayim, Israel\n\n[Derech Yitzhak Rabin 33,\nGivatayim, 5348303, Israel][212]\n\n[Open map][213]\n* Burlington, US\n\n[154 Middlesex Turnpike, Burlington, MA 01803, USA][214]\n\n[Open map][215]\n* New York, US\n\n[6 E 32nd St, New York, NY 10016, 8 Floor][216]\n\n[Open map][217]\n* Sao Paulo, Brazil\n\n[Rua Jaceru, 225 - Vila Gertrudes,\nS\u00e3o Paulo, Brazil,\n04705-000][218]\n\n[Open map][219]\n* Florian\u00f3polis, Brazil\n\n[Rod. Admar Gonzaga, 440 Itacorubi - Florian\u00f3polis / SC 88034-000 - Brasil][220]\n\n[Open map][221]\n* Chile\n\n[Av Vitacura 2736,Las Condes, Regi\u00f3n Metropolitana, Chile Floor 4][222]\n\n[Open map][223]\n* Prague, Czech Republic\n\n[Boudn\u00edkova 253