            "url": "https://syndicatedanalytics.com/about-us",
            "text": "[[logo]][1]\n* [home][2]\n* [report store][3]\n* [Prefeasibility Reports][4]\n* [Market Research Reports][5]\n* [Production Cost Reports][6]\n* [industries][7]\n* [Aerospace and Defense][8]\n* [Agriculture][9]\n* [Automotive][10]\n* [Banking, Financial Services and Insurance][11]\n* [Chemical & Materials][12]\n* [Construction and Manufacturing][13]\n* [View All ][14]\n* [Services][15]\n* [Consulting Services][16]\n* [Customised Research][17]\n* [Syndicated Research][18]\n* Information Centre\n* [Blogs][19]\n* [Press Releases][20]\n* [about us][21]\n* [Contact us][22]\n* [ Home][23]\n* |\n* # About Us\n\n#### About Us\n\n### Overview\n\nSyndicated Analytics, a subsidiary of [ IMARC Group][24], offers consulting services and\ncomprehensive market intelligence in the form of research reports, production cost reports, and\nfeasibility studies. Our team, consisting of experienced researchers and analysts from diverse\nindustries, is deeply committed to providing quality information and insights to our clients,\nranging from small and medium enterprises to Fortune 1000 companies. These firms can achieve this by\nstudying the qualitative and quantitative aspects of the market as well as staying up to date with\nthe current and evolving trends of the industry.\n\nOur set of syndicated as well as customized research reports and studies help clients in conducting\nan early-stage analysis to validate the availability of necessities such as raw materials, plant and\nmachinery, and packaging requirements. These reports also assist stakeholders in understanding the\nmarket trends prevalent in the industry to gain a better view of their competitive landscape,\novercoming various industry-related challenges, and formulating revenue-generating business\nstrategies for entering the industry.\n\n#### Our Intelligence Coverage\n\nOur research reports provide deep insights into market intelligence at the global as well as the\nregional level. Our research capabilities span numerous industries, including but not limited to\nchemicals, energy, mining, advanced materials, pharmaceuticals, food and beverage, and\nbiotechnology.\n\n[Objective]\n\n#### Objective\n\nAt \u2018Syndicated Analytics\u2019, we constantly strive to assist businesses in making significant\nimprovements in their performance and profitability by providing the latest market information about\ndifferent industry verticals.\n\n[Work Speciality]\n\n#### Work Speciality\n\nOur speciality primarily lies in providing complete competitive intelligence and procuring updated\nmarket data through both primary and secondary research methods.\n\n[Vision]\n\n#### Vision\n\nTo attain a recognizable position in market research industry as a reliable and committed growth\npartner. As we believe that the success of our clients will help us succeed, we keep our client\u2019s\ninterests prior to that of our own.\n\n#### RESEARCH CATEGORIES\n* [ Aerospace and Defense][25]\n* [ Agriculture][26]\n* [ Automotive][27]\n* [ Banking, Financial Services and Insurance][28]\n* [ Chemical & Materials][29]\n* [ Construction and Manufacturing][30]\n* [ Electronics and Semiconductors][31]\n\n#### RESEARCH CATEGORIES\n* [ Energy & Mining][32]\n* [ Food & Beverages][33]\n* [ Healthcare][34]\n* [ Packaging][35]\n* [ Retail][36]\n* [ Technology & Media][37]\n* [ Transportation and Logistics][38]\n\n#### RESEARCH SERVICES\n* [ Consulting Services ][39]\n* [ Customised Research ][40]\n* [ Syndicated Research ][41]\n* [ Import Export][42]\n* [ Latest Industry Reports][43]\n\n#### CONTACT US\n\n#### USA & Canada:\n\n+1-631-791-1145\n\n[[email protected]][44]\n\n#### United Kingdom:\n\n+44-753-714-6104\n\n[[email protected]][45]\n* [About Us][46]\n* [Services][47]\n* [Careers][48]\n* [Press Releases][49]\n* [Blogs][50]\n* [Privacy Policy][51]\n* [Sitemap][52]\n* [Term & Conditions][53]\n* [Contact Us][54]\n* [GDPR Policy][55]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright Syndicated Analytics 2026.\n\nWe use cookies, including third-party, for better services. See our [Privacy Policy][56] for more.\nI ACCEPTX\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /reports\n[4]: /type/prefeasibility-reports\n[5]: /type/market-research-reports\n[6]: /type/production-cost-reports\n[7]: /categories\n[8]: /categories/aerospace-defense-market-reports\n[9]: /categories/agriculture-market-reports\n[10]: /categories/automotive-market-report\n[11]: /categories/bfsi-market-reports\n[12]: /categories/chemicals-market-reports\n[13]: /categories/building-construction-material-market-reports\n[14]: /categories\n[15]: /services\n[16]: /services/consulting-services\n[17]: /services/customised-research-services\n[18]: /services/syndicated-research\n[19]: /blog\n[20]: /pressrelease\n[21]: /about-us\n[22]: /contact-us\n[23]: /\n[24]: https://www.imarcgroup.com/\n[25]: /categories/aerospace-defense-market-reports\n[26]: /categories/agriculture-market-reports\n[27]: /categories/automotive-market-report\n[28]: /categories/bfsi-market-reports\n[29]: /categories/chemicals-market-reports\n[30]: /categories/building-construction-material-market-reports\n[31]: /categories/electronics-semiconductors-market-reports\n[32]: /categories/energy-market-reports\n[33]: /categories/food-beverages-market-reports\n[34]: /categories/healthcare-market-research-reports\n[35]: /categories/packaging-market-reports\n[36]: /categories/retail-market-reports\n[37]: /categories/technology-market-reports\n[38]: /categories/transportation-logistics-market-reports\n[39]: /services/consulting-services\n[40]: /services/customised-research-services\n[41]: /services/syndicated-research\n[42]: /importexport\n[43]: /reports\n[44]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[45]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[46]: /about-us\n[47]: /services\n[48]: /career\n[49]: /pressrelease\n[50]: /blog\n[51]: /privacy-policy\n[52]: /sitemap\n[53]: /terms-conditions\n[54]: /contact-us\n[55]: /gdp-policy\n[56]: /privacy-policy"
