 \n  #### Finishes\n  \n  No one offers more MCM colors of finish choices than ALPOLIC. We offer an extensive selection of\n  rich, vibrant colors and styles for both coil-coated paint and natural metal finishes.\n  * [Finishes Overview][67]\n  * [Textured Series][68]\n  * [Anodized Aluminum][69]\n  * [Mica Finishes][70]\n  * [Matte Finishes][71]\n  * [Natural Metal][72]\n  * [Zinc Elements][73]\n  * [Stone Series][74]\n  * [Timber Series][75]\n  * [Solid Color][76]\n  * [Prismatic Finishes][77]\n  * [Shimmer Finishes][78]\n  * [Pattern Series][79]\n  * [Multi-Color][80]\n  * [Metallic Finishes][81]\n  * [Decorative Metals][82]\n  \n  [\n  \n  #### Download the Stock Color Chart\n  \n  Read More][83]\n* Inspiration\n  \n  #### Inspiration\n  \n  Architecture is art and function, and your project deserves the very best. At ALPOLIC\u00ae, we build\n  products that work with architecture, not against it. Your project is your legacy, and your\n  satisfaction is ours.\n  * [Projects][84]\n  * [Architecture][85]\n  * [Corporate ID][86]\n  * [Petroleum][87]\n  * [Residential][88]\n  * [Specialty][89]\n  \n  [\n  [Voxman Music Hall Ceiling Kites]\n  \n  #### Metal Composite Materials Engineer Sound and\u2026\n  \n  Read More][90]\n* Company\n  \n  #### Company\n  \n  For over 50 years, ALPOLIC has been changing the face of architecture worldwide. Since 1991, we\u2019ve\n  been servicing North and South America with our headquarters in Chesapeake, Virginia.\n  * [About ALPOLIC][91]\n  * [Sustainability][92]\n  * [Careers][93]\n  * [Why ALPOLIC][94]\n  \n  [\n  [Rigo Vega - Hero image]\n  \n  #### We Are ALPOLIC: Get To Know\u2026\n  \n  Read More][95]\n* Knowledge Center\n  \n  #### Knowledge Center\n  \n  Our knowledge is your resource.\n  * [Color Charts][96]\n  * [Technical Library][97]\n  * [ALPOLIC Sales][98]\n  * [Find Fabricators][99]\n  * [AIA Continuing Education][100]\n  * [Specifications][101]\n  * [Warranty Calculator][102]\n  * [Request a Quote][103]\n  * [Fire Safety][104]\n  * [Color Match Request][105]\n  * [Blog][106]\n  * [Warranty Request][107]\n  \n  [\n  [Closeup shot of ALPOLIC Rusted Steel MCM cladding senior living facility]\n  \n  #### Industry Experts Compare ACM Versus Plate\u2026\n  \n  Read More][108]\n* [Order Samples][109]\n  \n  #### Order Samples\n\n# Beautiful, Durable, Safe\n# **Architectural Solutions.**\n\nRealize your vision with trusted ALPOLIC architectural cladding. With the largest selection of\nfinishes warranted for up to 35 years, sustainable MCM gives you the code-compliant solutions you\nneed. Let\u2019s partner for your success.\n\n[Explore Our Products][110] [Get In Touch][111]\n\n## Iconic designs deserve exceptional materials.\n## **ALPOLIC means quality**.\n\n### Beautiful\n\nOur unmatched selection of finishes will ensure a stunning project.\n* Virtually unlimited color palette.\n* Expert custom color matching.\n* Brightest colors made possible with FEVE paint.\n* Smoother finish with precision die coating.\n* Ultra matte to high gloss.\n\n### Durable\n\nBuilt to last, your finishes will maintain their brilliance for decades.\n* AAMA 2605 certified to resist fading and chalking.\n* Excellent strength to weight ratio.\n* Built-in graffiti-resistance.\n* No delamination [fbpx]\n* [Products][1]\n  * [Products Overview][2]\n  * [FR][3]\n  * [PE][4]\n  * [HD][5]\n  * [Brake Metal][6]\n  * [Graphic-AL][7]\n  * [RF][8]\n  * [NC-US][9]\n* [Finishes][10]\n  * [Finishes Overview][11]\n  * [Textured Series][12]\n  * [Anodized Aluminum][13]\n  * [Mica Finishes][14]\n  * [Matte Finishes][15]\n  * [Natural Metal][16]\n  * [Zinc Elements][17]\n  * [Stone Series][18]\n  * [Timber Series][19]\n  * [Solid Color][20]\n  * [Prismatic Finishes][21]\n  * [Shimmer Finishes][22]\n  * [Pattern Series][23]\n  * [Multi-Color][24]\n  * [Metallic Finishes][25]\n  * [Decorative Metals][26]\n* [Inspiration][27]\n  * [Projects][28]\n  * [Architecture][29]\n  * [Corporate ID][30]\n  * [Petroleum][31]\n  * [Residential][32]\n  * [Specialty][33]\n* [Company][34]\n  * [About ALPOLIC][35]\n  * [Sustainability][36]\n  * [Careers][37]\n  * [Why ALPOLIC][38]\n* [Knowledge Center][39]\n  * [Color Charts][40]\n  * [Technical Library][41]\n  * [ALPOLIC Sales][42]\n  * [Find Fabricators][43]\n  * [AIA Continuing Education][44]\n  * [Specifications][45]\n  * [Warranty Calculator][46]\n  * [Request a Quote][47]\n  * [Fire Safety][48]\n  * [Color Match Request][49]\n  * [Blog][50]\n  * [Warranty Request][51]\n* [Order Samples][52]\n[AIA CE Courses][53] [Contact Us][54] [Find ALPOLIC][55] [Technical Library][56]\nSearch\n[ [ALPOLIC\u00ae Materials - Aluminum Metal Composite Materials] ][57]\n* Products\n  \n  #### Products\n  \n  Lightweight ALPOLIC\u00ae metal composite materials (MCM) provide superior flatness, durability and\n  ease of maintenance in nearly limitless finishes that look as good as new for years after other\n  materials begin to fade.\n  * [Products Overview][58]\n  * [FR][59]\n  * [PE][60]\n  * [HD][61]\n  * [Brake Metal][62]\n  * [Graphic-AL][63]\n  * [RF][64]\n  * [NC-US][65]\n  \n  [\n  [Traffic lights featuring ALPOLIC 350 MCM on backplates]\n  \n  #### ALPOLIC\u00ae 350 Plays a Major Role\u2026\n  \n  Read More][66]\n* Finishes\n  \n  #### Finishes\n  \n  No one offers more MCM colors of finish choices than ALPOLIC. We offer an extensive selection of\n  rich, vibrant colors and styles for both coil-coated paint and natural metal finishes.\n  * [Finishes Overview][67]\n  * [Textured Series][68]\n  * [Anodized Aluminum][69]\n  * [Mica Finishes][70]\n  * [Matte Finishes][71]\n  * [Natural Metal][72]\n  * [Zinc Elements][73]\n  * [Stone Series][74]\n  * [Timber Series][75]\n  * [Solid Color][76]\n  * [Prismatic Finishes][77]\n  * [Shimmer Finishes][78]\n  * [Pattern Series][79]\n  * [Multi-Color][80]\n  * [Metallic Finishes][81]\n  * [Decorative Metals][82]\n  \n  [\n  \n  #### Download the Stock Color Chart\n  \n  Read More][83]\n* Inspiration\n  \n  #### Inspiration\n  