        "crawl_text": "[[AvoHealth Avocado Oil]][1]\n\nEst. 1999\nExtra Virgin and Unrefined Avocado Oil\n\n[andrew@avohealth.com][2]\n[ AvoHealth ][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Health Benefits][6]\n* [Consulting][7]\n* [Our Story][8]\n* [News][9]\n* [Contact][10]\n[[AvoHealth Avocado Oil]][11]\n\nEst. 1999\nExtra Virgin and Unrefined Avocado Oil\n\n[andrew@avohealth.com][12]\n[avocado health]\n[Avocado Extra Virgin Oils]\n[benefits of avocado]\n[ Previous ][13] [ Next ][14]\n\n# **AvoHealth** \u2013 **Avocado Oil Specialists**\n\n**We provide Advisory Services to ensure you have an excellent business case to start manufacturing\n***or*** marketing Avocado Oil.**\n\n**AvoHealth** **also market/distribute **(often bulk)** Avocado Oil products all over the world.**\nFor our client production companies, w*e can handle 100% of your avocado oil marketing &\ndistribution.*\n\nIn 2025 we can supply:\n1. **Bulk Unrefined CRUDE (raw) Avocado Oil **\u2013 *Shipped in 24,000 liter Flexitanks. Use as a food,*\n   *nutraceutical or cosmetic ingredient.* We are confident our Crude Oil is such high quality,\n   there is no chance the \u2018toxins\u2019 known as 3-MCPD ,or Glycidyl Esters will form in the refining\n   process.\n2. **Extra Virgin Avocado Oil** \u2013 *usually shipped in 1,000 liter IBC\u2019s/Totes*\n\nIn future we will supply:\n3. **Refined Avocado Oil **\u2013 RBD & RBDW \u2013 not before 2026\n\n4. **Retail Avocado Oil** \u2013 packed to your requirements in dark glass bottles or Hi-Tech plastic\nbottles designed for on-line retail (e.g. Amazon).\n* Your Private Label, *or*\n* AvoHealth brand\n\nAndrew Logan \u2013 Presenter at World Avocado Congress 2023. Avocado Africa Congress 2024 + 2025\n\n## **Personal service, best prices and the highest quality Avocado Oil**\n\nAvocado Oil is a Functional Food, made from the healthiest fruit on earth. This new generation\nSuper-Food provides additional health benefits and anti-oxidant activity in the fights against\nobesity, heart disease, dementia, blindness, skincare and a range of cancers. Read more about the\namazing [health benefits of AvoHealth Avocado Oil][15].\n\n**AvoHealth**\u00a0[provides advice][16] on every aspect of the Avocado Oil business; from feasibility\nstudies to the Agri-Tech processing technology required, to advising on product packaging & branding\nto meet your target markets.\n\nWe advise on the optimum production machinery and plant design, to maximize oil quality & yields.\n* New production plants are in constant planning and development.\n* Each new production facility improves our supply of \u2018clean label\u2019, minimally processed, finest\n  quality Avocado Oil.\n\n[ripe avocado]\n\n**Avocado Health Limited**, (**AvoHealth**), is incorporated in New Zealand. **Avocado Processors\nEPZ Limited,** is incorporated in Kenya and trades as **AvoHealth Kenya.**\u00a0 We receive regular\ninquiry for assistance on new Avocado Oil Production Projects from Mexico & South America.\nCurrently, we are working on NEW projects in Kenya, Tanzania, Ethiopia, Uganda & Rwanda.\u00a0\u00a0\n* **November 2022:** \u2013 Held a seminar on the Avocado Oil industry for 43 participants in Nairobi,\n  Kenya. Extensive meetings with many clients.\n\n**April 2023: World Avocado Congress \u2013 Auckland, New Zealand**\n\nInvited to make 2 presentations about the Avocado Oil industry.\n\n**Presentation #1:** Is there a good business case to press Avocado Oil?\n\n**Presentation #2:** Avocado Oil Processing \u2013 a model for self-regulation.\n\n\n**May 2024 + May 2025 \u2013 Avocado Africa Congress** in Nairobi \u2013 a lead presenter always focussed on:\n**\u2018The Business Case to enter the Avocado Oil industry**\u2018 *and*\n\u2018**How to manufacture the Highest Quality Avocado Oil**\u2018\n\n## AvoHealth Avocado Oils\n\n[ [product extra virgin avocado oil] Extra Virgin Avocado Oil ][17]\n[ [avocado BBQ oil] BBQ & Grill Gourmet \u2013 Avocado Cooking Oil ][18]\n\n## Why AvoHealth?\n\n[andrew logan director avocado health]\n\n#### [Our story][19]\n\nAvoHealth, a New Zealand business, grew from a dream to cold-press the healthiest, natural fruit oil\nin the world ...\n\n[read more][20]\n\n#### [Nutrition][21]\n\nNeed more Carotenoids & anti-oxidants?\nOr the benefits of a Mediterranean style diet? Suffering from chronic illnesses like heart ...\n\n[read more][22]\n\n#### [News & Recipes][23]\n\nStay informed with the latest Avocado Oil news and insights and learn to use avocado oil as an\neveryday gourmet ingredient ...\n\n[read more][24]\n\n### Avocado Health Limited\n\n##### Andrew Logan\n\n[Avocado Health Limited Logo]\n\nWhatsApp + Phone: [+64 21 428 645][25] \u2013 New Zealand\nEmail: [andrew@avohealth.com][26]\n\n[**WhatsApp**][27] or [**Email**][28] is best to make contact\n\n[Privacy Policy][29]\n\u00a9 2026 Avocado Health Limited\n[Good Websites][30]\n\n[ WhatsApp ][31]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: mailto:andrew@avohealth.com\n[3]: /\n[4]: https://www.avohealth.com/\n[5]: https://www.avohealth.com/products/\n[6]: https://www.avohealth.com/avocado-oil-health-benefits/\n[7]: https://www.avohealth.com/consulting/\n[8]: https://www.avohealth.com/our-story/\n[9]: https://www.avohealth.com/news/\n[10]: https://www.avohealth.com/contact/\n[11]: /\n[12]: mailto:andrew [[AvoHealth Avocado Oil]][1]\n\nEst. 1999\nExtra Virgin and Unrefined Avocado Oil\n\n[andrew@avohealth.com][2]\n[ AvoHealth ][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Health Benefits][6]\n* [Consulting][7]\n* [Our Story][8]\n* [News][9]\n* [Contact][10]\n[[AvoHealth Avocado Oil]][11]\n\nEst. 1999\nExtra Virgin and Unrefined Avocado Oil\n\n[andrew@avohealth.com][12]\n[avocado health]\n[Avocado Extra Virgin Oils]\n[benefits of avocado]\n[ Previous ][13] [ Next ][14]\n\n# **AvoHealth** \u2013 **Avocado Oil Specialists**\n\n**We provide Advisory Services to ensure you have an excellent business case to start manufacturing\n***or*** marketing Avocado Oil.**\n\n**AvoHealth** **also market/distribute **(often bulk)** Avocado Oil products all over the world.**\nFor our client production companies, w*e can handle 100% of your avocado oil marketing &\ndistribution.*\n\nIn 2025 we can supply:\n1. **Bulk Unrefined CRUDE (raw) Avocado Oil **\u2013 *Shipped in 24,000 liter Flexitanks. Use as a food,*\n   *nutraceutical or cosmetic ingredient.* We are confident our Crude Oil is such high quality,\n   there is no chance the \u2018toxins\u2019 known as 3-MCPD ,or Glycidyl Esters will form in the refining\n   process.\n2. **Extra Virgin Avocado Oil** \u2013 *usually shipped in 1,000 liter IBC\u2019s/Totes*\n\nIn future we will supply:\n3. **Refined Avocado Oil **\u2013 RBD & RBDW \u2013 not before 2026\n\n4. **Retail Avocado Oil** \u2013 packed to your requirements in dark glass bottles or Hi-Tech plastic\nbottles designed for on-line retail (e.g. Amazon).\n* Your Private Label, *or*\n* AvoHealth brand\n\nAndrew Logan \u2013 Presenter at World Avocado Congress 2023. Avocado Africa Congress 2024 + 2025\n\n## **Personal service, best prices and the highest quality Avocado Oil**\n\nAvocado Oil is a Functional Food, made from the healthiest fruit on earth. This new generation\nSuper-Food provides additional health benefits and anti-oxidant activity in the fights against\nobesity, heart disease, dementia, blindness, skincare and a range of cancers. Read more about the\namazing [health benefits of AvoHealth Avocado Oil][15].\n\n**AvoHealth**\u00a0[provides advice][16] on every aspect of the Avocado Oil business; from feasibility\nstudies to the Agri-Tech processing technology required, to advising on product packaging & branding\nto meet your target markets.\n\nWe advise on the optimum production machinery and plant design, to maximize oil quality & yields.\n* New production plants are in constant planning and development.\n* Each new production facility improves our supply of \u2018clean label\u2019, minimally processed, finest\n  quality Avocado Oil.\n\n[ripe avocado]\n\n**Avocado Health Limited**, (**AvoHealth**), is incorporated in New Zealand. **Avocado Processors\nEPZ Limited,** is incorporated in Kenya and trades as **AvoHealth Kenya.**\u00a0 We receive regular\ninquiry for assistance on new Avocado Oil Production Projects from Mexico & South America.\nCurrently, we are working on NEW projects in Kenya, Tanzania, Ethiopia, Uganda & Rwanda.\u00a0\u00a0\n* **November 2022:** \u2013 Held a seminar on the Avocado Oil industry for 43 participants in Nairobi,\n  Kenya. Extensive meetings with many clients.\n\n**April 2023: World Avocado Congress \u2013 Auckland, New Zealand**\n\nInvited to make 2 presentations about the Avocado Oil industry.\n\n**Presentation #1:** Is there a good business case to press Avocado Oil?\n\n**Presentation #2:** Avocado Oil Processing \u2013 a model for self-regulation.\n\n\n**May 2024 + May 2025 \u2013 Avocado Africa Congress** in Nairobi \u2013 a lead presenter always focussed on:\n**\u2018The Business Case to enter the Avocado Oil industry**\u2018 *and*\n\u2018**How to manufacture the Highest Quality Avocado Oil**\u2018\n\n## AvoHealth Avocado Oils\n\n[ [product extra virgin avocado oil] Extra Virgin Avocado Oil ][17]\n[ [avocado BBQ oil] BBQ & Grill Gourmet \u2013 Avocado Cooking Oil ][18]\n\n## Why AvoHealth?\n\n[andrew logan director avocado health]\n\n#### [Our story][19]\n\nAvoHealth, a New Zealand business, grew from a dream to cold-press the healthiest, natural fruit oil\nin the world ...\n\n[read more][20]\n\n#### [Nutrition][21]\n\nNeed more Carotenoids & anti-oxidants?\nOr the benefits of a Mediterranean style diet? Suffering from chronic illnesses like heart ...\n\n[read more][22]\n\n#### [News & Recipes][23]\n\nStay informed with the latest Avocado Oil news and insights and learn to use avocado oil as an\neveryday gourmet ingredient ...\n\n[read more][24]\n\n### Avocado Health Limited\n\n##### Andrew Logan\n\n[Avocado Health Limited Logo]\n\nWhatsApp + Phone: [+64 21 428 645][25] \u2013