        "crawl_text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [NHS] ][2]\nSearch the NHS website Search\n* [ Health A to Z ][3]\n* [ NHS services ][4]\n* [ Healthy living ][5]\n* [ Mental health ][6]\n* [ Care and support ][7]\n* Browse More\n\n# NHS website for England Find information and services to help you manage your health\n\n## [Health A to Z][8]\n\nFind out about conditions, symptoms, medicines, tests and treatments, including when to get help\n\n## [NHS services][9]\n\nFind out about NHS services including GPs, pharmacies, prescriptions, hospitals and dentists\n\n## Manage your health\n* [ Order a repeat prescription ][10]\n* [ View your test results ][11]\n* [ Appointments and bookings at your GP surgery ][12]\n* [ How to register with a GP surgery ][13]\n* [ Find your NHS number ][14]\n\n## NHS services\n* [ Find a pharmacy ][15]\n* [ Find a dentist ][16]\n* [ Find a GP ][17]\n* [ Find NHS talking therapies for anxiety and depression ][18]\n\n[ Find other NHS services ][19]\n\n### Help from NHS 111\n\nIf you're worried about a symptom and not sure what help you need, NHS 111 can tell you what to do\nnext.\n\nGo to [111.nhs.uk][20] or [call 111][21].\n\nFor a life-threatening emergency call 999.\n\n## Featured\n* ### [ Book a COVID-19 vaccination appointment ][22]\n  \n  If you're eligible for the spring COVID-19 vaccine, you can book a vaccination appointment now\n* ### [ Get healthcare cover abroad with a UK GHIC or EHIC ][23]\n  \n  Get or renew your health insurance card to help you get healthcare in the EU and some other\n  countries\n* ### [ Refer yourself for help for back and joint problems ][24]\n  \n  Get NHS help from community musculoskeletal (MSK) services, like physiotherapy, for back and joint\n  problems\n\n## More information and advice\n* ## [Vaccinations][25]\n  \n  Information about vaccinations for babies, children and adults, including why they're important\n  and how to get them\n* ## [COVID-19][26]\n  \n  Advice about COVID-19, including symptoms, treatments and how to avoid catching and spreading it.\n* ## [Baby][27]\n  \n  A guide to everything you need to know about caring for a baby\n* ## [Women's health][28]\n  \n  Information and support on health, wellbeing, conditions and screening\n* ## [Contraception][29]\n  \n  Information about different types of contraception, including where to get them and how well they\n  work\n\n## Support links\n* [Home][30]\n* [Health A to Z][31]\n* [NHS services][32]\n* [Healthy living][33]\n* [Mental health][34]\n* [Care and support][35]\n* [COVID-19][36]\n* [NHS App][37]\n* [Find my NHS number][38]\n* [View your test results][39]\n* [About the NHS][40]\n* [Healthcare abroad][41]\n* [Other NHS websites][42]\n* [Profile editor login][43]\n* [About us][44]\n* [Report an issue with the NHS website][45]\n* [Accessibility statement][46]\n* [Our policies][47]\n* [Cookies][48]\n\n\u00a9 Crown copyright\n\n[1]: #maincontent\n[2]: /\n[3]: /health-a-to-z/\n[4]: /nhs-services/\n[5]: /live-well/\n[6]: /mental-health/\n[7]: /social-care-and-support/\n[8]: /health-a-to-z/\n[9]: /nhs-services/\n[10]: /nhs-services/prescriptions/how-to-order-a-repeat-prescription/\n[11]: /nhs-services/gps/view-your-test-results/\n[12]: /nhs-services/gps/gp-appointments-and-bookings/\n[13]: /nhs-services/gps/how-to-register-with-a-gp-surgery/\n[14]: /nhs-services/find-nhs-number/\n[15]: https://www.nhs.uk/service-search/find-a-pharmacy/\n[16]: https://www.nhs.uk/service-search/find-a-dentist\n[17]: https://www.nhs.uk/service-search/find-a-GP\n[18]: /nhs-services/mental-health-services/find-nhs-talking-therapies-for-anxiety-and-depression/\n[19]: /nhs-services/\n[20]: https://111.nhs.uk/?utm_source=nhsuk&utm_campaign=homepage\n[21]: tel: 111\n[22]: /nhs-services/vaccination-and-booking-services/book-covid-19-vaccination/\n[23]: /using-the-nhs/healthcare-abroad/apply-for-a-free-uk-global-health-insurance-card-ghic/\n[24]: /nhs-services/get-nhs-help-for-back-joint-problems/\n[25]: https://www.nhs.uk/vaccinations/\n[26]: https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/covid-19/\n[27]: https://www.nhs.uk/baby/\n[28]: https://www.nhs.uk/womens-health/\n[29]: https://www.nhs.uk/contraception/\n[30]: /\n[31]: /health-a-to-z/\n[32]: /nhs-services/\n[33]: /live-well/\n[34]: /mental-health/\n[35]: /social-care-and-support/\n[36]: /conditions/covid-19/\n[37]: /nhs-app/\n[38]: /nhs-services/online-services/find-nhs-number/\n[39]: /nhs-services/gps/view-your-test-results/\n[40]: /using-the-nhs/about-the-nhs/\n[41]: /using-the-nhs/healthcare-abroad/\n[42]: /nhs-sites/\n[43]: /our-policies/profile-editor-login/\n[44]: /about-us/\n[45]: /report-an-issue-with-the-nhs-website\n[46]: /accessibility-statement/\n[47]: /our-policies/\n[48]: /our-policies/choose-your-cookie-settings/ [Skip to main content][1]\n[ [NHS] ][2]\nSearch the NHS website Search\n* [ Health A to Z ][3]\n* [ NHS services ][4]\n* [ Healthy living ][5]\n* [ Mental health ][6]\n* [ Care and support ][7]\n* Browse More\n\n# NHS website for England Find information and services to help you manage your health\n\n## [Health A to Z][8]\n\nFind out about conditions, symptoms, medicines, tests and treatments, including when to get help\n\n## [NHS services][9]\n\nFind out about NHS services including GPs, pharmacies, prescriptions, hospitals and dentists\n\n## Manage your health\n* [ Order a repeat prescription ][10]\n* [ View your test results ][11]\n* [ Appointments and bookings at your GP surgery ][12]\n* [ How to register with a GP surgery ][13]\n* [ Find your NHS number ][14]\n\n## NHS services\n* [ Find a pharmacy ][15]\n* [ Find a dentist ][16]\n* [ Find a GP ][17]\n* [ Find NHS talking therapies for anxiety and depression ][18]\n\n[ Find other NHS services ][19]\n\n### Help from NHS 111\n\nIf you're worried about a symptom and not sure what help you need, NHS 111 can tell you what to do\nnext.\n\nGo to [111.nhs.uk][20] or [call 111][21].\n\nFor a life-threatening emergency call 999.\n\n## Featured\n* ### [ Book a COVID-19 vaccination appointment ][22]\n  \n  If you're eligible for the spring COVID-19 vaccine, you can book a vaccination appointment now\n* ### [ Get healthcare cover abroad with a UK GHIC or EHIC ][23]\n  \n  Get or renew your health insurance card to help you get healthcare in the EU and some other\n  countries\n* ### [ Refer yourself for help for back and joint problems ][24]\n  \n  Get NHS help from community musculoskeletal (MSK) services, like physiotherapy, for back and joint\n  problems\n\n## More information and advice\n* ## [Vaccinations][25]\n  \n  Information about vaccinations for babies, children and adults, including why they're important\n  and how to get them\n* ## [COVID-19][26]\n  \n  Advice about COVID-19, including symptoms, treatments and how to avoid catching and spreading it.\n* ## [Baby][27]\n  \n  A guide to everything you need to know about caring for a baby\n* ## [Women's health][28]\n  \n  Information and support on health, wellbeing, conditions and screening\n* ## [Contraception][29]\n  \n  Information about different types of contraception, including where to get them and how well they\n  work\n\n## Support links\n* [Home][30]\n* [Health A to Z][31]\n* [NHS services][32]\n* [Healthy living][33]\n* [Mental health][34]\n* [Care and support][35]\n* [COVID-19][36]\n* [NHS App][37]\n* [Find my NHS number][38]\n* [View your test results][39]\n* [About the NHS][40]\n* [Healthcare abroad][41]\n* [Other NHS websites][42]\n* [Profile editor login][43]\n* [About us][44]\n* [Report an issue with the NHS website][45]\n* [Accessibility statement][46]\n* [Our policies][47]\n* [Cookies][48]\n\n\u00a9 Crown copyright\n\n[1]: #maincontent\n[2]: /\n[3]: /health-a-to-z/\n[4]: /nhs-services/\n[5]: /live-well/\n[6]: /mental-health/\n[7]: /social-care-and-support/\n[8]: /health-a-to-z/\n[9]: /nhs-services/\n[10]: /nhs-services/prescriptions/how-to-order-a-repeat-prescription/\n[11]: /nhs-services/gps/view-your-test-results/\n[12]: /nhs-services/gps/gp-appointments-and-bookings/\n[13]: /nhs-services/gps/how-to-register-with-a-gp-surgery/\n[14]: /nhs-services/find-nhs-number/\n[15]: https://www.nhs.uk/service-search/find-a-pharmacy/\n[16]: https://www.nhs.uk/service-search/find-a-dentist\n[17]: https://www.nhs.uk/service-search/find-a-GP\n[18]: /nhs-services/mental-health-services/find-nhs-talking-therapies-for-anxiety-and-depression/\n[19]: /nhs-services/\n[20]: https://111.nhs.uk/?utm_source=nhsuk&utm_campaign=homepage\n[21]: tel: 111\n[22]: /nhs-services/vaccination-and-booking-services/book-covid-19-vaccination/\n[23]: /using-the-nhs/healthcare-abroad/apply-for-a-free-uk-global-health-insurance-card-ghic/\n[24]: /nhs-services/get-nhs-help-for-back-joint-problems/\n[25]: https://www.nhs.uk/vaccinations/\n[26]: https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/covid-19/\n[27]: https://www.nhs.uk/baby/\n[28]: https://www.nhs.uk/womens-health/\n[29]: https://www.nhs.uk/contraception/\n[30]: /\n[31]: /health-a-to-z/\n[32]: /nhs-services/\n[33]: /live-well/\n[34]: /mental-health/\n[35]: /social-care-and-support/\n[36]: /conditions/covid-19/\n[37]: /nhs-app/\n[38]: /nhs-services/online-services/find-nhs-number/\n[39]: /nhs-services/gps/view-your-test-results/\n[40]: /using-the-nhs/about-the-nhs/\n[41]: /using-the-nhs/healthcare-abroad/\n[42]: /nhs-sites/\n[43]: /our-policies/profile-editor-login/\n[44]: /about-us/\n[45]: /report-an-issue-with-the-nhs-website\n[46]: /accessibility-statement/\n[47]: /our-policies/\n[48]: /our-policies/choose-your-cookie-settings/ nhs.uk"
