        "crawl_text": "* Follow Us\n[\n\n# Global Goodfroots & Avocados\n\n## Bulk Food Distribution Specialists\n\n][1]\n* [Products][2]\n  * [Freeze Dried Fruits][3]\n    * [Freeze Dried Pineapple & Chili Snack][4]\n    * [Freeze Dried Pineapple Snack][5]\n    * [Freeze Dried Mango Snack][6]\n  * [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][7]\n* [Commodities][8]\n* [Contact Us][9]\n* [Products][10]\n  * [- Freeze Dried Fruits][11]\n    * [- - Freeze Dried Pineapple & Chili Snack][12]\n    * [- - Freeze Dried Pineapple Snack][13]\n    * [- - Freeze Dried Mango Snack][14]\n  * [- Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][15]\n* [Commodities][16]\n* [Contact Us][17]\n* [Slider Image]\n  [Read More][18]\n* [Slider Image]\n  [Read More][19]\n* [Slider Image]\n  [Read More][20]\n\n### Global Goodfroots & Avocados is a Top Tier producer of High-Quality Freeze-Dried Fruits and\n### Extra Virgin Avocado Oil. Our products specifically target the Grocery, Wholesale and Horeca\n### bulk food distribution global markets. We are an International company based in the United\n### States possessing over 50 combined years' of experience in commodity sales and product\n### development. Our emphasis is providing the highest level of customer care and support to enhance\n### your business buying and supply chain requirements. We welcome the opportunity to discuss your\n### business needs while offering solutions to expand your product line offerings in your\n### specialized areas of expertise.\n\n[Lets Grow Together][21]\n\n### Freeze Dried Fruit\n\n\u2022 100% Natural Fruit\n\u2022 Under 100 Calories per Serving\n\u2022 Ready-To-Eat Freeze-dried Snack\n\u2022 No added Sugar or Additives\n\u2022 Grown and Prepared in Mexico\n\u2022 No Refrigeration Needed\n\u2022 2 year shelf life\n\u2022 Individually bagged for convenience\n\nAvailable in Pineapple with Chili, Pineapple , and mango.\n\n[Read More][22]\n\n### Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nOur 100% Extra Virgin Avocado Oil is Non-GMO, collected from the first cold pressed extraction of\nquality ripe fruit pulp, to give you a neutral fresh unique flavor. This makes it ideal for most\nhigh-heat cooking processes including baking, stir-frying, deep-frying, searing, barbecuing,\nroasting, and Saut\u00e9ing.The end result is a smooth, rich avocado oil that\u2019s ideal for cooking,\nbaking, finishing, and even skincare.\n\n[Read More][23]\n\n### Contact Us\n\nThank you for taking the time to look at our website.\n\nWe appreciate your business and look forward to enhancing your business buying and supply chain\nrequirements.\n\nWe look forward to Growing with You.\n\n[Read More][24]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2023 Global Goodfroots & Avocados All rights reserved.\n* [Freeze Dried Pineapple & Chili Snack][25]\n* [Freeze Dried Pineapple Snack][26]\n* [Freeze Dried Mango Snack][27]\n* [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][28]\n* [Contact Us][29]\n\n[1]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/\n[2]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/products/\n[3]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[4]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/pineapple-chili/\n[5]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-pineapple/\n[6]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-mango-snack/\n[7]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[8]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/more-commodities/\n[9]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/\n[10]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/products/\n[11]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[12]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/pineapple-chili/\n[13]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-pineapple/\n[14]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-mango-snack/\n[15]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[16]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/more-commodities/\n[17]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/\n[18]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[19]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[20]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[21]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/\n[22]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[23]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[24]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/\n[25]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/pineapple-chili/\n[26]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-pineapple/\n[27]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-mango-snack/\n[28]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[29]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/ * Follow Us\n[\n\n# Global Goodfroots & Avocados\n\n## Bulk Food Distribution Specialists\n\n][1]\n* [Products][2]\n  * [Freeze Dried Fruits][3]\n    * [Freeze Dried Pineapple & Chili Snack][4]\n    * [Freeze Dried Pineapple Snack][5]\n    * [Freeze Dried Mango Snack][6]\n  * [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][7]\n* [Commodities][8]\n* [Contact Us][9]\n* [Products][10]\n  * [- Freeze Dried Fruits][11]\n    * [- - Freeze Dried Pineapple & Chili Snack][12]\n    * [- - Freeze Dried Pineapple Snack][13]\n    * [- - Freeze Dried Mango Snack][14]\n  * [- Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][15]\n* [Commodities][16]\n* [Contact Us][17]\n* [Slider Image]\n  [Read More][18]\n* [Slider Image]\n  [Read More][19]\n* [Slider Image]\n  [Read More][20]\n\n### Global Goodfroots & Avocados is a Top Tier producer of High-Quality Freeze-Dried Fruits and\n### Extra Virgin Avocado Oil. Our products specifically target the Grocery, Wholesale and Horeca\n### bulk food distribution global markets. We are an International company based in the United\n### States possessing over 50 combined years' of experience in commodity sales and product\n### development. Our emphasis is providing the highest level of customer care and support to enhance\n### your business buying and supply chain requirements. We welcome the opportunity to discuss your\n### business needs while offering solutions to expand your product line offerings in your\n### specialized areas of expertise.\n\n[Lets Grow Together][21]\n\n### Freeze Dried Fruit\n\n\u2022 100% Natural Fruit\n\u2022 Under 100 Calories per Serving\n\u2022 Ready-To-Eat Freeze-dried Snack\n\u2022 No added Sugar or Additives\n\u2022 Grown and Prepared in Mexico\n\u2022 No Refrigeration Needed\n\u2022 2 year shelf life\n\u2022 Individually bagged for convenience\n\nAvailable in Pineapple with Chili, Pineapple , and mango.\n\n[Read More][22]\n\n### Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nOur 100% Extra Virgin Avocado Oil is Non-GMO, collected from the first cold pressed extraction of\nquality ripe fruit pulp, to give you a neutral fresh unique flavor. This makes it ideal for most\nhigh-heat cooking processes including baking, stir-frying, deep-frying, searing, barbecuing,\nroasting, and Saut\u00e9ing.The end result is a smooth, rich avocado oil that\u2019s ideal for cooking,\nbaking, finishing, and even skincare.\n\n[Read More][23]\n\n### Contact Us\n\nThank you for taking the time to look at our website.\n\nWe appreciate your business and look forward to enhancing your business buying and supply chain\nrequirements.\n\nWe look forward to Growing with You.\n\n[Read More][24]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2023 Global Goodfroots & Avocados All rights reserved.\n* [Freeze Dried Pineapple & Chili Snack][25]\n* [Freeze Dried Pineapple Snack][26]\n* [Freeze Dried Mango Snack][27]\n* [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][28]\n* [Contact Us][29]\n\n[1]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/\n[2]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/products/\n[3]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[4]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/pineapple-chili/\n[5]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-pineapple/\n[6]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-mango-snack/\n[7]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[8]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/more-commodities/\n[9]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/\n[10]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/products/\n[11]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[12]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/pineapple-chili/\n[13]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-pineapple/\n[14]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-mango-snack/\n[15]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[16]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/more-commodities/\n[17]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/\n[18]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[19]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[20]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[21]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/\n[22]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-fruits/\n[23]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[24]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/\n[25]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/pineapple-chili/\n[26]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-pineapple/\n[27]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/freeze-dried-mango-snack/\n[28]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/extra-virgin-avocado-oil/\n[29]: https://goodfrootsavocados.com/contact-us/ goodfrootsavocados.com"
