ays You Can Help Prevent a Migraine\n][48] [\n[young woman sitting on couch taking medication with water]\nMigraine Treatment Options and At-Home Remedies\n][49] [\n[Person making a peanut butter sandwich.]\nCould These 10 Foods Trigger Your Migraines?\n][50] [\n[Young black woman wearing a patterned shirt is taking a supplement pill and holding a glass of\nwater, sitting on a couch]\nHow Taking Magnesium May Bring Migraine Relief\n][51]\nJune Is Migraine Awareness Month\n[\n\n## Explore Conditions\n\nSee All Health Conditions ][52]\n[Breast Cancer][53] [Digestive Disorders][54] [Depression][55] [Heart Disease][56] [Lung Cancer][57]\n[Migraines][58] [Psoriasis][59] [Rheumatoid Arthritis][60] [Skin Conditions][61] [Type 2\nDiabetes][62] [See All Health Conditions ][63]\n[\n[A person scratching a red irritated area on their lower back.]\nHow Long Do Chronic Spontaneous Urticaria Symptoms Last?\n][64] [\n[A plate with cooked salmon and fresh spinach leaves.]\n7 Kinds of Food That Can Help With Obstructive Sleep Apnea\n][65] [\n[A woman sitting at a table using a smartphone with a laptop visible in the foreground]\nHow to Navigate Daily Tasks With Diabetic Macular Edema\n][66]\n[\n\n## Eat Well\n\nSee Tips for Eating Well ][67]\n[\n[a glass filled with pure, dark red cherry juice]\nWhat Happens to Your Sleep When You Drink Tart Cherry Juice Before Bed\n][68] [\n[Fish oil capsules displayed on a light pink background]\nFish Oil vs. Omega-3: Which Is Better For You?\n][69] [\n[Hand pours maple syrup from a glass bottle onto a stack of pancakes with fresh berries.]\nIs Maple Syrup Really Better for You Than Sugar?\n][70] [\n[two salmon filets on a plate]\nHow to Get Enough Vitamin D During the Winter Months\n][71]\n[\n\n## Move Your Body\n\nSee All Fitness ][72]\n[\n[Senior woman stretching and exercising in living room]\nWhat Taking Short Stretch Breaks During the Day May Do for Your Blood Sugar and Joint Health\n][73] [\n[Person stretching on a floor mat in a room with e