ducts\n\nProvide high-quality nutritional oils to global customers to empower health and life\n\n[ [Nutritional Oils] ][29]\n\n[ Nutritional Oils ][30]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][31]\n[ [Plant-based Protein Powders] ][32]\n\n[ Plant-based Protein Powders ][33]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][34]\n[ [Microencapsulated Oil Powders] ][35]\n\n[ Microencapsulated Oil Powders ][36]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][37]\n[ [Bottled Oils] ][38]\n\n[ Bottled Oils ][39]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][40]\n[ Learn more ][41]\n\nSANMARK\n\nAbout Us\n\nAfter more than 20 years of development, Sanmark has become a global leading enterprise in\nhigh-quality nutritional oils.\n\nSanmark ranks among the top in the global market share for its evening primrose oil, borage oil, and\nperilla seed oil, and is a leading enterprise in China's flaxseed oil exports. In 2025, relying on\nits outstanding quality and consumer trust, Sanmark's avocado oil won three major certifications in\nsales, brand influence, and customer reputation.\n\n\u00a0\n\n2\n\nProduction Bases\n\n4\n\nMarketing Centers\n\n15\n\nCertifications\n\n40 +\n\nServing over 40 Countries & Regions\n\n700 +\n\nOver 700 Corporate Customers\n\n50 +\n\nOver 50 varieties of Nutritional Oils\n\n[ Learn more ][42]\n\nSustainability\n\nFollow and Respect the Rules of Nature\n\n[ [\u73af\u5883\u8d23\u4efb] ][43]\n\n[ Environmental Responsibility ][44]\n\n[ From sustainable sourcing to full-chain recycling, Sanmark implements green processing, energy\nconservation and emission reduction to establish an ecological closed-loop system, thus fulfilling\nits environmental commitments. ][45]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][46]\n\n\n[ [\u793e\u4f1a\u8d23\u4efb] ][47]\n\n[ Social Responsibility ][48]\n\n[ Sanmark is committed to public welfare assistance, ecological protection and food safety\nassurance. It fulfills its diversified social responsibilities through assisting agriculture to\nboost industries, cross-border empowerment, and employee care. ][49]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][50]\n\n\n[ [\u516c\u53f8\u6cbb\u7406] ][51]\n\n[ Cor