andle Making, and Aromatherapy &mdash;each with their own challenges and requirements&mdash;are just a few of the industries Jedwards supports.\n\nContact Us\n\nWhy Choose Jedwards?\n\nJedwards International, Inc. is a family-owned business approaching a 100-year tradition of supplying wholesale specialty ingredients. Our origins were in the import and distribution of Omega-3 Fish Oils and Cod Liver Oil to Dietary Supplement producers. We have since evolved to specialize in supplying difficult-to-source Bulk Specialty Ingredients to small and mid-sized companies and contract manufacturers across North America.\n\nAs an established distributor, we proudly focus on Specialty Marine and Plant-based Oils and have developed long-standing partnerships across the globe. With inventory maintained in our own custom-built, geothermal facility south of Boston, Jedwards is well-positioned to adapt to supply chain challenges and disruptions as they arise for our bulk naturals and essentials portfolio.\n\nJedwards International, Inc. is a family-owned business with an almost 100-year tradition of supplying wholesale specialty ingredients. Our orig The store will not work correctly when cookies are disabled.\n\n**JavaScript seems to be disabled in your browser.** For the best experience on our site, be sure to\nturn on Javascript in your browser.\n\n**We use cookies to make your experience better.** To comply with the new e-Privacy directive, we\nneed to ask for your consent to set the cookies. [Learn more][1].\n\nAccept Cookies\n[ Skip to Content ][2]\n* [Blog][3]\n* [Sign In][4]\n* [Create an Account][5]\n[About Us][6]\n[Contact Us][7]\n* [ (617) 472-9300 Monday to Friday 9AM - 6PM (EST)][8]\n* [Contact Us][9]\n* [About Us][10]\n* [MOQ = $150 - Combine Any][11]\n* [Product Catalog][12]\n[ ][13]\nToggle Nav [ [ Jedwards International, Inc - Wholesale Bulk Supplier of Natural Ingredients]\n[Jedwards International, Inc] ][14]\n[ Account ][15]\n* [My Account ][16]\n* [My Cart ][17]\