 - Organic\n\nCotton Seed Oil - Solvent Extracted\n\nAscorbyl Palmitate\n\nWatermelon Seed Oil - Virgin Organic\n\nCyclopentasiloxane\n\nDimethicone\n\nLard - Deodorized\n\nView All New Products\n\nBEST SELLERS\n\nCoconut Oil - RBD\n\nRating:\n\n96.5%\n\n3 Reviews\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $26.25\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nJojoba Oil - Golden Organic\n\nRating:\n\n98%\n\n5 Reviews\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $66.47\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nShea Nut Butter - White Refined\n\nRating:\n\n100%\n\n10 Reviews\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $30.00\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nMagnesium Chloride - Dead Sea\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $41.25\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nBeeswax - Yellow Granules\n\nRating:\n\n95%\n\n4 Reviews\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $58.00\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nEpsom Salt (Magnesium Sulfate)\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $22.00\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nGlycerin - USP/BP Refined - RSPO MB\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $28.00\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nCoconut Oil - RBD Organic\n\nRating:\n\n100%\n\n1 Review\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $30.00\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nBeeswax - White Granules\n\nRating:\n\n100%\n\n1 Review\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $64.50\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nJojoba Oil - Golden\n\nRating:\n\n100%\n\n3 Reviews\n\nStarting at\n\nUSD $56.95\n\nAdd to Cart\n\nMore About Jedwards&hellip;\n\nWhom We Serve\n\nSince our founding, our mission has been to be the go-to bulk wholesale supplier of natural, organic, and specialty raw materials for companies servicing multiple industries. Personal Care, Soapmaking, Cosmetic, Specialty Food, Candle Making, and Aromatherapy &mdash;each with their own challenges and requirements&mdash;are just a few of the industries Jedwards supports.\n\nContact Us\n\nWhy Choose Jedwards?\n\nJedwards International, Inc. is a family-owned business approaching a 100-year tradition of supplying wholesale specialty ingredients. Our origins were in the import and distribution of Omega-3 Fish Oils and Cod Liver Oil to Dietary Supplement producers. We have since evolved to specialize in supplying difficult-to-source Bulk Specialty Ingredients to small and mid-sized companies and contract manufacturers across North America.\n\nAs an established distributor, we proudly focus on Specialty Marine and Plant-based Oils and have developed long-standing partnerships across the globe. With inventory maintained in our own custom-built, geothermal facility south of Boston, Jedwards is well-positioned to adapt to supply chain challenges and disruptions as they arise for our bulk naturals and essentials portfolio.\n\nJedwards International, Inc. is a family-owned business with an almost 100-year tradition of supplying wholesale specialty ingredients. Our origins were in the import and distribution of Omega-3 Fish Oils and Cod Liver Oil for use by Dietary Supplement producers. Since then, we have come to specialize in servicing the unique needs of a variety of small and mid-sized companies and contract manufacturers across North America with a range of difficult to source Bulk Specialty Ingredients, with a particular focus on Specialty Marine and Plant-based Oils.\n\nAs an established distributor that has developed long-standing partnerships across the globe and maintains inventory warehoused in our own custom-built geothermal facility, Jedwards is well-positioned to adapt to supply chain challenges and disruptions as they occur.\n\nAbout Us\nProduct Lines\nContact Us\n\nConventional & Organic Ingredients for Soap&nbsp;Making\n\nM&P Soaps \u2022 Shampoo, Conditioner & Lotion Bases \u2022 Exfoliants \u2022 More!\n\nConventional & Organic Ingredients for Soap&nbsp;Making\n\nNatural Products for Candle&nbsp;Making\n\nWaxes \u2022 Essential Oils \u2022 Oleo Chemicals\n\nNatural Products for Candle Making\n\nRaw Materials for Cosmetic & Personal Care&nbsp;Formulations\n\nOils \u2022 Butters \u2022 Waxes \u2022 Antioxidants \u2022 More!\n\nRaw Materials for Cosmetic & Personal Care&nbsp;Formulations\n\nCertifications\n\nOur globally-sourced products carry a variety of certifications:\n\nOrganic Fair&nbsp;Trade&nbsp;USA Fair&nbsp;For&nbsp;Life Kosher USP Non\u2011GMO Project&nbsp;Verified Sustainable Palm&nbsp;Oil American Emu Association Global&nbsp;Organization&nbsp;for&nbsp;EPA & DHA Handcrafted&nbsp;Soapmakers&nbsp;Guild EcoVadis Silver\n\nView USDA Organic Certificate\n\nView Fair Trade USA Certificate\n\nView Fair for Life Certificate\n\nNon-GMO Project Verified\n\nView RSPO Certficate\n\nPalm Done Right\n\nView American Emu Association Certified Oil\n\nView Handcrafted Soapmakers Member Oil\n\nGOED Omega-3 Member\n\nView EcoVadis Certification\n\nView Certificates\n\nGet Exclusive Discounts\n\nIn Your Facebook Feed!\n\nLike and follow us on Facebook to get notified of discounts and special promotions in your feed.\n\nVisit Our Facebook Page\n\nDirectly in Your Inbox!\n\nSign up for our newsletters and get notified of exclusive discounts, monthly promotions, and new product arrivals directly in your inbox at the beginning of every month.\n\nEmail *\n\nShould be Empty:\n\nWe value your privacy. Read our Privacy Policy here.\n\nInfo\n\nCustomer Service\n\nFAQs\n\nAbout Us\n\nThird Party Certifications\n\nInternational Orders\n\nTerms & Conditions of Sale\n\nShipment & Returns\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Use\n\nProduct Lines\n\nAntioxidants\n\nButters & Waxes\n\nChocolate \u2022 Cocoa \u2022 Coffee\n\nExtracts & Powders\n\nOils&ensp;(Carrier \u2022 Essential \u2022 +More!)\n\nOleochemicals & Acids\n\nSalts & Sweeteners\n\nCandle Making Supplies\n\nSoap Making Supplies\n\nPromotions\n\nCoupon Codes\nClearance -->\n\nNew Products\n\nSearch\n\nHome\n\nSite Map\nSearch Terms -->\nAdvanced Search -->\n\nConnect\n\nContact Us\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nNewsletters\n\nBlog\n\nReview Us on Google\n\nNEWSLETTER\n\nShould be Empty:\n\nhere.\n-->\n\nCertifications &amp; Sustainability\n\nOur globally-sourced products carry a variety of certifications:\n\nOrganic\n\nFair Trade USA\n\nFair For Life\n\nKosher\n\nRSPO\n\nPalm Done Right\n\nUSP\n\nNon-GMO Project Verified\n\nCOSMOS\n\nEcoVadis Bronze\n\nView USDA Organic Certificates\n\nView Fair Trade USA Certificate\n\nView Fair for Life Certificate\n\nView RSPO Certficate\n\nView Palm Done Right\n\nView Non-GMO Project Certificate\n\nView COSMOS Certificate\n\nView EcoVadis Certification\n\nView Certificates\n\nClose\n\nJedwards International, Inc. exports to most countries globally on a regular basis. While our e-commerce site supports the United States and Canada only, we can export majority of our products internationally. We accept international payments by wire only. Please submit a Contact Us form via our e-commerce platform for more information regarding international orders and shipping options.\n\n&copy; 2017\u20132026 Jedwards International, Inc. All Rights Reserved. The Jedwards logo design is a trademark of Jedwards International, Inc., in the USA other countries or both."
