leic Acid][122]\n* [Stearic Acid][123]\n* [Kosher Oleochemicals][124]\n* [Organic Certified Oleochemicals][125]\n* [Miscellaneous][126]\n* [ View All Miscellaneous ][127]\n* [Adapters & Packaging][128]\n* [Apple Cider Vinegar][129]\n* [Non-Plant-based Products][130]\n* [Polymers & Compounds][131]\n* [Candle Making Materials][132]\n* [ View All Candle Making Materials ][133]\n* [Candle Making Waxes][134]\n* [Candle Fragrance Oils][135]\n* [Oleochemicals & Acids][136]\n* [Butters][137]\n* [Soap Making Materials][138]\n* [ View All Soap Making Materials ][139]\n* [Soap & Body Wash Bases][140]\n* [Hair Care Bases][141]\n* [Liquid Castile Soap Bases][142]\n* [Lotion & Body Butter Bases][143]\n* [Exfoliants][144]\n* [Colorants & Additives][145]\n* [Glycerin & Glycol][146]\n* [Preservatives & Hardeners][147]\n* [Carrier Oils - Soapmaking][148]\n* [Essential Oils - Soapmaking][149]\n* [Butters - Soapmaking][150]\n* [Waxes - Soapmaking][151]\n* [Stephenson Personal Care Products][152]\n* [New Products][153]\n* [Sales & Promotions][154]\n* [ View All Sales & Promotions ][155]\n* [Special Savings][156]\n* [Clearance][157]\n* [Certifications][158]\n* [FAQs][159]\n* [Newsletter][160]\n* [Blog][161]\n[ Account ][162]\n* [ (617) 472-9300 Monday to Friday 9AM - 6PM (EST)][163]\n* [Contact Us][164]\n* [About Us][165]\n* [MOQ = $150 - Combine Any][166]\n* [Product Catalog][167]\n* [ Home ][168]\n* **About Us**\n\n# About Us\n\n*Cod Liver Oil Processing in South Boston, Massachusetts (1940)*\n\n**Jedwards International, Inc.** is a wholesale bulk supplier of natural Ingredients. Our\nincorporation in 1994 represents the continuation of a** **100-year family tradition in the\n**specialty oils and ingredient market,** which started with the processing and refining of cod\nliver oil in South Boston.\n\nJedwards International has worked aggressively to expand its product line to include many\n**difficult-to-source, custom-manufactured materials,** such as our certified Organic Fair Trade\nVirgin Shea Butter. We own and operate a **state-of-the-art geothermal temperature-regulated\nwarehouse** in Massachusetts, from which we can quickly supply a variety of carrier oils, essential\noils, waxes, salts, sweeteners, extracts and concentrates. As a result, Jedwards has become a\n**leading supplier to many small and mid-sized manufacturers** of many hot personal care\ningredients, including Moroccan Argan Oil, Olive Oil Squalane, Shea Butter, Jojoba Oil, and Virgin\nCoconut Oil.\n\nJedwards has developed an extensive global network of manufacturing and supply partners,\nconsolidating each of their unique strengths under one roof. **Our mission** is to supply innovative\nspecialty oils and other bulk ingredients to the food, dietary supplement, cosmetic, soap and candle\nmaking industries and to help our customers grow. A strategic partner to vendor and customer alike,\n**Jedwards International brings value and innovation** to the marketplace. We encourage you to\nexplore the wealth of information and products available.\n\n**View or Download File**\n[pdf]\n**Animal Testing Statement***\n(Size: 165.2 KB)\n[pdf]\n[ **Product Catalog** ][169]\n(Size: 527.5 KB)\n* To view or download files marked with an asterisk *, please [Login][170] or [Register][171].\n**Info**\n* [Customer Service][172]\n* [FAQs][173]\n* [About Us][174]\n* [Third Party Certifications][175]\n* [International Orders][176]\n* [Terms & Conditions of Sale][177]\n* [Shipment & Returns][178]\n* [Privacy Policy][179]\n* [Terms of Use][180]\n**Product Lines**\n* [Antioxidants][181]\n* [Butters & Waxes][182]\n* [Chocolate \u2022 Cocoa \u2022 Coffee][183]\n* [Extracts & Powders][184]\n* [Oils (Carrier \u2022 Essential \u2022 +More!)][185]\n* [Oleochemicals & Acids][186]\n* [Salts & Sweeteners][187]\n* [Candle Making Supplies][188]\n* [Soap Making Supplies][189]\n**Promotions**\n* [Coupon Codes][190]\n* [New Products][191]\n**Search**\n* [Home][192]\n* [Site Map][193]\n**Connect**\n* [Contact Us][194]\n* [Facebook][195]\n* [Twitter][196]\n* [Instagram][197]\n* [Newsletters][198]\n* [Blog][199]\n* [Review Us on Google][200]\nNEWSLETTER\n\nShould be Empty:\n\n## Certifications & Sustainability\n\nOur globally-sourced products carry a variety of certifications:\n* Organic\n* Fair Trade USA\n* Fair For Life\n* Kosher\n* RSPO\n* Palm Done Right\n* USP\n* Non-GMO Project Verified\n* COSMOS\n* EcoVadis Bronze\n\n[ [usda organic symbol]\nView USDA Organic Certificates\n][201]\n[ [fair trade usa symbol]\nView Fair Trade USA Certificate\n][202]\n[ [fair for life symbol]\nView Fair for Life Certificate\n][203]\n[ [rspo symbol]\nView RSPO Certficate\n][204]\n[ [palm done right]\nView Palm Done Right\n][205]\n[ [non gmo project verified]\nView Non-GMO Project Certificate\n][206]\n[ [Cosmos Approved]\nView COSMOS Certificate\n][207]\n[ [Bronze EcoVadis Medal]\nView EcoVadis Certification\n][208]\n[View Certificates][209]\n\n[**Close**][210]\n\n**Jedwards International, Inc.** exports to most countries globally on a regular basis. While our\ne-commerce site supports the United States and Canada only, we can export majority of our products\ninternationally. We accept international payments by wire only. Please submit a [Contact Us\nform][211] via our e-commerce platform for more information regarding international orders and\nshipping options.\n\u00a9 2017\u20132026 Jedwards International, Inc. All Rights Reserved. The Jedwards logo design is a\ntrademark of Jedwards International, Inc., in the USA other countries or both.\n\n[1]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/privacy-policy-cookie-restriction-mode/\n[2]: #contentarea\n[3]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/blog.html\n[4]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/customer/account/login/referer/aHR0cHM6Ly9idWxrbmF0dXJhbG9pbHMuY29t\nL2Fib3V0LXVz/\n[5]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/customer/account/create/\n[6]: /about-us\n[7]: /contact-us\n[8]: tel:617-472-9300\n[9]: /contact-us\n[10]: /about-us\n[11]: /faq#moq\n[12]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/mwdownloads/download/link/id/992\n[13]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/\n[14]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/\n[15]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/customer/account/\n[16]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/customer/account/\n[17]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/checkout/cart/\n[18]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/checkout/\n[19]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/customer/account/create/\n[20]: https://bulknaturaloils.com//customer/account/login/\n[21]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/checkout/cart/\n[22]: #store.menu\n[23]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils.html\n[24]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils.html\n[25]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/bulk-essential-oils.html\n[26]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/bulk-essential-oils.html\n[27]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/bulk-essential-oils/kosher-essential-oils.html\n[28]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/bulk-essential-oils/organic.html\n[29]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/plant-oils.html\n[30]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/plant-oils.html\n[31]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/plant-oils/fair-trade-plant-oils.html\n[32]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/plant-oils/kosher-plant-oils.html\n[33]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/plant-oils/organic-certified-oils.html\n[34]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/marine-oils.html\n[35]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/marine-oils.html\n[36]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/marine-oils/kosher-marine-oils.html\n[37]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/mineral-oils-plus.html\n[38]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/mineral-oils-plus.html\n[39]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/mineral-oils-plus/mineral-oils.html\n[40]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/fragrance-oils.html\n[41]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/animal-oil.html\n[42]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/fair-trade-oils.html\n[43]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/kosher-oils.html\n[44]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/oils/organic-certified-oils.html\n[45]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/butter-wax.html\n[46]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/butter-wax.html\n[47]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/butter-wax/butters.html\n[48]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/butter-wax/butters.html\n[49]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/butter-wax/butters/fair-trade-butters.html\n[50]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/butter-wax/butters/kosher-butters.html\n[51]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/butter-wax/butters/organic-certified-butters.html\n[52]: https://bulknaturaloils.com/butter-wax/waxes.html\n[5"
