            "text": "AVODEMIA - We Export Fresh Avocados &amp; Premium Avocado Oil Supply\n\ninquiry@avodemia.com\nEmail\n\nRuiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd, Godown No. 519 Near KPLC sub branch\nLocation\n\nGet A Quote\n\nHome\nAbout Us\nServices\nWhy Us\nBlog\nContacts\n\n\"Avodemia: Certified Exporters of Premium Avocado Products\"\n\nPure, Cold-Pressed Avocado Crude Oil\n\nPartnering with Over 4,700+ Farmers, Committed to Quality\"\n\nFresh Organic Avocado\n\nAvodemia is one of Kenya\u2019s leading avocado exporters, connecting premium-quality Kenyan avocados to global markets.\nWe specialize in exporting high-quality fresh avocados that are carefully handpicked and subjected to strict quality control before final export, ensuring every fruit meets international standards. For avocado farmers in Kenya, Avodemia offers a trusted market partner committed to quality, fair partnerships, and helping growers unlock the full value of their harvest.\n\nMore About Us\n\nCrude Avocado Oil\n\nProducer of 100% Pure &amp; Organic Avocado Cooking Oil\nWe, are one of the largest producer of Avocado Oil in Kenya. Our Bulk crude oil and branded bottled product are exported worldwide. We produce best quality of Avocado Oil with high nutritional value.\n\nMore About Us\n\nOur Impact in Numbers\n\n6M Kgs Annual Fresh Avocado Production\n\n4,700 Contracted Farmers, 81% + Certified\n\n1.6M Kgs Annual Oil Production\n\nAvocado PackHouse\n\nOur packhouse ensures every avocado is graded, inspected, and packed to meet strict export standards. Each fruit is checked for size, ripeness, and quality , guaranteeing consistency in every shipment.\n\nMore About Us\n\nCertifications\n\nQuick Links\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nServices\n\nWhy Us\n\nBlog\n\nContacts\n\nRecent Posts\n\nKenya Avocado Export Season April 2026: Strategy, Challenges &amp; Opportunities\n\nMature Avocado Tree Care Guide: Tips for Health, Growth &amp; High Production\n\nAvocado Farming in Kenya Guide: Climate, Pests, Harvest &amp; Postharvest\n\ninquiry@avodemia.com\nDrop Us a Line\n\n+ 254 705 888 444\nCall Us Now\n\nRuiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd\nLocation\n\n\u00a9 All right reserved 2026 Avodemia\n\nWhatsApp us"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://avodemia.com/about-us/",
            "text": "[ [AVODEMIA] [AVODEMIA] ][1]\n* [inquiry@avodemia.com][2] Email\n* Ruiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd, Godown No. 519 Near KPLC sub branch Location\n[Get A Quote][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n* [Services][6]\n* [Why Us][7]\n* [Blog][8]\n* [Contacts][9]\n[lush avocado tree with avocados from an avodemian farmer farm]\n\n## Who We Are\n\nAt Avodemia, we have established ourselves as leaders in the avocado industry, leveraging cutting\nedge technology and sustainable practices to deliver exception products. We export fresh avocados,\nhave a state-of the art packing house and we process and export cold pressed avocado crude oil.\n\n[ More About Us ][10]\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][11]\n* [About Us][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Why Us][14]\n* [Blog][15]\n* [Contacts][16]\n\n### Recent Posts\n* [Kenya Avocado Export Season April 2026: Strategy, Challenges & Opportunities][17]\n* [Mature Avocado Tree Care Guide: Tips for Health, Growth & High Production][18]\n* [Avocado Farming in Kenya Guide: Climate, Pests, Harvest & Postharvest][19]\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n[inquiry@avodemia.com][20] Drop Us a Line\n[+ 254 705 888 444][21] Call Us Now\nRuiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd Location\n\u00a9 All right reserved 2026 Avodemia\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: https://avodemia.com/\n[2]: mailto:in%71uiry@avodem%69a.%63om\n[3]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[4]: https://avodemia.com/home/\n[5]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[6]: https://avodemia.com/products/service/\n[7]: https://avodemia.com/products/why-us/\n[8]: https://avodemia.com/blog-grid/\n[9]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[10]: https://avodemia.com/products/service/\n[11]: https://avodemia.com/home/\n[12]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[13]: https://avodemia.com/products/service/\n[14]: https://avodemia.com/products/why-us/\n[15]: https://avodemia.com/blog-grid/\n[16]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[17]: https://avodemia.com/kenya-avocado-export-season-april-2026-strategy-challenges-opportunities/\n[18]: https://avodemia.com/mature-avocado-tree-care-guide-tips-for-health-growth-high-production/\n[19]: https://avodemia.com/avocado-farming-guide-climate-pests-harvest-postharvest/\n[20]: mailto:%69nquir%79%40a%76odemi%61.%63%6f%6d\n[21]: tel:+ 254 705 888 444"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://avodemia.com/products/service/",
            "text": "[ [AVODEMIA] [AVODEMIA] ][1]\n* [inquiry@avodemia.com][2] Email\n* Ruiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd, Godown No. 519 Near KPLC sub branch Location\n[Get A Quote][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n* [Services][6]\n* [Why Us][7]\n* [Blog][8]\n* [Contacts][9]\n\n# Avocado Pack House Facility\n\nWelcome to our state-of-the-art avocado pack house facility, where quality meets efficiency. At\nAvodemia, we offer comprehensive packing services to ensure the freshness and premium quality of our\navocados. Our pack house facility is equipped with advanced technology and operated by skilled\nprofessionals dedicated to delivering excellence at every step of the process.\n\n[ Contact us ][10]\n[avocados packed in crates inside avodemia warehouse before they are processed for export]\n\n# Our Pack House Services\n\nExpert handling, sorting, and packaging of fresh avocados and avocado oil to meet global standards.\n\n#### [\n####\n#### Timely Delivery\n####\n#### ][11]\n\nWe are committed to delivering our freshly packed avocados in a timely and efficient manner. Our\nlogistics team works closely with trusted transportation partners to ensure prompt delivery to\ndomestic and international markets, minimizing transit times and maximizing shelf life.\n\n#### [Quality Control][12]\n\nQuality is our top priority. Our pack house facility is equipped with quality control measures and\nprocedures to maintain the highest standards of food safety and hygiene. We adhere to strict\nprotocols and regulations to ensure that our products meet or exceed industry standards.\n\n#### [Customizations][13]\n\nWe understand that every customer has unique needs and preferences. That\u2019s why we offer customizable\npacking solutions to accommodate different packaging sizes, labelling requirements, and branding\nspecifications. Whether you\u2019re a retailer, distributor, or food service provider, we can tailor our\nservices to meet your individual needs.\n\n#### [Sorting and Grading][14]\n\nWe employ meticulous sorting and grading processes to ensure that only the finest avocados meet our\nquality standards. Each avocado is carefully inspected for size, ripeness, and blemishes, ensuring\nconsistency and uniformity in every pack.\n\n#### [Packaging][15]\n\nOur packaging solutions are designed to preserve the freshness and flavor of our avocados during\ntransportation and storage. We offer a variety of packaging options, including cartons, trays, and\ncustomized branding solutions tailored to meet your specific requirements.\n\n# Our Products\n\n## **Fresh Avocados**\n\nHandpicked by our local farmers in Kenya, our fresh avocados are carefully selected for their\nsuperior taste, texture, and nutritional\nvalue.\n\n## **Avocado Crude Oil**\n\nOur cold-pressed avocado oil is extracted from ripe avocados using state-of-the-art technology,\npreserving the natural goodness and health benefits of the fruit\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][16]\n* [About Us][17]\n* [Services][18]\n* [Why Us][19]\n* [Blog][20]\n* [Contacts][21]\n\n### Recent Posts\n* [Kenya Avocado Export Season April 2026: Strategy, Challenges & Opportunities][22]\n* [Mature Avocado Tree Care Guide: Tips for Health, Growth & High Production][23]\n* [Avocado Farming in Kenya Guide: Climate, Pests, Harvest & Postharvest][24]\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n[inquiry@avodemia.com][25] Drop Us a Line\n[+ 254 705 888 444][26] Call Us Now\nRuiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd Location\n\u00a9 All right reserved 2026 Avodemia\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: https://avodemia.com/\n[2]: mailto:inqu%69%72y@avod%65m%69a.%63%6f%6d\n[3]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[4]: https://avodemia.com/home/\n[5]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[6]: https://avodemia.com/products/service/\n[7]: https://avodemia.com/products/why-us/\n[8]: https://avodemia.com/blog-grid/\n[9]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[10]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[11]: #\n[12]: #\n[13]: #\n[14]: #\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://avodemia.com/home/\n[17]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[18]: https://avodemia.com/products/service/\n[19]: https://avodemia.com/products/why-us/\n[20]: https://avodemia.com/blog-grid/\n[21]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[22]: https://avodemia.com/kenya-avocado-export-season-april-2026-strategy-challenges-opportunities/\n[23]: https://avodemia.com/mature-avocado-tree-care-guide-tips-for-health-growth-high-production/\n[24]: https://avodemia.com/avocado-farming-guide-climate-pests-harvest-postharvest/\n[25]: mailto:%69n%71%75iry%40av%6f%64emia.%63om\n[26]: tel:+ 254 705 888 444"
