            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [Frame] ][2]\n* [ Our Oils ][3]\n  * [ Products][4]\n    * [ Olive Oils ][5]\n    * [ Olive Oil Blends ][6]\n    * [ Vegetable Oils ][7]\n    * [ Specialty Oils ][8]\n    * [ Tropical Oils ][9]\n    * [ Fry Oils ][10]\n    * [ Popcorn Oils ][11]\n    * [ Butter Alternatives ][12]\n  * [Browse Products] [Browse Products ][13]\n    [Buy Now] [Buy Now ][14]\n* [ Commitment To Quality ][15]\n  * [ Quality Assurance Process ][16]\n  * [ Certifications ][17]\n  * [ Responsible Sourcing ][18]\n* [ Who We Serve ][19]\n  * [ Bulk Buyers Food & Industrial Manufacturers ][20]\n  * [ Foodservice Restaurants, Chains, Distributors ][21]\n  * [ Retail Grocery, Club Stores, Brokers ][22]\n  * [ Private Label Your Brand ][23]\n  * [ Soapers & Small Business Crafters, Cooks, Startups ][24]\n* [ Company ][25]\n  * [ Partner With Us ][26]\n  * [ Our Story ][27]\n  * [ Catania Cares ][28]\n  * [ Annual Golf Tournament ][29]\n  * [ Careers ][30]\n* [ Resources ][31]\n  * [ Blog ][32]\n  * [ Resource Center ][33]\n  * [ Product Catalog ][34]\n[ Talk to Sales ][35]\n\u2716\n* [ Our Oils ][36]\n  * [ Products][37]\n    * [ Olive Oils ][38]\n    * [ Olive Oil Blends ][39]\n    * [ Vegetable Oils ][40]\n    * [ Specialty Oils ][41]\n    * [ Tropical Oils ][42]\n    * [ Fry Oils ][43]\n    * [ Popcorn Oils ][44]\n    * [ Butter Alternatives ][45]\n  * [Other Links][46]\n    * [ Browse Products ][47]\n    * [ Buy Now ][48]\n* [ Commitment To Quality ][49]\n  * [ Quality Assurance Process ][50]\n  * [ Certifications ][51]\n  * [ Responsible Sourcing ][52]\n* [ Who We Serve ][53]\n  * [ Bulk Buyers Food & Industrial Manufacturers ][54]\n  * [ Foodservice Restaurants, Chains, Distributors ][55]\n  * [ Retail Grocery, Club Stores, Brokers ][56]\n  * [ Private Label Your Brand ][57]\n  * [ Soapers & Small Business Crafters, Cooks, Startups ][58]\n* [ Company ][59]\n  * [ Partner With Us ][60]\n  * [ Our Story ][61]\n  * [ Catania Cares ][62]\n  * [ Annual Golf Tournament ][63]\n  * [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Resources ][65]\n  * [ Blog ][66]\n  * [ Resource Center ][67]\n  * [ Product Catalog ][68]\n[ Talk to Sales ][69]\n\u2716\nFamily-Owned Since 1900\n\n# Authenticity in Every Drop\n\nCatania Oils is the trusted supplier of plant-based oils for every scale of business. From authentic\nolive and vegetable oils to avocado and specialty blends, we pair proven quality with responsive\nservice, market insight, and packaging that fits your operation.\n[Discover Our Legacy][70] [Explore Product Catalog][71]\n[olive branch lineart light green cropped]\n\n## Our Oils\n\nOil isn\u2019t a side category, it\u2019s our entire craft. With over 125 years of expertise, we source\nglobally, test every batch in-house, and deliver with full documentation. Whether our oils carry\nyour private label or become a core ingredient in your creation, you can trust us to protect your\nbrand with quality, consistency, and care.\n\nOlive Oils\n\nOlive oil is where our story began, and it remains at the heart of what we do. From Extra Virgin to\nLight Tasting and Pomace, our portfolio delivers dependable flavor, heat performance, and\nversatility for retail, foodservice, and private label programs.\n\n[See Olive Oils][72] [Product Catalog][73]\nOlive Oil Blends\n\nOur blends balance olive flavor with dependable high-heat performance. We pair EVOO, olive oil, or\npomace with vegetable or sunflower oils to create flexible options for cooking and custom\nformulations. Choose from trusted ratios or request a blend tailored to your goals.\n\n[See Blends][74] [Product Catalog][75]\nVegetable Oils\n\nFor teams that need consistency at scale, our soybean, canola, corn, and sunflower oils support\nfrying, baking, and blending with ease. Many options are organic or Non-GMO Project Verified, and\nevery choice is backed by rigorous quality testing.\n\n[See Vegetable Oils][76] [Product Catalog][77]\nTropical Oils\n\nFrom baked snacks to plant-based spreads to wellness and skincare products, our coconut oils and\nRSPO-certified palm oils deliver the texture, stability, and clean-label attributes makers rely on.\nAvailable in organic, RBD, kernel, and shortening options.\n\n[See Tropical Oils][78] [Product Catalog][79]\nSpecialty Oils\n\nAvocado, a customer favorite, plus almond, grapeseed, jojoba, and more. Our specialty oils support\ndistinctive flavors, clean-label formulations, and culinary or personal care innovation, sourced\nfrom trusted global partners and verified for quality in our own lab.\n\n[See Specialty Oils][80] [Product Catalog][81]\nFry Oils\n\nEngineered for busy kitchens that run hot and fast, our fry oils include high oleic, non-GMO, and\npurpose-built blends designed for long fry life and crisp results. Trusted by independents, QSRs,\nnational chains, and leading food manufacturers for performance that stays consistent across\nlocations and production lines.\n\n[See Fry Oils][82] [Product Catalog][83]\nPopcorn Oils\n\nU-POP and U-TOP streamline concession workflows. Liquid at room temperature with no melting or\nrefrigeration needed, they deliver natural golden color, buttery flavor, and vegan, kosher-friendly\nsimplicity for theaters and foodservice.\n\n[See Popcorn Oils][84] [Product Catalog][85]\nButter Alternatives\n\nMade with extra virgin olive oil and sea salt, our liquid butter alternative brings rich flavor\nwithout dairy or common allergens. It stays pourable, saves fridge space, and performs beautifully\nfor saut\u00e9ing, grilling, sauces, and high-volume kitchens.\n\n[See Butter Alternatives][86] [Product Catalog][87]\nPartnership First\n\n## More than a Supplier, a True Partner\n\n### We bring market insights, risk mitigation, and uncompromising quality to every relationship,\n### treating your business like our own.\n\n[ What Makes Us Different ][88]\n[plant-blow-molder-LB-zoomed-in-default-cards]\nCertainty With Every Order\nDirect relationships across 30+ countries and meticulous records mean you know the origin, the\nspecs, and the \u201cwhy\u201d behind every oil we ship.\n[Our Sourcing][89]\n[lab-oil-mid-drop-vertical-cards]\nProven Credibility, Down to the Detail\nAOCS-certified chemists validate each lot in our in-house lab and verify through external partners.\nRetained samples for two years support total traceability.\n[Our Quality Assurance][90]\n[plant-retail-4-ST-default-cards]\nStandards for Discerning Consumers\nNon-GMO Project Verified, USDA Organic, RSPO, Kosher, and more. Real certifications, current audits,\nand documentation ready for your files.\n[Our Certifications][91]\nBuilt Around You\n\n## We Fit Your Business\n\n### We support manufacturers, chefs, retailers, and makers testing their first recipe and\n### coordinating national distribution alike. Whatever your stage, we match your specs, volumes, and\n### timelines with direct access to our experts.\n\n[tanker-loading-landscape-cards]\nBulk Buyers\nWe move oils by the tote, drum, and tanker to give food producers and major distributors a steady\nsupply. Our team helps you forecast demand, manage risk, and keep production on schedule.\n[How We Support Bulk Buyers ][92]\n[wok-action-shot-landscape-cards]\nFoodservice\nQSRs, chains, and concessions love our high-performance fry oils, olive oils, and blends.\nRight-sized packaging and responsive support keep back-of-house running smoothly.\n[How We Support Foodservice][93]\n[OO-bottle-FS-lifestyle-landscape-cards (1)]\nRetail\nShelf-ready olive, vegetable, and specialty oils with strong consumer appeal. From 3/8-oz packets to\n3L bottles, we\u2019re built for scale.\n[How We Support Retail][94]\n[plant-retail-4-LP-landscape-card]\nPrivate Label\nBuild your own brand with confidence. Our reliable, consistent, premium oils and flexible packaging\noptions ensure your label stands out across every SKU.\n[How We Support Private Label][95]\n[soap-making-landscape-cards]\nSoapers &\nSmall Business\nWe've got you covered for base oils for soapmaking or specialty oils for your early-stage food\nbusiness. Order one or a few large containers through our online store.\n[How We Support Entrepreneurs][96]\nWhy Catania Oils\n\n## What Sets Us Apart\n\n### Four generations in, we still lead with expertise, integrity, and a service mindset you can\n### feel.\n\n[tote-fill-2-default-cards]\nSized to Fit,\nBuilt To Scale\nFrom 8-oz bottles to 8-ton shipments, choose packaging that matches your operation today and grows\nwith tomorrow\u2019s plans.\n[warehouse-WR-default-cards]\nConsistency\nAcross Locations\nNational chains and manufacturers count on uniform flavor and performance across sites, lots, and\nseasons, batch after batch.\n[plant-retail-4-bottle-blur-default-cards]\nBig Capability,\nHands-On Care\nWe're dedicated to top-of-the-line oils, blending, and QA, paired with the direct access and\nresponsiveness only a family company delivers.\n[railyard-JB-MC-updated-default-cards]\nMarket Expertise,\nReal Guidance\nWe share pricing trends and supply signals so you can mitigate risks and buy smarter. Subscribe for\nupdates or talk with our team one-on-one.\n[basille-family-AB-4th-default-cards]\nRelationships That Last\n\"We are Family\u201d is more than a core value, it\u2019s how we live. Visit our facility, see our integrity\nin action, and join a community that treats your business like our own.\nLet\u2019s Partner\n\n## Here to Help You Grow\n\nStartup batches, national supply, and everything between. Get the oils, insights, and partnership\nthat keep your business moving.\n\n[Partner With Us][97] [Discover Our Legacy][98]\n[SB-and-JB-with-tanks-CTA-row-2]\n* [Our Oils][99]\n  * [Olive Oils][100]\n  * [Olive Oils Blends][101]\n  * [Vegetable Oils][102]\n  * [Specialty Oils][103]\n  * [Tropical Oils][104]\n  * [Fry Oils][105]\n  * [Popcorn Oils][106]\n  * [Butter Alternatives][107]\n* [Commitment To Quality][108]\n  * [Quality Assurance Process][109]\n  * [Certifications][110]\n  * [Responsible Sourcing][111]\n* [Who We Serve][112]\n  * [Bulk Buyers][113]\n  * [Foodservice][114]\n  * [Retail][115]\n  * [Private Label][116]\n  * [Soapers & Small Business][117]\n* [Company][118]\n  * [Partner With Us][119]\n  * [Our Story][120]\n  * [Catania Cares][121]\n  * [Annual Golf Tournament][122]\n  * [Careers][123]\n* [Resources][124]\n  * [Blog][125]\n  * [Resource Center][126]\n  * [Product Catalog][127]\n  * [Market Updates][128]\n  * [Shop][129]\n\u00a9 2026 Catania Oils\n* [Privacy Policy][130]\n* [Terms of Use][131]\n* [Terms of Sale][132]\n[ [Group ] ][133]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: javascript:void(0)\n[4]: javascript:void(0)\n[5]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/olive-oil\n[6]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/olive-oil-blends\n[7]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/vegetable-oil\n[8]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/specialty-oils\n[9]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/tropical-oil\n[10]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/fry-oils\n[11]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/popcorn-oil\n[12]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/butter-alternatives\n[13]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/product-catalog\n[14]: https://cataniaoils.myshopify.com/\n[15]: javascript:void(0)\n[16]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/quality-assurance\n[17]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/certifications\n[18]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/sourcing\n[19]: javascript:void(0)\n[20]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/bulk\n[21]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/foodservice\n[22]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/retail\n[23]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/private-label\n[24]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/soapers-and-small-businesses\n[25]: javascript:void(0)\n[26]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/about-us\n[27]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/legacy\n[28]: /catania-cares\n[29]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/basile-family-memorial-golf-tournament\n[30]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/careers\n[31]: javascript:void(0)\n[32]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/blog\n[33]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/resources\n[34]: https://www.cataniaoils.com/product-catalog\n[35]: https://cta-service-cms2.hubspot.com/web-interactives/public/v1/track/click?encryptedPayload=A\nVxigLLRuRIeBlFXmgP4UVfLSnjlQLm%2FgVP%2BVX4mJwiutoT9AFQpp01UIEyFX5umfm5DxAAcCN24Dda%2BNCaW89%2FgiEE6S\nf7bdhi43IpMZBjUXPbeCvqQwEtu5qqe5y4FRy3i%2FdkHXLgwWOIAxtW53lSfe3log2fKObmLcx4%2Frqnf9S6WwBaGxwXDWSalG\nFT77QHoape1VyvNp54%2BGYt9cZ68oDPRs1Q%3D&portalId=47573679\n[36]: javascript:void(0)\n[37]: javascript:void(0)\n[38]: htt"
