on selected days over the festive period. Normal\nworking hours and delivery services will resume from **Friday 2nd January. **\n\nWe use Royal Mail and DPD to deliver across the UK.\n* Free UK Delivery on orders over \u00a345\n* Standard Delivery (Royal Mail Tracked): \u00a33.99 on orders under \u00a345.\n* Next Day Delivery (DPD): \u00a35.99.\n\nYou have a full 60 days from the date of purchase to try out our foods and supplements. If you find\nyourself not completely satisfied within this period, simply reach out to our customer service team\nand let them know.\n\n**\u2713 **HASSLE-FREE RETURNS\n\n**\u2713 **RISK-FREE ONLINE PURCHASES\n\n**\u2713 **FULL REFUND ON RETURN OF GOODS\n\nMore detail on our 60-day money-back guarantee can be found [here][67].\n\n[Klarna] [American Express] [Apple Pay] [PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Visa]\nIngredients & Nutritional Label ][68]\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\n\n## What to expect over time\n* ### Week 1\n\nEnjoy a light, savoury broth that\u2019s easy to add to your day, whether sipped or used in cooking, a\nsimple way to top up protein and collagen.\n* ### Month 1\n\nIncreased support for muscle recovery and lean mass, with collagen-rich protein helping support\njoints and connective tissue. Enhanced energy levels throughout the day.\n* ### Month 2-3\n\nFeel supported in your everyday strength and energy with consistent, high-quality protein, while\ncollagen helps maintain joint comfort and support your skin, hair and nails.\n* ### Month 3-6\n\nEnjoy lasting benefits with reliable protein intake supporting muscle maintenance and healthy\nbones, alongside collagen to support joints, skin, and connective tissue over time.\n\n## Bone Broth Showdown\n\n[Free Range Chicken Bone Broth] Our Bone Broth\nThe Other Guys\nProtein Content\n11g per serving\nMinimal\nTaste\nTastes like chicken\nVarious soup flavour\nConvenience\nTravel-friendly, powder format\nNot easily portable\nPrice Per Serve\n\u00a31.50 per serving\n\u00a34+ per serving\nSustainability\nFree-range European chicken bones\nUnknown sourcing\nStorage\nShelf stable, easily stored\nNeeds refrigeration, spoils quickly\n[Try Now ][69]\n\nLab tested for purity\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][70]\n[Free Range Chicken Bone Broth] Ingredients\n\nFree Range Chicken Bone Broth, Nutritional Yeast, Himalayan Pink Salt, Yeast Extract, Tomato,\nCarrot, Onion, Thyme, Rosemary\n\n## A Real Food Chicken Bone Broth for Everyday Use\n\n### Why Choose Chicken Bone Broth\n\nOur chicken bone broth is a **light, versatile staple made from free-range chicken**, designed to\nfit easily into your everyday routine.\n\nWith a delicious, real chicken flavour, it\u2019s made to sip, stir and savour, whether enjoyed as a warm\ndrink or used in your cooking. It\u2019s a simple, practical way to bring real food nourishment into your\nday.\n\n### Benefits of Chicken Bone Broth\n\nEach serving provides **11g of protein, supporting muscle strength, energy and overall wellbeing as\npart of a balanced diet.**\n\nNaturally rich in **type 1 and type 2 collagen**, it also supports joint structure and mobility,\nhelping you stay active and consistent in your routine. A warm, savoury option that fits naturally\ninto everyday life.\n\n### How to Use Chicken Bone Broth\n\nUse it anywhere you\u2019d normally reach for stock, from soups and sauces to slow-cooked dishes and\nsavoury recipes. It adds depth of flavour while naturally increasing the protein content of your\ncooking.\n\nYou can also enjoy it on its own as a warm, savoury drink when you want something simple and\nnourishing.\n\nWatch Video\n][71]\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][72]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nCan you drink Chicken Bone Broth every day?\n\nYes, chicken bone broth is designed for regular use and can be enjoyed daily as part of a balanced\ndiet, either on its own or added to meals.\n\nIn fact, you'll see greater benefits to your skin, hair, nails and gut, with consisent intake.\n\nWhat are the benefits of Chicken Bone Broth?\n\nChicken bone broth is a natural source of protein and collagen, supporting muscle maintenance, joint\nstructure and overall wellbeing. It\u2019s a simple, real food way to add nourishment to your daily\nroutine.\n\nHow do I use Chicken Bone Broth?\n\nAdd 10g (about one heaped tablespoons) to a mug of 250ml boiling water, fill a third with hot water,\nwhisk to form a paste, then top up with more hot water and whisk again.\n\nSip as a drink, or add the paste to recipes for a nutritional upgrade.\n\nIs Chicken Bone Broth high in protein?\n\nYes, chicken bone broth provides a convenient source of protein, with each serving delivering 11g to\nsupport muscle strength, energy and daily intake.\n\nCan I cook with Chicken Bone Broth?\n\nChicken bone broth can be enjoyed as a warm drink or used in cooking. It works well in soups,\nsauces, stews and savoury dishes as a natural alternative to stock.\n\nWhat\u2019s in it besides Bone Broth? Any additives or preservatives?\n\nAlongside nutrient-rich bone broth, you\u2019ll find real food ingredients like carrots, tomato, onion,\npink Himalayan salt, chicken extract, and natural herbs and spices. We never use artificial\nadditives or yeast extracts.\n\nCan I use it instead of stock cubes or bouillon?\n\nAbsolutely. Just make a small paste with hot water, and add to your recipes. It\u2019s a clean-label,\nreal-food upgrade to the highly processed stuff. Better taste, better nutrition.\n\nWhat is the difference between Chicken Bone Broth and stock?\n\nChicken bone broth is typically simmered to extract more protein and naturally occurring collagen,\nmaking it a more nourishing option compared to standard stock.\n\nCan I take the Chicken Bone Broth and Collagen Peptides together?\n\nYes, absolutely. Our Chicken Bone Broth and Collagen Peptides are designed to complement each other\nperfectly.\n\nThe Bone Broth already contains naturally occurring collagen type 1 and type 2 Collagen, while our\nBovine Collagen contains 1 and 3 Collagen, giving you both the nourishment of slow-simmered bone\nbroth and the benefits of highly bioavailable collagen.\n\n[ Read all FAQs Here ][73]\n\n## CUSTOMER REVIEWS\n\n## Return Policy\n\nWe guarantee that our goods are of high quality. You must inspect the goods and notify us promptly\nin writing or by phone of any dissatisfaction with your order. We will fully refund the price of any\ngoods that do not meet your reasonable satisfaction or arrange for the delivery of replacement\ngoods, provided that you notify us within 30 days of delivery of the goods.\n\nView our full [terms of service][74]\n\n## Save on your first order\n\n### Shop\n* [Shop All][75]\n* [Collagen][76]\n* [Mayonnaise][77]\n* [Sauces][78]\n"
