n* [ [Supplements] Supplements ][54]\n* [ [MCT Oil] MCT Oil ][55]\n\nGo Back\n* [ Ebooks ][56]\n* [ Articles ][57]\n* [\nThrive with Julia ][58]\n* [ Our Founders ][59]\n* [ Recipes ][60]\n\n# Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder\n* Bestseller\n[Hunter & Gather grass fed protein cacao package with a glass of chocolate shake on a wooden\nsurface.]\n* [Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder]\n* [Man pouring Hunter Gather protein powder into a shaker bottle with a white background]\n* [Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder]\n* [Hunter & Gather protein package with text highlighting features on a beige background]\n\nBestseller\n[Hunter & Gather grass fed protein cacao package with a glass of chocolate shake on a wooden\nsurface.]\n[Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder]\n[Man pouring Hunter Gather protein powder into a shaker bottle with a white background]\n[Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder]\n[Hunter & Gather protein package with text highlighting features on a beige background]\n\n# Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder\n\n#### 20g Protein \u2022 15 Servings \u2022 400g\n\n## Nature's Complete Protein\n\nA naturally chocolatey, dairy free alternative to whey. Made from 100% grass fed European beef and\nreal cacao, it delivers **20g of complete protein per serving** with no sweeteners, fillers, gums or\nartificial flavourings. Real food protein that supports your daily intake, muscle maintenance and\ngrowth.\n* Contributes to the maintenance of muscle mass with 20g of complete protein\n* Naturally easy to digest as it's dairy and soy free\n* High in protein to help you feel fuller for longer\n* Real food beef protein isolate with no additives\n* Easy to blend into smoothies and shakes\n* Complete amino acid profile\n\nChoose Flavour\n* [\n[Unflavoured Protein]\nUnflavoured Protein ][61]\n* [\n[Cacao Protein]\nCacao Protein ][62]\nPurchase type Purchase type options\n\nSubscribe & Save 20%\n\n\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u00a3\u03363\u03364\u0336 \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\n\u00a327.20\n* 20% off your first 3 orders\n* 10% thereafter\nDelivers every\n2 Weeks 4 Weeks 6 Weeks 8 Weeks\n* Free scoop with 1st order\n* Free UK Delivery\n* Cancel, pause, skip anytime\n\nTry Once\n\n\u00a334\nEarn 68 [Loyalty Points ][63]\n3 For 2 on Collagen, Bone Broth, Protein & Electrolytes\nAdd to cart\n[Notify Me When Available][64]\nOnly 1365 left in stock!\n\nOrder now and receive in {x days}\n\nFast & Tracked Delivery\n\n60-day Money Back Guarantee\n\nPlease note we will be operating reduced hours on selected days over the festive period. Normal\nworking hours and delivery services will resume from **Friday 2nd January. **\n\nWe use Royal Mail and DPD to deliver across the UK.\n* Free UK Delivery on orders over \u00a345\n* Standard Delivery (Royal Mail Tracked): \u00a33.99 on orders under \u00a345.\n* Next Day Delivery (DPD): \u00a35.99.\n\nYou have a full 60 days from the date of purchase to try out our foods and supplements. If you find\nyourself not completely satisfied within this period, simply reach out to our customer service team\nand let them know.\n\n**\u2713 **HASSLE-FREE RETURNS\n\n**\u2713 **RISK-FREE ONLINE PURCHASES\n\n**\u2713 **FULL REFUND ON RETURN OF GOODS\n\nMore detail on our 60-day money-back guarantee can be found [here][65].\n\n[Klarna] [American Express] [Apple Pay] [PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Visa]\nIngredients & Nutritional Label ][66] [\nSuggested Serving Size ][67]\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\n\n## What to expect over time\n* ### Week 1\n\nEasier to digest and can reduce bloating compared to whey protein. Better post-workout recovery.\n* ### Month 1\n\nIncreased satiety and enhanced energy levels throughout the day.\n* ### Month 2-3\n\nImproved strength support as our complete protein helps maintain strong, healthy muscles.\n* ### Month 3-6\n\nEnjoy lasting benefits with consistent protein intake supporting muscle maintenance and healthy\nbones.\n\n### How to Use Our Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder\n\n**For a cacao protein shake:**\n1. Add 2 heaped tablespoons of cacao beef protein to a shaker with your choice of water or milk, we\nrecommend 200ml.\n2. Shake well to blend the dairy free protein powder smoothly.\n3. Let it settle for 90 seconds, then enjoy your chocolatey protein shake.\n\n**For a chocolate protein smoothie:**\n1. Add 2 heaped tablespoons of cacao grass fed protein to a blender with fruit or other ingredients.\n2. Blend until smooth and creamy.\n3. Pour into a glass and enjoy a naturally chocolatey high protein smoothie.\n\n## Protein Powder Showdown\n\n[Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder] Our Protein Powder\n[The Other Guys product] The Other Guys\nDigestibility\nEasier on the stomach, reduced bloating\nDigestive discomfort from whey or soy proteins\nSource\n100% grass fed European beef\nUnknown origin\nIngredients\nOnly 5 ingredients\n10+ with bulkers, fillers and artificial sweeteners\nAmino Acids\nComplete profile with 9 essential amino acids\nNo collagen and limited information on amino acids\nAllergens\nDairy free, lactose free\nContains dairy or soy\nSustainability\nNose-to-tail\nWasteful processing\n[Try Now ][68]\n\nLab tested for purity\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][69]\n[Cacao Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder] Ingredients\n\nBeef Protein, Cacao Powder, Glycine, Natural Flavouring, Pink Himalayan Salt\n\n## Unlock the Power of Complete, Real Food Protein\n\n### Why Choose Cacao Beef Protein Powder\n\nGrass fed beef protein offers a natural, real food alternative to whey and plant blends, delivering\na complete amino acid profile with no dairy, lactose, soy or artificial ingredients. Our cacao\nversion is naturally flavoured with real cacao, giving you a smooth, chocolatey taste without\nsweeteners or added sugar, a rare find in the world of chocolate protein powders.\n\n### Benefits of Beef Protein Powder\n\nWith all nine essential amino acids, beef protein supports daily protein intake, muscle maintenance\nand healthy bones. This cacao blend provides the same complete 20g protein as our unflavoured\nversion, but with a naturally rich chocolate flavour ideal for shakes, smoothies and healthy\ndesserts. Under 1g of carbs per serving and free from fillers, gums and artificial flavours, it\u2019s a\nversatile protein that fits any routine. Helping to grow and support lean muscles and body\ncomposition.\n\n### Is Beef Protein More Digestible Than Whey?\n\nMany people seek out beef protein as a gentle whey alternative because it contains no dairy, lactose\nor soy, all common triggers for digestive discomfort. Our Cacao Grass Fed Protein is naturally\nbioavailable and made without additives, sweeteners or thickeners, offering a smooth, chocolatey\nprotein that\u2019s easy to enjoy every day.\n\nWatch Video\n][70]\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][71]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is beef protein powder made from?\n\nOur Grass Fed Beef Protein is a real food protein powder made from grass fed European beef. It\u2019s a\ncomplete protein source that provides all nine essential amino acids to support daily intake, muscle\nmaintenance and healthy bones, without dairy, soy or additives.\n\nFor the cacao flavour, we add only natural cacao for a smooth, chocolatey taste.\n\nHow does beef protein compare to whey protein?\n\nBeef protein is naturally dairy free and lactose free, making it a great option if you want a whey\nalternative. It provides a complete amino acid profile and is naturally bioavailable, meaning many\npeople find it easier to digest than whey or soy-based proteins. It supports daily protein intake,\nmuscle maintenance and healthy bones, without the added sweeteners or fillers commonly found in whey\nblends.\n\nIs beef protein suitable for people with dairy intolerance?\n\nYes, our cacao protein is completely dairy free and lactose free, with no whey, milk derivatives or\nsoy.\n\nHow much should I use?\n\nUse two heaped tablespoons (one serving) added to shakes or smoothies. You can mix it with water,\nmilk alternatives or blend it into recipes. It\u2019s an easy way to increase your daily protein intake.\n\nDoes beef protein powder taste like beef?\n\nNo, the cacao version has a naturally rich, smooth chocolate flavour.\n\nCan I use it for baking or cooking?\n\nYes. The natural cacao flavour works beautifully in shakes, smoothies, yoghurt bowls and healthy\nchocolate recipes like protein brownies.\n\nWhat allergens does it contain?\n\nOur Grass Fed Beef Protein is free from dairy, gluten, soy, sweeteners, flavourings and all major\nallergens. It contains only real food protein sourced from grass fed European beef.\n\nHow long does it last?\n\nOnce opened, store in a cool, dry place and keep the pouch resealed. Use within 3\u20136 months for best\nfreshness. The resealable, recyclable packaging helps maintain quality for longer.\n\nWhat\u2019s the difference between protein and collagen?\n\nCollagen is a specific type of protein naturally rich in amino acids like glycine, proline and\nhydroxyproline, which your body uses to build collagen. Grass Fed Beef Protein, on the other hand,\nis a complete protein, meaning it provides all nine essential amino acids your body needs to help\nmaintain strong muscles and healthy bones. Many people choose to use both, with collagen for\ntargeted nourishment and Grass Fed Beef Protein for complete, everyd"
