n* [ [Supplements] Supplements ][54]\n* [ [MCT Oil] MCT Oil ][55]\n\nGo Back\n* [ Ebooks ][56]\n* [ Articles ][57]\n* [\nThrive with Julia ][58]\n* [ Our Founders ][59]\n* [ Recipes ][60]\n\n# Electrolytes Multipack\n* [Electrolytes Multipack]\n* ## 750mg\n\nSodium\n\n## 150mg\n\nPotassium\n\n## 80mg\n\nMagnesium\n* [Hunter & Gather Restore Multipack with colorful packaging and Nourish Awards badge on a green\nbackground]\n* [NEW MULTIPACK RESTORE ELECTROLYTES GLASS OF WATER]\n* [ Three Hunter Gather electrolyte powder packets on a blue background with text highlighting\nfeatures.]\n\n[Electrolytes Multipack]\n\n## 750mg\n\nSodium\n\n## 150mg\n\nPotassium\n\n## 80mg\n\nMagnesium\n\n[Hunter & Gather Restore Multipack with colorful packaging and Nourish Awards badge on a green\nbackground]\n[NEW MULTIPACK RESTORE ELECTROLYTES GLASS OF WATER]\n[ Three Hunter Gather electrolyte powder packets on a blue background with text highlighting\nfeatures.]\n\n# Electrolytes Multipack\n\n## 30 Sachets, 3 Flavours\n\nFormulated with electrolytes in the perfect ratio to support everyday hydration, naturally sweetened\nwith no added sugar. Hydration you actually enjoy.\n* Sodium \u2013 Maintains hydration and replaces lost electrolytes\n* Magnesium \u2013 Eases tired muscles and aids recovery\n* Potassium \u2013 Supports steady energy and muscle function\n* Balanced Trio \u2013 All three minerals work together for effective hydration\n* Single sachets for balanced hydration anytime, anywhere\n* Fresh, fruity taste with no added sugar\n\nChoose your flavour\n* [\n[Multipack]\nMultipack ][61]\n* [\n[Mixed Berry]\nMixed Berry ][62]\n* [\n[Lemon & Lime]\nLemon & Lime ][63]\n* [\n[Blood Orange]\nBlood Orange ][64]\n* [\n[Unflavoured]\nUnflavoured ][65]\n* [\n[9 Pack]\n9 Pack ][66]\nPurchase type Purchase type options\n\nSubscribe & Save 20%\n\n\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u