ibe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\n* 750mg SODIUM\nPink Himalayan Salt\n* 150mg POTASSIUM\nNatural Potash Salt\n* 80mg MAGNESIUM\nMarine Magnesium\n\n## What to expect over time\n* ### >1 HOUR\n\nYou\u2019ll feel refreshed as the electrolytes begin to replenish lost fluids and restore hydration\nlevels.\n* ### 1-2 HOURS\n\nSymptoms of dehydration, such as fatigue, headache, muscle cramps, and dizziness, should diminish\ngradually.\n* ### 2-4 HOURS\n\nImproved mental clarity, alertness and focus.\n* ### 4+ HOURS\n\nImproved focus, energy and overall well-being.\n\n## Electrolyte Showdown\n\n[Electrolytes Multipack] Our Electrolytes\nThe Other Guys\nTaste\nFresh & Fruity Natural Flavours (Blood Orange, Lemon & Lime or Mixed Berry)\nVery sweet or artificial flavouring\nSodium Content\n750mg per serve\n<500mg per serve\nFillers Or Bulkers\nNone\nVaries\nArtificial Sweeteners\nNone\nOften\nIngredients\nNaturally sourced\nUsually lab made\nSupport\nTop-tier, educational\nLimited\n[Try Now ][71]\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Electrolytes Multipack]\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][72]\n\n## Restore Your Health Sip by Sip\n\n### How to use Restore\n\nExpertly formulated with an ideal ratio of essential minerals, each sachet is your key to balanced\nhydration. Simply add a sachet of Restore to water (or a drink of your choice) and stir. Consult our\n'Taste-o-meter' guide to find your perfect flavour intensity \u2013 from a light fruity taste in 750ml of\nwater to a bold blend in 250ml. Whether you're gearing up for a heavy workout, tackling a busy day\nat the office, or simply looking to replenish electrolytes lost during sleep, Restore is your answer\nto peak physical performance, mental clarity and overall well-being.\n\n### NATURALLY SWEET WITH MONK FRUIT\n\nWe chose monk fruit to bring natural sweetness for our Mixed Berry, Lemon & Lime and Blood Orange\nRestore Electrolytes - adding just the right amount of fresh and fruity flavour without refined\nsugar or artificial sweeteners. Its sweet compounds are metabolised differently from sugar,\ndelivering a natural sweetness with minimal impact on blood sugar levels. The result? A subtle,\nnaturally fresh and fruity electrolyte blend, that\u2019s ideal for keto, low-carb, and grain-free\nlifestyles.\n\n### Nature's Ingredients\n\nIn an age where modern diets often fall short due to soil depletion and poor eating habits, Restore\nis here to help you bridge the nutritional gap. We've scoured the earth to bring you the purest,\nmost potent minerals nature has to offer. Each sachet delivers a mighty 750mg of sodium from Pink\nHimalayan Rock Salt, 150mg of potassium from natural Potash Salt, and 80mg of magnesium from marine\nmagnesium. With Restore, you're not just hydrating \u2013 you're reconnecting with the primal power of\nthe earth's essential minerals.\n\n### SIGNS YOU NEED ELECTROLYTES\n\nYour body has a unique way of communicating its needs. Feeling foggy-brained, dizzy and struggling\nto focus? These are tell-tale signs of an electrolyte imbalance. Muscle cramps, headaches, and\nfatigue are also common indicators. If that\u2019s you \u2013 Restore is the answer. Replenish essential\nminerals and get back to feeling your best with our expertly formulated blend of nature\u2019s best\nelectrolytes. This is hydration, redefined.\n\n# **RESTORE BALANCE: **THE IMPORTANCE OF SALT & ELECTROLYTE MINERALS\n\n##### -\n\nEverything you need to know about electrolytes and why they are essential for hydration and health.\n\n[LEARN MORE][73]\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][74]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat are the main benefits of taking Restore All Natural Daily Electrolytes?\n\nThese electrolytes are designed to support optimal hydration, improve mental clarity, and help\nprevent muscle cramps or fatigue. They are also effective for replenishing essential minerals lost\nthrough sweat during exercise or heat.\n\nHow often should I take the Restore Daily Electrolytes?\n\nThe recommended serving is one sachet per day mixed with 500ml to 750ml of water, though you can\nadjust this based on your activity levels. For those who are very active or in hot climates, a\nsecond sachet may be consumed if required to maintain hydration.\n\nDoes this product contain artificial sweeteners, colours, or flavors?\n\nNo, this product contains absolutely no artificial sweeteners, colours, or synthetic flavours, as it\nis sweetened with monkfruit and flavoured with real fruit powders. It is also free from fillers,\nmaltodextrin, and added sugars.\n\nWhat specific electrolyte flavours are included in the 30-pack multipack?\n\nOur multipack contains blood orange, mixed berry and lemon and lime electrolyte sachets, perfect for\nmaking hydration that bit more enjoyable.\n\nAre these electrolytes suitable for people following a keto or low-carb diet?\n\nYes, they are perfectly suited for keto, paleo, and low-carb lifestyles as they contain zero sugar\nand negligible carbohydrates. They are often used by those on a keto diet to help manage the\nsymptoms of \"keto flu\" by maintaining mineral balance.\n\n[ Read all FAQs Here ][75]\n\n## CUSTOMER REVIEWS\n\n## Return Policy\n\nWe guarantee that our goods are of high quality. You must inspect the goods and notify us promptly\nin writing or by phone of any dissatisfaction with your order. We will fully refund the price of any\ngoods that do not meet your reasonable satisfaction or arrange for the delivery of replacement\ngoods, provided that you notify us within 30 days of delivery of the goods.\n\nView our full [terms of service][76]\n\n## Save on your first order\n\n### Shop\n* [Shop All][77]\n* [Collagen][78]\n* [Mayonnaise][79]\n* [Sauces][80]\n* [Electrolytes][81]\n* [Bone Broth][82]\n* [Oils & Fats][83]\n* [Supplements][84]\n* [Coffee][85]\n* [Julia's Favourites][86]\n\n### Lifestyle\n* [Refined Sugar free][87]\n* [Gluten Free][88]\n* [Keto][89]\n* [Paleo][90]\n* [Carnivore][91]\n* [Dairy Free][92]\n\n### Learn\n* [Articles][93]\n* [Recipes][94]\n* [Pillar Articles][95]\n* [eBook Library][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Investors][98]\n\n### Store\n* [Account]["
