ilable][76]\nOnly 5463 left in stock!\n\nOrder now and receive in {x days}\n\nFast & Tracked Delivery\n\n60-day Money Back Guarantee\n\nPlease note we will be operating reduced hours on selected days over the festive period. Normal\nworking hours and delivery services will resume from **Friday 2nd January. **\n\nWe use Royal Mail and DPD to deliver across the UK.\n* Free UK Delivery on orders over \u00a345\n* Standard Delivery (Royal Mail Tracked): \u00a33.99 on orders under \u00a345.\n* Next Day Delivery (DPD): \u00a35.99.\n\nYou have a full 60 days from the date of purchase to try out our foods and supplements. If you find\nyourself not completely satisfied within this period, simply reach out to our customer service team\nand let them know.\n\n**\u2713 **HASSLE-FREE RETURNS\n\n**\u2713 **RISK-FREE ONLINE PURCHASES\n\n**\u2713 **FULL REFUND ON RETURN OF GOODS\n\nMore detail on our 60-day money-back guarantee can be found [here][77].\n\n[Klarna] [American Express] [Apple Pay] [PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Visa]\nIngredients & Nutritional Label ][78] [\nSuggested Serving Size ][79]\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\n* 85% Saw improvements within 12 weeks\n* 89% Saw a more youthful appearance\n* 88% Saw improvements in their hair, skin and nail health\n\n## Real results using Collagen\n* [Madeleine Shaw]\n\n> \"I use it everyday and whole heartedly trust their quality & sourcing!\"\n> Madeleine Shaw Leading UK Nutritionist & Best Selling Author\n* [Rosie Millen]\n\n> \"I love taking this collagen as it's great for my skin health\"\n> Rosie Millen Leading UK Nutritionist & Public Speaker\n* [Tom Hopper]\n\n> \"Perfect for adding healthy goodness to your day\"\n> Tom Hopper Actor & Earth Locker Podcast Host\n\n## What to expect over time\n* ### Week 1\n\nYou\u2019ll notice an improvement in skin hydration and smoothness.\n* ### Month 1\n\nIncrease nail strength, minimise joint discomfort, and support gut health.\n* ### Month 2-3\n\nReduced appearance of fine lines and wrinkles for a more youthful complexion.\n* ### Month 3-6\n\nPromotes hair and nail growth.\n\n## Collagen Showdown\n\n[Marine Collagen Powder] Our Collagen Peptides\n[The Other Guys product] The Other Guys\nTaste\nNeutral, mixes easily\nOff-taste, clumps\nIngredients\n10+ (Bulkers & Fillers)\nAmino Acids\nLimited\nQuality Control\nThird-party tested\nVaries\nSustainability\nWild caught Marine collagen from MSC certified supplier\nFarmed Fish Unknown Origin\nSupport\nTop-tier, educational\nLimited\n[Try Now ][80]\n\nLab tested for purity\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][81]\n[Marine Collagen Powder] Ingredients\n\nMarine Collagen (Wild - Caught)\n\n5-Star Reviews\n\n## Customers Love Our Collagen\n\n## Unlock the Power of Collagen for Your Body\n\n### WHY TAKE COLLAGEN?\n\nCollagen is a key structural protein that ensures the cohesion, elasticity & regeneration of all of\nour connective tissues - as we age, our collagen levels start to drop, starting as early as our\n20's. Many of us are lacking in nutritional real food sources of collagen, which our ancestors would\nhave gotten in abundance from eating nose to tail (including skin/tendons). By adding Marine\nCollagen real food powder into your daily tea, coffee, water or smoothie you will nourish your body\nfrom inside out to support skin, hair and nail health.\n\n### BENEFITS OF COLLAGEN\n\nBy adding 10g (2 tablespoon) serving per day of hydrolysed marine collagen peptide protein powder to\na real food diet, you are supporting a healthier you through shinier hair, strong nails and plumper\nskin. Suffer from dry or ageing skin, hair loss or if you are looking for a clean source of protein\n- Marine Collagen could be ideal for you!\n\n### CARING FOR THE ENVIRONMENT\n\nWe only use 100% recyclable resealable pouches & 100% plastic free packaging for sending your orders\ntoo. Our Marine collagen comes from sustainably wild-caught white fish from the North Atlantic,\nNorwegian and Barents seas. Our Bovine collagen comes from grass fed European cattle instead of\nSouth American (saving air transport). The collagen is made from the skin or hide of the animal,\nwhich would otherwise go to waste. By utilising collagen peptides we are helping to ensure all of\nthe animal is utilised from nose to tail as well as supporting our optimal health.\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][82]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is Marine Collagen and where is it sourced from?\n\nMarine collagen is a Type I collagen protein primarily sourced from the skins, scales, and bones of\nsaltwater fish. It is widely utilised in supplements due to it consisting of smaller peptides that\nare more easily absorbed by the human body.\n\nWhat are the benefits of taking Marine Collagen Peptides?\n\nRegular intake of Marine Collagen Peptides can improve skin elasticity, hydration, and the\nappearance of fine lines by supporting the body's natural collagen production. Additionally, it\nprovides essential amino acids that strengthen hair, nails, and support joint health.\n\nIs Marine Collagen a complete protein?\n\nNo, marine collagen is not a complete protein because it lacks tryptophan, one of the nine essential\namino acids the body cannot produce on its own. While it is rich in glycine and proline, it should\nnot be used as a primary source of dietary protein.\n\nHow many grams of collagen should be consumed per day for results?\n\nWe recommend consuming 10 grams of collagen a day to see effective improvements in skin and joint\nhealth. Consistently taking this amount for 8 to 12 weeks is typically necessary to notice visible\nresults.\n\nWhat are the potential side effects of taking marine collagen supplements?\n\nWhile generally safe, some users report minor digestive discomforts like bloating and heartburn.\nCrucially, individuals with fish or shellfish allergies should not consume our collagen peptides as\nthey may cause a potential allergic reaction.\n\n[ Read all FAQs Here ][83]\n\n## CUSTOMER REVIEWS\n\n## Return Policy\n\nWe guarantee that our goods are of high quality. You must inspect the goods and notify us promptly\nin writing or by phone of any dissatisfaction with your order. We will fully refund the price of any\ngoods that do not meet your reasonable satisfaction or arrange for the delivery of replacement\ngoods, provided that you notify us within 30 days of delivery of the goods.\n\nView our full [terms of service][84]\n\n## Save on your first order\n\n### Shop\n* [Shop All][85]\n* [Collagen][86]\n* [Mayonnaise][87]\n* [Sauces][88]\n* [Electrolytes][89]\n* [Bone Broth][90]\n* [Oils & Fats][91]\n* [Supplements][92]\n* [Coffee][93]\n* [Julia's Favourites][94]\n\n### Lifestyle\n* [Refined Sugar free][95]\n* [Gluten Free][9"
