rom **Friday 2nd January. **\n\nWe use Royal Mail and DPD to deliver across the UK.\n* Free UK Delivery on orders over \u00a345\n* Standard Delivery (Royal Mail Tracked): \u00a33.99 on orders under \u00a345.\n* Next Day Delivery (DPD): \u00a35.99.\n\nYou have a full 60 days from the date of purchase to try out our foods and supplements. If you find\nyourself not completely satisfied within this period, simply reach out to our customer service team\nand let them know.\n\n**\u2713 **HASSLE-FREE RETURNS\n\n**\u2713 **RISK-FREE ONLINE PURCHASES\n\n**\u2713 **FULL REFUND ON RETURN OF GOODS\n\nMore detail on our 60-day money-back guarantee can be found [here][77].\n\n[Klarna] [American Express] [Apple Pay] [PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Visa]\nIngredients & Nutritional Label ][78] [\nSuggested Serving Size ][79]\nSubscribe & Save 10% FREE Metal Scoop 2nd Sub Order 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10%\nFREE Metal Scoop 2nd Sub Order 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% FREE Metal Scoop 2nd\nSub Order 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% FREE Metal Scoop 2nd Sub Order 60-Day\nMoney Back Guarantee\n\n## Real results using Collagen\n* [Madeleine Shaw]\n\n> \"Collagen Peptides Bovine Protein Powder transformed my hair \u2013 thicker and shinier than ever!\"\n> Madeleine Shaw Leading UK Nutritionist & Best Selling Author\n* [Rosie Millen]\n\n> \"I love taking collagen as it's great for my skin health\"\n> Rosie Millen Leading UK Nutritionist & Public Speaker\n* [Tim Gray]\n\n> \"Quality and ease of use make this collagen product stand out. Love it in my coffee!\"\n> Tim Gray UK\u2019s Leading Biohacker\n* [Tom Hopper]\n\n> \"Perfect for adding healthy goodness to your day.\"\n> Tom Hopper Actor & Earth Locker Podcast Host\n\n## What to expect over time\n* ### Week 1\n\nEnhanced skin hydration and smoothness.\n* ### Month 1\n\nStrengthens nails, supports gut health, and helps ease joint discomfort.\n* ### Month 2-3\n\nImprovements in fine lines, wrinkles, and overall skin elasticity.\n* ### Month 3-6\n\nPromotes hair growth, joint mobility, stronger nails, and improved post-workout recovery.\n* 84% Saw improvements within 12 weeks\n* 99% Say Bovine Collagen supports their health and wellness goals\n* 88% Saw improvements in their hair, skin and nail health with Marine Collagen\n\n## Collagen Showdown\n\n[Bovine & Marine Collagen Powder Bundle] Our Collagen Peptides\n[The Other Guys product] The Other Guys\nTaste\nNeutral, mixes easily\nOff-taste, clumps\nCollagen Type\nType I & III\nVaries\nAmino Acids\nLimited\nQuality Control\nThird-party tested\nVaries\nSustainability\nGrass fed European cattle and Wild caught Marine collagen from MSC certified supplier\nUnknown sourcing\nSupport\nTop-tier, educational\nLimited\n[Try Now ][80]\n\nLab tested for purity\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][81]\n[Bovine & Marine Collagen Powder Bundle] Ingredients\n\nBovine Collagen (Grass Fed), Marine Collagen (Wild - Caught)\n\n5-Star Reviews\n\n## Customers Love Our Collagen\n\n## Two Sources. One Powerful Routine.\n\n### Bovine & Marine Collagen: What's the difference?\n\nNot all collagen is created equal. Our Bovine Collagen is sourced from grass fed European cattle and\nis a rich source of whole-body support, helping to nourish joints, bones, gut lining and skin. Our\nMarine Collagen, made from wild-caught MSC whitefish, has a smaller molecular structure that\u2019s often\neasier to absorb, making it especially effective for skin, hair and nail health.\n\nEach offers its own unique benefits. Bovine is great for strength and structure, while Marine is\nideal for radiance and repair. Together, they deliver a more complete collagen routine that supports\nbeauty, mobility, gut health and healthy ageing inside and out.\n\n### PICTURE THIS: RADIANT SKIN, STRONG JOINTS & A HAPPY GUT ALL FROM ONE DAILY RITUAL\n\nCombining Bovine and Marine Collagen gives your body more than just a mix of collagen types, it\ngives you a broader set of benefits. Bovine is excellent for joint comfort, muscle recovery and gut\nsupport. Marine is highly bioavailable and may be better absorbed, making it ideal for smoother\nskin, stronger nails and shinier hair.\n\nTake 2 tablespoons of one (13g Bovine or 10g Marine), or enjoy the benefits of both together daily\nby taking 1 tablespoon each (6.5g Bovine and 5g of Marine). If you're new to collagen, start with 1\nteaspoon of each and gradually build up over a week. Build a simple, effective routine that supports\nbeauty, movement and wellness from within. No fillers, no nonsense, just results.\n\n### CARING FOR THE ENVIRONMENT\n\nWe only use 100% recyclable, resealable pouches and plastic-free packaging when sending your order.\nOur Marine Collagen is sourced from sustainably sourced Wild-caught MSC Whitefish in the North\nAtlantic, Norwegian, and Barents Seas. Our Bovine Collagen comes from grass fed European cattle, not\nSouth American, reducing air miles and supporting higher welfare standards. Both are made from parts\nof the animal, skin or hide, that would otherwise go to waste. By choosing collagen peptides, you're\nnot only supporting your health, but also embracing nose-to-tail nutrition and reducing unnecessary\nwaste.\n\nWatch Video\n][82]\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][83]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nCan I take both bovine and marine collagen together?\n\nYes, you can absolutely take them together to benefit from a broader spectrum of collagen types,\nspecifically Types 1 and This combination provides comprehensive support for your skin, hair, nails,\njoints, and gut health in one go.\n\nWhat are the main differences between bovine and marine collagen?\n\nBovine collagen is sourced from cattle and is rich in Types 1 and 3, whereas marine collagen is\nsourced from wild-caught fish and is primarily Type Marine collagen also has slightly smaller\nparticles, which some find allows for even faster absorption into the bloodstream.\n\nWhich benefits are associated with bovine collagen, and which are associated with marine collagen?\n\nBovine collagen is particularly effective for supporting joint health, muscle recovery, and gut\nlining repair, whereas marine collagen is highly regarded for its beauty-boosting properties,\nspecifically for improving skin elasticity, hydration, and hair strength.\n\nIs this powder safe for people with fish allergies?\n\nNo, this bundle contains marine collagen sourced from wild-caught white"
