bscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\n\n## What to expect over time\n* ### Week 1\n\nEasier to digest and can reduce bloating compared to whey protein. Better post-workout recovery.\n* ### Month 1\n\nIncreased satiety and enhanced energy levels throughout the day.\n* ### Month 2-3\n\nImproved strength support as our complete protein helps maintain strong, healthy muscles.\n* ### Month 3-6\n\nEnjoy lasting benefits with consistent protein intake supporting muscle maintenance and healthy\nbones.\n\n### How to Use Our Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder\n\n**For a protein smoothie:**\n1. Add 2 heaped tablespoons of unflavoured beef protein to a blender with fruit or other\ningredients.\n2. Blend until smooth.\n3. Serve and enjoy a natural, dairy free high protein smoothie.\n\n**For a protein shake:**\n1. Add 2 heaped tablespoons of beef protein powder to a shaker with water or milk and extra\ningredients of your choice.\n2. Let the shake settle for 90 seconds, then drink and enjoy a natural, easy-to-digest protein.\n\n## Protein Powder Showdown\n\n[Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder] Our Protein Powder\n[The Other Guys product] The Other Guys\nDigestibility\nEasier on the stomach, reduced bloating\nDigestive discomfort from whey or soy proteins\nSource\n100% grass fed European beef\nUnknown origin\nIngredients\nOnly 1 ingredient\n10+ with bulkers, fillers and artificial sweeteners\nAmino Acids\nComplete profile with 9 essential amino acids\nNo collagen and limited information on amino acids\nAllergens\nDairy free, lactose free\nContains dairy or soy\nSustainability\nNose-to-tail\nWasteful processing\n[Try Now ][68]\n\nLab tested for purity\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][69]\n[Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder] Ingredients\n\n100% Beef Protein\n\n## Unlock the Power of Complete, Real Food Protein\n\n### Why Choose Beef Protein Powder\n\nOur grass fed beef protein powder offers a simple, real food alternative to whey and overly\nprocessed plant blends. Made from 100% grass fed European beef, this beef isolate protein delivers a\ncomplete amino acid profile with no dairy, soy, gums, sweeteners or additives. With 20g of protein\nper serving, it supports daily protein intake, muscle maintenance and bone health, ideal for anyone\nseeking a natural, digestible beef protein powder.\n\n### Benefits of Beef Protein Powder\n\nThis dairy free protein powder provides all nine essential amino acids your body needs for everyday\nnourishment, including those that maintain strong muscles and healthy bones. With less than 1g of\ncarbs per serving, it\u2019s perfect for keto and carnivore diets. Its neutral flavour makes it easy to\nblend into shakes, smoothies, yoghurt or recipes, a convenient way to keep your protein intake\nsteady without the additives found in typical whey or vegan blends.\n\n### Is Beef Protein Isolate More Digestible Than Whey?\n\nMany people find beef protein powder more easily digestible than whey because it contains no dairy,\nlactose or soy, common triggers for bloating. As a naturally bioavailable, whey alternative protein,\nit\u2019s gentle on sensitive stomachs and ideal for those seeking a natural protein powder that still\ndelivers a complete amino acid profile.\n\nWatch Video\n][70]\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][71]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is beef protein powder made from?\n\nOur Grass Fed Beef Protein Powder is made from 100% grass fed European beef through a gentle\nhydrolysis process. This creates a pure, single ingredient beef protein isolate containing all nine\nessential amino acids, with no dairy, soy, gums, sweeteners or added sugar.\n\nHow does beef protein powder compare to whey protein?\n\nBeef protein is naturally dairy free and lactose free, making it a great option if you\u2019re looking\nfor a whey alternative protein. It\u2019s highly digestible and bioavailable, offering complete amino\nacids without the sweeteners or fillers found in many whey blends.\n\nIs beef protein isolate suitable for people with dairy intolerance?\n\nYes. Our Grass Fed Beef Protein is completely dairy free and lactose free, with no whey, milk\nderivatives. It\u2019s a simple option for anyone avoiding dairy or following paleo, carnivore, keto or\nwhole food lifestyles.\n\nHow much beef protein powder should I use?\n\nUse two heaped tablespoons (one serving) added to shakes or smoothies. It\u2019s an easy way to increase\nyour daily protein intake.\n\nDoes beef protein powder taste like beef?\n\nNo, our unflavoured version has a neutral taste when mixed into smoothies or shakes. While it may\nhave a slight savoury taste when mixed only with water, it blends smoothly into recipes. For a\nnaturally chocolatey option, the cacao version offers a richer taste.\n\nCan I use beef protein isolate for baking or cooking?\n\nAbsolutely. Because it\u2019s unflavoured and made from a single real food protein ingredient, it works\nwell in smoothies, yoghurt bowls, protein bakes or added into recipes for extra protein. It blends\neasily and holds up well in hot and cold uses.\n\nWhat allergens does beef protein isolate contain?\n\nOur Grass Fed Beef Protein is free from dairy, gluten, soy, sweeteners, flavourings and all major\nallergens. It contains only real food protein sourced from grass fed European beef.\n\nHow long does beef protein last?\n\nOnce opened, store in a cool, dry place and keep the pouch resealed. Use within 3\u20136 months for best\nfreshness. The resealable, recyclable packaging helps maintain quality for longer.\n\nWhat\u2019s the difference between protein and collagen?\n\nCollagen provides targeted amino acids (glycine, proline, hydroxyproline). Grass Fed Beef Protein\nPowder is a complete protein with all nine essential amino acids, ideal for daily muscle and bone\nsupport. Many people use both for complementary benefits.\n\nWhat is Light Labs and why do we use them?\n\n[Light Labs][72] is an independent software platform that specialises in verifying product purity\nand nutritional integrity. Transparency is one of our key values as a company and by providing\nclear"
