d DPD to deliver across the UK.\n* Free UK Delivery on orders over \u00a345\n* Standard Delivery (Royal Mail Tracked): \u00a33.99 on orders under \u00a345.\n* Next Day Delivery (DPD): \u00a35.99.\n\nYou have a full 60 days from the date of purchase to try out our foods and supplements. If you find\nyourself not completely satisfied within this period, simply reach out to our customer service team\nand let them know.\n\n**\u2713 **HASSLE-FREE RETURNS\n\n**\u2713 **RISK-FREE ONLINE PURCHASES\n\n**\u2713 **FULL REFUND ON RETURN OF GOODS\n\nMore detail on our 60-day money-back guarantee can be found [here][76].\n\n[Klarna] [American Express] [Apple Pay] [PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Visa]\nIngredients & Nutritional Label ][77] [\nSuggested Serving Size ][78]\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\n\nLab tested for purity\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][79]\n[Bone Broth & Collagen Powder Bundle] Ingredients\n\nBone Broth: Beef bone broth, bovine collagen, carrot, pink Himalayan salt, beef extract, tomato,\nonion, rosemary, garlic, sage, black pepper. Collagen: 100% Hydrolysed Bovine Collagen.\n\n## The Ultimate Protein & Collagen Combo\n\n### Why take bone broth?\n\nWe\u2019ve reimagined classic bone broth for modern life. Made from marrow, knuckle and collagen-rich\nbeef bones, slow-simmered with herbs and vegetables, then gently dried into a powder. Just whisk\nwith hot water and enjoy 15g of protein and 13g of collagen per cup. No stock cubes, no fridge\nwaste, just real nutrition ready in seconds.\n\nUse it to deepen sauces, stews, gravies or sip it straight from a mug. Our broth is made from grass\nfed European cattle raised without GMO feed or Bovaer additives. No artificial flavours. No yeast\nextract. Just real food ingredients, high-welfare sourcing and every batch tested for heavy metals.\n\n### Why Take Bovine Collagen Powder?\n\nFrom your mid-twenties, your body makes less collagen each year, leading to fine lines, brittle\nnails, stiff joints and weaker bones. Our hydrolysed Bovine Collagen Peptides offer 13g of pure\ncollagen per serving to support skin elasticity, gut health, joint comfort, sleep and more.\n\nStir into coffee, tea, smoothies or even water, our collagen is completely unflavoured and mixes\nsmoothly into anything. We use hides from grass fed European cattle, helping ensure more of the\nanimal is used. Packaged in 100% recyclable pouches and plastic-free shipping, it's a better choice\nfor you and the planet.\n\n### Why Take Them Together?\n\nBone broth provides collagen, gelatin, and amino acids like glycine and glutamine to support\ndigestion and immunity. Collagen peptides offer highly bioavailable Type I & III collagen to nourish\nyour skin, joints and tissues more efficiently.\n\nTogether, they deliver a full spectrum of support, from gut integrity to post-workout recovery, from\nglowing skin to strong bones and cartilage. Think of it as a nose-to-tail toolkit for your modern\nlife.\n\nWatch Video\n][80]\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][81]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is the difference between bone broth and collagen powder?\n\nBone broth is a traditional whole-food source containing collagen, minerals, and amino acids,\nwhereas collagen powder is a more concentrated protein supplement that has been broken down into\npeptides for faster absorption.\n\nWhat are the main benefits of consuming both the Bone Broth powder and Collagen powder in this\nBundle?\n\nBoth powders in this bundle offer comprehensive support for gut health, joint mobility, and radiant\nskin by providing a versatile way to incorporate essential amino acids and minerals into your daily\nroutine to support overall vitality.\n\nHow should I use the Bone Broth Collagen Powder Bundle?\n\nThe collagen powder can be stirred effortlessly into coffee, tea, or smoothies as it is unflavoured\nand dissolves instantly in hot or cold liquids. The bone broth powder is best mixed with hot water\nto enjoy as a nourishing savoury drink or added to soups and stews for an extra nutritional boost.\n\nHow much collagen is typically in bone broth?\n\nHunter & Gather\u2019s premium bone broth contains 13 grams of collagen due to the slow-simmering process\nused to extract maximum nutrients.\n\nDoes the Bone Broth Collagen Powder Bundle contain electrolytes or other minerals?\n\nYes, the bone broth component is naturally rich in essential minerals that support bone health.\nWhile the collagen peptides focus on pure protein, the inclusion of bone broth ensures you receive a\nbalanced profile of trace minerals.\n\n## CUSTOMER REVIEWS\n\n## Return Policy\n\nWe guarantee that our goods are of high quality. You must inspect the goods and notify us promptly\nin writing or by phone of any dissatisfaction with your order. We will fully refund the price of any\ngoods that do not meet your reasonable satisfaction or arrange for the delivery of replacement\ngoods, provided that you notify us within 30 days of delivery of the goods.\n\nView our full [terms of service][82]\n\n## Save on your first order\n\n### Shop\n* [Shop All][83]\n* [Collagen][84]\n* [Mayonnaise][85]\n* [Sauces][86]\n* [Electrolytes][87]\n* [Bone Broth][88]\n* [Oils & Fats][89]\n* [Supplements][90]\n* [Coffee][91]\n* [Julia's Favourites][92]\n\n### Lifestyle\n* [Refined Sugar free][93]\n* [Gluten Free][94]\n* [Keto][95]\n* [Paleo][96]\n* [Carnivore][97]\n* [Dairy Free][98]\n\n### Learn\n* [Articles][99]\n* [Recipes][100]\n* [Pillar Articles][101]\n* [eBook Library][102]\n* [About Us][103]\n* [Investors][104]\n\n### Store\n* [Account][105]\n* [Help][106]\n* [Contact Us][107]\n* [Rewards][108]\n* [Delivery Info][109]\n* [Stockist Log In][110]\n* [Klarna Payments][111]\n* [B-Corp][112]\n* [Money Back Guarantee][113]\n* [Subscription T&Cs][114]\n* [Easter Bank Holiday Information ][115]\n\n### Socials\n\n\u00a9 2026 Hunter & Gather.\n\n[Privacy Policy][116] [Cookies][117] [Sitemap][118]\n* [Klarna]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Bancontact]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [iDEAL Wero]\n* [Klarna]\n* [Maestro]\n* [Mastercard]\n* "
