n* [ [Supplements] Supplements ][54]\n* [ [MCT Oil] MCT Oil ][55]\n\nGo Back\n* [ Ebooks ][56]\n* [ Articles ][57]\n* [\nThrive with Julia ][58]\n* [ Our Founders ][59]\n* [ Recipes ][60]\n\n# Cacao Collagen Powder\n* [Cacao creamer collagen with coffee cup]\n* [Cacao Collagen Powder]\n* [Cacao Collagen Powder]\n* [Cacao Collagen Powder]\n* [ Hunter & Gather Collagen Creamer package on a purple background with text highlighting\nfeatures.]\n* [Cacao Collagen Powder]\n\n[Cacao creamer collagen with coffee cup]\n[Cacao Collagen Powder]\n[Cacao Collagen Powder]\n[Cacao Collagen Powder]\n[ Hunter & Gather Collagen Creamer package on a purple background with text highlighting features.]\n[Cacao Collagen Powder]\n\n# Cacao Collagen Powder\n\n## Rich Cacao and Collagen\n\nElevate your daily ritual with real nutrition and indulgent flavour. Each serving of our Cacao\nCollagen Creamer delivers **13g of grass fed Bovine Collagen** and **15g of protein **to support\nskin elasticity, gut health, and joint strength. Blended with smooth coconut milk powder and\nantioxidant-rich cacao for a naturally chocolatey inspired flavour - with no dairy, no added sugar,\nand nothing artificial.\n* High Strength - 13g Collagen & 15g Protein\n* Real cacao provides polyphenols and magnesium to support wellbeing and energy\n* Supports skin, hair, nails, gut & joints from within\n* Smooth, subtly sweet, and naturally indulgent - a real-food twist on your morning coffee\n* Naturally sweetened by cacao - no artificial flavours, no added sugar or additives\n* Stir into coffee, blend into smoothies, mix through yoghurt, or bake into healthy treats\n\nCompare Collagens Here \u2192 [ Compare ][61]\n* [\n[Collagen]\nCollagen ][62]\n* [\n[Beef Bone Broth]\nBeef Bone Broth ][63]\n* [\n[Marine]\nMarine ][64]\n* [\n[Bovine & Marine]\nBovine & Marine ][65]\n* [\n[Bone Broth & Collagen]\nBone Broth & Collagen ][66]\n* [\n[Vanilla]\nVanilla ][67]\n* [\n[Cacao]\nCacao ][68]\n* [\n[Vanilla & Cacao]\nVanilla & Cacao ][69]\n* [\n[Beauty Collagen]\nBeauty Collagen ][70]\n* [\n[Collagen Coffee]\nCollagen Coffee ][71]\n* [\n[AM PM Bundle]\nAM PM Bundle ][72]\n* [\n[Collagen Sachets]\nCollagen Sachets ][73]\n* [\n[Marine Sachets]\nMarine Sachets ][74]\nPurchase type Purchase type options\n\nSubscribe & Save 20%\n\n\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u00a3\u03363\u03364\u0336 \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\n\u00a327.20\n* 20% off your first 3 orders\n* 10% thereafter\nDelivers every\n2 Weeks 4 Weeks 6 Weeks 8 Weeks\n* Free scoop with 1st order\n* Free UK Delivery\n* Cancel, pause, skip anytime\n\nTry Once\n\n\u00a334\nEarn 68 [Loyalty Points ][75]\n3 For 2 on Collagen, Bone Broth, Protein & Electrolytes\nAdd to cart\n[Notify Me When Available][76]\nOnly 3260 left in stock!\n\nOrder now and receive in {x days}\n\nFast & Tracked Delivery\n\n60-day Money Back Guarantee\n\nPlease note we will be operating reduced hours on selected days over the festive period. Normal\nworking hours and delivery services will resume from **Friday 2nd January. **\n\nWe use Royal Mail and DPD to deliver across the UK.\n* Free UK Delivery on orders over \u00a345\n* Standard Delivery (Royal Mail Tracked): \u00a33.99 on orders under \u00a345.\n* Next Day Delivery (DPD): \u00a35.99.\n\nYou have a full 60 days from the date of purchase to try out our foods and supplements. If you find\nyourself not completely satisfied within this period, simply reach out to our customer service team\nand let them know.\n\n**\u2713 **HASSLE-FREE RETURNS\n\n**\u2713 **RISK-FREE ONLINE PURCHASES\n\n**\u2713 **FULL REFUND ON RETURN OF GOODS\n\nMore detail on our 60-day money-back guarantee can be found [here][77].\n\n[Klarna] [American Express] [Apple Pay] [PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Visa]\nIngredients & Nutritional Label ][78] [\nSuggested Serving Size ][79]\nSubscribe & Save 10% FREE Scoop 2nd Sub Order 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% FREE\nScoop 2nd Sub Order 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% FREE Scoop 2nd Sub Order 60-Day\nMoney Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% FREE Scoop 2nd Sub Order 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\n\n## Real results using Collagen\n* [Madeleine Shaw]\n\n> \"Collagen Peptides Bovine Protein Powder transformed my hair \u2013 thicker and shinier than ever!\"\n> Madeleine Shaw Leading UK Nutritionist & Best Selling Author\n* [Rosie Millen]\n\n> \"I really love taking this collagen food powder as it supports my body from the inside out!\"\n> Rosie Millen Leading UK Nutritionist & Public Speaker\n* [Tim Gray]\n\n> \"Quality and ease of use make this collagen product stand out. Love it in my coffee!\"\n> Tim Gray UK\u2019s Leading Biohacker\n\n## What to expect over time\n* ### Week 1\n\nYou\u2019ll notice an improvement in skin hydration and smoothness.\n* ### Month 1\n\nIncrease nail strength, minimise joint discomfort, and support gut health.\n* ### Month 2-3\n\nReduced appearance of fine lines and wrinkles for a more youthful complexion.\n* ### Month 3-6\n\nPromotes hair and nail growth, joint mobility, and muscle recovery after exercise.\n\n## Collagen Creamer Showdown\n\n[Cacao Collagen Powder] Our Collagen Creamer\n[The Other Guys product] The Other Guys\nTaste\nCacao, mixes easily\nOften artificial, clumps\nCollagen Type\nType I & III\nVaries\nAmino Acids\nLimited\nQuality Control\nThird-party tested\nVaries\nSustainability\nGrass fed European cattle (no deforestation)\nSouth American (or unknown sourcing) leading to deforestation\nSupport\nTop-tier, educational\nLimited\n[Try Now ][80]\n\nLab tested for purity\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][81]\n[Cacao Collagen Powder] Ingredients\n\nCollagen Peptides (Bovine), Organic Coconut Milk Powder, Organic Cacao Powder, Glycine, Natural\nFlavours (Cacao, Vanilla), Pink Himalayan Salt.\n\n## Unleash Health & Flavour with Collagen Creamer\n\n### Collagen Creamer: your coffees new best friend\n\nOur cacao collagen creamer is packed with our grass-fed bovine collagen protein, as well as creamy\ncoconut milk and cacao. Made to mix into your tea or coffee, without needing the addition of milk,\nit's convenience without added sugar, sweeteners or chemical E-numbers.\n\n### Why Choose Collagen Creamer?\n\nAn easy to use source of real food collagen protein, with a delicious flavour - what's not to love!\n\nAs a creamer, you can experience the health benefits of nourishing your body with bovine collagen\nbut with a creamy cacao flavour.\n\n### CARING FOR THE ENVIRONMENT\n\nWe only use 100% recyclable resealable pouches and 100% plastic free packaging for sending your\norders too. Our Bovine collagen comes from grass fed European cattle instead of South American\n(saving air transport). The collagen is made from the hide of the cattle, which would otherwise go\nto waste from the meat industry. By utilising collagen peptides we are helping to ensure all of the\nanimal is utilised from nose to tail as well as supporting our optimal health.\n\nWatch Video\n][82]\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][83]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nHow should I use the creamers?\n\nThe creamers are great added to coffee, but you can also add to tea, smoothies, shakes or sprinkle\non yoghurts. We recommend 2x heaped tablespoons per day, which can be spread throughout the day or\nall in one go.\n\nYou can use the creamers at any time of the day as they are a real food product.\n\nWhat\u2019s the difference between the collagen creamers and Hunter & Gather bovine collagen?\n\nWe use our award winning grass-fed bovine collagen peptides within our creamers and one serve of\nCollagen Creamer gives you a whopping 13,000mg of bovine collagen per serve.\n\nWithin our creamers, we also add Organic Coconut milk, natural vanilla (or Cacao) alongside glycine.\nThese pouches are great to have at work, on the go or for situations where you may not have milk,\ncream or access to a blender to make a morning coffee with the plain bovine collagen.\n\nCan I take collagen creamers alongside other collagens such as marine or bovine?\n\nWe do include a whopping 13,000mg of bovine collagen per serve (2 heaped tbsps.) in each of our\ncreamers, however, should you wish to take marine collagen or more bovine collagen alongside, you\nare welcome to.\n\nYou could for example have 1 heaped scoop of collagen creamer per day in a coffee and then a sachet\nof bovine collagen or a scoop of marine collagen also (either at the same time or a separate\noccasion). We recommend up to 30-40g of collagen per day.\n\nDo your collagen creamers come with a scoop?\n\nAs we aim to avoid single use plastics as much as possible, we do not use plastic scoops within any\nof our powder products. We do however give serving sizes based on tablespoons. For the creamers we\nrecommend 2 heaped tablespoons per day.\n\nAre the collagen creamer bags recyclable?\n\nYes, our collagen creamer bags are fully recyclable.\n\n[ Read all FAQs Here ][84]\n\n## CUSTOMER REVIEWS\n\n## Return Policy\n\nWe guarantee that our goods are of high quality. You must inspect the goods and notify us promptly\nin writing or by phone of any dissatisfaction with your order. We will fully refund the price of any\ngoods that do not meet your reasonable satisfaction or arrange for the delivery of replacement\ngoods, provided that you notify us within 30 days of delivery of the goods.\n\nView our full [terms of service][85]\n\n## Save on your first order\n\n### Shop\n* [Shop All][86]\n* [Collagen][87]\n* [Mayonnaise][88]\n* [Sauces][89]\n* [Electrolytes][90]\n* [Bone Broth][91]\n* [Oils & Fats][92]\n* [Supplements][93]\n* [Coffee][94]\n* [Julia's Favourites][95]\n\n### Lifestyle\n* [Refined Sugar free][96]\n* [Gluten Free][97]\n* [Keto][98]\n* [Paleo][99]\n* [Carnivore][100]\n* [Dairy Free][101]\n\n### Learn\n* [Articles][102]\n* [Recipes][103]\n* [Pillar Artic"
