n* [ [Supplements] Supplements ][54]\n* [ [MCT Oil] MCT Oil ][55]\n\nGo Back\n* [ Ebooks ][56]\n* [ Articles ][57]\n* [\nThrive with Julia ][58]\n* [ Our Founders ][59]\n* [ Recipes ][60]\n\n# GRASS FED ORGANIC BEEF TALLOW\n* [Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow]\n* ## 100%\n\nBeef Fat\n\n## High\n\nSmoke Point\n\n## Organic\n\nGrass Fed\n* [Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow]\n* [Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow]\n* [Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow]\n\n[Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow]\n\n## 100%\n\nBeef Fat\n\n## High\n\nSmoke Point\n\n## Organic\n\nGrass Fed\n\n[Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow]\n[Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow]\n[Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow]\n\n# GRASS FED ORGANIC BEEF TALLOW\n\n## Organic Grass Fed Beef Tallow\n\n##### -\n\nOur Beef Tallow contains 100% Suet only beef fat from organically grass fed British cattle;\ncontaining Vitamin A, D, E, K. Fantastic for bones, healthy skin, eyes and teeth.\n* Simply 1 Ingredient\n* Non GMO\n* Vitamin A, E, D & K\n* Dairy & Gluten Free\n* High Smoke Point\n* Keto, Paleo & Low Carb\n\nFats Comparison Guide [ Compare ][61]\n* [\n[Avocado Oil]\nAvocado Oil ][62]\n* [\n[Olive Oil]\nOlive Oil ][63]\n* [\n[Tallow]\nTallow ][64]\n* [\n[Ghee]\nGhee ][65]\n* [\n[Coconut Oil]\nCoconut Oil ][66]\n\nSize\n\nSize\n2 Pack\n3 Pack\n6 Pack\nPurchase type Purchase type options\n\nSubscribe & Save 10%\n\n\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u00a3\u03363\u03360\u0336 \u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\u0336\n\u00a327\nDelivers every\n2 Weeks 4 Weeks 6 Weeks 8 Weeks\n* 10% off every order\n* Free UK Delivery\n* Cancel, pause, skip anytime\n\nTry Once\n\n\u00a330\nEarn 60 [Loyalty Points ][67]\nAdd to cart\n[Notify Me When Available][68]\nOnly 495 left in stock!\n\nOrder now and receive in {x days}\n\nFast & Tracked Delivery\n\n60-day Money Back Guarantee\n\nPlease note we will be operating reduced hours on selected days over the festive period. Normal\nworking hours and delivery services will resume from **Friday 2nd January. **\n\nWe use Royal Mail and DPD to deliver across the UK.\n* Free UK Delivery on orders over \u00a345\n* Standard Delivery (Royal Mail Tracked): \u00a33.99 on orders under \u00a345.\n* Next Day Delivery (DPD): \u00a35.99.\n\nYou have a full 60 days from the date of purchase to try out our foods and supplements. If you find\nyourself not completely satisfied within this period, simply reach out to our customer service team\nand let them know.\n\n**\u2713 **HASSLE-FREE RETURNS\n\n**\u2713 **RISK-FREE ONLINE PURCHASES\n\n**\u2713 **FULL REFUND ON RETURN OF GOODS\n\nMore detail on our 60-day money-back guarantee can be found [here][69].\n\n[Klarna] [American Express] [Apple Pay] [PayPal] [Shop Pay] [Visa]\nIngredients & Nutritional Label ][70]\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Subscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\nSubscribe & Save 10% 60-Day Money Back Guarantee\n\n## How we make our Tallow\n* ### Selected\n\n100% suet fat is derived from organically raised and grass fed British cows.\n* ### Rendered\n\nThe fat is gently heated to remove impurities and create a pure form of tallow.\n* ### Cooled\n\nTallow cooled to room temperature to solidify to a firm state.\n* ### Use\n\nUse in Cooking. Store in the fridge and use a clean spoon when handling.\n\n## Tallow Showdown\n\n[Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow] Our Tallow\n[Other Beef Tallow] The Other Guys\nOrganic\nYes\nVaries\nGrass Fed\nBritish cows\nVaries\nSeed or Veg Oils\nNo, 100% tallow\nUsually\nQuality Control\nThird-party tested\nVaries\nSustainability\nEco-friendly\nOften not\nSupport\nTop-tier, educational\nLimited\n[Try Now ][71]\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][72]\n[Grass Fed Organic Beef Tallow] Ingredients\n\nOrganic Grass Fed British Beef Tallow\n\n## Unlock the Versatility of Tallow\n\n### How to use Beef Tallow\n\nWith a high smoke point (220c), you can use beef tallow for roasting, frying or baking. It tastes\nlike a subtle beefy flavoured butter. It's also great in various culinary applications like grilling\nsteak, cooking eggs, or stir-frying veggies.\n\n### Benefits of Tallow\n\nTallow is a mix of good fats: saturated and heart-healthy monounsaturated fats (about 50%). These\nfats are good for your heart and don't raise LDL cholesterol. Plus, tallow contains vitamins A, D,\nE, and K, great for eyes, skin, bones, and immunity. It also contains Conjugated Linoleic Acid\n(CLA), linked to muscle maintenance, fat loss, and heart health. Opt for quality Grass Fed tallow\nfor 300-500% more CLA.\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][73]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is tallow?\n\nTallow is a nutrient-dense, rendered fat traditionally made from the suet of cattle. This Hunter &\nGather version is sourced specifically from 100% grass-fed and organic British cows to ensure the\nhighest purity and quality.\n\nHow should tallow be stored?\n\nWhile tallow is shelf-stable and can be kept in a cool, dark cupboard, it is best stored in the\nfridge after opening to maintain its freshness for longer. Ensure the lid is tightly sealed to\nprotect it from moisture and strong kitchen odours.\n\nCan tallow be used in all types of cooking?\n\nYes, tallow has a very high smoke point of approximately 250\u00b0C, making it ideal for high-heat\nmethods such as frying, roasting, and searing. Its rich, savoury profile also makes it a fantastic\ntraditional ingredient for making incredibly crispy roast potatoes or pastry.\n\nHow does tallow compare to lard?\n\nThe main difference is the source; tallow is rendered from beef fat, whereas lard is rendered from\npork fat. Tallow typically has a higher melting point and a more robust, beefy flavour compared to\nthe milder taste of lard.\n\nDoes grass-fed tallow have natural trans fat (CLA)?\n\nYes, grass-fed tallow naturally contains Conjugated Linoleic Acid (CLA), a beneficial type of fatty\nacid found in much higher concentrations in pasture-raised animals. Unlike industrial trans fats,\nCLA is a naturally occurring fat that is associated with various health and metabolic benefits.\n\n[ Read all FAQs Here ][74]\n\n## CUSTOMER REVIEWS\n\n## Return Policy\n\nWe guarantee that our goods are of high quality. You must inspect the goods and notify us promptly\nin writing or by phone of any dissatisfaction with your order. We will fully refund the price of any\ngoods that do not meet your reasonable satisfaction or arrange for the delivery of replacement\ngoods, provided that you notify us within 30 days of delivery of the goods.\n\nView our full [terms of service][75]\n\n## Save on your first order\n\n### Shop\n* [Shop All][76]\n* [Collagen][77]\n* [Mayonnaise][78]\n* [Sauces][79]\n* [Electrolytes][80]\n* [Bone Broth][81]\n* [Oils & Fats][82]\n* [Supplements][83]\n* [Coffee][84]\n* [Julia's Favourites][85]\n\n### Lifestyle\n* [Refined Sugar free][86]\n* [Gluten Free][87]\n* [Keto][88]\n* [Paleo][89]\n* [Carnivore][90]\n* [Dairy Free][91]\n\n### Learn\n* [Articles][92]\n* [Recipes][93]\n* [Pillar Articles][94]\n* [eBook Library][95]\n* [About Us][96]\n* [Investors][97]\n\n### Store\n* [Account][98]\n* [Help][99]\n* [Contact Us][100]\n* [Rewards][101]\n* [Delivery Info][102]\n* [Stockist Log In][103]\n* [Klarna Payments][104]\n* [B-Corp][105]\n* [Money Back Guarantee][106]\n* [Subscription T&Cs][107]\n* [Easter Bank Holiday Information ][108]\n\n### Socials\n\n\u00a9 2026 Hunter & Gather.\n\n[Privacy Policy][109] [Cookies][110] [Sitemap][111]\n* [Klarna]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Bancontact]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [iDEAL Wero]\n* [Klarna]\n* [Maestro]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\n[1]: /products/creatine\n[2]: /collections/january-3-for-2\n[3]: /collections/best-sellers\n[4]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/all\n[5]: /products/grass-fed-collagen-peptides-protein-powder\n[6]: /products/chicken-bone-broth\n[7]: /products/creatine\n[8]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/all\n[9]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/collagen\n[10]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/bone-broth\n[11]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/protein\n[12]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/products/creatine\n[13]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/electrolytes\n[14]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/coffee\n[15]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/oils-and-fats\n[16]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/mayon