ative agriculture.\n* ### Purified\n\nClarified for purity to remove toxins, impurities, lactose and casein.\n* ### PACKED\n\nPackaged in recyclable glass jars, paper labels & 100% plastic free packaging for sending your\norders.\n* ### USAGE\n\nUse for roasting, frying, baking or add to coffee for a Keto friendly Bullet coffee.\n\n## Ghee Showdown\n\n[Grass Fed Organic Ghee] Our Ghee\n[Other Ghee] The Other Guys\nOrganic\nYes\nOften not\nGrass Fed\nYes\nOften not\nGreat Taste Gold Winner\nYes\nOften not\nNo Seed or Veg Oils\nYes\nVaries\nMade in the UK\nYes\nVaries\n[Try Now ][71]\n\n## Only real ingredients\n\nNo unnecessary fillers, bulkers or chemical preservatives! Other brands are not the same.\n\n[Ingredients & Nutritional Label][72]\n[Grass Fed Organic Ghee] Ingredients\n\nOrganic Grass Fed British Ghee\n\n## Revolutionise Your Health & Cooking with Ghee\n\n### HOW TO USE GHEE\n\nWith a high smoke point (250c), you can use ghee for roasting, frying or baking and it has a creamy\nbuttery taste. You can also use ghee in hot drinks (Coffee, Tea, Hot Chocolate, Matcha) instead of\nmilk, to add healthy fats but keeping it low carb. Whizz a spoonful into your hot drink for a rich\ncreamy drink.\n\n### BENEFITS OF GHEE\n\nGhee has been used in Indian cooking and Ayurveda ceremonies for generations, prized for its purity,\nVitamins (A,E,D,K) and omega 3 content it is believed to support bone density, immunity, heart\nhealth (from Vitamin K2) and gut health.\n\n### CARING FOR THE ENVIRONMENT\n\nWe only use recyclable glass jars for our ghee, paper labels & 100% plastic free packaging for\nsending your orders. We use British Grass Fed Dairy, locally sourced and made - reducing transit and\nsupporting regenerative agriculture.\n\nWatch Video\n][73]\n\nHi, we\u2019re Amy and Jeff, co-founders of Hunter & Gather, an ancestrally inspired lifestyle brand.\n\nAfter our own health journeys led us to a more natural way of living, we launched Hunter & Gather in\n2017. Eight years on, we\u2019re proud to have supported hundreds of thousands of people on their path to\nbetter health.\n\n### Modern life moves quickly, and it's easy to lose sight of what your body truly needs.\n\nWe\u2019re here to help you reconnect, with real food, practical guidance and the tools you need to\nthrive.\n\n[Our Story][74]\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhy is ghee a good alternative to butter or cooking oils?\n\nGhee has a very high smoke point of approximately 250\u00b0C, meaning it doesn't burn or produce harmful\nfree radicals at high temperatures like many other fats. It also provides a rich buttery taste\nwithout the inflammatory properties often associated with processed vegetable and seed oils.\n\nWhat is ghee?\n\nGhee is a form of highly clarified butter created by simmering butter to remove the water content\nand milk solids. This process results in a pure, golden fat with a rich, nutty flavour and a high\nsmoke point.\n\nIs this ghee made from grass-fed cow milk?\n\nYes, this ghee is made from the butter of grass-fed cows that graze on lush pastures. Using\ngrass-fed milk ensures a superior nutritional profile, including higher levels of conjugated\nlinoleic acid (CLA) and vitamins.\n\nIs your ghee organic?\n\nYes, Hunter & Gather ghee is an organic certified butter made from local UK grass fed dairy.\n\nIs ghee lactose-free?\n\nBecause the milk solids are removed during the clarification process, ghee is very low in lactose\nand casein. This makes it an excellent, gut-friendly alternative for individuals who are sensitive\nto traditional dairy.\n\n[ Read all FAQs Here ][75]\n\n## CUSTOMER REVIEWS\n\n## Return Policy\n\nWe guarantee that our goods are of high quality. You must inspect the goods and notify us promptly\nin writing or by phone of any dissatisfaction with your order. We will fully refund the price of any\ngoods that do not meet your reasonable satisfaction or arrange for the delivery of replacement\ngoods, provided that you notify us within 30 days of delivery of the goods.\n\nView our full [terms of service][76]\n\n## Save on your first order\n\n### Shop\n* [Shop All][77]\n* [Collagen][78]\n* [Mayonnaise][79]\n* [Sauces][80]\n* [Electrolytes][81]\n* [Bone Broth][82]\n* [Oils & Fats][83]\n* [Supplements][84]\n* [Coffee][85]\n* [Julia's Favourites][86]\n\n### Lifestyle\n* [Refined Sugar free][87]\n* [Gluten Free][88]\n* [Keto][89]\n* [Paleo][90]\n* [Carnivore][91]\n* [Dairy Free][92]\n\n### Learn\n* [Articles][93]\n* [Recipes][94]\n* [Pillar Articles][95]\n* [eBook Library][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Investors][98]\n\n### Store\n* [Account][99]\n* [Help][100]\n* [Contact Us][101]\n* [Rewards][102]\n* [Delivery Info][103]\n* [Stockist Log In][104]\n* [Klarna Payments][105]\n* [B-Corp][106]\n* [Money Back Guarantee][107]\n* [Subscription T&Cs][108]\n* [Easter Bank Holiday Information ][109]\n\n### Socials\n\n\u00a9 2026 Hunter & Gather.\n\n[Privacy Policy][110] [Cookies][111] [Sitemap][112]\n* [Klarna]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Bancontact]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [iDEAL Wero]\n* [Klarna]\n* [Maestro]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Visa]\n\n[1]: /products/creatine\n[2]: /collections/january-3-for-2\n[3]: /collections/best-sellers\n[4]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/all\n[5]: /products/grass-fed-collagen-peptides-protein-powder\n[6]: /products/chicken-bone-broth\n[7]: /products/creatine\n[8]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/all\n[9]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/collagen\n[10]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/bone-broth\n[11]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/protein\n[12]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/products/creatine\n[13]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/electrolytes\n[14]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/coffee\n[15]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/oils-and-fats\n[16]: https://hunterandgatherfoods.com/collections/mayonnaise\n[17]: https://hunterandgatherfoo