        "crawl_text": "Aceitera Mevi FSSC22000, ANAB, SMETA, Global G.A.P., GRASP, Primus GFS, HACCP North America Europe Asia FSSC22000 ANAB SMETA Global G.A.P. GRASP Primus GFS HACCP Experience in avocado production since 1974 Balanced Value Chain Method ensuring quality control from planting to distribution FSSC22000 HACCP Zapotiltic, Jalisco, Mexico Perib\u00e1n, Michoac\u00e1n, Mexico Mexico United States Canada Germany France Spain Italy Netherlands United Kingdom Japan South Korea Australia Zapotiltic, Jalisco, Mexico Perib\u00e1n, Michoac\u00e1n, Mexico North America Europe Asia Mevi Avocados\n\nAbout Mevi Avocados\n\nWelcome to Mevi Avocados\n\nAceitera Mevi is a proud Mexican company with international presence in over 11 countries, operating one of the biggest extra virgin avocado oil producing facilities in the world.\n\nMinimal Slider\n\n-->\n\nEsp\n\n-->\n\nMain\n\nAbout us\n\nProducts\n\nSocial Responsibility\n\nGrupo Mevi\n\nContact\n\nDirect from our fields\n\nBringing the Best Avocados\n\nto Whole World.\n\nMore about our products\n\nAlways in season!\n\nAvailability\n\nAll Year Round.\n\nMore about our products\n\nInternational Presence\n\npresence in 13 countries\n\naround the world.\n\nMore about our Products\n\nAvocados in every way for every day\n\nAvocado growers, Packers\n\nand Distributors.\n\nMore about our Process\n\nABOUT US\n\nOur Mission\n\nWe are a Mexican company dedicated to the production, transformation, commercialization and export of avocado and derivatives at a global level, through the sustainability of our processes and through an organizational ethic based on collaborative work with its stakeholders.\n\nOur Vision\n\nBeing one of the best Mexican companies in the avocado and derivatives industry, recognized for the quality of our products, for our commitment to the environment, for the development of our collaborators and our operational excellence.\n\nOur Commitment\n\nWe are committed to socially responsible management as part of our business strategy, having a positive impact on the quality of life of our employees, the community that surrounds us and the environment.\n\nThe Future\n\nAt MEVI Avocados we approach the future with passion and confidence, with an enduring belief in the promise of avocado, a superfood that promotes the health and well-being of our consumers.\n\nMEVI's foundation lies in 5 CORE VALUES:\n\nTRUST We make sure that everyone involved with our company works with the same high purpose and ethics, driving significant positive outcomes for our company and industry.\n\nRESPONSABILITY We are committed to supplying exclusively healthy products, like the avocado and its derivatives.\n\nHONESTY We combine professionalism with integrity in all aspects of our business, including team members and suppliers.\n\nRESPECT We recognize the capabilities and achievements of clients, team members and suppliers.\n\nCUSTOMER SERVICE We offer excellent personalized attention and responsiveness from the moment of purchase until the delivery of our products, with the aim of fulfilling and exceeding the expectations of our customers.\n\nADVANTAGES OF OUR SERVICE\n\nExperience: Overall knowledge of production and management of avocados since 1974. Market experience as a packer since 1994, and as an exporter\u2015through APEAM\u2015since 2003. Balanced Value Chain Method: MEVI pledges to provide the best service through this process, ensuring full control from planting the avocado, to its storage and distribution.\n\nTIMELINE\n\nCold Storage: MEVI owns Crosspoint, Inc.a South Texas cold storage facility with a 60 container\n\ncapacity that serves as a primary distribution point.\n\nSocial Responsibility\n\nInternational Presence\n\nProviding the best Avocados with the most rich flavor, we have\n\npresence in 13 countries around the world.\n\n-->\n\nNourishing you should not be so complicated, much less boring. Avocado oil contains a multitude of benefits for everyone, its high content of vitamins A, B1, B2, E, oleic acid and fatty acids such as Omegas 3, 6, 9 and Lutein combine a super oil that nourishes you while you enjoy food More rich. Take care of your heart! the amount of monounsaturated fatty acids in our oils help to reduce the levels of cholesterol and triglycerides, supporting you to prevent cardiovascular diseases.\n\nAdd a little extra virgin avocado oil makes your meals more nutritious! This is because there are substances that require fats to be properly absorbed by our body, as are the carotenoids (great antioxidants that are in our fruits and vegetables) is scientifically proven to add a little avocado oil in a normal salad It allows to absorb up to 17 times more nutrients ingested.\n\nWatch out! Lutein is a substance that keeps our eyes healthy, however, our body does not produce it and must obtain it from the food we consume. Luckily avocado oil has large amounts of this substance, helping to prevent eye diseases.\n\nMevi Oil\u00ae targets consumers who seek to improve:\n\nLower high cholesterol levels\n\nHealthy heart\n\nGood source of vitamin E, Alpha Sitosterol, Beta Sitosterol, Lycopene and Lutein\n\nSkin care\n\nMinimize bad fats\n\nGood source of Omega 3,6 y 9\n\n-->\n\nWe are a Mexican company with presence in over 13 countries, always on the lookout for talent, passion for excellence, teamwork and integrity. If you think your philosophy matches ours, we want you\u2026\n\nBE A PART OF OUR TEAM\n\nSEND\n\nContact US\n\nMEVI AVOCADOS\n\nWe are avocado growers, packers & distributors, want to visit of contact us? For commercial inquiries please fill out this boxes and we\u00b4ll get back to you.\n\nJalisco\n\nKm 2+800 Carretera Cd. Guzman - Zapotiltic\n\nZapotiltic, Jalisco. C.P. 49616 M\u00e9xico.\n\nPhone: +52 (33) 3113 4341\n\nMichoacan\n\nLibramiento Perib\u00e1n-Buenavista Km 0+200\n\nPerib\u00e1n, Michoac\u00e1n, C.P. 60440 M\u00e9xico.\n\nPhone: +52 (35) 4551 2461 / 4551 2353.\n\n+01 234 56 78\n+01 234 56 79\n-->\n\nl