u2122 Sesame][66]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Avocado][67]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Macadamia][68]\n* [OLVEAct With Us][69]\n  * [The fair trade calculator][70]\n  * [Fair trade projects][71]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Shea][72]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Hazelnut][73]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Avocado][74]\n    * [Coconut Oil][75]\n    * [Jojoba Oil][76]\n* [Sustainable Development][77]\n  * [CSR policy][78]\n  * [Our commitments][79]\n  * [Philanthropic fund][80]\n* [News][81]\n* [Contact][82]\n* [[Fran\u00e7ais]][83]\n* [[English]][84]\n* Search for:Search Button\nVegetable Oils & Specialty ingredients FROM SOURCES YOU CAN TRUST Discover our OLVE'True\u2122 Shea FROM\nSOURCES YOU CAN TRUST integrated supply chain Discover our OLVE'True\u2122 Shea FROM SOURCES YOU CAN\nTRUST (Shea Butter) Discover our OLVE'True\u2122 Argan FROM SOURCES YOU CAN TRUST integrated supply chain\nDiscover our OLVE'True\u2122 Argan FROM SOURCES YOU CAN TRUST (Argan oil)\n\n# OLVEA Vegetable Oils\n\nOLVEA offers a wide range of **pure and natural vegetable oils** ([**COSMOS Approved**][85],\n**[organic][86]**, **[upcycled][87] **or **[fair trade][88]**) for **cosmetics and nutrition**.\n\n## Shorten the distance from Nature to Brands\n\nIn order to maintain the highest standards regarding the quality, traceability and consistency of\nits raw materials, [OLVEA][89] has set up [**sustainable supply chains**][90] in Africa:\n\n**\u2022 **In **[Morocco][91]**, for the production of OLVE\u2019True\u2122 **[Argan oil][92]** and\u00a0OLVE\u2019True\u2122\n**[Hazelnut oil][93]**,\n\n\u2022 In [**Burkina Faso**][94], for the production of OLVE\u2019True\u2122 [**Shea** **butter**][95],\n\n\u2022 In [**Kenya**][96], for the production of OLVE\u2019True\u2122 [**Avocado** **oil**][97], OLVE\u2019True\u2122\n[**Macadamia oil**][98] and OLVE\u2019True\u2122**[Sesame oil][99]**.\n\n### [Our vegetable oils and butters][100]\n\nDiscover OLVEA\u2019s [**COSMOS Approved**][101], **[organic][102]**, **[upcycled][103] **or **[fair\ntrade][104]** vegetable oils\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Argan Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Argan Oil][105]\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Avocado Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Avocado Oil][106]\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Hazelnut Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Hazelnut Oil][107]\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Macadamia Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Macadamia Oil][108]\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Sesame Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Sesame Oil][109]\n\n[OLVEA - Shea butter (OLVE'True\u2122 Shea) Producer & Supplier]\n\n## [OLVEA"
