            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nOLVEA Vegetable Oils\nFrom sources you can trust\n[[OLVEA Vegetable Oils]][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [Presentation][4]\n  * [Who are we?][5]\n  * [Quality & certifications][6]\n  * [Our values][7]\n  * [Production in Morocco][8]\n  * [Production in Burkina Faso][9]\n  * [Production in Kenya][10]\n  * [Eco-refining in France][11]\n  * [R&D and Innovation][12]\n* [Vegetable oils][13]\n  * [Presentation][14]\n  * [All our vegetable oils][15]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 oils][16]\n  * [100% natural oils][17]\n  * [Organic oils][18]\n  * [Fair trade oils][19]\n  * [Upcycled oils][20]\n  * [Our solutions][21]\n* [Supply chains][22]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Argan][23]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Shea][24]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Sesame][25]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Avocado][26]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Macadamia][27]\n* [OLVEAct With Us][28]\n  * [The fair trade calculator][29]\n  * [Fair trade projects][30]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Shea][31]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Hazelnut][32]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Avocado][33]\n    * [Coconut Oil][34]\n    * [Jojoba Oil][35]\n* [Sustainable Development][36]\n  * [CSR policy][37]\n  * [Our commitments][38]\n  * [Philanthropic fund][39]\n* [News][40]\n* [Contact][41]\n* [[Fran\u00e7ais]][42]\n* [[English]][43]\n* Search for:Search Button\n* [Home][44]\n* [Presentation][45]\n  * [Who are we?][46]\n  * [Quality & certifications][47]\n  * [Our values][48]\n  * [Production in Morocco][49]\n  * [Production in Burkina Faso][50]\n  * [Production in Kenya][51]\n  * [Eco-refining in France][52]\n  * [R&D and Innovation][53]\n* [Vegetable oils][54]\n  * [Presentation][55]\n  * [All our vegetable oils][56]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 oils][57]\n  * [100% natural oils][58]\n  * [Organic oils][59]\n  * [Fair trade oils][60]\n  * [Upcycled oils][61]\n  * [Our solutions][62]\n* [Supply chains][63]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Argan][64]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Shea][65]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Sesame][66]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Avocado][67]\n  * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Macadamia][68]\n* [OLVEAct With Us][69]\n  * [The fair trade calculator][70]\n  * [Fair trade projects][71]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Shea][72]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Hazelnut][73]\n    * [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Avocado][74]\n    * [Coconut Oil][75]\n    * [Jojoba Oil][76]\n* [Sustainable Development][77]\n  * [CSR policy][78]\n  * [Our commitments][79]\n  * [Philanthropic fund][80]\n* [News][81]\n* [Contact][82]\n* [[Fran\u00e7ais]][83]\n* [[English]][84]\n* Search for:Search Button\nVegetable Oils & Specialty ingredients FROM SOURCES YOU CAN TRUST Discover our OLVE'True\u2122 Shea FROM\nSOURCES YOU CAN TRUST integrated supply chain Discover our OLVE'True\u2122 Shea FROM SOURCES YOU CAN\nTRUST (Shea Butter) Discover our OLVE'True\u2122 Argan FROM SOURCES YOU CAN TRUST integrated supply chain\nDiscover our OLVE'True\u2122 Argan FROM SOURCES YOU CAN TRUST (Argan oil)\n\n# OLVEA Vegetable Oils\n\nOLVEA offers a wide range of **pure and natural vegetable oils** ([**COSMOS Approved**][85],\n**[organic][86]**, **[upcycled][87] **or **[fair trade][88]**) for **cosmetics and nutrition**.\n\n## Shorten the distance from Nature to Brands\n\nIn order to maintain the highest standards regarding the quality, traceability and consistency of\nits raw materials, [OLVEA][89] has set up [**sustainable supply chains**][90] in Africa:\n\n**\u2022 **In **[Morocco][91]**, for the production of OLVE\u2019True\u2122 **[Argan oil][92]** and\u00a0OLVE\u2019True\u2122\n**[Hazelnut oil][93]**,\n\n\u2022 In [**Burkina Faso**][94], for the production of OLVE\u2019True\u2122 [**Shea** **butter**][95],\n\n\u2022 In [**Kenya**][96], for the production of OLVE\u2019True\u2122 [**Avocado** **oil**][97], OLVE\u2019True\u2122\n[**Macadamia oil**][98] and OLVE\u2019True\u2122**[Sesame oil][99]**.\n\n### [Our vegetable oils and butters][100]\n\nDiscover OLVEA\u2019s [**COSMOS Approved**][101], **[organic][102]**, **[upcycled][103] **or **[fair\ntrade][104]** vegetable oils\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Argan Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Argan Oil][105]\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Avocado Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Avocado Oil][106]\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Hazelnut Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Hazelnut Oil][107]\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Macadamia Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Macadamia Oil][108]\n\n[OLVE'True\u2122 Sesame Oil]\n\n## [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Sesame Oil][109]\n\n[OLVEA - Shea butter (OLVE'True\u2122 Shea) Producer & Supplier]\n\n## [OLVEA \u2013 Shea butter (OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Shea) Producer & Supplier][110]\n\n##### Sustainability for OLVEA\n\n[OLVEA][111] is committed in promoting sustainable development, not only **environmentally**, but\nalso by [**adding real social and economic values**][112] to the actors of our eco-responsible\nsupply chains.\n\nSustainability has always been one of OLVEA\u2019s core values. Since 2018, OLVEA formalizes\nits\u00a0Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) approach, with dedicated leading employees, through a\n**policy and an action plan**, accompanied by **ambitious and quantifiable goals** with the horizon\nof **OLVEA\u2019s 100th anniversary**, in 2029.\u00a0\n\nSince 2020, OLVEA goes further by publishing annually its CSR performance report, [**OLVEAct\nNow**][113], which is also shared with the **United Nations **as part of our **membership to the\n[Global Compact][114]**.\n\n[OLVEAct Now - 2025][115]\n\n###### Our previous CSR reports:\n\n[OLVEAct Now - 2020][116]\n[OLVEAct Now - 2021][117]\n[OLVEAct Now - 2022][118]\n[OLVEAct Now - 2023][119]\n[OLVEAct Now - 2024][120]\n\n\u201cWe are continually investing for the quality of our oils, the satisfaction of our customers and our\ncommitment to sustainable development. While maintaining our family identity, we aim at developing\nour people and creating a safe environment for our people and the planet.\u201d\n\n\u201cWe are committed to apply daily the sustainable development principles while respecting local\nresources, and adding real social and economic values to local communities. The local transformation\nofour raw materials allows us to participate in the development of these countries and reduce the\ncarbon footprint of our productions.\u201d\n\n***Arnauld Daudruy**, President *\n***Caroline Mayaud Daudruy**, Managing Director Support Services*\n***Emmanuel Petiot**, Managing Director Vegetable Oils Business Unit\n**Jean-Fran\u00e7ois Vollier**, Managing Director Fish Oils Business Unit*\n***Bertrand Alfroid**, Managing Director OLVEA Green Technologies*\n\n#### [OLVEA's latest news][121]\n\n[[OLVEA Foundation soutient l\u2019hygi\u00e8ne menstruelle au Kenya : un projet \u00e0 fort impact social autour\ndu Mont Kenya]][122]\n\n### [OLVEA Foundation supports menstrual health in Kenya: a high-impact social project around Mount\n### Kenya][123]\n\n[28 May 2026][124]\n\nOLVEA Foundation supports Mount Kenya Trust\u2019s Menstrual Health and Hygiene project to fight period\npoverty, promote girls\u2019 education and strengthen the empowerment of local communities.\n\n[Read more][125]\n[[Biodiversity: how OLVEA takes concrete action across its marine and vegetable supply chains]][126]\n\n### [Biodiversity: how OLVEA takes concrete action across its marine and vegetable supply\n### chains][127]\n\n[22 May 2026][128]\n\n\u00c0 l\u2019occasion de la Journ\u00e9e internationale de la biodiversit\u00e9, d\u00e9couvrez comment OLVEA agit\nconcr\u00e8tement pour pr\u00e9server les ressources marines et soutenir des fili\u00e8res v\u00e9g\u00e9tales plus durables.\n\n[Read more][129]\n\n### [Fair Trade Beyond Certification: Making Positive Impact Measurable with OLVEAct With Us][130]\n\n[12 May 2026][131]\n\nFair trade is no longer only about certification. Today, companies also need to understand, measure,\nand showcase the positive impact generated through their sourcing decisions.\n\n[Read more][132]\n[[OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Macadamia: The Upcycled High-Performance Oil for Next-Gen Sun Care]][133]\n\n### [OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Macadamia: The Upcycled High-Performance Oil for Next-Gen Sun Care][134]\n\n[4 May 2026][135]\n\nThanks to its biomimetic composition, OLVE\u2019True\u2122 Macadamia Oil delivers strong skin affinity,\ncombining sensory appeal with technical efficacy.\u00a0\n\n[Read more][136]\n[[OLVEA is exhibiting at In-Cosmetics Global!]][137]\n\n### [OLVEA highlights its new products and formulas at In-Cosmetics Global!][138]\n\n[14 April 2026][139]\n\nCome meet us and learn more about our range of natural vegetable oils and performance-driven\ningredients\n\n[Read more][140]\n\n### [National Nutrition Month\u00ae : Supporting a responsible approach to Omega\u20113\u2011rich oils and dietary\n### fats in nutrition][141]\n\n[15 March 2026][142]\n\nOn the occasion of National Nutrition Month\u00ae, OLVEA reaffirms its commitment to responsible sourcing\nof Omega\u20113\u2011rich and vegetable oils.\n\n[Read more][143]\n[[OLVEA Vegetable Oils]][144]\nOLVEA Vegetable Oils, 319 rue Jean Paumier, Parc d'Activit\u00e9 des Hautes Falaises, 76400 Saint L\u00e9onard\n- France\n+33 235 292 854\ninfo-vegoils[at]olvea.com\n[LinkedIn][145][YouTube][146]\n\u00a9OLVEA - 2026\n* [General terms of sales][147]\n* [Legal mentions][148]\nFooter menu en\n[Go to Top][149]\nWe use cookies on our website to give you the most relevant experience by remembering your\npreferences and repeat visits. By clicking \u201cAccept\u201d, you consent to the use of ALL the cookies.\nCookie settingsACCEPT\nManage consent\nClose\n\n#### Privacy Overview\n\nThis website uses cookies to improve your experience while you navigate through the website. Out of\nthese, the cookies that are categorized as necessary are stored on your browser as they are\nessential for the working of basic functionalities of the website. We also use third-party cookies\nthat help us analyze and understand how you use this website. These cookies will be stored in your\nbrowser only with your consent. You also have the option to opt-out of these cookies. But opting out\nof some of these cookies may affect your browsing experience.\nSAVE & ACCEPT\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/\n[3]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/\n[4]: #\n[5]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/who-are-we/\n[6]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/quality-certifications/\n[7]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/values-olvea/\n[8]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/argan-oil-producer-morocco/\n[9]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/natural-shea-butter-producer-in-burkina-faso/\n[10]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olvetrue-avocado-macadamia-oil-production-kenya/\n[11]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/vegetable-oil-eco-refining-plant-france/\n[12]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olvea-innovation-oils-cosmetics-nutrition-rd/\n[13]: #\n[14]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/vegetable-oils-supplier/\n[15]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/complete-list-organic-fair-trade-conventional-vegetable-o\nils/\n[16]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olvetrue-vegetable-oils/\n[17]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/cosmos-approved-natural-vegetable-oils/\n[18]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/organic-vegetable-oils-ecocert/\n[19]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/fair-trade-vegetable-oils-ecocert-fair-for-life/\n[20]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/natural-upcycled-vegetable-oils/\n[21]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/our-solutions/\n[22]: #\n[23]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/argan-oil-production-supply-chain-morocco/\n[24]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olvetrue-shea-butter-sustainable-integrated-supply-chain/\n[25]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olvetrue-sesame-seed-oil-integrated-supply-chain/\n[26]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olvetrue-avocado-oil-integrated-supply-chain-kenya/\n[27]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olvetrue-macadamia-oil-integrated-supply-chain-kenya/\n[28]: //www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olveact-with-us-calculator-fair-trade-supply-chains-sustainable\n-projects/\n[29]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olveact-with-us-calculator-fair-trade-supply-chains-susta\ninable-projects/\n[30]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olveact-with-us-sustainable-projects-fair-trade-shea-butt\ner/\n[31]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olveact-with-us-sustainable-projects-fair-trade-shea-butt\ner/\n[32]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olveact-with-us-fair-trade-projects-olvetrue-hazelnut-sup\nply-chain/\n[33]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olveact-with-us-fair-trade-projects-olvetrue-avocado-oil/\n[34]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olveact-with-us-fair-trade-projects-coconut-oil/\n[35]: https://www.olvea-vegetable-oils.com/olveact-with-us-fair-trade-projects-jojoba-oil/\n[36]: #\n[37]: /com/sustainable-development/#corporate"
          }
