learance- 30% off\nRs. 900.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][301]\n[Batana Oil (American Palm)]\nBatana Oil (American Palm)\nRs. 1,300.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][302]\nAll enquires are welcome at Bulk Naturals\n[ Search ][303]\n* Deals & Promotions\n* [ Clearance & Sale Items ][304]\n* [ New and Restocked Products ][305]\n* [ Special Offers ][306]\n* [Batana Oil (American Palm)]\nBatana Oil (American Palm)\nRs. 1,300.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][307]\n[AHK-Cu Copper Tripeptide-3 Powder 99%]\nAHK-Cu Copper Tripeptide-3 Powder 99%\nRs. 2,600.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][308]\n* All enquires are welcome at Bulk Naturals\n[ Search ][309]\n* [ Why Buy From Us ][310]\n* [ Blog ][311]\nSearch\nSearch\nPause slideshow Play slideshow\nWant some extra savings? Enter code 15OFF250 at check out for orders $250 USD or more.\n\n### Sign up and save\n\nSign up for our newsletter and get exclusive promotions and information about the latest cutting\nedge botanical ingredients.\n\nEnter your email Subscribe\nSubscribe [icon-right-arrow]\n[icon-X] \"Close (esc)\"\n[Home][312] [Liquid Soap Unscented, Castile][313]\n[Liquid Soap Unscented, Castile] [icon-search] Close (esc)\n\n# Liquid Soap Unscented, Castile\n\n[ This is a Sample Product Title ][314]\nWas $200.00 Now $100.00\nAdd\n15% off orders over $250 USD\nRegular priceRs. 1,000.00\n[Shipping calculated at checkout. ][315]\n15% off orders over $250 USD\nWhy Bulk Naturals?\n\n100% Pure Undiluted Products\n\nSustainably Sourced, Responsibly Packaged\n\nFreshly Packaged to Order\n\nFL/OZ\n8oz Glass Bottle 16oz Glass Bottle 32oz HDPE jug 64oz HDPE Jug 1 Gallon HDPE Jug - Email for pricing\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart ADD TO WISHLIST\n* [Amazon]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Diners Club]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Visa]\n* Out of Stock\n* In stock, ready to ship\n* Backordered, shipping soon\n8oz Glass Bottle - Rs. 1,000.00 INR 16oz Glass Bottle - Rs. 1,600.00 INR 32oz HDPE jug - Rs.\n2,100.00 INR 64oz HDPE Jug - Rs. 3,800.00 INR 1 Gallon HDPE Jug - Email for pricing - Rs. 7,200.00\nINR\nFL/OZ\n8oz Glass Bottle 16oz Glass Bottle 32oz HDPE jug 64oz HDPE Jug 1 Gallon HDPE Jug - Email for pricing\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart\n[Icon] Description\n\n### **A Pure, Versatile Soap Base for Every Formulation**\n\nOur **Liquid Castile Soap made with organic oils** is a gentle, plant-based cleanser made with only\nsix simple ingredients\u2014including **organic sunflower and coconut oils**. Free from synthetic\ndetergents, fragrances, and sulfates, this castile soap base is ideal for DIY body care products,\nnatural home cleaning, or use as-is for a minimalist skin-friendly wash.\n\nWhether you're formulating for sensitive skin or crafting your own eco-conscious line, this\nmulti-use soap is a must-have staple.\n\n### Key Features:\n* **Organic Oils**: Made with organic **Sunflower Seed Oil** and **Coconut Oil**\n* **Sulfate-Free**: No SLS,"
