learance- 30% off\nRs. 900.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][301]\n[Batana Oil (American Palm)]\nBatana Oil (American Palm)\nRs. 1,300.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][302]\nAll enquires are welcome at Bulk Naturals\n[ Search ][303]\n* Deals & Promotions\n* [ Clearance & Sale Items ][304]\n* [ New and Restocked Products ][305]\n* [ Special Offers ][306]\n* [Batana Oil (American Palm)]\nBatana Oil (American Palm)\nRs. 1,300.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][307]\n[AHK-Cu Copper Tripeptide-3 Powder 99%]\nAHK-Cu Copper Tripeptide-3 Powder 99%\nRs. 2,600.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][308]\n* All enquires are welcome at Bulk Naturals\n[ Search ][309]\n* [ Why Buy From Us ][310]\n* [ Blog ][311]\nSearch\nSearch\nPause slideshow Play slideshow\nWant some extra savings? Enter code 15OFF250 at check out for orders $250 USD or more.\n\n### Sign up and save\n\nSign up for our newsletter and get exclusive promotions and information about the latest cutting\nedge botanical ingredients.\n\nEnter your email Subscribe\nSubscribe [icon-right-arrow]\n[icon-X] \"Close (esc)\"\n[Home][312] [French Clay - Green][313]\n[French Clay - Green] [icon-search] Close (esc)\n\n# French Clay - Green\n\n[ This is a Sample Product Title ][314]\nWas $200.00 Now $100.00\nAdd\n15% off orders over $250 USD\nRegular priceRs. 1,200.00\n[Shipping calculated at checkout. ][315]\n15% off orders over $250 USD\nWhy Bulk Naturals?\n\n100% Pure Undiluted Products\n\nSustainably Sourced, Responsibly Packaged\n\nFreshly Packaged to Order\n\nSize\n4oz 8oz 16oz 2lb 5lb 10lb - Email for pricing\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart ADD TO WISHLIST\n* [Amazon]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Diners Club]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Visa]\n* Out of Stock\n* In stock, ready to ship\n* Backordered, shipping soon\n4oz - Rs. 1,200.00 INR 8oz - Rs. 1,900.00 INR 16oz - Rs. 3,000.00 INR 2lb - Rs. 5,200.00 INR 5lb -\nRs. 11,500.00 INR 10lb - Email for pricing - Rs. 19,100.00 INR\nSize\n4oz 8oz 16oz 2lb 5lb 10lb - Email for pricing\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart\n[Icon] Description\n\n**French Green Clay** - This comes from the sedimentation of Silico-aluminum, its color is the\nresult of the decomposition of ancient plant matter. Its unique composition includes Iron, Silica,\nAluminum, Magnesium, Calcium, Titanium, Sodium, and Potassium. French Green Clay absorbs and removes\nimpurities from the skin, revealing the fresh surface of the skin to provide a healthy-looking glow.\nWhen prepared as a mask, the clay dries on the skin, causing pores to tighten and the skin starts to\nfeel firm, toned, and refreshed. French Green Clay can be used in mineral baths to promote\nrelaxation of the body and a sense of well-being. It is suitable for all skin types.\n\n**INCI Nomenclature:** *Illite*\n**Appearance:** Light green colored powder.\n**Application:** French Green Clay can be used in body wraps, soap making, face masks, mineral-based\nor cream-"
