s - Rs. 1,900.00 INR 4oz Glass - Rs. 2,600.00 INR 8oz Glass - Rs. 5,000.00 INR 16oz Glass -\nRs. 8,800.00 INR 32oz HDPE Jug - Rs. 15,300.00 INR 32oz Glass - Rs. 15,500.00 INR 64oz HDPE Jug -\nRs. 28,300.00 INR 1 Gallon HDPE Jug - Rs. 53,800.00 INR\nSize\n2oz Glass 4oz Glass 8oz Glass 16oz Glass 32oz HDPE Jug 32oz Glass 64oz HDPE Jug 1 Gallon HDPE Jug\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart\n[Icon] Description\n\nSea buckthorn oil is a powerful, nutrient-rich oil that is used in many cosmetic formulations. It is\none of the very few oils that has more nutritional content than essential fatty acids(EFA) by\npercentage. It has many therapeutic properties, which make it a very versatile oil. It can be used\nfor relieving the symptoms of many issues and also makes a great ingredient for skin and hair\nvitality. Sea buckthorn oil is great for rejuvenating and regenerating the skin when applied\ntopically.\n\nBenefits of Sea buckthorn\n\u2022 UV Protection\n\u2022 Skin Regenerating\n\u2022 Anti-Aging\n\nSourced from a supplier"
