learance- 30% off\nRs. 900.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][301]\n[Batana Oil (American Palm)]\nBatana Oil (American Palm)\nRs. 1,300.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][302]\nAll enquires are welcome at Bulk Naturals\n[ Search ][303]\n* Deals & Promotions\n* [ Clearance & Sale Items ][304]\n* [ New and Restocked Products ][305]\n* [ Special Offers ][306]\n* [Batana Oil (American Palm)]\nBatana Oil (American Palm)\nRs. 1,300.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][307]\n[AHK-Cu Copper Tripeptide-3 Powder 99%]\nAHK-Cu Copper Tripeptide-3 Powder 99%\nRs. 2,600.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][308]\n* All enquires are welcome at Bulk Naturals\n[ Search ][309]\n* [ Why Buy From Us ][310]\n* [ Blog ][311]\nSearch\nSearch\nPause slideshow Play slideshow\nWant some extra savings? Enter code 15OFF250 at check out for orders $250 USD or more.\n\n### Sign up and save\n\nSign up for our newsletter and get exclusive promotions and information about the latest cutting\nedge botanical ingredients.\n\nEnter your email Subscribe\nSubscribe [icon-right-arrow]\n[icon-X] \"Close (esc)\"\n[Home][312] [Australian Beige Clay][313]\n[Australian Beige Clay] [icon-search] Close (esc)\n\n# Australian Beige Clay\n\n[ This is a Sample Product Title ][314]\nWas $200.00 Now $100.00\nAdd\n15% off orders over $250 USD\nRegular priceRs. 800.00\n[Shipping calculated at checkout. ][315]\n15% off orders over $250 USD\nWhy Bulk Naturals?\n\n100% Pure Undiluted Products\n\nSustainably Sourced, Responsibly Packaged\n\nFreshly Packaged to Order\n\nSize\n2oz 4oz 8oz 16oz 2lb\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart ADD TO WISHLIST\n* [Amazon]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Diners Club]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Visa]\n* Out of Stock\n* In stock, ready to ship\n* Backordered, shipping soon\n2oz - Rs. 800.00 INR 4oz - Rs. 1,000.00 INR 8oz - Rs. 1,600.00 INR 16oz - Rs. 2,500.00 INR 2lb - Rs.\n3,800.00 INR\nSize\n2oz 4oz 8oz 16oz 2lb\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart\n[Icon] Description\n\nAustralian Beige Clay is a kaolinite clay with a higher mineral content than white kaolin and\ncontains magnesium, calcium, copper, zinc, and potassium, which give it a beige color.\n\n** INCI Name: **Kaolinite**\nParticle Size: **25\u201335\u00b5m**\nOrigin(s): **Mineral**\nAppearance:** Light beige-colored powder.\n**Aromatic Description:** Characteristic.\n**Solubility: **Insoluble in water.\n**Absorption:** 65%\n\n** Common Use:** Australian Beige Clay is ideal for spa treatments and can be used to cleanse the\nbody and face, absorbing and removing impurities. It is said to be invigorating, and may possibly\nhelp reduce the look of cellulite and provide a toned, refreshed, and youthful glow. It is suitable\nfor both dry and oily skin types. It can be used in detoxifying body wraps, soap making, face masks,\nmineral-based or cream-based cleansers, face or body scrubs, cosmetics, and facial powders.\n\n##### Documents\n\n[SDS][316]\n[CoA-LOT: BN2102902082/CL][317]\n[Co"
