NR 10lb - Rs. 9,200.00 INR\nWeight\n4oz 8oz 16oz 2lb 5lb 10lb\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart\n[Icon] Description\n\n##### **[\n#####\n##### Castor Wax (Hydrogenated Castor Oil)\n#####\n##### Castor Wax is a plant-derived hard wax created through the hydrogenation of castor oil,\n##### resulting in a stable, creamy white wax with excellent thickening and oil-binding properties.\n##### Valued in both skincare and cosmetic formulations, it helps create rich textures, improve\n##### product stability, and add structure to balms, sticks, salves, and anhydrous products.\n#####\n##### Unlike traditional beeswax, Castor Wax offers a smoother glide and a more refined feel while\n##### still delivering impressive hardness and viscosity-building performance. It is commonly used\n##### in natural and vegan formulations where formulators want enhanced texture, suspension\n##### abilities, and improved payoff.\n#####\n##### This versatile wax works beautifully in lip balms, body butters, salves, ointments,\n####"
