learance- 30% off\nRs. 900.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][301]\n[Batana Oil (American Palm)]\nBatana Oil (American Palm)\nRs. 1,300.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][302]\nAll enquires are welcome at Bulk Naturals\n[ Search ][303]\n* Deals & Promotions\n* [ Clearance & Sale Items ][304]\n* [ New and Restocked Products ][305]\n* [ Special Offers ][306]\n* [Batana Oil (American Palm)]\nBatana Oil (American Palm)\nRs. 1,300.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][307]\n[AHK-Cu Copper Tripeptide-3 Powder 99%]\nAHK-Cu Copper Tripeptide-3 Powder 99%\nRs. 2,600.00\n15% off orders over $250\n[ VIEW ][308]\n* All enquires are welcome at Bulk Naturals\n[ Search ][309]\n* [ Why Buy From Us ][310]\n* [ Blog ][311]\nSearch\nSearch\nPause slideshow Play slideshow\nWant some extra savings? Enter code 15OFF250 at check out for orders $250 USD or more.\n\n### Sign up and save\n\nSign up for our newsletter and get exclusive promotions and information about the latest cutting\nedge botanical ingredients.\n\nEnter your email Subscribe\nSubscribe [icon-right-arrow]\n[icon-X] \"Close (esc)\"\n[Home][312] [Chamomile Extract Powder-Soothing and Skin Calming Botanical][313]\n[Glass bowl filled with brown powder and a wooden scoop on a beige background] [icon-search] Close\n(esc)\n[Chamomile Extract Powder-Soothing and Skin Calming Botanical] [icon-search] Close (esc)\n[Glass bowl filled with brown powder and a wooden scoop on a beige background]\n][314]\n[Chamomile Extract Powder-Soothing and Skin Calming Botanical]\n][315]\n\n# Chamomile Extract Powder-Soothing and Skin Calming Botanical\n\n[ This is a Sample Product Title ][316]\nWas $200.00 Now $100.00\nAdd\n15% off orders over $250 USD\nRegular priceRs. 700.00\n[Shipping calculated at checkout. ][317]\n15% off orders over $250 USD\nWhy Bulk Naturals?\n\n100% Pure Undiluted Products\n\nSustainably Sourced, Responsibly Packaged\n\nFreshly Packaged to Order\n\nSize\n50 Grams 100 Grams 500 Grams 1kg\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart ADD TO WISHLIST\n* [Amazon]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Diners Club]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Shop Pay]\n* [Visa]\n* Out of Stock\n* In stock, ready to ship\n* Backordered, shipping soon\n50 Grams - Rs. 700.00 INR 100 Grams - Rs. 1,100.00 INR 500 Grams - Rs. 2,900.00 INR 1kg - Rs.\n5,300.00 INR\nSize\n50 Grams 100 Grams 500 Grams 1kg\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart\n[Icon] Description\n\n##### Description\n\nA member of the daisy family, chamomile (as a tea or dietary supplement) is a plant most commonly\nused as a calming aid. Chamomile contains terpenoids, flavonoids, and lactones, including matricin\nand apigenin, which are believed to be the chief active compounds that contribute to its numerous\nhealth benefits. Commonly used both topically and orally, chamomile has anti-anxiety,\nanti-inflammatory, and anti-histamine effects. Chamomile's anti-inflammatory properties help soothe,\nmoisturize, and soften the skin. While a face scrub is a b"
