0 INR 16oz - Rs. 1,300.00 INR 5lbs - Rs. 3,400.00 INR 10lbs - Rs. 5,300.00 INR 55lbs\n- Rs. 16,900.00 INR\nSize\n4oz 16oz 5lbs 10lbs 55lbs\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart\n[Icon] Description\n\n**Ultra Fine Premium Activated Charcoal Powder** is a virgin activated charcoal powder that comes\nfrom high-purity coconut shell base char and is produced by a high-temperature steam activation\nprocess. Activated charcoal can be used as a teeth whitener since it assists in removing plaque and\nother contaminants that cause teeth to become yellow and discolored. Activated charcoal powder can\nbe used as a colorant to create extremely beautiful black and rich gray colors in natural soap and\nother cosmetic products such as facial scrubs.\n\n**INCI Name: ***Activated Charcoal.*\n**Origin(s):** Coconut shells\n**Appearance:** Black-colored powder.\n**Aromatic Description: **Odorless.\n**Solubility:** Disperses in water or oil.\n\n**Common Use:** Ultra Fine Premium Activated Charcoal Powder is commonly used in"
