old Out 250 Grams - Sold\nOut 500 Grams - Sold Out\nSize\n10 Grams 25 Grams 50 Grams 100 Grams 250 Grams 500 Grams\nQuantity\n\u2212 +\nAdd to cart\n[Icon] Description\n\nChebe Powder Hair Growth Formula is a natural remedy gaining popularity for its ability to support\nhair growth and strength. To use, mix equal parts of your favorite oil and Chebe Powder, then apply\nthe mixture to clarified, conditioned, and detangled wet hair. Adjust the ratio to suit your hair's\ndensity, length, and thickness. Rinse the mixture out with warm water every 3-5 days, then remix and\nreapply as needed, avoiding shampoo more than twice a month. Keep the hair in a protective style,\nsuch as braids or under a scarf, and use a satin bonnet at night for added protection.\n\nIt is essential to test a strand of hair for any allergic reaction before use and to avoid applying\nthe powder directly to the scalp, as it may cause irritation or dandruff with prolonged use. This\ntime-honored formula has become a favorite i"
