        "crawl_text": "Avopro EPZ Limited EPZA licensed under Kenyan regulations Kenya International Global G.A.P. IFS Food Sedex SGS USDA Organic Agri-Europe FFL (Fair For Life) JAS State-of-the-art cold press techniques Ethical sourcing from nearly 5,000 farmers Commitment to sustainability and community impact EPZA regulations FSSC 22000 food safety standards Sagana, Kirinyaga District, Central Kenya The Hyatt, 2nd Floor, Suite No. 206, 207, Lower Kabete Road, Westlands, Nairobi, Kenya Kenya Sagana, Kirinyaga District, Central Kenya International Home - Avoprokenya\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nThe Kenyan Way\n\nOur Team\n\nQuality Management System\n\nCareers\n\nSustainability\n\nGiving Back to the Environment\n\nGiving Back to the Community\n\nSourcing\n\nProducts\n\nRequest Quote\n\nContact Us\n\nSearch\n\nKenya's Best Avocado Oil\nA reliable farming network + ethical practices = The Avopro Difference\nGet in Touch\n\nExperts in Purity\nWe believe in the best product we can produce. Avopro uses no additives or preservatives in its oil.\nOur Product\n\nFair Trade \u2013 Sustainable Process\nOur mission is to build a long-lasting network of farmers and treat them with the respect that all humans deserve.\nLearn More\n\nState-of-the-art cold press techniques give Avopro the advantage in creating antioxidant-rich extra virgin or crude avocado oil optimized for pharmaceutical and beauty products.\n\nReliable Supply Chain\n\nThe Avopro network consists of nearly 5,000 Kenyan farmers. You can count on us for consistency.\n\n100% Natural\n\nOur avocado oil is naturally refined. We are 100% transparent with what goes into our oils\u2014pure avocados, purely from our farms.\n\nSustainable\n\nAvopro gives back to the planet and the community by making a positive impact in Sagana, Central Kenya, and providing employment opportunities.\n\nOur Story\n\nAvopro EPZ is dedicated to education and agronomy to build a sustainable business\u2014for our employees and our farmers. We have dedicated the time it takes to create organic growing conditions at our farms. This creates a better product for you and a long-lasting economy for our region.\n\nAvopro was incorporated in 2020 and holds an EPZA license under Kenyan regulations.\n\nMore About Us\n\nOur farmers pride themselves in knowing what it takes to grow a good fruit.\n\nWe are partnered with 80% female-owned farms, from which we ethically source our avocados to always bring you the safest and highest quality products. We only engage in socially, environmentally, and economically responsible practices in order to benefit everyone that handles our avocados in any stage of the process\u2014from the farm, to you.\n\nIn the Ideal Growing Conditions of Kenya\n\nAvopro EPZ Ltd is located in Sagana, Kirinyaga District, in Central Kenya. This is right in the heart of the highly fertile and productive agricultural zone of the Mt Kenya region.\n\nThe volcanic soils in this expansive zone, coupled with good climate, offer conditions that are very conducive for agriculture. Most of our avocados are farmed in this region\n\nWhere to Buy\n\nRequest Pricing\n\nSubmit this form and we will work with you to create a quote.\n\nRequest A Quote\n\nRequest Pricing\n\nSubmit this form and we will work with you to create a quote.\n\nRequest A Quote\n\nBulk Order\n\nReach out and learn more about how you can count on Avopro.\n\nContact Us\n\nBulk Order\n\nReach out and learn more about how you can count on Avopro.\n\nContact Us\n\nCertifications and Industry Partnerships\n\nTestimonials\n\nQuality avocado oil, made with our customers in mind.\n\nAvopro oil is definitely up there with the good quality oils I\u2019ve tried. I\u2019m loving it and will regularly place my order through their website.\n\nJennifer C.\n\n/ Orlando, FL\n\nAs a chef, I\u2019m in constant search for organic oils and from the first taste, Avopro's avocado oil simply mind blowing. There's no oil to compare, it is simply the Awesome!\n\nJennifer C.\n\n/ Orlando, FL\n\nBeing an experienced personnel in the field, I can say that Avopro offers the best. They have made the importing process very seamless. To anybody seeking \"top-quality avocado oil,\" I strongly suggest Avopro.\n\nREVEDA Exporters\n\nFounder and CEO\n\nAs a Kenyan-based business, Avopro exports premium-quality avocado oil. I definitely support Avopro as a trustworthy source of premium avocado oil with top customer service for any business wishing to export avocado oil.\n\nKEN Exporters\n\nFounder &amp; CEO\n\nThe team at Avopro is professional and efficient in exporting premium quality avocado oil. I highly recommend Avopro for anyone looking for a reliable and high-quality avocado oil supplier.\n\nRK Exporters\n\nFounder &amp; CEO\n\nFrom Our Blog\n\nThe benefits of avocado oil and health and nutrition facts of avocados you need to know now!\n\nAvocado Oil\n\nJanuary 22, 2023\n\nThe Benefits of Avocado Oil\n\nAvocado\n\nJanuary 22, 2023\n\nHealth and nutrition facts of avocados you need to know now!\n\nAvocado Oil\n\nJanuary 22, 2023\n\nWhat makes avocado oil a \u2018healthy cooking oil\n\nView all posts\n\nGROWERS\n\nCAREER\n\nCompany\n\n+254 740 441 441\n\nsales@avoprokenya.com\n\ninfo@avoprokenya.com\n\nAbout Us\n\nSustainability/Environmental Impact\n\nProducts\n\nRequest Quote\n\nContact Us\n\nPolicies\n\nPrivacy policy\n\nRefund policy\n\nTerms of services\n\nOrder track policy\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nYouTube\n\nInstagram\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2023 Avopro EPZ Ltd. All rights reserved.\n\nDisclaimer\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nThe Kenyan Way\n\nOur Team\n\nQuality Management System\n\nCareers\n\nSustainability\n\nGiving Back to the Environment\n\nGiving Back to the Community\n\nSourcing\n\nProducts\n\nRequest Quote\n\nContact Us * [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [The Kenyan Way][3]\n* [Our Team][4]\n* [Quality Management System][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][8]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][9]\n* [Sourcing][10]\n* [Products][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n[ [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] ][14]\n[Search][15]\n\n## The Kenyan Way\n* [][16]\n* [][17]\n\n## At Avopro, we consider ourselves to be more than just avocado oil processors.\n\nWe are a partner who is committed to delivering value to the farmer and the buyer through nurturing\nrelationships that bring about growth to both parties. Through fair wages, ethical labor, and a\nrobust quality management system, the quest for excellence drives our business and we ensure that it\nis ingrained in our culture.\n\nThe contractual arrangements we have with our producers enable us to monitor production at farm\nlevel, systematically harvest the avocados at the right maturity, and appropriately transport them\nto our purpose\u2013built factory. The producers in return get an assured market for their produce at a\ncompetitive price. Once the hand\u2013picked mature avocados are delivered to the factory, they are\nnaturally ripened. The avocado oil is mechanically extracted from the ripened avocado fruits using\nthe cold press method, which ensures we retain all the essential nutrients. We guarantee a\ncompletely chemical and additive free extraction process.\n\n##### We couldn\u2019t do it without them.\n\nOur journey as a company would not have been possible were it not for our great partners, the\navocado farmers. It is always our great joy when we see our partnership bringing significant change\nin the quality of lives of our avocado farming community.\n\n#### Inspired by Sagana\n\nAvopro is located in **Sagana, Kirinyaga District, in Central Kenya.** This is right in the heart of\nthe highly fertile and productive agricultural zone of the Mt Kenya region. The volcanic soils in\nthis expansive zone, coupled with good climate, offer conditions that are very conducive for\nagriculture.\n\nMost of our avocados are farmed in this region. The presence of our company here, in the heart of\nthe avocado growing zone of Sagana, provides a valuable source of employment for the community.\n\n1568 +\n\n###### Tons of Harvest\n\n457\n\n###### Hectares of Farm\n\n125\n\n###### Units of Technic\n* [][18]\n* [][19]\n* [][20]\n\n## The best team, made up of the best people.\n\nWe have a highly qualified and dedicated team of professionals. Our team\u2019s expertise is firmly\ngrounded on cumulative experiences of more than 50 years in the avocado oil sector. We are very\npassionate about what we do. We are sticklers for integrity, team work, and are relentless in our\npursuit for quality and customer satisfaction. With a team like ours, our esteemed customers can\nalways count on us to deliver products that meet internationally set standards in terms of sourcing,\nprocessing and marketing.\n\nAs a company, we appreciate the critical role our partners play in the existence of our company.\nThis motivates us to always want to achieve the best for our suppliers and buyers.\n\n## We aim to:\n\nCreate long-term shared value by engaging in socially, environmentally, and\neconomically responsible practices that benefit our stakeholders.\n\n## We strive to be:\n\nA leading producer of safe, high-quality products that are handled by\nqualified & motivated staff.\n\n## When you support us, you support our farmers.\n\nOver 80% of our raw material is sourced from hundreds of contracted small\u2013scale farmers, with the\nrest coming from large scale farmers and prequalified independent suppliers.\n\nWe offer technical advice to the contracted farmers; this helps them meet quality and food standards\nrequired for our markets. Our technical advice also helps the farmers achieve maximum production. We\ndo not confine the technical advice to the crops of interest, we extend this to all the farm\nactivities in a way that truly creates value for the farmer.\n\nOur main aim in working with smallholders is to convert them from subsistence farming into a cash\neconomy as a way of poverty eradication. We encourage youth and gender participation in our farmer\nprograms.\n* [][21]\n* [][22]\n\n## High level quality, high level production.\n\nIn accordance to the EPZ Act of Kenya, we sell 20% of our avocado oil output locally. We export the\nremaining 80% to our clients in the international market. Our engagement with the market, both local\nand international, is firmly grounded on our dedication to quality delivery. At Avopro EPZ Ltd., we\nare cognizant of the very high\u2013quality standards the market expects of our products.\n\n##### The quest for excellence drives our business and we ensure that this is ingrained in our\n##### culture.\n\nTo make sure our products live up to these expectations, we use avocado fruit that is of the best\nquality possible. In addition to this, we operate a high\u2013end processing line that runs on the latest\ntechnologies in the industry, and with a workforce that\u2019s highly motivated and meticulously trained.\nOur total quality management system makes it possible for us to confidently put out our products\ninto the market. We have an internal quality control system that is benchmarked to FSSC 22000. This\nrigorous system enables us to comply with both local and international food safety standards.\nThe contractual arrangement we have with the farmers enables us to monitor production at farm level,\nsystematically harvest the avocados at the right maturity and appropriately transport them to our\npurpose\u2013built factory.\n[ GROWERS ][23]\n[ CAREER ][24]\n\n## Company\n\n**[+254 740 441 441][25]\n****[sales@avoprokenya.com][26]**\n**[info@avoprokenya.com][27]**\n* [ About Us ][28]\n* [ Sustainability/Environmental Impact ][29]\n* [ Products ][30]\n* [ Request Quote ][31]\n* [ Contact Us ][32]\n\n## Policies\n* [ Privacy policy ][33]\n* [ Refund policy ][34]\n* [ Terms of services ][35]\n* [ Order track policy ][36]\n* [ Facebook ][37]\n* [ LinkedIn ][38]\n* [ YouTube ][39]\n* [ Instagram ][40]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2023 Avopro EPZ Ltd. All rights reserved.\n* [ Disclaimer ][41]\n* [Home][42]\n* [About Us][43]\n* [The Kenyan Way][44]\n* [Our Team][45]\n* [Quality Management System][46]\n* [Careers][47]\n* [Sustainability][48]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][49]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][50]\n* [Sourcing][51]\n* [Products][52]\n* [Request Quote][53]\n* [Contact Us][54]\n\n[1]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[2]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /about"
      },
