tally, and economically responsible practices in order to benefit everyone that handles our avocados in any stage of the process\u2014from the farm, to you.\n\nIn the Ideal Growing Conditions of Kenya\n\nAvopro EPZ Ltd is located in Sagana, Kirinyaga District, in Central Kenya. This is right in the heart of the highly fertile and productive agricultural zone of the Mt Kenya region.\n\nThe volcanic soils in this expansive zone, coupled with good climate, offer conditions that are very conducive for agriculture. Most of our avocados are farmed in this region\n\nWhere to Buy\n\nRequest Pricing\n\nSubmit this form and we will work with you to create a quote.\n\nRequest A Quote\n\nRequest Pricing\n\nSubmit this form and we will work with you to create a quote.\n\nRequest A Quote\n\nBulk Order\n\nReach out and learn more about how you can count on Avopro.\n\nContact Us\n\nBulk Order\n\nReach out and learn more about how you can count on Avopro.\n\nContact Us\n\nCertifications and Industry Partnerships\n\nTestimonials\n\nQuality avocado oil, made with our customers in mind.\n\nAvopro oil is definitely up there with the good quality oils I\u2019ve tried. I\u2019m loving it and will regularly place my order through their website.\n\nJennifer C.\n\n/ Orlando, FL\n\nAs a chef, I\u2019m in constant search for organic oils and from the first taste, Avopro's avocado oil simply mind blowing. There's no oil to compare, it is simply the Awesome!\n\nJennifer C.\n\n/ Orlando, FL\n\nBeing an experienced personnel in the field, I can say that Avopro offers the best. They have made the importing process very seamless. To anybody seeking \"top-quality avocado oil,\" I strongly suggest Avopro.\n\nREVEDA Exporters\n\nFounder and CEO\n\nAs a Kenyan-based business, Avopro exports premium-quality avocado oil. I definitely support Avopro as a trustworthy source of premium avocado oil with top customer service for any business wishing to export avocado oil.\n\nKEN Exporters\n\nFounder &amp; CEO\