            "text": "* [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [The Kenyan Way][3]\n* [Our Team][4]\n* [Quality Management System][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][8]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][9]\n* [Sourcing][10]\n* [Products][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n[ [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] ][14]\n[Search][15]\n\n### Quality Management System\n\n## Need to come back to this with a new headline.\n\nWe have a rigorous quality management system that enables us to comply with both local and\ninternational food safety standards. The quest for excellence drives our business and we ensure that\nthis is ingrained in our culture.\n\nWe have an internal quality control system that is benchmarked to Food Safety System Certification\n22000. The contractual arrangement we have with each farmer enables us to monitor production at farm\nlevel, systematically harvest the avocados at the right maturity and appropriately transport them to\nour purpose-built factory.\n\n##### We also have the following food and sustainability certifications:\n* Global G.A.P.\n* IFS Food\n* Sedex\n* SGS\n* USDA Organic\n* Agri-Europe\n* FFL (Fair For Life)\n* JAS\n\n[ GROWERS ][16]\n[ CAREER ][17]\n\n## Company\n\n**[+254 740 441 441][18]\n****[sales@avoprokenya.com][19]**\n**[info@avoprokenya.com][20]**\n* [ About Us ][21]\n* [ Sustainability/Environmental Impact ][22]\n* [ Products ][23]\n* [ Request Quote ][24]\n* [ Contact Us ][25]\n\n## Policies\n* [ Privacy policy ][26]\n* [ Refund policy ][27]\n* [ Terms of services ][28]\n* [ Order track policy ][29]\n* [ Facebook ][30]\n* [ LinkedIn ][31]\n* [ YouTube ][32]\n* [ Instagram ][33]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2023 Avopro EPZ Ltd. All rights reserved.\n* [ Disclaimer ][34]\n* [Home][35]\n* [About Us][36]\n* [The Kenyan Way][37]\n* [Our Team][38]\n* [Quality Management System][39]\n* [Careers][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][42]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][43]\n* [Sourcing][44]\n* [Products][45]\n* [Request Quote][46]\n* [Contact Us][47]\n\n[1]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[2]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /about-us#team\n[5]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/quality-management-system/\n[6]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[7]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[8]: /sustainability-environmental-impact\n[9]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#community\n[10]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#sourcing\n[11]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[12]: https://avoprokenya.com/request-quote/\n[13]: https://avoprokenya.com/contact-us/\n[14]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[15]: #g5core_search_popup\n[16]: https://avoprokenya.com/growers/\n[17]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[18]: tel:+254740441441\n[19]: mailto:info@avoprokenya.com\n[20]: mailto:info@avoprokenya.com\n[21]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[22]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[23]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[24]: https://avoprokenya.com/get-a-quote/\n[25]: /contact-us/\n[26]: https://avoprokenya.com/privacy-policy/\n[27]: https://avoprokenya.com/refund-policy/\n[28]: https://avoprokenya.com/terms-of-services/\n[29]: https://avoprokenya/\n[30]: https://www.facebook.com/AvoproKenya/\n[31]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/avopro-epz-limited-241b2a250/\n[32]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj8C_eJyL8PIxKOvO_A1X4Q\n[33]: https://www.instagram.com/avopro_kenya/\n[34]: http://mksabuwala.com/avoprokenya/disclaimer/\n[35]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[36]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[37]: /about-us\n[38]: /about-us#team\n[39]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/quality-management-system/\n[40]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[41]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[42]: /sustainability-environmental-impact\n[43]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#community\n[44]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#sourcing\n[45]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[46]: https://avoprokenya.com/request-quote/\n[47]: https://avoprokenya.com/contact-us/"
