            "url": "https://avoprokenya.com/products/",
            "text": "* [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [The Kenyan Way][3]\n* [Our Team][4]\n* [Quality Management System][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][8]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][9]\n* [Sourcing][10]\n* [Products][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n[ [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] ][14]\n[Search][15]\n\n## Products\n\n#### We offer organically and conventionally farmed oils, which can be shipped to you in a variety\n#### of sizes, each of certified quality, to successfully fit your needs.\n\n### Conventional Oil\n\nConventional oil is rich, smooth, and packed with nutrients from conventionally farmed avocados.\nThis variety is popular in a wide spectrum of industries including pharmaceutical, food service, and\ncosmetics because of its many health-conscious benefits.\n\n### Organic/extra virgin\n\nThis organic oil is made by processing organically certified fruit. Abundant with important\nnutrients and rich in monounsaturated fats, this variety is in high demand in the food service,\npharmaceutical, and cosmetics industries.\n\n### Crude/bulk order\n\nBulk order crude oil can be your best option if you are looking for a large quantity of oil. This\nvariety is produced by pressing, and is good for any industry requiring a substantial amount of oil.\n\n### Flexitanks/Tankers\n\nFlexitanks and tankers are two certified quality styles of trucks used for bulk oil deliveries. They\ntypically hold 22,000 kg of oil, and pump into on-site holding tanks used exclusively for oil\nstorage. This variety is oriented toward the culinary industry, as it is a healthy food-grade\npackaging option.\n\nDepending on the type of the oil, or it is or where it is coming from, you may receive either type\nof truck.\n\n### Caged Plastic Totes\n\nCommonly used in high-volume production and manufacturing, certified quality totes are an\neasy-to-use packaging size that saves money on oil and shipping cost. Totes contain 1000 kg of oil,\nbut if you aren\u2019t sure if this is the right option for you, our team will assist in finding the\nright packaging type and size to suit your needs.\n\n### Drums\n\nCertified quality drums are food grade steel barrels that hold up to 200 kg of oil, an average size\nused in the manufacturing industry. In a warehouse setting, they are reasonably small which makes\nthem easy to move around and store while safeguarding the integrity of our products.\n\n[ REQUEST QUOTE ][16]\n[ GROWERS ][17]\n[ CAREER ][18]\n\n## Company\n\n**[+254 740 441 441][19]\n****[sales@avoprokenya.com][20]**\n**[info@avoprokenya.com][21]**\n* [ About Us ][22]\n* [ Sustainability/Environmental Impact ][23]\n* [ Products ][24]\n* [ Request Quote ][25]\n* [ Contact Us ][26]\n\n## Policies\n* [ Privacy policy ][27]\n* [ Refund policy ][28]\n* [ Terms of services ][29]\n* [ Order track policy ][30]\n* [ Facebook ][31]\n* [ LinkedIn ][32]\n* [ YouTube ][33]\n* [ Instagram ][34]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2023 Avopro EPZ Ltd. All rights reserved.\n* [ Disclaimer ][35]\n* [Home][36]\n* [About Us][37]\n* [The Kenyan Way][38]\n* [Our Team][39]\n* [Quality Management System][40]\n* [Careers][41]\n* [Sustainability][42]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][43]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][44]\n* [Sourcing][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [Request Quote][47]\n* [Contact Us][48]\n\n[1]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[2]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /about-us#team\n[5]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/quality-management-system/\n[6]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[7]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[8]: /sustainability-environmental-impact\n[9]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#community\n[10]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#sourcing\n[11]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[12]: https://avoprokenya.com/request-quote/\n[13]: https://avoprokenya.com/contact-us/\n[14]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[15]: #g5core_search_popup\n[16]: https://avoprokenya.com/request-quote/\n[17]: https://avoprokenya.com/growers/\n[18]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[19]: tel:+254740441441\n[20]: mailto:info@avoprokenya.com\n[21]: mailto:info@avoprokenya.com\n[22]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[23]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[24]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[25]: https://avoprokenya.com/get-a-quote/\n[26]: /contact-us/\n[27]: https://avoprokenya.com/privacy-policy/\n[28]: https://avoprokenya.com/refund-policy/\n[29]: https://avoprokenya.com/terms-of-services/\n[30]: https://avoprokenya/\n[31]: https://www.facebook.com/AvoproKenya/\n[32]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/avopro-epz-limited-241b2a250/\n[33]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj8C_eJyL8PIxKOvO_A1X4Q\n[34]: https://www.instagram.com/avopro_kenya/\n[35]: http://mksabuwala.com/avoprokenya/disclaimer/\n[36]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[37]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[38]: /about-us\n[39]: /about-us#team\n[40]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/quality-management-system/\n[41]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[42]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[43]: /sustainability-environmental-impact\n[44]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#community\n[45]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#sourcing\n[46]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[47]: https://avoprokenya.com/request-quote/\n[48]: https://avoprokenya.com/contact-us/"
