            "text": "* [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [The Kenyan Way][3]\n* [Our Team][4]\n* [Quality Management System][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][8]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][9]\n* [Sourcing][10]\n* [Products][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n[ [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] ][14]\n[Search][15]\n\n## Got a question? We can help.\n\n## Get in touch with us:\n\n#### Address\n\nAvopro EPZ Limited\nP.O BOX 8464-00100,\nEastleigh, Nairobi, Kenya\n\n][16]\n\n#### [ Office Address ][17]\n\nThe Hyatt, 2nd Floor\nSuite No. 206, 207\nLower Kabete Road, Westlands\nP.O. Box 8464-00610\nNairobi, Kenya\n\n[ Get Directions ][18]\n][19]\n\n#### [ Contact ][20]\n\nOffice: +254 740 441 441\n\n**E-mail**: info@avoprokenya.com\n\n][21]\n\n#### [ Hours of Operation ][22]\n\nMon \u2013 Fri: 08:30 \u2013 20:00\n\nSat & Sun: 09:30 \u2013 21:30\n\nAvocado oil like no other\n\n## Why do business with Avopro?\n\nState-of-the-art cold press techniques give Avopro the advantage in\ncreating antioxidant-rich extra virgin or crude avocado oil, optimized for\npharmaceutical and beauty products.\n\n[ Discover More ][23]\n\n## Contact Us\n\nLeave your contact information, and we will contact you as soon as\npossible.\n\n[ GROWERS ][24]\n[ CAREER ][25]\n\n## Company\n\n**[+254 740 441 441][26]\n****[sales@avoprokenya.com][27]**\n**[info@avoprokenya.com][28]**\n* [ About Us ][29]\n* [ Sustainability/Environmental Impact ][30]\n* [ Products ][31]\n* [ Request Quote ][32]\n* [ Contact Us ][33]\n\n## Policies\n* [ Privacy policy ][34]\n* [ Refund policy ][35]\n* [ Terms of services ][36]\n* [ Order track policy ][37]\n* [ Facebook ][38]\n* [ LinkedIn ][39]\n* [ YouTube ][40]\n* [ Instagram ][41]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2023 Avopro EPZ Ltd. All rights reserved.\n* [ Disclaimer ][42]\n* [Home][43]\n* [About Us][44]\n* [The Kenyan Way][45]\n* [Our Team][46]\n* [Quality Management System][47]\n* [Careers][48]\n* [Sustainability][49]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][50]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][51]\n* [Sourcing][52]\n* [Products][53]\n* [Request Quote][54]\n* [Contact Us][55]\n\n[1]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[2]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /about-us#team\n[5]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/quality-management-system/\n[6]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[7]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[8]: /sustainability-environmental-impact\n[9]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#community\n[10]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#sourcing\n[11]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[12]: https://avoprokenya.com/request-quote/\n[13]: https://avoprokenya.com/contact-us/\n[14]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[15]: #g5core_search_popup\n[16]: https://goo.gl/maps/SkstfHLxS1E4z62x6\n[17]: https://goo.gl/maps/SkstfHLxS1E4z62x6\n[18]: https://goo.gl/maps/SkstfHLxS1E4z62x6\n[19]: #\n[20]: #\n[21]: #\n[22]: #\n[23]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[24]: https://avoprokenya.com/growers/\n[25]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[26]: tel:+254740441441\n[27]: mailto:info@avoprokenya.com\n[28]: mailto:info@avoprokenya.com\n[29]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[30]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[31]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[32]: https://avoprokenya.com/get-a-quote/\n[33]: /contact-us/\n[34]: https://avoprokenya.com/privacy-policy/\n[35]: https://avoprokenya.com/refund-policy/\n[36]: https://avoprokenya.com/terms-of-services/\n[37]: https://avoprokenya/\n[38]: https://www.facebook.com/AvoproKenya/\n[39]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/avopro-epz-limited-241b2a250/\n[40]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCj8C_eJyL8PIxKOvO_A1X4Q\n[41]: https://www.instagram.com/avopro_kenya/\n[42]: http://mksabuwala.com/avoprokenya/disclaimer/\n[43]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[44]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[45]: /about-us\n[46]: /about-us#team\n[47]: https://avoprokenya.