            "url": "https://avoprokenya.com/contact",
            "text": "* [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [The Kenyan Way][3]\n* [Our Team][4]\n* [Quality Management System][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n* [Giving Back to the Environment][8]\n* [Giving Back to the Community][9]\n* [Sourcing][10]\n* [Products][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n[ [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] ][14]\n[Search][15]\n\n## Got a question? We can help.\n\n## Get in touch with us:\n\n#### Address\n\nAvopro EPZ Limited\nP.O BOX 8464-00100,\nEastleigh, Nairobi, Kenya\n\n][16]\n\n#### [ Office Address ][17]\n\nThe Hyatt, 2nd Floor\nSuite No. 206, 207\nLower Kabete Road, Westlands\nP.O. Box 8464-00610\nNairobi, Kenya\n\n[ Get Directions ][18]\n][19]\n\n#### [ Contact ][20]\n\nOffice: +254 740 441 441\n\n**E-mail**: info@avoprokenya.com\n\n][21]\n\n#### [ Hours of Operation ][22]\n\nMon \u2013 Fri: 08:30 \u2013 20:00\n\nSat & Sun: 09:30 \u2013 21:30\n\nAvocado oil like no other\n\n## Why do business with Avopro?\n\nState-of-the-art cold press techniques give Avopro the advantage in\ncreating antioxidant-rich extra virgin or crude avocado oil, optimized for\npharmaceutical and beauty products.\n\n[ Discover More ][23]\n\n## Contact Us\n\nLeave your contact information, and we will contact you as soon as\npossible.\n\n[ GROWERS ][24]\n[ CAREER ][25]\n\n## Company\n\n**[+254 740 441 441][26]\n****[sales@avoprokenya.com][27]**\n**[info@avoprokenya.com][28]**\n* [ About Us ][29]\n* [ Sustainability/Environmental Impact ][30]\n* [ Products ][31]\n* [ Request Quote ][32]\n* [ Contact Us ][33]\n\n## Policies\n* [ Privacy policy ][34]\n* [ Refund policy ][35]\n* [ Terms of services ][36]\n* [ Order track policy ][37]\n* [ Facebook ][38]\n* [ LinkedIn ][39]\n* [ YouTube ][40]\n* [ Instagram ][41]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2023 Avopro EPZ Ltd. All rights reserved.\n* [ Disclaimer ][42]\n* [Home][43]\n* [About Us][44]\n* [The Kenyan Way][45]\n* [Our Team][46]\n* [Quality Management System][47]\n*