            "text": "[[Deoleo]][1]\n* [Company][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Meet the Team][4]\n* [Contact Us][5]\n* [Our Brands][6]\n* [Brands][7]\n* [Quality][8]\n* [Awards][9]\n* [Global Leadership][10]\n* [Best Practices][11]\n* [Our Impact][12]\n* [Our Strategy][13]\n* [Our Certifications][14]\n* [Talent][15]\n* [News][16]\n* [Oil for Life][17]\n* [Contact Us][18]\n[Shareholders][19]\nSearch for:\nEng\n* Eng\n* [Esp][20]\n[[Deoleo]][21]\nSearch for:\n* [Company][22]\n* [About Us][23]\n* [Meet the Team][24]\n* [Contact Us][25]\n* [Our Brands][26]\n* [Brands][27]\n* [Quality][28]\n* [Awards][29]\n* [Global Leadership][30]\n* [Best Practices][31]\n* [Our Impact][32]\n* [Our Strategy][33]\n* [Our Certifications][34]\n* [Talent][35]\n* [News][36]\n* [Oil for Life][37]\n* [Contact Us][38]\n[Shareholders][39]\nEnglish\n* Eng\n* [Esp][40]\n\n## Data Protection Clause\n\nKindly be informed that, with the data that you provide, DEOLEO will manage the necessary\nshareholders information for the Governing Board as well as other activities related to the company,\nbased on your consent and in compliance with legal obligations.\n\nThe data provided will be kept as long as the relationship with DEOLEO is maintained or its deletion\nis requested. Anyone can obtain confirmation if DEOLEO is processing their personal data. All\npersons have the right to access their personal data, as well as to request the correction of\ninaccurate data or, where appropriate, request their deletion when, among other reasons, the data is\nno longer necessary for the purpose they were collected for. Likewise, they may post their\nopposition to the receiving information about our company.\n\nYou can exercise your rights materially through email at [rgpd@deoleo.com][41]. For more\ninformation, please consult the Privacy Policy of this web page.\n\n### Sections\n* [Public Communications][42]\n* [Relevant facts][43]\n* [Inside information][44]\n* [Other relevant information][45]\n* [Economic financial Information][46]\n* [Periodical Public Information][47]\n* [Audited annual accounts][48]\n* [Average period of payment to suppliers][49]\n* [Rating][50]\n* [Investor Presentation][51]\n* [General corporate information][52]\n* [The Share and the Share Capital][53]\n* [Dividends][54]\n* [Issuances and Admisions][55]\n* [Bylaws][56]\n* [Major Holdings and Own Shares][57]\n* [Notification of Right to Vote and Financial Instruments][58]\n* [Company-owned Shares (Treasury Shares)][59]\n* [Notification by Senior Managers and Related Parties][60]\n* [Relevant events on share-based remuneration plans][61]\n* [Corporate governance][62]\n* [Regulations][63]\n* [Shareholders\u00b4 Agreements][64]\n* [Board of Directors][65]\n* [Annual Report on Corporate Governance][66]\n* [Board Remunerations Annual Report][67]\n* [Committees on the Board][68]\n* [General shareholders meeting][69]\n* [Announcement and Agenda][70]\n* [Number of Shares and Right to Vote][71]\n* [Documentation][72]\n* [Right to information.][73]\n* [Right of attendance and Right to appoint a proxy.][74]\n* [Instructions for Telematic Attendance of the General Meeting of Shareholders][75]\n* [Attendance Cards, Proxy Cards and Distance Voting][76]\n* [Electronic Forum][77]\n* [Instructions for Delegation and remote voting][78]\n* [Vote, electronic delegation and registration for remote assistance][79]\n* [Telematic Attendance for registered shareholders][80]\n* [Previous General Shareholders\u2019 Meetings][81]\n* [Investor\u2019s area][82]\n* [Stock market information][83]\n* [Analyst Information][84]\n* [2026 Notes][85]\n* [2025 Notes][86]\n* [Shareholder attention][87]\n* [ESG and Sustainability Strategy][88]\n\n# Company-owned Shares (Treasury Shares)\n\n\u201cAs gathered from the latest declaration submitted to the CNMV, Deoleo, S.A.\u2019s own shares are the\nfollowing:\u201d\n\nRights to Vote 500.000.004\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n% direct participation\u2502% indirect participation\u2502% total\u2502Date entry register in CNMV\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n0,000 \u25020,000 \u25020,000 \u2502[27/04/201][89]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n4,463 \u25020,491 \u25024,954 \u2502[14/07/2008][90]\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2