and vitamins. Supports good cholesterol levels, heart health,\nand overall well-being. Perfect for health-conscious families. Cold weather may cause cloudiness,\nwhich doesn't affect quality.\nAdditional Information\nMade from a single ingredient, each bottle contains the pure essence of 72 avocados. Our oil has no\nadditives, no refinement, and no blending with other oils \u2013 just pure, rich avocado oil.\nReviews\nManish\n\"I've never tasted avocado oil this pure and flavorful! Knowing it's made from 72 avocados with no\nadditives makes me confident I'm choosing the healthiest option for my family.\"\nAnushka\n\"This extra virgin cold-pressed avocado oil has transformed my cooking. The rich, natural taste is\nunbeatable, and I love that it's free from any additives or blending.\"\nVaibhav\n\"I've tried many avocado oils, but this one stands out. The purity and richness are evident in every\ndrop. It's become a staple in my kitchen for all my culinary needs.\"\nPrachi\n\"The quality of this avocado oil is exceptional. It's incredible to know that it's made from 72\navocados without any refinement or additives. Highly recommend it to anyone looking for the best!\"\nVishal\n\"This is by far the best avocado oil I've ever used. The flavor is so rich and pure, and I\nappreciate that it's made with only avocados and no other oils or additives. A fantastic product!\"\nPrevious slide\nNext slide\n\n## Avocado Oil Delights\n\n**Category:** [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][48]\nNATURALLY NOURISHING\n\n## Avocado Oil Products\n\n**Ingredients: **Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nNet weight: \u25021000 ML (1910 gm)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u