            "text": "Home - A For Avocado\n\nSkip to content\n\n+91-9990928598\n\nsales@corbettindustries.in\n\nInstagram\n\nYoutube\n\nLinkedin\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nAvocado Oil Delights\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nUses\n\nBlogs\n\nContact\n\nMenu\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nAvocado Oil Delights\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nUses\n\nBlogs\n\nContact\n\nMenu\n\nSearch\n\nRegister\nLog In\n\nWishlist 0\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nAvocado Oil Delights\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nUses\n\nBlogs\n\nContact us\n\nMenu\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nAvocado Oil Delights\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nUses\n\nBlogs\n\nContact\n\nMenu\n\nDISCOVER THE\nWORLD's BEST\nEDIBLE OIL\n\nShop from Amazon\n\nSee Our products\n\nDISCOVER THE\nWORLD's BEST\nEDIBLE OIL\n\nShop from Amazon\n\nsee our products\n\nPrev\nNext\n\nScroll Down\n\nDISCOVER THE\nWORLD's BEST\nEDIBLE OIL\n\nShop from Amazon\n\nSee Our products\n\nDISCOVER THE\nWORLD's BEST\nEDIBLE OIL\n\nShop from Amazon\n\nsee our products\n\nPrev\nNext\n\nScroll Down\n\nBEST FOR ALL TYPES OF INDIAN COOKING\nApplications\ncook better,replace low quality oils with a single powerhouse\n\nTadka\nTempering spices in hot oil for enhanced flavor.\n\nFrying\nHigh-quality oils for perfect, crispy frying and delicious meals.\n\nGrilling\nCooking food directly over high heat, typically on a grill.\n\nRoasting\nRoasting involves cooking food using dry heat in an oven.\n\nBaking\nYour go-to destination for premium baking oils and culinary delights.\n\nSauteing\nSauteing perfection: Enhance flavors effortlessly with Meko Oil.\n\nMarinating\nExplore expert marinating tips, delicious recipes for perfect flavors.\n\nDrizzling\nYour go-to site for healthy, flavorful cooking with quality oils.\n\nBEST FOR ALL TYPES OF INDIAN COOKING\nApplications\nCook Better, Replace Low Quality Oils With A Single Powerhouse\n\nTadka\n\nTempering spices in hot oil for enhanced flavor.\n\nFrying\n\nHigh-quality oils for perfect, crispy frying and delicious meals.\n\nGrilling\n\nCooking food directly over high heat, typically on a grill.\n\nRoasting\n\nRoasting involves cooking food using dry heat in an oven.\n\nSauteing\n\nSauteing perfection: Enhance flavors effortlessly with Meko Oil.\n\nDrizzling\n\nYour go-to site for healthy, flavorful cooking with quality oils.\n\nBaking\n\nYour go-to destination for premium baking oils and culinary delights.\n\nMarinating\n\nExplore expert marinating tips, delicious recipes for perfect flavors.\n\nCAREFULLY SOURCED PRODUCTS\nRevolutionising Healthy Cooking in India\nIn the lush orchards of Kenya, where avocados flourish, begins the journey of our cold-pressed, extra-virgin avocado oil. Unrefined and unprocessed, our oil captures the pure essence of avocados, preserving all their natural nutrients and Flavors.\nFor years, our kitchens have relied on refined sunflower and mustard oils, which can harm heart health and release harmful chemicals when heated. Our avocado oil is a refreshing change, offering a healthier alternative rich in heart-friendly monounsaturated fats that withstand high heat.\nUse our Avocado oil for general Indian cooking (Tadka to Pasta) to enhances flavor and supports your wellness journey. By choosing our avocado oil, you're prioritizing your well-being with a touch of nature's finest.\nJoin us in this culinary revolution. Let our avocado oil be the beacon of health in your kitchen and the freshest innovation in the Indian oil industry. From the heartland of Kenya to your home, embrace the power of pure, natural goodness.\n\nBetter Nutritional Value\n\nHigh Smoke Point\n\nCold Pressed\n\nUnrefined\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nCAREFULLY SOURCED PRODUCTS\nRevolutionising Healthy Cooking in India\n\nFrom Kenya's orchards, our cold-pressed avocado oil offers a pure, heart-healthy alternative to refined oils. Perfect for Indian cooking, it's rich in nutrients and heat-resistant fats, promoting flavor and wellness naturally.\n\nBetter Nutritional Value\n\nHigh Smoke Point\n\nCold Pressed\n\nUnrefined\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nNATURALLY NOURISHING\nAvocado Oil Delights\nDiscover the ultimate in taste and nutrition with our premium avocado oil. Crafted from the finest avocados, each bottle is a powerhouse of flavor and health benefits, perfect for all your culinary adventures.\n\nVeiw all\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nView products details\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nView products details\n\nNATURALLY NOURISHING\nAvocado Oil Delights\nDiscover the ultimate in taste and nutrition with our premium avocado oil. Crafted from the finest avocados, each bottle is a powerhouse of flavor and health benefits, perfect for all your culinary adventures.\n\nVeiw all\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nView products details\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nView products details\n\nDiscover Health Benefits of Oil\n\u2022 High in Omega 3, 6, 9, Antioxidants, and Vitamin E\n\u2022 High MUFA % (Healthy Fatty Acids)\n\u2022 Supports Healthy Cholesterol Levels SUPER FOOD\n\nNutritionals\nQuantity Per 15 ml\nQuantity Per 100 ml\n\nEnergy\n514 kj (123 Kcal)\n3412 kj (819 Kcal)\n\nProtein\n\nFat Total\n13.6g\n91g\n\nSaturated\n1.9g\n13g\n\nTrans\n\nPolyunsaturated\n1.4g\n\nMonounsaturated\n10.3g\n69g\n\nCarbohydrate\n\nSugar\n\nDiscover Health Benefits of Oil\n\u2022 High in Omega 3, 6, 9, Antioxidants, and Vitamin E\n\u2022 High MUFA % (Healthy Fatty Acids)\n\u2022 Supports Healthy Cholesterol Levels SUPER FOOD\n\nNutritionals\nQuantity Per 15 ml\nQuantity Per 100 ml\n\nEnergy\n514 kj (123 Kcal)\n3412 kj (819 Kcal)\n\nProtein\n\nFat Total\n13.6g\n91g\n\nSaturated\n1.9g\n13g\n\nTrans\n\nPolyunsaturated\n1.4g\n\nMonounsaturated\n10.3g\n69g\n\nCarbohydrate\n\nSugar\n\nAvocado\n\nPREMIUM GRADE COLD PRESSED\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\nDiscover the purest extra virgin avocado oil, cold-pressed to preserve its rich nutrients and flavor. Perfect for enhancing your culinary creations, our premium grade oil is both delicious and healthy.\n\nPREMIUM GRADE COLD PRESSED\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\nDiscover the purest extra virgin avocado oil, cold-pressed to preserve its rich nutrients and flavor. Perfect for enhancing your culinary creations, our premium grade oil is both delicious and healthy.\n\nNutritional Value\nIt is rich inmonounsatu- -rated fats, particularly Oleic Acid, which is beneficial for heart health. It also contains Omega 3-6-9, Vitamins E and K, along with various antioxidants that contribute to overall health and well-being.\n\nVersatility\nIt has a neutral flavour profile, making it versatile for both cooking and salad dressings. It doesn't overpower other flavours, allowing the natural taste of ingredients to shine through.\n\nHigh Smoke Point\nIt has one of the highest smoke points among cooking oils, typically around 300\u00b0C. This makes it suitable for even high- heat cooking methods such as frying, sauteing and grilling without breaking down and producing harmful compounds.\n\nCholesterol-Free\nIt is naturally cholesterol- free, making it a heart-healthy alternative to other cooking oils that may contain higher levels of unhealthy fats.\n\nDiscover our premium avocado product line\nBlogs\n\nAugust 29, 2024\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n10 Delicious Recipes Featuring Extra Virgin Cold-Pressed Avocado Oil\n\nExtra virgin cold-pressed avocado oil is not only a powerhouse of health benefits...\n\nRead More\n\nAugust 29, 2024\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nUnlocking the Health Benefits of Extra Virgin Cold-Pressed Avocado Oil\n\nIn the quest for a healthier lifestyle, many people are turning to natural...\n\nRead More\n\nAugust 29, 2024\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nSkincare Secrets: Using Extra Virgin Cold-Pressed Avocado Oil for a Healthy Glow\n\nIn the world of natural skincare, few ingredients are as versatile and beneficial...\n\nRead More\n\nTESTIMONIALS\nWhat Our Customer Say\n\nAnushka\n\n\u201cThis extra virgin cold-pressed avocado oil has transformed my cooking. The rich, natural taste is unbeatable, and I love that it\u2019s free from any additives or blending.\u201d\n\nVaibhav\n\n\u201cI\u2019ve tried many avocado oils, but this one stands out. The purity and richness are evident in every drop. It\u2019s become a staple in my kitchen for all my culinary needs.\u201d\n\nPrachi\n\n\u201cThe quality of this avocado oil is exceptional. It\u2019s incredible to know that it\u2019s made from 72 avocados without any refinement or additives. Highly recommend it to anyone looking for the best!\u201d\n\nManish\n\n\u201cI\u2019ve never tasted avocado oil this pure and flavorful! Knowing it\u2019s made from 72 avocados with no additives makes me confident I\u2019m choosing the healthiest option for my family.\u201d\n\nVishal\n\n\u201cThis is by far the best avocado oil I\u2019ve ever used. The flavor is so rich and pure, and I appreciate that it\u2019s made with only avocados and no other oils or additives. A fantastic product!\u201d\n\nPrev\nNext\n\nSame Day Delivery\n&quot;Experience the richness of pure avocado oil with our same-day delivery service.&quot;\n\nSame Day Delivery\n\"Experience the richness of pure avocado oil with our same-day delivery service. Fresh, nutritious,\nand delivered to your doorstep today for a healthier lifestyle. Order now and enjoy immediate benefits!\"\n\nSame Day Delivery\n\"Experience the richness of pure avocado oil with our same-day delivery service. Fresh, nutritious,\nand delivered to your doorstep today for a healthier lifestyle. Order now and enjoy immediate benefits!\"\n\nGot Questions?\nWe're Here to Help!\n\n+91-9990928598\n\nsales@corbettindustries.in\n\nChilkiya, Ramnagar, Nainital, Uttarakhand, 244715, INDIA\n\nInstagram\n\nYoutube\n\nLinkedin\n\nName\n\nPhone Number\n\nEmail\n\nMessage\n\nSend Message\n\nGot Questions?\nWe're Here to Help!\n\n+91-9990928598\n\nsales@corbettindustries.in\n\nChilkiya, Ramnagar, Nainital, Uttarakhand, 244715, INDIA\n\nInstagram\n\nYoutube\n\nLinkedin\n\nGet In Touch\n\nName\n\nPhone Number\n\nEmail\n\nMessage\n\nSend Message\n\nAt A for Avocado Oil, we provide pure, high-quality avocado oil that enhances both flavor and health. Our oil is perfect for cooking or drizzling, offering a natural, healthy boost to every meal, ensuring taste and wellness in each drop.\n\nUseful Pages\n\nShop From Amazon\n\nAvocado Oil Delights\n\nHelp Center\n\nBlogs\n\nContact us\n\nContact us\n\nChilkiya, Ramnagar, Nainital, Uttarakhand, 244715, INDIA\n\n+91-9990928598\n\nsales@corbettindustries.in\n\nChilkiya, Ramnagar, Nainital, Uttarakhand, 244715, INDIA\n\n+91-9990928598\n\nsales@corbettindustries.in\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2024, All rights reserved A For Avocado. Powered by DIGIKRAFT SOCIAL.\n\nInstagram\n\nYoutube\n\nLinkedin"
