            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [ +91-9990928598 ][2]\n* [ sales@corbettindustries.in ][3]\n[ Instagram ][4] [ Youtube ][5] [ Linkedin ][6]\n[[A For Avocado]][7]\n* [Home][8]\n* [About][9]\n* [Avocado Oil Delights][10]\n* [Shop From Amazon][11]\n* [Uses][12]\n* [Blogs][13]\n* [Contact][14]\n[Menu][15]\n* [Home][16]\n* [About][17]\n* [Avocado Oil Delights][18]\n* [Shop From Amazon][19]\n* [Uses][20]\n* [Blogs][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n[Menu][23]\n[Search][24]\n[Register][25]\n[Log In][26]\n[Wishlist 0][27]\n[ [Avocados] ][28]\n* [Home][29]\n* [About][30]\n* [Avocado Oil Delights][31]\n* [Shop From Amazon][32]\n* [Uses][33]\n* [Blogs][34]\n* [Contact us][35]\n[Menu][36]\n[ [Avocados] ][37]\n* [Home][38]\n* [About][39]\n* [Avocado Oil Delights][40]\n* [Shop From Amazon][41]\n* [Uses][42]\n* [Blogs][43]\n* [Contact][44]\n[Menu][45]\n\n# About\n\n[Home][46]About\n[Bottle of premium extra virgin cold pressed avocado oil]\nCAREFULLY SOURCED PRODUCTS\n\n## Revolutionising Healthy Cooking in India\n\nFrom Kenya's orchards, our cold-pressed avocado oil offers a pure, heart-healthy alternative to\nrefined oils. Perfect for Indian cooking, it's rich in nutrients and heat-resistant fats, promoting\nflavor and wellness naturally.\n* Better Nutritional Value\n* High Smoke Point\n* Cold Pressed\n* Unrefined\n\nShop From Amazon\n][47]\n[ [Avocados] ][48]\n\nAt A for Avocado Oil, we provide pure, high-quality avocado oil that enhances both flavor and\nhealth. Our oil is perfect for cooking or drizzling, offering a natural, healthy boost to every\nmeal, ensuring taste and wellness in each drop.\n\nUseful Pages\n* [ Shop From Amazon ][49]\n* [ Avocado Oil Delights ][50]\nHelp Center\n* [ Blogs ][51]\n* [ Contact us ][52]\nContact us\n[Chilkiya, Ramnagar, Nainital, Uttarakhand, 244715, INDIA][53]\n\n[+91-9990928598 ][54]\n\n[sales@corbettindustries.in][55]\n* [ Chilkiya, Ramnagar, Nainital, Uttarakhand, 244715, INDIA ][56]\n* [ +91-9990928598 ][57]\n* [ sales@corbettindustries