            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ Email ][2][ Facebook ][3][ Instagram ][4][ Pinterest ][5][ YouTube ][6]\n[Subscribe and get FREE CA Medjool Dates! ][7]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[ [Dickinson Family Farms] ][8]\nSubmit\n[ Account ][9] Open cart Rs. 0.00 0 [ Rs. 0.00 (0) ][10]\nOpen menu Open cart0\n* [ Shop ][11]\n* [ Build-A-Box][12]\n\n[ Our Fruit][13]\n\n[ Dry Goods][14]\n* [ How It Works ][15]\n* [ Get Rewards ][16]\n* [ Our Story ][17]\n* [ Farm Blog ][18]\nPicking up? Select store\nFreshness Guaranteed Delivery Policy\n][19]\nSubmit\nMenu Close sidebar\n* [ Shop ][20]\n* Back\n\n[ Build-A-Box][21]\n\n[ Our Fruit][22]\n\n[ Dry Goods][23]\n* [ How It Works ][24]\n* [ Get Rewards ][25]\n* [ Our Story ][26]\n* [ Farm Blog ][27]\n* [ Account ][28]\n[ Email ][29][ Facebook ][30][ Instagram ][31][ Pinterest ][32][ YouTube ][33]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[Home][34]/ [Collections][35]/ Organic Hass Avocados\n[Organic Hass Avocados]\n[Organic Hass Avocados]\n[Organic Hass Avocados]\n[Dickinson Family Farms][36]\n\n# Organic Hass Avocados\n\nRs. 3,462.79\nSize\n3lb\n5lb\n10lb\nVariants 3lb - Rs. 3,462.79 5lb - Rs. 4,328.48 10lb - Rs. 7,695.08\n\nRs. 3,462.79\nQuantity Add to cart\n\nThis item is a deferred, subscription, or recurring purchase. By continuing, I agree to the\ncancellation policy and authorize you to charge my payment method at the prices, frequency and dates\nlisted on this page until my order is fulfilled or I cancel, if permitted.\n\nOur Certified Organic Hass Avocados are the crown jewel of Avocados! The Hass variety is known and\nbeloved worldwide. Southern California is one of the leading growing regions for Hass and Organic\nproduction is on the rise. In addition to growing our own fruit, we source fruit from local growers\nwho put great care into their groves and trees. You can taste the difference as we don\u2019t hold fruit\nfor long periods of time in coolers or gas chambers post harvest. We pick the fruit and pack it to\norder so you can be assured of the freshest quality. And we only grow and handle Certified Organic\nAvocados so rest assured no pesticides or harmful chemicals have ever come near to the tree or fruit\nyou're purchasing from us. Rich creamy flesh that\u2019s high in oil content and essential fatty acids,\nthe Hass Avocado is heart healthy and one of the best additions to human diets.\n\nHass Avocados ripen within 5-7 days at room temperature. The fruit is ripe when soft and the skin\nhas changed to a dark purple/black color.\n\nContents\n\n3lbs = Approx. 6 avocados\n\n5lbs = Approx. 10 avocados\n\n10lbs = Approx. 20 avocados\n\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n(14)\n\n## Freshness Is Guaranteed\n\n[Watch Video][37]\nMain Menu [Shop][38] [How It Works][39] [Get Rewards][40] [Our Story][41] [Farm Blog][42]\nLet Us Help [Contact][43] [Shipping Policy][44] [Fruit Care][45] [FAQ][46]\nFresh From California\n\n[4076 Little Rock Rd. Fallbrook, CA 92028][47]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 [Dickinson Family Farms][48]. Country/region India (INR \u20b9)\nPickup location\n**Dickinson Family Farms** **Free Pick-Up**. Usually ready in 24 hrs\n\n**4076 Little Rock Rd, Fallbrook, CA 92028**\n\n**Store Hours\n**Sun: Closed\nMon-Fri: 9:00 - 5:00\nSat: 10:00 - 5:00\n\n**What to expect at pickup**\n\nYour order will be packed fresh the day of pickup. Please bring your order number to the front\nentrance of the warehouse and ask for our e-store fulfillment team. They will retrieve your order\nfor you right away.\n\n[ Get directions ][49]\n\nClosed\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 1pm\n\nShopping Cart (0) Close sidebar\nYour cart is currently empty.\n0 Rs. 0.00 [ Continue browsing ][50]\nOrder instructions\nTotal **Rs. 0.00**\nTaxes and [shipping][51] calculated at checkout\n[View Cart][52] Chec