            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ Email ][2][ Facebook ][3][ Instagram ][4][ Pinterest ][5][ YouTube ][6]\n[Subscribe and get FREE CA Medjool Dates! ][7]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[ [Dickinson Family Farms] ][8]\nSubmit\n[ Account ][9] Open cart Rs. 0.00 0 [ Rs. 0.00 (0) ][10]\nOpen menu Open cart0\n* [ Shop ][11]\n* [ Build-A-Box][12]\n\n[ Our Fruit][13]\n\n[ Dry Goods][14]\n* [ How It Works ][15]\n* [ Get Rewards ][16]\n* [ Our Story ][17]\n* [ Farm Blog ][18]\nPicking up? Select store\nFreshness Guaranteed Delivery Policy\n][19]\nSubmit\nMenu Close sidebar\n* [ Shop ][20]\n* Back\n\n[ Build-A-Box][21]\n\n[ Our Fruit][22]\n\n[ Dry Goods][23]\n* [ How It Works ][24]\n* [ Get Rewards ][25]\n* [ Our Story ][26]\n* [ Farm Blog ][27]\n* [ Account ][28]\n[ Email ][29][ Facebook ][30][ Instagram ][31][ Pinterest ][32][ YouTube ][33]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[Home][34]/ [Collections][35]/ Organic Ruby Grapefruit\n[Organic Ruby Grapefruit]\n[Organic Ruby Grapefruit]\n[Organic Ruby Grapefruit]\n[Organic Ruby Grapefruit]\n[Organic Ruby Grapefruit]\n[Dickinson Family Farms][36]\n\n# Organic Ruby Grapefruit\n\nRs. 2,308.52\nSize\n3lb\n5lb\n10lb\nVariants 3lb - Rs. 2,308.52 5lb - Rs. 2,885.66 10lb - Rs. 4,809.43\n\nRs. 2,308.52\nQuantity Add to cart\n\nThis large, round citrus contains vibrant reddish flesh which inspires its name; the Ruby\nGrapefruit. Though known for its refreshing sweetness, the Ruby variety still has a touch of the\nbitterness typical of grapefruits. There\u2019s also a certain tanginess that gives the juice a pleasant\nspark as you eat it. The Ruby Grapefruit is great for many things, especially when making that\nhomemade Paloma.\n\nContents\n* 3lb = approx. 4 Fruits\n* 5lb = approx. 6 Fruits\n* 10lb = approx. 10 Fruits\n\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n(1)\n\n## Freshness Is Guaranteed\n\n[Watch Video