            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ Email ][2][ Facebook ][3][ Instagram ][4][ Pinterest ][5][ YouTube ][6]\n[Subscribe and get FREE CA Medjool Dates! ][7]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[ [Dickinson Family Farms] ][8]\nSubmit\n[ Account ][9] Open cart Rs. 0.00 0 [ Rs. 0.00 (0) ][10]\nOpen menu Open cart0\n* [ Shop ][11]\n* [ Build-A-Box][12]\n\n[ Our Fruit][13]\n\n[ Dry Goods][14]\n* [ How It Works ][15]\n* [ Get Rewards ][16]\n* [ Our Story ][17]\n* [ Farm Blog ][18]\nPicking up? Select store\nFreshness Guaranteed Delivery Policy\n][19]\nSubmit\nMenu Close sidebar\n* [ Shop ][20]\n* Back\n\n[ Build-A-Box][21]\n\n[ Our Fruit][22]\n\n[ Dry Goods][23]\n* [ How It Works ][24]\n* [ Get Rewards ][25]\n* [ Our Story ][26]\n* [ Farm Blog ][27]\n* [ Account ][28]\n[ Email ][29][ Facebook ][30][ Instagram ][31][ Pinterest ][32][ YouTube ][33]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[Home][34]/ [Collections][35]/ Organic Hass AvoKiddos\n[Organic Hass AvoKiddos]\n[Organic Hass AvoKiddos]\n[Organic Hass AvoKiddos]\n[Organic Hass AvoKiddos]\n[Dickinson Family Farms][36]\n\n# Organic Hass AvoKiddos\n\nRs. 865.70\nSize\n3lb\nVariants 3lb - Rs. 865.70\n\nRs. 865.70\nQuantity Add to cart\n\nThis item is a deferred, subscription, or recurring purchase. By continuing, I agree to the\ncancellation policy and authorize you to charge my payment method at the prices, frequency and dates\nlisted on this page until my order is fulfilled or I cancel, if permitted.\n\nOur signature AvoKiddo pack is comprised of 6 Organic California Hass Avocados packed in our\nbiodegradable, compostable 6 pack container. This pack is a great way to reduce waste and store your\nsingle serving size avocados as they naturally ripen. We have found the carton does a great job of\nevenly ripening the avocados on the counter top in any kitchen.\n\nOur Certified Organic Hass Avocados are the crown jewel of Avocados! In addition to growing our own\nfruit, we source fruit from local growers who put great care into their groves and trees. You can\ntaste the difference as we don\u2019t hold fruit for long periods of time in coolers or gas chambers post\nharvest. We pick the fruit and pack it to order so you can be assured of the freshest quality. And\nwe only grow and handle Certified Organic Avocados so rest assured no pesticides or harmful\nchemicals have ever come near to the tree or fruit you're purchasing from us.\n\nHass Avocados ripen within 5-7 days at room temperature. The fruit is ripe when soft and the skin\nhas changed to a dark purple/black color.\n\nContents:\n\n~3lb carton = 6 single serve Organic California Hass avocados\n\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n(12)\n\n## Freshness Is Guaranteed\n\n[Watch Video][37]\nMain Menu [Shop][38] [How It Works][39] [Get Rewards][40] [Our Story][41] [Farm Blog][42]\nLet Us Help [Contact][43] [Shipping Policy][44] [Fruit Care][45] [FAQ][46]\nFresh From California\n\n[4076 Little Rock Rd. Fallbrook, CA 92028][47]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 [Dickinson Family Farms][48]. Country/region India (INR \u20b9)\nPickup location\n**Dickinson Family Farms** **Free Pick-Up**. Usually ready in 24 hrs\n\n**4076 Little Rock Rd, Fallbrook, CA 92028**\n\n**Store Hours\n**Sun: Closed\nMon-Fri: 9:00 - 5:00\nSat: 10:00 - 5:00\n\n**What to expect at pickup**\n\nYour order will be packed fresh the day of pickup. Please bring your order number to the front\nentrance of the warehouse and ask for our e-store fulfillment team. They will retrieve your order\nfor you right away.\n\n[ Get directions ][49]\n\nClosed\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 1pm\n\nShopping Cart (0) Close sidebar\nYour cart is currently empty.\n0 Rs. 0.00 [ Continue browsing ][50]\nOrder instructions\nTotal **Rs. 0.00**\nTaxes and [shipping][51] calculated at checkout\n[View Cart][52] Check