brant color of our Certified Organic\nCalifornia Avocados. The taste of our oil contains all the nutty, rich, flavor of an avocado picked\nat peak season. We achieve Extra Virgin status by only bottling oil from the very first pressing of\nour avocados and by extracting the oil through mechanical methods, not with excess heat or chemical\nsolvents. Grown, pressed, and bottled locally in Fallbrook, CA, we proudly offer our Certified\nOrganic Avocado Oil from our groves to your home.\n\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n(3)\n\n## Freshness Is Guaranteed\n\n[Watch Video][37]\nMain Menu [Shop][38] [How It Works][39] [Get Rewards][40] [Our Story][41] [Farm Blog][42]\nLet Us Help [Contact][43] [Shipping Policy][44] [Fruit Care][45] [FAQ][46]\nFresh From California\n\n[4076 Little Rock Rd. Fallbrook, CA 92028][47]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 [Dickinson Family Farms][48]. Country/region India (INR \u20b9)\nPickup location\n**Dickinson Family Farms** **Free Pick-Up**. Usually ready in 24 hrs\n\n**4076 Little Rock Rd, Fallbrook, CA 92028**\n\n**Store Hours\n**Sun: Closed\nMon-Fri: 9:00 - 5:00\nSat: 10:00 - 5:00\n\n**What to expect at pickup**\n\nYour order will be packed fresh the day of pickup. Please bring your order number to the front\nentrance of the warehouse and ask for our e-store fulfillment team. They will retrieve your order\nfor you right away.\n\n[ Get directions ][49]\n\nClosed\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 1pm\n\nShopping Cart (0) Close sidebar\nYour cart is currently empty.\n0 Rs. 0.00 [ Continue browsing ][50]\nOrder instructions\nTotal **Rs. 0.00**\nTaxes and [shipping][51] calculated at checkout\n[View Cart][52] Check Out\nGo to top\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: info@dickinsonfamilyfarms.com\n[3]: https://www.facebook.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[4]: https://www.instagram.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms/?hl=en\n[5]: https://www.pinterest.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[6]: https://www.youtube.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[7]: /collections/subscriptions\n[8]: /\n[9]: /account/login\n[10]: /cart\n[11]: /collections\n[12]: https://www.dickinsonfamilyfarms.com/apps/subscriptions/bb/3HEh5vU9\n[13]: /collections/organic-fruit\n[14]: /collections/dry-goods\n[15]: /pages/how-it-works\n[16]: /pages/loyalty-program\n[17]: /pages/about\n[18]: /blogs/news\n[19]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[20]: /collections\n[21]: https://www.dickinsonfamilyfarms.com/apps/subscriptions/bb/3HEh5vU9\n[22]: /collections/organic-fruit\n[23]: /collections/dry-goods\n[24]: /pages/how-it-works\n[25]: /pages/loyalty-program\n[26]: /pages/about\n[27]: /blogs/news\n[28]: /account/login\n[29]: info@dickinsonfamilyfarms.com\n[30]: https://www.facebook.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[31]: https://www.instagram.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms/?hl=en\n[32]: https://www.pinterest.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[33]: https://www.youtube.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[34]: /\n[35]: /collections\n[36]: /collections/vendors?q=Dickinson%20Family%20Farms\n[37]: https://youtu.be/y2jPh7ja2rE?si=PCger7pwqms3HfQi\n[38]: /collections\n[39]: /pages/how-it-works\n[40]: /pages/loyalty-program\n[41]: /pages/about\n[42]: /blogs/news\n[43]: /pages/contact\n[44]: /pages/shipping-information\n[45]: /pages/tips-on-fruit-care\n[46]: /pages/faq\n[47]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/RAJ4ZFHoKrr2xR1U7\n[48]: /\n[49]: http://www.google.com/maps/place/33.418561568346426,-117.23844349400325\n[50]: /collections/all\n[51]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[52]: /cart"
