            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ Email ][2][ Facebook ][3][ Instagram ][4][ Pinterest ][5][ YouTube ][6]\n[Subscribe and get FREE CA Medjool Dates! ][7]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[ [Dickinson Family Farms] ][8]\nSubmit\n[ Account ][9] Open cart Rs. 0.00 0 [ Rs. 0.00 (0) ][10]\nOpen menu Open cart0\n* [ Shop ][11]\n* [ Build-A-Box][12]\n\n[ Our Fruit][13]\n\n[ Dry Goods][14]\n* [ How It Works ][15]\n* [ Get Rewards ][16]\n* [ Our Story ][17]\n* [ Farm Blog ][18]\nPicking up? Select store\nFreshness Guaranteed Delivery Policy\n][19]\nSubmit\nMenu Close sidebar\n* [ Shop ][20]\n* Back\n\n[ Build-A-Box][21]\n\n[ Our Fruit][22]\n\n[ Dry Goods][23]\n* [ How It Works ][24]\n* [ Get Rewards ][25]\n* [ Our Story ][26]\n* [ Farm Blog ][27]\n* [ Account ][28]\n[ Email ][29][ Facebook ][30][ Instagram ][31][ Pinterest ][32][ YouTube ][33]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[Home][34]/ [Collections][35]/ Organic Passion Fruit\n[Organic Passion Fruit]\n[Organic Passion Fruit]\n[Organic Passion Fruit]\n[Organic Passion Fruit]\n[Organic Passion Fruit]\n[Dickinson Family Farms][36]\n\n# Organic Passion Fruit\n\nRs. 4,039.92\nSize\n3lb\n5lb\n10lb\nVariants 3lb - Rs. 4,039.92 5lb - Rs. 5,771.31 10lb - Rs. 9,618.85\n\nRs. 4,039.92\nQuantity Add to cart\n\nOrganic Passionfruit grows very well in San Diego county. The vigorous vines respond with incredible\ngrowth and fruit production to the long hours of sunlight in our region. Passionfruit vines are\nsuspended on specially designed trellises to help them set maximum fruit and allow for easy\nharvesting.\n\nPassionfruit is sweet and tangy with small edible seeds that provide a nice texture. Simply cut in\nhalf and scoop out the pulp with seeds. It's delicious on yogurt, in smoothies, in preserves, as a\njuice, and other ice cream. Passionfruit is high in antioxidants such as Vitamin C and A. It is also\nhigh in fiber and magnesium. It can help promote effective digestion, provide immune system support,\nand help build healthy skin.\n\nWe love this fruit and are sure you will too!\n\nContents\n\n1lbs = Approx. 6-10 fruits\n\n3lbs = Approx. 16-20 fruits\n\n5lbs = Approx. 28-35 fruits\n\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n(2)\n\n## Freshness Is Guaranteed\n\n[Watch Video][37]\nMain Menu [Shop][38] [How It Works][39] [Get Rewards][40] [Our Story][41] [Farm Blog][42]\nLet Us Help [Contact][43] [Shipping Policy][44] [Fruit Care][45] [FAQ][46]\nFresh From California\n\n[4076 Little Rock Rd. Fallbrook, CA 92028][47]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 [Dickinson Family Farms][48]. Country/region India (INR \u20b9)\nPickup location\n**Dickinson Family Farms** **Free Pick-Up**. Usually ready in 24 hrs\n\n**4076 Little Rock Rd, Fallbrook, CA 92028**\n\n**Store Hours\n**Sun: Closed\nMon-Fri: 9:00 - 5:00\nSat: 10:00 - 5:00\n\n**What to expect at pickup**\n\nYour order will be packed fresh the day of pickup. Please bring your order number to the front\nentrance of the warehouse and ask for our e-store fulfillment team. They will retrieve your order\nfor you right away.\n\n[ Get directions ][49]\n\nClosed\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 1pm\n\nShopping Cart (0) Close sidebar\nYour cart is currently empty.\n0 Rs. 0.00 [ Continue browsing ][50]\nOrder instructions\nTotal **Rs. 0.00**\nTaxes and [shipping][51] calculated at checkout\n[View Cart][52] Check Out\nGo to top\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: info@dickinsonfamilyfarms.com\n[3]: https://www.facebook.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[4]: https://www.instagram.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms/?hl=en\n[5]: https://www.pinterest.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[6]: https://www.youtube.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[7]: /collections/subscriptions\n[8]: /\n[9]: /account/login\n[10]: /cart\n[11]: /collections\n[12]: https://www.dickinsonfamilyfarms.com/apps/subscriptions/bb/3HEh5vU9\n[13]: /collectio