            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ Email ][2][ Facebook ][3][ Instagram ][4][ Pinterest ][5][ YouTube ][6]\n[Subscribe and get FREE CA Medjool Dates! ][7]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[ [Dickinson Family Farms] ][8]\nSubmit\n[ Account ][9] Open cart Rs. 0.00 0 [ Rs. 0.00 (0) ][10]\nOpen menu Open cart0\n* [ Shop ][11]\n* [ Build-A-Box][12]\n\n[ Our Fruit][13]\n\n[ Dry Goods][14]\n* [ How It Works ][15]\n* [ Get Rewards ][16]\n* [ Our Story ][17]\n* [ Farm Blog ][18]\nPicking up? Select store\nFreshness Guaranteed Delivery Policy\n][19]\nSubmit\nMenu Close sidebar\n* [ Shop ][20]\n* Back\n\n[ Build-A-Box][21]\n\n[ Our Fruit][22]\n\n[ Dry Goods][23]\n* [ How It Works ][24]\n* [ Get Rewards ][25]\n* [ Our Story ][26]\n* [ Farm Blog ][27]\n* [ Account ][28]\n[ Email ][29][ Facebook ][30][ Instagram ][31][ Pinterest ][32][ YouTube ][33]\nCountry/region India (INR \u20b9)\n[Home][34]/ [Collections][35]/ Organic Yellow Nectarines\n[Organic Yellow Nectarines]\n[Organic Yellow Nectarines]\n[Dickinson Family Farms][36]\n\n# Organic Yellow Nectarines\n\nRs. 1,442.83\nSize\n3lb\n5lb\n10lb\nVariants 3lb - Rs. 1,442.83 5lb - Rs. 2,308.52 10lb - Rs. 4,328.48\n\nRs. 1,442.83\nQuantity Add to cart\n\nOur Certified Organic Yellow Nectarines are delicious in every way. They're sweet, slightly tangy,\nwith firm yet juicy flesh makes for a delicious piece of fruit. For us, eating a fresh piece of\nstonefruit like a nectarine is the literal taste of summer. Summer is quintessential stonefruit\nseason in California with many amazing varieties coming to full readiness. Our nectarines are\nharvested from generational certified Organic farms located in the San Joaquin Valley where great\ncare is given to producing flavorful, nutrient dense fruit using certified Organic methods.\nHarvested at just the right time and providing a fast delivery to your home ensures a delightful\neating experience with our California Organic Nectarines!\n\nSpecial Ripening Notes: After unwrapping your box and inspecting the fruit, you may want to allow\nthe fruit to soften with 1-2 days at room temperature for best flavor! We will typically ship firmer\nfruit so that each piece can finish ripening in our customer's hands.\n\nContents\n\n3lbs = Approx. 4-6 fruits\n\n5lbs = Approx. 8-10 fruits\n\n10lbs = Approx. 16-18 fruits\n\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Outline star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n[Filled star]\n(3)\n\n## Freshness Is Guaranteed\n\n[Watch Video][37]\nMain Menu [Shop][38] [How It Works][39] [Get Rewards][40] [Our Story][41] [Farm Blog][42]\nLet Us Help [Contact][43] [Shipping Policy][44] [Fruit Care][45] [FAQ][46]\nFresh From California\n\n[4076 Little Rock Rd. Fallbrook, CA 92028][47]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 [Dickinson Family Farms][48]. Country/region India (INR \u20b9)\nPickup location\n**Dickinson Family Farms** **Free Pick-Up**. Usually ready in 24 hrs\n\n**4076 Little Rock Rd, Fallbrook, CA 92028**\n\n**Store Hours\n**Sun: Closed\nMon-Fri: 9:00 - 5:00\nSat: 10:00 - 5:00\n\n**What to expect at pickup**\n\nYour order will be packed fresh the day of pickup. Please bring your order number to the front\nentrance of the warehouse and ask for our e-store fulfillment team. They will retrieve your order\nfor you right away.\n\n[ Get directions ][49]\n\nClosed\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 5pm\n\nClosing at 1pm\n\nShopping Cart (0) Close sidebar\nYour cart is currently empty.\n0 Rs. 0.00 [ Continue browsing ][50]\nOrder instructions\nTotal **Rs. 0.00**\nTaxes and [shipping][51] calculated at checkout\n[View Cart][52] Check Out\nGo to top\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: info@dickinsonfamilyfarms.com\n[3]: https://www.facebook.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[4]: https://www.instagram.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms/?hl=en\n[5]: https://www.pinterest.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[6]: https://www.youtube.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[7]: /collections/subscriptions\n[8]: /\n[9]: /account/login\n[10]: /cart\n[11]: /collections\n[12]: https://www.dickinsonfamilyfarms.com/apps/subscriptions/bb/3HEh5vU9\n[13]: /collections/organic-fruit\n[14]: /collections/dry-goods\n[15]: /pages/how-it-works\n[16]: /pages/loyalty-program\n[17]: /pages/about\n[18]: /blogs/news\n[19]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[20]: /collections\n[21]: https://www.dickinsonfamilyfarms.com/apps/subscriptions/bb/3HEh5vU9\n[22]: /collections/organic-fruit\n[23]: /collections/dry-goods\n[24]: /pages/how-it-works\n[25]: /pages/loyalty-program\n[26]: /pages/about\n[27]: /blogs/news\n[28]: /account/login\n[29]: info@dickinsonfamilyfarms.com\n[30]: https://www.facebook.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[31]: https://www.instagram.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms/?hl=en\n[32]: https://www.pinterest.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[33]: https://www.youtube.com/dickinsonfamilyfarms\n[34]: /\n[35]: /collections\n[36]: /collections/vendors?q=Dickinson%20Family%20Farms\n[37]: https://youtu.be/y2jPh7ja2rE?si=PCger7pwqms3HfQi\n[38]: /collections\n[39]: /pages/how-it-works\n[40]: /pages/loyalty-program\n[41]: /pages/about\n[42]: /blogs/news\n[43]: /pages/contact\n[44]: /pages/shipping-information\n[45]: /pages/tips-on-fruit-care\n[46]: /pages/faq\n[47]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/RAJ4ZFHoKrr2xR1U7\n[48]: /\n[49]: http://www.google.com/maps/place/33.418561568346426,-117.23844349400325\n[50]: /collections/all\n[51]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[52]: /cart"
