            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\n# Contact\n\n## Contact\n\n### Natural Oils.\n### Ethical Partnerships.\n\nHead Office\n\nFairoils EPZ Limited\n\nUnit 2, Capital Industrial Park\n\nExport Processing zone\n\nAthi River\n\nKenya \u2013 00204\n\nE: info@fairoils.com\n\nDistribution\n\nAvenue de I\u2019Innovation 5\n7822 Ghislenghien\nBelgium\nP: +32 68 28 43 16\n\n[ Explore our full range of oils ][2]\n\n##### In-Cosmetics New Products\n\n[ Muyao product data sheet ][3]\n[ Moringa oil product data sheet ][4]\nFairoils has a whole team of people ready to help you with your requirements. We can assist you\nwith:\n\n* Essential and vegetable oil samples\n* Packaging and shipping information\n* Technical and quality assurance documents\n* Sales advice and marketing assistance\n* Information on our grower projects and how you can get involved\n* Certification information (Fairtrade, organic, food-grade etc)\n\n##### Get in touch\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nFacebook\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nFirst name*\nLast name*\nEmail*\nPhone number*\nCompany name\nCompany role\nHow can we help?*\nCAPTCHA\n\n## We see a bright future for Africa\n\nPartner with us to strengthen local communities.\n\n[ Get in touch ][5]\n[ Learn about our impact ][6]\n\n###### Our key oils\n\n###### Current projects\n\n###### [Contact us][7]\n\n###### Our key oils\n\n[Ylang ylang][8]\n[Fresh ginger][9]\n[Tea tree][10]\n[Rose geranium][11]\n[Cinnamon bark][12]\n[Clove bud][13]\n[Eucalyptus citriodora][14]\n[Avocado][15]\n[Macadamia nut][16]\n[Sesame][17]\n\n###### Current projects\n* [Lunga Lunga \u2013 Kenyan Coast][18]\n* [Mt Kenya \u2013 Kenyan Highlands][19]\n* [Nosy Be \u2013 Madagascar North][20]\n* [Mananjary \u2013 Madagascar South][21]\n* [Mara \u2013 Western Kenya][22]\n* [Thika \u2013 Central Kenya][23]\n* [Lunga Lunga \u2013 Kenyan Coast][24]\n* [Mt Kenya \u2013 Kenyan Highlands][25]\n* [Nosy Be \u2013 Madagascar North][26]\n* [Mananjary \u2013 Madagascar South][27]\n* [Mara \u2013 Western Kenya][28]\n* [Thika \u2013 Central Kenya][29]\n\n###### Contact us\n\nDistribution\nFairoils SRL\nAvenue de l\u2019Innovation 5\n7822 Ghislenghien \u2013 Belgium\nE: info@fairoils.com\nP: + 32 68 28 43 16\n\n\u00a9 2026 Fairoils Limited | [Web design][30] by Excite Media | [Fairoils Terms and Conditions of\nsale][31]\n\n[ Facebook ][32] [ Linkedin ][33]\n[ ][34]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.fairoils.com/wp-content/uploads/Product-List-Oct2022.pdf\n[3]: https://www.fairoils.com/wp-content/uploads/Muyao-product-data-sheet.pdf\n[4]: https://www.fairoils.com/wp-content/uploads/Moringa-oil-product-data-sheet.pdf\n[5]: https://www.fairoils.com/contact/\n[6]: https://www.fairoils.com/our-impact/\n[7]: /contact\n[8]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/ylang-ylang/\n[9]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/ginger/\n[10]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/tea-tree/\n[11]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/rose-geranium/\n[12]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/cinnamon-bark/\n[13]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/clove-bud/\n[14]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/eucalyptus-citriodora/\n[15]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/avocado/\n[16]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/macadamia-nut/\n[17]: https://www.fairoils.com/products/sesame-oil/\n[18]: https://fairoils.com/projects/kenyan-coast-lunga-lunga-project/\n[19]: https://fairoils.com/projects/mount-kenya/\n[20]: https://fairoils.com/projects/madagascar/\n[21]: https://fairoils.com/projects/madagascar-south-mananjary-project/\n[22]: https://fairoils.com/projects/mara-location/\n[23]: https://fairoils.com/projects/thika-project/\n[24]: https://fairoils.com/projects/kenyan-coast-lunga-lunga-project/\n[25]: https://fairoils.com/projects/mount-kenya/\n[26]: https://fairoils.com/projects/madagascar/\n[27]: https://fairoils.com/projects/madagascar-south-mananjary-project/\n[28]: https://fairoils.com/projects/mara-location/\n[29]: https://fairoils.com/projects/thika-project/\n[30]: https://www.excitemedia.com.au/\n[31]: https://fairoils.com/wp-content/uploads/Fairoils-Terms-and-Conditions-of-Sale_V1.pdf\n[32]: https://www.facebook.com/Fairoils/\n[33]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/fairoils/\n[34]: #top"
