available to all.\n\n[ Learn more ][32]\nWe're in business to inspire healthy lifestyles\n\n### Nourishing families\n### for more than 135 years\n\nWe\u2019ve always been farmers\u2014that\u2019s where our roots are. We\u2019re proud of that legacy and will continue\nto build A Brighter World Tomorrow\u00ae.\n\n[ Learn more ][33]\n[banana fruit logo]\n\n### 86^{%}\n\nof our global products are grown on farms that have been certified as sustainably grown by SCS\nGlobal Services\n\n[hand logo]\n\n### 100^{%}\n\nof team members covered by Occupational Health & Safety (OHS) management system\n\n[recycle logo]\n\n### 300+\n\nlocal sustainability programs that focus on healthcare, education, infrastructure, and disaster\nrelief supported around the world\n\n[people-planet-produce-image]\nA Brighter World Tomorrow\u00ae\n\n## Planet\n\nWe only have one planet and it is our collective responsibility to protect it. Our business is built\non agriculture and ecosystems thriving together. In order to ensure the prosperity of our farms and\nthe biodiversity that surrounds them, water stewardship is key.\n\nWater is one of the resources at highest risk. To drive water use efficiency, we leverage innovative\ntechnologies and are certified by CDP as being in the top 20% of companies that implement current\nbest practices for water use. We continuously invest in upgrades to water infrastructure and reduced\nour total water usage in high water risk areas in 2020 by 18% compared to a 2011-2014 baseline.\n\n[ Learn more ][34]\n\n#### Explore our global watersheds\n\nMotagua\n\n[Motagua-Map logo]\n[Motagua Map Pin logo]\n\nTana\n\n[Tana-Map logo]\n[Tana Map Pin logo]\n\nPiranhas - A\u00e7u\n\n[Piranhas-Map logo]\n[Piranhas Map Pin logo]\n\nLimari, Biobio, and Rapel\n\n[Limari-Map logo]\n[Limari Map Pin logo]\n\nCagayan de Oro, Manupali\n\n[Cagayan-Map logo]\n[CDO Map Pin logo]\n[CDO Map Pin logo]\n[Tana Map Pin logo]\n[Piranhas Map Pin logo]\n[Limari Map Pin logo]\n[Motagua Map Pin logo]\n[map image]\n\n## People\n\nOur people are our heart and soul. We\u2019re building a global community around our team members and\ntheir communities.\n\n[ Learn more ][35]\n\n## Our products\n\nDriving innovation isn\u2019t a buzzword, it\u2019s a company tenet. We challenge ourselves to come up with\nnew processes and products, and are constantly improving to satisfy our consumers\u2019 tastes.\n[ See all products ][36]\n\n#### Fresh Fruit\n\nOur whole fruits are delivered from the farm to our customers at the peak of freshness.\n[ [category-button] ][37]\n\n#### Fresh Cut Produce\n\nConveniently packaged and freshly cut. These are your favorite fruit and vegetables, ready to eat.\n[ [category-button] ][38]\n\n#### Prepared Products\n\nWe produce, distribute, and market prepared fruits, vegetables, juices, and more.\n[ [category-button] ][39]\n\n## Our services\n\nWhile providing fresh produce is at our core, we have other business lines that are\ncomplementary\u2014shipping space on our vessels and trucks and restaurants that highlight our fresh\nfoods.\n\n[ See all services ][40]\n\n#### Commercial Cargo\n\nWe have an extensive logistics network available to transport your goods.\n\n#### Restaurants\n\nWe offer fresh, healthy foods in convenient locations across the Middle East and in the U.S.\n\n## Fresh from the press\n\n[ Read more ][41]\n[ [Fresh Del Monte Article] ][42]\n\n## [Fresh Del Monte Produce Inc. Announces Name Change to Del Monte Corporation and NYSE Ticker\n## Symbol Change to \u201cDMC\u201d][43]\n\nJune 9, 2026\n\n3 min read\n\n[ [Fresh Del Monte Article] ][44]\n\n## [Fresh Del Monte Expands Pittsburgh Commitment Through New Multi-Year Partnership with the\n## Pittsburgh Pirates][45]\n\nJune 4, 2026\n\n2 min read\n\n## [Fresh Del Monte Blasts Off with a Global Campaign in Celebration of Disney and Pixar\u2019s \u201cToy\n## Story 5\u201d][46]\n\nMay 18, 2026\n\n3 min read\n\n[ [Fresh Del Monte Article] ][47]\n\n## [Fresh Del Monte Names Pitts