            "url": "https://fruittal.com",
            "text": "100% Pure Avocado Oil Made in the USA \u2013 Premium Quality\n\nPRODUCT OF THE U.S.A.\n\nEnglish\n\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629\n\u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be\n\u0411\u044a\u043b\u0433\u0430\u0440\u0441\u043a\u0438\n\u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587\n\u9999\u6e2f\u4e2d\u6587\nHrvatski\nNederlands\nNederlands (Belgi\u00eb)\nEnglish (UK)\nFran\u00e7ais du Canada\nFran\u00e7ais\nDeutsch\nDeutsch (\u00d6sterreich)\nDeutsch (Schweiz)\n\u00cdslenska\nItaliano\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4\nNorsk bokm\u00e5l\nPortugu\u00eas\n\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439\nEspa\u00f1ol\nSvenska\nTagalog\n\nShop\nPurpose\nBlog\nCulinary Inspiration\nWholesale &#038; Foodservice\nExport Success\nContact\n\nPRODUCT OF THE U.S.A.\n\nShop\nPurpose\nBlog\nCulinary Inspiration\nWholesale &#038; Foodservice\nExport Success\nContact\n\nEnglish\n\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629\n\u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be\n\u0411\u044a\u043b\u0433\u0430\u0440\u0441\u043a\u0438\n\u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587\n\u9999\u6e2f\u4e2d\u6587\nHrvatski\nNederlands\nNederlands (Belgi\u00eb)\nEnglish (UK)\nFran\u00e7ais du Canada\nFran\u00e7ais\nDeutsch\nDeutsch (\u00d6sterreich)\nDeutsch (Schweiz)\n\u00cdslenska\nItaliano\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\n\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4\nNorsk bokm\u00e5l\nPortugu\u00eas\n\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439\nEspa\u00f1ol\nSvenska\nTagalog\n\nFarm to Table\n\nOrchard to Table\n\n100% REAL. FRESH. AUTHENTIC.\n\nOne Ingredient. Infinite Possibilities\nBecause what you cook with should nourish your body and delight your taste buds.\nThe smooth, buttery flavor that transforms any dish\u2014from saut\u00e9ing and roasting to drizzling and dipping.\nIts high smoke point makes it ideal for grilling, baking, and bold, high-heat cooking\nInfused with antioxidants and rich in heart-healthy monounsaturated fats\nCold-pressed to preserve nutrients, taste, and purity. Naturally vegan, gluten-free, and non-GMO\nMade in the USA using only premium avocados \u2014 nothing artificial, ever!\n\nSHOP NOW\n\nWhy Fruittal? Nourishment\nYou Can Taste, Flavor You Can Trust.\n\nOne Ingredient\nInfinite Possibilities\nBecause what you cook with should nourish your body and delight your taste buds.\nThe smooth, buttery flavor that transforms any dish\u2014from saut\u00e9ing and roasting to drizzling and dipping.\nIts high smoke point makes it ideal for grilling, baking, and bold, high-heat cooking.\nInfused with antioxidants and rich in heart-healthy monounsaturated fats.\nExpeller-pressed to preserve nutrients, taste, and purity.\nNaturally vegan, gluten-free, and non-GMO.\nMade in the USA using only premium avocados \u2014 nothing artificial, ever!\nShop Now\n\nWhy Fruittal? Nourishment\nYou Can Taste, Flavor You Can Trust.\n\nFruittal Pure Avocado oil is crafted from premium avocados grown with care in the USA\u2014delivering heart-healthy fats and powerful antioxidants to fuel your wellness journey. Fruittal is a multitasking avocado oil\u2014perfect for saut\u00e9ing, roasting, drizzling, and even skincare. Whether you\u2019re cooking, grilling, baking, or finishing a fresh salad, our oil elevates every bite.\nTransform every dish into a masterpiece with the one oil you\u2019ll ever need.\nVegan \u2022 Gluten-Free \u2022 Non-GMO \u2022 Small-Batch Perfection\nThis is about you\u2014your health, your taste, your lifestyle.\nDiscover the Fruittal difference today and elevate your kitchen with excellence made just for you.\n\nBenefits of Pure Avocado Oil\n\nSee Benefits\n\nThe Delicious Way to Wellness!\n\nLooking for a better way to cook and feel great? Fruittal Pure Avocado Oil is your go-to! Made in the USA, it&#8217;s heart-healthy, vegan, and gluten-free. It&#8217;s expeller pressed and rich in flavor. Choose a clean, natural oil you can trust, whether cooking, drizzling, or nourishing your skin. With Fruittal, you&#8217;re not just buying oil but unlocking a world of culinary and wellness possibilities.\n\nAS SEEN ON\n\n& OVER 450 NEWS SITES\n\nNON-GMO AND ETHICAL STANDARDS\nAvocados are naturally non-GMO. Our Non-GMO Project Verified logo reaffirms this fact, ensuring transparency and helping you make informed choices.\n\nPRODUCT OF THE U.S.A.\n\nShop\nPurpose\nBlog\nCulinary Inspiration\nWholesale &#038; Foodservice\nExport Success\nContact\n\nTerms of Service | Shipping &amp; Returns | Privacy Policy\n\nCopyright \u00a92025 Fruittal.com &#8211; All Rights Reserved\n\nCoupon\n\nIf you are human, leave this field blank.\nGET MY 10% OFF!\n&#916;"
