ils, homemade beauty formulations and skincare blends\n\nView Our Range\n\nCarrier Oils and Base Oils\n\nOur selection of all-natural carriers, formulated to blend with essential oils and \"carry\" them to your skin.\n\nView Our Range\n\nWho We Are\n\nFor over 20 years, it has always been our goal to source the best natural ingredients to nourish the body and mind in the most ethical and sustainable way possible.\n\nRead the Naissance Story\n\nCustomer Favourites\n\nEssential Oils\n\nCarrier Oils\n\nIngredients\n\nQuick View\n\nLavender True Essential Oil (No. 102)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a34.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nOrange Sweet Essential Oil (No. 105)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a33.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nLavender Organic Essential Oil (No. 102)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a35.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nRosemary Organic Essential Oil (No. 108)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a36.49\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nGeranium Rose Essential Oil (No. 116)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a35.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nLemon Essential Oil (No. 103)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a34.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nTangerine Essential Oil (No. 126)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a32.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nSold out\n\nQuick View\n\nLavender Spike Organic Essential Oil\n\nNaissance\n\n\u00a319.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nEssential Oils\n\nView all\n\nQuick View\n\nAlmond Sweet Oil (No. 215)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a35.49\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nSold out\n\nQuick View\n\nJojoba Golden Organic Oil (No. 233) Professional\n\nNaissance\n\n\u00a3170.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nCoconut Fractionated (liquid) Oil (No. 218)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a35.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nGrapeseed Oil (No. 210)\n\nNaissance\n\nfrom \u00a35.99\n\nUnit price\n\n/ per&nbsp;\n\nQuick View\n\nArgan Organic Oil (No. 228)\n\nNaissance\n\