perties, this lightweight, fast-absorbing gel provides instant support for dry or irritated skin. Rich in natural antioxidants, it helps to nourish, refresh, and restore your skin\u2019s moisture balance. Perfect for everyday skincare, after-sun care, or as a base for DIY beauty blends. Shop now for a fresh , natural boost!\n\nView Product\n\nShop with confidence\n\n100% Natural Guarantee\n\nWe don't add synthetic ingredients to our products\n\nFree UK Delivery\n\nSpend \u00a330 for free Standard delivery or \u00a375 for Express\n\n30 Day Returns\n\nChange your mind? We have a 30 day return policy\n\nCustomer Services\n\nContact us by email at infouk@naissance.com\n\nSign up to the Naissance newsletter:\n\nYour email\n\nSign up\n\nInformation\n\nInformation\n\nShipping Information\n\nReturns Policy\n\nPrivacy and Cookie Policy\n\nTerms and Conditions\n\nEthical Labour Policy\n\nFAQs\n\nNaissance\n\nNaissance\n\nOur Story\n\nAccreditations\n\nEthical Sourcing Partnerships\n\nCareers @ Naissance\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nContact Us\n\nAddress : Unit 11, Milland Road Industrial Estate, Milland Rd, Neath SA11 1NJ\nOpen : Monday-Friday\nE-mail : infouk@naissance.com\n\nNewsletter\n\nYour email\n\nSubscribe\n\nCopyright &copy; 2026, Naissance UK .\nAll rights reserved.\nSee our terms of use and privacy notice.\n\nPowered by Shopify\n\nAmerican Express\n\nApple Pay\n\nDiners Club\n\nDiscover\n\nGoogle Pay\n\nMaestro\n\nMastercard\n\nPayPal\n\nShop Pay\n\nUnion Pay\n\nVisa\n\nAvailability"
