y scrubs\n* Water soluble\n\n### Usage\n\nTop Tip\n\nRecommended use - 1%\n\nRecommended pH - 3 \u2013 8\n\nAdd during the cool down phase in emulsions below 40\u00b0C. Can be added directly in anhydrous products.\n\nWe recommended you use a weighing scales that weighs to 0.1g as measuring using drops to measure can\nbe inaccurate.\n\nMay crystallize upon exposure to cold temperature. Warm gently and mix before use.\n\nNot recommended for formulations for children under 3 years old.\n\n### Key Facts\n\nKey Facts\n\nOrigin: UK and USA\nIngredients: Benzyl Alcohol, Salicylic Acid, Glycerin, Sorbic Acid\n\nExtraction Method: Formulated\nColour: Colourless to straw coloured\nOdour: Distinctive\n\nVegan: Yes\nOrganic: No\n\nMSDS documentation: [Click here][275]\n\n### Indications\n\nIndications\n\nThis product cannot be guaranteed free from traces of nuts or other allergens. Seek medical advice\nbefore use if you are pregnant or suffering from any medical conditions or allergies. Always conduct\na patch test before using any new product.\n\nStore in a cool dry place away from sunlight.\n\nAs our products are natural, the colour and odour may vary from batch to batch. We are continually\nimproving our products and so on occasion the product you receive may differ slightly in appearance\nfrom images displayed on our website. But don\u2019t worry, it doesn\u2019t affect the quality or performance\nof your product \u2013 it\u2019s just down the natural and organic variations in our ingredients.\n\nWe describe and promote our products in good faith. The information given with regard to the\nbeneficial properties of our products (including medicinal and beauty) depend on popular opinion. We\ndo not express these thoughts as facts. The beneficial effects of our products may vary depending on\nthe user.\n\nShelf life: 12 months\n\n# Preservative Eco (N\u00b0 829) 50ml\n\nRegular price \u00a311.99\n\n* Unit price *\n/per\nLow Stock\nSize: 50ml\n30ml 50ml 250ml 30ml 50ml 250ml\nQuantity\nQuantity\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nQuantity\n30ml - Sold out 50ml 250ml - Sold out\nAdd to Bag\n\n[Shipping][276] calculated at checkout.\n\nEmpower Your Wellbeing, One Ingredient at a Time.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n### Customer reviews\n\n### Description\n\nPreservative Eco offers broad spectrum protection in a diverse range of products and is widely\naccepted in natural skin and hair care formulations.\n* Certified cruelty free and vegan friendly\n* Effective and easy to use\n* Protects against the growth of Gram-positive and Gram-negative bacteria, yeast and mould\n* Compatible for a wide range of natural self-care products\n* Suitable for water in oil emulsions, oil in water emulsions and anhydrous products\n* Can be used in anhydrous products that may come into contact with water such as body scrubs\n* Water soluble\n\n### Usage\n\nTop Tip\n\nRecommended use - 1%\n\nRecommended pH - 3 \u2013 8\n\nAdd during the cool down phase in emulsions below 40\u00b0C. Can be added directly in anhydrous products.\n\nWe recommended you use a weighing scales that weighs to 0.1g as measuring using drops to measure can\nbe inaccurate.\n\nMay crystallize upon exposure to cold temperature. Warm gently and mix before use.\n\nNot recommended for formulations for children under 3 years old.\n\n### Key Facts\n\nKey Facts\n\nOrigin: UK and USA\nIngredients: Benzyl Alcohol, Salicylic Acid, Glycerin, Sorbic Acid\n\nExtraction Method: Formulated\nColour: Colourless to straw coloured\nOdour: Distinctive\n\nVegan: Yes\nOrganic: No\n\nMSDS documentation: [Click here][277]\n\n### Indications\n\nIndications\n\nThis product cannot be guaranteed free from traces of nuts or other allergens. Seek medical advice\nbefore use if you are pregnant or suffering from any medical conditions or allergies. Always conduct\na patch test before using any new product.\n\nStore in a cool dry place away from sunlight.\n\nAs our products are natural, the colour and odour may vary 