ions ][231]\n* [ Vitamin E ][232]\n* [ Vegetable Glycerine ][233]\n* [ Preservative Eco ][234]\n* [ Salts ][235]\n* [ Clays ][236]\n* [ Beauty & Hair Care ][237]\n* [ Beauty & Hair Care ][238]\n* [ View All Beauty & Hair Care ][239]\n* [ View All Beauty & Hair Care ][240]\n* [ Hair Oils ][241]\n* [ Lip Oils ][242]\n* [ Face Oils ][243]\n* [ Organic Beard Oil ][244]\n* [ Accessories - Moulds & DIY Beauty Packaging ][245]\n* [ Massage ][246]\n* [ Massage ][247]\n* [ View All Massage Oils ][248]\n* [ View All Massage Oils ][249]\n* [ Massage Oils ][250]\n* [ Sensual Massage Oil ][251]\n* [ Relaxing Massage Oils ][252]\n* [ Energising Massage Oils ][253]\n* [ Reviving Massage Oils ][254]\n* [ Collections ][255]\n* [ Collections ][256]\n* [ View All ][257]\n* [ View All ][258]\n* [ Aromatherapy Gift Sets ][259]\n* [ Accessories ][260]\n* [ Collections and Kits ][261]\n* [ XL Sizes ][262]\n* [ XL Sizes ][263]\n* [ Carrier Oil Refills ][264]\n* [ Essential Oil Refills ][265]\n* [ Massage Blends XL ][266]\n* [ Soap Refills ][267]\n* [ Ingredients Refills ][268]\n* [ Sale ][269]\n* [ Sale ][270]\n* [ Clearance ][271]\n* [ Wholesale ][272]\n* [ Register / Login ][273]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][274]\nClear\nView all results\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n[Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)]\n\n### Description\n\nNaissance Lip Conditioning Oils (pack of 2). The base formula for our lip oil gloss consists of\nCastor, Sweet Almond and Vitamin E Oils to nourish, soften and regenerate the lips making it a great\nalternative to a lip gloss. Each lip oil is infused with a special ingredient and it's own unique\nproperties. Suitable for dry, chapped, damaged and cracked lips. The non-sticky texture glides on\nlips easily, leaving them soft and with a hint of shine for a naturally beautiful finish. This\nliquid lip balm kit, contains a powerful duo of clear lip oils:\n**Restore** - Powered by uplifting Jasmine and nourishing Jojoba.\n\n**Rejuvenate** - Powered by cooling Peppermint and balancing Hemp.\n\n* Nourishing set of 2 x 10ml lip oils powered by natural ingredients to help restore and rejuvenate\nlips\n* Hydrating, conditioning and plumping effect\n* Smooth non-sticky formula glides on the lips easily, leaving a subtle shine for a naturally\nbeautiful finish\n* 100% natural ingredients with enriching antioxidants\n* Each lip oil is powered by the unique properties of essential oils - Peppermint and Jasmine - to\nenergise, cool and uplift and give it a subtle fragrance\n* Cruelty free and vegan friendly\n\n### Usage\n\nLuscious Lips\n\nGlide the Lip Conditioning Oil directly onto your lips using the special rollerball applicator. As\nyou glide the applicator side to side over your lips, this massages and smooths the lips\nsimultaneously.\nThese lip oils are 100% natural so can be applied to your lips anytime day or evening.\n\nIn each collection you will have 2 Lip Conditioning Oils to choose from: Restore, Rejuvenate.\nAlways carry out a patch test before use.\n\n### Key Facts\n\nKey Facts\n\nOrigin: Produced in the UK\nIngredients: Restore: Ricinus communis, Prunus amygdalus dulcis, Simmondsia chinensis, Tocopherol,\nHelianthus anuus seed oil, Jasminum grandiflorum. Rejuvenate: Ricinus communis, Prunus amygdalus\ndulcis, Cannabis sativa, Tocopherol, Helianthus anuus seed oil, Mentha arvensis.\n\nExtraction Method: Blended\nColour: Restore: Clear to light yellow. Rejuvenate: Clear to light yellow.\nOdour: Restore: Floral jasmine notes. Rejuvenate: Refreshing mint aroma.\n\nVegan: Yes\nOrganic: No\n\nMSDS documentation: [Click here][275]\n\n### Indications\n\nIndications\n\nThis product cannot be guaranteed free from traces of nuts or other allergens. Seek medical advice\nbefore use if you are pregnant or suffering from any medical conditions or allergies. Always conduct\na patch test before using any new product.\n\nStore in a cool dry place away from sunlight.\n\nAs our products are natural, the colour and odour may vary from batch to batch. We are continually\nimproving our products and so on occasion the product you receive may differ slightly in appearance\nfrom images displayed on our website. But don\u2019t worry, it doesn\u2019t affect the quality or performance\nof your product \u2013 it\u2019s just down the natural and organic variations in our ingredients.\n\nWe describe and promote our products in good faith. The information given with regard to the\nbeneficial properties of our products (including medicinal and beauty) depend on popular opinion. We\ndo not express these thoughts as facts. The beneficial effects of our products may vary depending on\nthe user.\n\n# Lip Conditioning Oils Duo (2 x 10ml Roll-on Set)\n\nRegular price \u00a37.99\n\n* Unit price *\n/per\nSize: 2x10ml\n2x10ml 2x10ml\nQuantity\nQuantity\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nQuantity\n2x10ml\nAdd to Bag\n\n[Shipping][276] calculated at checkout.\n\nEmpower Your Wellbeing, One Ingredient at a Time.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n### Customer reviews\n\n### Description\n\nNaissance Lip Conditioning Oils (pack of 2). The base formula for our lip oil gloss consists of\nCastor, Sweet Almond and Vitamin E Oils to nourish, soften and regenerate the lips making it a great\nalternative to a lip gloss. Each lip oil is infused with a special ingredient and it's own unique\nproperties. Suitable for dry, chapped, damaged and cracked lips. The non-sticky texture glides on\nlips easily, leaving them soft and with a hint of shine for a naturally beautiful finish. This\nliquid lip balm kit, contains a powerful duo of clear lip oils:\n**Restore** - Powered by uplifting Jasmine and nourishing Jojoba.\n\n**Rejuvenate** - Powered by cooling Peppermint and balancing Hemp.\n\n* Nourishing set of 2 x 10ml lip oils powered by natural ingredients to help restore and rejuvenate\nlips\n* Hydrating, conditioning and plumping effect\n* Smooth non-sticky formula glides on the lips easily, leaving a subtle shine for"
