e a few drops of our beard growth oil in the palms and massage through beard and facial hair,\nworking through to the skin underneath. Use the sustainable wood comb to detangle and groom hair,\nfor a clean, polished look. For best results, use every day to strengthen and protect the beard.\n\nSuitable for thick beards. For finer hair you can try using the beard oil as a night time leave-in\nconditioner, and wash off in the morning to leave your hair soft and silky, ready for the day ahead.\n\n### Key Facts\n\nKey Facts\n\nOrigin: UK\nIngredients: Ricinus communis (Castor) seed oil*, Simmondsia chinensis (Jojoba) seed oil*, Argania\nspinosa (Argan Kernel)*, Citrus aurantium bergamia (Bergamot)*, Boswellia neglecta (Frankincense)*,\nCitrus nobilis (Mandarin)*, Linalool**, Limonene**, Citral**, Citronellol** *Organically produced\ningredient **Naturally occurring in essential oils Of total ingredients: 100% natural, 100% organic\n\nExtraction Method: Blended\nColour: Pale golden yellow\nOdour: Bergamot, Frankincense and Mandarin\n\nVegan: Yes\nOrganic: Yes\n\n### Indications\n\nIndications\n\nThis product cannot be guaranteed free from traces of nuts or other allergens. Seek medical advice\nbefore use if you are pregnant or suffering from any medical conditions or allergies. Always conduct\na patch test before using any new product.\n\nStore in a cool dry place away from sunlight.\n\nAs our products are natural, the colour and odour may vary from batch to batch. We are continually\nimproving our products and so on occasion the product you receive may differ slightly in appearance\nfrom images displayed on our website. But don\u2019t worry, it doesn\u2019t affect the quality or performance\nof your product \u2013 it\u2019s just down the natural and organic variations in our ingredients.\n\nWe describe and promote our products in good faith. The information given with regard to the\nbeneficial properties of our products (including medicinal and beauty) depend on popular opinion. We\ndo not express these thoughts as facts. The beneficial effects of our products may vary depending on\nthe user.\n\n# Organic Beard Oil\n\nRegular price \u00a3\u03361\u03363\u0336.\u03369\u03369\u0336 \u00a36.99\n\n* Unit price *\n/per\nSize: 30ml\n30ml 30ml\nQuantity\nQuantity\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nQuantity\n30ml\nAdd to Bag\n\n[Shipping][275] calculated at checkout.\n\nEmpower Your Wellbeing, One Ingredient at a Time.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n### Customer reviews\n\n### Description\n\nExpertly formulated to soften and nourish hair, our Organic Beard Oil is the perfect companion for a\nstrong and healthy beard. Crafted from a conditioning base of Castor, Argan and Jojoba Oil, this\nstrengthening beard oil coats hair strands and protects hair follicles, for a fuller, stronger beard\nthat grows.\n* Castor Oil encourages beard hair growth\n* Argan Oil prevents dryness and nourishes skin\n* Jojoba Oil supports a healthy hair growth cycle and reduces breakage\n* Natural, organic and sustainable ingredients\n* Enriching antioxidants\n* Cruelty free and vegan friendly\n\n### Usage\n\nBeauty\n\nDispense a few drops of our beard growth oil in the palms and massage through beard and facial hair,\nworking through to the skin underneath. Use the sustainable wood comb to detangle and groom hair,\nfor a clean, polished look. For best results, use every day to strengthen and protect the beard.\n\nSuitable for thick beards. For finer hair you can try using the beard oil as a night time leave-in\nconditioner, and wash off in the morning to leave your hair soft and silky, ready for the day ahead.\n\n### Key Facts\n\nKey Facts\n\nOrigin: UK\nIngredients: Ricinus communis (Castor) seed oil*, Simmondsia chinensis (Jojoba) seed oil*, Argania\nspinosa (Argan Kernel)*, Citrus aurantium bergamia (Bergamot)*, Boswellia neglecta (Frankincense)*,\nCitrus nobilis (Mandarin)*, Linalool**, Limonene**, Citral**, Citronellol** *Organically produced\ningredi