ions ][231]\n* [ Vitamin E ][232]\n* [ Vegetable Glycerine ][233]\n* [ Preservative Eco ][234]\n* [ Salts ][235]\n* [ Clays ][236]\n* [ Beauty & Hair Care ][237]\n* [ Beauty & Hair Care ][238]\n* [ View All Beauty & Hair Care ][239]\n* [ View All Beauty & Hair Care ][240]\n* [ Hair Oils ][241]\n* [ Lip Oils ][242]\n* [ Face Oils ][243]\n* [ Organic Beard Oil ][244]\n* [ Accessories - Moulds & DIY Beauty Packaging ][245]\n* [ Massage ][246]\n* [ Massage ][247]\n* [ View All Massage Oils ][248]\n* [ View All Massage Oils ][249]\n* [ Massage Oils ][250]\n* [ Sensual Massage Oil ][251]\n* [ Relaxing Massage Oils ][252]\n* [ Energising Massage Oils ][253]\n* [ Reviving Massage Oils ][254]\n* [ Collections ][255]\n* [ Collections ][256]\n* [ View All ][257]\n* [ View All ][258]\n* [ Aromatherapy Gift Sets ][259]\n* [ Accessories ][260]\n* [ Collections and Kits ][261]\n* [ XL Sizes ][262]\n* [ XL Sizes ][263]\n* [ Carrier Oil Refills ][264]\n* [ Essential Oil Refills ][265]\n* [ Massage Blends XL ][266]\n* [ Soap Refills ][267]\n* [ Ingredients Refills ][268]\n* [ Sale ][269]\n* [ Sale ][270]\n* [ Clearance ][271]\n* [ Wholesale ][272]\n* [ Register / Login ][273]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][274]\nClear\nView all results\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n[Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)]\n\n### Description\n\nOur Aloe Vera Gel is a unique formulation made from the fresh inner gel of the Aloe Vera leaf, and\nnot from concentrate. Soothing, cooling and moisturising for your skin, can be used on the body,\nface and hair.\n* Cruelty free and vegan friendly\n* Refreshing\n* Packed full of skin loving nutrients\n* Suitable for all skin types, including mature skin\n* Amazing for hair and skin\n* Easily absorbed by the skin\n* Perfect to quench sun parched skin\n* Uses natural Aloe Vera grown using organic methods\n\n### Usage\n\nBeauty\n\nApply a small amount of gel post shave to soothe and cool the skin and to keep skin hydrated.\n\nAloe Vera Gel can be used in your own beauty formulations such as body scrubs, make up remover, and\nmany more. Why not try replacing your usual shaving cream with Aloe Vera Gel? It will soothe and\ncool whilst helping the razor glide over your skin.\n\nSkincare\n\nUse as an all over body moisturiser, particularly useful after a day in the sun.\n\nHair\n\nAloe Vera is beneficial to your hair too. It will add moisture and help tame the frizz. You can add\nit to your shampoo for a nutritious boost for strong, shiny hair.\n\n### Key Facts\n\nKey Facts\n\nLatin Name: Aloe Barbadensis\nOrigin: Spain\nIngredients: Aqua (demineralized water), Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Glycerin, Carbomer,\nPhenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Hydroxide\n\nExtraction Method: Pulp is filtered and blended\nColour: Clear gel\nOdour: Characteristic\n\nVegan: Yes\nOrganic: No\n\nMSDS documentation: [Click here][275]\n\n### Indications\n\nIndications\n\nThis product cannot be guaranteed free from traces of nuts or other allergens. Seek medical advice\nbefore use if you are pregnant or suffering from any medical conditions or allergies. Always conduct\na patch test before using any new product.\n\nStore in a cool dry place away from sunlight.\n\nAs our products are natural, the colour and odour may vary from batch to batch. We are continually\nimproving our products and so on occasion the product you receive may differ slightly in appearance\nfrom images displayed on our website. But don\u2019t worry, it doesn\u2019t affect the quality or performance\nof your product \u2013 it\u2019s just down the natural and organic variations in our ingredients.\n\nWe describe and promote our products in good faith. The information given with regard to the\nbeneficial properties of our products (including medicinal and beauty) depend on popular opinion. We\ndo not express these thoughts as facts. The beneficial effects of our products may vary depending on\nthe user.\n\n# Aloe Vera Gel (No. 707)\n\nRegular price \u00a35.99\n\n* Unit price *\n/per\nSize: 100g\n100g 250ml 500g 870g 5kg 100g 250ml 500g 870g 5kg\nQuantity\nQuantity\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nQuantity\n100g 250ml 500g 870g 5kg\nAdd to Bag\n\n[Shipping][276] calculated at checkout.\n\nEmpower Your Wellbeing, One Ingredient at a Time.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n### Customer reviews\n\n### Description\n\nOur Aloe Vera Gel is a unique formulation made from the fresh inner gel of the Aloe Vera leaf, and\nnot from concentrate. Soothing, cooling and moisturising for your skin, can be used on the body,\nface and hair.\n* Cruelty free and vegan friendly\n* Refreshing\n* Packed full of skin loving nutrients\n* Suitable for all skin types, including mature skin\n* Amazing for hair and skin\n* Easily absorbed by the skin\n* Perfect to quench sun parched skin\n* Uses natural Aloe Vera grown using organic methods\n\n### Usage\n\nBeauty\n\nApply a small amount of gel post shave to soothe and cool the skin and to keep skin hydrated.\n\nAloe Vera Gel can be used in your own beauty formulations such as body scrubs, make up remover, and\nmany more. Why not try replacing your usual shaving cream with Aloe Vera Gel? It will soothe and\ncool whilst helping the razor glide over your skin.\n\nSkincare\n\nUse as an all over body moisturiser, particularly useful after a day in the sun.\n\nHair\n\nAloe Vera is beneficial to your hair too. It will add moisture and help tame the frizz. You can add\nit to your shampoo for a nutritious boost for strong, shiny hair.\n\n### Key Facts\n\nKey Facts\n\nLatin Name: Aloe Barbadensis\nOrigin: Spain\nIngredients: Aqua (demineralized water), Aloe Barbadens