354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [HERBAL CHAI TEA BLEND] ][394]\n* [ Bestsellers ][395]\n* [ tea ][396]\n* [ blends ][397]\nCanadian\n\n# HERBAL CHAI TEA BLEND\n* Regular price $10.50\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$10.50 $91.30 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$34.00 $74.72 / kg\n2.27kg (5lbs)\n$154.50 $68.09 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $10.50 CAD 454g (1lb) - $34.00 CAD 2.27kg (5lbs) - $154.50 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available HERBAL CHAI TEA BLEND\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nOur Herbal Chai Tea is a robust and aromatic mixture of seven traditional spices for a classic chai\nexperience. This fragrant blend is crafted with warming spices, including Cinnamon chips, Ginger,\nand Cloves. The combination is expertly balanced, featuring whole and crushed pieces of high-quality\nbotanicals to ensure maximum flavour release when brewed.\n\nThis blend is rich in complex, layered aromas, perfect for making a traditional, invigorating chai\nbeverage. The formula includes Coriander, Star Anise, Cardamom Pods, and Allspice, creating a spicy\ndepth that is both comforting and vibrant. The addition of **black pepper** provides a welcome\nwarmth and bite. This **caffeine-free spice mix** is traditionally simmered with milk (dairy or\nnon-dairy) and sweetened for a rich, creamy drink. This seven-spice, caffeine-free chai blend brings\nauthentic warmth and aroma to your kitchen.\n* Aromatic spice mix for a classic chai preparation\n* Contains seven spices for robust flavour\n* Features warming spices like Cinnamon, Ginger, and Cloves\n* Includes whole Cardamom Pods and Star Anise\n* Caffeine-free base that is traditionally simmered with milk\n* Provides authentic warmth and spicy aroma\n\n**Ingredients:** Coriander*, Cinnamon Chips*, Star Anise*, Cardamom Pods*, Allspice*, Cloves*,\nGinger*, Black Pepper*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Various parts of the world, processed in Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 14 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 22 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n95%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n04 Dec 2024\n**Rachael C.**\nCanada\n\n### Beautiful Quality\n\nI've been ordering organic herbs from OM Foods for a few months to use in my organic skincare"
