n flavour to any dish.\n\nThis versatile herb blend is a must-have for all your kitchen needs, far beyond just pasta. Italian\nSeasoning is **excellent for quickly flavouring marinades**, adding complexity to sauces, and\nsprinkling over salads. It also works beautifully as a **dry rub for meats or poultry**, providing\nrich, herbaceous notes. This five-ingredient, convenient blend ensures consistent, high-quality\nflavour for your favorite meals.\n* Fragrant blend of five herbs\n* Contains basil, oregano, and marjoram\n* Savory depth from garlic and sage\n* Essential blend for authentic Italian-inspired cuisine\n* Excellent for use in sauces, pasta, and salads\n* Conveniently used as a dry rub or marinade seasoning\n\n**Ingredients:** Basil*, Garlic*, Marjoram*, Oregano*, Sage*.\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** United States\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 11 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 15 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n100%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first 