 only after a careful process of steaming and drying, which removes a\nnaturally occurring caustic resin.\n\nThese beautiful whole cashews offer a sweet and creamy taste perfect for any dish. They make an\n**outstanding topping for oatmeal, yogurt, and desserts**, and they are the classic choice for\nsnacking straight out of the bag. You can use these versatile whole nuts to create smooth, homemade\ncashew butter or creamy non-dairy sauces and salad dressings. Keep these flavorful cashews on hand\nto elevate both sweet and savory recipes with their rich texture and substance.\n* Whole Cashews (Full Kernels)\n* Seeds of the cashew apple, native to Brazil\n* Always sold shelled due to careful processing\n* Features a sweet and creamy taste\n* Ideal for snacking, desserts, and toppings\n* Excellent base for homemade butter and sauces\n\n**Ingredient:** Cashew Nuts*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Vietnam\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 30 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.6** Based on 63 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n81%\n4 \u2605\n11%\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your