354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC COCONUT FLAKES, desiccated, large] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ nuts-butters ][396]\n* [ coconut ][397]\n\n# ORGANIC COCONUT FLAKES, desiccated, large\n* Regular price $9.00\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n454g (1lb)\n$9.00 $19.73 / kg\n2.27kg (5 lbs)\n$39.25 $17.27 / kg\n11.34kg (25 lbs)\n$162.50 $14.32 / kg\n454g (1lb) - $9.00 CAD 2.27kg (5 lbs) - $39.25 CAD 11.34kg (25 lbs) - $162.50 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC COCONUT FLAKES, desiccated, large\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nBring texture and flavour to your recipes with our Desiccated Large Coconut Flakes. These flakes are\nmade from fresh coconut meat that has been grated and dried, resulting in a substantial cut size.\nUnlike the finer shreds, these **large flakes provide a hearty, satisfying chew** and a burst of\nnatural coconut flavor.\n\nThe larger size of these flakes makes them an excellent ingredient for both cooking and decoration.\nUse them to make **delicious raw chocolate or energy bars**, where their size holds up well, or use\nthem as a crispy topping for granola, yogurt, and curries. They are also a flavorful substitute for\nbreadcrumbs in savory recipes. These versatile flakes are perfect for straight snacking or for\nblending with water to create homemade coconut milk for any recipe.\n* Desiccated Coconut Flakes (Dried)\n* Large flake cut from fresh coconut meat\n* Provides a hearty, satisfying chew and flavor\n* Ideal for raw chocolate and energy bars\n* Excellent topping for granola, yogurt, and curries\n* Can be used to make homemade coconut milk\n\n**Ingredient:** Coconut* (Cocos nucifera)\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Philippines\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 20 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.7** Based on 27 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n89%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n09 Jul 2024\n**Nancy E.**\nCanada\n\n### Amazing snack\n\nVery good experience. I use this as a snack. (Coconut chips). Really enjoy and will definitely\nreorder.\n\n[ORGANIC COCONUT FLAKES, desiccated, large][412]\n454g (1lb)\nWas this helpful? 0 0\n15 Jun 2024\n**Judy A.**\n[Canada] Canada\n\n### organic coconut flakes\n\nI use it as a dessert with goats milk yoghu"
