46ml (32fl oz) - $16.00 CAD 3.8L (1gal) - $55.50 CAD 473ml (16fl oz ) - case of 12 - $90.00 CAD\n946ml (32fl oz) - case of 12 - Sold Out 19L (5gal) - $230.00 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\n**Please note:** This product is final sale.\n**Please note:** All ORGANIC COCONUT OIL sizes come in plastic bottles for safety during shipping.\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC COCONUT OIL, virgin, unrefined, raw\n\nEmail\n[Description][401] [Ingredients & Origin][402] [Other][403] [ Reviews\n][404]\n\nOur pure-white, creamy Virgin Unrefined Coconut Oil is made from the first pressing of fresh, raw\ncoconut meat without chemicals, resulting in an unbleached and undeodorized product. It features a\n**mild, pleasant coconut flavor and scent** that enhances both food and body care applications.\n\nCoconut oil is renowned for its incredible versatility in the home. Since it can be heated to high\ntemperatures, it is ideally suited for **frying, saut\u00e9ing, and baking**, where it adds a subtle,\nexotic note to dishes. Beyond the kitchen, its raw form makes it an excellent ingredient for skin\nand hair moisturizing, or for oil pulling. Keep this single-ingredient, raw virgin coconut oil\nstocked for a multi-purpose fat that works beautifully in both your cooking and personal care\nroutines.\n* Virgin Unrefined Coconut Oil (Raw)\n* Made from first pressing of fresh, raw coconut meat\n* Features a mild coconut flavor and pleasant scent\n* Ideal for frying, saut\u00e9ing, and baking due to high heat suitability\n* Excellent for use in skin and hair moisturizing routines\n* Unbleached, unhydrogenated, and undeodorized pure product\n\n**Ingredient:** Coconut Oil*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Philippines / Sri Lanka\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 47 reviews [Write a review][405]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][406] [Continue to delivery and payment][407]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.9** Based on 114 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n93%\n106\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\n[ORGANIC COCONUT OIL, virgin, unrefined, raw - Customer Photo From Marguerite A.]i\n[ORGANIC COCONUT OIL, virgin, unrefined, raw - Customer Photo From Marguerite A.]i\n[ORGANIC COCONUT OIL, virgin, unrefined, raw - Customer Photo From Julie T.]i\n[ORGANIC COCONUT OIL, virgin, unrefined, raw - Customer Photo From Dawn L.]i"
