354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC DATES, Medjool, whole, large | Organic Matters] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ dried-fruits-berries ][396]\n* [ whole ][397]\n\n# ORGANIC DATES, Medjool, whole, large\n* Regular price $4.25\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$4.25 $36.32 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$12.75 $27.83 / kg\n6.8kg (15lb)\n$136.75 $20.09 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $4.25 CAD 454g (1lb) - $12.75 CAD 6.8kg (15lb) - $136.75 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC DATES, Medjool, whole, large\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nIndulge in the famous flavor of our Whole Large Medjool Dates. Often referred to as the \u2018king of\ndates,\u2019 this variety is cherished for its exceptionally large size, soft texture, and uniquely rich,\ncaramel-like sweetness. Dates are one of the world\u2019s oldest known fruits, used as a dietary staple\nfor millennia.\n\nThese whole dates are highly versatile for both sweet and savory kitchen creations. Their intense\nnatural sweetness makes them an **excellent sugar alternative** for baking, smoothies, and raw\ndesserts like energy balls. They also pair wonderfully with contrasting flavors in salads, such as\nthose featuring walnuts and Gorgonzola cheese. Keep these large, naturally sweet Medjool dates\nstocked for wholesome snacking, or to effortlessly add a luxurious, sweet component to any meal or\nplatter.\n* Whole Large Medjool Dates\n* Known as the \u2018king of dates\u2019 for superior flavor\n* Features exceptionally large size and soft texture\n* Offers a rich, caramel-like natural sweetness\n* An excellent sugar alternative for baking and smoothies\n* Delicious addition to salads and sweet/savory dishes\n\n**Ingredient:** Medjool Dates* (Phoenix dactylifera)\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** United States\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 37 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.8** Based on 55 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n89%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\n[ORGANIC DATES, Medjool, whole, large - Customer Photo From Erin P.]i\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSortWith Photos Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSortWith Photos Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n30 May 2024\n**Janis U.**\n[Canada] Canada\n\n### Yummy!\n\nour only disappointment is the bag empties too fast!\n\n[ORGANIC DATES, Medjool, whole, large][412]\n454g (1lb)\nWas this helpful? 0 0\n25 Apr 2024\n"
