354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC FLAX SEEDS, brown | Organic Matters] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ seeds-seed-butters ][396]\n* [ whole ][397]\nCanadian\n\n# ORGANIC FLAX SEEDS, brown\n* Regular price $6.00\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n454g (1lb)\n$6.00 $13.18 / kg\n2.27kg (5 lbs)\n$24.75 $10.90 / kg\n11.34kg (25 lbs)\n$99.50 $8.77 / kg\n454g (1lb) - $6.00 CAD 2.27kg (5 lbs) - $24.75 CAD 11.34kg (25 lbs) - $99.50 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC FLAX SEEDS, brown\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nAdd a rich, earthy flavor to your cooking with our Brown Flax Seeds. Flax seeds have been used for\ncenturies, with origins tracing back to Babylon over 3,000 years ago. This traditional brown variety\nis prized for its distinctive, slightly deeper, and nuttier taste compared to golden flax. When used\nwhole, they provide a **satisfying, subtle pop of crunch**.\n\nThese highly versatile seeds are easy to use in both sweet and savory recipes. Sprinkle them whole\nover **salads, stir-fries, or blend them into your morning smoothie**. They are an essential\ningredient for adding texture and character to breads, crackers, and dense baked goods. For maximum\nutility, you can easily grind them into powder to incorporate into granola, cereal, or batters. Keep\nthese nutty, traditional brown flax seeds stocked for a simple, earthy ingredient that complements a\nwide range of dishes.\n* Brown Flax Seeds\n* Offers a distinctive, slightly deeper, and nuttier flavor\n* Provides a satisfying, subtle crunch when used whole\n* Versatile for sprinkling on salads and blending into smoothies\n* Essential for adding texture to breads and baked goods\n* Can be ground into powder for granola or cereal\n\n**Ingredient:** Flax Seeds*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Please note:** This product can occasionally contain extraneous material such as grains and field\ndebris.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 5 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 11 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n100%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2]