 pantry with the warm, spicy sweetness of OM Foods Ginger Cubes, lightly dusted, large.\nThese delicious chunks of ginger are prepared by candying the root and then giving them a light\ndusting of raw cane sugar. The large, approximately 16 x 16mm squares offer a satisfying chew and a\nperfect balance of heat and sweetness.\n\nGinger is an invaluable item to keep on hand and is a well-known staple in traditional uses.\nSnacking on these ginger cubes is a simple way to help **balance the stomach** and warm the\ndigestive system. They are perfect for trail mixes, adding a spicy kick to salads, or simply\nsnacking alone. OM Foods offers this potent ingredient as a convenient and **delicious pantry item**\nfor year-round enjoyment.\n* Delicious chunks of spicy and sweet ginger\n* Large 16 x 16mm squares for a satisfying chew\n* Features a light dusting of raw cane sugar\n* Known to help balance the stomach and warm the digestive system\n* Perfect for trail mixes, salads, or snacking alone\n* An invaluable and delicious pantry item for year-round enjoyment\n\n**Ingredients:** Ginger*, Raw Cane Sugar* (Zingiber officinalis\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** China\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 24 reviews [Write a review][405]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][406] [Continue to delivery and payment][407]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.8** Based on 33 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n91%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nNam