354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC GINGER, lightly dusted, small cubes] ][394] [ [ORGANIC GINGER, lightly dusted, small\ncubes] ][395]\n[ [ORGANIC GINGER, lightly dusted, small cubes] ][396]\n[ [ORGANIC GINGER, lightly dusted, small cubes] ][397]\n* [ Baking ][398]\n* [ baking-flavors ][399]\n* [ whole-halves-pieces ][400]\n\n# ORGANIC GINGER, lightly dusted, small cubes\n* Regular price $3.75\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$3.75 $32.89 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$11.00 $24.17 / kg\n2.25kg (5lbs)\n$48.00 $21.13 / kg\n5kg (11lbs)\n$86.00 $17.19 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $3.75 CAD 454g (1lb) - $11.00 CAD 2.25kg (5lbs) - $48.00 CAD 5kg (11lbs) - $86.00 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC GINGER, lightly dusted, small cubes\n\nEmail\n[Description][401] [Ingredients & Origin][402] [Other][403] [ Reviews\n][404]\n\nIndulge in the zesty kick of our Ginger Cubes. These chunks of crystallized ginger are made from\nginger and lightly dusted with raw cane sugar. Cut into small 10-12mm squares, they provide a\n**balanced blend of spicy warmth and enjoyable sweetness**.\n\nThese ginger cubes are an invaluable item for snacking and adding zing to recipes. They are perfect\nfor **tossing into trail mixes, adding to baked goods, or simply snacking on their own** when you\nneed a little burst of flavor. You can also chop them finely to incorporate them into salads, or\nsteep them in hot water for a warm, comforting beverage. Keep these easy-to-use, spicy-sweet ginger\ncubes stocked in your pantry for instant flavor and warmth in countless sweet and savory\napplications.\n* Ginger Cubes (Crystallized)\n* Ingredients include ginger and raw cane sugar\n* Cut into convenient small 10-12mm squares\n* Offers a warming blend of spicy and sweet flavor\n* Ideal for snacking, trail mixes, and baking\n* Can be steeped in hot water for a warming drink\n\n**Ingredients:** Ginger* (Zingiber officinalis), Raw Cane Sugar*.\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** China\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 66 reviews [Write a review][405]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][406] [Continue to delivery and payment][407]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.8** Based on 86 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n92%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][408] [2][409] [3][410] [4][411] [5][412]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][413][Twitter][414]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n20 Dec 2024\n**Barbara S.**\n[Canada] Canada\n\n### Organic ginger cubes\n\nI like that not covered in crystalized sugar, I love ginger so I"
