ory taste and delicate\nchewiness. Their vibrant red-orange color adds visual appeal to any dish or snack mix.\n\nThese highly versatile berries can be enjoyed in countless ways throughout the day. You can easily\nadd them to **breakfast bowls, oatmeal, or sprinkle them over salads and desserts** for a unique\nburst of flavor. They are also excellent when **blended into smoothies or steeped to make a\nnourishing tea**. Like other dried fruits, you can soak them in water to soften their texture before\nuse. Keep these easy-to-use, distinctive dried berries stocked for a flavorful addition to your\neveryday routine.\n* Goji Berries (Wolfberries)\n* Distinctively sweet with a subtle herbal note\n* Vibrant red-orange color and delicate chewiness\n* Ideal for breakfast cereals, oatmeal, and salads\n* Excellent when blended into smoothies or brewed as tea\n* Can be soaked in water to soften before use\n\n**Ingredient:** Goji Berries* (Lycium barbarum)\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** China\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 24 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.7** Based on 46 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n85%\n4 \u2605\n11%\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\n[ORGANIC GOJI BERRIES - Customer Photo From jorden l.]i\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSortWith Photos Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSortWith Photos Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n10 Dec 2024\n**Huda A.**\nCanada\n\n### So delicious!\n\nAs some of the reviews state, they are a bit crunchy, but I found that not all of them are crunchy,\nand this only happened if they were very"
