354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC MANGO, filets & strips | Organic Matters] ][394]\n* [ Bestsellers ][395]\n* [ dried-fruits-berries ][396]\n* [ whole-pieces ][397]\n\n# ORGANIC MANGO, dried, filets & strips\n* Regular price $7.75\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$7.75 $66.23 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$24.25 $52.94 / kg\n2kg (4.4lb)\n$96.50 $48.34 / kg\n8kg (17.6lb)\n$303.25 $37.98 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $7.75 CAD 454g (1lb) - $24.25 CAD 2kg (4.4lb) - $96.50 CAD 8kg (17.6lb) - $303.25 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC MANGO, dried, filets & strips\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nEnjoy the rich flavor of our Dried Mango Filets and Strips. These dried mango pieces are known for\ntheir intense, sweet-and-sour flavor and satisfyingly chewy texture. Made solely from pure mango,\nthe drying process concentrates the fruit\u2019s tropical taste into a truly delightful snack.\n\nThese fruit pieces are sliced into convenient filets and strips, making them versatile for cooking\nand snacking. They are perfect for **on-the-go snacking or serving as a naturally sweet dessert**.\nYou can easily chop them and add them to trail mixes, granolas, or breakfast bowls for a\nconcentrated burst of flavor. If you prefer a softer chew, **a quick soak in water will soften the\nfruit** while enhancing both the chewiness and flavor. Keep these easy-to-use, single-ingredient\ndried fruits stocked for a sweet, tropical treat whenever you need it.\n* Dried Mango Filets and Strips\n* Intense, sweet-and-sour tropical flavor\n* Conveniently cut into ready-to-eat pieces\n* Excellent for on-the-go snacking or dessert\n* Can be chopped for trail mixes and breakfast bowls\n* Easily softened by soaking in water if desired\n\n**Ingredient:** Mango*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Peru\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Tip:** If your mango is drier than normal or a little tough, try soaking it in some water. This\ngenerally softens the fruit and increases both chewiness and flavour!\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 47 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.8** Based on 83 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n88%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a revi