354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC OATS, regular/thick rolled | Organic Matters] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ grains-rice ][396]\n* [ oats ][397]\nCanadian\n\n# ORGANIC OATS, regular/thick rolled\n* Regular price $6.00\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n1kg (2.2lb)\n$6.00 $5.98 / kg\n4.54kg (10 lbs)\n$22.00 $4.84 / kg\n11.34kg (25 lbs)\n$49.75 $4.38 / kg\n1kg (2.2lb) - $6.00 CAD 4.54kg (10 lbs) - $22.00 CAD 11.34kg (25 lbs) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC OATS, regular/thick rolled\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nThick rolled Oats are a highly versatile grain, processed for both speed and flavour. Raw oat groats\nare separated from their hulls, lightly steamed, rolled, and then kiln-dried to preserve their rich,\nnutty flavour. This method also extends their shelf life, making them a pantry essential. They\nretain their classic texture and are ready for both sweet and savoury recipes.\n\nThese thick rolled oats are naturally rich in important dietary components. Oats contain complex\ncarbohydrates, plant-based protein, and plenty of dietary fiber. They also supply **essential\nminerals such as magnesium, phosphorus, and zinc**, along with B vitamins. They are **perfect for\nclassic morning oatmeal, hearty granola, or muesli**. For a quick and effortless meal, try soaking\nthem overnight in milk for creamy \u201covernight oats.\u201d These hearty, quick-cooking oats are the\ndependable choice for a wholesome, foundational grain.\n* Thick rolled oats for classic texture\n* Kiln-dried to preserve flavour and extend shelf life\n* Naturally rich in complex carbohydrates and dietary fiber\n* Good source of protein and minerals (magnesium, zinc, phosphorus)\n* Ideal use in oatmeal, granola, and muesli\n* Great base for easy overnight oats\n\n**Ingredient:** Oats* (Avena sativa)\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 40 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.9** Based on 59 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n93%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n17 Oct 2024\n**Brenda R.**\n[Canada] Canada\n\n### I like them!\n\nI use these oats to make oat-based muffins twice a week, varying the fruit added, and sometimes\nincluding chopped walnuts.\n\n[ORGANIC "
