chemical means or\ntemperature alteration. Be assured of its **purity; no other type of oil is ever added** to this\nsingle-ingredient product.\n\nThis rich, yellow-green oil brings a full-bodied flavor profile to your culinary creations. You\u2019ll\nnotice hints of cut grass, almond, and fruit, finished with a gentle spice. While suitable for\ncooking, keeping the heat below its smoke point (approximately 375 degrees Fahrenheit or 191 degrees\nCelsius) will best preserve its complex flavor. This popular oil is excellent for salad dressings,\nsauces, dips, and drizzling over pasta, delivering the authentic taste of the Mediterranean.\n* Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n* Highest quality oil with full-bodied flavor\n* Produced by mechanically cold pressing whole olives\n* Guaranteed purity\u2014no other oil added\n* Notes of cut grass, almond, and fruit with spicy finish\n* Ideal for dressings, dips, and finishing pasta dishes\n\n**Ingredient:** Olive Oil*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Tunisia\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 54 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.7** Based on 78 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n81%\n4 \u2605\n10%\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank 