354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC PUMPKIN SEEDS, Grade AA] ][394]\n* [ Bestsellers ][395]\n* [ seeds-seed-butters ][396]\n* [ whole ][397]\n\n# ORGANIC PUMPKIN SEEDS, Grade AA\n* Regular price $8.75\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n454g (1lb)\n$8.75 $19.23 / kg\n2.27kg (5lbs)\n$37.75 $16.62 / kg\n12.5 kg (27.5lbs)\n$164.75 $13.17 / kg\n454g (1lb) - $8.75 CAD 2.27kg (5lbs) - $37.75 CAD 12.5 kg (27.5lbs) - $164.75 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC PUMPKIN SEEDS, Grade AA\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nAdd a satisfying crunch and vivid green color to your favorite dishes with our Pumpkin Seeds. These\nGrade AA seeds have been **mechanically shelled** to provide the highest quality kernel. Pumpkin\nseeds, often called pepitas, have a subtle, slightly sweet flavor that makes them ideal for both\nsavory and sweet recipes.\n\nThe versatility of these whole seeds makes them an essential pantry item. They are excellent for\nsnacking straight out of the bag or adding to trail mix for a quick energy boost. Use them to **top\nsalads, garnish soups, or incorporate into your homemade baking** like breads and muffins. You can\nalso grind them down to create seed butter or seed milk. These premium pumpkin seeds are ready to\nuse and offer a delicious, nutty complement to almost any meal.\n* Pumpkin Seeds (Pepitas)\n* Grade AA quality, mechanically shelled\n* Features a subtle, slightly sweet flavor\n* Versatile for snacking and trail mixes\n* Ideal for topping salads, soups, and baking\n* Can be ground into seed butter or milk\n\n**Ingredient:** Pumpkin Seeds* (Grade AA)\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** China\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 48 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.8** Based on 77 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n92%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n02 Jan 2025\n**Kristianne S.**\n[Canada] Canada\n\n### Great de-wormer\n\nPumpkin seeds are great de-wormers and parasite cleaners of the intestines. They are also alkalizing\nto the body which makes them great for keeping cancer at bay. I give these to my dogs as well as put\nthem in my smoothies. They are delicious, fresh, and another great purchase from OM!\n\n[ORGANIC PUMPKIN SEEDS, Grade AA][412]\n2.27kg (5lbs)\nW"
