and flavorful base for countless meals.\n\nWhite quinoa has a mild, delicate flavor that makes it incredibly easy to use. It cooks up quickly\nwith a light, **fluffy texture and pleasant chewiness** that complements both hot and cold dishes.\nYou can easily substitute it for most grains in both sweet and savory recipes, using it in salads,\nsoups, stews, or even breakfast porridge with fruit. Keep this gluten-free whole seed ready for\nsatisfying meals that come together in minutes.\n* White Quinoa (Whole Seed)\n* Highly versatile and quick-cooking\n* Features a mild, delicate flavor and chewy texture\n* Cooks up fluffy and light\n* Excellent gluten-free substitute for most grains\n* Ideal for salads, soups, and porridge\n\n**Ingredient:** Quinoa* (Chenopodium quinoa)\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Bolivia\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 7 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.9** Based on 14 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n86%\n4 \u2605\n14%\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this 