354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC SEVEN SEA-VEGGIES BLEND] ][394]\n* [ Bestsellers ][395]\n* [ seaweeds ][396]\n* [ blends ][397]\nCanadian\n\n# ORGANIC SEVEN SEA-VEGGIES BLEND\n* Regular price $13.50\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$13.50 $118.42 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$43.75 $96.15 / kg\n2.27kg (5lbs)\n$199.75 $87.95 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $13.50 CAD 454g (1lb) - $43.75 CAD 2.27kg (5lbs) - $199.75 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC SEVEN SEA-VEGGIES BLEND\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nA highly diverse mix of seven wild sea vegetables is found in the Seven Sea-Veggies Blend. All\ningredients, including dulse, nori, wakame, kombu, and sea lettuce, are sustainably wildcrafted and\nhand-harvested from the icy, clean waters of the Bay of Fundy, Canada. The harvest is then sun-dried\nto preserve the integrity of the sea vegetables. This blend offers a convenient, single product\nfeaturing multiple sea vegetable varieties.\n\nEach sea vegetable contributes a wealth of minerals, vitamins, and trace elements from the sea. The\nblend naturally contains sodium, along with protein and fiber from the dulse and sea lettuce\ncomponents. OM Foods offers this blend as a versatile and nourishing seasoning. It can be **easily\nsprinkled on meals** as a flavourful addition, or used to enhance **rice dishes and soup stocks**.\nIts natural qualities and ease of use make it an essential culinary staple for adding unique depth\nto any recipe.\n* Blend of seven sustainably wildcrafted sea vegetables\n* Hand-harvested from the Bay of Fundy, Canada\n* Features dulse, nori, wakame, kombu, and sea lettuce\n* Sun-dried to preserve natural integrity\n* Easily sprinkled on meals as a nutritious seasoning\n* Ideal for flavouring rice, soups, and stocks\n\n**Ingredients:** Dulse*, Nori*, Sea Lettuce*, Wakame*, Kombu*, Longicruris*, Knotted Wrack Flakes*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 35 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 48 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n96%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n