354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC VANILLA BEANS, whole] ][394]\n* [ Bestsellers ][395]\n* [ baking-flavors ][396]\n* [ whole ][397]\n\n# ORGANIC VANILLA BEANS, whole\n* Regular price $6.50\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n14g (.5oz)\n$6.50 $114.03 / kg\n113g (1/4lb)\n$42.50 $372.80 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$138.50 $305.06 / kg\n14g (.5oz) - $6.50 CAD 113g (1/4lb) - $42.50 CAD 454g (1lb) - $138.50 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC VANILLA BEANS, whole\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nThe rich, complex aroma is the primary feature of OM Foods\u2019 Vanilla Beans, whole. Whole vanilla\nbeans offer a deep, natural sweetness and a highly fragrant flavour far superior to artificial\nextracts. These pods are the dried, cured fruit of the vanilla orchid, providing the true, classic\nvanilla taste that defines gourmet baking and pastry. They are prized by chefs and home cooks alike\nfor their intense aromatic oil.\n\nVanilla beans are a staple for anyone serious about creating decadent desserts, custards, and ice\ncreams. Scrape out the tiny, concentrated seeds to infuse batters and creams with unmistakable\nflavour, then simmer the entire pod in milk for an extra layer of richness. These whole beans are\nalso **essential for making homemade vanilla extract**. OM Foods delivers **premium, whole vanilla\nbeans** that provide a highly fragrant and economical way to elevate your recipes and craft your own\nflavourings.\n* Whole, dried, cured fruit of the vanilla orchid\n* Offers deep, natural sweetness and intense aroma\n* Provides the true, classic vanilla taste for gourmet baking\n* Essential ingredient for custards, ice creams, and desserts\n* Perfect for making homemade vanilla extract\n* Highly fragrant and economical way to flavour recipes\n\n**Ingredient:** Vanilla Beans* (Vanilla planifolia).\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Madagascar\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 8 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.9** Based on 10 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n90%\n4 \u2605\n10%\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409