354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC WALNUTS, raw, halves & pieces] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ nuts-butters ][396]\n* [ whole-halves-pieces ][397]\n\n# ORGANIC WALNUTS, raw, halves & pieces\n* Regular price $6.00\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$6.00 $52.17 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$17.25 $37.91 / kg\n2.27kg (5 lbs)\n$77.00 $33.93 / kg\n11.34kg (25lb)\n$324.25 $28.59 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $6.00 CAD 454g (1lb) - $17.25 CAD 2.27kg (5 lbs) - $77.00 CAD 11.34kg (25lb) -\n$324.25 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC WALNUTS, raw, halves & pieces\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nAdd nutty flavor and crunch with our Raw Walnuts, Halves & Pieces. These English walnuts are shelled\nand raw, arriving ready to use in a mix of halves and smaller pieces. They are highly valued for\ntheir **distinctive, slightly bitter, and earthy flavor profile** that complements a wide range of\ningredients.\n\nWalnuts are a highly versatile nut in both sweet and savory cooking. The pieces are ideal for\nbaking, blending seamlessly into **muffins, cookies, and various quick breads**. Use the larger\nhalves to garnish salads, sprinkle over oatmeal or yogurt, or candy them for a sweet treat. Walnuts\nalso pair wonderfully with savory flavors in stuffings, cheese boards, and homemade pesto. Keep\nthese convenient, shelled walnuts stocked for a simple ingredient that adds texture and rich flavor\nto any meal or snack.\n* Raw Walnuts (Halves & Pieces)\n* Shelled and ready to use in a mix of sizes\n* Features a distinctive, slightly bitter, and earthy flavor\n* Excellent for baking into muffins and quick breads\n* Ideal garnish for salads, oatmeal, and yogurt\n* Pairs well with savory dishes, pesto, and cheese boards\n\n**Ingredient:** Walnuts* (Juglans regia)\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** United States\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 59 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.9** Based on 99 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n94%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n16 Dec 2024\n**Sylwia G.**\n[Canada] Canada\n\n### Great walnuts!\n\nThese are very tasty and nice walnuts. I tend to get painful bumps on my tongue when consuming too\nmany walnuts but this specific variety is amazingly smooth.\n\n[ORGAN"
