354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [SALT, HIMALAYAN, natural pink, fine ground] ][394]\n* [ Bestsellers ][395]\n* [ savory-ingredients ][396]\n* [ granular-powder ][397]\n\n# SALT, HIMALAYAN, natural pink, fine ground\n* Regular price $3.00\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n454g (1lb)\n$3.00 $6.57 / kg\n2.27kg (5lb)\n$11.75 $5.17 / kg\n25kg (55lb)\n$105.25 $4.21 / kg\n454g (1lb) - $3.00 CAD 2.27kg (5lb) - $11.75 CAD 25kg (55lb) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available SALT, HIMALAYAN, natural pink, fine ground\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nReplace your everyday table salt with the beautiful color and clean taste of our Natural Pink Fine\nGround Himalayan Salt. Mined from ancient salt beds in Pakistan, this natural pink salt is famed for\nits signature hue, which comes from trace minerals captured within the crystals. It contains **over\n80 different naturally occurring minerals**, including macrominerals like calcium, iron, and\npotassium.\n\nThe fine grind makes this salt an ideal, all-purpose seasoning for daily use. Use it directly in all\nyour cooking, baking, and seasoning applications\u2014wherever a traditional salt is needed. Its clean,\ndelicate flavour enhances the taste of everything from **simple scrambled eggs to complex braises\nand fresh vegetables**. This versatile, fine ground salt is a necessary staple for adding a hint of\ncolor and complex minerality to your entire culinary routine.\n* Natural Pink Himalayan Salt\n* Fine ground for all-purpose use\n* Contains over 80 different naturally occurring minerals\n* Minerals include calcium, iron, and potassium\n* Offers a clean, delicate flavour\n* Ideal for cooking, baking, and seasoning\n\n**Ingredient: ** Himalayan Sea Salt\n\n**Origin:** Pakistan\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 47 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 67 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n97%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreci