f powder, offering substantial capacity for homemade herbal blends\nor supplements.\n\nThese vegetable cellulose capsules are fast-dissolving and designed for clean, ethical consumption.\nThey are **100% natural and free of preservatives, gelatin, wheat, animal by-products, and gluten**,\nmaking them suitable for almost any dietary requirement. Production adheres to **strict GMP and ISO\n9002 regulations**, and they are manufactured without the addition of ethylene oxide or sulfites.\nThese Kosher, Halal, and Non-GMO certified capsules provide a high-quality, easily digestible vessel\nfor your ingredients.\n* \"00\" size offers substantial fill capacity (approx. 735 mg of powder)\n* Ingredients include HPMC (vegetable cellulose) and purified water\n* 100% Natural and free of gelatin, wheat, and animal by-products\n* Manufactured under strict GMP and ISO 9002 regulations\n* Fast dissolving and easily digestible\n* Certified Kosher, Halal, Non-GMO, and gluten-free\n\n**Ingredients: ** HPMC (derived from vegetable cellulose, 100% natural), Purified Water. These\ncapsules contain no preservatives, gelatin, wheat, animal by-products or starch, and they are made\nfrom pure cellulose of either pine or poplar.\n\n**Origin:** India\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 13 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 18 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n100%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Questio