354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC MOUNTAIN TRAIL MIX | Organic Matters] ][394]\n* [ Bestsellers ][395]\n* [ ready-to-eat ][396]\n* [ trail-mix ][397]\nCanadian\nSold Out\n\n# MOUNTAIN TRAIL MIX\n* Regular price $8.50\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$8.50 $73.91 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$27.00 $59.34 / kg\n2.27kg (5lb)\n$122.50 $53.98 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - Sold Out 454g (1lb) - Sold Out 2.27kg (5lb) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available MOUNTAIN TRAIL MIX\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nOur Mountain Trail Mix is a satisfying blend of sweet, tart, and crunchy ingredients designed for\nsustained energy. This trail mix features a delicious combination of pecans and Brazil nuts\nalongside sweet, soft diced apricots and tart cranberries. Every handful delivers a complex mix of\ntextures and flavours, making it the ideal snack for active days or afternoon cravings.\n\nThe mix is elevated with rich chocolate chips and a touch of warming spice. Included are semi-sweet\nchocolate chips, providing a decadent balance to the fruit and nuts. A hint of **Cassia cinnamon\npowder** and **Himalayan sea salt** ensures a perfectly seasoned, balanced flavour profile. This\nblend provides a wholesome, ready-to-eat source of energy that perfectly balances indulgence and\nnutrition.\n* Nut and fruit blend for sustained energy\n* Features pecans and Brazil nuts\n* Contains apricots and tart cranberries\n* Includes semi-sweet chocolate chips\n* Perfectly seasoned with cinnamon and Himalayan sea salt\n* An ideal, ready-to-eat snack for hiking or daily fuel\n\n**Ingredients:** Cranberries* (Cranberries*, Sugar*, Sunflower Oil* >][423]\n* [>][424]\n* * [ About Us ][425]\n* [ Contact Us ][426]\n* [ FAQs ][427]\n* * [ Pantry ][428]\n* [ Baking ][429]\n* [ Snacks ][430]\n* [ Superfoods ][431]\n* [ Wellness ][432]\n* * [ Orders and Shipping ][433]\n* [ Returns and Refunds ][434]\n* [ Damaged Goods ][435]\n* * [ Quick Order Form ][436]\n* [ Customer Experience ][437]\n* Sign up for the latest news, offers and styles\nNewsletter\nSubscribe\nBy submitting the form, you agree to our [Privacy Policy][438].\n\u00a9 2026 OM Foods Inc.\n* [ Cookie Policy ][439]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][440]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][441]\nCanada\nCanada United States\n][442]\n* [ Pantry ][443]\n* [ Baking ][444]\n* [ Snacks ][445]\n* [ Superfoods ][446]\n* [ Wellness ][447]\n* [ New ][448]\n* [ Sale ][449]\n* [ Quick Order Form ][450]\n* [\nContact Us\n][451]\n* [\nMy Account\n][452]\n* [\nCanada\nCanada United States\n][453]\nPantry\n* [View all from Category][454]\n* Filter category Pantry\n* [Canadian Products][455]\n* [New Products][456]\n* [Sale][457]\n* [Grains & Rice][458]\n* [View all][459]\n* [Whole][460]\n* [Flakes & Crisps][461]\n* [Flour][462]\n* [Rice][463]\n* 