354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC CRANBERRIES, apple juice infused] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ dried-fruits-berries ][396]\n* [ whole-pieces ][397]\nCanadian\nSold Out\n\n# ORGANIC CRANBERRIES, apple juice infused\n* Regular price $5.00\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$5.00 $43.85 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$15.25 $33.51 / kg\n2.27kg (5lbs)\n$67.75 $29.83 / kg\n11.34kg (25lbs)\n$266.25 $23.47 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - Sold Out 454g (1lb) - Sold Out 2.27kg (5lbs) - Sold Out 11.34kg (25lbs) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nUnfortunately, the harvest for organic cranberries last year was extremely poor due to climate\nvariability and pests. We will have this product back in stock as soon as the new harvest is\navailable.\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ORGANIC CRANBERRIES, apple juice infused\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\np>Cranberries deliver a classic tart flavour with balanced sweetness. These whole cranberries are\ninfused with apple juice concentrate instead of refined sugar, providing a delicious, natural\nsweet-tart flavour profile. They are kept soft and separate using a touch of sunflower oil, ensuring\na pleasant, chewy texture right out of the bag. These berries are a wonderful snack or ingredient\nfor both sweet and savoury applications.\n\nThe balanced sweet-tart taste of these cranberries enhances many recipes, from baking to salads.\nThese fruit pieces add a welcome burst of flavour and texture to muffins, scones, and loaves. They\nare also **a fantastic addition to trail mixes, breakfast cereals, and yogurt**. For savoury dishes,\nthese berries provide a **delicious counterpoint in wild rice stuffings or seasonal salads**. This\nnaturally sweetened, versatile dried fruit is an excellent pantry staple for year-round flavour and\ncolour.\n* Whole cranberries infused with apple juice concentrate\n* Naturally sweetened instead of refined sugar\n* Soft, chewy texture preserved with sunflower oil\n* Perfect balance of sweet and tart flavour\n* Ideal use in baking, trail mixes, and cereals\n* Adds flavour and colour to seasonal salads and stuffings\n\n**Ingredients:** Cranberries*, Apple Juice Concentrate*, Sunflower Oil* >][429]\n* [>][430]\n* * [ About Us ][431]\n* [ Contact Us ][432]\n* [ FAQs ][433]\n* * [ Pantry ][434]\n* [ Baking ][435]\n* [ Snacks ][436]\n* [ Superfoods ][437]\n* [ Wellness ][438]\n* * [ Orders and Shipping ][439]\n* [ Returns and Refunds ][440]\n* [ Damaged Goods ][441]\n* * [ Quick Order Form ][442]\n* [ Customer Experience ][443]\n* Sign up for the latest news, offers and styles\nNewsletter\nSubscribe\nBy submitting the form, you agree to our [Privacy Policy][444].\n\u00a9 2026 OM Foods Inc.\n* [ Cookie Policy ][445]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][446]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][447]\nCanada\nCanada United States\n][