remain juicy and\nflavourful with their natural oils intact. The distinctive olive flavour is enhanced by a mild\nseasoning blend.\n\nEach olive is fully pitted for ultimate convenience, ready to be enjoyed straight from the package.\nThe seasoning features a savoury Mediterranean blend of tarragon, thyme, and oregano, along with sea\nsalt. OM Foods curates this **flavourful, shelf-stable snack** as a perfect shortcut to adding\ncomplexity to your meals. They are wonderful in salads or can be featured as a **simple, seasoned\nsnack**. Their distinctive herbal flavour makes them an essential ready-to-eat item for quick\nculinary use.\n* Distinctive Botija olive variety (red & black mix)\n* Seasoned with tarragon, thyme, and oregano\n* Cured and dried at low temperatures to retain natural oils\n* Fully pitted for quick and easy use\n* Wonderful in salads and as a simple snack\n* A flavourful, ready-to-eat Mediterranean ingredient\n\n**Ingredients:** Botija Olives* (Olea europaea), Pitted, Cured, Dehydrated, Red & Black Mix, Sea\nSalt, Tarragon*, Thyme*, Oregano*.\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Peru\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 18 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.9** Based on 25 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n92%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][