354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC SPROUTING MIX (Sandwich Mix)] ][394]\n* [ Bestsellers ][395]\n* [ seeds ][396]\n* [ seed ][397]\nCanadian\nSold Out\n\n# SPROUTING MIX (Sandwich Mix)\n* Regular price $7.75\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$7.75 $67.98 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$24.75 $54.39 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - Sold Out 454g (1lb) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available SPROUTING MIX (Sandwich Mix)\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nGrow your own fresh greens with our Sprouting Mix (Sandwich Mix). This blend features a satisfying\ncombination of alfalfa, red clover, Daikon, and China rose radish seeds, along with mung beans and\nbroccoli seeds. The mix is specifically designed to produce **tasty, nutrient-dense sprouts with\nvaried textures and flavors** right on your kitchen counter.\n\nEnjoy the fresh taste and vibrant crunch of homegrown sprouts in just a few days. Simply **soak the\nseeds for 4\u20136 hours, then rinse them twice daily** to encourage sprouting. Once ready, these sprouts\nmake a fantastic addition to sandwiches, wraps, and salads, instantly boosting the freshness of your\nmeal. Rotating the container daily helps ensure good airflow for even growth. Keep this easy-to-use,\nversatile mix stocked for a continuous supply of fresh, crunchy, homemade sprouts.\n* Sprouting Mix (Sandwich Mix)\n* Blend of alfalfa, clover, radish, mung bean, and broccoli seeds\n* Designed for growing fresh sprouts at home\n* Easy to use process: soak then rinse twice daily\n* Adds a fresh, vibrant crunch to sandwiches and salads\n* Yields tasty, varied sprouts with different textures and flavors\n\n**Ingredients:** Alfalfa Seeds*, Red Clover Seeds*, Daikon Radish Seeds*, China Rose Radish Seeds,\nMung Beans, Broccoli Seeds.\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Various parts of the world, processed in Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 11 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 14 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n100%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n27 Jan 2024\n**Lynda Q.**\n[Canada] Canada\n\n### Perfect blend\n\nSo tasty. These sprouted in less than 4 days. Such an amazing taste. Love the blend. Will be\nreordering hands down.\n\n[SPROUTING MIX (Sandwich Mix)][412"
