354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ORGANIC TURMERIC TEA, Om Blend] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ culinary-herbs-spices ][396]\n* [ blends ][397]\nCanadian\nSold Out\n\n# TURMERIC TEA, Om Blend\n* Regular price $6.00\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$6.00 $52.63 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$19.00 $41.75 / kg\n2.27kg (5lbs)\n$85.00 $37.42 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - Sold Out 454g (1lb) - Sold Out 2.27kg (5lbs) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available TURMERIC TEA, Om Blend\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nA warmly spiced, golden infusion of roots and spices forms OM\u2019s Turmeric Tea Blend. This unique,\ncomforting mix contains turmeric root, ginger root, fennel seed, cloves, and black peppercorn,\ncomplemented by true cinnamon and cassia cinnamon, and lightly sweetened with stevia. The blend is\ncarefully formulated to be a soothing, flavourful beverage base that can be enjoyed daily.\n\nBlack peppercorn is included in the blend to aid in the bioavailability of the curcumin found in the\nturmeric root. OM Foods suggests using one teaspoon per cup of boiling water for preparation. The\nfinal product can be enjoyed alone, or with the addition of milks or milk alternatives to create a\ndelicious **\u201cgolden milk\u201d** beverage. This **versatile spice mix** is also delicious added to\noatmeal, pancakes, dressings, and desserts, making it an essential culinary staple for flavour and\nwarmth.\n* Warming spice blend featuring turmeric and ginger root\n* Includes black peppercorn to enhance curcumin's bioavailability\n* Naturally sweetened with stevia leaf\n* Versatile base for tea, golden milk, and culinary recipes\n* Blends true cinnamon and cassia cinnamon for complex flavour\n* An essential staple for flavouring both drinks and food\n\n**Ingredients:** Turmeric Root*, True Cinnamon*, Ginger Root*, Fennel Seed*, Cassia Cinnamon*,\nCloves*, Black Peppercorn*, Stevia*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Various parts of the world / Processed in Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 14 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.9** Based on 36 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n89%\n4 \u2605\n11%\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\n[ORGANIC TURMERIC TEA, Om Blend - Customer Photo From 