354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [ALMONDS, tamari roasted] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ nuts-butters ][396]\n* [ salted-nuts ][397]\nCanadian\n\n# ALMONDS, tamari roasted\n* Regular price $7.25\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$7.25 $62.50 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$20.75 $45.50 / kg\n2.27kg (5 lbs)\n$93.25 $41.07 / kg\n11.34kg (25 lbs)\n$390.75 $34.45 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $7.25 CAD 454g (1lb) - Sold Out 2.27kg (5 lbs) - Sold Out 11.34kg (25 lbs) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available ALMONDS, tamari roasted\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nSatisfy your savoury cravings with OM Foods Almonds, tamari roasted. We start with whole almonds,\nseason them lightly with authentic tamari (water, soybeans, salt, alcohol), and then roast them to\ncrispy perfection. This process creates a deliciously salty and umami-rich snack that's ready to\nenjoy right out of the bag.\n\nAlmonds are a renowned nutritional powerhouse, naturally rich in **monounsaturated and\npolyunsaturated fats** and dietary fibre. They are an excellent source of Vitamins E and B2, biotin,\nand antioxidants, as well as several essential minerals like magnesium, calcium, and iron. These\nflavourful nuts are commonly enjoyed as a healthy snack on their own, or you can add them to salads\nand stir-fries for a salty crunch. They are a convenient and wholesome way to boost your daily\nnutrient intake.\n* Whole almonds seasoned with tamari and roasted\n* Features a deliciously salty and umami-rich flavour\n* Rich in monounsaturated and polyunsaturated fats and dietary fibre\n* Excellent source of Vitamins E and B2, and magnesium\n* Ideal for healthy snacking or sprinkling over salads\n* Ready-to-eat savoury crunch for any time of day\n\n**Ingredient:** Almonds*, Tamari*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Canada / United States\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 2 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.8** Based on 4 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n75%\n4 \u2605\n25%\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n01 Nov 2024\n**valerie s.**\n[Canada] Canada\n\n### tamari roasted almonds\n\nDelicious snack.\n\n[ALMONDS, tamari roasted][412]\n113g (1/4lb)\nWas this helpful? 0 0\n14 Feb 2024\n**Kathleen** [SVG verified by SHOP]\n[Canada] Canada\n\nDelicious. O"
