354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [BAKING POWDER, double acting, Alu & GMO free | Organic Matters] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ baking-flavors ][396]\n* [ powder ][397]\nCanadian\n\n# BAKING POWDER, double acting, Alu & GMO free\n* Regular price $8.50\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n454g (1lb)\n$8.50 $8.48 / kg\n2.27kg (5 lbs)\n$36.50 $16.08 / kg\n20kg (44lbs)\n$245.75 $12.31 / kg\n454g (1lb) - $8.50 CAD 2.27kg (5 lbs) - $36.50 CAD 20kg (44lbs) - $245.75 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available BAKING POWDER, double acting, Alu & GMO free\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nGet reliable lift in all your baked goods with our Double Acting Baking Powder. This essential\nleavening agent is proudly Aluminum-free and GMO-free, offering a pure ingredient for your kitchen.\nIts unique double-acting formula ensures a **consistent rise and light texture** in everything from\nquick breads to cakes.\n\nThe formula works by releasing carbon dioxide gas in two phases, starting when it is mixed and\nfinishing when heated. This action creates bubbles in the dough or batter, resulting in the desired\nvolume and texture. It's the go-to ingredient for **biscuits, muffins, pancakes, and tortillas**\nwhere fermentation flavors from yeast are not desired. Rely on this high-quality powder for fast,\nconsistent leavening in all your homemade sweet and savory creations, resulting in light, fluffy\nresults every time.\n* Double Acting Baking Powder\n* Guaranteed Aluminum-free and GMO-free\n* Contains Sodium Bicarbonate and Potato Starch\n* Provides a consistent, two-phase rise for light texture\n* Essential for quick breads, muffins, and pancakes\n* Key leavening agent for reliable baking results\n\n**Ingredients: ** Sodium acid Pyrophosphate, Sodium Bicarbonate, Organic Potato Starch, Calcium\nSulphate, Monocalcium Phosphate. Aluminium Free, Sulfur Dioxide Free, Preservative Free, GMO-free.\n\n**Origin:** Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 6 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 9 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n100%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n12 Jun 2022\n**Wendy O.**\nCanada\n\nI love having the best for my baking. No poisonous GMOs and no neurotoxins like aluminum. Best\nproducts!\n\n[BAKING POWDER"
