354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [CAJUN SEASONING] ][394]\n* [ Culinary Botanicals ][395]\n* [ culinary-herbs-spices ][396]\n* [ blends ][397]\n\n# CAJUN SEASONING\n* Regular price $6.25\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$6.25 $54.34 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$20.25 $44.40 / kg\n2.27kg (5lbs)\n$92.00 $40.49 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $6.25 CAD 454g (1lb) - $20.25 CAD 2.27kg (5lbs) - $92.00 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available CAJUN SEASONING\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nThe powerful, savoury essence of the South is blended into OM Foods\u2019 Cajun Seasoning. This blend is\na flavorful mix of black pepper, cayenne, sea salt, garlic, onion, and paprika. Together, these\nspices create the intense, classic flavour profile that defines traditional Cajun and Creole\ncuisine. It\u2019s the easiest way to bring this bold regional taste directly to your kitchen.\n\nThis spice blend is incredibly flexible and can be used far beyond classic dishes like gumbo and\njambalaya. Use it to season meats and fish before grilling or baking, or mix it into rice and\nvegetable dishes for a spicy kick. It also works well when added to soups, stews, and sauces where\nyou need a deep, complex flavour. OM Foods delivers a **versatile, ready-to-use blend** that is\nperfect for everyday seasoning and is a **must-have pantry staple** for adding a punch of flavour.\n* Savory blend of six spices and sea salt\n* Key ingredients include black pepper, cayenne, and paprika\n* Creates the intense, classic flavour of Cajun cuisine\n* Incredibly flexible for use in many recipes\n* Ideal for gumbo, jambalaya, fish, and sauces\n* A must-have staple for adding bold flavour instantly\n\n**Ingredients:** Black Pepper*, Cayenne*, Sea Salt, Garlic*, Onion*, Paprika*.\n\n**Origin:** United States\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 4 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 5 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n100%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a rev