354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [CHOCOLATE WAFERS, 82%] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ cacao-chocolate ][396]\n* [ chunks-chips ][397]\n\n# CHOCOLATE WAFERS, 82%\n* Regular price $8.00\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$8.00 $70.17 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$25.50 $56.16 / kg\n2.27kg (5lb)\n$115.50 $50.92 / kg\n15kg (33lb)\n$579.25 $38.69 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $8.00 CAD 454g (1lb) - $25.50 CAD 2.27kg (5lb) - $115.50 CAD 15kg (33lb) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\n**Please note:** We are not responsible for melting or other damage caused by heat exposure during\nshipping.\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available CHOCOLATE WAFERS, 82%\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nExperience a bold intensity with our 82% Chocolate Wafers. These dark discs are crafted using cocoa\nliquor and unrefined panela sugar, resulting in a high-cocoa profile that lacks the bitterness often\nfound in lower-quality bars. The use of panela provides a **smooth, deep cocoa taste with a subtle\nhint of caramel-like sweetness** that balances the dark chocolate perfectly.\n\nThese versatile wafers are a favorite for both snacking and gourmet culinary projects. Their\nconvenient shape makes them **easy to melt for silky ganaches, glossy coatings, or decadent\nfondues**. You can also chop them into chunks for cookies and muffins, or stir them into hot\nbeverages for a rich chocolate experience. Because they are minimally processed, they retain the\nrobust, earthy character of premium cacao without unnecessary additives. Keep these intense,\nhigh-percentage dark chocolate wafers stocked to satisfy your chocolate cravings or to upgrade your\nnext baking session with a sophisticated, professional finish.\n* 82% Dark Chocolate Wafers\n* Simple ingredients consisting only of cocoa liquor and panela\n* Offers a sophisticated balance of bold cacao and caramel notes\n* Convenient wafer shape for even melting and easy portioning\n* Ideal for baking high-end cookies, cakes, and confections\n* Perfect for pairing with strong coffees or herbal teas\n\n**Ingredient:** Cocoa liquor*, Panela sugar*\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Peru\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][402] [Continue to delivery and payment][403]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n* * [ About Us ][404]\n* [ Contact Us ][405]\n* [ FAQs ][406]\n* * [ Pantry ][407]\n* [ Baking ][408]\n* [ Snacks ][409]\n* [ Superfoods ][410]\n* [ Wellness ][411]\n* * [ Orders and Shipping ][412]\n* [ Returns and Refunds ][413]\n* [ Damaged Goods ][414]\n* * [ Quick Order Form ][415]\n* [ Customer Experience ][416]\n* Sign up for the latest news, offers and styles\nNewsletter\nSubscribe\nBy submitting the form, you agree to our [Privacy Policy][417].\n\n\u00a9 2026 OM Foods Inc.\n* [ Cookie Policy ][418]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][419]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][420]\nCanada\nCanada United States\n][421]\n* [ Pantry ][422]\n* [ Baking ][423]\n* [ Snacks ][424]\n* [ Superfoods ][425]\n* [ Wellness ][426]\n* [ New ]["
