354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [CITRIC ACID, granules or powder] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ baking-flavors ][396]\n* [ granular-powder ][397]\n\n# CITRIC ACID, granules or powder\n* Regular price $34.25\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n454g (1lb)\n$8.00 $17.54 / kg\n2.27kg (5lb)\n$34.25 $15.08 / kg\n22.68kg (50lb)\n$261.75 $11.53 / kg\n454g (1lb) - Sold Out 2.27kg (5lb) - $34.25 CAD 22.68kg (50lb) - Sold Out\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available CITRIC ACID, granules or powder\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nAdd a clean, bright sourness and preserving power to your kitchen creations with our Citric Acid.\nThis Anhydrous Citric Acid is produced to USP grade standards through a submerged **fermentation\nprocess** using glucose sources obtained from sugar cane. It is a highly versatile crystalline or\npowder ingredient with a signature mouth-puckering sour flavor.\n\nCitric acid is invaluable in food applications for flavor and preservation. It works as an effective\npreservative to regulate pH levels in canned goods and prevents fresh fruit from oxidizing, keeping\nit bright. When used for flavor, it provides the classic sourness for candy coatings and can even be\nused as a sodium-free salt replacement to enhance dishes. It also functions as an **emulsifier to\neliminate fat globules in homemade ice cream**, ensuring a smoother texture. This multi-purpose\nculinary ingredient is a staple for bakers, canners, and those seeking vibrant, sour flavors.\n* Citric Acid (Anhydrous, USP Grade)\n* Produced via fermentation of sugar cane glucose\n* Functions as an effective pH-regulating preservative\n* Used for strong, mouth-puckering sour flavor\n* Excellent sodium-free salt replacement\n* Acts as an emulsifier in homemade ice cream\n\n**Ingredient: ** Citric Acid (Anhydrous is produced by submerged fermentation of glucose sources\nobtained from sugar cane). USP grade.\n\n**Origin:** Colombia\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 3 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**5.0** Based on 6 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n100%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twitter][411]\nBe the first to review this item\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nFilter Reviews:\nSort Most Recent Highest Rating Lowest Rating Most Helpful\nClear filter\nMore Filters\n03 Sep 2020\n**Christine M.**\n[United States] United States\n\n### citric acid\n\nI bought it for use in canning, but them the dishwasher repair person sai"
