354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [COFFEE, Decaf Blend] ][394] [ [COFFEE, Decaf Blend] ][395]\n[ [COFFEE, Decaf Blend] ][396]\n[ [COFFEE, Decaf Blend] ][397]\n* [ Canadian products ][398]\n* [ coffee ][399]\n* [ whole ][400]\nCanadian\n\n# COFFEE, Decaf Blend\n* Regular price $22.50\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n454g (1lb)\n$22.50 $49.34 / kg\n2.27kg (5lb)\n$112.50 $49.51 / kg\n454g (1lb) - $22.50 CAD 2.27kg (5lb) - $112.50 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available COFFEE, Decaf Blend\n\nEmail\n[Description][401] [Ingredients & Origin][402] [Other][403] [ Reviews\n][404]\n\nFinding a **decaf coffee** that actually delivers on **bold flavor** without the caffeine jolt is a\ngame changer for late-night coffee lovers. This signature blend focuses on rich aromatic profiles\nand a **smooth finish** that mirrors the experience of a high-quality caffeinated roast. Every cup\nprovides a **satisfying depth** that avoids the thin or watery texture often associated with\ndecaffeination processes.\n\nSourcing quality beans ensures that the natural oils and **complex tasting notes** remain intact\nthrough the roasting cycle. Whether you prefer a French press or a classic drip, this versatile\noption stands up to milk or shines as a black brew. It serves as a **reliable pantry staple** for\nthose seeking a gentle ritual at any hour of the day.\n* Crafted to maintain the authentic soul of the bean without the buzz\n* Roast profiles are carefully monitored to highlight chocolatey and nutty undertones\n* Ideal for evening gatherings or those reducing their daily stimulant intake\n* Pairs beautifully with dessert or as a standalone comfort beverage\n\n**Ingredient: **Coffee\n\n**Origin:** Roasted in Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][405] [Continue to delivery and payment][406]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n* * [ About Us ][407]\n* [ Contact Us ][408]\n* [ FAQs ][409]\n* * [ Pantry ][410]\n* [ Baking ][411]\n* [ Snacks ][412]\n* [ Superfoods ][413]\n* [ Wellness ][414]\n* * [ Orders and Shipping ][415]\n* [ Returns and Refunds ][416]\n* [ Damaged Goods ][417]\n* * [ Quick Order Form ][418]\n* [ Customer Experience ][419]\n* Sign up for the latest news, offers and styles\nNewsletter\nSubscribe\nBy submitting the form, you agree to our [Privacy Policy][420].\n\n\u00a9 2026 OM Foods Inc.\n* [ Cookie Policy ][421]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][422]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][423]\nCanada\nCanada Un