354]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][355]\n* [ Powder ][356]\n* [ Boosters ][357]\n* [ Protein Powders ][358]\n* [ Greens Powder ][359]\n* [ Fruit Powders ][360]\n* [ Coffee ][361]\n* [ Whole Bean ][362]\n* [ Instant ][363]\n* [ Tea ][364]\n* [ Leaf ][365]\n* [ Powder ][366]\n* [ Black ][367]\n* [ Green ][368]\n* [ Blends ][369]\n* [ Mushrooms ][370]\n* [ Whole & Cut ][371]\n* [ Powder ][372]\n* [ Herbal Botanicals & Spices ][373]\n* [ Whole ][374]\n* [ Cut ][375]\n* [ Powder ][376]\n* [ Extracts ][377]\n* [ Seaweeds ][378]\n* [ Whole & Flakes ][379]\n* [ Powder & Tablets ][380]\n* [ Noodle ][381]\n* [ Toasted ][382]\n* [ Blends ][383]\n* [ Bath & Body ][384]\n* [ Butter & Liquids ][385]\n* [ Clays ][386]\n* [ Bee Products ][387]\n* [ Packaging ][388]\n* [ hello@omfoods.com ][389]\n* [ Login ][390] / [ Register ][391]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n### Login\n\nPlease enter your e-mail and password:\n\nEmail\nPassword\n\n[Forgot your password?][392]\n\nLogin\n\nNew customer? [Register][393]\n\n### Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail\n\nSubmit\n\nBack to login\n[ [CREAM OF TARTAR, GMO-free] ][394]\n* [ Baking ][395]\n* [ baking-flavors ][396]\n* [ powder ][397]\n\n# CREAM OF TARTAR, GMO-free\n* Regular price $5.25\n* Sale -%\n\nSize :\n113g (1/4lb)\n$5.25 $46.05 / kg\n454g (1lb)\n$15.75 $34.61 / kg\n25kg (55lb)\n$600.00 $23.99 / kg\n113g (1/4lb) - $5.25 CAD 454g (1lb) - $15.75 CAD 25kg (55lb) - $600.00 CAD\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart Notify Availability\nWishlist\n\nInform when this item available CREAM OF TARTAR, GMO-free\n\nEmail\n[Description][398] [Ingredients & Origin][399] [Other][400] [ Reviews\n][401]\n\nEnsure light, stable meringues and baked goods with our GMO-Free Cream of Tartar. This fine, white\npowder is pure Potassium Bitartrate, sourced from **Spain**, and features a pleasant, slightly\nacidic taste. Interestingly, this kitchen staple is actually a by-product of the winemaking process,\npurified from the sediment left in barrels after wine fermentation.\n\nCream of tartar is a crucial ingredient for whipping egg whites. It helps **speed up the creation of\nfoam and maintains the fluffiness** required for towering meringues and delicate desserts. It can\nalso be used as a convenient leavening agent substitute for baking powder when blended with baking\nsoda (using the ratio: 1/4 tsp baking soda plus 1/2 tsp cream of tartar). Beyond baking, this\nversatile pantry ingredient can be added to boiling water to help vegetables retain their bright\ncolor.\n* GMO-Free Cream of Tartar\n* Single ingredient Potassium Bitartrate\n* Sourced from Spain\n* By-product of the winemaking process\n* Essential for stabilizing whipped egg whites\n* Substitute for baking powder when combined with baking soda\n\n**Ingredient: ** Potassium Bitartrate\n\n**Origin:** Spain\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 6 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.9** Based on 8 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n88%\n4 \u2605\n12%\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRating\nRating\n[1][405] [2][406] [3][407] [4][408] [5][409]\nTitle of Review\nHow was your overall experience?\nQuestions Photos Upload\n\nThank you for submitting a review!\n\nYour input is very much appreciated. Share it with your friends so they can enjoy it too!\n\n[Facebook][410][Twit