complex undertones of turmeric, coriander, and fenugreek. The\nflavour profile is enhanced by cayenne, cardamom, cinnamon, and black pepper.\n\nContaining ten distinct ingredients, this blend is essential for crafting authentic curries, soups,\nand stews. Because this blend is **completely salt-free**, you have complete control over the final\nseasoning of your meal. Curry powder is wonderfully versatile, easily added to **eggs, meat dishes,\nvegetables, or blended with mayonnaise or yogurt** to create a flavourful dipping sauce. This\nten-spice, salt-free blend is a necessary foundation for exploring rich, complex international\nflavours in your kitchen.\n* OM blend of ten spices\n* Completely salt-free for customized seasoning control\n* Features turmeric, coriander, cumin, and ginger\n* Balanced flavour combining earthy, zesty, and sweet notes\n* Essential base for Indian curries, soups, and stews\n* Excellent addition to eggs, meat, vegetables, and dipping sauces\n\n**Ingredients:** Turmeric*, Coriander*, Cumin*, Ginger*, Cinnamon*, Black Pepper*, Fenugreek*,\nCayenne*, Mustard*, Cardamom*.\n\n*Certified Organic by Pro-Cert\n\n**Origin:** Canada\n\n**Storage:** Store in a cool, dry place, away from heat and moisture. Protect from direct sunlight.\n\n**Disclaimer: **This information is for educational purposes only and has not been evaluated by the\nFDA or CFIA. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. This product has\nbeen packaged in the same facility as peanuts, tree nuts, wheat, soy, and other potential allergens.\n\n## Customer Reviews\n\nBased on 11 reviews [Write a review][402]\n\n#### Your Cart\n\nItem(s): ****\nTotal: $0.00\n[View Cart][403] [Continue to delivery and payment][404]\n\n### Recently Viewed\n\nCustomer Reviews\n**4.8** Based on 17 Reviews\n5 \u2605\n88%\n4 \u2605\n3 \u2605\n2 \u2605\n1 \u2605\nCustomer Photos\nWrite a Review Ask a Question\n* Reviews\n* Questions\nWrite a review\nAuthor\nName\nEmail\nLocation\nRa