        "crawl_text": "Primeavo Limited Global 100% Vertically Integrated Chemical-Free Processing Bulletproof Traceability Industrial Logistics Standards 4th Floor, Office No. 411, NHC Building, Samora Avenue, Dar es Salaam, Tanzania Tanzania Njombe, Tanzania Global Home - Primeavo Limited | Bulk Crude Avocado Oil Manufacturer &amp; Exporter\n\nSkip to content\n\nHome\n\nWho We Are\n\nOur Products\n\nContact Us\n\nHome\n\nWho We Are\n\nOur Products\n\nContact Us\n\nGet a Quote\n\nWe cultivate, harvest, and process.\n\nThe Purest Crude Avocado Oil Starts at the Source.\n\nPrimeavo Limited delivers a completely vertically integrated, 100% traceable bulk supply of premium Hass and Fuerte crude avocado oil directly from our own Tanzanian estates to global portss\n\nWho We Are\n\nPRIMEAVO LIMITED is a premier, vertically integrated agro-processing enterprise operating at the intersection of sustainable agriculture and industrial manufacturing . Strategically headquartered in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania, we specialize in the commercial cultivation of world-class avocados and the advanced extraction of premium crude avocado oil for global industrial, cosmetic, and pharmaceutical markets .\n\nTons Produce of Avocado Crude Oil\n\nTanzania Sourced\n\nFarmers Support\n\nTons per Container\n\nCultivated on Our Own Estates\n\nWe manage our own commercial farms in Njombe, protecting buyers from the inconsistent yields and unmonitored chemical exposures of out-grower networks.\n\nAdvanced Mechanical Processing\n\nOur modern facilities utilize chemical-free, mechanical extraction lines, guaranteeing a clean, highly stable crude oil that retains its natural nutrients.\n\nFlawless Supply Chain Control\n\nBy managing everything from harvesting in Njombe to shipping, Primeavo delivers total integration, bulletproof traceability, and unmatched quality control.\n\nVerified Quality. Total Traceability.\n\nAccess the complete technical dossier of our Tanzanian Hass and Fuerte crude avocado oil, including extensive extraction and logistics specifications\n\nDownload Company Profile\n\nPremium Bulk Crude Avocado Oil\n\nTechnical Specifications &amp; Quality Parameters\n\nProduct Classification\n\nPremium Bulk Crude Avocado Oil\n\nBotanical Cultivar Source\n\n100% Tanzania-Grown Hass and Fuerte Avocados\n\nGeographic Origin\n\nPrimeavo Owned Estates, Njombe Region, Tanzania\n\nIndustrial Processing Method\n\nHigh-efficiency mechanical extraction (Solvent-Free)\n\nPhysical Appearance\n\nRich, characteristic natural green-hued liquid\n\nRefinement Capabilities\n\nHighly optimized for seamless filtration and refinement by international buyers\n\nEngineered for Secure International Freight\n\nTechnical Specifications &amp; Quality Parameters\n\nTo protect the complex chemical compounds of our crude oil over long-distance ocean transit, Primeavo implements strict international bulk liquid logistics protocols . Every consignment is shipped exclusively inside high-capacity, food-grade multi-layered flexi-tanks secured within pristine 20-foot sea-freight containers .\nOur technical rigging features an advanced 5-bar steel bulkhead retention system, a robust unibody 3-inch snaplock ball valve configuration, and complete interior insulation using heavy-duty corrugated card linings . We provide a reliable, contamination-free arrival at any destination port worldwide .\n\nWhy Global Distributors Partner with Primeavo\n\n100% Vertically Integrated\n\nWe cultivate our own Hass and Fuerte estates in the Njombe region, shielding buyers from the volatile pricing and inconsistent volumes of out-grower networks.\n\nChemical-Free Processing\n\nOur modern processing facility utilizes advanced mechanical extraction lines that completely omit harsh chemical solvents, preserving natural oil integrity.\n\nBulletproof Traceability\n\nBecause we own the farms and the factory, we provide complete transparency and absolute batch traceability for every single flexi-tank we export.\n\nIndustrial Logistics Standards\n\nEvery consignment is rigged into low-age, strictly inspected 20ft ocean containers using premium 24-tonne food-grade flexi-tanks and heavy-duty steel bulkheads.\n\nEstablish a Secure Supply Partnership\n\nConnect directly with our commercial team in Dar es Salaam to request custom pricing, logistics coordination, or contract manufacturing variables .\n\nRequest for Quote\n\nHome\n\nWho We Are\n\nOur Products\n\nContact Us\n\nHome\n\nWho We Are\n\nOur Products\n\nContact Us\n\n+255 793 131 256\n\ninfo@primeavolimited.com\n\nFacebook\n\nX-twitter\n\nYoutube\n\nInstagram\n\nLinkedin\n\nCopyright 2026 \u00a9 Primeavo | All Rights Reserved\n\nWebsite Design By: Marsha Creatives\n\nGet a Quote\n\nFill in the Form Below and Our Team will get back to you ASAP\n\nName\n\nPhone\n\nEmail\n\nMessage\n\nSend Message [Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Who We Are][3]\n* [Our Products][4]\n* [Contact Us][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* [Who We Are][7]\n* [Our Products][8]\n* [Contact Us][9]\n[ Get a Quote ][10]\n\n## About Primeavo Limited\n\n## Who We Are\n\n**PRIMEAVO LIMITED** is a premier, vertically integrated agro-processing enterprise operating at the\nintersection of sustainable agriculture and industrial manufacturing. Strategically headquartered in\nDar es Salaam, Tanzania, we specialize in the commercial cultivation of world-class avocados and the\nadvanced extraction of premium crude avocado oil for global industrial, cosmetic, and pharmaceutical\nmarkets.\n\nUnlike traditional processors that rely entirely on fragmented, unmonitored out-grower networks,\nPrimeavo commands complete control over its entire supply chain. By managing our own extensive\nagricultural estates in the fertile highlands of Njombe alongside modern processing facilities, we\nguarantee unmatched quality, absolute structural traceability, and a reliable year-round production\nvolume of 100% Tanzanian-grown Hass and Fuerte avocado oils.\n\n### Our Vision\n\nTo establish definitive global leadership as East Africa's most trusted, fully integrated supplier\nof premium avocado products, recognized worldwide for quality excellence, supply chain integrity,\nand ecological stewardship.\n\n### Our Mission\n\nTo engineer a world-class agricultural ecosystem that maximizes the value of Tanzania's natural\nbounty, delivering superior-quality crude avocado oil to international markets through advanced\nsustainable processing while empowering local farming communities.\n\n## The Values That Drive Our Integration\n\nQuality Excellence (Farm-to-Factory)\n\nWe enforce rigorous quality standards at every single touchpoint\u2014from managing the soil chemistry in\nour Njombe fields to supervising the pressure parameters during oil extraction.\n\nComplete Supply Chain Integrity\n\nBy owning our commercial farms, we eliminate middle-tier supply variables, providing international\nbuyers with bulletproof batch traceability and total transparency.\n\nAgricultural Sustainability\n\nWe employ forward-thinking farming methodologies that conserve water, build rich soil biology, and\nminimize chemical dependency to preserve Tanzanian land for generations.\n\nCommunity Integration\n\nOur operations act as socio-economic anchors in the Njombe region, generating sustainable rural\nemployment, driving technical skills transfer, and upgrading regional agricultural infrastructure.\n\n## Our Footprint: From Highlands to High Seas\n\nLarge-Scale Commercial Avocado Cultivation & Bulk Crude Oil Mechanical Processing\n\n### The Agricultural Base: Njombe Region\n\nOur agricultural foundation is rooted in Njombe, Tanzania, an area widely celebrated as one of the\nmost geographically perfect environments on earth for high-yield avocado cultivation. The high\naltitudes, perfectly balanced rainfall patterns, and deep, well-drained volcanic soils allow our\nHass and Fuerte cultivars to achieve peak oil content and ideal fatty acid profiles. Because we own\nthe land, our crops are never vulnerable to the inconsistent sorting or arbitrary harvest dates\ntypical of unmonitored third-party smallholders.\n\n### The Logistics & Executive Hub: Dar es Salaam\n\nOperating from the 4th Floor of the NHC Building on Samora Avenue, our head office handles global\ntrade operations, international contract management, and rigorous quality assurance verification.\nOur strategic proximity to the Port of Dar es Salaam ensures that once our oil is securely loaded\ninto our specialized 24-tonne intermodal flexi-tanks, it transitions seamlessly onto ocean freight\ncarriers without logistical delay.\n\n## Establish a Secure Supply Partnership\n\nConnect directly with our commercial team in Dar es Salaam to request custom pricing, logistics\ncoordination, or contract manufacturing variables.\n\n[ Request for Quote ][11]\n* [Home][12]\n* [Who We Are][13]\n* [Our Products][14]\n* [Contact Us][15]\n* [Home][16]\n* [Who We Are][17]\n* [Our Products][18]\n* [Contact Us][19]\n* +255 793 131 256\n* info@primeavolimited.com\nFacebook X-twitter Youtube Instagram Linkedin\n\nCopyright 2026 \u00a9 Primeavo | All Rights Reserved\n\nWebsite Design By: [Marsha Creatives][20]\n\n## Get a Quote\n\nFill in the Form Below and Our Team will get back to you ASAP\n\nName\nPhone\nEmail\nMessage\nSend Message\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[3]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[4]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[5]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[6]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[7]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[8]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[9]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[10]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjEwMyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9\n[11]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[13]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[14]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[15]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[16]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[17]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[18]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[19]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[20]: https://marshacreatives.co.ke/ [Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Who We Are][3]\n* [Our Products][4]\n* [Contact Us][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* [Who We Are][7]\n* [Our Products][8]\n* [Contact Us][9]\n[ Get a Quote ][10]\n\n## Get In Touch with Us\n\nName\nPhone\nEmail\nMessage\nSend Message\n\n### Primary Contact Line:\n\n+255 793 131 256\n\n### Email:\n\ninfo@primeavolimited.com\n\n### Working Hours:\n\nMon - Fri (9:00am - 5:00pm)\n\n### Physical Address:\n\n4th Floor, Office No. 411, NHC Building, Samora Avenue, Dar es Salaam, Tanzania\n* [Home][11]\n* [Who We Are][12]\n* [Our Products][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n* [Home][15]\n* [Who We Are][16]\n* [Our Products][17]\n* [Contact Us][18]\n* +255 793 131 256\n* info@primeavolimited.com\n\nFacebook X-twitter Youtube Instagram Linkedin\n\nCopyright 2026 \u00a9 Primeavo | All Rights Reserved\n\nWebsite Design By: [Marsha Creatives][19]\n\n## Get a Quote\n\nFill in the Form Below and Our Team will get back to you ASAP\n\nName\nPhone\nEmail\nMessage\nSend Message\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[3]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[4]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[5]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[6]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[7]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[8]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[9]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[10]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjEwMyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9\n[11]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[12]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[13]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[14]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[15]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[16]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[17]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[18]: https://primeavoli