        "crawl_text": "Saficado Limited Global Direct sourcing from over 1,200 local farmers Robust farm-to-market system ensuring quality and traceability Commitment to sustainability and zero-waste production Cura Complex, Gatundu \u2013 Juja Road, Juja Town, Kenya Kenya Global Home - Saficado\n\nHOME\n\nABOUT\n\nPRODUCT\n\nCONTACT\n\nWHO WE ARE\nSaficado Limited:\nCrude Avocado Oil Producer\n\nPRODUCT\n\nDOWNLOAD PROFILE\n\nPremium Quality Avocado Oil Exports From Kenya\n\nCALL US\n\nSaficado is a leading producer of premium-quality avocado oil. We employ an integrated farmer-to-factory model, sourcing directly from over 1,200 smallholder farmers.\nSaficado implements a robust farm-to-market system that reliably traces the quality and origin of avocados at the farmer level. Our dedicated team of agricultural experts, logistics professionals, and community advocates work diligently to ensure that every shipment complies with the highest international standards.\n\nTONNES / YEAR\nSaficado has the capacity to produce over 1500 metric tonnes of premium quality avocado oil annually.\n\nKENYAN SOURCED\nSourced exclusively from locally cultivated Kenyan Hass and Fuerte avocado varieties.\n\nTONNES BULK EXPORT\n24-tonne flexi tanks, designed for efficient and safe transportation.\n\nFARMERS SUPPORTED\nWe directly collaborate with and empower over 1,200 local farmers,\n\nABOUT\n\nCONTACT\n\nHOW WE WORK\nOur Story\n\nFounded in 2023 as a fresh avocado trader, Saficado evolved into a premium oil producer in 2024, driven by a strategic vision to maximize the value of Kenyan agriculture through premium avocado oil exports.\nStrategically positioned along Thika Superhighway, our company bridges local agricultural resources with global market requirements.\n\nMORE ABOUT US\n\nSAFICADO LIMITED\nOur Process\n\nSTEP 1\nAvocado Sourcing and Collection\nSourcing from Kenyan Hass and Fuerte avocado varieties\nComprehensive farmer support program\nCareful selection of fruits at various ripeness stages\n\nSTEP 2\nIndustrial Extraction and Processing\nMechanical separation of oil from avocado pulp\nChemical-free processing approach\nTemperature-controlled extraction\nMinimized waste production\n\nSTEP 3\nQuality Assurance and Bulk Packaging\nPrecise flexi tank installation\nComprehensive export documentation\nComprehensive laboratory testing\n\nCONTACT\nWe&#8217;d Love To\nHear From You\n\nWe value your opinion and your feedback matter to us. We typically respond within 24 hours.\n\nGET IN TOUCH\n\nFounded in 2023, Saficado evolved from a strategic vision to elevate African agricultural potential through specialized crude oil exports.\n\ncontact@saficado.com\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nInstagram\n\nContact Us\n\n\u00a9 2025 Saficado Limited. All rights Reserved [[Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light]][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* [ABOUT][3]\n* [PRODUCT][4]\n* [CONTACT][5]\n\n# Who We Are\n\n##### Saficado is a specialized crude avocado oil producer established in 2023, focusing exclusively\n##### on the export of crude avocado oil\n\nLocated in Gatundu \u2013 Juja Town, the company has distinguished itself through its commitment to\nquality, sustainable practices, and farmer empowerment across the African region. The company\nleverages Kenya\u2019s prime avocado-growing conditions to produce high-quality crude avocado oil for the\nglobal market\n\n# Our Mission\n\nTo deliver superior value to customers while maintaining steadfast support for farmers and\nemployees, building a world-class enterprise in avocado oil.\n\n# Our Vision\n\nTo establish global leadership in avocado oil processing, while creating substantial value for\ncustomers and society at large\n\n###### SAFICADO LIMITED\n\n## Core Values\n\n#### Excellence\n\nWe pursue uncompromising quality in everything we do, from hand-selecting perfectly ripe avocados to\nmaintaining rigorous production standards. Excellence isn\u2019t just about the end product \u2013 it\u2019s about\nelevating every step of our process to create truly exceptional results\n\n#### Sustainability\n\nWe recognize our responsibility as stewards of both environmental and community resources. Our\ncommitment to sustainability encompasses zero-waste production methods, chemical-free processing,\nand farming practices that preserve our land for future generations.\n\n#### Integrity\n\nWe conduct our business with unwavering honesty and transparency, ensuring that every decision and\naction aligns with our ethical principles. From fair pricing for farmers to truthful product claims,\nintegrity guides every aspect of our operations.\n\n#### Community\n\nWe continuously seek better ways to serve our stakeholders\nby embracing new ideas and technologies while honoring\ntraditional wisdom. Our innovative spirit drives us to improve\nour processes, products, and services while maintaining our\ncommitment to natural, pure products.\n\n#### Empowerment\n\nWe understand that our success is intertwined with the prosperity of our community. By fostering\nstrong relationships with farmers, employees, and customers, we create a supportive ecosystem that\nbenefits everyone involved in our journey.\n\n# Kenya\u2019s equatorial climate provides us with a unique agricultural ecosystem. Our Hass and Fuerte\n# avocado varieties grow naturally, requiring minimal intervention. This pristine environment allows\n# us to produce some of the world\u2019s most sought-after crude avocado oil.\n\n##### We Actively Support 1200+ Local Farmers Each Year.\n\n###### CONTACT\n\n## We\u2019d Love To\n## Hear From You\n\nWe value your opinion and your feedback matter to us. We typically respond within 24 hours.\n\n[ GET IN TOUCH ][6]\n\nFounded in 2023, Saficado evolved from a strategic vision to elevate African agricultural potential\nthrough specialized crude oil exports.\n\n## contact@saficado.com\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nInstagram\n\n[Contact Us][7]\n\u00a9 2025 Saficado Limited. All rights Reserved\n\n[1]: https://saficado.com\n[2]: https://saficado.com/\n[3]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[4]: https://saficado.com/product/\n[5]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[6]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[7]: https://saficado.com/contact/ [[Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light]][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* [ABOUT][3]\n* [PRODUCT][4]\n* [CONTACT][5]\n\n###### OUR PRODUCT\n\n## High-grade Crude Avocado Oil\n\n#### 100% Locally Sourced\n\nOur production methodology is distinguished by its commitment to natural processing. Unlike\nconventional extraction techniques that rely on chemical solvents, we employ a sophisticated\nmechanical extraction process that carefully separates oil from the avocado flesh. This approach\nensures we capture the oil\u2019s fundamental characteristics while maintaining its inherent purity.\n\nThe extraction occurs in a carefully controlled environment, with temperature-regulated conditions\nthat protect the oil\u2019s natural properties. Our industrial-grade process is designed to maximize oil\nyield while minimizing mechanical intervention, resulting in a crude oil that serves as an\nexceptional base for various industrial applications.\n\n# We Produce High-grade Crude Avocado Oil Derived From 100% Kenyan-sourced Avocadoes\n\n##### A dedicated group of agricultural experts, logistics professionals, and community advocates\n##### work tirelessly to ensure every shipment meets the highest international standards.\n\n0 0 .\n\n###### EXTRACTION PROCESS\n* Mechanical extraction method\n* Zero chemical processing\n* Temperature-controlled extraction\n* Minimal mechanical intervention\n* Preserves natural oil characteristics\n\n0 0 .\n\n###### QUALITY PARAMETERS\n* Industrial-grade crude oil\n* Suitable for downstream refinement\n* Consistent composition\n* Comprehensive traceability\n* International food safety compliant\n\n0 0 .\n\n###### SHIPPING CONFIGURATION\n* Packaging: 24-tonne food-grade flexi tanks\n* Container Type: 20ft standard shipping container\n* Port of Origin: Mombasa, Kenya\n* Shipping Frequency: Year-round production capability\n\n###### SAFICADO LIMITED\n\n## Shipping and Storage\n\n###### GET IN TOUCH\n\n## INTERESTED IN\n## OUR PRODUCT?\n\n[ LET'S TALK ][6]\n\n###### CONTACT\n\n## We\u2019d Love To\n## Hear From You\n\nWe value your opinion and your feedback matter to us. We typically respond within 24 hours.\n\n[ GET IN TOUCH ][7]\n\nFounded in 2023, Saficado evolved from a strategic vision to elevate African agricultural potential\nthrough specialized crude oil exports.\n\n## contact@saficado.com\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nInstagram\n\n[Contact Us][8]\n\u00a9 2025 Saficado Limited. All rights Reserved\n\n[1]: https://saficado.com\n[2]: https://saficado.com/\n[3]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[4]: https://saficado.com/product/\n[5]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[6]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[7]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[8]: https://saficado.com/contact/ [[Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light]][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* [ABOUT][3]\n* [PRODUCT][4]\n* [CONTACT][5]\n\n## Contact Us\n\n### PHONE\n\n###### OUR HELP DESK IS AVAILABLE MON TO FRI 08:00 AM \u2013 05:00 PM\n\n**+254 799 598033**\n\n### E-MAIL\n\n###### CUSTOMER SERVICE AND QUERIES\n\ncontact@saficado.com\n\n### ADDRESS\n\n###### VISITS ARE POSSIBLE ONLY AFTER RESERVATION\n\nCura Complex,\n\nGatundu \u2013 Juja Road\n\nJuja Town\n\n### PHONE\n\n###### OUR PROFILES IN SOCIAL MEDIA\n\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\n\n###### CONTACT FORM\n\n## DO YOU HAVE A QUESTION?\n\nFounded in 2023, Saficado evolved from a strategic vision to elevate African agricultural potential\nthrough specialized crude oil exports.\n\n## contact@saficado.com\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nInstagram\n\n[Contact Us][6]\n\u00a9 2025 Saficado Limited. All rights Reserved\n\n[1]: https://saficado.com\n[2]: https://saficado.com/\n[3]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[4]: https://saficado.com/product/\n[5]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[6]: https://saficado.com/contact/ saficado.com Home - Saficado\n\nHOME\n\nABOUT\n\nPRODUCT\n\nCONTACT\n\nWHO WE ARE\nSaficado Limited:\nCrude Avocado Oil Producer\n\nPRODUCT\n\nDOWNLOAD PROFILE\n\nPremium Quality Avocado Oil Exports From Kenya\n\nCALL US\n\nSaficado is a leading producer of premium-quality avocado oil. We employ an integrated farmer-to-factory model, sourcing directly from over 1,200 smallholder farmers.\nSaficado implements a robust farm-to-market system that reliably traces the quality and origin of avocados at the farmer level. Our dedicated team of agricultural experts, logistics professionals, and community advocates work diligently to ensure that every shipment complies with the highest international standards.\n\nTONNES / YEAR\nSaficado has the capacity to produce over 1500 metric tonnes of premium quality avocado oil annually.\n\nKENYAN SOURCED\nSourced exclusively from locally cultivated Kenyan Hass and Fuerte avocado varieties.\n\nTONNES BULK EXPORT\n24-tonne flexi tanks, designed for efficient and safe transportation.\n\nFARMERS SUPPORTED\nWe directly collaborate with and empower over 1,200 local farmers,\n\nABOUT\n\nCONTACT\n\nHOW WE WORK\nOur Story\n\nFounded in 2023 as a fresh avocado trader, Saficado evolved into a premium oil producer in 2024, driven by a strategic vision to maximize the value of Kenyan agriculture through premium avocado oil exports.\nStrategically positioned along Thika Superhighway, our company bridges local agricultural resources with global market requirements.\n\nMORE ABOUT US\n\nSAFICADO LIMITED\nOur Process\n\nSTEP 1\nAvocado Sourcing and Collection\nSourcing from Kenyan Hass and Fuerte avocado varieties\nComprehensive farmer support program\nCareful selection of fruits at various ripeness stages\n\nSTEP 2\nIndustrial Extraction and Processing\nMechanical separation of oil from avocado pulp\nChemical-free processing approach\nTemperature-controlled extraction\nMinimized waste production\n\nSTEP 3\nQuality Assurance and Bulk Packaging\nPrecise flexi tank installation\nComprehensive export documentation\nComprehensive laboratory testing\n\nCONTACT\nWe&#8217;d Love To\nHear From You\n\nWe value your opinion and your feedback matter to us. We typically respond within 24 hours.\n\nGET IN TOUCH\n\nFounded in 2023, Saficado evolved from a strategic vision to elevate African agricultural potential through specialized crude oil exports.\n\ncontact@saficado.com\n\nFac"
