        "industries": "Cosmetics; Pharmaceuticals; Food; Ayurvedic Pharmaceuticals; Flavor & Fragrance; Ayurveda; Food and Beverage; Aromatherapy",
        "products": "Carrier Oils, Essential Oils, Herbal Dry & Liquid Extracts, Aromatherapy Oils, Ayurvedic Oils",
