        "crawl_text": "Shiv Sales Pvt. Ltd. Certified by ISO, GMP, Halal, Kosher, USFDA, WHO, HACCP, FSSAI India North America Europe GCC Southeast Asia ISO GMP Halal Kosher USFDA WHO HACCP FSSAI GC/GCMS analysis Cold pressing technology Fractional distillation High-quality standards Ethically sourced ingredients Custom formulation capabilities ISO GMP Halal Kosher USFDA WHO HACCP FSSAI 252, Kotla, Mayur Vihar, Phase -1, New Delhi-110091 B-99, Phase-2, Noida, Uttar Pradesh -201305 India Canada USA Europe Gulf countries Noida, Uttar Pradesh B-99, Phase-2, Noida, Uttar Pradesh -201305 Global Pan-India Over 1500 satisfied clients globally Manufacturing capacity of 15 tons per day 5 warehouses for efficient storage and distribution Established Sivaroma Naturals Pvt. Ltd. with modern lab and technology Opened multiple warehouses in Delhi NCR Expanding global reach Enhancing product quality and customer satisfaction Competition in the natural oils market Maintaining quality standards across production Growing demand for natural and organic products Expansion into new international markets Leading natural oils manufacturer in India Increasing consumer awareness of natural products Expansion of e-commerce channels Shiv Sales: Leading Natural Oils Manufacturer &amp; Supplier in India\n\nAbout Us\n\nProduct\n\nAbsolute Oils\n\nAromatherapy Oil\n\nAromatic Chemicals\n\nAyurvedic Oils\n\nButter &#038; Clay\n\nCarrier Oils\n\nCO2 Oils\n\nEssential Oils\n\nFlavours\n\nFragrance\n\nHerbal Dry &#038; Liquid Extracts\n\nMassage Oils\n\nMint Oils\n\nSpice Oils\n\nBlog &#038; News\n\nCareers\n\nContact\n\n-->\n\nproduct\n\nPartner with India\u2019s Leading Natural Oils Manufacturer and Discover Pure Excellence\n\nWe are recognized for manufacturing and delivering top-quality natural oils that set industry standards.\n\nSuperior Grade Natural Oils, Crafted for Industrial Superiority\n\nOur oils are meticulously processed to ensure top-tier quality, empowering your products with the best the industry has to offer.\n\nTransform Your Offerings with Our Exceptional Quality Oils\n\nElevate your product range with oils known for purity and effectiveness, enhancing value at every level.\n\nAbout Us\n\nWe at Shiv Sales believe in the power of nature and trust that nature plays a crucial role in generating an inner radiance of harmony and balance. That is why we always try our best to bring humans closer to nature with our wide assortments of pure and natural essential oils.\nWe take pride in the fact that we are a leading essential oil manufacturer in India, and our products are world-famous. Our aim to offer our clients an incredible experience encourages us to consistently enhance our products without compromising our core values and the natural properties and quality of our essential oils.\n\nExplore\n\nWhat We Offer\n\nManufacturer & Exporter\n\nAs one of the best essential oils manufacturers & exporters, we specialize in the wholesale distribution of premier natural oils.\n\nPrivate Labeling\n\nWe create distinctive and premium labeling that will not only offer you a unique and tailored experience but will also help you reflect your brand's identity.\n\nCustomer Formulations\n\nWe customize the oil formulations based on your needs and preferences, and that too without compromising the quality.\n\nProduct Range\n\nESSENTIAL OILS\n\nCARRIER OILS\n\nHERBAL DRY & LIQUID EXTRACTS\n\nMINT OILS\n\nABSOLUTE OILS\n\nAYURVEDIC OILS\n\nExplore all Categories\n\nOur Certifications\n\nSupply Chain\n\nSourcing of Raw Materials\n\nWe only source and use the finest raw materials from different parts of the world to ensure our essential oils are only made from the purest botanicals.\n\nProduct Development\n\nOur experts carefully distill and blend raw materials to craft premium and authentic natural oils with perfection.\n\nLab Testing\n\nMaintaining the quality standards is our top priority. We conduct rigorous lab testing to ensure our essential oils' purity, benefits and potency.\n\nSales\n\nOur product journey remains incomplete until we engage and connect with customers and businesses who appreciate the value and quality of our natural essential oils.\n\nTop Reasons To Partner With Shiv Sales\n\nDiscover why choosing Shiv Sales means partnering with the best natural oil manufacturer & exporter that cares about quality, sustainability and customer satisfaction.\n\nQUALITY & PURITY\n\nWe do not consider quality as just a criterion but a commitment to stand out as the best natural oil manufacturer & supplier.\n\nINTERNATIONAL PRESENCE\n\nWe continuously aim to expand our global reach and add more countries to our map which currently includes- Canada, USA, Europe and some other Gulf countries.\n\nBROAD PRODUCT PORTFOLIO\n\nFrom essential and carrier oils to fragrances and flavors, we manufacture more than 500 products to meet the growing needs of our customers.\n\nMANUFACTURING CAPACITY\n\nOur manufacturing unit spread across 1200 m, enables us to have a manufacturing capacity of 15 tons per day.\n\n5 WAREHOUSES\n\nOur current infrastructure setup includes multiple manufacturing units and five storage facilities to store materials efficiently.\n\nACCREDITATIONS\n\nWe proudly adhere to the highest quality standards and hold many certifications like Halal, Kosher, USFDA, WHO, GMP, ISO, HACCP, ISO and FSSAI approved.\n\nCOMPLETE CUSTOMER SATISFACTION\n\nOur commitment to offering 100% customer satisfaction and consistency in maintaining product quality helped us acquire over 1500 satisfied clients, both in India and globally.\n\n25+ YEARS OF EXPERIENCE\n\nOur dedication to researching and manufacturing exceptional products to exceed our customers' expectations has helped us cultivate 25 years of expertise in the industry.\n\nGlobal Reach\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore\n\nDiverse Products\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore\n\nManufacturing\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore\n\nWarehouses\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore\n\nAccreditations\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore\n\nCustomer Satisfaction\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore\n\nIndustry Expertise\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore\n\n-->\n\n-->\n\nBlogs\n\n11 Jun 2026\n\nPure Essential Oils Manufacturer in India | Bulk Essential Oils Supplier for Cosmetics Industry\n\nread more\n\n26 May 2026\n\nBest Cosmetic Butter Manufacturer &#038; Exporter in India\n\nread more\n\n25 May 2026\n\nBest Lavender Oil Manufacturer &#038; Exporter in India\n\nread more\n\nExplore\n\nQUICK LINKS\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nProduct\n\nCareers\n\nFAQ\n\nADDRESS\n\nHead Office\n252, Kotla, Mayur Vihar, Phase -1, New Delhi-110091\n\nFactory\nB-99, Phase-2, Noida,\nUttar Pradesh -201305\n\nCONTACT\n\nFor Domestic Enquiries\ninfo@shivorganics.com\nexport@shivorganics.com\n\nFor International Enquiries\nintsales@shivorganics.com\n\nFor Domestic Enquiries\nPhone: +91 9266613799\nPhone: +91 9266613796\n\nFor International Enquiries\nPhone: +91 8130169024\n\nFOLLOW US ON\n\nSHIV SALES PVT. LTD. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED\n\nPRIVACY POLICY [ [Shiv Sales] ][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Product][3]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Absolute Oils][4]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Aromatherapy Oil][5]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Aromatic Chemicals][6]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Ayurvedic Oils][7]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Butter & Clay][8]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Carrier Oils][9]\n* [[Shiv Sales]CO2 Oils][10]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Essential Oils][11]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Flavours][12]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Fragrance][13]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Herbal Dry & Liquid Extracts][14]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Massage Oils][15]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Mint Oils][16]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Spice Oils][17]\n* [Blog & News][18]\n* [Careers][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n[images]\n[essential oils]\n\n# ABOUT US\n\nLearn more about Shiv Sales, a leading natural oils manufacturer. Uncover our journey and\ndiscover how we deliver top tier natural oils manufactured with expertise.\n* [Home][21]\n* ** About Us**\n\n## GET TO KNOW US\n\nShiv Sales Corporation is an authentic and certified natural oils manufacturer and exporter in\nIndia. Founded in Delhi in 2017, our company has been dedicatedly working towards our mission to\ndeliver ethically produced and high quality natural oils to our clients. Our commitment to ensuring\n100% customer satisfaction and providing value for money products motivates us to manufacture pure\nEssential oils, Carrier oils, Herbal Extracts, Attars, Spices Oils, Aromatherapy oils, Absolute\nNatural Fragrances, etc. With continued development through advanced research, we maintain a high\nstandard of natural products highly suitable for food, pharmaceuticals, cosmetics, ayurvedic\npharmaceuticals, flavor & fragrance and many more industries. Each of our products reflects our\npromise of uncompromising quality and fair practices. Feel free to Contact Us today for more\ninformation!\n\n[essential oils]\n\n## Our Journey: Milestones & Memories\n\nAt Shiv Sales, we strongly believe in making people more mindful of the health benefits and\ntherapeutic qualities of pure plant extracts. That is why constantly improving and using the latest\ntechnology and innovation to offer the best quality oils made from the natural aroma and qualities\nof nature have been our goal since the start of our journey. Here is our wellness journey over the\nyears that we love to share with our customers.\n\n### 1993\n\n### 1994\n\n### 2000\n\n### 2005\n\n### 2006\n\n### 2007\n\n### 2009-10\n\n### 2011-12\n\n### 2013\n\n### 2015\n\n### 2017\n\n### 2018\n\n### 2019\n\n### 2022\n\n### 2023\n\n### 1993\n\nWe started our journey in Delhi at a rented place\n\n### 1994\n\nGot our first two clients!\n\n### 2000\n\nLaid the foundation of Shiv Sales Corporation, Delhi\n\n[Quality]\n\n### 2005\n\nReached our short-term goal by generating double revenue every year\n\n### 2006\n\nGot certified by International Organization for Standardization (ISO)\n\n### 2007\n\nBecame a proud member of Essential Oils Assosiation India (EOAI) and got Good manufacturing practice\n(GMP) certified.\n\n### 2009-10\n\nWe got Halal certified & Spice Board certified Held our first exhibition in Paris\n\n### 2011-12\n\nExhibited in Bangkok & Dubai\n\n### 2013\n\nBecame Fragrances and Flavours Association of India (FAFAI) member\n\n[meeting]\n\n### 2015\n\nGrew our revenue exponentially and opened two warehouses in Noida and Delhi\n\n[meeting]\n\n### 2017\n\nEstablished Sivaroma Naturals Pvt. Ltd with modern lab and technology\n\n[storage]\n\n### 2018\n\nSet up plant for Essential and Carrier oils in Noida\n\n[test lab]\n\n### 2019\n\nGot US FDA certified & Kosher certified Opened three more warehouses in Delhi NCR\n\n### 2022\n\nReached milestone of 800+ happy customers\n\n### 2023\n\nHave become a family of 100 plus happy employees\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/brand-logo1.webp]\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/brand-logo6.webp]\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/brand-logo3.webp]\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/brand-logo4.webp]\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/brand-logo5.webp]\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/brand-logo2.webp]\n[Quality]\n\n## Unwavering Commitment to Quality\n\nSince we have been one of the leading natural fragrance oil companies in India for 25 years, we\nnever fail to offer world-class quality products. Our focus is always on improving the health and\noverall well-being of the community. This goal allows us to run various QAP and testing procedures\nusing GC/GCMS technologies and techniques. Additionally, we have complete control of the conception,\nformulation, manufacturing and packaging processes of all our product lines. It ensures that all our\nproducts are not only chemical free but are made using fresh, pure and carefully selected\ningredients. Overall, we are the foremost natural oils manufacturer and supplier in India that\nprioritizes health while beating high pric"
      },
