            "text": "[ [Shiv Sales] ][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Product][3]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Absolute Oils][4]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Aromatherapy Oil][5]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Aromatic Chemicals][6]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Ayurvedic Oils][7]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Butter & Clay][8]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Carrier Oils][9]\n* [[Shiv Sales]CO2 Oils][10]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Essential Oils][11]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Flavours][12]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Fragrance][13]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Herbal Dry & Liquid Extracts][14]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Massage Oils][15]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Mint Oils][16]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Spice Oils][17]\n* [Blog & News][18]\n* [Careers][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n[images]\n[essential oil]\n\n# Nature's Finest In Every Drop\n\nFind our range of finest ethically produced natural oils\nfor your business.\n* [Home][21]\n* ** Product**\n\n## Explore Our Products\n\nKnowing the fact the oil extraction from sources such as flowers, seeds, plants and roots is a\ndelicate process, we have made ourselves focused towards having completion of all the processing\nworks with ease. At the premise of Sivaroma Naturals Pvt. Ltd, highly experienced personnel using\nsensitive processing technology process the products.\n\n#### Category\n\n[See All][22] [Absolute Oil][23] [Aromatherapy Oil][24] [Aromatic Chemical][25] [Ayurvedic Oil][26]\n[Butter & Clay][27] [Carrier Oil][28] [CO2 Oil][29] [Essential Oil][30] [Flavours][31]\n[Fragrance][32] [Herbal Dry and Liquid Extracts][33] [Massage Oil][34] [Mint Oil][35] [Spice\nOil][36]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Agarwood Oil\n\n][37]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Ajwain Oil\n\n][38]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Almond Oil\n\n][39]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Aloe Vera Oil\n\n][40]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Aloevera Extract D.P\n\n][41]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Aloevera Liquid Extract\n\n][42]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Alpha Humlene\n\n][43]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Alpha Pinene\n\n][44]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Amber Oil\n\n][45]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Amla Extract D.P\n\n][46]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Amla Liquid Extract\n\n][47]\n* [ [gallery-img]\n\n### Amla Seed Oil\n\n][48]\n* [1][49]\n* [2][50]\n* [3][51]\n* [4][52]\n* [5][53]\n\n## Know More About\n\n[ [skin care] ][54]\n\n### [ Your Well-Being Matters To Us][55]\n\n[ We care about you, your well-being and your business. That is why our goal is not only to provide\nexceptional natural oils but to offer 100% customer satisfaction and value for money experience.\n][56]\n\n[ [Quality] ][57]\n\n### [ We Focus On The Quality][58]\n\n[ Since we prioritize improving the ultimate health and well-being of society, we ensure all our\nnatural oils are safe, fresh and pure. Technologies like GC/GCMS analysis that are a part of our QAP\nand testing procedure allow us to ensure the purity, safety and effectiveness of our natural oils.\n][59]\n\n[ [Sustainability] ][60]\n\n### [ Sustainability ][61]\n\n[ We believe in using the power of pure plant extracts and thoughtfully sourced ingredients to offer\nyou excellent products at the best prices. Our natural oils not only enhance well-being but also\npromote a brand that is deeply focused on environmental stewardship. ][62]\n\n### QUICK LINKS\n* * [Home][63]\n* [About Us][64]\n* [Product][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* [FAQ][67]\n\n### ADDRESS\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/location-foot.webp]\n\nHead Office\n\n252, Kotla, Mayur Vihar, Phase -1, New Delhi-110091\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/location-foot.webp]\n\nFactory\n\nB-99, Phase-2, Noida,\nUttar Pradesh -201305\n\n### CONTACT\n\n[email]\n\nFor Domestic Enquiries\n\n[info@shivorganics.com][68]\n[export@shivorganics.com][69]\n\n[email]\n\nFor International Enquiries\n\n[intsales@shivorganics.com ][70]\n\n[call]\n\nFor Domestic Enquiries\n\n[Phone: +91 9266613799][71]\n[Phone: +91 9266613796][72]\n\n[call]\n\nFor International Enquiries\n\n[Phone: +91 8130169024][73]\n\n### FOLLOW US ON\n\nSHIV SALES PVT. LTD. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED\n\n[ PRIVACY POLICY ][74]\n\n[1]: http