            "text": "[ [Shiv Sales] ][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Product][3]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Absolute Oils][4]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Aromatherapy Oil][5]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Aromatic Chemicals][6]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Ayurvedic Oils][7]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Butter & Clay][8]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Carrier Oils][9]\n* [[Shiv Sales]CO2 Oils][10]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Essential Oils][11]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Flavours][12]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Fragrance][13]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Herbal Dry & Liquid Extracts][14]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Massage Oils][15]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Mint Oils][16]\n* [[Shiv Sales]Spice Oils][17]\n* [Blog & News][18]\n* [Careers][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n[images]\n* [Home][21]\n* [Products][22]\n* ** Garlic Oil**\n\n# Garlic Oil\n\nThrough the steam distillation of garlic, we obtain garlic oil, which primarily holds its origins in\nIndia. Garlic oil possesses an unpleasant and pungent odor but behind it\u2019s heavy sulphuric odor lies\na plethora of benefits. It is widely used by athletes since it promises a boost in athletic\ncapabilities. It also covers benefits like moisturized, glowing skin and stronger bones. Get in\ntouch with Shiv Sales, the best Garlic Oil manufacturer and supplier, and experience the advantages\nof working with a top natural oils supplier.\n\n0/5 (0 Reviews)\n* Product Description\n* Packaging\n* Botanical Name: Allium sativum\n* Other Name:Garlic Oil\n* Country of Origin:India\n* Colour:Yellow to orange red\n* Odour:Characteristics\n* Refractive Index:1.540-1.601\n* Specific Gravity:0.990-1.280\n* Optical Rotation:-2 to +2\n* Solubility:Soluble in alcohol & oil, insoluble in water\n* Extraction Method:Steam Distillation\n* Parts Used:Bulbs\n* Major Constituents:alliin, allicin, diallyl sulfide, diallyl disulfide and diallyl trisulfide\n[ Make an enquiry [images]][23]\n\n##### Download PDF\n\n## Similar Products\n\n[ [gallery-img]\n\n### Olibanum Absolute Oil\n\n][24]\n[ [gallery-img]\n\n### Neem Extract D.P\n\n][25]\n[ [gallery-img]\n\n### Natural Caffeine Extract D.P\n\n][26]\n[ [gal