e, premium labeling that reflects\nyour brand identity. Unlike other natural oil manufacturers, we ensure your brand benefits from both\ncustomization and authenticity.\n\n][22] [\n[offer-pic]\n\n### CUSTOM FORMULATIONS\n\nWe offer custom oil formulations according to your requirements with zero compromise on quality.\nThis has made us one of the most reliable names among top-tier natural oil manufacturers worldwide.\n\n][23]\n\n##### Ensuring Quality and Sustainability\n\n## Our Certifications\n\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n\n##### 100% Pure and Natural\n\n## Our Core Products\n\n[ [freshner] ][24]\n[ Almond Oil ][25]\n[ [freshner] ][26]\n[ Castor Oil ][27]\n[ [freshner] ][28]\n[ Groundnut Oil ][29]\n[ [freshner] ][30]\n[ Coconut Oil ][31]\n[ [freshner] ][32]\n[ Jojoba Oil ][33]\n[ [freshner] ][34]\n[ Linseed Oil ][35]\n[ [freshner] ][36]\n[ Malkangni Oil ][37]\n[ [freshner] ][38]\n[ Mustard Oil ][39]\n[ [freshner] ][40]\n[ Neem Oil ][41]\n[ [freshner] ][42]\n[ Sesame Oil ][43]\n[ [freshner] ][44]\n[ Basil Oil ][45]\n[ [freshner] ][46]\n[ Citronella Oil ][47]\n[ [freshner] ][48]\n[ Cardamom Oil ][49]\n[ [freshner] ][50]\n[ Eucalyptus ][51]\n[ [freshner] ][52]\n[ Frankincense Oil ][53]\n[ [freshner] ][54]\n[ Lemongrass Oil ][55]\n[ [freshner] ][56]\n[ Myrrh Oil ][57]\n[ [freshner] ][58]\n[ Palmarosa Oil ][59]\n[ [freshner] ][60]\n[ Rosemary Oil ][61]\n[ [freshner] ][62]\n[ Tea Tree Oil ][63]\n[ [freshner] ][64]\n[ Ylang Ylang Oil ][65]\n[explore ALL ][66]\n\n##### Our USP\n\n## Why Sivaroma?\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Authenticity & Purity\n\nAt Sivaroma, quality is not only a check but a commitment to be the best among natural oil\nmanufacturers.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Global reach\n\nCanada, USA, Europe and some other Gulf countries are all on our map today, and the list continues\nto expand.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Diverse Products\n\nFrom Essential oils and Carrier oils to Herbal Extracts and more, we now manufacture over 500\nproducts.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Manufacturing Capacity\n\nWith a manufacturing unit spread across 1200 meters, we have a manufacturing capacity of 15 tons per\nday.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### 100 % Customer Satisfa [ [logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Products][4]\n  * [Essential Oils][5]\n  * [Ayurvedic Oils][6]\n  * [Carrier Oils][7]\n  * [Aromatic Chemicals][8]\n  * [Herbal Dry & Liquid Extracts][9]\n  * [Butter & Clay][10]\n  * [Mint Oils][11]\n  * [CO2 Oils][12]\n  * [Absolute Oils][13]\n  * [Massage Oils][14]\n  * [Fragrances][15]\n* [News/Events][16]\n* [Careers][17]\n* [Contact][18]\n\n**Error:** Contact form not found.\n\n# Sivaroma\n\n[images]\n\n### Revitalize with\n### Essential Oils\n\n100% pure, natural, and authentic.\n\n[images]\n\n### Quality At\n### Every Step\n\nExperience Nature\u2019s finest with Sivaroma.\n\n[images]\n\n### Natural Essential Oils\n### Manufacturer in India\n\nAlways safe, always pure.\n* [client-logo]\n* [client-logo]\n* [client-logo]\n* [client-logo]\n* [client-logo]\n* [client-logo]\n* [client-logo]\n* [client-logo]\n\n##### About us\n\n## Look Good. Smell Good, Feel Good.\n\nWe at Sivaroma Naturals, at our core, believe that the power of nature is essential for generating\nan inner radiance of harmony and balance. This encourages us to consistently work towards offering\nour clients the finest grade of Essential Oils, Cold Press Carrier Oils and Herbal extracts.\n\nAs one of the leading natural oil manufacturers, we aim to offer a world-class experience to our\nclients and are proud of being globally recognized as the leading manufacturer and supplier of pure\nEssential Oils.\n\n[explore [image]][19]\n[ [about-image]\n[image]\n][20]\n\n##### explore portfolio of\n\n## Our Offerings\n\n[\n[offer-pic]\n\n### MANUFACTURER & EXPORTER\n\nWe specialize in the wholesale distribution of premium natural oils, providing the best quality with\nexceptional value for money. Our reputation as one of the most trusted natural oil manufacturers is\nbuilt on consistency, reliability and unmatched quality.\n\n][21] [\n[offer-pic]\n\n### PRIVATE LABELLING\n\nWe offer a unique and tailored experience by creating distinctive, premium labeling that reflects\nyour brand identity. Unlike other natural oil manufacturers, we ensure your brand benefits from both\ncustomization and authenticity.\n\n][22] [\n[offer-pic]\n\n### CUSTOM FORMULATIONS\n\nWe offer custom oil formulations according to your requirements with zero compromise on quality.\nThis has made us one of the most reliable names among top-tier natural oil manufacturers worldwide.\n\n][23]\n\n##### Ensuring Quality and Sustainability\n\n## Our Certifications\n\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n[images]\n\n##### 100% Pure and Natural\n\n## Our Core Products\n\n[ [freshner] ][24]\n[ Almond Oil ][25]\n[ [freshner] ][26]\n[ Castor Oil ][27]\n[ [freshner] ][28]\n[ Groundnut Oil ][29]\n[ [freshner] ][30]\n[ Coconut Oil ][31]\n[ [freshner] ][32]\n[ Jojoba Oil ][33]\n[ [freshner] ][34]\n[ Linseed Oil ][35]\n[ [freshner] ][36]\n[ Malkangni Oil ][37]\n[ [freshner] ][38]\n[ Mustard Oil ][39]\n[ [freshner] ][40]\n[ Neem Oil ][41]\n[ [freshner] ][42]\n[ Sesame Oil ][43]\n[ [freshner] ][44]\n[ Basil Oil ][45]\n[ [freshner] ][46]\n[ Citronella Oil ][47]\n[ [freshner] ][48]\n[ Cardamom Oil ][49]\n[ [freshner] ][50]\n[ Eucalyptus ][51]\n[ [freshner] ][52]\n[ Frankincense Oil ][53]\n[ [freshner] ][54]\n[ Lemongrass Oil ][55]\n[ [freshner] ][56]\n[ Myrrh Oil ][57]\n[ [freshner] ][58]\n[ Palmarosa Oil ][59]\n[ [freshner] ][60]\n[ Rosemary Oil ][61]\n[ [freshner] ][62]\n[ Tea Tree Oil ][63]\n[ [freshner] ][64]\n[ Ylang Ylang Oil ][65]\n[explore ALL ][66]\n\n##### Our USP\n\n## Why Sivaroma?\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Authenticity & Purity\n\nAt Sivaroma, quality is not only a check but a commitment to be the best among natural oil\nmanufacturers.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Global reach\n\nCanada, USA, Europe and some other Gulf countries are all on our map today, and the list continues\nto expand.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Diverse Products\n\nFrom Essential oils and Carrier oils to Herbal Extracts and more, we now manufacture over 500\nproducts.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Manufacturing Capacity\n\nWith a manufacturing unit spread across 1200 meters, we have a manufacturing capacity of 15 tons per\nday.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### 100 % Customer Satisfaction\n\nOur dedication to customer service and product quality has given us more than 1500 Indian & Globally\nsatisfied clients.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### 25+ years of experience\n\nOur will to research and craft products that meet our clients' growing needs has helped us develop\n25 years of industry expertise.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### 5 Warehouses\n\nOur infrastructure now includes factories and five warehouses for proper storage of materials.\n\n[global reach]\n\n### Accreditations\n\nIn keeping with our excellence, we are Halal, Kosher, USFDA, WHO GMP, ISO 9001:2015, HACCP and\nFSSAI-approved.\n\n##### SUPPLY CHAIN\n\n## Managing the Entire Value Chain\n## from End-to-End\n\n[Product development]\n\n### Sourcing of raw materials\n\nThis includes sourcing the finest raw materials from around the world and ensuring the purest\nbotanicals for our essential oils, as expected from one of the top natural oil manufacturers.\n\n[Product development]\n\n### Product Development\n\nCrafting perfection, our team of experts carefully distills and blends these raw materials for\npremium and authentic natural oils.\n\n[Product development]\n\n### Lab Testing\n\nQuality assurance is our priority. Rigorous lab testing is conducted to guarantee the purity,\npotency, and therapeutic benefits of our oils.\n\n[Product development]\n\n### Sales\n\nOur journey comes full circle as we connect with individuals and businesses who appreciate the value\nof quality essential oils and seek the best natural oil manufacturers.\n\n##### HIGHLIGHTS FROM\n\n## Latest Blogs\n\n[ [U