            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[LinkedIn][2][Instagram][3]\n1-(800) 521-0065 |[PCinfo-us@azelis.com ][4]\n[ [Azelis US PC Logo] ][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* [Company ][7]\n  * [About Azelis][8]\n  * [Company Mission][9]\n  * [Sustainability \u2013 Azelis.com][10]\n* [Products][11]\n* [Formulas ][12]\n  * [Beauty Care][13]\n  * [Color Cosmetics][14]\n  * [All Formulas][15]\n* [Trends ][16]\n  * [Beauty Care Trends][17]\n  * [Color Cosmetics Trends][18]\n* [Markets We Serve][19]\n* [Our Lab][20]\n* [Contact Us][21]\n* Search for:\n* [Home][22]\n* [Company ][23]\n  * [About Azelis][24]\n  * [Company Mission][25]\n  * [Sustainability \u2013 Azelis.com][26]\n* [Products ][27]\n  * Beauty Care Trends\n  * Color Cosmetics Trends\n  * Sustainability Trends\n* [Formulas ][28]\n  * [Beauty Care][29]\n  * [Color Cosmetics][30]\n  * [All Formulas][31]\n* [Trends][32]\n* [Markets We Serve][33]\n* [Contact Us][34]\n* Search for:\n* [Home][35]\n* [Company ][36]\n  * [About Us][37]\n  * [Meet the Sales Team][38]\n  * [Company History][39]\n  * [Company Mission][40]\n  * [News][41]\n  * [Events and Tradeshows][42]\n  * [Product Guide][43]\n  * [Ross \u201cOut & About\u201d][44]\n  * [Overview Video][45]\n  * [Azelis][46]\n* [Product Lines ][47]\n  * [Arkema][48]\n  * [Arxada][49]\n  * [BASF Personal Care][50]\n  * [Beraca/Clariant][51]\n  * [BioOrganic Concepts][52]\n  * [Campo][53]\n  * [Ceapro][54]\n  * [Cargill][55]\n  * [Hallstar Beauty][56]\n  * [Lessonia][57]\n  * [Naolys][58]\n  * [ProTec][59]\n  * [Schill & Seilacher][60]\n  * [Sun Chemical][61]\n  * [Tagra][62]\n  * [View All][63]\n* [Newsletters][64]\n* [Products][65]\n* [Formulas][66]\n* [Intelligent Ingredients ][67]\n  * [Intelligent Ingredients][68]\n  * [Whiteboard Videos][69]\n* [Contact Us ][70]\n  * [General Contact][71]\n  * [Credit Application][72]\n  * [Career Opportunities][73]\n  * [Product Sample Request][74]\n* [Our Lab][75]\nLoading...\nBioOrganic Concepts[[email\u00a0protected]][76]2025-09-26T13:30:07-04:00\n\nBioOrganic Concepts supplies an extensive range of natural ingredients to the cosmetic and personal\ncare industry. The diverse and exotic nature of the extensive BioOrganic Concepts product catalog is\nno accident. Each ingredient serves a particular function with a rich history of use in diverse\nhealth and beauty products. The product list features extraordinary ingredients sourced from\nfar-away places, some familiar, some not. This company was one of the first in the United States to\nintroduce new and unusual natural ingredients to the personal care industry. That tradition\ncontinues today.\n\n## Featured Products\n* **Dermatein^{\u00ae} Hyaluronic Acids:** BioOrganic Concepts offers the highest quality bioengineered\n  hyaluronic acid in a variety of molecular weights\n* **BioNatural^{\u00ae} Tropical Enzyme:** A unique blend of all-natural, non-GMO enzymes used together\n  with conditioning agents. It gently breaks down protein in dead skin and lightly refines &\n  exfoliates the skin surface. The result is brighter, illuminated skin with a noticeably softer and\n  smoother appearance.\n* **BioScent^{\u00ae} Essential Oils:** We offer a range of essential oils including bergamot, chamomile,\n  geranium, grapefruit, lavender, lemon, lime, & peppermint.\n* **BioBlend^{\u00ae} AS:** A concentrated mild surfactant blend designed specifically for alpha-hydroxy\n  acid and beta-hydroxy cleansers \u2013 such as Glycolic and Salicylic Acid cleansers.\n\n#### Contact Us\n\nWest Coast:\n9770 Bell Ranch Drive\nSanta Fe Springs, CA 90670\n\nT. [1-(800) 521-0065][77]\nF. 562-236-5736\n\nEast Coast:\n300 Jefferson Blvd\nWarwick, RI 02888\n\nT. [1-(800) 521-0065][78]\nF. 562-236-5736\n\n#### Links\n* [Home][79]\n* [About Azelis][80]\n* [Add Azelis to Your Mobile Home Screen][81]\n* [Sustainability \u2013 Azelis.com][82]\n* [Welcome to Your Azelis Account][83]\n* [Legal Disclaimer][84]\n* [Terms and Conditions][85]\n* [FAQs][86]\n* [Newsletters][87]\n* [Products][88]\n* [Formulas][89]\n* [Prototypes][90]\n\n[Innovation through formulation]\nCopyright \u00a9 2025 Azelis, LLC | All Rights Reserved\n[LinkedIn][91][Instagram][92]\nThis website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website. By clicking anywhere\non our website you will accept our cookie policy. [ Accept Cookies ][93]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/azelis-beauty-personal-care\n[3]: https://www.instagram.com/weareazelis/\n[4]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2b7b0d081d1c1042450d081a1b19100d081a1a1a10060d081a1a1c10580d081d1f1\n04a0d081a1919104e0d081a1b1310420d081a1a1e100548440d081a1b12100b\n[5]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/\n[6]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/\n[7]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/about/\n[8]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/about/\n[9]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/our-mission/\n[10]: https://www.azelis.com/en/sustainability\n[11]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/#search_products\n[12]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/?post_type=formulations\n[13]: /formulatype/beauty-care/\n[14]: /formulatype/color-cosmetics/\n[15]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/?post_type=formulations\n[16]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/category/trends/\n[17]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/category/beauty-care-trends/\n[18]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/category/color-cosmetics/\n[19]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/markets-we-serve/\n[20]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/our-lab/\n[21]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/contact-us/\n[22]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/\n[23]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/?page_id=900\n[24]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/about/\n[25]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/our-mission/\n[26]: https://www.azelis.com/en/sustainability\n[27]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/?page_id=4622\n[28]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/formulas/\n[29]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/formulatype/beauty-care/\n[30]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/formulatype/color-cosmetics/\n[31]: #\n[32]: #\n[33]: #\n[34]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/contact-us/\n[35]: https://www.azelispc-us.com/\n[3