.\n\ngroups\n\n#### 500+ Clients\n\nServing diverse industries across the globe with our premium solutions.\n\n## What Our Clients Say\n\nTrusted by brands worldwide\n\n[Client]\n\n#### Viktor Villand\n\n\u201cWe\u2019ve been working with Aromaaz International for close to a year now, and the experience has been\nexcellent. The thing that really stands out is their responsiveness- whenever we need something,\nthey are quick to reply and get things moving. Their pricing is fair, and they are very supportive\nwith shipments, which makes the whole process smooth.If you ever get the chance, meet them at one of\nthe beauty fairs and connect with the owner Mr. Gaurav -it\u2019s worth it. They have the capability to\nproduce whatever products you need, as long as you know your requirements. .\u201d\n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n[Client]\n\n#### \u7d46\u306e\u96eb\n\n\u201cYour products are of high quality and reasonably priced, unmatched by others. The fact that you can\npromptly disclose information regarding quality is proof of the excellence of your products. Above\nall, I would like to express my gratitude to Mr. Gupta. He arranged the goods quickly and\nefficiently. I trust your company and look forward to continuing our business together.\u201d\n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2606\n[Client]\n\n#### Sahana Prabhu\n\n\u201cExcellent experience working with Aromaaz! Their vast product portfolio, commitment to quality, and\ncustomization options exceeded our expectations. The team was very supportive in providing documents\nand samples, making it easy for us to evaluate and finalize our requirements. Their dedication to\nsustainability and customer support is truly impressive. Highly recommended!\u201d\n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n[Client]\n\n#### Karthik Manoharan\n\n\u201cOrdered essential oils from Aromaaz International and had a great experience. Spoke with their team\nwhile placing the order \u2014 super helpful and friendly. The oils came well packed, smell authentic,\nand feel high quality. Really happy with both the service and the product.\u201d\n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n[Client]\n\n#### Nisar Basheer\n\n\u201cWe recently sourced Lemongrass Essential Oil from Aromaz International and are highly satisfied\nwith the product quality. The oil is 100% pure, with a fresh and consistent aroma that reflects its\nauthenticity. It blends well for various applications, including aromatherapy, personal care, and\nproduct formulations. Packaging was professional, ensuring the product reached us in excellent\ncondition, and the delivery was prompt. The pricing is also competitive compared to the market,\nwhich adds value for bulk and business purchases.\u201d\n\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n\n## Aromaaz Certifications\n\nTrusted globally for quality, sustainability, and authenticity.\n\n[ISO Certified]\n\n#### ISO Certified\n\nInternationally recognized quality standards.\n\n[Organic Standard]\n\n#### Organic Standard\n\nPure and natural with certified organic practices.\n\n[Eco Friendly]\n\n#### Eco Friendly\n\nSustainability and environment-friendly commitment.\n\n[Global Trust]\n\n#### Global Trust\n\nTrusted by customers across 50+ countries.\n\n## Ready to Build Your Brand with Us?\n\nConnect with us at [sales@aromaazinternational.com][52]\n\n[Start Your Private Label Journey][53]\n[[Aromaaz Logo]][54]\n\n### Information\n* [About Us][55]\n* [Shipping][56]\n* [Packaging Quality][57]\n* [Assurance][58]\n* [Shipping Policy][59]\n* [Disclaimer][60]\n* [Blog][61]\n* [Sitemap][62]\n\n### Contact Info\n\n**Aromaaz International Pvt Ltd**\nB - 45/8, Shahibabad Industrial Area Site - 4,\nShahibabad, Ghaziabad,\nUttar Pradesh 201010\n\n**Mob:** [+91-9643342464][63]\n**Mob:** [+91-9650050730][64]\n**Landline:** [+91-120-4118804][65]\n[ sales@aromaazinternational.com ][66] [ customercare@aromaazinternational.com ][67] [\nAromaazinternational@gmail.com ][68]\n\n### Product Categories\n* [Natural Essential Oils][69]\n* [Organic Essential Oil][70]\n* [Carrier Oils / Base Oils][71]\n* [Organic Carrier Oils][72]\n* [Hydrosols / Floral Water][73]\n* [Floral Absolute Oil][74]\n* [Liquid Herbals Extracts][75]\n* [Natural Cosmetic Butters][76]\n* [Aromatic Chemicals][77]\n* [Ayurvedic Herbal Oils][78]\n\nUSA UK Canada Australia Germany France UAE Singapore South Africa Netherlands Italy Spain New\nZealand Brazil Russia Japan South Korea China Mexico Malaysia Vietnam Indonesia Saudi Arabia Qatar\nTurkey Thailand Bangladesh Nepal Bhutan Sri Lanka Kenya Nigeria Philippines\n\nCopyright @2025 aromaazinternational.com\n\n[1]: index.html\n[2]: tel:+919650050730\n[3]: mailto:sales@aromaazinternational.com\n[4]: https://wa.me/919643342464\n[5]: #\n[6]: natural-essential-oils/index.html\n[7]: organic-essential-oil/index.html\n[8]: carrier-oils/index.html\n[9]: organic-carrier-oil/index.html\n[10]: hydrosols/index.html\n[11]: floral-absolute-oils/index.html\n[12]: liquid-herbals-extracts/index.html\n[13]: natural-cosmetic-butters/index.html\n[14]: aromatic-chemicals/index.html\n[15]: ayurvedic-herbal-oil/index.html\n[16]: info/about-us.html\n[17]: info/privacy-policy.html\n[18]: info/certification.html\n[19]: contact.html\n[20]: info/our-distillation.html\n[21]: info/steam-distillation.html\n[22]: info/cold-pressed.html\n[23]: info/solvent-extraction.html\n[24]: info/fractional-distillation.html\n[25]: info/refractive-index.html\n[26]: info/co2-extraction.html\n[27]: info/private-labeling.html\n[28]: inquiry.html\n[29]: info/private-labeling.html\n[30]: info/custom-blends.html\n[31]: info/wholesale.html\n[32]: info/secure-shopping.html\n[33]: info/packaging.html\n[34]: info/barrel-packaging.html\n[35]: info/private-packaging.html\n[36]: info/worldwide-delivery.html\n[37]: info/dhl.html\n[38]: info/fedex.html\n[39]: info/ups.html\n[40]: info/international-shipping.html\n[41]: info/commercial-cargo.html\n[42]: info/worldwide-delivery.html\n[43]: info/quality-assurance.html\n[44]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/blog/\n[45]: index.html\n[46]: tel:+919643342464\n[47]: tel:+919650050730\n[48]: tel:+911204118804\n[49]: mailto:sales@aromaazinternational.com\n[50]: mailto:Aromaazinternational@gmail.com\n[51]: mailto:customercare@aromaazinternational.com\n[52]: mailto:sales@aromaazinternational.com\n[53]: mailto:sales@aromaazinternational.com\n[54]: index.html\n[55]: info/about-us.html\n[56]: info/shipping.html\n[57]: info/packaging.html\n[58]: info/quality-assurance.html\n[59]: info/shippingpolicy.html\n[60]: info/disclaimer.html\n[61]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/blog\n[62]: #\n[63]: tel:+919643342464\n[64]: tel:+919650050730\n[65]: tel:+911204118804\n[66]: mailto:sales@aromaazinternational.com\n[67]: mailto:customercare@aromaazinternational.com\n[68]: mailto:Aromaazinternational@gmail.com\n[69]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/natural-essential-oils/index.html\n[70]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/organic-essential-oil/index.html\n[71]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/carrier-oils/index.html\n[72]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/organic-carrier-oil/index.html\n[73]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/hydrosols/index.html\n[74]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/floral-absolute-oils/index.html\n[75]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/liquid-herbals-extracts/index.html\n[76]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/natural-cosmetic-butters/index.html\n[77]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/aromatic-chemicals/index.html\n[78]: https://www.aromaazinternational.com/ayurvedic-herbal-oil/index.html"
