the evolution of botanical extracts. Atomm Botanicals is a\nleader in the development of natural active substances and works with partners and growers. Our R&D\nteam is dedicated to creating technology to unlock and maximise the benefits of botanical species\nfor the cosmetic and pharmaceutical industries, and they are leading research on some of the most\npotent plant-based concentrates in the world.\n\nUsing a ground-breaking extraction technique, all extracts and oils are offered\u00a0in the liquid\ncarrier matrix of the plant to harness the potent phytoactives without the use of chemicals.\nAtomm Botanicals\u2019 products\u00a0maintain\u00a0the integrity of native botany responsibly, ethically, and while\nmaintaining excellent levels of quality, service, and delivery. It bridges the gap between the\ncomplicated needs of the consumer and the actual power of untouched nature.\nAtomm botanicals procure the finest selection of top ingredients grown and brewed to deliver\npowerful nutrients to your skin. We use the finest ingredients and techniques to create herbal\nblends that will hydrate your skin without fail.\n\n## Our Products\n\nBest Sellers New Launches\n\n### Avocado Oil\n\n(Persea Americana)\n\n### Brahmi Extract\n\n(Bacopa Monnieri)\n\n### Argan Oil\n\n(Argania Spinosa)\n\n### Shea Butter\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n### Olive Extract\n\n(Olea Europaea)\n\n### Mulberry Extract\n\n(Morus Alba)\n\n### Acai Berry Extract\n\n(Euterpe Oleracea)\n\n### Bakuchi Oil\n\n(Psoralea Corylifolia)\n\n### Murumuru Butter\n\n(Astrocaryum Murumuru)\n\n### Cocoa Oil\n\n(Theobroma Cacao)\n\n### Shea Oil\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n### Babassu Oil\n\n(Attalea Speciosa)\n\n### Kakadu Plum Extract\n\n(Terminalia Ferdinandiana)\n\nBest Sellers\nNew Launches\nBest Sellers\n\n### Brahmi Extract\n\n(Bacopa Monnieri)\n\n### Argan Oil\n\n(Argania Spinosa)\n\n### Olive Extract\n\n(Olea Europaea)\n\n### Mulberry Extract\n\n(Morus Alba)\n\n### Shea Butter\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n#