            "url": "https://avokadfruits.co.ke",
            "text": "Avokad Fruits (K) Limited &#8211; Your Trusted Partner for Premium Avocados and Avocado Oil\n\nSkip to content\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nProducts\n\nHow We Work\n\nSustainability\n\nCareers\n\nGallery\n\nContact Us\n\nAvokad Fruits Kenya\n\nYour Trusted Partner for Premium Avocados and Avocado Oil\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited is proud to be Kenya\u2019s leading exporter of avocados and avocado oil, catering to the growing global demand for high-quality, healthy, plant-based products.\n\nExplore Our Products\n\nPremium Products\n\nDelivering high-quality avocado oil, fresh fruits, and nutritious nuts.\n\nSustainable Practices\n\nCommitted to eco-friendly production and responsible sourcing for the environment.\n\nGlobal Reach\n\nSupplying premium plant-based products to meet international market demands.\n\nWhy Choose Us?\n\nNurturing Nature, Delivering Quality\n\nAbout Us\n\nAs the largest avocado exporter in East Africa, we specialize in delivering fresh avocados and cold-pressed avocado oil to Europe and beyond, adhering to the highest standards of quality and sustainability.\nOur success stems from a commitment to excellence at every stage of production and processing. We work closely with farmers across Embu, Meru, Kirinyaga, Nyeri, Murang\u2019a Counties, and beyond; constantly empowering them through access to better markets and training in sustainable agricultural practices.\n\nFarmers\n\nM +\n\nFruits\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Commitment to Sustainability\n\nAt Avokad Fruits (K) Limited, we pride ourselves on our ethical sourcing and dedication to best labor practices, ensuring that every product reflects our values of integrity and sustainability. By leveraging cutting-edge technology and innovative processing techniques under the Export Processing Zones (EPZ) program, we deliver avocados and avocado oil that meet the stringent quality demands of European markets.\nWhether you are looking for the finest fresh avocados or nutrient-rich avocado oil, Avokad Fruits (K) Limited guarantees unmatched quality, a commitment to sustainability, and a passion for connecting the best of Africa\u2019s produce with the world. Partner with us today and join a movement that values health, taste, and community.\n\nContact Us\n\nAvokad Fruits Kenya\n\nDelivering Excellence to the World\n\nOur strategic location in Kenya, combined with a robust supply chain, allows us to export to regions that prioritize wellness and sustainability.\n\nGet Started\n\nOur Products\n\nExplore Our Premium Products\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited offers premium, sustainably sourced products for global markets, including cold-pressed avocado oil, fresh export-grade avocados, macadamia nuts, and mangoes. Each product reflects our commitment to quality, sustainability, and health-conscious consumers.\n\nGet Started\n\nAvocado Oil\n\nPremium, cold-pressed, antioxidant-rich, versatile.\n\nOrder Now\n\nMacadamia Nuts\n\nButtery, rich, crunchy, high-quality.\n\nOrder Now\n\nFresh Avocado Fruits\n\nExport-grade, handpicked, fresh, flavorful.\n\nOrder Now\n\nMangoes\n\nDelicious, smooth, carefully processed, premium.\n\nOrder Now\n\nHow We Work\n\nFrom Nature to Your Table, Crafted with Care\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited offers premium, sustainably sourced products for global markets\n\nExplore Our Products\n\nBrowse our range of premium avocado oil, fresh avocados, macadamia nuts, and mangoes.\n\nPlace Your Order\n\nContact us via email, phone, or our online form to request a quote or make an order.\n\nReceive Your Products\n\nWe ensure timely export and delivery, maintaining the highest quality standards throughout the process.\n\nBecome a Supplier with Avokad Fruits Kenya\n\nAre you a farmer growing high-quality avocados, macadamia and/or mangoes? Join Avokad Fruits Kenya , Kenya's leading platform connecting avocados, macadamia and mango farmers with buyers locally and internationally. By registering as a supplier, you gain access to a wider market, fair prices, and opportunities to grow your farming business.\n\nRegister\n\nKenya\u2019s leading exporter of avocados and avocado oil, catering to the growing global demand for high-quality, healthy, plant-based products.\n\nUseful Links\n\nHome\n\nWho We Are\n\nProducts\n\nHow We Work\n\nSustainability\n\nCareers\n\nGallery\n\nContact Us\n\nGet in Touch\n\nP.O Box 306-60100, Embu Kenya\n\ninfo@avokadfruits.co.ke\n\n+254 111 860860\n\nSubscribe Now\n\n\u00a92026. Avokad Fruits (K) Limited. All Rights Reserved.\n\nStaff Email Login\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nScroll to Top"
