        "crawl_text": "Avolio Industries Sustainable sourcing from local farmers Commitment to quality and purity Efficient production line with 8-tonne per hour capacity Plot 500, Kazinga, Namanve Industrial Area, P. O. Box 103986 Kampala, Uganda Uganda Global Avolio\n\nYou should check in on some of those fields below.\n\n&times;\n\n-->\n\nWelcome to Avolio\n\n-->\n\n-->\n\n-->\n\n+256 744 600 000\n\ninfo@avolio.co.ug\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nOur Impact\n\nCareers\n\nWhy work with us\n\nDistributorship Careers\n\nFarmers\n\nExperienced Professionals\n\nMedia\n\nOur Stories\n\nMedia Gallery\n\nContact Us\n\nRequest For A Quote\n\nLeading the Way in bulk\n\nCold-Pressed Avocado\nOil Production\n\nExplore Our Products\nReach Us\n\nDelivering sustainable\n\nHigh-quality\navocado oil\n\nLearn More\nReach Us\n\nPrecision-engineered\n\nSolutions for a\nhealthier future.\n\nLearn More\nReach Us\n\nSelection\n\nThe finest selection\n\nCold Pressing\n\nPreserving Nutrients & Flavor\n\nFiltration\n\nFiltered to perfection\n\nPackaging\n\nMore than just a product\n\nThe Avolio Process\n\nFrom Uganda's finest avocados to your production line - our cold-pressed oils are rich in nutrients and flavor, available in bulk tanks for global distribution.\n\nogenix\n\n5 Years Of Excellence\n\nThe Avolio Process\n\nA Commitment to Quality and Purity\n\nInnovation Meets Tradition\n\nAt Avolio Industries, we specialize in producing premium avocado oil using sustainable methods. Our commitment to quality and eco-conscious practices ensures that every product supports both health and the environment.\n\nSetting the standard for bulk organic and crude avocado oil. Our 8-tonne per hour production line ensures efficiency while maintaining purity and quality, shipped globally in large tanks.\n\nAvolio is an industry leader in the production and supply of 100% natural Ugandan avocado oil, setting the standard for quality and sustainability in the sector. With a commitment to purity and excellence, Avolio delivers avocado oil that is cold-pressed and unrefined, ensuring that every bottle captures the full nutritional benefits and rich flavors of the Ugandan avocados used.\n\nExperience the pure essence of nature with Avolio\n\nDiscover more\n\nOur Services\n\nPremium Avocado Oil\n\nand Tailored Industrial Solutions\n\nPremium Avocado Oil\n\nAvocado Oil Production\n\nOrganic, edible, and crude avocado oil-cold-pressed using cutting-edge techniques that maintain purity for culinary\nand cosmetic applications.\n\nLearn More\n\nBulk\nProduction\n\nSustainable\nSourcing\n\nGlobal\nShipping\n\nCustom Engineering\nSolutions\n\nBe healthy & eat only\n\nfresh organic vegetables\n\nOur Sourcing\n\nSustainably sourced from\nsmall Ugandan farms\n\nAvolio ensures ethical practices that empower farmers and promote organic farming.\nWe guarantee the highest standards in bulk avocado oil supply for the global market.\n\nWhy Choose Avolio\n\nEthically sourced\n\nWe ethically source avocados from local farmers, ensuring fair compensation while promoting sustainable and organic farming practices.\n\nHass Seedlings\n\nEmpowerment\n\nSustainability\n\nOrganic\n\nOur Impact\n\nWhat they're saying about Avolio!\n\nOur avocado oil fuels both the beauty and food industries worldwide. Through sustainable practices and ethical sourcing, we contribute to healthier products and stronger communities.\n\nAvolio's Impact\n\n\",\" \"],\n\"responsive\": {\n\"0\": {\n\"items\": 1\n\"768\": {\n\"items\": 1\n\"992\": {\n\"items\": 1\n\"1200\": {\n\"items\": 1\n}'>\n\nAs a single mother of 3 kids, i have managed to provide the basic needs for my children and afford them a decent education. This has all been possible because Avolio gave me an opportunity to earn.\n\nGloria Tereza\n\n. Distributor.\n\n-->\n\nLargest Ugandan Avocado Oil\nProducer.\n\nSeeds Issued Monthly\n\nLtrs Processed Daily\n\nFrom the Blog Posts\n\nLatest news updates\n\n& articles\n\nby Admin\n\nShowcasing the value addition impact.\n\nRead More\n\n20 Sep\n\nby Admin\n\nAvolio's commitment to empowerment.\n\nRead More\n\n20 Sep\n\nApartment\n\nby Admin\n\nAvolio's Commitment & sustainability\n\nRead More\n\n20 Sep\n\nAvolio was founded by a group of motivated individuals who came together to maximize the use of Ugandan avocados and empower local farmers in Uganda.\n\nExplore\n\nHome\n\nAbout Avolio\n\nOur Impact\n\nContact Us\n\nOur Gallery\n\nFAQs\n\nCareers\n\nWhy Work With Avolio\n\nFarmers\n\nDstributors\n\nProfessionals\n\nNews\n\nReach Us\n\nPlot 500, Kazinga, Namanve Industrial Area, P. O. Box 103986 Kampala, Uganda\n\n+256 744 600 000\n\ninfo@avolio.co.ug\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2024 by Avolio All rights reserved\n\nDeveloped by\n\ninfo@avolio.co.ug\n\n+256 744 600 000\n\n-->\n\n-->\n\nSend Your Request Welcome to Avolio\n* [+256 744 600 000][1]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][2]\n* [Home ][3]\n* [About ][4]\n* [Our Impact ][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Why work with us][7]\n* [Distributorship Careers][8]\n* [Farmers][9]\n* [Experienced Professionals][10]\n* [Media][11]\n* [Our Stories][12]\n* [Media Gallery][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n\nRequest For A Quote\n* [Home][15]\n* /\n* About\n\n## About us\n\nGet to Know us\n\n## Who We Are\n\nAvolio Industries is Uganda's leading supplier of bulk crude and edible avocado oil. Our oils are\nsourced sustainably from Uganda's finest avocados, empowering local farmers and promoting\neco-friendly practices in every step of production.\"\n\nAt Avolio, we are passionate about bringing the purest and most natural avocado oil to the world.\n\n### 5\n\nYears of\nExcellence\n* Largest Ugandan Avocado Oil\nProducers\n* ### 00\n\nSeeds Issued Monthly\n* ### 00\n\nLtrs Processed Daily\n\n## Avocado Oil\n## The Better Choice.\n\n### Mission Statement\n\nTo sustainably produce bulk crude and organic avocado oil, driving environmental responsibility\nwhile empowering local farmers and supporting global manufacturers.\n\n### Vision Statement\n\nTo become the worlds leading supplier of bulk organic and crude avocado oil, setting benchmarks for\nsustainability, ethical sourcing, and global impact.\n\n### From Ugandan Farms to Global Manufacturers - 100% Natural, Bulk Avocado Oil\n\nOur cold-pressed avocado oil, sourced directly from Uganda's finest farms, is rich in healthy fats,\nvitamins, and antioxidants. Available in bulk, it serves the needs of global food and cosmetic\nmanufacturers, offering unmatched quality in every tank.\n\n### Core Values\n\n###### Innovation\n\nConstantly advancing bulk oil extraction techniques for optimal quality.\n\n###### Sustainability\n\nEnsuring eco-friendly and organic farming practices to protect the environment.\n\n###### Customer-Centric\n\nTailoring bulk oil solutions to meet client needs in both culinary and cosmetic industries.\n\n###### Integrity\n\nUpholding ethical practices, transparency, and trust at every stage of production.\n\nAvolio was founded by a group of motivated individuals who came together to maximize the use of\nUgandan avocados and empower local farmers in Uganda.\n\n### Explore\n* [Home][16]\n* [About Avolio][17]\n* [Our Impact][18]\n* [Contact Us][19]\n* [Our Gallery][20]\n* [FAQs][21]\n\n### Careers\n* [Why Work With Avolio][22]\n* [Farmers][23]\n* [Dstributors][24]\n* [Professionals][25]\n* [News][26]\n\n### Reach Us\n\nPlot 500, Kazinga, Namanve Industrial Area, P. O. Box 103986 Kampala, Uganda\n* [+256 744 600 000][27]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][28]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2024 by [Avolio][29] All rights reserved\n* [Developed by [Itabari]][30]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][31]\n* [+256 744 600 000][32]\n\nSend Your Request\n\n[1]: tel:256744600000\n[2]: mailto:info@avolio.co.ug\n[3]: https://avolio.co.ug/\n[4]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[5]: https://avolio.co.ug/impact\n[6]: #\n[7]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[8]: https://avolio.co.ug/distributors\n[9]: https://avolio.co.ug/farmers\n[10]: https://avolio.co.ug/professionals\n[11]: #\n[12]: https://avolio.co.ug/news\n[13]: https://avolio.co.ug/gallery\n[14]: https://avolio.co.ug/contact\n[15]: https://avolio.co.ug/\n[16]: https://avolio.co.ug/\n[17]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[18]: https://avolio.co.ug/impact\n[19]: https://avolio.co.ug/contact\n[20]: https://avolio.co.ug/gallery\n[21]: https://avolio.co.ug/faqs\n[22]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[23]: https://avolio.co.ug/farmers\n[24]: https://avolio.co.ug/distributors\n[25]: https://avolio.co.ug/professionals\n[26]: https://avolio.co.ug/news\n[27]: tel:+256744600000\n[28]: mailto:info@avolio.co.ug\n[29]: #\n[30]: https://www.itabari.co.ug\n[31]: mailto:info@avolio.co.ug\n[32]: tel:+256744600000 Welcome to Avolio\n* [+256 744 600 000][1]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][2]\n* [Home ][3]\n* [About ][4]\n* [Our Impact ][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Why work with us][7]\n* [Distributorship Careers][8]\n* [Farmers][9]\n* [Experienced Professionals][10]\n* [Media][11]\n* [Our Stories][12]\n* [Media Gallery][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n\nRequest For A Quote\n* [Home][15]\n* /\n* Contact\n\n## Contact Us\n\nGet in Touch with Avolio Industries\n\n## Get in Touch with Avolio.\n\nWe're here to answer any questions about our premium cold-pressed avocado oil and tailored\nsolutions. Whether you're looking for bulk orders, custom solutions, or simply want to learn more\nabout our sustainability practices, we'd love to hear from you.\n* Have question?\n\n#### [+256 744 600 000][16]\n* Email Address.\n\n#### [info@avolio.co.ug][17]\n* Our Offices.\n\n#### Plot 500, Kazinga, Namanve Industrial Area,\n#### P. O. Box 103986 Kampala, Uganda\n* Business Hours\n\n#### Monday - Friday: 9 AM - 5 PM\n\n#### Saturday: 10 AM - 2 PM\n\nWrite a Message\n\n## We're always here to\n## help you\n\nService / Inquiry Type Avocado Oil Bulk Orders Partnerships Custom Solutions General Inquiry\n\nSend Your Inquiry\n\nAvolio was founded by a group of motivated individuals who came together to maximize the use of\nUgandan avocados and empower local farmers in Uganda.\n\n### Explore\n* [Home][18]\n*