ore\n\nOur Services\n\nPremium Avocado Oil\n\nand Tailored Industrial Solutions\n\nPremium Avocado Oil\n\nAvocado Oil Production\n\nOrganic, edible, and crude avocado oil-cold-pressed using cutting-edge techniques that maintain purity for culinary\nand cosmetic applications.\n\nLearn More\n\nBulk\nProduction\n\nSustainable\nSourcing\n\nGlobal\nShipping\n\nCustom Engineering\nSolutions\n\nBe healthy & eat only\n\nfresh organic vegetables\n\nOur Sourcing\n\nSustainably sourced from\nsmall Ugandan farms\n\nAvolio ensures ethical practices that empower farmers and promote organic farming.\nWe guarantee the highest standards in bulk avocado oil supply for the global market.\n\nWhy Choose Avolio\n\nEthically sourced\n\nWe ethically source avocados from local farmers, ensuring fair compensation while promoting sustainable and organic farming practices.\n\nHass Seedlings\n\nEmpowerment\n\nSustainability\n\nOrganic\n\nOur Impact\n\nWhat they're saying about Avolio!\n\nOur avocado oil fuels both the beauty and food industries worldwide. Through sustainable practices and ethical sourcing, we contribute to healthier products and stronger communities.\n\nAvolio's Impact\n\n\",\" \"],\n\"responsive\": {\n\"0\": {\n\"items\": 1\n\"768\": {\n\"items\": 1\n\"992\": {\n\"items\": 1\n\"1200\": {\n\"items\": 1\n}'>\n\nAs a single mother of 3 kids, i have managed to provide the basic needs for my children and afford them a decent education. This has all been possible because Avolio gave me an opportunity to earn.\n\nGloria Tereza\n\n. Distributor.\n\n-->\n\nLargest Ugandan Avocado Oil\nProducer.\n\nSeeds Issued Monthly\n\nLtrs Processed Daily\n\nFrom the Blog Posts\n\nLatest news updates\n\n& articles\n\nby Admin\n\nShowcasing the value addition impact.\n\nRead More\n\n20 Sep\n\nby Admin\n\nAvolio's commitment to empowerment.\n\nRead More\n\n20 Sep\n\nApartment\n\nby Admin\n\nAvolio's Commitment & sustainability\n\nRead More\n\n20 Sep\n\nAvolio was founded by a group of motivated indivi