            "text": "Welcome to Avolio\n* [+256 744 600 000][1]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][2]\n* [Home ][3]\n* [About ][4]\n* [Our Impact ][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Why work with us][7]\n* [Distributorship Careers][8]\n* [Farmers][9]\n* [Experienced Professionals][10]\n* [Media][11]\n* [Our Stories][12]\n* [Media Gallery][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n\nRequest For A Quote\n* [Home][15]\n* /\n* About\n\n## About us\n\nGet to Know us\n\n## Who We Are\n\nAvolio Industries is Uganda's leading supplier of bulk crude and edible avocado oil. Our oils are\nsourced sustainably from Uganda's finest avocados, empowering local farmers and promoting\neco-friendly practices in every step of production.\"\n\nAt Avolio, we are passionate about bringing the purest and most natural avocado oil to the world.\n\n### 5\n\nYears of\nExcellence\n* Largest Ugandan Avocado Oil\nProducers\n* ### 00\n\nSeeds Issued Monthly\n* ### 00\n\nLtrs Processed Daily\n\n## Avocado Oil\n## The Better Choice.\n\n### Mission Statement\n\nTo sustainably produce bulk crude and organic avocado oil, driving environmental responsibility\nwhile empowering local farmers and supporting global manufacturers.\n\n### Vision Statement\n\nTo become the worlds leading supplier of bulk organic and crude avocado oil, setting benchmarks for\nsustainability, ethical sourcing, and global impact.\n\n### From Ugandan Farms to Global Manufacturers - 100% Natural, Bulk Avocado Oil\n\nOur cold-pressed avocado oil, sourced directly from Uganda's finest farms, is rich in healthy fats,\nvitamins, and antioxidants. Available in bulk, it serves the needs of global food and cosmetic\nmanufacturers, offering unmatched quality in every tank.\n\n### Core Values\n\n###### Innovation\n\nConstantly advancing bulk oil extraction techniques for optimal quality.\n\n###### Sustainability\n\nEnsuring eco-friendly and organic farming practices to protect the environment.\n\n###### Customer-Centric\n\nTailoring bulk oil solutions to meet client needs in both