            "url": "https://avolio.co.ug/contact",
            "text": "Welcome to Avolio\n* [+256 744 600 000][1]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][2]\n* [Home ][3]\n* [About ][4]\n* [Our Impact ][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n* [Why work with us][7]\n* [Distributorship Careers][8]\n* [Farmers][9]\n* [Experienced Professionals][10]\n* [Media][11]\n* [Our Stories][12]\n* [Media Gallery][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n\nRequest For A Quote\n* [Home][15]\n* /\n* Contact\n\n## Contact Us\n\nGet in Touch with Avolio Industries\n\n## Get in Touch with Avolio.\n\nWe're here to answer any questions about our premium cold-pressed avocado oil and tailored\nsolutions. Whether you're looking for bulk orders, custom solutions, or simply want to learn more\nabout our sustainability practices, we'd love to hear from you.\n* Have question?\n\n#### [+256 744 600 000][16]\n* Email Address.\n\n#### [info@avolio.co.ug][17]\n* Our Offices.\n\n#### Plot 500, Kazinga, Namanve Industrial Area,\n#### P. O. Box 103986 Kampala, Uganda\n* Business Hours\n\n#### Monday - Friday: 9 AM - 5 PM\n\n#### Saturday: 10 AM - 2 PM\n\nWrite a Message\n\n## We're always here to\n## help you\n\nService / Inquiry Type Avocado Oil Bulk Orders Partnerships Custom Solutions General Inquiry\n\nSend Your Inquiry\n\nAvolio was founded by a group of motivated individuals who came together to maximize the use of\nUgandan avocados and empower local farmers in Uganda.\n\n### Explore\n* [Home][18]\n* [About Avolio][19]\n* [Our Impact][20]\n* [Contact Us][21]\n* [Our Gallery][22]\n* [FAQs][23]\n\n### Careers\n* [Why Work With Avolio][24]\n* [Farmers][25]\n* [Dstributors][26]\n* [Professionals][27]\n* [News][28]\n\n### Reach Us\n\nPlot 500, Kazinga, Namanve Industrial Area, P. O. Box 103986 Kampala, Uganda\n* [+256 744 600 000][29]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][30]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2024 by [Avolio][31] All rights reserved\n* [Developed by [Itabari]][32]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][33]\n* [+256 744 600 000][34]\n\nSend Your Request\n\n[1]: tel:256744600000\n[2]: mailto:info@avolio.co.ug\n[3]: https://avolio.co.ug/\n[4]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[5]: https://avolio.co.ug/impact\n[6]: #\n[7]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[8]: https://avolio.co.ug/distributors\n[9]: https://avolio.co.ug/farmers\n[10]: https://avolio.co.ug/professionals\n[11]: #\n[12]: https://avolio.co.ug/news\n[13]: https://avolio.co.ug/gallery\n[14]: https://avolio.co.ug/contact\n[15]: https://avolio.co.ug/\n[16]: tel:+256744600000\n[17]: mailto:info@avolio.co.ug\n[18]: https://avolio.co.ug/\n[19]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[20]: https://avolio.co.ug/impact\n[21]: https://avolio.co.ug/contact\n[22]: https://avolio.co.ug/gallery\n[23]: https://avolio.co.ug/faqs\n[24]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[25]: https://avolio.co.ug/farmers\n[26]: https://avolio.co.ug/distributors\n[27]: https://avolio.co.ug/professionals\n[28]: https://avolio.co.ug/news\n[29]: tel:+256744600000\n[30]: mailto:info@avolio.co.ug\n[31]: #\n[32]: https://www.itabari.co.ug\n[33]: mailto:info@avolio.co.ug\n[34]: tel:+256744600000"
