            "text": "* [China][1]\n* [Hong Kong][2]\n* [ 01664 501110][3]\n* [ My Account ][4]\n* [Register][5]\n* [Login][6]\n* [ Wish List (0)][7]\n* [ Shopping Cart][8]\n* [ Checkout][9]\n[[Base Formula]][10]\n0 item(s) - \u00a30.00\n* Your shopping cart is empty!\n[Trustpilot][11]\n[FREE P&P ON UK ORDERS OVER \u00a360*][12]\nShop Menu\n* [Reseller Packs][13]\n* [+-][14] AROMATHERAPY\n[Aromatherapy Oils][15]\n* [Essential Oils][16]\n* [Organic Essential Oils][17]\n* [Absolute Oils][18]\n* [Essential Oil Infusions & Dilutions][19]\n* [Carrier Oils][20]\n* [Organic Carrier Oils][21]\n* [Aromatherapy Kits][22]\n[Aromatherapy Blends][23]\n* [Pre-blended Essential Oils][24]\n* [Aromatherapy Pulse Point Rollers][25]\n* [Aromatherapy Massage Oils][26]\n* [Aromatherapy Massage Waxes][27]\n* [Aromatherapy Spritzes][28]\n* [Aromatherapy Stones][29]\n[View All AROMATHERAPY][30]\n* [ORGANIC][31]\n* [+-][32] BASES & INGREDIENTS\n[Cosmetic Bases][33]\n* [Bath & Shower Bases][34]\n* [Cream & Lotion Bases][35]\n* [Facial Cleansing Bases][36]\n* [Haircare Bases][37]\n[Cosmetic Ingredients][38]\n* [Cosmetic Additives][39]\n* [Natural Butters][40]\n* [Natural Clays][41]\n* [Natural Salts][42]\n[View All BASES & INGREDIENTS][43]\n* [+-][44] GELS & HYDROLATS\n[Aloe Vera Gels][45]\n[Eye Gels][46]\n[Hydrolats][47]\n[Face Mask Kits][48]\n[View All GELS & HYDROLATS][49]\n* [+-][50] SKINCARE\n[Face & Body][51]\n* [Aloe Vera Gels][52]\n* [Eye Gels][53]\n* [Hydrolats][54]\n* [Natural Clays][55]\n* [Face Mask Kits][56]\n* [Facial Oils][57]\n* [Neroli Range][58]\n* [Rose Range][59]\n* [Recovery Range][60]\n* [Aromatherapy Massage Oils][61]\n* [Handmade Soaps][62]\n[Fragrance Free ][63]\n* [Bath & Shower Bases][64]\n* [Cream & Lotion Bases][65]\n* [Facial Cleansing Bases][66]\n[Skin Type][67]\n* [Dry Skin][68]\n* [Mature Skin][69]\n* [Normal Skin][70]\n* [Oily Skin][71]\n* [Sensitive Skin][72]\n[View All SKINCARE][73]\n* [+-][74] ACCESSORIES\n[Aromatherapy Cases][75]\n[Aromatherapy Diffusers][76]\n[Blending Equipment][77]\n[View All ACCESSORIES][78]\n* [+-][79] PACKAGING\n[Aromatherapy Bottles][80]\n[Cosmetic Jars][81]\n[Caps & Closures][82]\n[View All PACKAGING][83]\n* [BLOG][84]\n* [+-][85] SPECIAL OFFERS\n[Latest Offers][86]\n[Clearance][87]\n[View All SPECIAL OFFERS][88]\n* [About Us][89]\n\n# About Us\n\n### An Introduction\n\nBase Formula is one of the UK\u2019s leading aromatherapy suppliers. We supply over 5000 therapists and\n40 training colleges in the UK with premium grade essential oils, carrier oils, massage oils,\ncosmetic bases and other aromatherapy supplies. We also have customers across the world including a\nstrong presence in the US and South-East Asia.\n\n### Our Founders\n\nThe company was founded by Chris Keating in 1996 and was initially operated as a small home based\nbusiness. Having previously worked with essential oils, Chris' aim was to offer high quality\naromatherapy oils without the high price tag! Chris was later joined by his wife, and trained\naromatherapist, Karen, and together they have grown the business to what it is today.\n\nChris and Karen remain at the heart of the company, which is now based in Melton Mowbray,\nLeicestershire. Melton Mowbray is known as England's 'Rural Capital of Food' and is most famous for\nits pork pies and stilton cheese!\n\n### ATC Member\n\nBase Formula is a registered member of the [Aromatherapy Trade Council][90] (ATC). The ATC is the\ntrade association for the specialist aromatherapy essential oil trade, and represents manufacturers\nand suppliers of aromatherapy products as well as the interest of consumers in the United Kingdom.\nAs members of the ATC, Base Formula are committed to consumer safety and responsible marketing,\nconsistent high standards (essential oils must be of the purist quality) and providing accurate,\nup-to-date information on our products. We are bound by the ATC's voluntary code of practice for\nsafety, labelling and packaging, and our oils are subject to a random testing and verification\nprogramme at independent laboratories. Out of the many hundreds of aromatherapy businesses in the UK\nonly 57 companies, including Base Formula, are actually registered members of the ATC.\n\n### IFA & IPFA Members\n\nWe are also corporate members of the [International Federation of Aromatherapists][91] (IFA) and the\n[International Federation of Professional Aromatherapists][92] (IFPA) - both of which are\ninternationally recognised with members throughout the world.\n\n### Our Expertise\n\nBase Formula employs highly qualified aromatherapists and natural health experts who are committed\nto developing top quality products for professional use and for customers to use at home. They are\nalways on hand to offer their advice and answer any natural health questions that our customers\nmight have. Please click [here][93] to read more about our Consultant Aromatherapists. Base\nFormula\u2019s expertise is also well respected within the media and our aromatherapists are often asked\nto contribute expert advice to magazines, websites and blogs. Visit our media page for more\ninformation.\n\nTo find out more and to view our latest news please click [here][94]!\n\n### Follow us\n\n### Subscribe to our news, advice and offers\n\nSubscribe\n[[Complimentary Health Professionals]][95]\n[[The International Federation of Aromatherapists]][96]\n[[The Aromatherapy Trade Council ]][97]\n[[The International Federation of Professional Aromatherapists]][98]\n[Trustpilot][99]\n\n##### Base Formula\n* [About Us][100]\n* [Meet Our Therapists][101]\n* [International][102]\n* [Job Opportunities][103]\n* [Base Formula News][104]\n* [Media Coverage][105]\n* [Site Map][106]\n\n##### Students & Therapists\n* [Therapist Discounts][107]\n* [Wholesale Products][108]\n* [Product Development][109]\n* [Aromatherapy Kits][110]\n* [Kits for Colleges][111]\n* [Specials][112]\n\n##### General\n* [Contact Us][113]\n* [FAQ's][114]\n* [Delivery & Returns][115]\n* [Terms & Condi