            "url": "https://eatwellwell.com/contact/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [Eat Well Well] ][2]\nMenu\n* [Recipes][3]\n* [Main Dishes][4]\n* [Casseroles][5]\n* [Desserts & Baking][6]\n* [Cookies][7]\n* [Salads][8]\n* [Soups][9]\n* [Air Fryer Recipes][10]\n* [Vegetarian Diet][11]\n* [Weight Loss Meals][12]\n* [Wellness][13]\n* [About Us][14]\n[][15]\n\n# Contact\n\nWe\u2019d love to hear from you!\n\nWhether you have a question, feedback, a collaboration idea, or just want to say hi, we\u2019re here for\nit. EAT WELL WELL is all about community, connection, and making your time in the kitchen more\njoyful.\n\nPlease use the contact form below to get in touch. We typically respond within 2\u20133 business days.\n\n**Prefer email?** You can reach us directly at:\n**contact@eatwellwell.com**\n\nWe respect your privacy. For details on how we handle your data, please read our [Privacy\nPolicy][16].\n\nThanks for stopping by!\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nFirst\nLast\nEmail *\nMessage Comment Email\nComment or Message\nSubmit[Loading]\n[][17] [][18] [][19] [][20]\n\n[Abby pinkmann Eat well well]\n\n## Abby Pinkmann\n\nI'm Abby Pinkmann, founder of EatWellWell and a passionate home cook based near Austin, Texas. I\ncreated EatWellWell to share simple, flavorful recipes that make healthy eating enjoyable and\naccessible for everyone. Every recipe is carefully developed and tested before publication to ensure\nreliable results. For nutrition, healthy eating, and weight-loss content, we review information from\ntrusted sources such as the [National Institutes of Health (NIH)][21], [Mayo Clinic][22], and\n[Harvard Health][23] to help provide accurate, trustworthy, and up-to-date information for our\nreaders.\n[][24] [][25] [][26] [][27]\n\n## Recent Recipes\n\n[[Gluten free casserole recipe baked with chicken rice and cheese]][28]\n\n### [Gluten Free Casserole Recipe: Easy, Comforting, and Family-Friendly][29]\n\n[[Low carb casserole recipe baked with cheese, broccoli, and ground beef]][30]\n\n### [Low Carb Casserole Recipe: Easy, Cheesy, and Family-Friendly Dinner][31]\n\n[[Stuffed pepper casserole recipe with ground beef rice and melted cheese]][32]\n\n### [Stuffed Pepper Casserole Recipe: Easy Family Dinner With Classic Flavor][33]\n\n[[Cheddar bay biscuit casserole with golden garlic cheddar biscuit topping]][34]\n\n### [Cheddar Bay Biscuit Casserole: The Ultimate Comfort Food Dinner][35]\n\n[Dish image]\n\n**\u00a9 2026 Eat Well Well**\n\n[**About**][36]\n\n[**Privacy policy**][37]\n\n[**Terms & conditions**][38]\n\n[**Disclaimer**][39]\n\n[**Contact**][40]\n\nClose\n* [Recipes][41]\n* [Main Dishes][42]\n* [Casseroles][43]\n* [Desserts & Baking][44]\n* [Cookies][45]\n* [Salads][46]\n* [Soups][47]\n* [Air Fryer Recipes][48]\n* [Vegetarian Diet][49]\n* [Weight Loss Meals][50]\n* [Wellness][51]\n* [About Us][52]\nSearch for:\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://eatwellwell.com/\n[3]: https://eatwellwell.com/blog/\n[4]: https://eatwellwell.com/main-dishes/\n[5]: https://eatwellwell.com/casseroles/\n[6]: https://eatwellwell.com/desserts-baking/\n[7]: https://eatwellwell.com/cookies/\n[8]: https://eatwellwell.com/salads/\n[9]: https://eatwellwell.com/soups/\n[10]: https://eatwellwell.com/air-fryer-recipes/\n[11]: https://eatwellwell.com/vegetarian-diet/\n[12]: https://eatwellwell.com/weight-loss/\n[13]: https://eatwellwell.com/wellness/\n[14]: https://eatwellwell.com/about-us/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://eatwellwell.com/privacy-policy/\n[17]: https://x.com/eat_wellwell\n[18]: https://www.pinterest.com/Eatwellwell/\n[19]: https://www.facebook.com/eatwellwell/\n[20]: https://www.instagram.com/eat.well.well/\n[21]: https://www.nih.gov/\n[22]: https://www.mayoclinic.org/\n[23]: https://www.health.harvard.edu/\n[24]: https://x.com/eat_wellwell\n[25]: https://www.pinterest.com/Eatwellwell/\n[26]: https://www.instagram.com/eat.well.well/\n[27]: https://www.facebook.com/eatwellwell/\n[28]: https://eatwellwell.com/gluten-free-casserole-recipe/\n[29]: https://eatwellwell.com/gluten-free-casserole-recipe/\n[30]: https://eatwellwell.com/low-carb-casserole-recipe/\n[31]: https://eatwellwell.com/low-carb-casserole-recipe/\n[32]: https://eatwellwell.com/stuffed-pepper-casserole-recipe/\n[33]: https://eatwellwell.com/stuffed-pepper-casserole-recipe/\n[34]: https://eatwellwell.com/cheddar-bay-biscuit-casserole/\n[35]: https://eatwellwell.com/cheddar-bay-biscuit-casserole/\n[36]: https://eatwellwell.com/about-me/\n[37]: https://eatwellwell.com/privacy-policy/\n[38]: https://eatwellwell.com/terms-and-conditions/\n[39]: https://eatwellwell.com/disclaimer/\n[40]: https://eatwellwell.com/contact/\n[41]: https://eatwellwell.com/blog/\n[42]: https://eatwellwell.com/main-dishes/\n[43]: https://eatwellwell.com/casseroles/\n[44]: https://eatwellwell.com/desserts-baking/\n[45]: https://eatwellwell.com/cookies/\n[46]: https://eatwellwell.com/salads/\n[47]: https://eatwellwell.com/soups/\n[48]: https://eatwellwell.com/air-fryer-recipes/\n[49]: https://eatwellwell.com/vegetarian-diet/\n[50]: https://eatwellwell.com/weight-loss/\n[51]: https://eatwellwell.com/wellness/\n[52]: https://eatwellwell.com/about-us/"
