        "email": "dotan@frontek-usa.com",
        "phone": "+1 (914) 918-2211",
        "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/front-tek/",
        "website": "https://frontek-usa.com",
        "industries": "Construction; Architecture; Building Materials; Interior Design",
        "products": "Frontek Facade System; Custom Colors; Argos Interior Panels; XXL Panels; Pavements; Countertops; CV8028 Colored Panel; M6002 Metal-like Panel; M6001 Metal-like Panel; MT7005 Metal-like Panel; V1007 Facade Panel; V1001; V1002; V1003; SV112; C8002; C8007 Colored Panel; C8008 Colored Panel; C8009 Colored Panel",
        "certifications": "ICC Certified; Global EPDs",
        "distributors": "",
        "customers": "",
        "partnerships": "",
        "crawl_text": "Frontek USA LLC ICC Certified North America ICC Certified Global EPDs Lightweight and easy to install Maintenance-free Excellent thermal and acoustic insulation ASTM E119 NFPA 285 ASTM E136 1695 Curtiss Court, La Verne, CA 91750 USA Rainscreen System Manufacturer - Frontek Porcelain Facades\n\nAbout us\n\nProducts\n\nFrontek Facade\n\nTextured\n\nSoft Stone Cladding Panels\n\nStone-like Cladding Panels\n\nWood-like Cladding Panels\n\nColored Panels\n\nVolume\n\nMetal-like Cladding Panels\n\nCustomize color\n\nXXL\n\nArgos\n\nPavements\n\nCountertops\n\nXXL\n\nProjects\n\nTechnical Resources\n\nEducational\n\nContact us\n\nSelect Page\n\nExtruded porcelain facade systems\n\nThe Frontek revolutionary cladding system is double-ventilated extruded porcelain. It\u2019s ICC Certified with Global EPDs and offers CRAFTMANSHIP that blends a passion for ART with the latest TECHNICAL advances. The Frontek difference.\n\nTechnical inquiry\n\nInstallation videos\n\nOUR PRODUCTS\n\nFrontek\n\nFACADE SYSTEM\n\nFrontek\n\nCUSTOM COLORS\n\nArgos\n\nINTERIOR PANELS\n\nXXL\n\nExpand the possibility of facade design with our outstanding XXL size extruded ceramic pieces that, at 1,000 x 3,000 mm, have unmatched beauty, lightness, and versatility.\n\nWHAT IS FRONTEK?\n\nFrontek is an ICC-certified complete extruded porcelain open-jointed rainscreen system.\n\nThe double-ventilated facade panels are extruded porcelain in an optically flat honeycomb structure. It is a single source solution for the complete building envelope that meets or exceeds code requirements, utilizes a standard frame and connections, while giving design teams complete design flexibility.\n\nThe Frontek complete system (tiles &amp; Plus structure) weighs only 6.55lb/sf. and come in a limitless variety of colors, designs and sizes ranging from 300 x 800 mm to 1000 x 3000 mm.\n\nADVANTAGES\n\n&nbsp;\n\nThe system designed specifically for exterior fa\u00e7ade, it stands out for its great strength, durability, and smooth installation. It\u2019s extremely hard, lightweight, and long-lasting.\n\nSuperior Product\n\nAvailable in 80+ colors, the range of creativity is virtually limitless. Textures, sizes, and colors can be manufactured and customized on request.\n\nElegant Design\n\nAn astonishingly low water absorption rate (only 0.1%) makes for a truly weather-resistant material and virtaully no maintenance.\n\nLow Water Absorption\n\nExcellent sound protection, Frontek achieves acoustic improvements around 4dBA in the range of 1000 Hz, with the ventilation layer furthering the noise barrier effect.\n\nAcoustic\n\nRead more\n\nDownload Textures, Technical Guides, and More\n\nAdd free technical resources to your project library.\n\nOur products exist to elevate your buildings. We invite you to use our textures, guides, wall assemblies and more in your projects.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nSee our technical resources \u2192\n\nLet\u2019s talk\n\nHOW WE CAN HELP YOUR NEXT FACADE PROJECT\n\nCONTACT US\n\nInformation\n\nAbout us\nProducts\nEducational\nResources\nOur Blog\nContact us\nSite map\nLog in\n\nCOPYRIGHT \u00a9 2024 FRONTEK USA LLC \u00b7 PRIVACY POLICY\n\n&larr;\n\nContact Us!\n\nInterested in an offer? Get in touch!\n\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue to use this site we will assume that you are happy with it. Ok Privacy policy About | Frontek Residential & Commercial Facade System\n[ [Frontek] ][1]\n* [About us][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Frontek Facade][4]\n* [Textured][5]\n* [Soft Stone Cladding Panels][6]\n* [Stone-like Cladding Panels][7]\n* [Wood-like Cladding Panels][8]\n* [Colored Panels][9]\n* [Volume][10]\n* [Metal-like Cladding Panels][11]\n* [Customize color][12]\n* [XXL][13]\n* [Argos][14]\n* [Pavements][15]\n* [Countertops][16]\n* [XXL][17]\n* [Projects][18]\n* [Technical Resources][19]\n* [Educational][20]\n* [Contact us][21]\nSelect Page\n\nABOUT US\n\nWe make the best panels and tiles for the outside and inside of your building, from the best\nmaterial, period.\n[See the proof][22]\n\nFRONTEK USA LLC represents Greco Gres, a company based in Spain with a long tradition in ceramics,\nwhose origins date back to 1940.\n\nThe experience accumulated over decades in our production plants dedicated to the production of\nhigh-tech ceramic products has enabled us to position ourselves nationally and internationally as a\n**benchmark in the distribution of porcelain,** ventilated facades, porcelain stoneware and klinker\nproducts.\n\nOUR PRODUCTS\n\n# RELIABILITY AND INSULATION\n\nThe revolutionary ventilated facade system is an exclusive piece of extruded ceramic that has\nexcellent technical qualities.\n\n# ELEGANT AND MAJESTIC\n\nDiscover the new generation of large format flooring, wall tiles and countertops, from 800 \u00d7 800 mm\nto 1300 \u00d7 3200 mm.\n\nThe Frontek\u2122 Rainscreen Extruded Porcelain Siding System Strength\nMaintenance Free\nHigh resistance and durability\nAn all-weather material\nElimination of thermal bridges\n- energy saving up to 35%\nLightweight and easy to install\nUnlimited variety of\ncolors and textures\nRemarkably easy\nto Cut on site\nReduce thermal\njumps\nExcellent Acoustic\ninsulation\n\n#### Exceeds all ICC Fire Resistance Requirements\n\nPorcelain, a naturally non-combustible material, married with the Frontek open joint cladding\nsystem, **easily meets fire code requirements**. Frontek is compliant with ASTM E119, NFPA 285, and\nASTM E136.\n\n#### Factory Recti\ufb01ed\n\nAll four sides of each panel edge is grinded after firing. This \u201crectification\u201d process is done\nbefore leaving the factory production line and ensures that every panel edge is extremely precise\nwhere no shrinkage or expansion occurs after installation.\nThe attention to detail is immaculate.\n\n#### An all-weather material\n\nWith excellent performance against the most demanding environmental conditions, **Frontek\u2019s**\nresistance to different weather conditions is superior and steadfast.\n\n#### Lightweight & Flexible\n\n**The Frontek complete system** (panels & Plus Structure) weigh only 6.55lb/sf. Panels come in a\nwide **variety of colors, designs** and sizes ranging from 15.95 x 31.50 inches to 39.3 x 118\ninches.\n\nAll facade panels can be **adapted to any building peculiarity** and its surroundings. Even cut,\nexposed areas such as kerf saw cuts, mitered corner joints, or open corners don\u2019t need sealing or\ncoating.\n\n#### Acoustic Insulation\n\nProviding excellent protection from sound, the Frontek System achieves acoustic improvements around\n4dBA in the range of 1000 Hz where the human ear is most sensitive. In addition to protecting\ninhabitants against noise from the outside, sound leakage from the inside is also alleviated. And\nbecause there is a ventilation layer, the **rainscreen system further increases the noise barrier\neffect**.\n\n#### Virtually no maintenance\n\nThe high density and extremely low absorption rates of porcelain doesn\u2019t allow dirt or graffiti to\nstick to it. Installed in an open joint cladding application, there is no efflorescence, no drips,\nand no stains. So, your cladding is maintenance-free.\n\nExtruded Porcelain\nVs Traditional Materials\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFeatu\u2502Frontek Extruded Porcelain \u2502Fiberc\u2502Terracotta\u2502ACM \u2502Natural Stone \u2502Fibercem\u2502GRC\nre \u2502 \u2502ement \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502ent \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502produc\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502Product \u2502\n\u2502 \u2502t type\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502Type 2 \u2502\n\u2502 \u25021 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAESTH\u2502Any design/texture is possible \u2502Glazed\u2502Traditiona\u2502Laminat\u2502Only one nature \u2502Limited \u2502Limited\nETIC \u2502 \u2502 \u2502l glazing \u2502ed \u2502 \u2502designs \u2502designs\nVERSA\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502paint \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nTILIT\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\nY \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nBREAK\u25021349 lbf (6000N) \u2502779 \u2502944lbf \u2502Elastic\u2502Depends on the \u2502Unknown \u2502\nING \u2502 \u2502lbf \u2502(4200N) \u2502ity \u2502type (igneous, \u