            "url": "https://frontek-usa.com/products/",
            "text": "Product Line Archive | Frontek\n[ [Frontek] ][1]\n* [About us][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Frontek Facade][4]\n* [Textured][5]\n* [Soft Stone Cladding Panels][6]\n* [Stone-like Cladding Panels][7]\n* [Wood-like Cladding Panels][8]\n* [Colored Panels][9]\n* [Volume][10]\n* [Metal-like Cladding Panels][11]\n* [Customize color][12]\n* [XXL][13]\n* [Argos][14]\n* [Pavements][15]\n* [Countertops][16]\n* [XXL][17]\n* [Projects][18]\n* [Technical Resources][19]\n* [Educational][20]\n* [Contact us][21]\nSelect Page\n\nOUR PRODUCTS\n\n[Frontek Facade System][Frontek Facade System]\n\nFrontek\n\n### **FACADE SYSTEM**\n\n[Frontek Custom Colors][Frontek Custom Colors]\n\nFrontek\n\n### CUSTOM COLORS\n\n[Front-Tek ARGOS Interior Panels][Front-Tek ARGOS Interior Panels]\n\nArgos\n\n### INTERIOR PANELS\n\nXXL\nExpand the possibility of facade design with our outstanding **XXL size extruded ceramic pieces**\nthat, at 1,000 x 3,000 mm, have unmatched beauty, lightness, and versatility.\n[Front-Tek XXL Products][Front-Tek XXL Products]\n\n# Inside-Outside\n# System\n\n**Frontek** Two Layers system is our innovative solution showing the versatility of our panels by\npushing the boundaries of design.\nIt is the ventilated fa\u00e7ade system that is born from the evolution of **Frontek Super plus system**,\nproviding all the advantages of our system with the compositional flexibility of** design that\nallows the placement of different depths on the same fa\u00e7ade, with inner and outer pieces in two\ndifferent layers, this solution adds a volumetric and sculptural effect to your facade**.\n\nCombining the wide range of **Frontek** panel colors and textures as well as the use of different\nsizes in modules, a world of possibilities emerges to add aesthetic and architectural value to your\ndesign that gives each project a unique character.\nWith this system, there are infinite options that give each project a unique character.\n\n[DOWNLOAD TECHNICAL DOSSIER][22]\n\n# LATTICE\n\n**Frontek** expands its range with the launch of ALFA Lamas,\nan exclusive piece for lattices, compatible with any system\nof the ventilated facade **Frontek** and the traditional facade\ncladding system.\n\nAn exquisite piece in Venice slat style available in different\nsizes and any finish of the collection.\n\nThe new collection for lattices **Frontek** offers a solution for\nimproving the energy efficiency of the facade, enhancing\nnatural ventilation. A high-tech product that can be placed in\nfixed and mobile systems.\n\n[DOWNLOAD TECHNICAL DOSSIER][23]\n\n# GRID\n\nWe present a new piece of grid that it is added to the wide\nrange of solutions offered by Frontek for the coating of last\ngeneration fa\u00e7ades.\n\nA new piece of extruded ceramics specially designed for\nsolutions in spaces where it is necessary to hide and\nprotect, also allowing the circulation of air.\n\n[DOWNLOAD TECHNICAL DOSSIER][24]\n\nFRONTEK GALLERY\n\nTxagorritu Hospital, Spain.\n\nSouth Asia Mall, China\n\nShanghai International Trade Center, China\n\nApartment building, Spain.\n\n## Let\u2019s talk\n\nHOW WE CAN HELP YOUR NEXT FACADE PROJECT\n\n[CONTACT US][25]\nInformation\n[About us][26] [Products][27] [Educational][28] [Resources][29] [Our Blog][30] [Contact us][31]\n[Site map][32] [Log in][33]\n[][34] [][35] [][36]\n\nCOPYRIGHT \u00a9 2024 FRONTEK USA LLC \u00b7 [PRIVACY POLICY][37]\n* \u2190\n* Contact Us!\n\n### Interested in an offer? Get in touch!\n\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue to use\nthis site we will assume that you are happy with it.[Ok][38][Privacy policy][39]\n\n[1]: https://frontek-usa.com/\n[2]: https://frontek-usa.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://frontek-usa.com/products/\n[4]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-frontek-facade/\n[5]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/textured/\n[6]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/soft/\n[7]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/nature/\n[8]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/wood/\n[9]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/colored-panels/\n[10]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/volume/\n[11]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/metal/\n[12]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-color-page/\n[13]: https://frontek-usa.com/xxl-products/\n[14]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-argos/\n[15]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-argos-pavements/\n[16]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-argos-countertops/\n[17]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-argos-xxl/\n[18]: https://frontek-usa.com/featured/\n[19]: https://frontek-usa.com/resources/\n[20]: https://frontek-usa.com/educational/\n[21]: https://frontek-usa.com/contact-us/\n[22]: /wp-content/uploads/2021/02/FRONTEK-Inside-Outside-System-Dossier-.pdf\n[23]: /wp-content/uploads/2021/02/LATTICE-SYSTEM.pdf\n[24]: /wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Frontek-piece-405x80-1.pdf\n[25]: https://frontek-usa.com/contact-us/\n[26]: https://frontek-usa.com/about-us/\n[27]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-frontek-facade/\n[28]: https://frontek-usa.com/educational/\n[29]: https://frontek-usa.com/resources/\n[30]: https://frontek-usa.com/blog/\n[31]: https://frontek-usa.com/contact-us/\n[32]: https://frontek-usa.com/site-map/\n[33]: https://frontek-usa.com/login/\n[34]: https://www.facebook.com/FrontekUS\n[35]: https://www.instagram.com/frontekusa/\n[36]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/front-tek/\n[37]: /privacy-policy/\n[38]: #\n[39]: https://frontek-usa.com/privacy-policy/"
