            "text": "Contact | Frontek Residential & Commercial Facade Systems\n[ [Frontek] ][1]\n* [About us][2]\n* [Products][3]\n* [Frontek Facade][4]\n* [Textured][5]\n* [Soft Stone Cladding Panels][6]\n* [Stone-like Cladding Panels][7]\n* [Wood-like Cladding Panels][8]\n* [Colored Panels][9]\n* [Volume][10]\n* [Metal-like Cladding Panels][11]\n* [Customize color][12]\n* [XXL][13]\n* [Argos][14]\n* [Pavements][15]\n* [Countertops][16]\n* [XXL][17]\n* [Projects][18]\n* [Technical Resources][19]\n* [Educational][20]\n* [Contact us][21]\nSelect Page\n\n# GET IN TOUCH\n\nWe\u2019d love to hear from you. Here\u2019s how you can reach us.\n\n### Have an inquiry?\n\nFill out this form\n\n### Want to set up a meeting?\n\n[click here][22]\n\n*Name\n\n*Email\n\n*Company\n\n*Phone\n\nSubmit\n\n*Name\n\n*Email\n\n*Company\n\n*Phone\n\nSubmit\n\nSet up a meeting\n\n#### PHONE\n\n+1 (914) 918-2211\n\n#### EMAIL\n\ndotan@frontek-usa.com\n\n#### ADDRESS\n\n1695 Curtiss Court,\n\nLa Verne, CA 91750\n\n## Let\u2019s talk\n\nHOW WE CAN HELP YOUR NEXT FACADE PROJECT\n\n[CONTACT US][23]\nInformation\n[About us][24] [Products][25] [Educational][26] [Resources][27] [Our Blog][28] [Contact us][29]\n[Site map][30] [Log in][31]\n[][32] [][33] [][34]\n\nCOPYRIGHT \u00a9 2024 FRONTEK USA LLC \u00b7 [PRIVACY POLICY][35]\n* \u2190\n* Contact Us!\n\n### Interested in an offer? Get in touch!\n\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue to use\nthis site we will assume that you are happy with it.[Ok][36][Privacy policy][37]\n\n[1]: https://frontek-usa.com/\n[2]: https://frontek-usa.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://frontek-usa.com/products/\n[4]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-frontek-facade/\n[5]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/textured/\n[6]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/soft/\n[7]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/nature/\n[8]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/wood/\n[9]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/colored-panels/\n[10]: https://frontek-