 Line][121]\n* [Papaya Processing Line][122]\n* [Kiwifruit Processing Line][123]\n* [Sea Buckthorn Processing Line][124]\n* [Dragon Fruit Processing Line][125]\n* [Longan/Litchi Processing Line][126]\n* [Cherry Processing Line][127]\n* [Acai Berry Processing Line][128]\n* [Cactus Pear Processing Line][129]\n* [Food Sauce&Beverage Processing Line ][130]\n* [Chili Sauce Production Line][131]\n* [Ginger Garlic Paste Production Line][132]\n* [Ketchup Production Line][133]\n* [Onion Paste Processing Line][134]\n* [RTD Tea Drinks Processing Line][135]\n* [Reconstituted Juice Dilution Line][136]\n* [NFC Juice Production Line][137]\n* [Liquid Egg Processing Line][138]\n* [Bottled Water Production Line][139]\n* [Carbonated Drinks Production Line][140]\n* [Milk Beverage Processing Line][141]\n* [Fermented Juice Processing Line][142]\n* [Milk&Dairy Processing Line ][143]\n* [Pasteurized Milk Processing Line][144]\n* [UHT Milk Processing Line][145]\n* [Yogurt Processing Line][146]\n* [Condensed Milk Processing Line][147]\n* [Milk Powder Production Line][148]\n* [Plant-based Milk Processing Line ][149]\n* [Soybean Milk Processing Line][150]\n* [Oat Milk Processing Line][151]\n* [Almond Milk Processing Line][152]\n* [Contact Us][153]\n* [Blogs ][154]\n* [Project Case Share][155]\n* [Get Quote][156]\nSearch for:\n[Home][157]/About Us\nAbout Us[admin][158]2023-03-27T08:46:25+00:00\n\n**Who We Are**\n\nEstablished in 2005, Shanghai Beyond Machinery is developing into a solid engineering and high-tech\nenterprise, who is mainly specialized in supplying turn-key projects for fruit&vegetable,\nmilk&dairy, plant-based milk, fruit jam and sauce, beverage and juice processing lines to clients in\ndomestic and overseas. The company combines scientific research and development, process design\nservice, engineering contracting, equipment manufacturing, installation, commissioning and trainee\nas an integrated.\n\nThanks to so many excellent staff in technical and marketing hardworking, through 15 years of\ndevelopment, we have grown bigger with 400 registered employees and 75,000 square meters workshop\nnow. With strong hardware and software, we have the faith to keep providing excellent service to\nclients beyond their expectations.\n\nWe adhere to food hygiene regulations, strictly control equipment quality, distribute in a more\nflexible and invigorated working surrounding development, and help our customers be more successful\nin the corresponding areas by offering better products and services.\n\nWe would like to cooperate with the same occupations to develop Chinese light industry machinery and\nwelcome warmly our old and new customers visiting and viewing.\n\n**Beyond History and Milestone:**\n\n\u2014In the Year of 2005, Our President Mr. Hu and 6 other venture Partners Set up Beyond.\n\n\u2014In the Year of 2007, We have our own workshop in Fengxian District. Set Up 300TPD milk processing\nline for Client; Business turnover reached $3.15 million.\n\n\u2014 In The Year of 2009, We marched into the fruit Processing line. Built-up the largest date\nprocessing line in domestic. Turnover is $11.4 million.\n\n\u2014 In the Year of 2010, 35TPH Orange juice Processing Line Exported to Ghana and 5TPH tomato sauce\nprocessing line exported to Australia. Turnover reached $14.28 million.\n\n\u2014 In the Year of 2013, Setting up China\u2019s largest herbal tea processing line for WangLaoJi, Turnover\nreach $17.14 million.\n\n\u2014 In the Year of 2015, we exported the 5TPH pineapple Processing line to Kenya. And we moved to our\nnew factory in Jinshan District. Business turnover is $25.7 million.\n\n\u2014 In the Year of 2017, 5TPH Peach, Carrot and Blueberry Combined Processing line Exported to\nGeorgia. Turnover is $38.28 million.\n\n\u2014 In The Year of 2019, We Opened a new branch in Xuzhou, Jiangsu Province, The new workshop covered\nabout 50,000 square meters to meet the increasing equipment capacity requirements. Business turnover\nis $44.28 million.\n\n**Project Workflow and Machine Parts Sample **\n\n[Processing parts sample][Processing parts sample]\n\n**Processing Equipment**\n\n[Processing equipment][Processing equipment]\n\n**Client Project**\n\n[client project][client project]\n\n**Exhibition **\n\n[Beyond exhibition][Beyond exhibition]\n\n**Product Patents**\n\n[Beyond patent][Beyond patent]\n\n**Beyond Introduction**\n\n#### INQUIRY\n\nYour Name (required)\n\nYour Email (required)\n\nYour Number\n\nYour Message\n\n#### Main Menu\n* [Fruit&Vegetable Processsing Line][159]\n* [Food&Bever [Skip to content][1]\n[YouTube][2][Facebook][3][WhatsApp][4][LinkedIn][5][WeChat][6]\nWECHAT/WHATSAPP: 0086-15250214745|[INFO@FRUITPROCESSINGMACHINE.COM][7]\n[ [IBC MACHINE Logo] [IBC MACHINE Logo] ][8]\nSearch for:\n* [Home][9]\n* [About Us ][10]\n* [Why Us][11]\n* [Machinery ][12]\n* [Washing&Sorting Series ][13]\n* [Air Bubble Washing Machine][14]\n* [Brush Washing Machine][15]\n* [Drum Washing Machine][16]\n* [Fruit Scraper Elevator][17]\n* [Vacuum Feeder][18]\n* [Roller Sorter][19]\n* [Peeling&Pitting Series ][20]\n* [Fruit Destoner][21]\n* [Fruit Stone Washer][22]\n* [Pomegranate Peeler and Deseeder][23]\n* [Grape Destemmer Crusher][24]\n* [Crushing&Pulping Series ][25]\n* [Hammer Crusher][26]\n* [Coconut Grinder][27]\n* [Fruit Slicer][28]\n* [Screw Blancher][29]\n* [Pulping Machine][30]\n* [Colloid Mill][31]\n* [Cereal Wet Milling Machine][32]\n* [Scrape Refiner][33]\n* [Citrus Oil Extracting Machine][34]\n* [Heat Exchanger Series ][35]\n* [Plate Heat Exchanger][36]\n* [Tubular Heat Exchanger][37]\n* [Scraped Surface Heat Exchanger][38]\n* [Juice Extractor Series ][39]\n* [Citrus Juice Extractor][40]\n* [Spiral Juice Extractor][41]\n* [Roller Juice Extractor][42]\n* [Belt Press][43]\n* [Vacuum Membrane Press][44]\n* [Barrel Type Hydraulic Press][45]\n* [Separator&Filter Series ][46]\n* [Decanter Centrifuge][47]\n* [Disk Type Separator][48]\n* [Tubular Centrifuge Separator][49]\n* [Vibrating Sieve Machine][50]\n