Retort Sterilizer][69]\n* [Spray Tunnel Pasteurizer][70]\n* [Bottle Tilt Sterilizer][71]\n* [Water Bath Type Pasteurizer][72]\n* [HPP Pasteurizer][73]\n* [Stainless Steel Tanks Series ][74]\n* [Storage Tank][75]\n* [Blending Tank][76]\n* [Fermentation Tank][77]\n* [High Shear Emulsification Tank][78]\n* [Milk Cooling Tank][79]\n* [SUS304 Extraction Tank][80]\n* [Enzymatic Hydrolysis Tank][81]\n* [Aseptic Tank][82]\n* [Filler Series ][83]\n* [Aseptic Bags Filler][84]\n* [Bottled Juice Filler][85]\n* [Can Filler][86]\n* [Sauce Bottle Filler][87]\n* [Aseptic Brick Carton Filler][88]\n* [Gable Top Carton Filler][89]\n* [Stand Up Pouch Filler][90]\n* [Sachet Filler][91]\n* [Bottled Water Filler][92]\n* [Carbonated Drinks Bottle Filler][93]\n* [Labeling Series ][94]\n* [Shrink Sleeve Labeling Machine][95]\n* [Self-Adhesive Labeling Machine][96]\n* [Cold Glue Paste Labeling Machine][97]\n* [Packing Series ][98]\n* [Shrink Wrapping Machine][99]\n* [Carton Packing Machine][100]\n* [Carton Wrapping Machine][101]\n* [CIP System][102]\n* [Solution ][103]\n* [Fruit&Vegetable Processing Line ][104]\n* [Tomato Processing Line][105]\n* [Apple&Pear Processing Line][106]\n* [Mango Processing Line][107]\n* [Coconut Processing Line][108]\n* [Citrus Processing Line][109]\n* [Pineapple Processing Line][110]\n* [Pomegranate Processing Line][111]\n* [Banana Processing Line][112]\n* [Apricot, Peach&Plum Processing Line][113]\n* [Carrot&Beetroot Processing Line][114]\n* [Berry Fruit Processing Line][115]\n* [Passion Fruit&Guava Processing Line][116]\n* [Avocado Processing Line][117]\n* [Grape Processing Line][118]\n* [Date Processing Line][119]\n* [Aloe Vera Processing Line][120]\n* [Cashew Fruit Processing Line][121]\n* [Papaya Processing Line][122]\n* [Kiwifruit Processing Line][123]\n* [Sea Buckthorn Processing Line][124]\n* [Dragon Fruit Processing Line][125]\n* [Longan/Litchi Processing Line][126]\n* [Cherry Processing Line][127]\n* [Acai Berry Processing Line][128]\n* [Cactus Pear Processing Line][129]\n* [Food Sauce&Beverage Processing Line ][130]\n* [Chili Sauce Production Line][131]\n* [Ginger Garlic Paste Production Line][132]\n* [Ketchup Production Line][133]\n* [Onion Paste Processing Line][134]\n* [RTD Tea Drinks Processing Line][135]\n* [Reconstituted Juice Dilution Line][136]\n* [NFC Juice Production Line][137]\n* [Liquid Egg Processing Line][138]\n* [Bottled Water Production Line][139]\n* [Carbonated Drinks Production Line][140]\n* [Milk Beverage Processing Line][141]\n* [Fermented Juice Processing Line][142]\n* [Milk&Dairy Processing Line ][143]\n* [Pasteurized Milk Processing Line][144]\n* [UHT Milk Processing Line][145]\n* [Yogurt Processing Line][146]\n* [Condensed Milk Processing Line][147]\n* [Milk Powder Production Line][148]\n* [Plant-based Milk Processing Line ][149]\n* [Soybean Milk Processing Line][150]\n* [Oat Milk Processing Line][151]\n* [Almond Milk Processing Line][152]\n* [Contact Us][153]\n* [Blogs ][154]\n* [Project Case Share][155]\n* [Get Quote][156]\nSearch for:\n[Home][157]/About Us\nAbout Us[admin][158]2023-03-27T08:46:25+00:00\n\n**Who We Are**\n\nEstablished in 2005, Shanghai Beyond Machinery is developing into a solid engineering and high-tech\nenterprise, who is mainly specialized in supplying turn-key projects for fruit&vegetable,\nmilk&dairy, plant-based milk, fruit jam and sauce, beverage and juice processing lines to clients in\ndomestic and overseas. The company combines scientific research and development, process design\nservice, engineering contracting, equipment manufacturing, installation, commissioning and trainee\nas an integrated.\n\nThanks to so many excellent staff in technical and marketing hardworking, through 15 years of\ndevelopment, we have grown bigger with 400 registered employees and 75,000 square meters workshop\nnow. With strong hardware and software, we have the faith to keep providing excellent service to\nclients beyond their expectations.\n\nWe adhere to food hygiene regulations, strictly control equipment quality, distribute in a more\nflexible and invigorated working surrounding development, and help our customers be more successful\nin the corresponding areas by offering better products and services.\n\nWe would like to cooperate with the same occupations to develop Chinese light industry machinery and\nwelcome warmly our old and new customers visiting and viewing.\n\n**Beyond History and Milestone:**\n\n\u2014In the Year of 2005, Our President Mr. Hu and 6 other venture Partners Set up Beyond.\n\n\u2014In the Year of 2007, We have our own workshop in Fengxian District. Set Up 300TPD milk processing\nline for Client; Business turnover reached $3.15 million.\n\n\u2014 In The Year of 2009, We marched into the fruit Processing line. Built-up the largest date\nprocessing line in domestic. Turnover is $11.4 million.\n\n\u2014 In the Year of 2010, 35TPH Orange juice Processing Line Exported to Ghana and 5TPH tomato sauce\nprocessing line exported to Australia. Turnover reached $14.28 million.\n\n\u2014 In the Year of 2013, Setting up China\u2019s largest herbal tea processing line for WangLaoJi, Turnover\nreach $17.14 million.\n\n\u2014 In the Year of 2015, we exported the 5TPH pineapple Processing line to Kenya. And we moved to our\nnew factory in Jinshan District. Business turnover is $25.7 million.\n\n\u2014 In the Year of 2017, 5TPH Peach, Carrot and Blueberry Combined Processing line Exported to\nGeorgia. Turnover is $38.28 million.\n\n\u2014 In The Year of 2019, We Opened a new branch in Xuzhou, Jiangsu Province, The new workshop covered\nabout 50,000 square meters to meet the increasing equipment capacity requirements. Business turnover\nis $44.28 million.\n\n**Project Workflow and Machine Parts Sample **\n\n[Processing parts sample][Processing parts sample]\n\n**Processing Equipment**\n\n[Processing equipment][Processing equipment]\n\n**Client Project**\n\n[client project][client project]\n\n**Exhibition **\n\n[Beyond exhibition][Beyond exhibition]\n\n**Product Patents**\n\n[Beyond patent][Beyond patent]\n\n**Beyond Introduction**\n\n#### INQUIRY\n\nYour Name (required)\n\nYour Email (required)\n\nYour Number\n\nYour Message\n\n#### Main Menu\n* [Fruit&Vegetable Processsing Line][159]\n* [Food&Beverage Processing Line][160]\n* [Milk&Dairy Processing Line][161]\n* [Plant-based Protein Drinks Processing Line][162]\n\n#### Contact Info\n\nAddress:NO.680, Tingyi Road, Jinshan Industrial Park, Shanghai, China 201505\n\nPhone: [0086-15250214745][163]\n\nMobile: [0086-188 0211 7272][164]\n\nFax: [0086-021-57172728][165]\n\nEmail: [info@fruitprocessingmachine.com][166]\n\nWeb: [ fruitprocessingmachine.com ][167]\n\nCopyright 2012 - 2026 IBC MACHINE | All Rights Reserved\n[Page load link][168]\n\nYour Name (required)\n\nYour Email (required)\n\nYour Number\n\nYour Message\n\nYour Name (required)\n\nYour Email (required)\n\nYour Number\n\nYour Message\n\n[ Go to Top ][169]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwcjKXEtOIGcX28kP9LSV0g?view_as=subscriber\n[3]: https://www.facebook.com/bottledrinks/?ref=aymt_homepage_panel&eid=ARDojBqISWtot12XPa5S-GTqZZeW\nxRXZqUXGRJIxb1tfmk08FczULRBRuFuxA3jxNbwDmQzVwVXi3Yy3\n[4]: https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=+8615250214745\n[5]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jimmy-zhang-933b3810b/\n[6]: weixin://dl/chat?hbzj19900827\n[7]: mailto:INFO@FRUITPROCESSINGMACHINE.COM\n[8]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/\n[9]: http://fruitprocessingmachine.com\n[10]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/about-us/\n[11]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/why-us/\n[12]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio_category/unit-machine/\n[13]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio_category/washing-sorting-series/\n[14]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/air-blowing-washing-machine/\n[15]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/brush-washing-machine/\n[16]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/drum-washing-machine/\n[17]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/fruit-scraper-elevator/\n[18]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/vacuum-feeder/\n[19]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/roller-sorter/\n[20]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio_category/peelingpitting-series/\n[21]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/fruit-destoner/\n[22]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/fruit-stone-washer/\n[23]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/pomegranate-peeler-and-deseeder/\n[24]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/grape-destemmer-crusher/\n[25]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio_category/crushing-pulping-series/\n[26]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/hammer-crusher/\n[27]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/coconut-grinder/\n[28]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/fruit-slicer/\n[29]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/screw-blancher/\n[30]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/fruit-and-vegetable-pulping-machine/\n[31]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/colloid-mill/\n[32]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/cereal-wet-milling-machine/\n[33]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/scrape-refiner/\n[34]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/citrus-oil-extracting-machine/\n[35]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio_category/heat-exchanger-series/\n[36]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/plate-heat-exchanger/\n[37]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/tubular-heat-exchanger/\n[38]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/scraped-surface-heat-exchanger/\n[39]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio_category/juice-extractor-series/\n[40]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/industrial-citrus-juice-extractor/\n[41]: https://fruitprocessingmachine.com/portfolio-items/spira