        "crawl_text": "Naturo & Orgo GMP-certified and ISO-certified India GMP-certified ISO-certified ISO GMP AYUSH Over 1,500 base formulations 30 days turnaround time 150+ satisfied customers Strong research and development expertise End-to-end private label solutions Certified manufacturing processes Comprehensive private label manufacturing services Strict quality assurance and compliance Meets international safety and quality standards ISO GMP AYUSH 805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058 Gurugram, Haryana, India Plot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052 India Plot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052 Pan-India Naturo & Orgo manufactures approximately 800 SKUs every month, with around 3 million units sold monthly. Naturo & Orgo manufactures approximately 800 SKUs every month from around 3 million units sold monthly. Naturo & Orgo manufactures approximately 800 SKUs every month from approximately 3 million units sold every month. Expanding product offerings in natural and organic personal care. Enhancing private label services for brands. Expanding product offerings in natural and organic personal care products. Competition in the personal care and cosmetics market. Maintaining quality and compliance with international standards. Growing demand for natural and organic personal care products. Expansion into new markets. Expansion into new markets and customer segments. A recognized leader in the natural and organic personal care industry. Growing demand for natural and organic personal care products Expansion of private label offerings in the cosmetics market Increasing consumer awareness of natural products Expansion of e-commerce channels. Increasing consumer preference for natural and organic products. Strong research and development capabilities. Naturo &amp; Orgo - Cosmetic Manufacturer in India\n\nHome\nAbout Us\nServices\n\nContract Manufacturing\nPrivate Label Service\nCustom Formulations\nCustom Packaging\n\nProducts\nContact Us\nBlogs\n\nBusiness\nBody Care\nHair Care\nSkin Care\nBaby Care\nPet Care\n\nSearch Site\n\nType and hit enter to search\n\nShopping Cart\n\nCart\n\nContact Us\n\nGet In Touch\n&times;\n\nLet\u2019s Build Your Dream Personal\n\nCare Brand Together!\n\nSubmit Enquiry Call Now\n\nChoose from our services\n\nNaturo &amp; Orgo is a leading personal care and cosmetic manufacturer in India that offers a wide range of services, including private label and contract manufacturing, custom formulations and custom packaging to bring your brand vision to life. From innovative designs to bulk production of personal care and beauty essentials, we cover every step of the process with precision and expertise. Our personal care manufacturing services also include research &amp; development, packaging design, product testing, and regulatory compliance, ensuring your products meet global standards.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nPrivate\n\nLabel\n\nLaunch your own private label cosmetic products with high-quality, ready-to-market formulations manufactured under your brand name.\n\nExplore\n\nContract\n\nManufacturing\n\nPartner with us for seamless personal care and cosmetics contract manufacturing services that ensure consistent quality.\n\nExplore\n\nCustom\n\nFormulations\n\nIf you have an idea for a custom personal care product, our team of expert chemists can develop a formulation.\n\nExplore\n\nCustomized\n\nPackaging\n\nStand out with custom personal care packaging solutions to enhance shelf appeal &amp; strengthen your brand identity.\n\nExplore\n\nOur Expertise\n\nWe specialize in private label personal care, beauty, and cosmetics product contract manufacturing, custom formulations, and custom packaging, delivering high-quality organic, natural, and herbal personal care and cosmetic products. Backed by GMP- and ISO-certified facilities, we ensure every product meets international standards of safety and efficacy. From innovative R&amp;D to eco-friendly packaging solutions, our expertise helps beauty and personal care brands create products that stand out in today\u2019s competitive market.\n\n30 days\nturnaround time\n\n30 days\nturnaround time\n\n1500+\nbase formulations\n\n1500+\nbase formulations\n\n150+\ncustomer satisfied\n\n150+\ncustomer satisfied\n\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\nCALL US NOW +91-9599482900\n\nOur Manufacturing Process\n\nAt Naturo &amp; Orgo, every product is crafted with precision, safety, and innovation at its core. From sourcing high-quality raw materials to formulating unique blends, our process is handled by skilled chemists and technicians under strict quality standards. Each stage: research &amp; development, formulation, testing, production, and packaging, is carefully monitored to ensure consistency and excellence.\n\nMajor Categories\n\nAs a leading personal care &amp; cosmetics product manufacturer, we offer a wide range of product categories tailored to meet diverse consumer needs. Our expertise spans hair care, skin care, body care, pet care, and men\u2019s grooming care, ensuring high-quality solutions for every market segment. From nourishing shampoos, conditioners, and hair oils to innovative face creams, serums, body lotions, scrubs, and more, we create products that blend science with nature.\n\nhair care\n\nskin care\n\nbody care\n\npet care\n\nmen\u2019s grooming care\n\nFeatured collections\n\nOur featured collections showcase the diversity and innovation we bring to skincare and personal care manufacturing. From nourishing face serums and gentle soaps to revitalizing shampoos and refreshing hand washes, we deliver high-quality formulations that meet global standards. Beyond these, our expertise also covers moisturizers, face creams, body lotions, hair oils, conditioners, facial cleansers, scrubs, sunscreens, toners, masks, lip balms, baby care, men\u2019s grooming essentials, and so on.\n\nFace Serums\n\nSoaps\n\nShampoos\n\nHand Washes\n\nConnect with experts!\n\nLet\u2019s create something extraordinary together! Whether you\u2019re looking for private-label solutions, custom formulations, or innovative packaging, we India\u2019s leading OEM manufacturer are here to turn your ideas into high-quality products your customers will love. Fill out the form below, and our team will get in touch to kickstart your journey toward success. Let\u2019s make it happen!\n\nSubmit Enquiry Call Now\n\nTestimonials\n\n\u201cWorking with the team at Naturo &amp; Orgo has truly been a game-changer for our brand. Their attention to detail in formulating customized personal care products has elevated our offerings. Plus, the raw materials they supply are always top-quality. Our customers can feel the difference!\u201d\n\nAman Gupta\n\n\u201cWe&#8217;ve partnered with the Naturo &amp; Orgo team for years, and they continue to impress us with their consistency. Whether it&#8217;s custom personal care formulations or raw materials, we know we can always count on them for the highest quality and reliable service.\u201d\n\nMohit Singh\n\n&#8220;From product ideation to final production, experts at Naturo &amp; Orgo have been with us every step of the way. Their personalized approach to formulating products for our brand has led to customer satisfaction. &#8221;\n\nVarsha Jain\n\n\u201cWorking with the team at Naturo &amp; Orgo has truly been a game-changer for our brand. Their attention to detail in formulating customized personal care products has elevated our offerings. Plus, the raw materials they supply are always top-quality. Our customers can feel the difference!\u201d\n\nVijay Kapoor\n\nThe Latest News\n\nExplore tips, trends, and essentials of private label manufacturing\n\nHow to Choose the Best Scalp Serum Manufacturer in India\n\nThe Indian beauty and personal care market is growing faster than ever,...\n\nRead more\n\nJune 4, 2026\n\n0 like\n\nCustom Packaging for Scalp Serums: What Every Brand Needs\n\nThe scalp serum market is booming. More and more people are looking...\n\nRead more\n\nJune 3, 2026\n\n0 like\n\nPrivate Label vs Custom Scalp Serum Formulation: What Brands Must Know\n\nScalp care products are the hot product category. Consumers are increasingly seeking...\n\nRead more\n\nJune 2, 2026\n\n0 like\n\nHow to Start a Profitable Scalp Care Brand in India\n\nThe Indian hair care industry is undergoing a rapid transformation. Today&#8217;s consumers...\n\nRead more\n\nJune 1, 2026\n\n0 like\n\nHow to Choose the Best Brightening Serum Manufacturer in India\n\nThe skincare industry in India is growing at a rapid pace. An...\n\nRead more\n\nMay 22, 2026\n\n0 like\n\nCustom Packaging Solutions for Brightening Serum Brands\n\nThe skincare market is expanding at a very rapid rate. There is...\n\nRead more\n\nMay 20, 2026\n\n0 like\n\nPrivate Label vs Custom Brightening Serum: Which Is Best for Your Brand?\n\nWhen deciding to start your own skincare brand, one of the first...\n\nRead more\n\nMay 1, 2026\n\n0 like\n\nHow To Start A Profitable Brightening Serum Business\n\nThe Indian skincare business is flourishing. Increasing numbers of individuals are seeking...\n\nRead more\n\nApril 21, 2026\n\n1 like\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat makes Naturo &amp; Orgo the best cosmetic manufacturer in India?\n\nNaturo &amp; Orgo is a GMP-certified and ISO-certified cosmetic manufacturer in India with over 1,500+ base formulations, a 30-day turnaround time, and 150+ satisfied global clients. We specialize in private label cosmetics, contract manufacturing, custom formulations, and custom packaging for personal care and beauty brands \u2014 from startups to established D2C brands.\n\nWhat is the minimum order quantity (MOQ) for private labe