            "url": "https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/",
            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n# Innovative .\n# Empowering.\n# Sustainable.\n\n[Submit Enquiry][20] [Call Now][21]\n\n## Who are we & what do we do?\n\nEvery great idea starts with a vision, and at Naturo & Orgo, our journey began with a commitment to\nempowering businesses to bring their dream cosmetic and personal care products to life. As an OEM\nmanufacturing unit by Khadi Natural Healthcare, we have always believed in the power of nature to\ndeliver high-quality, effective products. This belief laid the foundation for Naturo & Orgo, a brand\ndedicated to creating exceptional personal care products through innovation, sustainability, and\ncare.\n\n[icon-image]\n\n## 30 days\n\nturnaround time\n\n##### 30 days\n\nturnaround time\n[icon-image]\n\n## 1500+\n\nbase formulations\n\n##### 1500+\n\nbase formulations\n[icon-image]\n\n## 150+\n\ncustomer satisfied\n\n##### 150+\n\ncustomer satisfied\n[background]\n\nOur commitment to sustainability ensures that every step of our process, from sourcing to packaging,\nis eco-friendly. Join us on this journey to embrace the power of nature and enhance your well-being.\n\n[GET A QUOTE][22]\n\n**\u201cEmpower your vision, and let innovation lead the way.\u201d**\n** \u2013 Gaurav Singh**\n\nOur founder, Gaurav Singh, envisions a world where innovation and ideas come together to\ncreate personal-care solutions. His mission is to lead the cosmetic industry with high-quality,\nethically produced products that are both effective and sustainable. He believes in empowering\nbrands to bring their ideas to life, offering expert guidance, advanced manufacturing capabilities,\nand a commitment to excellence in every step of the process. Through his vision, Naturo & Orgo\nstrives to set new standards in the cosmetic and personal care industry, with a focus on purity,\nsafety, and customer trust.\n\n### GAURAV SINGH\n\nCEO FOUNDER\n\n## Testimonials\n\n[page-header]\n\u201cWorking with the team at Naturo & Orgo has truly been a game-changer for our brand. Their attention\nto detail in formulating customized personal care products has elevated our offerings. Plus, the raw\nmaterials they supply are always top-quality. Our customers can feel the difference!\u201d\nAnonymous\n\n[page-header]\n\u201cWe\u2019ve partnered with the Naturo & Orgo team for years, and they continue to impress us with their\nconsistency. Whether it\u2019s custom personal care formulations or raw materials, we know we can always\ncount on them for the highest quality and reliable service.\u201d\nAnonymous\n\n[page-header]\n\u201cFrom product ideation to final production, experts at Naturo & Orgo have been with us every step of\nthe way. Their personalized approach to formulating products for our brand has led to customer\nsatisfaction. \u201d\nAnonymous\n\n[page-header]\n\u201cWorking with the team at Naturo & Orgo has truly been a game-changer for our brand. Their attention\nto detail in formulating customized personal care products has elevated our offerings. Plus, the raw\nmaterials they supply are always top-quality. Our customers can feel the difference!\u201d\nAnonymous\n\n## Our Core Values\n\nAt the heart of everything we do are our core values: Innovation, International Standards of Purity\nand Quality, and Growth. We achieve this through Dedicated Teamwork, building the Trust of our\npartners and customers, and executing Impeccable Strategy.\n\nWe are committed to delivering 100% quality and exceptional service every time\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units sold every month, [Read More][23]\n\n###### Contact Us\n\n**Corporate Office Address**\n\n805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058\nPhone: +91-9599482900\nconnect@naturoandorgo.com\n\n**Manufacturing Plant Address **\n\nPlot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [Home][24]\n* [About Us][25]\n* [Products][26]\n* [Services][27]\n* [In The Press][28]\n* [Blog][29]\n* [Contact Us][30]\n* [Certifications][31]\n* [Our Clients][32]\n* [Media/News][33]\n* [Gallery][34]\n* [Events][35]\n\n###### Services\n* [Contact Manufacturing][36]\n* [Private Label][37]\n* [Custom Formulations][38]\n* [Custom Packaging][39]\n\n[Back to top of page][40]\n\n[ ][41] [ ][42]\n\nLoading Comments...\nWrite a Comment...\nEmail (Required) Name (Required) Website\n\n[1]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[2]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[3]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[4]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[5]: /services/\n[6]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[7]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[8]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[9]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[10]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[11]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://naturoandorgo.com/blog/\n[13]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/business/\n[14]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/body-care/\n[15]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/hair-care/\n[16]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/skin-care/\n[17]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/baby-care/\n[18]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/pet-care/\n[19]: https://naturoandorgo.com/?page_id=10\n[20]: https://naturoandorgo.com/submit-enquiry/\n[21]: tel:+919599482900\n[22]: https://naturoandorgocom.wpcomstaging.com/submit-enquiry/\n[23]: /about-us/\n[24]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[25]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[26]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[27]: /services/\n[28]: /in-the-press/\n[29]: /blog/\n[30]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[31]: https://naturoandorgo.com/certifications/\n[32]: https://naturoandorgo.com/our-clients/\n[33]: https://naturoandorgo.com/media-news/\n[34]: https://naturoandorgo.com/gallery/\n[35]: https://naturoandorgo.com/event/\n[36]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[37]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[38]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[39]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[40]: #\n[41]: #\n[42]: #"
