            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n# From Concept To\n# Creation\n# We Do It All\n\n[Submit Enquiry][20] [Call Now][21]\n\n## Who are we & what do we do?\n\nEvery great idea starts with a vision, and at Naturo & Orgo, our journey began with a commitment to\nempowering businesses to bring their dream cosmetic and personal care products to life. As a trusted\npersonal care contract manufacturer and cosmetic products manufacturer, we specialize in offering\nend-to-end packaging and formulations that help brands stand out in a competitive market.\n\nBeing part of Khadi Natural Healthcare, our expertise extends beyond traditional manufacturing. We\nare recognized among the leading third party cosmetic manufacturers and beauty product\nmanufacturers, delivering innovative formulations that combine nature with science. Our capabilities\nin private label beauty products manufacturing and personal care manufacturing ensure that\nbusinesses of all sizes can launch products tailored to their unique brand identity.\n\n## Choose from our services\n\nAs a leading cosmetic manufacturer and personal care product manufacturer, we bring you complete\nend-to-end solutions for building your beauty brand. From cosmetic formulation development and\ncustom skincare formulation to eco-friendly packaging solutions and private label cosmetics\nmanufacturing, our services are designed to help you launch with confidence.\n\n## Private\n## Label\n\nLaunch your brand\neffortlessly with our private-label\nsolutions.\n\n[Explore][22]\n\n## Contract\n## Manufacturing\n\nPartner with us for\nseamless contract\nmanufacturing services.\n\n[Explore][23]\n\n## Custom\n## Formulations\n\nBring your unique\nproduct ideas to life with\nour custom formulation\nexpertise.\n\n[Explore][24]\n\n## Customized\n## Packaging\n\nEnhance your brand with\nour versatile packaging\nsolutions.\n\n[Explore][25]\n\n##### FAQs for client\n* What services does Naturo & Orgo offer for cosmetic and personal care brands?\nNaturo & Orgo offers end-to-end cosmetic and personal care manufacturing services, including\nprivate label manufacturing, contract manufacturing, custom product formulations, and Customized\nPackaging for beauty and personal care brands.\n* Can startups launch their own cosmetics & personal care brand with Naturo & Orgo?\nYes, Naturo & Orgo supports startups, D2C brands, salon owners, and entrepreneurs by providing low\nMOQ manufacturing, ready-to-use formulations, packaging solutions, and complete brand launch\nassistance.\n* Does Naturo & Orgo provide custom formulation services?\nYes, their team of experts develops custom skincare, haircare, and personal care formulations\ntailored to specific brand requirements, ingredients, and target audiences.\n* What types of cosmetic and personal care products are manufactured by Naturo & Orgo?\nWe manufacture a wide range of products, including shampoos, conditioners, face serums,\nmoisturizers, sunscreens, soaps, body lotions, beard serums, hand washes, baby care products, and\nmen\u2019s grooming products and more.\n* Does Naturo & Orgo offer private label cosmetic manufacturing?\nYes, Naturo & Orgo specializes in private label cosmetic manufacturing, allowing businesses to\nlaunch products under their own brand name with customized packaging and branding solutions.\n* Are Naturo & Orgo products manufactured under quality-certified facilities?\nYes, the company operates **GMP-certified and ISO-certified** manufacturing facilities to ensure\nhigh-quality, safe, and internationally compliant cosmetic and personal care products.\n* Does Naturo & Orgo provide customized packaging solutions?\nYes, they offer customized packaging solutions designed to improve shelf appeal, strengthen brand\nidentity, and match specific product and branding requirements.\n* What is the typical turnaround time for product manufacturing at Naturo & Orgo?\nNaturo & Orgo generally offers a 20-day turnaround time for ready private label formulations,\nwhile custom-developed formulations may take longer depending on R&D and testing requirements.\n* Does Naturo & Orgo support international cosmetic manufacturing standards?\nYes, their products and manufacturing processes are designed to meet international safety and\nquality standards, making them suitable for both domestic and export markets.\n* Why choose Naturo & Orgo as a cosmetic manufacturing partner?\nNaturo & Orgo combines natural and organic expertise with modern manufacturing capabilities,\noffering over 1,500+ formulations, customized solutions, eco-friendly packaging, and end-to-end\nsupport for beauty and personal care brands.\n\n##### Get in Touch\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units sold every month, [Read More][26]\n\n###### Contact Us\n\n**Corporate Office Address**\n\n805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058\nPhone: +91-9599482900\nconnect@naturoandorgo.com\n\n**Manufacturing Plant Address **\n\nPlot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [Home][27]\n* [About Us][28]\n* [Products][29]\n* [Services][30]\n* [In The Press][31]\n* [Blog][32]\n* [Contact Us][33]\n* [Certifications][34]\n* [Our Clients][35]\n* [Media/News][36]\n* [Gallery][37]\n* [Events][38]\n\n###### Services\n* [Contact Manufacturing][39]\n* [Private Label][40]\n* [Custom Formulations][41]\n* [Custom Packaging][42]\n\n[Back to top of page][43]\n\n[ ][44] [ ][45]\n\nLoading Comments...\nWrite a Comment...\nEmail (Required) Name (Required) Website\n\n[1]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[2]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[3]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[4]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[5]: /services/\n[6]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[7]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[8]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[9]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[10]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[11]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://naturoandorgo.com/blog/\n[13]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/business/\n[14]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/body-care/\n[15]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/hair-care/\n[16]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/skin-care/\n[17]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/baby-care/\n[18]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/pet-care/\n[19]: https://naturoandorgo.com/?page_id=10\n[20]: /submit-enquiry/\n[21]: tel:+919599482900\n[22]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[23]: /contract-manufacturing/\n[24]: /formulations/\n[25]: /custom-packaging/\n[26]: /about-us/\n[27]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[28]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[29]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[30]: /services/\n[31]: /in-the-press/\n[32]: /blog/\n[33]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[34]: https://naturoandorgo.com/certifications/\n[35]: https://naturoandorgo.com/our-clients/\n[36]: https://naturoandorgo.com/media-news/\n[37]: https://naturoandorgo.com/gallery/\n[38]: https://naturoandorgo.com/event/\n[39]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[40]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[41]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[42]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[43]: #\n[44]: #\n[45]: #"
