            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nPrivate Label Menstrual Cup Wash Manufacturer\nBody Care\n][20] [\nPrivate Label Nargis Body Butter Manufacturer\nBody butter\n][21]\n[[Private Label Nail Hardner Manufacturer]][22]\n\n# Private Label Nail Hardner Manufacturer\n\n[Get a Quote][23]\n\n**Benefits: **\n**Moq: **1000 unit\n**Lead Time: **20 days/1000 unit\n**Packaging Size: **Multiple Packaging Sizes Available\n**Packaging Type: **Multiple Packaging Types Available**\n****Private Label: **Yes\n**Custom Formula: **Yes\n\nCategories: [Body Care][24], [Nail Hardener][25]\n* Share\n* [0][26]\n* [0][27]\n* [0][28]\n* [0][29]\n* [ Description ][30]\n* [ Ingredients ][31]\n* [ Benefits ][32]\n* [ How to use ][33]\n\n## Description\n\nWe are a leading private label Nail Hardener manufacturer, offering advanced nail care formulations\nthat strengthen, protect, and restore brittle or weak nails. Our nail hardeners are enriched with\nkeratin, calcium, biotin, and vitamin E, providing deep nourishment while improving resilience and\nshine. Designed to reduce chipping, peeling, and breakage, the fast-drying, non-yellowing formula\ncreates a protective barrier that promotes healthier nail growth. Whether used as a standalone\ntreatment or a strengthening base coat, it delivers salon-quality results for long-lasting,\nbeautiful nails.\n\nBrands can customize formula type (clear, tinted, or glossy), active concentrations, and packaging,\ncatering to both professional and consumer nail care ranges. Produced in GMP- and ISO-certified\nfacilities, each batch undergoes strict testing for durability, adhesion, and safety. Our\ncomprehensive private label solutions, including R&D, formulation design, filling, and branding,\nhelp brands launch nail hardeners that combine performance, protection, and innovation \u2014 giving\nconsumers the confidence of strong, healthy nails with every application.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Ingredients\n\nKeratin Protein \u2013 Strengthens and rebuilds nail structure.\n\nCalcium Complex \u2013 Fortifies nails and prevents breakage.\n\nVitamin E \u2013 Protects nails from dryness and damage.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Benefits\n\nStrengthens Weak Nails: Reinforces brittle nails, reducing chipping, splitting, and peeling.\n\nPromotes Nail Growth: Nutrient-rich formula helps nails grow longer and healthier with consistent\nuse.\n\nRestores Smoothness and Shine: Creates a smooth surface and glossy finish for a polished look.\n\nProtects from Damage: Forms a protective layer that shields nails from external damage and harsh\nproducts.\n\nHydrates and Conditions Cuticles: Enriched with oils and vitamins that nourish nails and surrounding\nskin.\n\nCan Be Used as Base Coat: Works perfectly under nail polish for added strength and smooth\napplication.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## How to use\n\nApply one thin coat directly to clean nails. Allow it to dry completely before applying nail polish.\nUse 2\u20133 times a week for stronger, shinier nails.\n\n### *Related*\n\n### Private Label Nail Hardner Manufacturer\n\nApply one thin coat of the nail hardener directly to clean, dry nails and let it dry completely\nbefore applying polish. Use 2\u20133 times weekly to strengthen weak or brittle nails and restore natural\nshine. Naturo & Orgo\u2019s advanced nail hardener formulations are infused with keratin, calcium, and\nvitamin E to nourish and reinforce nails while preventing breakage and peeling. As a certified\nprivate label manufacturer, we provide multiple finish options \u2014 glossy, matte, or transparent \u2014\nalong with full packaging and branding customization to help your brand create salon-quality nail\ncare products.\n\n## FAQS\n\n### Q. What makes your nail hardener effective?\n\n**Ans.**Our nail hardener is enriched with keratin, calcium, and vitamin E to strengthen nails,\nprevent chipping, and improve overall nail texture and shine.\n\n### Q. Can the formulation be customized for specific nail concerns?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, we can create specialized formulations for brittle nails, split nails, or weak nail\nbeds, including fast-drying and breathable variants.\n\n### Q. Is your nail hardener free from harmful chemicals?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, our nail hardeners are free from toluene, formaldehyde, DBP, and camphor \u2014 ensuring\nsafety and comfort for regular use.\n\n### Q. Do you offer clear, tinted, and matte finish options?\n\n**Ans.**Absolutely. We provide various finish choices including transparent, glossy, or matte\neffects, suitable for different brand styles.\n\n### Q. Can the product be used as a base coat or top coat?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, our formula is versatile and can be used as both a strengthening base coat and a\nprotective top coat.\n\n### Q. What is your MOQ for private label nail hardeners?\n\n**Ans.**The minimum order typically starts from 1,000\u20132,000 units depending on packaging and bottle\ncustomization.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Related products\n* [[Private Label glycerine Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label glycerine Manufacturer\n\n][34][Read more][35] [View Details][36]\n* [[Private Label Handmade Soap Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Handmade Soap Manufacturer\n\n][37][View Details][38]\n* [[Private Label Rosewater Soap Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Rosewater Soap Manufacturer\n\n][39][View Details][40]\n* [[Private Label Jasmine Essential Oil Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Jasmine Essential Oil Manufacturer\n\n][41][View Details][42]\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units sold every month, [Read More][43]\n\n###### Contact Us\n\n**Corporate Office Address**\n\n805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058\nPhone: +91-9599482900\nconnect@naturoandorgo.com\n\n**Manufacturing Plant Address **\n\nPlot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [Home][44]\n* [About Us][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [Services][47]\n* [In The Press][48]\n* [Blog][49]\n* [Contact Us][50]\n* [Certifications][51]\n* [Our Clients][52]\n* [Media/News][53]\n* [Gallery][54]\n* [Events][55]\n\n###### Services\n* [Contact Manufacturing][56]\n* [Private Label][57]\n* [Custom Formulations][58]\n* [Custom Packaging][59]\n\n[Back to top of page][60]\n\n[1]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[2]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[3]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[4]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[5]: /services/\n[6]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[7]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[8]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[9]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[10]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[11]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://naturoandorgo.com/blog/\n[13]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/business/\n[14]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/body-care/\n[15]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/hair-care/\n[16]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/skin-care/\n[17]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/baby-care/\n[18]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/pet-care/\n[19]: https://naturoandorgo.com/?page_id=10\n[20]: https://naturoandorgo.com/product/private-label-m