            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nPrivate Label Hair Mousse Manufacturer\nHair Care\n][20] [\nPrivate Label Moisturize Lock Body Oil Manufacturer\nBody Care\n][21]\n[[Private Label Lip Cheek Tint Manufacturer]][22]\n\n# Private Label Lip Cheek Tint Manufacturer\n\n[Get a Quote][23]\n\n**Benefits: **\n**Moq: **1000 unit\n**Lead Time: **20 days/1000 unit\n**Packaging Size: **Multiple Packaging Sizes Available\n**Packaging Type: **Multiple Packaging Types Available**\n****Private Label: **Yes\n**Custom Formula: **Yes\n\nCategories: [Lip & Cheek Tint][24], [Skin Care][25]\n* Share\n* [0][26]\n* [0][27]\n* [0][28]\n* [0][29]\n* [ Description ][30]\n* [ Ingredients ][31]\n* [ Benefits ][32]\n* [ How to use ][33]\n\n## Description\n\nOur Private Label Lip & Cheek Tint is a multi-purpose beauty essential that delivers natural,\nbuildable color with a lightweight and long-lasting finish. Specially formulated with skin-friendly\ningredients like aloe vera, vitamin E, and fruit extracts, this tint nourishes while providing a\nhealthy flush of color that blends seamlessly onto lips and cheeks. Its versatile formula allows for\ncustomizable intensity, whether your customers prefer a subtle everyday glow or a bold pop of color.\nThe non-sticky, quick-absorbing texture ensures a smooth application without clogging pores or\ndrying the lips. Available in a variety of shades, from soft neutrals to vibrant tones, it caters to\ndiverse consumer preferences and skin tones. As a trusted private label lip cheek tint manufacturer,\nwe provide formulation flexibility, clean beauty certifications, and eco-conscious packaging.\nPartner with us to launch a Lip & Cheek Tint that combines effortless beauty, skincare benefits, and\non-trend appeal.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Ingredients\n\nBeeswax \u2013 give structure and help the product stay in place.\n\nMoisturizers \u2013 maintain softness and prevent dryness.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Benefits\n\nDual-purpose for lips and cheeks\n\nProvides natural flush of color\n\nLong-lasting and blendable\n\nLightweight and comfortable\n\n### *Related*\n\n## How to use\n\nApply a small amount to lips or cheeks.\n\nBlend gently with fingers or brush.\n\nLayer for more intensity if needed.\n\nReapply as desired throughout the day.\n\n### *Related*\n\n### Private Label Lip Cheek Tint Manufacturer\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading Private Label LIP CHEEK TINT Manufacturer and key leader of LIP CHEEK\nTINT contract manufacturing. We use a standardised and certified international process, and all the\nproducts manufactured here are clinically tested and verified. We are open to customisation in\nlabelling and packaging in the white label Private Label LIP CHEEK TINT Manufacturing formula.\n\nNaturo & Orgo is the perfect private label manufacturer of LIP CHEEK TINT brands. We offer the best\nproficiency and efficiency in research and development, ensuring they meet your product needs. We\nare a trusted brand for a reason, and we are certified with ISO, GMP, AYUSH, etc., and have served\nover 150+ satisfied customers.\n\n## FAQS\n\n### Q. What is lip & cheek tint made of?\n\n**Ans.**Lip & cheek tint is formulated with natural pigments, emollients, and nourishing oils to\nprovide a smooth, blendable color for both lips and cheeks.\n\n### Q. What are the benefits of lip & cheek tint?\n\n**Ans.**It gives a natural flush, is easy to apply and blend, provides long-lasting color, and often\ncontains moisturizing ingredients to keep skin and lips hydrated.\n\n### Q. Can the formula be customized for private label brands?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, we offer fully customizable formulations including shades, finishes (matte, satin,\nglossy), and added skincare ingredients like vitamin E or natural extracts.\n\n### Q. Is it safe for all skin types?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, our lip & cheek tints are suitable for all skin types. Those with sensitive skin should\nperform a patch test before use.\n\n### Q. What is the minimum order quantity (MOQ)?\n\n**Ans.**MOQ depends on packaging and formulation, but we cater to both small batch and bulk private\nlabel orders.\n\n### Q. What packaging options are available?\n\n**Ans.**We provide twist-up sticks, pots, tubes, or compact packaging, all customizable with your\nbrand\u2019s design and labels.\n\n### Q. Are there any side effects?\n\n**Ans.**The product is generally safe for regular use. Rarely, allergic reactions may occur in\nindividuals sensitive to pigments or oils. Patch testing is advised.\n\n### Q. What is the shelf life of lip & cheek tint?\n\n**Ans.**Typically 2\u20133 years when stored in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\n\n### Q. Do you provide regulatory and labeling support?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, we assist with INCI ingredient lists, safety compliance, and labeling documentation\nrequired for private label products.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Related products\n* [[Private Label Hyaluronic Acid Gel Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Hyaluronic Acid Gel Manufacturer\n\n][34][Read more][35] [View Details][36]\n* [[Private Label Overnight Barrier Repair Sleeping Mask Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Overnight Barrier Repair Sleeping Mask Manufacturer\n\n][37][View Details][38]\n* [[Placeholder]\n\n## Private Label Aloe Vera Gentle Face Wash Manufacturer\n\n][39][View Details][40]\n* [[Private Label Salicyclic Face Wash Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Salicyclic Face Wash Manufacturer\n\n][41][View Details][42]\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units sold every month, [Read More][43]\n\n###### Contact Us\n\n**Corporate Office Address**\n\n805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058\nPhone: +91-9599482900\nconnect@naturoandorgo.com\n\n**Manufacturing Plant Address **\n\nPlot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [Home][44]\n* [About Us][45]\n* [Products][46]\n* [Services][47]\n* [In The Press][48]\n* [Blog][49]\n* [Contact Us][50]\n* [Certifications][51]\n* [Our Clients][52]\n* [Media/News][53]\n* [Gallery][54]\n* [Events][55]\n\n###### Services\n* [Contact Manufacturing][56]\n* [Private Label][57]\n* [Custom Formulations][58]\n* [Custom Packaging][59]\n\n[Back to top of page][60]\n\n[1]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[2]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[3]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[4]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[5]: /services/\n[6]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[7]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[8]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[9]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[10]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[11]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://naturoandorgo.com/blog/\n[13]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/business/\n[14]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/body-care/\n[15]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/hair-care/\n[16]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/skin-care/\n[17]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/baby-care/\n[18]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/pet-care/\n[19]: https://naturoandorgo.com/?page_id=10\n[20]: https://naturoandorgo.com/product/private-label-hair-mousse-manufacturer