            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nPrivate Label Conditioner Manufacturer\nHair Care\n][20] [\nPrivate Label Golden Gaze Under Eye Cream Manufacturer\nSkin Care\n][21]\n[[Private Label Trucare Antidandruff Shampoo Manufacturer]][22]\n\n# Private Label Trucare Antidandruff Shampoo Manufacturer\n\n[Get a Quote][23]\n\n**Benefits: **\n**Moq: **1000 unit\n**Lead Time: **20 days/1000 unit\n**Packaging Size: **Multiple Packaging Sizes Available\n**Packaging Type: **Multiple Packaging Types Available**\n****Private Label: **Yes\n**Custom Formula: **Yes\n\nCategories: [Hair Care][24], [Anti Dandruff][25], [Shampoo][26]\n* Share\n* [0][27]\n* [0][28]\n* [0][29]\n* [0][30]\n* [ Description ][31]\n* [ Ingredients ][32]\n* [ Benefits ][33]\n* [ How to use ][34]\n\n## Description\n\nThis anti-dandruff shampoo in a compact format is created for structured hair care routines where\ncontrolled use and consistency are important. It integrates comfortably into grooming schedules and\nsupports routine cleansing habits. Designed for practicality, it aligns well with long-term hair\ncare practices focused on regular maintenance and ease of use.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Ingredients\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Benefits\n\nHelps cleanse flakes and buildup\nSupports scalp freshness\nSuitable for routine scalp care\nHelps maintain clean and healthy-looking hair\n\n### *Related*\n\n## How to use\n\nApply to wet hair\nMassage into scalp\nRinse thoroughly\nUse regularly\n\n### *Related*\n\n### Private Label Trucare Antidandruff Shampoo Manufacturer\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading Private Label Trucare Anti-Dandruff Shampoo Manufacturer, offering\ntargeted scalp care formulations developed under standardized and certified international\nmanufacturing processes. Each product is manufactured with strict quality control to ensure safety,\nstability, and regulatory compliance. We provide end-to-end private label solutions, including\nformulation customization, packaging options, and branding support. Backed by strong research and\ndevelopment expertise, Naturo & Orgo ensures dandruff-care formulations are market-ready and\nscalable. Certified with ISO, GMP, AYUSH, and other accreditations, we have partnered with over 150+\nsatisfied customers.\n\n## FAQS\n\n### Q.1. Is it suitable for frequent use?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, can be used regularly.\n\n### Q.2. Does it irritate scalp?\n\n**Ans.**Patch testing is recommended.\n\n### Q.3. Is private label available?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, customizable for brands.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Related products\n* [[Private Label Tulsi Hair Oil Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Tulsi Hair Oil Manufacturer\n\n][35][Read more][36] [View Details][37]\n* [[Private Label Satritha Hair Cleanser Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Satritha Hair Cleanser Manufacturer\n\n][38][View Details][39]\n* [[Private Label Saffron Tulsi & Reetha Hair Cleanser Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Saffron Tulsi & Reetha Hair Cleanser Manufacturer\n\n][40][View Details][41]\n* [[Private Label Henna & Rosemary Hair Oil Paraben Mineral Oil Free Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Henna & Rosemary Hair Oil Paraben Mineral Oil Free Manufacturer\n\n][42][View Details][43]\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units s