            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nPrivate Label Amla Hair Oil Manufacturer\nHair Care\n][20] [\nPrivate Label Hair smoothening conditioner Manufacturer\nHair Care\n][21]\n[[Private Label Anti Hairfall and anti dandruff shampoo Manufacturer]][22]\n\n# Private Label Anti Hairfall and anti dandruff shampoo Manufacturer\n\n[Get a Quote][23]\n\n**Benefits: **\n**Moq: **1000 unit\n**Lead Time: **20 days/1000 unit\n**Packaging Size: **Multiple Packaging Sizes Available\n**Packaging Type: **Multiple Packaging Types Available**\n****Private Label: **Yes\n**Custom Formula: **Yes\n\nCategories: [Anti Hairfall][24], [Hair Care][25], [Shampoo][26]\n* Share\n* [0][27]\n* [0][28]\n* [0][29]\n* [0][30]\n* [ Description ][31]\n* [ Ingredients ][32]\n* [ Benefits ][33]\n* [ How to use ][34]\n\n## Description\n\nThis anti hair fall and anti dandruff shampoo is developed to support structured hair care routines\nwhere scalp and hair cleansing are approached consistently. It integrates well into regular wash\nschedules and fits naturally into grooming practices focused on routine maintenance. The formulation\nspreads easily through the hair and rinses cleanly, making it practical for ongoing use. Designed\nfor consistency, it aligns with personal care habits where hair cleansing is part of a disciplined\nroutine.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Ingredients\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Benefits\n\nHelps reduce dandruff and visible flakes with regular use\nSupports a cleaner, healthier scalp environment\nHelps minimize hair fall caused by scalp dryness and buildup\nStrengthens hair strands and improves resilience\nLeaves scalp feeling refreshed and comfortable\nSuitable for regular hair cleansing routine\n\n### *Related*\n\n## How to use\n\nApply to wet scalp and hair\nMassage gently to form lather\nRinse thoroughly\nUse regularly for best results\n\n### *Related*\n\n### Private Label Anti Hairfall and anti dandruff shampoo Manufacturer\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a reliable Private Label Anti Hairfall & Anti-Dandruff Shampoo Manufacturer,\noffering dual-action hair care formulations developed under certified international standards. All\nproducts are manufactured with strict quality control to ensure consistency and regulatory\ncompliance. We support complete private label and white label manufacturing, including formulation\ncustomization, packaging options, and branding assistance. With strong research and development\nbacking, Naturo & Orgo helps brands deliver effective and scalable hair care solutions. Certified\nwith ISO, GMP, AYUSH, and more, we are a trusted manufacturing partner.\n\n## FAQS\n\n### Q.1. Does this shampoo remove dandruff completely?\n\n**Ans.**It helps control dandruff with consistent and proper use.\n\n### Q.2. Can it be used daily?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, depending on scalp condition.\n\n### Q.3. Is it suitable for oily scalp?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, helps control excess scalp buildup.\n\n### Q.4. Does it dry the hair?\n\n**Ans.**Follow with conditioner for added softness.\n\n### Q.5. Is it suitable for men and women?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, suitable for all genders.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Related products\n* [[Private Label Apple Cider Vinegar Conditioner Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Apple Cider Vinegar Conditioner Manufacturer\n\n][35][Read more][36] [View Details][37]\n* [[Private Label Henna & Rosemary Hair Oil Paraben Mineral Oil Free Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Henna & Rosemary Hair Oil Paraben Mineral Oil Free Manufacturer\n\n][38][View Details][39]\n* [[Private Label Amla and Bhringraj Hair Conditioner Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Amla and Bhringraj Hair Conditioner Manufacturer\n\n][40][View Details][41]\n* [[Private Label Shikakai & Honey Hair Cleanser Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Shikakai & Honey Hair Cleanser Manufacturer\n\n][42][View Details][43]\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units sold every month, [Read More][44]\n\n###### Contact Us\n\n**Corporate Office Address**\n\n805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058\nPhone: +91-9599482900\nconnect@naturoandorgo.com\n\n**Manufacturing Plant Address **\n\nPlot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [Home][45]\n* [About Us][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Services][48]\n* [In The Press][49]\n* [Blog][50]\n* [Contact Us][51]\n* [Certifications][52]\n* [Our Clients][53]\n* [Media/News][54]\n* [Gallery][55]\n* [Events][56]\n\n###### Services\n* [Contact Manufacturing][57]\n* [Private Label][58]\n* [Custom Formulations][59]\n* [Custom Packaging][60]\n\n[Back to top of page][61]\n\n[1]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[2]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[3]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[4]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[5]: /services/\n[6]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[7]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[8]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[9]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[10]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[11]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://naturoandorgo.com/blog/\n[13]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/business/\n[14]: https://naturoandorgo.com/categ