            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nPrivate Label Papaya Face Wash Manufacturer\nFace Wash\n][20] [\nPrivate Label Groomessence All in 1Shampoo + Conditioner Manufacturer\nShampoo\n][21]\n[[Private Label Anti Hair Fall Shampoo Manufacturer]][22]\n\n# Private Label Anti Hair Fall Shampoo Manufacturer\n\n[Get a Quote][23]\n\n**Benefits: **\n**Moq: **1000 unit\n**Lead Time: **20 days/1000 unit\n**Packaging Size: **Multiple Packaging Sizes Available\n**Packaging Type: **Multiple Packaging Types Available**\n****Private Label: **Yes\n**Custom Formula: **Yes\n\nCategories: [Anti Hairfall][24], [Hair Care][25], [Shampoo][26]\n* Share\n* [0][27]\n* [0][28]\n* [0][29]\n* [0][30]\n* [ Description ][31]\n* [ Ingredients ][32]\n* [ Benefits ][33]\n* [ How to use ][34]\n\n## Description\n\nThis anti hair fall shampoo is developed to fit into regular hair care routines where consistent\ncleansing is an essential part of grooming practices. It integrates smoothly into daily or\nalternate-day wash schedules and is designed for individuals who follow structured hair maintenance\nhabits. The formulation spreads easily through the hair and scalp, allowing thorough cleansing\nwithout complicating existing routines. Designed for practicality and routine use, it aligns well\nwith personal care schedules focused on regular maintenance rather than occasional treatment. It\nfits naturally into long-term grooming habits where hair cleansing is approached methodically and\nconsistently.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Ingredients\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Benefits\n\nHelps reduce hair fall caused by breakage\nStrengthens hair from root to tip with regular use\nGently cleanses scalp without stripping natural oils\nSupports healthier-looking, thicker-feeling hair\nImproves hair texture and manageability\nSuitable for regular hair washing routines\n\n### *Related*\n\n## How to use\n\nApply to wet hair and scalp\nMassage gently to form lather\nRinse thoroughly with water\nUse regularly for best results\n\n### *Related*\n\n### Private Label Anti Hair Fall Shampoo Manufacturer\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a reliable Private Label Anti Hair Fall Shampoo Manufacturer, delivering targeted\nhair care formulations developed under certified international manufacturing standards. Our\nproduction process emphasizes quality consistency, safety, and regulatory compliance. We provide\nend-to-end private label solutions, including formulation customization, packaging options, and\nbranding support. With strong research and development capabilities, Naturo & Orgo ensures shampoo\nformulations are scalable and aligned with brand objectives. Certified with ISO, GMP, AYUSH, and\nother relevant accreditations, we are a dependable manufacturing partner.\n\n## FAQS\n\n### Q.1. Does this shampoo stop hair fall completely?\n\n**Ans.**It helps reduce hair fall caused by breakage with consistent use.\n\n### Q.2. Is it suitable for daily use?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, depending on hair and scalp type.\n\n### Q.3. Can it be used by men and women?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, suitable for all genders.\n\n### Q.4. Is it suitable for chemically treated hair?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, gentle enough for treated hair.\n\n### Q.5. How long before results are visible?\n\n**Ans.**Results may vary; regular use over weeks is recommended.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Related products\n* [[Private Label Shikakai & Honey Hair Cleanser Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Shikakai & Honey Hair Cleanser Manufacturer\n\n][35][Read more][36] [View Details][37]\n* [[Private Label Henaa and Tulsi Hair Cleanser Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Henaa and Tulsi Hair Cleanser Manufacturer\n\n][38][View Details][39]\n* [[Private Label Saffron Tulsi & Reetha Hair Cleanser Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Saffron Tulsi & Reetha Hair Cleanser Manufacturer\n\n][40][View Details][41]\n* [[Private Label Honey and Vanilla Hair Shampoo Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Honey and Vanilla Hair Shampoo Manufacturer\n\n][42][View Details][43]\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units sold every month, [Read More][44]\n\n###### Contact Us\n\n**Corporate Office Address**\n\n805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058\nPhone: +91-9599482900\nconnect@naturoandorgo.com\n\n**Manufacturing Plant Address **\n\nPlot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [Home][45]\n* [About Us][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Services][48]\n* [In The Press][49]\n* [Blog][50]\n* [Contact Us][51]\n* [Certifications][52]\n* [Our Clients][53]\n* [Media/News][54]\n* [Gallery][55]\n* [Events][56]\n\n###### Services\n* [Contact Manufacturing][57]\n* [Private Label][58]\n* [Custom Formulations][59]\n* [Custom Packaging][60]\n\n[Back to top of page][61]\n\n[1]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[2]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[3]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[4]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[5]: /services/\n[6]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[7]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[8]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[9]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[10]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[11]: https://naturoandorg