            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nPrivate Label Purelume cleanser Manufacturer\nSkin Care\n][20] [\nPrivate Label AHA BHA Scrub Manufacturer\nSkin Care\n][21]\n[[Private Label Cu peptide serum Manufacturer]][22]\n\n# Private Label Cu peptide serum Manufacturer\n\n[Get a Quote][23]\n\n**Benefits: **\n**Moq: **1000 unit\n**Lead Time: **20 days/1000 unit\n**Packaging Size: **Multiple Packaging Sizes Available\n**Packaging Type: **Multiple Packaging Types Available**\n****Private Label: **Yes\n**Custom Formula: **Yes\n\nCategories: [Skin Care][24], [Peptide][25], [Serum][26]\n* Share\n* [0][27]\n* [0][28]\n* [0][29]\n* [0][30]\n* [ Description ][31]\n* [ Ingredients ][32]\n* [ Benefits ][33]\n* [ How to use ][34]\n\n## Description\n\nThis copper peptide serum is developed for targeted skincare routines that emphasize structured,\ningredient-focused application. It is intended for controlled use and fits naturally into regimens\nwhere serums are applied after cleansing and before moisturising. The formulation integrates\nsmoothly into layered skincare routines and supports disciplined daily or professional care\npractices. Designed for consistency, it aligns with skincare habits that prioritize routine\nmaintenance and methodical application. It fits well into personal care schedules focused on\nlong-term skincare structure.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Ingredients\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Benefits\n\nHelps support skin repair and renewal processes\nImproves skin firmness and elasticity over time\nSupports smoother, healthier-looking skin texture\nHelps strengthen skin barrier function\nLightweight serum suitable for advanced skincare routines\nIdeal for regular anti-aging care\n\n### *Related*\n\n## How to use\n\nApply a few drops on clean skin\nMassage gently until absorbed\nUse once or twice daily\nFollow with moisturizer\n\n### *Related*\n\n### Private Label Cu peptide serum Manufacturer\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a trusted Private Label Copper Peptide Serum Manufacturer, offering advanced\nskincare formulations developed under certified international manufacturing standards. Each product\nundergoes rigorous quality checks to ensure stability, consistency, and compliance with regulatory\nrequirements. We provide comprehensive private label manufacturing services, including formulation\ncustomization, packaging options, and branding support. Supported by strong research and development\ncapabilities, Naturo & Orgo helps brands launch high-performance and scalable skincare serums.\nCertified with ISO, GMP, AYUSH, and more, we are a dependable contract manufacturing partner.\n\n## FAQS\n\n### Q.1. What are copper peptides used for?\n\n**Ans.**They support skin repair, firmness, and renewal.\n\n### Q.2. Is it suitable for daily use?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, can be used daily.\n\n### Q.3. Can sensitive skin use this serum?\n\n**Ans.**Patch testing is recommended.\n\n### Q.4. Can it be layered with other actives?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, generally compatible; avoid layering with strong exfoliants initially.\n\n### Q.5. Is it suitable for mature skin?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, especially beneficial for aging skin.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Related products\n* [[Private Label Wine Jelly Sleeping Mask Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Wine Jelly Sleeping Mask Manufacturer\n\n][35][Read more][36] [View Details][37]\n* [[Private Label Orange Brightening Face Wash Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Orange Brightening Face Wash Manufacturer\n\n][38][View Details][39]\n* [[Placeholder]\n\n## Private Label Aloe Vera Gentle Face Wash Manufacturer\n\n][40][View Details][41]\n* [[Private Label Vitamin C Glow Sleeping Mask Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Vitamin C Glow Sleeping Mask Manufacturer\n\n][42][View Details][43]\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units sold every month, [Read More][44]\n\n###### Contact Us\n\n**Corporate Office Address**\n\n805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058\nPhone: +91-9599482900\nconnect@naturoandorgo.com\n\n**Manufacturing Plant Address **\n\nPlot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [Home][45]\n* [About Us][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Services][48]\n* [In The Press][49]\n* [Blog][50]\n* [Contact Us][51]\n* [Certifications][52]\n* [Our Clients][53]\n* [Media/News][54]\n* [Gallery][55]\n* [Events][56]\n\n###### Services\n* [Contact Manufacturing][57]\n* [Private Label][58]\n* [Custom Formulations][59]\n* [Custom Packaging][60]\n\n[Back to top of page][61]\n\n[1]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[2]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[3]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[4]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[5]: /services/\n[6]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[7]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[8]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[9]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[10]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[11]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://naturoandorgo.com/blog/\n[13]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/business/\n[14]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/body-care/\n[15]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/hair-care/\n[16