            "text": "[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n* [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n* [Private Label Service][7]\n* [Custom Formulations][8]\n* [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n* [Business][13]\n* [Body Care][14]\n* [Hair Care][15]\n* [Skin Care][16]\n* [Baby Care][17]\n* [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\nPrivate Label Anti Hair Fall Shampoo Manufacturer\nAnti Hairfall\n][20] [\nPrivate Label Neem + Aloevera Soap Manufacturer\nBody Care\n][21]\n[[Private Label Groomessence All in 1Shampoo + Conditioner Manufacturer]][22]\n\n# Private Label Groomessence All in 1Shampoo + Conditioner Manufacturer\n\n[Get a Quote][23]\n\n**Benefits: **\n**Moq: **1000 unit\n**Lead Time: **20 days/1000 unit\n**Packaging Size: **Multiple Packaging Sizes Available\n**Packaging Type: **Multiple Packaging Types Available**\n****Private Label: **Yes\n**Custom Formula: **Yes\n\nCategories: [Shampoo][24], [Conditioner][25], [Hair Care][26]\n* Share\n* [0][27]\n* [0][28]\n* [0][29]\n* [0][30]\n* [ Description ][31]\n* [ Ingredients ][32]\n* [ Benefits ][33]\n* [ How to use ][34]\n\n## Description\n\nThis all-in-one shampoo and conditioner is formulated to simplify hair care routines by combining\nmultiple steps into one. It integrates easily into regular grooming practices where efficiency and\ntime management are priorities. The formulation allows smooth application through the hair and\nrinses cleanly, making it suitable for frequent use. Designed for consistent application, it fits\nnaturally into structured grooming schedules followed at home or in professional environments. It\nsupports hair care habits focused on convenience and routine consistency.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Ingredients\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Benefits\n\nCleanses and conditions hair in a single step\nReduces dryness and roughness after washing\nImproves hair smoothness and ease of combing\nSaves time and simplifies hair care routine\nLeaves hair light, soft, and clean\nSuitable for regular hair care use\n\n### *Related*\n\n## How to use\n\nApply to wet hair\nMassage gently\nRinse thoroughly\nRepeat if needed\n\n### *Related*\n\n### Private Label Groomessence All in 1Shampoo + Conditioner Manufacturer\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a reliable Private Label All-in-One Shampoo + Conditioner Manufacturer, offering\ncombined grooming formulations developed under certified international manufacturing protocols. All\nproducts undergo strict quality checks to ensure consistency and regulatory compliance. We provide\ncomplete private label manufacturing support, including formulation customization, fragrance\noptions, packaging design, and branding solutions. With strong research and development\ncapabilities, we ensure formulations are market-ready and scalable. Certified with ISO, GMP, and\nother quality standards, Naturo & Orgo is a preferred manufacturing partner for personal and pet\ncare brands.\n\n## FAQS\n\n### Q.1. Is this a 2-in-1 product?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, it works as both shampoo and conditioner.\n\n### Q.2. Is it suitable for daily use?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, gentle enough for regular use.\n\n### Q.3. Does it weigh hair down?\n\n**Ans.**No, balanced cleansing and conditioning formula.\n\n### Q.4. Is it suitable for all hair types?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, suitable for most hair types.\n\n### Q.5. Is it travel-friendly?\n\n**Ans.**Yes, ideal for quick and convenient grooming.\n\n### *Related*\n\n## Related products\n* [[Private Label Shikakai & Honey Hair Cleanser Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Shikakai & Honey Hair Cleanser Manufacturer\n\n][35][Read more][36] [View Details][37]\n* [[Private Label Greentea and Aloevera Hair Conditioner Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Greentea and Aloevera Hair Conditioner Manufacturer\n\n][38][View Details][39]\n* [[Private Label Saffron Tulsi & Reetha Hair Cleanser Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Saffron Tulsi & Reetha Hair Cleanser Manufacturer\n\n][40][View Details][41]\n* [[Private Label Methi Bhringraj Conditioner Manufacturer]\n\n## Private Label Methi Bhringraj Conditioner Manufacturer\n\n][42][View Details][43]\n\n###### About Us\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading brand that provides natural and organic products for a healthier\nlifestyle. We believe in the power of nature and its ability to nourish and heal our bodies. Naturo\nand Orgo have consistently demonstrated a remarkable total of 800 sku's manufactured every month\nfrom approximately 3 million units sold every month, [Read More][44]\n\n###### Contact Us\n\n**Corporate Office Address**\n\n805, Shahpuri Tower C-58, Community Centre Near Cinepolis Janak Cinema Janakpuri New Delhi : 110058\nPhone: +91-9599482900\nconnect@naturoandorgo.com\n\n**Manufacturing Plant Address **\n\nPlot No. 133, Sector-5 IMT Manesar, Gurugram, Haryana, India - 122052\n\n###### Quick Links\n* [Home][45]\n* [About Us][46]\n* [Products][47]\n* [Services][48]\n* [In The Press][49]\n* [Blog][50]\n* [Contact Us][51]\n* [Certifications][52]\n* [Our Clients][53]\n* [Media/News][54]\n* [Gallery][55]\n* [Events][56]\n\n###### Services\n* [Contact Manufacturing][57]\n* [Private Label][58]\n* [Custom Formulations][59]\n* [Custom Packaging][60]\n\n[Back to top of page][61]\n\n[1]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[2]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[3]: https://naturoandorgo.com/\n[4]: https://naturoandorgo.com/about-us/\n[5]: /services/\n[6]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contract-manufacturing/\n[7]: https://naturoandorgo.com/private-label-third-party-cosmetic-manufacturer/\n[8]: https://naturoandorgo.com/formulations/\n[9]: https://naturoandorgo.com/custom-packaging/\n[10]: https://naturoandorgo.com/products/\n[11]: https://naturoandorgo.com/contact-us/\n[12]: https://naturoandorgo.com/blog/\n[13]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/business/\n[14]: https://naturoandorgo.com/category/blog/body-care/\n[15]: https