        "crawl_text": "Onocado Farm Enterprises Company Limited Agribusiness Tanzania International Njombe Highlands, Tanzania AML Tower 3rd Floor, Sam Nujoma Rd Tanzania Njombe Highlands, Tanzania Worldwide Home - onocado farm\n\nonocado farm\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nOur Products\n\nHass Avocados\n\nPremium Habanero Chilies\n\nPure Cold-Pressed Avocado Oil\n\nSustainability\n\nContact\n\nFAQ\n\nSustainable Farming\nExceptional Produce\n\nTrusted Worldwide\n\nKnow More\n\nabout us\n\nOur&nbsp;Main Goal is to provide Premium-Quality Agricultural Products that meet International Standards\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises Company Limited produces premium Hass avocados, vibrant habanero chilies, and nutrient-rich cold-pressed avocado oil in the Njombe Highlands of Tanzania. With sustainable farming, careful handling, and high-altitude growing conditions, we deliver products with exceptional quality, flavor, and shelf life to buyers worldwide\n\nLearn More About Us\n\nOur products\n\nFrom Ou r Farms to You\n\nHess Avocados\n\nCreamy, rich-flavored Hass avocados grown in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands.\n\nhabanero Chilies\n\nVibrant, hand-harvested habanero chilies with intense flavor and premium quality.\n\nAvocado Oil\n\n100% pure cold-pressed avocado oil, nutrient-rich and perfect for culinary or cosmetic use.\n\nHarvest &amp; Logistics\n\nOur Harvest &amp; Delivery Process\n\nOur Hass avocados are harvested from February to September, ensuring peak quality and freshness, while our habanero chilies are harvested throughout the year, with multiple picking cycles depending on maturity. We provide consistent weekly shipments of both products, with flexible delivery options via air freight (3\u20134 days to Hong Kong) or sea freight (21\u201324 days). Products are packed in 4 kg or 10 kg ventilated cartons, with private label options available for bulk orders. To maintain optimal quality, all produce is pre-cooled within hours of harvest and stored at 5\u20137\u00b0C, guaranteeing freshness from our farms to your business.\n\nView Harvest Details\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises | Tanzania's Premium Export Agribusiness\n\nPlace Your Oder\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises | Tanzania's Premium Export Agribusiness\n\nCONTACT US\n\nAbout Us\n\nAt our farm in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands, we are passionate about cultivating the finest produce. Dedicated to quality, sustainability, and responsible farming, we grow avocados and produce paper products that meet international standards while supporting our local communities\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\n{{icon_label}}\n\nQuick Links\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nContact Us\n\nAML Tower 3rd Floor, Sam Nujoma Rd\n\n+255 (0) 719865116\n\ninfo@onocadofarm.co.tz\n\n\u00a9 2025 onocado farm\n\nCustomize Reject All Accept All\n\n&#10006;\n\n... Show more\n\n&#9658; Necessary Cookies Standard\nNecessary cookies enable essential site features like secure log-ins and consent preference adjustments. They do not store personal data.\nNone\n\n&#9658; Functional Cookies Remark\nFunctional cookies support features like content sharing on social media, collecting feedback, and enabling third-party tools.\nNone\n\n&#9658; Analytical Cookies Remark\nAnalytical cookies track visitor interactions, providing insights on metrics like visitor count, bounce rate, and traffic sources.\nNone\n\n&#9658; Advertisment Cookies Remark\nAdvertisement cookies deliver personalized ads based on your previous visits and analyze the effectiveness of ad campaigns.\nNone\n\n&#9658; Unclassified Cookies Remark\nUnclassified cookies are cookies that we are in the process of classifying, together with the providers of individual cookies.\nNone\nReject All Save My Preferences Accept All onocado farm\nPremium Fresh Farm Produce\n][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About][3]\n* [Our Products][4]\n* [Hass Avocados][5]\n* [Premium Habanero Chilies][6]\n* [Pure Cold-Pressed Avocado Oil][7]\n* [Sustainability][8]\n* [Contact][9]\n* [FAQ][10]\n[ Q&A ][11]\n\n## Fresh, Sustainable, and Trusted Worldwide\n\n## Who We Are\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises Company Limited is a proudly Tanzanian agribusiness specializing in the\ncultivation and export of premium Hass avocados, vibrant habanero chilies, and pure avocado oil. Our\nfarms are located in the lush Njombe Highlands, where the combination of fertile volcanic soils,\nhigh altitude, and favorable climate creates the perfect environment for growing world-class\nproduce.\n\nAs a company, we are driven by a passion for agriculture, sustainability, and excellence. We combine\ntraditional farming knowledge with modern agricultural practices to ensure that our products meet\nthe highest global standards. Over the years, we have positioned ourselves as a trusted partner for\ninternational buyers seeking quality, consistency, and reliability.\n\nWhat we do\n\nAt Onocado, we manage every stage of production with great care\u2014from planting and nurturing our\ncrops to harvesting, sorting, and packaging. Our Hass avocados are celebrated for their creamy\ntexture and long shelf life, our habanero chilies are hand-harvested for maximum flavor and heat,\nand our avocado oil is cold-pressed to preserve its rich nutrients, making it ideal for both\nculinary and cosmetic use.\n\nWe work closely with logistics partners to ensure timely and efficient deliveries through both air\nand sea freight, depending on client needs. Our produce is carefully pre-cooled, graded, and packed\nin ventilated cartons to maintain freshness from farm to market. Beyond supply, we are committed to\nsustainable farming practices that protect the environment, support local communities, and promote\nfood safety.\n\n## Our Main Goal\n\nOur main goal is to provide premium quality products that consistently meet international standards,\nwhile at the same time promoting sustainable farming practices that protect the environment for\nfuture generations. We are committed to empowering local farmers by creating employment\nopportunities, sharing knowledge, and strengthening communities in the Njombe Highlands. Beyond\nsupplying world-class Hass avocados, habanero chilies, and avocado oil, we focus on building\nlong-term partnerships with our buyers, founded on trust, reliability, and transparency. By\nbalancing quality, sustainability, and community impact, we aim to position Onocado Farm Enterprises\nas a dependable and socially responsible supplier in the global agro-market.\n\n## About Us\n\nAt our farm in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands, we are passionate about cultivating the finest produce.\nDedicated to quality, sustainability, and responsible farming, we grow avocados and produce paper\nproducts that meet international standards while supporting our local communities\n\nFacebook\n][12]\nTwitter\n][13]\nInstagram\n][14]\n{{icon_label}}\n][15]\n\n## Quick Links\n* Home\n* About\n* Contact\n\n## Contact Us\n* AML Tower 3rd Floor, Sam Nujoma Rd\n* +255 (0) 719865116\n\n[ info@onocadofarm.co.tz][16]\n[ \u00a9 2025 onocado farm ][17]\nCustomize Reject All Accept All\n... Show more\n\u25ba Necessary Cookies Standard\nNecessary cookies enable essential site features like secure log-ins and consent preference\nadjustments. They do not store personal data.\nNone\n\u25ba Functional Cookies Remark\nFunctional cookies support features like content sharing on social media, collecting feedback, and\nenabling third-party tools.\nNone\n\u25ba Analytical Cookies Remark\nAnalytical cookies track visitor interactions, providing insights on metrics like visitor count,\nbounce rate, and traffic sources.\nNone\n\u25ba Advertisment Cookies Remark\nAdvertisement cookies deliver personalized ads based on your previous visits and analyze the\neffectiveness of ad campaigns.\nNone\n\u25ba Unclassified Cookies Remark\nUnclassified cookies are cookies that we are in the process of classifying, together with the\nproviders of individual cookies.\nNone\nReject All Save My Preferences Accept All\n[Re-consent]\n\n[1]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz\n[2]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/\n[3]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[4]: #\n[5]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/hass-avocados-2/\n[6]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/premium-habanero-chilies/\n[7]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/pure-cold-pressed-avocado-oil/\n[8]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/sustainability/\n[9]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/contact/\n[10]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/faq/\n[11]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/faq/\n[12]: https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[13]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[14]: https://www.instagram.com/\n[15]: {{social_url}}\n[16]: mailto:info@onocadofarm.co.tz\n[17]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz onocadofarm.co.tz Home - onocado farm\n\nonocado farm\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nOur Products\n\nHass Avocados\n\nPremium Habanero Chilies\n\nPure Cold-Pressed Avocado Oil\n\nSustainability\n\nContact\n\nFAQ\n\nSustainable Farming\nExceptional Produce\n\nTrusted Worldwide\n\nKnow More\n\nabout us\n\nOur&nbsp;Main Goal is to provide Premium-Quality Agricultural Products that meet International Standards\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises Company Limited produces premium Hass avocados, vibrant habanero chilies, and nutrient-rich cold-pressed avocado oil in the Njombe Highlands of Tanzania. With sustainable farming, careful handling, and high-altitude growing conditions, we deliver products with exceptional quality, flavor, and shelf life to buyers worldwide\n\nLearn More About Us\n\nOur products\n\nFrom Ou r Farms to You\n\nHess Avocados\n\nCreamy, rich-flavored Hass avocados grown in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands.\n\nhabanero Chilies\n\nVibrant, hand-harvested habanero chilies with intense flavor and premium quality.\n\nAvocado Oil\n\n100% pure cold-pressed avocado oil, nutrient-rich and perfect for culinary or cosmetic use.\n\nHarvest &amp; Logistics\n\nOur Harvest &amp; Delivery Process\n\nOur Hass avocados are harvested from February to September, ensuring peak quality and freshness, while our habanero chilies are harvested throughout the year, with multiple picking cycles depending on maturity. We provide consistent weekly shipments of both products, with flexible delivery options via air freight (3\u20134 days to Hong Kong) or sea freight (21\u201324 days). Products are packed in 4 kg or 10 kg ventilated cartons, with private label options available for bulk orders. To maintain optimal quality, all produce is pre-cooled within hours of harvest and stored at 5\u20137\u00b0C, guaranteeing freshness from our farms to your business.\n\nView Harvest Details\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises | Tanzania's Premium Export Agribusiness\n\nPlace Your Oder\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises | Tanzania's Premium Export Agribusiness\n\nCONTACT US\n\nAbout Us\n\nAt our farm in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands, we are passionate about cultivating the finest produce. Dedicated to quality, sustainability, and responsible farming, we grow avocados and produce paper products that meet international standards while supporting our local communities\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\n{{icon_label}}\n\nQuick Links\n\nHome\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nContact Us\n\nAML Tower 3rd Floor, Sam Nujoma Rd\n\n+255 (0) 719865116\n\ninfo@onocadofarm.co.tz\n\n\u00a9 2025 onocado farm\n\nCustomize Reject All Accept All\n\n&#10006;\n\n... Show more\n\n&#9658; Necessary Cookies Standard\nNecessary cookies enable essential site features like secure log-ins and consent preference adjustments. They do not store personal data.\nNone\n\n&#9658; Functional Cookies Remark\nFunctional cookies support features like content sharing on social media, collecting feedback, and enabling third-party tools.\nNone\n\n&#9658; Analytical Cookies Remark\nAnalytical cookies track visitor interactions, providing insights on metrics like visitor count, bounce rate, and traffic sources.\nNone\n\n&#9658; Advertisment Cookies Remark\nAdvertisement cookies deliver personalized ads based on your previous