        "crawl_text": "Pacifica Culinaria Vista, CA United States top of page\n\n###### **FREE SHIPPING - ON ALL ORDERS OVER $99 ** (Continental United States)\n* [Home][1]\n* * [Avocado Oils][2]\n* [Vinegars][3]\n* [Olive Oils][4]\n* [Other Condiments][5]\n* [Culinary Tools][6]\n* [Gift Items][7]\n* [Order Information][8]\n* * [Avocado Oil 3 Packs][9]\n* [Avocado Oils][10]\n* [Infused Vinegars][11]\n* [Olive Oil][12]\n* [Salad Packs][13]\n* [Spicy Beans][14]\n* [Gift Items][15]\n* [Culinary Tools][16]\n* [Monthly Specials][17]\n* [All Products][18]\n* [Benefits and Uses][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [FAQ][21]\n\n# PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\n### Gourmet Avocado Oil, Olive Oil & Premium Aged Balsamic Vinegar\n\n###### Call Now\n\n###### [1-800-622-8880][22]\n\n## Contact\n\nPlease contact us if you would like more information on any of our products. We welcome any comments\nor suggestions you may have and invite you to submit recipes for our products.\n\nAddress: PO Box 507 | Vista, CA 92085\n\nEmail: [sales@pacificaculinaria.com][23]\n\nToll Free: [(800) 622-8880][24]\nTelephone: [(760) 727-9883][25]\nFax: [(760) 727-9886][26]\n\nYour details were sent successfully!\n\nSend\n\n###### Keep in touch: For inspiration, special offers and promotions, follow us on Facebook,\n###### Twitter and Pinterest\n* [[Facebook App Icon]][27]\n* [[Twitter App Icon]][28]\n* [[Pinterest App Icon]][29]\n\n[About Us][30] | [Wholesale Information][31] | [Wholesale Products][32] | [Testimonials][33]\n| [Press Room][34]\n\nAll contents and photography \u00a9 2023 Pacifica Culinaria\n\nPO Box 507\nVista, CA 92085\n\nCustomer Service: [1-800-622-8880][35]\n\nFor any Questions, Drop us a line:\n\n[sales@pacificaculinaria.com][36]\n* [[Facebook App Icon]][37]\n* [[Instagram Social Icon]][38]\n* [[Twitter App Icon]][39]\n* [[Pinterest App Icon]][40]\n\nYour details were sent successfully!\n\nSend\n\n###### PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com\n[2]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-avocado-oils\n[3]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-vinegars-c9j0\n[4]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/olive-oils\n[5]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/other-condiments\n[6]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/culinary-tools-c19rr\n[7]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/gift-items\n[8]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/order-information\n[9]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/avocado-oil-3-packs\n[10]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/avocado-oils\n[11]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-vinegars-c528\n[12]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/olive-oil\n[13]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/salad-packs\n[14]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/spicy-beans\n[15]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/gift-items\n[16]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/culinary-tools-c24s4\n[17]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/monthly-specials\n[18]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/all-products\n[19]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/benefits-and-uses\n[20]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/contact\n[21]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/faq\n[22]: tel:1-800-622-8880\n[23]: mailto:sales@pacificaculinaria.com\n[24]: tel:(800) 622-8880\n[25]: tel:(760) 727-9883\n[26]: tel:(760) 727-9886\n[27]: https://www.facebook.com/PacificaCulinaria92081?fref=ts\n[28]: https://twitter.com/pacifica92081\n[29]: https://www.pinterest.com/pacifica92081/\n[30]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/about-us\n[31]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/information\n[32]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/products\n[33]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/testimonials\n[34]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/press\n[35]: tel:1-800-622-8880\n[36]: mailto:sales@pacificaculinaria.com\n[37]: https://www.facebook.com/PacificaCulinaria92081\n[38]: https://www.instagram.com/pacifica_culinaria/\n[39]: https://twitter.com/@PacificaCuli\n[40]: https://www.pinterest.com/pacifica92081/ top of page\n\n# PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\n###### **FREE SHIPPING - ON ALL ORDERS OVER $99 ** (Continental United States)\n\n### Gourmet Avocado Oil, Olive Oil & Premium Aged Balsamic Vinegar\n\n###### Call Now\n\n###### 1-800-622-8880\n* [[Facebook App Icon]][1]\n* [[Instagram Social Icon]][2]\n* [[Twitter App Icon]][3]\n* [[Pinterest App Icon]][4]\n* [\n\nHome\n\n][5]\n* Our Products\n* [Avocado Oils][6]\n* [Vinegars][7]\n* [Olive Oils][8]\n* [Other Condiments][9]\n* [Culinary Tools][10]\n* [Gift Items][11]\n* [Order Information][12]\n* Shop\n* [Avocado Oil 3 Packs][13]\n* [Avocado Oils][14]\n* [Infused Vinegars][15]\n* [Olive Oil][16]\n* [Salad Packs][17]\n* [Spicy Beans][18]\n* [Gift Items][19]\n* [Culinary Tools][20]\n* [Monthly Specials][21]\n* [All Products][22]\n* [\n\nBenefits and Uses\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nContact\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nFAQ\n\n][25]\n* More\n\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n\n## About Us\n\nCSI has been manufacturing and packaging quality nutritional and gourmet food products for over 30\nyears. We are proud to announce that we have expanded our product line by purchasing Pacifica\nCulinaria, a premier gourmet food manufacturer specializing in avocado oils for cooking. We\ncurrently offer twelve varieties of our flavor infused avocado oils including award-winning Blood\nOrange as well as Key Lime, Coastal Lemon and savory infusions such as Toasted Onion and Roasted\nGarlic. We also offer thick and rich balsamic vinegars from Modena, Italy, along with our new line\nof Olive Oils. Lastly, we offer a unique collection of premium culinary tools specifically for the\navocado lover.\n\nHealthier than the commonly used olive oil, this luxurious oil is made from avocados which are\nnaturally cholesterol free, contain heart-healthy mono-unsaturated fats (the \"good\" fats) and is a\nrich source of Vitamin E. Avocado oil has one of the highest smoke points at over 500 degrees, which\nmakes it great for saut\u00e9ing, searing or stir-frying. The infused oils are created by an oil to oil\ninfusion resulting in a healthier flavorful oil choice.\n\nOur main office and warehouses are located in Vista, California. From there we manufacture, market\nand ship our high-quality collection of specialty gourmet food items to wholesalers, distributors,\nand retailers nationwide. Our products are sold to specialty food markets via sales representatives\ncovering the entire United States. We also sell direct to customers from our on-line store at\n[www.PacificaCulinaria.com][26] and over the phone at(800) 622-8880 or (760) 727-9883.\n\nWe pride ourselves on excellent customer service and satisfaction. We operate with a\ncustomer-oriented style carried out by skilled professionals working hard to ensure delivery of top\nquality, gourmet specialty food items and unique culinary tool products.\n\n# Pacifica Culinaria Avocado Oils, Olive Oils & Balsamic Vinegars.\n\n[About Us][27] | [Wholesale Information][28] | [Wholesale Products][29] | [Testimonials][30]\n| [Press Room][31]\n\nAll contents and photography \u00a9 2023 Pacifica Culinaria\n\nPO Box 507\nVista, CA 92085\n\nCustomer Service: 1-800-622-8880\n\nFor any Questions, Drop us a line:\n\n[sales@pacificaculinaria.com][32]\n\n###### PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\nYour details were sent successfully!\n\nSend\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/PacificaCulinaria92081\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/pacifica_culinaria/\n[3]: https://twitter.com/@PacificaCuli\n[4]: https://www.pinterest.com/pacifica92081/\n[5]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com\n[6]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-avocado-oils\n[7]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-vinegars-c9j0\n[8]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/olive-oils\n[9]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/other-condiments\n[10]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/culinary-tools-c19rr\n[11]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/gift-items\n[12]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/order-information\n[13]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/avocado-oil-3-packs\n[14]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/avocado-oils\n[15]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-vinegars-c528\n[16]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/olive-oil\n[17]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/salad-packs\n[18]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/spicy-beans\n[19]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/gift-items\n[20]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/culinary-tools-c24s4\n[21]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/monthly-specials\n[22]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/all-products\n[23]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/benefits-and-uses\n[24]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/contact\n[25]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/faq\n[26]: http://www.PacificaCulinaria.com\n[27]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/about-us\n[28]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/information\n[29]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/products\n[30]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/testimonials\n[31]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/press\n[32]: mailto:sales@pacificaculinaria.com top of page\n\n# PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\n###### **FREE SHIPPING - ON ALL ORDERS OVER $99 ** (Continental United States)\n\n### Gourmet Avocado Oil, Olive Oil & Premium Aged Balsamic Vinegar\n\n###### Call Now\n\n###### 1-800-622-8880\n* [[Facebook App Icon]][1]\n* [[Instagram Social Icon]][2]\n* [[Twitter App Icon]][3]\n* [[Pinterest App Icon]][4]\n* [\n\nHome\n\n][5]\n* Our Products\n* [Avocado Oils][6]\n* [Vinegars][7]\n* [Olive Oils][8]\n* [Other Condiments][9]\n* [Culinary Tools][10]\n* [Gift Items][11]\n* [Order Information][12]\n* Shop\n* [Avocado Oil 3 Packs][13]\n* [Avocado Oils][14]\n* [Infused Vinegars][15]\n* [Olive Oil][16]\n* [Salad Packs][17]\n* [Spicy Beans][18]\n* [Gift Items][19]\n* [Culinary Tools][20]\n* [Monthly Specials][21]\n* [All Products][22]\n* [\n\nBenefits and Uses\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nContact\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nFAQ\n\n][25]\n* More\n\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n\n## Wholesale Products\n\nOlive Oils\n\nOur Extra Virgin Olive Oils are California grown and certified, and come infused with a variety of\ndelicious flavors. Available in Arbequina Extra Virgin, Lemon, Garlic, Blood Orange, Basil, and\nGarlic/Herb/Sun Dried Tomato flavors. Available in 8.5 oz bottles sold in 12 per case or 1/2 gallon\ncontainers for Food Service / Wholesale.\n\nAvocado Oils\n\nPacifica Culinaria offers a line of all-natural infused avocado oils. Blending avocado oil with\nunique flavors creates many culinary possibilities and maximizes the health benefits of oil that is\nhigh in monounsaturated fats (\"good fats\") which help lower cholesterol and promote heart health.\nThe avocado is known to reduce the risk of cancer and diabetes and enhances the bioavailability of\ncarotenoid-rich fruits and vegetables. Avocado oil's multi-functionality makes it a must-have in the\nkitchen. With its high smoke point (500 degrees) it is ideal for searing, frying, grilling and\nsaut\u00e9ing. Its light, silky texture and refined taste is the perfect ingredient for salad dressings.\nAvailable in Blood Orange (winner for Outstanding Oil at the NASFT Fancy Food show), All Natural,\nKey Lime, Coastal Lemon, Roasted Garlic, Roasted Chili, Toasted Onion, Lemon Pepper, Tuscan Herb,\nProvencal Herb. Available in 8.5 oz bottles sold in 12 per case or 1/2 gallon containers for Food\nService / Wholesale.\n\nInfused Vinegars\n\nOur Modena gourmet balsamic vinegars are deliciously rich and thick balsamic vinegars that begin\nwith grape must -- whole pressed grapes complete with juice, skin, seeds and stems. It's then\ncarefully processed and aged for years before it can bear the name of \"balsamic\". We have developed\nunique blends such as Mission Fig, Pomegranate, Blackberry, Peach, Pear, Strawberry, Dark Chocolate,\nBianco White, and our Traditional Aged. Available in 8.5 oz bottles sold in 12 per case or 1/2\ngallon containers for Food Service / Wholesale.\n\n# Pacifica Culinaria Avocado Oils, Olive Oils & Balsamic Vinegars.\n\n[About Us][26] | [Wholesale Information][27] | [Wholesale Products][28] | [Testimonials][29]\n| [Press Room][30]\n\nAll contents and photography \u00a9 2023 Pacifica Culinaria\n\nPO Box 507\nVista, CA 92085\n\nCustomer Service: 1-800-622-8880\n\nFor any Questions, Drop us a line:\n\n[sales@pacificaculinaria.com][31]\n\n###### PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\nYour details were sent successfully!\n\nSend\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/PacificaCulinaria92081\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/pacifica_culinaria/\n[3]: https:"
