            "text": "top of page\n\n###### **FREE SHIPPING - ON ALL ORDERS OVER $99 ** (Continental United States)\n* [Home][1]\n* * [Avocado Oils][2]\n* [Vinegars][3]\n* [Olive Oils][4]\n* [Other Condiments][5]\n* [Culinary Tools][6]\n* [Gift Items][7]\n* [Order Information][8]\n* * [Avocado Oil 3 Packs][9]\n* [Avocado Oils][10]\n* [Infused Vinegars][11]\n* [Olive Oil][12]\n* [Salad Packs][13]\n* [Spicy Beans][14]\n* [Gift Items][15]\n* [Culinary Tools][16]\n* [Monthly Specials][17]\n* [All Products][18]\n* [Benefits and Uses][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [FAQ][21]\n\n# PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\n### Gourmet Avocado Oil, Olive Oil & Premium Aged Balsamic Vinegar\n\n###### Call Now\n\n###### [1-800-622-8880][22]\n\n## Contact\n\nPlease contact us if you would like more information on any of our products. We welcome any comments\nor suggestions you may have and invite you to submit recipes for our products.\n\nAddress: PO Box 507 | Vista, CA 92085\n\nEmail: [sales@pacificaculinaria.com][23]\n\nToll Free: [(800) 622-8880][24]\nTelephone: [(760) 727-9883][25]\nFax: [(760) 727-9886][26]\n\nYour details were sent successfully!\n\nSend\n\n###### Keep in touch: For inspiration, special offers and promotions, follow us on Facebook,\n###### Twitter and Pinterest\n* [[Facebook App Icon]][27]\n* [[Twitter App Icon]][28]\n* [[Pinterest App Icon]][29]\n\n[About Us][30] | [Wholesale Information][31] | [Wholesale Products][32] | [Testimonials][33]\n| [Press Room][34]\n\nAll contents and photography \u00a9 2023 Pacifica Culinaria\n\nPO Box 507\nVista, CA 92085\n\nCustomer Service: [1-800-622-8880][35]\n\nFor any Questions, Drop us a line:\n\n[sales@pacificaculinaria.com][36]\n* [[Facebook App Icon]][37]\n* [[Instagram Social Icon]][38]\n* [[Twitter App Icon]][39]\n* [[Pinterest App Icon]][40]\n\nYour details were sent successfully!\n\nSend\n\n###### PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com\n[2]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-avocado-oils\n[3]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-vinegars-c9j0\n[4]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/olive-oils\n[5]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/other-condiments\n[6]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/culinary-tools-c19rr\n[7]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/gift-items\n[8]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/order-information\n[9]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/avocado-oil-3-packs\n[10]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/avocado-oils\n[11]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-vinegars-c528\n[12]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/olive-oil\n[13]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/salad-packs\n[14]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/spicy-beans\n[15]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/gift-items\n[16]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/culinary-tools-c24s4\n[17]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/monthly-specials\n[18]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/all-products\n[19]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/benefits-and-uses\n[20]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/contact\n[21]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/faq\n[22]: tel:1-800-622-8880\n[23]: mailto:sales@pacificaculinaria.com\n[24]: tel:(800) 622-8880\n[25]: tel:(760) 727-9883\n[26]: tel:(760) 727-9886\n[27]: https://www.facebook.com/PacificaCulinaria92081?fref=ts\n[28]: https://twitter.com/pacifica92081\n[29]: https://www.pinterest.com/pacifica92081/\n[30]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/about-us\n[31]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/information\n[32]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/products\n[33]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/testimonials\n[34]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/press\n[35]: tel:1-800-622-8880\n[36]: mailto:sales@pacificaculinaria.com\n[37]: https://www.facebook.com/PacificaCulinaria92081\n[38]: https://www.instagram.com/pacifica_culinaria/\n[39]: https://twitter.com/@PacificaCuli\n[40]: https://www.pinterest.com/pacifica92081/"
