          {
            "url": "https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/products",
            "text": "top of page\n\n# PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\n###### **FREE SHIPPING - ON ALL ORDERS OVER $99 ** (Continental United States)\n\n### Gourmet Avocado Oil, Olive Oil & Premium Aged Balsamic Vinegar\n\n###### Call Now\n\n###### 1-800-622-8880\n* [[Facebook App Icon]][1]\n* [[Instagram Social Icon]][2]\n* [[Twitter App Icon]][3]\n* [[Pinterest App Icon]][4]\n* [\n\nHome\n\n][5]\n* Our Products\n* [Avocado Oils][6]\n* [Vinegars][7]\n* [Olive Oils][8]\n* [Other Condiments][9]\n* [Culinary Tools][10]\n* [Gift Items][11]\n* [Order Information][12]\n* Shop\n* [Avocado Oil 3 Packs][13]\n* [Avocado Oils][14]\n* [Infused Vinegars][15]\n* [Olive Oil][16]\n* [Salad Packs][17]\n* [Spicy Beans][18]\n* [Gift Items][19]\n* [Culinary Tools][20]\n* [Monthly Specials][21]\n* [All Products][22]\n* [\n\nBenefits and Uses\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nContact\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nFAQ\n\n][25]\n* More\n\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n\n## Wholesale Products\n\nOlive Oils\n\nOur Extra Virgin Olive Oils are California grown and certified, and come infused with a variety of\ndelicious flavors. Available in Arbequina Extra Virgin, Lemon, Garlic, Blood Orange, Basil, and\nGarlic/Herb/Sun Dried Tomato flavors. Available in 8.5 oz bottles sold in 12 per case or 1/2 gallon\ncontainers for Food Service / Wholesale.\n\nAvocado Oils\n\nPacifica Culinaria offers a line of all-natural infused avocado oils. Blending avocado oil with\nunique flavors creates many culinary possibilities and maximizes the health benefits of oil that is\nhigh in monounsaturated fats (\"good fats\") which help lower cholesterol and promote heart health.\nThe avocado is known to reduce the risk of cancer and diabetes and enhances the bioavailability of\ncarotenoid-rich fruits and vegetables. Avocado oil's multi-functionality makes it a must-have in the\nkitchen. With its high smoke point (500 degrees) it is ideal for searing, frying, grilling and\nsaut\u00e9ing. Its light, silky texture and refined taste is the perfect ingredient for salad dressings.\nAvailable in Blood Orange (winner for Outstanding Oil at the NASFT Fancy Food show), All Natural,\nKey Lime, Coastal Lemon, Roasted Garlic, Roasted Chili, Toasted Onion, Lemon Pepper, Tuscan Herb,\nProvencal Herb. Available in 8.5 oz bottles sold in 12 per case or 1/2 gallon containers for Food\nService / Wholesale.\n\nInfused Vinegars\n\nOur Modena gourmet balsamic vinegars are deliciously rich and thick balsamic vinegars that begin\nwith grape must -- whole pressed grapes complete with juice, skin, seeds and stems. It's then\ncarefully processed and aged for years before it can bear the name of \"balsamic\". We have developed\nunique blends such as Mission Fig, Pomegranate, Blackberry, Peach, Pear, Strawberry, Dark Chocolate,\nBianco White, and our Traditional Aged. Available in 8.5 oz bottles sold in 12 per case or 1/2\ngallon containers for Food Service / Wholesale.\n\n# Pacifica Culinaria Avocado Oils, Olive Oils & Balsamic Vinegars.\n\n[About Us][26] | [Wholesale Information][27] | [Wholesale Products][28] | [Testimonials][29]\n| [Press Room][30]\n\nAll contents and photography \u00a9 2023 Pacifica Culinaria\n\nPO Box 507\nVista, CA 92085\n\nCustomer Service: 1-800-622-8880\n\nFor any Questions, Drop us a line:\n\n[sales@pacificaculinaria.com][31]\n\n###### PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\nYour details were sent successfully!\n\nSend\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/PacificaCulinaria92081\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/pacifica_culinaria/\n[3]: https://twitter.com/@PacificaCuli\n[4]: https://www.pinterest.com/pacifica92081/\n[5]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com\n[6]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-avocado-oils\n[7]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-vinegars-c9j0\n[8]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/olive-oils\n[9]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/other-condiments\n[10]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/culinary-tools-c19rr\n[11]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/gift-items\n[12]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/order-information\n[13]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/avocado-oil-3-packs\n[14]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/avocado-oils\n[15]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/infused-vinegars-c528\n[16]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/olive-oil\n[17]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/salad-packs\n[18]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/spicy-beans\n[19]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/gift-items\n[20]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/culinary-tools-c24s4\n[21]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/monthly-specials\n[22]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/all-products\n[23]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/benefits-and-uses\n[24]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/contact\n[25]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/faq\n[26]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/about-us\n[27]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/information\n[28]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/products\n[29]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/testimonials\n[30]: https://www.pacificaculinaria.com/press\n[31]: mailto:sales@pacificaculinaria.com"
