        "products": "Lavender Oil; Tea Tree Oil; Eucalyptus Oil; Lemongrass Oil; Rosemary Oil; Cinnamon Oil; Jasmine Essential Oil; Peppermint Oil; Frankincense Oil; Agarwood Oil; Ajwain Oil; Anise Oil; Bergamot Oil; Bhringraj Oil; Black Pepper Oil; Brahmi Oil; Cardamom Oil; Celery Seed Oil; Chamomile Oil; Clove Oil; Coriander Oil; Cumin Oil; Curry Leaf Oil; Garlic Oil; Geranium Oil; Ginger Lily Oil; Ginger Oil; Jyotishmati Oil; Kumkumadi Oil; Lemon Oil; Mandarin Oil; Nagarmotha Oil; Neroli Oil; Orange Oil",
