        "crawl_text": "AG Industries ISO Certified, GMP Compliant India North America Europe Asia-Pacific USA Asia Global Australia ISO Certified GMP Compliant FSSAI HALAL FDA ISO GMP MSME Strong R&D department State-of-the-art manufacturing facilities Global distribution network Exceptional Quality Control Global Export Reach Customized Solutions Sustainable sourcing practices High-quality standards Ethical sourcing Customized solutions High-quality sourcing from trusted farmers Stringent quality control processes Global export capabilities High-quality products FDA approved products GMP guidelines FDA ISO GMP ISO certified Compliant with international quality standards FSSAI MSME HALAL C-11, Sector 85, Noida, 201305, India India United States Canada Australia Germany United Kingdom South Africa Singapore Spain Brazil China Japan France Italy Noida, India India Global AG Organica has over 27 years of experience in the essential oils and cosmetics industry. The company serves over 162 countries worldwide, showcasing its global reach. AG Organica has a team of over 200 employees, indicating a robust operational capacity. AG Organica specializes in the production of essential oils and cosmetics, focusing on quality and sustainability. The company offers a wide range of essential oils including lemongrass, rosemary, cinnamon, jasmine, peppermint, and frankincense. Expanding product lines in color cosmetics and skincare. Enhancing R&D capabilities to innovate new products. Expanding global reach Enhancing product offerings Strengthening customer relationships Intense competition in the global essential oils market. Regulatory compliance in various international markets. Market competition Regulatory compliance Supply chain disruptions Growing demand for natural and organic skincare products. Expansion into emerging markets. Growing demand for natural and organic products Expansion into new markets Partnerships with brands for private labeling AG Organica is positioned as a leading manufacturer and supplier of essential oils and cosmetics, recognized for quality and innovation. Increasing consumer preference for natural products. Expansion of e-commerce channels for product distribution. Increasing consumer awareness of natural products Rising demand in the wellness and aromatherapy sectors [011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n\n# **A.G. ORGANICA**\n\nAG Industries started with manufacturing mint products in 1990. With an understanding of the\nindustry and tasting success in a small span of time, Mr. Anil Gupta started a new brand by the name\nof AG INDUSTRIES in 1994 that grew with time to become a popular name among-st Essential Oils,\nCold-Pressed Carrier oils, and allied product manufacturers and suppliers. And next span of time,\nMr. Arpit Gupta started a new brand by the name of AG ORGANICA Pvt Ltd in 2019.\n* Innovation\n* Growth\n* Teamwork\n* Strategy\n* Trust\n\n[image]\n[img]\n\n#### **Anil Gupta**\n\nChairman of the company\n* Financial Planning & Analysis\n* Investment of Funds\n* Working Capital Management\n\n[img]\n\n#### **Arpit Gupta**\n\nDirector of the company\n* Growth & Analytics\n* Global Innovation\n* Marketing\n\n[img]\n\n#### **Achin Gupta**\n\nDirector of the company\n* Production Management\n* Improve Operational Efficiency\n* Export Management\n\n#### **YEARS OF EXPERIENCE**\n\n27+\n\n#### ** STAFF & GROWING**\n\n200+\n\n#### **PRODUCT LIST**\n\n6000+\n\n#### **COUNTRY COVERAGE**\n\n162+\n\n### **COMPANY BRIEFING**\n* [** Company **][89]\n* [** Our Story **][90]\n* [** Core Values **][91]\n* [** Our USP **][92]\n* [** Innovation **][93]\n\nWith the help of our ISO certification and GMP guidelines, AG Organica connects to the globe. In\naddition to offering a complete line of skincare products, we are dedicated to expanding the\ncosmetics industry. Our motto is always putting the customer\u2019s needs above all else and bring a\nrevolution through our innovative product line to solve a myriad of skin concerns and transforming\nthe skincare industry for the better.\n\nWith an existing range of natural oils, skincare, haircare, personal care, and fragrance, AG\nOrganica is now entering into the color cosmetics market. The company offers multi-category color\nmake-up items including lipsticks, eyeliners, definers, highlighters, and other innovative products.\n\nCome on, do some beauty therapy that\u2019s in your price range!\n\nSO SMILEEEE!!!\n\n[img]\n\nAG Organica has achieved national recognition and its goal is to make India proud by setting and\nsustaining high standards of trust, delivering high-quality products and solutions.\n\n[img]\n[image]\n\nDesigned for holistic well-being, AG Organica is growing every single day with our promise\nto deliver the best. With our experts, we continuously strive to give the best and latest possible\noutcomes.\n* Sustainability\n* Innovative product line\n* Delivering high quality products\n* More than 9+ Certification\n* Team Work\n* We fulfil what we promise\n* Fairness\n* Accountability\n* Continuous learning\n\n[image]\n\nWith the help of our ISO certification and GMP guidelines, AG Organica connects to the globe. We\nactively use the most recent technology, bigger infrastructure, skilled work personnel, and advanced\nlabs to give every customer the highest-quality skincare products.\n* Professionalism and innovation\n* Strict QC Process\n* Reliability and integrity\n* Sustainability\n* 27+ Years of Experience\n\n[image]\n\nAG Organica continuously strives to create new products enabling customers to get a variety of pure\nand organic products at an affordable price using latest equipment's, bigger infrastructure, skilled\nworkforce, and trained scientists.\n* We develop products as per the requirements and newest market trends\n* Complete end-to-end support from manufacturing\n* Well-researched cosmetic formulas that are lab-tested and ready to be made\n* Ensure 100% quality while serving both our clients and customers\n* Serving over 162+ worldwide!\n* Develop reliable & natural formulas\n* Team of highly trained and experienced chemists\n* Over 1500 fragrance options to choose from\n* ISO Certified Quality Oils\n\n[icon]\n\n#### **MANUFACTURING**\n\nAG Organica is the most promising contract manufacturer in India. We serve our partners with\ncomprehensive product solutions including regulatory approvals & support, Customized Packaging, and\nmuch more.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### **RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT **\n\nAG Organica is a technology-driven company with a large R&D department, well-equipped laboratories,\nand the most talented technical officials.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### **INNOVATIONS **\n\nThe pursuit of innovation drives investment in cutting-edge technology. Thus, with its strong\ninfrastructure and technical proficiency, AG Organica meets a significant portion of India's\ncosmetic requirements.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### **REGULATIONS & ETHICS **\n\nIn the fast-paced culture of the cosmetics industry, AG Organica employs a unique model in which we\nprovide clients with market-ready, FDA-approved products, thereby accelerating market entry by\nseveral notches.\n\n### Best deal short description\n\n[Discover][94]\n[Image]\n\n### Infrastructure\n\nBigger infrastructure with modern equipment's and high-tech advancements.\n\n### Research and Development\n\nOur Research and Development (R&D) works heavily on experimenting and creating in-house formulations\nand innovations.\n\n### Quality Control\n\nOur Quality Control (QC) designs and executes laboratory testing according to standard procedures.\nConducts experiments under defined conditions to verify/ reject various types of sample under\nrefined scientific methods.\n\n### Production Area\n\nOur Production Area operates and maintains machinery, ensure production standards are met, finalize\nproducts, and maintain proper storage for material and product inventory in warehouses.\n\n[logo]\n\n### Multipurpose template\n\n### Contact us\n\nGet in touch and our expert support team will answer all your questions.\n* C 11 Sector 85, Noida, 201305 (India)\n* +91-8929440683/ +91-9958755774\n* 09:30 AM - 06:30 PM (MON to SAT)\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care an [011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Repor"
