            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. Contact Us\n\n# Contact Us\n\nIf you would like to send us a comment or question, just email/ complete the form below and we will\nget back to you ASAP!\n\nGet In Touch\nBusiness Name\nA. G. Groups\nHead Office\nC-11, Sector 85, Noida -201305, UP, INDIA.\nGrievances/Feedback\ninfo@agorganica.com\nFor Purchase\npurchase@agorganica.com\nFor Sales\nag@agorganica.com\nCareers\nhr03@agorganica.com\nContact Us\nName\nEmail Address\nPhone Number\nMessage\nSubmit\nSubmit\n\n**\ud83d\udccd Strategic Location \u2013 Based in Noida, Serving the Entire NCR**\n\nAG Organica operates from a state-of-the-art facility situated in **Noida**, with seamless\nconnectivity to:\n* **Gautam Budh Nagar**\n* **Faridabad**\n* **Ghaziabad**\n* **New Delhi**\n* **Gurugram**\n* Other parts of **Delhi NCR and Northern India**\n\nOur central location ensures **quick delivery**, **easy accessibility**, and efficient service\nsupport for our regional clients.\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][90]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][91]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][92]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][93]\n* [Third Party Manufacturing][94]\n* [About Us][95]\n* [Magazine][96]\n* [Infrastructure][97]\n* [Contact Us][98]\nQuick Links\n* [Lavender Essential Oil][99]\n* [Tea Tree Essential Oil][100]\n* [Euc