            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Lavender Oil\n[Lavender Oil]\n\n# Lavender Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [4 Reviews][91]\n\nLooking for a trusted Lavender Oil manufacturer? AG Organica offers premium-grade lavender essential\noil crafted from the finest natural sources. Renowned for quality, purity, and sustainability, AG\nOrganica specializes in private labeling and bulk supply, meeting diverse needs with exceptional\ncustomer service. Discover pure lavender oil solutions tailored to you.\n\n**Varieties**\n* [Lavender Oil][92]\n* [Bulgaria Lavender Oil][93]\n* [France Lavender Oil][94]\n* [Organic Lavender Oil][95]\n* [Population Lavender Oil][96]\n* [Spike Lavender Oil][97]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Lavandula angustifolia / Lavandula officinalis\n* Family: Lamiaceae\n* Extraction: Steam and water distillation\n* Part: Leaves and Flowers/Buds\n* Colour: Clear with a Tinge of Yellow\n* Aroma: Floral, Sweet & Herbaceous\n* Constituents: Linalool, Linalyl acetate, Ocimene\n* Packaging: Glass Bottles, Plastic Bottle, Aluminum Bottles, HDPE Drums, Galvanized steel drum &\nexport standard Packing\n* Certification: GMP, ISO, FSSAI, MSME, HALAL\n* Available Services: Bulk, Third party manufacturer, White Label, Contract Manufacturing, Private\nLabeling\n* Brand: A.G. Organica / ODM / OEM / Private Label\n* Business Type: Trusted Manufacturer, Leading Supplier, Bulk, Wholesaler, Verified Exporter\n\nProduct Details\n\n## **Lavender Oil Manufacturer & Supplier in India(****All-Rounder Essential Oil****)**\n\n**Lavender Oil,** also known as *Lavandula Oil* or *Lavandula angustifolia Oil* (Lavandula /\nLavender / \u0932\u0948\u0935\u0947\u0902\u0921\u0930 / \u0932\u0948\u0935\u0947\u0902\u0921\u0941\u0932\u093e / \u0932\u0948\u0935\u0947\u0902\u0921\u0930 \u0915\u093e \u0924\u0947\u0932), is celebrated worldwide for its soothing aroma and versatile\napplications. Extracted from the delicate purple blooms of the lavender plant, this treasured oil\ncarries a rich legacy in traditional wellness, perfumery, and skincare. Its array of common names\nreflects its cultural roots and timeless appeal across different regions and traditions.\n\nAG Organica is one of the best manufacturing company worldwide that offer unmatched quality 100%\ncomplete lavender oil used in global markets. The oil is used by cosmetology, aromatherapy,\npharmacology and other fields worldwide and it finds its place in perfumery as its cornerstone\ncomponent. Our Lavender oil has some properties such as anti-depressant effects, anti-oxidant\neffects, sedation effects, soothing abilities and it has been scientifically proven that it is more\nthan just a smell.\n\n**Why Choose Us:**\n1. **Unmatched Quality:** Our lavender oil is obtained from the greatest lavender fields to make\nsure of its purity and potency.\n2. **Reliability:** Being a reputable ***manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of lavender essential\noils***, we always assure all our clients of standard quality hence they can never lack ones they\nneed \u2026\n3. **Custom Solutions:** We can customize solutions that can suit your bulk needs.\n4. **Exceptional Service:** We have a team that is committed and has been providing excellent\ncustomer support making it easier for most customers to use our services effectively.\n\n**Industries We Serve:**\n1. **Cosmetics and Personal Care:** Elevate your cosmetic formulations with the exquisite aroma and\ntherapeutic benefits of lavender oil.\n2. **Aromatherapy and Wellness:** Cater to the growing demand for holistic wellness products with\nour premium lavender essential oil.\n3. **Hospitality:** Enhance guest experiences by incorporating our lavender oil into your hotel\namenities or spa treatments.\n4. **Pharmaceuticals:** Harness the therapeutic properties of lavender essential oil for various\npharmaceutical applications, backed by our stringent quality standards.\n\n## **Uses of Lavender Oil**\n* ### **Lavender Oil Bath**\n\nLavender oil is perfect for soothing sore muscles, relieving stress, and promoting relaxation. To\nenjoy a lavender oil bath, simply add 6-8 drops of lavender essential oil to your bathwater after\nfilling the tub. Stir the water thoroughly to help the oil disperse. For added benefits, mix the\noil with a capful of milk or Epsom salts before soaking.\n* ### **Shower with Lavender Oil**\n\nTo incorporate lavender oil into your shower routine, add 3 drops of lavender oil to a capful of\nwater and gently pour the mixture over your head after wetting your hair. Stand under the running\nwater and let the oil wash out. You can enhance the experience by inhaling the soothing aroma by\ncupping your hands over your face. For additional hair care benefits, add a few drops of lavender\noil to your shampoo and rinse as usual. If you're in the cosmetics or skincare industry,\npurchasing lavender oil wholesale from A.G Organica is a great option.\n* ### **Lavender Oil Vaporization**\n\nFor vaporization, fill the top dish of an oil burner or vaporizer with water and add 6-8 drops of\nlavender essential oil. Place a lit tea light candle beneath the dish and enjoy the calming aroma\nin your living room or bedroom. Vaporizing lavender oil is especially beneficial when you're\nfeeling unwell or need to relax.\n* ### **Massage with Lavender Oil**\n\nLavender oil is ideal for massage therapy, especially if you have stiff muscles or injuries. The\noil quickly absorbs into the bloodstream, delivering both mental and physical relief. Always mix\nlavender oil with a high-quality carrier oil before massaging the skin to ensure safe application.\n\n## **Lavender Essential Oil**\n\nLavender essential oil is widely recognized for its multitude of benefits. It has powerful\nantifungal and antibacterial properties that can help treat infections such as candida. AG Organica,\na leading lavender oil manufacturer, provides premium-quality lavender oil in large quantities,\nmaking it a reliable source for industries requiring this essential oil.\n\n### **Aroma of Lavender Oil**\n\nLavender has a soothing and balancing scent, making it a favorite for aromatherapy. The name\n\"***lavender***\" comes from the Latin word \"*lavare*,\" meaning \"to wash,\" as it was traditionally\nused for laundry and baths. The oil\u2019s calming aroma has made it popular in medicinal, religious, and\nculinary practices, dating back to the Ancient Egyptians and Romans. Lavender essential oil is\nprized for its fragrance and therapeutic qualities, and AG Organica meets the growing demand for\nhigh-quality, wholesale lavender oil, widely used in wellness treatments and healthcare.\n\nAs a **lavender oil manufacturer**, **A.G. Organica** dedicated to [supplying top-grade lavender\nessential oil][98] to meet the rising global demand. Whether you\u2019re in aromatherapy, healthcare, or\ncosmetics, this lavender oil manufacturer offers large-scale production to meet your needs.\n\n...\n\n## **Benefits of Lavender Essential Oil**\n* Improves blood circulation\n* Treats insomnia by inducing sleep\n* Helps in acne treatment\n* Eliminates nerve tension\n* Helps remove hair lice\n* Treats respiratory disorders\n* Soothes skin irritations\n* Reduces anxious feelings and promotes peaceful sleep\n* Eases feelings of tension when used internally\n\nLavender essential oil serves a variety of purposes, with its applications varying based on the\nneed. It is most commonly used in skincare routines and in oil burners to create a soothing\natmosphere. For optimal results, it's recommended to dilute lavender essential oil with a carrier\noil, as essential oils are highly concentrated. Carrier oils blend well with essential oils and\nfacilitate better absorption into the skin.\n\nAs a leading lavender oil manufacturer, AG Organica guarantees that all products meet the highest\nstandards of safety and quality. We provide both [natural and organic essential oils][99], free from\nchemicals, additives, fillers, artificial colors, preservatives, or synthetic fragrances. Given the\npotency of essential oils, it is crucial to dilute them before topical application. We conduct\nrigorous testing and quality assurance to ensure that only premium-grade oils are delivered to our\ncustomers. Additionally, we maintain strict packaging standards to preserve the oils' effectiveness\nand ensure excellent results upon use. Our company offers bulk lavender oil with prompt delivery and\ndedicated customer support, ensuring your complete satisfaction with our products.\n\n***Important Note:** If pregnant or breastfeeding, consult a healthcare professional before use.\nOverconsumption may result in side effects such as vomiting, diarrhea, vision disturbances,\ndifficulty breathing, and eye irritation.*\n***Disclaimer : **The information provided here is for general guidance. Always seek medical advice\nbefore using this product. AG Organica and its affiliates do not guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Consult your doctor, especially if pregnant or dealing with any health conditions or\nallergies.*\n\n## **Private Label Lavender Essential Oils**\n\nAG Organica is well-known private label manufacturer of skin care, hair care, personal care, health\nand wellness products that deals in private label of lavender products like pharma grade lavender\nessential oil, lavender hydrosol and products made using lavender like body lotion, face cream, hair\ngrowth oil, hair serum, baby cream, de-stress roll-on, sweet sleep balm, anxiety relief oil, and\nmuch more.\n\n## **Lavender Oil Manufacturer, Bulk Supplier. Know what's in your product**\n\nLavender essential oil has anti-inflammatory & antiseptic properties that can heal minor burns & bug\nbites. It is useful in treating insomnia, anxiety, depression & restlessness. This oil can be put on\nyour skin with or without carrier oil for forming a lotion. This oil can be applied directly to the\ndry skin & wrinkles. It is also used in aromatherapy as steam. Constipation, headache, skin\nirritation & increased appetite are the side effects of the lavender oil. It calms the body & eases\nthe pain, stress, and anxiety & muscle tension. It has "
