l into your product range, ensuring\nsuccess every step of the way.\n\n## Manufacturer, Supplier and Wholesale Exporter of Tea tree oil\n\nTea tree oil is safe for topical treatment & is direct to the skin on a daily basis. It is applied\nto the skin in its pure form, it causes irritation. It is known for treating acne as it has\nanti-inflammatory & antimicrobial properties. It calms redness, swelling & inflammation. It prevents\n& reduces acne scars makes it smooth & clear skin. It reduces the causes of swelling & irritation.\nIt dries out the whiteheads, blackheads, pimples, blemishes, and disinfects the skin pores. It has\nanti-fungal properties. It kills fungi that cause ringworm. It helps with different ailments like\nhair loss & dandruff. It provides both anti fungal & antibacterial benefits. It helps in getting rid\nof the dead skin. AG Organica is the leading manufacturer, distributor & supplier of bulk orders of\ntea tree oil. This oil is derived from the leaves of the Melaleuca alternifolia plant. Tea tree oil\nis used in food, nutritional & cosmetic products. Our oil meets all the international guidelines.\nYes, it's safe to use because it doesn't contain any parabens, sulfates, or other chemicals. Add 1\nto 2 drops of tea tree oil with a carrier oil (1-2 drops). Do a tiny low test before applying the\nface and wash your face gently with a face cleanser. Gently apply diluted tea tree oil with a cotton\npad. Tea Tree oil has been used as a remedy for treating various conditions including itching,\nringworm infections, athlete's foot, warts, corns, acne, headaches, dandruff, and therefore the flu.\nYes, you'll inhale it on to get instant relief from congestion and breathlessness. No, Tea tree oil\nhas been formulated for external use only.\n\n**PEOPLE ALSO SEARCH US BY :**\n\n[Tea Tree Oil Manufacturer][96], Wholesale Tea Tree Oil, Essential Oil Manufacturer, Organic Tea\nTree Oil, Bulk Tea Tree Oil, Natural Essential Oil Supplier, Tea Tree Oil Exporter, Te