lant. It can be applied to the skin for health\nproblems after dilution. Cough relief, Clear chest, Bug repellent, Heal wounds, Breathing, Blood\nsugar, Cold sores & Breath freshener.\n1. Bergamot oil\n2. Eucalyptus oil\n3. Red thyme\n4. Cinnamon leaf\n\nYou can [try making a steam][96] bath by placing "
