, sedative, antipyretic, insecticidal, galactagogue, and antimicrobial.\n\n### **Key Features of Lemongrass Oil:**\n1. **100% Pure Lemongrass Oil:** Our Lemongrass Oil is extracted using advanced techniques,\npreserving its natural essence and therapeutic properties.\n2. **Manufacturer and Wholesale Supplier:** As both manufacturer and wholesale supplier, we\neliminate unnecessary intermediaries, ensuring competitive pricing without compromising on\nquality.\n3. **Therapeutic Grade Assurance:** Our Lemongrass Oil is meticulously tested to meet the highest\nstandards of therapeutic grade, making it ideal for a wide range of applications.\n4. **Customized Solutions:** We understand that every business is unique. That's why we offer\ncustomized solutions to meet your specific requirements, whether you need bulk quantities or\ntailored packaging.\n5. **Global Exporter:** With a global footprint, we cater to clients worldwide, delivering\nexcellence beyond borders.\n6. **Unmatched Expertise:** Backed by years of industry experience and a team of seasoned\nprofessionals, we guarantee unmatched expertise and reliability in every transaction.\n\n### **Why Choose Us?**\n* **Exceptional Quality Control:** From sourcing raw materials to final packaging, our rigorous\nquality control measures ensure that only the best reaches your doorstep.\n* **Competitive Pricing:** By streamlining our operations and maintaining direct relationships with\nclients, we offer competitive pricing that adds value to your business.\n* **Prompt Delivery:** Time is of the essence, and we understand the importance of timely delivery.\nWith efficient logistics and reliable partners, we ensure prompt delivery, every time.\n* **Customer-Centric Approach:** Your satisfaction is our top priority. With a customer-centric\napproach, we strive to exceed your expectations at every step of the journey.\n\n### **Extraction**\n\nLemongrass oil is extracted by the method of steam distillation from fresh or partly dried leaves.\n\n### **Constituents**\n\n**Main Constituents: **Citral\n\n**Other:** Myrcene, nerol, Citronellal, terpineol, methyl heptonene, dipentene, farnesol, and\nlimonene.\n\n## **Lemongrass Oil Uses**\n\nThe oil can be used for internal and topical applications. The oil can be consumed in diluted form\nfor its hormonal modulating and anti-inflammatory properties. It can also be added to beverages like\ntea for flavor. Externally, you can apply the oil to the skin to prevent acne and skin irritation.\n\n**Topical Uses**\n* Acne\n* Anxiety\n* Athlete's foot\n* Excessive sweating\n* Headaches\n* Indigestion\n* Muscle aches\n\n**Everyday Uses**\n* Lowers cholesterol\n* Prevents infection\n* Boosts oral health\n* Relieves pain\n* Boosts red blood cell levels\n* Relieves bloating\n**Popular Uses**\n* Used in culinary, medicinal, and skincare purposes\n* As an ingredient of antiseptic lotions and creams\n* Used as an insect repellent\n* Soothes sore joints or muscle strains\n* Cleans toenails and healthy nails\n* Helps in reducing pain and inflammation\n* Helps in facilitate nutrients assimilation a\n* Increases the formation of milk\n* Promotes soothing, sedating, and calming effect on the mind\n* Cures inflammation, itching of the skin, and also relieves tension and anxiety\n* Used as an air freshener and deodorant\n**Applications Uses**\n* Creams\n* Lotions\n* Scrub\n* Natural Bug Repellent\n* Oil Controlling Toner\n* Makeup & Sun Care Products\n* Air Freshener or Deodorizer\n* Anti-Dandruff Oil/Shampoo/Conditioner\n* Pest Control\n* Ailments\n* Sanitize\n* Tonics\n\n### **Benefits of Lemongrass Oil**\n\nLemongrass oil possesses various medicinal properties and provides a large range of benefits. Some\nof the key benefits of Lemongrass oil are:\n* Reduces Pain\n* Microbial Growth\n* Heals Wounds\n* Astringent\n* Fights with Infections\n* Reduce Depression\n\n...\n\n**Primary Benefits**\n* Supports healthy digestion when taken in a capsule\n* Combine with a carrier oil for a soothing massage\n* Apply diluted after a long run for a refreshing feeling\n\nLemongrass essential oil offers a wide range of applications, depending on your needs. It's\nfrequently used in skincare routines and as a soothing fragrance in oil burners. If you're searching\nfor a reliable source to buy lemongrass oil, look no further. AG Organica, a leading lemongrass oil\nmanufacturer, offers a vast selection of pure lemongrass oil, ideal for bulk orders at competitive\nwholesale prices. For topical use, it\u2019s important to dilute the essential oil, as it is highly\nconcentrated. We conduct rigorous testing and quality assessments to ensure only top-grade,\neffective oils reach our customers. Strict quality and packaging standards are maintained to\nguarantee the best results.\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n**Disclaimer : **The information provided is for general purposes only. Please seek medical advice\nbefore using this product, especially during pregnancy or if you have allergies or health concerns.\nAG Organica and its associates do not guarantee the accuracy of this information.\n\n## Private Label Lemongrass Essential Oils\n\nUnlock the invigorating essence of lemongrass with our premium private label lemongrass essential\noils. Sourced from the finest botanicals and crafted with precision, our essential oils offer a\nmultitude of benefits for both mind and body.\n* **Purity Guaranteed**: Our private label lemongrass essential oils are meticulously extracted\nusing state-of-the-art methods to ensure maximum purity and potency. Rest assured, each drop is\nfree from additives or dilution, delivering the true essence of lemongrass to your senses.\n* **Versatile Applications**: From aromatherapy to skincare, our lemongrass essential oils offer\nversatile applications. Diffuse to create an uplifting ambiance, or incorporate into your skincare\nroutine for its cleansing and toning properties. The possibilities are endless.\n* **Refreshing Aroma**: Immerse yourself in the refreshing aroma of lemongrass, known for its\ncitrusy, revitalizing scent. Whether you're seeking to boost energy levels or simply unwind after\na long day, our essential oils provide a natural solution to elevate your mood and uplift your\nspirits.\n* **Quality Assurance**: We prioritize quality at every step of the production process, from\nsourcing raw materials to packaging the final product. Our private label lemongrass essential oils\nundergo rigorous testing to ensure they meet our stringent quality standards, providing you with a\nproduct you can trust.\n\nExperience the transformative benefits of lemongrass essential oil with our premium private label\nofferings. Elevate your well-being and indulge in the pure essence of nature's bounty.\n\n## **Steam Distilled Wholesale Lemongrass Oil Manufacturer**\n\nIt prevents the growth of bacteria & yeast. It relieves pain & swelling, reduces fever & stimulates\nthe uterus & menstrual flow. Honey bees are attracted to the sweet grassy & lemony fragrance; it is\nan effective swarm lure. Lemongrass helps in keeping away the mosquitoes & bugs. Gastrointestinal\nspasms, stomachache, hypertension, convulsions, pain and neuralgia, vomiting, cough, rheumatism,\nfever, common cold, and exhaustion. Topical: Headache, stomachache, abdominal pain, and\nmusculoskeletal pain. Lemongrass oil used for digestive problems & high blood pressure. It has many\nhealth benefits. It is used in aromatherapy as it helps in relieving stress, anxiety & depression.\nIt is more effective in repelling pests as compared to rodents. Mice hate peppermint, pepper &\ncloves the most. You can soak the cotton balls in these oils as it repels mice. It is used in\naromatherapy to freshen the air, reduces stress & uplifts the mood. It promotes sleep, relieves pain\n& boosts immunity. Yes, it can attract bees as it has sweet grassy & lemony fragrance. Lemongrass &\neucalyptus helps in keeping away the mosquitos. It is packed with vitamin A & C; it makes skin &\nhair glossy. It has astringent properties that help to minimize your pores. It has anxiety-reducing\nproperties. It relieves stress & anxiety.\n* Take a fe"
