            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Cinnamon Oil\n[Cinnamon Oil]\n\n# Cinnamon Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\n\nWelcome to the pinnacle of quality and excellence in Cinnamon Oil products. As a leading Cinnamon\nOil manufacturer, supplier, and exporter, we take pride in offering unparalleled solutions crafted\nto elevate your business to new heights. Our commitment to excellence, coupled with our dedication\nto providing the finest products, ensures that you receive nothing short of the best.\n\n**Varieties**\n* [Cinnamon Bark Oil][92]\n* [Cinnamon Bark Oil - Madagascar][93]\n* [Cinnamon Leaf Oil][94]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Cinnamomum zeylanicum\n* Family: Lauraceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Bark\n* Colour:\n\nProduct Details\n\n## **Trusted Cinnamon Oil Manufacturer & Wholesale Supplier for Unmatched Quality**\n\nCinnamon oil is used to calm dry skin, alleviates aches, pain & stiffness in the muscles & joints,\nacne, rashes & infections, enhance circulation, nourish the skin, revives the skin tone & slow the\nsign of aging & revives the skin tone. It promotes heart health & helps in digestion.\n\nCinnamon Oil, with its warm, spicy aroma and multifaceted benefits, is a treasured ingredient in\naromatherapy, cosmetics, and the food industry. At AG Organica, we take pride in being a globally\ntrusted **Cinnamon Oil Manufacturer** and **Cinnamon Oil Supplier**, delivering excellence to\nclients in the USA, India, and beyond.\n\n### **Key Features of Our Cinnamon Oil**\n* 100% Pure and Natural\n* Ethically Sourced from premium cinnamon bark and leaves.\n* Steam-Distilled for maximum potency and quality.\n* Customizable Packaging for private labeling and bulk orders.\n* Compliance with International Standards (FDA, ISO, GMP).\n\n## **Uses of Cinnamon Oil**\n\n**Topical Uses**\n* Lotions\n* Soaps\n* Shampoos\n* Hair oils\n* Room sprays\n* Perfumes\n* Candles\n* Heart health\n* Digestion\n**Everyday Uses**\n* Promote Heart Health\n* Aid Diabetes Treatment\n* Aid Cancer Treatment\n* Work as an Aphrodisiac\n* Treat Ulcers\n* Treat Fungal Infections\n* Manage Stress\n* Skin Health\n**Popular Uses**\n* Acts as a part of ant-fungal\n* Kills the infectious germs within your body\n* Used as a powerful anti-fungal and anti-skin malady agent\n* Alleviates your rheumatic and joint pains\n* Derived from the bark for killing the harmful microorganism\n* Used as a food preservative\n* Prevent mosquitoes from assaulting you\n* Used as an aromatherapy oil\n* Improve your mental functions by soothing your mind and causation sound sleep\n* Helps to normalize your biological process patterns\n...\n\n## **Benefits of Cinnamon Oil**\n\n#### 1. **Aromatherapy**\n* **Stress Relief**: The warm and spicy aroma of cinnamon oil helps alleviate anxiety and promote\nrelaxation.\n* **Enhanced Focus**: Its invigorating scent stimulates the senses, aiding mental clarity and\nconcentration.\n\n#### 2. **Cosmetics**\n* **Anti-Aging Properties**: Cinnamon oil is rich in antioxidants that combat free radicals,\nreducing signs of aging.\n* **Skin Health**: Known for its antibacterial properties, it helps cleanse and tone the skin\neffectively.\n\n#### 3. **Food Industry**\n* **Flavor Enhancer**: Adds a bold, spicy-sweet flavor to baked goods, beverages, and savory dishes.\n* **Preservative**: Natural antimicrobial properties make it an ideal ingredient for preserving food\nproducts.\n\n**Disclaimer: **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergies,\nor health issues.\n\nIt can kill bacteria, viruses & drug-resistant fungi. It wreaks devastation with hospital-acquired\ninfections.\n\n## **Private Label Cinnamon Essential Oils**\n\nLooking to offer your customers an unforgettable sensory experience while boosting your brand's\nreputation? Our premium private label Cinnamon Essential Oil is the perfect choice. Crafted with\nprecision and care, our oil encapsulates the pure essence of cinnamon, renowned for its aromatic\nallure and numerous health benefits.\n\n## Partner With AG Organica Today!\n\nWhether you're in the aromatherapy, cosmetics, or food industry, AG Organica is your reliable\npartner for high-quality Cinnamon Oil. As a leading **Cinnamon Oil Manufacturer** and **Cinnamon Oil\nSupplier**, we are committed to helping your brand thrive with our premium-grade products.\n\n**Contact us now** to explore bulk orders, private labeling, or custom formulations tailored to your\nneeds.\n\nDon't use this oil without dilution as it can irritate or can cause a burn.\n\nIt stimulates the scalp & increases blood circulation. It is good for hair loss treatment. It helps\nin promoting healthy hair & scalp. It helps in losing visceral fat & supports weight loss. This oil\nalso helps in lowering blood pressure, cholesterol, and boosts insulin function, and metabolism.\nCinnamon Oil is native to Sri Lanka & belongs to the Lauraceae family. It is used in Beauty, Food,\nAromatherapy, Nutraceuticals, beverages, Sports Nutrition, Health & Wellness, Pet Nutrition, and\nVitamins & Supplements. It is used in massage oils and gels, face creams, lotions, soaps, shampoos,\nhair oils, room sprays, perfumes, and candles. AG Organica is the leading **manufacturer & supplier\nof Chamomile Oil**. It has extreme shelf-life stability. It is repellent to high temperatures.\nCinnamon Bark Essential Oil proves to be beneficial for aromatherapy, massage, making soaps, and\nskincare purposes. Lavender, Lemon, Grapefruit, Bergamot, and Clove essential oils blend well with\nCinnamon Bark Essential Oil. You can use it because it makes your hair thick and reduces hair fall\nas well.\n\n### **PEOPLE ALSO SEARCH US BY :**\n\nCinnamon Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Cinnamon Oil, Essential Oil Manufacturer, Organic Cinnamon Oil,\nBulk Cinnamon Oil, Natural Essential Oil Supplier, Cinnamon Oil Exporter, Cinnamon Essential Oil\nBenefits, Pure Cinnamon Oil, Cinnamon Essential Oil, Cinnamon Essential Oil Manufacturers, [Cinnamon\nOil Manufacturer in India][95], Cinnamon Essential Oil Manufacturer in Ghaziabad, [Cinnamon Oil\nManufacturer in Delhi][96], [Cinnamon Oil Manufacturer in Noida][97], Cinnamon Essential Oil\nSupplier, Cinnamon Essential Oil exporter from India to [USA][98], [Canada][99], Australia,\n[Germany][100], [Europe][101].\n\nRead more\n\n**Blog**\n\nTechnical\n\n## **Cinnamon Oil IP, BP and USP (****Indian, ****British and United States Pharmacopoeia)**\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Botanical Name** \u2502**:**\u2502**Cinnamomum zeylanicum**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Parts Used** \u2502: \u2502Bark\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\