ics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Jasmine Essential Oil\n[Jasmine Essential Oil]\n\n# Jasmine Essential Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [3 Reviews][91]\nDiscover the finest Jasmine Oil from a trusted manufacturer dedicated to purity and quality.\nSpecializing in premium jasmine essential oil, we ensure natural extraction methods for the highest\npotency. Ideal for skincare, aromatherapy, and wellness, our jasmine oil offers soothing floral\nnotes and therapeutic benefits for a luxurious experience.\n**Varieties**\n* [Jasmine Essential Oil][92]\n* [Jasmine Absolute][93]\n* [Jasmine Natural Blend Oil][94]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Jasminum grandiflorum\n* Family: Oleaceae (Jasmininaceae)\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Flowers\n* Colour: Deep brown with a golden tinge viscouse liquid with warm, floral, exotic odor\nProduct Details\n\n## **Jasmine Oil Manufacturer & Supplier in India**\n\nAG Organica is a leading Jasmine Oil Manufacturer in India, renowned for producing premium-quality\nessential oils. We specialize in extracting pure jasmine oil from natural sources, ensuring its\ntherapeutic properties and fragrance remain intact. Our jasmine oil is versatile and can be used in\naromatherapy, skincare, personal care products, and more. At AG Organica, we prioritize quality and\ncustomer satisfaction, offering a wide range of products to meet diverse needs.\n\n**Why Choose AG Organica as Your Jasmine Oil Manufacturer?**\n1. **Pure and Authentic Jasmine Oil: **At AG Organica, we guarantee 100% pure jasmine oil extracted\nusing advanced techniques to preserve its natural essence. Whether for personal use or industrial\napplications, our jasmine oil meets the highest quality standards.\n2. **Wide Application of Jasmine Oil: **Jasmine oil is widely used in:\n* **Aromatherapy**: Promoting relaxation and alleviating stress.\n* **Skincare**: Soothing skin irritation and enhancing complexion.\n* **Cosmetic Products**: Adding a natural fragrance and therapeutic properties to creams,\nlotions, and perfumes.\n3. **Quality Assurance: **As a reputed **jasmine oil manufacturer and supplier**, we adhere to\nstringent quality control measures. From sourcing raw materials to bottling the final product,\nevery step is meticulously supervised to ensure the highest quality standards.\n\n###\n\n### **Benefits of Jasmine Oil**\n* **Sustainably Sourced Ingredients**: We partner with reliable suppliers for the highest-grade raw\nmaterials.\n* **Customizable Orders**: Catering to both small-scale buyers and bulk orders.\n* **Competitive Pricing**: High-quality jasmine oil at reasonable prices.\n* **Expert Customer Support**: A dedicated team to assist with product queries and requirements.\n\n...\n\n### **Applications of Jasmine Oil**\n\nJasmine oil is a valuable addition to a wide range of products, including:\n* **Perfumes and Fragrances**\n* **Cosmetic Formulations**\n* **Massage Oils**\n* **Candles and Diffusers**\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n## **Private Label Jasmine Essential Oils**\n\nUnlock the secret to pure indulgence with our meticulously crafted Jasmine Essential Oil. Renowned\nfor its intoxicating fragrance and therapeutic properties, our Jasmine Essential Oil is a\nquintessential addition to any wellness or beauty regimen. Why Choose Our Private Label Jasmine\nEssential Oil Services?\n1. **Exceptional Quality:** Our Jasmine Essential Oil is sourced from the finest jasmine blossoms,\nensuring unmatched purity and potency.\n2. **Customized Solutions:** Tailored to meet your unique requirements, our Private Label services\nempower you to create your own branded line of Jasmine Essential Oil products, perfectly aligned\nwith your brand identity.\n3. **Impeccable Standards:** From sourcing to manufacturing, we adhere to the highest industry\nstandards, guaranteeing the authenticity and quality of every batch.\n4. **Versatile Applications:** Whether it's skincare formulations, aromatherapy blends, or spa\ntreatments, our Jasmine Essential Oil lends its aromatic charm and therapeutic benefits to a\nmyriad of applications.\n5. **Expert Guidance:** Our team of seasoned professionals is committed to guiding you through every\nstep of the private labeling process, ensuring seamless integration and optimal results.\n\nElevate your brand with the timeless allure of Jasmine Essential Oil. Contact us today to embark on\nyour journey towards creating signature wellness products that captivate the senses and nurture the\nsoul.\n\n## About AG Organica\n\nAG Organica stands out as a trusted **Jasmine Oil Manufacturer, Supplier, and Exporter** in India.\nWith years of experience in essential oil manufacturing, we are committed to delivering products\nthat exceed customer expectations. Our focus on innovation and sustainability ensures we stay ahead\nin the competitive market of natural essential oils.\n\nJasmine Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Jasmine Oil, Essential Oil Manufacturer, Organic Jasmine Oil,\nBulk Jasmine Oil, Natural Essential Oil Supplier, Jasmine Oil Exporter, Jasmine Essential Oil\nBenefits, Pure Jasmine Oil, Jasmine Essential Oil, Jasmine Essential Oil Manufacturers, [Lavender\nOil Manufacturer in India][95], Jasmine Essential Oil Manufacturer in Ghaziabad, [Lavender Oil\nManufacturer in Delhi][96], [Jasmine Oil Manufacturer in Noida][97], Jasmine Essential Oil Supplier,\nJasmine Essential Oil exporter from India to [USA][98], Canada,\nAustralia, [Germany][99], [Europe][100].\n\nRead more\n\n**Blog**\n\nTechnical\n\nList of technical documents - Jasmine Grandiflorum Absolute\n1. Jasmine essential oil - COA\n2. [Jasmine essential oil - SOP][101]\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nRamya\n\n04-02-2020 12:51\n\nNostalgic scent\n\nShivali\n\n04-02-2020 12:52\n\nI love this, I would recommend this product to anyone who has damaged hair from coloring, or too\nmuch styling.\n\nUday\n\n12-03-2021 13:02\n\nWoah!! This was the reaction I had when I opened the packaging. It's super potent and very very\nstrong.\n\nVarieties\n[Jasmine Absolute][102]\n* Origin: Himalaya\n* Botanical: Jasminum officianale\n* Family: Oleaceae\n* Extraction: Solvent Extraction\n* Part: Flowers\n* Colour: Light reddish brown liquid\n[Jasmine Essential Oil][103]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Jasminum grandiflorum\n* Family: Oleaceae (Jasmininaceae)\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Flowers\n* Colour: Deep brown with a golden tinge viscouse liquid with warm, floral, exotic odor\n[Jasmine Natural Blend Oil][104]\n* Origin: India\n* Part: Flowers\n[Jasmine Water][105]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Wrightia religiosa\n* Family: Oleaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Flowers\nFAQs\nWhat is Jasmine Oil?\n\nJasmine Oil is an essential oil derived from the flowers of the Jasmine plant through a meticulous\nextraction process. Renowned for its captivating fragrance and therapeutic properties, it\u275cs widely\nutilized in cosmetics, perfumery, and aromatherapy.\n\nHow is Jasmine Oil extracted?\n\nJasmine Oil is typically extracted through the process of steam distillation, where the blossoms of\nthe Jasmine plant are subjected to high-pressure steam to release their aromatic compounds,\nresulting in a highly concentrated oil.\n\nWhat are the main benefits of using Jasmine Oil?\n\nJasmine Oil offers a myriad of benefits, including its ability to promote relaxation, reduce stress\nand anxiety, improve skin elasticity, fade scars and stretch marks, and enhance mood and overall\nwell-being through its delightful scent.\n\nIs Jasmine Oil safe for sensitive skin?\n\nYes, Jasmine Oil is generally safe for sensitive skin types. However, it\u275cs recommended to perform a\npatch test before widespread use to ensure compatibility and to dilute the oil with a carrier oil,\nespecially for those with highly sensitive skin.\n\nCan Jasmine Oil be used for hair care?\n\nAbsolutely! Jasmine Oil is beneficial for hair care as it nourishes the scalp, strengthens hair\nfollicles, promotes hair growth, and imparts a luxurious fragrance to the hair. It can be added to\nshampoos, conditioners, or used as a scalp treatment.\n\nHow can Jasmine Oil be incorporated into skincare?\n\nJasmine Oil can be incorporated into skincare routines in various ways, such as adding a few drops\nto moisturizers, serums, or facial oils to enhance hydration, reduce the appearance of fine lines\nand wrinkles, and improve overall skin radiance and texture.\n\nIs Jasmine Oil suitable for aromatherapy?\n\nYes, Jasmine Oil is highly suitable for aromatherapy due to its calming and uplifting properties. It\ncan be diffused using a diffuser to create a serene atmosphere, added to bathwater for a luxurious\nsoak, or used in massage oils to promote relaxation and well-being.\n\nWhat sets Jasmine Oil apart from other essential oils?\n\nJasmine Oil stands out for its exquisite fragrance, often described as rich, floral, and\nintoxicatingly sweet. Additionally, its therapeutic benefits, including its ability to uplift mood\nand reduce emotional stress, make it a coveted choice among essential oils enthusiasts.\n\nCan Jasmine Oil be used during pregnancy?\n\nWhile Jasmine Oil is generally considered safe for use during pregnancy, it\u275cs advisable to consult\nwith a healthcare professional before incorporating it into your routine, especially during the\nfirst trimester. Dilution with a carrier oil is recommended for topical application.\n\nWhat is the shelf life of Jasmine Oil?\n\nWhen stored properly in a cool, dark place away from direct sunlight and heat sources, Jasmine Oil\ncan have a shelf life of approximately two to three years. However, it\u275cs essential to check for any\nsigns of rancidity or changes in scent before use.\n\nHow can Jasmine Oil be used for stress relief?\n\nJasmine Oil can be used for stress relief by inhaling its aroma directly from the bottle, adding a\nfew drops to a cotton ball or handkerchief, or diffusing it in an aro"
