            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Peppermint Oil\n[Peppermint Oil]\n\n# Peppermint Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4.5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nDiscover premium-quality Peppermint Oil from a trusted manufacturer specializing in wholesale and\nbulk supply. Elevate your product line with pure, potent oil sourced responsibly\u2014perfect for\ncosmetics, aromatherapy, and more. Partner for quality, reliability, and sustainable solutions.\n\n**Varieties**\n* [Peppermint Oil][92]\n* [Spearmint Oil][93]\n* [L-MENTHOL 38-40% TMC 50% Peppermint Oil][94]\n* [L-Menthol 38% TMC 50% Peppermint Essential Oils][95]\n* [L-MENTHOL 75% Peppermint Essential Oils][96]\n* [L-Menthol 90% Peppermint Essential Oils][97]\n* Origin: India, North America and Europe\n* Botanical: Mentha piperita\n* Family: Labiatae (Lamiaceae)\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Leaves\n* Colour: Clear with a Yellow Tinge\n\nProduct Details\n\n## **Peppermint Oil Manufacturer and Mentha Piperata Oil Supplier in India**\n\nWe are a **globally recognized Peppermint Oil Manufacturer, supplier, and exporter**, delivering\npremium-quality essential oils tailored for the **medical, Ayurveda, and cosmetic industries**. Our\npeppermint oil is celebrated for its exceptional purity, potent therapeutic properties, and\nsustainable sourcing. Trusted by businesses worldwide, we provide reliable B2B solutions with a\nfocus on quality, innovation, and seamless global distribution. Partner with us to elevate your\nproduct line with unmatched expertise and excellence.\n\n### **Benefits of Partnering with Us:**\n1. **Reliable Supply Chain:** With a robust supply chain and efficient logistics, we ensure timely\ndelivery of bulk orders, minimizing downtime for your operations.\n2. **Dedicated Customer Support:** Our team of experts is committed to providing exceptional\ncustomer service, offering guidance and assistance at every stage of your journey with us.\n3. **Competitive Pricing:** Despite our uncompromising commitment to quality, we offer competitive\npricing, maximizing the value proposition for your business.\n\nElevate your products and exceed customer expectations with our premium peppermint oil. As your\ntrusted partner in quality and reliability, we invite you to experience the difference with AG\nOrganica. Contact us today to discuss your peppermint oil requirements and embark on a journey\ntowards excellence.\n\n### **Intro about Peppermint Oil**\n\nPeppermint oil, derived from the aromatic herb of the mint family, is a versatile essential oil\ncherished for its refreshing scent and myriad of uses. Cultivated in regions including India, North\nAmerica, and Europe, peppermint oil is a hybrid of water mint and spearmint plants. Its invigorating\naroma and cooling properties make it a popular ingredient in various products, ranging from soaps\nand shampoos to perfumes and cosmetics. Additionally, peppermint oil is valued for its therapeutic\nbenefits, often incorporated into analgesic balms, ointments, and lotions for its soothing effects.\nIts inclusion in oral care items like toothpaste and chewing gums further highlights its widespread\nappeal and utility.\n\n### **Extraction of Peppermint oil**\n\nPeppermint oil is used for a variety of different purposes and is extracted from the leaves of the\npeppermint plant through the process of **steam distillation**. The oil is manufactured at AG\nOrganica, processed, and made available at a very reasonable price not only at the national level\nbut at the international level.\n\n### **Uses of Peppermint oil**\n\nThis antibacterial herb is known for various uses as given:-\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Muscle and joint pain\n* Sinus care and respiratory problems\n* Alleviating headaches\n* Improves IBS symptoms\n* Oral Health\n* Hair growth\n* Itchiness\n* Repels bugs\n* Reduces nausea\n* Sunburn relief\n\n### **Applications Uses**\n* Flavoring agent\n* Moisturizes\n* Pharmaceutical Products\n* Shampoo\n* Lotion\n* Soap\n* Face Care\n* Toothpaste\n* Shaving\n* Ointments\n* Perfumes\n* Balms\n\n...\n\n## **Benefits of Peppermint Oil**\n\nUnlike many natural herbs and medicines, there are numerous [benefits of Peppermint oil][98] as\ngiven under:\n* **Reduces muscle and joint pain: **It reduces inflammation and chronic pain of joints and muscles\nif applied to the affected area properly.\n* **Used for IBS: **Peppermint oil is used to reduce IBS which is a gastrointestinal condition and\ncan lead to conditions that involve abdominal pain, constipation, and conditions like diarrhea.\n* **Effective against nausea: **Nausea can occur usually after any operation. Results and research\nprove that inhaling of Peppermint oil lowers the level of nausea.\n* **Relieves headache: **With effective usage of Peppermint oil, you can get relief from any kind of\npain and headache. It provides a relaxing and soothing effect in a very effective manner.it also\nreduces the pain of migraines in most of the patients.\n* **Prevents allergy: **The oil like clove and eucalyptus oil helps in preventing any severe kind of\nallergic condition prevailing. It relaxes the nasal passages and clears out the nose of any muck\nand pollens.\n\n**Primary Benefits**\n* Promotes healthy respiratory function and clear breathing\n* Promotes digestive health\n* Repels bugs naturally\n\nAG Organica is a leading **manufacturer, distributor, and wholesale supplier of bulk** orders of\npeppermint oil. Peppermint is a hybrid species, a cross between spearmint and water mint. We create\npeppermint essential oil and oil powders meeting food, nutritional, and drink grade standards.\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n***Disclaimer : **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergy,\nhealth issues.*\n\n## **Private Label Peppermint Essential Oils Manufacturer**\n\nElevate your brand with our premium Private Label Services. Crafted with expertise and precision,\nour peppermint oil is sourced from the finest botanicals, ensuring unparalleled quality and purity.\n\n**Why Choose Our Private Label Manufacturer?**\n1. **Exceptional Quality**: Our peppermint oil is meticulously extracted using advanced techniques,\npreserving its natural essence and therapeutic properties.\n2. **Customization Options**: Tailor the packaging, labeling, and branding to reflect your unique\nvision and brand identity. Stand out in the market with a product that speaks volumes about your\ncommitment to excellence.\n3. **Unmatched Expertise**: Backed by years of industry experience, our team of professionals\nensures that every aspect of your Private Label Peppermint Oil is handled with utmost care and\nprecision.\n4. **Seamless Process**: From formulation to packaging, we streamline the entire process, ensuring\ntimely delivery without compromising on quality.\n5. **Comprehensive Support**: We offer comprehensive support at every step of the way, from initial\nconsultation to post-launch assistance, ensuring your satisfaction and success.\n\nHarness the power of peppermint oil and elevate your brand to new heights. Contact us today to learn\nmore about our Private Label Services and take the first step towards creating a product that leaves\na lasting impression.\n\n## **Manufacturer, Supplier and Wholesale Exporter of Peppermint Oil**\n\nAG Organica is the leading manufacturer & supplier of peppermint oil. It has extreme shelf-life\nstability. It is repellent to high temperatures. To know more about the product line and pricing,\nget in touch with us.[Peppermint oil][99] ( In English black mint oil, Mentha crispa oil, Mentha\ndumetorum oil, Mentha piperita (peppermint) leaf water, Mentha piperita (peppermint) oil, Mentha\npiperita flowering top oil, Mentha piperita oil, Mentha X piperita oil, Menthae piperitae\naetheroleum, Oil of peppermint, Pepermint oil, Peppermint volatile oil, [**\u092a\u0947\u092a\u0930\u092e\u093f\u0902\u091f \u0924\u0947\u0932**][100],\n**\u092a\u0941\u0926\u0940\u0928\u093e \u0924\u0947\u0932**, \u092e\u0947\u0902\u0925\u093e \u092a\u093f\u092a\u0947\u0930\u093f\u091f\u093e (\u092a\u0941\u0926\u0940\u0928\u093e) \u092a\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0940 \u0915\u093e \u0924\u0947\u0932), Peppermint Oil, Mentha Piperita Essential Oil, Pepper\nMint Oil is an aromatic herb of the mint family and is found in India, North America, and Europe.\n\n**PEOPLE ALSO SEARCH US BY :**\n\nPeppermint Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Peppermint Oil, Essential Oil Manufacturer, natural\nPeppermint Oil, Bulk Peppermint Oil, Natural Essential Oil Supplier, Peppermint Oil Exporter,\nPeppermint Essential Oil Benefits, Pure Peppermint Oil, Peppermint Essential Oil, Peppermint\nEssential Oil Manufacturers, [Peppermint Oil Manufacturer in India][101], Peppermint Essential Oil\nManufacturer in Ghaziabad, [Peppermint Oil Manufacturer in Delhi][102], [Peppermint Oil Manufacturer\nin Noida][103], Peppermint Essential Oil Supplier, Peppermint Essential Oil exporter from India to\n[USA][104], [Canada][105], Australia, [Germany][106], [Europe][107].\n\nRead more\n\n**Blog**\n\nTechnical\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500