            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Frankincense Oil\n[Frankincense Oil]\n\n# Frankincense Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [3 Reviews][91]\n\nFrankincense originates from a small scraggly but hardy tree indigenous to the Middle East, which is\nsmall with abundant pinnacle leaves and white or pale pink flowers. Basil, Bergamot, Cardamom,\nCedarwood, Chamomile, Cinnamon Bark, Clary Sage, Coriander, Geranium, Myrrh, and Vanilla.\n\n**Varieties Frankincense Oil (The King of Essential Oils)**\n* [Frankincense Oil][92]\n* [Frankincense Oil - India][93]\n* [Frankincense Oil - Carterii][94]\n* [Frankincense Oil - Organic][95]\n* [Frankincense Natural Blend Oil][96]\n* [Frankincense Hydrosol][97]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Boswellia carterii / Boswellia sacra\n* Family: Burseraceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Resin\n* Colour: Light Yellow or pale yellow-green\nProduct Details\n\n## **Frankincense Oil Manufacturer & Supplier (The King of Essential Oils)**\n\nFrankincense Oil, also known as Olibanum Oil or Oil of Lebanon (Boswellia / olibanum / Frankincense\n/ \u092c\u094b\u0938\u0935\u0947\u0932\u093f\u092f\u093e / \u0913\u0932\u093f\u092c\u093e\u0928\u092e / \u0932\u094b\u092c\u093e\u0928 / \u0932\u094b\u092c\u093e\u0928 \u0924\u0947\u0932/ \u0932\u0947\u092c\u0928\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u093e \u0924\u0947\u0932), is renowned for its rich history and\nmultifaceted uses. This precious oil, derived from the resin of the Boswellia Serrata tree, boasts a\nvariety of common names that highlight its cultural and geographical significance.\n\n### **Common Names for Boswellia Serrata:**\n* **Olibanum**\n* **Indian Frankincense**\n* **Salai Guggul**\n* **Sallaki**\n\nEach name reflects a unique aspect of the tree's heritage and its revered place in traditional\npractices. Whether referred to as Olibanum in ancient texts or as Sallaki in Ayurvedic\nmedicine, Boswellia Serrata continues to be a cornerstone in both historical and modern\napplications.\n\n### **Extraction of Frankincense essential oil**\n\nAt the distillery of AG Organica, the raw Frankincense crystals are crushed firstly into a powder,\nthen the powder is placed in an oil bath and undergoes steam distillation or CO2 extraction process\nand the essential is finally produced. It is made available easily at a very reasonable price\nnationally and internationally.\n\n## **Manufacturer of Natural Steam Distilled Frankincense Oil **\n\nA.G. Organica Private Limited, a leading Frankincense Oil manufacturer, ensures the highest quality\noil through steam distillation from the resin of the Frankincense tree. This method preserves the\noil\u2019s therapeutic properties, making it a staple for multiple industries.\n\n### **Our Commitments to Sustainability and Ethical Sourcing**\n\n#### **Prioritizing Organic and Sustainable Practices**\n\nWe\u2019re deeply committed to offering only products that meet stringent organic standards or are\nwildcrafted in their natural environments. When organic certification isn't an option, we ensure\nthat our items are cultivated using organic methods. This commitment is reinforced by maintaining\nclose relationships with trustworthy distillers and suppliers, who adhere to sustainable and\npesticide-free practices.\n\n#### **Ensuring Ethical Production**\n\nQuality and ethics go hand in hand for us. We rigorously vet our suppliers to ensure that no\nsynthetic additives, contaminants, or cheap fillers compromise our products. Furthermore, we insist\non ethical production methods, void of any unscrupulous practices. Our dedication to comprehensive\nquality testing guarantees that every product we offer is genuinely pure and authentic.\n\n### **Key Areas of Commitment**\n* **Certified Organic Products:** We prioritize items that have received organic certification or\nhave been wild-harvested sustainably.\n* **Ethical Supplier Relationships:** Close collaboration with suppliers ensures adherence to\norganic and ethical practices.\n* **No Compromises on Quality:** Strict quality controls to prevent any form of product\nadulteration.\n* **Sustainable Sourcing:** We focus on harvesting methods that maintain the health of natural\nresources.\n\nBy adhering to these principles, we not only support the environment but also ensure that consumers\nreceive products that are pure, potent, and ethically sourced.\n\n### **Properties of Frankincense Essential Oil**\n\nFrankincense Oil is a pleasantry aromatic essential oil and its scent has been described as earthy\nor woody. It contains properties that diminish the sign of aging, reduces the feeling of anxiety,\nand stimulate the immune system of our body.\n\n### **Topical Uses of Frankincense Oil**\n* Skin Conditioner\n* Scar Reduction\n* Regeneration Of Skin\n* Strengthens Finger Nails\n* Cures Warts\n* Insect Bites\n* Cures Dandruff\n* Gives Shiny Hair\n* Relieves Pain\n* Stress Relief\n* Back Pain Relief\n* Improves Immunity\n\n### **Everyday Uses of Hydrodistilled Frankincense Essential Oil**\n* Improve Skin Health\n* Boost Immunity\n* Ready Yourself for Sleep\n* Ease Anxiety\n* Establish a Habit of Mindfulness\n\n### **Water Steam Distillation of Frankincense gum Oil Benefits**\n* Used in perfumery and aromatherapy\n* Used for the treatment of arthritis and rheumatoid arthritis\n* It is a natural painkiller\n* Used in respiratory disorder, it is broken down the deposited phlegm from the lungs and\nrespiratory tract\n* Gives relives in cold\n* Act as antiseptic\n* Prevented toothaches, cavities, mouth sores, and other infection\n* Used for the treatment of the digestive problem.\n* Regulates menstrual cycle of female\n* Acts as a coagulant. It stops bleeding from wounds\n* Inhibits the chest and abdominal pain\n* Used as skin health and anti-aging agents\n* Removes sun spots, micro wrinkles in cheeks, and eyes\n* Used for lowering of high blood pressure\n* Has sedative activity\n* Used for the treatment of ulcers\n\n### **Primary Benefits of Frankincense Oil**\n* Ingest to support healthy cellular function\n* Helps reduce the appearance of skin imperfections when applied topically\n* May provide a soothing aromatic experience\n* Supports healthy immune and nervous system function\n\n...\n\n## **Why Choose A.G. Organica?**\n\nWe provide 100% natural Frankincense Oil, adhering to the highest quality standards. Our oils are\ngovernment authorized, ensuring they are non-alcoholic and chemical-free. With distributors across\nmajor Indian cities, timely delivery and product integrity are guaranteed. Bulk and wholesale orders\nare handled efficiently with no hidden charges. Contact us for more details or visit our website to\nmake a purchase.\n\n**Usage Guidelines**\n\n**Frankincense Oil For Hair:**\n1. Mix a few drops with a carrier oil like coconut or jasmine oil.\n2. Apply to scalp and massage gently.\n\n**Frankincense Oil For Arthritis:**\n1. Mix a few drops with a carrier oil.\n2. Apply to joints and massage gently.\n\n**Frankincense Oil For Skin / Face:**\n1. Mix a few drops with a carrier oil.\n2. Apply to face and massage gently in circular motions.\n\nFrankincense has earned its title as \"The King of Oils\" because of its versatility. When used\ntopically, frankincense touts powerful anti-aging properties. Frankincense is a wonderful sleep aid\nbecause of its aroma therapeutic benefits, relieving stress and promoting relaxation. Frankincense\noil has a rejuvenating effect, especially on mature skin. It minimizes wrinkles and fine lines and\nreduces the appearance of scars and blemishes. Frankincense is also excellent at promoting a healthy\nscalp and moisturizing existing hair follicles to prevent and treat hair loss\n\n***Disclaimer :** The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergy,\nhealth issues.*\n\n**Note / Strength of Aroma:** A base note with a medium aroma; has a warm and spicy, woody odor that\nis haunting, but milder than Frankincense from Somalia.\n\n**Classification:** It is classified as a base note, which serves as an excellent fixative. This\nmeans it helps to stabilize and preserve the fragrance of other essential oils in a blend,\nprolonging the overall scent experience.\n\n**PEOPLE ALSO SEARCH US BY :**\n\nFrankincense Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Frankincense Oil, Essential Oil Manufacturer, Organic\nFrankincense Oil, Bulk Frankincense Oil, Natural Essential Oil Supplier, Frankincense Oil Exporter,\nFrankincense Essential Oil Benefits, Pure Frankincense Oil, Frankincense Essential Oil, Frankincense\nEssential Oil Manufacturers, [Lavender Oil Manufacturer in India][98], Frankincense Essential Oil\nManufacturer in [Ghaziabad][99], [Lavender Oil Manufacturer in Delhi][100], [Lavender Oil\nManufacturer in Noida][101], Frankincense Essential Oil Supplier, Frankincense Essential Oil\nexporter from India to [USA][102], Canada, Australia, [Germany][103], [Europe][104].\n\nRead more\n\nTechnical\n\n## **Properties of Frankincense Oil**\n1. Sweet, warm balsamic aroma\n2. Pale yellow-green hue\n3. Anti-catarrhal\n4. Anti-depressant\n5. Anti-infectious\n6. Antiseptic\n7. Expectorant\n8. Immune-stimulant\n9. Muscle relaxant\n10. Sedative\n\n### **Uses of Therapeutic Grade Frankincense Essential Oil**\n* **Antiseptic and Healing : **Frankincense Oil can be applied directly to wounds to prevent\ninfections like tetanus and sepsis. Purchase from A.G. Organica for bulk orders and reap its\nhealth benefits.\n* **Oral Health : **This oil combats bad breath, toothaches, cavities, and mouth sores, promoting\noverall oral hygiene.\n* **Hair and Skin Care : **Frankincense Oil strengthens gums and hair roots, preventing premature\nloss. It also evens skin tone and reduces signs of aging. Our oil is all-natural and\nchemical-free, ensuring safe topical use.\n* **Digestive Aid : **It alleviates symptoms of indigestion, including stomach pains and discomfort,\nby eliminating excess gas.\n* **Scar and Mark Reduction : **Applied topically, Frankincense Oil helps diminish scars, acne,\nboils, and stretch marks. It is a key ingredient in"
