            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Agarwood Oil\n[Agarwood Oil]\n\n# Agarwood Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4.5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nWe are the wholesale essential oil supplier of agarwood oil. It is used to make traditional\nmedicines, perfumes & incense items.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Aquilaria malaccensis\n* Family: Thymelaeaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Wood\n* Colour:\nProduct Details\n\n## **Agarwood Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Exporter from India \u2013 Authentic & Sustainable**\n\nAgarwood oil, often referred to as **oud oil**, holds a legendary status in the world of luxury,\nwellness, and spirituality. With its rich history, mesmerizing aroma, and exceptional benefits,\nagarwood oil is highly sought after globally. At **AG Organica**, we pride ourselves on being a\ntrusted **agarwood oil (oud) manufacturer**, committed to sustainable practices and premium quality.\nThis article delves into the origins, extraction process, uses, and benefits of this \"liquid gold\"\nwhile emphasizing AG Organica's role as a leading supplier in the industry.\n\n## **What is Agarwood Oil?**\n\nAgarwood oil, also known as **oud oil**, is an essential oil extracted from the resinous heartwood\nof Aquilaria trees. These trees produce resin in response to fungal infections or physical injuries,\nwhich over time, transforms into the aromatic agarwood. The resin-rich wood undergoes steam\ndistillation to extract pure **agarwood oil**.\n\n## **Historical Significance of Agarwood Oil**\n\nThe legacy of agarwood oil dates back thousands of years. Ancient Chinese medicine revered it for\nits therapeutic properties, while Indian rituals considered it a symbol of purity. Middle Eastern\nroyalty used it as a signature fragrance, often blending it with other precious oils. Today, the\nglobal fascination with agarwood oil persists, thanks to its rare, captivating aroma and versatile\napplications.\n\n## **The Role of AG Organica as a Trusted Manufacturer**\n\nAs a globally recognized **agarwood oil (oud) manufacturer**, **AG Organica** upholds stringent\nquality standards. We specialize in sustainably sourcing agarwood from regions like Assam, Nagaland,\nand Manipur. Our commitment to eco-friendly practices ensures the conservation of Aquilaria species\nwhile delivering the finest oud oil to customers worldwide.\n\n## **Extraction Process of Agarwood Oil**\n\nThe production of agarwood oil is a meticulous process involving:\n1. **Harvesting**: Sourcing resin-rich heartwood from mature Aquilaria trees.\n2. **Cleaning**: Removing impurities from the resin.\n3. **Distillation**: Employing steam or water distillation to extract the oil.\n4. **Filtration**: Purifying the oil to achieve a high-grade product.\n5. **Aging**: Allowing the oil to mature, enhancing its aroma and depth.\n6. **Packaging**: Bottling the oil in airtight containers for optimal preservation.\n\nAG Organica\u2019s cutting-edge facilities ensure that every batch meets global quality benchmarks.\n\n## **Benefits of Agarwood Oil**\n\nAgarwood oil is prized for its numerous benefits, including:\n* **Aromatherapy**: Its woody fragrance induces relaxation and reduces stress.\n* **Spiritual Enhancement**: Used in meditation and rituals for its grounding properties.\n* **Skincare**: Anti-inflammatory properties help soothe skin irritations.\n* **Immune Support**: Antimicrobial effects bolster the body's natural defenses.\n* **Sleep Aid**: Promotes restful sleep by calming the mind.\n\n**Blending:** It blends well with Sandalwood, Neroli, Frankincense, Myrrh, Jasmine, Rose Otto,\nLemon, Bergamot, Vetiver, Patchouli, Orris Root, Lime, Palo Santo, and Ylang.\n\n## **Innovative Uses of Agarwood Oil**\n1. **Perfume Blending**: As a base note in luxury perfumes, it adds longevity and complexity.\n2. **Diffusion**: Enhances ambiance with its calming aroma.\n3. **Massage Oil**: When blended with carrier oils, it soothes muscles and nourishes skin.\n4. **Bath Soaks**: A few drops transform an ordinary bath into a spa-like retreat.\n5. **Meditation Aid**: Heightens focus and spiritual connection during mindfulness practices.\n6. **DIY Skincare**: Mixed with creams or serums, it promotes a radiant complexion.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nRenu\n\n25-02-2020 12:24\n\nI am so pleased! The smell is amazing. Very well packaged!!\n\nVaani\n\n25-02-2020 12:36\n\nI love this oil !!!!!\n\nVarieties\n[Agarwood Natural Blend Oil][92]\n* Origin: India\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][93]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][94]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][95]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][96]\n* [Third Party Manufacturing][97]\n* [About Us][98]\n* [Magazine][99]\n* [Infrastructure][100]\n* [Contact Us][101]\nQuick Links\n* [Lavender Essential Oil][102]\n* [Tea Tree Essential Oil][103]\n* [Eucalyptus Essential Oil][104]\n* [Lemongrass Essential Oil][105]\n* [Rosemary Essential Oil][106]\n* [Cinnamon Essential Oil][107]\n* [Jasmine Essential Oil][108]\n* [Peppermint Essential Oil][109]\n* [Frankincense Essential Oil][110]\nContact Us\n\nHQ & Manufacturing Site\n\nC-11, Sector 85, Noida \u2013 201305 (India)\n\nagorganica@pureoilsindia.com\n\n011-411-87600\n\nwww.pureoilsindia.com\n\n## Govt. recognition Star Export House - Leading Wholesale Supplier, Manufacturer & Exporter\n\nAG Organica provides India made bulk oils, Floral Water, Butter and Cosmetics to businesses\nworldwide. Serving clients in:\n* America\n* Argentina\n* Australia\n* Belgium\n* Brazil\n* Canada\n* Chile\n* China\n* Colombia\n* Costa Rica\n* Dubai\n* Egypt\n* Ethiopia\n* European Union\n* Finland\n* France\n* Germany\n* Greece\n* Hong Kong\n* India\n* Indonesia\n* Israel\n* Italy\n* Japan\n* Kenya\n* Luxembourg\n* Malaysia\n* Mexico\n* Morocco\n* New Zealand\n* Nigeria\n* Norway\n* North America\n* Oman\n* Philippines\n* Portugal\n* Russia\n* Saudi Arabia\n* Singapore\n* South Africa\n* South Korea\n* Spain\n* Sri Lanka\n* Sweden\n* Taiwan\n* Thailand\n* United Arab Emirates\n* United Kingdom\n* United States\n* Istanbul\n* Vietnam\n\nMany well-reputed domestic & global brands entrust their products to us.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 pureoilsindia.com. All Rights Reserved.\nSend Inquiry\n\n##### Enquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nMessage\nSubmit\nSubmit\n\n[1]: tel:01141187600\n[2]: tel:+9101204310497\n[3]: #\n[4]: /about-us\n[5]: https://www.pureoilsindia.com/media-coverage\n[6]: /event-gallary\n[7]: /market-report\n[8]: /newsletter\n[9]: /certifications-docs\n[10]: /frequently-ask-questions\n[11]: /policies\n[12]: /download-ag-organica-catalog\n[13]: /best-quality-essential-oil\n[14]: /infrastructure-list\n[15]: #\n[16]: /contract-manufacturing\n[17]: /cosmetics-manufacturer\n[18]: /natural-cosmetics-skincare-in-private-labels\n[19]: /custom-formulation\n[20]: /new-color-cosmetics-manufacturer\n[21]: /skin-care-manufacturer\n[22]: /third-party-cosmetics-manufacturing\n[23]: /wholesale-supplier\n[24]: /article\n[25]: /blog\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: https://www.pureoilsindia.com/\n[28]: #\n[29]: /product-category/essential-oils\n[30]: /product-category/carrier-oi