            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Ajwain Oil\n[Ajwain Oil]\n\n# Ajwain Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4.5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nWe export high-quality Ajwain essential oil and provide it to customers all over the world.\n**Varieties**\n* [Thyme Oil Red][92]\n* [Thyme Oil White][93]\n* [Thyme Oil(As per USP)][94]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Trachyspermum ammi\n* Family: Apiaceae /Umbelliferae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Seeds\n* Colour: Light orange to reddish brown with herbaceous, spicy, medicinal odor\nProduct Details\n\n## **Ajwain Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nWe are one of the leading exporters of premium quality Ajwain oil and supply the oil to many\ndifferent parts of the world. The essential Ajwain Oil is extracted from the Ajwain seeds in its\npurest form by our team using the steam distillation process. Ajwain, a common ingredient of Indian\nkitchen and frequently used spice in many cuisines in India, is commonly known as bishop's weed,\najowan caraway, ajowan, and carom seed. Ajwain is derived from the seeds of the herb\n*Trachyspermumammi*, or CaramCopticum. The herb belongs to the Apiaceae family of plants and is a\nnative of Egypt, while is widely used in the South East Asian countries like India, Afghanistan,\nPakistan, Iraq, and Iran.\n\nWelcome to the world of premium Ajwain Oil, where quality meets purity! As a leading manufacturer,\nsupplier, and exporter of Ajwain Oil, we take pride in delivering excellence in every drop. Our\ncommitment to quality, backed by years of expertise, makes us your trusted partner in the realm of\nessential oils.\n\n**Key Features:**\n1. **Uncompromised Quality:** Our Ajwain Oil is meticulously extracted from the finest Ajwain seeds,\nensuring unparalleled quality and purity. Each batch undergoes rigorous quality checks to\nmaintain consistency and potency.\n2. **Premium Ingredients:** We source our Ajwain seeds from trusted farmers who adhere to organic\ncultivation practices, ensuring that only the best ingredients go into our oil. This dedication\nto quality reflects in the aroma and efficacy of our product.\n3. **State-of-the-Art Manufacturing:** Equipped with advanced technology and adhering to stringent\nquality standards, our manufacturing facility ensures that every bottle of Ajwain Oil retains its\nnatural goodness and therapeutic properties.\n4. **Versatile Applications:** From pharmaceuticals to aromatherapy, our Ajwain Oil finds diverse\napplications across industries. Its antiseptic, digestive, and antimicrobial properties make it a\nversatile ingredient for various formulations.\n5. **Global Reach:** As an esteemed exporter, we cater to clients worldwide, delivering our premium\nAjwain Oil with promptness and reliability. Whether you're a distributor, retailer, or end-user,\nyou can trust us to meet your requirements with precision.\n\n**Why Choose Us:**\n1. **Exceptional Customer Service:** Our dedicated team is committed to providing personalized\nassistance and prompt responses to ensure a seamless experience for our clients.\n2. **Competitive Pricing:** Despite offering premium quality, we believe in fair pricing, making our\nAjwain Oil accessible to businesses of all sizes.\n3. **Customized Solutions:** Understanding the unique needs of our clients, we offer customized\npackaging and labeling solutions to enhance brand identity and market presence.\n4. **Certifications and Compliance:** Our adherence to international quality standards and\ncertifications underscores our commitment to delivering excellence without compromise.\n\nIn conclusion, when it comes to Ajwain Oil, trust only the best. With our unwavering dedication to\nquality, extensive industry experience, and global reach, we stand as your reliable partner in\nfulfilling your Ajwain Oil requirements. Experience the difference with our premium Ajwain Oil \u2013\nyour gateway to purity and potency. Contact us today to embark on a journey of excellence!\n\n### **Constituents**\n\nAjwain Oil contains around 50% of thymol, along with carvacrol, a-terpinene, dipentene, styrene,\ndillapiole, carvone, limonene, p-cymene, b-phyllanderene, and a-pinene. The seeds of the oil contain\nsome essential nutrients like calcium, thiamine, niacin, carotene, phosphorus, riboflavin,\ncarbohydrates, proteins, iron, and fatty minerals.\n\n### **Blending**\n\nAjwain oil blends well with other spice oils like sage and thyme. This is also works with citrus\noils like orange, lemon and bergamot.\n\n## **Uses of Ajwain Oil**\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Instant Relief from Acidity and Indigestion\n* Treats Common Cold\n* For Ear and Tooth Ache\n* For Cleaning Wound\n* Oma Water\n* Stop Greying of Hair\n* Mosquito Repellent\n* Cleansing skin\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Alleviate Bronchitis\n* Get Rid of a Fever\n* Treat Asthma\n* Get Relief from Arthritis\n* Relieve Neuralgia Pain\n* Alleviate Headaches and Migraines\n* Improve Digestion\n* Get Relief from Flatulence\n* Treat Stomach Ulcers\n\n### **Popular Uses**\n* Used as an ingredient in toothpaste and mouthwashes\n* Used in eardrops for earaches\n* Used for aromatherapy, in massage body oil and providing relief from muscle spasm, cramps, and\narthritis\n* Used for the treatment of cholera and diarrhea\n* Useful in breathing issues as it relaxes air passage\n* Provides aid in healing painful throat\n* Provides ease in the stuffy nose, sinus congestion, colds, and coughs\n* Helps in kidney stones as it dissolves stone and treats urinary infections to relieve pain and\nanother discomfort of the kidney\n* Used to alleviate rheumatic pain and inflammatory condition.\n* Used in wound cleaning and treating skin infection because of its antiseptic property\n* Has antifungal component i.e. thymol and \u00c3\u0192-pinene which helps to get rid of molds, yeasts, and\nother fungi\n* Used for the treatment of emphysema, migraine, and rheumatic pain\n\n...\n\n## **Benefits of Ajwain Oil**\n* **Helps in Digestion** : Ajwain Oil can treat flatulence by as it can be used to kill the\nintestinal parasites. It possesses anthelmintic and nematicidal properties. It prevents the growth\nof harmful parasites and bacteria in the digestive system.\n* **Treats Cholera and Diarrhoea** : The essential Ajwain oil is extensively used for treating\nvarious intestine and stomach issues and is used to treat cholera, vomiting, diarrhoea, colic pain\nin babies.\n* **Treats infections related to Respiratory System** : It is rich in macro and micro nutrients that\nessential for the immune system of our body. Hence, it is used to improve immunity. It also helps\nin fighting some seasonal infections like cold, flu and asthma.\n* **Treat Urinary Infections** : The diuretic, lithotriptic and cleansing properties of the Ajwain\nessential oil helps in dissolving the renal calculi and kidney stones. It is also beneficial in\nthe treatment of urinary infections by removing toxins, salts and uric acid from the body.\n* **Enhances Fertility** : Ajwain oil is used for many years for enhancing fertility. The\naphrodisiac property of the oil helps improve the secretion of hormones like estrogen and\nprogesterone.\n* **Pain Reliever** : Ajwain essential oil also acts as a pain killer. It is used commonly to treat\npains like an ear ache, muscle and joint pain, and rheumatic pain.\n* **Nasal Congestion** : The oil is very effective in treating nasal congestions. It cleans the\nmucous membrane and the respiratory tracts when inhaled.\n* **Fights Fungal and Bacterial infections** : The anti-fungal property of the Ajwain essential oil\nhelps in fighting fungal infections due to mods, yeast, and fungi. The oil is also beneficial in\npreventing various bacterial infections and boosts the immune response of the body.\n\n### **Primary Benefits**\n* Fight bacteria and fungi\n* Improve cholesterol levels\n* Lower blood pressure\n* Combats peptic ulcers and relieves indigestion\n* Prevent coughing and improve airflow\n* Has anti-inflammatory effects\n\nThe Ajwain essential oil has different uses and the application depends on the usages. Most commonly\nAjwain oil is used in skincare & in oil burners as a calming fragrance. Dilute the essential oils\nwith a carrier oil for the best results as they are very concentrated. Carrier oil mix well with\nessential oils and helps take them within the skin. AG Organica is one of the leading wholesale\nsuppliers of Ajwain essential oil. We assure you that all our products adhere to the highest\ncriteria of safety and quality. We offer the natural & organic forms of essential oils to our\ncustomers. Our products are free from all chemicals, additives, & fillers. They also do not carry\nany artificial colors, preservatives, and fragrances. You should dilute essential oil before using\nit for topical application as it is highly concentrated. We employ various tests and quality checks\nto assure that only premium-quality and effective oils reach our clients. The highest quality and\npackaging norms are employed to deliver excellent results on usage. We sell Ajwain oil in bulk with\nfast delivery and complete customer support. Our company assures that you will not regret choosing\nus!\n* If a person is on diet, avoid using of ajwain oil as it stimulates appetite.\n* Consult to doctor before using while pregnant or breast feeding.\n\n**Disclaimer : **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergy,\nhealth issues.\n\n## Private Label Ajwain Essential Oils\n\nUnlock the potential of your brand with our bespoke Private Label Services. Crafted with precision\nand expertise, our Ajwain Oil is the epitome of purity and quality. Partner with us to create a\nunique product that reflects the essence of your brand, from formulation to packaging. Harness the\npower of Ajwain Oil, known for i"
