            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Bergamot Oil\n[Bergamot Oil]\n\n# Bergamot Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nWe are the most reputed names in the industry to export premium quality Bergamot Essential Oil.\nBefore it reaches us, the oil passes through various quality tests. Every year, we receive bulk\norders for products from all across the world.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Citrus Bergamia\n* Family: Rutaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Fruit\n* Colour: Light yellow to a dark green\n* Grade: Pharma, and Cosmetic\nProduct Details\n\n## **Bergamot Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Supplier, and Exporter of Pure and Natural Bergamot\n## Essential Oil**\n\nBergamot oil, derived from the peels of the citrus *Citrus bergamia*, is a fragrant and versatile\nessential oil. Belonging to the Rutaceae family, bergamot resembles other citrus plants like lemon\nand orange, and its oil is prized for its distinctive, uplifting aroma and multifaceted uses. While\nnative to Asia, bergamot is now predominantly cultivated in Calabria, Italy.\n\nAG Organica, a globally trusted and leading **Bergamot oil manufacturer**, supplies pure and natural\nbergamot essential oil to a broad spectrum of industries worldwide, including cosmetics,\naromatherapy, and pharmaceuticals. Our commitment to quality and sustainability makes us a preferred\nchoice among **Bergamot oil exporters**.\n\n## **Bergamot Essential Oil \u2013 Extraction & Composition**\n\nOur bergamot oil is extracted through a cold-pressed method from the fresh peels of *Citrus\nbergamia* fruit. The result is a yellow-green liquid with a sweet, fruity scent. The oil is rich in\nlinalyl acetate (about 60%) and linalool (about 22%), both of which contribute to its therapeutic\nproperties. It also contains beneficial compounds like bergamottin, citropten, and bergapten, making\nit a powerful addition to various formulations.\n\nAs a premier **Bergamot oil supplier**, AG Organica provides this oil in bulk quantities while\nmaintaining stringent quality standards.\n\n## **Key Uses of Bergamot Oil**\n\nBergamot oil's wide range of applications makes it indispensable in various sectors:\n1. **Cicatrisant**: Bergamot oil's regenerative properties make it a popular ingredient in\ncosmetics, where it's used in deodorants, creams, and moisturizers. Its ability to reduce the\nappearance of scars and blemishes is particularly valued in skincare formulations.\n2. **Febrifuge**: Known for its fever-reducing properties, bergamot oil is used in the formulation\nof antipyretic medicines. It supports glandular functions and offers protection against bacteria\nand viruses that cause influenza and fever.\n3. **Analgesic**: The oil is highly effective in alleviating pain, particularly when it comes to\nmuscle aches, sprains, and headaches. Its natural compounds stimulate the release of eicosanoids,\nwhich help in managing nerve pain.\n4. **Antidepressant & Stimulant**: The uplifting components of bergamot, particularly limonene and\nalpha-pinene, enhance mood, increase blood circulation, and bring about feelings of joy and\nrefreshment, making it an ideal choice for stress-relieving products.\n5. **Antiperspirant**: Bergamot oil, particularly the AB 430 compound, is a natural antiperspirant\nthat helps control body odor by inhibiting the growth of odor-causing bacteria.\n\n## **Benefits of Bergamot Oil**\n\nAt AG Organica, we ensure that our **Bergamot oil** meets the highest purity standards. As a\ncold-pressed oil from the fruit's peel, it offers numerous benefits:\n* **Fragrance**: Bergamot oil\u2019s unique, sweet-floral aroma makes it a key ingredient in perfumes and\nscented products.\n* **Topical Use**: Its antibacterial properties help treat skin conditions like acne, and its\nability to reduce inflammation makes it an ideal ingredient in lotions and creams.\n* **Respiratory Aid**: Known for its antispasmodic and expectorant properties, bergamot oil aids in\nimproving breathing, reducing chronic coughs, and eliminating bacteria.\n* **Sleep Enhancer**: Diffusing bergamot oil in the air can promote restful sleep, particularly in\nchildren, making it a popular choice in bedtime aromatherapy routines.\n\n## **Aromatherapy & Beyond**\n\nBergamot oil has a long history in aromatherapy due to its mood-enhancing properties. It is\nfrequently used to combat stress, headaches, and emotional tension. Whether diffused in the air or\napplied topically after dilution with a carrier oil, bergamot oil brings balance and positivity.\n\nAt AG Organica, we offer **wholesale Bergamot oil** to clients worldwide, catering to a variety of\nindustries such as cosmetics, skincare, and aromatherapy. As a leading **Bergamot oil\nmanufacturer**, we understand the importance of delivering high-quality, pure essential oils that\nmeet the specific needs of our clients.\n\nAG Organica stands as a globally trusted **Bergamot oil manufacturer**, supplier, and exporter,\ndedicated to providing top-quality bergamot oil for various applications. Whether you are looking\nfor bulk bergamot oil for industrial use or to enhance your product formulations, our commitment to\nexcellence ensures you receive nothing but the best. Reach out to AG Organica for your **Bergamot\noil** requirements and experience the true power of natural and pure essential oils.\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nKatheline\n\n11-09-2020 10:40\n\nBergamont is a natural anti-depressant. I like this brand because I can truly smell the scent of\nthis.\n\nAnnie\n\n11-09-2020 10:41\n\nThe oil is very pure and with only a few drops, my office is filled with the citrus scent of\nBergamont!\n\nVarieties\n[Bergamot Natural Blend Oil][92]\n* Origin: Italy\n[Bergamot Oil - Bergaptene Free - Natural Blend][93]\n* Origin: Indonesia\n* Botanical: Pogostemon Cablin\n* Extraction: Cold Pressed\n* Part: Leaves\n* Colour: A thin, brown to dark brown liquid\n[Bergamot Oil - Calabrian][94]\n* Origin: Italy\n* Botanical: Citrus Bergamia\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Fruit Peel\n* Colour: A thin, light yellowish green to yellowish-brown liquid\n[Bergamot Oil - Natural Blend][95]\n* Origin: Italy\n* Botanical: Citrus Bergamia\n* Extraction: Cold Pressed\n* Part: Fruit Peel\n* Colour: A thin, light yellowish green to yellowish-brown liquid\nFAQs\nWhat is Bergamot Oil?\n\nBergamot Oil is a citrus essential oil extracted from the peel of the bergamot fruit. It's widely\nused in cosmetics, beauty products, pharmaceuticals, FMCG, and aroma industries for its refreshing\nscent and various therapeutic properties.\n\nHow is Bergamot Oil extracted?\n\nBergamot Oil is extracted through cold pressing the peel of the bergamot fruit, preserving its\naromatic compounds and therapeutic benefits. This method ensures high-quality oil suitable for\nvarious applications.\n\nCan Bergamot Oil be used for hair care?\n\nYes, Bergamot Oil is beneficial for hair care. It helps in balancing oil production on the scalp,\nreducing dandruff, and adding shine to the hair. Additionally, its refreshing scent makes it a\npopular choice for aromatherapy during hair treatments.\n\nIs Bergamot Oil suitable for DIY beauty products?\n\nYes, Bergamot Oil can be incorporated into homemade beauty products such as facial masks, bath\nsalts, and body scrubs. It offers a natural fragrance and therapeutic benefits, enhancing the\noverall quality of DIY formulations.\n\nCan Bergamot Oil help in improving mood and mental clarity?\n\nYes, Bergamot Oil is known for its mood-enhancing properties. Inhaling its aroma through diffusion\nor inhalation can help in boosting mood, increasing mental clarity, and reducing feelings of anxiety\nor depression, promoting overall emotional well-being.\n\nHow can Bergamot Oil be used for scalp health?\n\nBergamot Oil can be added to shampoo or diluted with a carrier oil such as coconut oil and massaged\ninto the scalp. It helps in balancing oil production, reducing itchiness, and promoting a healthier\nscalp environment for optimal hair growth.\n\nWhat are the primary constituents of Bergamot Oil?\n\nBergamot Oil contains various chemical compounds, including limonene, linalyl acetate, and\nbergapten. These constituents contribute to its distinct aroma, therapeutic properties, and\npotential benefits for skincare, haircare, and aromatherapy.\n\nHow does Bergamot Oil contribute to natural skincare routines?\n\nBergamot Oil offers natural alternatives to synthetic skincare ingredients. Its antibacterial and\nantifungal properties make it effective against acne-causing bacteria and fungi, while its\nastringent properties help in tightening pores and balancing sebum production.\n\nWhat is the difference between Bergamot Oil and other citrus oils?\n\nWhile Bergamot Oil shares similarities with other citrus oils in terms of its refreshing aroma and\nsome therapeutic properties, it has a unique composition and fragrance profile. Bergamot Oil is\ndistinctively characterized by its citrusy, floral, and slightly spicy aroma, setting it apart from\nother citrus oils such as lemon or orange oil.\n\nCan Bergamot Oil be used in natural cleaning products?\n\nYes, Bergamot Oil can be incorporated into homemade or natural cleaning products such as surface\nsprays, room fresheners, and laundry detergents. Its antibacterial properties help in effectively\ndisinfecting surfaces while leaving behind a pleasant citrus scent.\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][96]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][97]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][98]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][99]\n* "
