            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Black Pepper Oil\n[Black Pepper Oil]\n\n# Black Pepper Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nBlack pepper oil can normalize blood pressure, improve glucose tolerance & reduce inflammation.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Piper nigrum\n* Family: \u200ePiperaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Fruit\n* Colour: Pale yellow to Orange\nProduct Details\n\n## **Black Pepper Oils Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nWe at AG Organica is a trusted name among the worldwide manufacturers and suppliers of Black Pepper\nessential oil. Today we deal in bulk trading of 100% pure Black Pepper Essential oil passed through\nseveral quality tests.\n\n**Introduction to Black Pepper Essential Oil** - Commonly considered as popular spice or condiment,\nthe Black Pepper essential oil has excellent popularity throughout the world. The Black Pepper\nessential oil is derived from Black Pepper through the process of steam distillation. Black Pepper\nhas a fantastic aroma and is one of the essential ingredients in all culinary dishes, especially\nIndian ones. Black Pepper is small back colored dried fruit of the pepper plant. Due to its\nextraordinary taste and aroma, the Black Pepper is considered to be the \"queen of seasonings\" and\none of the reasons to be in high demand throughout the world. With its various beneficial properties\nlike digestive, diaphoretic, carminative, and aperient, the Bllack Pepper essential oil is an\nessential ingredient for our health.\n\n### **High Nutrition Value**\n\nBlack Pepper Essential Oil is rich in essential Vitamins, minerals, Calcium, manganese, iron,\nvitamin K, beta-carotene, phosphorus, potassium, and selenium. All these nutrients make the oil as\nhighly beneficial. Aside to the nutrition value, the oil has a lot of essential components as\nmentioned.\n\nWelcome to the premier destination for premium Black Pepper Oil solutions. As a trusted\nmanufacturer, supplier, and exporter, we pride ourselves on delivering top-notch products tailored\nto meet your business needs. Discover the essence of quality, reliability, and professionalism with\nour comprehensive range of Black Pepper Oil offerings.\n\nKey Features:\n* **Exquisite Manufacturing**: Our state-of-the-art facilities ensure the highest standards of\nmanufacturing, guaranteeing purity and potency in every drop of our Black Pepper Oil.\n* **Reliable Supply**: With a robust supply chain and efficient logistics, we ensure timely delivery\nof our products to your doorstep, wherever you are in the world.\n* **Global Export**: Experience seamless international transactions with our expert export services,\nallowing you to expand your market reach with ease.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n1. **Pure and Potent Formulation**: Our Black Pepper Oil is crafted using premium quality black\npepper seeds, meticulously extracted to preserve its natural essence and therapeutic properties.\n2. **Versatile Applications**: From culinary delights to wellness products, our Black Pepper Oil\nfinds its way into various industries, adding flavor, fragrance, and wellness benefits.\n3. **Stringent Quality Control**: Each batch of our Black Pepper Oil undergoes rigorous quality\ntesting to ensure compliance with international standards, giving you peace of mind and\nconfidence in every purchase.\n\nWhy Choose Us?\n* **Uncompromising Quality**: We adhere to stringent quality control measures at every stage of\nproduction, ensuring that our Black Pepper Oil surpasses industry standards.\n* **Customized Solutions**: Whether you require bulk quantities or tailored formulations, our team\nis dedicated to meeting your specific requirements with personalized solutions.\n* **Exceptional Customer Service**: Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the sale,\nwith responsive support and assistance available to address any queries or concerns.\n\nElevate your business with the finest Black Pepper Oil products from a trusted manufacturer,\nsupplier, and exporter. Experience the perfect blend of quality, reliability, and professionalism\nthat sets us apart in the industry. Get in touch with us today to discover how our premium Black\nPepper Oil solutions can enhance your business endeavors.\n\n### **Key Components**\n\nBlack Pepper Essential Oil includes some critical components like limonene, pinene, myrcene,\nphellandrene, beta-caryophyllene, beta-bisabolene, sabinene, Linalool, pinocarveol, alpha-terpineol,\ncamphene, and alpha-terpinene.\n\n**Important Properties : **Black Pepper Essential Oil has various properties like antispasmodic,\nantirheumatic, antiarthritic, antibacterial, and antioxidant.\n\n**Main Constituents :** \u00ce\u00b2-caryophyllene, limonene, sabinene, \u00ce\u00b1-pinene, \u00c3\u0178-Pinene, \u00ce\u00b4-3-carene\n\n**Other Constituents :** Alpha Terpenene, Cineole, Camphene, Pinene, Myristicin, Terpinen-4-ol,\nSabinene\n\n### **Blending**\n\nBlack Pepper oil blends with Bergamot, Coriander, Fennel, Lime.\n\n### **Uses of Black Pepper Essential Oil**\n\nBlack Pepper Oil has got several uses as listed below :\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Aching Muscles\n* Arthritis\n* Chilblains\n* Constipation\n* Muscle Cramps\n* Poor Circulation\n* Sluggish Digestion\n* Quitting Smoking and Nicotine Addiction\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Improves Digestion\n* Relieves Spasms\n* Eliminates Excess Gas\n* Cleans Excretory System\n* Reduces Arthritis Pain\n* Increases Urination\n\n### **Popular Uses**\n* Used in gastrointestinal disorder, against diarrhea, constipation, improves blood circulation\n* Used in aching muscles, cold flu, exhaustion, nerve tonic, and emotional coldness\n* Used in cosmetics\n* Used in a blend as a massage oil or diluted in the bath\n* Used as a preservative and as a raw material for food and other oils\n* Used as a detoxifier for the scalp\n* Helpful in sore muscles\n\n### **Applications Uses**\n* Hair Care\n* Skin Care\n* Creams\n* Lotions\n* Shampoos\n* Body Washes\n* Cleansers & Toners\n* Facial Oils & Serums\n* Moisturiser\n* Antioxidant Creams\n* Anti-ageing Creams\n\n...\n\n### **Benefits of Black Pepper Essential Oil**\n\nAll these factors make the oil-rich and highly beneficial to use. Let us discover some fantastic\nbenefits of this oil\n* **Improves Digestion : **Black Pepper Essential Oil inspires the whole digestive system and\nendorses excretion of intestinal juices like acids and bile into the stomach to ease the body\ndigestion.\n* **Relieves Spasms : **Black Pepper Essential Oil is highly effective antispasmodic and proves out\nto be good relief when it comes to problems like cramps, muscles pulls, spasms, or convulsions.\n* **Eliminates Excess Gas : **Black Pepper essential oil inhibits the bacteria which is responsible\nfor the formation of the gas. The oil thus protects the stomach against the formation of gas,\nkeeping it healthy & fit.\n* **Cleans Excretory System : **Black Pepper oil keeps one away from all problems which upset the\nstomach like stomach ache, stomach infections, gas by the cleaning the intestines\n* **Reduces Arthritis Pain : **Black Pepper oil improves body circulation and aid in immediate\nrelief for rheumatism and arthritis, especially during the winter season. It is the time of year\nwhen such symptoms are worst and effectively removes toxins from the body, such as Uric acid from\nthe blood.\n* **Increases Urination : **With the removal of body toxins, Black Pepper oil act as a disinfectant.\nThe oil encourages increased sweat and urination, which encourages the removal of excess water and\nfat from the body. It makes one reduce body inflammation level, lose weight,\u00c2 keep blood pressure\nlow, thus making one feel relaxed.\n\n**Primary Benefits**\n* Provides antioxidant and digestive support\n* Support healthy circulation\n* Enhances food flavor\n* Soothing and satisfying aroma\n\n### **Directions For Use**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:**\n* Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with Bergamot, Clary Sage, Frankincense, Geranium, Lavender, Clove, Juniper Berry,\nSandalwood, and Cedarwood oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n## Private Label Black Pepper Essential Oils\n\nUnlock the power of nature with our meticulously curated Black Pepper Oil, expertly extracted to\npreserve its potent properties. We understand the importance of standing out in a competitive\nmarket. That's why our Private Label services offer you the opportunity to showcase your unique\nbrand identity through our exceptional Black Pepper Oil.\n\nWhy choose Black Pepper Oil for your Private Label? Because it's more than just a product\u2014it's a\nsymbol of quality, authenticity, and sophistication. With its rich, spicy aroma and versatile\napplications, Black Pepper Oil adds a touch of luxury to any product line.\n\nAt our state-of-the-art facilities, we adhere to the highest industry standards to ensure that every\ndrop of our Black Pepper Oil meets your exact specifications. From sourcing the finest black pepper\nberries to employing advanced extraction techniques, we leave no stone unturned in delivering\nexcellence.\n\nPartnering with us means more than just access to premium Black Pepper Oil. It means having a\ndedicated team of professionals committed to bringing your vision to life. From custom labeling to\npackaging design, we work tirelessly to ensure that your Private Label reflects the essence of your\nbrand.\n\nElevate your brand with our Private Label Black Services. Experience the difference quality makes.\nContact us today to begin your journey towards excellence.\n\nIt is a warm oil that's why it is the best choice for sore, stiff muscles when applied topically. It\nhelps to stimulate circulation & relieves pain. It is safe as it is found in foods. It is used in\nmedicines & applied to the skin. It doesn't have any side effects. It promotes hair grow"
