            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Brahmi Oil\n[Brahmi Oil]\n\n# Brahmi Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nWe are the leading exporter and supplier of a premium quality Brahmi Oil, and keep receiving orders\nfrom our wide client based present all across the world. We are globally known to deliver Brahmi\noil, 100% organic in nature, and are recognized among the leading brands across the world for their\nhonest pricing and best-in-class quality standards. Introduction Brahmi Oil is a natural substance\nused since ancient times, specifically for making Ayurveda Medicines. The oil is produced by steam\ndistillation method, which involves the collection of herbs in a base oil. With slow heat, the\nsoluble nutrients pass into the oil and later are filtered. Basically, there are two herbs which are\nused to produce this oil.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Bacopa Monnieri(also known as gotu kola)\n* Family: Scrophulariaceae\n* Extraction: Cold Pressed\n* Part: Leaves, the whole plant\n* Colour: Sweet fragrance and natural greenish brown color\nProduct Details\n\n## **Brahmi Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nWe are the leading exporter and supplier of a premium quality Brahmi Oil, and keep receiving orders\nfrom our wide client based present all across the world. We are globally known to deliver Brahmi\noil, 100% organic in nature, and are recognized among the leading brands across the world for their\nhonest pricing and best-in-class quality standards.\n\n## **Introduction**\n\nBrahmi Oil is a natural substance used since ancient times, specifically for making Ayurveda\nMedicines. The oil is produced by steam distillation method, which involves the collection of herbs\nin a base oil. With slow heat, the soluble nutrients pass into the oil and later are filtered.\nBasically, there are two herbs which are used to produce this oil.\n1. BacopaMonnieri\n2. CentellaAsiatica\n\nBacopaMonnieri improves memory and cognitive function and CentellaAsiatica helps prevent cancer but\nit's not medically proven. It acts as a tonic to brain nerves as it contains neuron properties.\nBrahmi Oil, actually, is an infusion of Brahmi in any base oil such as :\n1. Butter Oil\n2. Sesame Oil\n3. Coconut oil\n\n**Constituents**\n\nThe chemical composition of Brahmi oil is alkaloids and sterols such as bacopasides, brahmine,\nherpestine, d-mannitol, hersaponin, monnierin, betulic acid, beta sitosterol, bacosine, luteolin,\nquercetin, apigenin and nicotine.\n\n**Common Uses**\n\nBrahmi Oil is known to bring a lot of health benefits and helps to cure the health problems listed\nbelow:\n* Alopecia areata\n* Anxiety\n* Dandruff\n* Epilepsy\n* Sleeping Disorders like Insomnia\n* Stress\n* Hair fall\n\n**Topical Uses**\n* Reduces Hair Fall\n* Promotes Hair Growth\n* Treats Mouth Ulcer\n* Cures Insomnia and Sleep Disorders\n* Treats Abdominal Pain and Relieves Gas\n* Controls Epilepsy and Seizures\n* Increases Concentration and Memory\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Boosts brain function\n* Help reduce ADHD symptom\n\n### **Popular Uses & Benefits**\n* Helps to improve memory and also a good nerve tonic.\n* Helps to calm down the mind and promotes relaxation.\n* Helps to decrease anxiety and restlessness.\n* Helps to improve the growth of hair, maintains shine in hair.\n* Helps to reduce dandruff, split ends, and flakey scalp.\n* Helps to treat certain skin problems.\n* Helps to prevent hair fall and premature graying of hair.\n* Enhance the power of memory\n* Helps to reduce hair fall and also cares for the skin\n* Provides alertness to your mind, so you may apply to remove stress\n* Whether you face a sleeping problem, apply and reduce your sleeping problems.\n* Works as a conditioner that means Brahmi oil reduces dandruff also\n\n### **Primary ****Benefits**\n* Prevents anxiety and stress\n* Help lower blood pressure levels\n* Have anticancer properties\n\n### **Directions For Use**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:**\n* Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with a carrier oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nTechnical\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nMeera v\n\n11-06-2021 16:52\n\nGood, pure, and effective oil\n\nNavya\n\n11-06-2021 16:53\n\nWell packaged and delivered very fast. Dropper added for convenience.\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][92]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][93]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][94]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][95]\n* [Third Party Manufacturing][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Magazine][98]\n* [Infrastructure][99]\n* [Contact Us][100]\nQuick Links\n* [Lavender Essential Oil][101]\n* [Tea Tree Essential Oil][102]\n* [Eucalyptus Essential Oil][103]\n* [Lemongrass Essential Oil][104]\n* [Rosemary Essential Oil][105]\n* [Cinnamon Essential Oil][106]\n* [Jasmine Essential Oil][107]\n* [Peppermint Essential Oil][108]\n* [Frankincense Essential Oil][109]\nContact Us\n\nHQ & Manufacturing Site\n\nC-11, Sector 85, Noida \u2013 201305 (India)\n\nagorganica@pureoilsindia.com\n\n011-411-87600\n\nwww.pureoilsindia.com\n\n## Govt. recognition Star Export House - Leading Wholesale Supplier, Manufacturer & Exporter\n\nAG Organica provides India made bulk oils, Floral Water, Butter and Cosmetics to businesses\nworldwide. Serving clients in:\n* America\n* Argentina\n* Australia\n* Belgium\n* Brazil\n* Canada\n* Chile\n* China\n* Colombia\n* Costa Rica\n* Dubai\n* Egypt\n* Ethiopia\n* European Union\n* Finland\n* France\n* Germany\n* Greece\n* Hong Kong\n* India\n* Indonesia\n* Israel\n* Italy\n* Japan\n* Kenya\n* Luxembourg\n* Malaysia\n* Mexico\n* Morocco\n* New Zealand\n* Nigeria\n* Norway\n* North America\n* Oman\n* Philippines\n* Portugal\n* Russia\n* Saudi Arabia\n* Singapore\n* South Africa\n* South Korea\n* Spain\n* Sri Lanka\n* Sweden\n* Taiwan\n* Thailand\n* United Arab Emirates\n* United Kingdom\n* United States\n* Istanbul\n* Vietnam\n\nMany well-reputed domestic & global brands entrust their products to us.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 pureoilsindia.com. All Rights Reserved.\nSend Inquiry\n\n##### Enquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nMessage\nSubmit\nSubmit\n\n[1]: tel:01141187600\n[2]: tel:+9101204310497\n[3]: #\n[4]: /about-us\n[5]: https://www.pureoilsindia.com/media-coverage\n[6]: /event-gallary\n[7]: /market-report\n[8]: /newsletter\n[9]: /certifications-docs\n[10]: /frequently-ask-questions\n[11]: /policies\n[12]: /download-ag-organica-catalog\n[13]: /best-quality-essential-oil\n[14]: /infrastructure-list\n[15]: #\n[16]: /contract-manufacturing\n[17]: /cosmetics-manufacturer\n[18]: /natural-cosmetics-skincare-in-private-labels\n[19]: /custom-formulation\n[20]: /new-color-cosmetics-manufacturer\n[21]: /skin-care-manufacturer\n[22]: /third-party-cosmetics-manufacturing\n[23]: /wholesale-supplier\n[24]: /article\n[25]: /blog\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: https://www.pureoilsindia.com/\n[28]: #\n[29]: /product-category/essential-oils\n[30]: /product-category/carrier-oils\n[31]: /product-category/essential-oils/natural-essential-oil\n[32]: /product-category/herbal-oils\n[33]: /product-categ