ics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Cardamom Oil\n[Cardamom Oil]\n\n# Cardamom Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4.5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nCardamom oil is used to make medicines. It is used for digestion problems. It contains chemicals\nthat are used to treat intestinal spasms, kill bacteria, reduce swelling & help the immune system.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Elettaria cardamomum\n* Family: Zingiberaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: seeds\n* Colour:\nProduct Details\n\n## **Cardamom Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nCardamom oil is used to make medicines. It is used for digestion problems i.e. heartburn, intestinal\nspasms, irritable bowel syndrome, diarrhea, liver, constipation & other problems. It has subtle\nscent & flavor i.e. mildly spicy, slightly nutty, aromatic & sweet. It has a bigger scent. It is\nused as a spice in foods. It is also used in soaps, perfumes & creams. It contains chemicals that\nare used to treat intestinal spasms, kill bacteria, reduce swelling & help the immune system.\n\n### **Welcome to Our World of Cardamom Oil Excellence**\n\nAt A.G. Organica, we take immense pride in presenting our premium Cardamom Oil, meticulously crafted\nto meet the diverse needs of our esteemed B2B clients. As a renowned manufacturer, wholesale\nsupplier, and exporter of essential oils, we uphold the highest standards of quality, purity, and\nprofessionalism in every drop of our product.\n\n### **Why Choose Our Cardamom Oil?**\n1. **100% Pure**: Our Cardamom Oil is extracted from the finest cardamom seeds, ensuring absolute\npurity and authenticity. We guarantee no dilution or adulteration, providing you with a product\nof unparalleled quality.\n2. **Therapeutic Grade**: Recognized for its therapeutic properties, our Cardamom Oil is carefully\nprocessed to retain its natural constituents, offering maximum efficacy for various applications.\n3. **Expertly Manufactured**: With years of experience and expertise, our manufacturing process\nadheres to strict industry standards, guaranteeing a product that exceeds expectations in aroma,\npotency, and effectiveness.\n\n### **Key Features and Benefits:**\n* **Aromatic Bliss**: Immerse yourself in the captivating aroma of pure Cardamom Oil, perfect for\naromatherapy, perfumery, and personal care products.\n* **Versatile Applications**: From pharmaceuticals to culinary delights, our Cardamom Oil lends its\ndelightful flavor and therapeutic benefits to a myriad of industries and products.\n* **Trusted Partner**: As your trusted wholesale supplier, we ensure reliable and timely delivery,\nenabling you to meet your business demands efficiently and effectively.\n\n### **Extraction:**\n\nIt is extracted by steam distillation.\n\n### **Blending:**\n\nIt blends well with Bergamot, Cedarwood, Cinnamon, Clove, Orange, Rose, and Ylang Ylang essential\noils.\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Boosts Overall Health\n* Relieves Muscular Spasms\n* Good for Emotional Well-Being\n* Maintains Normal Body Temperature\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Used for treating digestion problems\n* Lowers blood pressure\n* It contains cancer-fighting properties\n* It treats bad breathe\n\n### **Popular Uses & Benefits**\n* Soothes and Scents\n* Protects Oral Health\n* Boosts Immune Health\n* Stimulates Digestion\n* Boosts Metabolism\n* Treat Nicotine Withdrawal\n* Used for the treatment of the digestive problem\n* Gives nausea, loss of appetite, and constipation\n* Reduces the toxic material of the body through the kidney\n* Removes the excess salt, waste material, and water from the body\n* Cardamom oil is used in the depression\n* Reduces mouth ulcers, infections of the mouth and throat\n* Used for the treatment of cold and flu\n* Used in coughs and bronchitis\n* Used for the treatment of cancer\n* Reduces blood pressure\n\n...\n\n### **Primary ****Benefits**\n* Helps in maintaining overall gastrointestinal health\n* Promotes clear breathing and respiratory health\n* Flavorful spice for cooking and baking\n\n### **Directions For Use**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:**\n* Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with a carrier oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nYes, as it possesses powerful detoxifying effects and cleansing properties. Cardamom Essential Oil\nblends well with Bay, Orange, Bergamot, Ginger, and Cinnamon essential oils. Cardamom essential oil\ncan be made by steam distilling the ripe and dried Cardamom seeds. Yes, you can purchase cardamom\noil in bulk in packages of up to 25kg from the official website of Pureoilsindia. No, because it is\nmade for topical use only.\n\n## Private Label Cardamom Essential Oils\n\nLooking to elevate your brand with our premium Cardamom Oil? Partner with us for a private label\nsolution tailored to your specifications. From packaging to branding, we'll work closely with you to\nbring your vision to life and deliver products that stand out in the market.\n\n**Why Choose Us:**\n* **Premium Quality:** We source only the finest ingredients to create products that exceed\nexpectations.\n* **Expertise:** Backed by years of experience and a team of dedicated professionals, we're\ncommitted to delivering excellence.\n* **Customization:** Tailor our products to suit your brand's unique identity and leave a lasting\nimpression on your customers.\n\n**Experience the Difference:** Elevate your skincare and wellness routine with our luxurious Private\nLabel Cardamom Oil. Unlock the secret to radiant, youthful skin and embark on a journey of\nindulgence like never before. Try it today and experience the difference for yourself.\n\nRead more\n\n**Blog**\n\nTechnical\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nJenny\n\n04-02-2020 11:57\n\nSuperb company and quality products!\n\nPatty\n\n04-02-2020 11:58\n\nI love the smell and quality of this product.\n\nVarieties\n[Cardamom Oil USP][92]\n* Botanical: Elettaria cardamomum\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Seeds\n[Cardamom Oleoresin][93]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Elettariacardamomum\n* Family: Zingiberaceae\n* Extraction: Solvent Extraction\n* Part: Dried fruits\nFAQs\nWhat is Cardamom Oil?\n\nCardamom Oil is a highly aromatic essential oil derived from the seeds of the cardamom plant\n(Elettaria cardamomum). It\u275c known for its distinct spicy-sweet scent and various therapeutic\nproperties.\n\nHow is Cardamom Oil extracted?\n\nCardamom Oil is typically extracted through steam distillation, a process that involves passing\nsteam through crushed cardamom seeds to release and capture the essential oil.\n\nWhat are the main components of Cardamom Oil?\n\nThe main components of Cardamom Oil include terpinyl acetate, 1,8-cineole, linalool, terpinene,\nsabinene, and myrcene, among others, which contribute to its aroma and therapeutic effects.\n\nWhat are the benefits of using Cardamom Oil in cosmetics?\n\nCardamom Oil is rich in antioxidants and antimicrobial properties, making it beneficial for skincare\nproducts. It can help reduce acne, improve skin texture, and provide a refreshing scent to\ncosmetics.\n\nIs Cardamom Oil suitable for sensitive skin?\n\nYes, Cardamom Oil is generally considered safe for sensitive skin when properly diluted. However,\nit\u275c recommended to perform a patch test before using it extensively.\n\nHow can Cardamom Oil be used in beauty products?\n\nCardamom Oil can be used in various beauty products such as creams, lotions, serums, and masks to\nimpart its aromatic fragrance and provide skin benefits.\n\nWhat are the potential therapeutic benefits of Cardamom Oil in pharma?\n\nCardamom Oil possesses digestive, anti-inflammatory, and antimicrobial properties, making it useful\nin pharmaceutical products aimed at treating digestive issues, muscle pain, and respiratory\nconditions.\n\nCan Cardamom Oil be ingested?\n\nYes, Cardamom Oil is considered safe for internal use in small quantities. However, it\u275c essential to\ndilute it properly and consult with a healthcare professional before ingestion.\n\nHow is Cardamom Oil used in the FMCG industry?\n\nCardamom Oil is utilized in FMCG products such as perfumes, air fresheners, and household cleaners\nto add a pleasant fragrance and antimicrobial properties.\n\nWhat makes Cardamom Oil suitable for aroma industries?\n\nCardamom Oil\u275c warm, spicy aroma makes it a popular choice in aroma industries for diffusers,\ncandles, and incense, creating a welcoming and uplifting atmosphere.\n\nCan Cardamom Oil be purchased in bulk?\n\nYes, Cardamom Oil is available for purchase in bulk quantities for wholesale purposes, catering to\nthe needs of manufacturers and distributors.\n\nWhat should I consider when sourcing Cardamom Oil from a supplier?\n\nWhen sourcing Cardamom Oil from a supplier, consider factors such as the quality of the oil,\nextraction methods, purity, certifications, and the supplier\u275c reputation in the industry.\n\nIs private labeling an option for Cardamom Oil products?\n\nYes, many suppliers and manufacturers offer private labeling services for Cardamom Oil products,\nallowing businesses to brand products with their logo and packaging.\n\nWhat are the advantages of private labeling Cardamom Oil products?\n\nPrivate labeling Cardamom Oil products enables businesses to establish their brand identity, create\ncustom formulations, control pricing, and build customer loyalty.\n\nCan Cardamom Oil be exported internationally?\n\nYes, Cardamom Oil can be exported internationally, but it\u275c essential to comply with regulations and\nobtain necessary permits and documentation for customs clearance.\n\nWhat are the storage recommendations for Cardamom Oil?\n\nCardamom Oil should be stored in a cool, dark place away from direct sunlight and heat to maintain\nits potency and shelf life.\n\nHow long does Cardamom Oil typically last?\n\nWhen stored correctly, Cardamom Oil can retain its quality for up to two years or more, but it\u275c best\nto use it wit"
