ics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Celery Seed Oil\n[Celery Seed Oil]\n\n# Celery Seed Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nCelery Seed Oil is extracted from the biennial plant, named Celery, having a smooth stem, soft\nleaves, and white flowers.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Apium graveolens\n* Family: N. O. Umbelliferae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Roots, Stems and Seeds\n* Colour:\nProduct Details\n\n**Description** AG Organica comes into the picture by supplying 100% organic Celery Seed Oil to\nseveral reputed industries across the world. The company is one of the leading manufacturers,\ndistributors, and suppliers of oil to both domestic and internal markets. Celery Seed Oil is\nextracted from the biennial plant, named Celery, having a smooth stem, soft leaves, and white\nflowers. The average height of the celery plant is about 30-50 cm. The plant has its origin in Asia\nand other countries. India is one of the primary producers of this plant along with Holland, China,\nHungary, and the USA. The word celery means quick action. The plant belongs to the Umbelliferae\nplant family and is botanically known as Apiumgraveolens. Celery Seed Oil is extracted by applying\nthe steam distillation method on the fresh or dried leaves of the plant along with its seeds.\n\n**Properties of Celery Seed Oil** The properties of Celery Seed Oil can be categorized into two\nparts, viz. Physical and Chemical\n* * **Physical Properties: **Celery Seed Oil is quite popular due to its physical properties which\nmake it stand apart from others such as antioxidative, antirheumatic, antiseptic (urinary),\nantispasmodic, and aperitif.\n* **Chemical Properties: **The chemical components of this oil include sedanolide, sedanonic\nanhydride, d-limonene, selinene, and sesquiterpene alcohols. The oil also contains different\nfatty acids such as linoleic, myristic, palmitic, palmitoleic, stearic, petroselinic, oleic, and\nmyristoleic.\n\n**Blending** Celery oil blends with lavender, pine, opopanax, oakmoss, lovage, Tea Tree, and other\nspice oils.\n\n**Uses of Celery Oil** Celery Seed Oil blends well with other essential oils to provide numerous\nhealth benefits. Due to the same reason, oil is effectively used by cosmetics and pharma brands for\nuses like:\n* * Making health tonics\n* Making cosmetics product\n* Making fragrances\n* As a flavoring agent\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Support Bone Health\n* Promote Red Blood Cell Formation\n* Improve Blood Sugar Levels\n* Fight Bacteria\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Excellent Detoxification Agent\n* Offers Pain Relief\n* Potent Antihypertensive Agent\n* Improves Digestive Health\n* Powerful Insecticide Agent\n* Promotes Menstrual Relief\n\n### **Popular Uses & Benefits**\n* Used in cosmetics, soaps, detergents, and perfumes as fragrant agents\n* Used in the food and beverage industry as a flavoring agent\n* Widely used for the treatment of cancer\n* Stimulate the gastric gland of the digestive system\n* It has sedative activity\n* It stimulates the body's function\n* Act as antioxidants\n* Celery seeds Essential oil capture the free radicals and reactive oxygen species of the body\n* Has anti-rheumatic properties. It reduces the pain in joints of the body\n* Cure the wound for septic\n* Celery Oil is inhibited bacterial and fungal infection\n* Celery Oil has reduced the spasm of smooth muscles of the body\n* Reduced the level of excess water and salt of the body\n* Reduced blood pressure\n\n### **Primary ****Benefits**\n* Supports nervous and digestive systems\n* Calms the body and mind\n* Cleanses both internally and externally\n\n### **Directions For Use**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:**\n* Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with a carrier oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nThe Celery Seed essential oil reduces menstrual problems and is beneficial for your skin and hair.\nNo, because it is formulated only for external use. Yes, it boosts hair growth and improves the\ntexture of your hair. It can blend well with Black pepper, Coriander, Ginger, and Lavender essential\noils. Yes, you can use Celery Seed oil for Aromatherapy.\n\nTechnical\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nYonika Thomas\n\n18-06-2021 09:48\n\nThe celery seed essential oil arrived promptly, and it was wrapped well and did not leak.\n\nSherry A.\n\n18-06-2021 09:49\n\nLove the product. Tried a combination of celery seed oil and olive leaf oil to lower my borderline\nblood pressure. Within 2 weeks it was back to normal and has stayed normal.\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][92]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][93]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][94]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][95]\n* [Third Party Manufacturing][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Magazine][98]\n* [Infrastructure][99]\n* [Contact Us][100]\nQuick Links\n* [Lavender Essential Oil][101]\n* [Tea Tree Essential Oil][102]\n* [Eucalyptus Essential Oil][103]\n* [Lemongrass Essential Oil][104]\n* [Rosemary Essential Oil][105]\n* [Cinnamon Essential Oil][106]\n* [Jasmine Essential Oil][107]\n* [Pepper