            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Clove Oil\n[Clove Oil]\n\n# Clove Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4.5) / [4 Reviews][91]\n\nLooking for a trusted Clove Oil manufacturer catering to the wholesale and bulk market? Experience\nthe purity and potency of natural clove oil, expertly crafted for diverse industries like\naromatherapy, skincare, and pharmaceuticals. Our products are tailored for businesses seeking\nreliable, high-quality solutions at competitive prices. Partner with us to elevate your brand with\nethically sourced and meticulously manufactured clove oil.\n\n**Varieties**\n* [Clove Oil][92]\n* [Clove Bud Oil - Organic][93]\n* [Clove Leaf Oil - Organic][94]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Syzygium aromaticum\n* Family: Myrtaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Buds\n* Colour: Pale Yellow\n* Certification: GMP, ISO, FSSAI, MSME\n* Available Services: Bulk, Third party manufacturer, White Label, Contract Manufacturing, Private\nLabeling\n* Brand: A.G. Organica / ODM / OEM / Private Label\n* Packaging: Glass Bottles, Plastic Bottle, Aluminium Bottles, HDPE Drums, Jerry cans, Galvanized\nsteel drum & export standard Packing\n\nProduct Details\n\n## **Clove Oil Manufacturer for Wholesale & Bulk: : Premium Quality**\n\nWelcome to A.G Organica, a trusted **Clove Oil Manufacturer** and **Clove Oil Supplier**, delivering\nunmatched quality for the aromatherapy, cosmetics, and food industries. With a commitment to\nexcellence and sustainability, we cater to clients across the USA, India, and beyond.\n\n### **Why Choose Clove Oil?**\n\nDerived from the buds, stems, and leaves of the clove tree, clove oil is a powerhouse of benefits.\nIts spicy, warm aroma and versatile properties make it a staple in various industries:\n* **Aromatherapy**: Clove oil is celebrated for its calming and therapeutic properties, aiding in\nstress relief and mental clarity.\n* **Cosmetics**: Known for its antimicrobial properties, clove oil is widely used in skincare\nformulations to combat blemishes and enhance skin health.\n* **Food Industry**: Its strong, distinct flavor makes clove oil a key ingredient in food seasoning,\nbeverages, and confectionery.\n\nElevate your business with our premium Clove Oil solutions. As a leading manufacturer, supplier, and\nexporter, we are your trusted partner in meeting your Clove Oil needs with excellence and\nprofessionalism. Get in touch with us today to explore how we can support your business growth.\n* **Extraction** Clove oil is extracted by the method of **steam and water distillation** from the**\nleaves, stem and bud** of clove.\n* **Blending** Clove oil blends with benzoin, lavender, ginger, sandalwood, basil and clary sage.\n\n## **Properties of Clove Oil**\n* **Main Constituents :**Eugenol\n* **Other : **Iron, calcium, potassium, phosphorous, vitamin A & C, hydrolic acid\n\n## **Uses of Clove Oil**\n1. **Dental Care \u2013 A Natural Solution for Oral Health: **Clove oil is a trusted remedy for\nmaintaining oral hygiene. Its active compound, eugenol, has natural analgesic and antimicrobial\nproperties, making it a common ingredient in toothpaste, mouthwashes, and dental treatments\n2. **Skincare \u2013 A Radiant Boost: **Packed with antioxidants and antibacterial properties, clove oil\nrejuvenates the skin and combats imperfections. It\u2019s a go-to ingredient for clear, healthy skin\n3. **Aromatherapy \u2013 Relaxation at its Best: **The warm, spicy scent of clove oil is perfect for\nstress relief and relaxation. It\u2019s widely used in aromatherapy to uplift mood and create a\ncalming environment\n4. **Pain Relief \u2013 A Natural Comforter: **Known for its analgesic and anti-inflammatory properties,\nclove oil offers natural relief for various aches and pains.\n5. **Household Uses \u2013 A Natural Defender: **Clove oil doubles as a household essential, thanks to\nits antifungal and insect-repelling abilities\n\nRead more : [10 Ways to Use **Clove** Essential **Oil**][95]\n\n...\n\nAG Organica is one of the reputed and certified **clove essential oil manufacturers** and we make\nsure to help customers take utmost advantage of oil's therapeutic properties. There are varieties of\n[benefits of using Clove Bud Oil][96] and it also helps in enhancing one's overall beauty. The oil\nis 100% natural, pure, and concentrated in nature.\n* If pregnant or breastfeeding then consult a doctor before use.\n* If taken in more quantity then it can cause vomiting, diarrhea, Blurred on a clear vision,\ndifficult to take clear in breath & burning over your eyes.\n\n***Disclaimer : **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergy,\nhealth issues.*\n\n### **Our Expertise as a Clove Oil Manufacturer. ****High-Quality Essential Oils**\n\nAt AG Organica, we specialize in producing high-quality clove oil using advanced extraction\ntechniques to retain its natural potency and purity.\n* **Sourcing Excellence**: Our raw materials are ethically sourced from trusted farms in regions\nrenowned for clove cultivation, ensuring a sustainable supply chain.\n* **Stringent Quality Control**: Every batch of clove oil undergoes rigorous quality testing to meet\ninternational standards.\n* **Customized Solutions**: We offer bulk supply and private labeling options tailored to the unique\nrequirements of our clients in the USA, India, and worldwide.\n\n## **Private Label Clove Essential Oils Manufacturer**\n\nAre you searching for a unique and captivating addition to your product line? Look no further than\nour exclusive Private Label Clove Essential Oil services. Crafted with precision and quality in\nmind, our offerings are designed to elevate your brand to new heights.\n\n### **Challenges in Clove Oil Manufacturing**\n1. **Raw Material Availability**: Fluctuations in clove crop yields due to climatic conditions can\naffect production.\n2. **Sustainability Concerns**: Ensuring ethical and environmentally friendly sourcing remains a\npriority.\n3. **Regulatory Compliance**: Navigating diverse regulations for essential oil usage in different\ncountries requires constant vigilance.\n\n### **PEOPLE ALSO SEARCH US BY :**\n\nClove Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Clove Oil, Essential Oil Manufacturer, Organic Clove Oil, Bulk\nClove Oil, Natural Essential Oil Supplier, Clove Oil Exporter, Clove Essential Oil Benefits, Pure\nClove Oil, Clove Essential Oil, Clove Essential Oil Manufacturers, [Clove Oil Manufacturer in\nIndia][97], Clove Essential Oil Manufacturer in [Ghaziabad][98], [Clove Oil Manufacturer in\nDelhi][99], [Clove Oil Manufacturer in Noida][100], Clove Essential Oil Supplier, Clove Essential\nOil exporter from India to [USA][101], [Canada][102], Australia, [Germany][103], [Europe][104].\n\nRead more\n\n**Blog**\n\nTechnical\n\n## Manufacturer, Supplier and Wholesale Exporter of Clove Oil\n\nClove originated from Indonesia & Malacca islands. Clove originated from Indonesia & Malacca\nislands. It is obtained by the leaves and bud of a clove it is red-brown in color. It is picked by\nhand the buds are dried until they brown and, then grinding them.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Botanical Name** \u2502**:**\u2502**Syzygium aromaticum/Eugenia caryophyllata **\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Parts Used** \u2502: \u2502Bud\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Color & Odor** \u2502: \u2502*Golden Yellow/Brown@ Strong odor*\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Methods of Extraction**\u2502: \u2502Steam distillation\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25