            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Cumin Oil\n[Cumin Oil]\n\n# Cumin Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nAG Organica has been recognized as one of the leading manufacturers, suppliers, and exporters of\ncumin carrier oil. **Varieties**\n* [Cumin Oil][92]\n* [Cumin Seed Oil - Virgin][93]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Nigella Sativa\n* Family: Ranunculaceae\n* Extraction: Cold Pressed\n* Part: Seeds\n* Colour: Deep yellow to deep amber\nProduct Details\n\n## **Cumin Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nHaving years of experience, AG Organica has been recognized as one among the leading manufacturers,\nsuppliers, and exporters of cumin seed oil, among other essential as well as carrier oils. The cumin\noil (also known as black cumin seed oil due to the black seeds of its parent plant) is extracted &\nsupplied in a 100% pure state. No chemical is used during the extraction process, and the oil is\nfiltered twice to obtain an ideal pure variety. A magical ingredient for products in the health,\nbeauty, and food industries, the cumin oil is extracted from Nigella Sativa, a plant native to Asia.\nTechnically known as a part of the buttercup family, the plant has black, small, crescent-shaped\nseeds that are cold-pressed for oil extraction. The nutrient-rich oil has been in use as a natural\nremedy for numerous health conditions for centuries in South Asia and the Middle East.\n\nAre you in search of top-tier Cumin Oil for your business needs? Look no further! As a leading Cumin\nOil manufacturer, supplier, and exporter, we take pride in offering you the finest quality Cumin Oil\nthat meets your exact specifications.\n\n**Why Choose Our Cumin Oil?**\n1. **Uncompromised Quality:** Our Cumin Oil is extracted from the finest cumin seeds, ensuring the\nhighest purity and potency. Each batch undergoes rigorous quality checks to maintain consistency\nand excellence.\n2. **Premium Ingredients:** We source our cumin seeds from trusted farmers who follow sustainable\nand citified practices, ensuring that our oil is free from any harmful chemicals or additives.\n3. **Exceptional Manufacturing Standards:** As a reputable Cumin Oil manufacturer, we adhere to\nstrict manufacturing standards to guarantee the integrity and efficacy of our product. Our\nstate-of-the-art facilities employ advanced techniques to preserve the natural goodness of cumin\nseeds.\n\n**Our Range of Services:**\n1. **Manufacturing:** We specialize in manufacturing high-quality Cumin Oil tailored to meet the\ndiverse needs of our clients. Whether you require bulk quantities or customized formulations,\nwe've got you covered.\n2. **Supply Solutions:** As a reliable Cumin Oil supplier, we ensure timely delivery of our products\nto your doorstep, no matter where you are located. Our efficient supply chain management ensures\nhassle-free transactions and on-time deliveries.\n3. **Global Export Services:** With our extensive network and expertise as a Cumin Oil exporter, we\ncater to clients worldwide, delivering our premium products with utmost care and professionalism.\nRest assured, your satisfaction is our priority.\n\n**Why Partner With Us?**\n1. **Unparalleled Customer Service:** We are committed to providing exceptional customer service,\ncatering to your unique requirements and offering personalized solutions that exceed your\nexpectations.\n2. **Competitive Pricing:** Despite our uncompromising quality standards, we offer competitive\npricing options that provide excellent value for your investment, ensuring maximum returns for\nyour business.\n3. **Collaborative Approach:** We believe in fostering long-term partnerships based on trust,\ntransparency, and mutual growth. Your success is our success, and we are dedicated to supporting\nyour business every step of the way.\n\nElevate your business with the finest quality Cumin Oil from a trusted manufacturer, supplier, and\nexporter. Get in touch with us today to discuss your requirements, and let us be your partner in\nsuccess.\n\n### **Optimum Chemical Composition Aids Multiple Uses**\n\nThe black seed cumin oil is rich in several chemicals like phytochemicals, crystalline nigellone,\nand thymoquinone. It also contains amino acids, anti-oxidants, fixed oil (EFA's 3/6/9), alkaloids,\nvolatile oil, saponin, carbohydrates, and proteins. Minerals present in the oil include sodium,\npotassium, calcium, and iron. Traditionally, the oil has been used for various applications such as\naiding digestion, bolstering vitality, and supporting the circulatory, inflammatory, kidney, liver,\nand respiratory system. Today, the oil is in use for many supportive health benefits such as\nstrengthening the natural defenses of the body's vital organs and restoring their natural balance.\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Treating Acne\n* Skin Softening\n* Healing Wounds\n* Hydrating Hair& Psoriasis\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Reduce High Blood Pressure\n* Reduce High Cholesterol\n* Improve Symptoms of Rheumatoid Arthritis\n\n### **Popular Uses & Benefits of Cumin Oil**\n* Useful as warming purpose that can apply to relieve from osteoarthritis and muscular pains\n* Provides relaxation from stress and Anxious\n* A perfect Cumin Seed oil also support Positive emotion\n* Perfect spice oil for mood uplifting\n* Use to purify the blood of your body systems that means it is a benefit for removing toxins\n* Promotes oral health\n* One of the amazing health benefits of this oil to maintain the nervous system\n\n...\n\n### **Primary Benefits**\n* Reduce Asthma Symptoms\n* Reduce Stomach Upset\n\nThough Cumin Flavor Oil is skin-friendly, it may not be ideal for adding aroma to the lip glosses.\nYes, you can add the special spicy flavor of Cumin seeds for baked goods and other recipes. Cumin\nFlavor Oil is a skin-friendly product, but it may not be the ideal choice for products like scented\ncandles and soaps. You may add it in hard candies that require a spicy and strong flavor. Our Cumin\nFlavor Oil is of 100% food-grade quality. You can order Cumin Flavor Oil in bulk from Pureoilsindia.\n\n## Private Label Cumin Seed Essential Oils\n\nIntroducing our exclusive Private Label services for Cumin Essential Oil, designed to elevate your\nbrand to new heights of success and distinction.\n\nHarness the power of nature with our premium Cumin Essential Oil, carefully extracted and refined to\nperfection. Our Private Label services offer you the opportunity to customize this exceptional\nproduct with your own branding, creating a unique offering that reflects your brand's values and\nvision.\n\nWhy choose Cumin Essential Oil for your Private Label venture? Not only does it possess a myriad of\nhealth benefits, including anti-inflammatory and antimicrobial properties, but it also boasts a\nrich, earthy aroma that captivates the senses. Whether you're in the cosmetics, aromatherapy, or\nwellness industry, incorporating Cumin Essential Oil into your product line is sure to resonate with\nyour discerning clientele.\n\nPartnering with us for your Private Label needs ensures impeccable quality and attention to detail\nevery step of the way. From sourcing the finest cumin seeds to expertly crafting the oil through\nadvanced extraction techniques, we maintain stringent quality control measures to deliver a product\nthat exceeds expectations.\n\nExperience the difference of partnering with a trusted industry leader in Private Label services.\nElevate your brand with the unparalleled quality and customization options of our Cumin Essential\nOil offerings. Contact us today to embark on a journey towards branding excellence and market\nsuccess.\n\nRead more\n\n**Blog**\n\nTechnical\n\n### **Directions For Use of Cumin Oil**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical Use:**\n* * Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with Coriander, and other spices oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nAndrew\n\n12-09-2020 16:35\n\nI have been taking it and I already see a difference in my skin. I woke with a sore throat (felt\nlike a rock was lodged). After taking the 2 as recommended, the symptoms have not come back. This is\nnow and will forever be a part of my daily regimen\n\nTara\n\n12-09-2020 16:36\n\nGreat product for my lupus.\n\nFAQs\nWhat is Cumin Oil?\n\nCumin oil is a potent essential oil derived from the seeds of the Cuminum cyminum plant. It is\nrenowned for its distinct aroma and numerous health and beauty benefits.\n\nHow is Cumin Oil extracted?\n\nCumin oil is extracted through a process of steam distillation from the dried seeds of the cumin\nplant, ensuring the preservation of its therapeutic properties and aromatic essence.\n\nWhat are the key benefits of using Cumin Oil?\n\nCumin oil offers a range of benefits, including digestive support, immune system boosting, skin and\nhair nourishment, and alleviation of muscle pain and inflammation, owing to its rich composition of\nantioxidants, vitamins, and minerals.\n\nIs Cumin Oil suitable for all skin types?\n\nYes, Cumin oil is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin, as it possesses\nanti-inflammatory and antimicrobial properties that help soothe and nourish the skin without causing\nirritation.\n\nCan Cumin Oil be used for aromatherapy?\n\nAbsolutely, Cumin oil is widely utilized in aromatherapy practices due to its earthy and warm aroma,\nwhich promotes relaxation, relieves stress, and enhances mental clarity when diffused or inhaled.\n\nHow can Cumin Oil be incorporated into skincare?\n\nCumin oil can be added to skincare formulations such as creams, serums, and lotions to promote skin\nhydration, reduce acne, and diminish signs of aging. It can also be used as a spot treatment for\nblemishes and scars.\n\nIs Cumin Oil safe for internal consumption?\n\nWhile Cumin oil is generally safe for internal use, it is essential"
