ics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Garlic Oil\n[Garlic Oil]\n\n# Garlic Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nGarlic oil is obtained from the cloves of the garlic plant. The oil is insoluble in water and\nsoluble in organic solvents and is used for treating various health problems. In addition to its\nmedicinal properties, the oil finds use in a number of applications across cooking, as a flavoring\nagent, and more. AG Organica is one of the trusted Garlic Oil manufacturers and suppliers in the\nglobal market. We offer 100% organic products at a reasonable price that are supplied to some of the\nleading brands across the world.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Allium sativum L\n* Family: Alliaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Bulb\n* Colour: Pale or yellowish with strong garlic odor\nProduct Details\n\n## **Garlic Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nGarlic oil is obtained from the cloves of the garlic plant. The oil is insoluble in water and\nsoluble in organic solvents and is used for treating various health problems. In addition to its\nmedicinal properties, the oil finds use in a number of applications across cooking, as a flavoring\nagent, and more. AG Organica is one of the trusted Garlic Oil manufacturers and suppliers in the\nglobal market. We offer 100% organic products at a reasonable price that are supplied to some of the\nleading brands across the world.\n\n**Topical Uses**\n* Fights skin issues\n* Controls acne\n* Reduces hair fall\n* Controls toothache\n* Good for cardiovascular health\n* Lowers bad cholesterol\n* Cures cancer\n* Protects against cold\n* Effective decongestant\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Cold, bronchitis, and flu symptoms\n* Poor digestion\n* Respiratory problems\n* Stomach and colon cancers\n* Prevents heart diseases\n\n### **Popular Uses & Benefits**\n* Boosts immunity\n* Works as an anti-inflammatory\n* Improves cardiovascular health\n* Gives you better hair and skin\n* Protects your food\n* Treat athlete's foot\n\n### **Primary ****Benefits**\n* Used in cooking due to its medicinal properties and spicy flavor\n* Also used as a flavoring agent in soups, canned foods, and sauces, etc.\n\nTechnical\n\n### **Directions For Use**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:**\n* Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with a carrier oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nDomo\n\n02-07-2021 11:55\n\nThis is soothing for my tinnitus. Love it... just ordered my second bottle.\n\nTracy B.\n\n02-07-2021 11:56\n\nMy mother had a painful ear infection that was getting worse every day, but she hesitated to go to\nthe doctor because she didn't want to be put on antibiotics and also hoped it would go away on its\nown\n\nVarieties\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][92]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][93]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][94]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][95]\n* [Third Party Manufacturing][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Magazine][98]\n* [Infrastructure][99]\n* [Contact Us][100]\nQuick Links\n* [Lavender Essential Oil][101]\n* [Tea Tree E