            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Geranium Oil\n[Geranium Oil]\n\n# Geranium Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4.5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nGeranium oil is a fragrant essential oil extracted from the leaves of the Pelargonium graveolens\nplant, commonly known for its floral and fresh aroma. It has been widely used in aromatherapy,\nskincare, and health treatments due to its therapeutic properties.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Pelargonium Graveolens\n* Family: Geraniaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Leaves\n* Colour: Greenish olive liquid\nProduct Details\n\n## **Geranium Essential Oil Manufacturer & Supplier India**\n\nGeranium essential oil offers a myriad of benefits for both emotional and physical well-being. Known\nfor its ability to promote emotional stability, this versatile oil also serves as a natural pain\nreliever and aids in the healing process of burns and wounds. With its anti-inflammatory properties,\nit effectively reduces swelling and enhances mood, while doubling as an insect repellent.\nAdditionally, geranium oil is revered for its stress-relieving qualities, helping to alleviate\nanxiety, sadness, and tension, while simultaneously improving concentration and cognitive function.\nIncorporating geranium essential oil into your routine can provide holistic support, balancing\nemotions and fostering overall wellness.\n\n### **Why Choose Our Geranium Oil:**\n\nWelcome to the epitome of excellence in Geranium Oil sourcing! Our premium Geranium Oil is not just\nanother product; it's a testament to quality, purity, and reliability. As a reputable manufacturer,\nsupplier, and exporter of Geranium Oil, we pride ourselves on delivering unparalleled standards to\nbusinesses worldwide.\n1. **Authentic Sourcing:** Our Geranium Oil is meticulously extracted from the finest geranium\nplants, ensuring authenticity and potency.\n2. **Manufacturing Excellence:** With state-of-the-art facilities, we employ advanced techniques to\nmaintain the integrity of the oil, preserving its natural properties.\n3. **Stringent Quality Control:** Each batch undergoes rigorous quality checks to meet international\nstandards, guaranteeing purity and efficacy.\n4. **Direct Supply Chain:** By eliminating intermediaries, we offer competitive prices without\ncompromising on quality, making us your ideal supplier.\n\n**Key Features:**\n* **Pure and Natural:** Our Geranium Oil is free from additives and chemicals, ensuring a completely\nnatural experience.\n* **Versatile Applications:** From aromatherapy to skincare, our oil boasts a wide range of\napplications, catering to diverse business needs.\n* **Customizable Packaging:** We offer flexible packaging options to suit your specific\nrequirements, ensuring convenience and efficiency.\n\n### **Understanding Essential Oil Quality**\n\nIt's important to note that essential oils come in various quality levels. Generally, there are 4-5\ndifferent grades for each essential oil, and understanding these can help you make an informed\npurchase. If you're new to essential oils, the quality we offer may not be the right fit for you\nwithout further verification.\n\n### **Benefits of Partnering with Us:**\n1. **Reliability:** As a trusted name in the industry, we guarantee consistency and reliability in\nevery batch of Geranium Oil.\n2. **Global Reach:** With our extensive export network, we ensure timely delivery to businesses\nworldwide, fostering long-term partnerships.\n3. **Expert Support:** Our team of experienced professionals is dedicated to providing personalized\nassistance, from product inquiries to after-sales support.\n\nBy combining our commitment to pure, natural products with thorough guidance on quality\nverification, we ensure you receive the best essential oils tailored to your specific needs.\n\n### **Composition:**\n* **Main : **Citronellol, citronellylformate, geraniol\n* **Other : **Pinene, myrcene, limonene, menthone, linalool, geranyl acetate, citronellol, and\ngeranyl butyrate\n\n**Blending :** It blends well with carrot seed oil, agarwood, clary sage, clove bud, sandalwood &\nmany more.\n\n## **Uses of Geranium Oil**\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Treats acne, cuts, burns & bruises\n* Treats eczema, ulcers & ring worms\n* Cures stress, sore throats, neuralgia & tonsillitis\n* Used in menopause problems\n\n### **Popular Uses**\n* Treats acne, eczema, hemorrhoids, burns, dermatitis, cuts, lice, as a mosquito repellent,\nringworm, ulcers, edema, poor circulation, sore throat, tonsillitis, stress, and neuralgia\n* Balance the oil production of the skin and help keep it supple\n* Diluted in shampoo to help with head lice\n* Uplifts the mind\n* Ward off mosquitoes and head lice\n* Help relieve stress, mild depression, PMS, anxiety and tension, menopausal problems and for\ngeneral energizin\n\n**Applications Uses**\n* Face And Eye Cream\n* Mosquito Repellents\n* Hair Conditioner\n* Hair Mask\n* Hair Oil\n* Deodorant\n\n...\n\n## **Benefits of Geranium Oil**\n* Promotes clear, healthy skin\n* Naturally resists insects\n* Gives hair a vibrant, healthy glow\n\nGeranium essential oil offers various applications, primarily in skincare and as a soothing\nfragrance in oil burners. When using this potent oil, it\u2019s important to dilute it with a carrier oil\nto ensure effective and safe use, as essential oils are highly concentrated. Carrier oils blend well\nwith essential oils, facilitating deeper skin absorption. A.G. Organica, a trusted **Geranium oil\nmanufacturer**, provides premium-quality geranium essential oil in bulk. Our products strictly\nadhere to the highest standards of safety and purity, offering 100% natural and organic oils without\nany harmful chemicals, fillers, or additives. You can be assured of no artificial colors,\npreservatives, or fragrances in our offerings.\n\nIt is crucial to dilute essential oils before topical use to prevent irritation due to their\nconcentration. We perform extensive quality checks and tests to ensure that only top-tier, effective\noils are delivered to our customers. A.G. Organica upholds stringent packaging and quality\nprotocols, ensuring optimal results with every use. As a leading **Geranium oil manufacturer**, we\nguarantee fast bulk order delivery along with comprehensive customer support, making us your\nreliable partner in the essential oil industry.\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n***Disclaimer : **The above information is general in nature. Always seek professional medical\nadvice before using essential oils, especially during pregnancy or if you have allergies or health\nconcerns. A.G. Organica and its affiliates do not assume responsibility for the accuracy of this\ninformation.*\n\n## Private Label Geranium Essential Oils\n\nElevate your brand with our premium Private Label Services. Crafted with precision and care, our\nofferings provide you with the opportunity to showcase your brand's uniqueness while delivering the\nhighest quality product to your customers.\n\n**Why Choose Our Private Label Services:**\n1. **Unmatched Quality:** Our Geranium Essential Oil is sourced from the finest botanicals, ensuring\npurity and potency in every drop. Your customers will experience the true essence of Geranium,\nleaving them captivated by its aroma and therapeutic benefits.\n2. **Customization Options:** Tailor the packaging, labeling, and branding to reflect your vision\nand values. Our team of experts will work closely with you to create a bespoke product that\nresonates with your target audience, fostering brand loyalty and trust.\n3. **Exceptional Service:** We understand the importance of seamless collaboration. From product\ndevelopment to distribution, our dedicated team is committed to providing you with unparalleled\nsupport every step of the way. Your success is our priority.\n4. **Industry-Leading Expertise:** With years of experience in the essential oils market, we bring\ninvaluable expertise to the table. Count on us to guide you through the intricacies of private\nlabeling, ensuring a smooth and successful journey for your brand.\n\nPartner with us today and unlock the full potential of your brand with our Private Label Services.\nElevate your offerings, delight your customers, and stand out in the market with confidence. Let's\nembark on this transformative journey together.\n\nRead more\n\nTechnical\n\n## **Properties of Geranium Oils**\n\nGeranium Oil is a versatile essential oil known for its therapeutic and organoleptic properties.\nIt's considered safe for skin, less irritant, and often non-allergenic. Common properties include\nbeing an antidepressant, antiseptic, and anti-inflammatory. Importantly, Geranium Oil differs from\nRose Geranium Essential Oil.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Botanical Name** \u2502**:**\u2502**Pelargonium Graveolens**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\