ics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Ginger Lily Oil\n[Ginger Lily Oil]\n\n# Ginger Lily Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nWe are the leading supplier of ginger lily oil. It helps with depression & harmonizes the mind\nreleasing tension & irritability.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Hedychium Spicatum\n* Family: zingiberaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Flower Petals\n* Colour: odour is Fresh &amp; Woody, characteristic\nProduct Details\n\n## **Ginger Lily Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nGinger Lily Oil helps with depression & harmonizes the mind releasing tension & irritability. It is\nalso useful for the digestive system as it helps in fighting nausea & indigestion. It also helps\nwith aches & pain & reduces inflammation.\n\n**Topical Uses**\n* Aphrodisiac\n* Induce Calmness\n* Antispasmodic\n* Aid Digestion\n**Everyday Uses**\n* Used in treating diminished appetite, nausea, vomiting, and inflammation\n* Used an antiseptic agent\n* Used in perfume formulations\n* Used in hair oil to prevent baldness and hair fall\n**Popular Uses & Benefits**\n* Controls vomiting, decreases appetite regulates the overall digestive system.\n* Provides relief from muscular spasms (pains).\n* It Relaxes and refreshes the mind to relieve stress and prompt happiness.\n* Decreases the symptoms of nausea.\n* It renews new cells and replenishes moisture in the skin.\n* Reduces sexual weakness and increases sensuality.\n* Used in the treatment of bronchitis.\n* Improves blood circulation and helps in getting rid of hiccups as well.\n* It is useful in local inflammations, nausea, asthma, bronchitis, hiccups, and pain.\n* It counteracts mouth taste and smell.\n**Primary Benefits**\n* Treats liver problems, food indigestion, and poor blood circulation\n* Medicinal values for the cure of bronchitis\n* Beneficial in the cure of asthma and interior injuries\nTechnical\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:** Apply one to two drops to the desired area. AG Organica is one of the leading\nwholesale suppliers of Ginger Lily oil. We assure you that all our products adhere to the highest\ncriteria of safety and quality. We offer natural & organic forms of natural oils to our customers.\nOur products are free from all chemicals, additives, & fillers. They also do not carry any\nartificial colors, preservatives, or fragrances. We sell Ginger Lily oil in bulk with fast delivery\nand complete customer support. Our company assures you that you will not regret choosing us!\nPregnant & breastfeeding women should avoid it.\n\n**Disclaimer: **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergies,\nor health issues.\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nNaresh Vij\n\n14-04-2021 14:45\n\nIt's a fantastic oil. Helps in joint pain and sore muscles when mixed with a carrier oil like\ncoconut\n\nRadhika\n\n14-04-2021 14:46\n\nThis is my many of repeat buy. I use it to ward off Mosquitoes from my living room. Great Aroma and\ntakes away dampness in this rainy season. Enjoying it!\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Pr