ics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Ginger Oil\n[Ginger Oil]\n\n# Ginger Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nWe are the leading distributor of ginger oil. The fragrance of ginger oil is rich, warm, and sharp.\n**Varieties**\n* [Ginger Oil][92]\n* [Ginger Root Oil - Dried][93]\n* [Ginger Root Oil - Fresh][94]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Zingiber Officinale\n* Family: Zingiberaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Root\n* Colour: Pale yellow liquid with characteristic odour\nProduct Details\n\n## **Ginger Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nDiscover the versatile benefits of ginger oil, renowned for its potent, warm, and spicy aroma.\nWidely embraced in aromatherapy, ginger oil offers a multitude of advantages for both skin and hair\ncare. Beyond its aromatic appeal, this essential oil serves as a natural remedy for an array of\nailments including colds, flu, nausea, motion sickness, and even morning sickness during pregnancy.\nAdditionally, its therapeutic properties extend to relieving muscle aches and pains while enhancing\ncirculation. Embrace the holistic power of ginger oil to revitalize your well-being and elevate your\ndaily self-care routine.\n\n### **Why Choose Us:**\n\nAre you seeking top-tier Ginger Oil for your business needs? Look no further! As a leading\nmanufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality Ginger Oil, we are committed to delivering\nexcellence tailored to your specific requirements.\n\nWelcome to A.G Organica, your one-stop solution for premium Ginger Oil products. With years of\nexpertise in the industry, we take pride in offering top-notch quality that exceeds expectations.\n1. **Unparalleled Quality:** Our Ginger Oil is meticulously crafted using the finest ingredients,\nensuring superior quality and efficacy.\n2. **Reliable Supply:** As a trusted supplier, we maintain consistent supply chains to meet your\ndemands promptly and efficiently.\n3. **Global Reach:** With our extensive export network, we cater to businesses worldwide, delivering\nexcellence across borders.\n4. **Custom Solutions:** We understand that every business is unique. That's why we offer\ncustomizable solutions tailored to your specific needs and preferences.\n\n**Our Products:**\n1. **Pure Ginger Oil:** Extracted from premium ginger roots, our pure Ginger Oil boasts rich aroma\nand therapeutic benefits, ideal for various applications.\n2. **Bulk Ginger Oil:** Whether you require large quantities for manufacturing or distribution, our\nbulk Ginger Oil options ensure cost-effectiveness without compromising on quality.\n\n**Why Ginger Oil?**\n* **Versatility:** From culinary delights to wellness products, Ginger Oil finds versatile\napplications across industries.\n* **Health Benefits:** Renowned for its medicinal properties, Ginger Oil offers a plethora of health\nbenefits, promoting wellness and vitality.\n* **Flavor Enhancement:** Elevate your culinary creations with the exquisite flavor and aroma of our\npremium Ginger Oil, enhancing the taste profile of your products.\n\nReady to elevate your business with premium Ginger Oil? Contact us today to discuss your\nrequirements and explore how we can assist you in achieving your goals.\n\nExperience the difference with AG Group \u2013 your trusted partner for premium Ginger Oil manufacturing,\nsupply, and export. Elevate your business and unlock new possibilities with our exceptional products\nand services.\n\n### **Constituents**\n\n**Main : **zingiberene, beta-sesquiphellandrene\n\n**Other : ****G**eranial,1-8 cineole, Zingiberene, B- bisabolene, B-sesquiphellandrene, \u00c2\u00b1-pinene,\ncamphene, linalool, borneol, -terpineol, nerol, geraniol, and geranyl acetate\n\n### **Extraction:**\n\nIt is extracted by steam distillation method.\n\n### **Blending of Ginger Oil:**\n\nIt blends well with Bergamot, Cedarwood, Clove, Coriander, Eucalyptus, Frankincense, Geranium,\nGrapefruit, Jasmine, Juniper, Lemon, Lime, Mandarin, Neroli, Orange, Palmarosa, Patchouli, Rose,\nSandalwood, Vetivert and Ylang Ylang.\n\n## **Uses of Ginger Oil**\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Aching Muscles\n* Arthritis\n* Nausea\n* Indigestion\n* Poor Circulation\n* Nervous Exhaustion\n* Nausea\n* Hair applications\n* Skin applications\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Relieves respiratory difficulties\n* Digestive processes and relieving stomach discomforts even after surgery\n* Proper functioning of the liver\n* Handles cases of food poisoning, bacterial dysentery, and other infections\n* Relieves inflammatory conditions\n* Lowers cholesterol levels and improves heart health\n* Boosts libido\n* Depression, anxiety, and fatigue\n* Reduces menstrual cramps, joint and muscular pains\n\n### **Popular Uses**\n* Helps in the treatment of muscle aches, arthritis, and migraine\n* Used for treatment for various stomach issues such as colic, indigestion, diarrhea, spasm, and\nstomach aches\n* Used in aromatherapy as it brings a feeling of courageous and self-assurance and provides relief\nfrom depression, mental stress, dizziness, restlessness, exhaustion, and anxiety\n* Provides relief from pain due to its Zingibain component\n* Used to treat food poisoning, motion sickness, and vomiting\n* Helps in intestinal infections and bacterial dysentery\n* Effective against yellow fever and malaria\n* Used to provide relief from menstrual illnesses such as irregular, menstrual cramps, and painful\nmenstrual discharges\n* Helpful in respiratory issues such as coughs, flu, asthma, breathlessness, and bronchitis as it\nhelps in removing mucus from the throat & lungs\n* Strengthens heart health, it reduces cholesterol level and prevents blood clotting lead to reduce\nrisk of heart attack and stroke\n* Used to treat kidney stones issues as it dissolves stones in the kidney\n* Used for hair care as it helps in controlling dandruff\n* Used to treat cancer\n* Used to add in meals such as meat as a preservative and flavoring agent\n\n...\n\n**Primary Benefits**\n* Internal use may help support healthy digestion\n* Known as internal use of digestive aid to help ease occasional indigestion and nausea\n* The soothing and calming aroma\n\nThe Ginger essential oil has different uses and the application depends on the usages. Most commonly\nGinger oil is used in skincare & in oil burners as a calming fragrance. Dilute the essential oils\nwith a carrier oil for the best results as they are very concentrated. Carrier oil mix well with\nessential oils and helps take them within the skin. AG Organica is one of the leading wholesale\nsuppliers of Ginger essential oil. We assure you that all our products adhere to the highest\ncriteria of safety and quality. We offer the natural & certified forms of essential oils to our\ncustomers. Our products are free from all chemicals, additives, & fillers. They also do not carry\nany artificial colors, preservatives, and fragrances. You should dilute essential oil before using\nit for topical application as it is highly concentrated. We employ various tests and quality checks\nto assure that only premium-quality and effective oils reach our clients. The highest quality and\npackaging norms are employed to deliver excellent results on usage. We sell ginger oil in bulk with\nfast delivery and complete customer support. Our company assures that you will not regret choosing\nus!\n* Pregnant & breastfeeding women should avoid it.\n\n**Disclaimer : **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergy,\nhealth issues.\n\n## Private Label Ginger Essential Oils\n\nElevate your brand with our exquisite Private Label Ginger Essential Oil services. Crafted with\nprecision and expertise, our premium-grade Ginger Essential Oil is the epitome of purity and\npotency. Whether you're seeking to expand your product line or create a signature blend, our\ncustomizable private label solutions are tailored to meet your exact specifications.\n\n**Why Ginger Essential Oil?**\n\nRenowned for its myriad health benefits and invigorating aroma, Ginger Essential Oil is a versatile\naddition to any wellness or beauty regimen. Extracted from the fresh rhizome of the ginger plant,\nour oil boasts a rich, warm scent with spicy undertones, captivating the senses and soothing the\nmind.\n\n**Benefits of Partnering with Us:**\n1. **Unparalleled Quality**: Our Ginger Essential Oil is sourced from the finest ginger plants,\nensuring maximum potency and efficacy. Each batch undergoes rigorous testing to guarantee purity\nand authenticity.\n2. **Customization Options**: Tailor your private label Ginger Essential Oil to reflect your brand's\nidentity. From packaging design to scent intensity, we offer a range of customization options to\nsuit your preferences.\n3. **Expert Guidance**: Our team of seasoned professionals is dedicated to guiding you through every\nstep of the private label process. From formulation to packaging, we provide expert advice to\nhelp you create a product that stands out in the market.\n4. **Fast Turnaround**: With streamlined processes and efficient production methods, we ensure\nprompt delivery of your private label Ginger Essential Oil, allowing you to seize market\nopportunities without delay.\n\nPartner with us and unlock the potential of Ginger Essential Oil for your brand. Experience the\ndifference of premium quality and personalized service with our Private Label services. Get in touch\nwith us today to learn more about how we can elevate your brand to new heights.\n\nAG Organica is the leading manufacturer & supplier of Ginger Oil. It has extreme shelf-life\nstability. It is repellent to high temperatures. It is used in Beauty, Food, Aromatherapy,\nNutraceutical, Beverage, Sports Nutrition, Health & Wellness, Pet Nutrition, and Vitamins &\nSupplements. Yes, because it prevents the formation of acne, fine "
