            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Kumkumadi Oil\n[Kumkumadi Oil]\n\n# Kumkumadi Oil Manufacturer\n\nBe the first to review this product. [Add Review][91]\n\nThe rare and exotic saffron flowers retexture the skin making it spotlessly and blemish-free.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical:\n* Family:\n* Extraction: Cold-pressed method\n* Part:\n* Colour: Reddish-Wine Color\nProduct Details\n\nThe name Kumkumadi comes from its key ingredient red-gold saffron, which is known as Kumkuma in\nSanskrit. The rare and exotic saffron flowers retexture the skin making it spotlessly and\nblemish-free.\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Anti- Aging\n* Tan Removal\n* Natural Sunscreen\n* Hyperpigmentation\n* Dark Circles\n* Blemishes\n* Black Spots or Black Marks\n* Acne Scars\n* Acne or pimples\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Skin Brightening\n* Treatment for Skin Infections\n* Removing Scars and Marks\n\n### **Popular Uses**\n* Improves Complexion\n* Treats Hyperpigmentation\n* Prevents Acne And Pimples\n* Diminishes Spots And Blemishes\n* Used As A Sunscreen\n* Lessens Scars\n* Heals Wounds\n\n**Primary Benefits**\n* Lightens complexion\n* Helps to remove scars and wrinkles\n* Reverses the effect of suntan, blemishes, and uneven patches.\n\n### **Directions For Use**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:**\n* Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with a carrier oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nTechnical\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][92]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][93]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][94]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][95]\n* [Third Party Manufacturing][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Magazine][98]\n* [Infrastructure][99]\n* [Contact Us][100]\nQuick Links\n* [Lavender Essential Oil][101]\n* [Tea Tree Essential Oil][102]\n* [Eucalyptus Essential Oil][103]\n* [Lemongrass Essential Oil][104]\n* [Rosemary Essential Oil][105]\n* [Cinnamon Essential Oil][106]\n* [Jasmine Essential Oil][107]\n* [Peppermint Essential Oil][108]\n* [Frankincense Essential Oil][109]\nContact Us\n\nHQ & Manufacturing Site\n\nC-11, Sector 85, Noida \u2013 201305 (India)\n\nagorganica@pureoilsindia.com\n\n011-411-87600\n\nwww.pureoilsindia.com\n\n## Govt. recognition Star Export House - Leading Wholesale Supplier, Manufacturer & Exporter\n\nAG Organica provides India made bulk oils, Floral Water, Butter and Cosmetics to businesses\nworldwide. Serving clients in:\n* America\n* Argentina\n* Australia\n* Belgium\n* Brazil\n* Canada\n* Chile\n* China\n* Colombia\n* Costa Rica\n* Dubai\n* Egypt\n* Ethiopia\n* European Union\n* Finland\n* France\n* Germany\n* Greece\n* Hong Kong\n* India\n* Indonesia\n* Israel\n* Italy\n* Japan\n* Kenya\n* Luxembourg\n* Malaysia\n* Mexico\n* Morocco\n* New Zealand\n* Nigeria\n* Norway\n* North America\n* Oman\n* Philippines\n* Portugal\n* Russia\n* Saudi Arabia\n* Singapore\n* South Africa\n* South Korea\n* Spain\n* Sri Lanka\n* Sweden\n* Taiwan\n* Thailand\n* United Arab Emirates\n* United Kingdom\n* United States\n* Istanbul\n* Vietnam\n\nMany well-reputed domestic & global brands entrust their products to us.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 pureoilsindia.com. All Rights Reserved.\nSend Inquiry\n\n##### Enquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nMessage\nSubmit\nSubmit\n\n[1]: tel:01141187600\n[2]: tel:+9101204310497\n[3]: #\n[4]: /about-us\n[5]: https://www.pureoilsindia.com/media-coverage\n[6]: /event-gallary\n[7]: /market-report\n[8]: /newsletter\n[9]: /certifications-docs\n[10]: /frequently-ask-questions\n[11]: /policies\n[12]: /download-ag-organica-catalog\n[13]: /best-quality-essential-oil\n[14]: /infrastructure-list\n[15]: #\n[16]: /contract-manufacturing\n[17]: /cosmetics-manufacturer\n[18]: /natural-cosmetics-skincare-in-private-labels\n[19]: /custom-formulation\n[20]: /new-color-cosmetics-manufacturer\n[21]: /skin-care-manufacturer\n[22]: /third-party-cosmetics-manufacturing\n[23]: /wholesale-supplier\n[24]: /article\n[25]: /blog\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: https://www.pureoilsindia.com/\n[28]: #\n[29]: /product-category/essential-oils\n[30]: /product-category/carrier-oils\n[31]: /product-category/essential-oils/natural-essential-oil\n[32]: /product-category/herbal-oils\n[33]: /product-category/essential-oils/spice-oil\n[34]: /product-category/essential-oils/absolute-oils\n[35]: /product-category/essential-oils/nature-identical-oils\n[36]: /product-category/essential-oils/pharma\n[37]: #\n[38]: /product-category/bath-and-body/body-care/face-care\n[39]: /product-category/body-care/hair-care\n[40]: /product-category/bath-and-body/body-care/lip-care\n[41]: /product-category/bath-and-body/baby-care\n[42]: /product-category/bath-and-body/men-grooming-products\n[43]: /product-category/bath-and-body/sunscreen\n[44]: /product-category/bath-and-body/concern-wise-products\n[45]: /product-category/bath-and-body/body-care/personal-care/intimate-hygiene\n[46]: /natural-cosmetics-skincare-in-private-labels\n[47]: /wholesale-supplier\n[48]: /product-category/natural-butters\n[49]: /private-label-perfume-manufacturer\n[50]: /product-category/