            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Lemon Oil\n[Lemon Oil]\n\n# Lemon Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4) / [3 Reviews][91]\n\nThis tree is native to South Africa. The leaves of the tree are dark green & in oval shape. This\ntree grows up to 6 meters (20 feet). It has aromatic flowers that are pink or white in color. Unripe\nlemons are in green color but they become yellow when they ripen.\n\n**Varieties**\n* [Lemon Oil - Argentina][92]\n* [Lemon Oil - Natural Blend][93]\n* [Lemon Oil - Natural Blend (5 Fold)][94]\n* [Lemon Oil - Organic][95]\n* [Lemon Oil - Sicily][96]\n* [Lemon Oil - Sicily(5 Fold)][97]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Citrus limonum (also known as Citrus Limon)\n* Family: Rutaceae\n* Extraction: Cold Pressed Expression\n* Part: Fresh fruit peel\n* Colour: Pale Yellow to Deep Yellow\n\nProduct Details\n\n## **Lemon Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nOne of the most beneficial essential as well as natural oils, lemon oil is obtained from Citrus\nLimonum plant. Obtained by the process of cold extraction, the oil comes in a pale greenish-yellow\ncolor as well as a pleasant & refreshing smell. Lemon is a popular citrus fruit with multiple health\nbenefits making the oil extracted from it rich in natural ingredients including minerals and\nvitamins. This oil is manufactured in its 100% natural state by AG Organica. This product is in high\ndemand among some of the leading brands across different parts of the world.\n\n**Product Highlights:**\n1. **Pure Lemon Oil:** Our lemon oil is extracted using advanced techniques to preserve its natural\nessence, ensuring unmatched purity.\n2. **Therapeutic Grade:** Experience the therapeutic benefits of lemon oil, carefully formulated to\npromote well-being and vitality.\n3. **Versatile Applications:** From aromatherapy to culinary delights, our lemon oil seamlessly\nintegrates into various applications, adding a burst of freshness.\n4. **Bulk Supply:** As a wholesale supplier, we cater to businesses of all sizes, offering\ncompetitive pricing and flexible quantities to meet your requirements.\n5. **Global Export:** Partner with us to access premium-quality lemon oil on a global scale. Benefit\nfrom our efficient export services, ensuring timely delivery and customer satisfaction.\n\n**Why Choose Us:**\n1. **Exceptional Quality:** Our commitment to quality is unwavering, ensuring that every batch of\nlemon oil surpasses industry standards.\n2. **Reliability:** Count on us for consistent supply and superior customer service, establishing\nenduring partnerships built on trust.\n3. **Custom Solutions:** Tailored to your needs, we offer custom formulations and packaging options\nto align with your brand's vision.\n4. **Environmental Stewardship:** We prioritize sustainability throughout our production process,\nminimizing our environmental footprint.\n5. **Competitive Advantage:** With our extensive expertise and dedication to innovation, we secure\ntop rankings on Google, enhancing your visibility and market presence.\n\n### **Constituents**\n\n**Main : **Limonene, pinene, terpinene\n\n**Other : **a-pinene, camphene, , sabinene, myrcene, a-terpinene, linalool, b-bisabolene,\ntrans-a-bergamotene, nerol and neral\n\n## **Uses of Lemon Oil**\n\nA common ingredient of aromatherapy, lemon oil is used to offer several benefits. Some of the\ntypical uses of this essential oil include fighting fatigue & insomnia, easing stress and addressing\nseveral conditions like athlete's foot, depression, acne, varicose veins, and warts. Moreover, the\noil is also known to promote weight loss, alleviate pain, and stimulate the immune system.\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Skincare\n* Laundry\n* Disinfectant\n* Degreaser (goo be gone)\n* Mood Booster/Concentration\n* Insect Repellant\n* Hair/Nail Care\n* Immune Support\n* Feet Care\n* Wood Polish\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Helps in blood flow, reducing blood pressure, and helping with nosebleeds\n* Brings down fever, helps relieve throat infections, bronchitis, asthma, and flu\n* Boosts the immune system and cleanses the body & improves the functions of the digestive system\n* Soothes and relieves headaches and migraines\n\n### **Popular Uses**\n* Improves digestion of the body\n* Used as a remedy for halitosis and health care of oral\n* Helps in medicine for acidity, upset stomach, and including indigestion and cramps\n* Used in various artificial drink\n* Has cough relief properties\n* Used in cleansing and purification\n* Used for the treatment of asthma\n* Effective against malaria and typhoid\n* Gives relief from sleeplessness\n* Used as an ingredient for perfumes\n* Removes dandruff from the hair\n* Used in anxiety, nervousness, and nervous tension\n* Improves immune system\n* Used for treatment of pimples and it also nourishes the skin\n\n### **Application Uses**\n* **Disinfecting room spray**\n* Freshening room spray\n* **Surface cleaner**\n* Massage oil\n* Stress relief oil\n* **Sanitizer**\n* Soap\n* Shampoo\n* Anti-dandruff hair oil\n* Face cream for oily skin\n* Facial cream\n* Serum\n* Hair treatment\n* Skin treatment\n* Scrub\n* Deodorant\n* Face mask\n* **Bacteria removal**\n* Foaming face wash\n\n...\n\n## **Benefits of Using Lemon Oil**\n\nLemon essential oil possesses various therapeutic properties that enable it to deliver a wide range\nof benefits. Properties include anti-microbial, anti-rheumatic, anti-bacterial, and antiseptic. Some\nof the key aroma therapeutic benefits of this oil are listed below:\n* **Anxiety: **Lemon oil is observed to help reduce stress and anxiety through several preliminary\nresearch studies. For instance, a study found a reduction in the levels of a type of stress\nhormone, corticosterone, in rats when exposed to the odor of this oil.\n* **Mood: **Enhancing mood is another benefit of this oil as revealed by preliminary research. A\nstudy involving 56 healthy participants, as published in 2008 in Psychoneuroendocrinology, lemon\noil was found more effective in improving mood as compared to lavender oil when its aroma was\ninhaled by both men & women.\n* **Weight Loss: **The oil is also found to deliver promising effects in preventing the gain of\nweight. As published in 2003 in Experimental Biology & Medicine, a study revealed results of tests\nconducted on rats by scientists. According to the study, breathing in the scent of grapefruit and\nlemon essential oils was discovered to promote body fat breakdown by altering the nervous system\nactivity.\n* **Alzheimer's disease: **Another study published in 2009 in Psychogeriatrics states that the lemon\nessential oil may offer benefits to people suffering from Alzheimer's disease. Tested among 28\nolder adults, the use of lemon, lavender, orange, and rosemary oils in aromatherapy significantly\nimproved certain measures of cognitive function.\n\n**Primary Benefits**\n* Cleanses and purifies the air and surfaces\n* Cleanses the body and helps in digestion\n* Supports healthy respiratory function when used internally\n* Uplifting, positive aroma\n\nThe lemon essential oil has different uses and the application depends on the usages. Most commonly\nlemon oil is used in skincare & in oil burners as a calming fragrance. Dilute the essential oils\nwith a carrier oil for the best results as they are very concentrated. Carrier oil mix well with\nessential oils and helps take them within the skin. If you are wondering where to buy lemon oil\nfrom, we can help! AG Organica is a **leading lemon oil supplier**, carrying an extensive stock of\npure lemon oil to facilitate bulk orders. You can get the best prices for wholesale purchases with\nus. You should dilute essential oil before using it for topical application as it is highly\nconcentrated. We employ various tests and quality checks to assure that only premium-quality and\neffective oils reach our clients. The highest quality and packaging norms are employed to deliver\nexcellent results on usage.\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n**Disclaimer : **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergy,\nhealth issues.\n\nIt can be diluted & applied topically to the skin & diffused into the air. It helps in fighting with\ndepression, clears your skin, kills harmful viruses and bacteria, and reduces inflammation.\n* [**Lemon essential oil**][98]\n* Helichrysum essential oil\n* Frankincense essential oil\n* Geranium essential oil\n* [Lavender essential oil][99]\n\nThe essential oil can be added to the bath or applied to the skin (a drop or two) after being\ndiluted with a carrier oil. Pure lemon oil can be toxic if used in large quantities and shouldn't be\napplied to the skin directly and without recommendation. The oil can also be inhaled using a\nvaporizer or an aromatherapy diffuser or by sprinkling a drop onto a tissue/cloth. In short, the\n**lemon essential oil** is of great use as a healing scent and in aromatherapy facial or massage.\nThough more researches would be needed to point out the exact benefits, it is recommended to use the\noil after consulting an aromatherapist.\n* Grate the outside of the lemon over a bowl\n* Fill a small glass bottle halfway with the grated lemon zest.\n* Set the bottle on a window that gets a lot of sun rays.\n* Leave it there for a few days, but shake the bottle a few times per day.\n\n### **PEOPLE ALSO SEARCH US BY :**\n\nLemon Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Lemon Oil, Essential Oil Manufacturer, Organic Lemon Oil, Bulk\nLemon Oil, Natural Essential Oil Supplier, Lemon Oil Exporter, Lemon Essential Oil Benefits, Pure\nLemon Oil, Lemon Essential Oil, Lemon Essential Oil Manufacturers, [Lemon Oil Manufacturer in\nIndia][100], Lemon Essential Oil Manufacturer in Ghaziabad, [Lemon Oil Manufacturer in"
          },
