ics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Malkangni Oil\n[Malkangni Oil]\n\n# Malkangni Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nWe are the leading supplier of malkangni oil. It is an Ayurveda product that provides relief from\njoint pain & arthritis. It is used to improve memory.\n* Origin:\n* Botanical: Celastrus paniculatus\n* Family: Celastraceae\n* Extraction: Cold-pressed method\n* Part: Seeds\n* Colour:\nProduct Details\n\n## **Malkangni Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nMalkangni Oil is an Ayurveda product that provides relief from joint pain & arthritis. It is used to\nimprove memory. It helps with anemia and liver disorders. It is the best treatment for mental &\nphysical well-being. It helps with anemia and liver disorders. It is the best treatment for mental &\nphysical well-being.\n\n**Extraction:**\n\nIt is extracted by the cold-pressed method.\n\n**Blending:**\n\nIt blends well with Almond oil, Lavender Oil & More.\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Sharpens memory\n* Paralysis\n* Facial palsy\n* Mental health problems\n* Helps with better sleep\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Used to improve intelligence\n* Balances Vata and Kapha\n* Induces vomiting\n* Improves digestion\n* Improves memory\n\n### **Popular Uses & Benefits**\n* Boosts memory, learning, and concentration power\n* Has anti-oxidants that boost digestive functions and appetite\n* Ensures stimulating effects on the neuromuscular system\n* Helps with cognitive dysfunction\n* Provides relief from mental fatigue, depression as well as stress\n* Has expectorant properties that cure cough and asthma\n* Comes with analgesic, anti-arthritic and anti-inflammatory properties\n* Used for treating inflammation of muscles and joints\n* Contains vitamin b1\n\n### **Primary ****Benefits**\n* Relieves constipation\n* Helps with anemia and liver disorders\n* Acts as a cardiac tonic\n\nTechnical\n\n### **Directions For Use**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:**\n* Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with a carrier oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nVijendra\n\n08-07-2021 11:16\n\nA product worth buying. Have been using it for over a month now and can see the results in rising\nconcentration of my son while studying. A go for it product\n\nJignesh patel\n\n08-07-2021 11:16\n\nSimply awesome. Deep sleep time increased. Feeling much more refresh after waking up in the morning.\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][92]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][93]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][94]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][95]\n* [Third Party Manufacturing][96]\n* [About Us][97]\n* [Magazine][98]\n* [Infrastructure][99]\n* [Contact Us][100]\nQuick Links\n* [Lavender Essential Oil][101]\n* [Tea Tree Essential Oil][102]\n* [Eucalyptus Essential Oil][103]\n* [Lemongrass Essential Oil][104]\n* [Rosemary Essential Oil][105]\n* [Cinnamon Essential Oil][106]\n* [Jasmine Essential Oil][107]\n* [Peppermint Essential Oil][108]\n* [Frankincense Essential Oil][109]\nContact Us\n\nHQ & Manufacturing Site\n\nC-11, Sector 85, Noida \u2013 201305 (India)\n\nagorganica@pureoilsindia.com\n\n011-411-87600\n\nwww.pureoilsindia.com\n\n## Govt. recognition Star Export House - Leading Wholesale Supplier, Manufacturer & Exporter\n\nAG Organica provides India made bulk oils, Floral Water, Butter and Cosmetics to businesses\nworldwide. Serving clients in:\n* America\n* Argentina\n* Australia\n* Belgium\n* Brazil\n* Canada\n* Chile\n* China\n* Colombia\n* Costa Rica\n* Dubai\n* Egypt\n* Ethiopia\n* European Union\n* Finland\n* France\n* Germany\n* Greece\n* Hong Kong\n* India\n* Indonesia\n* Israel\n* Italy\n* Japan\n* Kenya\n* Luxembourg\n* Malaysia\n* Mexico\n* Morocco\n* New Zealand\n* Nigeria\n* Norway\n* North America\n* Oman\n* Philippines\n* Portugal\n* Russia\n* Saudi Arabia\n* Singapore\n* South Africa\n* South Korea\n* Spain\n* Sri Lanka\n* Sweden\n* Taiwan\n* Thailand\n* United Arab Emirates\n* United Kingdom\n* United States\n* Istanbul\n* Vietnam\n\nMany well-reputed domestic & global brands entrust their products to us.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 pureoilsindia.com. All Rights Reserved.\nSend Inquiry\n\n##### Enquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nMessage\nSubmit\nSubmit\n\n[1]: tel:01141187600\n[2]: tel:+9101204310497\n[3]: #\n[4]: /about-us\n[5]: https://www.pureoilsindia.com/media-coverage\n[6]: /event-gallary\n[7]: /market-report\n[8]: /newsletter\n[9]: /certifications-docs\n[10]: /frequently-ask-questions\n[11]: /policies\n[12]: /download-ag-organica-catalog\n[13]: /best-quality-essential-oil\n[14]: /infrastructure-list\n[15]: #\n[16]: /contract-manufacturing\n[17]: /cosmetics-manufacturer\n[18]: /natural-cosmetics-skincare-in-private-labels\n[19]: /custom-formulation\n[20]: /new-color-cosmetics-manufacturer\n[21]: /skin-care-manufacturer\n[22]: /third-party-cosmetics-manufacturing\n[23]: /wholesale-supplier\n[24]: /article\n[25]: /blog\n[26]: /contact-us\n[27]: https://www.pureoilsindia.com/\n[28]: #\n[29]: /product-category/essential-oils\n[30]: /product-category/carrier-oils\n[31]: 