            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Mandarin Oil\n[Mandarin Oil]\n\n# Mandarin Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nMandarin Essential Oil is extracted from Citrus Rind Peel and commonly used in aromatherapy.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Citrus reticulata Blanco\n* Family: Rutaceae\n* Extraction: Cold Pressed\n* Part: Citrus Rind (Peel)\n* Colour: Greenish Orange\n* Usage: Cosmetics, Food & Pharmaceutics\n* Composition: C16:0 Palmitic acid, C16:1 Palmitoleic acid, C18:1 Oleic acid & C20:0 Arachidic acid\nProduct Details\n\n## **Mandarin Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nMandarin Oil, also known with its botanical name Citrus Reticuleta is nourished in the region of\nChina, but now it is extensively produced and used in Italy. It helps to prevent bacterial, fungal\nas well as viral infections. AG Organica is the leading supplier and distributor of the Mandarin\nEssential oil to the leading brands in the world.\n\n## **Extraction of Mandarin Oil:**\n\nMandarin Oil is extracted from the peels of the oranges with the help of the cold-pressed method.\nThe extracted Mandarin Oil comes up with yellow to dark orange color in liquid form. The oil has\nvarious therapeutic properties like antibacterial, antiseptic, antiviral, and anti-neuralgic.\n\n### **Constituents**\n\n**Main : **Limonene, \u00ce\u00b3-Terpinene\n\n**Other : **Alpha-Pinene, camphene, alpha thujane, sabinene, beta-pinene, terpineol-4-ol,\ncitronellal, linalool, y-terpinolene, limonene, mycene, nerol, and geranial\n\n## **Uses of Mandarin Oil**\n\n**Topical Uses**\n* Acne\n* Dull Skin\n* Insomnia\n* Oily Skin\n* Scars\n* Spots\n* Stress\n* Wrinkles\n\n**Everyday Uses**\n* Antiseptic\n* Nervine\n* Circulatory\n* Digestive\n* Nervous Relaxant\n* Tonic\n* Stomache\n\n**Popular Uses**\n* Has a soothing effect on the Nervous system\n* Proves better treatment for the digestive system, helping in diarrhea, constipation & flatulence\n* Used to increase blood circulation & reducing fluid retention\n* Used by women after pregnancy to stretch the marks\n* Used against insomnia, obesity & skin rejuvenation\n* Has antispasmodic, antiseptic, diuretic, laxative, and digestive properties\n* Reduces stress and tension\n* Promotes the growth of new Tissues and Cells\n\n## **Benefits of Mandarin Oil**\n\nMandarin oil has various benefits which are given as under:\n* **Reduce Acne, Scars and Stretch Marks: **Mandarin Oil does not have an irritating impact on the\nskin and is safe to apply. You can directly apply this oil to your skin to reduce acne and scars.\n* **Reduce Anxiety, and Nausea:** The oil is essential to reduce anxiety, and nausea through\naromatherapy. The effective usage of the oil will help you get relieve from stress and anxiety\ndisorders.\n* **Protect Food:** Mandarin Oil is used to protect food from bacteria because of its antimicrobial\nnature.\n* **Relieve Pain:** The oil is used to relieve body pain via therapy.\n* **Help Cancer: **Mandarin Oil is used to fight against cancer. This oil is useful for the\ntreatment of cancer.\n\n**Primary Benefits**\n* Supports healthy nervous, digestive, and respiratory systems\n* Known for its soothing and uplifting aroma\n* Internal use helps maintain healthy immune function\n\nAG Organica is the leading manufacturer & supplier of Mandarin Oil. It has extreme shelf-life\nstability. It is repellent to high temperatures.\n\n## **Uses of Mandarin Oil: **\n\nThis oil has many applications as listed below:\n* Mandarin Oil is essential for medicinal properties like the treatment of acne and insomnia.\n* It is used for the treatment of dull skin, oily skin, and scars.\n* It is used to reduce stress and anxiety\n* The oil is essential for the children\n* Mandarin Oil is also used to add flavors in chocolates, sweets, gems deodorants and in many dairy\nproducts\n* Mandarin Oil is used in many cosmetics\n\nTechnical\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:** Apply one to two drops to the desired area. Dilute with Orange, grapefruit,\npetitgrain, lemon, bergamot, lime, lemongrass, neroli, lavender oil to minimize any skin\nsensitivity.\n\nOf all the citrus oils, mandarin oil is the sweetest and the most aromatic one. Pure mandarin oil\nreduces the negative effects of daily stress, promotes deep, restful sleep as well.AG Organica is\none of the reputed and certified mandarin essential oil manufacturers and we make sure to help\ncustomers take utmost advantage of oil's therapeutic properties.\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n**Disclaimer : **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergy,\nhealth issues.\n\nList of technical documents\n1. Mandarin essential oil - COA\n2. [Mandarin essential oil - SOP][92]\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nMindy\n\n11-09-2020 17:08\n\nThis Mandarin has a good clean pure orangey fragrance, not sharp and acidic, but mellow.\n\nMonika\n\n11-09-2020 17:11\n\nI love this essential oil and the crisp citrus orange scent. It has a wonderful calmness I blend it\nwith lavender oil For a soothing bath bomb and soak. Lovely\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on delivering\nquality through industry-known practices for manufacturing, storage, and supplying as well as\nrigorous quality checks.\n\nBest Products\n* [Essential Oil Supplier][93]\n* [Skin Care Manufacturer][94]\n* [Cosmetics Manufacturer][95]\n* [Private Labels Manufacturer][96]\n* [Third Party Manufacturing][97]\n* [About Us][98]\n* [Magazine][99]\n* [Infrastructure][100]\n* [Contact Us][101]\nQuick Links\n* [Lavender Essential Oil][102]\n* [Tea Tree Essential Oil][103]\n* [Eucalyptus Essential Oil][104]\n* [Lemongrass Essential Oil][105]\n* [Rosemary Essential Oil][106]\n* [Cinnamon Essential Oil][107]\n* [Jasmine Essential Oil][108]\n* [Peppermint Essential Oil][109]\n* [Frankincense Essential Oil][110]\nContact Us\n\nHQ & Manufacturing Site\n\nC-11, Sector 85, Noida \u2013 201305 (India)\n\nagorganica@pureoilsindia.com\n\n011-411-87600\n\nwww.pureoilsindia.com\n\n## Govt. recognition Star Export House - Leading Wholesale Supplier, Manufacturer & Exporter\n\nAG Organica provides India made bulk oils, Floral Water, Butter and Cosmetics to businesses\nworldwide. Serving clients in:\n* America\n* Argentina\n* Australia\n* Belgium\n* Brazil\n* Canada\n* Chile\n* China\n* Colombia\n* Costa Rica\n* Dubai\n* Egypt\n* Ethiopia\n* European Union\n* Finland\n* France\n* Germany\n* Greece\n* Hong Kong\n* India\n* Indonesia\n* Israel\n* Italy\n* Japan\n* Kenya\n* Luxembourg\n* Malaysia\n* Mexico\n* Morocco\n* New Zealand\n* Nigeria\n* Norway\n* North America\n* Oman\n* Philippines\n* Portugal\n* Russia\n* Saudi Arabia\n* Singapore\n* South Africa\n* South Korea\n* Spain\n* Sri Lanka\n* Sweden\n* Taiwan\n* Thailand\n* United Arab Emirates\n* United Kingdom\n* United States\n* Istanbul\n* Vietnam\n\nMany well-reputed domestic & global brands entrust their products to us.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 pureoilsindia.com. All Rights Reserved.\nSend Inquiry\n\n##### Enquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nMessage\nSubmit\nSubmit\n\n[1]: tel:01141187600\n[2]: tel:+91012043104