            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Nagarmotha Oil\n[Nagarmotha Oil]\n\n# Nagarmotha Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4) / [2 Reviews][91]\nLooking for the best Nagarmotha Oil Manufacturer? You\u2019ve landed at the right place. At AG Organica,\nwe take pride in being a leading Nagarmotha Oil manufacturer and bulk supplier, offering unmatched\nquality and consistency across the globe.\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Cyperus Rotundus\n* Family: Cyperaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Roots\n* Colour: Dark yellow to brownish\n* Type of Packaging: Drum\n* Packaging Size: 25 Kg, 50 Kg, 180 Kg and 200 Kg\n* Services: Bulk, Third party manufacturer, White Label, Contract Manufacturing, Private Labeling\n* Brand: A.G. Organica / ODM / OEM / Private Label\n* Packaging: Glass Bottles, Plastic Bottle, Aluminum Bottles, HDPE Drums, Galvanized steel drum &\nexport standard Packing\n* Business Type: Trusted Manufacturer, Leading Supplier, Bulk, Wholesaler, Verified Exporter\n* Certification: GMP, ISO, FSSAI, MSME, HALAL\nProduct Details\n\n## **Nagarmotha Oil Manufacturer \u2013 Trusted, Pure & Globally Recognized**\n\nAt **Pure Oils India**, we take pride in being a globally recognized **Nagarmotha oil\nmanufacturer**, offering 100% pure and natural oil extracted from the roots of *Cyperus\nscariosus*\u2014an herb deeply revered in Ayurveda. As a seasoned **Nagarmotha oil supplier**, we ensure\nunmatched quality, consistent purity, and bulk availability, making us a reliable partner for brands\nin cosmetics, perfumery, and aromatherapy.\n\n## **What Is Nagarmotha Oil?**\n\nNagarmotha Oil, also known as **Cypriol Oil**, is derived from the steam distillation of the roots\nof the Nagarmotha plant. Celebrated for its deep, woody, and spicy aroma, it plays a vital role in\nhigh-end perfumery, natural skincare, and therapeutic blends. It is particularly renowned for:\n* Balancing oily skin\n* Soothing digestive discomfort\n* Promoting hair and scalp health\n* Serving as a base note in perfumes and incense\n\n## **\ud83d\ude9a Why Choose Pure Oils India as Your Nagarmotha Oil Supplier?**\n\nWe don\u2019t just manufacture \u2013 we **nurture the essence** of purity. Here\u2019s what sets us apart:\n* \ud83c\udf31 **100% Pure & Natural Oil - **No additives. No dilutions. Just nature\u2019s essence distilled with\nprecision.\n* \ud83c\udfed **In-House Manufacturing - **As a trusted **Nagarmotha Oil manufacturer**, we oversee the\ncomplete process\u2014from sourcing to extraction\u2014to ensure **consistency and quality**.\n* \ud83c\udf0d **Global Supply Network - **Whether you're a startup or a legacy brand, our supply chain\nsupports **bulk orders, private labeling, and white-label solutions**.\n* \ud83d\udd2c **GC/MS Tested Quality - **Each batch is rigorously tested to meet **international standards**\nfor aroma, consistency, and composition.\n\n**Blending:**\n\nIt blends well with Clary sage, bergamot, patchouli, and labdanum\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Fever\n* Burning maturation\n* Skin diseases\n* Rheumatoid arthritis\n* Painful menstruation\n* Neurasthenia\n* General debility\n* Kidney stones\n* Fibromyalgia\n* Gout\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Used in aromatherapy as it relieves stress, reduces tension, tone system.\n* Fights with intestinal worms and works as a healthy tonic\n* Decreases blood glucose level, cures diabetes\n\n## **Popular Uses & Benefits of Nagarmotha Oil**\n* Cures various illnesses like fever, painful menstruation, stomach issues, rheumatoid arthritis,\nskin infections, diabetes, kidney problems, etc.\n* Used as a decongestant as it cures a cold, coughs mucus, and scabies as well as other decongestive\nproblems\n* Remedy to avoid digestive system conditions which include diarrhea, intestinal worms as well as\nloose stools\n* Used for skincare; it boosts skin as it has beauty-enhancing properties and also an effective\nremedy for various kinds of dermatitis and other skin disorders. It decreases skin dryness,\nredness, irritation, and also control flare-ups\n* Decreases respiratory problems include coughs, bronco pulmonary, congestion, bronchitis, loosening\nmucus, and phlegm\n\n### **Primary ****Benefits**\n* Used for fragrance; its refreshing aroma is fascinating to both women and men\n* Helps in the treatment of acne, it is used in skin creams preparation as it hydrates skin\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n## **PEOPLE ALSO SEARCH US BY :**\n\nNagarmotha Oil Manufacturer, Wholesale Nagarmotha Oil, Essential Oil Manufacturer, Organic\nNagarmotha Oil, Bulk Nagarmotha Oil, Natural Essential Oil Supplier, Nagarmotha Oil Exporter,\nNagarmotha Essential Oil Benefits, Pure Nagarmotha Oil, Nagarmotha Essential Oil, Nagarmotha\nEssential Oil Manufacturers, [Nagarmotha Oil Manufacturer in India][92], Nagarmotha Essential Oil\nManufacturer in [Ghaziabad][93], [Nagarmotha Oil Manufacturer in Delhi][94], [Nagarmotha Oil\nManufacturer in Noida][95], Nagarmotha Essential Oil Supplier, Nagarmotha Essential Oil exporter\nfrom India to [USA][96], [Canada][97], Australia, [Germany][98], [Europe][99].\n\nTechnical\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nDebi\n\n04-02-2020 12:57\n\nPure &amp; organic product\n\nRahul\n\n04-02-2020 12:58\n\nIt's a good product. Affordable and pocket-friendly.\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Send Inquiry\n\nName\nEmail Address\nContact No\nCountry\nCompany Name\nSubmit\nSubmit\nAbout Our Company\n\nA.G. Organica is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of pure essential oils and products\nused in natural skin-care and aromatherapy. Since our inception, we have focused on deliv