            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Neroli Oil\n[Neroli Oil]\n\n# Neroli Oil Manufacturer\n\n(5) / [2 Reviews][91]\nAG Organica is a trusted Neroli Oil manufacturer, offering high-quality, pure, and organic Neroli\nessential oil. Perfect for skincare and aromatherapy, our Neroli oil is meticulously crafted to\nretain its natural benefits. Partner with us for bulk, private labeling, or custom formulations\ntailored to meet your brand\u2019s needs.\n* Origin: North Eastern\n* Botanical: Citrus Aurantium/Citrus Vulgaris\n* Family: Rutaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Flower Blossoms\n* Colour: Pale Yellow to Golden\nProduct Details\n\n## **Neroli Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nNeroli essential oil is derived from the plant of Neroli and is used for external application and is\nvery common in North Eastern.\n\n**Extraction of Neroli essential oil** Neroli oil is extracted from small, white waxy flowers of the\nbitter orange tree by steam distillation. At AG Organica, the oil is extracted and supplied at a\nvery reasonable rate all throughout the world it is a leading supplier, producer, and manufacturer\nof this oil. This product is supplied to different parts of the world.\n\n**Properties of Neroli essential oil** It is an anti-depressant and rejuvenates the entire nervous\nsystem. It is ant-septic and anti-infectious in nature. It is a watery fluid, yellow in color.\n\n### **Topical Uses**\n* Lowers Inflammation & Pain\n* Reduces Stress & Improve Symptoms of Menopause\n* Decreases Blood Pressure & Cortisol Levels\n* Exhibits Antimicrobial & Antioxidant Activities\n* Repairs & Rejuvenates Skin\n\n### **Everyday Uses**\n* Combats Anxiety\n* Treats Acne\n* Normalizes Blood Pressure\n* Relieves Menstrual Cramps\n* Lowers Inflammation\n\n### **Popular Uses & Benefits**\n* Neroli oil helps to clear acne and blemished skin.\n* Other important properties include being digestive, anti-depressant, deodorant, stimulant,\nantiseptic, antispasmodic, carminative, cordial, and tonic.\n* Any type of skin can benefits from this oil although it is particularly good for dry, irritated,\nor sensitive skin.\n* Regulates oiliness and minimizes enlarged pores.\n* Help when a patient is convalescing and is a good general tonic.\n* Used in treating skin conditions linked to emotional stress.\n* In insomnia problems, you may easily use it.\n* It is effective in treating headaches, calming heart palpitations, vertigo, and neuralgia.\n* It works as perfect essential oil with the most sedative effects that most useful for treating\nshock, depression, and anxiety.\n\n### **Primary ****Benefits**\n* Creates an uplifting atmosphere\n* May help reduce feelings of anxiousness\n* Soothes skin\n* Encourages relaxation\n\n### **Directions For Use**\n\n**Diffusion:** Use three to four drops in the diffuser\n\n**Topical use:**\n* Apply one to two drops to the desired area.\n* Dilute with a carrier oil to minimize any skin sensitivity.\n\n### **Caution**\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\nTechnical\n\nList of Technical Documents\n1. [Neroli Essential Oil - COA][92]\n\nPackaging\nReviews\n\nCarol s.\n\n12-07-2021 10:47\n\nThis was surprisingly good quality for the size, and I'd buy it again. It's a real Neroli scent. I\nuse it to make homemade laundry products, room spray, diffusing, etc. It combines well with other\nscents. I use it most often with lavender and sweet orange.\n\nJacqui Komschlies\n\n12-07-2021 10:47\n\nThis is a quality oil. It is potent and smells so good. Actually like roses. I will buy again and\npurchase other oils too.\n\n#### Related Products\n\n**Notification**\n\n##### Sen