            "text": "[011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n* [ Media Gallery ][5]\n* [ Event Gallary ][6]\n* [ Market Report ][7]\n* [ Newsletter ][8]\n* [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n* [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n* [ Policies ][11]\n* [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n* [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n* [ Private Labels ][18]\n* [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n* [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n* [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n* [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n* [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - Manufacturer, Exporter and Supplier of Essential Oils, Carrier Oils and Cosmetics]\n][27]\nSearch the site:\n* [ OILS ][28]\n* [ Essential Oils ][29]\n* [ Carrier Oils ][30]\n* [ Natural Essential Oil ][31]\n* [ Herbal Oils ][32]\n* [ Spice Oil ][33]\n* [ Absolute Oils ][34]\n* [ Nature Identical Oils ][35]\n* [ Pharmaceutical Grade Oil ][36]\n* [ COSMETICS ][37]\n[ Face Care ][38] [ Hair Care ][39] [ Lip Care ][40] [ Baby Care ][41] [ Men Grooming ][42] [\nSunscreen ][43] [ Concern Wise Products ][44] [ Hygiene ][45]\n* [Private label][46]\n* [Bulk Supplier][47]\n* [BUTTERS][48]\n* [Perfume][49]\n* [FLORAL WATER][50]\n* [ MISCELLANEOUS ][51]\n[ Color Cosmetics ][52] [ Fragrance ][53] [ Aerosol ][54] [ Aromatherapy ][55] [ Aromatic\nIngredients ][56] [ Oleoresins ][57]\n* [ CATALOG ][58]\n[ Essential Oil Catalog ][59] [ Skin Care Catalog ][60] [ Fragrance Catalog ][61] [ Color\nCosmetics Catalog ][62] [ Private Label Catalog ][63] [ All Catalog \u21a0 ][64]\n* [ COMPANY ][65]\n[ About Us ][66] [ Media Gallery ][67] [ Event Gallary ][68] [ Market Report ][69] [ Newsletter\n][70] [ Certifications & DOCs ][71] [ Frequently Ask Questions ][72] [ Policies ][73] [ Download\nCatalog ][74]\n* [Quality][75]\n* [Infra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n[ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\nFormulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\nManufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n1. [Home][89]\n2. [Products][90]\n3. Orange Oil\n[Orange Oil]\n\n# Orange Oil Manufacturer\n\n(4) / [2 Reviews][91]\nAs a trusted Orange Oil Manufacturer, AG Organica delivers high-quality, pure orange oil ideal for\ncosmetics, aromatherapy, and wellness applications. Sourced sustainably, our orange oil captures the\nrefreshing citrus essence, offering versatile benefits from skin care to uplifting moods. Partner\nwith us for reliable supply and custom formulations that elevate your product line.\n**Varieties**\n* [Orange Oil][92]\n* [Orange Oil - 5 Fold][93]\n* [Orange Oil Bitter][94]\n* [Orange Oil Sweet][95]\n* Origin: India\n* Botanical: Citrus sinensis\n* Family: Citrus &amp; Rutaceae\n* Extraction: Steam Distillation\n* Part: Fruit Peel\n* Colour:\nProduct Details\n\n## **Orange Oil Manufacturer & Supplier**\n\nOrange oil is beneficial for maintaining the appearance, health & texture of the skin as it promotes\nradiance, clarity, smoothness & radiance. It is used for reducing the signs of acne & uncomfortable\nskin conditions. It increases the flow of blood. Orange oil is used in massages that relieve stress,\nconstipation, abdominal pain, indigestion & congestion of nose or liver.\n\nWelcome to our comprehensive range of premium orange oil solutions tailored to meet your diverse\nbusiness requirements. As a reputable manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-quality orange\noil, we take pride in delivering excellence in every drop. Discover how our products can elevate\nyour operations and unlock a world of possibilities.\n\n**Our Offerings:**\n1. **Pure Orange Oil**: Crafted from the finest oranges, our pure orange oil exudes unparalleled\nquality and freshness. Ideal for various industrial applications, it serves as a versatile\ningredient in cosmetics, flavorings, and cleaning products.\n2. **Orange Oil Blends**: Elevate your products with our expertly blended orange oil formulations.\nWhether you seek a citrusy fragrance for personal care items or a natural flavor enhancer for\nfood products, our blends deliver exceptional results.\n3. **Custom Solutions**: Tailored to your specifications, our custom orange oil solutions empower\nyour business with unique formulations. From scent profiles to potency levels, we work closely\nwith you to create the perfect blend for your specific needs.\n\n**Why Choose Us:**\n1. **Exceptional Quality**: Our commitment to quality is unwavering. With stringent quality control\nmeasures in place, we ensure that every batch of orange oil meets the highest industry standards.\n2. **Reliable Supply Chain**: As a trusted supplier, we guarantee timely delivery of your orange oil\norders, keeping your production schedules on track and minimizing downtime.\n3. **Global Reach**: Whether you operate locally or internationally, our extensive export\ncapabilities enable us to serve clients worldwide. Experience seamless transactions and prompt\ndelivery, no matter where your business is located.\n4. **Sustainability**: We prioritize sustainability in every aspect of our operations. From\neco-friendly production practices to responsible sourcing, we strive to minimize our\nenvironmental footprint and support a healthier planet.\n\n**Get in Touch: **Unlock the full potential of orange oil for your business today. Contact us to\ndiscuss your requirements, request samples, or place an order. Let us be your trusted partner in\nharnessing the power of nature's finest citrus essence.\n\nAs a leading manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of premium orange oil, we are dedicated to\nempowering businesses with top-quality solutions tailored to their unique needs. Discover the\ndifference our orange oil products can make in your industry and elevate your offerings to new\nheights of excellence.\n\n### **Constituents**\n\na-pinene, sabinene, myrcene, limonene, linalool, citronellal, neral and geranial\n\n## **Uses of Orange Oil:**\n\n**Topical Uses**\n* Clarity\n* Radiance\n* Smoothness\n* Signs of acne\n\n**Everyday Uses**\n* Effective in cold & constipation\n* Radiant & is also relaxing\n* Used in anti-aging cream\n* Relieve the flu, gums, slow digestion & stress\n* Used in creams & lotion\n**Popular Uses**\n* Antimicrobial activity\n* Anxiety and depression\n* Pain relief\n* Anticancer and antioxidant activity\n* Exercise performance\n* Weight loss\n* Insecticide activity\n**Application Uses**\n* Soap\n* Perfumes\n* Cosmetics\n* **Gels**\n* Deodorants\n* Sprays\n* Acne treatments\n* Candles\n* **Lotions**\n...\n\n### **Primary Benefits**\n* Antiseptic\n* Antidepressant\n* Antispasmodic\n* Digestive\n* Anti-inflammatory\n* Carminative\n* Diuretic\n* Pesticide\n\nThe orange essential oil has different uses and the application depends on the usages. Most commonly\norange oil is used in skincare & in oil burners as a calming fragrance. Dilute the essential oils\nwith a carrier oil for the best results as they are very concentrated. Carrier oil mix well with\nessential oils and helps take them within the skin. AG Organica is one of the leading manufacturers\nof orange essential oil. We assure you that all our products adhere to the highest criteria of\nsafety and quality. We offer natural & organic forms of essential oils to our customers. Our\nproducts are free from all chemicals, additives, & fillers. They also do not carry any artificial\ncolors, preservatives, and fragrances.\n* Keep away from children.\n* If pregnant or nursing, consult your doctor.\n* Avoid contact with eyes, inner ears, and sensitive areas.\n\n**Disclaimer : **The information provided is general and you must take medical advice before using\nthis product. A.G Organica or associated business entities don't guarantee the accuracy of the\ninformation. Please consult your doctor, especially if being used during pregnancy or any allergy,\nhealth issues.\n\n## **Private Label Orange Essential Oils**\n\nElevate your brand with our premium Private Label services tailored for Orange Essential Oil. As\nindustry leaders in essential oils, we offer you the opportunity to craft a unique product line that\nembodies quality, purity, and the vibrant essence of oranges.\n\n**Why Choose Our Private Label Services?**\n1. **Uncompromising Quality**: We source the finest oranges from trusted suppliers to ensure the\nhighest quality oil for your products. Our rigorous quality control measures guarantee purity and\npotency, meeting the stringent standards of the industry.\n2. **Customized Branding**: Stand out in the market with personalized branding that reflects your\nvision. From label design to packaging, our team works closely with you to create a cohesive\nbrand identity that resonates with your target audience.\n3. **Flexible Solutions**: Whether you're a small boutique or a large-scale retailer, our flexible\nsolutions cater to businesses of all sizes. Choose from a range of packaging options, quantities,\nand formulations to suit your specific needs.\n4. **Expert Guidance**: With years of experience in the industry, our team of experts provides\ncomprehensive guidance every step of the way. From formulation advice to marketing strategies,\nwe're here to support you in building a successful product line.\n5. **Quick Turnaround**: We understand the importance of timeliness in today's competitive market.\nOur streamlined processes ensure quick turnaround times without compromising on quality, allowing\nyou to bring your products to market swiftly.\n\n**Unlock the Potential of Orange Essential Oil**\n\nKnown for its invigorating scent and numerous therapeutic benefits, Orange Essential Oil is a\nversatile ingredient that can enhance a wide range of products. From skincare to aromatherapy, its\nuplifting aroma and antioxidant properties make it a popular choice among consumers.\n\nWhether you're looking to expand your existing product line or venture into new territory, our\nPrivate Label services offer you the opportunity to capitalize on the popularity of Orange Essential\nOil while showcasing your brand's unique identity.\n\n**Get Started Today**\n\nTake the first step towards creating your own signature line of Orange Essential Oil products.\nContact us to learn more about our Private Label services and discover how we can help you elevate\nyour brand to new heights. Let's embark on this journey together and unleash the full potential of\nOrange Essential Oil.\n\nOrange oil belongs to the Citrus & Rutaceae family. It is native to China. It is used in cosmetics,\nsoaps, perfumes & more. AG Organica is the leading manufacturer & supplier of orange oil. It has\nextreme shelf-life stability. It is repellent to high temperatures. Yes, it's safe to use. However,\ndo not forget to dilute it and if you've got sensitive skin then you can also perform a skin test on\nyour elbow to test its compatibility together with your skin. Yes, sweet orange oil helps in teeth\nwhitening and is also suitable for gum health thanks to its anti-fungal properties. No, we've\nformulated sweet orange oil for external use only.\n\nRead more\n\n**Blog**\n\nTechnical\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Botanical Name** \u2502**:**\u2502**Citrus sinensis**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Parts Used** \u2502: \u2502Fruit Peel\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Color & Odor** \u2502: \u2502Yellow orange to dark orange @22\u00b0C with Fruit/peel scent\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Methods of Extraction**\u2502: \u2502Steam Distillation\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25