\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n17% off\n\n# Regeneration Night Cream\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03361\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $9.90 17% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n17% off\n\nVolumen: 50 ml | 1.69 FL.OZ\n\nExperience the nighttime rejuvenation of your skin with Rosamix Night Cream. This luxurious cream\ncombines the nourishing properties of shea butter with a blend of advanced ingredients to tighten\nand enrich your skin. Suitable for both face and neck, this night cream provides full care for all\nskin types.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Regenerative Effect:** Promotes nighttime skin [regeneration][27], leaving your skin refreshed\nby morning.\n* **Firming Care:** A complex of advanced ingredients tightens the skin and enhances its elasticity.\n* **Nutrient-Rich:** Enriched with shea butter, providing the skin with healthy fats and maintaining\nits elasticity.\n* **Antioxidant Properties: **Pomegranate oil, rich in antioxidants, helps brighten the skin and\nreduce pigmentation.\n* **Suitable for All Skin Types:** Gentle enough for every skin type, offering comprehensive\nanti-aging care.\n\nIdeal for nightly use, apply this night cream before bed and wake up to noticeably refreshed and\nrejuvenated skin. The pomegranate oil in the cream offers numerous benefits, including a high\nconcentration of antioxidants that help bri