es\nskin elasticity and reduces pigmentation. Vitamin E soothes the skin and protects against\nenvironmental factors, while olive oil provides moisture and prevents dryness. Hemp seed oil\ndelivers valuable vitamins and fatty acids, nourishing and revitalizing the skin. Rose oil helps\nmaintain skin elasticity and ensures a fresh skine tone.\n\nDiscover the beneficial properties of our replenishing face serum and enjoy healthy, radiant skin.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply 2-3 drops on dry skin, morning and evening.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nDIMETHICONE, DIMETHICONE CROSSPOLYMER, C15-19 ALKANE, ARGANIA SPINOSA (ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PUNICA\nGRANATUM (POMEGRANATE) SEED OIL, ROSA CANINA SEED OIL, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, CANNABIS\nSATIVA SEED OIL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, CITRUS AURANTIUM AMARA FLOWER OIL, ROSA DAMASCENA FLOWER\nEXTRACT.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][41]\n* [ ][42]\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][45]\n\n[Amer