PICHA OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[Nourishing Conditioner - Argan & Oblipicha Oil]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[NOURISHING CONDITIONER - ARGAN & OBLIPICHA OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[NOURISHING CONDITIONER - ARGAN & OBLIPICHA OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[NOURISHING CONDITIONER - ARGAN & OBLIPICHA OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[NOURISHING CONDITIONER - ARGAN & OBLIPICHA OIL - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Nourishment:** The conditioner delivers intensive care with keratin and hyaluronic acid to\nstrengthen and revitalize hair fibers.\n* **Repair and Protection:** Repairs damage caused by environmental factors and chemical treatments,\nprotecting hair from future harm.\n* **Healthy and Shiny Hair:** The combination of hemp oil and olive oil gives hair a healthy, full,\nsoft, and shiny appearance.\n* **Suitable for All Hair Types:** Ideal for all hair types, ensuring smooth, easily manageable\nhair.\n* **Free from Harmful Additives:** No salts or SLS \u2013 for gentle and safe use.\n\nThis professional conditioner is perfect for daily use. High-quality ingredients like keratin and\nhyaluronic acid provide deep nourishment, restoring your hair's natural strength and shine. Hemp oil\nand Galilean olive oil add extra moisture and protection, keeping your hair healthy and vibrant.\n\nExperience the exceptional benefits of our conditioner and enjoy healthy, strong and shiny hair.\n\n### Directions\n\nafter shampooing, apply from mid,length to ends. Leave on for 1\u20132 minutes and rinse well.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), CETYL ALCOHOL, DIPALMITOYLETHYL HYDROXYETHYLMONIUM METHOSULFATE, HYALURONIC ACID,\nAMODIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, ACRYLAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE/ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, FRAGRANCE,\nOLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), ISOHEXADECANE, HYDROLYZED\nKERATIN, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TRIDECETH-12, SEA BUCKTHORN\n(HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, COCETH-7, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n# Nourishing Conditioner - Argan & Oblipicha Oil\n\nRegular price $9.90\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n\nVolumen: 500 ml | FL.OZ 16.9\n\nOur Hair Conditioner with argan oil is the ultimate solution for those seeking intensive care and\nrevitalization for their hair. Formulated with a unique blend of keratin and hyaluronic acid, this\nhair conditioner provides deep treatment, helping to repair damage from environmental changes and\nchemical styling.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Nourishment:** The conditioner delivers intensive care with keratin and hyaluronic acid to\nstrengthen and revitalize hair fibers.\n* **Repair and Protection:** Repairs damage caused by environmental factors and chemical treatments,\nprotecting hair from future harm.\n* **Healthy and Shiny Hair:** The combination of hemp oil and olive oil gives hair a healthy, full,\nsoft, and shiny appearance.\n* **Suitable for All Hair Types:** Ideal for all hair types, ensuring smooth, easily manageable\nhair.\n* **Free from Harmful Additives:** No salts or SLS \u2013 for gentle and safe use.\n\nThis professional conditioner is perfect for daily use. High-quality ingredients like keratin and\nhyaluronic acid provide deep nourishment, restoring your hair's natural strength and shine. Hemp oil\nand Galilean olive oil add extra moisture and protection, keeping your hair healthy and vibrant.\n\nExperience the exceptional benefits of our conditioner and enjoy healthy, strong and shiny hair.\n\n### Directions\n\nafter shampooing, apply from mid,length to ends. Leave on for 1\u20132 minutes and rinse well.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), CETYL ALCOHOL, DIPALMITOYLETHYL HYDROXYETHYLMONIUM METHOSULFATE, HYALURONIC ACID,\nAMODIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, ACRYLAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE/ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, FRAGRANCE,\nOLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), ISOHEXADECANE, HYDROLYZED\nKERATIN, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TRIDECETH-12, SEA BUCKTHORN\n(HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, COCETH-7, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][41]\n* [ ][42]\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][45]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Googl