 OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[NOURISHING SHAMPOO WITH ARGAN OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[NOURISHING SHAMPOO WITH ARGAN OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[NOURISHING SHAMPOO WITH ARGAN OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[NOURISHING SHAMPOO WITH ARGAN OIL - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Hydration:** This formula delivers deep moisture to combat dryness and leave hair smooth\nand supple.\n* **Nourishing and Repairing:** Enriched with Aloe Vera and Argan oil, it helps repair damaged hair\nstructures and promotes healthy hair growth.\n* **Easy to Detangle: **Makes hair easy to comb through, reducing breakage during styling.\n* **Natural Shine: **Sea buckthorn and Galilean olive oil give your hair a natural, healthy shine.\n* **Suitable for All Hair Types:** Ideal for daily care, this shampoo works well for all hair types.\n\nOur shampoo with argan oil is the perfect choice for anyone looking to give their hair special care.\nThe Aloe Vera in the formula provides intense moisture to hair and scalp, while Argan oil and sea\nbuckthorn strengthen and smooth the hair structure. The result is soft, shiny and healthy hair. Pair\nit with other [natural hair care products][25] for a complete hair care routine. For best results,\nwe recommend regular use along with a nourishing conditioner or hair mask.\n\nGive your hair the care it deserves with our nourishing and repairing hair shampoo.\n\n### Directions\n\nWet hair, apply the shampoo, lather and then add more water. Leave on hair for around 2 minutes and\nthen rinse off. For best results, pair with our Rosamix Conditioner.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), SODIUM COCETH SULFATE, COCAMIDE DEA, SODIUM CHLORIDE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, PEG-12\nDIMETHICONE, HYALURONIC ACID, AMODIMETHICONE, HYDROLYZED KERATIN, FRAGRANCE, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE,\nCITRIC ACID, ALOE VERA (ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF POWDER) , TRIDECETH-12, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT)\nOIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), SEA BUCKTHORN (HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, FD&C\nBlue No. 1, TRIETHYLENE GLYCOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYETHANOL,\nMAGNESIUM CHLORIDE, MAGNESIUM NITRATE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN,METHYLCHLOROISOTHIAZOLINO NE,\nMETHYLISOTHIAZOLINONE.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n# Nourishing Shampoo With Argan Oil\n\nRegular price $9.90\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n\nVolumen: 500 ml | FL.OZ 16.9\n\nDiscover the nourishing power of our specially formulated shampoo with argan oil, designed to\nprovide your hair with intense hydration and a healthy, glossy appearance. Infused with a unique\nblend of Aloe Vera, sea buckthorn (Obliphicha), Argan oil and Galilean olive oil, this argan oil\nhair shampoo ensures optimal care and easy manageability.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Hydration:** This formula delivers deep moisture to combat dryness and leave hair smooth\nand supple.\n* **Nourishing and Repairing:** Enriched with Aloe Vera and Argan oil, it helps repair damaged hair\nstructures and promotes healthy hair growth.\n* **Easy to Detangle: **Makes hair easy to comb through, reducing breakage during styling.\n* **Natural Shine: **Sea buckthorn and Galilean olive oil give your hair a natural, healthy shine.\n* **Suitable for All Hair Types:** Ideal for daily care, this shampoo works well for all hair types.\n\nOur shampoo with argan oil is the per