[HAIR MASK - KERATIN & HYALURONIC ACID - ROSAMIX]\n[HAIR MASK - KERATIN & HYALURONIC ACID - ROSAMIX]\n[HAIR MASK - KERATIN & HYALURONIC ACID - ROSAMIX]\n[HAIR MASK - KERATIN & HYALURONIC ACID - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Intensive Regeneration:** Deeply nourishes and helps to regenerate and strengthen hair\nstructure.\n* **Damage Protection:** Shields hair from harmful environmental factors and chemical treatment\neffects.\n* **Healthy and Shiny Hair: **Gives hair a healthy, full, soft, and shiny appearance.\n* **Suitable for All Hair Types:** Ideal for all hair types, ensuring smooth and easily manageable\nhair.\n* **Free from Harmful Additives:** Contains no salts or SLS, ensuring gentle and safe use.\n\nOur Restorative Hair Mask is perfect for weekly use. Due to its premium ingredients like keratin and\nhyaluronic acid, your hair receives deep nourishment and strength. This mask helps restore your\nhair\u2019s natural beauty and protects it from future damage. The addition of nourishing oils provides\nextra moisture and a brilliant shine.\n\nPamper your hair with our Restorative Hair Mask and enjoy the feeling of healthy, strong and shiny\nhair.\n\n### Directions\n\nAfter washing the hair, spread a generous amount on the palm of the hand and apply with the fingers\nalong the entire length of the hair towards the ends. Leave on the hair for 2-3 minutes and wash.\nSuitable for everyday use. For faster results, it is recommended to use Rosamix shampoo &\nconditioner.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), STEARYL ALCOHOL, CRAMBE ABYSSINICA SEED OIL PHYTOSTEROL ESTERS,\nCOCO-CAPRYLATE/CAPRATE, HYALURONIC ACID, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROLYZED KERATIN, DIMETHICONE,\nAMODIMETHICONE, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT)\nOIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ISOPROPYL MYRISTATE, CETYL\nALCOHOL, ARACHIDYL ALCOHOL, TRIDECETH-12, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, MYRISTYL ALCOHOL, FRAGRANCE, BUTYLENE\nGLYCOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n27% off\n\n# Hair Mask - Keratin & Hyaluronic Acid\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03364\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $10.90 27% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n27% off\n\nVolumen: 250 ml | FL.OZ 8.45\n\nDiscover the transformative power of our Restorative Hair Mask. This therapeutic mask is\nspecifically designed to provide your hair with intensive care and revitalization. Enriched with\nkeratin and hyaluronic acid, it helps protect and strengthen your hair from environmental damage and\nthe effects of chemical treatments.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Intensive Regeneration:** Deeply nourishes and helps to regenerate and strengthen hair\nstructure.\n* **Damage Protection:** Shields hair from harmful environmental factors and chemical treatment\neffects.\n* **Healthy and Shiny Hair: **Gives hair a healthy, full, soft, and shiny appearance.\n* **Suitable for All Hair Types:** Ideal for all hair types, ensuring smooth and easily manageable\nhair.\n* **Free from Harmful Additives:** Contains no salts or SLS, ensuring gentle and safe use.\n\nOur Restorative Hair Mask is perfect for weekly use. Due to its premium ingredients like keratin and\nhyaluronic acid, your hair receives deep nourishment and strength. This mask helps restore your\nhair\u2019s natural beauty and protects it from future damage. The addition of nourishing oils provides\nextra moisture and a brilliant shine.\n\nPamper your hair with our Restorative Hair Mask and enjoy the feeling of healthy, strong and shiny\nhair.\n\n### Directions\n\nAfter washing the hair, spread a generous amount on the palm of the hand and apply with the fingers\nalong the entire length of the hair towards the ends. Leave on the hair for 2-3 minutes and wash.\nSuitable for everyday use. For faster results, it is recommended to use Rosamix shampoo &\nconditioner.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), STEARYL ALCOHOL, CRAMBE ABYSSINICA SEED OIL PHYTOSTEROL ESTERS,\nCOCO-CAPRYLATE/CAPRATE, HYALURONIC ACID, BEHENTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, HYDROLYZED KERATIN, DIMETHICONE,\nAMODIMETHICONE, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT)\nOIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ISOPROPYL MYRISTATE, CETYL\nALCOHOL, ARACHIDYL ALCOHOL, TRIDECETH-12, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, MYRISTYL ALCOHOL, FRAGRANCE, BUTYLENE\nGLYCOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\n