            "text": "FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $50\n* [ ][1]\n* [ ][2]\n* [ ][3]\n* [ ][4]\n[ Skip to content ][5]\nROSAMIX ][6]\n* [ SKIN CARE ][7]\n* [ HAIR CARE ][8]\n* [ BODY CARE ][9]\n* [ CARRIER OIL ][10]\n* [ ESSENTIAL OIL ][11]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n[ ][12]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n#### Login\n\nEmail\nPassword Forgot password?\nSign in\nNew customer? [Create account][13]\n\n## Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail address Submit\nCancel\n$0.00\n][14]\n[ ][15]\nROSAMIX ][16]\n[ ][17]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n* [SKIN CARE][18]\n* [HAIR CARE][19]\n* [BODY CARE][20]\n* [CARRIER OIL][21]\n* [ESSENTIAL OIL][22]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][23]\n1. [Home][24]\n2. Treatment Hair Oil\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[Treatment Hair Oil]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[Treatment Hair Oil]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[TREATMENT HAIR OIL - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Intensive Regeneration:** The rich blend of [argan][25], castor, jojoba, and avocado oils helps\nto repair damaged hair and strengthen its overall structure.\n* **Protection and Care:** Provides effective protection against environmental stressors while\nmaintaining the hair's natural moisture.\n* **Vibrant Shine: **Gives hair a natural, healthy shine and improves manageability.\n* **Versatile Application: **Suitable for all hair types, whether used as a tip treatment or an\nintensive hair mask.\n* **Natural Ingredients: **Includes high-quality Galilean olive oil for additional nourishment and\ncare.\n\nThis treatment hair oil is perfect for daily hair care. Apply a few drops to your hands, distribute\nevenly through the lengths and ends of towel-dried or dry hair. Argan oil in the formula intensively\nnourishes and protects the hair, while castor and jojoba oils strengthen the hair structure which\nadds softness. Avocado oil provides essential nutrients and Galilean olive oil completes the care by\noffering extra protection and moisture.\n\nDiscover the benefits of our Treatment Hair Oil and give your hair newfound vitality and shine.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply a small amount along the hair after showering, apply as needed.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nGRAPE (VITIS VINIFERA) SEED OIL, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, SUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS\nANNUUS SEED) OIL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), CRAMBE\nABYSSINICA SEED OIL PHYTOSTEROL ESTERS, AVOCADO (PERSEA GRATISSIMA) OIL, JOJOBA (SIMMONDSIA\nCHINENSIS) SEED OIL, FENUGREEK (TRIGONELLA FOENUM-GRAECUM) SEED OIL, CASTOR (RICINUS COMMUNIS SEED)\nOIL, SEA BUCKTHORN (HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, WHEAT\n(TRITICUM VULGARE) GERM OIL, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, ROSEMARY (ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS\nFLOWER) OIL, LINALOOL, LIMONENE.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n30% off\n\n# Treatment Hair Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03366\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $11.90 30% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n30% off\n\nVolumen: 50 ml | 1.69 FL.OZ\n\nRevitalize your hair with a new level of shine and vitality using our Treatment Hair Oil. This\nexclusive formula combines the restorative and protective properties of argan, castor, jojoba and\navocado oils. Enhanced with premium Galilean olive oil, this hair oil delivers comprehensive care\nand vibrancy.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Intensive Regeneration:** The rich blend of [argan][27], castor, jojoba, and avocado oils helps\nto repair damaged hair and strengthen its overall structure.\n* **Protection and Care:** Provides effective protection against environmental stressors while\nmaintaining the hair's natural moisture.\n* **Vibrant Shine: **Gives hair a natural, healthy shine and improves manageability.\n* **Versatile Application: **Suitable for all hair types, whether used as a tip treatment or an\nintensive hair mask.\n* **Natural Ingredients: **Includes high-quality Galilean olive oil for additional nourishment and\ncare.\n\nThis treatment hair oil is perfect for daily hair care. Apply a few drops to your hands, distribute\nevenly through the lengths and ends of towel-dried or dry hair. Argan oil in the formula intensively\nnourishes and protects the hair, while castor and jojoba oils strengthen the hair structure which\nadds softness. Avocado oil provides essential nutrients and Galilean olive oil completes the care by\noffering extra protection and moisture.\n\nDiscover the benefits of our Treatment Hair Oil and give your hair newfound vitality and shine.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply a small amount along the hair after showering, apply as needed.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nGRAPE (VITIS VINIFERA) SEED OIL, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, SUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS\nANNUUS SEED) OIL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), CRAMBE\nABYSSINICA SEED OIL PHYTOSTEROL ESTERS, AVOCADO (PERSEA GRATISSIMA) OIL, JOJOBA (SIMMONDSIA\nCHINENSIS) SEED OIL, FENUGREEK (TRIGONELLA FOENUM-GRAECUM) SEED OIL, CASTOR (RICINUS COMMUNIS SEED)\nOIL, SEA BUCKTHORN (HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, WHEAT\n(TRITICUM VULGARE) GERM OIL, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, ROSEMARY (ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS\nFLOWER) OIL, LINALOOL, LIMONENE.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][28]\n* [About Us][29]\n* [Skin Care][30]\n* [Body Care][31]\n* [Hair Care][32]\n* [Essential Oil][33]\n* [Carrier Oil][34]\n* [Blog][35]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][36]\n* [Privacy Policy][37]\n* [Cookie Policy][38]\n* [Shipping Policy][39]\n* [Refund Policy][40]\n* [Contact Us][41]\n* [FAQ][42]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* [ ][46]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][47]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://