ING - ROSAMIX]\n* [APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n* [APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n* [APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n* [APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[Apricot Face & Body Cream Peeling]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n[APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Gentle Exfoliation:** Effectively removes dead skin cells and impurities, leaving your skin soft\nand smooth.\n* **Nutrient-Packed:** Infused with hyaluronic acid, shea butter, and vitamins E and C for deep\nhydration and nourishment.\n* **Natural Oil Blend:** Enriched with sweet almond, castor, sunflower, and [Galilean olive oil][25]\nto maintain skin's elasticity and suppleness.\n* **Skin Renewal:** Promotes skin regeneration, resulting in a radiant and healthy complexion.\n* **Multi-Purpose:** Suitable for both face and body, providing comprehensive care and a refreshing\nexperience.\n\nIdeal for regular use, apply a small amount of the peeling cream to your moist skin and massage in\ngentle, circular motions. The natural exfoliating particles combined with nourishing ingredients\nensure your skin stays refreshed and smooth. Hyaluronic acid and shea butter deliver intense\nmoisture, while vitamins E and C offer antioxidant protection. The blend of sweet almond, castor and\nsunflower oils, along with Galilean olive oil, deeply nourishes and supports the skin\u2019s natural\nrenewal process.\n\nExperience the revitalizing power of our Apricot Peeling cream and enjoy a smooth, silky skin feel\nevery day.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply the peeling cream and leave on for 1 - 2 minutes. Then gently massage and with the fingertips\nand rinse using warm water.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), APRICOT KERNEL (PRUNUS ARMENIACA SEED) POWDER, GLYCERIN, SHEA BUTTER (BUTYROSPERMUM\nPARKII BUTTER), SUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS ANNUUS SEED) OIL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, HYDROGENATED ETHYLHEXYL\nOLIVATE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, CASTOR (RICINUS COMMUNIS\nSEED) OIL, HYALURONIC ACID, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE,\nPHYTOSTEROLS, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA SEED)\nOIL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, FRAGRANCE, TETRASODIUM EDTA, XANTHAN GUM, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, SODIUM\nHYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n27% off\n\n# Apricot Face & Body Cream Peeling\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03364\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $10.90 27% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n27% off\n\nVolumen: 250 ml | FL.OZ 8.45\n\nDiscover the rejuvenating benefits of our Apricot Face & Body Scrub Cream. Expertly crafted with\nfinely ground apricot kernels and a luxurious blend of sweet almond, castor and sunflower oils, this\npeeling cream gently exfoliates dead skin cells and impurities while nourishing and soothing your\nskin. As part of our premium apricot skin care products, it provides a deeply refreshing experience\nfor your face and body.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Gentle Exfoliation:** Effectively removes dead skin cells and impurities, leaving your skin soft\nand smooth.\n* **Nutrient-Packed:** Infused with hyaluronic acid, shea butter, and vitamins E and C for deep\nhydration and nourishment.\n* **Natural Oil Blend:** Enriched with sweet almond, castor, sunflower, and [Galilean olive oil][27]\nto maintain skin's elasticity and suppleness.\n* **Skin Renewal:** Promotes skin regeneration, resulting in a radiant and healthy complexion.\n* **Multi-Purpose:** Suitable for both face and body, providing comprehensive care and a refreshing\nexperience.\n\nIdeal for regular use, apply a small amount of the peeling cream to your moist skin and massage in\ngentle, circular motions. The natural exfoliating particles combined with nourishing ingredients\nensure your skin stays refreshed and smooth. Hyaluronic acid and shea butter deliver intense\nmoisture, while vitamins E and C offer antioxidant protection. The blend of sweet almond, castor and\nsunflower oils, along with Galilean olive oil, deeply nourishes and supports the skin\u2019s natural\nrenewal process.\n\nExperience the revitalizing power of our Apricot Peeling cream and enjoy a smooth, silky skin feel\nevery day.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply the peeling cream and leave on for 1 - 2 minutes. Then gently massage and with the fingertips\nand rinse using warm water.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), APRICOT KERNEL (PRUNUS ARMENIACA SEED) POWDER, GLYCERIN, SHEA BUTTER (BUTYROSPERMUM\nPARKII BUTTER), SUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS ANNUUS SEED) OIL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, HYDROGENATED ETHYLHEXYL\nOLIVATE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, CASTOR (RICINUS COMMUNIS\nSEED) OIL, HYALURONIC ACID, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, PHENOXYETHANOL, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE,\nPHYTOSTEROLS, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA SEED)\nOIL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, FRAGRANCE, TETRASODIUM EDTA, XANTHAN GUM, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, SODIUM\nHYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][28]\n* [About Us][29]\n* [Skin Care][30]\n* [Body Care][31]\n* [Hair Care][32]\n* [Essential Oil][33]\n* [Carrier Oil][34]\n* [Blog][35]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][36]\n* [Privacy Policy][37]\n* [Cookie Policy][38]\n* [Shipping Policy][39]\n* [Refund Policy][40]\n* [Contact Us][41]\n* [FAQ][42]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* [ ][46]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][47]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[3]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[4]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[5]: #main\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/skin-care\n[8]: /collections/hair-care\n[9]: /collections/body-care\n[10]: /collections/natural-oils\n[11]: /collections/essential-oil\n[12]: /account\n[13]: https://account.rosamix.us?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyb3NhbWl4bmF0\ndXJlLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgyMTgxOCwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE3MDE4fQ.cXMCRwefZ-ZnU\nwENf6Pp9P1HNV2cMRpdZEb0vxQtghY\n[14]: /cart\n[15]: /search\