ightens skin\nfor a smoother appearance. Experience the warming sensation as you apply, leaving your skin deeply\nhydrated and revitalized. Perfect for thighs, abdomen, and arms\u2014your journey to firmer skin starts\nhere!\n\n### Directions\n\nMassage the cream into the skin in circular motions. Use twice a day for best results. you will feel\nthe heat after a few minutes.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), CETEARYL ALCOHOL, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, SHEA BUTTER\n(BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER), CETYL ALCOHOL, IPM (ISOPROPYL MYRISTATE), CETEARETH-33, GLYCERIN,\nPHENOXYETHANOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA SEED) OIL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE,\nFRAGRANCE, VANILLYL BUTYL ETHER, GUARANA (PAULLINIA CUPANA) EXTRACT, ALLANTOIN, CAFFEINE,\nETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, CAPSICUM OLEORESIN (CAPSICUM FRUTESCENS RESIN), TETRASODIUM EDTA, SILOXANETRIOL\nALGINATE, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Do not apply to face. Do not use on spots with injury, burns, wounds, or\nother skin sensitivities. Wash your hands after application. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of\nreach of children.\nA patch test on a small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right\nproduct for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n*This product does not treat cellulite, but simply improve the texture and looking of the skin.\n* not suitable for sensitive skin.\n\n# Anti Cellulite Hot Cream\n\nRegular price $14.90\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n\nVolumen: 250 ml | FL.OZ 8.45\n\nRosamix\u00ae Anti Cellulite & Anti Stretch Marks Hot Cream is a very effective anti-cellulite cream with\nuseful ingredients such as Guarana (Paullinia cupana), Caffeine and Vanillyl Butyl Ether which are\nknown for their ability to tighten the skin and effectively reduce the appearance of cellulite.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\nTransform your skin with our rejuvenating cream designed to combat cellulite and stretch marks.\nInfused with caffeine, guarana, and nourishing vitamins, it promotes circulation and tightens skin\nfor a smoother appearance. Experience the warming sensation as you apply, leaving your skin deeply\nhydrated and revitalized. Perfect for thighs, abdomen, and arms\u2014your journey to firmer skin starts\nhere!\n\n### Directions\n\nMassage the cream into the skin in circular motions. Use twice a day for best results. you will feel\nthe heat after a few minutes.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), CETEARYL ALCOHOL, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, SHEA BUTTER\n(BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER), CETYL ALCOHOL, IPM (ISOPROPYL MYRISTATE), CETEARETH-33, GLYCERIN,\nPHENOXYETHANOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA SEED) OIL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE,\nFRAGRANCE, VANILLYL BUTYL ETHER, GUARANA (PAULLINIA CUPANA) EXTRACT, ALLANTOIN, CAFFEINE,\nETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, CAPSICUM OLEORESIN (CAPSICUM FRUTESCENS RESIN), TETRASODIUM EDTA, SILOXANETRIOL\nALGINATE, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Do not apply to face. Do not use on spots with injury, burns, wounds, or\nother skin sensitivities. Wash your hands after application. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of\nreach of children.\nA patch test on a small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right\nproduct for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n*This product does not treat cellulite, but simply improve the texture and looking of the skin.\n* not suitable for sensitive skin.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][41]\n* [ ][42]\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][45]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[3]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[4]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[5]: #main\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/skin-care\n[8]: /collections/hair-care\n[9]: /collections/body-care\n[10]: /collections/natural-oils\n[11]: /collections/essential-oil\n[12]: /account\n[13]: https://account.rosamix.us?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyb3NhbWl4bmF0\ndXJlLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgyMTgyMCwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE3MDIwfQ.EphHZcagIaCzv\nUBv60hizXsoxQnaDja5accJCuyEKmQ&consent=s0\n[14]: /cart\n[15]: /search\n[16]: /\n[17]: /cart\n[18]: /collections/skin-care\n[19]: /collections/hair-care\n[20]: /collections/body-care\n[21]: /collections/natural-oils\n[22]: /collections/essential-oil\n[23]: /collections\n[24]: /\n[25]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[26]: /\n[27]: /pages/us-rosamix\n[28]: /collections/skin-care\n[29]: /collections/body-care\n[30]: /collections/hair-care\n[31]: /collections/essential-oil\n[32]: /collections/natural-oils\n[33]: /blogs/news\n[34]: /policies/terms-of-service\n[35]: /policies/privacy-policy\n[36]: /page