itamins E and C, which nourish the skin and protect it from\nenvironmental damage.\n* **Suitable for All Skin Types:** Versatile and ideal for very dry areas on hands, feet, elbows,\nand knees.\n* **Rich Formulation:** Includes Galilean olive oil and other plant oils for a rich, softening care\nthat leaves your skin silky smooth.\n* **Deep Penetration:** Penetrates deeply into the skin, ensuring long-lasting hydration and care.\n\nThis moisturizing body cream is perfect for daily use and particularly effective on very dry skin\nareas. Apply generously to hands, feet, elbows and knees, and massage gently until fully absorbed.\nThe rich formulation ensures that your skin stays soft and smooth all day long. Hyaluronic acid and\nshea butter provide intense hydration, while vitamins E and C nourish and protect the skin.\n[Galilean olive oil][25] and other botanical oils offer a rich care that regenerates and smooths\nparticularly dry skin.\n\nExperience the soothing care of our Body Cream and enjoy smooth and well-nourished skin.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply liberally as often as needed.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), ISONONYL ISONONANOATE, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, GLYCERIN, CETEARYL\nALCOHOL, SODIUM PCA, JOJOBA (SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS) SEED OIL, SHEA BUTTER (BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII\nBUTTER), STEARYL ALCOHOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BEESWAX (CERA ALBA), CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE,\nXYLITYLGLUCOSIDE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, HYALURONIC ACID, CHAMOMILE HYDROLAT (CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA FLOWER\nWATER), PHENOXYETHANOL, ANHYDROXYLITOL, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, OLIVE\n(OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, XANTHAN GUM,\nXYLITOL, POMEGRANATE (PUNICA GRANATUM) SEED OIL, FRAGRANCE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TETRASODIUM EDTA,\nCALENDULA OFFICINALIS FLOWER EXTRACT, CETYL ALCOHOL, ARACHIDYL ALCOHOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, MYRISTYL\nALCOHOL, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n13% off\n\n# Body Moisturizing Cream\n\nRegular price $\u03367\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $6.90 13% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n13% off\n\nVolumen: 250 ml | FL.OZ 8.45\n\nOur Body Moisturizing Cream offers a rich, nourishing formula designed to deeply moisturize your\nskin. Enriched with botanical oils and butters, this high-quality body cream is suitable for all\nskin types and especially effective on very dry areas.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Hydration:** Infused with hyaluronic acid and shea butter, this cream provides intense\nmoisture, leaving your skin smooth and supple.\n* **Nutrient-Rich: **Contains vitamins E and C, which nourish the skin and protect it from\nenvironmental damage.\n* **Suitable for All Skin Types:** Versatile and ideal for very dry areas on hands, feet, elbows,\nand knees.\n* **Rich Formulation:** Includes Galilean olive oil and other plant oils for a rich, softening care\nthat leaves your skin silky smooth.\n* **Deep Penetration:** Penetrates deeply into the skin, ensuring long-lasting hydration and care.\n\nThis moisturizing body cream is perfect for daily use and particularly effective on very dry skin\nareas. Apply generously to hands, feet, elbows and knees, and massage gently until fully absorbed.\nThe rich formulation ensures that your skin stays soft and smooth all day long. Hyaluronic acid and\nshea butter provide intense hydration, while vitamins E and C nourish and protect the skin.\n[Galilean olive oil][27] and other botanical oils offer a rich care that regenerates and smooths\nparticularly dry skin.\n\nExperience the soothing care of our Body Cream and enjoy smooth and well-nourished skin.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply liberally as often as needed.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), ISONONYL ISONONANOATE, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, GLYCERIN, CETEARYL\nALCOHOL, SODIUM PCA, JOJOBA (SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS) SEED OIL, SHEA BUTTER (BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII\nBUTTER), STEARYL ALCOHOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BEESWAX (CERA ALBA), CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE,\nXYLITYLGLUCOSIDE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, HYALURONIC ACID, CHAMOMILE HYDROLAT (CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA FLOWER\nWATER), PHENOXYETHANOL, ANHYDROXYLITOL, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, OLIVE\n(OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, XANTHAN GUM,\nXYLITOL, POMEGRANATE (PUNICA GRANATUM) SEED OIL, FRAGRANCE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TETRASODIUM EDTA,\nCALENDULA OFFICINALIS FLOWER EXTRACT, CETYL ALCOHOL, ARACHIDYL ALCOHOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, MYRISTYL\nALCOHOL, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][28]\n* [About Us][29]\n* [Skin Care][30]\n* [Body Care][31]\n* [Hair Care][32]\n* [Essential Oil][33]\n* [Carrier Oil][34]\n* [Blog][35]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][36]\n* [Privacy Policy][37]\n* [Cookie Policy][38]\n* [Shipping Policy][39]\n* [Refund Policy][40]\n* [Contact Us][41]\n* [FAQ][42]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* [ ][46]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][47]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[3]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[4]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[5]: #main\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/skin-care\n[8]: /collections/hair-care\n[9]: /collections/body-care\n[10]: /collections/natural-oils\n[11]: /collections/essential-oil\n[12]: /account\n[13]: https://account.rosamix.us?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyb3NhbWl4bmF0\ndXJlLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgyMTgyMywibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE3MDIzfQ.NDMS_5p5v-Nff\n0FD3jRuAzKYRljrvUefqqmtKs1SrK0\n[14]: /cart\n[15]: /search\n[16]: /\n[17]: /cart\n[18]: /collections/skin-care\n[19]: /collections/hair-care\n[20]: /collections/body-care\n[21]: /collections/natural-oils\n[22]: /collections/essential-oil\n[23]: /collections\n[24]: /\n[25]: https://www.rosamix.us/blogs/blog/hero-ingredients-dead-sea-salt-water-and-olive-oil\n[26]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[27]: https://www.rosamix.us/blogs/blog/hero-ingredients-dead-sea-salt-water-and-olive-oil\n[28]: /\n[29]: /pages/us-rosamix\n[30]: /collections/skin-care\n[31]: /collections/body-care\n[32]: /collections/hair-care\n[33]: /collections/essential-oil\n[34]: /collections/natural-oils\n[35]: /blogs/news\n[36]: /policies/terms-of-service\n[37]: /policies/privacy-policy\n[38]: /pages/shipping-policy\n[39]: /policies/shipping-policy\n[40]: /policies/refund-policy\n[41]: /pages/contact-rosamix\n[42]: /pages/frequently-asked-questions\n[43]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[44]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[45]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[46]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[47]: /"
