            "text": "FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $50\n* [ ][1]\n* [ ][2]\n* [ ][3]\n* [ ][4]\n[ Skip to content ][5]\nROSAMIX ][6]\n* [ SKIN CARE ][7]\n* [ HAIR CARE ][8]\n* [ BODY CARE ][9]\n* [ CARRIER OIL ][10]\n* [ ESSENTIAL OIL ][11]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n[ ][12]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n#### Login\n\nEmail\nPassword Forgot password?\nSign in\nNew customer? [Create account][13]\n\n## Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail address Submit\nCancel\n$0.00\n][14]\n[ ][15]\nROSAMIX ][16]\n[ ][17]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n* [SKIN CARE][18]\n* [HAIR CARE][19]\n* [BODY CARE][20]\n* [CARRIER OIL][21]\n* [ESSENTIAL OIL][22]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][23]\n1. [Home][24]\n2. Foot Cream - For Dry & Cracked Skin\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[Foot Cream - For Dry & Cracked Skin]\n[Foot Cream - For Dry & Cracked Skin]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n* [FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[Foot Cream - For Dry & Cracked Skin]\n[Foot Cream - For Dry & Cracked Skin]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n[FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\nExperience the soothing benefits of our therapeutic **FOOT CREAM**, expertly crafted to deliver\nnoticeable results from the very first use. This premium formula is tailored for those who want to\nprovide exceptional care and hydration for their feet. Developed using high-quality, purposeful\ningredients, our product is designed to bring comfort, nourishment, and long-lasting moisture to\nyour daily routine. With every application, you\u2019ll discover renewed softness and healthy-looking\nskin as the visible effects of dryness begin to fade away.\n\n## Why Choose Our FOOT CREAM?\n\nOur **FOOT CREAM** stands out for its unique blend of ingredients that are chosen to target areas of\ndiscomfort and dehydration. The inclusion of [hemp oil][25], combined with Vitamin C, creates a\nformula that soothes, hydrates, and reinvigorates. Whether your skin has been exposed to rough\nsurfaces, long days, or the effects of environmental stressors, this advanced blend helps replenish\nand protect. Enjoy smooth, flexible skin after each application and reveal natural vitality with\nconsistent, daily use.\n\n### Key Benefits and Features of This Product\n* **Intensive Moisturization**: The core formulation with hemp oil penetrates deeply to restore lost\nmoisture and soften rough areas.\n* **Support for Healthy Skin**: Vitamin C supports the skin\u2019s natural repair processes and defends\nagainst external aggressors.\n* **Guards Against Dryness**: This formulation helps maintain hydration and comfort, so you\u2019re\nprotected from everyday exposure that leads to irritation.\n* **Promotes Skin Flexibility and Comfort**: Each use leaves skin feeling relaxed, supple, and\nrefreshed.\n* **Non-Greasy and Fast-Absorbing Texture**: Enjoy a lightweight feel that allows you to move about\nfreely after each application.\n\n## How to Best Use This FOOT CREAM\n\nFor optimal results, apply a generous layer of our nourishing formula to the areas that require the\nmost attention. Gently massage until the product is fully absorbed, concentrating on regions that\nfeel rough or require extra hydration. This process enhances absorption and locks in moisture,\nhelping your skin to remain conditioned and healthy. Repeat daily to experience lasting benefits and\nimproved skin texture with continued use.\n\n### Powerful Ingredients for Enhanced Care\n\nWhat sets our **FOOT CREAM** apart is the synergistic effect of its core ingredients. The hemp oil\ndelivers Omega fatty acids, which nourish and protect your skin\u2019s barrier. Vitamin C works as an\nantioxidant and encourages the skin\u2019s natural renewal cycle. Together, they create a protective\nshield that helps maintain moisture balance and leaves your skin looking vibrant day after day. This\ncareful combination targets common discomforts and provides visible relief, making every use a step\ntowards comfort and wellness.\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\nFor enhanced effectiveness, use our product after bathing or soaking your skin, as damp skin allows\nfor even deeper hydration. Focus on regions that may need more care, and apply extra product to\nthese sections as needed. Consistent, daily use will gradually help restore comfort, smooth texture,\nand confidence in the appearance of your skin. Incorporating this routine into your self-care\nregimen ensures long-term improvements and sustainable comfort.\n\n## Nourish Your Skin Every Day\n\nOur **FOOT CREAM** is designed for those who value both immediate results and long-term\nimprovements. The fast-absorbing, lightweight texture means you can easily apply it before bed or\nprior to putting on socks and shoes in the morning. The deeply hydrating formula relieves common\ndiscomforts and is especially suited for people who want preventative care that fits into a busy\nlifestyle. Enjoy total comfort every day and feel your confidence grow as your skin becomes\nprogressively softer.\n\n### Experience the Power of Nature\n\nWe believe in using nature-derived ingredients, such as premium hemp oil and Vitamin C, to deliver\nboth care and protection for your skin. These natural elements work in harmony to repair, protect,\nand revitalize. Our eco-conscious formula is perfect for regular use and supports an overall sense\nof well-being by helping you feel your best each day.\n\nIf you seek effective relief and everyday care, this is your gateway to healthier, more comfortable\nskin. Trust in our **FOOT CREAM** and create a daily routine that transforms your daily experience.\nBegin your journey to ultimate softness and embrace the difference that dedicated self-care can\nmake.\n\n### Directions\n\nWash your feet and dry them well. Apply the cream, massage it in well until fully absorbed.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nWATER (AQUA), UREA, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, LIQUID PARAFFIN (PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM), IPM (ISOPROPYL\nMYRISTATE), CASTOR (RICINUS COMMUNIS) SEED OIL, CETYL ALCOHOL, CETEARETH-33, HYALURONIC ACID,\nPHENOXYETHANOL, HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ALLANTOIN, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL, SALICYLIC\nACID, FRAGRANCE, TEA TREE (MELALEUCA ALTERNIFOLIA LEAF) OIL, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN,\nTETRASODIUM EDTA, COPERNICIA CERIFERA WAX, STYRAX BENZOIN RESIN EXTRACT, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, LIMONENE,\nLINALOOL, BENZYL BENZOATE, BENZYL ALCOHOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n# Foot Cream - For Dry & Cracked Skin\n\nRegular price $19.90\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n\n250 ml | FL.OZ 8.45\n\nSay goodbye to dry, cracked feet and hello to soft, supple skin! This nourishing foot cream features\na rich blend of hemp oil and urea for deep moisturization and protection against environmental\ndamage. Absorbing quickly without a greasy residue, it leaves your feet feeling flexible, light, and\ncomfortable all day long. Treat your feet to the care they deserve!\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title - Sold out\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nSold out\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\nExperience the soothing benefits of our therapeutic **FOOT CREAM**, expertly crafted to deliver\nnoticeable results from the very first use. This premium formula is tailored for those who want to\nprovide exceptional care and hydration for their feet. Developed using high-quality, purposeful\ningredients, our product is designed to bring comfort, nourishment, and long-lasting moisture to\nyour daily routine. With every application, you\u2019ll discover renewed softness and healthy-looking\nskin as the visible effects of dryness begin to fade away.\n\n## Why Choose Our FOOT CREAM?\n\nOur **FOOT CREAM** stands out for its unique blend of ingredients that are chosen to target areas of\ndiscomfort and dehydration. The inclusion of [hemp oil][27], combined with Vitamin C, creates a\nformula that soothes, hydrates, and reinvigorates. Whether your skin has been exposed to rough\nsurfaces, long days, or the effects of environmental stressors, this advanced blend helps replenish\nand protect. Enjoy smooth, flexible skin after each application and reveal natural vitality with\nconsistent, daily use.\n\n### Key Benefits and Features of This Product\n* **Intensive Moisturization**: The core formulation with hemp oil penetrates deeply to restore lost\nmoisture and soften rough areas.\n* **Support for Healthy Skin**: Vitamin C supports the skin\u2019s natural repair processes and defends\nagainst external aggressors.\n* **Guards Against Dryness**: This formulation helps maintain hydration and comfort, so you\u2019re\nprotected from everyday exposure that leads to irritation.\n* **Promotes Skin Flexibility and Comfort**: Each use leaves skin feeling relaxed, supple, and\nrefreshed.\n* **Non-Greasy and Fast-Absorbing Texture**: Enjoy a lightweight feel that allows you to move about\nfreely after each application.\n\n## How to Best Use This FOOT CREAM\n\nFor optimal results, apply a generous layer of our nourishing formula to the areas that require the\nmost attention. Gently massage until the product is fully absorbed, concentrating on regions that\nfeel rough or require extra hydration. This process enhances absorption and locks in moisture,\nhelping your skin to remain conditioned and healthy. Repeat daily to experience lasting benefits and\nimproved skin texture with continued use.\n\n### Powerful Ingredients for Enhanced Care\n\nWhat sets our **FOOT CREAM** apart is the synergistic effect of its core ingredients. The hemp oil\ndelivers Omega fatty acids, which nourish and protect your skin\u2019s barrier. Vitamin C works as an\nantioxidant and encourages the skin\u2019s natural renewal cycle. Together, they create a protective\nshield that helps maintain moisture balance and leaves your skin looking vibrant day after day. This\ncareful combination targets common discomforts and provides visible relief, making every use a step\ntowards comfort and wellness.\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\nFor enhanced effectiveness, use our product after bathing or soaking your skin, as damp skin allows\nfor even deeper hydration. Focus on regions that may need more care, and apply extra product to\nthese sections as needed. Consistent, daily use will gradually help restore comfort, smooth texture,\nand confidence in the appearance of your skin. Incorporating this routine into your self-care\nregimen ensures long-term improvements and sustainable comfort.\n\n## Nourish Your Skin Every Day\n\nOur **FOOT CREAM** is designed for those who value both immediate results and long-term\nimprovements. The fast-absorbing, lightweight texture means you can easily apply it before bed or\nprior to putting on socks and shoes in the morning. The deeply hydrating formula relieves common\ndiscomforts and is especially suited for people who want preventative care that fits into a busy\nlifestyle. Enjoy total co"
