*Improves Skin Elasticity:** Regular use promotes skin elasticity, leaving a smooth and radiant\nappearance.\n* **Luxurious Fragrance: **The pleasant scent of ylang ylang and geranium oil gives the skin a\nsubtle, soothing aroma.\n* **Formulated for Dry Skin:** Specifically designed to address the needs of dry skin and provide\noptimal care.\n\nIdeal for daily use, apply this hydrating body oil after showering or bathing to slightly wet skin\nand massage gently until fully absorbed. The premium blend of almond, avocado, wheat germ, argan,\nand jojoba oils, along with Galilean olive oil, ensures your skin is deeply moisturized and well\ncared for. Vitamin E protects the skin from environmental damage and supports natural regeneration.\nThe delightful fragrance of ylang ylang and geranium oil completes the care experience and leaves a\nsubtle, pleasant scent on your skin.\n\nDiscover the beneficial properties of our Hydrating Body Oil and enjoy velvety smooth skin.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply generously all over your body and massage in circular motions.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nSWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, SUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS ANNUUS) SEED OIL, AVOCADO (PERSEA\nGRATISSIMA) OIL, WHEAT GERM (TRITICUM VULGARE) OIL, JOJOBA (SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS) SEED OIL, ARGAN\n(ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL) OIL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL,\nVITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, ROSE GERANIUM (PELARGONIUM GRAVEOLENS FLOWER) OIL, YLANG YLANG\n(CANANGA ODORATA FLOWER) OIL, EUGENOL, ISOEUGENOL, BENZYL SALICYLATE, GERANIOL, FARNESOL, LINALOOL,\nBENZYL BENZOATE, LIMONENE, CITRAL, CITRONELLOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n30% off\n\n# Natural Moisturizing Body Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03369\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $6.90 30% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n30% off\n\nVolumen: 100 ML | 3.4 FL.OZ.\n\nOur Moisturizing Body Oil is specifically designed to meet the needs of dry skin. This unique\nformula combines Vitamin E with a curated selection of natural oils, including almond, avocado,\nwheat germ, argan and jojoba oils, along with Galilean olive oil. Refined with the soothing scent of\nylang ylang and geranium oil, this body oil offers a luxurious care experience.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Hydration:** The rich blend of high-quality oils provides intense moisture and protects\nagainst dryness.\n* **Nourishing Ingredients:** Enriched with Vitamin E and natural oils to nourish and keep your skin\nsmooth.\n* **Improves Skin Elasticity:** Regular use promotes skin elasticity, leaving a smooth and radiant\nappearance.\n* **Luxurious Fragrance: **The pleasant scent of ylang ylang and geranium oil gives the skin a\nsubtle, soothing aroma.\n* **Formulated for Dry Skin:** Specifically designed to address the needs of dry skin and provide\noptimal care.\n\nIdeal for daily use, apply this hydrating body oil after showering or bathing to slightly wet skin\nand massage gently until fully absorbed. The premium blend of almond, avocado, wheat germ, argan,\nand jojoba oils, along with Galilean olive oil, ensures your skin is deeply moisturized and well\ncared for. Vitamin E protects the skin from environmental damage and supports natural regeneration.\nThe delightful fragrance of ylang ylang and geranium oil completes the care experience and leaves a\nsubtle, pleasant scent on your skin.\n\nDiscover the beneficial properties of our Hydrating Body Oil and enjoy velvety smooth skin.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply generously all over your body and massage in circular motions.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nSWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, SUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS ANNUUS) SEED OIL, AVOCADO (PERSEA\nGRATISSIMA) OIL, WHEAT GERM (TRITICUM VULGARE) OIL, JOJOBA (SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS) SEED OIL, ARGAN\n(ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL) OIL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL,\nVITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, ROSE GERANIUM (PELARGONIUM GRAVEOLENS FLOWER) OIL, YLANG YLANG\n(CANANGA ODORATA FLOWER) OIL, EUGENOL, ISOEUGENOL, BENZYL SALICYLATE, GERANIOL, FARNESOL, LINALOOL,\nBENZYL BENZOATE, LIMONENE, CITRAL, CITRONELLOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][41]\n* [ ][42]\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][45]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard