            "text": "FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $50\n* [ ][1]\n* [ ][2]\n* [ ][3]\n* [ ][4]\n[ Skip to content ][5]\nROSAMIX ][6]\n* [ SKIN CARE ][7]\n* [ HAIR CARE ][8]\n* [ BODY CARE ][9]\n* [ CARRIER OIL ][10]\n* [ ESSENTIAL OIL ][11]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n[ ][12]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n#### Login\n\nEmail\nPassword Forgot password?\nSign in\nNew customer? [Create account][13]\n\n## Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail address Submit\nCancel\n$0.00\n][14]\n[ ][15]\nROSAMIX ][16]\n[ ][17]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n* [SKIN CARE][18]\n* [HAIR CARE][19]\n* [BODY CARE][20]\n* [CARRIER OIL][21]\n* [ESSENTIAL OIL][22]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][23]\n1. [Home][24]\n2. Eucalyptus Essential Oil\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[EUCALYPTUS ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n\nINCI Listing: Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Steam Distilled\n\nAroma: Camphorous, Fresh, Woody\n\nCAS Number: 8000-48-4\n\nOrigin: China\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Refreshing and Invigorating:** The fresh scent of eucalyptus oil refreshes and invigorates the\nsenses.\n* **Versatile Application:** Ideal for inhalations, room fragrance, and as an addition to bath and\nmassage oils.\n* **Excellent Combination:** Blends well with other [essential oils][25] such as lemon eucalyptus,\nlavender, peppermint, and tea tree.\n* **Natural Insect Repellent:** Effective against mosquitoes and other insects when sprayed in the\nroom.\n* **Nurturing Properties:** Can be used in skincare to refresh and revitalize the skin.\n\nEucalyptus oil is renowned for its refreshing and invigorating properties which makes it an\nexcellent choice for aromatherapy. It can have a refreshing effect when inhaled and is perfect for\nimproving air quality. A few drops on the edge of a pillow or in a vaporizer in the nursery can\ncreate a pleasant atmosphere. Combined with a carrier oil, eucalyptus oil is also ideal for relaxing\nmassages. Add it to your bath for an invigorating and refreshing bathing experience.\n\nDiscover the many applications and refreshing properties of our eucalyptus oil.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\n100% Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Oil\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n23% off\n\n# Eucalyptus Essential Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03362\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $9.90 23% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n23% off\n\nVolumen: 30 ml | 1.01 FL.OZ.\n\nOur Eucalyptus Oil (Eucalyptus Globulus) is one of the most popular essential oils found in almost\nevery household. Known and valued for its diverse applications, eucalyptus oil is an indispensable\npart of aromatherapy and home care. With its fresh and invigorating scent, it also offers numerous\nbenefits for your well-being.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\nINCI Listing: Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Steam Distilled\n\nAroma: Camphorous, Fresh, Woody\n\nCAS Number: 8000-48-4\n\nOrigin: China\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Refreshing and Invigorating:** The fresh scent of eucalyptus oil refreshes and invigorates the\nsenses.\n* **Versatile Application:** Ideal for inhalations, room fragrance, and as an addition to bath and\nmassage oils.\n* **Excellent Combination:** Blends well with other [essential oils][27] such as lemon eucalyptus,\nlavender, peppermint, and tea tree.\n* **Natural Insect Repellent:** Effective against mosquitoes and other insects when sprayed in the\nroom.\n* **Nurturing Properties:** Can be used in skincare to refresh and revitalize the skin.\n\nEucalyptus oil is renowned for its refreshing and invigorating properties which makes it an\nexcellent choice for aromatherapy. It can have a refreshing effect when inhaled and is perfect for\nimproving air quality. A few drops on the edge of a pillow or in a vaporizer in the nursery can\ncreate a pleasant atmosphere. Combined with a carrier oil, eucalyptus oil is also ideal for relaxing\nmassages. Add it to your bath for an invigorating and refreshing bathing experience.\n\nDiscover the many applications and refreshing properties of our eucalyptus oil.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\n100% Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Oil\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][28]\n* [About Us][29]\n* [Skin Care][30]\n* [Body Care][31]\n* [Hair Care][32]\n* [Essential Oil][33]\n* [Carrier Oil][34]\n* [Blog][35]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][36]\n* [Privacy Policy][37]\n* [Cookie Policy][38]\n* [Shipping Policy][39]\n* [Refund Policy][40]\n* [Contact Us][41]\n* [FAQ][42]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* [ ][46]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][47]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[3]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[4]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[5]: #main\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/skin-care\n[8]: /collections/hair-care\n[9]: /collections/body-care\n[10]: /collections/natural-oils\n[11]: /collections/essential-oil\n[12]: 