            "text": "FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $50\n* [ ][1]\n* [ ][2]\n* [ ][3]\n* [ ][4]\n[ Skip to content ][5]\nROSAMIX ][6]\n* [ SKIN CARE ][7]\n* [ HAIR CARE ][8]\n* [ BODY CARE ][9]\n* [ CARRIER OIL ][10]\n* [ ESSENTIAL OIL ][11]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n[ ][12]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n#### Login\n\nEmail\nPassword Forgot password?\nSign in\nNew customer? [Create account][13]\n\n## Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail address Submit\nCancel\n$0.00\n][14]\n[ ][15]\nROSAMIX ][16]\n[ ][17]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n* [SKIN CARE][18]\n* [HAIR CARE][19]\n* [BODY CARE][20]\n* [CARRIER OIL][21]\n* [ESSENTIAL OIL][22]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][23]\n1. [Home][24]\n2. Frankincense Essential Oil\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[FRANKINCENSE ESSENTIAL OIL - ROSAMIX]\n\nINCI Listing: Boswellia Carterii Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Steam Distilled\n\nAroma: Citrus\n\nCAS Number: 89957-98-2 / 8050-07-5\n\nOrigin: UK\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Calming and Relaxing:** The warm scent of frankincense oil promotes relaxation and helps create\na peaceful atmosphere.\n* **Nourishing Skincare: **Excellent for skincare, especially beneficial for mature and dry skin.\n* **Versatile Use:** Perfect for aromatherapy, meditation, skincare, and as an addition to [massage\noils][25].\n* **Rich Aroma:** The distinctive balsamic fragrance enhances the air quality and creates a pleasant\nenvironment.\n* **Natural Combinations:** Blends well with essential oils like lavender, myrrh, bergamot, and\nsandalwood.\n\nFrankincense oil is renowned for its calming and meditative properties, making it ideal for reducing\nstress and promoting relaxation in aromatherapy. Use it in a diffuser to refresh your indoor air and\ncreate a serene atmosphere. In skincare, frankincense oil is particularly valuable for mature and\ndry skin. Mix it into creams and lotions to nourish and revitalize the skin. When added to massage\noils, it enhances the soothing effects and supports skin care. For a luxurious bathing experience,\nadd a few drops of frankincense oil to your bathwater. The warm, calming scent helps relax the body\nand mind. This truly provides an indulgent experience.\n\nWith its numerous benefits and wide range of uses, our premium Frankincense Oil is a versatile\nmust-have in your wellness routine.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nBoswellia carterii\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n22% off\n\n# Frankincense Essential Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03369\u0336.\u03360\u03360\u0336 $14.90 22% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n22% off\n\nVolumen: 30 ml | 1.01 FL.OZ.\n\nOur essential Frankincense Oil (Boswellia Carterii) is a premium oil extracted from the resin of the\nfrankincense tree. Known for its warm, balsamic fragrance, it is a valuable addition to aromatherapy\nand skincare routines. Discover the various uses and soothing properties of this precious oil and\nindulge in its benefits.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\nINCI Listing: Boswellia Carterii Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Steam Distilled\n\nAroma: Citrus\n\nCAS Number: 89957-98-2 / 8050-07-5\n\nOrigin: UK\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Calming and Relaxing:** The warm scent of frankincense oil promotes relaxation and helps create\na peaceful atmosphere.\n* **Nourishing Skincare: **Excellent for skincare, especially beneficial for mature and dry skin.\n* **Versatile Use:** Perfect for aromatherapy, meditation, skincare, and as an addition to [massage\noils][27].\n* **Rich Aroma:** The distinctive balsamic fragrance enhances the air quality and creates a pleasant\nenvironment.\n* **Natural Combinations:** Blends well with essential oils like lavender, myrrh, bergamot, and\nsandalwood.\n\nFrankincense oil is renowned for its calming and meditative properties, making it ideal for reducing\nstress and promoting relaxation in aromatherapy. Use it in a diffuser to refresh your indoor air and\ncreate a serene atmosphere. In skincare, frankincense oil is particularly valuable for mature and\ndry skin. Mix it into creams and lotions to nourish and revitalize the skin. When added to massage\noils, it enhances the soothing effects and supports skin care. For a luxurious bathing experience,\nadd a few drops of frankincense oil to your bathwater. The warm, calming scent helps relax the body\nand mind. This truly provides an indulgent experience.\n\nWith its numerous benefits and wide range of uses, our premium Frankincense Oil is a versatile\nmust-have in your wellness routine.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nBoswellia carterii\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][28]\n* [About Us][29]\n* [Skin Care][30]\n* [Body Care][31]\n* [Hair Care][32]\n* [Essential Oil][33]\n* [Carrier Oil][34]\n* [Blog][35]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][36]\n* [Privacy Policy][37]\n* [Cookie Policy][38]\n* [Shipping Policy][39]\n* [Refund Policy][40]\n* [Contact Us][41]\n* [FAQ][42]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* [ ][46]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][47]\n\n[American Express]\n[A