are for and revitalize the skin.\n* **Versatile Uses:** Perfect for aromatherapy, skincare, and as a natural fragrance for your home.\n* **Refreshing Scent:** The pleasant, floral aroma of lavender oil refreshes the air and creates a\ncalming atmosphere.\n\nLavender oil can be applied directly to the skin, either neat or diluted with a carrier oil. It is\nparticularly effective for treating minor skin irritations and soothing the skin after insect bites.\nIn aromatherapy, it helps promote restful sleep and creates a relaxing environment. Add a few drops\nto your bath for a calming and relaxing bathing experience. You can also use it in a diffuser to\nfill your home with the soothing scent of lavender which helps creating a peaceful atmosphere.\n\nEmbrace the great benefits and gentle ambiance of our Lavender Oil.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nLavandula Angustifolia Oil\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n34% off\n\n# Lavender Essential Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03361\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $7.90 34% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n34% off\n\nVolumen: 30 ml | 1.01 FL.OZ.\n\nDiscover the soothing benefits of our essential Lavender Oil (Lavandula Angustifolia). This\nluxurious, high-quality oil which is extracted from the finest lavender blossoms, is an essential\ncompanion for your aromatherapy and skincare routines. With its high concentration of active\ningredients, lavender oil offers versatile applications that pamper your senses and nurture your\nskin.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\nINCI Listing: Lavandula Angustifolia Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Steam Distilled\n\nAroma: Floral, Herbal\n\nCAS Number: 8000-28-0 / 90063-37-9\n\nOrigin: France\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Relaxing Effects:** Known for its calming properties, lavender oil helps reduce stress and\npromote relaxation.\n* **Nurturing Skin Care: **Ideal for use in creams and salves to care for and revitalize the skin.\n* **Versatile Uses:** Perfect for aromatherapy, skincare, and as a natural fragrance for your home.\n* **Refreshing Scent:** The pleasant, floral aroma of lavender oil refreshes the air and creates a\ncalming atmosphere.\n\nLavender oil can be applied directly to the skin, either neat or diluted with a carrier oil. It is\nparticularly effective for treating minor skin irritations and soothing the skin after insect bites.\nIn aromatherapy, it helps promote restful sleep and creates a relaxing environment. Add a few drops\nto your bath for a calming and relaxing bathing experience. You can also use it in a diffuser to\nfill your home with the soothing scent of lavender which helps creating a peaceful atmosphere.\n\nEmbrace the great benefits and gentle ambiance of our Lavender Oil.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nLavandula Angustifolia Oil\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][41]\n* [ ][42]\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][45]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[3]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[4]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[5]: #main\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/skin-care\n[8]: /collections/hair-care\n[9]: /collections/body-care\n[10]: /collections/natural-oils\n[11]: /collections/essential-oil\n[12]: /account\n[13]: https://account.rosamix.us?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyb3NhbWl4bmF0\ndXJlLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgyMTgzOCwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE3MDM4fQ.UUQrfxUflYl2e\nkh