:** Cleanses and clarifies the skin, making it ideal for oily skin\nand acne.\n* **Versatile Use: **Perfect for aromatherapy, skincare, massages, and air purification.\n* **Natural Combinations: **Blends well with essential oils like lavender, jasmine, and geranium.\n* **Calming and Balancing:** Despite its invigorating properties, lemongrass oil also has calming\neffects that can help with stress and headaches.\n\nLemongrass oil can be used in aromatherapy to create a refreshing and revitalizing atmosphere. Use\nit in a diffuser to improve air quality and awaken the senses. For skincare, lemongrass oil is\nparticularly beneficial for oily skin and acne. Incorporate it into homemade creams and lotions to\nclarify and cleanse the skin. In massages, lemongrass oil provides a revitalizing experience. Mix it\nwith a carrier oil for a refreshing massage that also relaxes. It can also be added to bathwater to\nunleash its soothing properties.\n\nEnhance your well-being with the versatile applications and refreshing qualities of our Lemongrass.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nCymbopogon Citratus Leaf Oil\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n26% off\n\n# Lemongrass Essential