eating skin issues such as acne, psoriasis, and for addressing\nwounds and burns.\n* **Natural Purity:** Can be applied directly to the skin but is often diluted with a carrier oil or\nmoisturizer to prevent dryness.\n* **Combinable:** Blends well with essential oils like lavender and geranium to enhance its\nbeneficial effects.\n* **Refreshing Scent:** The distinct, fresh aroma of tea tree oil invigorates the senses and\nprovides a refreshing experience.\n\nIn practice, tea tree oil is particularly recommended for daily skincare. While it can be used in\nits pure form, we suggest diluting it with a carrier oil or moisturizer to avoid skin dryness. Even\nwhen diluted, its efficacy remains strong and effective. In aromatherapy, tea tree oil is valued for\nits antibacterial and anti-inflammatory properties. It can be used in diffusers to purify the air\nand create a refreshing atmosphere. For skincare, tea tree oil is especially effective in treating\nacne and other skin irritations. It can also be blended with other essential oils like lavender and\ngeranium to create customized mixtures for various skin issues. These combinations offer synergistic\neffects and improve care outcomes.\n\nThese powerful and versatile applications make tea tree oil a true all-rounder in daily practice.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nMelaleuce Altermifolia\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n18% off\n\n# Tea Tree Essential Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03362\u0336.\u03360\u03360\u0336 $9.90 18% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n18% off\n\nVolumen: 30 ml | 1.01 FL.OZ.\n\nDiscover the powerful properties of our essential Tea Tree Oil (Melaleuca alternifolia). Known for\nits strong disinfectant and antiviral qualities, this versatile oil is a must-have in skincare and\naromatherapy. Tea tree oil offers numerous applications that can improve your daily care routine.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\nINCI Listing: Melaleuca Alternifolia Leaf Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Steam Distilled\n\nAroma: Herbal, Medicinal\n\nCAS Number: 85085-48-9 / 8022-72-8 / 68647-73-4\n\nOrigin: Australia\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Antiviral and Disinfectant:** Tea tree oil is a potent disinfectant that helps effectively\ncombat bacteria and viruses.\n* **Versatile Use:** Ideal for treating skin issues such as acne, psoriasis, and for addressing\nwounds and burns.\n* **Natural Purity:** Can be applied directly to the skin but is often diluted with a carrier oil or\nmoisturizer to prevent dryness.\n* **Combinable:** Blends well with essential oils like lavender and geranium to enhance its\nbeneficial effects.\n* **Refreshing Scent:** The distinct, fresh aroma of tea tree oil invigorates the senses and\nprovides a refreshing experience.\n\nIn practice, tea tree oil is particularly recommended for daily skincare. While it can be used in\nits pure form, we suggest diluting it with a carrier oil or moisturizer to avoid skin dryness. Even\nwhen diluted, its efficacy remains strong and effective. In aromatherapy, tea tree oil is valued for\nits antibacterial and anti-inflammatory properties. It can be used in diffusers to purify the air\nand create a refreshing atmosphere. For skincare, tea tree oil is especially effective in treating\nacne and other skin irritations. It can also be blended with other essential oils like lavender and\ngeranium to create customized mixtures for various skin issues. These combinations offer synergistic\neffects and improve care outcomes.\n\nThese powerful and versatile applications make tea tree oil a true all-rounder in daily practice.\n\n### Directions\n\nFor external use and Aroma purposes only. carefully dilute with a carrier oil such as jojoba,\ngrapeseed, olive, or almond oil prior to use.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nMelaleuce Altermifolia\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping an