 oil for skin and hair care. Extracted\nfrom ripe avocados, this oil is rich in essential vitamins and fatty acids, which makes it an\nimportant part of your daily beauty routine. Explore the numerous applications and unique benefits\nof our avocado oil.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\nINCI Listing: Persea Gratissima Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Cold Pressed\n\nAroma: Characteristic, Earthy, Nutty\n\nCAS Number: 8024-32-6\n\nOrigin: South Africa\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Rich in Vitamin E:** An excellent source of Vitamin E, avocado oil nourishes and nurtures the\nskin.\n* **Essential Fatty Acids: **Contains fatty acids that support the skin's natural barrier and\nprovide deep hydration.\n* **Hair Care:** Perfect for hair care, enhancing hair structure and giving it a natural shine.\n* **Versatile Use:** Ideal for making cosmetics like facial, hand, and eye creams, as well as baby\nhair care products.\n* **Natural Protection:** Aids in skin regeneration and shields it from harmful environmental\nfactors.\n\nThanks to its diverse properties, our avocado oil is a favorite in cosmetic production. Therefore,\nit is particularly effective for hair and skin care. Whether used as a nourishing hair oil, a skin\nmoisturizer, or a base for homemade beauty products, avocado oil proves to be an all-rounder. Use it\nas a massage oil to pamper body and mind, or as a hydrating skin care product. Try out the natural\npower of avocado oil and incorporate it into your daily care routine.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply few drops to clean skin and gently massage. Or add few drops to mid length to end on dry or\nwet hair.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nPersea Gratissima Oil.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][41]\n* [ ][42]\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][45]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[3]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[4]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[5]: #main\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/skin-care\n[8]: /collections/hair-care\n[9]: /collections/body-care\n[10]: /collections/natural-oils\n[11]: /collections/essential-oil\n[12]: /account\n[13]: https://account.rosamix.us?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyb3NhbWl4bmF0\ndXJlLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgyMTg3MSwibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE3MDcxfQ.D0yFwE1Dfzoqq\nShPJTVMDc_1NO11YsyrNnwzyADEljk\n[14]: /cart\n[15]: /search\n[16]: /\n[17]