age oil supports skincare routines by helping to keep the skin soft and supple.\n* **Deep Moisturization: **Provides intense hydration, making it ideal for dry and stressed skin.\n* **Haircare:** Can be used in haircare to nourish and revitalize dry, brittle hair.\n* **Rich in Gamma-Linolenic Acid:** High in gamma-linolenic acid, which plays a crucial role in skin\nhealth.\n* **Versatile Use: **Perfect as a carrier oil in homemade cosmetic products or as an addition to\ncreams and lotions.\n\nOrganic borage oil serves as an excellent base for various cosmetic applications. It can be applied\ndirectly to the skin or blended with other oils to enhance its nourishing effects. Regular use is\nespecially beneficial for dry and sensitive skin as it provides essential nutrients and moisture.\nMoreover, borage oil is a valuable component in haircare, helping to rejuvenate dry, brittle hair\nand restore its natural shine and softness.\n\nIncorporate Organic Borage Oil into your daily skincare and haircare routines and enjoy the numerous\nbenefits of this natural oil.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply few drops to clean skin and gently massage. Or add few drops to mid length to end on dry or\nwet hair.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nBorago Officinalis Seed Oil.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n27% off\n\n# Organic Cold Pressed Borage Oil