INCI Listing: Oenothera Biennis Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Cold Pressed\n\nAroma: Earthy\n\nCAS Number: 90028-66-3\n\nOrigin: China\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Moisturization: **Delivers intense hydration, making it perfect for dry and stressed skin.\n* **Anti-Aging Properties: **Ideal for inclusion in anti-wrinkle creams to smooth and revitalize the\ncomplexion.\n* **Versatile Application: **Excellent for use in moisturizing creams, day and night creams, and\nrevitalizing eye and lip treatments.\n* **Nail Care Excellence: **Fortifies nails and nourishes cuticles, preventing brittleness and\nbreakage.\n* **Rich in Essential Fatty Acids:** Packed with Omega-6 fatty acids that deeply nourish and care\nfor the skin.\n\nThis organic evening primrose oil can be utilized in its pure form or incorporated into various\ncosmetic formulations. Favored by many cosmetic manufacturers, it is ideal for crafting premium\nskincare products. Its hydrating and nurturing qualities make it a superb choice for daily skin\ncare. Use it in your moisturizers and creams to provide your skin with extra nourishment.\nAdditionally, it excels in nail care, promoting stronger and healthier nails.\n\nExplore the countless benefits and nutrient-rich properties of our Organic Evening Primrose Oil and\nelevate your skincare and nail care routines.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply few drops to clean skin and gently massage. Or add few drops to mid length to end on dry or\nwet hair.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nOenothera Biennis Oil.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n# Organic Cold Pressed Evening Primrose Oil\n\nRegular price $15.00\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n\nVolumen: 100 ML | 3.4 FL.OZ.\n\nOrganic Cold-Pressed Evening Primrose Oil (Oenothera Biennis) is high-quality carrier oil derived\nfrom the seeds of the evening primrose plant. Known for its richness in essential fatty acids and\nvitamins, this precious oil is a staple in skincare and nail care routines. Discover the extensive\nbenefits and diverse applications of this remarkable oil.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title - Sold out\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nSold out\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\nINCI Listing: Oenothera Biennis Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Cold Pressed\n\nAroma: Earthy\n\nCAS Number: 90028-66-3\n\nOrigin: China\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Moisturization: **Delivers intense hydration, making it perfect for dry and stressed skin.\n* **Anti-Aging Properties: **Ideal for inclusion in anti-wrinkle creams to smooth and revitalize the\ncomplexion.\n* **Versatile Application: **Excellent for use in moisturizing creams, day and night creams, and\nrevitalizing eye and lip treatments.\n* **Nail Care Excellence: **Fortifies nails and nourishes cuticles, preventing brittleness and\nbreakage.\n* **Rich in Essential Fatty Acids:** Packed with Omega-6 fatty acids that deeply nourish and care\nfor the skin.\n\nThis organic evening primrose oil can be utilized in its pure form or incorporated into various\ncosmetic formulations. Favored by many cosmetic manufacturers, it is ideal for crafting premium\nskincare products. Its hydrating and nurturing qualities make it a superb choice for daily skin\ncare. Use it in your moisturizers and creams to provide your skin with extra nourishment.\nAdditionally, it excels in nail care, promoting stronger and healthier nails.\n\nExplore the countless benefits and nutrient-rich properties of our Organic Evening Primrose Oil and\nelevate your skincare and nail care routines.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply few drops to clean skin and gently massage. Or add few drops to mid length to end on dry or\nwet hair.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nOenothera Biennis Oil.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][41]\n* [ ][42]\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][45]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.face