due.\n* **Enhanced Hair Care:** Strengthens hair, adds a natural shine, and improves manageability.\n* **Nutrient-Rich:** Boasts a balanced blend of Omega-3 and Omega-6 fatty acids, which nourish and\ncare for both skin and hair.\n* **Versatile Applications:** Ideal as a carrier oil for DIY cosmetic creations or as an enriching\naddition to creams, lotions, and hair treatments.\n\nOur hemp oil is ideal for use as a base oil and can be applied on its own or blended with other\noils. It's perfect for daily skincare as it helps the skin in maintaining its natural elasticity and\nhydration. Hemp oil is also known for its soothing properties on the skin. In hair care, it works to\nstrengthen and nourish, enhancing hair structure and imparting a healthy shine. It's also great for\nuse in homemade cosmetics such as creams, lotions, and hair masks. Here it boosts their nourishing\neffects.\n\nExplore the many applications of our hemp oil and experience the rich benefits it brings to your\nskincare and haircare routines.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply few drops to clean skin and gently massage. Or add few drops to mid length to end on dry or\nwet hair.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nCannabis Sativa Seed Oil.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n11% off\n\n# Cold Pressed Hemp Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03360\u0336.\u03360\u03360\u0336 $8.90 11% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n11% off\n\nVolumen: 100 ML | 3.4 FL.OZ.\n\nOur Cold Pressed Hemp Oil (Cannabis) is a precious carrier oil derived from the seeds of the hemp\nplant. Packed with essential fatty acids, vitamins and minerals, this high-quality oil is a\nmust-have for your skincare and haircare routines. Discover the wide-ranging benefits and nourishing\nproperties of this exceptional oil.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][25] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\nINCI Listing: Cannabis Sativa Seed Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Cold Pressed\n\nAroma: Characteristic, Nutty\n\nCAS Number: 89958-21-4\n\nOrigin: Netherlands\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Moisturization:** Delivers intense hydration, making it perfect for dry and stressed skin.\n* **Effective Skincare: **Quickly absorbs into the skin, leaving it smooth and soft without any\ngreasy residue.\n* **Enhanced Hair Care:** Strengthens hair, adds a natural shine, and improves manageability.\n* **Nutrient-Rich:** Boasts a balanced blend of Omega-3 and Omega-6 fatty acids, which nourish and\ncare for both skin and hair.\n* **Versatile Applications:** Ideal as a carrier oil for DIY cosmetic creations or as an enriching\naddition to creams, lotions, and hair treatments.\n\nOur hemp oil is ideal for use as a base oil and can be applied on its own or blended with other\noils. It's perfect for daily skincare as it helps the skin in maintaining its natural elasticity and\nhydration. Hemp oil is also known for its soothing properties on the skin. In hair care, it works to\nstrengthen and nourish, enhancing hair structure and imparting a healthy shine. It's also great for\nuse in homemade cosmetics such as creams, lotions, and hair masks. Here it boosts their nourishing\neffects.\n\nExplore the many applications of our hemp oil and experience the rich benefits it brings to your\nskincare and haircare routines.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply few drops to clean skin and gently massage. Or add few drops to mid length to end on dry or\nwet hair.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nCannabis Sativa Seed Oil.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][26]\n* [About Us][27]\n* [Skin Care][28]\n* [Body Care][29]\n* [Hair Care][30]\n* [Essential Oil][31]\n* [Carrier Oil][32]\n* [Blog][33]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][34]\n* [Privacy Policy][35]\n* [Cookie Policy][36]\n* [Shipping Policy][37]\n* [Refund Policy][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n* [FAQ][40]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][41]\n* [ ][42]\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][45]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[3]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[4]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[5]: #main\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/skin-care\n[8]: /collections/hair-care\n[9]: /collections/