ing:** The gentle scents and nourishing properties promote relaxation and\nwell-being.\n* **Quick Absorption:** Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, ensuring a pleasant\napplication.\n* **Versatile Use:** Perfect for sensual partner massages and also great for daily skincare.\n\nOur Sensual Massage Oil is easy to use: apply a generous amount to the skin and massage gently until\nfully absorbed. The combination of nourishing almond oil and stimulating essential oils makes every\nmassage a unique experience. Use this oil for intimate moments with your partner or as a luxurious\ntreat after a long day. The captivating aromas and rich care will please your senses and pamper your\nskin.\n\nDiscover the versatile applications and alluring properties of our Sensual Massage Oil.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply to the skin and massage with gentle movements until fully absorbed.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nSWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATECE,\nPELARGONIUM GRAVEOLENS OIL, PATCHOULI (POGOSTEMON CABLIN) OIL, CANANGA ODORATA FLOWER OIL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n25% off\n\n# Natural Sensual Massage Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03361\u03361\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $8.90 25% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n25% off\n\nVolumen: 100 ML | 3.4 FL.OZ.\n\nIndulge in the captivating care of our Sensual Massage Oil. This luxuriou