            "text": "FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $50\n* [ ][1]\n* [ ][2]\n* [ ][3]\n* [ ][4]\n[ Skip to content ][5]\nROSAMIX ][6]\n* [ SKIN CARE ][7]\n* [ HAIR CARE ][8]\n* [ BODY CARE ][9]\n* [ CARRIER OIL ][10]\n* [ ESSENTIAL OIL ][11]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n[ ][12]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n#### Login\n\nEmail\nPassword Forgot password?\nSign in\nNew customer? [Create account][13]\n\n## Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail address Submit\nCancel\n$0.00\n][14]\n[ ][15]\nROSAMIX ][16]\n[ ][17]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n* [SKIN CARE][18]\n* [HAIR CARE][19]\n* [BODY CARE][20]\n* [CARRIER OIL][21]\n* [ESSENTIAL OIL][22]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][23]\n1. [Home][24]\n2. Sweet Almond Oil\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n* [SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n[SWEET ALMOND OIL - ROSAMIX]\n\nINCI Listing: Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Refined\n\nAroma: Neutral\n\nCAS Number: 8007-69-0 / 90320-37-9\n\nOrigin: USA\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Nutrient-Rich:** Packed with vitamins and minerals that nourish and protect the skin.\n* **Quick Absorption:** Easily penetrates the skin, helping to break down impurities in the pores\nand prevent blemishes.\n* **Skin Care:** Provides moisture and shields the skin from harmful environmental factors,\nresulting in a radiant and smooth complexion.\n* **Hair Care: **When applied to the scalp after showering, it strengthens hair from the roots and\npromotes healthy hair growth.\n* **Versatile Use:** Ideal for creating creams, lotions, and hair care products, as well as for\ndirect application on skin and hair.\n\nSweet almond oil is an excellent moisturizer for the skin but also an effective emollient that keeps\nthe skin soft and elastic. Additionally, it is perfect for [hair care][25], nourishing the scalp and\nsupporting the long-term strengthening of hair roots. It can also be incorporated into homemade\ncosmetic products to improve their nourishing effects.\n\nDiscover the diverse applications and valuable nutrients of our Sweet Almond Oil and elevate your\nbeauty routine.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply few drops to clean skin and gently massage. Or add few drops to mid length to end on dry or\nwet hair.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nPrunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n34% off\n\n# Sweet Almond Oil\n\nRegular price $\u03368\u0336.\u03369\u03360\u0336 $5.90 34% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n34% off\n\nVolumen: 100 ML | 3.4 FL.OZ.\n\nOur Sweet Almond Oil (Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis) is a premium carrier oil extracted from the kernels\nof sweet almonds. This versatile oil is rich in essential nutrients such as Vitamin E, potassium,\nproteins, iron, unsaturated fatty acids and zinc. Its light texture and nourishing properties make\nit an essential component in skincare and haircare routines.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\nINCI Listing: Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil\n\nManufacturing Method: Refined\n\nAroma: Neutral\n\nCAS Number: 8007-69-0 / 90320-37-9\n\nOrigin: USA\n\n## Description\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Nutrient-Rich:** Packed with vitamins and minerals that nourish and protect the skin.\n* **Quick Absorption:** Easily penetrates the skin, helping to break down impurities in the pores\nand prevent blemishes.\n* **Skin Care:** Provides moisture and shields the skin from harmful environmental factors,\nresulting in a radiant and smooth complexion.\n* **Hair Care: **When applied to the scalp after showering, it strengthens hair from the roots and\npromotes healthy hair growth.\n* **Versatile Use:** Ideal for creating creams, lotions, and hair care products, as well as for\ndirect application on skin and hair.\n\nSweet almond oil is an excellent moisturizer for the skin but also an effective emollient that keeps\nthe skin soft and elastic. Additionally, it is perfect for [hair care][27], nourishing the scalp and\nsupporting the long-term strengthening of hair roots. It can also be incorporated into homemade\ncosmetic products to improve their nourishing effects.\n\nDiscover the diverse applications and valuable nutrients of our Sweet Almond Oil and elevate your\nbeauty routine.\n\n### Directions\n\nApply few drops to clean skin and gently massage. Or add few drops to mid length to end on dry or\nwet hair.\n\n### Ingredients\n\nPrunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor External use only. Keep Out of reach of Children. Keep away from eyes. If you are pregnant,\nnursing, taking medication or have a medical condtion, consult a health professional prior to use.\nIf skin irritation occurs discontinue use. A patch test on a small area of skin is highly\nrecommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n* These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n## Recommended products\n\n### What our customers say\n\nFast shipping\nEasy returns\nSecure payments\n\n### Rosamix\n\nRosamix\n* [Home Page][28]\n* [About Us][29]\n* [Skin Care][30]\n* [Body Care][31]\n* [Hair Care][32]\n* [Essential Oil][33]\n* [Carrier Oil][34]\n* [Blog][35]\n\n### Policies\n\nPolicies\n* [Terms of Service][36]\n* [Privacy Policy][37]\n* [Cookie Policy][38]\n* [Shipping Policy][39]\n* [Refund Policy][40]\n* [Contact Us][41]\n* [FAQ][42]\n\n### Contact us\n\nFor questions about your order, shipping and returns, please contact us:\n\ninfo@rosamix.us\n\n### Follow us\n* [ ][43]\n* [ ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* [ ][46]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, [ROSAMIX][47]\n\n[American Express]\n[Apple Pay]\n[Diners Club]\n[Discover]\n[Google Pay]\n[JCB]\n[Mastercard]\n[PayPal]\n[Visa]\n\n#### Availability\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/RosamixUSA\n[2]: https://www.instagram.com/rosamix_usa/\n[3]: https://www.tiktok.com/@rosamix.us\n[4]: https://www.youtube.com/@Rosamix-USA\n[5]: #main\n[6]: /\n[7]: /collections/skin-care\n[8]: /collections/hair-care\n[9]: /collections/body-care\n[10]: /collections/natural-oils\n[11]: /collections/essential-oil\n[12]: /account\n[13]: https://account.rosamix.us?locale=en&buyer_flags=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJyb3NhbWl4bmF0\ndXJlLm15c2hvcGlmeS5jb20iLCJmbGFncyI6W10sImV4cCI6MTc4MjgyMTk0MywibmJmIjoxNzgyMjE3MTQzfQ.4PGkosDayLbqX\nmatZk_hI_rROWxseZAGITVbR2O_5OU&consent=s0\n[14]: /cart\n[15]: /search\n[16]: /\n[17]: /ca