            "text": "FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $50\n* [ ][1]\n* [ ][2]\n* [ ][3]\n* [ ][4]\n[ Skip to content ][5]\nROSAMIX ][6]\n* [ SKIN CARE ][7]\n* [ HAIR CARE ][8]\n* [ BODY CARE ][9]\n* [ CARRIER OIL ][10]\n* [ ESSENTIAL OIL ][11]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n[ ][12]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n#### Login\n\nEmail\nPassword Forgot password?\nSign in\nNew customer? [Create account][13]\n\n## Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail address Submit\nCancel\n$0.00\n][14]\n[ ][15]\nROSAMIX ][16]\n[ ][17]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n* [SKIN CARE][18]\n* [HAIR CARE][19]\n* [BODY CARE][20]\n* [CARRIER OIL][21]\n* [ESSENTIAL OIL][22]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][23]\n1. [Home][24]\n2. Rosamix Hair Care Kit\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Hair Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\n### **Hair Care Kit**\n\n**1) HAIR SHAMPOO:**\n\nDiscover the nourishing power of our specially formulated hair [shampoo][25], designed to provide\nyour hair with intense hydration and a healthy, glossy appearance. Infused with a unique blend of\nAloe Vera, sea buckthorn (Obliphicha), Argan oil and Galilean olive oil, this hair shampoo ensures\noptimal care and easy manageability.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Hydration:** This formula delivers deep moisture to combat dryness and leave hair smooth\nand supple.\n* **Nourishing and Repairing:** Enriched with Aloe Vera and Argan oil, it helps repair damaged hair\nstructures and promotes healthy hair growth.\n* **Easy to Detangle: **Makes hair easy to comb through, reducing breakage during styling.\n* **Natural Shine: **Sea buckthorn and Galilean olive oil give your hair a natural, healthy shine.\n* **Suitable for All Hair Types:** Ideal for daily care, this shampoo works well for all hair types.\n\n**2) HAIR CONDITIONER: **\n\nOur Hair [Conditioner ][26]is the ultimate solution for those seeking intensive care and\nrevitalization for their hair. Formulated with a unique blend of keratin and hyaluronic acid, this\nhair conditioner provides deep treatment, helping to repair damage from environmental changes and\nchemical styling.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Nourishment:** The conditioner delivers intensive care with keratin and hyaluronic acid to\nstrengthen and revitalize hair fibers.\n* **Repair and Protection:** Repairs damage caused by environmental factors and chemical treatments,\nprotecting hair from future harm.\n* **Healthy and Shiny Hair:** The combination of hemp oil and olive oil gives hair a healthy, full,\nsoft, and shiny appearance.\n* **Suitable for All Hair Types:** Ideal for all hair types, ensuring smooth, easily manageable\nhair.\n* **Free from Harmful Additives:** No salts or SLS \u2013 for gentle and safe use.\n\n**3) TREATMENT HAIR OIL:**\n\nRevitalize your hair with a new level of shine and vitality using our Treatment Hair Oil. This\nexclusive formula combines the restorative and protective properties of argan, castor, jojoba and\navocado oils. Enhanced with premium Galilean olive oil, this hair oil delivers comprehensive care\nand vibrancy.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Intensive Regeneration:** The rich blend of argan, castor, jojoba, and avocado oils helps to\nrepair damaged hair and strengthen its overall structure.\n* **Protection and Care:** Provides effective protection against environmental stressors while\nmaintaining the hair's natural moisture.\n* **Vibrant Shine: **Gives hair a natural, healthy shine and improves manageability.\n* **Versatile Application: **Suitable for all hair types, whether used as a tip treatment or an\nintensive hair mask.\n* **Natural Ingredients: **Includes high-quality Galilean olive oil for additional nourishment and\ncare.\n\n### Directions\n\n- HAIR CONDITIONER: after shampooing, apply from mid,length to ends. Leave on for 1\u20132 minutes and\nrinse well.\n\n- TREATMENT HAIR OIL: Apply a small amount along the hair after showering, apply as needed.\n\n- HAIR SHAMPOO: Wet hair, apply the shampoo, lather and then add more water. Leave on hair for\naround 2 minutes and then rinse off. For best results, pair with our Rosamix Conditioner.\n\n### Ingredients\n\n- HAIR CONDITIONER: WATER (AQUA), CETYL ALCOHOL, DIPALMITOYLETHYL HYDROXYETHYLMONIUM METHOSULFATE,\nHYALURONIC ACID, AMODIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, ACRYLAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE/ACRYLATES\nCOPOLYMER, FRAGRANCE, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL),\nISOHEXADECANE, HYDROLYZED KERATIN, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN,\nTRIDECETH-12, SEA BUCKTHORN (HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, COCETH-7, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE,\nBUTYLENE GLYCOL.\n\n- HAIR SHAMPOO: WATER (AQUA), SODIUM COCETH SULFATE, COCAMIDE DEA, SODIUM CHLORIDE, COCAMIDOPROPYL\nBETAINE, PEG-12 DIMETHICONE, HYALURONIC ACID, AMODIMETHICONE, HYDROLYZED KERATIN, FRAGRANCE,\nCETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, CITRIC ACID, ALOE VERA (ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF POWDER) , TRIDECETH-12, OLIVE\n(OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), SEA BUCKTHORN (HIPPOPHAE\nRHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, FD&C Blue No. 1, TRIETHYLENE GLYCOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL,\nBUTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYETHANOL, MAGNESIUM CHLORIDE, MAGNESIUM NITRATE,\nETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN,METHYLCHLOROISOTHIAZOLINO NE, METHYLISOTHIAZOLINONE.\n\n- TREATMENT HAIR OIL: GRAPE (VITIS VINIFERA) SEED OIL, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL,\nSUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS ANNUUS SEED) OIL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA\nKERNEL OIL), CRAMBE ABYSSINICA SEED OIL PHYTOSTEROL ESTERS, AVOCADO (PERSEA GRATISSIMA) OIL, JOJOBA\n(SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS) SEED OIL, FENUGREEK (TRIGONELLA FOENUM-GRAECUM) SEED OIL, CASTOR (RICINUS\nCOMMUNIS SEED) OIL, SEA BUCKTHORN (HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL,\nWHEAT (TRITICUM VULGARE) GERM OIL, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, ROSEMARY (ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS\nFLOWER) OIL, LINALOOL, LIMONENE.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n18% off\n\n# Rosamix Hair Care Kit\n\nRegular price $\u03363\u03366\u0336.\u03367\u03360\u0336 $30.00 18% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n18% off\n\nVolumen: HAIR CONDITIONER: 500 ml | FL.OZ 16.9. HAIR SHAMPOO: 500 ml | FL.OZ 16.9. TREATMENT HAIR\nOIL: 50 ml | 1.69 FL.OZ.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][27] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n### **Hair Care Kit**\n\n**1) HAIR SHAMPOO:**\n\nDiscover the nourishing power of our specially formulated hair [shampoo][28], designed to provide\nyour hair with intense hydration and