hanced with premium Galilean olive oil, this hair oil delivers comprehensive care\nand vibrancy.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Intensive Regeneration:** The rich blend of argan, castor, jojoba, and avocado oils helps to\nrepair damaged hair and strengthen its overall structure.\n* **Protection and Care:** Provides effective protection against environmental stressors while\nmaintaining the hair's natural moisture.\n* **Vibrant Shine: **Gives hair a natural, healthy shine and improves manageability.\n* **Versatile Application: **Suitable for all hair types, whether used as a tip treatment or an\nintensive hair mask.\n* **Natural Ingredients: **Includes high-quality Galilean olive oil for additional nourishment and\ncare.\n\n### Directions\n\n- HAIR CONDITIONER: after shampooing, apply from mid,length to ends. Leave on for 1\u20132 minutes and\nrinse well.\n\n- TREATMENT HAIR OIL: Apply a small amount along the hair after showering, apply as needed.\n\n- HAIR SHAMPOO: Wet hair, apply the shampoo, lather and then add more water. Leave on hair for\naround 2 minutes and then rinse off. For best results, pair with our Rosamix Conditioner.\n\n### Ingredients\n\n- HAIR CONDITIONER: WATER (AQUA), CETYL ALCOHOL, DIPALMITOYLETHYL HYDROXYETHYLMONIUM METHOSULFATE,\nHYALURONIC ACID, AMODIMETHICONE, PHENOXYETHANOL, ACRYLAMIDOPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE/ACRYLATES\nCOPOLYMER, FRAGRANCE, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL),\nISOHEXADECANE, HYDROLYZED KERATIN, ISOPROPYL ALCOHOL, CETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN,\nTRIDECETH-12, SEA BUCKTHORN (HIPPOPHAE RHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, COCETH-7, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE,\nBUTYLENE GLYCOL.\n\n- HAIR SHAMPOO: WATER (AQUA), SODIUM COCETH SULFATE, COCAMIDE DEA, SODIUM CHLORIDE, COCAMIDOPROPYL\nBETAINE, PEG-12 DIMETHICONE, HYALURONIC ACID, AMODIMETHICONE, HYDROLYZED KERATIN, FRAGRANCE,\nCETRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, CITRIC ACID, ALOE VERA (ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF POWDER) , TRIDECETH-12, OLIVE\n(OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, ARGAN OIL (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL OIL), SEA BUCKTHORN (HIPPOPHAE\nRHAMNOIDES FRUIT) OIL, FD&C Blue No. 1, TRIETHYLENE GLYCOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL,\nBUTYLENE GLYCOL, PHENOXYETHANOL, MAGNESIUM CHLORIDE, MAGNESIUM NITRATE,\nETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN,METHYLCHLOROISOTHIAZOLINO NE, METHYLISOTHIAZOLINONE.\n\n- TREATMENT HAIR OIL: GRAPE (VITIS VINIFERA) SEED "
