            "text": "FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $50\n* [ ][1]\n* [ ][2]\n* [ ][3]\n* [ ][4]\n[ Skip to content ][5]\nROSAMIX ][6]\n* [ SKIN CARE ][7]\n* [ HAIR CARE ][8]\n* [ BODY CARE ][9]\n* [ CARRIER OIL ][10]\n* [ ESSENTIAL OIL ][11]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n[ ][12]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n#### Login\n\nEmail\nPassword Forgot password?\nSign in\nNew customer? [Create account][13]\n\n## Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail address Submit\nCancel\n$0.00\n][14]\n[ ][15]\nROSAMIX ][16]\n[ ][17]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n* [SKIN CARE][18]\n* [HAIR CARE][19]\n* [BODY CARE][20]\n* [CARRIER OIL][21]\n* [ESSENTIAL OIL][22]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][23]\n1. [Home][24]\n2. Rosamix Skin Care Kit\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Skin Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\n### **Skin Care Kit**\n\n**1) DAY CREAM:**\n\nDiscover the versatile care of our [Day Cream][25], which is carefully crafted to hydrate your skin\nand shield it from harmful environmental factors. This unique formula combines sunscreen with a rich\nblend of pomegranate oil, hemp seed oil and shea butter to nourish and protect your skin throughout\nthe day.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Moisturizing:** Enhances skin hydration, leaving it smooth and supple.\n* **Sun Protection:** Provides a protective barrier against harmful UV rays.\n* **Antioxidant-Rich: **Pomegranate oil helps brighten the skin and reduce the appearance of\npigmentation spots.\n* **Nourishing Ingredients:** Hemp seed oil and shea butter deliver essential nutrients, boosting\nskin elasticity.\n* **Perfect Makeup Base:** Absorbs quickly, prepping the skin for makeup without any greasy residue.\n\nIdeal for daily use on the face and neck, this day cream is suitable for all skin types. Apply a\nsmall amount to cleansed skin and gently massage in. The hemp seed oil in the formula is packed with\nvaluable vitamins and unsaturated fatty acids to deeply nourish and care for your skin. Pomegranate\noil, rich in antioxidants, helps protect and brighten, while shea butter and jojoba oil enhance skin\nelasticity and provide additional protection against environmental stressors.\n\nExperience the comprehensive benefits of this day cream and enjoy the lasting hydration and\nprotection your skin needs all day long.\n\n**2) NIGHT CREAM: **\n\nExperience the nighttime rejuvenation of your skin with Rosamix [Night Cream][26]. This luxurious\ncream combines the nourishing properties of shea butter with a blend of advanced ingredients to\ntighten and enrich your skin. Suitable for both face and neck, this night cream provides full care\nfor all skin types.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Regenerative Effect:** Promotes nighttime skin regeneration, leaving your skin refreshed by\nmorning.\n* **Firming Care:** A complex of advanced ingredients tightens the skin and enhances its elasticity.\n* **Nutrient-Rich:** Enriched with shea butter, providing the skin with healthy fats and maintaining\nits elasticity.\n* **Antioxidant Properties: **Pomegranate oil, rich in antioxidants, helps brighten the skin and\nreduce pigmentation.\n* **Suitable for All Skin Types:** Gentle enough for every skin type, offering comprehensive\nanti-aging care.\n\n**3) REPLENISHING FACIAL SERUM:**\n\nDiscover the intensive care and rejuvenation of your skin with our [replenishing face serum][27].\nEnriched with a unique blend of precious oils, including pomegranate oil, hemp seed oil, olive oil,\nand rose oil as well as Vitamin E, this serum offers comprehensive protection and revitalizes your\nskin. Suitable for all skin types, this face serum promises high-quality care without compromise.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Regeneration: **The powerful combination of pomegranate oil and hemp seed oil promotes skin\nregeneration, giving you a youthful and radiant complexion.\n* **Protection and Nourishment: **Vitamin E and olive oil provide antioxidant protection and\nintensely nourish the skin, preventing dryness and strengthening the skin barrier.\n* **Enhanced Elasticity:** Rose oil supports the production of elastin and collagen fibers, making\nthe skin appear more elastic and refreshed.\n* **Nutrient-Rich Formula: **Packed with vitamins and essential fatty acids, this serum supplies the\nskin with vital nutrients, promoting overall skin health.\n* **Suitable for All Skin Types:** The serum is gentle enough for every skin type, offering\nversatile benefits that calm and revitalize the skin.\n\n**4) APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING:**\n\nDiscover the rejuvenating benefits of our [Apricot Face & Body Scrub Cream][28]. Expertly crafted\nwith finely ground apricot kernels and a luxurious blend of sweet almond, castor and sunflower oils,\nthis peeling cream gently exfoliates dead skin cells and impurities while nourishing and soothing\nyour skin.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Gentle Exfoliation:** Effectively removes dead skin cells and impurities, leaving your skin soft\nand smooth.\n* **Nutrient-Packed:** Infused with hyaluronic acid, shea butter, and vitamins E and C for deep\nhydration and nourishment.\n* **Natural Oil Blend:** Enriched with sweet almond, castor, sunflower, and Galilean olive oil to\nmaintain skin's elasticity and suppleness.\n* **Skin Renewal:** Promotes skin regeneration, resulting in a radiant and healthy complexion.\n* **Multi-Purpose:** Suitable for both face and body, providing comprehensive care and a refreshing\nexperience.\n\n### Directions\n\n- DAY CREAM: For daily use, apply and massage on clean facial skin and neck until completely\nabsorbed. Used as an ideal base for makeup. To complete the treatment, it is recommended to use a\nnight cream.\n\n- NIGHT CREAM: Apply the night cream evenly over face and neck every night after cleansing to deeply\nmoisturize and revive the skin while you sleep.\n\n- REPLENISHING FACIAL SERUM: Apply 2-3 drops on dry skin, morning and evening.\n\n- APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING: Apply the peeling cream and leave on for 1 - 2 minutes. Then\ngently massage and with the fingertips and rinse using warm water.\n\n### Ingredients\n\n- DAY CREAM: WATER (AQUA), SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, GLYCERIN, GLYCERYL STEARATE,\nCETYL ALCOHOL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, SHEA BUTTER (BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER), PROPYLENE GLYCOL,\nBEESWAX (CERA ALBA), POTASSIUM PALMITOYL HYDROLYZED WHEAT PROTEIN, ZINC OXIDE, HYALURONIC ACID,\nCHAMOMILE HYDROLAT (CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA FLOWER WATER), PHENOXYETHANOL, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, VITAMIN E\n(TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL, XANTHAN\nGUM, POMEGRANATE (PUNICA GRANATUM) SEED OIL, FRAGRANCE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TETRASODIUM EDTA,\nCALENDULA OFFICINALIS FLOWER EXTRACT, BENZYL ALCOHOL, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM\nHYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n- NIGHT CREAM: WATER (AQUA), GLYCERIN, CETEARYL OLIVATE, PROPANEDIOL, C15-19 ALKANE, SORBITAN\nOLIVATE, SHEA BUTTER (BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER), DIPALMITOYL HYDROXYPROLINE, HYALURONIC ACID,\nPHENOXYETHANOL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL, PALMITIC\nACID, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, POMEGRANATE (PUNICA GRANATUM) SEED OIL, XANTHAN GUM, FRAGRANCE,\nMETHYLGLUCOSIDE PHOSPHATE, TETRASODIUM EDTA, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN,\nCOPPER LYSINATE/PROLINATE, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n- REPLENISHING FACIAL SERUM: DIMETHICONE, DIMETHICONE CROSSPOLYMER, C15-19 ALKANE, ARGANIA SPINOSA\n(ARGAN) KERNEL OIL, PUNICA GRANATUM (POMEGRANATE) SEED OIL, ROSA CANINA SEED OIL, OLEA EUROPAEA\n(OLIVE) FRUIT OIL, CANNABIS SATIVA SEED OIL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, CITRUS AURANTIUM AMARA FLOWER OIL,\nROSA DAMASCENA FLOWER EXTRACT.\n\n- APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING: WATER (AQUA), APRICOT KERNEL (PRUNUS ARMENIACA SEED) POWDER,\nGLYCERIN, SHEA BUTTER (BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER), SUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS ANNUUS SEED) OIL,\nCETEARYL ALCOHOL, HYDROGENATED ETHYLHEXYL OLIVATE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS\nDULCIS) OIL, CASTOR (RICINUS COMMUNIS SEED) OIL, HYALURONIC ACID, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE,\nPHENOXYETHANOL, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, PHYTOSTEROLS, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, OLIVE (OLEA\nEUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA SEED) OIL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, FRAGRANCE,\nTETRASODIUM EDTA, XANTHAN GUM, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n20% off\n\n# Rosamix Skin Care Kit\n\nRegular price $\u03364\u03368\u0336.\u03366\u03360\u0336 $39.00 20% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n20% off\n\nVOLUMEN: DAY CREAM: 50 ml | 1.69 FL.OZ. NIGHT CREAM: 50 ml | 1.69 FL.OZ. REPLENISHING FACIAL SERUM:\n30 ml | 1.01 FL.OZ. APRICOT FACE & BODY CREAM PEELING: 250 ml | FL.OZ 8.45\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nAdd to Cart\n[Shipping][29] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n### **Skin Care Kit**\n\n**1) DAY CREAM:**\n\nDiscover the versatile care of our [Day Cream][30], which is carefully crafted to hydrate your skin\nand shield it from harmful environmental factors. This unique formula combines sunscreen with a rich\nblend of pomegranate oil, hemp seed oil and shea butter to nourish and protect your skin throughout\nthe day.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Moisturizing:** Enhances skin hydration, leaving it smooth and supple.\n* **Sun Protection:** Provides a protective barrier against harmful UV rays.\n* **Antioxidant-Rich: **Pomegranate oil helps brighten the skin and reduce the appearance of\npigmentation spots.\n* **Nourishing Ingredients:** Hemp seed oil and shea butter deliver essential nutrients, boosting\nskin elasticity.\n* **Perfect Makeup Base:** Absorbs quickly, prepping the skin for makeup without any greasy residue.\n\nIdeal for daily use on the face and neck, this day cream is suitable for all skin types. Apply a\nsmall amount to cleansed skin and gently massage in. The hemp seed oil in the formula is packed with\nvaluable vitamins and unsaturated fatty acids to deeply nourish and care for your skin. Pomegranate\noil, rich in antioxidants, helps protect and brighten, while shea butter and jojoba oil enhance skin\nelasticity and provide additional protection against environmental stressors.\n\nExperience the comprehensive benefits of this day cream and enjoy the lasting hydration and\nprotection your skin needs all day long.\n\n**2) NIGHT CREAM: **\n\nExperience the nighttime rejuvenation of your skin with Rosamix [Night Cream][31]. This luxurious\ncream combines the nourishing properties of shea butter with a blend of advanced ingredients to\ntighten and enrich your skin. Suitable for both face and neck, this night cream provides full care\nfor all skin types.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Regenerative Effect:** Promotes nighttime skin regeneration, leaving your skin refreshed by\nmorning.\n* **Firming Care:** A complex of advanced ingredients tightens the skin and enhances its elasticity.\n* **Nutrient-Rich:** Enriched wit"
