            "text": "FREE SHIPPING ON ORDERS OVER $50\n* [ ][1]\n* [ ][2]\n* [ ][3]\n* [ ][4]\n[ Skip to content ][5]\nROSAMIX ][6]\n* [ SKIN CARE ][7]\n* [ HAIR CARE ][8]\n* [ BODY CARE ][9]\n* [ CARRIER OIL ][10]\n* [ ESSENTIAL OIL ][11]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n[ ][12]\nWe've sent you an email with a link to update your password.\n\n#### Login\n\nEmail\nPassword Forgot password?\nSign in\nNew customer? [Create account][13]\n\n## Reset your password\n\nWe will send you an email to reset your password.\n\nEmail address Submit\nCancel\n$0.00\n][14]\n[ ][15]\nROSAMIX ][16]\n[ ][17]\nSearch\u2026\nCancel\nView all results\n* [SKIN CARE][18]\n* [HAIR CARE][19]\n* [BODY CARE][20]\n* [CARRIER OIL][21]\n* [ESSENTIAL OIL][22]\n\n## Your cart\n\n### Your cart is empty\n\n[ Continue shopping ][23]\n1. [Home][24]\n2. Rosamix Body Care Kit\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n* [Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n[Rosamix Body Care Kit - ROSAMIX]\n\n## Description\n\n### **Rosamix Body Care Kit**\n\n**1) BODY MOISTURIZING CREAM:**\n\nOur [Body Moisturizing Cream][25] offers a rich, nourishing formula designed to deeply moisturize\nyour skin. Enriched with botanical oils and butters, this high-quality body cream is suitable for\nall skin types and especially effective on very dry areas.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Hydration:** Infused with hyaluronic acid and shea butter, this cream provides intense\nmoisture, leaving your skin smooth and supple.\n* **Nutrient-Rich: **Contains vitamins E and C, which nourish the skin and protect it from\nenvironmental damage.\n* **Suitable for All Skin Types:** Versatile and ideal for very dry areas on hands, feet, elbows,\nand knees.\n* **Rich Formulation:** Includes Galilean olive oil and other plant oils for a rich, softening care\nthat leaves your skin silky smooth.\n* **Deep Penetration:** Penetrates deeply into the skin, ensuring long-lasting hydration and care.\n\n**2) FOOT CREAM - FOR DRY & CRACKED SKIN: **\n\nExperience the soothing benefits of our therapeutic foot cream designed for dry and cracked skin.\nEnriched with hemp oil and Vitamin C, this special formula is developed to provide intense care and\nprevent dryness and cracking. Restore smoothness and flexibility to your feet with this unique\ntreatment.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Moisturization:** The rich formulation with hemp oil delivers deep hydration, leaving your\nskin soft and supple.\n* **Nutrient-Rich: **Vitamin C supports skin regeneration and protects against environmental damage.\n* **Prevents Dryness:** Effectively helps to prevent dryness, cracking, and itching.\n* **Improves Flexibility and Comfort:** Ensures your feet feel flexible and light.\n* **Quick Absorption:** Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, providing a pleasant skin\nfeel.\n\n**3) MOISTURIZING BODY OIL:**\n\nOur Moisturizing Body Oil is specifically designed to meet the needs of dry skin. This unique\nformula combines Vitamin E with a curated selection of natural oils, including almond, avocado,\nwheat germ, argan and jojoba oils, along with Galilean olive oil. Refined with the soothing scent of\nylang ylang and geranium oil, this body oil offers a luxurious care experience.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Hydration:** The rich blend of high-quality oils provides intense moisture and protects\nagainst dryness.\n* **Nourishing Ingredients:** Enriched with Vitamin E and natural oils to nourish and keep your skin\nsmooth.\n* **Improves Skin Elasticity:** Regular use promotes skin elasticity, leaving a smooth and radiant\nappearance.\n* **Luxurious Fragrance: **The pleasant scent of ylang ylang and geranium oil gives the skin a\nsubtle, soothing aroma.\n* **Formulated for Dry Skin:** Specifically designed to address the needs of dry skin and provide\noptimal care.\n\n**4) SENSUAL MASSAGE OIL:**\n\nIndulge in the captivating care of our Sensual Massage Oil. This luxurious carrier oil blends\npremium almond oil with pure essential oils to create a unique massage experience that ignites\ndesire and invigorates the senses. Enjoy a relaxing massage with your partner and revel in the\nintense aromas and nourishing properties of this special oil.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Stimulating and Alluring:** Contains a carefully balanced mix of essential oils that enhance\nlibido and arouse desire.\n* **Nourishing Almond Oil:** The base of high-quality almond oil provides deep hydration, leaving\nyour skin soft and supple.\n* **Relaxing and Soothing:** The gentle scents and nourishing properties promote relaxation and\nwell-being.\n* **Quick Absorption:** Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, ensuring a pleasant\napplication.\n* **Versatile Use:** Perfect for sensual partner massages and also great for daily skincare.\n\n### Directions\n\n- BODY MOISTURIZING CREAM: Apply liberally as often as needed.\n\n- FOOT CREAM: Wash your feet and dry them well. Apply the cream, massage it in well until fully\nabsorbed.\n\n- MOISTURIZING BODY OIL: Apply generously all over your body and massage in circular motions.\n\n- SENSUAL MASSAGE OIL: Apply to the skin and massage with gentle movements until fully absorbed.\n\n### Ingredients\n\n- BODY MOISTURIZING CREAM: WATER (AQUA), ISONONYL ISONONANOATE, SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS\nDULCIS) OIL, GLYCERIN, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, SODIUM PCA, JOJOBA (SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS) SEED OIL, SHEA\nBUTTER (BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII BUTTER), STEARYL ALCOHOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BEESWAX (CERA ALBA),\nCETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, XYLITYLGLUCOSIDE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, HYALURONIC ACID, CHAMOMILE HYDROLAT\n(CHAMOMILLA RECUTITA FLOWER WATER), PHENOXYETHANOL, ANHYDROXYLITOL, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, VITAMIN E\n(TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL,\nASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, XANTHAN GUM, XYLITOL, POMEGRANATE (PUNICA GRANATUM) SEED OIL, FRAGRANCE,\nETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TETRASODIUM EDTA, CALENDULA OFFICINALIS FLOWER EXTRACT, CETYL ALCOHOL, ARACHIDYL\nALCOHOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, MYRISTYL ALCOHOL, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE,\nLIMONENE, LINALOOL.\n\n- FOOT CREAM: WATER (AQUA), UREA, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, LIQUID PARAFFIN (PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM), IPM\n(ISOPROPYL MYRISTATE), CASTOR (RICINUS COMMUNIS) SEED OIL, CETYL ALCOHOL, CETEARETH-33, HYALURONIC\nACID, PHENOXYETHANOL, HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ALLANTOIN, HEMP SEED (CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL,\nSALICYLIC ACID, FRAGRANCE, TEA TREE (MELALEUCA ALTERNIFOLIA LEAF) OIL, DIPROPYLENE GLYCOL,\nETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TETRASODIUM EDTA, COPERNICIA CERIFERA WAX, STYRAX BENZOIN RESIN EXTRACT, SODIUM\nHYDROXIDE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, BENZYL BENZOATE, BENZYL ALCOHOL.\n\n- MOISTURIZING BODY OIL: SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, SUNFLOWER (HELIANTHUS ANNUUS)\nSEED OIL, AVOCADO (PERSEA GRATISSIMA) OIL, WHEAT GERM (TRITICUM VULGARE) OIL, JOJOBA (SIMMONDSIA\nCHINENSIS) SEED OIL, ARGAN (ARGANIA SPINOSA KERNEL) OIL, OLIVE (OLEA EUROPAEA FRUIT) OIL, HEMP\n(CANNABIS SATIVA) SEED OIL, VITAMIN E (TOCOPHERYL) ACETATE, ROSE GERANIUM (PELARGONIUM GRAVEOLENS\nFLOWER) OIL, YLANG YLANG (CANANGA ODORATA FLOWER) OIL, EUGENOL, ISOEUGENOL, BENZYL SALICYLATE,\nGERANIOL, FARNESOL, LINALOOL, BENZYL BENZOATE, LIMONENE, CITRAL, CITRONELLOL.\n\n- SENSUAL MASSAGE OIL: SWEET ALMOND (PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS) OIL, OLEA EUROPAEA (OLIVE) FRUIT OIL,\nTOCOPHERYL ACETATECE, PELARGONIUM GRAVEOLENS OIL, PATCHOULI (POGOSTEMON CABLIN) OIL, CANANGA ODORATA\nFLOWER OIL.\n\n### Warnings\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any\nallergy or irritation caused by this product, discontinue use and seek medical help. A patch test on\na small area of skin is highly recommended before using to ensure this is the right product for you.\nStorage Conditions: Store in a cool and dry place. Keep away from direct sunlight. Do not buy if the\nproduct seal is tampered. Keep the lid always closed.\n\n19% off\n\n# Rosamix Body Care Kit\n\nRegular price $\u03364\u03369\u0336.\u03366\u03360\u0336 $40.00 19% off\n\n* Unit price *\n/ per\n19% off\n\nVOLUMEN: BODY MOISTURIZING CREAM: 250 ml | FL.OZ 8.45. FOOT CREAM: 250 ml | FL.OZ 8.45. MOISTURIZING\nBODY OIL: 100 ML | 3.4 FL.OZ. SENSUAL MASSAGE OIL: 100 ML | 3.4 FL.OZ.\n\nQuantity selected exceeds current stock\nDefault Title - Sold out\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nQuantity\nSold out\n[Shipping][26] calculated at checkout.\n\nAdding product to your cart\n\n## Description\n\n### **Rosamix Body Care Kit**\n\n**1) BODY MOISTURIZING CREAM:**\n\nOur [Body Moisturizing Cream][27] offers a rich, nourishing formula designed to deeply moisturize\nyour skin. Enriched with botanical oils and butters, this high-quality body cream is suitable for\nall skin types and especially effective on very dry areas.\n\n**Key Benefits and Features:**\n* **Deep Hydration:** Infused with hyaluronic acid and shea butter, this cream provides intense\nmoisture, leaving your skin smooth and supple.\n* **Nutrient-Rich: **Contains vitamins E and C, which nourish the skin and protect it from\nenvironmental damage.\n* **Suitable for All Skin Types:** Versatile and ideal for very dry areas on hands, feet, elbows,\nand knees.\n* **Rich Formulation:** Includes Galilean olive oil and other plant oils for a rich, softening care\nthat leaves your skin silky smooth.\n* **Deep Penetration:*