            "text": "[About Us][1] de Jacinta Gomez Organic Cooking Oils | Simple Foods | USA\ntop of page\n[[Logo Website.png]][2]\nSelect Language\n* [About][3]\n* [The Purity Standard][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n  * [Wholesale Inquiries][7]\n* [[Facebook]][8]\n* [[Instagram]][9]\n[[MX-Mexico-Flag-icon.png]][10]\n[vidriowebportada_edited_edited.jpg]\n\n## Make the switch to healthier cooking oils with our perfect kitchen companions.\u00a0\n## 100% Pure Avocado Oil. Nothing added. No fillers. No shortcuts. Other brands dilute with cheap\n## oils. We never compromise\u2014Simple Foods is 100% avocado.\n\n# No more. No Less\n\n# Follow us [@simplefoods.usa][11]\n\n##### SITE\n\n##### Products\n\n##### [Home][12]\n\n##### [About][13]\n\n##### [Recipes][14]\n\n##### [Contact Us][15]\n\n[[available_at_amazon_1200x600_Nvz5h2M.png]][16]\n\n##### [Terms and Conditions][17]\n\n##### [Where to Buy][18]\n\n[Simpleleyendas-05.png]\n\nSaporis International, Inc.\n\n5900 Balcones Drive STE 7049\u00a0\n\nAustin TX 78731\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.canva.com/design/DAHM2ZWtVe0/8RWpowPwhVrzp2IYXe2_Iw/view?utm_content=DAHM2ZWtVe0&ut\nm_campaign=designshare&utm_medium=embeds&utm_source=link\n[2]: https://www.simplefoods.com\n[3]: https://www.simplefoods.com/about\n[4]: https://www.simplefoods.com/about-4\n[5]: https://www.simplefoods.com/products\n[6]: https://www.simplefoods.com/contact\n[7]: https://www.simplefoods.com/wholesale\n[8]: https://www.facebook.com/Simple-Foods-Usa-103437048292472\n[9]: https://www.instagram.com/simplefoods.usa/\n[10]: http://simplefoods.mx\n[11]: https://www.instagram.com/simplefoods.usa/\n[12]: https://www.simplefoods.com\n[13]: https://www.simplefoods.com/about\n[14]: https://www.simplefoods.com/recipes\n[15]: https://www.simplefoods.com/contact\n[16]: https://www.amazon.com/stores/SimpleFoods/page/C4ABAA7E-C03E-47C0-95E1-27C8DBBC1F29?ref_=ast_b\nln&store_ref=bl_ast_dp_brandLogo_sto\n[17]: https://www.simplefoods.com/terms-condi