        "crawl_text": "Global Manufactures over 80% of products in-house Commitment to transparency in product sourcing and ingredients Wide range of products catering to various dietary needs United Kingdom United Kingdom Global Bulk\u2122 is one of the largest and fastest-growing nutrition brands globally, delivering nearly 10 million products in 2022. The company emphasizes transparency and quality in its product offerings, manufacturing a significant portion in-house. Expanding product range to cater to diverse dietary needs. Enhancing global reach and community engagement. Growing demand for health and wellness products globally. Increasing interest in plant-based nutrition. Leading brand in the sports and active nutrition market. Expansion of product lines Increased online presence and e-commerce capabilities [cz][1][cz][2][dk][3][dk][4][at][5][ch][6][de][7][at][8][ch][9][de][10][eu][11][uk][12][ie][13][eu][\n14][uk][15][ie][16][es][17][es][18][fr][19][fr][20][it][21][it][22][nl][23][nl][24][pl][25][pl][26][\npt][27][pt][28][ro][29][ro][30][se][31][se][32]\n* [Up to 75% off][33]\n* [Free Delivery over \u00a339][34]\n* [Extra 10% Off for Students][35]\n**[Offers][36]**\n* **[Best Sellers][37]** [up to 75% off]\n* [New Products][38]\n* [Trending Products][39]\n* [Clearance][40]\nShop by goal\n* [Build Muscle][41]\n* [Weight Loss][42]\n* [Endurance][43]\n* [Health & Wellbeing][44]\n* [Vegan][45]\n[Protein][46]\n* [All Protein][47]\n* [Whey Protein][48] [Bestseller]\n* [Clear Protein][49] [Trending]\n* [Vegan Protein][50]\n* [Mass Gainers][51]\n* [Beef Protein][52] [New]\n* [Collagen Protein][53] [Trending]\n* [Recovery Protein][54]\n* [Complete Food Shake][55]\n* [Protein Bars][56]\n* [Protein Snacks][57]\n* [Protein Smoothie][58]\n* [High Protein Foods][59]\n\n[BBLE-HWHE][60]\n\n[BPB-WPC8-0000][61]\n\n[BPB-VWHE][62]\n\n[BPB-CLPR][63]\n\n[BPB-COLL-VITC][64]\n\n[Pre-Workout][65]\n[Creatine][66]\n[Vegan][67]\n* [All Vegan][68]\n* [Vegan Protein Powders][69]\n* [Veg