        "crawl_text": "US Foods CHEF'STORE Publicly traded under US Foods United States California Idaho Montana North Carolina No membership required Wide selection of products Competitive pricing Convenient store locations Wide selection of high-quality products Convenient locations across California Wide selection of restaurant-quality products Wholesale pricing Convenient online ordering and pickup options Wide range of products Bulk purchasing options Convenient online ordering Wide variety of products Tempe, Arizona Tempe, AZ Chico, CA Concord, CA Eureka, CA Merced, CA Modesto, CA Oakland, CA Redding, CA Sacramento, CA San Francisco, CA San Jose, CA San Lorenzo, CA Santa Cruz, CA Santa Rosa, CA United States North America California Idaho Montana North Carolina CHEF'STORE offers a wide range of food products without requiring membership, making it accessible to both businesses and individual consumers. The company has a strong presence across the United States with multiple locations, enhancing its service reach. CHEF'STORE has been serving the restaurant and catering community since 1988. The company offers a wide range of products including fresh produce, premium meats, and kitchen supplies. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae Cash & Carry store model. Expanding product offerings to include more exclusive brands and unique ingredients. Enhancing customer experience through improved store layouts and online services. Expanding product offerings to include more plant-based options. Enhancing online ordering capabilities for convenience. Competition from other wholesale and retail grocery stores. Maintaining supply chain efficiency amidst fluctuating demand. Competition from other wholesale food suppliers and grocery stores. Growing demand for bulk food supplies among restaurants and home cooks. Expansion into new geographic markets. Growing demand for bulk food supplies among restaurants and catering businesses. CHEF'STORE is positioned as a leading wholesale food supplier in the United States, catering to both commercial and individual customers. Increasing trend of home cooking and meal preparation. Expansion of online shopping and delivery services. Increasing number of restaurants and catering businesses in California. Rising trend of home cooking and meal preparation. Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# Wholesale Food Store Locations\n\nSearch City, State, Zip Code, or Store #\nReset\n\nFound 0 locations near\n\nUse My Location CLICK&CARRY Pick Up\nFound **0**\n0of0\nLoad More\n\nSearching for a wholesale food and restaurant supplier near you? Your search is over! CHEF\u2019STORE\n(formerly Cash&Carry Smart Foodservice) has locations all across the United States, making it\nconvenient for you to find the food and restaurant supplies you need. Our stores are easy to\nnavigate and carry everything from fresh produce to kitchen supply staples at competitive prices,\nsaving you time and money.\n\n## Your Local Wholesale Food and Restaurant Supplier\n\nConsider CHEF\u2019STORE your one-stop-shop for quality meats, fresh produce, premium dairy products, and\nmore. Are you also looking for quality kitchen supplies? We have you covered! As one of the largest\nwholesale grocery distributors in the nation, our friendly, knowledgeable staff is ready and eager\nto answer questions and help you find exactly what you need for a superior shopping experience.\n\n### Daily Savings and Specials on Restaurant Supplies\n\n**Everyone is welcome:** A membership is not required\u2014we work with restaurateurs and home cooks\nalike\n\n**Buy a lot (or not!):** Stock up on a list of kitchen supplies or run in for one or two produce\nitems\n\n### A Fresh Take on Wholesale Supplies for Restaurants\n\n**Volume and variety:** Whether you\u2019re looking for unique ingredients or kitchen staples, we have\nwhat you need\n\n**Quality freshness: **We\u2019re proud to offer high-quality, fresh produce, meats, dairy, and bakery\nproducts\n\n### Paving the Way For Time and Money Savings\n\n**Ready to help:** Our friendly, knowledgeable staff is here to ensure a superior shopping\nexperience\n\n**Bright, well-lit warehouse stores: **Save valuable time shopping our wide aisles and organized\nshelves\n\n### WHAT\u2019S THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN A WHOLESALE STORE AND GROCERY STORE?\n\nThe primary difference between a wholesale store and a grocery store lies in their target customers,\npricing, and buying process.\n\nWholesale stores sell goods in large quantities at lower per-unit prices, catering mainly to\nbusinesses, institutions, and bulk-buying consumers. These stores often require membership and offer\na wide range of products at discounted rates due to bulk purchasing.\n\nIn contrast, grocery stores meet the everyday needs of individuals and families, offering a diverse\nselection of items in smaller quantities with an emphasis on convenience, variety, and\naccessibility.\n\nCHEF\u2019STORE is open to all without membership fees and contracts, providing a wide range of food and\nnon-food items at low prices. As a grocery wholesaler, we serve both restaurants and organizations,\nas well as the general public, offering quality goods at affordable prices.\n\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][59] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][60]\n[Specials][61]\n[Products][62]\n[About][63]\n[Site Map][64]\n[Logo Downloads][65]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][66]\n[Privacy Policy][67]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][68]\n[Terms & Conditions][69]\n[Cookie Policy][70]\n[Investors][71]\n[Recalls][72]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][73]\n[Contact][74]\n[Facebook][75]\n[Instagram][76]\n[X (Twitter)][77]\n[LinkedIn][78]\n[Pinterest][79]\n[US Foods.com][80]\n[Privacy Policy][81]\n[Locations][82]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][83]\n[About][84]\n[Terms & Conditions][85]\n[Careers][86]\n[Cookie Policy][87]\n[Contact][88]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][89]\n[Investors][90]\n\n[Recalls][91]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][92]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][93]\n\n[Sign In to Add][94] [ Sign Up][95]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][96]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the CHEF'STORE you shop at?\nYes No\nYes No\nEnter city Select state Select state Arizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina\nOklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas Utah Virginia Washington Enter zipcode\nThanks!\n\nTo view this video please enable JavaScript, and consider upgrading to a web browser that [supports\nHTML5 video][97]\n\nSigned Out\n\nYou have been signed out due to inactivity or by signing in on another device.\n\nSelect how to shop\n[Start Shopping][98]\nNew Shopping List Name\nChoose how you'd like to shop.\n[ Instacart\nDelivery][99]\n[ CLICK&CARRY\nPick Up][100]\nYes No\nFeedback\n\n[1]: https://www.google.com/chrome/\n[2]: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/edge\n[3]: https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/\n[4]: https://support.apple.com/downloads/safari\n[5]: #layBody\n[6]: /locations/\n[7]: /locations/AZ/\n[8]: /locations/CA/\n[9]: /locations/GA/\n[10]: /locations/ID/\n[11]: /locations/MT/\n[12]: /locations/NV/\n[13]: /locations/NC/\n[14]: /locations/OK/\n[15]: /locations/OR/\n[16]: /locations/SC/\n[17]: /locations/TX/\n[18]: /locations/UT/\n[19]: /locations/VA/\n[20]: /locations/WA/\n[21]: /specials/\n[22]: /grocerydelivery/\n[23]: /grocerydelivery/\n[24]: /grocerydelivery/clickandcarry/\n[25]: https://shop.chefstore.com\n[26]: https://www.doordash.com/business/chefstore-13051015\n[27]: https://www.ubereats.com/brand/chefstore\n[28]: https://www.grubhub.com/third-party/merchant/chef-store?partner=instacart\n[29]: /search/ful