            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Tempe\n\n3115 S. McClintock Drive Tempe, AZ 85282\n#8105\nStore Hours\nMonday\n7am - 6pm\nTuesday\n7am - 6pm\nWednesday\n7am - 6pm\nThursday\n7am - 6pm\nFriday\n7am - 6pm\nSaturday\n7am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 4pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 7am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n7am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n7am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n7am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n7am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n7am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n7am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 4pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 7am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[480-838-1199][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Tempe, AZ\n\nVisit your local Tempe CHEF'STORE for everything from professional-grade equipment to exceptional\nproduce. Looking for restaurant supplies like fresh beef, pork, seafood, deli meats, bakery items,\nand dairy for your bustling restaurant off 7th St. in Downtown Phoenix? Searching for some classic\ntailgate snacks for an epic Sun Devil Football Stadium game? Our restaurant supply store in the\nPhoenix area provides restaurants, caterers, and home chefs with high-quality and affordable bulk\nmeats, dry ingredients, baking supplies, top-quality canned goods, dressings, sauces, dessert\ntoppings, and to-go paper products. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae\nCHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nNew to CHEF\u2019STORE? We're easily accessible from the I-10 on McClintock Drive near the Valley Plaza\nShopping Mall. Situated a mere 500 feet NE of Southern Palms Shopping Center and less than a mile SW\nof McClintock High School, Tempe\u2019s CHEF\u2019STORE is smack-dab in one of the most popular sections of\ntown. That means quick access, ample parking, and a convenient location for all your restaurant\nsupply needs. Our vast inventory ensures you'll find precisely what you are looking for and even\nmore than you expected!\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\nORDER AHEAD - CLICK&CARRY ONLINE\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nOur 7 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nOur 7 new products!\n[MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN\nSYRUP] [MR. C'S BLUE RASPBERRY FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S CHERRY FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S LIME\nFOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S WATERMELON FOUNTAIN SYRUP]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nMichael Lulf\nManager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][106]\n\n[Sign In to Add][107] [ Sign Up][108]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites 