            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# Wholesale Food Store Locations in California\n\nSearch City, State, Zip Code, or Store #\nReset\nUse My Location CLICK&CARRY Pick Up\nFound **0**\n0of0\nLoad More\n\n# US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE Locations in California\n\nIf you\u2019re looking for wholesale food and restaurant supplies in California, look no further! With\nwholesale food supply locations throughout the state, it\u2019s easy for you to find the variety and\nquality of food and restaurant supplies you need while saving time and money.\n\n## Your Local Wholesale Food Store & Restaurant Supply Company\n\nAt CHEF\u2019STORE (formerly Cash&Carry Smart Foodservice), we carry choice meats, fresh produce, bakery\nitems, dairy products, and more in the variety and volume you need. We pride ourselves on\nexceptional products, convenient online shopping, and knowledgeable associates. We also offer\ngrocery delivery services so you can get our competitively priced products directly to your\nlocation.\n\n### Savings and Specials on Bulk Food and More\n\n**Buy in bulk or just a bit:** Spend less for a weekly stock-up or a last-minute save\n\n**Public welcome:** Get special deals, discounts and promotions \u2013 with no membership\n\n### A Fresh Take on Shopping for Restaurant Supplies\n\n**Produce, meat and dairy: **Hand-select your products at the peak of freshness\n\n**Variety and volume: **Find a world of ethnic food, equipment and our exclusive brands\n\n### CHEF\u2019STORE Paves the Way to Saving You Time and Money\n\n**Bright and clutter-free stores:** Enjoy a superior warehouse shopping experience\n\n**Superior customer engagement: **Get staff expertise and service that respects your time\n\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][59] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][60]\n[Specials][61]\n[Products][62]\n[About][63]\n[Site Map][64]\n[Logo Downloads][65]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][66]\n[Privacy Policy][67]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][68]\n[Terms & Conditions][69]\n[Cookie Policy][70]\n[Investors][71]\n[Recalls][72]\n\n## Connect