            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Chico\n\n930 Mangrove Ave Chico, CA 95926\n#565\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(530) 891-9140][61] f(530) 891-9150\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Chico, CA\n\nVisit our wholesale restaurant supply warehouse, located in the heart of Chico. Our shelves are\nstocked with top-quality dry goods, beverages, frozen foods, canned goods, dressings, and more.\nLooking for premium ingredients for your restaurant menu? Choose from a wide selection of fresh\nbeef, pork, seafood, cheeses, and deli meats. Our large, temperature-controlled coolers mean veggies\nand fruits stay crisp and delicious. We also offer eco-friendly paper products, cleaning supplies,\nand more. There's no need to visit multiple stores for your restaurant, catering, or home cook\nneeds. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into\nthe US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nWant to cut down on your in-store shopping time? Our online program, Click&Carry, lets you pre-order\nand pick up with ease. Simply place your order online, and our team will put it together for you to\npick it up in the store.\n\nAre you a CHEF\u2019STORE first-time shopper? Our bulk supply store is easily accessible via CA-99 and\nlocated right at the intersection of Mangrove and Palmetto, just a few blocks from the Post Office\non Vallombrosa Avenue. Coming from a day at Bidwell Park One-Mile area? Simply go north up Artibus\nAvenue to Palmetto. Hoping to stock up on premium ingredients for your university area restaurant?\nCHEF\u2019STORE is less than two miles from California State University, quick trip easy. Regardless of\nwhat neighborhood you are located in\u2013from Nob Hill to Waterford to Aspen Glen\u2013CHEF\u2019STORE provides a\nconvenient location, excellent parking, and exceptional products.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S\nMARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100'\nRED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE\nSHREDDED CHEDDAR] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S CHERRY\nFOUNTAIN SYRUP]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nBrandon Koski\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sel