            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Concord\n\n2050 Monument Blvd Concord, CA 94520\n#510\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(925) 671-0148][61] f(888) 698-4715\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Concord, CA\n\nLooking for the highest-quality restaurant and catering supplies at wholesale costs? Visit us at our\ndowntown Concord restaurant supply store today. Situated in the heart of the Four Corners\nneighborhood, CHEF'STORE provides one-stop shopping for professional chefs, as well as families on a\nstrict grocery budget. That means there's no need to waste time shopping at multiple vendors. We're\nknown for our fresh produce, beef, pork, dairy, bakery, and more. You'll love our wide aisles and\nshelves stocked with all the dry ingredients and canned goods you need for exceptional meals. Our\nbeverage center provides our customers with everything from bottled water to soda to premium teas\nand coffees. We know you're busy, so save time using Click&Carry. Shop online and our team will put\ntogether your order for in-store pickup. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US\nFoods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nFind us right off of Monument Boulevard, in the same shopping area as Big Lots, Dollar Tree, and\nFurniture Depot. If traveling from the Bay Point or Pittsburg areas, take CA-4 W to CA-242 S for a\nquick stop at our convenient location. Restaurant owners and home chefs coming from the southern\nparts, like Walnut Creek, I-680 N will get you to our doors in less than 20 minutes. No matter where\nyou are coming from, you will be wowed by our expansive selection of professional-quality products\nat bulk store price points.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[KETTLE POTATO CHIPS, VARIETY PACK, 30 CT SNACK BAGS, 1.5 OZ] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK\nPLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY IVORY] [MR.\nC'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS DINNER NAPKIN 15X17 2 PLY BLACK] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE\nSMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [JOY CONE LARGE JACKETED WAFFLE CONES #7196] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN\nSYRUP] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE GREEK FETA BLOCK]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nAustin Peterson\nManager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][1