            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Eureka\n\n6700 N Highway 101 Eureka, CA 95501\n#546\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(707) 443-2103][61] f(707) 443-1306\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Eureka, CA\n\nEureka restaurant and bar owners pride themselves on delivering exceptional food and drink to all\ntheir patrons. That\u2019s why so many local restaurant owners flock to CHEF\u2019STORE for top ingredients,\nstellar customer service, and everyday operational essentials. Since 1988, CHEF'STORE has been\nserving Eureka\u2019s restaurant and catering community and surrounding areas with the highest-quality\nbulk food and beverage supplies. If you haven\u2019t explored what we have to offer, visit us today! In\nMarch 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US\nFoods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nOur store is easily accessible, located three miles north of Eureka near the Indianola cutoff.\nSituated right on the scenic Pacific Coast Highway, US-101, our welcoming restaurant supply store is\nhard to miss! Stop by for the produce, farm-fresh dairy, and of course, premium wholesale meats like\nbeef, pork, and poultry. Our shelves are stocked with top-quality dry ingredients, canned goods, and\nbeverage items. Looking for frozen products? You'll love our newly remodeled freezer and coolers.\nExpanding your vegan and vegetarian menus options? CHEF\u2019STORE carries the latest ingredients for\nplant-based dining. We are also open to the general public, so if you are a budding home chef or\nfeeding a family on a budget, anyone can enjoy premium eats at industry prices.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' RED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S\nMARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [REAL FRESH VANILLA\nPUDDING] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' GREEN PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [LYCHEE CLAMSHELL] [CREATIVE\nCONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE\nSHREDDED CHEDDAR]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nTami Gruetzmacher\nManager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Food