            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Merced\n\n3275 R Street Merced, CA 95348\n#217\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[209-626-3612][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF'STORE in Merced, CA\n\nCalling all Merced, CA restaurant operators and home cooks! Visit your local CHEF\u2019STORE for bulk\nfoods at wholesale prices. Located on R Street, across from the Merced Mall, this CHEF'STORE\nlocation includes a wide selection of exceptional products, such as meat, produce, and dairy as well\nas ingredients and kitchen supplies across nearly 19,000 square feet designed for culinary success.\nIn March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US\nFoods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nShop for catering supplies, fresh meat, produce, cleaning products, and more at our 86th store and\n17th California location. Like all CHEF'STORE locations, expect competitive prices, wholesale\nconvenience, and high-quality supplies during every visit.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][66]\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][67] [See All New Products][68]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SHREDDED CHEDDAR] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [MR. C'S LEMON\nFOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MCCORMICK DEHYDRATED CHOPPED ONIONS] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S\nMARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' RED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING\n40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [REAL FRESH BANANA PUDDING]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nRobert Lopez\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][69]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][70] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][71]\n[Specials][72]\n[Products][73]\n[About][74]\n[Site Map][75]\n[Logo Downloads][76]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][77]\n[Privacy Policy][78]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][79]\n[Terms & Conditions][80]\n[Cookie Policy][81]\n[Investors][82]\n[Recalls][83]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][84]\n[Contact][85]\n[Facebook][86]\n[Instagram][87]\n[X (Twitter)][88]\n[LinkedIn][89]\n[Pinterest][90]\n[US Foods.com][91]\n[Privacy Policy][92]\n[Locations][93]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][94]\n[About][95]\n[Terms & Conditions][96]\n[Careers][97]\n[Cookie Policy][98]\n[Contact][99]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][100]\n[Investors][101]\n\n[Recalls][102]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][103]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][104]\n\n[Sign In to Add][105] [ Sign Up][106]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][107]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the CHEF'STORE you shop at?\nYes No\nYes No\nEnter city Select state Select state Arizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina\nOklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas Utah Virginia Washington Enter zipcode\nThanks!\n\nTo view this video please enable JavaScript, and consider upgrading to a web browser that [supports\nHTML5 video][108]\n\nSigned Out\n\nYou have been signed out due to inactivity or by signing i