            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Redding\n\n1152 Hartnell Redding, CA 96002\n#547\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(530) 223-0341][61] f(888) 840-8138\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Redding, CA\n\nCHEF'STORE has been Redding\u2019s go-to restaurant bulk supply store since first opening our doors in\n1985. Less than half a mile from Enterprise High School, our conveniently located building is right\non Hartnell Avenue, just across the street from Harbor Freight Tools. CHEF\u2019STORE is also easily\naccessible via I-5 and Churn Creek road. Restaurateurs in Anderson and surrounding areas can make a\nquick trip for exceptional products. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae\nCHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nVisit us today for choice beef, pork, and deli meats. Browse our large selection of high-quality\nproduce, farm-fresh dairy, and bakery items. Our shelves are stocked with hundreds of dry\ningredients, canned goods, and beverages. You can even order online with Click&Carry. Our friendly\nstaff will put together your custom order, and you can simply pick it up in the store the next day.\nWe also partner with third-party delivery services to help you get all of our products delivered\ndirectly to you.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $150\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CAFE CLASSIC TAPIOCA PUDDING] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN\nSYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [REAL\nFRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING\n40X100' RED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE\nSHREDDED CHEDDAR]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nMichael Yang\nManager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][106]\n\n[Sign In to Add][107] [ Sign Up][108]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][109]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the CHEF'STORE you shop at?\nYes No\nYes No\nEnter city Select state Select state Arizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina\nOklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas Utah Virginia Washington Enter zipcode\nThanks!\n\nTo view this video please enable JavaScript, and consider upgrading to a web browser that [supports\nHTML5 video][110]\n\nSigned Out\n\nYou have been signed out due to inactivity or by signing in on another device.\n\nSelect how to shop\n[Start Shopping][111]\nNew Shopping List Name\nChoose how you'd like to shop.\n[ Instacart\nDelivery][112]\n[ CLICK&CARRY\nPick Up][113]\nYes No\nFeedback\n\n[1]: https://www.google.com/chrome/\n[2]: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/edge\n[3]: https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/\n[4]: https://support.apple.com/downloads/safari\n[5]: #layBody\n[6]: /locations/\n[7]: /locations/AZ/\n[8]: /locations/CA/\n[9]: /locations/GA/\n[10]: /locations/ID/\n[11]: /locations/MT/\n[12]: /locations/NV/\n[13]: /locations/NC/\n[14]: /locations/OK/\n[15]: /locations/OR/\n[16]: /locations/SC/\n[17]: /locations/TX/\n[18]: /locations/UT/\n[19]: /locations/VA/\n[20]: /locations/WA/\n[21]: /specials/\n[22]: /grocerydelivery/\n[23]: /grocerydelivery/\n[24]: /grocerydelivery/clickandcarry/\n[25]: https://shop.chefstore.com\n[26]: https://www.doordash.com/business/chefstore-13051015\n[27]: https://www.ubereats.com/brand/chefstore\n[28]: https://www.grubhub.com/third-party/merchant/chef-store?partner=instacart\n[29]: /search/fullsearch/\n[30]: /search/fullsearch/\n[31]: /search/departments/\n[32]: /search/newproducts/\n[33]: /search/exclusivebrands/\n[34]:\n[35]: /services/checkbusinesstools/\n[36]: /services/checkbusinesstools/\n[37]: /services/cardsignup/\n[38]: /services/staycoolfoodsafety/\n[39]: /about/\n[40]: /about/blog/\n[41]: /about/cultural