            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - San Francisco\n\n170 S Van Ness Avenue San Francisco, CA 94103\n#586\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(415) 864-8284][61] f(888) 417-3324\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in San Francisco, CA\n\nSan Francisco is synonymous with world-class cuisine. It's famous for eateries in Fisherman\u2019s Wharf,\nRussian Hill, Jackson Square, Chinatown, and more. There\u2019s a reason why chefs consider CHEF\u2019STORE,\nSan Francisco's go-to bulk restaurant supply store. We provide our customers with the highest\nquality products and competitive prices. Shop for fresh beef, pork, deli meats, produce, and dairy.\nOur freezers are stocked with everything from appetizers to desserts. Our aisles are filled with\ncanned and dry goods, paper products, and much more. Place an online order using Click&Carry and our\nteam will have it ready for in-store pickup. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US\nFoods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nCHEF\u2019STORE is located just off of HWY 101, at the intersection of South Van Ness Avenue and 13th\nStreet. We are a little over a mile north of the bustling Mission District, via Folsom Street, just\nsouth of TAP Plastics. You can\u2019t miss our huge parking lot or convenient location. So, stop by to\nshop for everything you need to create exceptional dishes that meet San Francisco's high, epicurean\nexpectations. We not only cater to restaurant professionals, but our doors are open to home chefs,\noffice managers, and anyone searching for exceptional products. CHEF\u2019STORE even carries cleaning\nsupplies, to-go boxes, and more!\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100'\nNAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MCCORMICK DEHYDRATED CHOPPED ONIONS] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SHREDDED CHEDDAR]\n[REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [CREATIVE CONVERTING\n40X100' RED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S\nLEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nStile Preinitz\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[