y\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(510) 278-8985][61] f(888) 417-3324\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in San Lorenzo, CA\n\nVisit CHEF\u2019STORE, across the street from Crunch Fitness San Lorenzo, for all your bulk restaurant\nsupplies. Our large deli coolers are filled with the freshest meats. Stop by today for high-quality\nproduce, beef, pork, dairy, and bakery items. Our aisles are stocked with a wide variety of canned\ngoods and ingredients. We have delicious ready-to-go appetizers and entrees for sale in our massive\nfreezer section! In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and\nintegrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nLocated off the 880 freeway, you'll find our wholesale restaurant supply company on Lewelling\nBoulevard, just a little northeast of the Tracy Street intersection and west of National Petroleum.\nLook for the large green awning and vast parking lot. Want to save time shopping? Use Click&Carry,\nour online ordering system. Our team will compile your order so you can pick it up in the store.\nSimply register your account online. Plus, CHEF\u2019STORE never requires membership fees to take\nadvantage of our bulk store prices. Anyone can shop our shelves for restaurant-quality products!\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order 