            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Santa Cruz\n\n1660 Commercial Way Santa Cruz, CA 95065\n#215\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[831-824-9646][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF'STORE in Santa Cruz, CA\n\nOur 84th CHEF\u2019STORE location in Santa Cruz, California offers high-quality bulk food and restaurant\nsupplies at unbeatable prices! Visit our 23,000 square foot location in the former Toys R' Us space\noff Cabrillo Highway near Dignity Health Dominican Hospital. We carry a full selection of fresh\nproduce, meat, and dairy products. Beyond meeting your wholesale grocery needs, you'll find a range\nof kitchen equipment, restaurant supplies, and other items like cleaning supplies, storage\ncontainers, and more. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and\nintegrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nAs the 16th location in California, we're delighted to bring our competitive prices, wholesale\nconvenience, and professional-grade supplies to Santa Cruz's incredible community. Visit us today!\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][66]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][67] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][68] [See All New Products][69]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [MCCORMICK DEHYDRATED CHOPPED ONIONS] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS\nDINNER NAPKIN 15X17 2 PLY WHITE] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY WHITE] [REAL FRESH BANANA\nPUDDING] [CAFE CLASSIC TAPIOCA PUDDING] [DANISH ORCHARDS RASPBERRY 56 OZ] [THE ORIGINAL LOUISIANA\nHOT SAUCE GLASS BOTTLE SHELF STABLE] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S\nWATERMELON FOUNTAIN SYRUP]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nKazandra Amador Osorio\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][70]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][71] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][72]\n[Specials][73]\n[Products][74]\n[About][75]\n[Site Map][76]\n[Logo Downloads][77]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][78]\n[Privacy Policy][79]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][80]\n[Terms & Conditions][81]\n[Cookie Policy][82]\n[Investors][83]\n[Recalls][84]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][85]\n[Contact][86]\n[Facebook][87]\n[Instagram][88]\n[X (Twitter)][89]\n[LinkedIn][90]\n[Pinterest][91]\n[US Foods.com][92]\n[Privacy Policy][93]\n[Locations][94]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][95]\n[About][96]\n[Terms & Conditions][97]\n[Careers][98]\n[Cookie Policy][99]\n[Contact][100]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][101]\n[Investors][102]\n\n[Recalls][103]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][104]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][105]\n\n[Sign In to Add][106] [ Sign Up][107]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][108]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the CHEF'STORE you shop at?\nYes No\nYes No\nEnter city Select state