            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Santa Rosa\n\n565 Barham Avenue Santa Rosa, CA 95404\n#576\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 7pm\nTuesday\n6am - 7pm\nWednesday\n6am - 7pm\nThursday\n6am - 7pm\nFriday\n6am - 7pm\nSaturday\n6am - 7pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 7pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 7pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 7pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 7pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 7pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 7pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(707) 543-5844][61] f(707) 543-5949\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## Santa Rosa Saves You Money Every Week!\n\nSave money at CHEF\u2019STORE in Santa Rosa! Visit our giant, bulk supply store for everything from\npremium coffee and teas to farm-fresh produce and more! We stock only the freshest meats, seafood,\nbakery goods, and dairy products. Our shelves are filled with top-quality canned and dry goods. From\npaper products to cleaning supplies, we have it all for a convenient one-stop shopping\nexperience. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated\ninto the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nWe are located at the intersection of Barham Avenue and Santa Rosa Avenue, a few blocks west of\nCarquest Auto Parts. We are in the same complex as Boost Mobile and Sam\u2019s Donuts, so you can\u2019t miss\nus! If you are traveling from out of the area, our wholesale restaurant supply store is easily\naccessible from HWY 101 and HWY 12. Plus, we offer plenty of parking so you can load up on\nexceptional supplies with ease. Whether you are shopping for your downtown restaurant, bustling\ncafe, office pantry, or for the whole family, you\u2019ll find everything you are looking for at\nCHEF\u2019STORE.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][68] [See All New Products][69]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE HEAVY\nWHIPPING CREAM] [CAFE CLASSIC TAPIOCA PUDDING] [MR. C'S BLUE RASPBERRY FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [ULTRA SOFT\nPLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY BLACK] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN\nSYRUP] [SECRET AARDVARK HABANERO HOT SAUCE] [DANISH ORCHARDS RASPBERRY 56 OZ]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nTim Baseheart\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][70]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][71] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][72]\n[Specials][73]\n[Products][74]\n[About][75]\n[Site Map][76]\n[Logo Downloads][77]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][78]\n[Privacy Policy][79]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][80]\n[Terms & Conditions][81]\n[Cookie Policy][82]\n[Investors][83]\n[Recalls][84]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][85]\n[Contact][86]\n[Facebook][87]\n[Instagram][88]\n[X (Twitter)][89]\n[LinkedIn][90]\n[Pinterest][91]\n[US Foods.com][92]\n[Privacy Policy][93]\n[Locations][94]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][95]\n[About][96]\n[Terms & Conditions][97]\n[Careers][98]\n[Cookie Policy][99]\n[Contact][100]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][101]\n[Investors][102]\n\n[Recalls][103]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][104]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][105]\n\n[Sign In to Add][106] [ Sign Up][107]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][108]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the C