            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Yuba City\n\n717 Colusa Ave Yuba City, CA 95991\n#572\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(530) 751-7125][61] f(530) 751-7363\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Yuba City, CA\n\nVisit CHEF\u2019STORE in Yuba City for all your culinary needs. As professional restaurant food\nsuppliers, we pride ourselves on excellent customer service, convenience, and of course, plenty of\nparking. Shop our shelves, freezer section, and coolers for the freshest produce, beef, pork, dairy,\nand bakery products. Our wide variety of beverages, grocery items, and dry ingredients are available\nat low costs, so you can stock up easily and save money. In order to provide our customers with the\nbest service we created Click&Carry. Simply order online, and our staff will put together your\ncustom order so you can save time by picking it up at the store. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice\nofficially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store\nmodel][63].\n\nCome stop by our impressive and easy-to-shop warehouse with large aisles. You\u2019ll find us on Colusa\nAvenue, between Clark Avenue and Orange Street, next door to Party Land. We're also easily\naccessible from HWY 99, allowing patrons outside of Yuba City quick access. No matter where you are\ncoming from or what you are looking for, our bulk food store offers one-stop shopping for all your\nrestaurant and catering supplies.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SHREDDED CHEDDAR] [MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING\n40X100' PURPLE PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' NAVY\nPLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' RED PLASTIC\nTABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL]\n[VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nBreeana Hernandez\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n