Foods CHEF\u2019STORE Locations in Idaho\n\nIf you\u2019re looking for wholesale food and restaurant supplies in Idaho, look no further! As a premier\nwholesale food supplier serving the U.S., we make it easy for you to find the variety and quality of\nfood and restaurant supplies you need. Not only will you save money, you\u2019ll save time shopping at\nour easy-to-navigate warehouse stores.\n\n## Your Local Wholesale Food and Restaurant Supplier\n\nWe offer fresh produce, quality meats, wholesale cheese and dairy products, and much more. Looking\nto maximize your restaurant profits or want to introduce fresh new ingredients into your menu? How\nabout both? CHEF\u2019STORE (formerly Cash&Carry Smart Foodservice) provides high-quality products at\ncompetitive prices, so you meet your food cost goals and keep your menus creative.\n\n### Daily Savings and Specials on Bulk Products\n\n**No membership required: **Everyone can take advantage of savings and quality products\n\n**Shop your way:** Whether you want a little or a lot, you can get exactly what you need\n\n### A New Way to Shop for Restaurant Food and Supplies\n\n**Dairy, meat, and produce: **We stock only the freshest wholesale products\n\n**Shop outside the box:** Our selection of wholesale items makes it easy to enhance your menu\n\n### Save Time, Money and Get Great Customer Service\n\n**Our customers are our partners:** Get staff expertise and service that respects your time\n\n**Time-saving shopping:** Wide aisles and smart design make our stores a breeze to navigate\n\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][59] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][60]\n[Specials][61]\n[Products][62]\n[About][63]\n[Site Map][64]\n[Logo Downloads][65]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][66]\n[Privacy Policy][67]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][68]\n[Terms & Conditions][69]\n[Cookie Policy][70]\