            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Boise\n\n1700 W Shoreline Dr Boise, ID 83702\n#564\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Open Now! Till 6pm][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nOpen Now! Till 6pm\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(208) 338-0700][61] f(208) 338-0704\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Boise, ID\n\nLooking for a Boise grocery store that carries high-quality meats, seafood, produce, baked goods,\nand more for your restaurant? Visit CHEF'STORE today. Stop by for fresh beef, pork, and deli meats.\nView our large selection of produce, dairy, and bakery items. Our wholesale grocery store also\noffers beverages from water and juices to sodas and energy drinks, plus everything you need to\ncreate amazing espresso beverages with flavored syrups and more. Want to save time? Use Click&Carry\nto order online. Our helpful and friendly staff will put together your customized order so you can\npick it up in the store. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae\nand integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nWe've been serving the Boise area since 1995, and we're conveniently located downtown, near Ann\nMorrison Park. Our massive grocery and restaurant supply store stretches from Shoreline Drive to S\n17th Street and is packed with exceptional products for your business or home needs. We are across\nShoreline Drive from the popular River Walk Apartments and across the parking lot from St. Luke\u2019s\nClinic. We are easy to find, so come stop by and see us!\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [VIOLIFE\nDAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [LYCHEE CLAMSHELL] [CREATIVE\nCONVERTING 40X100' GREEN PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [INTERSTATE BEEF PATTIES 80% 3/1 ANGUS] [CREATIVE\nCONVERTING 40X100' RED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING\n40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nRyan Sorensen\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][106]\n\n[Sign I