            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Coeur d'Alene\n\n208 E Appleway Avenue Coeur d'Alene, ID 83814\n#504\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(208) 666-4898][61] f(888) 827-6619\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## Coeur d'Alene Saves You Money Every Week!\n\nVisit CHEF\u2019STORE in Coeur d'Alene for all your restaurant, catering supplies, and groceries. We\npride ourselves on viewing our customers as partners. That\u2019s why we only stock only the highest\nquality products. Browse our shelves for specialty ingredients to cleaning supplies to frozen foods\nand more. Our friendly staff is available to help you find exactly what you need. We're known for\nour fresh produce, beef, pork, dairy, and bakery items. Plus, our beverage center and aisles are\nalways stocked. Get organic ingredients, dry and canned goods, and much more. Save time grocery\nshopping by using Click&Carry. Place an order online and pick it up at the store. In March 2020,\nSmart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash &\nCarry store model][63].\n\nEasily accessible from I-90, we're located on Appleway Avenue, half a mile north of Ramada by\nWyndham via N 4th Street. You\u2019ll find us in one of Coeur D\u2019Alene\u2019s restaurant hot spots, nearby\nSatay Bistro, Atilano\u2019s Mexican, and Rogers\u2019s Ice Cream and Burgers. Our massive restaurant supply\nstore is open to the public, so anyone can visit us and start saving on food costs.\n\nDon't waste time searching for the closest grocery store \u2013 come to CHEF\u2019STORE for a one-stop-shop\nfor all your culinary needs.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [REAL FRESH BANANA PUDDING] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY\nWHITE] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS DINNER NAPKIN 15X17 2 PLY WHITE] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC\nTABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S LIME FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S CHERRY\nFOUNTAIN SYRUP] [PLATINUM HARVEST BONELESS SKINLESS CHICKEN BREAST] [MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN\nSYRUP]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nJason Ohmann\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105