            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Idaho Falls\n\n1240 Lindsay Blvd Idaho Falls, ID 83402\n#509\nStore Hours\nMonday\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 7am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\nTue\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\nWed\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\nThu\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\nFri\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\nSat\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 7am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(208) 419-0796][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Idaho Falls, ID\n\nOur Idaho Falls restaurant supply store provides foodservice operators and home cooks access to all\nof the bulk food and restaurant supplies they need. Our large deli and fresh produce coolers are\nstocked daily with fresh meat, cheese, dairy, eggs, vegetables, seasonal fruits, and many more great\nitems. So, no matter what you are making you can be confident our ingredients are always top-notch\nand reasonably priced. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and\nintegrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nCHEF'STORE serves the greater Idaho Falls, Rexburg, Pocatello, and Jackson areas, and is open seven\ndays a week for your convenience. We're located on Lindsay Boulevard, between Motel 6 and the US\nBonneville Power Administration. Visiting us from out of town? We are easily accessible via I-15 and\nUS-20. Anytime you need exceptional food service supplies and professional-grade equipment, we will\nbe here for you.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' PURPLE PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC\nTABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CAFE CLASSIC\nTAPIOCA PUDDING] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' YELLOW PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING\n40X100' WHITE PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [MR. C'S WATERMELON FOUNTAIN SYRUP]\n[ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY YELLOW]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nCraig Peless\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][106]\n\n[Sign In to Add][107] [ Sign Up][108]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][109]\nEach individ