            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Meridian\n\n1560 N. Hickory Ave. Meridian, ID 83642\n#203\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Open Now! Till 6pm][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nOpen Now! Till 6pm\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(208) 514-2674][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Meridian, ID\n\nLocated on North Hickory Avenue, behind Great Floors, CHEF'STORE carries all the wholesale products\nyour restaurant or catering company needs. We stock the freshest meats, seafood, produce, bakery,\nand dairy products. Our shelves are filled with top-quality canned and dry goods, including coffee,\nespresso, tea, and more. From paper products to cleaning supplies, we have it all for convenient\none-stop shopping. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and\nintegrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nOur customers are our partners. Our courteous and knowledgeable staff is available to help you find\nexactly what you need. Want to save time? Use Click&Carry, and we'll put your custom order together\nfor you. Simply stop by the store to pick up and pay. You\u2019ll find us just west of The Village at\nMeridian and north of the Blue Cross of Idaho. Look for our expansive white supply warehouse with a\nvast parking area. Plus, CHEF\u2019STORE never requires a membership to shop our aisles, so anyone\nwanting to save on groceries is welcome. Visit us today.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][68] [See All New Products][69]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SHREDDED CHEDDAR] [LIPTON\nYELLOW LABEL BLACK TEA] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' RED PLASTIC\nTABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN\nSYRUP] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [FRANKS MANGO HABANERO WING SAUCE .5 GAL] [MR. C'S MARGARITA\nFOUNTAIN SYRUP]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nJason Barclay\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][70]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][71] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][72]\n[Specials][73]\n[Products][74]\n[About][75]\n[Site Map][76]\n[Logo Downloads][77]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][78]\n[Privacy Policy][79]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][80]\n[Terms & Conditions][81]\n[Cookie Policy][82]\n[Investors][83]\n[Recalls][84]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][85]\n[Contact][86]\n[Facebook][87]\n[Instagram][88]\n[X (Twitter)][89]\n[LinkedIn][90]\n[Pinterest][91]\n[US Foods.com][92]\n[Privacy Policy][93]\n[Locations][94]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][95]\n[About][96]\n[Terms & Conditions][97]\n[Careers][98]\n[Cookie Policy][99]\n[Contact][100]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][101]\n[Investors][102]\n\n[Recalls][103]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][104]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][105]\n\n[Sign In to Add][106] [ Sign Up][107]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][108]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the CHEF'STORE