            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Nampa\n\n2710 Sundance Road Nampa, ID 83651\n#584\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Open Now! Till 6pm][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nOpen Now! Till 6pm\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(208) 442-8145][61] f(208) 442-8149\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Nampa, ID\n\nAt CHEF'STORE in Nampa, our customers are our partners. Our kitchen and restaurant supply store\nalways provide the highest-quality ingredients, from fresh meats and produce, to beverages and\nfrozen items. In need of catering supplies or paper and cleaning products? You can find it all at\nwholesale prices. Our friendly and knowledgeable staff is always available to assist you. Place your\nonline grocery order with Click&Carry and we'll compile it for you for in-store pickup. In March\n2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US\nFoods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nWhether you are searching for specialty items for your restaurant menu, effortless snacks for your\noffice pantry, or budget-friendly groceries for your large family, we have you covered. We are\ncentrally located on Sundance Road, easily accessible from I-84. Find us just 1 mile southwest from\nCollege of Western Idaho: Canyon Country Center, right next door to Play It Again Sports. You\u2019ll\nenjoy plenty of parking, and tons of shopping space in our expansive, easy-to-shop, store.\n\nNo need to tirelessly search for your closest grocery store \u2013 visit CHEF'STORE in Nampa for a\ncomprehensive shopping experience that caters to all your culinary needs.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[REAL FRESH BANANA PUDDING] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY WHITE] [MR. C'S CHERRY FOUNTAIN\nSYRUP] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS DINNER NAPKIN 15X17 2 PLY WHITE] [PLATINUM HARVEST BONELESS SKINLESS CHICKEN\nBREAST] [MR. C'S LIME FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S MARGARITA\nFOUNTAIN SYRUP] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY NAVY BLUE] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nJason Draper\nManager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\