            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Twin Falls\n\n1777 Canyon Crest Drive Twin Falls, ID 83301\n#590\nStore Hours\nMonday\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 7am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\nTue\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\nWed\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\nThu\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\nFri\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\nSat\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 7am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(208) 734-2173][61] f(888) 677-9348\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Twin Falls, ID\n\nSave money on all your restaurant supply needs at CHEF\u2019STORE in Twin Falls. Our shelves are stocked\nwith all your favorites, like canned and dry goods, dressings, espresso and coffee products, and\nmore. We also offer catering supplies, frozen foods, fresh bakery items, and to-go packaging\nstaples. Shop online using Click&Carry and our knowledgeable team will put together your custom\norder so you can pick it up in the store! In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US\nFoods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nCHEF'STORE is located in the West Park Commercial District, less than 600 feet north of Farmers\nBank, across Avenida del Rio Drive. Our expansive store is easily accessible from HWY 93 and I-84,\nat the intersection of HWY 93 and Canyon Crest Drive, perfect for all who are looking to save. Our\nchef supply warehouse provides the freshest beef, pork, deli meats, seafood, dairy, and produce.\nPlus, we never charge membership fees, so anyone is welcome to stop by and shop.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY BLACK] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY IVORY]\n[VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE GREEK FETA BLOCK] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE HEAVY WHIPPING CREAM] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE\nSMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [INTERSTATE BEEF PATTIES 80% 3/1 ANGUS] [SECRET AARDVARK HABANERO HOT\nSAUCE] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS DINNER NAPKIN 15X17 2\nPLY BLACK] [MR. C'S BLUE RASPBERRY FOUNTAIN SYRUP]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nZachary Olsen\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][106]\n\n[Sign In to Add][107] [ Sign Up][108]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding produ