            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# Wholesale Food Store Locations in Montana\n\nSearch City, State, Zip Code, or Store #\nReset\nUse My Location CLICK&CARRY Pick Up\nFound **0**\n0of0\nLoad More\n\n# US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE Locations in Montana\n\nIf you\u2019re looking for wholesale food and restaurant supplies in Montana, look no further! Visit\nCHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae (formerly Cash&Carry Smart Foodservice) wholesale food distribution locations to find\nthe variety and quality of food and restaurant supplies you need while saving time and money.\n\n## Shop Your Local Wholesale Food and Restaurant Supply Store\n\nCHEF\u2019STORE offers high-quality products at economical prices to help you achieve your bottom line.\nWith our online ordering platform, you purchase items and track orders, saving you time and money.\nWe also offer grocery delivery services through our Instacart and Shipt, allowing you to receive\nsupplies when you need them.\n\n### Specials and Savings on Bulk Food and More\n\n**Everyone is welcome: **No membership is required to take advantage of savings\n\n**Get exactly what you want:** Whether you want a little or a lot, you can get exactly what you need\n\n### A Fresh Take on Shopping for Restaurant Supplies\n\n**Variety:** From ethnic food and ingredients to paper products and equipment, we\u2019ve got you covered\n\n**Quality first:** We stock only the freshest meat, seafood, dairy, and bakery products\n\n### CHEF\u2019STORE Paves the Way to Saving You Time and Money\n\n**Whenever you need us: **Save more with wholesale prices, seven days a week\n\n**Here to serve you: **Get staff expertise and service that respects your time\n\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][59] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][60]\n[Specials][61]\n[Products][62]\n[About][63]\n[Site Map][64]\n[Logo Downloads][65]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][66]\n[Privacy Policy][67]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][68]\n[Terms & Conditions][69]\n[Cookie Policy][70]\n[Investors][71]\n[Recalls][72]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][73]\n[Contact][74]\n[