            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Helena\n\n2885 North Sanders Street Helena, MT 59601\n#213\nStore Hours\nMonday\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 7am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\nTue\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\nWed\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\nThu\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\nFri\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\nSat\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 7am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[406-417-6812][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF'STORE in Helena, MT\n\nCalling all small business operators, chefs, restaurant owners, caterers, and home cooks! We\u2019re\nexcited to open our third CHEF\u2019STORE location in Helena, Montana. This CHEF\u2019STORE location is right\noff of I-15 near the Helena Regional Airport and offers great deals on high-quality and affordable\nbulk foods. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated\ninto the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nOur huge inventory ensures you'll find exactly what you need including meat, seafood, fresh produce,\naffordable packaging, cleaning supplies, and more for your restaurant or home. Visit CHEF'STORE\ntoday and discover why we are Helena\u2019s go-to wholesale grocery.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][66]\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][67] [See All New Products][68]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' WHITE PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CAFE CLASSIC TAPIOCA PUDDING] [CREATIVE\nCONVERTING 40X100' PURPLE PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE CHEDDAR SLICES] [MR. C'S\nWATERMELON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [INTERSTATE BEEF\nPATTIES 80% 3/1 ANGUS] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [LAMB WESTON SUPREME CRISSCUT\nSKIN ON FRY FROZEN] [MEADOW GOLD POG PASSION ORANGE GUAVA JUICE]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nManager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][69]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][70] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][71]\n[Specials][72]\n[Products][73]\n[About][74]\n[Site Map][75]\n[Logo Downloads][76]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][77]\n[Privacy Policy][78]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][79]\n[Terms & Conditions][80]\n[Cookie Policy][81]\n[Investors][82]\n[Recalls][83]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][84]\n[Contact][85]\n[Facebook][86]\n[Instagram][87]\n[X (Twitter)][88]\n[LinkedIn][89]\n[Pinterest][90]\n[US Foods.com][91]\n[Privacy Policy][92]\n[Locations][93]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][94]\n[About][95]\n[Terms & Conditions][96]\n[Careers][97]\n[Cookie Policy][98]\n[Contact][99]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][100]\n[Investors][101]\n\n[Recalls][102]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][103]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][104]\n\n[Sign In to Add][105] [ Sign Up][106]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][107]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the CHEF'STORE you shop at?\nYes No\nYes No\nEnter city Select state Select state Arizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina\nOklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas Utah Virginia Washington Enter zipcode\nThanks!\n\nTo view this video please enable JavaScript, and consider upgrading to a web browser that [supports\nHTML5 video][108]\n\nSigned Out\n\nYou have been signed out due to inactivity or by signing in on another device.\n\nSelect how to shop\n[Start Shopping][109]\nNew Shopping List Name\nChoose how you'd like to shop.\n[ Instacart\nDelivery][110]\n[ CLICK&CARRY\nPick Up][111]\nYes No\nFeedback\n\n[1]: https://www.google.com/chrome/\n[2]: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/edge\n[3]: https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/\n[4]: https://support.apple.com/downloads/safari\n[5]: #layBody\n[6]: /locations/\n[7]: /locations/AZ/\n[8]: /locations/CA/\n[9]: /locations/GA/\n[10]: /locations/ID/\n[11]: /locations/MT/\n[12]: /locations/NV/\n[13]: /locations/NC/\n[14]: /locations/OK/\n[15]: /locations/OR/\n[16]: /locations/SC/\n[17]: /locations/TX/\n[18]: /locations/UT/\n[19]: /locations/VA/\n[20]: /locations/WA/\n[21]: /specials/\n[22]: /grocerydelivery/\n[23]: /grocerydelivery/\n[24]: /grocerydelivery/clickandcarry/\n[25]: https://shop.chefstore.com\n[26]: https://www.doordash.com/business/chefstore-13051015\n[27]: https://www.ubereats.com/brand/chefstore\n[28]: https://www.grubhub.com/third-party/merchant/chef-store?partner=instacart\n[29]: /search/fullsearch/\n[30]: /search/fullsearch/\n[31]: /search/departments/\n[32]: /search/newproducts/\n[33]: /search/exclusivebrands/\n[34]:\n[35]: /services/checkbusinesstools/\n[36]: /services/checkbusinesstools/\n[37]: /services/cardsignup/\n[38]: /services/staycoolfoodsafety/\n[39]: /about/\n[40]: /about/blog/\n[41]: /about/culturalbeliefs/\n[42]: /about/history/\n[43]: /about/getsocial/\n[44]: /about/policies/\n[45]: /about/faq/\n[46]: /contact/\n[47]: /contact/\n[48]: /contact/receiptmanager/\n[49]: https://ir.usfoods.com/investors/stock-information-news/default.aspx\n[50]: /contact/careers/\n[51]: /contact/browser-troubleshooting/\n[52]: /\n[53]: #\n[54]: /shopping/cart/\n[55]: #\n[56]: #\n[57]: /account/retrieve/\n[58]: /account/signup/\n[59]:\n[60]: /content/setStore/213/\n[61]: tel:406-417-6812\n[62]:\n[63]: https://www.chefstore.com/about/history/\n[64]: /content/hotSheet/1099/\n[65]: /search/temporarypricereductions/\n[66]: /blog