            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Kalispell\n\n1031 E Highway 2 Kalispell, MT 59901\n#902\nStore Hours\nMonday\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 7am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\nTue\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\nWed\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\nThu\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\nFri\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\nSat\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 7am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(406)-309-6063][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Kalispell, MT\n\nCHEF'STORE in Kalispell is Flathead County\u2019s go-to wholesale bulk food supply warehouse. Stop by\ntoday for fresh beef, pork, and deli meats. View our large selection of high-quality produce, dairy,\nand bakery items. Our shelves are stocked with dry ingredients, canned goods, and beverages. Whether\nyou are shopping for your downtown coffee shop, getting snacks for the office, or planning a family\nfeast, we have everything you need, and more! Looking for top-quality espresso, coffee, or flavored\nsyrups? On the hunt for choice beef and farm-fresh produce? Maybe you want to stock up on frozen\nmeals for the family? We carry them all, at wholesale prices. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice\nofficially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store\nmodel][63].\n\nTake advantage of online ordering with Click&Carry. Our friendly staff will put together your custom\norder and you can simply pick it up in the store. Located at the corner of Flathead Drive and\nMontclair Drive, you\u2019ll discover plenty of parking, a delightful staff, and exceptional\nproducts\u2013including cleaning necessities, paper products, and cooking equipment. We are easily\naccessible via US-2 E/U.S. Hwy 2 W or HWY 35 W.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[LYCHEE CLAMSHELL] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE\nROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE\nSLICES] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' GREEN PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [INTERSTATE BEEF PATTIES 80% 3/1\nANGUS] [FRANKS MANGO HABANERO WING SAUCE .5 GAL] [LIPTON YELLOW LABEL BLACK TEA] [CREATIVE\nCONVERTING 40X100' RED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nNate Hubbard\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot pa