            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Missoula\n\n2501 Brooks St Missoula, MT 59801\n#505\nStore Hours\nMonday\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 7am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n7am - 7pm\nTuesday\nTue\n7am - 7pm\nWednesday\nWed\n7am - 7pm\nThursday\nThu\n7am - 7pm\nFriday\nFri\n7am - 7pm\nSaturday\nSat\n7am - 7pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 7am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(406) 728-5986][61] f(888) 494-0058\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Missoula, MT\n\nLooking for the highest-quality restaurant and catering supplies at wholesale costs in Missoula\nCounty? Then visit CHEF\u2019STORE, located nearby the Southgate Triangle area, for all your chef supply\nneeds. We're known for our large selection of choice, wholesale meats, including beef, pork, deli\nmeats, and more. If you are searching for unique menu ingredients, frozen meals for quick family\ndinners, or paper goods for your office pantry, we have you covered. Save time by using Click&Carry.\nPlace your order online and our team will put it together for you so you can pick it up in the\nstore. You'll find all the highest-quality foodservice items you need for easy one-stop shopping. In\nMarch 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US\nFoods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nOur bulk supply store is conveniently situated less than half a mile southeast of Jefferson School.\nLook for our parking lot across from Catlin Plaza, at the intersection of South Avenue West and\nSouth Caitlin Street. CHEF\u2019STORE is easily accessible via I-90 for customers traveling from outside\nMissoula. Visit us for premium products, exceptional customer service, and easy shopping. Our\nbeverage center is always stocked and our grocery aisles are filled with dry and canned goods,\ncondiments, baking necessities, farm-fresh produce, and more.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 50 new products!\n[MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [FRANKS MANGO HABANERO WING SAUCE .5 GAL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING\n40X100' GREEN PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' RED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE\nCONVERTING 40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [VIOLIFE PREMIUM MELT MOZZ SHREDS] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE\nSHREDDED CHEDDAR] [LIPTON YELLOW LABEL BLACK TEA] [GALAXY GREEN 2 PLY BAMBOO NAPKINS] [CREATIVE\nCONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nPhillip Smith\nManager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF