            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# Wholesale Food Store Locations in Nevada\n\nSearch City, State, Zip Code, or Store #\nReset\nUse My Location CLICK&CARRY Pick Up\nFound **0**\n0of0\nLoad More\n\n# US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE Locations in Nevada\n\nFind the nearest CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae (formerly Cash&Carry Smart Foodservice) restaurant supply and wholesale\nfood store in Nevada by city, state, and zip. With wholesale food supplier locations throughout the\nUnited States, our goal is to make it easy for you to find the variety and quality of food and\nrestaurant supplies you need while saving time and money.\n\n## A Local Supplier of Wholesale Food and More for Restaurants\n\nHelp your restaurant food budget stretch further by choosing CHEF\u2019STORE as your wholesale restaurant\nsupply partner. We\u2019ve been serving the culinary community for decades and pride ourselves on\nexceptional wholesale bulk food, restaurant supplies and equipment, convenient online shopping, and\nknowledgeable associates.\n\n### Discounts and Special Savings on Bulk Food and Supplies\n\n**Something for everyone:** There\u2019s no membership required to shop at CHEF\u2019STORE\n\n**Exactly what you need:** Stock up on bulk items, or just stop in to save on individual items\n\n### Restaurant Supplies That are Outside the Box\n\n**Innovation: **From ethnic spices and products to eco-friendly takeout containers, you\u2019ll find\noptions to enhance your menu\n\n**Always fresh**: Hand-select the freshest meat, seafood, dairy, and more\n\n### Shop Easily and Save Time Doing It\n\n**Superior customer service:** Our helpful and knowledgeable staff is always on hand to serve you\n\n**Stretch out: **You\u2019ll love our clean, well-lit stores and wide aisles that are easy to navigate\n\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][59] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][60]\n[Specials][61]\n[Products][62]\n[About][63]\n[Site Map][64]\n[Logo Downloads][65]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][66]\n[Privacy Policy][67]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][68]\n[Terms & Conditions][69]\n[Cookie Policy][70]\n[Investors][71]\n[Recalls][72]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][73]\n[Contact][74]\n[Facebook][75]\n[Instagram][76]\n[X (Twitter)][77]\n[LinkedIn][78]\n[Pinterest][79]\n[US Foods.com][80]\n[Privacy Policy][81]\n[Locations][82]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][83]\n[About][84]\n[Terms & Conditions][85]\n[Careers][86]\n[Cookie Policy][87]\n[Contact][88]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][89]\n[Investors][90]\n\n[Recalls][91]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][92]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][93]\n\n[Sign In to Add][94] [ Sign Up][95]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][96]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the CHEF'STORE you shop at?\nYes No\nYes No\nEnter city Select state Select state Arizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina\nOklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas Utah Virginia Washington Enter zipcode\nThanks!\n\nTo view this video please enable JavaScript, and consider upgrading to a web browser that [supports\nHTML5 video][97]\n\nSigned Out\n\nYou have been signed out due to inactivity or by signing in on another device.\n\nSelect how to shop\n[Start Shopping][98]\nNew Shopping List Name\nChoose how you'd like to shop.\n[ Instacart\nDelivery][99]\n[ CLICK&CARRY\nPick Up][100]\nYes No\nFeedback\n\n[1]: https://www.google.com/chrome/\n[2]: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/edge\n[3]: https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/\n[4]: https://support.apple.com/downloads/safari\n[5]: #layBody\n[6]: /locations/\n[7]: /locations/AZ/\n[8]: /locations/CA/\n[9]: /locations/GA/\n[10]: /locations/ID/\n[11]: /locations/MT/\n[12]: /locations/NV/\n[13]: /locations/NC/\n[14]: /locations/OK/\n[15]: /locations/OR/\n[16]: /locations/SC/\n[17]: /locations/TX/\n[18]: /locations/UT/\n[19]: /locations/VA/\n[20]: /locations/WA/\n[21]: /specials/\n[22]: /grocerydelivery/\n[23]: /grocerydelivery/\n[24]: /grocerydelivery/clickandcarry/\n[25]: https://shop.chefstore.com\n[26]: https://www.doordash.com/business/chefstore-13051015\n[27]: https://www.ubereats.com/brand/chefstore\n[28]: https://www.grubhub.com/third-party/merchant/chef-store?partner=instacart\n[29]: /search/fullsearch/\n[30]: /search/fullsearch/\n[31]: /search/departments/\n[32]: /search/newproducts/\n[33]: /search/exclusivebrands/\n[34]:\n[35]: /services/checkbusinesstools/\n[36]: /services/checkbusinesstools/\n[37]: /services/cardsignup/\n[38]: /services/staycoolfoodsafety/\n[39]: /about/\n[40]: /about/blog/\n[41]: /about/culturalbeliefs/\n[42]: /about/history/\n[43]: /about/getsocial/\n[44]: /about/policies/\n[45]: /about/faq/\n[46]: /contact/\n[47]: /contact/\n[48]: /contact/receiptmanager/\n[49]: https://ir.usfoods.com/investors/stock-information-news/default.aspx\n[50]: /contact/careers/\n[51]: /contact/browser-troubleshooting/\n[52]: /\n[53]: #\n[54]: /shopping/cart/\n[55]: #\n[56]: #\n[57]: /account/retrieve/\n[58]: /account/signup/\n[59]: https://www.usfoods.com/\n[60]: /locations/\n[61]: /specials/\n[62]: /search/fullsearch/\n[63]: /about/\n[64]: /sitemap/\n[65]: /downloads/files/logos/Logos.zip\n[66]: /services/checkbusinesstools/\n[67]: /privacy/\n[68]: https://www.usfoods.com/forms/request.html\n[69]: /termsandconditions/\n[70]: /cookiepolicy/\n[71]: https://ir.usfoods.com/overview/default.aspx\n[72]: /product-recalls/\n[73]: /contact/careers/\n[74]: /contact/\n[75]: https://www.facebook.com/USFCHEFSTORE/\n[76]: https://www.instagram.com/USFCHEFSTORE/\n[77]: https://twitter.com/USFCHEFSTORE/\n[78]: https://linkedin.com/company/usfchefstore/\n[79]: https://www.pinterest.com/USFCHEFSTORE/\n[80]: https://www.usfoods.com/\n[81]: /privacy/\n[82]: /locations/\n[83]: https://www.us