            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Carson City\n\n222 Fairview Drive Carson City, NV 89701\n#502\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(775) 461-7416][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Carson City, NV\n\nOur bulk food store in Carson City provides our customers with exceptional products at competitive\nprices. CHEF\u2019STORE\u2019s large, walk-in deli and produce coolers are stocked with the highest-quality\nwholesale meats and farm-fresh veggies. We also carry a wide variety of beverages, grocery items,\ndry ingredients, and more at low costs so you can stock up and save money. In order to provide our\ncustomers with the best service, we created Click&Carry. Simply order online and our staff will put\ntogether your custom order so you can save time by picking it up in the store. In March 2020, Smart\nFoodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry\nstore model][63].\n\nLocated in the neighborhood of South Carson, CHEF\u2019STORE offers one-stop shopping for restaurant and\ncatering supplies. You\u2019ll find us on Fairview Drive, east of S Carson Street, in the same complex as\nPetSmart and Office Depot. Stop by and experience the best in chef supplies. Load up on cleaning\nessentials, to-go packaging, cooking equipment, and more. Not a professional chef? No problem! Our\nhigh-quality items are available to the whole community\u2013from home chefs to office managers.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][68] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][69] [See All New Products][70]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE\nGRATED PARMESAN] [CAFE CLASSIC TAPIOCA PUDDING] [DANISH ORCHARDS RASPBERRY 56 OZ] [REAL FRESH\nCHOCOLATE PUDDING] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' NAVY PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING\n40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' RED PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [VIOLIFE\nDAIRY FREE SHREDDED CHEDDAR]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nDanny Capps\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][71]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][72] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][73]\n[Specials][74]\n[Products][75]\n[About][76]\n[Site Map][77]\n[Logo Downloads][78]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][79]\n[Privacy Policy][80]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][81]\n[Terms & Conditions][82]\n[Cookie Policy][83]\n[Investors][84]\n[Recalls][85]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][86]\n[Contact][87]\n[Facebook][88]\n[Instagram][89]\n[X (Twitter)][90]\n[LinkedIn][91]\n[Pinterest][92]\n[US Foods.com][93]\n[Privacy Policy][94]\n[Locations][95]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][96]\n[About][97]\n[Terms & Conditions][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Cookie Policy][100]\n[Contact][101]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][102]\n[Investors][103]\n\n[Recalls][104]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][105]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][106]\n\n[Sign In to Add][107] [ Sign Up][108]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][109]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show you accurate information, please\nselect a store.\nIs this the CHEF'STORE you shop at?\nYes No\nYes No\nEnter city Select state Select state Arizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina\nOklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas Utah Virginia Washington Enter zipcode\nThanks!\n\nTo view this video please enable JavaScript, and consider upgrading to a web browser that [supports\nHTML5 video][110]\n\nSigned Out\n\nYou have been signed out due to inactivity or by signing in on another device.\n\nSelect how to shop\n[Start Shopping][111]\nNew Shopping List Name\nChoose how you'd like to shop.\n[ Instacart\nDelivery][112]\n[ CLICK&CARRY\nPick Up][113]\nYes No\nFeedback\n\n[1]: https://www.google.com/chrome/\n[2]: https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/edge\n[3]: https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/\n[4]: https://support.apple.com/downloads/safari\n[5]: #layBody\n[6]: /locations/\n[7]: /locations/AZ/\n[8]: /locations/CA/\n[9]: /locations/GA/\n[10]: /locations/ID/\n[11]: /locations/MT/\n[12]: /locations/NV/\n[13]: /locations/NC/\n[14]: /locations/OK/\n[15]: /locations/OR/\n[16]: /locations/SC/\n[17]: /locations/TX/\n[18]: /locations/UT/\n[19]: /locations/VA/\n[20]: /locations/WA/\n[21]: /specials/\n[22]: /grocerydelivery/\n[23]: /grocerydelivery/\n[24]: /grocerydelivery/clickandcarry/\n[25]: https://shop.chefstore.com\n[26]: https://www.doordash.com/business/chefstore-13051015\n[27]: https://www.ubereats.com/brand/chefstore\n[28]: https://www.grubhub.com/third-party/merchant/chef-store?partner=instacart\n[29]: /search/fullsearch/\n[30]: /search/fullsearch/\n[31]: /search/departments/\n[32]: /search/newproducts/\n[33]: /search/exclusivebrands/\n[34]:\n[35]: /services/checkbusinesstools/\n[36]