            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Reno\n\n115 Kietzke Lane Reno, NV 89502\n#520\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Closed Till 6am][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nClosed Till 6am\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[(775) 322-3610][61] f(775) 322-6638\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Reno, NV\n\nVisit CHEF\u2019STORE in Reno for all your culinary needs. Not only will you find the freshest meats,\nproduce, dairy, and bakery items, but we also have a large walk-in freezer. It's always stocked with\npremium appetizers, entrees, desserts, and so much more. Our shelves are filled with beverages,\ncanned and dry goods, baking essentials, spices, condiments, and everything else you need for your\nrestaurant or catering company. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae\nCHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nSwing by our wholesale restaurant supply store and see what we can offer you. We are conveniently\nlocated on Kietzke Lane at the Kuenzli Street intersection. Our massive warehouse provides plenty of\nparking, wide grocery aisles, and knowledgeable staff. Looking to cut down on your in-store shopping\ntime? Use Click&Carry, our easy online ordering system. Simply place your custom order, and we will\nput it together for you. Just stop by the store to pick it up! Need products to come to you?\nCHEF\u2019STORE partners with third-party delivery services so you can get exceptional items delivered to\nyour home or restaurant.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [\nStart Shopping with Instacart\n][66] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][67]\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][68] [See All New Products][69]\nA few of our 49 new products!\n[MR. C'S BLUE RASPBERRY FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [CREATIVE CONVERTING 40X100' BLACK PLASTIC TABLE ROLL] [REAL\nFRESH BANANA PUDDING] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [MR. C'S\nMARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS DINNER\nNAPKIN 15X17 2 PLY WHITE] [ULTRA SOFT PLUS BEV NAPKIN 10X10 2 PLY WHITE] [MCCORMICK DEHYDRATED\nCHOPPED ONIONS]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nCarol Hohman\nStore Manager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][70]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][71] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][72]\n[Specials][73]\n[Products][74]\n[About][75]\n[Site Map][76]\n[Logo Downloads][77]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][78]\n[Privacy Policy][79]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][80]\n[Terms & Conditions][81]\n[Cookie Policy][82]\n[Investors][83]\n[Recalls][84]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][85]\n[Contact][86]\n[Facebook][87]\n[Instagram][88]\n[X (Twitter)][89]\n[LinkedIn][90]\n[Pinterest][91]\n[US Foods.com][92]\n[Privacy Policy][93]\n[Locations][94]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][95]\n[About][96]\n[Terms & Conditions][97]\n[Careers][98]\n[Cookie Policy][99]\n[Contact][100]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][101]\n[Investors][102]\n\n[Recalls][103]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][104]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][105]\n\n[Sign In to Add][106] [ Sign Up][107]\n\nAdding products to a shopping list is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\nAdding products to favorites is easy.\n\nCreate an account to get started!\n\n[Sign Up][108]\nEach individual store has specific products and details. To show