            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# Wholesale Food Store Locations in North Carolina\n\nSearch City, State, Zip Code, or Store #\nReset\nUse My Location CLICK&CARRY Pick Up\nFound **0**\n0of0\nLoad More\n\n# US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE Locations in North Carolina\n\nFind the nearest CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae (formerly Cash&Carry Smart Foodservice) wholesale food and restaurant\nsupply store in North Carolina. Whether you need fresh produce, kitchen essentials, or quality meat\nand seafood, you\u2019ll find it and more at competitive prices in an easy-to-navigate store.\n\n## Wholesale Food and Restaurant Supplies in North Carolina\n\nCHEF\u2019STORE carries kitchen essentials, high-quality meat and seafood, fresh produce, and more in the\nvariety and volume that\u2019s right for you. Plus, our friendly, knowledgeable staff is always ready to\nanswer questions and help you find what you need.\n\n### Save Big on Bulk Food and Supplies\n\n**Open to the public:** Memberships aren\u2019t required to shop CHEF\u2019STORE\n\n**Exactly what you need: **Whether you\u2019re stocking up or checking one thing off your list, you\u2019ll\nfind it here\n\n### Fresh, Innovative Food and Kitchen Essentials\n\n**Meat, produce, and dairy: **Enhance your menu with the highest-quality food available\n\n**Variety and volume:** Exclusive brands and a wide range of food and equipment to meet your needs\n\n### Shop CHEF\u2019STORE to Save Time and Money\n\n**Ready to help:** Our knowledgeable staff is always ready to answer questions and find solutions\n\n**Clutter-free stores:** You\u2019ll love our clean, well-lit stores and easy-to-navigate aisles\n\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][59] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][60]\n[Specials][61]\n[Products][62]\n[About][63]\n[Site Map][64]\n[Logo Downloads][65]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][66]\n[Privacy Policy][67]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][68]\n[Terms & Conditions][69]\n[Cookie Policy][70]\n[Investors][71]\n[Recalls][72]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][73]\n[Contact][74]\n[Facebook][75]\n[Instagram][76