            "text": "Close\n\n### Upgrade browser for full experience\n\nIt looks like you may be using a web browser version that we don't support. Make sure you're using\nthe most recent version of your browser, or try using one of these supported browsers to get the\nmost out of the CHEF'STORE\u00ae website.\n\n[ [Chrome icon]\nChrome\n][1]\n[ [Edge icon]\nEdge\n][2]\n[ [Firefox icon]\nFirefox\n][3]\n[ [Safari icon]\nSafari\n][4]\nAlready using one of these browsers but still having issues?\nVisit our Browser Troubleshooting Page or continue anyway.\n[Skip to Main Content][5]\n[Locations][6]\n[Arizona][7] [California][8] [Georgia][9] [Idaho][10] [Montana][11] [Nevada][12] [North\nCarolina][13] [Oklahoma][14] [Oregon][15] [South Carolina][16] [Texas][17] [Utah][18] [Virginia][19]\n[Washington][20]\n[Specials][21]\n[Pick Up & Delivery][22]\n[Ways To Shop][23] [CLICK&CARRY Pick Up][24] [Instacart][25] [DoorDash][26] [Uber Eats][27]\n[Grubhub][28]\n[Products][29]\n[Search All Products][30] [Search By Department][31] [Search New Products][32] [Exclusive Brands by\nUS Foods\u00ae CHEF\u2019STORE\u00ae][33] [Create Shopping List][34]\n[Services][35]\n[Business Services][36] [CHEF'STORE\u00ae Customer Card][37] [Cool and Carry\u00ae Food Safety Program][38]\n[About][39]\n[Blog][40] [Cultural Beliefs][41] [Our History][42] [Follow Us On Social Media][43] [Store\nPolicies][44] [Frequently Asked Questions][45]\n[Contact][46]\n[Contact Us][47] [Receipt Management][48] [Media Inquiries][49] [Careers][50] [Browser\nTroubleshooting][51]\n[CHEF'STORE][52]\n[Select A Store][53]\nChange Location Sign In/Up [ Cart ][54]\n[ Change][55]\n[Select A Store][56]\nPlease Sign In Email or Username Password\nRemember Me [Forgot password?][57]\nNew to CHEF'STORE?\n\nSigning up is easy.\nStart saving today!\n\n[Sign Up][58]\n\n# CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae} - Charlotte\n\n3304 Eastway Drive Charlotte, NC 28205\n#8102\nStore Hours\nMonday\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Open Now! Till 6pm][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n6am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n6am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n6am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n6am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n6am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n6am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nOpen Now! Till 6pm\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[704-531-4610][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF\u2019STORE in Charlotte, NC\n\nCHEF'STORE is Charlotte\u2019s one-stop shop grocery store in North Carolina for restaurant and chef\ngoods and supplies. We carry professional-grade cooking essentials, cafe beverage staples and paper\nproducts, and bulk grains. Whether you are operating a food truck, creating a deli platter for an\noffice lunch, or designing a holiday menu for the family, CHEF\u2019STORE has you covered. We stock the\nfreshest meats, seafood, produce, bakery, and dairy items. Our shelves are filled with top-quality\ncanned and dry goods. Our frozen section is stocked with delectable, effortless options\u2013from entrees\nto sides to desserts. In March 2020, Smart Foodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and\nintegrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry store model][63].\n\nIf you are looking for the best bulk food supplies in the region, visit us today. CHEF\u2019STORE is\nlocated on Eastway Drive, next door to Ann\u2019s Beauty and Smartwheels Tire Shop. We provide ample\nparking, a drive-up loading area, and easy access. From cutting boards to cleaning supplies,\neggplants to eggs, we stock a variety of quality products for all your restaurant, catering, or home\ncook desires. Our customers are our partners, and our friendly staff is available to help you find\nexactly what you need.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][66]\n\n### Order Ahead - Click&Carry Online\n* We'll gather the order and have it ready for you\n* Pick up and pay for it in the store\n* We load your car\n* Saving you time and energy\n\n[ Start Your Order Now ][67] Minimum Order $100\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 40 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][68] [See All New Products][69]\nA few of our 40 new products!\n[MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [EMBASA SALSA VERDE MEDIUM] [MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP]\n[EMBASA CHIPOTLE PEPPER] [MR. C'S LEMON FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE GRATED PARMESAN]\n[VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SHREDDED CHEDDAR] [EMBASA MEDIUM MEXICAN SALSA] [LA VICTORIA SALSA ALAMO STREET\nTHICK & CHUNKY MEDIUM] [REAL FRESH VANILLA PUDDING]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nJeremy Aspuac\nManager\nCareers\n[ Apply Now ][70]\nSearch City\nState\nArizona California Georgia Idaho Montana Nevada North Carolina Oklahoma Oregon South Carolina Texas\nUtah Virginia Washington\nZipcode\nStore #\nGet Promotions, Specials,\nTemporary Price Reductions and more!\nContact Information Email First Name Select a Store\nCONNECT WITH US\n[US Foods.com][71] Cookie Settings\n\n## Quick links\n\n[Locations][72]\n[Specials][73]\n[Products][74]\n[About][75]\n[Site Map][76]\n[Logo Downloads][77]\n\n## Customer Service\n\n[Services][78]\n[Privacy Policy][79]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][80]\n[Terms & Conditions][81]\n[Cookie Policy][82]\n[Investors][83]\n[Recalls][84]\n\n## Connect\n\n[Careers][85]\n[Contact][86]\n[Facebook][87]\n[Instagram][88]\n[X (Twitter)][89]\n[LinkedIn][90]\n[Pinterest][91]\n[US Foods.com][92]\n[Privacy Policy][93]\n[Locations][94]\n[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][95]\n[About][96]\n[Terms & Conditions][97]\n[Careers][98]\n[Cookie Policy][99]\n[Contact][100]\nCookie Settings\n[Site Map][101]\n[Investors][102]\n\n[Recalls][103]\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright - US Foods^{\u00ae} CHEF'STORE^{\u00ae}\n[AVIBE Web Development][104]\nSign In\nSign Up\nPlease create an account or sign in.\nEmail or Username Password\nRemember Me\n\n[Forgot password?][105]\n\n[Sign In to Add][106] [ Sign Up][107]\n\nAdding product