ursday\n7am - 6pm\nFriday\n7am - 6pm\nSaturday\n7am - 6pm\nSunday\n8am - 5pm\n\n## Store hours\n\n[Open Now! Till 6pm][59]\nStore hours\nMonday\nMon\n7am - 6pm\nTuesday\nTue\n7am - 6pm\nWednesday\nWed\n7am - 6pm\nThursday\nThu\n7am - 6pm\nFriday\nFri\n7am - 6pm\nSaturday\nSat\n7am - 6pm\nSunday\nSun\n8am - 5pm\nStore hours\nOpen Now! Till 6pm\n[Make My Warehouse][60]\np[1-(910)-912-2304][61]\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n## US Foods CHEF'STORE in Fayetteville, NC\n\nBoasting over 20,000 square feet of right in the heart of Cross Creek Mall is our CHEF\u2019STORE\nFayetteville restaurant supply store. Just down the street from Sam's Club and situated 15-minute\ndrive from downtown, this marks the fourth location in North Carolina. In March 2020, Smart\nFoodservice officially became US Foods\u00ae CHEF'STORE\u00ae and integrated into the US Foods\u00ae [Cash & Carry\nstore model][63].\n\nWe're thrilled to be your go-to wholesaler for premium ingredients, professional kitchen supplies,\nand a world of culinary inspiration. Visit us today to see our extensive selection of top-quality\nbrands and explore, shop, and celebrate the art of cooking!\n\nJoin the CHEF\u2019STORE community! We invite you to fill out the pre-registration form, just click below\nfor more information.\n\nView Specials\n][64] [\nTemporary Price Reductions\n][65] [ The CHEF'STORE Blog ][66]\nAll the Products Your Business Will Ever Need\nA few of our 40 new products!\n[Search Thousands of Products][67] [See All New Products][68]\nA few of our 40 new products!\n[MR. C'S BUBBLE GUM FOUNTAIN SYRUP] [LA VICTORIA MEDIUM PICANTE SALSA] [SMITHFIELD CANADIAN STYLE\nBACON SLICED SMOKED COOKED 6/2LB R] [EMBASA MEDIUM MEXICAN SALSA] [MR. C'S MARGARITA FOUNTAIN SYRUP]\n[VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE SMOKED PROVOLONE SLICES] [NANA'S CORN BREADED FRITTER PARCOOKED FROZEN 2/5LB]\n[LA VICTORIA SALSA ALAMO STREET THICK & CHUNKY MEDIUM] [VIOLIFE DAIRY FREE GRATED PARMESAN] [REAL\nFRESH VANILLA PUDDING]\nMeet Our Team\nCareers\nDavid 