n\n6 [next-arrow] Additional Information\nSubmit\nIncorrect Captcha\n\n## Avail any from numerous customization we provide and make your jewelry look stunning\n\nAn attractive jewelry packaging is a mixture of high quality stock, unique layout and mesmerizing\nfinishing add-ons. In order to achieve these qualities, we make packaging boxes available in\nnumerous sizes and shapes, select stock amid 12pt, 14pt, 16pt, 18pt and 24pt with multi-color SBS\nC1S C2S that offer durability and bring a touch of luxury in your rings, anklets and brooches.\nCreate your custom jewelry boxes beautiful with finishing choices that includes Aqua Coating,\nGlossy, Matte, and Spot UV and prepare a perfect jewelry carrier for point of sale, promotions and\nof course for highlighting business\u2019s name and logo. Elect from stylish add-on options like\nsilver/gold foiling, magnetic closures, embossing or metallic labels that bring a modernize outlook\nout of your simple box. Creative packaging experts of Emenac Packaging provides meticulously\nengineered jewelry boxes that are highly customizable to numerous style variations. Just name any\ninclusions that you need in your box, we ensure to provide everything through your initial ideas to\nfinal production with ease and comfort.\n\n## Perks of getting custom jewelry boxes manufactured from Emenac Packaging!\n\nEmenac Packaging is determined to provide you the best services aimed to excel your expectations\nthroughout the box ordering process. For this, we have formulated a list of pre-defined rules and\nguidelines after keen consideration to make your boxes top-notch and provide easy and memorable\nordering experience. Starting from pricing, you are only charged for the boxes you get and no hidden\ncharges like plate cost, die cutting or setup fee is included \u2013 you save more this way! We strongly\nimplement quality check procedures and our certified quality control team ensures your text is\naccurate, printed colors are exactly to the code used in the provided 3D design, the images are\nclear and most importantly the structural design including shape, size and style are double-checked\nto be as per your specifications \u2013 No defects pass the eyes of our quality control inspectors to\nensure you get boxes that are equally fine in quality as the fashion ornament inside. Moreover, our\nno minimum order quantity ensures you can order boxes in any quantity you need \u2013 50 or 50,000, you\ncan get them manufactured without paying higher than the base production cost. In the end, get these\nboxes delivered at your doorsteps within 14 business days thanks to our fast turnaround policy to\nensure you don\u2019t miss product promotion target.\n\n## Personalize your Jewelry Box Just the Way You Want!\n\nGet started on your custom jewelry box project by following a series of quick steps. From earrings\nto pendant ornaments & from hairpins to watches, you can obtain a jewelry box that\u2019s custom made\njust for you!\n\n**Design :** Showcase your creativity, add custom texts, graphics, and create a one-of-a-kind\njewelry gift box for that \u201cspecial one\u201d. Get all your names, monograms, & special messages printed\nor better yet, embossed on these jewelry boxes in striking color combinations to make them memorable\nfor every receiver.\n\n**Stylize :** Surprise everyone with a personalized jewelry box made in an imaginative style. Ladies\nlove gifts that come in a special package \u2013 it\u2019s time for you to impress them with these uniquely\nstyled boxes. Browse our styles catalogue to pick one that suits your jewelry accessories.\n\n**Build :** Finalized the design, shape & style for your custom designed jewelry box? Good. Now\nselect the packaging material with which you want it manufactured. Available choices include\nmulti-layered\n\nOrder Custom Boxes. Designed in Minutes. Delivered in Days. Distinction Quality.\n\nconnect with us:\n* [ [Facebook Logo] ][44]\n* [ [Twitter X Logo] ][45]\n* [ [Instagram Logo] ][46]\n* [ [Pintrest Logo] ][47]\n* [ [YouTube Logo] ][48]\n* [ [Linkedin Logo] ][49]\nNeed Assistance? Call us at: [888-276-1239][50] For More Convenience\n* [Google Play Icon]\n* [App Store Icon]\n[ [Emenac Packaging Logo] ][51]\n\nEmenac Packaging is the first priority of businesses for personalized packaging solutions. With\nyears of experience to back us, we strive forward to offer the best custom-printed boxes of all\nkinds. Quality distinction and affordable rates are also guaranteed.\n* [ [Envelope Icon] inquiry@emenacpackaging.com ][52]\n* [Pin Location] 21515 Hawthorne Blvd Suite 200, Torrance, CA 90503\n\n**LEARN MORE:**\n* [Choose Your Style][53]\n* [Customer Reviews][54]\n* [Listen Podcasts][55]\n* [Blog][56]\n* [Videos][57]\n* [Beat My Quote][58]\n* [Terms and Conditions][59]\n* [Privacy Policy][60]\n**JOIN OUR NEWSLETTER:** SUBMIT\nPayment System: [All Payment Methods Icons]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 www.emenacpackaging.com All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/EmenacPackagingUSA/\n[2]: https://twitter.com/EmenacPackUSA/\n[3]: https://www.instagram.com/emenacpackagingus/\n[4]: https://www.pinterest.com/EmenacPackagingUSA/\n[5]: https://www.youtube.com/EmenacPackaging/\n[6]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/emenac-packagingusa/\n[7]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/aboutus/\n[8]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/contact-us/\n[9]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/\n[10]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/portfolio/\n[11]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/custom-quote/\n[12]: tel:8882761239\n[13]: #\n[14]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/cosmetic-boxes/\n[15]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/custom-food-boxes/\n[16]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/retail-boxes/\n[17]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/custom-apparel-boxes/\n[18]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/gift-boxes/\n[19]: #\n[20]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/sleeve-boxes/\n[21]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/display-boxes/\n[22]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/hang-tab-boxes/\n[23]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/pillow-boxes/\n[24]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/gable-boxes/\n[25]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/handle-boxes/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/cardboard-boxes/\n[28]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/corrugated-boxes/\n[29]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/kraft-boxes/\n[30]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/paper-boxes/\n[31]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/rigid-boxes/\n[32]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/blog/\n[33]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/custom-box-videos/\n[34]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/anklet-boxes/\n[35]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/frozen-lunch-boxes/\n[36]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/frozen-yeast-rolls-boxes/\n[37]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/frozen-tater-tots-boxes/\n[38]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/frozen-taquitos-boxes/\n[39]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/frozen-tamales-boxes/\n[40]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/frozen-scallops-boxes/\n[41]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/frozen-salmon-boxes/\n[42]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/frozen-quiche-boxes/\n[43]: tel:8882761239\n[44]: https://www.facebook.com/EmenacPackagingUSA/\n[45]: https://twitter.com/EmenacPackUSA/\n[46]: https://www.instagram.com/emenacpackagingus/\n[47]: https://www.pinterest.com/EmenacPackagingUSA/\n[48]: https://www.youtube.com/EmenacPackaging/\n[49]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/emenac-packagingusa/\n[50]: tel:8882761239\n[51]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/\n[52]: mailto:inquiry@emenacpackaging.com\n[53]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/choose-your-style/\n[54]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/comments/\n[55]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/podcasts/\n[56]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/blog/\n[57]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/custom-box-videos/\n[58]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/beat-my-quo"
