            "text": "[facebook]\n* [ [Facebook Icon] ][1]\n* [ [X Twitter Icon] ][2]\n* [ [Instagram Icon] ][3]\n* [ [Pinterest Icon] ][4]\n* [ [Youtube Icon] ][5]\n* [ [Linkedin Icon] ][6]\n* [ About Us ][7]\n* [ Contact Us ][8]\n[ [Emenac Packaging Logo] ][9]\n* [ [Portfolio icon]\n**Our Portfolio** Check For Ideas\n][10]\n* [ [Custom Pricing Icon]\n**Custom** **Get Quote** Pricing\n][11]\n[ [Phone Volume Icon] 888-276-1239 ][12]\n[toggle-btn]\n* [ Categories ][13]\n* [ [Cosmetic Category Icon] Cosmetic Boxes ][14]\n* [ [Food Category Icon] Food & Beverage Boxes ][15]\n* [ [Retail Category Icon] Retail Boxes ][16]\n* [ [Apparel Category Icon] Apparel Boxes ][17]\n* [ [Retail Category Icon] Gift Boxes ][18]\n* [Shape & Style][19]\n* [Sleeve Boxes][20]\n* [Display Boxes][21]\n* [Hang Tab Boxes][22]\n* [Pillow Boxes][23]\n* [Gable Boxes][24]\n* [Handle Boxes][25]\n* [Material][26]\n* [Cardboard Boxes][27]\n* [Corrugated Boxes][28]\n* [Kraft Boxes][29]\n* [Paper Boxes][30]\n* [Rigid Boxes][31]\n* [Blogs][32]\n* [Our Videos][33]\n[Search Icon]\n* [ Home ][34]\n* Contact Us\n\n## Feel Free to Make a Talk\n\nEmenac Packaging - The House of Proficient Printing & Distinct Featured Boxes\n\nEmenac Packaging facilitates your business by providing innovative styled boxes in extraordinary\ndesign. We use the finest paper material and high-quality cardboard to ensure perfect Die Cut boxes.\nYou will get guaranteed satisfaction with high quality printing and free shipping in US and Canada.\nJust dial 888-276-1239 to know more about our services.\n\nEnter Name\nEmail Address\nContact Message\nSubmit\n\nOrder Custom Boxes. Designed in Minutes. Delivered in Days. Distinction Quality.\n\nconnect with us:\n* [ [Facebook Logo] ][35]\n* [ [Twitter X Logo] ][36]\n* [ [Instagram Logo] ][37]\n* [ [Pintrest Logo] ][38]\n* [ [YouTube Logo] ][39]\n* [ [Linkedin Logo] ][40]\nNeed Assistance? Call us at: [888-276-1239][41] For More Convenience\n* [Google Play Icon]\n* [App Store Icon]\n[ [Emenac Packaging Logo] ][42]\n\nEmenac Packaging is the first priority of businesses for personalized packaging solutions. With\nyears of experience to back us, we strive forward to offer the best custom-printed boxes of all\nkinds. Quality distinction and affordable rates are also guaranteed.\n* [ [Envelope Icon] inquiry@emenacpackaging.com ][43]\n* [Pin Location] 21515 Hawthorne Blvd Suite 200, Torrance, CA 90503\n\n**LEARN MORE:**\n* [Choose Your Style][44]\n* [Customer Reviews][45]\n* [Listen Podcasts][46]\n* [Blog][47]\n* [Videos][48]\n* [Beat My Quote][49]\n* [Terms and Conditions][50]\n* [Privacy Policy][51]\n**JOIN OUR NEWSLETTER:** SUBMIT\nPayment System: [All Payment Methods Icons]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 www.emenacpackaging.com All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: https://www.facebook.com/EmenacPackagingUSA/\n[2]: https://twitter.com/EmenacPackUSA/\n[3]: https://www.instagram.com/emenacpackagingus/\n[4]: https://www.pinterest.com/EmenacPackagingUSA/\n[5]: https://www.youtube.com/EmenacPackaging/\n[6]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/emenac-packagingusa/\n[7]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/aboutus/\n[8]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/contact-us/\n[9]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/\n[10]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/portfolio/\n[11]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/custom-quote/\n[12]: tel:8882761239\n[13]: #\n[14]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/cosmetic-boxes/\n[15]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/custom-food-boxes/\n[16]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/retail-boxes/\n[17]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/custom-apparel-boxes/\n[18]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/gift-boxes/\n[19]: #\n[20]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/sleeve-boxes/\n[21]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/display-boxes/\n[22]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/hang-tab-boxes/\n[23]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/pillow-boxes/\n[24]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/gable-boxes/\n[25]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/handle-boxes/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/cardboard-boxes/\n[28]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/corrugated-boxes/\n[29]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/kraft-boxes/\n[30]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/paper-boxes/\n[31]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/product-description/rigid-boxes/\n[32]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/blog/\n[33]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/custom-box-videos/\n[34]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/\n[35]: https://www.facebook.com/EmenacPackagingUSA/\n[36]: https://twitter.com/EmenacPackUSA/\n[37]: https://www.instagram.com/emenacpackagingus/\n[38]: https://www.pinterest.com/EmenacPackagingUSA/\n[39]: https://www.youtube.com/EmenacPackaging/\n[40]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/emenac-packagingusa/\n[41]: tel:8882761239\n[42]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/\n[43]: mailto:inquiry@emenacpackaging.com\n[44]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/choose-your-style/\n[45]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/comments/\n[46]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/podcasts/\n[47]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/blog/\n[48]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/custom-box-videos/\n[49]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/beat-my-quote/\n[50]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/terms-conditions/\n[51]: https://www.emenacpackaging.com/privacy-policy/"
