        "crawl_text": "Kathy & Ray Horticultures Limited Compliant with international standards USA UAE Israel Sustainable production practices Proximity to raw material base High quality and reliability Flexibility in packaging and customer service Compliance with food safety standards Organic production documentation Nairobi, Kenya Kenya Nairobi, Kenya USA UAE Israel Premium cold-pressed avocado oil Kathy &amp; Ray Horticultures Limited\n\n[About] [Development] [Cooperation] [Requirements] [Contacts]\n\nQuality\navocado oil.\nWe produce\nhonestly.\nWe deliver\nexactly on time.\n\nWe produce a cold-pressed avocado oil substitute with a focus on sustainable production and full compliance with International Standards\n\nProduction is carried out on an industrial scale using two production lines that operate year-round.\nWe manage the entire chain: from purchasing avocados to processing, packaging and export logistics.\nWe are located close to the raw material base, which allows us to significantly reduce logistics costs, minimize the environmental footprint and ensure uninterrupted supplies.\nWe supply high-quality oil that meets food safety and traceability standards.\n\nSustainable development and quality proven by our customers and time\n\nSustainable production\nWe strive for sustainable development, minimizing our ecological footprint. Our company actively implements the principles of environmentally friendly production at every stage.\n\nLogistics optimization\nThe location of our production close to the raw material base allows us to significantly reduce logistics costs, which makes our deliveries more efficient and accessible.\n\nHigh quality standards\nWe ensure that our avocado oil meets strict food safety and traceability standards, ensuring high quality and reliability for our customers.\n\nWe work with export traders working with organic oils, private label producers, distributors of edible oils and importers of natural products, retail chains working in the natural products segment and wholesale buyers.\n\nReadiness for European requirements and standards\n\nWe work only with certified suppliers, which guarantees quality and compliance with standards. Products are accompanied by the necessary documentation to confirm organic production.\nWe know the specifics of document flow and logistics in the USA, UAE, Israel and the EU. This helps to effectively organize deliveries and avoid delays\nWe offer various packaging formats to meet customer needs. Whether it is small packages for retail or large volumes for wholesale, we can offer optimal solutions.\nWe value flexibility and individual approach to clients. We are ready to adapt offers to your needs to create long-term partnerships.\n\nInterested in cooperation? Leave a request, we will contact you quickly and discuss the details.\n\nSubmit\nBy clicking the &quot;Submit&quot; button you accept the terms of the Privacy Policy\n\n\u00a9 2025 Kathy &amp; Ray Horticultures Limited. All rights reserved\n\nNairobi, Kenya +254772548095 info@krhorticultures.com krhorticultures.com Premium cold-pressed avocado oil Kathy &amp; Ray Horticultures Limited\n\n[About] [Development] [Cooperation] [Requirements] [Contacts]\n\nQuality\navocado oil.\nWe produce\nhonestly.\nWe deliver\nexactly on time.\n\nWe produce a cold-pressed avocado oil substitute with a focus on sustainable production and full compliance with International Standards\n\nProduction is carried out on an industrial scale using two production lines that operate year-round.\nWe manage the entire chain: from purchasing avocados to processing, packaging and export logistics.\nWe are located close to the raw material base, which allows us to significantly reduce logistics costs, minimize the environmental footprint and ensure uninterrupted supplies.\nWe supply high-quality oil that meets food safety and traceability standards.\n\nSustainable development and quality proven by our customers and time\n\nSustainable productio