            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [LDG International] ][2]\n* [ +91 8447660003 ][3]\n* [ +91 8447550003 ][4]\n* [ [email\u00a0protected] ][5]\n[ Instagram ][6] [ Facebook ][7] [ Youtube ][8] [ X-twitter ][9]\n* [HOME][10]\n* [ABOUT US][11]\n* [ETHICAL STANDARDS][12]\n* [FRAGRANCES][13]\n  * [Fine Fragrances][14]\n  * [Candle Fragrances][15]\n  * [Body Wash Fragrances][16]\n  * [Air Freshener Fragrances][17]\n  * [Soap & Detergent Fragrances][18]\n* [ESSENTIAL OILS][19]\n  * [Natural Essential Oils][20]\n  * [Carrier Oils][21]\n  * [Aromatherapy Oils][22]\n  * [Floral Absolute Oils][23]\n  * [Spice Oils][24]\n  * [Wild Crafted Oils][25]\n  * [CO2 Extract Oils][26]\n* [OUR PRODUCTS][27]\n  * [FLAVOURS][28]\n  * [PERSONAL CARE FRAGRANCES][29]\n  * [INCENSE FRAGRANCES][30]\n  * [DIFFUSERS FRAGRANCES][31]\n  * [EXTRACTS][32]\n  * [FOOD COLORS][33]\n* [CONTACT US][34]\n* [HOME][35]\n* [ABOUT US][36]\n* [ETHICAL STANDARDS][37]\n* [FRAGRANCES][38]\n  * [Fine Fragrances][39]\n  * [Candle Fragrances][40]\n  * [Body Wash Fragrances][41]\n  * [Air Freshener Fragrances][42]\n  * [Soap & Detergent Fragrances][43]\n* [ESSENTIAL OILS][44]\n  * [Natural Essential Oils][45]\n  * [Carrier Oils][46]\n  * [Aromatherapy Oils][47]\n  * [Floral Absolute Oils][48]\n  * [Spice Oils][49]\n  * [Wild Crafted Oils][50]\n  * [CO2 Extract Oils][51]\n* [OUR PRODUCTS][52]\n  * [FLAVOURS][53]\n  * [PERSONAL CARE FRAGRANCES][54]\n  * [INCENSE FRAGRANCES][55]\n  * [DIFFUSERS FRAGRANCES][56]\n  * [EXTRACTS][57]\n  * [FOOD COLORS][58]\n* [CONTACT US][59]\n\n## Fragrance Manufacturing Company\n\n## Welcome to Our World of\n## Fragrances!\n\n## We're Manufacturer & Supplier\n\n## Step Into The World of Natural Fragrances\n\n**LDG International** is a trusted manufacturer of Flavours, Fragrances, Essential Oils, Personal\nCare Fragrances, Incense Fragrances, Diffusers Fragrances, Extracts, and Food Colors. We focus on\ncreating high-quality products and fragrances that bring joy to everyday life. With care and\ncreativity, we deliver solutions that meet your needs and exceed expectations.\n\n[Fragrance Manufacturing Unit of Kannauj]\nYears Experience\n0 +\nNatural Products\n0 %\nHappy Clients\n0 k\nSpecialists Team\n0 +\n\n## What We Do\n\n## Explore LDG International's Products\n\n[Flavor]\n\n## Flavours\n\nWe manufacture all kinds of flavors, providing great taste for food, drinks, and sweets, and\nensuring they meet the needs of different businesses worldwide.\n\n[Fragrances]\n\n## Fragrances\n\nWe are a leading manufacturer and supplier of high-quality fragrances, and we also offer custom\nfragrance solutions tailored to meet each client\u2019s unique needs and preferences.\n\n[Essential Oils]\n\n## Essential Oils\n\nWe offer a wide range of pure, natural essential oils, extracted using organic and natural methods\nto ensure the highest quality and purity.\n\n[\n\n### You Get More products \u00a0Explore\u00a0Now \u00a0Explore\u00a0Now \u00a0Explore\u00a0Now\n\n][60]\n[Exporter of Fragrances]\n\n## Why Choose Us\n\n## Discover Why LDG International is the Right Choice\n\n## Nature\u2019s Best: Premium Quality Fragrances!\n\n**LDG International**, one of India\u2019s largest manufacturer and exporter, excels in high-quality\nfragrances, natural essential oils, personal care fragrances, incense fragrances, diffuser\nfragrances, food colors, and flavours.\n\nWith over 40 years of experience, our expertise is rooted in Delhi, ensuring the finest fragrances\nthat meet international standards. We are committed to providing exceptional quality and innovation\nto our global customers.\n\nCustomer satisfaction is our top priority; it inspires us to improve, innovate, and grow\ncontinuously.\n\n## High-Quality Fragrances:\n\n**LDG International** is one of India\u2019s largest manufacturer &\u00a0 exporter of High-quality Fragrances.\n\n## 40+ Years of Expertise\n\nOur experience ensures premium quality and consistency.\n\n## Customer Satisfaction:\n\nWe prioritize customer happiness, ensuring meet high standards and deliver the best experience.\n\n## Our Fragrances Category\n\n## Explore LDG International's Fragrances!\n\n[Fragrances services]\n\n### Fine Fragrances\n\nWe have a great collection of fine fragrances.\n\n[Fragrances services]\n\n### Personal Care Fragrances\n\nWe create high-quality fragrances for personal care products.\n\n[Fragrances services]\n\n### Incense Fragrances\n\nWe manufacture high-quality incense fragrances for a soothing and aromatic experience.\n\n[Fragrances services]\n\n### Diffuser Fragrances\n\nPremium diffuser fragrances that enhance your space.\n\n## Testimonials\n\n## Our Customer Feedback\n\n## Fragrances Manufacturers & Suppliers\n\n## Experience the Magic of Our Natural Fragrances\n\nAt **LDG International**, we value our customers and are here to assist you. Feel free to reach out\nto us with any questions or concerns regarding our products, services, or inquiries. Our team is\ndedicated to providing prompt and helpful support to ensure your satisfaction.\n* Customizable fragrances solutions to meet unique needs.\n* Expert team providing dedicated customer support.\n* Over 40 years of manufacturing experience.\n* Commitment to innovation and continuous improvement.\n\n## Our Contact Information\n\nSEND MESSAGES\n[ [LDG International] ][61]\n\n**LDG International** creates high-quality flavors, fragrances, essential oils, extracts, and food\ncolors. We focus on delivering innovative, joyful solutions that exceed expectations with care and\ncreativity.\n\n**Follow Us:**\n\n[ Instagram ][62] [ Facebook ][63] [ Youtube ][64] [ X-twitter ][65]\n\n#### Quick Links\n* [ Home ][66]\n* [ About Us ][67]\n* [ Ethical Standards ][68]\n* [ Our Products ][69]\n* [ Contacts Us ][70]\n\n#### Contact Details\n\n## Phone Number\n\n### +91-8447660003\n### +91-8447550003\n\n## Email Address\n\n### [[email\u00a0protected]][71]\n\n## Our Location\n\n### G- 928, DSIIDC, Narela Industrial Area, Delhi-110040, India\n\n\u00a9 All Copyright 2025 by [**LDG International**][72]. All Rights Reserved\n* [ SITEMAP ][73]\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/\n[3]: tel:+91%208447660003\n[4]: tel:+91%208447550003\n[5]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#0e676068614e626a692367607a6220606b7a\n[6]: https://www.instagram.com/ldgintl32/\n[7]: https://www.facebook.com/ldgintl32\n[8]: https://www.youtube.com/@LDGInternational-wq9rt/\n[9]: https://x.com/ldgintl32?lang=en\n[10]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/\n[11]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/about/\n[12]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/ethical-standards/\n[13]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/fragrances/\n[14]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/fine-fragrances/\n[15]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/candle-fragrances/\n[16]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/body-wash-fragrances/\n[17]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/air-freshener-fragrances/\n[18]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/soap-detergent-fragrances/\n[19]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/essential-oils/\n[20]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/natural-essential-oils/\n[21]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/carrier-oils/\n[22]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/aromatherapy-oils/\n[23]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/floral-absolute-oils/\n[24]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/spice-oils/\n[25]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/wild-crafted-oils/\n[26]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/co2-extract-oils/\n[27]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/products/\n[28]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/flavours/\n[29]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/personal-care-fragrances/\n[30]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/incense-fragrances/\n[31]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/diffusers-fragrances/\n[32]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/extracts/\n[33]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/food-colours/\n[34]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/contact/\n[35]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/\n[36]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/about/\n[37]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/ethical-standards/\n[38]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/fragrances/\n[39]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/fine-fragrances/\n[40]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/candle-fragrances/\n[41]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/body-wash-fragrances/\n[42]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/air-freshener-fragrances/\n[43]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/soap-detergent-fragrances/\n[44]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/essential-oils/\n[45]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/natural-essential-oils/\n[46]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/carrier-oils/\n[47]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/aromatherapy-oils/\n[48]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/floral-absolute-oils/\n[49]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/spice-oils/\n[50]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/wild-crafted-oils/\n[51]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/co2-extract-oils/\n[52]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/products/\n[53]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/flavours/\n[54]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/personal-care-fragrances/\n[55]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/incense-fragrances/\n[56]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/diffusers-fragrances/\n[57]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/extracts/\n[58]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/food-colours/\n[59]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/contact/\n[60]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/products/\n[61]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/\n[62]: https://www.instagram.com/ldgintl32/\n[63]: https://www.facebook.com/ldgintl32\n[64]: https://www.youtube.com/@LDGInternational-wq9rt/\n[65]: https://x.com/ldgintl32?lang=en\n[66]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/\n[67]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/about/\n[68]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/ethical-standards/\n[69]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/products/\n[70]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/contact/\n[71]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[72]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/\n[73]: https://www.ldg-intl.net/sitemap/"
