            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## About Us\n* [ Home ][28]\n* About Us\n\n**Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.** is a well-established group engaged in manufacturing &\nexports of **Nicotine EP/USP, Other Nicotine Products, Caffeine Extract, Natural Essential Oils,\nHerbal Extracts & Oleoresins **on a large scale.\n\nThe company has 3 manufacturing units, unit 1 is situated at **Industrial Growth Centre, Chaygaon \u2013\nPatgaon \u2013 Jambari, Assam \u2013 781141** for distillation of Fragrance and Essential Oils like Cypriol,\nLemongrass, Eucalyptus, Lavender, Oregano, Rosemary Oil etc. Unit 2 is in **SIDCO Industrial Estate,\nKappalur, Madurai, Dharmathupatti, Tamil Nadu \u2013 625706** for manufacturing of Natural Caffeine &\nCaffeine Anhydrous, along with Herbal Extracts. Unit 3 is located in **Hyderabad, Telangana** for\nmanufacturing of Oleoresins like Paprika Oleoresin, Capsicum Oleoresin, Turmeric Oleoresin etc.\n\nOur products are exported across the globe and we have firm presence in **Europe, Asia, North\nAmerica, Canada, Australia, Middle East** etc. and continuing to expand throughout the world by\nserving products of International standards.\n\n[nvitalis corporate]\n\nWith many years of industrial experience, Natura Vitalis is a leader in sourcing and providing the\nfinest quality of products all over the world.\n\nur catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care, aromatherapy, health and wellness to\nkeep you and your body beautiful from inside out. We are a locally owned business, looking to take\non a natural and holistic approach to your health and everyday lifestyle. By helping you incorporate\nthe best-quality of essential oils in your day-to-day life, we wish to bring out the best of you,\ninside and out.\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd is an **ISO 9001: 2015 certified and GMP accreted company**. We\nhave ultra-modern in-house labs with latest high-tech GC-MS, HPLC, REFRACTOMETER, POLARIMETER etc.\nand all our products comes with proper lab reports like **Certificate of Analysis, MSDS, Gas\nChromatography** etc.\n\n[100% Natural]\n\n#### **100% Pure and Natural\u2014Nothing Added, Nothing Removed**\n\nOur team is consistently growing and we are making a point by providing the absolute highest quality\n100% pure and natural products, never compromising on the quality. Sourced for purity, quality and\nethics, our products are enjoyed in homes, aromatherapy, herbal cosmetics, drinks/beverages,\nnicotine products and used by massage therapists, naturalists etc.\n\nAt Natura Vitalis, delivering the highest quality is our first priority. With professional expertise\nbehind developing the most effective solutions to meet the market demand of natural products, we lay\nhigh emphasis on factors like quality of products, hygiene of workers, and packaging of the\nproducts.\n\n#### **The ISO 9001 Quality System**\n\n**Natura Vitalis **has been awarded the ISO 9001 certificate for quality, what this means is that we\nhave established and apply a quality management system in our factories to design, develop,\nmanufacture and supply Natural Products conforming to ISO 9001 standards. Our quality management\nsystem is audited every 6 months by an external auditor.\n\n[ISO Certified]\n[nvitalis team]\n\n#### **Team Efforts Keep Us Growing**\n\nTo be the best in the industry, we believe in combined efforts of each and every member of our\ncorporate family, starting right from the owners to the customer service team. We strive to\npositively impact the quality of lives of all the people around us or in any remote corner of the\nworld by building long-lasting relationships based on mutual trust and respect.\n\nYou may contact us for any kind of questions related to our products or simply to learn more about\nour products. Experts at our team are committed to help you search and buy the best product that\nwork best for you. Pleasure to say that whether you\u2019re a newbie to the world of essential oils or\nusing them for years, our experienced staff are fully committed to make your essential oils journey\nthe absolute best!\n\nWe care about you, and we care about your experience with us!\n\n#### Shipping Options\n\nOur shipping partners are DHL, FedEx, UPS, TNT and EMS. We also ship the goods by air as well as by\nsea as per buyer\u2019s requirement.\n\n[nvitalis presence]\n\n#### **The Major Countries of our Export**\n* Australia\n* Brazil\n* Canada\n* China\n* France\n* Germany\n* Japan\n* New Zealand\n* Korea\n* Spain\n* U.K\n* U.S.A\n\n#### OUR LEADERS\n\nM.P Goyal\nFounder, Chairman\nAshish Jain\nExecutive Director\nIshaan Jain\nManaging Director\nKumud Jain\nPresident\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][29]\n* [About Us][30]\n* [Products][31]\n* [Shipping][32]\n* [Packaging][33]\n* [Quality Assurance][34]\n* [USP][35]\n* [Industries We Serve][36]\n* [Business Verticals][37]\n* [CSR][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][40]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/carrier-oils/\n[17]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[18]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[19]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[20]: https://www.nvitalis.com/payment/\n[21]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/blog/\n[22]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[23]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Natura-Vitalis.pdf\n[24]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-ESSENTIAL-OILS.pdf\n[25]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-EXTRACTS.pdf\n[26]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-OLEORESINS.pdf\n[27]: https://www.nvitalis.com/contact-us/\n[28]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[29]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[30]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[31]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[32]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[33]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[34]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[35]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[36]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[37]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[38]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[39]: https://www.nvitalis.com/contact-us/\n[40]: https://www.deltait.co.in/"
