            "url": "https://www.nvitalis.com/products/celery-seed-oil/",
            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Celery Seed Oil\n\nNatural Essential Oils\n\n# Celery Seed Oil\n\n**Botanical Name:** **Apium graveolens**\n\n**Extraction Method:** Steam Distillation\n\n**Plant Part:** Seeds\n\n**Appearance:** Pale yellow, transparent, mobile liquid.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNatura Vitalis is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nCELERY SEED ESSENTIAL OIL worldwide. Our catalogue features a range of stellar products for skin\ncare, hair care & aromatherapy.\n\nSourced from the celery plant, Celery Seed essential oil improves digestion when taken internally.\nIt is soothing to the skin and adds to a comforting after-work out massage.\n\nCelery was used as early as the 5th century by the Chinese, and is widely used in Indian Ayurvedic\npractices today. Conventionally grown grocery store celery looks nothing like the celery seen at\nlocal farmers\u2019 markets. The celery plant grows up to three feet tall, is bright green, and radiating\nwith life. Celery has a complex, strong, , and spicy aroma. The plant takes two years to fully\nmature and produce its small fruit, which are tan to brown in color. The seeds are the primary\nrepository for essential oil. Limonene, the dominant constituent, puts Celery Seed oil in the same\nleague as the refreshing citrus peel and fir needle oils. Soothing digestive issues is one of the\nmany benefits of Celery Seed essential oil. Experimental research suggests that it may soothe\nmuscles and help joint discomfort when taken internally. Celery Seed oil creates a calming,\nrelaxing, and positive environment while providing cooling and soothing effects.\n\n**Chemical Composition:**\n\nCelery seed oil comprises various chemical components such as sedanolide, sedanonic anhydride,\nd-limonene, selinene and sesquiterpene alcohols. Besides, it can also contain fatty acids like\nlinoleic, myristic, palmitic, palmitoleic, stearic, petroselinic, oleic and myristoleic.\n\n**Essential Oil Information:**\n\nCelery plant is a biennial plant that grows about 30 to 50 cm height. It has grooved, fleshy, erect\nstalk and skinny pinnant leaves. This plant has smooth stem, soft leaves and has white flowers.\n\n**Oil Properties:**\n\nCelery seed oil is known for its antioxidative, anti-rheumatic, antiseptic (urinary), antispasmodic\nand aperitif properties. Besides, it is also carminative, cholagogue, depurative, digestive\ndiuretic, hepatic, nervine, stomachic, tonic (digestive), sedative (nervous) and stimulant (uterine)\nin nature.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turpentine Oil\n\n### Thyme Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Tea Tree Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rosemary Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rose Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Patchouli Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Palmarosa Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Oregano Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Nutmeg Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: 