            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Chamomile (Blue) Oil\n\nNatural Essential Oils\n\n# Chamomile (Blue) Oil\n\n**Botanical Name:** **Matricaria recutita L.** (synonym of Matricaria chamomilla L.)\n\n**Extraction Method:** Steam Distillation\n\n**Plant Part:** Flower Head\n\n**Appearance:** Dark inky blue, semi-transparent, slightly viscous to mobile liquid.\n\n**Aroma :** Straw-like fragrance.\n\n**Blends Well With:** Bergamot, clary sage, lavender, geranium, jasmine, tea tree, grapefruit, rose,\nlemon and ylang-ylang\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNatura Vitalis is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nCHAMOMILE ESSENTIAL OIL worldwide. Our catalogue features a range of stellar products for skin care,\nhair care & aromatherapy.\n\n**Extraction**\n\nThe oil is extracted by means of steam distillation in an easier way.\n\n**Chemical Composition**\n\nThe chemical composition of chamomile oil includes Esters, Pinene, Fanesol, Nerolidol, Chamazulene,\nPinocarvone, Cineol.\n\n**Essential Oil Information**\n\nThese oils are excellent for protecting dry skin and thus provide a soothing effect on mind and\nbody. The Featuring an, apple-like fragrance, CHAMOMILE OIL is light clear blue in color with a\nwatery viscosity. These are highly effective for irritation, impatience and feeling disagreeable.\n\n**Oil Properties**\n\nChamomile essential oil has an apple-like fragrance and belongs to species Asteraceae. Light clear\nblue in color with a watery viscosity, this oil is a powerful anti-inflammatory agent.\n\n**Uses**\n\nCHAMOMILE OIL is widely used in day-to-day activities in various applications like mouthwashes,\nlotions and creams. Moreover, the oil is also used to relieve allergies, anorexia, addiction, colic,\ninsomnia, back pain, muscle pain, arthritis, post-natal depression and bowel disorders., However,\nthis oil is highly recommended for those who are suffering from asthma, measles, mumps, PMS,\nmenopausal symptoms as well as rheumatism.\n\n**Therapeutic Properties**\n\nThe therapeutic properties include analgesic, anti-infectious, anti-depressant, anti-neuralgic,\nantiphlogistic, antiseptic, antispasmodic, anti-spasmodic, antiseptic, antibiotic,\nanti-inflammatory, bactericidal, carminative, cholagogue, cicatrisant, emmenagogue, febrifuge,\nhepatic, sedative, nervine, digestive, tonic, sudorific, stomachic, vermifuge and vulnerary.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turpentine Oil\n\n### Thyme Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Tea Tree Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rosemary Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rose Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Patchouli Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Palmarosa Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Oregano Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Nutmeg Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www