            "url": "https://www.nvitalis.com/products/citronella-oil/",
            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Citronella Oil\n\nNatural Essential Oils\n\n# Citronella Oil\n\n**Botanical Name:** **Cymbopogon winterianus**\n\n**Extraction Method:** Steam Distillation\n\n**Plant Part:** Grass\n\n**Appearance:** Pale yellow, transparent, mobile liquid.\n\n**Strength of Aroma:** Medium\n\n**Aromatic Scent:** Crispy, Floral, and Citrusy scent\n\n**Blends Well With:** Geranium, Clary Sage, Bergamot, Lemon and Sandalwood.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNatura Vitalis is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler, and supplier of 100% Pure and\nNatural Citronella Oil worldwide. Our catalogue features a range of stellar products for skin care,\nhair care & aromatherapy.\n\nPREMIUM THERAPEUTIC GRADE CITRONELLA OIL: \u2013 NATURA VITALIS CITRONELLA Oil is obtained by steam\ndistillation extraction of Cymbopogon winterianus grass. It is 100% Pure & Natural, Authentic, steam\ndistilled Citronella Essential Oil. We care for you!\n\nEXTREMELY BENEFICIAL FOR AROMATHERAPY: Steam Distilled Citronella Oil has a soothing scent that\nwakes up your mind and spirit. Just add a few drops to a bath or in a diffuser and get relief from\nstress throughout the day. Its soothing & calming aroma makes it one of the best essential oils for\naromatherapy & massage practices.\n\nAMAZING FOR YOUR SKINCARE: Natura Vitalis CITRONELLA Oil is not just a perfumery oil for massage and\naromatherapy, it can be beneficial for nourishing your skin as well. You can apply it topically to\nexperience the incredible benefits of citronella oil that makes your skin smooth & wrinkle-free. It\nprotects your skin against environmental factors and improves skin elasticity.\n\nPERFECT FOR HAIR CARE: CITRONELLA oil organic is the perfect essential oil for your hair care\nformulations. It is good to use topically for hair & scalp as it stimulates hair growth, nourishes\ndry scalp & improves hair thickness. It has been used in cosmetic formulations & beauty products\nlike skin creams, lotions, soaps, hair shampoo, hair conditioners, and more.\n\n100% AUTHENTIC & RISK-FREE PURCHASE: Natura Vitalis is committed to providing our customers with\nhigh-quality authentic products that deliver an extraordinary experience. In a time when quality\nseems to be compromised by price by others, we are determined to be different and continue to offer\nthe genuine quality we are known for.\n\n**Extraction:**\nCitronella oil is generally extracted using steam distillation process; using finely chopped fresh,\ndried or part-dried grass.\n\n**Chemical Composition:**\nCitronella oil contains citronellol, geraniol, citronellic acid, borneol, nerol, camphene, citral,\ncitronellal, dipentene and limonene.\n\n**Essential Oil Information:**\nThis is a volatile oil and is steam distilled using greenish blue, lemon-scented leaves and stem of\nCymbopogon nardus (Ceylon citronella) or Cymbopogon winteratus (Java type citronella) plants. This\nessential oil generally contains citronellal and geraniol.\n\nCitronella oil is available in two different categories such as Ceylon citronella oil obtained from\nCymbopogon nardus Rendle, (inferior type) and Java citronella oil obtained from Cymbopogon\nwinterianus Jowitt, (superior type).\n\n**Oil Properties:**\nIt is a colorless or light-yellow liquid known for its characteristic woody, grassy or lemony odor.\nVapors of this oil causes initial stimulation followed by depression of the central nervous system\nwhen inhaled. It is also flammable in nature.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turpentine Oil\n\n### Thyme Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Tea Tree Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rosemary Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rose Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Patchouli Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Palmarosa Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Oregano Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Nutmeg Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,