            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Clary Sage Oil\n\nNatural Essential Oils\n\n# Clary Sage Oil\n\n**Botanical Name:** **Salvia sclarea**\n\n**Extraction Method:** Steam Distillation\n\n**Appearance:** Colorless, transparent, mobile liquid.\n\n**Plant Part:** Leaves and Flowering Tops\n\n**Strength of Aroma:** Strong\n\n**Aromatic Scent:** Floral, Earthy and Musky scent\n\n**Blends Well With:** Lemon, Lavender, Jasmine and Geranium.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nClary Sage Essential Oil, worldwide. Our catalogue features a range of stellar products for skin\ncare, hair care & aromatherapy.\n\n100% PURE AND STEAM DISTILLED: \u2013 NATURA VITALIS Clary Sage Essential Oil, is obtained by steam\ndistillation extraction method of Salvia sclarea herb originated from France. It is 100% Pure &\nNatural, Authentic essential oil. We care for you!\n\nHIGHLY EFFECTIVE FOR REDUCING DARK SPOTS: \u2013 Natura Vitalis Clary Sage Oil has powerful natural\nproperties that you need to have a young beautiful glowing skin. CLARY SAGE Oil works as an amazing\nmoisturizer for skin and scalp. It reduces the appearance of dark spots, softens the skin and fades\naway unwanted signs of aging, wrinkles & fine lines. It also highly effective for hair growth and\nmakes hair looks strong & shiny.\n\nEXCELLENT FOR AROMATHERAPY: When it comes to aromatherapy, our steam distilled Natura Vitalis Clary\nSage oil is amazing, soothing aromatic oil to look for. It has been used for thousands of years for\naromatherapy and massage that makes you stress free and keeps you calm & collected. Just mix this\nessential oil with carrier oil and experience the incredible results on your skin, hair & body.\n\nVARIOUS USES OF CLARY SAGE OIL: \u2013 Natura Vitalis Clary Sage oil essential oil is considered as\nhighly effective essential oil when applied topically on skin to improve the texture of the skin as\nit absorbs into skin & it won\u2019t leave your skin greasy. It is also used in formulation of cosmetics,\nface creams, body lotions, hair serums, massage oils & conditioners.\n\n100% AUTHENTIC & RISK-FREE PURCHASE: Natura Vitalis is committed to providing our customers with\nhigh quality authentic products that deliver an extraordinary experience. In a time when quality\nseems to be compromised by price by others, we are determined to be different and continue to offer\nthe genuine quality we are known for.\n\n**Extraction:**\nThis sage essential oil is extracted by using flowering tops and dried leaves through steam\ndistillation method.\n\n**Chemical Composition:**\nSage essential oil is composed of camphene, a-pinene, myrcene, b-pinene, 1, 8-cineole, limonene,\nb-thujone, a-thujone, linalool, camphor, bornyl acetate and borneol.\n\n**Essential Oil Information:**\nSage essential oil is the oil which is extracted from the herb named as salvia sclarea by mean of\nstem distillation method. It is extensively used for the treatment of various kidney diseases,\nmenstrual irregularities, mental disorders, digestive problems and heals eye problems. Furthermore,\nit is also used in aromatherapy.\n\n**Oil Properties:**\nThis sage essential oil is known for its various therapeutic properties such as laxative,\nhypertensive, emmenagogue, diuretic, digestive, astringent, antispasmodic, antiseptic, antibacterial\nand anti-inflammatory. This sage essential oil is a watery liquid and has sharp and herbal smell.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turpentine Oil\n\n### Thyme Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Tea Tree Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rosemary Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rose Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Patchouli Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Palmarosa Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Oregano Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Nutmeg Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/carrier-oils/\n[17]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[18]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[19]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[20]: https://www.nvitalis.com/payment/\n[21]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/blog/\n[22]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[23]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Natura-Vitalis.pdf\n[24]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-ESSENTIAL-OILS.pdf\n[25]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-EXTRACTS.pdf\n[26]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-OLEORESINS.pdf\n[27]: https://www.nvitalis.com/contact-us/\n[28]: #\n[29]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[30]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[31]: #description\n[32]: #specification\n[33]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[34]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[35]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[36]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[37]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[38]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[39]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[40]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[41]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[42]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[43]: https://www.nvitalis.com/contact-us/\n[44]: https://www.deltait.co.in/"
