            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Eucalyptus Globulus Oil\n\nNatural Essential Oils\n\n# Eucalyptus Globulus Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Eucalyptus globulus**\n\n**Extraction Method:** Steam Distillation\n\n**Appearance:** Colorless, transparent, mobile liquid.\n\n**Plant Part:** Leaves\n\n**Strength of Aroma:** Strong\n\n**Aromatic Scent:** Fresh, medicinal, woody, and earthy.\n\n**Blends Well With:** Spearmint, Tea Tree, Lavender, Myrtle, Lemon, Frankincense.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nEucalyptus Globulus Essential Oil worldwide. Our catalogue features a range of stellar products for\nskin care, hair care & aromatherapy.\n\n100% PURE & NATURAL STEAM DISTILLED OIL: Natura Vitalis Eucalyptus Globulus Essential Oil is\nobtained by steam distillation extraction method of Eucalyptus globulus tree leaves. It is 100% Pure\n& Natural, Authentic Essential Oil. We care for you!\n\nPREMIUM THERAPEUTIC GRADE EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS ESSENTIAL OIL: This oil is best known for its\ntherapeutic properties. People often use this oil to bring down the fever and to aid and prevent\nrespiratory issues, cold, cough, or congestion due to minor ailments or changing weather. It is said\nto be a great help in curing such orders naturally.Natura Vitalis Eucalyptus Globulus Essential Oil\nhas the ability to reduce pain due to bruises, cuts and other body aches due to arthritis and\nrheumatism. The topical application on the affected area may aid significantly in coping up with\nbody pain.\n\nHAIR CARE WITH NATURA VITALIS EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS ESSENTIAL OIL: The follicle-stimulating property\nof Natura Vitalis Eucalyptus Globulus Essential Oil makes it perfect for hair growth and issues\nrelated to hair fall and scalp health. It shows to be very useful in pattern baldness and alopecia.\n\nENJOY VARIOUS BENEFITS OF NATURA VITALIS EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS ESSENTIAL OIL: The heart of the\nayurvedic industry, Eucalyptus Globulus Essential Oil is used for its various therapeutic benefits\nand its aroma that uplifts the spirit and instills a sense of calmness within.\n\n100% AUTHENTIC & RISK-FREE PURCHASE: Natura Vitalis is committed to providing our customers with\nhigh-quality authentic products that deliver an extraordinary experience. In a time when quality\nseems to be compromised by price by others, we are determined to be different and continue to offer\nthe genuine quality we are known for.\n\n**Extraction**\nThe essential oil is steam distilled from the dried leaves and young twigs of the eucalyptus tree.\n\n**Chemical Composition**\nThe main chemical components are 1,8-cineole, limonene, terpinen-4-ol, aromadendrene, epiglobulol,\na-pinene, b-pinene, a-phellandrene, piperitone and globulol.\n\n**Essential Oil Information**\nThe eucalyptus essential oil is extracted from Myrtaceae, a genus of flowering trees in myrtle\nfamily. As a source of wood, the oil finds usage for cleaning functions as a natural insecticide.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turpentine Oil\n\n### Thyme Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Tea Tree Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rosemary Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rose Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Patchouli Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Palmarosa Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Oregano Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Nutmeg Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/abou