            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Galbanum Oil\n\nNatural Essential Oils\n\n# Galbanum Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Ferula galbaniflua**\n\n**Extraction Method:** Steam Distillation\n\n**Appearance:** Colorless to very pale olive-yellow, transparent, mobile liquid.\n\n**Plant Part:** Resin\n\nStrength of Initial Aroma: Medium\n\n**Aromatic Description:** Galbanum Essential Oil smells fresh, green, earthy, balsamic, woody and\nspicy.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNatura Vitalis is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nGALBANUM ESSENTIAL OIL worldwide. Our catalogue features a range of stellar products for skin care,\nhair care & aromatherapy.\n\nGalbanum is a large perennial herb with a smooth stem shiny leaflets and small flowers. This oil is\nused in soap making ingredients, lotions, massage oils, diffusers, potpourri, scent, air fresheners,\nbody fragrance, perfume oils, aromatherapy products, bath oils, towel scenting, spa\u2019s, incense,\nlight rings, laundry, facial steams, hair treatments.\n\nGalbanum Essential Oil is steam distilled from the resin of a flowering plant (Ferula galbaniflua)\nthat is indigenous to Iran (Persia). Galbanum resin has been widely used as incense and in perfumery\nsince ancient times.\n\nTherapeutically, Galbanum Essential Oil is probably most widely known for its anti-inflammatory,\nanti-microbial and nervine properties.\n\nPeople take galbanum for diarrhea, gas (flatulence), poor appetite, cough, and seizure disorder\n(epilepsy).\n\nGalbanum is sometimes applied directly to the skin to help wounds heal.\n\nIn food and beverages, galbanum oil and resin are used as flavoring.\n\nIn manufacturing, galbanum oil and resin are used as fragrance in cosmetics.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turpentine Oil\n\n### Thyme Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Tea Tree Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rosemary Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rose Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Patchouli Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Palmarosa Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Oregano Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Nutmeg Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n