            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Geranium Oil\n\nNatural Essential Oils\n\n# Geranium Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Pelargonium graveolens**\n\n**Extraction Method:** Steam Distillation\n\n**Appearance:** Very pale yellow, transparent, mobile liquid.\n\n**Plant Part:** Leaves and Stalks\n\n**Strength of Aroma:** strong\n\n**Aroma :** Earthy, Floral Aroma with a hint of mint\n\n**Blends Well With:** Angelica, Basil, Bergamot, Carrot Seed, Juniper, Cedarwood, Citronella, Clary\nSage, Grapefruit, Jasmine, Lavender, Lemongrass, Lime, Neroli, Nutmeg, Orange, Fennel and Rosemary.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nGERANIUM ESSENTIAL OIL, of stellar products for skin care, hair care & aromatherapy.\n\n100% PURE & NATURAL STEAM DISTILLED: Natura Vitalis Geranium Oil, is obtained by steam distillation\nextraction method of Pelargonium graveolens flowers originated in Egypt. It is 100% Pure & Natural,\nAuthentic Essential Oil. Our Geranium Oil and is not tested on Animals. We care for you!\n\nNATURA VITALIS GERANIUM ESSENTIAL OIL, where a keen eye has been kept from the day the seed was sown\ntill the oil is packed to keep it free from toxins, pesticides, insecticides and other adulteration.\nIt is purely derived by an organic method and reaches you without harming the environment and the\nquality is 100% natural.\n\nPREMIUM THERAPEUTIC GRADE NATURA VITALIS GERANIUM ESSENTIAL OIL: This oil helps in skin rejuvenation\nand prevent from signs of aging. Its regular use tightens the skin giving perfect younger looking,\nclear and flawless skin. Mix it with your favorite carrier oil like Argan Oil, Almond Oil, Jojoba\noil etc. for best results.\n\nHAIR CARE WITH NATURA VITALIS GERANIUM ESSENTIAL OIL, it promotes hair by nourishing the roots and\nbalancing the production of sebum. It can be used as hair conditioner as it gently hydrates the hair\nlocks and restores the natural oils making them softer and shinier, leaving behind magical flowery\naroma. It is good for both oily and dry hair and gives easily manageable, smooth and silky tresses.\nJust add a few drops of geranium oil to your favorite shampoo for best results.\n\nENJOY VARIOUS BENEFITS OF NATURA VITALIS GERANIUM ESSENTIAL OIL, it has extensive use in\naromatherapy, massages, diffusers and spa. It has pleasing and uplifting aroma which lingers for a\nlong period of time and keeps you relaxed and refreshed. It has been used in cosmetic formulations &\nbeauty products like skin creams, lotions, soaps, hair shampoo, hair conditioners and more.\n\n100% AUTHENTIC & RISK-FREE PURCHASE: Natura Vitalis is committed to providing our customers with\nhigh quality authentic products that deliver an extraordinary experience. In a time when quality\nseems to be compromised by price by others, we are determined to be different and continue to offer\nthe genuine quality we are known for.\n\n**Extraction**\nGeranium oil is extracted by means of Steam Distillation from the stalks and leaves\n\n**Chemical Composition**\nThe Chemical Composition of geranium oil includes geranyl butyrate, a-pinene, geraniol, myrcene,\ncitronellol, limonene, geranyl acetate, menthone and linalool.\n\n**Essential Oil Information**\nOriginated from South Africa, as well as Reunion, Madagascar, Egypt and Morocco, these plants were\nintroduced to European countries such as Italy, Spain and France in the 17th century. The plant has\nabout 700 different varieties but only 10 species are capable of supplying viable quantity of oil.\n\nIt is a perennial shrub, which stands about 1 meter high. The plant has pointed leaves, which are\nserrated from the edges and the flowers of this plant is pinkish white in color. Geraniums were\nplanted around the house in previous times to keep evil spirits at bay.\n\n**Oil Properties**\nThe oil has watery viscosity. It is normally colorless but can have a slight tinge of light green\ncolor in it.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turpentine Oil\n\n### Thyme Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Tea Tree Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rosemary Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Rose Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Patchouli Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Palmarosa Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Oregano Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Nutmeg Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/carrier-oils/\n[17]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[18]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[19]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[20]: https://www.nvitalis.com/payment/\n[21]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/blog/\n[22]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[23]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Natura-Vitalis.pdf\n[24]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/th