            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Acerola\n\nHerbal Extracts\n\n# Acerola\n\nBotanical name: **Malpighia Emarginata**\n\nExtraction Method: Solvent Extraction\n\nPlant Part: Fruit\n\nAppearance: Pink Powder\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nAcerola Herbal Extract worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care,\nhair care & aromatherapy.\n\nAcerola cherry is a plant that is native to tropical regions of the Western Hemisphere. It\u2019s also\ncommonly called the West Indies cherry, Barbados cherry, or just simply \u201cacerola.\u201d It\u2019s believed\nthat the shrub-like plant originated in southern Mexico and the Caribbean.\n\nAcerola produces cherry-like berries, but it\u2019s not a true cherry. These berries are pleasant-tasting\nand have been used in modern and folk medicine. Traditional uses include treatment for liver\nailments, diarrhea, dysentery, coughs, and colds.\n\nAcerola is most well-known for being extremely rich in vitamin C. Because of this, it\u2019s often used\nto help with or prevent colds or flu. It\u2019s also used as an antioxidant nutrient. Together with\nvitamin C, acerola may be taken to boost immunity.\n\nSimilar to witch hazel, acerola cherry is an astringent. This could make it helpful for treating\nskin blemishes, promoting skin elasticity, and aiding digestive issues. It may even have use as an\nantimicrobial mouth wash.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Zeaxanthin\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Yohimbe\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Soy Isoflavones\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Milk Thistle\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Lycopene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Konjac\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Coenzyme Q10\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Calcium Sennoside\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Beta-Carotene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@