            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Amla\n\nHerbal Extracts\n\n# Amla\n\nBotanical Name: **Emblica Officinalis **\n\nExtraction Method: Solvent Extraction\n\nPlant Part: Fruit\n\nAppearance: Yellow brown fine powder\n\nActives: 40%, 45% Tannins by Titration.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nAmla Herbal Extract worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care, hair\ncare & aromatherapy.\n\nAmla extracts helps in anti-inflammatory and blood flow benefits. It is extracted from Indian\nGooseberry (Emblica Officinalis Gaertn). It\u2019s an effective anti-inflammatory agent and anticoagulant\naccording to new study. It is commonly used to kill germs and reduce pain and swelling caused by the\nbody\u2019s reaction to injury or illness. It helps in slows down aging also, its cures to a sore throat\nwhich fights against heart disease and increases diuretic activity and metabolic activity. It also\nhelps in reducing the blood sugar rate and boost up the immunity system.\n\nAmla or Phyllanthus Emblica is a major ingredient of globally accepted Ayurvedic preparations like\nChyavanaprash and Triphala. It is a rich source of vitamin C, as low molecular weight hydrolyzable\ntannins containing a molecular fragment similar to ascorbic acid (vitamin C) are the active\nprinciples of Amla.\n\nThe Amla tree is medium in size and bears fruit in Autumn. The fruit is fibrous by nature and tastes\nsour, bitter and astringent. Beyond being a vital ingredient of Ayurvedic formulations and grandma\u2019s\nhousehold remedies for centuries. Today Amla has become an invaluable composition of modern era\nproducts like hair care shampoos and oils apart from medicines.\n\n**BENEFITS OF AMLA EXTRACT**\n* Reducing total cholesterol, LDL cholesterol and triglycerides\n* Increases HDL Cholesterol\n* Increasing RBC, WBC, Lymphocytes and Hemoglobin\n* Reverses intima \u2013 media thickening\n* Retards intima \u2013 media thickening.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Zeaxanthin\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Yohimbe\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Soy Isoflavones\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Milk Thistle\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Lycopene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Konjac\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Coenzyme Q10\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Calcium Sennoside\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Beta-Carotene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/carrier-oils/\n[17]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[18]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[19]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[20]: https://www.nvitalis.com/payment/\n[21]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/blog/\n[22]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[23]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023