            "url": "https://www.nvitalis.com/products/andrographis/",
            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Andrographis\n\nHerbal Extracts\n\n# Andrographis\n\nBotanical name: **Andrographis paniculate**\n\nExtraction Method: Solvent Extraction\n\nPlant Part: Leaf & Stem.\n\nAppearance: Brown Yellow Fine Powder\n\nActives: 5% Andrographolides by Gravimetry.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nAndrographis Herbal Extract worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin\ncare, hair care & aromatherapy.\n\nAndrographis is a plant that is native to South Asian countries such as India and Sri Lanka. The\nleaf and underground stem are used to make medicine.\n\nAndrographis Paniculata is also known as \u2018The King of Bitters,\u2019 traditionally used in Ayurveda and\nChinese Medicine.\n\nAndrographis is frequently used for preventing and treating the common cold and flu (influenza).\n\nIt is widely cultivated in Southern and Southeastern Asia, where it is been used as treatment for\nbacterial infections and some diseases. Mostly the leaves and roots were used for such purposes. The\nwhole plant is also used in some cases. In Thailand, it is touted as a treatment for Covid-19\n\nAndrographis is also used for a wide assortment of other conditions. It is used for digestive\ncomplaints including diarrhea, constipation, intestinal gas, colic, and stomach pain; for liver\nconditions including an enlarged liver, jaundice, and liver damage due to medications; for\ninfections including leprosy, pneumonia, tuberculosis, gonorrhea, syphilis, malaria, cholera,\nleptospirosis, rabies, sinusitis, and HIV/AIDS; and for skin conditions including wounds, ulcers and\nitchiness.\n\nIt\u2019s also been used for sore throat, coughs, swollen tonsils, bronchitis, and allergies. It is also\nused for \u201chardening of the arteries\u201d (atherosclerosis), and prevention of heart disease and\ndiabetes.\n\nOther uses include treatment of snake and insect bites, loss of appetite, kidney problems\n(pyelonephritis), hemorrhoids, and an inherited condition called familial Mediterranean fever.\n\nAndrographis is also used as an astringent, bacteria killing agent, painkiller, fever reducer, and\ntreatment for worms.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Zeaxanthin\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Yohimbe\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Soy Isoflavones\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Milk Thistle\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Lycopene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Konjac\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Coenzyme Q10\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Calcium Sennoside\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Beta-Carotene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/carrier-oils/\n[17]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[18]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[19]