            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Ashwagandha\n\nHerbal Extracts\n\n# Ashwagandha\n\nBotanical Name: **Withania somnifera**\n\nExtraction Method: Solvent Extraction\n\nPlant Part: Root\n\nAppearance: Yellow brown fine powder.\n\nActives: 2.5% Withanoloids by Gravimetry; 5% Withanoloids by HPLC.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nAshwagandha Herbal Extract worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin\ncare, hair care & aromatherapy.\n\nAshwagandha or Withania Somnifera is a widely used herb in Ayurvedic medicines. The berries, leaves\nand root of this short herb have versatile medicinal values. The extract, light in color and neutral\nin taste is derived from select, handpicked roots. According to Ayurveda, Ashwagandha is excellent\nfor vitality as well as rejuvenation and is a general health booster. The purification of\nAshwagandha roots and the extraction processes are carried out under expert supervision using\ntraditional methods laid down in ancient Ayurveda texts.\n\nAshwagandha is a short shrub with small greenish flowers and reddish orange-colored fruits. The word\nAshwagandha is derived from Sanskrit usages Ashwa (horse) and Gandha (smell) as its roots have the\nsmell of a sweaty horse. Being one of the leading Ashwagandha Extract Manufacturer, we know this\nshrub had been widely used in Ayurvedic system of treatment. This plant is cultivated and is\nabundantly seen in most of the drier regions in India. In Ayurveda, the berries and leaves of the\nplant are also used for the treatment of ulcer, carbuncles etc.\n\n**Uses:**\n* May boost testosterone levels\n* May boost male fertility by increasing sperm count\n* May reduce blood sugar levels\n* May reduce cortisol levels\n* May reduce anxiety and depression\n* May decrease inflammation\n* May increase muscle mass and muscle strength\n* May help lower cholesterol\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Zeaxanthin\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Yohimbe\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Soy Isoflavones\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Milk Thistle\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Lycopene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Konjac\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Coenzyme Q10\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Calcium Sennoside\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Beta-Carotene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,