            "url": "https://www.nvitalis.com/products/black-pepper/",
            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Black Pepper\n\nHerbal Extracts\n\n# Black Pepper\n\nBotanical name: **Piper nigrum**\n\nExtraction Method: Solvent Extraction\n\nPart Used: Fruit\n\nAppearance: Yellow-brown fine dark powder.\n\nActives: 5%, 95% Piperine by HPLC.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nBlack Pepper Herbal Extract worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin\ncare, hair care & aromatherapy.\n\nBlack pepper grows in India and other tropical Asian countries. Black pepper is one of the most\ncommonly used spices in the world. It\u2019s used for arthritis, asthma, upset stomach, and many other\nconditions. Black pepper oil is used to prevent falls, to help quit smoking and reduce cravings, and\nfor many other conditions. In foods, black pepper and black pepper oil are used as a spice.\n\nBlack pepper contains a chemical called piperine. This chemical seems to have many effects in the\nbody. It seems to kill bacteria, fungi, and parasites. Piperine might also help with absorption of\nsome medications and protect against cancer. It has been well recognized as a bioavailability\nenhancer for nearly two decades.\n\nOther uses of Black Pepper: For treating bronchitis, a bacterial infection that causes diarrhea\n(cholera), colic, depression, gas, headache, sex drive, menstrual pain, stuffy nose, sinus\ninfection, dizziness, discolored skin (vitiligo), weight loss, and cancer.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Zeaxanthin\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Yohimbe\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Soy Isoflavones\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Milk Thistle\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Lycopene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Konjac\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Coenzyme Q10\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Calcium Sennoside\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Beta-Carotene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -1220