            "url": "https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caralluma/",
            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Caralluma\n\nHerbal Extracts\n\n# Caralluma\n\nBotanical Name: **Caralluma fimbriata**\n\nExtraction Method: Solvent Extraction\n\nPlant Part: Aerial Parts\n\nAppearance: Yellow Brown\n\nActives: 20%-30% Pregnane Glycosides by Gravimetry\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nCaralluma Herbal Extract worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care,\nhair care & aromatherapy.\n\nCaralluma is a succulent plant (cactus) from India.\n\nPeople use caralluma to decrease appetite or hunger, especially during times of food shortages, for\nobesity, and for a rare, inherited disorder that causes obesity, short stature, and learning\ndisability (Prader-Willi syndrome or PWS).\n\nIn India it grows wild and is often used as a border in gardens and as a roadside shrub. It is also\nfound in the wild in Africa, Saudi Arabia, Canary Islands, Afghanistan, and Southern Europe.\n\nTraditionally, Indian tribes chewed chunks of caralluma to keep from being hungry during a long\nhunt. The chemicals taken from the plant extract is used to decrease appetite for weight loss. It is\nalso used to quench thirst and to increase endurance.\n\nThe person who is using Caralluma fimbriata feels more energetic and has gained lean muscle mass\nwhile losing fat. The reason is that it not only inhibits fat synthesis but also increases the\nburning of fat. This makes more energy available to the body and makes the person more active and\nlivelier.\n\nCaralluma fimbriata contains pregnane glycosides which block the activity of citrate lyase enzyme\nthus blocking the formation of fat by the body. Further Caralluma fimbriata blocks another enzyme\ncalled Malonyl Coenzyme A. By blocking this enzyme fat formation is further blocked and the body is\nforced to burn its fat reserves. This accelerates the rate of fat loss by the body.\n\n**Uses & Effectiveness**\n* A type of persistent anxiety marked by exaggerated worry and tension (generalized anxiety disorder\nor GAD).\n* **Obesity:** Some early research shows that taking an extract of caralluma may decrease food\nintake, feelings of hunger, and waist size.\n* A rare, inherited disorder that causes obesity, short stature, and learning disability\n(Prader-Willi syndrome or PWS).\n* Quenching thirst.\n* Increasing endurance.\n* Pain.\n* Other conditions.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Zeaxanthin\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Yohimbe\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Soy Isoflavones\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Milk Thistle\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Lycopene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Konjac\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Coenzyme Q10\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Calcium Sennoside\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Beta-Carotene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/cat