            "url": "https://www.nvitalis.com/products/centella-asiatica/",
            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Centella Asiatica\n\nHerbal Extracts\n\n# Centella Asiatica\n\nBotanical name: **Centella asiatica**\n\nExtraction Method: Solvent Extraction\n\nPart Used: Herbs\n\nAppearance: Gray white to white fine powder.\n\nActives: 10% Asiaticosides by HPLC; 40% Saponins by Gravimetry.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nCentella Asiatica Herbal Extract worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for\nskin care, hair care & aromatherapy.\n\nCentella asiatica aka Gotu Kola is a medicinal plant. The active compounds include pentacyclic\ntriterpenes, mainly asiaticoside, madecassoside, asiatic and madecassic acids. Centella asiatica is\neffective in improving treatment of small wounds, hypertrophic wounds as well as burns, psoriasis\nand scleroderma. The mechanism of action involves promoting fibroblast proliferation and increasing\nthe synthesis of collagen and intracellular fibronectin content and also improvement of the tensile\nstrength of newly formed skin as well as inhibiting the inflammatory phase of hypertrophic scars and\nkeloids.\n\nCentella asiatica extract containing 70% triterpenic acids (asiatic acid, madecassic acid,\nasiatoside) is impressive in treating cellulite, venous insufficiency of lower limbs, and varicose\nveins. It exerts normalizing action on metabolism of connective tissue. It enhances tissue integrity\nby stimulating glycosaminoglycan (GAG) synthesis without promoting excessive collagen synthesis or\ncell growth. GAGs are major components of amorphous intercellular matrix (ground substance) in which\ncollagen fibers are embedded. Net effect is normal tissue. Effect in venous insufficiency and\nvaricose veins is to enhance connective tissue structure, reducing sclerosis and improving blood\nflow through affected limbs.\n\nSome traditional uses of gotu kola include:\n* healing wounds\n* relieving diarrhea\n* boosting energy levels\n* reducing anxiety\n* enhancing sexual potency\n* treating venereal diseases\n* treating skin diseases\n* treating menstrual disorders\n* slowing leprosy progression\n* prolonging life\n\n** **\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Zeaxanthin\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Yohimbe\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Soy Isoflavones\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Milk Thistle\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Lycopene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Konjac\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Coenzyme Q10\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Calcium Sennoside\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Beta-Carotene\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/carrier-oils/\n[17]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[18]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[19]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[20]: