            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Cinnamon Leaf Oil\n\nEssential Oils\n\n# Cinnamon Leaf Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Cinnamomum verum**\n\nExtraction Method: Steam Distillation\n\nPlant Part: Leaves\n\nAroma: sweet, earthy, and spicy aroma\n\nBlends Well With: Bergamot, clove, ginger, ylang ylang etc.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nCinnamon Leaf Oil Organic worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care,\nhair care & aromatherapy.\n\nPREMIUM THERAPEUTIC GRADE CINNAMON LEAF OIL: \u2013 Natura Vitalis Cinnamon Oil is obtained by steam\ndistillation extraction method of Cinnamomum verum leaf .It is 100% Pure & Natural, Authentic\nEssential Oil. We care for you!\n\n100% PURE & NATURAL STEAM DISTILLED OIL: Natura Vitalis Cinnamon Leaf Oil nourishes the skin and\nslows the rate of premature aging. It revives the skin tone, calms the dry skin, moisturizes it\neliminates itchiness and enhance skin beauty. It may also be used to moist lips to hydrate dry,\nchapped lips. Mix with your favorite lotion to get beautiful skin.\n\nNATURA VITALIS CINNAMON LEAF OIL: It helps to stimulate hair growth and promote thickening of hair.\nIt cleanses the hair and help to maintain good hair quality, add luster and fullness to dull, dry\nhair. Mix with your favorite carrier oil like Argan Oil, Jojoba Oil, Olive Oil for best results.\n\nCINNAMON is full of rich, natural antioxidants and is ranked one of the top most used spice.\nCinnamon leaf oil is known to decrease the feeling of depression, exhaustion, and increase strength\nand immunity. It has warm, uplifting and relaxing fragrance. It has various medicinal benefits. It\nfacilitates pain relief, diminishes stiffness in the muscles and joints, stimulate metabolic\nfunction, reduce skin inflammation and improve metabolic function. It also benefits the respiratory\nsystem by reducing the symptoms of cold and flu, such as sore throat, nasal congestion and\nheadaches.\n\nENJOY VARIOUS BENEFITS OF NATURA VITALIS CINNAMON LEAF OIL: It is very popularly used in\naromatherapy, massages, diffusers and spa. It has been used in cosmetic formulations & beauty\nproducts like mouth washes, toothpaste, skin creams, lotions, soaps, hair shampoo, hair conditioners\nand more.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Vanilla CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Marigold CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Black Pepper Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Mace Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Garlic Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www.nvitalis