            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Clove Leaf Oil\n\nEssential Oils\n\n# Clove Leaf Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Syzygium aromaticum ****L.**\n\nExtraction Method: Steam Distillation\n\nPlant Part: Leaves\n\nOdour: Spicy, warm, typical odour of eugenol.\n\nAppearance: Colorless to pale yellow clear liquid\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nPREMIUM THERAPEUTIC GRADE CLOVE OIL: \u2013 Natura Vitalis Clove Oil is obtained by steam distillation\nextraction method of Syzygium aromaticum L. leaves. It is 100% Pure & Natural, Authentic Essential\nOil. We care for you!\n\n100% PURE & NATURAL STEAM DISTILLED OIL: Natura Vitalis Clove Oil is beneficial for dental care\nformulations. It is added to many dental products like toothpaste, mouthwashes. It has pleasant\nstrong smell and removes bad breath. It could be used as a mouth wash by diluting 1-2 drops of clove\noil in warm water once a day daily for fresh breath and clean teeth.\n\nNATURA VITALIS CLOVE OIL: It helps to get clear even-toned skin & makes youthful and radiant looking\nskin. It is also endowed with hair care benefits and boost hair growth and thickness by stimulating\nhair follicles. Mix with your favorite carrier oil like Argan Oil, Jojoba Oil, Olive Oil for best\nresults.\n\nENJOY VARIOUS BENEFITS OF NATURA VITALIS CLOVE OIL: It is very popularly used in aromatherapy,\nmassages, diffusers and spa. It has been used in cosmetic formulations & beauty products like mouth\nwashes, toothpaste, skin creams, lotions, soaps, hair shampoo, hair conditioners and more.\n\nIt has a warm, strong, spicy smell, and the oil is colorless to pale yellow with a medium to watery\nviscosity. The whole tree is highly aromatic. A native of Medagaska and Indonesia, Syzygium\naromaticum is an evergreen tree that grows to about 10 meters tall and has bright green leaves. It\nwas often used by the Greeks, Roman and the Chinese, to ease toothache and as a breath sweetener.\nThe main chemical components of clove oil are eugenol, eugenol acetate, iso-eugenol and\ncaryophyllene.\n\n**Uses:\n**1. One of the most well-known clove oil uses, as a remedy for toothaches.\n2. It helps in lowering blood pressure and boost heart health.\n3. Cloves possess beneficial properties that help relax the smooth muscle lining in your\ngastrointestinal tract. When used as oil, it can aid in halting digestive problems, like nausea and\nvomiting.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Vanilla CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Marigold CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Black Pepper Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Mace Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Garlic Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleo