            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Davana Essential Oil\n\nEssential Oils\n\n# Davana Essential Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Artemisia Pallens**\n\nCommon Method of Extraction: Steam Distilled\n\nPlant Part Typically Used: Flowers\n\nAppearance: Pale yellow to reddish gold, transparent, mobile liquid.\n\nAromatic Profile: Exceptionally rich, penetrating, strongly boozy (of dried fruits),\nsweet/herbaceous aroma; has warm, balsamic, woody and bittersweet undertones and a slight\ncamphoraceous note.\n\nBlends Well With: Basil, Geranium, Patchouli, Vetiver, Ylang Ylang etc.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nDavana Oil worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care, hair care &\naromatherapy.\n\nDavana Essential Oil is typically steam distilled from the leaves and flowers of Artemisia pallens,\na shrub that is primarily found in India.\n\nDavana Essential Oil is comprised primarily davanone, a ketone. Not much is known about this\nspecific ketone, but ketones generally tend to be anti-viral, analgesic, mucolytic and can help\npromote the healing of wounds.\n\nAromatically, Davana Essential Oil possesses a rich, fruity, slightly woody aroma. It is appreciated\nand used within natural fragrancing applications. It\u2019s an aromatically versatile oil that blends\nwell with essential oils in the wood, spice, resin, floral and citrus families.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Vanilla CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Marigold CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Black Pepper Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Mace Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Garlic Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -1