            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Frankincense Oil\n\nEssential Oils\n\n# Frankincense Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Boswellia serrata**\n\nExtraction Method: Steam Distillation\n\nPlant Part: Resin\n\nAppearance: Pale golden yellow, slightly viscous, transparent, mobile liquid.\n\nStrength of Aroma: Strong\n\nAromatic Scent: Warm, Balsamic, Spicy\n\nBlends Well With: Bergamot, Peppermint, Lavender, Rose, and Clary Sage.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler, and supplier of 100% Pure and\nNatural Frankincense Oil worldwide. Our catalogue features a range of stellar products for skincare,\nhair care & aromatherapy.\n\nPREMIUM THERAPEUTIC GRADE FRANKINCENSE SERRATA ESSENTIAL OIL: \u2013 NATURA VITALIS Frankincense\nEssential Oil is obtained by steam distillation extraction of Boswellia Serrata resin. It is 100%\nPure & Natural, Authentic essential oil.\n\nSTEAM DISTILLED FRANKINCENSE SERRATA ESSENTIAL OIL: NATURA VITALIS Frankincense Essential Oil is one\nof the best essential oils that have natural soothing properties to uplift your mood. Just add a few\ndrops in your diffuser. It has been used in cosmetic formulations & beauty products like skin\ncreams, lotions, soaps, hair shampoo, hair conditioners, and more.\n\nGREAT ESSENTIAL OIL FOR BODY: Besides having a soothing aromatic impact on you, NATURA VITALIS\nFrankincense Essential Oil do wonders in your body care formulations especially if you are looking\nfor young, hydrated glowing skin. It deeply moisturizes your face, feet, and body and excellent oil\nfor skin brightening. Mix it with a carrier oil for the best results.\n\nMULTIPLE BEAUTY CARE BENEFITS: NATURA VITALIS Frankincense Essential Oil has multiple benefits such\nas aromatherapy, skincare & hair care. It can be added to your favorite hair oils and lotions to\nmake your hair smooth and silky. Combine it with base oils known as carrier oils to apply on skin,\nhair, and body & experience incredible benefits.\n\n100% AUTHENTIC & RISK-FREE PURCHASE: Natura Vitalis is committed to providing our customers with\nhigh quality authentic products that deliver an extraordinary experience. In a time when quality\nseems to be compromised by price by others, we are determined to be different and continue to offer\nthe genuine quality we are known for.\n\n**Uses: **Rub Frankincense on your hands after a long day of gardening, Apply topically to help\nreduce the appearance of skin imperfections, Massage Frankincense oil on the bottoms of feet, Take\none to two drops in a veggie capsule to support healthy cellular function.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Vanilla CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Marigold CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Black Pepper Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Mace Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Garlic Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https:/