            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Garlic Oil\n\nEssential Oils\n\n# Garlic Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Allium sativum**\n\nExtraction Method: Steam Distillation\n\nPlant Part: Bulbs\n\nAppearance: pale yellow to brownish yellow\n\nFlavor: pungent & spicy\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nGarlic Oil worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care, hair care &\naromatherapy.\n\nGarlic, *Allium* *sativum*, is broadly used around the world for its numerous culinary and medicinal\nuses. Wild garlic, *Allium vineale*, has been used as a substitute for garlic, both in food as well\nas in herbal medicine. The present study investigated the chemical compositions of *A.\nsativum* and *A. vineale* essential oils. The essential oils from the bulbs of *A. sativum*,\ncultivated in Spain, were obtained by three different methods: laboratory hydro-distillation,\nindustrial hydro-distillation, and industrial steam distillation.\n\n**Garlic Essential Oil Properties:**\n\nDocumented properties of garlic essential oil include analgesic, antibacterial, anticoagulant,\nantifungal, antiviral, calmative, decongestant, disinfectant, diuretic, expectorant,\nhypo-tensor, insecticide, laxative, stimulant, tonic, lymphatic toner, vasodilator.\n\n**Benefits:**\n\nSkin Benefits, Treats Acne, Fights Skin Infections, Hair Benefits, Prevents Hair Loss, Treats\nDandruff, Health Benefits, Fights Infections, Relieves Toothaches, Lowers Cholesterol, Improves\nCardiovascular Health, Prevents Cognitive Decline, Treats Ear Infections, Boosts Immunity, Enhances\nBone Health In Women, Improves Exercise Endurance, Works as a Mosquito Repellant, Treats Cold Sores.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Vanilla CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Marigold CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger CO2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Black Pepper Co2 Extract\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ylang Ylang Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Turmeric Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Mace Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Ginger Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Frankincense Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n