            "url": "https://www.nvitalis.com/products/avocado-oil/",
            "text": "100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Facility][5]\n* [USP][6]\n* [Industries We Serve][7]\n* [Business Verticals][8]\n* [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n* [Natural Caffeine][12]\n* [Essential Oils][13]\n* [Herbal Extracts][14]\n* [Oleoresins][15]\n* [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\n* [Download][22]\n* [Company Profile][23]\n* [List of Essential Oils][24]\n* [List of Extracts][25]\n* [List of Oleoresins][26]\n* [Contact Us][27]\n\n## Avocado Oil\n\nCarrier Oils\n\n# Avocado Oil\n\nBotanical Name: **Persea Americana**\n\nExtraction Method: Cold Pressed\n\nPlant Part: Fruit\n\nColor : Pale yellow to golden yellow liquid.\n\nAroma: It has very little scent characteristic of most carrier oils, NEARLY ODORLESS.\n\nBlend With: Blends with most of the oil including olive oil, palm oil, castor oil, coconut oil,\netc.\n\n[Send An Enquiry ][28]\n[packging sizing][29] [shipping info][30]\n[group-5]\n[Description][31] [Technical Details ][32]\n\nNATURA VITALIS is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nAvocado Oil worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care, hair care &\naromatherapy.\n\nAvocado oil is extracted from fleshy pulp surrounding of avocado pit. It is classified as a\nmonosaturated oil. The ultra-rich oil contains Vitamins A, B1, B2, D, E, and Beta carotene. Avocado\noil is known to have healing and regenerating properties. This carrier oil has a relatively high\nviscosity and is high-oleic content.\n\n100% PURE & NATURAL NATURA VITALIS AVOCADO OIL: The Unfiltered, undiluted without any additives or\nfillers. Rich in vitamins and fatty acids it is truly wonderful carrier oil. From skin care, hair\ncare to aromatherapy and way beyond this amazing oil has endless uses. We care for you!\n\nNATURAL NUTRIENT RICH SKIN MOISTURIZER: The Natura Vitalis Avocado essential oil is a cold pressed\nAvocado oil acts as a natural moisturizer which has a many hydrating benefits for hair, skin, face\nand nails. It is also used in making of effective massage oil. This pure refined avocado oil has the\nunique ability to deeply penetrate the outer layers of skin.\n\nAVOCADO OIL FACIAL MOISTURIZER: Excellent to use organic avocado oil as a facial moisturizer.\nMassage with the avocado cold pressed oil on face and leave it on for about 15 minutes, then rinse\nthe face with warm water. When left on for short periods of time and rinsed off with warm water,\navocado oil can keep skin hydrated without leaving an oily residue.\n\nAVOCADO OIL FOR HEALTHY HAIR: Loved by many people around the world for their hair care. When\napplied to the hair shafts, it helps to detangle hair. It promotes hair growth because of the\nnutrients in it, especially Vitamin E. It helps to achieve gorgeous shiny hair without any\ngreasiness and it also softens the hair, so that they are more manageable and easily combed.\n\nNatura Vitalis is a leading manufacturer, exporter, wholesaler and supplier of 100% Pure and Natural\nAvocado Oil, Organic worldwide. Our catalog features a range of stellar products for skin care, hair\ncare & aromatherapy.\n\n** **\n\n**Benefits & Uses:**\n\nAvocado carrier oil blends are very useful when treating sun, climate or chemical damaged skin that\nis dehydrated and undernourished. The oil also helps to regenerate and rejuvenate the skin as well\nas soften the skin tissue. Avocado oil is well known as a nutrient for penetrating dry skin and\nresolving other skin problems.\n* Avocado oil is a penetrating oil that is easily absorbed and suitable for all skin types. It is an\neffective skin moisturizer due to its regenerating and structuring abilities.\n* It is also believed to be an effective sexual stimulant and is used to make ointments aimed at\ndelaying old age.\n* The oil is used as hairdressing and is employed in making facial creams, hand lotions and fine\nsoap.\n\nAll Product Technical Details, Specifications, Lab Analytical Report, MSDS, and other related\ndocuments and certifications will be provided on request.\n\nOur facility is equipped with a in house laboratory using state-of-the-art lab testing equipments to\nrigorously test the veracity of the purity and potency of our products. With an unwavering\ncommitment to offering the highest quality of products, we firmly believe that Quality Assurance is\nof utmost importance.\n\n### Similar Products\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Zedoaria Essential Oil\n\n[nvitalis product]\n\n### Cucumber Oil\n\n[group-5]\n[image]\n\n### About Our Company\n\nNatura Vitalis Industries is a recognized brand among leading manufacturers of Pure Essential oils,\nHerbal extracts and other products used in natural skincare and aromatherapy.\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][33]\n* [About Us][34]\n* [Products][35]\n* [Shipping][36]\n* [Packaging][37]\n* [Quality Assurance][38]\n* [USP][39]\n* [Industries We Serve][40]\n* [Business Verticals][41]\n* [CSR][42]\n* [Contact Us][43]\n\n### Company\n\n**Head Office Address: ** Plot No. 29, Sector 37, Pace City 1, HSIIDC Industrial Area, Gurgaon,\nHaryana, India -122001\n\n**Email: **info@nvitalis.com,\nsupport@nvitalis.com\n\n**Landline Tel:** +91 124-4364795\n**Mobile Tel:** +91-9810431486, +91-7838690001, +91-9999040662\n\n[card]\n\n\u00a9 All Rights Reserved | Designed By [Delta Web Services][44]\n\nEnquire Now\n\n#### Enquire Now\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail Id\n\nMobile No.\n\nCountry\n\nMessage\n\nAlert: Content is protected !!\n\n[1]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[2]: https://www.nvitalis.com\n[3]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[4]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://www.nvitalis.com/facility/\n[6]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[7]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[8]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[9]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[10]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[11]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/caffeine-anhydrous-bp-ep-usp/\n[12]: https://www.nvitalis.com/products/natural-caffeine/\n[13]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/essential-oils/\n[14]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/herbal-extracts/\n[15]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/oleoresins/\n[16]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/carrier-oils/\n[17]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[18]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[19]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[20]: https://www.nvitalis.com/payment/\n[21]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/blog/\n[22]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[23]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Natura-Vitalis.pdf\n[24]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-ESSENTIAL-OILS.pdf\n[25]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-EXTRACTS.pdf\n[26]: https://www.nvitalis.com/wp-content/themes/nvtheme/pdf/LIST-OF-OLEORESINS.pdf\n[27]: https://www.nvitalis.com/contact-us/\n[28]: #\n[29]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[30]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[31]: #description\n[32]: #specification\n[33]: https://www.nvitalis.com/\n[34]: https://www.nvitalis.com/about-us/\n[35]: https://www.nvitalis.com/category/products/\n[36]: https://www.nvitalis.com/shipping/\n[37]: https://www.nvitalis.com/packaging/\n[38]: https://www.nvitalis.com/quality-assurance/\n[39]: https://www.nvitalis.com/usp/\n[40]: https://www.nvitalis.com/industries-we-serve/\n[41]: https://www.nvitalis.com/business-verticals/\n[42]: https://www.nvitalis.com/csr/\n[43]: https://www.nvitalis.com/contact-us/\n[44]: https://www.deltait.co