        "crawl_text": "Packaging Professionals Group ISO 22716:2007 accredited for Cosmetic Product Manufacturing and meets stringent Australian Certified Organic Standards. ISO 22716:2007 accredited for Cosmetic Product Manufacturing Australian Certified Organic Standards 100% Australian owned and operated Onshore manufacturing Highly trained and experienced staff Registered in the Transitional Fatigue Management Scheme of the NSW Road Transport (Safety & Traffic Management) (Driver Fatigue) Regulation 1999 3 Olympic Place, Kelso, NSW 2795, Australia Unit 1, 136 Newton Rd, Wetherill Park, NSW, Australia Asquith, Sydney, NSW, Australia Australia Bathurst, NSW, Australia Sydney, NSW, Australia Australia [ Skip to content][1]\n[[Packaging Professionals]][2]\nMain Menu\n* [Shop][3]\n* [Pet Foods][4]\n* [Beauty and Skincare][5]\n* [Go to Market][6]\n* [Other Services][7]Menu Toggle\n* [Veterinary and Pet Care][8]\n* [Filling, Packing and Packaging][9]\n* [Industrial][10]\n* [MSDS Downloads][11]\n* [Dry Foods][12]\n* [Warehouse and Distribution][13]\n* [Sanitiser][14]\n* [Container Sales][15]\n* [Company Profile][16]Menu Toggle\n* [About Us][17]\n* [Contact Us][18]\n* [Accreditations][19]\n* [ Cart/$0.00\n][20]\n\n# About Us\n\n[ Facebook-f ][21] [ Linkedin ][22]\n\nAbout Us\n\n[ Facebook-f ][23] [ Linkedin ][24]\n\n### 100% Australian Owned\n\n[ More ][25]\n\n## Professional\n\n[Packaging Professionals - Packing Service]\n\nPackaging Professionals Group is a complete technical facility capable of managing your product\u2019s\nproduction, packaging and distribution all under the one roof. We deliver, with the upmost care and\nattention to detail, and understand the importance of protecting your valuable product.\n\nPackaging Professionals Group keep all our manufacturing onshore, employing local qualified staff to\nensure a high-quality product.\n\n## Versatile\n\n[Packaging Professionals - Manufacturing Service]\n\nWe are a contract manufacturing and packaging company catering to small and medium businesses.\nSpecialties are, but are not limited to, Pet Care, Veterinary, Food, Industrial and Personal Care\nmanufacturing and packing.\n\nWe have two facilities located in Bathurst and Sydney in New South Wales Australia. We have the\ntechnical capabilities to delivery high-end products, and are 100% ready for distribution and\nretail.\n\n## Experienced\n\n[Packaging Professionals - Full Transport Service]\n\nPackaging Professionals can supply a full Transport service to complement manufacturing and packing.\nAs a result we can support your business in all areas of manufacturing to the highest standard, from\nbeginning to end.\n\nWe are registered in the Transitional Fatigue Management Scheme of the NSW Road Transport (Safety &\nTraffic Management) (Driver Fatigue) Regulation 1999.\n\n## [A little bit more about us...][26]\n\nPackaging Professionals Group is 100% Australian owned and operated. We pride ourselves on our\nindustry knowledge and creativity, offering attentive and discreet customer service at all times.\n\nAs a result we deliver an exceptionally high standard of quality, because conformance to customer\nrequirements is our number one goal.\n\nPackaging Professionals Group has two facilities. Our Pet, Veterinary and Food facility is located\nin Bathurst NSW. Our Personal Care and Industrial facility is located in Asquith, Sydney.\n\n[Packaging Professionals - Container Fill]\n[Packaging Professionals - Industrial Goods]\n[Packaging Professionals - Tube Filling]\n[Packaging Professionals - Beauty and Skincare Products]\n\nPackaging Professional Group has over 75,000 square feet under roof. Hence, we can store in excess\nof 3,000 pallets of raw material, packaging and finished product.\n\nAll functions to support your business including Purchasing, Packing Development and Transport are\nall covered in house. This is serviced by highly trained and experienced Packaging Professionals\nstaff.\n\nRest assured, our facility is ISO 22716:2007 accredited for Cosmetic Product Manufacturing and meets\nstringent Australian Certified Organic Standards.\n\nIf you would like further information on the services we are able to provide to you, we welcome your\nenquiry.\n\n[ Contact Us ][27]\n[Packaging Professionals -Bathurst Facility]\n\n### Call our Sales Team on +61 (0)2 6338 2100 for more information.\n\nServices\n\n[Pet Foods][28]\n[Beauty and Skincare][29]\n[Veterinary][30]\n[Sanitiser][31]\n[Industrial Products][32]\n\nServices\n\n[Ingredient Shop][33]\n[Filling Packing Packaging][34]\n[Go to Market][35]\n[Dry Food][36]\n[Warehouse and Distribution][37]\n\nMore\n\n[Home][38]\n[About][39]\n[Contact][40]\n[Accreditations][41]\n[Privacy][42]\n\nPackaging Professionals have worked hard to ensure that we have the latest Accreditation\u2019s required\nto ensure that we can support our customers.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Packaging Professionals\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.packpro.com.au/\n[3]: https://www.packpro.com.au/ingredient-shop/\n[4]: https://www.packpro.com.au/pet-foods/\n[5]: https://www.packpro.com.au/beauty-and-skincare/\n[6]: https://www.packpro.com.au/go-to-market/\n[7]: #\n[8]: https://www.packpro.com.au/veterinary-and-pet-care/\n[9]: https://www.packpro.com.au/filling-packing-and-packaging/\n[10]: https://www.packpro.com.au/industrial/\n[11]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sds-downloads/\n[12]: https://www.packpro.com.au/dry-foods/\n[13]: https://www.packpro.com.au/warehouse-and-distribution/\n[14]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sanitiser/\n[15]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[16]: #contact\n[17]: https://www.packpro.com.au/about-us/\n[18]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[19]: https://www.packpro.com.au/accreditations/\n[20]: https://www.packpro.com.au/cart/\n[21]: https://www.facebook.com/Packaging-Professionals-Group-1486639358252017/\n[22]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/packaging-professionals-group/\n[23]: https://www.facebook.com/Packaging-Professionals-Group-1486639358252017/\n[24]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/packaging-professionals-group/\n[25]: #aboutusprofessional\n[26]: #Our-Service\n[27]: /contact-us\n[28]: https://www.packpro.com.au/pet-foods/\n[29]: https://www.packpro.com.au/beauty-and-skincare/\n[30]: https://www.packpro.com.au/veterinary-and-pet-care/\n[31]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sanitiser/\n[32]: https://www.packpro.com.au/industrial/\n[33]: https://www.packpro.com.au/ingredient-shop/\n[34]: https://www.packpro.com.au/filling-packing-and-packaging/\n[35]: https://www.packpro.com.au/go-to-market/\n[36]: https://www.packpro.com.au/dry-foods/\n[37]: https://www.packpro.com.au/warehouse-and-distribution/\n[38]: https://www.packpro.com.au/\n[39]: https://www.packpro.com.au/about-us/\n[40]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[41]: https://www.packpro.com.au/accreditations/\n[42]: https://www.packpro.com.au/privacy/ [ Skip to content][1]\n[[Packaging Professionals]][2]\nMain Menu\n* [Shop][3]\n* [Pet Foods][4]\n* [Beauty and Skincare][5]\n* [Go to Market][6]\n* [Other Services][7]Menu Toggle\n* [Veterinary and Pet Care][8]\n* [Filling, Packing and Packaging][9]\n* [Industrial][10]\n* [MSDS Downloads][11]\n* [Dry Foods][12]\n* [Warehouse and Distribution][13]\n* [Sanitiser][14]\n* [Container Sales][15]\n* [Company Profile][16]Menu Toggle\n* [About Us][17]\n* [Contact Us][18]\n* [Accreditations][19]\n* [ Cart/$0.00\n][20]\n\n# Contact Us\n\n[ Facebook-f ][21] [ Linkedin ][22]\n\nContact Us\n\n[ Facebook-f ][23] [ Linkedin ][24]\n\n### Customer Service is our priority\n\n[ More ][25]\n\n### Get In touch\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nCompany\nMessage\nSend Message\n\n### Deliveries\n\n**Sydney \u2013 Warehouse ONLY:** Unit 1, 136 Newton Rd, Wetherill Park\n(Deliveries require marking PackPro/Lidster)\n\n*(Deliveries close 1.30pm on Friday)*\n\n**Bathurst**: 3 Olympic Place, Kelso, NSW 2795\n\n*(Deliveries close 3pm on Friday)*\n\n**Standard Hours 9.00 \u2013 5.00 Monday to Thursday**\n\nOver the last 30 years we have always worked with several contract manufacturers. A few years ago we\ntried a new company Packaging Professionals to manufacture and fill just part of our skin care\nrange. We have been impressed by what matters most to us being their co-operation with relatively\nshort delays in filling our orders, the quality of product produced and packaged and of course their\nall important favourable prices. Consequently they have now surpassed the others and are our\npreferred contract manufacturers.\nMichaelOwner\nAs a long time customer of Care Packaging, we are always satisfied with their services. They are\nvery prompt, accommodating and flexible with our needs. The customer service is also great. We love\nworking with them!\nChristinaPurchasing and Inventory Manager\nWe have been dealing with Packaging Professionals for over 10 years. They are a great team and their\nquality, attention to detail and communication cannot be faulted. We look forward to continuing this\nrelationship for many years to come.\nIanOperations Manager\nHaving done business with Care Packaging for more than 10 years, we know we are in good hands. They\nhave friendly customer service, on-time delivery and consistent quality. They never fail us. We\nwould highly recommend Packaging Professionals to anyone looking for contract manufacturer.\nKimPurchasing Manager\n\n### Call our Sales Team on +61 (0)2 6338 2100 for more information.\n\nServices\n\n[Pet Foods][26]\n[Beauty and Skincare][27]\n[Veterinary][28]\n[Sanitiser][29]\n[Industrial Products][30]\n\nServices\n\n[Ingredient Shop][31]\n[Filling Packing Packaging][32]\n[Go to Market][33]\n[Dry Food][34]\n[Warehouse and Distribution][35]\n\nMore\n\n[Home][36]\n[About][37]\n[Contact][38]\n[Accreditations][39]\n[Privacy][40]\n\nPackaging Professionals have worked hard to ensure that we have the latest Accreditation\u2019s required\nto ensure that we can support our customers.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Packaging Professionals\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.packpro.com.au/\n[3]: https://www.packpro.com.au/ingredient-shop/\n[4]: https://www.packpro.com.au/pet-foods/\n[5]: https://www.packpro.com.au/beauty-and-skincare/\n[6]: https://www.packpro.com.au/go-to-market/\n[7]: #\n[8]: https://www.packpro.com.au/veterinary-and-pet-care/\n[9]: https://www.packpro.com.au/filling-packing-and-packaging/\n[10]: https://www.packpro.com.au/industrial/\n[11]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sds-downloads/\n[12]: https://www.packpro.com.au/dry-foods/\n[13]: https://www.packpro.com.au/warehouse-and-distribution/\n[14]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sanitiser/\n[15]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[16]: #contact\n[17]: https://www.packpro.com.au/about-us/\n[18]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[19]: https://www.packpro.com.au/accreditations/\n[20]: https://www.packpro.com.au/cart/\n[21]: https://www.facebook.com/Packaging-Professionals-Group-1486639358252017/\n[22]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/packaging-professionals-group/\n[23]: https://www.facebook.com/Packaging-Professionals-Group-1486639358252017/\n[24]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/packaging-professionals-group/\n[25]: #getintouch\n[26]: https://www.packpro.com.au/pet-foods/\n[27]: https://www.packpro.com.au/beauty-and-skincare/\n[28]: https://www.packpro.com.au/veterinary-and-pet-care/\n[29]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sanitiser/\n[30]: https://www.packpro.com.au/industrial/\n[31]: https://www.packpro.com.au/ingredient-shop/\n[32]: https://www.packpro.com.au/filling-packing-and-packaging/\n[33]: https://www.packpro.com.au/go-to-market/\n[34]: https://www.packpro.com.au/dry-foods/\n[35]: https://www.packpro.com.au/warehouse-and-distribution/\n[36]: https://www.packpro.com.au/\n[37]: https://www.packpro.com.au/about-us/\n[38]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[39]: https://www.packpro.com.au/accreditations/\n[40]: https://www.packpro.com.au/privacy/ [ Skip to content][1]\n[[Packaging Professionals]][2]\nMain Menu\n* [Shop][3]\n* [Pet Foods][4]