            "url": "https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/",
            "text": "[ Skip to content][1]\n[[Packaging Professionals]][2]\nMain Menu\n* [Shop][3]\n* [Pet Foods][4]\n* [Beauty and Skincare][5]\n* [Go to Market][6]\n* [Other Services][7]Menu Toggle\n* [Veterinary and Pet Care][8]\n* [Filling, Packing and Packaging][9]\n* [Industrial][10]\n* [MSDS Downloads][11]\n* [Dry Foods][12]\n* [Warehouse and Distribution][13]\n* [Sanitiser][14]\n* [Container Sales][15]\n* [Company Profile][16]Menu Toggle\n* [About Us][17]\n* [Contact Us][18]\n* [Accreditations][19]\n* [ Cart/$0.00\n][20]\n\n# Contact Us\n\n[ Facebook-f ][21] [ Linkedin ][22]\n\nContact Us\n\n[ Facebook-f ][23] [ Linkedin ][24]\n\n### Customer Service is our priority\n\n[ More ][25]\n\n### Get In touch\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nCompany\nMessage\nSend Message\n\n### Deliveries\n\n**Sydney \u2013 Warehouse ONLY:** Unit 1, 136 Newton Rd, Wetherill Park\n(Deliveries require marking PackPro/Lidster)\n\n*(Deliveries close 1.30pm on Friday)*\n\n**Bathurst**: 3 Olympic Place, Kelso, NSW 2795\n\n*(Deliveries close 3pm on Friday)*\n\n**Standard Hours 9.00 \u2013 5.00 Monday to Thursday**\n\nOver the last 30 years we have always worked with several contract manufacturers. A few years ago we\ntried a new company Packaging Professionals to manufacture and fill just part of our skin care\nrange. We have been impressed by what matters most to us being their co-operation with relatively\nshort delays in filling our orders, the quality of product produced and packaged and of course their\nall important favourable prices. Consequently they have now surpassed the others and are our\npreferred contract manufacturers.\nMichaelOwner\nAs a long time customer of Care Packaging, we are always satisfied with their services. They are\nvery prompt, accommodating and flexible with our needs. The customer service is also great. We love\nworking with them!\nChristinaPurchasing and Inventory Manager\nWe have been dealing with Packaging Professionals for over 10 years. They are a great team and their\nquality, attention to detail and communication cannot be faulted. We look forward to continuing this\nrelationship for many years to come.\nIanOperations Manager\nHaving done business with Care Packaging for more than 10 years, we know we are in good hands. They\nhave friendly customer service, on-time delivery and consistent quality. They never fail us. We\nwould highly recommend Packaging Professionals to anyone looking for contract manufacturer.\nKimPurchasing Manager\n\n### Call our Sales Team on +61 (0)2 6338 2100 for more information.\n\nServices\n\n[Pet Foods][26]\n[Beauty and Skincare][27]\n[Veterinary][28]\n[Sanitiser][29]\n[Industrial Products][30]\n\nServices\n\n[Ingredient Shop][31]\n[Filling Packing Packaging][32]\n[Go to Market][33]\n[Dry Food][34]\n[Warehouse and Distribution][35]\n\nMore\n\n[Home][36]\n[About][37]\n[Contact][38]\n[Accreditations][39]\n[Privacy][40]\n\nPackaging Professionals have worked hard to ensure that we have the latest Accreditation\u2019s required\nto ensure that we can support our customers.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Packaging Professionals\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://www.packpro.com.au/\n[3]: https://www.packpro.com.au/ingredient-shop/\n[4]: https://www.packpro.com.au/pet-foods/\n[5]: https://www.packpro.com.au/beauty-and-skincare/\n[6]: https://www.packpro.com.au/go-to-market/\n[7]: #\n[8]: https://www.packpro.com.au/veterinary-and-pet-care/\n[9]: https://www.packpro.com.au/filling-packing-and-packaging/\n[10]: https://www.packpro.com.au/industrial/\n[11]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sds-downloads/\n[12]: https://www.packpro.com.au/dry-foods/\n[13]: https://www.packpro.com.au/warehouse-and-distribution/\n[14]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sanitiser/\n[15]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[16]: #contact\n[17]: https://www.packpro.com.au/about-us/\n[18]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[19]: https://www.packpro.com.au/accreditations/\n[20]: https://www.packpro.com.au/cart/\n[21]: https://www.facebook.com/Packaging-Professionals-Group-1486639358252017/\n[22]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/packaging-professionals-group/\n[23]: https://www.facebook.com/Packaging-Professionals-Group-1486639358252017/\n[24]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/packaging-professionals-group/\n[25]: #getintouch\n[26]: https://www.packpro.com.au/pet-foods/\n[27]: https://www.packpro.com.au/beauty-and-skincare/\n[28]: https://www.packpro.com.au/veterinary-and-pet-care/\n[29]: https://www.packpro.com.au/sanitiser/\n[30]: https://www.packpro.com.au/industrial/\n[31]: https://www.packpro.com.au/ingredient-shop/\n[32]: https://www.packpro.com.au/filling-packing-and-packaging/\n[33]: https://www.packpro.com.au/go-to-market/\n[34]: https://www.packpro.com.au/dry-foods/\n[35]: https://www.packpro.com.au/warehouse-and-distribution/\n[36]: https://www.packpro.com.au/\n[37]: https://www.packpro.com.au/about-us/\n[38]: https://www.packpro.com.au/contact-us/\n[39]: https://www.packpro.com.au/accreditations/\n[40]: https://www.packpro.com.au/privacy/"
