mes & Bio-actives ][96]\n* [Cosmetics & Personal Care]\n  \n  ### [Cosmetics & Personal Care ][97]\n  \n  Medikonda Nutrients is the Producer, Manufacturer, and Wholesale Bulk Supplier of Organic...\n  \n  ### [Cosmetics & Personal Care ][98]\n\n1 / of 8\n\n## How it works?\n\nWhy Reveda? Gain instant access to 2,000+ ingredients, downloadable QC documents, and ready-to-use\nstarter formulations, US & EU ready inventory\u2014all in one place.\n* ### Instant access to the industry\u2019s most comprehensive catalog\n  \n  *Browse, search, and filter the largest food ingredient catalog with ease.*\n* ### Order samples, access QC docs, and secure quotes instantly\n  \n  *The Reveda Concierge manages all your requests and ensures they\u2019re processed faster than ever.*\n* ### Real-time inventory, right here in the USA & EU\n  \n  *Tiered pricing, real-time inventory, expert food technologist support, and everything you need to\n  accelerate product development.*\n\n1 / of 3\n\n## What makes us stand out of the crowd?\n* ### Consistency\n  \n  All of our products\u00a0are created using the same extraction process in the same facility, which\n  creates consistency. This ensures that you will receive a product that\u2019s always reliable and\n  effective.\n* ### Premium Grade\n  \n  Our products are considered premium grade because they are manufactured using the highest\n  standards. We only\u00a0 offer products of the highest purity with no binders, fillers, excipients,\n  dyes or unknown substances.\n* ### Every Batch is Tested\n  \n  Our standards are rigorous and thorough. We test every single batch of our herbs and oils\u00a0 through\n  a third-party lab to ensure that the products you receive are the highest quality available,\n  without pesticides or heavy metals.\n* ### Customer Support\n  \n  We stand behind our products and reputation with something more than professional pride \u2014 this\n  company is truly a labor of love, and it shows in every moment of your shopping experience.\u00a0We\n  always provide world-class customer support.\n* ### Low MOQ\n  \n  We know that every big company had a small beginning. Hence, We offer even smaller quantities and\n  Low Minimum Order Quantity requirement.\n* ### Co-Packing & Contract Manufacturing\n  \n  Contract manufacturing, Co-packing and private labeling is available. Please ask us about this\n  option.\n\n1 / of 6\n\n## Certifications\n\n## Resources\n* [ Careers ][99]\n* [ Customer Registration ][100]\n* [ Vendor Registration ][101]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][102]\n\n* The information provided about specific products on this site have not been evaluated by the US\nFDA, it is for informational purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent\nany disease.\n\nPayment methods\n* [Visa]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [American Express]\n* [Discover]\n* [Diners Club]\n* [JCB]\n* [Maestro]\n* [Union Pay]\n* [PayPal]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Google Pay]\n\u00a9 2026, [Reveda.Co][103]\n* [Privacy policy][104]\n* [Refund policy][105]\n* [Terms of service][106]\n* [Contact information][107]\n* Choosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\n* Opens in a new window.\n\n[1]: #MainContent\n[2]: /collections/powders\n[3]: /collections/juice-powders\n[4]: /collections/extracts\n[5]: /collections/fermented-flours\n[6]: /collections/freeze-dried\n[7]: /collections/probiotics\n[8]: /collections/enzymes\n[9]: /collections/cold-pressed-oils\n[10]: /collections/essential-oils\n[11]: /collections/omega-369-fatty-acids\n[12]: /collections/cosmetic-ingredients\n[13]: /collections/seed-cake-protein-powders\n[14]: /collections/animal-feeds\n[15]: /collections/functional-mushroom\n[16]: /collections/baking-ingredients\n[17]: /collections/ethnobotanicals\n[18]: /collections/capsules-and-tablets\n[19]: /collections/bulk-market\n[20]: /pages/wholesale-bulk-pricing-quote-request\n[21]: /pages/careers\n[22]: /blogs/medikonda-blog\n[23]: /pages/contact\n[24]: https://shopify.com/98655764823/accoun