            "text": "Organic vegetable oil\n\nSkip to content\n\n833 - 756-8645 (PLNTOIL) | &#105;nf&#111;&#64;s&#112;&#97;&#99;k&#45;in&#116;e&#114;&#110;&#97;&#116;&#105;&#111;&#110;al&#46;com\n\nLinkedIn Facebook Instagram X\n\nSearch for:\n\nOUR COMPANY In control from seed to oil\nOUR PRODUCTS Our product range\nCertified Organic Canola Oil\nCertified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil\nOrganic Flaxseed Oil\nCertified Organic Palm Oil\nOrganic Coconut Oil RBD\nCertified Organic Sunflower Oil\nOUR QUALITY Own laboratory for optimum quality\nREQUEST A QUOTATION Get a proposal that meets your needs\nNEWS Stay up to date\nCONTACT US Get in touch with the team\n\nSearch for:\n\nOUR COMPANY In control from seed to oil\nOUR PRODUCTS Our product range\nCertified Organic Canola Oil\nCertified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil\nOrganic Flaxseed Oil\nCertified Organic Palm Oil\nOrganic Coconut Oil RBD\nCertified Organic Sunflower Oil\nOUR QUALITY Own laboratory for optimum quality\nREQUEST A QUOTATION Get a proposal that meets your needs\nNEWS Stay up to date\nCONTACT US Get in touch with the team\n\nOUR COMPANY In control from seed to oil\nOUR PRODUCTS Our product range\nCertified Organic Canola Oil\nCertified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil\nOrganic Flaxseed Oil\nCertified Organic Palm Oil\nOrganic Coconut Oil RBD\nCertified Organic Sunflower Oil\nOUR QUALITY Own laboratory for optimum quality\nREQUEST A QUOTATION Get a proposal that meets your needs\nNEWS Stay up to date\nCONTACT US Get in touch with the team\n\nHome (With Grizzly Text) Koen Zuyderwijk 2026-01-26T09:24:23-04:00\n\nWe produce your organic vegetable oils in bulk at the most competitive price\n\nDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGE DISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGE\n\nWe produce your organic vegetable oils in bulk at the most competitive price\n\nDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGE DISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGE\n\nOrganic Vegetable Oil\n\nWe are the leading wholesale manufacturers of organic vegetable oil and conventional oils. At Spack International, we have specialized in high-quality, certified organic oils since the year 2000. Over time, we have become one of the leading organic vegetable oil suppliers. We are an ideal partner company for anyone seeking bulk organic vegetable oil. As trusted certified organic vegetable oil wholesalers, we ensure full control over the entire production process, from seed harvesting to oil production, in our advanced expeller and packing facilities in the Netherlands. We pride ourselves on being among the organic vegetable oil suppliers with the most rigorous oversight at every stage. We are committed to delivering the highest quality organic vegetable oil on the market and supporting health-conscious and environmentally sustainable choices.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nWhat Makes Us the Top Organic Vegetable Oil Supplier?\n\nFounded in 1977, we are a trusted bulk organic vegetable oil company. We are a family-owned business that expanded to the U.S. in 2019. We are a team of efficient and experienced organic vegetable oil suppliers, providing high-quality oils, including organic palm oil , to meet the needs of various industries. Our other products include organic canola oil, palm oil, coconut oil, and flaxseed oil. Our New Jersey and Toronto warehouses stock IBC totes and drums to ensure fast wholesale organic vegetable oil availability with short lead times. We also maintain bulk storage of high-oleic organic sunflower oil in New Jersey and the Chicago area, enabling quick delivery via tanker trucks. We focus on sourcing the highest-quality ingredients, offering competitive pricing, and delivering excellent customer service. These commitments have positioned us globally as a prominent bulk organic vegetable oil manufacturer. We are proud to be among the world\u2019s premier organic high-oleic sunflower oil producers. We can accommodate any bulk order size. Our delivery options include railcars, ISO tanks, flexitanks, or pallets of totes and drums. Our supply of organic coconut oil in bulk further enhances your convenience when doing business with us. Various types of coconut oil, including organic coconut oil RBD and organic virgin coconut oil, are some of our beloved wholesale organic vegetable oil products. The product range is further diversified by including organic flaxseed oil . These ingredients are the backbone of numerous health-centric and eco-friendly formulations. By working with one of the most established organic vegetable oil wholesalers, you are opting for a partner that understands the nuances of this versatile oil and provides unparalleled quality and service.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nOur Product Line\n\nadmin 2026-01-15T05:04:03-04:00\n\nCertified Organic Canola Oil\n\nCertified Organic Canola Oil\n\nadmin 2026-01-14T09:53:20-04:00\n\nCertified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil\n\nCertified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil\n\nadmin 2026-01-26T09:35:15-04:00\n\nOrganic Flaxseed Oil\n\nOrganic Flaxseed Oil\n\nadmin 2026-01-15T05:06:53-04:00\n\nCertified Organic Palm Oil\n\nCertified Organic Palm Oil\n\nadmin 2026-05-18T10:31:17-04:00\n\nOrganic Coconut Oil RBD\n\nOrganic Coconut Oil RBD\n\nadmin 2026-01-26T09:40:06-04:00\n\nCertified Organic Sunflower Oil\n\nCertified Organic Sunflower Oil\n\nChoose Our Wholesale Organic Vegetable Oil\n\nAs a company deeply invested in this sector, we welcome you to contact us and explore the options available for bulk organic vegetable oil. By getting wholesale organic vegetable oil from our company, you are choosing a path of ethical business practices, top-tier product quality, and a promise of fast and reliable delivery. We use the highest quality ingredients and are well respected among organic vegetable oil manufacturers and suppliers globally. You can trust in our commitment to organically grown products and take the next step in upgrading your inventory. Call us today to discover how our wholesale organic vegetable oil options can benefit your operations.\n\nREQUEST A QUOTATION\n\nWhat makes Spack International your partner for certified organic oils?\n\nSourcing\n\nand Manufacturing\n\nQuality\n\nControl\n\nOnly\n\nOrganic\n\nAbility to\n\nDeliver Volume\n\nOur Family\n\nValues\n\nInstagram feed #spackinternational\n\nOrganic High Oleic Sunflower Oil\u2026.contact us for new crop pricing soon! #organicsunfloweroil #hearthealth #niop\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nJul 28\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 18035681876434583\n\nOrganic High Oleic Sunflower Oil\u2026.contact us for new crop pricing soon! #organicsunfloweroil #hearthealth #niop\n\n...\n\nWholesome, delicious crackers made with wholesome, regenerative ingredients! #organicsunfloweroil #spackinternational #simplemills #organiccrackers\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nJun 4\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17870175951381502\n\nWholesome, delicious crackers made with wholesome, regenerative ingredients! #organicsunfloweroil #spackinternational #simplemills #organiccrackers\n\n...\n\nEnjoying a delicious blueberry scone created with product which includes sunflower oil in its ingredient list. Yum! #spackinternational #sunfloweroil #sunfloweroil\ud83c\udf3b #stonewallkitchen #vegetableoil\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nMay 27\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 18165365161348605\n\nEnjoying a delicious blueberry scone created with product which includes sunflower oil in its ingredient list. Yum! #spackinternational #sunfloweroil #sunfloweroil\ud83c\udf3b #stonewallkitchen #vegetableoil\n\n...\n\nSpack International had a wonderful experience attending Expo East last week in Philly. Even took some time out to wade in a cranberry bog at Ocean Spray! #expoeast2022 #oceanspray #organicoils #spackinternational\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nOct 5\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17846943182850423\n\nSpack International had a wonderful experience attending Expo East last week in Philly. Even took some time out to wade in a cranberry bog at Ocean Spray! #expoeast2022 #oceanspray #organicoils #spackinternational\n\n...\n\nSpack International - Q1 2021 Update!\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nApr 12\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17916018871648628\n\nSpack International - Q1 2021 Update!\n\n...\n\nTis the season to stay on track and make healthy snack choices. Choose products made with high oleic sunflower oil. \ud83c\udf3b #holidayspirit #spackinternational #pita #healthyeating\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nDec 2\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17890413376771983\n\nTis the season to stay on track and make healthy snack choices. Choose products made with high oleic sunflower oil. \ud83c\udf3b #holidayspirit #spackinternational #pita #healthyeating\n\n...\n\nWhat\u2019s not to love about irresistible banana-based snacks made with organic sunflower oil? How about the fact that they are also made from up cycled bananas!! #simplesnacks #spackinternational #barnana #organicfood #sunflower\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nNov 5\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17885005555781811\n\nWhat\u2019s not to love about irresistible banana-based snacks made with organic sunflower oil? How about the fact that they are also made from up cycled bananas!! #simplesnacks #spackinternational #barnana #organicfood #sunflower\n\n...\n\nToday for lunch, treat yourself to healthy, delicious soup made with organic ingredients including organic canola oil. YUM! #healthyeating #sodelicious #organicliving #spackinternational\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nOct 22\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 18167791642003174\n\nToday for lunch, treat yourself to healthy, delicious soup made with organic ingredients including organic canola oil. YUM! #healthyeating #sodelicious #organicliving #spackinternational\n\n...\n\nOrganic sunflower oil is one of the healthiest oils, with low saturated fat and an abundance of Oleic fatty acids. Balance out your diet with this Vitamin E, A, C and D rich ingredient! #spackinternational #organicchips #healthydiet\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nOct 15\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17884060843794463\n\nOrganic sunflower oil is one of the healthiest oils, with low saturated fat and an abundance of Oleic fatty acids. Balance out your diet with this Vitamin E, A, C and D rich ingredient! #spackinternational #organicchips #healthydiet\n\n...\n\nGearing up for another exciting football weekend?? Chips made with organic sunflower oil are perfect to snack on while enjoying the game. #football #organicfood #healthysnacks #spackinternational #gopats\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nOct 1\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17898650338598432\n\nGearing up for another exciting football weekend?? Chips made with organic sunflower oil are perfect to snack on while enjoying the game. #football #organicfood #healthysnacks #spackinternational #gopats\n\n...\n\nWhy organic sunflower oil? With its low saturated fat content and fatty acids high in oleic, organic sunflower oil is one of the healthiest oils to bake with. Packing a punch high in Vitamin A, E, C and D makes crackers made with organic sunflower oil a wonderful choice for Fall.....or anytime! #organicsnacks #spackinternational #healthyoptions\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nSep 25\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17854472051268080\n\nWhy organic sunflower oil? With its low saturated fat content and fatty acids high in oleic, organic sunflower oil is one of the healthiest oils to bake with. Packing a punch high in Vitamin A, E, C and D makes crackers made with organic sunflower oil a wonderful choice for Fall.....or anytime! #organicsnacks #spackinternational #healthyoptions\n\n...\n\nThere\u2019s a chill in the air and school is back in session. It must be time to celebrate FALL! Why not indulge in organic chips made with organic sunflower oil? #fall #healthyfats #spackinternational #organicsnacks\n\nView Instagram post by spackinternational\n\nSep 16\n\nOpen post by spackinternational with ID 17890959562642889\n\nThere\u2019s a chill in the air and school is back in session. It must be time to celebrate FALL! Why not indulge in organic chips made with organic sunflower oil? #fall #healthyfats #spackinte"
