502[info@spack-international.com][50]\n\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2502[Contact us][51]\n\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n#### REQUEST A QUOTATION\n\nIf you need a quick quotation, feel free to contact us. We\u2019re happy to help.\n\n[I need a quotation][52]\n\n#### ABOUT US\n\nSpack International is a producer of certified organic vegetable oils. We control the production\nprocess from the harvesting of the seeds to the producing of the oils in our own expeller and\npacking facilities. We are a family owned business and have been producing oils since 1977.\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2024 | Spack International Inc. | All Rights Reserved | Powered by [Moodz Concepts &\nDesigns][53]\n[LinkedIn][54][Facebook][55][Instagram][56][X][57]\n[Toggle Sliding Bar Area][58]\n\n#### LATEST NEWS\n* [Spack Market Insights Report \u2013 April 2026][59] April 8, 2026\n\n#### OUR PRODUCTS\n\n[ [Organic Coconut Oil RBD] ][60] [ [Organic Palm Oil] ][61] [ [sunflower seeds and oil] ][62] [\n[Spack International - Organic Canola Oil] ][63] [ [Spack International - Organic Flaxseed Oil]\n][64] [ [Spack International - Organic Coconut Oil] ][65]\n\n#### ABOUT US\n\nSpack International is a producer of certified organic vegetable oils. We control the production\nprocess from the harvesting of the seeds to the producing of the oils in our own expeller and\npacking facilities. We are a family owned business and have been producing oils since 1977.\n\n#### CONTACT US\n\n4 Research Drive - Suite 402 / Shelton, Connecticut 06484\n\nPhone: [833 - 756-8645 (PLNTOIL)][66]\n\nEmail: [info@spack-international.com][67]\n\nWeb: [www.spack-international.com][68]\n\n[Page load link][69]\n[ Go to Top ][70]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: mailto:info@spack-international.com\n[3]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/19205083\n[4]: https://www.facebook.com/Spack-International-103960011100094/?tn-str=k*F\n[5]: https://www.instagram.com/spackinternational/\n[6]: https://twitter.com/SpackInt\n[7]: https://spack-international.com/\n[8]: https://spack-international.com/our-company\n[9]: https://spack-international.com/organic-vegetable-oils-in-bulk-at-the-most-competitive-price/\n[10]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-canola-oil/\n[11]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-virgin-coconut-oil/\n[12]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/organic-flaxseed-oil/\n[13]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-palm-oil/\n[14]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-coconut-oil-rbd/\n[15]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/organic-sunflower-oil/\n[16]: https://spack-international.com/quality\n[17]: https://spack-international.com/quotation-certified-organic-vegetable-oils/\n[18]: https://spack-international.com/certified-organic-vegetable-oils-news/\n[19]: https://spack-international.com/contact\n[20]: https://spack-international.com/our-company\n[21]: https://spack-international.com/organic-vegetable-oils-in-bulk-at-the-most-competitive-price/\n[22]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-canola-oil/\n[23]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-virgin-coconut-oil/\n[24]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/organic-flaxseed-oil/\n[25]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-palm-oil/\n[26]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-coconut-oil-rbd/\n[27]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/organic-sunflower-oil/\n[28]: https://spack-international.com/quality\n[29]: https://spack-international.com/quotation-certified-organic-vegetable-oils/\n[30]: https://spack-international.com/certified-organic-vegetable-oils-news/\n[31]: https://spack-international.com/contact\n[32]: https://spack-international.com/our-company\n[33]: https://spack-international.com/organic-vegetable-oils-in-bulk-at-the-most-competitive-price/\n[34]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-canola-oil/\n[35]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-organic-virgin-coconut-oil/\n[36]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/organic-flaxseed-oil/\n[37]: https://spack-international.com/product-line/certified-o