        "crawl_text": "E3 Aluminium Composite Panels Manufacturing India First ACP manufacturing plant in South India Advanced manufacturing methods Rigorous quality testing D-12 | 2, Okhla Industrial Area, Okhla Phase II, New Delhi \u2013 110020 India Himachal Pradesh Uttar Pradesh Andhra Pradesh Uttarakhand Greater Noida Pan-India Leading manufacturer of ACP and HPL sheets in India. Increasing demand for innovative building materials Expansion of manufacturing capabilities ACP, HPL, Soffit Panel &amp; Exterior Clads Manufacturer, Supplier &amp; Dealer | E3\n\nSkip to content\n\nAbout\n\nAbout Us\n\nCertificate\n\nCatalogue\n\nManufacturing Plant\n\nFire Grade\n\nLocate Dealers\n\nInstallation Guide\n\nSpecification\n\nTestimonials\n\nArch House\n\nBetter Halves\n\nMetal Marvels\n\nACP Sheets\n\nFeather Touch New\n\nPrime Series\n\n3D Louvers\n\nTimeless Collection\n\nItalian Stone\n\nAnti Scratch\n\nTimber Wood\n\nSand Series\n\nPebbles Sheets\n\nSparkle Mirror Brush\n\nGloss Sheet\n\nHigh Gloss\n\nPastel Series\n\nMetallic Series\n\nHPL Sheets\n\nAnti Scratch\n\nItalian Stone\n\nTimber Wood\n\nPebbles\n\nSand Series\n\nPastel Metallic\n\nExterior Clads\n\nContact Us\n\nAbout\n\nAbout Us\n\nCertificate\n\nCatalogue\n\nManufacturing Plant\n\nFire Grade\n\nLocate Dealers\n\nInstallation Guide\n\nSpecification\n\nTestimonials\n\nArch House\n\nBetter Halves\n\nMetal Marvels\n\nACP Sheets\n\nFeather Touch New\n\nPrime Series\n\n3D Louvers\n\nTimeless Collection\n\nItalian Stone\n\nAnti Scratch\n\nTimber Wood\n\nSand Series\n\nPebbles Sheets\n\nSparkle Mirror Brush\n\nGloss Sheet\n\nHigh Gloss\n\nPastel Series\n\nMetallic Series\n\nHPL Sheets\n\nAnti Scratch\n\nItalian Stone\n\nTimber Wood\n\nPebbles\n\nSand Series\n\nPastel Metallic\n\nExterior Clads\n\nContact Us\n\nEnquire Now\n\nAbout E3 Aluminium Composite Panels\n\nE3 ACP, a leading ACP sheets manufacturer, was the first to establish an ACP manufacturing plant in South India. Offering Aluminium Composite Panels in a wide range of hues, textures, finishes, and visual effects, E3 ACP is redefining exterior design solutions. From timber-like finishes to sparkle, gloss, pebbles, and more\u2014our panels combine flexibility with innovation. These sheets can be bent, folded, or shaped in ways that are not possible with other materials, giving architects and designers limitless possibilities. With a strong commitment to excellence, every ACP sheet from E3 undergoes rigorous quality testing to ensure unmatched performance and durability.\n\nYears\nexperience\n\nOur Products Range\n\nAnnual Production Capacity of 4 million Square Meters\n\nE3 is India\u2019s leading name in innovative surface solutions, offering world-class ACP manufacturing, HPL manufacturing, soffit panels manufacturing, and exterior clads manufacturing. As the country\u2019s biggest ACP producer, E3 sets industry benchmarks with advanced technology and unmatched quality standards. With state-of-the-art manufacturing plants in Himachal Pradesh, Uttar Pradesh, Andhra Pradesh, Uttarakhand, and in Greater Noida, E3 ensures nationwide accessibility and trust. Proudly being the first to establish an ACP production facility in South India, making E3 true in redefining architectural excellence across India.\n\nE3 ACP\n\nE3 ACP panels bring modern architecture to life with unmatched durability and style. Perfect for exteriors, interiors, and signage, these Aluminium Composite Panels are flexible, premium, and strong as well.\n\nE3 HPL\n\nE3 HPL delivers the perfect mix of durability, versatility, and design elegance. Suitable for fa\u00e7ades, interiors, and furniture, they are weather-resistant, UV-protected, and available in a variety of textures and colors.\n\nExterior Clads\n\nE3 Exterior Clads combine durability with premium design, transforming building fa\u00e7ades. Made to withstand weather challenges, they enhance architectural appeal with superior finishes &amp; textures.\n\nOur Services\n\nInstallation Guide\n\nExplore Brochures\n\nLocate Dealers\n\nSample Request\n\nWhy Choose E3 ACP?\n\nWaterproof \u2013 Built to resist moisture and protect against damage in any condition.\n\nLight Weight \u2013 Easy to handle, install, and transport without compromising strength.\n\nTermite Proof \u2013 Safeguards your interiors with complete resistance to termite attacks.\n\nDurability \u2013 Engineered for long life, withstanding time and tough environments.\n\nEasy to Clean \u2013 Low-maintenance surfaces that retain their beauty effortlessly.\n\nExplore Our Journey\n\nTestimonials\n\nBravismah Agro Private Limited\n\n-Karan Aggarwal [ Director]\n\n&#9733; &#9733; &#9733; &#9733; &#9733; Rated 5 out of 5\n\nSince we began working with your company, we have been consistently impressed by the quality of your Aluminium Composite Panels, along with the professionalism and expertise of your team. Your products are extremely popular among our customers and we have received numerous positive feedback about quality, durability and the versatility of your product.\n\nNaman Plywood &amp; Interiors\n\n-Harshit [Proprietor]\n\n&#9733; &#9733; &#9733; &#9733; &#9733; Rated 5 out of 5\n\nWe&#8217;ve had the honor of working with E3 ACP for a considerable amount of time, and their aluminum composite panels have continuously shown to be a great complement to our product line. The quality and versatility of their panels make them a perfect fit for our plywood and interiors business. Our customers appreciate the premium finish and durability these panels offer, and we&#8217;ve seen an increase in demand since introducing them.\n\nRadhe Traders\n\n-Anshul Gupta [Proprietor]\n\n&#9733; &#9733; &#9733; &#9733; &#9733; Rated 5 out of 5\n\nBeing a six-month-old company, E3 ACP is moving with good momentum. The company provides a wide range of colours and various sizes; they even customise according to our needs. This quality of theirs is one of the very reasons for the growth of E3 ACP, and they stand by their commitment to all aspects of quality and productivity; this policy helps E3 to enter a niche market.\n\nUpcoming Exhibitions\n\nWe are excited to participate in Dubai WoodShow 2026, taking place on 22\u201324 June 2026 at the Dubai World Trade Centre, UAE. We look forward to connecting with global industry professionals, exploring new opportunities, and showcasing innovative solutions and expertise to the international woodworking community.\n\nKnow More\n\nMatecia 2026 is set to showcase some of the leading building material products. Taking place from 20\u201323 August 2026 at Yashobhoomi, Dwarka, New Delhi, India\u2019s largest building material exhibition will highlight the latest innovations, advanced solutions, and emerging industry trends in the furniture and interior industry.\n\nKnow More\n\nMatecia BBMP Kolkata 2027, scheduled for 12\u201314 February, is the East and Northeast Edition of the Building Material Exhibition, bringing together industry leaders, innovative products, advanced solutions, and emerging market trends under one platform for networking, business growth, and future opportunities.\n\nKnow More\n\nIndiaWood 2027 will take place from 3\u20136 March 2027 at India Expo Mart (IEML), Greater Noida, Delhi-NCR. The exhibition will showcase the latest innovations in woodworking machinery, furniture manufacturing technologies, tools, fittings, accessories, raw materials, and finished products, bringing together industry professionals from across the globe.\n\nKnow More\n\nView All\n\nOur Exciting Projects\n\nInterior Design\n\nInterior Design\nGurugram Global Heights School\n\nOutdoor Design\n\nOutdoor Design\nDubai Mall\n\nBuilding Engineering\n\nBuilding Engineering\nBindals\n\nUrban Design\n\nUrban Design\nAmbay Hospital\n\nLatest Blogs\n\nACP Sheet in Indian Climate: Heat, Rain, and Pollution Tested\n\nThe climatic conditions in India do not go easy on building materials. Scorching summers, heavy monsoons, high humidity, and rising&hellip;\n\nRead More\n\nFire Rated Grade Aluminium Composite Panel Price\n\nA fire-rated grade ACP is the number one question that most individuals asking a designer how to maintain safety, and&hellip;\n\nRead More\n\nBudget-Friendly Ceiling Panels That Look Premium\n\nWhen you dream of a trendy ceiling but don\u2019t want to rack your budget, the E3 Soffit Panels become a&hellip;\n\nRead More\n\nBest ACP Manufacturers in India\n\nWhen it comes to modern architecture and innovative fa\u00e7ade design, few materials have transformed the industry like E3 ACP sheets.&hellip;\n\nRead More\n\nOur Clients\n\nGet Enquiry for Free 3D Design\n\nName\n\nEmail\n\nPhone\n\nState\n\nIntrested for Products\n\nSelect\nACP Sheet\nHPL Sheet\nExterior Clads\nSoffit Panels\n\nSubmit\n\nOur Corporate Office\n\nD-12 | 2, Okhla Industrial Area\nOkhla Phase II\nNew Delhi \u2013 110020\n\nPhone: +91 9310934090\n\n [Skip to content][1]\n* About\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Certificate][3]\n* [Catalogue][4]\n* [Manufacturing Plant][5]\n* [Fire Grade][6]\n* [Locate Dealers][7]\n* [Installation Guide][8]\n* [Specification][9]\n* [Testimonials][10]\n* [Arch House][11]\n* [Better Halves][12]\n* [Metal Marvels][13]\n* [ACP Sheets][14]\n* [Feather TouchNew][15]\n* [Prime Series][16]\n* [3D Louvers][17]\n* [Timeless Collection][18]\n* [Italian Stone][19]\n* [Anti Scratch][20]\n* [Timber Wood][21]\n* [Sand Series][22]\n* [Pebbles Sheets][23]\n* [Sparkle Mirror Brush][24]\n* [Gloss Sheet][25]\n* [High Gloss][26]\n* [Pastel Series][27]\n* [Metallic Series][28]\n* [HPL Sheets][29]\n* [Anti Scratch][30]\n* [Italian Stone][31]\n* [Timber Wood][32]\n* [Pebbles][33]\n* [Sand Series][34]\n* [Pastel Metallic][35]\n* [Exterior Clads][36]\n* [Contact Us][37]\n* About\n* [About Us][38]\n* [Certificate][39]\n* [Catalogue][40]\n* [Manufacturing Plant][41]\n* [Fire Grade][42]\n* [Locate Dealers][43]\n* [Installation Guide][44]\n* [Specification][45]\n* [Testimonials][46]\n* [Arch House][47]\n* [Better Halves][48]\n* [Metal Marvels][49]\n* [ACP Sheets][50]\n* [Feather TouchNew][51]\n* [Prime Series][52]\n* [3D Louvers][53]\n* [Timeless Collection][54]\n* [Italian Stone][55]\n* [Anti Scratch][56]\n* [Timber Wood][57]\n* [Sand Series][58]\n* [Pebbles Sheets][59]\n* [Sparkle Mirror Brush][60]\n* [Gloss Sheet][61]\n* [High Gloss][62]\n* [Pastel Series][63]\n* [Metallic Series][64]\n* [HPL Sheets][65]\n* [Anti Scratch][66]\n* [Italian Stone][67]\n* [Timber Wood][68]\n* [Pebbles][69]\n* [Sand Series][70]\n* [Pastel Metallic][71]\n* [Exterior Clads][72]\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[ Enquire Now ][74]\n[Desktop Banner] [Mobile Banner]\nHOME | ABOUT US\n\n# About Us\n\nAt E3, we believe in shaping innovative buildings with modern materials. As a leading **ACP sheets\nmanufacturer**, we bring cutting-edge solutions for architectural exteriors, interiors, and signage\napplications. We are proud to be the **first company to establish an ACP board manufacturing plant\nin South India.**\n\nEvery E3 ACP sheet undergoes rigorous quality checks to ensure durability and performance. Our\ncommitment lies in delivering value-driven services while maintaining the highest standards of\nexcellence.\n\nWith over **30 years of expertise in metal composite materials**, E3 continues to pioneer with\nadvanced manufacturing methods, strong client orientation, and technological innovation. Our vision\nis to build a legacy as a century-old company, offering a complete one-stop solution that unites\nmanufacturing strength with inspiring design.\n\n## Our Management Team\n\n#### Ajay Garg\n\n**Managing Director**\n\nMr. Ajay Garg, Managing Director of E3 Group, brings over 31 years of expertise in Sales and\nMarketing. For 25 years, he successfully operated as a retailer, supplier, and wholesaler of timber,\nplywood, and allied products, gaining in-depth market knowledge before steering E3 toward becoming a\nleading manufacturer of interior and exterior solutions.\n\n#### Mr. Amit Goyal\n\n**Director **\n\nMr. Amit Goyal is a visionary and innovative entrepreneur, highly regarded for his contribution to\nthe ACP and HPL sheet industry. As the Director of Alutech Industries, he has brought together solid\nindustry experience, keen business sense, and sound management skills to place the company on the\nlist of top players in the industry.\n\n#### Sujit K Tripathi\n\n**President \u2013 E3 ACP Division**\n\nWith 14+ years of experience, he inspires his team through strong leadership. He has a proven track\nrecord in the building materials and infrastructure sector since 2008, he brings unma"
      },
