            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* About\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Certificate][3]\n* [Catalogue][4]\n* [Manufacturing Plant][5]\n* [Fire Grade][6]\n* [Locate Dealers][7]\n* [Installation Guide][8]\n* [Specification][9]\n* [Testimonials][10]\n* [Arch House][11]\n* [Better Halves][12]\n* [Metal Marvels][13]\n* [ACP Sheets][14]\n* [Feather TouchNew][15]\n* [Prime Series][16]\n* [3D Louvers][17]\n* [Timeless Collection][18]\n* [Italian Stone][19]\n* [Anti Scratch][20]\n* [Timber Wood][21]\n* [Sand Series][22]\n* [Pebbles Sheets][23]\n* [Sparkle Mirror Brush][24]\n* [Gloss Sheet][25]\n* [High Gloss][26]\n* [Pastel Series][27]\n* [Metallic Series][28]\n* [HPL Sheets][29]\n* [Anti Scratch][30]\n* [Italian Stone][31]\n* [Timber Wood][32]\n* [Pebbles][33]\n* [Sand Series][34]\n* [Pastel Metallic][35]\n* [Exterior Clads][36]\n* [Contact Us][37]\n* About\n* [About Us][38]\n* [Certificate][39]\n* [Catalogue][40]\n* [Manufacturing Plant][41]\n* [Fire Grade][42]\n* [Locate Dealers][43]\n* [Installation Guide][44]\n* [Specification][45]\n* [Testimonials][46]\n* [Arch House][47]\n* [Better Halves][48]\n* [Metal Marvels][49]\n* [ACP Sheets][50]\n* [Feather TouchNew][51]\n* [Prime Series][52]\n* [3D Louvers][53]\n* [Timeless Collection][54]\n* [Italian Stone][55]\n* [Anti Scratch][56]\n* [Timber Wood][57]\n* [Sand Series][58]\n* [Pebbles Sheets][59]\n* [Sparkle Mirror Brush][60]\n* [Gloss Sheet][61]\n* [High Gloss][62]\n* [Pastel Series][63]\n* [Metallic Series][64]\n* [HPL Sheets][65]\n* [Anti Scratch][66]\n* [Italian Stone][67]\n* [Timber Wood][68]\n* [Pebbles][69]\n* [Sand Series][70]\n* [Pastel Metallic][71]\n* [Exterior Clads][72]\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[ Enquire Now ][74]\n[Desktop Banner] [Mobile Banner]\nHOME | ABOUT US\n\n# About Us\n\nAt E3, we believe in shaping innovative buildings with modern materials. As a leading **ACP sheets\nmanufacturer**, we bring cutting-edge solutions for architectural exteriors, interiors, and signage\napplications. We are proud to be the **first company to establish an ACP board manufacturing plant\nin South India.**\n\nEvery E3 ACP sheet undergoes rigorous quality checks to ensure durability and performance. Our\ncommitment lies in delivering value-driven services while maintaining the highest standards of\nexcellence.\n\nWith over **30 years of expertise in metal composite materials**, E3 continues to pioneer with\nadvanced manufacturing methods, strong client orientation, and technological innovation. Our vision\nis to build a legacy as a century-old company, offering a complete one-stop solution that unites\nmanufacturing strength with inspiring design.\n\n## Our Management Team\n\n#### Ajay Garg\n\n**Managing Director**\n\nMr. Ajay Garg, Managing Director of E3 Group, brings over 31 years of expertise in Sales and\nMarketing. For 25 years, he successfully operated as a retailer, supplier, and wholesaler of timber,\nplywood, and allied products, gaining in-depth market knowledge before steering E3 toward becoming a\nleading manufacturer of interior and exterior solutions.\n\n#### Mr. Amit Goyal\n\n**Director **\n\nMr. Amit Goyal is a visionary and innovative entrepreneur, highly regarded for his contribution to\nthe ACP and HPL sheet industry. As the Director of Alutech Industries, he has brought together solid\nindustry experience, keen business sense, and sound management skills to place the company on the\nlist of top players in the industry.\n\n#### Sujit K Tripathi\n\n**President \u2013 E3 ACP Division**\n\nWith 14+ years of experience, he inspires his team through strong leadership. He has a proven track\nrecord in the building materials and infrastructure sector since 2008, he brings unmatched expertise\nin exterior fa\u00e7ade production and manufacturing. His customer-centric approach gives uncompromised\nquality standards .\n\n## Our Clients\n\n[yamaha1]\n[lt1]\n[oppo1]\n[samsung1]\n[tvs1]\n[ncrtc1]\n[pwd1]\n[dominos1]\n[vivo1]\n\n##### Our Corporate Office\n\n#### [D-12 | 2, Okhla Industrial Area Okhla Phase II New Delhi \u2013 110020][75]\n\n#### [Phone: +91 9310934090][76]\n\n##### [Email: info@e3acp.com][77]\n\n[ Facebook ][78] [ Instagram ][79] [ Youtube ][80] [ Linkedin ][81]\n\n##### Our ACP Sheet Series\n\n## [Timeless Collection][82]\n\n## [Italian Stone][83]\n\n## [Anti Scratch][84]\n\n## [Timber Wood][85]\n\n## [Sand Series][86]\n\n## [Pebbles Series][87]\n\n##### Our HPL Sheet Series\n\n## [Sand Series][88]\n\n## [Anti Scratch][89]\n\n## [Italian Stone][90]\n\n## [Timber Wood][91]\n\n## [Pebbles Series][92]\n\n## [Pastel | Metallic][93]\n\n##### Our Overview\n\n## [Blog][94]\n\n## [About Us][95]\n\n## [Terms and Conditions][96]\n\n## [Download Catalogue][97]\n\n## [Privacy Policy][98]\n\n## [Copyright][99]\n\n###### [\u00a9 2026 E3 ACP. All rights reserved][100]\n\n### Enquire Now\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nState\nIntrested for Products\nSelect ACP Sheet HPL Sheet Exterior Clads Soffit Panels\nMessage\nSubmit\n\nThis website uses Cookies and related technologies for the site to function correctly and securely,\nimprove & personalise your browsing experience, analyse site traffic, and support our marketing\nefforts. By continuing to browse the site, you agree to our [Privacy Policy][101]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://e3acp.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://e3acp.com/certificate/\n[4]: https://e3acp.com/catalogue/\n[5]: https://e3acp.com/manufacturing-plant/\n[6]: https://e3acp.com/fire-grade/\n[7]: https://e3acp.com/dealers/\n[8]: https://e3acp.com/installation-guide/\n[9]: https://e3acp.com/specification/\n[10]: #\n[11]: https://e3acp.com/arch-house/\n[12]: https://e3acp.com/better-halves/\n[13]: https://e3acp.com/metal-marvels/\n[14]: https://e3acp.com/acp-sheets-manufacturer/\n[15]: https://e3acp.com/feather-touch-series/\n[16]: https://e3acp.com/prime-series/\n[17]: https://e3acp.com/3d-louver/\n[18]: https://e3acp.com/timeless-collection-acp-sheet/\n[19]: https://e3acp.com/italian-stone-acp-sheets/\n[20]: https://e3acp.com/anti-scratch-acp-sheets/\n[21]: https://e3acp.com/timber-wood-acp-sheet/\n[22]: https://e3acp.com/sand-series-acp-sheet/\n[23]: https://e3acp.com/pebbles-acp-sheets/\n[24]: https://e3acp.com/sparkle-mirror-brush-acp-sheets/\n[25]: https://e3acp.com/gloss-acp-sheet/\n[26]: https://e3acp.com/high-gloss-acp-sheets/\n[27]: https://e3acp.com/pastel-series-acp-sheets/\n[28]: https://e3acp.com/acp-metallic-series/\n[29]: https://e3acp.com/hpl-sheet-manufacturing-company/\n[30]: https://e3acp.com/anti-scratch-hpl-sheet/\n[31]: https://e3acp.com/italian-stone-hpl-sheet/\n[32]: https://e3acp.com/timber-wood-hpl-sheet/\n[33]: https://e3acp.com/pebbles-hpl-sheet/\n[34]: https://e3acp.com/sand-series-hpl-sheet/\n[35]: https://e3acp.com/pastel-metallic-hpl-sheet/\n[36]: https://e3acp.com/exterior-wall-cladding-manufacturer/\n[37]: https://e3acp.com/contact-us/\n[38]: https://e3acp.com/about-us/\n[39]: https://e3acp.com/certificate/\n[40]: https://e3acp.com/catalogue/\n[41]: https://e3acp.com/manufacturing-plant/\n[42]: https://e3acp.com/fire-grade/\n[43]: https://e3acp.com/dealers/\n[44]: https://e3acp.com/installation-guide/\n[45]: https://e3acp.com/specification/\n[46]: #\n[47]: https://e3acp.com/arch-house/\n[48]: https://e3acp.com/better-halves/\n[49]: https://e3acp.com/metal-marvels/\n[50]: https://e3acp.com/acp-sheets-manufacturer/\n[51]: https://e3acp.com/feather-touch-series/\n[52]: https://e3acp.com/prime-series/\n[53]: https://e3acp.com/3d-louver/\n[54]: https://e3acp.com/timeless-collection-acp-sheet/\n[55]: https://e3acp.com/italian-stone-acp-sheets/\n[56]: https://e3acp.com/anti-scratch-acp-sheets/\n[57]: https://e3acp.com/timber-wood-acp-sheet/\n[58]: https://e3acp.com/sand-series-acp-sheet/\n[59]: https://e3acp.com/pebbles-acp-sheets/\n[60]: https://e3acp.com/sparkle-mirror-brush-acp-sheets/\n[61]: https://e3acp.com/gloss-acp-sheet/\n[62]: https://e3acp.com/high-gloss-acp-sheets/\n[63]: https://e3acp.com/pastel-series-acp-sheets/\n[64]: https://e3acp.com/acp-metallic-series/\n[65]: