            "text": "[[Faren]][1]\n\nDiversifying our portfolio, in 2023, we ventured into exterior solutions with the establishment of\nALLCOR ACP in New Delhi. Under the brand umbrella of \"ALLCOR PANELS\" we offer a comprehensive array\nof ACP, APP and AHPL. with a manufacturing unit situated in Greater Noida.\n\n### Social Media:\n\n[ [Faren] [Faren]][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [ Vision and Mission][5]\n* [ Our Director][6]\n* [ Technical Specification][7]\n* [ Manufacturing Unit][8]\n* [ Certificates][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [ **ACP** Aluminium Composite Panel][11]\n* [ **AHPL** High Pressure Laminates][12]\n* [ **APP** Aluminium Partition Panel][13]\n* [Gallery][14]\n* [Product Application][15]\n* [3D Images][16]\n* [Our Projects][17]\n* [Events][18]\n* [Exhibitions][19]\n* [Major Events][20]\n* [ Catalogues][21]\n* [ Blogs][22]\n* [Prestigious Customers][23]\n* [Contact Us][24]\n* [Office Address][25]\n* [Factory Address ][26]\n* [Warehouses Address][27]\n[+91-9090209080][28]\n[ [Faren ] ][29]\n* [Home][30]\n* [About][31]\n* [Vision and Mission][32]\n* [Our Director][33]\n* [Technical Specification][34]\n* [Manufacturing Unit][35]\n* [Certificates][36]\n* [Products][37]\n* [**ACP** Aluminium Composite Panel][38]\n* [**AHPL** High Pressure Laminates][39]\n* [**APP** Aluminium Partition Panel][40]\n* [Gallery][41]\n* [Product Application][42]\n* [3D Images][43]\n* [Our Projects][44]\n* [Events][45]\n* [Exhibitions][46]\n* [Major Events][47]\n* [Catalogues][48]\n* [Prestigious Customers][49]\n* [Contact Us][50]\n* [Office Address][51]\n* [Factory Address ][52]\n* [Warehouses Address][53]\n[Aluminium Composite Panels Manufacturers in Delhi] [ Aluminium Composite Panels Manufacturers in\nIndia]\n[ AHPL Sheet Manufacturers in India]\n[Aluminium Composite Panels Manufacturers in India]\n[ACP Panels Manufacturers ]\nAbout Us\n\n## Company Profile\n\nIntroducing Allcor: Elevating Exterior Design with Premium Aluminium Composite Panels. Where\nInnovation Meets Craftsmanship in Exterior-Grade Decorative Surfaces. ALLCOR stands tall as a\nleading and rapidly growing force in the realm of Aluminium Composite Panels (ACP) within India.\nSince its inception in 2017, ALLCOR GROUP OF COMPANIES has been dedicated to excellence Diversifying\nour portfolio, in 2023, we ventured into exterior solutions with the establishment of ALLCOR ACP in\nNew Delhi. Under the brand umbrella of \"ALLCOR PANELS,\" we offer a comprehensive array of ACP, APP\nand HPL. , with a manufacturing unit situated in Greater Noida. Here, under the esteemed brand name\nof \"ALLCOR LAMINATES,\" we produce an interior range of PVC and Acrylic sheets and clads, catering to\ndiverse needs with precision and finesse.\n\nAt Allcor, we believe that architecture is more than just structures-it's an expression of\ncreativity and precision. With two years of expertise in Aluminium Composite Panels (ACP), we bring\nyou cutting-edge technology, exceptional durability, and unmatched aesthetics. Our ACPs are the top\nchoice for architects, interior designers, and trade professionals seeking excellence in exterior\nand interior applications.\n\n#### Uncompromising Quality & Innovation\n\n**No Compromises. Just Quality That Hits Different** Each Allcor ACP is a flex of top-tier\nengineering and innovation. Built to boss through time and tough weather, our panels pack serious\npower. Our panels features:\n\n**Exceptional Weather Resistance** - Built to endure extreme temperatures, UV exposure, and\nenvironmental factors, ensuring long-lasting beauty.\n\n**Precision Engineering** - Advanced manufacturing ensures superior flatness, an impeccable surface\nflawless finish, and a vibrant color palette that enhances any project.\n\n**Next-Level Versatility** - Whether it's signage, facades, cladding or creative installs, these\npanels fit right in, bringing your vision to life.\n\n**Lightweight Yet Sturdy** - The perfect balance of strength and flexibility allows for seamless\ninstallation and creative design freedom. Easy to install, built to last-the perfect balance of\nbrains and brawn.\n\n[AHPL Sheet Manufacturers company in India]\n\n#### Applications That Redefine Spaces\n\nFrom sleek homes and cool cafes to big-league corporate pads and retail setups, Allcor ACPs flip\nboring buildings into total stunners, Luxe, modem- edgy whatever your vibe is, we've got the panel\npower to match it. Our solutions blend functionality with aesthetics to craft extraordinary\narchitectural masterpieces.\n\n[ACP Panels sheet Manufacturers in India]\n\n#### A Customer-Centric Approach\n\nAt Allcor, it's not just about selling premium ACPs. It's about creating an experience. Our support\nsquad rolls with you-From picking the perfect panel to making it lands right where it should.\n\nWith a commitment to customer satisfaction, we provide:\n\n**Expert Consultation** - Helping you choose the perfect ACP for your project.\n\n**Innovative Design Support** - Assisting in material selection and technical specifications .We\nguide you on colors, finishes, and fits like's an art form.\n\n**Seamless Logistics** - Ensuring timely delivery with efficient supply chain management.\n\n#### Let's Build the Future-One Panel at a Time.\n\nAllcor isn\u2019t just a name- it's a movement. We're reshaping architecture with a combo of class,\nstrength, and bold design. Ready to switch gears from basic breathtaking. Come vibe with\nAllcor-where each panel speaks style.\n\n[HPL Sheet Manufacturers in India][54] [AHPL Sheet Manufacturers in Delhi][55] [Aluminium High\nPressure Laminate Manufacturers in Delhi][56] [Aluminium Composite Panels Manufacturers in\nDelhi][57] [AHPL Sheet Manufacturers in India][58] [Aluminium High Pressure Laminates Manufacturers\nin India ][59] [ACP Panels Manufacturers in India ][60] [ACP Panels Manufacturers ][61] [Aluminium\nComposite Panels Manufacturers][62]\n\n##### Get in Touch\n* [SFS - 14, CAT-2, DSIDC INDUSTRIAL COMPLEX, NEAR UDYOG NAGAR METRO STATION, NANGLOI - 110041 ][63]\n* [info@allcorpanels.com ][64]\n* [ +91-9090209080 ][65]\n\n##### Company\n* [ Vision and Mission][66]\n* [ Our Director][67]\n* [ Technical Specification][68]\n* [ Manufacturing Unit][69]\n* [ Certificates][70]\n\n##### Products\n* [ACP Aluminium Composite Panel][71]\n* [AHPL Aluminium High Pressure Laminates][72]\n* [APP Aluminium Partition Panel][73]\n\n\u00a9 2025 Allcor Aluminium Composite Panels. All Right Reserved. Powered by\n\n[1]: https://allcorpanels.com/\n[2]: https://allcorpanels.com/\n[3]: https://allcorpanels.com/\n[4]: https://allcorpanels.com/about-us\n[5]: https://allcorpanels.com/vision-mission\n[6]: https://allcorpanels.com/our-director\n[7]: https://allcorpanels.com/technical-specification\n[8]: https://allcorpanels.com/manufacturing-unit\n[9]: https://allcorpanels.com/certificates\n[10]: #\n[11]: https://allcorpanels.com/acp-aluminium-composite-panel\n[12]: https://allcorpanels.com/ahpl-high-pressure-laminates\n[13]: https://allcorpanels.com/app-aluminium-partition-panel\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://allcorpanels.com/product-application\n[16]: https://allcorpanels.com/3d-images\n[17]: https://allcorpanels.com/projects\n[18]: #\n[19]: https://allcorpanels.com/exhibitions\n[20]: https://allcorpanels.com/major-events\n[21]: https://allcorpanels.com/catalogues\n[22]: https://allcorpanels.com/blogs\n[23]: https://allcorpanels.com/prestigious-customers\n[24]: #\n[25]: https://allcorpanels.com/office-address\n[26]: https://allcorpanels.com/factory-address\n[27]: https://allcorpanels.com/warehouses-address\n[28]: tel:+91-9090209080\n[29]: https://allcorpanels.com/\n[30]: https://allcorpanels.com/\n[31]: https://allcorpanels.com/about-us\n[32]: https://allcorpanels.com/vision-mission\n[33]: https://allcorpanels.com/our-director\n[34]: https://allcorpanels.com/technical-specification\n[35]: https://allcorpanels.com/manufacturing-unit\n[36]: https://allcorpanels.com/certificates\n[37]: #\n[38]: https://allcorpanels.com/acp-alumi