        "crawl_text": "BMA USA, Inc. Deep industry knowledge from over 20 years of experience Strong relationships with suppliers and customers Ability to custom blend products to specifications 7923 Gloria Ave, Van Nuys, California 91406 BMA USA &#8211; Premium Oil\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nOur Brands\n\nOur Products\n\nOlive Oils\n\nAvocado Oils\n\nGrape Seed Oils\n\nNut &#038; Seed Oils\n\nInfused Oils\n\nOrganic Oils\n\nVinegars\n\nRice\n\nServices\n\nSourcing &#038; Supply\n\nManufacturing\n\nInternational\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nOur Brands\n\nOur Products\n\nOlive Oils\n\nAvocado Oils\n\nGrape Seed Oils\n\nNut &#038; Seed Oils\n\nInfused Oils\n\nOrganic Oils\n\nVinegars\n\nRice\n\nServices\n\nSourcing &#038; Supply\n\nManufacturing\n\nInternational\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nOur Brands\n\nOur Products\n\nOlive Oils\n\nAvocado Oils\n\nGrape Seed Oils\n\nNut &#038; Seed Oils\n\nInfused Oils\n\nOrganic Oils\n\nVinegars\n\nRice\n\nServices\n\nSourcing &#038; Supply\n\nManufacturing\n\nInternational\n\nImporter Packer Distributor\n\nPremium Culinary Oils\n\nFind Out More About BMA USA, Inc. And Our Services\n\nPremium Culinary Oils\n\nImporter, Packer, and Distributor\n\nFind Out More About BMA USA, Inc. And Our Services\n\nThe BMA Difference\n\nThe BMA Difference\n\nOur Expertise\n\nWe have been providing our customers with a wide range of quality products for over 20 years. We offer deep industry knowledge because of our years of experience in the field.\n\nOur Quality\n\nWe work with third-party organizations to make sure that everything we offer is the best you'll find. From plant to bottle we take pride in knowing that we will continue to exceed expectations by producing high-quality culinary oils at competitive prices.\n\nOur Service\n\nWe know how important strong relationships are to our clients. That's why we have forged long-term relationships with companies, to help you flourish even faster than you could on your own.\n\nLearn More about the BMA Difference\n\nLearn More\n\nMain Products\n\nOlive Oil\n\nExtra Virgin Olive Oil\nPure Olive Oil\nPomace Olive Oil\nCustom Blend\n\nAvocado Oil\n\nPure Avocado Oil\nAvocado Oil with Garlic\nAvocado Oil Blend\n\nGrape Seed Oil\n\nPure Grape Seed Oil\nGrape Seed Oil with Garlic\nCustom Blend\n\nSpecialty & Fry Oil\n\nAlmond Oil\nCanola Oil\nPeanut Oil\nRice Bran Oil\nSafflower Oil\nSesame Oil\nSunflower Oil\nWalnut Oil\n\nOther\n\nBalsamic Vinegar of Modena\nKosher Balsamic Vinegar of Modena\nBasmati Rice\n\nOlive Oil\n\nExtra Virgin Olive Oil\nPure Olive Oil\nPomace Olive Oil\nCustom Blend\n\nAvocado Oil\n\nPure Avocado Oil\nAvocado Oil with Garlic\nAvocado Oil Blend\n\nGrape Seed Oil\n\nPure Grape Seed Oil\nGrape Seed Oil with Garlic\nCustom Blend\n\nSpecialty & Fry Oil\n\nAlmond Oil\nCanola Oil\nPeanut Oil\nRice Bran Oil\nSafflower Oil\nSesame Oil\nSunflower Oil\nWalnut Oil\n\nOther\n\nBalsamic Vinegar of Modena\nKosher Balsamic Vinegar of Modena\nBasmati Rice\n\nBMA USA, Inc. Brands\n\nAt BMA USA, we go to great lengths for our brands and our customers. We choose only the highest quality ingredients and packaging for our products, and we work hard to make sure our prices are always competitive. Our brands have earned widespread recognition from consumers across the globe, and we continue to add new lines that will satisfy even the pickiest shoppers.\n\nSee Our Brands\n\nBMA USA, Inc. Brands\n\nAt BMA USA, we go to great lengths for our brands and our customers. We choose only the highest quality ingredients and packaging for our products, and we work hard to make sure our prices are always competitive. Our brands have earned widespread recognition from consumers across the globe, and we continue to add new lines that will satisfy even the pickiest shoppers.\n\nSee Our Brands\n\nWhere Can You Find Our Products?\n\nDisclaimer:\n\nPlease note this is a collective list where our products are currently being sold.\nNot every product is available in these stores. Not every location of these stores carry our product.\nPlease check with the store closest to you to see if our product is being sold at that location.\n\nWhere Can You Find Our Products?\n\nDisclaimer:\n\nPlease note this is a collective list where our products are currently being sold.\nNot every product is available in these stores. Not every location of these stores carry our product.\nPlease check with the store closest to you to see if our product is being sold at that location.\n\nWe Also Sell To Distributors\n\nWe Also Sell To Distributors\n\nOur Core Competencies\n\nFood Manufacturing to Global Standards\n\nBMA strives to meet or exceed global standards for food manufacturing, handling and distribution including environmentally responsible resource management.\n\nGlobal Sourcing\n\nOur global sourcing experience spans more than 40 years with suppliers in Asia, Latin America and Europe\n\nBrand Development\n\nBMA positions its brands and the brands of its private-label customers with a focus on taste and quality\n\nLogistics\n\nDomestic and international logistics capabilities to meet the needs of our customers and channel requirements\n\nOur Core Competencies\n\nFood Manufacturing to Global Standards\n\nBMA strives to meet or exceed global standards for food manufacturing, handling and distribution including environmentally responsible resource management.\n\nGlobal Sourcing\n\nOur global sourcing experience spans more than 40 years with suppliers in Asia, Latin America and Europe\n\nBrand Development\n\nBMA positions its brands and the brands of its private-label customers with a focus on taste and quality\n\nLogistics\n\nDomestic and international logistics capabilities to meet the needs of our customers and channel requirements\n\nWe are Internationally Recognized &amp; Sold\n\nBMA\u2019s products are widely sold throughout the United States and also in international markets, through modern trade channels including mass merchants, cross border e-commerce, and with importer and distributor partners primarily in Asia. We are actively seeking strategic partners in North Asia, China and Southeast Asia.\n\nLearn More\n\nChina\n\nwww.Tmall.hk\n\nwww.kaola.com\n\nSouth Korea\n\nHong Kong\n\nMyanmar\n\nMassimo Gusto is also sold in China, www.Tmall.hk and www.kaola.com , South Korea, Hong Kong and Myanmar and other locations.\n\nWe are Internationally Recognized &amp; Sold\n\nBMA\u2019s products are widely sold throughout the United States and also in international markets, through modern trade channels including mass merchants, cross border e-commerce, and with importer and distributor partners primarily in Asia. We are actively seeking strategic partners in North Asia, China and Southeast Asia.\n\nLearn More\n\nMassimo Gusto is also sold in China, www.Tmall.hk and www.kaola.com , South Korea, Hong Kong and Myanmar and other locations.\n\nChina\n\nwww.Tmall.hk\n\nwww.kaola.com\n\nSouth Korea\n\nHong Kong\n\nMyanmar\n\nOur Services\n\nOur Services\n\nFood Manufacturing\n\nLearn More\n\nBMA has the capabilities to manage almost every packaging and bottling solution with ease. From simple packaging needs to complex, high-volume bottling processes with custom-branded products, we are ready to take on any challenge with creativity and precision.\n\nSourcing &amp; Supply\n\nLearn More\n\nIt is our pleasure to offer you a wide range of locally and globally sourced products. We work with growers and producers to bring the highest quality goods to you, ensuring a successful project. Whether you need a small or a large shipment, we have the right sourcing strategy for you. Our worldwide reach makes it possible to have your supply chain vision come to life from anywhere in the world.\n\nBrand Development\n\nBMA allows brands to position themselves with ease. For BMA, customer service is an essential component of its brand identity. With the world changing at a rapid pace, it\u2019s hard to adapt your business practices fast enough to keep up. Relying on experience, technic and efficiency BMA is able to adapt quickly. In the end, what matters is that you get your brand in front of customers in a way that reflects your company\u2019s values.\n\nLogistics\n\nYour delivery process doesn\u2019t have to be cumbersome and expensive. BMA can help ship goods with ease, preparing and delivering them where they need to be as quickly as possible without spending a fortune on fees and other overhead. We help you ship products to your customers \u2014 we\u2019re experts at simplifying logistics and distributing your product wherever it needs to go.\n\nOur Partners\n\n [ [BMA USA Logo] ][1]\n* [About][2]\n* [Contact][3]\n* [Our Brands][4]\n* [Our Products][5]\n* [Olive Oils][6]\n* [Avocado Oils][7]\n* [Grape Seed Oils][8]\n* [Nut & Seed Oils][9]\n* [Infused Oils][10]\n* [Organic Oils][11]\n* [Vinegars][12]\n* [Rice][13]\n* [Services][14]\n* [Sourcing & Supply][15]\n* [Manufacturing][16]\n* [International][17]\n* [About][18]\n* [Contact][19]\n* [Our Brands][20]\n* [Our Products][21]\n* [Olive Oils][22]\n* [Avocado Oils][23]\n* [Grape Seed Oils][24]\n* [Nut & Seed Oils][25]\n* [Infused Oils][26]\n* [Organic Oils][27]\n* [Vinegars][28]\n* [Rice][29]\n* [Services][30]\n* [Sourcing & Supply][31]\n* [Manufacturing][32]\n* [International][33]\n[ [BMA USA Logo] ][34]\n* [About][35]\n* [Contact][36]\n* [Our Brands][37]\n* [Our Products][38]\n* [Olive Oils][39]\n* [Avocado Oils][40]\n* [Grape Seed Oils][41]\n* [Nut & Seed Oils][42]\n* [Infused Oils][43]\n* [Organic Oils][44]\n* [Vinegars][45]\n* [Rice][46]\n* [Services][47]\n* [Sourcing & Supply][48]\n* [Manufacturing][49]\n* [International][50]\n[adalia-botha-7tyW8-6rb_4-unsplash]\n\n## About Us\n\nEstablished in Van Nuys, California in 2000, BMA started off as a family owned and operated hands-on\nbusiness. Two decades later BMA has established comprehensive line of oils, a variety of custom\npackaging options, is able to custom blend to a customer\u2019s exact specifications, and has the latest\nequipment which can process and fill 80 units per minute making order fulfillment fast.\n\nBMA is an Importer, Manufacturer, Packer and Distributor of premium imported and domestic edible\noils. BMA has relationships with suppliers in Italy, Spain, Tunisia, Greece, Turkey, Mexico, South\nAmerica and California\n\nBMA services grocery retailers, manufacturers, wholesalers, distributors, foodservice, cash and\ncarry, and specialty retailers.\n\nBMA has a number of established brands with Massimo Gusto being our most popular. Massimo Gusto is\nour premium label and is quickly becoming one of the best known and fastest growing oil brands in\nthe United States.\n\nFor information on private label partnerships, products, and more, browse our site at your leisure\nor contact us directly with an inquiry.\n\n## About Us\n\nEstablished in Van Nuys, California in 1998, BMA started off as a family owned and operated hands-on\nbusiness. Two decades later BMA has established comprehensive line of oils, a variety of custom\npackaging options, is able to custom blend to a customer\u2019s exact specifications, and has the latest\nequipment which can process and fill 80 units per minute making order fulfillment fast.\n\nBMA is an Importer, Manufacturer, Packer and Distributor of premium imported and domestic edible\noils. BMA has relationships with suppliers in Italy, Spain, Tunisia, Greece, Turkey, Mexico, South\nAmerica and California\n\nBMA services grocery retailers, manufacturers, wholesalers, distributors, foodservice, cash and\ncarry, and specialty retailers.\n\nBMA has a number of established brands with Massimo Gusto being our most popular. Massimo Gusto is\nour premium label and is quickly becoming one of the best known and fastest growing oil brands in\nthe United States.\n\nFor information on private label partnerships, products, and more, browse our site at your leisure\nor contact us directly with an inquiry.\n\n## Our Brands\n\n[Massimo Gusto Logo]\n[MG Logo]