            "url": "https://bmausa.com/about",
            "text": "[ [BMA USA Logo] ][1]\n* [About][2]\n* [Contact][3]\n* [Our Brands][4]\n* [Our Products][5]\n* [Olive Oils][6]\n* [Avocado Oils][7]\n* [Grape Seed Oils][8]\n* [Nut & Seed Oils][9]\n* [Infused Oils][10]\n* [Organic Oils][11]\n* [Vinegars][12]\n* [Rice][13]\n* [Services][14]\n* [Sourcing & Supply][15]\n* [Manufacturing][16]\n* [International][17]\n* [About][18]\n* [Contact][19]\n* [Our Brands][20]\n* [Our Products][21]\n* [Olive Oils][22]\n* [Avocado Oils][23]\n* [Grape Seed Oils][24]\n* [Nut & Seed Oils][25]\n* [Infused Oils][26]\n* [Organic Oils][27]\n* [Vinegars][28]\n* [Rice][29]\n* [Services][30]\n* [Sourcing & Supply][31]\n* [Manufacturing][32]\n* [International][33]\n[ [BMA USA Logo] ][34]\n* [About][35]\n* [Contact][36]\n* [Our Brands][37]\n* [Our Products][38]\n* [Olive Oils][39]\n* [Avocado Oils][40]\n* [Grape Seed Oils][41]\n* [Nut & Seed Oils][42]\n* [Infused Oils][43]\n* [Organic Oils][44]\n* [Vinegars][45]\n* [Rice][46]\n* [Services][47]\n* [Sourcing & Supply][48]\n* [Manufacturing][49]\n* [International][50]\n[adalia-botha-7tyW8-6rb_4-unsplash]\n\n## About Us\n\nEstablished in Van Nuys, California in 2000, BMA started off as a family owned and operated hands-on\nbusiness. Two decades later BMA has established comprehensive line of oils, a variety of custom\npackaging options, is able to custom blend to a customer\u2019s exact specifications, and has the latest\nequipment which can process and fill 80 units per minute making order fulfillment fast.\n\nBMA is an Importer, Manufacturer, Packer and Distributor of premium imported and domestic edible\noils. BMA has relationships with suppliers in Italy, Spain, Tunisia, Greece, Turkey, Mexico, South\nAmerica and California\n\nBMA services grocery retailers, manufacturers, wholesalers, distributors, foodservice, cash and\ncarry, and specialty retailers.\n\nBMA has a number of established brands with Massimo Gusto being our most popular. Massimo Gusto is\nour premium label and is quickly becoming one of the best known and fastest growing oil brands in\nthe United States.\n\nFor information on private label partnerships, products, and more, browse our site at your leisure\nor contact us directly with an inquiry.\n\n## About Us\n\nEstablished in Van Nuys, California in 1998, BMA started off as a family owned and operated hands-on\nbusiness. Two decades later BMA has established comprehensive line of oils, a variety of custom\npackaging options, is able to custom blend to a customer\u2019s exact specifications, and has the latest\nequipment which can process and fill 80 units per minute making order fulfillment fast.\n\nBMA is an Importer, Manufacturer, Packer and Distributor of premium imported and domestic edible\noils. BMA has relationships with suppliers in Italy, Spain, Tunisia, Greece, Turkey, Mexico, South\nAmerica and California\n\nBMA services grocery retailers, manufacturers, wholesalers, distributors, foodservice, cash and\ncarry, and specialty retailers.\n\nBMA has a number of established brands with Massimo Gusto being our most popular. Massimo Gusto is\nour premium label and is quickly becoming one of the best known and fastest growing oil brands in\nthe United States.\n\nFor information on private label partnerships, products, and more, browse our site at your leisure\nor contact us directly with an inquiry.\n\n## Our Brands\n\n[Massimo Gusto Logo]\n[MG Logo]\n[Milano Plus Logo]\n[Oliverda Sana Logo]\n\nAt BMA USA, we go to great lengths for our brands and our customers. We choose only the highest\nquality ingredients and packaging for our products, and we work hard to make sure our prices are\nalways competitive. Our brands have earned widespread recognition from consumers across the globe,\nand we continue to add new lines that will satisfy even the pickiest shoppers.\n\n[ See Our Brands ][51]\n\n## Main Products\n\nOlive Oil\n\n\u2013 Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\n\u2013 Extra Virgin Olive Oil Blend\n\n\u2013 Californian Extra Vigin Olive Oil\n\n\u2013 Italian Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\n\u2013 Culinary Blend 75/25\n\n\u2013 Culinary Blend 90/10\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infusions\n\n\u2013 Pomace Olive Oil\n\n\u2013 Pure Olive Oil\n\nAvocado Oil\n\n\u2013 Avocado Oil\n\n\u2013 Avocado Oil Blend\n\n\u2013 Avocado Oil with Garlic\n\n\u2013 Avocado Oil with Lemon\n\n\u2013 Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nGrape Seed Oil\n\n\u2013 Grape Seed Oil Blend\n\n\u2013 Grape Seed Oil Blend with Jalape\u00f1o & Garlic\n\n\u2013 Grape Seed Oil Blend with Jalape\u00f1o Pepper\n\n\u2013 Pure Grape Seed Oil\n\nInfused Oil\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Basil\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Black Truffle\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Garlic\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Jalape\u00f1o Pepper\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Lemon\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Lime\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Orange\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Rosemary\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with White Truffle\n\nNut & Seed Oil\n\n\u2013 Almond Oil\n\n\u2013 Corn Oil\n\n\u2013 Flax Seed Oil\n\n\u2013 Organic Canola Oil\n\n\u2013 Organic Sunflower Oil\n\n\u2013 Peanut Oil\n\n\u2013 Roasted Sesame Oil\n\n\u2013 Rice Bran Oil\n\n\u2013 Safflower Oil\n\n\u2013 Sweet Almond Oil\n\n\u2013 Walnut Oil\n\nOrganic Oil\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\n\u2013 Organic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infusions\n\n\u2013 Organic Canola Oil\n\n\u2013 Organic Sunflower Seed Oil\n\nVinegar\n\n\u2013 Balsamic Vinegar of Modena\n\n\u2013 Kosher Balsamic Vinegar of Modena\n\nRice\n\n\u2013 Basmati Rice\n\nOlive Oil\n\nExtra Virgin Olive Oil\n\nExtra Virgin Olive Oil Blend\n\nCalifornian Extra Vigin Olive Oil\n\nItalian Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\nCulinary Blend 75/25\n\nCulinary Blend 90/10\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infusions\n\nPomace Olive Oil\n\nPure Olive Oil\n\nAvocado Oil\n\nAvocado Oil\n\nAvocado Oil Blend\n\nAvocado Oil with Garlic\n\nAvocado Oil with Lemon\n\nExtra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\nGrape Seed Oil\n\nGrape Seed Oil Blend\n\nGrape Seed Oil Blend with Jalape\u00f1o & Garlic\n\nGrape Seed Oil Blend with Jalape\u00f1o Pepper\n\nPure Grape Seed Oil\n\nInfused Oil\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Basil\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Black Truffle\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Garlic\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Jalape\u00f1o Pepper\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Lemon\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Lime\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Orange\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with Rosemary\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infused with White Truffle\n\nNut & Seed Oil\n\nAlmond Oil\n\nCorn Oil\n\nFlax Seed Oil\n\nOrganic Canola Oil\n\nOrganic Sunflower Oil\n\nPeanut Oil\n\nRoasted Sesame Oil\n\nRice Bran Oil\n\nSafflower Oil\n\nSweet Almond Oil\n\nWalnut Oil\n\nOrganic Oil\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\nOrganic Extra Virgin Olive Oil Infusions\n\nOrganic Canola Oil\n\nOrganic Sunflower Seed Oil\n\nVinegar\n\nBalsamic Vinegar of Modena\n\nKosher Balsamic Vinegar of Modena\n\nRice\n\nBasmati Rice\n\n## Where Can You Find Our Products?\n\nDisclaimer:\n\nPlease note this is a collective list where our products are currently being sold.\n\nNot every product is available in these stores. Not every location of these stores carry our\nproduct.\n\nPlease check with the store closest to you to see if our product is being sold at that location.\n\n## Where Can You Find Our Products?\n\nDisclaimer:\n\nPlease note this is a collective list where our products are currently being sold.\n\nNot every product is available in these stores. Not every location of these stores carry our\nproduct.\n\nPlease check with the store closest to you to see if our product is being sold at that location.\n\n[Food 4 Less]\n[Food Maxx]\n[Lucky Supermarket]\n[Save Mart]\n[Smiths]\n\n## We Also Sell To Distributors\n\n## We Also Sell To Distributors\n\n[Chef's Warehouse]\n\n## Our Quality Standards\n\nWe work closely with external organizations and take their insights to create the best products. We\nwon\u2019t accept anything less.\n\n### Find Out More About BMA USA, Inc. And Our Services\n\n## Our Quality Standards\n\nWe work closely with external organizations and take their insights to create the best products. We\nwon\u2019t accept anything less.\n\n### Find Out More About BMA USA, Inc. And Our Services\n\n## Subscribe to our mailing list!\n\nDon\u2019t miss out on exciting new offerings, industry news and more.\n\nSubscribe\n* [Home][52]\n* [About][53]\n* [Contact][54]\n* [Home][55]\n* [About][56]\n* [Contact][57]\n[ [BMA USA Logo] ][58]\n\n7923 Gloria Ave.\n\nVan Nuys, CA 91406\n\n(818) 241-8383\n\n[ [BMA USA Logo] ][59]\n* [Home][60]\n* [About][61]\n* [Contact][62]\n* [Home][63]\n* [About][64]\n* [Contact][65]\n\n## Copyright \u00a9 2022 BMA USA, Inc. All rights reserved.\n\n## 7923 Gloria Ave. Van Nuys, California 91406\n\n[1]: /bma-home/\n[2]: /about-us/\n[3]: /contact-bma/\n[4]: /bma-brands/\n[5]: /our-products/\n[6]: /olive-oils/\n[7]: /avocado-oils/\n[8]: /grape-seed-oils/\n[9]: /nut-seed-oils/\n[10]: /infused-oils/\n[11]: /organic-oils/\n[12]: /vinegars/\n[13]: /rice/\n[14]: /services/\n[15]: /sourcing-supply/\n[16]: /manufacturing/\n[17]: /international/\n[18]: /about-us/\n[19]: /contact-bma/\n[20]: /bma-brands/\n[21]: /our-products/\n[22]: /olive-oils/\n[23]: /avocado-oils/\n[24]: /grape-seed-oils/\n[25]: /nut-seed-oils/\n[26]: /infused-oils/\n[27]: /organic-oils/\n[28]: /vinegars/\n[29]: /rice/\n[30]: /services/\n[31]: /sourcing-supply/\n[32]: /manufacturing/\n[33]: /international/\n[34]: /bma-home/\n[35]: /about-us/\n[36]: /contact-bma/\n[37]: /bma-brands/\n[38]: /our-products/\n[39]