        "crawl_text": "Brentwood Avo Limited Certified Organic, Fair Trade, Carbon Neutral Africa Europe North America EU Organic AFA Certification Full traceability from orchard to facility Cold-press extraction method Sustainable farming practices International food safety standards Fair Trade certification Nairobi, Kenya Kenya Uganda Tanzania Burundi Rwanda Nairobi, Kenya Global 700+ partner farmers 60% women-led farms 100% sustainable practices Expanding global distribution Enhancing product quality and traceability Market competition in the global oil industry Sustainability challenges in sourcing Growing demand for healthy cooking oils Expansion into new international markets Leading exporter of premium avocado oil from Kenya Increasing health consciousness among consumers Rising popularity of avocado oil in culinary and beauty sectors Premium Avocado Oil Exporters from Kenya | Brentwood Avo\n\nHome\n\nCompany\n\nBusiness\n\nSupport\nRequest Quote Contact Us Toggle menu\n\nPremium Kenyan Avocado Oil\nFrom Kenya&#x27;s Finest Orchards to Your Table\nExperience the pure essence of premium avocado oil, cold-pressed from sustainably sourced avocados and crafted with generations of farming expertise.\nRequest Sample Our Story\n\n700+\nPartner Farmers\n\nCountries Served\n\n100%\nCold-Pressed\n\nWhy Choose Brentwood Avo\nExpertise in sustainable avocado farming and oil production, delivering premium quality to discerning global markets.\n\nFull Traceability\nTrack your oil from specific orchards to your facility with complete transparency and documentation.\n\nCold-Press Excellence\nOur mechanical extraction preserves nutrients and flavor without heat or chemical processing.\n\nCertified Quality\nInternational certifications ensure consistent quality and safety standards for global markets.\n\nTrusted Certifications\nOur commitment to quality is backed by international certifications and rigorous standards.\n\nEU Organic\nEU Organic Certification\n\nAFA\nAFA Certification\n\nGrowing Together\nOur success is rooted in sustainable partnerships with local farmers, creating positive impact across Kenyan communities.\n\n700+\nPartner Farmers\nSupporting local communities\n\n60%\nWomen-Led Farms\nEmpowering female farmers\n\n100%\nSustainable Practices\nEnvironmentally responsible\n\nMeet Our Farmers\n\nOur Farmer Network\nWe work directly with smallholder farmers across Kenya&#x27;s prime avocado-growing regions and neighboring countries. Our network spans multiple counties and countries, bringing together dedicated growers who share our commitment to quality and sustainable practices.\n\n700+\n\nPartner Farmers\nSmallholder farmers across East Africa\n\nSourcing Regions\nKenya, Uganda, Tanzania, Burundi, Rwanda\n\n100%\n\nSustainable Practices\nOrganic farming and fair trade principles\n\nFarmer Network Map\nClick on markers to see farmer details and locations\n\nLoading map...\n\nEast Africa Network\n700+ Partner Farmers\n\nKenya\n\nUganda\n\nTanzania\n\nRwanda\nExplore Our Impact\n\nOur Process\nFrom orchard to export, every step is carefully controlled to deliver the highest quality avocado oil to global markets.\n\nSelection\nHand-picked premium avocados from certified organic farms\nOnly the finest, fully ripened avocados make it to our processing facility\n\nCold Press\nMechanical extraction without heat or chemicals\nOur cold-press method preserves all natural nutrients and flavor compounds\n\nQuality Assurance\nRigorous testing for purity, acidity, and nutritional content\nEvery batch undergoes comprehensive laboratory analysis and certification\n\nPackaging\nFilled into Flexi Tanks for bulk crude avocado oil export\nFlexi Tanks are fitted into standard 20ft containers, offering a cost-effective and hygienic solution for transporting large volumes of crude avocado oil\n\nExport\nGlobal distribution with full traceability documentation\nTemperature-controlled logistics ensure product integrity from Kenya to your facility\n\nQuality Guarantee\nEvery batch comes with complete documentation including certificates of analysis, traceability records, and quality assurance reports.\n\nTrusted by Leading Brands Worldwide\nBuilding partnerships with industry leaders who value quality and sustainability.\n\nPremium avocado oil from Kenya&#x27;s finest orchards. Committed to quality, sustainability, and supporting local farmers.\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n+254 (0) 720 721 390\n[email&#160;protected]\n\nCompany\nAbout\nQuality\nSustainability\n\nBusiness\nProducts\nExport\nRequest Quote\n\nSupport\nResources\nContact\n\n\u00a9 2026 Brentwood Avo Limited. All rights reserved.\nFacebook Twitter Instagram LinkedIn [[Brentwood Avo Logo]][1]\n[Home][2]\nCompany\nBusiness\nSupport\n[Request Quote][3][Contact Us][4]\nToggle menu\n[Kenyan avocado orchard at golden hour]\n\n# Let's Start aConversation\n\nReady to bring premium Kenyan avocado oil to your market? Our team is here to discuss partnerships,\nbulk orders, and custom solutions.\n\nCall Us\n\n[+254 (0) 720 721 390][5]\n\nEmail\n\n[[email protected]][6]\n\n### Quick Inquiry\n\nInquiry TypeBulk OrdersPartnershipProduct InformationOtherSend Message\n[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][7]\n\nPremium avocado oil from Kenya's finest orchards. Committed to quality, sustainability, and\nsupporting local farmers.\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n+254 (0) 720 721 390\n[[email protected]][8]\n\n### Company\n* [About][9]\n* [Quality][10]\n* [Sustainability][11]\n\n### Business\n* [Products][12]\n* [Export][13]\n* [Request Quote][14]\n\n### Support\n* [Resources][15]\n* [Contact][16]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Brentwood Avo Limited. All rights reserved.\n\n[Facebook][17][Twitter][18][Instagram][19][LinkedIn][20]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /quote\n[4]: /contact\n[5]: tel:+2540720721390\n[6]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e68f888089a6849483889291898982879089c88589c88d83\n[7]: /\n[8]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[9]: /about\n[10]: /quality\n[11]: /sustainability\n[12]: /products\n[13]: /export\n[14]: /quote\n[15]: /resources\n[16]: /contact\n[17]: #\n[18]: #\n[19]: #\n[20]: # [[Brentwood Avo Logo]][1]\n[Home][2]\nCompany\nBusiness\nSupport\n[Request Quote][3][Contact Us][4]\nToggle menu\n[Kenyan avocado orchards]\nRooted in Kenya, Growing for the World\n\n# Building Excellence from Day One\n\nStarting fresh in Kenya's fertile highlands, we're building a trusted global supply chain with\npassion, innovation, and unwavering commitment to quality from the very beginning.\n\n[Our Impact Today][5]\n\n## Our Purpose\n\nGuided by our mission, vision, and values, we're building a sustainable future for avocado oil\nproduction.\n\n### Our Mission\n\nTo produce the world's finest avocado oil while empowering Kenyan farming communities through\nsustainable practices, fair partnerships, and innovative agricultural techniques that preserve our\nenvironment for future generations.\n\n### Our Vision\n\nTo be the global leader in premium avocado oil production, recognized for our unwavering commitment\nto quality, sustainability, and positive social impact across the communities we serve.\n\n### Our Values\n\nQuality Excellence\nSustainable Practices\nCommunity Empowerment\nTransparency\nInnovation\nIntegrity\n[Farming community]\n[Farmer leader]\n[Traditional processing]\n5,000+\nPartner Families\n\n## Our Processing Facility\n\nA state-of-the-art facility combining cutting-edge technology with sustainable practices to produce\nthe finest avocado oil.\n\n[Cold-Press Extraction]\nCold-Press Extraction\n\nState-of-the-art mechanical extraction preserving natural nutrients\n\nTemperature-controlled extraction at optimal 27\u00b0C\n\nTour\n\n### World-Class Infrastructure\n\nOur Nairobi facility represents the pinnacle of avocado oil processing technology, designed to\nmaintain the highest quality standards while minimizing environmental impact.\n\n5,000MT/year\nProcessing Capacity\n99.9%\nQuality Consistency\n100%\nRenewable Energy\n27\u00b0C\nExtraction Temperature\n[Schedule Facility Tour][6]\n\n### Certified Excellence\n\nOur facility maintains the highest international standards for food safety, quality management, and\nenvironmental responsibility.\n\nFair TradeCarbon Neutral\n[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][7]\n\nPremium avocado oil from Kenya's finest orchards. Committed to quality, sustainability, and\nsupporting local farmers.\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n+254 (0) 720 721 390\n[[email protected]][8]\n\n### Company\n* [About][9]\n* [Quality][10]\n* [Sustainability][11]\n\n### Business\n* [Products][12]\n* [Export][13]\n* [Request Quote][14]\n\n### Support\n* [Resources][15]\n* [Contact][16]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Brentwood Avo Limited. All rights reserved.\n\n[Facebook][17][Twitter][18][Instagram][19][LinkedIn][20]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /quote\n[4]: /contact\n[5]: /sustainability\n[6]: /contact?type=facility-tour\n[7]: /\n[8]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[9]: /about\n[10]: /quality\n[11]: /sustainability\n[12]: /products\n[13]: /export\n[14]: /quote\n[15]: /resources\n[16]: /contact\n[17]: #\n[18]: #\n[19]: #\n[20]: # [[Brentwood Avo Logo]][1]\n[Home][2]\nCompany\nBusiness\nSupport\n[Request Quote][3][Contact Us][4]\nToggle menu\n[Premium avocado oil bottles]\nPremium Cold-Pressed\n\n# Pure Liquid Gold\n\nDiscover our range of premium avocado oils, each crafted with precision and care from the finest\nKenyan avocados.\n\n100% Natural\nAward Winning\nCold-Pressed\nExplore Products\n[Premium avocado oil bottle]\nNEW\n\n## Technical Specifications\n\nDetailed specifications and nutritional information for our premium avocado oil products.\n\nExtra VirginRefined\n\n### Crude Avocado Oil\n\nTechnical Specs\nSmoke Point\n271\u00b0C (520\u00b0F)\nAcidity\n< 0.5%\nPeroxide Value\n< 10 meq O2/kg\nMoisture\n< 0.2%\nProcessing\nCold-Pressed\nShelf Life\n24 months\nNutritional Profile\nMonounsaturated Fat70-80%\nPolyunsaturated Fat10-15%\nSaturated Fat10-15%\nVitamin EHigh\nOmega-31-2%\nOmega-68-13%\nCertifications\nNon-GMOKosherHalal\n\n## Versatile Applications\n\nDiscover the many ways our premium avocado oil can enhance your culinary creations, health, and\nbeauty routine.\n\n### Culinary\n\n[High-Heat Cooking]\nUp to 271\u00b0C\n\n#### High-Heat Cooking\n\nPerfect for searing, grilling, and roasting with its high smoke point\n\n[Salad Dressings]\nCold use\n\n#### Salad Dressings\n\nMild flavor enhances without overpowering delicate ingredients\n\n[Baking & Pastries]\n180-200\u00b0C\n\n#### Baking & Pastries\n\nCreates moist, tender textures in cakes and pastries\n\n### Health & Wellness\n\n[Heart Health]\n70-80% MUFA\n\n#### Heart Health\n\nRich in monounsaturated fats that support cardiovascular health\n\n[Nutrient Absorption]\n4x Better\n\n#### Nutrient Absorption\n\nEnhances absorption of fat-soluble vitamins A, D, E, K\n\n[Anti-Inflammatory]\nNatural\n\n#### Anti-Inflammatory\n\nContains oleic acid with natural anti-inflammatory properties\n\n### Beauty & Skincare\n\n[Skin Moisturizer]\nDeep Hydration\n\n#### Skin Moisturizer\n\nDeep penetrating oil that nourishes and hydrates skin\n\n[Hair Treatment]\nStrengthening\n\n#### Hair Treatment\n\nStrengthens and adds shine to damaged or dry hair\n\n[Anti-Aging]\nAntioxidant Rich\n\n#### Anti-Aging\n\nRich in antioxidants that help protect against free radicals\n\n[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][5]\n\nPremium avocado oil from Kenya's finest orchards. Committed to quality, sustainability, and\nsupporting local farmers.\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n+254 (0) 720 721 390\n[[email protected]][6]\n\n### Company\n* [About][7]\n* [Quality][8]\n* [Sustainability][9]\n\n### Business\n* [Products][10]\n* [Export][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n\n### Support\n* [Resources][13]\n* [Contact][14]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Brentwood Avo Limited. All rights reserved.\n\n[Facebook][15][Twitter][16][Instagram][17][LinkedIn][18]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /quote\n[4]: /contact\n[5]: /\n[6]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[7]: /about\n[8]: /quality\n[9]: /sustainability\n[10]: /products\n[11]: /export\n[12]: /quote\n[13]: /resources\n[14]: /con