          {
            "url": "https://brentwood.co.ke/about",
            "text": "[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][1]\n[Home][2]\nCompany\nBusiness\nSupport\n[Request Quote][3][Contact Us][4]\nToggle menu\n[Kenyan avocado orchards]\nRooted in Kenya, Growing for the World\n\n# Building Excellence from Day One\n\nStarting fresh in Kenya's fertile highlands, we're building a trusted global supply chain with\npassion, innovation, and unwavering commitment to quality from the very beginning.\n\n[Our Impact Today][5]\n\n## Our Purpose\n\nGuided by our mission, vision, and values, we're building a sustainable future for avocado oil\nproduction.\n\n### Our Mission\n\nTo produce the world's finest avocado oil while empowering Kenyan farming communities through\nsustainable practices, fair partnerships, and innovative agricultural techniques that preserve our\nenvironment for future generations.\n\n### Our Vision\n\nTo be the global leader in premium avocado oil production, recognized for our unwavering commitment\nto quality, sustainability, and positive social impact across the communities we serve.\n\n### Our Values\n\nQuality Excellence\nSustainable Practices\nCommunity Empowerment\nTransparency\nInnovation\nIntegrity\n[Farming community]\n[Farmer leader]\n[Traditional processing]\n5,000+\nPartner Families\n\n## Our Processing Facility\n\nA state-of-the-art facility combining cutting-edge technology with sustainable practices to produce\nthe finest avocado oil.\n\n[Cold-Press Extraction]\nCold-Press Extraction\n\nState-of-the-art mechanical extraction preserving natural nutrients\n\nTemperature-controlled extraction at optimal 27\u00b0C\n\nTour\n\n### World-Class Infrastructure\n\nOur Nairobi facility represents the pinnacle of avocado oil processing technology, designed to\nmaintain the highest quality standards while minimizing environmental impact.\n\n5,000MT/year\nProcessing Capacity\n99.9%\nQuality Consistency\n100%\nRenewable Energy\n27\u00b0C\nExtraction Temperature\n[Schedule Facility Tour][6]\n\n### Certified Excellence\n\nOur facility maintains the highest international standards for food safety, quality management, and\nenvironmental responsibility.\n\nFair TradeCarbon Neutral\n[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][7]\n\nPremium avocado oil from Kenya's finest orchards. Committed to quality, sustainability, and\nsupporting local farmers.\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n+254 (0) 720 721 390\n[[email protected]][8]\n\n### Company\n* [About][9]\n* [Quality][10]\n* [Sustainability][11]\n\n### Business\n* [Products][12]\n* [Export][13]\n* [Request Quote][14]\n\n### Support\n* [Resources][15]\n* [Contact][16]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Brentwood Avo Limited. All rights reserved.\n\n[Facebook][17][Twitter][18][Instagram][19][LinkedIn][20]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /quote\n[4]: /contact\n[5]: /sustainability\n[6]: /contact?type=facility-tour\n[7]: /\n[8]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[9]: /about\n[10]: /quality\n[11]: /sustainability\n[12]: /products\n[13]: /export\n[14]: /quote\n[15]: /resources\n[16]: /contact\n[17]: #\n[18]: #\n[19]: #\n[20]: #"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://brentwood.co.ke/products",
            "text": "[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][1]\n[Home][2]\nCompany\nBusiness\nSupport\n[Request Quote][3][Contact Us][4]\nToggle menu\n[Premium avocado oil bottles]\nPremium Cold-Pressed\n\n# Pure Liquid Gold\n\nDiscover our range of premium avocado oils, each crafted with precision and care from the finest\nKenyan avocados.\n\n100% Natural\nAward Winning\nCold-Pressed\nExplore Products\n[Premium avocado oil bottle]\nNEW\n\n## Technical Specifications\n\nDetailed specifications and nutritional information for our premium avocado oil products.\n\nExtra VirginRefined\n\n### Crude Avocado Oil\n\nTechnical Specs\nSmoke Point\n271\u00b0C (520\u00b0F)\nAcidity\n< 0.5%\nPeroxide Value\n< 10 meq O2/kg\nMoisture\n< 0.2%\nProcessing\nCold-Pressed\nShelf Life\n24 months\nNutritional Profile\nMonounsaturated Fat70-80%\nPolyunsaturated Fat10-15%\nSaturated Fat10-15%\nVitamin EHigh\nOmega-31-2%\nOmega-68-13%\nCertifications\nNon-GMOKosherHalal\n\n## Versatile Applications\n\nDiscover the many ways our premium avocado oil can enhance your culinary creations, health, and\nbeauty routine.\n\n### Culinary\n\n[High-Heat Cooking]\nUp to 271\u00b0C\n\n#### High-Heat Cooking\n\nPerfect for searing, grilling, and roasting with its high smoke point\n\n[Salad Dressings]\nCold use\n\n#### Salad Dressings\n\nMild flavor enhances without overpowering delicate ingredients\n\n[Baking & Pastries]\n180-200\u00b0C\n\n#### Baking & Pastries\n\nCreates moist, tender textures in cakes and pastries\n\n### Health & Wellness\n\n[Heart Health]\n70-80% MUFA\n\n#### Heart Health\n\nRich in monounsaturated fats that support cardiovascular health\n\n[Nutrient Absorption]\n4x Better\n\n#### Nutrient Absorption\n\nEnhances absorption of fat-soluble vitamins A, D, E, K\n\n[Anti-Inflammatory]\nNatural\n\n#### Anti-Inflammatory\n\nContains oleic acid with natural anti-inflammatory properties\n\n### Beauty & Skincare\n\n[Skin Moisturizer]\nDeep Hydration\n\n#### Skin Moisturizer\n\nDeep penetrating oil that nourishes and hydrates skin\n\n[Hair Treatment]\nStrengthening\n\n#### Hair Treatment\n\nStrengthens and adds shine to damaged or dry hair\n\n[Anti-Aging]\nAntioxidant Rich\n\n#### Anti-Aging\n\nRich in antioxidants that help protect against free radicals\n\n[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][5]\n\nPremium avocado oil from Kenya's finest orchards. Committed to quality, sustainability, and\nsupporting local farmers.\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n+254 (0) 720 721 390\n[[email protected]][6]\n\n### Company\n* [About][7]\n* [Quality][8]\n* [Sustainability][9]\n\n### Business\n* [Products][10]\n* [Export][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n\n### Support\n* [Resources][13]\n* [Contact][14]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Brentwood Avo Limited. All rights reserved.\n\n[Facebook][15][Twitter][16][Instagram][17][LinkedIn][18]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /quote\n[4]: /contact\n[5]: /\n[6]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[7]: /about\n[8]: /quality\n[9]: /sustainability\n[10]: /products\n[11]: /export\n[12]: /quote\n[13]: /resources\n[14]: /contact\n[15]: #\n[16]: #\n[17]: #\n[18]: #"
