            "text": "Search products...\n[ [company logo] ][1]\n[\n\n# Exim Enterprise\n\n][2]\n[Surat, Gujarat][3]\n\n**GST** 24AAFFE6912L1ZD\n\n**TrustSeal** Verified\n* [Lemongrass Essential Oil] [\n  \n  ## Lemongrass Essential Oil\n  \n  ### Rs 1,500\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n  \n  Get Best Price\n  ][4]\n* [\n  \n  ## Apricot Essential Oil\n  \n  ### Rs 600\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n  \n  Get Best Price\n  ][5]\n* [\n  \n  ## Lemongrass Essential Oil\n  \n  ### Rs 1,790\u00a0/\u00a0Litre\n  \n  Get Best Price\n  ][6]\n* [\n  \n  ## Eucalyptus Essential Oil\n  \n  ### Rs 850\u00a0/\u00a0Litre\n  \n  Get Best Price\n  ][7]\n* [\n  \n  ## Palmarosa Essential Oil\n  \n  ### Rs 4,200\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n  \n  Get Best Price\n  ][8]\n* [\n  \n  ## Organic Orange Oil\n  \n  ### Rs 2,200\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n  \n  Get Best Price\n  ][9]\n* [\n  \n  ## Jasmin Essential Oil\n  \n  ### Rs 1,850\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n  \n  Get Best Price\n  ][10]\n* [\n  \n  ## Black Pepper Oil - CO2 Extracted\n  \n  ### Rs 7,400\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n  \n  Get Best Price\n  ][11]\n\n## [Essential Oil And Organic Oil][12]\n\n### [Essential Oil][13]\n\n[View All][14]\n[ [Essential Oil] ][15]\n\n## [Apricot Essential Oil][16]\n\n[\n\nRs 600\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Packaging Size: 25 kg\n* Purity: 100% Pure\n\n][17]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n[ [Essential Oil] ][18]\n\n## [Lemongrass Essential Oil][19]\n\n[\n\nRs 1,790\u00a0/\u00a0Litre\n* Packaging Type: Bottle\n* Usage/Application: Cosmetic\n\n][20]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n### [Organic Oil][21]\n\n[View All][22]\n[ [Organic Oil] ][23]\n\n## [Organic Orange Oil][24]\n\n[\n\nRs 2,200\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Purity: 100% Pure\n* Usage/Application: Cosmetic\n\n][25]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n[ [Organic Oil] ][26]\n\n## [Tulsi Essential Oil][27]\n\n[\n\nRs 1,500\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Purity: 100% Pure\n* Extraction Method: Steam Distillation\n\n][28]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n### [Spices Oil][29]\n\n[View All][30]\n[ [Spices Oil] ][31]\n\n## [Black Pepper Oil - CO2 Extracted][32]\n\n[\n\nRs 7,400\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Packaging Size: 1 L\n* Purity: 100% Pure\n\n][33]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n[ [Spices Oil] ][34]\n\n## [Turmeric Essential Oil - Co2 Extracted][35]\n\n[\n\nRs 2,600\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Packaging Size: 1 L\n* Purity: 100% Pure\n\n][36]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n### [Oleoresins][37]\n\n[View All][38]\n[ [Oleoresins] ][39]\n\n## [Capsicum Oleoresin - CO2][40]\n\n[\n\nRs 3,200\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Grade: Co2 Extracted\n* Shelf Life: 02 Years\n\n][41]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n[ [Oleoresins] ][42]\n\n## [Turmeric Oleoresin -Curcuma longa][43]\n\n[\n\nRs 4,200\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Packaging Size: 25 kg\n* Form: viscous liquid\n\n][44]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n### [Natural Essential Oil][45]\n\n[View All][46]\n[ [Natural Essential Oil] ][47]\n\n## [Lemongrass Essential Oil][48]\n\n[\n\nRs 1,500\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Packaging Size: 1 Kg\n* Purity: 100% Pure\n\n][49]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n[ [Natural Essential Oil] ][50]\n\n## [Jasmin Essential Oil][51]\n\n[\n\nRs 1,850\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Packaging Size: 1 Kg\n* Purity: 100% Pure\n\n][52]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n### [Essential Oils][53]\n\n[View All][54]\n[ [Essential Oils] ][55]\n\n## [Jojoba Carrier Oil][56]\n\n[\n\nRs 1,500\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Purity: 100% Pure\n* Packaging Size: 25 Kg\n\n][57]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n[ [Essential Oils] ][58]\n\n## [Aromatherapy Essential Oil][59]\n\n[\n\nRs 1,100\u00a0/\u00a0Kg\n* Packaging Size: 1- 25 kg\n* Packaging Type: Drum\n\n][60]\n\nGet Best Price\n\n[View All Categories][61]\n\n## [Product Videos][62]\n\n[Lemongrass Essential Oil]\n[\n\n## Lemongrass Essential Oil\n\n][63]\n\nGet Best Quote\n\n## [About Us][64]\n\nWe \"**Exim Enterprise**\" are a **Wholesaler, Exporter and Retailer** of **Essential Oil, Organic\nOil, Aloe Vera Gel, Cold Pressed Coconut Oil, Rose Water, Avocado Oil, etc.**\n* Nature of BusinessManufacturer\n* GST Registration Date01-07-2017\n* Legal Status of FirmPartnership\n* GST No.24AAFFE6912L1ZD\n\nBack\n\n\nPrice Unit\n[Details ][65]\n* [SMS][66]\n* [Email][67]\n* [Call Us][68]\n* [07949222288][69]\n* Ajay Gajera (Partner)\n* Exim Enterprise\n  2nd Floor, Plot No. 35, Shakti Industries, Laskana Kholwad Road, Sr. No. 153,154,155,156,157,\n  Block No. 159, Old Block No.133, Surat - 395010, Gujarat, India [ Get Directions ][70]\n* [Home][71]\n* [About Us][72]\n* [Photos][73]\n* [Our Product Range][74]\n* [Contact Us][75]\n* [Sitemap][76]\n* Share via\n\n\u00a9 Exim Enterprise\n\n[[im Logo]][77]\n[ [company logo] ][78]\n\n[Exim Enterprise ][79]\n* [Home][80]\n* [ About Us][81]\n  * [About Us][82]\n  * [Testimonial][83]\n* [Photos][84]\n* [ Our Product Range ][85]\n  * [Essential Oil][86]\n  * [Organic Oil][87]\n  * [Spices Oil][88]\n  * [Oleoresins][89]\n  * [Natural Essential Oil][90]\n  * [Essential Oils][91]\n  * [Palmarosa Oil][92]\n  * [Neem Oil][93]\n  * [Cold Pressed Coconut Oil][94]\n  * [Coconut Oil][95]\n  * [Rose Water][96]\n  * [Avocado Oil][97]\n  * [Aloe Vera Gel][98]\n  * [New Items][99]\n* [Contact Us][100]\n* [Sitemap][101]\n* [Call Us][102]\n\n[File Icon] Get Quote\n* [ Home ][103]\n* Profile\n* Our Range\n* [ Contact Us ][104]\n* [ Call Us ][105]\n\n[1]: #\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://maps.google.com?q=21.25565000,72.92617000\n[4]: enquiry.html\n[5]: enquiry.html\n[6]: enquiry.html\n[7]: enquiry.html\n[8]: enquiry.html\n[9]: enquiry.html\n[10]: enquiry.html\n[11]: enquiry.html\n[12]: essential-oil-and-organic-oil.html\n[13]: essential-oil.html\n[14]: essential-oil.html\n[15]: essential-oil.html#apricot-essential-oil22881593748\n[16]: essential-oil.html#apricot-essential-oil22881593748\n[17]: essential-oil.html#apricot-essential-oil22881593748\n[18]: essential-oil.html#lemongrass-essential-oil22881554633\n[19]: essential-oil.html#lemongrass-essential-oil22881554633\n[20]: essential-oil.html#lemongrass-essential-oil22881554633\n[21]: organic-oil.html\n[22]: organic-oil.html\n[23]: organic-oil.html#organic-orange-oil22881569697\n[24]: organic-oil.html#organic-orange-oil22881569697\n[25]: organic-oil.html#organic-orange-oil22881569697\n[26]: organic-oil.html