          {
            "url": "https://industrytoday.co.uk",
            "text": "Industry Today\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nThe leading B2B Content publishing platform\n\nContact Us\n\nFurther information or support\n\nServices\n\nPR Content Publishing\n\nShare across 30+ relevant Industries\n\nMarket Research\n\nTake advantage of a wealth of insight\n\nIndustry Directory\n\nSearch our network\n\nNews\n\nPricing\n\nContact\n\nIndustry Directory\n\nLog in\nSign up\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nContact Us\n\nServices\n\nPR Content Publishing\n\nMarket Research\n\nIndustry Directory\n\nNews\n\nPricing\n\nContact\n\nIndustry Directory\n\nLog in\n\nSign up\n\nCreate | Optimise | Publish | Syndicate\n\nPress Release Syndication Service\n\nUtilize our expansive syndication network to share your news around the world, engaging audiences with a mix of text, images, and video. Perfect for businesses looking to reach global audiences. PR and Market Research Report Distribution: Share your insights with the world through our robust market report distribution service. Industry Today enables your content to reach key players and larger audiences across all industries and regions.\n\nRequest publishing package options\n\nSign up for our newsletter\n\nRapid news syndication across multiple channels\n\nNews published on Industry Today is syndicated via publishing partners, email distribution, RSS and social media as well as featuring in your own customised news room\n\nPublishing packages to suit all budgets and syndication requirements\n\nWe have the right package for you whether you are an SME, a large marketing agency with multiple clients or a market research reports publisher with multiple reports to share\n\nContact Us\n\nWho is it for?\n\nIndustry Today provides market research companies, agencies and PR teams with a syndication platform for all of their digital content. If you are a PR agency, use Industry Today to gain rapid coverage for all of your clients! If you are the marketing executive within an organisation, Industry Today provides you with an agency level distribution platform at a fraction of the budget!\nGet Started\n\nHow it works\n\nIndustry Today syndicates multimedia content to a network of subscribers from media outlets including editors, journalists, analysts, bloggers and industry professionals, increasing the visibility and reach of your news announcement.\n\nRequest information on our syndication packages\n\nSelect from our range of publishing options\n\nSign up securely via Stripe\n\nCredits are immediately available\n\nStart submitting your content\n\nSubmit your content for rapid publication and distribution\n\nRequest information on our syndication packages\n\nSelect from our range of publishing options\n\nSign up securely via Stripe\n\nCredits are immediately available\n\nStart submitting your content\n\nSubmit your content for rapid publication and distribution\n\nStart Now\n\nDirect to your inbox\n\nSign up for our newsletter with the latest insights, analysis and more\n\nContinue\n\nTrusted by media publishers across the globe\n\nStart publishing news from your industry TODAY!\n\n400k+\n\nPublished News items\n\n30+\n\nIndustry Specific News Portals\n\n30,000+\n\nPublishers\n\nLoved by businesses worldwide\n\nIndustry Today is a global press release syndication platform, trusted by business across the globe\n\nIndustry Today has been a fantastic press release partner for SRI Consulting Group Ltd. As a firm delivering actionable market intelligence and consulting across 50+ industries, we need reach, reliability, and speed\u2014Katie and the team delivered all three. From transparent, value-driven pricing to proactive guidance on headlines, targeting, and timing, the experience was seamless. Distribution was strong globally, reporting was clear, and the turnaround consistently exceeded expectations. Katie\u2019s responsiveness and practical advice helped us amplify key announcements and convert attention into qualified inquiries. We highly recommend Industry Today\u2014and especially Katie\u2014for anyone seeking credible amplification and measurable ROI from their press communications.\n\nRohit B\n\nSRI Consulting Group Ltd\n\nWe highly recommend Industry Today as a reports publishing platform. We began using the service after taking up an introductory offer and through one of our reports synopsis published in the first week, we sold 14 reports @ $4995 each. This is just one of the thousand reports we published on Industry Today. We can honestly say, it is the most cost-effective platform we have come across for publishing our reports and we are delighted with the ROI.\nSince completing our first month of publishing, we have increased our publishing package credits significantly and Industry Today is now a fundamental part of our business.\n\nAnil P\n\nBusiness Development\n\nIndustry Today has provided us with a cost-effective publishing space for all our research reports for the last 2 years. We have several members of our team submitting research reports through Industry Today at any one time. We are able to gain exposure and publish hundreds of reports each day and we have seen a huge increase in interest for our reports as well as traffic to our website. We have tried a number of services but this has give us the best ROI by far.\n\nAbhishek B - Integral MR\n\nCEO\n\nWe have been using Industry Today since it began in 2009. We publish all types of content for our clients from press releases to video, this is the digital content publishing platform that suits our budget and meets all of our publishing requirements!\n\nLilly Sanderson - RedEmber\n\nDirector\n\nI have been using Industry Today PR service for a long period, and it has helped us to get excellent visibility all around the globe, especially for the UK, EU, and APAC regions. Their assistance and customer support are great and pricing is very competitive. It's a great platform for any market research organization to share updates regarding their syndicate reports. Best wishes to Katie and her team.\n\nSaurabh Kumar Sinha, WGR\n\nVice President\n\nwww.industrytoday.co.uk has been a mainstay of our PR strategy for clients since it launched and it remains one of the most successful online portals we use, if not THE most successful. Not only is it obviously thoroughly loved by the search engines, it is also extremely user-friendly. That combination of ease of use (backed up by excellent customer service) and delivery of results is not always easy to achieve. With Industry Today, it is.\n\nTracy Twitchin, TLCPR\n\nManaging Director\n\nIndustry Today has been a fantastic press release partner for SRI Consulting Group Ltd. As a firm delivering actionable market intelligence and consulting across 50+ industries, we need reach, reliability, and speed\u2014Katie and the team delivered all three. From transparent, value-driven pricing to proactive guidance on headlines, targeting, and timing, the experience was seamless. Distribution was strong globally, reporting was clear, and the turnaround consistently exceeded expectations. Katie\u2019s responsiveness and practical advice helped us amplify key announcements and convert attention into qualified inquiries. We highly recommend Industry Today\u2014and especially Katie\u2014for anyone seeking credible amplification and measurable ROI from their press communications.\n\nRohit B\n\nSRI Consulting Group Ltd\n\nWe highly recommend Industry Today as a reports publishing platform. We began using the service after taking up an introductory offer and through one of our reports synopsis published in the first week, we sold 14 reports @ $4995 each. This is just one of the thousand reports we published on Industry Today. We can honestly say, it is the most cost-effective platform we have come across for publishing our reports and we are delighted with the ROI.\nSince completing our first month of publishing, we have increased our publishing package credits significantly and Industry Today is now a fundamental part of our business.\n\nAnil P\n\nBusiness Development\n\nIndustry Today has provided us with a cost-effective publishing space for all our research reports for the last 2 years. We have several members of our team submitting research reports through Industry Today at any one time. We are able to gain exposure and publish hundreds of reports each day and we have seen a huge increase in interest for our reports as well as traffic to our website. We have tried a number of services but this has give us the best ROI by far.\n\nAbhishek B - Integral MR\n\nCEO\n\nWe have been using Industry Today since it began in 2009. We publish all types of content for our clients from press releases to video, this is the digital content publishing platform that suits our budget and meets all of our publishing requirements!\n\nLilly Sanderson - RedEmber\n\nDirector\n\nI have been using Industry Today PR service for a long period, and it has helped us to get excellent visibility all around the globe, especially for the UK, EU, and APAC regions. Their assistance and customer support are great and pricing is very competitive. It's a great platform for any market research organization to share updates regarding their syndicate reports. Best wishes to Katie and her team.\n\nSaurabh Kumar Sinha, WGR\n\nVice President\n\nwww.industrytoday.co.uk has been a mainstay of our PR strategy for clients since it launched and it remains one of the most successful online portals we use, if not THE most successful. Not only is it obviously thoroughly loved by the search engines, it is also extremely user-friendly. That combination of ease of use (backed up by excellent customer service) and delivery of results is not always easy to achieve. With Industry Today, it is.\n\nTracy Twitchin, TLCPR\n\nManaging Director\n\nReady to start publishing\n\nSign Up today!\n\nGet Started\n\nLearn More\n\nA B2B Content publishing and distribution platform allowing users to\nshare\ncontent\nacross 30+\nrelevant\nIndustries as and when it happens. We publish news Monday to Friday, 9am-5pm and all news\nitems\nare\npublished within 24 hours.\n\nUseful\n\nNews\n\nIndustry Directory\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nContact\n\nLegal\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms & Conditions\n\n&#169; 2026 Industry Today. All rights reserved |\nRegistered office: Warwick\nBusiness Centre Hawkes Drive, Heathcote Industrial\nEstate, Warwick, England,\nCV34 6LX | support@industrytoday.co.uk\n\nCookies\n\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing\nexperience, analyse site traffic and serve\ntailored advertisements. By continuing to browse or closing this banner, you consent to our\nuse\nof cookies. Read more about how we use cookies and how you can control them by clicking\n\u201cCookie\nSettings.\"\n\nReject\nAccept Cookies\n\nAre you sure? This will redirect you away from\nthe\nsite\n\nCookies are essential for this site to function.\n\nReject and leave\nAccept Cookies"
