            "url": "https://industrytoday.co.uk/about-us",
            "text": "[ [Industry Today Logo] ][1]\n* [ Company ][2]\n* [\n\n##### About Us\n\nThe leading B2B Content publishing platform\n\n][3]\n* [\n\n##### Contact Us\n\nFurther information or support\n\n][4]\n* [ Services ][5]\n* [\n\n##### PR Content Publishing\n\nShare across 30+ relevant Industries\n\n][6]\n* [\n\n##### Market Research\n\nTake advantage of a wealth of insight\n\n][7]\n* [\n\n##### Industry Directory\n\nSearch our network\n\n][8]\n* [ News ][9]\n* [ Pricing ][10]\n* [ Contact ][11]\n* [ Industry Directory ][12]\n[Log in][13] [Sign up][14]\n[Industry Today Logo]\n* Company\n* * [\n\nAbout Us\n\n][15]\n* [\n\nContact Us\n\n][16]\n* Services\n* * [\n\nPR Content Publishing\n\n][17]\n* [\n\nMarket Research\n\n][18]\n* [\n\nIndustry Directory\n\n][19]\n* [\n\nNews\n\n][20]\n* [\n\nPricing\n\n][21]\n* [\n\nContact\n\n][22]\n* [\n\nIndustry Directory\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nLog in\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nSign up\n\n][25]\n\n## About Us\n\nIndustry Today is a Market Research Reports and press release syndication platform that spans all\nsectors. There are various news distribution services available however none offer the diversity of\ndigital content quite like Industry Today...\n\nIf you are a Market Research company or a PR & Marketing consultancy publishing and distributing\ncontent on behalf of the client or you are the Marketing Professional within your company and need\nto get your content in front of relevant audiences, Industry Today offers you the chance to do so\nwithout breaking the budget!\n\nIndustry Today is a B2B Content publishing and distribution platform allowing users to share content\nacross 30+ relevant Industries as and when it happens.\n\nAll news articles published on Industry Today are distributed via various publishing partners and\nchannels including Google News, RSS, email and across the major social networks.\n\nWe offer a range of publishing packages designed to suit all budgets depending upon the level of\ncoverage you require. We also offer bespoke publishing packages for more bespoke requirements. To\nfind out more about the bespoke options available, contact the team today!\n\n## [Contact us to become the latest publisher from your industry TODAY!][26]\n\n## Frequently asked questions\n\nWhere will my news be distributed\n\nIndustry Today works with a broad range of distribution partners and publishing channels.\nAdditionally, we are constantly growing our distribution networks to share all content through RSS\nsyndication, email and social media. The site is developed in-line with the requirements of various\nnews publishing platforms such as Google News, Bing News, Yahoo News and more. All news is shared\nvia all of our distribution channels and to 11million+ subscribers.\n\nHow long does it take for my news to be published?\n\nWe publish all content within 24 hours, Monday to Friday 9am-5pm GMT. If you submit content outside\nof these times but would like us to publish, you can reach our team by submitting a request via our\nContact page.\n\nWhat is the word limit for a press release?\n\nWe don't impose a word limit but we do recommend you keep your news short and punchy enough to\nretain the interest of our readers! The recommendation for press releases is between 300-500 words\n\nHow many press releases can I publish per month\n\nWe have a range of publishing packages to suit all requirements. Whether you have 1 press release\nper month or 1000, we have packages to suit your needs! For more information, visit our pricing page\n\nShare your story with Industry Today\n\nDownload our media information\n\n[ Start Publishing ][27] Download\n\n### Subscribe\n\n[Close nav]\n\n## Download our media information\n\n* indicates required\nEmail Address *\nFirst Name\nLast Name\n**Types of subscriber **\n* Journalist\n* Subscriber\n* Current customer\nMarketing Permissions\n\nIndustry Today Media Ltd will use the information you provide on this form to be in touch with you\nand to provide updates and marketing. Please let us know all the ways you would like to hear from\nus:\n\nEmail Direct Mail Customized online advertising\n\nYou can change your mind at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in the footer of any email you\nreceive from us, or by contacting us at support@industrytoday.co.uk. We will treat your information\nwith respect. For more information about our privacy practices please visit our website. By clicking\nbelow, you agree that we may process your information in accordance with these terms.\n\nWe use Mailchimp as our marketing platform. By clicking below to subscribe, you acknowledge that\nyour information will be transferred to Mailchimp for processing. [Learn more about Mailchimp's\nprivacy practices here.][28]\n\n## Trusted by media publishers across the globe\n\nStart publishing news from your industry TODAY!\n\n400k+\n\nPublished News items\n\n30+\n\nIndustry Specific News Portals\n\n30,000+\n\nPublishers\n\n[Industry Today Logo]\n\nA B2B Content publishing and distribution platform allowing users to share content across 30+\nrelevant Industries as and when it happens. We publish news Monday to Friday, 9am-5pm and all news\nitems are published within 24 hours.\n\nUseful\n* [ News ][29]\n* [ Industry Directory ][30]\n\nCompany\n* [ About Us ][31]\n* [ Contact ][32]\n\nLegal\n* [ Privacy Policy ][33]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][34]\n* [[Facebook icon]][35]\n* [[Linkdin icon]][36]\n* [ [Twitter icon] ][37]\n* [ [Instagram icon] ][38]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Industry Today. All rights reserved | Registered office: Warwick Business Centre Hawkes\nDrive, Heathcote Industrial Estate, Warwick, England, CV34 6LX | [support@industrytoday.co.uk][39]\n\n##### Cookies\n\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, analyse site traffic and serve tailored\nadvertisements. By continuing to browse or closing this banner, you consent to our use of cookies.\nRead more about how we use cookies and how you can control them by clicking \u201cCookie Settings.\"\n\n[Reject][40] [Accept Cookies][41]\n\n**Are you sure? This will redirect you away from the site**\n\nCookies are essential for this site to function.\n\n[Reject and leave][42] [Accept Cookies][43]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/about-us\n[4]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/contact\n[5]: #\n[6]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/pr-content-publishing\n[7]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/market-research\n[8]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/industry-directory-service\n[9]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/news\n[10]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/pricing\n[11]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/contact\n[12]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/industry-directory\n[13]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/login\n[14]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/pricing\n[15]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/about-us\n[16]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/contact\n[17]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/pr-content-publishing\n[18]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/market-research\n[19]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/industry-directory-service\n[20]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/news\n[21]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/pricing\n[22]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/contact\n[23]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/industry-directory\n[24]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/login\n[25]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/pricing\n[26]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/contact\n[27]: /pricing\n[28]: https://mailchimp.com/legal/terms\n[29]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/news\n[30]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/industry-directory\n[31]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/about-us\n[32]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/contact\n[33]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/privacy-policy\n[34]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/terms-conditions\n[35]: https://www.facebook.com/industrytoday.co.uk/\n[36]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/740868/admin/\n[37]: https://twitter.com/industrytoday\n[38]: https://www.instagram.com/industrytodaymedia/\n[39]: mailto:support@industrytoday.co.uk\n[40]: javascript://\n[41]: #\n[42]: https://google.com\n[43]: #"
