            "text": "[ [Industry Today Logo] ][1]\n* [ Company ][2]\n* [\n\n##### About Us\n\nThe leading B2B Content publishing platform\n\n][3]\n* [\n\n##### Contact Us\n\nFurther information or support\n\n][4]\n* [ Services ][5]\n* [\n\n##### PR Content Publishing\n\nShare across 30+ relevant Industries\n\n][6]\n* [\n\n##### Market Research\n\nTake advantage of a wealth of insight\n\n][7]\n* [\n\n##### Industry Directory\n\nSearch our network\n\n][8]\n* [ News ][9]\n* [ Pricing ][10]\n* [ Contact ][11]\n* [ Industry Directory ][12]\n[Log in][13] [Sign up][14]\n[Industry Today Logo]\n* Company\n* * [\n\nAbout Us\n\n][15]\n* [\n\nContact Us\n\n][16]\n* Services\n* * [\n\nPR Content Publishing\n\n][17]\n* [\n\nMarket Research\n\n][18]\n* [\n\nIndustry Directory\n\n][19]\n* [\n\nNews\n\n][20]\n* [\n\nPricing\n\n][21]\n* [\n\nContact\n\n][22]\n* [\n\nIndustry Directory\n\n][23]\n* [\n\nLog in\n\n][24]\n* [\n\nSign up\n\n][25]\n\n# Pricing Plans\n\nChoose from our range of press release syndication packages that have been designed with all\npublishing requirements and budgets in mind. We also offer bespoke packages if you have larger\npublishing requirements! Contact us for more information\n\n### Starter\n\nPublish 1-10 credits per month. These packages are perfect for smaller companies and in-house\nmarketing teams (*prices are ex-VAT)\n\nfrom \u00a346\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPR Credits\u2502Pricing\u2502Unit\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1 \u2502\u00a346 \u2502\u00a346\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ Sign Up ][26]\n\n#### What's included\n* [Check mark] Your publishing credits\n* [Check mark] 1 user\n* [Check mark] Directory Listing\n\nMost popular\n\n### Professional\n\n10 publishing credits for just \u00a320 each (price excludes VAT). Credits can be used over 12 months for\nthis package\n\nfrom \u00a3200\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPR Credits\u2502Pricing\u2502Unit\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n10 \u2502\u00a3200 \u2502\u00a320\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n100 \u2502\u00a3200 \u2502\u00a32\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ Sign Up ][27]\n\n#### What's included\n* [Check mark] Your publishing credits\n* [Check mark] 3 users\n* [Check mark] Directory Listing\n\n### Enterprise\n\nAnnual subscription includes 365 credits that can be used over 12 months. We also offer packages up\nto 5000 credits for those with larger publishing needs. Contact us for bespoke packages\n\nfrom \u00a3365\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPR Credits\u2502Pricing\u2502Unit\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n365 \u2502\u00a3365 \u2502\u00a31.00\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n[ Sign Up ][28]\n\n#### What's included\n* [Check mark] Your publishing credits\n* [Check mark] 4 users\n* [Check mark] Directory Listing\n\n## Frequently asked questions\n\nWhere will my news be distributed\n\nIndustry Today works with a broad range of distribution partners and publishing channels.\nAdditionally, we are constantly growing our distribution networks to share all content through RSS\nsyndication, email and social media. The site is developed in-line with the requirements of various\nnews publishing platforms such as Google News, Bing News, Yahoo News and more. All news is shared\nvia all of our distribution channels and to 11million+ subscribers.\n\nHow long does it take for my news to be published?\n\nWe publish all content within 24 hours, Monday to Friday 9am-5pm GMT. If you submit content outside\nof these times but would like us to publish, you can reach our team by submitting a request via our\nContact page.\n\nWhat is the word limit for a press release?\n\nWe don't impose a word limit but we do recommend you keep your news short and punchy enough to\nretain the interest of our readers! The recommendation for press releases is between 300-500 words\n\nHow many press releases can I publish per month\n\nWe have a range of publishing packages to suit all requirements. Whether you have 1 press release\nper month or 1000, we have packages to suit your needs! For more information, visit our pricing page\n\n## Rapid news syndication across multiple channels\n\nNews published on Industry Today is syndicated via publishing partners, email distribution, RSS and\nsocial media as well as featuring in your own customised news room\n* [Newsnow.jpg]\n* [Bing.jpg]\n* [google news publisher.jpg]\n* [Yahoo.png]\n\n## Trusted by media publishers across the globe\n\nStart publishing news from your industry TODAY!\n\n400k+\n\nPublished News items\n\n30+\n\nIndustry Specific News Portals\n\n30,000+\n\nPublishers\n\n## Loved by businesses worldwide\n\nIndustry Today is a global press release syndication platform, trusted by business across the globe\n\nIndustry Today has been a fantastic press release partner for SRI Consulting Group Ltd. As a firm\ndelivering actionable market intelligence and consulting across 50+ industries, we need reach,\nreliability, and speed\u2014Katie and the team delivered all three. From transparent, value-driven\npricing to proactive guidance on headlines, targeting, and timing, the experience was seamless.\nDistribution was strong globally, reporting was clear, and the turnaround consistently exceeded\nexpectations. Katie\u2019s responsiveness and practical advice helped us amplify key announcements and\nconvert attention into qualified inquiries. We highly recommend Industry Today\u2014and especially\nKatie\u2014for anyone seeking credible amplification and measurable ROI from their press communications.\n\nRohit B\n\nSRI Consulting Group Ltd\n\nWe highly recommend Industry Today as a reports publishing platform. We began using the service\nafter taking up an introductory offer and through one of our reports synopsis published in the first\nweek, we sold 14 reports @ $4995 each. This is just one of the thousand reports we published on\nIndustry Today. We can honestly say, it is the most cost-effective platform we have come across for\npublishing our reports and we are delighted with the ROI.\n\nSince completing our first month of publishing, we have increased our publishing package credits\nsignificantly and Industry Today is now a fundamental part of our business.\n\nAnil P\n\nBusiness Development\n\nIndustry Today has provided us with a cost-effective publishing space for all our research reports\nfor the last 2 years. We have several members of our team submitting research reports through\nIndustry Today at any one time. We are able to gain exposure and publish hundreds of reports each\nday and we have seen a huge increase in interest for our reports as well as traffic to our website.\nWe have tried a number of services but this has give us the best ROI by far.\n\nAbhishek B - Integral MR\n\nCEO\n\nWe have been using Industry Today since it began in 2009. We publish all types of content for our\nclients from press releases to video, this is the digital content publishing platform that suits our\nbudget and meets all of our publishing requirements!\n\nLilly Sanderson - RedEmber\n\nDirector\n\nI have been using Industry Today PR service for a long period, and it has helped us to get excellent\nvisibility all around the globe, especially for the UK, EU, and APAC regions. Their assistance and\ncustomer support are great and pricing is very competitive. It's a great platform for any market\nresearch organization to share updates regarding their syndicate reports. Best wishes to Katie and\nher team.\n\nSaurabh Kumar Sinha, WGR\n\nVice President\n\n[www.industrytoday.co.uk][29] has been a mainstay of our PR strategy for clients since it launched\nand it remains one of the most successful online portals we use, if not THE most successful. Not\nonly is it obviously thoroughly loved by the search engines, it is also extremely user-friendly.\nThat combination of ease of use (backed up by excellent customer service) and delivery of results is\nnot always easy to achieve. With Industry Today, it is.\n\nTracy Twitchin, TLCPR\n\nManaging Director\n\nIndustry Today has been a fantastic press release partner for SRI Consulting Group Ltd. As a firm\ndelivering actionable market intelligence and consulting across 50+ industries, we need reach,\nreliability, and speed\u2014Katie and the team delivered all three. From transparent, value-driven\npricing to proactive guidance on headlines, targeting, and timing, the experience was seamless.\nDistribution was strong globally, reporting was clear, and the turnaround consistently exceeded\nexpectations. Katie\u2019s responsiveness and practical advice helped us amplify key announcements and\nconvert attention into qualified inquiries. We highly recommend Industry Today\u2014and especially\nKatie\u2014for anyone seeking credible amplification and measurable ROI from their press communications.\n\nRohit B\n\nSRI Consulting Group Ltd\n\nWe highly recommend Industry Today as a reports publishing platform. We began using the service\nafter taking up an introductory offer and through one of our reports synopsis published in the first\nweek, we sold 14 reports @ $4995 each. This is just one of the thousand reports we published on\nIndustry Today. We can honestly say, it is the most cost-effective platform we have come across for\npublishing our reports and we are delighted with the ROI.\n\nSince completing our first month of publishing, we have increased our publishing package credits\nsignificantly and Industry Today is now a fundamental part of our business.\n\nAnil P\n\nBusiness Development\n\nIndustry Today has provided us with a cost-effective publishing space for all our research reports\nfor the last 2 years. We have several members of our team submitting research reports through\nIndustry Today at any one time. We are able to gain exposure and publish hundreds of reports each\nday and we have seen a huge increase in interest for our reports as well as traffic to our website.\nWe have tried a number of services but this has give us the best ROI by far.\n\nAbhishek B - Integral MR\n\nCEO\n\nWe have been using Industry Today since it began in 2009. We publish all types of content for our\nclients from press releases to video, this is the digital content publishing platform that suits our\nbudget and meets all of our publishing requirements!\n\nLilly Sanderson - RedEmber\n\nDirector\n\nI have been using Industry Today PR service for a long period, and it has helped us to get excellent\nvisibility all around the globe, especially for the UK, EU, and APAC regions. Their assistance and\ncustomer support are great and pricing is very competitive. It's a great platform for any market\nresearch organization to share updates regarding their syndicate reports. Best wishes to Katie and\nher team.\n\nSaurabh Kumar Sinha, WGR\n\nVice President\n\n[www.industrytoday.co.uk][30] has been a mainstay of our PR strategy for clients since it launched\nand it remains one of the most successful online portals we use, if not THE most successful. Not\nonly is it obviously thoroughly loved by the search engines, it is also extremely user-friendly.\nThat combination of ease of use (backed up by excellent customer service) and delivery of results is\nnot always easy to achieve. With Industry Today, it is.\n\nTracy Twitchin, TLCPR\n\nManaging Director\n\nReady to start publishing\n\nSign Up today!\n\n[ Get Started ][31] [ Learn More ][32]\n[Industry Today Logo]\n\nA B2B Content publishing and distribution platform allowing users to share content across 30+\nrelevant Industries as and when it happens. We publish news Monday to Friday, 9am-5pm and all news\nitems are published within 24 hours.\n\nUseful\n* [ News ][33]\n* [ Industry Directory ][34]\n\nCompany\n* [ About Us ][35]\n* [ Contact ][36]\n\nLegal\n* [ Privacy Policy ][37]\n* [ Terms & Conditions ][38]\n* [[Facebook icon]][39]\n* [[Linkdin icon]][40]\n* [ [Twitter icon] ][41]\n* [ [Instagram icon] ][42]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Industry Today. All rights reserved | Registered office: Warwick Business Centre Hawkes\nDrive, Heathcote Industrial Estate, Warwick, England, CV34 6LX | [support@industrytoday.co.uk][43]\n\n##### Cookies\n\nWe use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, analyse site traffic and serve tailored\nadvertisements. By continuing to browse or closing this banner, you consent to our use of cookies.\nRead more about how we use cookies and how you can control them by clicking \u201cCookie Settings.\"\n\n[Reject][44] [Accept Cookies][45]\n\n**Are you sure? This will redirect you away from the site**\n\nCookies are essential for this site to function.\n\n[Reject and leave][46] [Accept Cookies][47]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://industrytoday.co.uk/about"
