ice Oils, Carrier\nOils, Pine and Terpine Products such as** Camphor Oil, Black Pepper Oil, Pomegranate Seed Oil**,\netc. Our huge collection is appreciated by customers for quality excellence.\u00a0\n\nOur 100% pure and effective oils are demanded in Indian and International market for effective use\nand reliable results. From food to cosmetics, pharmaceutical, aromatherapy centres and more, our\ncollection finds used in various industries.\n\n**Men Behind Successful Business Operations**\n\n**Mr. Vijay Kalsaria **is the Proprietor of the company, skilled in handling diverse business tasks.\nHis entrepreneurship skills and right approach to serving clients is the main reason of company\ngetting appreciation from local and foreign buyers. Along with Mr. Kalsaria, **Dr. Paresh Kahar **is\nleading the company as a Technical Expert.\u00a0\n\n**Our Clients**\n\nOur company is maintaining relations with industry leading names like:\n\n* KANCOR Ingredients Limited\n* Plant Lipids\n* Synthite and more.\n\n\n[ Read More][118]\n\nGST : 24AIEPK8429K1Z0\n[Send Inquiry][119]\n[[send inq]Send Inquiry][120]\n\n\n## Quick Links\n* [Home Page][121]\n* [Company Profile][122]\n* [ Our Products ][123]\n* [Contact Us][124]\n* [Sitemap][125]\n\n## Our Products\n* [Essential Oil][126]\n* [Carrier Oil][127]\n* [Spices Oil][128]\n* [Pine And Terpine Products][129]\n* [[trusted seller]][130]\n\n[map]\nPlot No. - U-22, Mahalaxmi Market, Near Old Udhna Petrol Pump, Surat - 394210, Gujarat, India\nView More branchs\n[people]\n**Mr Vijay Kalsaria K.K. (Proprietor) **\n**Mobile :**07971549238\n[[Send Inquiry] Send Inquiry][131] [[Send SMS]Send SMS][132]\n[[logo]][133]\nK. K. ENTERPRISE All Rights Reserved.[(Terms of Use)][134]\nDeveloped and Managed by [Infocom Network Private Limited.][135]\n\u2715\nContact Us\n[Get Quotation][136] [Get Price List][137] [Discuss Requirement][138]\nTell us your requirement\n\n\nMobile number\n\nMobile No. is needed for Inquiry.\n\nEmail\n\nEmail id is needed for