g Soon][70]\n* [View All][71]\n* [Best Sellers][72]\n* [Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][73]\n* [Whipped Body Butter][74]\n* [Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][75]\n* [Meadowfoam & Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][76]\n* [Calendula Body Wash][77]\n* [Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][78]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][79]\n\n[**Learn More**][80]\n* Scents\n* [By Category][81]\n* [Fragrance Oils][82]\n* [Essential Oils][83]\n* [View All][84]\n* [Best Sellers][85]\n* [Sandalwood Eucalyptus][86]\n* [Lemon Verbena][87]\n* [Cashmere Blush][88]\n* [Summer Spritz][89]\n* [Sweet Orange Essential Oil][90]\n* [Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][91]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][92]\n\n[**Learn More**][93]\n* Resources\n* [About Us][94]\n* [How It Works][95]\n* [Clean Beauty][96]\n* [Mixing Manual][97]\n* [Ingredient Lists][98]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][99]\n* [Blog][100]\n* [FAQs][101]\n* [Contact Us][102]\n* [Private Label][103]\n* [ Search][104]\n* [ Cart ][105]\nClose\n* Skin Care\n* Hair Care\n* Bath & Body\n* Scents\n* Resources\n* [Private Label][106]\nLogin\nSkin Care\n* By Category\n[Cleansers][107][Toners & Mists][108][Serums & Oils][109][Moisturizers][110][Eye\nTreatments][111][Masks][112][New Formulas][113][Coming Soon][114][View All][115]\n* By Result\n[Hydrating][116][Brightening][117][Smooth & Firm][118][Barrier Repair][119][Clear\nSkin][120][Plumping][121]\n* By Focus\n[Professional Grade][122][Plant Powered][123][Vegan][124][Sensitive Skin][125][Antioxidant\nSupport][126][Trending][127][For Men][128]\n* By Ingredient\n[Vitamin C][129][Hyaluronic\nAcid][130][Peptides][131][Niacinamide][132][Ceramides][133][Retinol][134][Ingredient\nGlossary][135]\n* Best Sellers\n[Vitamin C Serum][136][Niacinamide & HA Water Cream][137][Kale Protein Facial\nCleanser][138][Niacinamide Vita Mist Toner][139][Niacinamide Complexion Prep Serum][140][Advanced\nFirming Eye Cream][141]\n\n[*NEW!*** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING RECOVERY CREAM**][142]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][143]\n\nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Complexion Renewal Dry Oil]\n[Complexion Renewal Dry Oil]\n[Complexion Renewal Dry Oil]\n[Complexion Renewal Dry Oil]\n[Complexion Renewal Dry Oil]\n[Complexion Renewal Dry Oil] [Complexion Renewal Dry Oil] [Complexion Renewal Dry Oil] [Complexion\nRenewal Dry Oil] [Complexion Renewal Dry Oil]\n\n# Complexion Renewal Dry Oil\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk skincare sizes, our **Complexion Renewal Dry Oil **is a lightweight,\nfast-absorbing facial oil designed to deliver deep nourishment, visible radiance, and a smooth,\nluminous finish without heaviness.\n\nFormulated with a carefully balanced blend of **sunflower seed, rice bran, rosehip, argan, and sea\nbuckthorn oils**, this advanced dry oil provides antioxidant support and essential fatty acids to\nhelp improve skin tone, texture, and overall vitality. The result is soft, hydrated skin with a\nhealthy, renewed glow, making it ideal for daily use and professional back-bar treatments.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $53.591 gallon - $150.645 gallon - $543.25Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for formula testing, texture evaluation, and packaging compatibility assessments.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, treatment room use, small refill programs, and low-volume filling\nruns.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, growing skincare brands, recurring fulfillment, and professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume refills, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling serum production while\nimproving manufacturing efficiency.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities. ***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Complexion Renewal Dry Oil** helps nourish, protect, and revitalize the skin, making it a\nversatile essential for daily skincare routines and professional facial services. **It addresses:**\n* Dullness and lack of radiance\n* Uneven tone and rough texture\n* Dryness and moisture imbalance\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Enhance natural radiance for a smooth, luminous complexion\n* Deliver lightweight hydration with fast-absorbing botanical oils\n* Support the skin barrier with essential fatty acids\n* Provide antioxidant protection against environmental stressors\n* Improve skin softness, comfort, and overall appearance\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **All skin types, especially those seeking lightweight nourishment, enhanced\nradiance, and improved skin smoothness.\n\nLightly pat and press several drops all over face in an upward motion, avoiding the immediate eye\narea. Use after serum and moisturizer and before daily sun protection. Appropriate for regular,\ndaily use.\n\n**For professional use: **Facial massage, finishing oil, post-mask application, or incorporation\ninto customized skincare protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Organic Sunflower Seed Oil:**][197] A lightweight, nutrient-rich oil high in linoleic acid and\nvitamin E that helps support the skin barrier while delivering fast-absorbing hydration.\n\n[**Rice Bran Oil:**][198]** **A skin-conditioning oil rich in antioxidants and essential fatty acids\nthat helps improve softness, elasticity, and overall skin comfort.\n\n[**Rosehip Seed Oil:**][199]** **Known for its regenerative properties, this oil helps improve the\nappearance of uneven tone and texture while promoting a healthy-looking glow.\n\n**Organic Argan Kernel Oil: **A deeply nourishing oil rich in fatty acids and antioxidants that\nsupports skin elasticity and imparts a soft, youthful radiance.\n\n**Sea Buckthorn Fruit Oil: **A vibrant, antioxidant-rich oil that helps protect against\nenvironmental stressors while revitalizing dull, tired-looking skin.\n\n[**Vitamin E (Tocopherol):**][200]** **A powerful antioxidant that helps protect the skin from\noxidative stress while supporting formula stability.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32 oz, 1 gallon, and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis facial oil is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nOil-based formulations are ideal for fragrance oils as they blend seamlessly without the need for\nsolubilizers. For more information, view our DIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][201].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][202] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][203]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Complexion Renewal Dry Oil**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare\noptions.\n\nWhat makes this a dry oil?\n\nThis formula is designed to absorb quickly into the skin without leaving a greasy or heavy residue,\nproviding nourishment with a lightweight feel.\n\nCan this oil be used on oily or combination skin?\n\nYes. The lightweight, fast-absorbing oils make it suitable for most skin types when used in\nappropriate amounts.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][204][\n][205][\n][206][\n][207][\n][208]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][209]\n* [Hair Care][210]\n* [Bath & Body][211]\n* [Scents][212]\n* [Resources][213]\n* [Private Label][214]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][215]\n* [Refund Policy][216]\n* [Shipping Policy][217]\n* [Terms of Service][218]\n* [Wholesale Terms][219]\n* [FAQs][220]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][221]\n* [orders@pravada.com][222]\n* [(239) 260-9826][223]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive u"
