nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum]\n[Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum]\n[Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum]\n[Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum]\n[Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum]\n[Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum]\n[Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum] [Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum] [Multi-Molecular\nHyaluronic Acid Serum] [Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum] [Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid\nSerum] [Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum]\n\n# Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nDelivering deep, multi-layer hydration, the **Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum **combines\n**five molecular weights of hyaluronic acid** to quench the skin at every level. This advanced\nformulation enhances suppleness, smooths fine lines, and strengthens the moisture barrier for a\nplump, radiant complexion. It layers seamlessly under masks, moisturizers, and other treatment\nserums to boost overall hydration and performance.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $86.721 gallon - $245.325 gallon - $920.90Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for formula testing, texture evaluation, and packaging compatibility assessments.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, treatment room use, small refill programs, and low-volume filling\nruns.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, growing skincare brands, recurring fulfillment, and professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume refills, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling serum production while\nimproving manufacturing efficiency.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities. ***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum** delivers advanced hydration benefits that deeply\nreplenish, plump, and smooth the skin, making it an essential step in daily routines and\nprofessional back-bar treatments. **It targets:**\n* Dehydration and moisture loss\n* Fine lines and rough texture\n* Dullness and loss of elasticity\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Restore multi-layer hydration for visibly plumper, smoother skin\n* Strengthen the skin barrier to reduce dryness and sensitivity\n* Enhance elasticity and firmness for a more youthful appearance\n* Boost the performance of active ingredients layered above or below\n* Promote a dewy, refreshed glow suitable for all skin types\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **All skin types, especially dehydrated, dry, mature, or dull skin in need of\nlayered hydration and improved suppleness.\n\nApply small amount with fingertips to freshly cleansed and toned skin. Lightly pat on the face, neck\nand d\u00e9collet\u00e9 and avoid direct contact with eyes. Allow time to absorb before moisturizer\napplication.\n\n**For professional use: **Apply during facial treatments, under masks, or as part of multi-step\nhydration protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Hyaluronic Acid Complex (5 Molecular Weights):**][197] Delivers moisture at multiple skin depths\nfor visible plumping and smoothing\n\n[**Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate (Vitamin C):**][198] Brightens and supports collagen health while\nenhancing the serum\u2019s revitalizing benefits\n\n[**Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice:**][199] Calms, soothes, and replenishes moisture\n\n[**Centella Asiatica (Gotu Kola Extract):**][200] Promotes barrier repair and firmness for\nresilient, hydrated skin\n\n[**MSM (Methylsulfonylmethane):**][201] Enhances absorption and supports smoother, more supple skin\ntexture\n\n**Formulated Without:** Parabens, sulfates, phthalates\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty-Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, and phthalates\n* pH Range: 5.00 \u2013 6.00\n* Lightweight, aqueous serum ideal for layering\n* Contains 5 molecular weights of hyaluronic acid\n* Made in the USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32 oz, 1 gallon, 5 gallon\n* For larger quantities, please contact us\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis serum base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate 20** or\n**Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2 ratio** of\nsolubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our DIY Fragrance\nMixing Manual [here][202].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][203] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][204]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nHyaluronic Acid\n\nA powerful humectant that attracts and locks in moisture for plump, hydrated skin.\n\nCentella Asiatica\n\nA botanical that helps soothe, strengthen, and repair the skin barrier while promoting firmness,\nelasticity, and a calm, healthy-looking complexion.\n\nVitamin C\n\nA brightening antioxidant that supports collagen production, enhances radiance, and helps protect\nthe skin from environmental stressors.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum**, formulation standards, and bulk\nskincare options.\n\nWhat makes this a \u201cmulti-molecular\u201d hyaluronic acid serum?\n\nIt features five molecular weights of hyaluronic acid, each targeting different layers of the skin\nto deliver comprehensive hydration.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][205][\n][206][\n][207][\n][208][\n][209]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA "
