Oil] [Noni & Tamanu Facial Oil]\n\n# Noni & Tamanu Facial Oil\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\n**Available in bulk skincare sizes**, our nourishing **Noni & Tamanu Facial Oil** is a lightweight\nbotanical treatment designed to replenish moisture, support the skin barrier, and restore a healthy,\nradiant glow. This nutrient-rich blend features tamanu oil, traditionally valued for its restorative\nproperties, alongside antioxidant-rich noni extract and a balanced base of grape seed, avocado,\njojoba, and macadamia oils.\n\nTogether, these skin-conditioning botanicals deliver essential fatty acids and antioxidants that\nhelp soften, calm, and revitalize the complexion while promoting smooth, supple, and visibly\nhealthy-looking skin.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $60.001 gallon - $170.005 gallon - $625.00Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for formula testing, texture evaluation, and packaging compatibility assessments.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, treatment room use, small refill programs, and low-volume filling\nruns.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, growing skincare brands, recurring fulfillment, and professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume refills, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling serum production while\nimproving manufacturing efficiency.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities. ***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Noni & Tamanu Facial Oil** delivers targeted nourishment and barrier support, making it ideal\nfor daily skincare routines and professional facial treatments. **It targets:**\n* Dryness and dehydration\n* Dull or tired-looking skin\n* Skin in need of nourishment and barrier support\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Deeply nourish the skin with essential fatty acids from avocado, macadamia, and tamanu oils\n* Support a healthy moisture barrier to improve softness and resilience\n* Comfort and condition stressed or compromised skin\nProvide antioxidant support with noni extract to help defend against environmental stressors\n* Enhance natural radiance for smoother, more supple-looking skin\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **All skin types, especially dry, dehydrated, or dull skin seeking added nourishment\nand barrier support.\n\nApply lightly to face, neck, d\u00e9collet\u00e9 for aging/drying skin. Can also be used with water to remove\neye makeup (rinse after using) or as a pre-shave oil.\n\n**For professional use: **Ideal for facial massage, finishing oil applications, blending with\nmoisturizers, or incorporating into customized facial treatments.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n**Tamanu Oil: **A deeply restorative botanical oil traditionally used to help calm stressed or\ncompromised skin. Rich in fatty acids and skin-supporting compounds, it helps promote smoother,\nhealthier-looking skin while supporting the skin barrier.\n\n**Noni Extract: **A potent antioxidant-rich extract derived from the tropical noni fruit. Known for\nits skin revitalizing properties, it helps support a brighter, more balanced complexion while\nprotecting against environmental stressors.\n\n**Grape Seed Oil: **A lightweight oil naturally high in linoleic acid and antioxidants. It helps\nmoisturize without heaviness while supporting skin elasticity and a smooth, refined appearance.\n\n**Avocado Oil: **A nutrient-dense oil rich in vitamins, sterols, and essential fatty acids. It\ndeeply nourishes the skin and helps support a healthy moisture barrier for lasting softness.\n\n**Jojoba Oil: **A balancing oil that closely resembles the skin\u2019s natural sebum. It helps maintain\nhydration while supporting soft, supple skin without clogging pores.\n\n**Macadamia Oil: **A silky botanical oil rich in oleic acid and palmitoleic acid that helps improve\nskin softness and elasticity while delivering long-lasting nourishment.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32 oz, 1 gallon, and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis facial oil is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nOil-based formulations are ideal for fragrance oils as they blend seamlessly without the need for\nsolubilizers. For more information, view our DIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][197].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][198] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][199]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nNoni Extract\n\nAn antioxidant-rich extract that supports a brighter, more balanced complexion while protecting\nagainst environmental stressors.\n\nTamanu Oil\n\nA botanical oil that promotes smoother, healthier-looking skin while supporting the skin barrier.\n\nJojoba Oil\n\nA botanical emollient that mimics skin\u2019s natural sebum to balance and hydrate without greasiness.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Noni & Tamanu Facial Oil**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare options.\n\nCan this oil be used during professional facials?\n\nYes. It is ideal for facial massage, finishing treatments, and adding additional nourishment during\nprofessional skincare services.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packagi"
