nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Peptide+ Firming Serum]\n[Peptide+ Firming Serum]\n[Peptide+ Firming Serum]\n[Peptide+ Firming Serum]\n[Peptide+ Firming Serum]\n[Peptide+ Firming Serum]\n[Peptide+ Firming Serum] [Peptide+ Firming Serum] [Peptide+ Firming Serum] [Peptide+ Firming Serum]\n[Peptide+ Firming Serum] [Peptide+ Firming Serum]\n\n# Peptide+ Firming Serum\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nThe Peptide+ Firming Serum is designed to visibly firm, smooth, and rejuvenate the skin. This\nformula combines a synergistic **five-peptide complex** with **hyaluronic acid, amino acids,** and\n**chia seed extract** to restore skin elasticity and support collagen integrity. Skin appears more\nresilient, hydrated, and supple with continued use.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $67.411 gallon - $190.445 gallon - $709.11Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for formula testing, texture evaluation, and packaging compatibility assessments.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, treatment room use, small refill programs, and low-volume filling\nruns.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, growing skincare brands, recurring fulfillment, and professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume refills, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling serum production while\nimproving manufacturing efficiency.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities. ***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Peptide+ Firming Serum** delivers targeted benefits to help visibly firm, smooth, and\nrejuvenate the complexion. This peptide-rich treatment strengthens the skin\u2019s structural integrity\nwhile promoting deep hydration and renewed suppleness. **It targets:**\n* Loss of firmness and elasticity\n* Fine lines and uneven texture\n* Dehydration and surface roughness\n* Dull or fatigued-looking skin\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Support collagen and elastin for visibly firmer, lifted skin\n* Improve elasticity and smoothness for a refined complexion\n* Deliver lasting hydration to plump and cushion the skin\n* Restore a supple, resilient look with continued use\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for:**All skin types, especially mature, dry, and dehydrated skin seeking improved\nfirmness and elasticity.\n\nApply small amount with fingertips to freshly cleansed and toned face, neck and d\u00e9collet\u00e9 areas\navoiding direct contact with eyes. Allow time to absorb prior to moisture application.\n\n**For professional use:**Ideal for facial treatments, layering under masks, or incorporating into\ncustom skincare protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Five-Peptide Complex:**][197]** **Synergistic network of bioactive peptides that help strengthen\nskin structure, improve elasticity, and smooth visible lines\n\n[**Sodium Hyaluronate (Hyaluronic Acid):**][198]** **Draws moisture into the skin to visibly plump,\nsmooth, and enhance suppleness\n\n**Amino Acids & PCA (including Sodium PCA, Proline):** Reinforce the skin\u2019s natural moisturizing\nfactors for long-lasting comfort and flexibility\n\n[**Vegetable Glycerin**:][199] Attracts and retains hydration to keep skin soft, smooth, and\nhydrated throughout the day.\n\n**Chia Seed Extract**: Rich in omega fatty acids and antioxidants that help protect and fortify the\nskin barrier.\n\n**Formulated Without:** Parabens, Sulfates, Phthalates\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from Parabens, Sulfates, & Phthalates\n* pH Range: 5.00 \u2013 6.50\n* Lightweight serum base ideal for layering\n* Made in the USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32 oz, 1 gallon, 5 gallon\n* For larger quantities, please contact us\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis serum base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate 20** or\n**Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2 ratio** of\nsolubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our DIY Fragrance\nMixing Manual [here][200].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][201] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][202]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nPeptides\n\nShort chains of amino acids that act as cellular messengers, helping to stimulate collagen and\nelastin production for visibly firmer, smoother, and more resilient skin.\n\nHyaluronic Acid\n\nA powerful humectant that attracts and locks in moisture for plump, hydrated skin.\n\nGlycerin\n\nA powerful humectant that draws moisture into the skin, keeping it soft, smooth, and hydrated.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Peptide+ Firming Serum**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare options.\n\nWhat is the five signal peptide complex?\n\nIt\u2019s a synergistic blend of five bioactive peptides that work together to improve firmness and\nelasticity by signaling the skin to produce more collagen and structural proteins.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][203][\n][204][\n][205][\n][206][\n][207]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][208]\n* [Hair Care][209]\n* [Bath & Body][210]\n* [Scents][211]\n* [Resources][212]\n* [Private Label][213]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][214]\n* [Refund Policy][215]\n* [Shipping Policy][216]\n* [Terms of Service][217]\n* [Wholesale Terms][218]\n* [F"
