nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum]\n[Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum]\n[Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum]\n[Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum]\n[Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum]\n[Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum]\n[Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum] [Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum] [Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum] [Bio Cell\nPeptide Eye Serum] [Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum] [Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum]\n\n# Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk skincare sizes, our lightweight, fast-absorbing **Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum\n**delivers targeted hydration, visible brightening, and a smoother, more rejuvenated eye contour.\n\nFormulated with **peptides, saffron stem cells, hyaluronic acid,** and soothing **mushroom\nferments,** this advanced treatment harnesses proven actives to improve firmness, radiance, and\nmoisture retention around the delicate eye area.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $109.521 gallon - $333.395 gallon - $1,285.81Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating texture, absorption, finish, and compatibility with delicate under-eye areas.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, professional treatments, refill preparation, and small filling runs.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa treatment programs, recurring refill needs, and growing professional skincare lines.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for large filling runs, spa operations, ongoing wholesale demand, and scaling eye treatment\nproduction efficiently.\n\n*Estimated yield varies by fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum delivers targeted rejuvenation to help smooth, brighten, and hydrate\nthe delicate eye area, making it an ideal choice for daily use and professional back-bar treatments.\n**It targets:**\n* Fine lines and early signs of aging\n* Puffiness and visible fatigue\n* Dullness and uneven tone\n* Dehydration and loss of firmness\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Soften the look of fine lines and improve firmness with peptides\n* Brighten and revive the eye contour with saffron stem cells, licorice root, and mushroom ferments\n* Deliver deep, lasting hydration with hyaluronic acid, sodium PCA, and glycerin\n* Soothe puffiness and reduce irritation with aloe, cucumber water, MSM, and green tea\n* Strengthen the delicate skin barrier with nourishing botanical oils and amino acids\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **All skin types, including sensitive and mature skin, especially those looking to\nreduce fine lines, improve brightness, calm puffiness, and enhance hydration.\n\n**After cleansing,** dab around eyes, forehead and cheek area or use as an overall facial serum.\nFollow with moisturizer. Suitable for **AM and PM **use.\n\n**For professional use: **Ideal for facial treatments, layering under masks, use with eye-focused\nmassage techniques, or incorporation into custom treatment protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7 + Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1:**][197] A clinically recognized peptide\ncomplex that helps support collagen efficiency, smooth the appearance of fine lines, and improve\nvisible firmness around the delicate eye area.\n\n**Crocus Sativus Meristem Cell Extract (Saffron Stem Cells):** A brightening, rejuvenating stem cell\nactive that promotes radiance, supports cellular vitality, and helps reduce dullness for a more\nenergized eye contour.\n\n[**Reishi & Shiitake Mushroom Ferment Filtrate:**][198] An adaptogenic, antioxidant-rich ferment duo\npacked with beta-glucans to soothe irritation, reinforce the skin\u2019s defenses, and help calm\npuffiness.\n\n[**Hyaluronic Acid**][199]** + Sodium PCA:** A powerful humectant pairing that attracts and retains\nmoisture to visibly plump the skin, smooth fine dryness lines, and maintain optimal hydration\nthroughout the day.\n\n[**Aloe Vera Juice**][200]** + **[**MSM**][201]**:** A soothing, skin-balancing combination that\ncalms irritation, reduces puffiness, and helps restore comfort and moisture to the under-eye area.\n\n[**Jojoba Oil**][202]** + Argan Oil:** Lightweight nourishing oils that replenish softness, support\nbarrier integrity, and condition delicate eye-area skin without heaviness.\n\n**Licorice Root + **[**Gotu Kola**][203]** + **[**Green Tea**][204]**:** A botanical trio that\nbrightens uneven tone, delivers antioxidant protection, and provides calming support for stressed,\ntired-looking skin.\n\n**Amino Acids:** A restorative blend of essential and non-essential amino acids that help reinforce\nskin structure, improve elasticity, and promote smoother, more resilient skin.\n\n**Formulated Without: **Parabens, Sulfates, Phthalates\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* Lightweight eye serum\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32 oz, 1 gallon, and 5 gallons\n* *Updated December 2025*\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nFragrance is not recommended for eye products.\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][205] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][206]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nPeptides\n\nShort chains of amino acids that act as cellular messengers, helping to stimulate collagen and\nelastin production for visibly firmer, smoother, and more resilient skin.\n\nCentella Asiatica\n\nA botanical that helps soothe, strengthen, and repair the skin barrier while promoting firmness,\nelasticity, and a calm, healthy-looking complexion.\n\nHyaluronic Acid\n\nA powerful humectant that attracts and locks in moisture for plump, hydrated skin.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Bio Cell Peptide Eye Serum**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare\noptions.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\nWh"
