nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Kale Protein Complex Facial Cleanser]\n[Kale Protein Complex Facial Cleanser]\n[Kale Protein Complex Facial Cleanser]\n[Kale Protein Complex Facial Cleanser]\n[Kale Protein Complex Facial Cleanser] [Kale Protein Complex Facial Cleanser] [Kale Protein Complex\nFacial Cleanser] [Kale Protein Complex Facial Cleanser]\n\n# Kale Protein Complex Facial Cleanser\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 1 Gallon 5 Gallon\nSample - $3.951 Gallon - $124.865 Gallon - $453.65Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating cleansing performance, skin feel, and formulation compatibility.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, facial treatment rooms, refill preparation, and professional-use\napplications.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa back bar, recurring facial services, refill systems, and professional skincare\noperations.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume treatment services, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling cleanser\nproduction efficiently.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger order quantities.\n***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nStrengthen the skin\u2019s protective barrier with natural ingredients like kale, carrot and lemon amino\nacids. This lightly foaming, milky cleanser is full of nutrients and antioxidants to help fight\nagainst damage from free radicals. Aloe vera and green tea hydrate the skin while reducing blue\nlight oxidative damage. This wholesale cleanser can be used as an effective make up remover.\n\n**Note: This cleanser will undergo a formulation update later this year. **\n\n### **Highlighted Benefits\n### **\n\n##### **Protein-Powered Cleansing**\n* **Hydrolyzed Kale, Carrot, and Lemon Proteins:** Infuse the skin with a powerful blend of plant\nproteins to nourish and strengthen, promoting a radiant and resilient complexion.\n\n##### **Soothing and Calming**\n* **Chamomile Extract & [Aloe Vera Juice][197]:** Offer calming and anti-inflammatory properties\nthat soothe the skin, making it ideal for daily cleansing of all skin types, including sensitive\nones.\n* **Cucumber Fruit Extract:** Delivers a cooling effect, helping to reduce puffiness and refresh the\nskin.\n\n##### **Antioxidant-Rich Formula**\n* **[Japanese Green Tea Leaf Extract][198]:** Provides a rich source of antioxidants to protect the\nskin from environmental stressors and aid in maintaining a clear, youthful appearance.\n\n##### **Gentle and Effective Cleansing**\n* **Disodium Cocoamphoacetate & Decyl Glucoside:** Mild surfactants derived from coconut oil that\ngently cleanse the skin without stripping it of its natural oils.\n* **Sucrose Cocoate:** A natural ingredient that enhances the skin's ability to retain moisture,\nleaving it soft and hydrated post-cleansing.\n\nOur Kale Protein Facial Cleanser is designed to offer a nourishing cleanse that balances and\nrevitalizes the skin. Its unique formula combines potent plant proteins with soothing botanicals,\ndelivering a purifying experience that leaves your complexion looking bright and feeling refreshed.\nGentle enough for everyday use, this cleanser works to maintain the skin's natural balance while\nproviding the beneficial properties of antioxidants and proteins. The result is a soft, smooth, and\ndeeply cleansed skin, ready to absorb the benefits of your skincare regimen.\n\n**pH Range: 5.00 - 7.00**\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nApply a small amount to fingers, lather and massage with warm water to cleanse skin of all oils,\ndirt, and makeup. For best results use morning and night and follow with a toner, serum, moisturizer\nand eye treatment.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n\n[**Green Tea Extract:**][199]** **A powerful antioxidant that helps protect against environmental\nstress while supporting a calm, balanced appearance.\n\n**Hydrolyzed Kale Protein: **A nutrient-rich plant protein that helps support skin vitality and\nreinforce a healthy-looking complexion.\n\n[**Chamomile Extract:**][200]** **Known for its soothing properties, it helps comfort and calm the\nskin.\n\n[**Cucumber Extract:**][201]** **Provides refreshing hydration and helps reduce the look of dryness\nand irritation.\n\n[**Vegetable Glycerin:**][202]** **A humectant that attracts moisture to help keep skin soft and\nhydrated after cleansing.\n\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][203] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][204]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][205][\n][206][\n][207][\n][208][\n][209]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][210]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][211]\n* [Hair Care][212]\n* [Bath & Body][213]\n* [Scents][214]\n* [Resources][215]\n* [Private Label][216]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][217]\n* [Refund Policy][218]\n* [Shipping Policy][219]\n* [Terms of Service][220]\n* [Wholesale Terms][221]\n* [FAQs][222]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][223]\n* [orders@pravada.com][224]\n* [(239) 260-9826][225]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][226]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin"
