[Vitamin C\nAntioxidant Facial Cleanser] [Vitamin C Antioxidant Facial Cleanser]\n\n# Vitamin C Antioxidant Facial Cleanser\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nComing soon in bulk skincare sizes, our Vitamin C Antioxidant Facial Cleanser is a refreshing\nformula designed to gently yet effectively cleanse the skin while supporting brightness, balance,\nand antioxidant protection. This active-infused cleanser removes impurities, excess oil, and\nenvironmental buildup without stripping the skin.\n\nIdeal for daily professional and at-home use, the formula leaves skin feeling clean, comfortable,\nand refreshed, making it a versatile foundational cleanser for a wide range of facial treatments and\nskincare routines.\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $165.005 gallon - $660.00Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating cleansing performance, skin feel, and formulation compatibility.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, facial treatment rooms, refill preparation, and professional-use\napplications.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa back bar, recurring facial services, refill systems, and professional skincare\noperations.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume treatment services, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling cleanser\nproduction efficiently.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger order quantities.\n***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur Vitamin C Antioxidant Facial Cleanser delivers effective yet balanced cleansing while supporting\nbrightness and antioxidant protection, making it ideal for daily use and professional back-bar\ntreatments.** It addresses:**\n* Dullness and lack of radiance\n* Excess oil and surface buildup\n* Post-cleanse tightness caused by over-cleansing\n* Environmental stressors that contribute to a fatigued-looking complexion\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Remove impurities, excess oil, and daily buildup without stripping the skin\n* Brighten the appearance of skin with a stable, water-soluble form of vitamin C\n* Provide antioxidant defense with green tea, bilberry, and citrus-derived extracts\n* Calm and condition the skin during cleansing with aloe and centella asiatica\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **Normal, combination, oily, and acne-prone skin types.\n\nApply to moistened skin with fingers or damp cloth. Apply to skin with light circular and massaging\nmotions avoiding contact with eyes. Rinse with warm, clear water. For best results use twice daily\nand follow with toner, serum, moisturizer, and eye treatment.\n\n**For professional use: **Ideal as a primary cleanse or pre-treatment cleanser in facials, before\nexfoliation, masks, or advanced treatments.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate:**][197] A stable, gentle form of vitamin C that brightens dull skin,\nsupports an even tone, and provides antioxidant protection to defend against environmental stressors\n\n[**Aloe Vera Juice:**][198] A soothing botanical hydrator that calms irritation, restores moisture\nbalance, and helps replenish the skin for improved comfort and softness\n\n[**Green Tea Leaf Extract:**][199] Antioxidant-rich botanical that helps defend against\nenvironmental stressors.\n\n[**Gotu Kola Extract:**][200] Promotes tone, elasticity, and overall skin vitality.\n\n[**Methylsulfonylmethane:**][201] A bioavailable form of organic sulfur known for its ability to\nsupport collagen structure, calm visible irritation, and enhance overall skin resilience.\n\n[**Sunflower Seed Oil:**][202] A lightweight, nutrient-rich oil high in linoleic acid and vitamin E\nthat helps support the skin barrier while delivering fast-absorbing hydration.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* Hydrating, non-stripping cleanser with a rich lather\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Coming soon in bulk sizes: 1 gallon and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n\n*Updated January 2026 from Vitamin C Cleanser*\n\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis cleanser base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient,\nready-to-use application.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate\n20** or **Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2\nratio** of solubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our\nDIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][203].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][204] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][205]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nVitamin C\n\nA brightening antioxidant that supports collagen production, enhances radiance, and helps protect\nthe skin from environmental stressors.\n\nAloe Vera\n\nA hydrating and soothing botanical that helps replenish moisture, calm irritation, and support the\nskin barrier for a soft, balanced complexion.\n\nCentella Asiatica\n\nA botanical that helps soothe, strengthen, and repair the skin barrier while promoting firmness,\nelasticity, and a calm, healthy-looking complexion.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Vitamin C Antioxidant Facial Cleanser**, formulation standards, and bulk\nskincare options.\n\nWhat type of vitamin C does this cleanser contain?\n\nIt features sodium ascorbyl phosphate, a stable and gentle form of vitamin C suitable for rinse-off\nproducts.\n\nDoes this cleanser provide antioxidant benefits?\n\nYes, vitamin C, green tea, bilberry, and citrus extracts work together to help protect skin from\nenvironmental stressors.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\n"
