\n\n# Vitamin C Antioxidant Toner\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nComing soon in bulk skincare sizes, our Vitamin C Antioxidant Toner is a lightweight, refreshing\nformula designed to brighten, hydrate, and balance the skin. Powered by sodium ascorbyl phosphate, a\nstable form of vitamin C, this toner delivers antioxidant support while helping improve the look of\ndullness and uneven tone.\n\nAloe Vera, panthenol, and glycerin provide gentle hydration, while a blend of botanical extracts\nincluding green tea, gotu kola, ginseng, and papaya helps calm and revitalize the complexion. Ideal\nfor daily use and professional back-bar treatments, this toner leaves skin feeling clean, refreshed,\nand prepped for serums and moisturizers.\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $135.005 gallon - $490.00Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating skin feel, absorption, and mist quality.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa operations, facial services, refill systems, and recurring professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume spa services, treatment room refills, hospitality programs, and large-scale\nproduction.\n\n*Estimated yields vary by fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Vitamin C Antioxidant Toner** delivers a refreshing, antioxidant-rich toning step that helps\nbrighten, hydrate, and balance the complexion, making it ideal for daily use and professional\nback-bar treatments. **It addresses:**\n* Dullness and lack of radiance\n* Uneven-looking tone\n* Redness and visible signs of stress\n* Rough texture and the look of enlarged pores\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Refresh and rebalance skin after cleansing without stripping moisture\n* Brighten the look of skin tone with vitamin C\n* Support hydration and comfort with aloe, glycerin, and panthenol\n* Calm the look of redness and support skin resilience with centella and green tea\n* Refine the look of pores and smooth texture with witch hazel and botanical extracts\n\n**Usage**\n\nApply to freshly cleansed skin with a cotton ball or mist onto skin with an atomizer. Allow product\nto dry prior to applying other skin care products. Best when used twice daily.\n\n**Professional Use: **Ideal for post-cleanse toning, skin prep before treatments, and layering into\ncustomized facial protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate:**][197] A stable, gentle form of vitamin C that brightens dull skin,\nsupports an even tone, and provides antioxidant protection to defend against environmental stressors\n\n[**Aloe Vera Juice:**][198] A soothing botanical hydrator that calms irritation, restores moisture\nbalance, and helps replenish the skin for improved comfort and softness\n\n[**Panthenol (Vitamin B5):**][199] Hydrates, soothes, and supports skin repair for improved softness\nand resilience.\n\n[**Witch Hazel:**][200] A gentle natural astringent that refines pores, balances oil, and leaves the\nskin feeling clean and refreshed\n\n[**Centella Asiatica (Gotu Kola) Extract:**][201] Supports collagen synthesis and barrier repair for\nfirmer, healthier skin\n\n[**Green Tea Leaf Extract:**][202] Antioxidant-rich botanical that helps defend against\nenvironmental stressors\n\n[**Panax Ginseng Root Extract**:][203] Helps revitalize the look of tired, lackluster skin for a\nfresher appearance\n\n**Carica Papaya (Papaya) Fruit Extract**: Helps gently refine the look of skin texture for a\nsmoother, brighter finish\n\n**Lavender Oil + Geranium Oil**: Aromatic botanicals that add a spa-like sensory experience to the\nformula\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* pH Range: 6.0 - 6.5\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Coming soon in bulk sizes: 1 gallon and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n\n*Updated January 2026 from Vitamin C All-In-One Toner*\n\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis toner base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate\n20** or **Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2\nratio** of solubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our\nDIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][204].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][205] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][206]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nVitamin C\n\nA brightening antioxidant that supports collagen production, enhances radiance, and helps protect\nthe skin from environmental stressors.\n\nWitch Hazel\n\nA gentle natural astringent that helps refine the appearance of pores, balance excess oil, and\nrefresh skin without stripping essential moisture.\n\nCentella Asiatica\n\nA botanical that helps soothe, strengthen, and repair the skin barrier while promoting firmness,\nelasticity, and a calm, healthy-looking complexion.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Vitamin C Antioxidant Toner**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare\noptions.\n\nWhat form of vitamin C is used in this toner?\n\nThe formula features sodium ascorbyl phosphate, a stable, water-soluble form of vitamin C known for\nits brightening and antioxidant benefits with a lower potential for irritation.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?"
