nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Vitamin C Stem-C Serum]\n[Vitamin C Stem-C Serum]\n[Vitamin C Stem-C Serum]\n[Vitamin C Stem-C Serum]\n[Vitamin C Stem-C Serum]\n[Vitamin C Stem-C Serum]\n[Vitamin C Stem-C Serum] [Vitamin C Stem-C Serum] [Vitamin C Stem-C Serum] [Vitamin C Stem-C Serum]\n[Vitamin C Stem-C Serum] [Vitamin C Stem-C Serum]\n\n# Vitamin C Stem-C Serum\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk skincare sizes, our lightweight, fast-absorbing **Vitamin C Stem-C Serum**\ndelivers deep hydration, visible brightening, and a healthy, radiant glow. Formulated with\n**vitamins C and E**, a** dual-weight hyaluronic acid complex**, and **orange stem cells**, this\nadvanced serum harnesses clinically validated actives to improve tone, texture, and moisture\nretention while supporting rejuvenation for a smoother, more luminous complexion.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $114.721 gallon - $326.695 gallon - $1,276.81Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for formula testing, texture evaluation, and packaging compatibility assessments.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, treatment room use, small refill programs, and low-volume filling\nruns.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, growing skincare brands, recurring fulfillment, and professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume refills, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling serum production while\nimproving manufacturing efficiency.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities. ***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur Vitamin C Stem-C Serum delivers targeted benefits that help brighten, hydrate, and rejuvenate\nthe skin, making it a staple for daily use and professional back-bar treatments. **It targets:**\n* Dullness and discoloration\n* Uneven texture and tone\n* Dehydration and loss of firmness\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Brighten and even skin tone for a more radiant, youthful appearance\n* Deliver deep hydration with dual-weight hyaluronic acid to plump and smooth\n* Provide antioxidant protection with vitamins C, E, and ferulic acid\n* Support skin rejuvenation and firmness with orange stem cells\n* Calm and refine the complexion for improved clarity and balance\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable For: **All skin types, especially those seeking improved brightness, rejuvenated\ncomplexions, balanced tone, and enhanced hydration.\n\n**Shake well before use.** Apply to clean skin, pat gently, let absorb before moisturizer. Best\nfor **AM **use.\n\n**For professional use:** Facial treatments, layering under masks, or incorporation into custom\nskincare protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n**Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Callus Culture Extract:** A stem cell-derived ingredient that\nhelps protect skin cells from environmental damage, supports cellular rejuvenation, and promotes a\nfirmer, more youthful appearance\n\n[**Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate:**][197] A stable, gentle form of vitamin C that brightens dull skin,\nsupports an even tone, and provides antioxidant protection to defend against environmental stressors\n\n[**Vitamin E (Tocopherol):**][198] A nourishing antioxidant that moisturizes, helps protect the skin\nfrom free radical damage, and enhances the stability and performance of other antioxidants\n\n[**Hyaluronic Acid (Dual-Weight Complex):**][199] A blend of low and high molecular weights that\ndelivers multi-level hydration, plumps the appearance of fine lines, and promotes a smoother, more\nsupple skin texture\n\n[**Ferulic Acid:**][200] A powerful antioxidant that helps neutralize environmental aggressors while\nboosting and stabilizing the effectiveness of vitamins C and E for enhanced skin defense\n\n[**Aloe Vera Juice:**][201] A soothing botanical hydrator that calms irritation, restores moisture\nbalance, and helps replenish the skin for improved comfort and softness\n\n**Formulated Without:** Parabens, Sulfates, Phthalates\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* pH Range: 7.00 - 8.00\n* Lightweight serum base ideal for layering\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32 oz, 1 gallon, 5 gallon\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis serum base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate 20** or\n**Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2 ratio** of\nsolubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our DIY Fragrance\nMixing Manual [here][202].\n\nTry [Pink Grapefruit][203] or [Sweet Orange Essential Oil][204] to complement the bright, hydrating\nbenefits of this serum with a fresh, citrus-infused finish.\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][205] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][206]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nOrange Stem Cells\n\nA plant-derived ingredient that helps protect skin cells from environmental damage, supports\ncellular rejuvenation, and promotes a firmer, more youthful appearance.\n\nVitamin C\n\nA brightening antioxidant that supports collagen production, enhances radiance, and helps protect\nthe skin from environmental stressors.\n\nHyaluronic Acid\n\nA powerful humectant that attracts and locks in moisture for plump, hydrated skin.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Vitamin C Stem-C Serum**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare options.\n\nWhat makes the Vitamin C Stem-C Serum different from your regular Vitamin C Serum?\n\nThe Vitamin C Stem-C Serum features the same brightening and hydrating base formula as our original\nVitamin C Serum, but with the addition of orange stem cells. These advanced botanical actives help\nsupport "
