ent] [Bio Clear Spot Treatment]\n\n# Bio Clear Spot Treatment\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk skincare sizes, our **Bio Clear Spot Treatment** is a fast-acting, targeted\ntreatment designed to visibly calm blemishes and help clarify congested skin without over-drying.\nThis lightweight formula combines botanical exfoliants, soothing extracts, and purifying actives to\nhelp reduce the appearance of breakouts while supporting a clearer, more balanced complexion. Ideal\nfor on-the-spot use or targeted application in breakout-prone areas.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $60.001 gallon - $170.005 gallon - $695.00Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for formula testing, texture evaluation, and packaging compatibility assessments.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, treatment room use, small refill programs, and low-volume filling\nruns.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, growing skincare brands, recurring fulfillment, and professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume refills, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling serum production while\nimproving manufacturing efficiency.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities. ***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Bio Clear Spot Treatment **delivers targeted benefits that help calm, clarify, and refine\nblemish-prone skin, making it an effective solution for professional treatments and corrective\nskincare routines. **It targets:**\n* Active blemishes and congestion\n* Excess oil and pore buildup\n* Redness associated with breakouts\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Gently exfoliate and refine pores using willow bark and botanical clarifiers\n* Calm and soothe stressed skin with aloe, centella asiatica, and green tea\n* Support a clearer, more balanced complexion without stripping moisture\n* Purify breakout-prone areas while maintaining skin comfort\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **Oily, combination, acne-prone, and normal skin types. Not recommended for very\nsensitive skin.\n\nApply a small amount with fingertips to freshly cleansed face, neck and d\u00e9collet\u00e9 areas avoiding\ndirect contact with eyes. Allow time to absorb prior to moisturizer or makeup application.\n\n**For professional use: **Ideal for spot application during facial treatments, post-extraction care,\nor incorporation into corrective and clarifying skincare protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Salix Nigra (Willow) Bark Extract:**][197] A natural source of salicylates that helps gently\nexfoliate, refine pores, and reduce the appearance of blemishes\n\n**Spiraea Ulmaria Extract: **Traditionally used for its clarifying and purifying properties, helping\nsupport clearer-looking skin\n\n[**Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel) Extract:**][198] Helps tone and refine pores while calming\nexcess oil and congestion\n\n[**Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice:**][199]** **Soothes and hydrates the skin, helping offset dryness\noften associated with spot treatments\n\n[**Centella Asiatica (Gotu Kola) Extract:**][200]** **Known for its calming and skin-comforting\nproperties, helping reduce visible redness\n\n[**Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Leaf Extract:**][201] Provides antioxidant support to help defend\nskin against environmental stressors\n\n**Colloidal Silver: **Supports skin clarity with purifying properties commonly used in\nblemish-focused formulations\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* Targeted treatment\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32 oz, 1 gallon, and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n\n*Update January 2026 from Anti-Blemish Spot Treatment.*\n\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis treatment base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient,\nready-to-use application.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate\n20** or **Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2\nratio** of solubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our\nDIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][202].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][203] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][204]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nWitch Hazel\n\nA gentle natural astringent that helps refine the appearance of pores, balance excess oil, and\nrefresh skin without stripping essential moisture.\n\nCentella Asiatica\n\nA botanical that helps soothe, strengthen, and repair the skin barrier while promoting firmness,\nelasticity, and a calm, healthy-looking complexion.\n\nAloe Vera\n\nA hydrating and soothing botanical that helps replenish moisture, calm irritation, and support the\nskin barrier for a soft, balanced complexion.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Bio Clear Spot Treatment**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare options.\n\nCan this be used all over the face?\n\nThis formula is designed for targeted use rather than full-face application.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][205][\n][206][\n][207][\n][208][\n][209]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERT"
