nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment]\n[Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment]\n[Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment]\n[Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment]\n[Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment]\n[Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment]\n[Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment] [Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment] [Anti-Blemish\nMoisturizing Treatment] [Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment] [Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment]\n[Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment]\n\n# Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon 55 gallon drum\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $72.461 gallon - $214.635 gallon - $796.8155 gallon drum - $8,100.99Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nIdeal for evaluating texture, absorption, finish, and packaging compatibility.\n\n**32 oz**\nGreat for spa back bar, esthetician treatment rooms, refill preparation, and small filling batches.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for professional skincare practices, recurring refills, spa retail support, and growing\nbrand inventory needs.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nDesigned for large-scale filling runs, ongoing wholesale demand, spa operations, and scaling\nmoisturizer production efficiently.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nThe Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment is a meticulously crafted formula designed to hydrate,\nsoothe, and improve the appearance of blemish-prone skin with a potent blend of natural extracts and\noils.\n\n***Note: This moisturizer will undergo an formulation update in Q2 2026. [View here.][197]***\n\n### Highlighted Benefits\n\n##### **Hydration, Nourishment & Soothing Essential Oils**\n* **Organic Jojoba Seed Oil and Organic Aloe Leaf Juice:** Provide deep hydration and soothing\nproperties.\n* **Amyris, Copaiba, Sandalwood, and Melissa Essential Oils:** Offer calming effects and help reduce\nskin imperfections.\n\n##### **Natural Extracts for Blemish Control & Skin Tone Improvement**\n* **Organic Oat Seed, Turmeric, Echinacea, and Goldenseal Extracts:** Anti-inflammatory and\nantimicrobial, aiding in acne control.\n* **Organic Licorice Root, Lavender, and Sage Extracts:** Improve uneven skin tone and provide\nantiseptic benefits.\n\n##### **Anti-Aging, Firming & Detoxification**\n* **Organic Gotu Kola, Horsetail, and Wild Geranium Extracts:** Support collagen production and firm\nthe skin.\n* **Organic Dandelion Extract:** Detoxifies the skin and reduces irritation.\n\n##### **Friendly Formulation**\n* **Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Sodium Hydroxide, Phenoxyethanol, and\nEthylhexylglycerin:** Ensure a stable, and skin-friendly formulation.\n\nEach ingredient in the Anti-Blemish Moisturizing Treatment is selected for its ability to support\nskin health, reduce the appearance of blemishes, and leave the skin feeling refreshed and\nrevitalized. This treatment is an essential part of any skincare regimen aiming to maintain a clear\nand glowing complexion, naturally.\n\n**pH Range: 6.00 - 7.50**\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nApply in a light circular motion to freshly cleansed and toned face, neck and d\u00e9collet\u00e9 avoiding\ndirect contact with eyes. Moisturizer application should follow serum application, if used. Allow\ntime to absorb prior to makeup application.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Organic Jojoba Oil\n* Organic Aloe Vera Leaf Juice\n* West Indian Sandalwood Oil\n* Copaiba Resin Oil\n* Balsam Oil\n* Indian Sandalwood Oil\n* Australian Sandalwood Oil\n* Melissa Essential Oil\n* Geranium Essential Oil\n* Organic Oat Seed Extract\n* Organic Turmeric Extract\n* Organic Echinacea Extract\n* Organic Licorice Root Extract\n* Organic Goldenseal Extract\n* Lavender Extract\n* Propolis Extract\n* Sage Extract\n* Organic Comfrey Extract\n* Thyme Extract\n* Organic Gotu Kola\n* Horsetail Plant Extract\n* Wild Geranium Extract\n* Dandelion Extract\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][198] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][199]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203][\n][204]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][205]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][206]\n* [Hair Care][207]\n* [Bath & Body][208]\n* [Scents][209]\n* [Resources][210]\n* [Private Label][211]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][212]\n* [Refund Policy][213]\n* [Shipping Policy][214]\n* [Terms of Service][215]\n* [Wholesale Terms][216]\n* [FAQs][217]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][218]\n* [orders@pravada.com][219]\n* [(239) 260-9826][220]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][221]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-produc