en Tea Calming Toner]\n\n# Green Tea Calming Toner\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk sizes, our **Green Tea Calming Toner **is a soothing, mineral-infused formula\ndesigned to hydrate, rebalance, and visibly calm the complexion after cleansing. Powered by aloe\nvera, chamomile, cucumber, and antioxidant-rich green tea, this refreshing toner helps reduce\nvisible redness while restoring comfort to stressed or sensitized post-inflammatory skin.\n\nFortified with fermented mineral complexes including zinc, copper, magnesium, iron, and silicon,\nthis advanced formula supports skin vitality while hydrolyzed wheat protein and tamarind seed\nextract help improve hydration and softness. Ideal for daily use and professional facial treatments,\nit leaves skin balanced, refreshed, and perfectly prepped for serums and moisturizers.\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $110.005 gallon - $395.00Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating skin feel, absorption, and mist quality.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa operations, facial services, refill systems, and recurring professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume spa services, treatment room refills, hospitality programs, and large-scale\nproduction.\n\n*Estimated yields vary by fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Green Tea Calming Toner** supports post-inflammatory skin by helping to:\n* Calm visible redness and irritation\n* Restore hydration and skin comfort\n* Rebalance skin after cleansing\n* Deliver antioxidant protection against environmental stress\n* Support overall skin vitality with fermented mineral complexes\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **All skin types, especially sensitive, reactive, dry, or post-treatment skin.\n\nApply to freshly cleansed skin with a cotton pad or mist onto skin with an atomizer avoiding direct\neye contact. Allow product to dry prior to the application of other skincare products. Suitable for\n**AM and/or PM** use.\n\n**For professional use: **Ideal for calming facials, post-exfoliation treatments, post-extraction\nsoothing, and as a hydrating prep step before masks or advanced treatment protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Green Tea Extract:**][197] A potent antioxidant that helps defend against environmental stressors\nwhile calming and soothing the skin.\n\n[**Aloe Vera Leaf Juice:**][198] Provides lightweight hydration while helping to reduce visible\nredness and irritation.\n\n[**Chamomile Extract:**][199] Known for its soothing properties, it supports sensitive and reactive\nskin.\n\n[**Cucumber Extract:**][200]** **Refreshes and hydrates while helping to comfort stressed skin.\n\n**Fermented Minerals (Zinc, Copper, Magnesium, Iron, Silicon Ferments): **Bioavailable minerals that\nsupport skin vitality, balance, and overall healthy appearance.\n\n**Tamarind Seed Extract: **A plant-based hydrator that helps improve moisture retention and skin\nsoftness.\n\n[**Allantoin:**][201]** **Helps calm, protect, and support skin recovery.\n\n**Hydrolyzed Wheat Protein: **Supports skin conditioning and improves surface smoothness.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* pH Range: 5.0 - 5.5\n* Lightweight toner base ideal for layering\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 1 gallon and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis toner base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate\n20** or **Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2\nratio** of solubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our\nDIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][202].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][203] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][204]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nGreen Tea Extract\n\nA potent antioxidant that helps protect against environmental stress while promoting a refreshed,\nhealthy-looking complexion.\n\nAloe Vera\n\nA hydrating and soothing botanical that helps replenish moisture, calm irritation, and support the\nskin barrier for a soft, balanced complexion.\n\nChamomile Extract\n\nA soothing botanical extract that helps calm redness, reduce sensitivity, and soothe skin while\npromoting a balanced complexion.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Green Tea Calming Toner**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare options.\n\nWhat do the fermented minerals do for the skin?\n\nThe Saccharomyces-fermented zinc, copper, magnesium, iron, and silicon help support skin vitality,\nbalance, and overall healthy-looking tone.\n\nIs this toner suitable for sensitive skin?\n\nYes, this toner features ingredients that help calm and comfort the skin. We always recommend patch\ntesting to determine skin compatibility.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][205][\n][206][\n][207][\n][208][\n][209]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][210]\n* [Hair Care][211]\n* [Bath & Body][212]\n* [Scents][213]\n* [Resources][214]\n* [Private Label][215]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][216]\n* [Refund Policy][217]\n* [Shipping P"
