Balancing Moisturizer] [Skin\nBalancing Moisturizer] [Skin Balancing Moisturizer] [Skin Balancing Moisturizer]\n\n# Skin Balancing Moisturizer\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk skincare sizes, our Skin Balancing Moisturizer delivers lightweight, restorative\nhydration while helping support the skin\u2019s natural equilibrium.\n\nThis fast-absorbing cream is formulated with soothing botanicals, nutrient-rich plant oils, and\nactives including **retinol and panthenol** to nourish, refine, and maintain balanced moisture\nlevels without heaviness. Designed for daily use and professional treatments, it leaves the\ncomplexion soft, comfortable, and visibly refreshed.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $47.821 gallon - $139.095 gallon - $463.99Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nIdeal for evaluating texture, absorption, finish, and packaging compatibility.\n\n**32 oz**\nGreat for spa back bar, esthetician treatment rooms, refill preparation, and small filling batches.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for professional skincare practices, recurring refills, spa retail support, and growing\nbrand inventory needs.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nDesigned for large-scale filling runs, ongoing wholesale demand, spa operations, and scaling\nmoisturizer production efficiently.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur Skin Balancing Moisturizer delivers targeted benefits helps hydrate, refine, and support overall\nskin balance, making it ideal for daily use and professional back-bar applications.** It targets:**\n* Dehydration and moisture imbalance\n* Uneven texture and dullness\n* Early signs of aging\n* Environmental stress\u2013related dryness\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Deliver lasting hydration with aloe and plant-based glycerin\n* Nourish and soften skin with sunflower, jojoba, avocado, and shea butter\n* Support smoother texture and renewed appearance with retinol\n* Calm and condition the skin with panthenol\n* Protect against environmental stressors with green tea and vitamin E\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for:** All skin types, especially those seeking balanced hydration, improved texture, and\nskin-conditioning benefits.\n\nApply to clean skin and massage gently into the face and neck until fully absorbed. **Recommended\nfor PM use.**\n\n**For professional use:** Facial treatments, massage protocols, layering under masks, or\nincorporation into customized skincare regimens.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Retinol:**][197] Encourages skin renewal and helps improve the appearance of texture, tone, and\nearly signs of aging.\n\n[**Organic Sunflower Seed Oil:**][198]** **A lightweight, vitamin E\u2013rich oil that helps nourish the\nskin while supporting barrier function and moisture retention.\n\n[**Organic Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice:**][199] Provides soothing hydration and helps calm visible\nsigns of irritation and dryness.\n\n**Plant-Based Glycerin:** A powerful humectant that attracts and holds moisture in the skin for\nlong-lasting hydration.\n\n[**Organic Jojoba Seed Oil**][200]** & **[**Avocado Oil**][201]**:** Mimic the skin\u2019s natural lipids\nto help balance moisture, soften texture, and support overall skin comfort.\n\n[**Panthenol (Vitamin B5):**][202] Helps soothe, condition, and strengthen the skin while improving\nsoftness and elasticity.\n\n[**Organic Green Tea Leaf Extract:**][203] Rich in antioxidants that help protect the skin from\nenvironmental stressors and support a refreshed appearance.\n\n[**Shea Butter**][204]** & **[**Vitamin E**][205]**: **Provide nourishing emollience and antioxidant\nsupport to help protect and condition the skin.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* pH range: 6.00 \u2013 8.00\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32 oz, 1 gallon, and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis moisturizer base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient,\nready-to-use application.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate\n20** or **Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2\nratio** of solubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our\nDIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][206].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][207] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][208]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nRetinol\n\nA derivative of vitamin A known for its ability to visibly reduce the appearance of fine lines and\nuneven tone.\n\nGlycerin\n\nA powerful humectant that draws moisture into the skin, keeping it soft, smooth, and hydrated.\n\nPanthenol\n\nA humectant that attracts and retains moisture while improving softness and barrier resilience.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Skin Balancing Moisturizer**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare\noptions.\n\nDoes this moisturizer contain retinol?\n\nYes. It includes retinol to help support skin renewal and improve the appearance of texture and\ntone.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT T"
