nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Argan Beard Oil]\n[Argan Beard Oil]\n[Argan Beard Oil]\n[Argan Beard Oil]\n[Argan Beard Oil]\n[Argan Beard Oil] [Argan Beard Oil] [Argan Beard Oil] [Argan Beard Oil] [Argan Beard Oil]\n\n# Argan Beard Oil\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk grooming sizes, our lightweight, fast-absorbing Argan Beard Oil is designed to\ndeeply nourish, soften, and condition facial hair while caring for the skin beneath. This botanical\nbeard oil delivers essential fatty acids, antioxidants, and lasting hydration to support\nhealthier-looking, more manageable beards.\n\nIdeal for daily grooming and professional barber use, this advanced oil absorbs quickly without\ngreasiness, enhancing natural shine while improving beard texture and comfort.\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $36.651 gallon - $101.865 gallon - $340.04Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for formula testing, texture evaluation, and packaging compatibility assessments.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for esthetician back bar, treatment room use, small refill programs, and low-volume filling\nruns.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, growing skincare brands, recurring fulfillment, and professional-use\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume refills, large filling runs, spa operations, and scaling serum production while\nimproving manufacturing efficiency.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities. ***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Argan Beard Oil** delivers targeted benefits that help condition, strengthen, and refine the\nbeard, making it a staple for daily grooming routines and professional back-bar treatments. **It\ntargets:**\n* Dry, coarse, or brittle beard hair\n* Beard itch, flaking, and skin dryness\n* Dullness and lack of natural shine\n* Rough texture and poor manageability\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Deeply nourish and soften beard hair for improved manageability\n* Condition and hydrate the skin beneath the beard to reduce itchiness and flaking\n* Enhance natural shine without leaving a heavy or oily residue\n* Support the appearance of fuller, healthier-looking facial hair\n* Provide antioxidant protection to help defend against environmental stressors\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **All beard types and lengths.\n\nAfter cleansing, rub a few drops on to fingertips. Brush hands downward on to the hair of chin and\ncheeks. Massage oil in gently to the skin to moisturize and brush downward to smooth. **Can be used\ndaily, day or night.**\n\n**For professional use: **Beard conditioning treatments, finishing oil for trims, or incorporation\ninto customized grooming protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n**Organic Argan Oil: **Rich in vitamin E and essential fatty acids, argan oil deeply nourishes and\nhelps repair dry, brittle beard hair while enhancing shine and softness.\n\n[**Jojoba Seed Oil:**][197]** **Closely mimics the skin\u2019s natural sebum to help balance moisture,\ncondition the beard, and soothe the skin beneath to reduce irritation.\n\n[**Avocado Oil:**][198]** **A nutrient-dense oil that delivers vitamins and fatty acids to help\nstrengthen beard hair and support long-lasting hydration.\n\n**Organic Castor Oil: **Known for supporting the appearance of thicker, fuller facial hair while\nimproving overall beard density and resilience.\n\n**Grape Seed Oil: **A lightweight, fast-absorbing oil that helps strengthen beard hair and provide a\nsmooth, non-greasy finish.\n\n[**Vitamin E:**][199]** **A powerful antioxidant that helps protect beard hair and skin from free\nradical damage while supporting overall hair health.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* For men\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 32oz, 1 gallon, and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis beard oil is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nOil-based formulations are ideal for fragrance oils as they blend seamlessly without the need for\nsolubilizers. For more information, view our DIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][200].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][201] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][202]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Argan Beard Oil**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare options.\n\nCan this beard oil help with beard itch and flaking?\n\nYes. Regular use helps hydrate dry skin, reducing itchiness and flaking commonly associated with\nbeard growth.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][203][\n][204][\n][205][\n][206][\n][207]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][208]\n* [Hair Care][209]\n* [Bath & Body][210]\n* [Scents][211]\n* [Resources][212]\n* [Private Label][213]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][214]\n* [Refund Policy][215]\n* 