nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner]\n[Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner]\n[Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner]\n[Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner]\n[Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner]\n[Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner] [Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner] [Argan & Hemp Intense\nConditioner] [Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner] [Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner]\n\n# Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 4 x 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.954 x 32 oz - $127.001 gallon - $107.785 gallon - $430.00Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating performance, scent options, and hair compatibility.\n\n**4 x 32 oz**\nIdeal for salon back bar, stylist stations, refill preparation, and professional-use inventory.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for salon refill systems, back bar operations, treatment services, and growing haircare\nbrands.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume salon operations, hospitality programs, large-scale filling runs, and scaling\nhaircare collections.\n\n*Estimated yields vary by fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nUnveil the secret to deeply nourished and impeccably restored hair with our Argan & Hemp Intense\nConditioner. This richly formulated wholesale conditioner is a sanctuary for dry, damaged strands,\nproviding an unparalleled moisture boost and detangling benefits. Crafted with a luxurious blend of\nArgan and Hemp Oils, this conditioner delves deep into the hair's structure to fortify and\nrejuvenate from within, ensuring your locks regain their natural texture and strength. Ideal for\nthose with chemically or color-treated hair, this conditioner promises to transform your hair care\nroutine into a restorative ritual.\n\n### **Highlighted Benefits\n### **\n\n##### **Deep Moisturization and Repair**\n* **Argania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil & Cannabis Sativa (Organic Hemp) Seed Oil**: These potent\noils are celebrated for their exceptional moisturizing properties, penetrating deep into the hair\nshaft to hydrate, strengthen, and repair, leaving hair resilient and lustrous.\n* **Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Oil**: Mirroring the natural oils produced by the scalp, Jojoba\nOil provides additional hydration and softness, enhancing the hair's natural moisture balance.\n\n##### **Scalp and Hair Revitalization**\n* **Panax Ginseng (Organic Korean Ginseng) Extract & Aloe Barbadensis (Organic Aloe Vera) Leaf\nJuice**: A dynamic duo that revitalizes the scalp and hair, promoting healthy hair growth and\nsoothing scalp irritation for an optimal hair environment.\n* **Ginkgo Biloba (Organic Ginkgo) Leaf Extract & Salvia Officinalis (Organic Sage) Extract**: These\nextracts stimulate the scalp, enhancing blood circulation and providing antioxidant protection,\ncontributing to the overall health and vitality of the hair.\n\n##### **Strength and Elasticity Boost**\n* **Hydrolyzed Rice Protein & Panthenol (ProVitamin B5)**: This powerful combination not only\nstrengthens the hair, preventing breakage and split ends, but also enhances its elasticity and\nshine, ensuring your locks look and feel their best.\n\n##### **Nourishment and Protection**\n* **Tocopherol (Vitamin E)**: An antioxidant powerhouse, Vitamin E protects the hair from\nenvironmental stressors, locking in moisture and ensuring your hair remains healthy and vibrant.\n* **Urtica Dioica (Organic Nettle) Leaf Extract**: Renowned for its hair fortifying properties,\nNettle Extract nourishes the scalp and hair, contributing to stronger, more resilient strands.\n\n##### **Safe and Gentle Formulation**\n* **Cetyl Alcohol, Polyglyceryl-4 Oleate, Benzyl Alcohol, Salicylic Acid, Glycerin, Sorbic Acid**:\nThese ingredients ensure the conditioner's creamy texture and long-lasting stability, providing a\ngentle yet effective conditioning experience without harsh chemicals.\n\nOur Argan & Hemp Intense Conditioner is more than just a hair care product; it's an infusion of\nnature's most potent ingredients, designed to bring out the best in your hair. Safe for chemically\nor color-treated hair, this conditioner is an ally in achieving beautifully restored, soft, and\nmanageable locks, inviting you to experience the ultimate in hair rejuvenation.\n\n**Updated October 2024*\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nAfter shampooing, apply a generous amount of conditioner. Distribute evenly through hair from roots\nto ends. Leave on for 2 to 5 minutes and rinse thoroughly with warm water.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Organic Korean Ginseng\n* Organic Aloe Vera Leaf Juice\n* Ginkgo Biloba Leaf Extract\n* Organic Sage Extract\n* Organic Nettle Leaf Extract\n* Jojoba Oil\n* Hemp Seed Oil\n* Vitamin E (Tocopherol)\n* Rice Protein\n* ProVitamin B5\n* Argan Kernel Oil\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Work"
