bal Plus Conditioner]\n\n# Herbal Plus Conditioner\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 4 x 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.954 x 32 oz - $100.001 gallon - $88.065 gallon - $308.27Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating performance, scent options, and hair compatibility.\n\n**4 x 32 oz**\nIdeal for salon back bar, stylist stations, refill preparation, and professional-use inventory.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for salon refill systems, back bar operations, treatment services, and growing haircare\nbrands.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume salon operations, hospitality programs, large-scale filling runs, and scaling\nhaircare collections.\n\n*Estimated yields vary by fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nIntroducing our Herbal Plus Conditioner, a lightweight yet profoundly nourishing formula engineered\nto rejuvenate hair from root to tip without the heaviness often associated with conditioning\ntreatments. Specially designed for fine hair types, this wholesale conditioner harnesses the power\nof nature's finest botanicals and plant proteins to restore strength, moisture, and vitality to dry,\ndamaged strands.\n\n### **Highlighted Benefits\n### **\n\n##### **Deep Nourishment without Weight**\n* **Cannabis Sativa (Organic Hemp) Seed Oil & Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Oil**: These lightweight\noils are renowned for their ability to moisturize and smooth the hair without leaving a greasy\nresidue, making them perfect for fine hair in need of hydration and softness.\n\n##### **Botanical Strength and Vitality**\n* **Panax Ginseng (Organic Korean Ginseng) Extract & Aloe Barbadensis (Organic Aloe Vera) Leaf\nJuice**: A revitalizing blend that stimulates the scalp and hair follicles, promoting healthy hair\ngrowth and providing soothing hydration to the scalp.\n* **Ginkgo Biloba (Organic Ginkgo) Leaf Extract & Salvia Officinalis (Organic Sage) Extract**: These\nextracts invigorate the scalp, improving circulation and providing antioxidant protection to\nmaintain the health and vitality of the hair.\n\n##### **Restorative Herbal Extracts**\n* **Urtica Dioica (Organic Nettle Leaf) Extract & Symphytum Officinale (Organic Comfrey) Extract**:\nKnown for their healing properties, these extracts help to strengthen hair fibers, reduce\nbreakage, and enhance overall hair texture and resilience.\n\n##### **Protein and Vitamin Enrichment**\n* **Whole Wheat Protein & Panthenol (ProVitamin B5)**: These ingredients work together to fortify\nthe hair shaft, increase elasticity, and retain moisture, resulting in stronger, shinier, and more\nmanageable hair.\n* **Tocopheryl:** Provides antioxidant protection, helping to shield the hair from environmental\nstressors while promoting scalp health.\n\nOur Herbal Plus Conditioner is the epitome of botanical luxury, offering a perfect balance of deep\nhydration, strength, and vitality to those with fine hair. Its carefully curated blend of natural\ningredients works in harmony to leave hair feeling rejuvenated, silky smooth, and full of life,\nmaking it an essential part of a hair care ritual.\n\n**Updated October 2024*\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nAfter shampooing, apply a generous amount of conditioner. Distribute evenly through hair from roots\nto ends. Leave on for 2 to 5 minutes and rinse thoroughly with warm water.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Ginseng Extract\n* Organic Aloe Vera Leaf Juice\n* Ginkgo Biloba Leaf\n* Sage Extract\n* Organic Nettle Leaf\n* Comfrey Extract\n* Jojoba Oil\n* Hemp Seed Oil\n* Vitamin E (Tocopheryl Acetate)\n* Whole Wheat Protein\n* ProVitamin B5 (Panthenol)\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-