nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner]\n[Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner]\n[Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner]\n[Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner]\n[Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner]\n[Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner] [Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner] [Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner]\n[Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner] [Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner]\n\n# Pro-Rejuvenation Conditioner\n\nSale price$125.00 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 4 x 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.954 x 32 oz - $125.001 gallon - $107.785 gallon - $430.00Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating performance, scent options, and hair compatibility.\n\n**4 x 32 oz**\nIdeal for salon back bar, stylist stations, refill preparation, and professional-use inventory.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for salon refill systems, back bar operations, treatment services, and growing haircare\nbrands.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume salon operations, hospitality programs, large-scale filling runs, and scaling\nhaircare collections.\n\n*Estimated yields vary by fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\n**Notice: this formulation is being phased out at the end of 2026. It is being replaced with our\nnew [Amino Active Repair Conditioner][197]. **\n\nBehold the transformative power of our Pro Rejuvenation Conditioner, a deeply reparative formulation\ndesigned to bid farewell to split ends and welcome a new era of strength and vitality for the hair.\nInfused with Rice Protein and ProVitamin B5, this wholesale conditioner delves deep into the hair's\ncore to initiate restoration from the inside out. It's meticulously crafted to seal and reinforce\nstrands, offering robust protection against environmental aggressors, heat styling, and the rigors\nof color treatments. The synergistic blend of Jojoba and Hemp Seed Oils, enriched with Vitamin E,\nensures your hair emerges with unmatched softness, luminous shine, and effortless manageability.\n\n### **Highlighted Benefits\n### **\n\n##### **Intensive Repair and Reinforcement**\n* **Hydrolyzed Rice Protein & Panthenol (ProVitamin B5)**: These key ingredients penetrate the hair\nshaft to repair and strengthen at a molecular level, significantly reducing split ends and\nbreakage, and enhancing the hair's natural resilience.\n* **Cetrimonium Chloride**: Known for its ability to smooth hair and eliminate static, this\nconditioning agent helps to detangle and reduce frizz, making hair more manageable and less prone\nto damage.\n\n##### **Botanical Hydration and Vitality**\n* **Aloe Barbadensis (Organic Aloe Vera) Leaf Juice & Cannabis Sativa (Organic Hemp) Seed Oil**:\nThese natural moisturizers provide deep hydration to both hair and scalp, soothing irritation and\npromoting a healthy, balanced environment for hair growth.\n* **Panax Ginseng (Organic Korean Ginseng) Extract & Ginkgo Biloba (Organic Ginkgo) Leaf Extract**:\nEnergize the scalp, enhancing blood flow and nutrient delivery to the hair follicles, which\ninvigorates hair growth and revitalizes the hair's appearance.\n\n##### **Soothing Herbal Extracts**\n* **Salvia Officinalis (Organic Sage) Extract & Urtica Dioica (Organic Nettle) Leaf Extract**: Rich\nin vitamins and minerals, these extracts nourish the scalp and hair, balancing oil production and\nenhancing natural shine.\n\n##### **Luxurious Softness and Shine**\n* **Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Oil & Tocopherol (Vitamin E)**: Jojoba Oil closely mimics the\nscalp's natural sebum, providing lightweight hydration and shine, while Vitamin E offers\nantioxidant protection, guarding hair against environmental damage.\n\nOur Pro Rejuvenation Conditioner is not merely a hair care product; it's a comprehensive treatment\nthat breathes life back into weakened, tired strands, offering a sanctuary for hair to recover,\nrebuild, and shine with renewed vigor and beauty.\n\n**Updated October 2024*\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nAfter shampooing, apply a generous amount of conditioner. Distribute evenly through hair from roots\nto ends. Leave on for 2 to 5 minutes and rinse thoroughly with warm water.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Organic Korean Ginseng\n* Organic Aloe Vera Leaf Juice\n* Ginkgo Biloba Leaf Extract\n* Sage Extract\n* Organic Nettle Leaf Extract\n* Jojoba Oil\n* Hemp Seed Oil\n* Vitamin E (Tocopherol)\n* ProVitamin B5 (Panthenol)\n* Rice Protein\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][198] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][199]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203][\n][204]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][205]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][206]\n* [Hair Care][207]\n* [Bath & Body][208]\n* [Scents][209]\n* [Resources][210]\n* [Private Label][211]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][212]\n* [Refund Policy][213]\n* [Shipping Policy][214]\n* [Terms of Service][215]\n* [Wholesale Terms][216]\n* [FAQs][217]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][218]\n* [orders@pravada.com][219]\n* [(239) 260-9826][220]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][221]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-car"
