tore Biotin Conditioner]\n[Pro-Restore Biotin Conditioner] [Pro-Restore Biotin Conditioner]\n\n# Pro-Restore Biotin Conditioner\n\nSale price$135.00 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\n**Notice: this formulation is being phased out at the end of 2026. It is being replaced with our new\n**[**Density Boost Volumizing Conditioner**][197]**. **\n\nSize:\nSample 4 x 32 oz 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.954 x 32 oz - $135.001 gallon - $114.125 gallon - $461.71Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating performance, scent options, and hair compatibility.\n\n**4 x 32 oz**\nIdeal for salon back bar, stylist stations, refill preparation, and professional-use inventory.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for salon refill systems, back bar operations, treatment services, and growing haircare\nbrands.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume salon operations, hospitality programs, large-scale filling runs, and scaling\nhaircare collections.\n\n*Estimated yields vary by fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Usage**\n\nAfter shampooing, apply a generous amount of conditioner. Distribute evenly through hair from roots\nto ends. Leave on for 2 to 5 minutes and rinse thoroughly with warm water.\n\n**Ingredients**\n* Organic Nettle Leaf Extract\n* Organic Sage Extract\n* Organic Korean Ginseng Extract\n* Organic Olive Oil\n* Jojoba Oil\n* Vegetable Glycerin\n* Hemp Seed Oil\n* ProVitamin B5 (Panthenol)\n* Rice Protein\n* Inositol\n* Cystine\n* Cysteine\n* Methionine\n* Biotin\n* Vitamin D\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][198] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][199]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**, Sulfate Free, Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203][\n][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[19]: /collections