g Soon][70]\n* [View All][71]\n* [Best Sellers][72]\n* [Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][73]\n* [Whipped Body Butter][74]\n* [Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][75]\n* [Meadowfoam & Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][76]\n* [Calendula Body Wash][77]\n* [Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][78]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][79]\n\n[**Learn More**][80]\n* Scents\n* [By Category][81]\n* [Fragrance Oils][82]\n* [Essential Oils][83]\n* [View All][84]\n* [Best Sellers][85]\n* [Sandalwood Eucalyptus][86]\n* [Lemon Verbena][87]\n* [Cashmere Blush][88]\n* [Summer Spritz][89]\n* [Sweet Orange Essential Oil][90]\n* [Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][91]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][92]\n\n[**Learn More**][93]\n* Resources\n* [About Us][94]\n* [How It Works][95]\n* [Clean Beauty][96]\n* [Mixing Manual][97]\n* [Ingredient Lists][98]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][99]\n* [Blog][100]\n* [FAQs][101]\n* [Contact Us][102]\n* [Private Label][103]\n* [ Search][104]\n* [ Cart ][105]\nClose\n* Skin Care\n* Hair Care\n* Bath & Body\n* Scents\n* Resources\n* [Private Label][106]\nLogin\nSkin Care\n* By Category\n[Cleansers][107][Toners & Mists][108][Serums & Oils][109][Moisturizers][110][Eye\nTreatments][111][Masks][112][New Formulas][113][Coming Soon][114][View All][115]\n* By Result\n[Hydrating][116][Brightening][117][Smooth & Firm][118][Barrier Repair][119][Clear\nSkin][120][Plumping][121]\n* By Focus\n[Professional Grade][122][Plant Powered][123][Vegan][124][Sensitive Skin][125][Antioxidant\nSupport][126][Trending][127][For Men][128]\n* By Ingredient\n[Vitamin C][129][Hyaluronic\nAcid][130][Peptides][131][Niacinamide][132][Ceramides][133][Retinol][134][Ingredient\nGlossary][135]\n* Best Sellers\n[Vitamin C Serum][136][Niacinamide & HA Water Cream][137][Kale Protein Facial\nCleanser][138][Niacinamide Vita Mist Toner][139][Niacinamide Complexion Prep Serum][140][Advanced\nFirming Eye Cream][141]\n\n[*NEW!*** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING RECOVERY CREAM**][142]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][143]\n\nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Volumizing Styling Spray]\n[Volumizing Styling Spray]\n[Volumizing Styling Spray]\n[Volumizing Styling Spray]\n[Volumizing Styling Spray]\n[Volumizing Styling Spray] [Volumizing Styling Spray] [Volumizing Styling Spray] [Volumizing Styling\nSpray] [Volumizing Styling Spray]\n\n# Volumizing Styling Spray\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 32 oz 1 Gallon 5 Gallon\nSample - $3.9532 oz - $61.601 Gallon - $189.745 Gallon - $759.65Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating performance, scent options, and hair compatibility.\n\n**32 oz**\nIdeal for salon back bar, stylist stations, refill preparation, and professional-use inventory.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for salon refill systems, back bar operations, treatment services, and growing haircare\nbrands.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume salon operations, hospitality programs, large-scale filling runs, and scaling\nhaircare collections.\n\n*Estimated yields vary based on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nElevate the hair styling game with our revolutionary Volumizing Styling Spray, a masterful blend of\nnature's bounty and cutting-edge hair care technology. This lightweight wholesale spray is\nengineered to infuse your hair with incredible volume and a touchable, textured finish, transforming\neveryday styles into voluminous masterpieces.\n\n### Highlighted Benefits\n\n##### **Luxurious Volume and Texture Enhancement**\n* **Aqua (Water) & Ethanol**: These core ingredients provide a lightweight base, ensuring even\ndistribution and effortless application for a voluminous lift without the weight.\n* **PVP/VA Copolymer**: A key styling agent that delivers hold and structure, allowing for\nvoluminous blowouts and enhanced texture in braids and ponytails without stiffness.\n\n##### **Nourishing Botanicals for Hair Health**\n* **Rosa Canina (Rosehip) Fruit Oil**: Rich in vitamins and antioxidants, rosehip oil smooths and\nconditions hair strands, offering a non-drying finish that keeps hair soft and manageable.\n* **Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel)**: Known for its astringent properties, witch hazel helps to\nbalance the scalp and maintain hair health, adding to the spray's multifaceted benefits.\n\n##### **Hydration and Protection**\n* **Glycerine**: A powerful humectant that draws moisture to the hair, ensuring your locks remain\nhydrated and resilient against breakage.\n* **Cetrimonium Chloride & Dimethicone Copolyol**: These conditioning agents work synergistically to\ndetangle, reduce frizz, and protect hair from environmental stressors, leaving it silky and\nlustrous.\n\nOur Volumizing Styling Spray is more than just a styling product; it's a commitment to hair\nexcellence. Each ingredient is meticulously chosen for its ability to harmonize, creating a styling\nspray that not only elevates your look but also nurtures hair with every use. Step into a new era of\nhair styling where volume, texture, and hair health are seamlessly intertwined, resulting in styles\nthat are as healthy as they are breathtaking.\n\n**Updated October 2024*\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nSection damp hair. Spray evenly on roots to mid-shaft to distribute and style. Blow dry to style for\nadded volume or allow to air dry. Avoid eye contact. For external use only.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Glycerin\n* Witch Hazel\n* Rosehip Fruit Oil\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[19]: /collections/clear-skin\n[20]: /collections/plumping\n[21]: /pages/skin-care-by-focus\n[22]: /collections/professional-grade\n[23]: /collections/plant-powered\n[24]: /collections/vegan\n[25]: /collections/sensitive-skin\n[26]: /collections/antioxidant-support\n[27]: /collections/trending\n[28]: 