nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel]\n[Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel]\n[Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel]\n[Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel]\n[Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel] [Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel] [Flexible Hold Natural\nStyling Gel] [Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel]\n\n# Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 1 Gallon 5 Gallon\nSample - $3.951 Gallon - $190.725 Gallon - $759.65Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating performance, scent options, and hair compatibility.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for salon refill systems, back bar operations, treatment services, and growing haircare\nbrands.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume salon operations, hospitality programs, large-scale filling runs, and scaling\nhaircare collections.\n\n*Estimated yields vary based on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nIntroducing our Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel, a revolutionary product designed to offer\nlight-weight hold and control without the stickiness of traditional gels. Formulated with Hydrolyzed\nRice Protein and an array of nourishing botanicals, this wholesale gel not only eliminates frizz but\nalso gently defines hairstyles, locking in moisture for a polished, radiant shine.\n\n### Key Benefits:\n\n##### **Lightweight Control and Definition**\n* **PVP (Polyvinylpyrrolidone)**: This key ingredient provides flexible hold, allowing for natural\nmovement and style without the stiffness, making it perfect for a variety of hairstyles.\n* **Hydrolyzed Rice Protein**: Enriched with this powerful protein, our gel enhances hair volume and\nmanageability, while also strengthening strands and adding a lustrous shine.\n\n##### **Botanical Hydration and Nourishment**\n* **Tilia Cordata (Organic Linden) Extract & Humulus Lupulus (Organic Hops) Extract**: These\nbotanicals are known for their soothing and conditioning properties, contributing to healthier,\nmore vibrant hair.\n* **Althaea Officinalis (Organic Marshmallow) Extract & Equisetum Arvense (Organic Horsetail Plant)\nExtract**: Offer superior hydration and smoothing effects, aiding in detangling and improving hair\ntexture.\n\n##### **Scalp and Hair Health**\n* **Matricaria Recutita (Organic Chamomile) Extract & Arnica Montana (Organic Arnica) Extract**:\nThese extracts calm the scalp and promote hair growth, enhancing the overall health of your hair.\n* **Symphytum Officinale (Organic Comfrey) Leaf Extract & Arctium Lappa (Burdock Root) Extract**:\nKnown for their healing properties, these ingredients soothe the scalp and improve hair strength,\npreventing breakage.\n\nOur Flexible Hold Natural Styling Gel transcends ordinary hair care, offering a unique blend of\nstyling control and hair nourishment. Its non-sticky, lightweight formula makes it an indispensable\ntool for achieving frizz-free, beautifully defined hairstyles that last throughout the day. Embrace\nthe natural beauty of your hair, enhanced with botanical richness and innovative styling technology.\n\n**Updated October 2024*\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nApply to damp or dry hair. Squeeze a small amount of gel on palms or fingertips; rub hands together\nto make a thin layer of gel. For damp hair, starting at ends, work gel throughout hair. Blow dry\nhair to style. For dry hair, starting at ends, work gel upward throughout hair, lifting to style.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Hydrolyzed Rice Protein\n* Linden Extract\n* Hops Extract\n* Marshmallow (Althea) Extract\n* Horsetail Extract\n* Chamomile Extract\n* Arnica Extract\n* Comfrey Extract\n* Burdock Root Extract\n* Yarrow Extract\n* Kelp Extract\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[1