nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment]\n[Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment]\n[Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment]\n[Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment]\n[Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment] [Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment] [Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment]\n[Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment]\n\n# Hydra-Silk Leave In Treatment\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $189.745 gallon - $759.65Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating performance, scent options, and hair compatibility.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for salon refill systems, back bar operations, treatment services, and growing haircare\nbrands.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume salon operations, hospitality programs, large-scale filling runs, and scaling\nhaircare collections.\n\n*Estimated yields vary based on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nDiscover the ultimate hydration therapy with our Hydra-Silk Leave-In Treatment, a lightweight yet\ndeeply conditioning formula designed to breathe life into dry, thirsty hair. Enriched with a blend\nof natural oils and silk amino acids, this private label hair treatment offers an immediate rescue\nto parched strands, smoothing frizz, detangling knots, and restoring a luminous shine that radiates\nhealth from within.\n\n### Highlighted Benefits\n\n##### **Intense Hydration and Nourishment**\n* **Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, & Cannibis Sativa\n(Organic Hemp) Seed Oil**: A potent trio of natural oils renowned for their deep moisturizing and\nconditioning properties. These oils penetrate the hair shaft to smooth frizz, enhance shine, and\nprovide essential nutrients for healthier, more resilient hair.\n* **Panthenol (ProVitamin B5)**: A hydrating wonder, ProVitamin B5 attracts moisture into the hair,\nensuring strands remain supple, hydrated, and less prone to breakage.\n\n##### **Silk Strength and Smoothness**\n* **Silk Amino Acids**: This luxurious ingredient reinforces hair strength, providing a protective\nbarrier that helps retain moisture, reduce breakage, and enhance the natural structure of the\nhair, leaving it silky smooth and strong.\n\n##### **Soothing Botanical Extracts**\n* **Matricaria Recutita (Organic Chamomile) Flower Extract & Urtica Dioica (Organic Nettle)\nExtract**: These organic extracts offer soothing and anti-inflammatory benefits, promoting a\nhealthy scalp environment while enhancing hair's natural shine and vitality.\n\n##### **Frizz Control and Detangling**\n* **Cetrimonium Chloride & Quaternium-80**: These conditioning agents excel in detangling and\ncontrolling frizz, making hair more manageable and easier to style, while also imparting a smooth,\nsleek finish.\n\nOur Hydra-Silk Leave-In Treatment is a testament to the power of harmonizing nature with hair care\nscience. Each application not only quenches thirsty hair but also fortifies strands against future\nstressors, ensuring your hair remains lusciously soft, irresistibly smooth, and undeniably healthy.\nEmbrace the transformation to a more hydrated, stronger, and luminous mane with every use.\n\n**Updated October 2024*\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nWork a coin-sized amount of product through damp or dry hair, concentrating on ends and avoiding\nroots. Style or air dry as usual.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Panthenol (Vitamin B5)\n* Castor Seed Oil\n* Vegetable Glycerin\n* Jojoba Seed Oil\n* Hemp Seed Oil\n* Chamomile Flower Extract\n* Nettle Leaf Extract\n* Silk Amino Acids\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[19]: /collections/clear-skin\n[20]: /collections/plumping\n[21]: /pages/skin-care-by-focus\n[22]: /collections/professional-grade\n[23]: /colle