nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Marula Scalp Treatment Oil]\n[Marula Scalp Treatment Oil]\n[Marula Scalp Treatment Oil]\n[Marula Scalp Treatment Oil]\n[Marula Scalp Treatment Oil] [Marula Scalp Treatment Oil] [Marula Scalp Treatment Oil] [Marula Scalp\nTreatment Oil]\n\n# Marula Scalp Treatment Oil\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk haircare sizes, our **Marula Scalp Treatment Oil** is a lightweight yet deeply\nnourishing pre-wash oil designed to comfort the scalp while helping restore softness, shine, and\nmanageability to the hair. Formulated with **marula, black cumin, jojoba, argan, and organic\nsunflower seed oils**, this botanical blend helps moisturize dry scalp conditions, soothe feelings\nof irritation, and support smoother, healthier-looking strands.\n\nSize:\nSample 1 Gallon 5 Gallon\nSample - $3.951 Gallon - $209.645 Gallon - $898.96Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating performance, scent options, and hair compatibility.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for salon refill systems, back bar operations, treatment services, and growing haircare\nbrands.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for high-volume salon operations, hospitality programs, large-scale filling runs, and scaling\nhaircare collections.\n\n*Estimated yields vary based on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur **Marula Scalp Treatment Oil** delivers targeted benefits that help nourish the scalp and\nreplenish dry, stressed hair, making it an ideal addition to restorative hair rituals and\nscalp-focused treatments. **It targets:**\n* Dry scalp and flaking\n* Scalp discomfort and dehydration\n* Dullness, rough texture, and frizz\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Deeply nourish the scalp with lightweight botanical oils\n* Soothe and soften dry, tight-feeling scalp conditions\n* Support smoother, shinier, more manageable hair\n* Replenish moisture without a heavy, greasy afterfeel\n* Help protect strands from dryness associated with heat styling and environmental stressors\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **All hair types, especially those experiencing dry scalp, flaking, dullness, or\nlack of softness and shine.\n\nWarm up oil and apply generously to dry hair. Massage gently into hair and scalp and allow treatment\n5 to 10 minutes to absorb. Wash, condition, and rinse hair thoroughly. Style as usual.\n\n**For professional use:** Scalp treatments, pre-wash rituals, hot oil services, retail, or\nincorporation into customized haircare routines.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n**Marula Seed Oil:** Helps nourish the scalp and hair with lightweight moisture while supporting\nsoftness and shine\n\n**Black Cumin Seed Oil:** Helps comfort the scalp and reduce the feeling of dryness and irritation\n\n**Jojoba Oil:** Helps balance and soften while supporting smoother-looking hair\n\n**Organic Argan Kernel Oil:** Helps improve softness, shine, and overall manageability\n\n**Organic Sunflower Seed Oil:** Provides antioxidant-rich moisture to support scalp and hair\nconditioning\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* Salon-Grade\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 1 gallon and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Salon-Grade**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Marula Scalp Treatment Oil**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare\noptions.\n\nWhat does the Marula Scalp Treatment Oil do?\n\nThis treatment oil is designed to nourish the scalp while helping restore softness, shine, and\nmanageability to the hair. It supports hydration, soothes dryness, and enhances the overall look and\nfeel of the hair and scalp.\n\nWhat makes marula oil beneficial for hair and scalp?\n\nMarula oil is rich in essential fatty acids and antioxidants, helping to support moisture balance,\nimprove softness, and enhance natural shine while maintaining a lightweight feel.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][204]\n* [Hair Care][205]\n* [Bath & Body][206]\n* [Scents][207]\n* [Resources][208]\n* [Private Label][209]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][210]\n* [Refund Policy][211]\n* [Shipping Policy][212]\n* [Terms of Service][213]\n* [Wholesale Terms][214]\n* [FAQs][215]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][216]\n* [orders@pravada.com][217]\n* [(239) 260-9826][218]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][219]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[19]: /collections/clear-skin\n[20]: /collections/plumping\n[21]: /pages/skin-care-by-focus\n[22]: /collections/professiona"
