Lotion\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk skincare sizes, our **Argan & Aloe Body Lotion** is a lightweight, fast-absorbing\nbody care formula designed to deliver deep hydration, barrier support, and lasting skin comfort.\nFormulated with botanical extracts and oils, this lotion helps soften, smooth, and visibly improve\nskin texture. Antioxidant green tea extract and vitamin E provide added protection against\nenvironmental stressors, making this formula ideal for daily use and professional body treatments.\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $93.115 gallon - $369.37Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for testing texture, scent options, and absorption.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, hospitality programs, body treatment services, and recurring\noperational inventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for hospitality refill systems, high-volume spa operations, large-scale filling runs, and\nscaling body care collections.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. Please contact us for larger quantities.*\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur Argan & Aloe Body Lotion helps nourish, protect, and restore the skin, making it well-suited for\nspa treatments and back-bar applications. **It addresses:**\n* Dryness and dehydration\n* Rough texture and loss of softness\n* Compromised skin barrier\n* Environmental stress\u2013related skin fatigue\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Deliver deep, long-lasting moisturization\n* Enhance skin softness and elasticity\n* Strengthen the skin\u2019s natural moisture barrier\n* Improve overall skin texture and tone\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for:** All skin types, especially dry, dehydrated, or environmentally stressed skin.\n\nApply generously to clean, dry skin and massage until fully absorbed. Use daily or as needed to\nmaintain smooth, hydrated skin.\n\n**For professional use:** Ideal for body treatments, post-exfoliation hydration, massage\nenhancement, and finishing applications in spa and back-bar protocols.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Organic Aloe Leaf Juice:**][197] Soothing, hydration-rich botanical that calms the skin and\nsupports moisture balance.\n\n[**Botanical Glycerin:**][198] A powerful humectant that attracts and retains moisture, helping to\nkeep skin soft, smooth, and hydrated.\n\n**Organic Argan Oil + **[**Avocado Oil:**][199] Nutrient-dense oils rich in essential fatty acids\nthat help improve softness, elasticity, and skin resilience.\n\n[**Organic Shea Butter**][200]** + **[**Organic Jojoba Oil:**][201] Deeply nourishing lipids that\ncondition the skin and enhance long-lasting moisture.\n\n[**Panthenol (Vitamin B5):**][202] Moisture-binding vitamin that helps soothe, strengthen, and\nvisibly improve skin texture.\n\n[**Green Tea Extract**][203]** + **[**Vitamin E:**][204] Antioxidant-rich pairing that helps protect\nagainst environmental stressors and supports overall skin health.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* pH Range: 5.50 - 6.50\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 1 gallon and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis lotion base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient, ready-to-use\napplication.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate\n20** or **Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2\nratio** of solubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our\nDIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][205].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][206] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][207]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nPanthenol\n\nA humectant that attracts and retains moisture while improving softness and barrier resilience.\n\nAloe Vera\n\nA hydrating and soothing botanical that helps replenish moisture, calm irritation, and support the\nskin barrier for a soft, balanced complexion.\n\nGlycerin\n\nA powerful humectant that draws moisture into the skin, keeping it soft, smooth, and hydrated.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Argan & Aloe Body Lotion**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare options.\n\nDoes this formula provide antioxidant protection?\n\nYes. Green tea extract and vitamin E help defend against environmental stressors that can contribute\nto dryness and visible signs of aging.\n\nCan this lotion be used daily?\n\nAbsolutely. Its balanced, non-greasy formulation makes it suitable for daily use in both\nprofessional and at-home care routines.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][208][\n][209][\n][210][\n][211][\n][212]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][213]\n* [Hair Care][214]\n* [Bath & Body][215]\n* [Scents][216]\n* [Resources][217]\n* [Private Label][218]\n\n**POLICIES