nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Aloe Cooling Gel]\n[Aloe Cooling Gel]\n[Aloe Cooling Gel]\n[Aloe Cooling Gel]\n[Aloe Cooling Gel] [Aloe Cooling Gel] [Aloe Cooling Gel] [Aloe Cooling Gel]\n\n# Aloe Cooling Gel\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk skincare sizes, our lightweight, fast-absorbing **Aloe Cooling Gel **delivers\nimmediate soothing hydration, refreshing relief, and skin-calming support. Formulated with aloe\nvera, spirulina, and a blend of nutrient-rich botanical extracts, this advanced gel helps reduce\nvisible redness, comfort stressed skin, and support recovery after sun exposure or professional\ntreatments.\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $102.515 gallon - $390.45Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for testing texture, scent options, and absorption.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, hospitality programs, body treatment services, and recurring\noperational inventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for hospitality refill systems, high-volume spa operations, large-scale filling runs, and\nscaling body care collections.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. Please contact us for larger quantities.*\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur Aloe Cooling Gel delivers targeted benefits that help calm, hydrate, and restore the skin,\nmaking it an essential for daily use and professional back-bar treatments. **It targets:**\n* Irritation and redness\n* Post-treatment sensitivity\n* Dehydration and dryness\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Soothe and cool the skin with Aloe Vera and cucumber extract for immediate relief\n* Support skin repair and resilience with antioxidant-rich Spirulina and botanical extracts\n* Hydrate and replenish moisture to restore balance and comfort\n* Calm visible redness and reduce signs of stress for a more even, refreshed complexion\n\n**Usage**\n\n**Suitable for: **All skin types, especially those experiencing sensitivity, redness, or\npost-treatment stress.\n\nApply to clean skin and spread evenly over the desired area. Allow to absorb fully. Reapply as\nneeded for continued soothing and hydration.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n**Organic Aloe Leaf Juice:** Soothing, hydration-rich botanical that calms the skin and supports\nmoisture balance.\n\n**Spirulina Platensis Extract (Spirulina):** A nutrient-dense algae rich in proteins, vitamins, and\nantioxidants that helps support skin repair and resilience.\n\n**Oryza Sativa (Rice) Seed Water & Rice Extract:** Rich in minerals and antioxidants, these\ningredients support a smoother texture and more balanced, refreshed appearance.\n\n**Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract:** Known for its cooling and hydrating effects, it\ndelivers refreshing moisture while enhancing the gel\u2019s calming sensation, making it ideal for\npost-treatment and sun-exposed skin.\n\n**Gotu Kola:** Known for its soothing properties, this botanical helps calm the skin and support a\nhealthier-looking barrier.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, & phthalates\n* Made in USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 1 gallon and 5 gallons\n* For larger quantities, please contact us.\n* Updated September 2025\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nAloe Vera\n\nA hydrating and soothing botanical that helps replenish moisture, calm irritation, and support the\nskin barrier for a soft, balanced complexion.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Aloe Cooling Gel**, formulation standards, and bulk skincare options.\n\nWill this gel leave a sticky or greasy residue?\n\nNo, the fast-absorbing gel sinks into the skin quickly and leaves a clean, refreshed finish without\nstickiness or heaviness.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\nIs this formula clean and vegan?\n\nYes. This formula is 100% vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without parabens, phthalates, or\nsulfates. It aligns with clean beauty standards.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][204]\n* [Hair Care][205]\n* [Bath & Body][206]\n* [Scents][207]\n* [Resources][208]\n* [Private Label][209]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][210]\n* [Refund Policy][211]\n* [Shipping Policy][212]\n* [Terms of Service][213]\n* [Wholesale Terms][214]\n* [FAQs][215]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][216]\n* [orders@pravada.com][217]\n* [(239) 260-9826][218]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][219]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[19]: /collections/clear-skin\n[20]: /collections/plumping\n[21]: /pages/skin-care-by-focus\n[22]: /collections/professional-grade\n[23]: /collections/plant-powered\n[24]: /collect"
