nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel]\n[Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel]\n[Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel]\n[Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel]\n[Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel] [Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel] [Organic\nSunflower and Coconut Shower Gel] [Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel]\n\n# Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $87.255 gallon - $307.42Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating lather, cleansing feel, and scent options.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, hospitality amenities, salon operations, and recurring operational\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for hospitality refill systems, treatment rooms, high-volume operations, and large-scale\nproduction.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nIndulge in the gentle, moisturizing embrace of our Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel, a\npremium cleansing formula crafted from the finest natural and organic ingredients. Featuring a blend\nof organic sunflower and coconut oils, this shower gel creates a rich, luxurious foam that cleanses\nthe skin while imparting deep moisture. Free from sulfates, parabens, and phthalates, this shower\ngel is not only kind to your skin but also to the environment, making it a conscientious choice for\nyour daily routine.\n\n### **Highlighted Benefits\n### **\n\n##### **Gentle Cleansing & Moisturization**\n* **Potassium Cocoate (Organic Coconut Oil) & Potassium Oleate (Organic Sunflower Oil):** These\nnatural soap bases derived from coconut and sunflower oils provide gentle cleansing without\nstripping the skin of its natural oils, leaving the skin soft, hydrated, and refreshed.\n* **Glycerin:** A natural humectant that draws moisture into the skin, ensuring that your shower\nexperience leaves your skin feeling moisturized and supple.\n\n##### **Skin-Friendly & Sustainable**\n* **Sulfate, Paraben, and Phthalate-Free:** Formulated without harsh chemicals, ensuring the shower\ngel is gentle on the skin and suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n\n##### **Natural Botanicals for Enhanced Skin Health**\n* **Lauryl Betaine:** Derived from sugar beets, this mild surfactant helps to soften and reduce\nirritation, enhancing the cleansing experience.\n* **Potassium Palm Kernelate & Palm Kernel Acid:** Derived from sustainable palm kernel oil, these\ningredients contribute to the gel's luxurious lather and cleansing properties, ensuring a thorough\nyet gentle wash.\n\nOur Organic Sunflower and Coconut Shower Gel offers a harmonious blend of nature's most nurturing\noils, combined with botanicals, to provide a cleansing experience that's as indulgent as it is\neffective. Elevate your daily shower to a moment of pure bliss with this moisturizing cleanser, and\nstep out feeling refreshed, revitalized, and ready to embrace the day with beautifully soft,\nnourished skin.\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nApply to moistened skin with fingers or damp cloth in light circular and massaging motions avoiding\ndirect contact with eyes. Rinse with warm water. For best results, follow with a moisturizer.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Organic Coconut Oil\n* Organic Sunflower Oil\n* Botanical Glycerin\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[19]: /collections/clear-skin\n[20]: /collections/plumping\n[21]: /pages/skin-care-by-focus\n[22]: /collections/professional-grade\n[23]: /collections/plant-powered\n[24]: /collections/vegan\n[25]: /collections/sensitive-skin\n[26]: /collections/antioxidant-support\n[27]: /collections/tr