nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Calendula Body Wash]\n[Calendula Body Wash]\n[Calendula Body Wash]\n[Calendula Body Wash]\n[Calendula Body Wash] [Calendula Body Wash] [Calendula Body Wash] [Calendula Body Wash]\n\n# Calendula Body Wash\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $79.855 gallon - $272.97Variant\nWhat size should I order? Bulk Size Guide\n\n**Sample**\nBest for evaluating lather, cleansing feel, and scent options.\n\n**1 Gallon (128 oz)**\nPopular for spa refill systems, hospitality amenities, salon operations, and recurring operational\ninventory.\n\n**5 Gallon (640 oz)**\nBest for hospitality refill systems, treatment rooms, high-volume operations, and large-scale\nproduction.\n\n*Estimated yield varies depending on fill size. ****Please contact us for larger quantities.***\n\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nPamper skin with the gentle touch of our Calendula Body Wash, a naturally crafted cleanser designed\nto purify and rejuvenate skin with every wash. Infused with a symphony of botanical extracts,\nincluding the soothing properties of Calendula, this body wash is formulated to cleanse away\nimpurities while deeply conditioning and moisturizing your skin. Its mild composition makes it an\nideal choice for all skin types, offering a nurturing cleanse that leaves your skin feeling soft,\nrefreshed, and delicately scented.\n\n### **Highlighted Benefits\n### **\n\n##### **Gentle Cleansing**\n* **Decyl Glucoside & Coco Glucoside:** These natural, plant-derived surfactants offer a gentle\ncleansing experience, effectively removing dirt and impurities without stripping the skin of its\nnatural oils.\n* **Cocamidopropyl Betaine:** Enhances the cleansing action while maintaining the skin's natural\nbalance, ensuring a soft and soothing wash suitable for all skin types.\n\n##### **Deep Hydration & Nourishment**\n* **Vegetable Glycerin & Cannabis Sativa (Hemp) Seed Oil:** These hydrating ingredients attract and\nlock in moisture, leaving your skin feeling hydrated and supple. Hemp seed oil, rich in essential\nfatty acids, further nourishes the skin, enhancing its natural barrier.\n* **Panthenol (Vitamin B5):** Acts as a humectant, attracting moisture to the skin and holding it\nthere, ensuring lasting hydration and a silky-smooth feel.\n\n##### **Soothing Botanical Extracts**\n* **Calendula Officinalis (Calendula Marigold Flower) Extract:** Renowned for its soothing and\nanti-inflammatory properties, Calendula calms sensitive and irritated skin, promoting a healthy,\nradiant complexion.\n* **Arctium Lappa (Burdock Root) Extract & Urtica Diotica (Nettle Leaf) Extract:** These extracts\nare known for their skin-purifying and anti-inflammatory properties, aiding in the reduction of\nskin irritations and promoting overall skin health.\n\nOur Calendula Body Wash is more than just a cleansing product; it's a soothing elixir that brings\nthe nurturing power of nature to your daily routine. This body wash caters to those who seek a\nnatural, effective solution for maintaining the health and beauty of their skin. Embrace the calming\nembrace of Calendula and transform your shower into a rejuvenating botanical garden, leaving your\nskin clean, conditioned, and delightfully refreshed.\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nApply to moistened skin with fingers or damp cloth in light circular and massaging motions avoiding\ndirect contact with eyes. Rinse with warm water. For best results, follow with a moisturizer.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Botanical Glycerin\n* Hemp Seed Oil\n* ProVitamin B5\n* Calendula Marigold Flower Extract\n* Burdock Root Extract\n* Nettle Leaf Extract\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[19]: /collections/clear-skin\n[20]: /collections/plumping\n[21]: /pages/skin-care-by-focus\n[22]: /colle