nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Natural Foot Balm]\n[Natural Foot Balm]\n[Natural Foot Balm]\n[Natural Foot Balm]\n[Natural Foot Balm] [Natural Foot Balm] [Natural Foot Balm] [Natural Foot Balm]\n\n# Natural Foot Balm\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $181.625 gallon - $782.69Variant\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nElevate the foot care routine with our Natural Foot Balm, an invigorating blend designed to soothe\nand revitalize tired, achy feet. Anchored in wildcrafted Shea Butter, this balm is enriched with the\nhealing properties of MSM and Grape Seed Oil. Horsetail Extract works to reduce swelling, while an\ninvigorating mix of Mint Oils offers a refreshing sensation, making this balm ideal for foot\nmassages or as a comforting treatment for sore muscles.\n\n### **Highlighted Benefits\n### **\n\n##### **Soothing Relief & Moisturization**\n* **Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter) & Carthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Oil:** Provide deep\nhydration, softening rough skin and alleviating dryness for a smooth, supple feel.\n* **Aloe Barbardensis Leaf Juice (Organic Aloe Vera) & Organic Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower Oil):**\nOffer soothing properties and enhance the balm's moisturizing effect, promoting skin healing and\ncomfort.\n\n##### **Refreshing & Cooling Sensation**\n* **Mentha Piperita (Peppermint Essential Oil) & Laevo Menthol (Menthol):** Deliver a cooling and\nrefreshing sensation, revitalizing tired and achy feet with their invigorating properties.\n* **Gaultheria Procumbens (Wintergreen) Leaf Oil & Mentha Spicate (Spearmint) Oil:** Contribute to\nthe balm's minty aroma and provide additional soothing and cooling effects.\n\n##### **Healing & Anti-Inflammatory**\n* **Dimethyl Sulfone (MSM) & Organic Arnica Montana (Arnica):** Known for their healing and\nanti-inflammatory benefits, these ingredients help to reduce swelling and discomfort in sore\nmuscles and joints.\n* **Vitis Vinifera (Grapeseed) Oil & Organic Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Oil:** These oils offer\nantioxidant protection and aid in repairing and nourishing the skin.\n\n##### **Natural Protection & Repair**\n* **Beeswax & Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba Wax):** Create a protective barrier on the skin's\nsurface, locking in moisture and nutrients to aid in the skin's natural repair process.\n* **Organic Centella Asiatica (Gotu Kola Extract) & Organic Equisetum Arvense (Horsetail Plant)\nExtract:** Support skin regeneration, improve circulation, and enhance the skin's natural\nresilience.\n\nOur Natural Foot Balm is more than just a foot treatment; it's a comprehensive solution for\nrevitalizing and caring for your feet. Whether used as part of a daily care routine or as a special\ntreat after a long day, this balm offers the soothing, moisturizing, and healing care your feet\ndeserve, leaving them feeling refreshed, soft, and rejuvenated.\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nApply a generous amount to feet, ankles and calves in circular and massaging motions. Concentrate on\nrough and dry spots.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Organic Aloe Vera Leaf Juice\n* Safflower Oil\n* Organic Sunflower Seed Oil\n* Shea Butter\n* MSM\n* Peppermint Essential Oil\n* Menthol\n* Apricot Kernel Oil\n* Beeswax\n* Carnauba Wax\n* Organic Arnica Extract\n* Grape Seed Oil\n* Organic Jojoba Oil\n* Wintergreen Oil\n* Spearmint Oil\n* Eucalyptus Essential Oil\n* Tea Tree Oil\n* Hyaluronic Acid\n* Organic Hemp Oil\n* Honey\n* Organic Gotu Kola Extract\n* Organic Horsetail Plant Extract\n* Wild Geranium Extract\n* Organic Dandelion Extract\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][205]\n* [Hair Care][206]\n* [Bath & Body][207]\n* [Scents][208]\n* [Resources][209]\n* [Private Label][210]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][211]\n* [Refund Policy][212]\n* [Shipping Policy][213]\n* [Terms of Service][214]\n* [Wholesale Terms][215]\n* [FAQs][216]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][217]\n* [orders@pravada.com][218]\n* [(239) 260-9826][219]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][220]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing, Payments & Billing\nLead Times & Shipping\nReturns & Cancellations\nOur Standards\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products/overnight-glow-hydrating-cream-mask\n[3]: /\n[4]: /pages/skin-care\n[5]: /collections/cleansers\n[6]: /collections/toners-mists\n[7]: /collections/serums\n[8]: /collections/moisturizers\n[9]: /collections/eye-treatments\n[10]: /collections/masks\n[11]: /collections/new-products\n[12]: /collections/coming-soon-skin-care\n[13]: /collections/skin-care\n[14]: /pages/skin-care-by-result\n[15]: /collections/hydrating\n[16]: /collections/brightening\n[17]: /collections/smooth-firm\n[18]: /collections/barrier-repair\n[19]: /collections/clear-skin\n[20]: /collections/plumping\n[21]: /pages/skin-care-by-focus\n[22]: /collections/professional-grade\n[23]: /collections/plant-powered\n[24]: /collections/vega