nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C]\n[Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C]\n[Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C]\n[Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C]\n[Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C]\n[Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C] [Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C] [Restorative Hand\nCream with Vitamin C] [Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C] [Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin\n\n# Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nAvailable in bulk skincare sizes, our lightweight, fast-absorbing **Restorative Hand Cream with\nVitamin C** delivers deep hydration, visible smoothing, and lasting comfort for dry, overworked\nhands. Formulated with antioxidant **vitamins C and E, organic botanicals, and skin-conditioning\nactives**, this advanced cream helps improve texture, replenish moisture, and support a\nhealthy-looking skin barrier without leaving a greasy residue.\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $101.595 gallon - $388.70Variant\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\n**Benefits**\n\nOur** Restorative Hand Cream** delivers targeted benefits that help hydrate, smooth, and protect the\nskin, making it an essential for daily care and professional use. **It targets:**\n* Dryness and dehydration\n* Rough texture and uneven skin feel\n* Dullness and environmental stress\n\n**By helping to:**\n* Deeply hydrate and replenish moisture for soft, comfortable hands\n* Smooth rough texture and improve the overall feel of the skin\n* Provide antioxidant protection with vitamins C and E to support healthy-looking skin\n* Calm and soothe dry, stressed skin with aloe, chamomile, and allantoin\n* Support a resilient, healthy-looking skin barrier with nourishing botanicals\n\n**Usage**\n\nApply a generous amount to skin in circular and massaging motions. Concentrate on rough, cracked and\ndry areas. Can be used as a moisturizing all-over body creme.\n\n**Ingredients**\n\n[**Aloe Vera Juice:**][197] Soothing, hydration-rich botanical that calms the skin and supports\nmoisture balance.\n\n[**Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil:**][198] Rich in vitamin E and linoleic acid to help\nmaintain the skin barrier and retain moisture.\n\n[**Botanical Glycerin:**][199] A powerful humectant that attracts and retains moisture, helping to\nkeep skin soft, smooth, and hydrated.\n\n[**Chamomile Extract:**][200] Gentle calming agent that helps reduce redness and support sensitive\nskin.\n\n[**Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate (Vitamin C):**][201] A stable, lipid-soluble form of Vitamin C that\nbrightens, evens tone, and supports collagen production while reducing oxidative stress.\n\n[**Allantoin:**][202] Skin-conditioning ingredient that promotes comfort, softness, and barrier\nrecovery.\n\n[**Gotu Kola:**][203] Known for its soothing properties, this botanical helps calm the skin and\nsupport a healthier-looking barrier.\n\n[**Vitamin E (Tocopherol):**][204] Antioxidant that helps protect skin from environmental stressors\nwhile supporting moisture balance.\n\n**Formula Notes**\n* Clean Beauty Formulation\n* Vegan & Cruelty-Free\n* Free from parabens, sulfates, and phthalates\n* Made in the USA in a GMP-certified, FDA-compliant facility\n* Available in bulk sizes: 1 gallon and 5 gallon\n* For larger quantities, please contact us\n**Adding a Fragrance**\n\nThis hand cream base is available **unscented or pre-mixed with fragrance** for convenient,\nready-to-use application.\n\nIf mixing fragrance or essential oils yourself, use a **solubilizer** such as **Polysorbate\n20** or **Polysorbate 80** to ensure even dispersion in this water-based formula. A **1:1 to 1:2\nratio** of solubilizer to oil is recommended for optimal blending. For more information, view our\nDIY Fragrance Mixing Manual [here][205].\n\n**Sale Terms**\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][206] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][207]\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n**CLINICALLY VALIDATED ACTIVES**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CLEAN BEAUTY FORMULATION**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**CRUELTY FREE**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n**Vegan**\n\n**\u00b7**\n\n## Key Ingredients\n\nVitamin C\n\nA brightening antioxidant that supports collagen production, enhances radiance, and helps protect\nthe skin from environmental stressors.\n\nCentella Asiatica\n\nA botanical that helps soothe, strengthen, and repair the skin barrier while promoting firmness,\nelasticity, and a calm, healthy-looking complexion.\n\nSunflower Oil\n\nA nourishing botanical that helps replenish moisture and improve softness without heaviness.\n\n## More Questions?\n\nLearn more about our **Restorative Hand Cream with Vitamin C**, formulation standards, and bulk\nskincare options.\n\nWhat role does Vitamin C play in this hand cream?\n\nOil-soluble Vitamin C provides antioxidant protection while helping improve the look of radiance and\noverall skin tone on the hands.\n\nHow does this formula absorb on the skin?\n\nThe cream absorbs quickly, delivering immediate comfort and hydration without leaving a greasy or\nheavy residue.\n\nWhat bulk sizes are available?\n\nThis formula is available in bulk skincare sizes up to 5 gallons, ideal for brands, spas, and more\nlooking to fill their own packaging or use it for professional back-bar treatments.\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][208][\n][209][\n][210][\n][211][\n][212]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n\n**MoCRA COMPLIANT**\n\n**Cruelty-Free**\n\n**Clean Beauty**\n\n**Navigation**\n* [Skin Care][213]\n* [Hair Care][214]\n* [Bath & Body][215]\n* [Scents][216]\n* [Resources][217]\n* [Private Label][218]\n\n**POLICIES**\n* [Privacy Policy][219]\n* [Refund Policy][220]\n* [Shipping Policy][221]\n* [Terms of Service][222]\n* [Wholesale Terms][223]\n* [FAQs][224]\n\n**Contact**\n* [8820 Business Park Drive STE 501 , Fort Myers, FL 33912-USA][225]\n* [orders@pravada.com][226]\n* [(239) 260-9826][227]\n\n**Join our Newsletter**\n\nReceive updates, exclusive deals, tips and tricks, and more!\n\nE-mail\nSubscribe\n\n\u00a9 2026 - Pravada Beauty Labs [- ALL RIGHTS RESERVED][228]\n* [American Express]\n* [Apple Pay]\n* [Discover]\n* [Google Pay]\n* [Mastercard]\n* [Visa]\n\nHELP CENTER \u2715\nOur Products\nHow It Works\nPricing,"
