nHair Care\n* By Category\n[Shampoo][144][Conditioner][145][Styling & Hold][146][Prep & Prime][147][Repair &\nTreatment][148][Oils, Serums, & Scalp Care][149][Coming Soon][150][View All][151]\n* Best Sellers\n[Daily Ritual Hydrating Shampoo][152][Daily Ritual Hydrating Conditioner][153][Pre-Wash Hair &\nScalp Oil][154][Argan Smoothing Serum][155][Soft Sculpt Curl Cream][156][Weekly Ritual Hydrating\nHair Mask][157]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**WEEKLY RITUAL HYDRATING HAIR MASK**][158]\n\n[**LEARN MORE**][159]\n\nBath & Body\n* By Category\n[Body Lotions][160][Body Scrubs][161][Body Wash][162][Body Creams, Butters, & Balms][163][Body\nGels, Serums, & Oils][164][Coming Soon][165][View All][166]\n* Best Sellers\n[Argan & Aloe Body Lotion][167][Whipped Body Butter][168][Shea Butter Sugar Scrub][169][Meadowfoam\n& Black Currant Weightless Body Oil][170][Calendula Body Wash][171][Caf\u00e9 Mocha Body Scrub][172]\n\n*NEW!*** **[**HYDRATING BODY SERUM WITH CERAMIDES**][173]\n\n[**Learn More**][174]\n\nScents\n* By Category\n[Fragrance Oils][175][Essential Oils][176][View All][177]\n* Best Sellers\n[Sandalwood Eucalyptus][178][Lemon Verbena][179][Cashmere Blush][180][Summer Spritz][181][Sweet\nOrange Essential Oil][182][Rosemary Mint Essential Oil][183]\n\n*New!* [***Neroli Basil Fragrance Oil***][184]\n\n[**Learn More**][185]\n\nResources\n* [About Us][186]\n* [How It Works][187]\n* [Clean Beauty][188]\n* [Mixing Manual][189]\n* [Ingredient Lists][190]\n* [Ingredient Glossary][191]\n* [Blog][192]\n* [FAQs][193]\n* [Contact Us][194]\n\nCart\n\nYour cart is empty\n\nClose\n\n**New!** OVERNIGHT GLOW HYDRATING CREAM MASK\n\nAn overnight cream mask providing deep hydration and a radiant, dewy glow by morning. [**Try now\n**\u279c][195]\nZoom picture\n[Intensive Therapy Foot Cream]\n[Intensive Therapy Foot Cream]\n[Intensive Therapy Foot Cream]\n[Intensive Therapy Foot Cream]\n[Intensive Therapy Foot Cream] [Intensive Therapy Foot Cream] [Intensive Therapy Foot Cream]\n[Intensive Therapy Foot Cream]\n\n# Intensive Therapy Foot Cream\n\nSale price$3.95 USD\n\nTax excluded. [Shipping calculated][196] at checkout\n\nSize:\nSample 1 gallon 5 gallon\nSample - $3.951 gallon - $117.975 gallon - $469.36Variant\nDecrease quantity Increase quantity\nAdd to cart\nShare\nShare\n\n**Good to Know:** This formulation is Cruelty Free, Paraben Free, Sulfate Free\n\n**Please note:** All samples will ship unfragranced. *Lead times are generally 2-4 weeks, but can\nvary by product.* Please be advised that lead times are subject to change and you will be notified\nif such change occurs. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nDescription\n\nRevitalize weary feet with our Intensive Therapy Foot Cream, specially formulated to address the\nneeds of cracked and dry skin. This rich cream combines the energizing effects of Wintergreen and\nEucalyptus Oils with the healing properties of Horsetail and the deep hydration of Safflower Oil.\nDesigned to rejuvenate and refresh tired feet, this cream offers a minty, clean aroma derived from\nnatural plant extracts, making each application a revitalizing sensory experience.\n\n### **Highlighted Benefits\n### **\n\n##### **Deep Moisturization**\n* **Carthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Seed Oil & Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower Oil):** These oils are\nknown for their hydrating properties, penetrating deeply to moisturize and soothe dry, cracked\nskin.\n* **Organic Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice (Aloe Vera) & Glycerin (Kosher Vegetable):** Provide\nadditional moisture and promote healing, helping to restore the skin's natural balance and\nsoftness.\n\n##### **Stimulation & Revitalization**\n* **Gaultheria Procumbens (Wintergreen) Leaf Oil & Eucalyptus Globulus (Eucalyptus Essential Oil):**\nOffer a cooling and stimulating effect, rejuvenating tired feet and enhancing circulation.\n* **Mentha Piperita (Peppermint Essential Oil) & Laevo Menthol (Menthol):** Contribute to the\ncream's refreshing and invigorating properties, leaving a pleasant, cooling sensation.\n\n##### **Swelling Reduction & Skin Health**\n* **Organic Equisetum Arvense (Horsetail Plant) Extract:** Known for its anti-inflammatory\nproperties, Horsetail helps to reduce swelling and improve skin texture.\n* **Organic Centella Asiatica (Gotu Kola) Extract & Organic Taraxacum Officinale (Dandelion)\nExtract:** Support skin regeneration and offer detoxifying benefits, promoting overall foot\nhealth.\n\nOur Intensive Therapy Foot Cream is more than just a moisturizer; it's a comprehensive treatment for\nthe feet, offering relief from dryness and discomfort while energizing and reviving tired skin.\nIdeal for daily use or as part of a pampering foot care routine, this cream ensures feet remain\nhydrated, healthy, and refreshed, ready to carry you through your day with comfort and ease.\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nApply to the skin in a circular and massaging motion concentrating on rough, cracked, itchy and dry\nareas. Creates a cooling sensation to help relieve over worked feet.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS\n* Organic Aloe Vera Leaf Juice\n* Safflower Seed Oil\n* Sunflower Oil\n* Peppermint Essential Oil\n* Menthol\n* Wintergreen Essential Oil\n* Spearmint Essential Oil\n* Eucalyptus Essential Oil\n* Tea Tree Oil\n* Vitamin E\n* Honeysuckle Flower Extract\n* Organic Gotu Kola Extract\n* Organic Horsetail Plant Extract\n* Wild Geranium Extract\n* Organic Dandelion Extract\nSale Terms\n\nAll orders are **final sale and cannot be returned. **When you purchase a product from Pravada\nBeauty Labs, you agree to [Pravada Terms and Conditions.][197] For questions or concerns, including\nany issues with damaged goods, please contact us at [orders@pravada.com][198]\n\n## Recently viewed products\n\n## SHOP BY **PRODUCT TYPE**\n\n][199][\n][200][\n][201][\n][202][\n][203]\n\nInterested in **private label** for this product?\n\nAll of our bulk products are available for private label at low minimums. Learn more below.\n\n[Private Label][204]\n\n**FDA REGISTERED**\n\n**GMP CERTIFIED**\n