 Glycerin from a container.]\n[Beauty and Personal Care product category.]\nGlycerin\n[Tall glass building with mirror windows made with Silver Nitrate.]\n[Metals product category. Silver product icon.]\nSilver Nitrate\n[Factory making LCD screens using Potassium Iodide.]\n[Iodine & Iodine Derivatives product category.]\nPotassium Iodide\n[MRI imaging of a brain using contrast made with Iodine.]\n[Iodine & Iodine Derivatives product category.]\nIodine (DEA List I Permit Required)\n[Sample of Bromine in a tube encased in a clear plastic cube with periodic element labeling.]\n[Bromine and Bromine Derivatives product category.]\nBromine\n[High-tech stainless steel industrial processing tank control panel in pharmaceutical factory that\nuses Ethyl Bromide in manufacturing.]\n[Bromine and Bromine Derivatives product category.]\nEthyl Bromide\n[Livestock eating feed made with Copper Carbonate from a trough.]\n[Copper product icon.]\nCopper Carbonate\n[CNC plasma cutter machine big metal - uses Hydrobromic Acid.]\n[Bromine and Bromine Derivatives product category.]\nHydrobromic Acid Solutions\n[Worker spraying a fertilizer made with Phosphoric Acid onto plants.]\n[Phosphates product category. ]\nPhosphoric Acid\n[Button cell battery made with Silver Oxide.]\n[Metals product category. Silver product icon.]\nSilver(I) Oxide\n[Arial view of Wastewater Treatment plant which uses Zinc Sulfate.]\n[Zinc product icon.]\nZinc Sulfate Solution\n1.  Specialty Chemicals Available\n3.  Superior Service\n5.  Custom Packaging\n7.  Semi Bulk to Bulk Distribution\n9.  Domestic & International Supply Chain Network\n1.  Specialty Chemicals Available\n3.  Superior Service\n5.  Custom Packaging\n7.  Semi Bulk to Bulk Distribution\n9.  Domestic & International Supply Chain Network\n1.  Specialty Chemicals Available\n3.  Superior Service\n5.  Custom Packaging\n7.  Semi Bulk to Bulk Distribution\n9.  Domestic & International Supply Chain Network\n1.  Specialty Chemicals Available\n3.  Superior Se