 Better?]\n][148]\nJune 19, 2026 6 min read\n\n##### [LABSA vs SLES: Which Surfactant Is Better?][149]\n\nSurfactants are the backbone of modern cleaning products. Whether a manufacturer is producing\nlaundry detergents, dishwashing liquids, industrial degreasers, hand soaps, or personal care\nproducts, surfactant selection directly impacts cleaning performance, foam generation, product\nstability, and production costs.\n\n[ Read more ][150]\n[\n[Why LABSA Is the Most Widely Used Surfactant in Detergent Manufa"
