n* [ Bath Bomb Supplies ][246]\n* [ Salts ][247]\n* [ Exfoliants ][248]\n* [ Vitamins ][249]\n* [Candle Supplies][250]\n\n[CANDLE SUPPLIES][251]\n* * [ Containers ][252]\n* [ Tools ][253]\n* [ Wicks ][254]\n* [ Essential Oils ][255]\n* [ Fragrances ][256]\n* [ Waxes ][257]\n\n[ESSENTIAL OILS][258]\n* * [ Certified Organic Essential Oils ][259]\n* [ Hair Benefit ][260]\n* [ Skin Benefit ][261]\n* [ Fruits ][262]\n* [ Flowers ][263]\n* [ Trees ][264]\n* [ Candle Safe ][265]\n* [ Herbs ][266]\n\n[FRAGRANCES][267]\n* * [ Floral ][268]\n* [ Fruit ][269]\n* [ Woodsy ][270]\n* [ Outdoors ][271]\n* [ Holiday ][272]\n* [ Food ][273]\n* [ Tobacco ][274]\n* [ 100% Natural ][275]\n* [ Alcohol ][276]\n\n[WAXES][277]\n* *\n* [100% Coconut][278]\n* [100% Soy][279]\n* [Beeswax][280]\n* [Container Wax][281]\n* [Pillars/Tapers][282]\n* [Soy/Coconut/Palm Blends][283]\n* [Parablends][284]\n* [Tart/Wax Melt][285]\n* [Paraffins][286]\n* [Fragrances][287]\n\n[CLEAN FRAGRANCES][288]\n* * [ Floral ][289]\n* [ Fruit ][290]\n* [ Woodsy ][291]\n* [ Outdoors ][292]\n* [ Holiday ][293]\n* [ Food ][294]\n* [ Tobacco ][295]\n* [ 100% Natural ][296]\n* [ Alcohol ][297]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][298]\n\nHours of Operation\n\nThe store and the warehouse are open during following hours :\n* Tuesday through Thursday, 9am to 5pm\n* Friday, 9am to 4pm\n* We are closed Saturday, Sunday and Monday\n\nHow to Order\n\nYou can place orders online or through our shipping app (coming soon!).\n\nYou can email orders to [**[email protected]**][299]. These orders will not show up in your online\naccount history.\n\nYou can call us at** [503-653-1155][300]** with your order.\n\nYou can come in to the store and shop!\n[Read More..][301]\n\nHow does Store Pickup Work\n\nStore Pickup means that you will come in to our Milwaukie, Oregon store and pick up your order.\nOnce you place a Store Pickup order with us, we will email you when it is ready. Store Pickup\norders are usually processed within about two hours, but it all depends on how many orders we have\nto process. All orders are made in the order they are received. You are welcome to come in anytime\nafter you have received the email to pick up your order. Please be sure to check your spam folder\nfor this email as it may contain a copy of your invoice and often gets sent to spam.\n[Read More..][302]\n\nShipping\n\nOrders under 450 pounds are generally shipped UPS ground. Shipping can be calculated right on the\nwebsite. We know shipping is expensive! We don\u2019t make any profit on shipping, it is just what UPS\ncharges us.\n\nPallet sized orders will be shipped using Echo Logistics. Freight can be calculated directly on\nthe website.\nIf you have a small order, please call us directly as we can often ship via USPS and save you.\n\n[Read More..][303]\n* [[Vector-17.png]Product][304]\n[ [Shay-Co-logo] ][305]\n* [Packaging][306]\n[PACKAGING][307]\n* * [ Jars ][308]\n* [ Candle ][309]\n* [ Bottles ][310]\n* [ Pumps ][311]\n* [ Sprayers ][312]\n* [ Wicks ][313]\n* [ Tools ][314]\n* [ Labels ][315]\n* [ Buckets ][316]\n* [ Jugs ][317]\n* [ Bags ][318]\n* [Butters][319]\n\n[BUTTERS][320]\n* * [ Certified Organic Butter ][321]\n* [ Soft Butters ][322]\n* [ Hard Butters ][323]\n* [ Super Fats ][324]\n* [Specialty Ingredients][325]\n\n[SPECIALTY INGREDIENTS][326]\n* * [ Surfactants ][327]\n* [ Preservatives ][328]\n* [ Lyes ][329]\n* [ Emulsifiers ][330]\n* [ Colors ][331]\n* [ Clays ][332]\n* [ Waxes ][333]\n* [ Conditioning Agents ][334]\n* [ Bath Bomb Supplies ][335]\n* [ Salts ][336]\n* [ Exfoliants ][337]\n* [ Vitamins ][338]\n* [ Functional Waxes ][339]\n* [Exfoliants][340]\n\n[EXFOLIANTS][341]\n* * [ Certified Organic Exfoliants ][342]\n* [ Salts ][343]\n* [ Sugars ][344]\n* [ Jojoba Beads ][345]\n* [ Plant Fibers ][346]\n* [Cosmetic Bases][347]\n* [Hydrosols][348]\n* [Hair Care][349]\n\n[HAIR CARE][350]\n* * [ Bases ][351]\n* [ Essential Oils ][352]\n* [ Specialty Oils ][353]\n* [ Conditioning Agents ][354]\n* [ Surfactants ][355]\n