.uk\n\nGeneral enquiries: Call +44 (0) 191 587 2287\n\nOpening hours: Mon \u2013 Thur: 8.00am \u2013 5.00pm | Fri \u2013 8:00am \u2013 12pm\n\n[ONLINE CONTACT FORM][46]\n\u00a92026 Sotech Optima All rights reserved\n\n2 Traynor Way, Peterlee, SR8 2RU, UK\n\n[ X ][47][ Linkedin ][48][ Instagram ][49][ Youtube ][50]\nClose\nCart (0)\n\n[No products in the basket.] No products in the basket.\n\nSearch\nClose\nSearch\n\nSearch Result\n\n[View All][51]\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][52]\n[ Cart 0 ][53]\n* [Rainscreen Solutions][54]\n* [Rainscreen Systems][55]\n* [Optima FC+, Secret Fix Hook On Rainscreen][56]\n* [Optima TFC+, Through Fix Cassette Rainscreen][57]\n* [Optima Edge, SECRET FIX, FLAT PANEL APPEARANCE][58]\n* [Optima FlatFix, Flate Plate Rainscreen][59]\n* [OPTIMA BrickTECH, Alternative to traditional brickwork][60]\n* [Planks][61]\n* [OPTIMA XTR Contour][62]\n* [Optima Clip Plank System][63]\n* [Optima Interlock Plank Rainscreen][64]\n* [Specialist Cladding][65]\n* [OPTIMA Shingles][66]\n* [OPTIMA MEADOW, Living Wall Rainscreen][67]\n* [Optima Vertex Spandrel][68]\n* [Ancillaries][69]\n* [Sotech Clip on Coping][70]\n* [Sotech Perforations][71]\n* [Sotech Flashings][72]\n* [Resources][73]\n* [What is Rainscreen Cladding?][74]\n* [Fire testing][75]\n* [CWCT][76]\n* [SAFE HANDS Promise][77]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][78]\n* [EPD][79]\n* [Modelling Environment][80]\n* [SOTECH VR][81]\n* [LEARNING Zone & Showroom][82]\n* [Case Studies][83]\n* [NEWS][84]\n* [Downloads][85]\n* [Contact Us][86]\n[Sign In][87]\nClose\n[ 0 ][88]\n\n[1]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/about-sotech/\n[2]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/web-site-privacy-policy/\n[3]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/terms-conditions/\n[4]: /architects-installers/\n[5]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk\n[6]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/\n[7]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/\n[8]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/\n[9]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-fc-secret-fix-hook-on-rainscreen/\n[10]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-tfc-through-fix-cassette-rainscreen/\n[11]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-edge/\n[12]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-flatfix-flat-plate-rainscreen/\n[13]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-bricktech/\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-xtr-contour/\n[16]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-clip-plank-system/\n[17]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-interlock-plank-system/\n[18]: #\n[19]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-shingles/\n[20]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-meadow-hook-on-rainscreen/\n[21]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-vertex-spandrels/\n[22]: #\n[23]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-clip-on-coping/\n[24]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-perforations/\n[25]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-flashings/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/rainscreen-cladding/\n[28]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/rainscreen-fire-testing/\n[29]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/cwct-testing/\n[30]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/\n[31]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/sustainability/\n[32]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/epd/\n[33]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/modelling-environment/\n[34]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/vr/\n[35]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/learning/\n[36]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/case-studies/\n[37]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/news/\n[38]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/downloads/\n[39]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/contact/\n[40]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/my-account/\n[41]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/download-list/\n[42]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk\n[43]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/download-list/\n[44]: #1613485887446-730d5a6c-2b90ac4d-19b4\n[45]: #1613485887446-730d5a6c-2b90ac4d-19b4\n[46]: #lepopup-contact-form\n[47]: https://twitter.com/Sotech_\n[48]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/sotech-architectural-facade-systems/\n[49]: https://www.instagram.com/sotechlimited\n[50]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1T7V1Ix2Qn7SVjgNREFRtQ\n[51]: #\n[52]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk\n[53]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/download-list/\n[54]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/\n[55]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/\n[56]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-fc-secret-fix-hook-on-rainscreen/\n[57]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-tfc-through-fix-cassette-rainscreen/\n[58]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-edge/\n[59]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-flatfix-flat-plate-rainscreen/\n[60]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-bricktech/\n[61]: #\n[62]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-xtr-contour/\n[63]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-clip-plank-system/\n[64]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-interlock-plank-system/\n[65]: #\n[66]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-shingles/\n[67]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-meadow-hook-on-rainscreen/\n[68]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-vertex-spandrels/\n[69]: #\n[70]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-clip-on-coping/\n[71]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-perforations/\n[72]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-flashings/\n[73]: #\n[74]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/rainscreen-cladding/\n[75]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/rainscreen-fire-testing/\n[76]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/cwct-testing/\n[77]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/\n[78]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/sustainability/\n[79]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/epd/\n[80]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/modelling-environment/\n[81]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/vr/\n[82]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/learning/\n[83]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/case-studies/\n[84]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/news/\n[85]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/downloads/\n[86]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/contact/\n[87]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/my-account/\n[88]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/download-list/"
