            "text": "* [ABOUT][1]\n* [Privacy][2]\n* [Terms][3]\n* [cpd training][4]\nTechnical +44 (0) 191 587 9213 | General Enquiries +44 (0) 191 587 2287\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][5]\n\n[Sotech Optima][6]\n\nBespoke Metal Rainscreen Cladding & Facade Panel Systems\n* [Rainscreen Solutions][7]\n* * [Rainscreen Systems][8]\n* [Optima FC+, Secret Fix Hook On Rainscreen][9]\n* [Optima TFC+, Through Fix Cassette Rainscreen][10]\n* [Optima Edge, SECRET FIX, FLAT PANEL APPEARANCE][11]\n* [Optima FlatFix, Flate Plate Rainscreen][12]\n* [OPTIMA BrickTECH, Alternative to traditional brickwork][13]\n* [Planks][14]\n* [OPTIMA XTR Contour][15]\n* [Optima Clip Plank System][16]\n* [Optima Interlock Plank Rainscreen][17]\n* [Specialist Cladding][18]\n* [OPTIMA Shingles][19]\n* [OPTIMA MEADOW, Living Wall Rainscreen][20]\n* [Optima Vertex Spandrel][21]\n* [Ancillaries][22]\n* [Sotech Clip on Coping][23]\n* [Sotech Perforations][24]\n* [Sotech Flashings][25]\n* [Resources][26]\n* [What is Rainscreen Cladding?][27]\n* [Fire testing][28]\n* [CWCT][29]\n* [SAFE HANDS Promise][30]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][31]\n* [EPD][32]\n* [Modelling Environment][33]\n* [SOTECH VR][34]\n* [LEARNING Zone & Showroom][35]\n* [Case Studies][36]\n* [NEWS][37]\n* [Downloads][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n\n[ Sign in ][40]\nSearch\n[ Cart 0 ][41]\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][42]\n[ Cart 0 ][43]\n\n# ABOUT SOTECH\n\n## About SOTECH\n\n### Formed in 1982, Sotech is a leading designer and manufacturer of the Optima range of engineered\n### metal rainscreen cladding and architectural fabrications.\n\nWith offices in North East England and London, Sotech provides rainscreen cladding solutions to its\nclients nationwide.\n\nSotech puts a heavy focus on product innovation and testing and has full system tests for the\ncomplete Optima range of rainscreen cladding systems. Sotech is one of the few manufacturers that\ncan provide true A1 Non-Combustible rainscreen systems.\n\n**All systems carry full CWCT certification and the Optima FC+, TFC+ and Edge have met the fire\nrequirements of BR 135 when tested to BS 8414 in specific system configurations. Sotech is also\naccredited to ISO9001:2015, ISO 14001:2015 and ISO 45001.**\n\n[SPEAK TO AN EXPERT][44]\n\n## Our VALUES\n\n### Sotech\u2019s team of committed rainscreen cladding experts deliver enduring rainscreen solutions\n### that are safe, innovative and market leading in design and manufacturing.\n\n#### A safe pair of hands\n#### Providing our customers with safe solutions\n\nWe pride ourselves on being the safe pair of hands in the industry. Sotech\u2019s commitment to enduring\nand safe solutions can be witnessed in the volume of testing it does in the UK and Dubai, with a\nparticular focus on innovation for fire safety, providing true A1 and A2 rainscreen solutions ahead\nof the market. When you choose us, you are choosing a safe pair of hands.\n\n#### Customer focused.\n\nWorking for the repeat business. It is the true test of a customer focus.\n\nOur team of expert rainscreen cladding specialists work closely with architects, specifiers, fire\nconsultants, main contractors, and installers from the conception of a project to the moment the\nfinal panel is placed. We are here because of our customers, and those customers contact us project\nafter project for advice, solutions and recommendations to their scheme or specification because we\ncare about the details.\n\nWe share our industry knowledge generously and we go the extra mile to get projects complete to the\nhighest standards, protecting the building, protecting the inhabitants, and enhancing the reputation\nof rainscreen cladding in the industry.\n\n## Manufacturability at the core\n\n### Meeting the most specific requirements through teamwork, training, and technology\n\nSotech have invested handsomely in state-of-the-art manufacturing technology and facilities and lead\nthe market in in-house training. We are passionate about quality, style and safety of rainscreen\ncladding solutions which is why we follow Design for Manufacture (DFM) processes. DFM allows\npotential problems to be fixed in the design phase of a project, ensuring we meet our clients most\nspecific requirements consistently and on time.\n\n**Continual improvement and a get-it-done-right attitude.**\n\n#### Continually strive to do better in everything we do.\n\nWe are focused on innovating to lead the way when it comes to safety, flawless design, and an\noutstanding customer experience. We pride ourselves on our attitude of continual improvement and are\noften leaders in the market when it comes to innovation, as with the introduction of our true A1\ncladding systems. We are a can do business and will find a way to bring your design to life safely,\nefficiently and with flare.\n\n[VIEW SYSTEMS][45]\n\n## Family feel, international presence\n\n### We hire and train from within and demonstrate safety and quality as a result.\n\nSotech began in 1982, when company founder John Egginton combined the Social and Technological sides\nof business to form Sotech\n\nOur buildings can be seen in every major city across the UK and Ireland and our products have gained\nwidespread international recognition, supplying to projects in the Middle East. This is testament to\nthe skill, commitment, and loyalty of our team.\n\n**We pride ourselves on our family business feel, but have an incredible international reach.**\n\n[GET IN TOUCH][46]\n\u00a92026 Sotech Optima All rights reserved\n\n2 Traynor Way, Peterlee, SR8 2RU, UK\n\n[ X ][47][ Linkedin ][48][ Instagram ][49][ Youtube ][50]\nClose\nCart (0)\n\n[No products in the basket.] No products in the basket.\n\nSearch\nClose\nSearch\n\nSearch Result\n\n[View All][51]\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][52]\n[ Cart 0 ][53]\n* [Rainscreen Solutions][54]\n* [Rainscreen Systems][55]\n* [Optima FC+, Secret Fix Hook On Rainscreen][56]\n* [Optima TFC+, Through Fix Cassette Rainscreen][57]\n* [Optima Edge, SECRET FIX, FLAT PANEL APPEARANCE][58]\n* [Optima FlatFix, Flate Plate Rainscreen][59]\n* [OPTIMA BrickTECH, Alternative to traditional brickwork][60]\n* [Planks][61]\n* [OPTIMA XTR Contour][62]\n* [Optima Clip Plank System][63]\n* [Optima Interlock Plank Rainscreen][64]\n* [Specialist Cladding][65]\n* [OPTIMA Shingles][66]\n* [OPTIMA MEADOW, Living Wall Rainscreen][67]\n* [Optima Vertex Spandrel][68]\n* [Ancillaries][69]\n* [Sotech Clip on Coping][70]\n* [Sotech Perforations][71]\n* [Sotech Flashings][72]\n* [Resources][73]\n* [What is Rainscreen Cladding?][74]\n* [Fire testing][75]\n* [CWCT][76]\n* [SAFE HANDS Promise][77]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][78]\n* [EPD][79]\n* [Modelling Environment][80]\n* [SOTECH VR][81]\n* [LEARNING Zone & Showroom][82]\n* [Case Studies][83]\n* [NEWS][84]\n* [Downloads][85]\n* [Contact Us][86]\n[Sign In][87]\nClose\n[ 0 ][88]\n\n[1]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/about-sotech/\n[2]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/web-site-privacy-policy/\n[3]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/terms-conditions/\n[4]: /architects-installers/\n[5]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk\n[6]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/\n[7]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/\n[8]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/\n[9]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-fc-secret-fix-hook-on-rainscreen/\n[10]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-tfc-through-fix-cassette-rainscreen/\n[11]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-edge/\n[12]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-flatfix-flat-plate-rainscreen/\n[13]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-bricktech/\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-xtr-contour/\n[16]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-clip-plank-system/\n[17]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-interlock-plank-system/\n[18]: #\n[19]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-shingles/\n[20]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-meadow-hook-on-rainscreen/\n[21]: https://sotech-optima.co.u