            "text": "* [ABOUT][1]\n* [Privacy][2]\n* [Terms][3]\n* [cpd training][4]\nTechnical +44 (0) 191 587 9213 | General Enquiries +44 (0) 191 587 2287\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][5]\n\n[Sotech Optima][6]\n\nBespoke Metal Rainscreen Cladding & Facade Panel Systems\n* [Rainscreen Solutions][7]\n* * [Rainscreen Systems][8]\n* [Optima FC+, Secret Fix Hook On Rainscreen][9]\n* [Optima TFC+, Through Fix Cassette Rainscreen][10]\n* [Optima Edge, SECRET FIX, FLAT PANEL APPEARANCE][11]\n* [Optima FlatFix, Flate Plate Rainscreen][12]\n* [OPTIMA BrickTECH, Alternative to traditional brickwork][13]\n* [Planks][14]\n* [OPTIMA XTR Contour][15]\n* [Optima Clip Plank System][16]\n* [Optima Interlock Plank Rainscreen][17]\n* [Specialist Cladding][18]\n* [OPTIMA Shingles][19]\n* [OPTIMA MEADOW, Living Wall Rainscreen][20]\n* [Optima Vertex Spandrel][21]\n* [Ancillaries][22]\n* [Sotech Clip on Coping][23]\n* [Sotech Perforations][24]\n* [Sotech Flashings][25]\n* [Resources][26]\n* [What is Rainscreen Cladding?][27]\n* [Fire testing][28]\n* [CWCT][29]\n* [SAFE HANDS Promise][30]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][31]\n* [EPD][32]\n* [Modelling Environment][33]\n* [SOTECH VR][34]\n* [LEARNING Zone & Showroom][35]\n* [Case Studies][36]\n* [NEWS][37]\n* [Downloads][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n\n[ Sign in ][40]\nSearch\n[ Cart 0 ][41]\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][42]\n[ Cart 0 ][43]\n\n# Team Awards\n* [Awards][44]\n* [Award Winning][45]\n* [BREEAM Rated][46]\n* [Team Awards][47]\n\n## Team AWARDS\n\n[Simran Thiara Shortlisted for Top 100 Influential Woman in Construction Awards]\n\n#### Simran Thiara: Shortlisted for \u2018Top 100 Influential Woman in Construction Awards\u2019\n\nSimran Thiara, the Southern Facade Specification Manager at Sotech, has been shortlisted for the\nprestigious \u2018Top 100 Influential Woman in Construction Awards.\u2019 The distinguished panel of judges\nfaced a daunting task, given the exceptional quality\u2026\n\n[Read more][48]\n[North East Business Awards Sotech 2]\n\n#### Sotech WINS Manufacturing Award at North East Business Awards\n\nAs a team, we are thrilled to announce Sotech was announced as the WINNERS of the Manufacturing\nAward in last night\u2019s North East Business Awards, and runners up in the Apprenticeships, Training &\nSkills Award.\u2026\n\n[Read more][49]\n\u00a92026 Sotech Optima All rights reserved\n\n2 Traynor Way, Peterlee, SR8 2RU, UK\n\n[ X ][50][ Linkedin ][51][ Instagram ][52][ Youtube ][53]\nClose\nCart (0)\n\n[No products in the basket.] No products in the basket.\n\nSearch\nClose\nSearch\n\nSearch Result\n\n[View All][54]\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][55]\n[ Cart 0 ][56]\n* [Rainscreen Solutions][57]\n* [Rainscreen Systems][58]\n* [Optima FC+, Secret Fix Hook On Rainscreen][59]\n* [Optima TFC+, Through Fix Cassette Rainscreen][60]\n* [Optima Edge, SECRET FIX, FLAT PANEL APPEARANCE][61]\n* [Optima FlatFix, Flate Plate Rainscreen][62]\n* [OPTIMA BrickTECH, Alternative to traditional brickwork][63]\n* [Planks][64]\n* [OPTIMA XTR Contour][65]\n* [Optima Clip Plank System][66]\n* [Optima Interlock Plank Rainscreen][67]\n* [Specialist Cladding][68]\n* [OPTIMA Shingles][69]\n* [OPTIMA MEADOW, Living Wall Rainscreen][70]\n* [Optima Vertex Spandrel][71]\n* [Ancillaries][72]\n* [Sotech Clip on Coping][73]\n* [Sotech Perforations][74]\n* [Sotech Flashings][75]\n* [Resources][76]\n* [What is Rainscreen Cladding?][77]\n* [Fire testing][78]\n* [CWCT][79]\n* [SAFE HANDS Promise][80]\n* [SUSTAINABILITY][81]\n* [EPD][82]\n* [Modelling Environment][83]\n* [SOTECH VR][84]\n* [LEARNING Zone & Showroom][85]\n* [Case Studies][86]\n* [NEWS][87]\n* [Downloads][88]\n* [Contact Us][89]\n[Sign In][90]\nClose\n[ 0 ][91]\n\n[1]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/about-sotech/\n[2]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/web-site-privacy-policy/\n[3]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/terms-conditions/\n[4]: /architects-installers/\n[5]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk\n[6]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/\n[7]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/\n[8]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/\n[9]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-fc-secret-fix-hook-on-rainscreen/\n[10]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-tfc-through-fix-cassette-rainscreen/\n[11]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-edge/\n[12]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-flatfix-flat-plate-rainscreen/\n[13]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-bricktech/\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-xtr-contour/\n[16]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-clip-plank-system/\n[17]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-optima-interlock-plank-system/\n[18]: #\n[19]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-shingles/\n[20]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-meadow-hook-on-rainscreen/\n[21]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/optima-vertex-spandrels/\n[22]: #\n[23]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-clip-on-coping/\n[24]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-perforations/\n[25]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/systems/sotech-flashings/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/rainscreen-cladding/\n[28]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/rainscreen-fire-testing/\n[29]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/cwct-testing/\n[30]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/safe-hands/\n[31]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/sustainability/\n[32]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/epd/\n[33]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/modelling-environment/\n[34]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/vr/\n[35]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/architects-installers/learning/\n[36]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/case-studies/\n[37]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/news/\n[38]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/downloads/\n[39]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/contact/\n[40]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/my-account/\n[41]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk/download-list/\n[42]: https://sotech-optima.co.uk\n[43]: https://sotech-opti