            "url": "https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/",
            "text": "[ [logo] ][1]\n[ Oils ][2] [ Grains & Seeds ][3] [ Trucking ][4] [ Marianne\u2019s ][5]\n[ About ][6] [ Get in Touch ][7]\n[ [logo] ][8]\n[ Oils ][9] [ Grains & Seeds ][10] [ Trucking ][11] [ Marianne\u2019s ][12]\n[ About ][13] [ Get in Touch ][14]\n[ [logo] ][15]\n[ Oils ][16] [ Grains & Seeds ][17] [ Trucking ][18] [ Marianne\u2019s ][19] [ About ][20]\n[ Get in Touch ][21]\n\n# Adams Group is a fifth-generation, family-owned food company that crafts food with integrity from\n# seed-to-shelf\n\nSINCE 1920\n\n## For over 100 years we have been led by one principle\u2014doing the right thing\n\nIn 1920, a small malted barley venture in Woodland, California sparked a five-generation commitment\nto doing right\u2014by farmers, partners, employees, customers, and the families we feed.\n\nStill family-owned and operated, Adams Group has led the organic food movement and grown into a\nglobal, vertically integrated company delivering specialty at scale across grains, seeds, and oils.\n\nFor more than 100 years our compass hasn\u2019t changed\u2013because doing the right thing isn\u2019t just our\nhistory; it\u2019s our way forward\n\nOUR PRODUCT FOCUS\n\n## Uncompromising standards across every step\n\nAt Adams Group, quality isn\u2019t just about the end product\u2014it\u2019s a mindset that guides everything we\ndo.\n\nOur facilities, processes, and people all work together to ensure every product meets the highest\nstandards of safety, consistency, and excellence\n\n## Sourcing\n\n## Handling\n\n## Processing\n\n## Packaging\n\n## Delivery\n\n## Certifications\n\nWe\u2019re happy to explore alternate certifications if desired.\n\n[ Talk to our team ][22]\nWHERE TRADITION MEETS INNOVATION\n\n## Advanced facilities and capacity\n\nWith decades of investment, Adams Group operates modern facilities that set the standard in food\nprocessing. Our facilities ensure efficiency, safety, and scale for our partners worldwide.\n\nTwo grain processing and storage facilities in Woodland, California, including Gluten-Free\nprocessing.\n\nA state-of-the-art Oil refinery, quality lab, and bottling line in Arbuckle, California.\n\nSubstantial storage capacity ensuring consistent supply.\n\nHANDS-ON APPROACH\n\n## Global sourcing\n\nWe take a hands-on approach to global sourcing\u2014building long-term relationships with farmers,\nsuppliers, and manufacturers across the globe. This ensures resilience, diversity, and integrity.\n\nHands-on approach to sourcing to ensure resilience and diversity in our supply chain.\n\nLong term partnerships with farmers, suppliers and manufacturers around the world.\n\nTENDING TO THE LAND FOR GENERATIONS\n\n## Committed to sustainability\n\nWith origins in agriculture, Adams Group has been caring for the land and environment for over a\ncentury. Our sustainability efforts are rooted in stewardship and innovation\u2014ensuring we leave the\nworld better than we found it.\n\ntCO\u2082e\n2024 Scopes 1\u20132 emissions across operations\nSolar Power\nShare of oil refinery facility electricity from our five\u2011acre solar field\nWater Reuse\nFacility water treated, filtered, and reused in production at our oil refinery\nLEGACY MEETS INNOVATION\n\n## Our leadership team\n\nFive generations strong \u2014 and growing with the expertise of leaders who share our values. At Adams\nGroup, we blend family heritage with industry experience to build a future rooted in integrity,\ninnovation, and care.\n\n[Wayne Adams][Wayne Adams]\n\n## Wayne Adams\n\nChief Executive Officer\n\n[Meg Adams][Meg Adams]\n\n## Meg Adams\n\nChief Strategy Officer\n\n[Kristel Corson][Kristel Corson]\n\n## Kristel Corson\n\nChief Revenue Officer\n\n[Devin Harris][Devin Harris]\n\n## Devin Harris\n\nChief Operating Officer\n\n[Juan Moreno][Juan Moreno]\n\n## Juan Moreno\n\nChief Financial Officer\n\n## Michele Poplawski\n\nChief People Officer\n\n[Shrene White][Shrene White]\n\n## Shrene White\n\nChief Sourcing Officer\n\n[lets-started][lets-started]\n\n## Work at Adams Group\n\nGood food by good people. Believe in both? Join our team.\n\n[ View careers ][23]\nOFFERINGS\n[ Oils ][24] [ Grains & Seeds ][25] [ Trucking ][26]\nBrands\n[ Marianne\u2019s ][27]\nCompany\n[ About ][28] [ Contact ][29] [ Careers ][30]\n\nBy subscribing you agree to our [Privacy Policy][31] and provide consent to receive updates from\nAdams Group.\n\n[Footer Logo][Footer Logo]\n\n\u00a92026 ADAMS GROUP. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n\n[ PRIVACY POLICY ][32] [ TERMS & CONDITIONS ][33]\n[ ADAMS AUSTRALIA ][34]\n\n[1]: https://adamsgrp.com\n[2]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[3]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[4]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[5]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[6]: https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/\n[7]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[8]: https://adamsgrp.com\n[9]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[10]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[11]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[12]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[13]: https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/\n[14]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[15]: https://adamsgrp.com\n[16]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[17]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[18]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[19]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[20]: https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/\n[21]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[22]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[23]: https://adamsgrp.com/careers/\n[24]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[25]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[26]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[27]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[28]: https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/\n[29]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[30]: https://adamsgrp.com/careers/\n[31]: https://adamsgrp.com/privacy/\n[32]: https://adamsgrp.com/privacy/\n[33]: https://adamsgrp.com/terms-conditions/\n[34]: https://www.adamsaustralia.com.au/"
