        "crawl_text": "ALCLOUD ARCHITECTURAL MATERIALS CO., LTD Manufacturing ISO9001 ISO14001 OHSAS18001 Strong supply chain High-quality materials Diverse product range National standards compliance 1st Building,No.175 South Road, College town, Shapingba District, Chongqing, CN 401331 Chongqing, China Nanping, China Global ALCLOUD has completed over 15,000 projects globally since its establishment in 2003. The company has a production capacity of 8 million square meters per year. ALCLOUD operates two manufacturing plants in China. Expanding global distribution and partnerships. Enhancing product quality and innovation. Competition in the architectural materials market. Fluctuations in raw material prices. Growing demand for sustainable building materials. Expansion into new international markets. ALCLOUD is recognized as a leading manufacturer in the architectural aluminum panel industry. Increasing construction activities globally. Rising demand for decorative building materials. Home | alcloudcn.com\n\nSkip to content\n\nProducts\n\nAluminium Composite Panel\n\nAluminium Sign Board\n\nFireproof\n\nWooden Finishes\n\nMarble Finishes\n\nMirror Finishes\n\nBrushed Finishes\n\nPVDF\n\nMetal Honeycomb Panel\n\nMetal Ceiling System\n\nApplications\n\nExterior Facade\n\nInterior Design\n\nSign &#038; Display\n\nCeiling System\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nWhy ALCLOUD\n\nProjects\n\nDistribution\n\nSupports\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nBlogs\n\nArchitectural Partnership\n\nProducts\n\nAluminium Composite Panel\n\nAluminium Sign Board\n\nFireproof\n\nWooden Finishes\n\nMarble Finishes\n\nMirror Finishes\n\nBrushed Finishes\n\nPVDF\n\nMetal Honeycomb Panel\n\nMetal Ceiling System\n\nApplications\n\nExterior Facade\n\nInterior Design\n\nSign &#038; Display\n\nCeiling System\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nWhy ALCLOUD\n\nProjects\n\nDistribution\n\nSupports\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nBlogs\n\nArchitectural Partnership\n\nREQUEST A QUOTE\n\nYour Architectural Aluminium Specialist\n\nAluminium Composite Panel | Aluminium Honeycomb Panel |\nAluminium Ceiling Panel\n\nALCLOUD\u00ae | Freeing Your Design Like Clouds\n\nSend Inquiry\n\nFull ACP&amp;ACM Capabilities\n\nALCLOUD \u00ae offers full of ACP &amp; ACM with Stylish Yet durable panel for Your Facade, Interior Design and Signage.\n\nCustom Metal Ceiling\n\nALCLOUD is capable of supplying full kinds of metal ceiling panel materials, either machined aluminum panels or aluminum profiles and can be powder coated or painted.\n\nArchitectural Panel Specialist\n\nAs a manufacturer of architectural metal panels, we are pleased to share our manufacturing advantages and strong supply chain of building and decorative materials with our global customers.\n\nYears of Experience\n\nAnnual average m2 of Decoration Material\n\n1000\n\nEmployee\n\n100\n\nProjects\n\n1000\n\nWho We are\n\nWho We are\n\nALCLOUD is the First-class Quality Manufacturer in China that provides a complete line of Aluminium Composite Panel, Metal Ceiling System and One-stop solution for Architectural Aluminium Panels.\n\nEstablished in 2003, ALCLOUD \u00ae is proud to be a global brand of ShanDong FAME Group, a Specialist in manufacturing and supplying of Building Decorative Metal Panel.\n\nExploring More\n\nALCLOUD\u00ae&nbsp;Aluminium Panel For Your Applications\n\nFULL CEILING &#038; WALL SYSTEMS\n\nApplications\n\nApplications\n\nExterior Wall System\n\nInterior Wall Design\n\nFind Out More\n\nSign &amp; Display\n\nMetal Ceiling System\n\nFeatured Products\n\nMirror ACM Panel\n\nMirror Finish ACM Panel are available with an anodized mirror finish or with optional laminated colorless passivated polymer films to make the final product hygienic and environmentally compliant.\n\nView More\n\nWooden ACM Panel\n\nWooden Aluminium Composite panels have a fantastic look and feel durability like natural wood but without problems like a heavyweight, higher costs, &#038; much maintenance.\n\nView More\n\nMarble ACM Panel\n\nMarble ACM panel has realistic looks, rigidity &#038; feel of natural stones.\nMarble panels are much lighter, more durable, &#038; affordable than natural marble.\n\nView More\n\nFireproof Aluminium Composite Panel\n\nFireproof Aluminium Composite Panel is a new type of metal-plastic composite material made of a special flame-retardant modified polyethylene plastic core material through polymer adhesive film (or hot melt adhesive) by hot pressing and painted aluminum sheet.\n\nView More\n\nAluminium Honeycomb Panel\n\nHoneycomb Panels are the future of every industry, from Aerospace to making Trashcans, because a Honeycomb panel has less weight but more tensile &#038; compression strength than a solid panel of the same height &#038; material.\n\nView More\n\nAluminium Ceiling Panel\n\nAluminium ceiling tiles &#038; panels are the most popular metal material for interior design ceiling systems due to their light weight and strength.\n\nView More\n\nWhy ALCLOUD\u00ae is Trusted by&nbsp;15000+ Projects\n\nSubmit a Quick Quote\n\nFull Name\n\nEmail\n\nCompany\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit\n\nOur Value\n\nOur Value\n\nWith 15,000+ projects implemented domestically and internationally using aluminium composite panels, Honeycomb panels, and aluminum ceiling panels, our product performance and assortment has thus been sustainably enhanced.\n\nAluminium Panel Specialist\n\nSelection of colors and finishes covering all your decorative design, premium ALCLOUD\u00ae Aluminium Panels demand to be noticed in any setting.\n\nHigh-Quality\n\nPreferential selection of raw materials is the first criterion for quality assurance.\n\nBudgetary &amp; Cost control\n\nLowest price is not the goal, balances the quality and your budget.\n\nTrusted Suppliers and Partners\n\nWe are committed to the spirit of contract. The date we tell you the delivery date is the date you need to be known.\n\nGives real value satisfaction to your architectural projects.\n\nGlobal Distribution &amp; International Service\n\nALCLOUD\u00ae works with distributors in over 30 countries on 5 continents and seeks additional partnerships to give customers quick access to our aluminum composite panels and other architectural aluminium panel and decorative metal materials worldwide.\n\nWe are proud to manufacture most of our inventory in China and ship to our international customers by sea, rail, and road.\n\nTo find a stockist in your location or inquire about becoming a distributor, please contact us by clicking on the Contact Us link.\n\nWhat Our Valuable Partners Say About Us\n\nWe are a construction company and need materials that can bend and reform. ALCLOUD\u00ae provides the ACM Panels exactly what we need for our project, high intensity, easy to use for interior and exterior construction; we will keep working with them!\n\nHumberto From Brazil\n\nALCLOUD team gave me this first impression with a reasonable price and high quality on architectural aluminium panels. I spent my money and got what was worth it, adding value to my business!\n\nNyoman From Indonesia\n\nTrying to find a new Aluminium Composite Panel supplier, Charles from ALCLOUD provided everything I needed to know about product and quality details. I had never cooperated with a aluminium panel supplier so professional as them. We are looking forward to going to China and visiting factory.\n\nAlbert From Egypt\n\nI found the ALCLOUD web pages and checked they highly fit our architectural projects demand, so we built a connection with an aluminum panel specialist and what they can provide us. I have to say that your team is very professional and patient, five stars for U.\n\nAdam Cain From Australia\n\nA Complete Line of Aluminium Panels Deliver to Your Architectural Project.\n\nCompany\n\nAbout ALCLOUD\n\nWhy ALCLOUD\n\nSupport\n\nProducts\n\nAluminium Composite Panel\n\nAluminium Honeycomb Panel\n\nAluminium Ceiling Panel\n\nApplications\n\nExterior Facade\n\nInterior Wall Design\n\nMetal Ceiling System\n\nSign &amp; Display\n\nGET IN TOUCH\n\n+ 86 