e panel is made of multiple layers of material, the upper and lower layers are\nPre-painted aluminium sheets, the middle is a non-toxic low-density polyethylene (PE) core panel,\nand a protective film is attached to its front.\nALCLOUD\u00ae ACM Panel is the ideal metal panel for exterior & interior wall system. These lightweight\nACM Panels are in an almost endless array of colors, with the same unparalleled finish to match the\narchitectural expression you\u2019ve dreamed of that will fit your design vision perfectly.\nWooden Aluminium Composite Panel\n[ View More ][54]\nMarble Aluminium Composite Panel\n[ View More ][55]\nMirror Aluminium Composite Panel\n[ View More ][56]\nBrushed Aluminium Composite Panel\n[ View More ][57]\nMetallic Aluminium Composite Panel\n[ View More ][58]\nHigh-gloss Aluminium Composite Panel\n[ View More ][59]\nAluminium Sign Board\n[ View More ][60]\nFire-proof Aluminium Composite Panel\n[ View More ][61]\n\n## Aluminium Honeycomb Panel\n\n[ View More ][62]\nThe aluminum sheets are attached to the honeycomb core using industrial-grade, high-strength\nadhesive (PU glue) through a thermo-compression molding technique.\nHoneycomb panel middle sandwich contains a lot of air, can sound insulation, heat insulation, and\nfire-resistant B1. Aluminum honeycomb core single is not easy to deformation, completely overcome\nthe other decorative panels single large area easy to deformation, the middle collapse, and other\nprocessing defects.\n\n## Aluminium Ceiling Panel\n\n[ View More ][63]\nAluminium Ceiling is a Metal Ceiling partition decorative material that facilitates air circulation,\nexhaust, and heat dissipation.\nAluminium ceiling tiles & panels are the most popular metal material for interior design systems due\nto their light weight and strength.\n\n**DON\u2019T SEE WHAT YOU\u2019RE LOOKING FOR?**\n\nOur highly trained and experienced material experts, project manager, designer and sales are\navailable to assist you in all aspects of material selection and production of your architectural\nrequirements.\nWe request that you fill in the contact form with the details of requirements.\nFull Name\nEmail\nCompany\nMessage\nSubmit\n\n### Support\n\nQuality Policy\nTechnical Data Sheet\nCertifications\n[ Browse Support ][64]\n\n### Applications\n\nArchitecture expresses art and detail, and your project deserves the best.\n[ Browse Applications ][65]\n\n### Architectural Partnership\n\nWork together with our architectural-leading product designer and purchaser teams to set up your\nbuilding projects for success.\n[ Architectural Partnership ][66]\nA Complete Line of Aluminium Panels Deliver to Your Architectural Project.\n\n## Company\n\n[About ALCLOUD][67]\n[Why ALCLOUD][68]\n[ Support][69]\n\n## Products\n\nAluminium Composite Panel\n\n[Aluminium Honeycomb Panel][70]\n\n[Aluminium Ceiling Panel][71]\n\n## Applications\n\n[Exterior Facade][72]\n\n[Interior Wall Design][73]\n\n[Metal Ceiling System][74]\n\n[Sign & Display][75]\n\n## GET IN TOUCH\n\n+ 86 138 8322 5322\ninfo@alcloudcn.com\n1st Building,No.175 South Road, College town,\nShapingba District,\nChongqing,\nCN 401331\nLinkedin Facebook Youtube\nALCLOUD ARCHITECTURAL MATERIALS CO., LTD \u00a9 2022 All Rights RESERVED \uff5c [Privacy Policy][76]\nBy clicking \u201cAccept All Cookies\u201d, you agree to the storing of cookies on your device to enhance site\nnavigation, analyze site usage, and assist in our marketing efforts.\n[ Accept All Cookies ][77]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://alcloudcn.com/products/\n[3]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[4]: https://alcloudcn.com/fireproof-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[5]: https://alcloudcn.com/wooden-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[6]: https://alcloudcn.com/marble-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[7]: https://alcloudcn.com/mirror-aluminium-composite-panels/\n[8]: https://alcloudcn.com/brushed-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[9]: #\n[10]: #\n[11]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[12]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[13]: https://alcloudcn.com/applications/\n[14]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[15]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[16]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[17]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[18]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[19]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[20]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[21]: https://alcloudcn.com/projects/\n[22]: https://alcloudcn.com/distribution/\n[23]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[24]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://alcloudcn.com/architectural-partnership/\n[27]: https://alcloudcn.com/products/\n[28]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[29]: https://alcloudcn.com/fireproof-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[30]: https://alcloudcn.com/wooden-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[31]: https://alcloudcn.com/marble-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[32]: https://alcloudcn.com/mirror-aluminium-composite-panels/\n[33]: https://alcloudcn.com/brushed-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[34]: #\n[35]: #\n[36]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[37]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[38]: https://alcloudcn.com/applications/\n[39]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[40]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[41]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[42]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[43]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[44]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[45]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[46]: https://alcloudcn.com/projects/\n[47]: https://alcloudcn.com/distribution/\n[48]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[49]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[50]: #\n[51]: https://alcloudcn.com/architectural-partnership/\n[52]: https://alcloudcn.com/contacts/\n[53]: https://alcloudcn.com/\n[54]: https://alcloudcn.com/wooden-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[55]: https://alcloudcn.com/marble-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[56]: https://alcloudcn.com/mirror-aluminium-composite-panels/\n[57]: https://alcloudcn.com/brushed-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[58]: https://alcloudcn.com/metallic-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[59]: https://alcloudcn.com/high-gloss-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[60]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[61]: https://alcloudcn.com/fireproof-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[62]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[63]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[64]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[65]: https://alcloudcn.com/applications/\n[66]: https://alcloudcn.com/architectural-partnership/\n[67]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[68]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[69]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[70]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[71]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[72]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[73]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[74]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[75]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[76]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[77]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aclose%26settings%3DeyJkb19ub3Rfc2hvd19hZ2FpbiI6InllcyJ9"
