            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Products][2]\n* Aluminium Composite Panel\n* [Aluminium Sign Board][3]\n* [Fireproof][4]\n* [Wooden Finishes][5]\n* [Marble Finishes][6]\n* [Mirror Finishes][7]\n* [Brushed Finishes][8]\n* [PE][9]\n* [PVDF][10]\n* [Metal Honeycomb Panel][11]\n* [Metal Ceiling System][12]\n* [Applications][13]\n* [Exterior Facade][14]\n* [Interior Design][15]\n* [Sign & Display][16]\n* [Ceiling System][17]\n* [Company][18]\n* [About Us][19]\n* [Why ALCLOUD][20]\n* [Projects][21]\n* [Distribution][22]\n* [Supports][23]\n* [Privacy Policy][24]\n* [Blogs][25]\n* [Architectural Partnership][26]\n* [Products][27]\n* Aluminium Composite Panel\n* [Aluminium Sign Board][28]\n* [Fireproof][29]\n* [Wooden Finishes][30]\n* [Marble Finishes][31]\n* [Mirror Finishes][32]\n* [Brushed Finishes][33]\n* [PE][34]\n* [PVDF][35]\n* [Metal Honeycomb Panel][36]\n* [Metal Ceiling System][37]\n* [Applications][38]\n* [Exterior Facade][39]\n* [Interior Design][40]\n* [Sign & Display][41]\n* [Ceiling System][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [About Us][44]\n* [Why ALCLOUD][45]\n* [Projects][46]\n* [Distribution][47]\n* [Supports][48]\n* [Privacy Policy][49]\n* [Blogs][50]\n* [Architectural Partnership][51]\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][52]\n\n###### About Us\n\n[Home][53]\nAbout Us\n\n## Since 2003\n\nALCLOUD\u00ae is the flagship brand of HDM Group, specializing in providing Architectural Aluminum Metal\nMaterials for the Construction Decoration and Sign market.\n\nOur two plants are located in Chongqing and Nanping, covering an area of more than **240** acres,\nassembled with** 18** aluminum extrusion lines, **4** CNC machining centers, **5** world-class\nautomatic hot-pressing aluminum composite panel production lines, and advanced supporting testing\nequipment, 2 automatic fluorocarbon spraying production lines, and more than 70 sets of sheet metal\nequipment, with an installed capacity of 8 million square meters per year of various series of\ndecorative metal materials, making us capable of delivering products on time and with quality to our\nglobal customers.\n\nLet ALCLOUD make your decorative design dreams come true with our diverse metal panels and\nunparalleled finishes. We will always support your architectural projects with our motto:\n\u201c*Professional Innovation, Excellent Quality, First-class Service*\u201c.\n\nALCLOUD\u00ae | Freeing Your Design Like Clouds\n\nYears of Experience\nEmployee\n100 +\nAnnual average m2 of Decoration Material\n1000 +\nProjects\n1000 +\n\n### Since 2003\n\nWith 19 years of experience in the aluminium panel and Architectural metal materials industry, we\nconfidently assert that we have earned recognition from both our customers and the market as true\nprofessionals.\n\n25,000 +\n\n### Production Abilities\n\nAccording to our assessment of our current production capacity, we can confidently achieve a daily\nproduction of 25,000 square meters of decorative materials. This calculation considers a diverse\nproduct range, including Decorative aluminum profiles, Aluminum curtain walls, Aluminum Fence,\naluminium composite panels, aluminium veneer, honeycomb panels, and aluminium ceilings.\n\n15,000 +\n\n### Projects\n\nSince 2003, we have been directly involved in over 15,000 completed and ongoing projects both\ndomestically and internationally. We are grateful for the trust our clients have placed in us, and\nwe remain dedicated to building upon our work and exceeding their expectations.\n\n300 +\n\n### Employees\n\nWith a team of 300 highly skilled professionals in the Group\u2019s building materials segment, we are\nfully equipped with the expertise in all functions required for the successful execution of your\nproject.\n\n## Manufacturing at ALCLOUD\n\n### Professional Innovation\n\n### Excellent Quality\n\n### First-class Service\n\n### Innovation achievement professional\n\nWith two technology research and development centers, the company has undertaken more than 10\nimportant national science and technology innovation projects. It has won three Chinese invention\npatents and 12 utility model patents, and participated in the development of five national and\nindustry standards.\n\n### Quality forges brilliance\n\nWe strictly implement the ISO9001, ISO14001, and OHSAS18001 systems and standards for production and\nsales. Our products have passed the national standards with a sampling rate of 100%, and have even\nexceeded the national standards as tested by the National Building Materials Testing Center. From\n2005 to 2019, we have continuously obtained the \u201cProduct Certificate of Conformity\u201d issued by the\nChina Construction Materials Federation Metal Composites Branch.\n\n### Service leads the development\n\nA flawless marketing service system provides a robust assurance for the growth of the company. With\nover 200 specialized dealers in major cities across the country and strategic cooperation plans\nestablished with local dealers in key regions around the world, our products are exported to more\nthan 30 countries and regions, including Europe, the United States, the Middle East, Central Asia,\nand Southeast Asia.\n\n## Domestic and foreign projects 15000+\n\n### Exterior & Interior Wall System\n\n### Digital Signage Everywhere\n\n### Aluminium Ceiling Solutions\n\n[ Exploring More ][54]\n\n### What Our Valuable Partners Say About Us\n\nWe are a construction company and need materials that can bend and reform.\nALCLOUD\u00ae provides exactly what we need for our project, high intensity, easy to use for interior and\nexterior construction; we will keep working with them!\nHumbertoFrom Brazil\nALCLOUD team gave me this first impression with a reasonable price and high quality.\nI spent my money and got what was worth it, adding value to my business!\nNyomanFrom Indonesia\nTrying to find a new supplier, sales from ALCLOUD provided everything I needed to know about their\ncompany and product.\nI had never cooperated with a supplier so professional as them. We are looking forward to going to\nChina and visiting their factory.\nAlbertFrom Egypt\nI found the ALCLOUD website and checked they highly fit our needs, so we built a connection with the\npanel specialist and what they can provide us.\nI have to say that they are very professional and patient, five stars for them.\nAdam CainFrom Australia\nA Complete Line of Aluminium Panels Deliver to Your Architectural Project.\n\n## Company\n\n[About ALCLOUD][55]\n[Why ALCLOUD][56]\n[ Support][57]\n\n## Products\n\nAluminium Composite Panel\n\n[Aluminium Honeycomb Panel][58]\n\n[Aluminium Ceiling Panel][59]\n\n## Applications\n\n[Exterior Facade][60]\n\n[Interior Wall Design][61]\n\n[Metal Ceiling System][62]\n\n[Sign & Display][63]\n\n## GET IN TOUCH\n\n+ 86 138 8322 5322\ninfo@alcloudcn.com\n1st Building,No.175 South Road, College town,\nShapingba District,\nChongqing,\nCN 401331\nLinkedin Facebook Youtube\nALCLOUD ARCHITECTURAL MATERIALS CO., LTD \u00a9 2022 All Rights RESERVED \uff5c [Privacy Policy][64]\nBy clicking \u201cAccept All Cookies\u201d, you agree to the storing of cookies on your device to enhance site\nnavigation, analyze site usage, and assist in our marketing efforts.\n[ Accept All Cookies ][65]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://alcloudcn.com/products/\n[3]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[4]: https://alcloudcn.com/fireproof-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[5]: https://alcloudcn.com/wooden-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[6]: https://alcloudcn.com/marble-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[7]: https://alcloudcn.com/mirror-aluminium-composite-panels/\n[8]: https://alcloudcn.com/brushed-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[9]: #\n[10]: #\n[11]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[12]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[13]: https://alcloudcn.com/applications/\n[14]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[15]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[16]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[17]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[18]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[19]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[20]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[21]: https://alcloudcn.com/projects/\n[22]: https://alcloudcn.com/distribution/\n[23]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[24]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://alcloudcn.com/architectural-partnership/\n[27]: https://alcloudcn.com/products/\n[28]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[29]: https://alcloudcn.com/fireproof-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[30]: https://alcloudcn.com/wooden-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[31]: https://alcloudcn.com/marble-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[32]: https://alcloudcn.com/mirror-aluminium-composite-panels/\n[33]: https://alcloudcn.com/brushed-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[34]: #\n[35]: #\n[36]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[37]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[38]: https://alcloudcn.com/applications/\n[39]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[40]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[41]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[42]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[43]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[44]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[45]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[46]: https://alcloudcn.com/projects/\n[47]: https://alcloudcn.com/distribution/\n[48]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[49]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[50]: #\n[51]: https://alcloudcn.com/architectural-partnership/\n[52]: https://alcloudcn.com/contacts/\n[53]: https://alcloudcn.com/\n[54]: https://alcloudcn.com/projects/\n[55]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[56]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[57]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[58]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[59]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[60]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[61]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[62]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[63]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[64]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[65]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aclose%26settings%3DeyJkb19ub3Rfc2hvd19hZ2FpbiI6InllcyJ9"
