            "url": "https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Products][2]\n* Aluminium Composite Panel\n* [Aluminium Sign Board][3]\n* [Fireproof][4]\n* [Wooden Finishes][5]\n* [Marble Finishes][6]\n* [Mirror Finishes][7]\n* [Brushed Finishes][8]\n* [PE][9]\n* [PVDF][10]\n* [Metal Honeycomb Panel][11]\n* [Metal Ceiling System][12]\n* [Applications][13]\n* [Exterior Facade][14]\n* [Interior Design][15]\n* [Sign & Display][16]\n* [Ceiling System][17]\n* [Company][18]\n* [About Us][19]\n* [Why ALCLOUD][20]\n* [Projects][21]\n* [Distribution][22]\n* [Supports][23]\n* [Privacy Policy][24]\n* [Blogs][25]\n* [Architectural Partnership][26]\n* [Products][27]\n* Aluminium Composite Panel\n* [Aluminium Sign Board][28]\n* [Fireproof][29]\n* [Wooden Finishes][30]\n* [Marble Finishes][31]\n* [Mirror Finishes][32]\n* [Brushed Finishes][33]\n* [PE][34]\n* [PVDF][35]\n* [Metal Honeycomb Panel][36]\n* [Metal Ceiling System][37]\n* [Applications][38]\n* [Exterior Facade][39]\n* [Interior Design][40]\n* [Sign & Display][41]\n* [Ceiling System][42]\n* [Company][43]\n* [About Us][44]\n* [Why ALCLOUD][45]\n* [Projects][46]\n* [Distribution][47]\n* [Supports][48]\n* [Privacy Policy][49]\n* [Blogs][50]\n* [Architectural Partnership][51]\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][52]\n\n# Quality. Support.\n# Long-term Partnership.\n\n[Home][53]\n[About Us][54]\nWhy Us\n\n## Freeing Your Design Like Clouds\n\nWe\u2019re specialist in Architectural Aluminium Panels Supply.\n\nAs a leading manufacturer of aluminum composite materials in China, we meet the different\nrequirements of your project with our quality product series. You will get durable panels designed\nwith the latest technology from ALCLOUD.\n\nNot only that, we also unite artistry and technology, you can get some uniquely designed aluminum\npanels and many other kinds of metal building decoration materials beyond your original\nexpectations.\n\n## Why Choose ALCLOUD\u00ae Metal Materials?\n\n### Aluminium Panel Specialist\n\nSelection of colors and finishes covering all your decorative design, premium ALCLOUD\u00ae Panels demand\nto be noticed in any setting.\n\nACP & ACM panels, Aluminium Honeycomb Panels, and Metal Ceiling Panels cover all your needs in Wall\n& Ceiling systems.\n\nWith our nearly 20 years of experience in the building materials industry, we also have a strong\nsupply chain covering all the materials needed for building decoration, in addition to the products\nwe produce in-house.\n\n### High-quality\n\nPreferential selection of raw materials is the first criterion for quality assurance.\nThe perfect production and quality control system as the basis for ensuring quality, the company\u2019s\nuncompromising care for the production line workers makes the workers operate on the line more than\njust an assembly line operation, and everyone is highly responsible for the products they endure.\nAbsolutely rigorous quality testing process to ensure that the products leave the factory fully\nmeeting your requirements.\n\n### Budgetary & Cost control\n\nLowest price is not the goal, balances the quality and your budget.\nWe understand the Aluminium Composite Materials and hope that you do not have to hide your needs and\nbudget, so that we are absolutely confident that we can provide you with the quality to meet your\nproject requirements within your budget.\n\n### Trusted Suppliers and Partners\n\nWe are committed to the spirit of contract. The date we tell you the delivery date is the date you\nneed to be known.\nGives real value satisfaction to your architectural projects.\nPartnership Service & Support. Providing Excellence Through Our Partnerships\n**Freeing Your Design Like Clouds**\nFull Name\nEmail\nCompany\nMessage\nSubmit\n\nExploring FAQ about ALCLOUD?\n\n## Is the ALCLOUD brand a manufacturer?\n\nYes, we are an overseas brand founded by Shandong FAME Group, specializing in building materials.\nOur factory is in Linyi, Shandong, and the ALCLOUD office is in Hangzhou, Zhejiang.\n\n## Can I come to see the production of the factory or inspect the goods?\n\nBefore the Covid-19, we received dozens of waves of customers every year to visit our factory. You\nare more than welcome to come; this is the cornerstone that allows us to build a long-term\npartnership.\n\n## What were your sales in the previous year?\n\nOur annual sales last year were about $45 million, of which exports accounted for 30%.\n\n## What is the nearest port to the factory?\n\nThe factory is in Linyi, the logistics center in central China, which can reach Qingdao port in 2\nhours and deliver goods to Shanghai and Ningbo ports within one day.\n\n## Can you provide free samples?\n\n*Yes,* you are very welcome to ask us for samples. You can send us a sample request form from any of\nthe conditions on our website.\n\n## How long does it take to deliver a 20' GP container order?\n\nThe delivery can be done within 20-30 days in general for standard colors and requirements.\n\n## What is the accepted payment terms?\n\n30% advance payment and the remaining 70% payment should be paid against the copy of shipping docs.\n\n100% irrevocable L/C at sight.\n\n## Can you provide aluminum composite panels with fireproof core?\n\nWe are the best supplier of fireproof core aluminum composite panels in China.\n\nB1 and A2 fireproof cores are available.\n\n## What can I do if there is a quality objection after the goods are harvested?\n\nAlthough our complaint rate is less than 15%, we still have a perfect quality objection solution. We\nsuggest you visit our resource page for the details.\n\n## Do you accept OEM orders?\n\n*Yes,* we accept OEM orders. However, since Alcloud has a high product positioning, we also have\nhigh requirements for OEM orders.\nA Complete Line of Aluminium Panels Deliver to Your Architectural Project.\n\n## Company\n\n[About ALCLOUD][55]\n[Why ALCLOUD][56]\n[ Support][57]\n\n## Products\n\nAluminium Composite Panel\n\n[Aluminium Honeycomb Panel][58]\n\n[Aluminium Ceiling Panel][59]\n\n## Applications\n\n[Exterior Facade][60]\n\n[Interior Wall Design][61]\n\n[Metal Ceiling System][62]\n\n[Sign & Display][63]\n\n## GET IN TOUCH\n\n+ 86 138 8322 5322\ninfo@alcloudcn.com\n1st Building,No.175 South Road, College town,\nShapingba District,\nChongqing,\nCN 401331\nLinkedin Facebook Youtube\nALCLOUD ARCHITECTURAL MATERIALS CO., LTD \u00a9 2022 All Rights RESERVED \uff5c [Privacy Policy][64]\nBy clicking \u201cAccept All Cookies\u201d, you agree to the storing of cookies on your device to enhance site\nnavigation, analyze site usage, and assist in our marketing efforts.\n[ Accept All Cookies ][65]\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://alcloudcn.com/products/\n[3]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[4]: https://alcloudcn.com/fireproof-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[5]: https://alcloudcn.com/wooden-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[6]: https://alcloudcn.com/marble-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[7]: https://alcloudcn.com/mirror-aluminium-composite-panels/\n[8]: https://alcloudcn.com/brushed-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[9]: #\n[10]: #\n[11]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[12]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[13]: https://alcloudcn.com/applications/\n[14]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[15]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[16]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[17]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[18]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[19]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[20]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[21]: https://alcloudcn.com/projects/\n[22]: https://alcloudcn.com/distribution/\n[23]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[24]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://alcloudcn.com/architectural-partnership/\n[27]: https://alcloudcn.com/products/\n[28]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[29]: https://alcloudcn.com/fireproof-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[30]: https://alcloudcn.com/wooden-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[31]: https://alcloudcn.com/marble-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[32]: https://alcloudcn.com/mirror-aluminium-composite-panels/\n[33]: https://alcloudcn.com/brushed-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[34]: #\n[35]: #\n[36]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[37]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[38]: https://alcloudcn.com/applications/\n[39]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[40]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[41]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[42]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[43]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[44]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[45]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[46]: https://alcloudcn.com/projects/\n[47]: https://alcloudcn.com/distribution/\n[48]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[49]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[50]: #\n[51]: https://alcloudcn.com/architectural-partnership/\n[52]: https://alcloudcn.com/contacts/\n[53]: https://alcloudcn.com/\n[54]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[55]: https://alcloudcn.com/about-us/\n[56]: https://alcloudcn.com/why-us/\n[57]: https://alcloudcn.com/support/\n[58]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-honeycomb-panel/\n[59]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[60]: https://alcloudcn.com/exterior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[61]: https://alcloudcn.com/interior-aluminium-composite-panel/\n[62]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminum-ceiling/\n[63]: https://alcloudcn.com/aluminium-sign-board/\n[64]: https://alcloudcn.com/privacy-policy/\n[65]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aclose%26settings%3DeyJkb19ub3Rfc2hvd19hZ2FpbiI6InllcyJ9"
