ystals]\n[Palmarosa]\n[Rosemary]\n[Tea Tree]\n[Argan]\n[Get to know us]\n\n###### Divisha Natural Flavours And Fragrances Exports\n\n# Peppermint Oil Manufacturers in Delhi\n\n**Divisha Natural Flavours and Fragrances** is the largest **Peppermint Oil Manufacturers in\nDelhi**, offering best quality natural essential oils, carrier oils, aromatic chemicals, and henna\nbased products. We are dedicated to purity, protecting the environment and innovation in developing\na range of natural products for the international pharmaceutical, cosmetic, food, personal care and\naromatherapy sectors.\n\nWe specialise in pure and Natural essential oils: Ajwain Oil, Basil Oil, Camphor Oil, Cardamom Oil,\nClove Bud Oil, Frankincense Oil, Lavender Oil, Lemon Grass Oil, Rose Oil, Sandalwood Oil and Ylang\nYlang Oil. With some rare and highly demanded oils: Eucalyptus Globulus, Oregano Oil and Geranium\nOil. We also offer a full spectrum of mint derived oils and derivatives, including Menthol Crystals,\nPeppermint Oil (biotech, rectified, and terpeneless grades), Dementholised Oil (DMO), Mentha\nArvensis, Mentha Piperita, L-Menthyl Acetate and Spearmint Oils in various concentrations.\u00a0We are\nthe top **Tea Tree Oil, Olive Oil and [Lavender Oil\u00a0suppliers][186] and exporters from India**.\n\nWe also delivers a premium selection of natural carrier oils such as Almond (Sweet and Bitter),\nJojoba, Argan, Avocado, Flaxseed, Blackseed (Kalonji), Coconut, Olive and Wheatgerm Oils, designed\nto support therapeutic, cosmetic, and wellness applications. Our carrier oils are cold pressed, rich\nin nutrients and designed to meet international standards of quality and safety.\u00a0\n\nWe are also proficient in the production and supply of Aromatic And Terpene Chemicals, including\nhigh grade compounds like Linalool, Geraniol, Eucalyptol, Citronellol, Eugenol, Anethole, D\nLimonene, Cineole, [Alpha Pinene][187] and Terpineol, which are widely used in perfumery, flavoring,\nand industrial applications. Our fragrance chemicals such as Linalyl Acetate, Geranyl Acetate, and\nSandal Mysore Core (SMC) are carefully formulated to address the complex requirements of the global\nfragrances industry.\n\nWe provide a dedicated range of natural henna products, including Natural Henna Powder, Mehandi Oil\nand [Henna Oil][188]. These are processed with great care to ensure that their natural colo"
