l Manufacturers in Delhi\n\n**Divisha Natural Flavours and Fragrances** is the largest **Peppermint Oil Manufacturers in\nDelhi**, offering best quality natural essential oils, carrier oils, aromatic chemicals, and henna\nbased products. We are dedicated to purity, protecting the environment and innovation in developing\na range of natural products for the international pharmaceutical, cosmetic, food, personal care and\naromatherapy sectors.\n\nWe specialise in pure and Natural essential oils: Ajwain Oil, Basil Oil, Camphor Oil, Cardamom Oil,\nClove Bud Oil, Frankincense Oil, Lavender Oil, Lemon Grass Oil, Rose Oil, Sandalwood Oil and Ylang\nYlang Oil. With some rare and highly demanded oils: Eucalyptus Globulus, Oregano Oil and Geranium\nOil. We also offer a full spectrum of mint derived oils and derivatives, including Menthol Crystals,\nPeppermint Oil (biotech, rectified, and terpeneless grades), Dementholised Oil (DMO), Mentha\nArvensis, Mentha Piperita, L-Menthyl Acetate and Spearmint Oils in various concentrations.\u00a0We are\nthe top **Tea Tree Oil, Olive Oil and [Lavender Oil\u00a0suppliers][186] and exporters from India**.\n\nWe also delivers a premium selection of natural carrier oils such as Almond (Sweet and Bitter),\nJojoba, Argan, Avocado, Flaxseed, Blackseed (Kalonji), Coconut, Olive and Wheatgerm Oils, designed\nto support therapeutic, cosmetic, and wellness applications. Our carrier oils are cold pressed, rich\nin nutrients and designed to meet international standards of quality and safety.\u00a0\n\nWe are also proficient in the production and supply of Aromatic And Terpene Chemicals, including\nhigh grade compounds like Linalool, Geraniol, Eucalyptol, Citronellol, Eugenol, Anethole, D\nLimonene, Cineole, [Alpha Pinene][187] and Terpineol, which are widely used in perfumery, flavoring,\nand industrial applications. Our fragrance chemicals such as Linalyl Acetate, Geranyl Acetate, and\nSandal Mysore Core (SMC) are carefully formulated to address the complex requirements of the global\nfragrances industry.\n\nWe provide a dedicated range of natural henna products, including Natural Henna Powder, Mehandi Oil\nand [Henna Oil][188]. These are processed with great care to ensure that their natural color,\nfragrance, and effectiveness remain intact, thus suited for hair care as well as traditional usage.\n\n[We Always Stand Out]\n\n###### We Always Stand Out\n\n### Our Products\n* [Natural Essential Oils Suppliers] Natural Essential Oils\n* [Natural Mint Products] Natural Mint Products\n* [Terpene Chemicals] Terpene Chemicals\n* [Aromatic Chemicals] Aromatic Chemicals\n* [Natural Carrier Oils] Natural Carrier Oils\n* [Natural Henna Products] Natural Henna Products\n\n[Essential Oil][189] Pure and natural extracts crafted from aromatic plants to deliver therapeutic\nand aromatic benefits.\n[ [Essential Oil] ][190]\n\nLavender Oil\n\nCalming and soothing oil known for its floral fragrance and stress-relieving properties.\n[Lavender Oil]\n\nRosemary Oil\n\nEnergizing essential oil that promotes hair growth and enhances mental clarity.\n[Rosemary Oil]\n[Tea Tree Oil][191] A natural antiseptic oil with powerful antibacterial and skin-cleansing\nbenefits.\n[ [Tea Tree Oil] ][192]\n[Natural Spearmint Oil][193] Refreshing and sweet mint oil perfect for flavoring, aromatherapy, and\noral care.\n[ [Natural Spearmint Oil] ][194]\n[Natural Mint Oil][195] Cooling and revitalizing oil widely used in cosmetics, food, and\npharmaceutical applications.\n[ [Natural Mint Oil] ][196]\n\nMenthol Crystals\n\nNaturally derived cooling agent known for its refreshing menthol aroma and soothing sensation.\n[Menthol Crystals]\n[ Mentha Piperita Oil][197] Strong and aromatic peppermint oil valued for its cooling and digestive\nproperties.\n[Mentha Piperita Oil]\n\nDementholised Peppermint Oil\n\nLight, aromatic peppermint oil ideal for flavoring and medicinal use without excess menthol.\n[Dementholised Peppermint Oil]\n\nThymol Oil\n\nPotent essential oil with antifungal and antiseptic properties, commonly used in oral and skin care.\n[Thymol Oil]\n\nCornmint Oil\n\nRich in menthol content, this oil provides a cool, minty aroma for medicinal and cosmetic uses.\n[Cornmint Oil]\n\nMenthol Flakes\n\nNaturally sourced menthol in solid form, offering a crisp, refreshing fragrance and cooling effect.\n[Menthol Flakes]\n[Longifolene][198] Aromatic terpene compound widely used in fragrance and pharmaceutical\nformulations.\n[Longifolene]\n\nGum Turpentine Oil\n\nNatural solvent and raw material for perfumes, paints, and chemical synthesis.\n[Gum Turpentine Oil]\n\nTerpineolene\n\nFragrant monoterpene with floral, pine-like notes used in perfumery and cleaning products.\n[Terpineolene]\n\nD D Turpentine Oil\n\nHigh-quality oil used as a solvent and base ingredient in aromatic and chemical industries.\n[D D Turpentine Oil]\n\nDelta 3 Carene\n\nSweet, woody-scented compound used in fragrances and natural solvent formulations.\n[Delta 3 Carene]\n\nPine Oil\n\nFresh, forest-scented essential oil with cleansing and disinfecting properties.\n[Pine Oil]\n\nD Limonene\n\nCitrus-scented natural solvent extracted from orange peels, used in fragrances and cleaners.\n[D Limonene]\n\nEucalyptol\n\nCooling and camphoraceous oil component ideal for respiratory care and perfumery.\n[Eucalyptol]\n[Eugenol][199] Clove-derived oil compound with antiseptic properties used in dental, flavor, and\nfragrance industries.\n[ [Eugenol] ][200]\n\nGeranyl Acetate\n\nSweet floral ester contributing to rose-like and fruity aromas in perfumery.\n[Geranyl Acetate]\n\nLinalyl Acetate\n\nNaturally fragrant compound with soothing floral notes used in high-end perfumes.\n[Linalyl Acetate]\n\nCitronellal\n\nFresh, lemony aldehyde widely used in insect repellents and perfumery.\n[Citronellal]\n\nAvocado Oil\n\nNutrient-rich carrier oil that deeply nourishes and moisturizes skin and hair.\n[Avocado Oil]\n\nCoconut Oil\n\nVersatile natural oil prized for its hydrating, antibacterial, and nourishing qualities.\n[Coconut Oil]\n\nWalnut Oil\n\nLuxurious oil packed with omega fatty acids for skin rejuvenation and hair nourishment.\n[Walnut Oil]\n\nAlmond Oil Sweet\n\nGentle, vitamin-rich oil that softens skin and strengthens hair naturally.\n[Almond Oil Sweet]\n\nArgan Oil\n\nPrecious Moroccan oil known for its moisturizing and anti-aging benefits.\n[Argan Oil]\n\nV"
