            "url": "https://bruag.com",
            "text": "Home / Bruag Design Factory AG\n\nsend us an e-mail: info@bruag.ch\n\ncall now: info@bruag.ch\n\nEnglish\n\nDeutsch Fran\u00e7ais Italiano Espa\u00f1ol\n\nHome\nExterior\n\nVentilated Fa\u00e7ades\nPerforated Fa\u00e7ades\nBalcony Railings\nSliding, Folding &amp; Shading Elements\nBalcony Acoustic Systems\nBalcony Partitions &amp; Cabinets\nGarden Design Elements\nInterior\n\nWall &amp; Ceiling Panelling\nPartition Wall &amp; Room Dividing Elements\nRoom Acoustic Systems &amp; Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae\nStair Railings\nMaterials\nDownloads\nReferences\nAbout us\nContact\n\nContact\nOffer Request\nSample Order\n\nExterior\n\nVentilated Fa\u00e7ades\nPerforated Fa\u00e7ades\nBalcony Railings\nSliding, Folding & Shading Elements\nBalcony Acoustic Systems\nBalcony Partitions & Cabinets\nGarden Design Elements\nInterior\n\nWall & Ceiling Panelling\nPartition Wall & Room Dividing Elements\nRoom Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae\nStair Railings\nMaterials\nDownloads\nReferences\nAbout us\nContact\n\nContact\nOffer Request\nSample Order\n\nVentilated Fa\u00e7ades\n\nPerforated Fa\u00e7ades\n\nBalcony Railings\n\nSliding, Folding & Shading Elements\n\nBalcony Acoustic Systems\n\nBalcony Partitions & Cabinets\n\nGarden Design Elements\n\nWall & Ceiling Panelling\n\nPartition Wall & Room Dividing Elements\n\nRoom Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae\n\nStair Railings\n\nContact\n\nOffer Request\n\nSample Order\n\ndiv; cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom-medium; delay: 200; repeat: false;\">\n\nVentilated Facades\n\nBenefit from the cost-effective alternative to conventional facade&nbsp;panels with CELLON\u00ae, available in over 3,000 colours!\n\nRoom Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae\n\nLet the room acoustic systems & the Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae lower the tones to a comfortable level and clean the air at the same time!\n\nBalcony Partitions & Cabinets\n\nSeparate the balconies with CELLON\u00ae, enjoy more privacy and do it in style!\n\nWall & Ceiling Panelling\n\nDesign your wall and ceiling into an absolute eye-catcher made of MDF, CELLON\u00ae or OAK PLYWOOD!\n\nBalcony Railings\n\nEnable privacy and also a view - thanks to semi-transparent railings made of CELLON\u00ae!\n\nBalcony Acoustic Systems\n\nReduce your noise exposure and enjoy a quiet time on your balcony thanks to acoustic systems made of FORMBOARD TOP PINE\u00ae or CELLON\u00ae.\n\nPerforated Facades\n\nDesign your facade from CELLON\u00ae as individually and uniquely as a fingerprint!\n\nSliding, Folding & Shading Elements\n\nCombine the useful with the aesthetic - selective and flexible protection from the sun's rays with CELLON\u00ae!\n\nStair Railings\n\nTurn your home into the ultimate stunner with a stair railing made of MDF or CELLON\u00ae!\n\nPartition Wall & Room Dividing Elements\n\nCreate a first-class room divider made of MDF, CELLON\u00ae or OAK PLYWOOD according to your ideas!\n\ndiv; cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom-medium; delay: 200; repeat: false;\">\n\nWho we are\nInnovation for Architecture \u2013 We make architecture come alive! Bruag Design Factory AG is your partner for customized building materials. We combine many years of experience in the laser technology of wood and wood-like materials as well as the surface processing of these materials. We not only implement ordinary, but also innovative ideas and want to enable architecture to design individual buildings with the help of our products. We are a family-run Swiss SME with a team made up of creative but also technically experienced people.\n\nto the Team\n\ndiv; cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom-medium; delay: 200; repeat: false;\">\n\nindividual\n\nMaximum freedom in shape, colour and material for creative minds: because the best innovations are created in cooperation with you. Your customised product entirely according to your wishes.\n\ninnovativ\n\nInnovation arises where something is created and implemented. We are constantly looking for new applications and materials so that we can always offer you the right solution to all your challenges.\n\nreliable\n\nTime is a rare commodity. It is all the more important that you can rely on appointments. We deliver made-to-measure products in record time and oversee projects from planning to delivery under one roof.\n\nfamilial\n\nWe are a family-run SME without sluggish structures. We personally look after your project from the first consultation to production from a single source - one contact person throughout the entire process.\n\ndiv; cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom-medium; delay: 200; repeat: false;\">\n\nWhat &nbsp;we do\n\nUnique Balcony Railings for a Stunning Exterior Look\nBalcony Railings\n\nBeautiful Floral Design Pattern\nStair Railings\n\nSmall Format Ventilated Facades \u2013 CELLON\u00ae stripes in \"elegant\" Color Scheme\nVentilated Facades\n\nDesign and Room Acoustics Improvement in Doctor's Waiting Room\nWall & Ceiling Panelling\n&nbsp;&nbsp; Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae\n\nThere is no Second Chance for the First Impression\nPerforated Facades\n&nbsp;&nbsp; Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements\n\nBalcony Railings and Garden Design Elements for Private House Harmony\nBalcony Railings\n&nbsp;&nbsp; Garden Design Elements\n\nAn Office Building in Korydalos (Greece) that Stands out in Design Terms\nPerforated Facades\n\nUnique Ornamentation as a Kind of Work of Art in the Stairwell.\nStair Railings\n\nFacade Cladding and Shading Screens in CELLON.\nVentilated Facades\n&nbsp;&nbsp; Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements\n\nto References\n\ndiv; cls: uk-animation-slide-bottom-medium; delay: 200; repeat: false;\">\n\nOur Social Media\n\nbruagag\nJune 17, 2026\n\nR\u00e4ume k\u00f6nnen mehr, als nur sch\u00f6n aussehen. Sie k\u00f6nnen beruhigen. Sie ...\n\nbruagag\nJune 14, 2026\n\nEin Geb\u00e4ude muss nicht neu sein, um neu zu wirken. Gerade bei Sanierungen ...\n\nbruagag\nJune 9, 2026\n\nFast fertig \u2013 B8 in G\u00fcttingen \ud83c\