          {
            "url": "https://bruag.com/about-us/",
            "text": "[ [send us an e-mail: info@bruag.ch] ][1] [ [call now: info@bruag.ch] ][2]\nEnglish\n[Deutsch][3][Fran\u00e7ais][4][Italiano][5][Espa\u00f1ol][6]\n[ [Bruag Logo] ][7]\n* [Home][8]\n* [Exterior][9]\n* [Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][10]\n* [Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][11]\n* [Balcony Railings][12]\n* [Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][13]\n* [Balcony Acoustic Systems][14]\n* [Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][15]\n* [Garden Design Elements][16]\n* [Interior][17]\n* [Wall & Ceiling Panelling][18]\n* [Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][19]\n* [Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][20]\n* [Stair Railings][21]\n* [Materials][22]\n* [Downloads][23]\n* [References][24]\n* [About us][25]\n* [Contact][26]\n* [Contact][27]\n* [Offer Request][28]\n* [Sample Order][29]\n[ [Bruag Logo] ][30]\n* Exterior\n* [Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][31]\n* [Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][32]\n* [Balcony Railings][33]\n* [Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][34]\n* [Balcony Acoustic Systems][35]\n* [Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][36]\n* [Garden Design Elements][37]\n* Interior\n* [Wall & Ceiling Panelling][38]\n* [Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][39]\n* [Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][40]\n* [Stair Railings][41]\n* [Materials][42]\n* [Downloads][43]\n* [References][44]\n* [About us][45]\n* Contact\n* [Contact][46]\n* [Offer Request][47]\n* [Sample Order][48]\n[ Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades ][49]\n[ Perforated Fa\u00e7ades ][50]\n[ Balcony Railings ][51]\n[ Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements ][52]\n[ Balcony Acoustic Systems ][53]\n[ Balcony Partitions & Cabinets ][54]\n[ Garden Design Elements ][55]\n[ Wall & Ceiling Panelling ][56]\n[ Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements ][57]\n[ Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae ][58]\n[ Stair Railings ][59]\n[ Contact ][60]\n[ Offer Request ][61]\n[ Sample Order ][62]\n\n# Our **Team**\n\n### Manuel Z\u00fcllig\n\nOwner and CEO\n\nManuel Z\u00fcllig has been a member of the Bruag management board since September 2019 and owns Bruag\nDesign Factory AG since January 1st, 2023. As a trained draftsman and business economist with many\nyears of experience in financial and strategic consulting for SMEs, he has the ideal backpack to\nstrike the exciting balance between \"feasible and affordable creativity\". He is also your contact\nfor the entire area of facades.\n\n[ manuel.zuellig@bruag.ch][63]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][64]\n\n### Nina Z\u00fcllig\n\nOwner and CEO\n\nNina Z\u00fcllig (-Br\u00fchwiler) has been working at Bruag since 2009 and acts as owner and co-CEO since the\ntakeover on 1.1.2023. She is responsible for sales including the coordination of all projects and\nmarketing. Her business background helps her to keep an overview in the daily coordination of the\ncompany. Nina has been instrumental in building up the international business activities and is\nleading project implementations.\n\n[ nina.zuellig@bruag.ch][65]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][66]\n\n### Markus Br\u00fchwiler\n\nFounder\n\nAs the founder of Bruag, Markus Br\u00fchwiler has put his heart and soul into the continuous development\nof the company on a daily basis. With the handover of the business to his daughter Nina and\nson-in-law Manuel on 1.1.2023, he is stepping down from the operational side of the business, but\nwill continue to advise the company and contribute with innovative ideas.\n\n[ markus.bruehwiler@bruag.ch][67]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][68]\n\n### J\u00f6rg Kreuder-Carrington\n\nHead of Sales Germany\n\nJ\u00f6rg Kreuder-Carrington joined the team in July 2024 as head of sales Germany. His more than 30\nyears of experience in the field of architectural communication, an extensive network of\ndecision-makers in the construction and real estate industry and the various stations of his sales\ncareer will be a benefit for his new position at Bruag Design Factory. He is the central point of\ncontact for all German partners and customers: architects, real estate managers, construction\ncompanies, metalworkers and other cooperation and sales partners.\n\n[ joerg.kreuder@bruag.ch][69]\n[ +49 151 52943714][70]\n\n### Marcel Briegmann\n\nSales and project management\n\nMarcel Briegmann is a trained roofer and has successfully completed his second training as an EFZ\ndesign engineer. The handball NLA co-trainer brings his extensive technical know-how and broad\nprofessional experience to Bruag in various customer-oriented areas. He is a technical sales\nconsultant and contact person for craftsmen and architects throughout the whole order process.\nMarcel Briegmann accompanies projects from planning to electronic data preparation for laser\ncutting.\n\n[ marcel.briegmann@bruag.ch][71]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][72]\n\n### Raffaela Paolucci\n\nSales, logistics and exports\n\nRaffaela Paolucci joined our team in April 2018. She handles our export business, organises\ntransports and supports our sales activities all over the world. Raffaela is not only an\norganisational talent, but also a linguistic genius. Due to her many years of working in\ninternational companies and the associated stays abroad, she speaks English, French, Italian and\nSpanish as well as German.\n\n[ raffaela.paolucci@bruag.ch][73]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][74]\n\n### Remo Berger\n\nSales consultant and work preparation\n\nRemo Berger knows our products from the ground up. As a trained industrial painter who joined our\ncompany in 2021 and later worked as a production manager in our company, he knows exactly where the\nlimits and possibilities of our products are. He is therefore also very valuable in his new role as\na sales consultant. Because he knows exactly what has to be taken care of in our production so that\nthe most individual customer wishes can be implemented to their complete satisfaction.\n\n[ remo.berger@bruag.ch][75]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][76]\n\n### Miguel Ruiz Mora\n\nArchitecture and work preparation\n\nEspecially in a company that offers customised, individual products, careful work preparation is of\ncentral importance. In addition to the object-specific work preparation, Miguel's creative vein has\nenabled the unique staging of Bruag trade fair stands since 2013.\n\n[ avor@bruag.ch][77]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][78]\n\n### Alessandra Bulut\n\nAdministration, personnel and accounting\n\nNumbers, personnel and administration are the world of Alessandra Bulut. The Amriswil native joined\nour team in August 2023. Alessandra Bulut can use her many years of experience and profound\neducation and training in human resources and accounting in our internationally oriented company on\na daily basis.\n\n[ alessandra.bulut@bruag.ch ][79]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][80]\n\n### Marie-Theres Br\u00fchwiler\n\nCommunication and marketing\n\nMarie-Theres Br\u00fchwiler joined the marketing and communications department in August 2017 and\nsupports sales. Her trademarks are passion and enthusiasm for Bruag products, which she uses audibly\nand legibly.\n\n[ marketing@bruag.ch][81]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][82]\n\n### Tarek Adidou\n\nArchitecture and design\n\nTarek Adidou is the creative vein when it comes to visualizations or the development of new design\nand perforation ideas. He supports and advises architects worldwide in Arabic, French and English\nand enables the implementation of a design idea in production. He has been with Bruag since October\n2015.\n\n[ tarek.adidou@bruag.ch][83]\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][84]\n[[Downloads]][85] [[Request offer]][86]\n[Bruag Logo]\n\n##### Contact\n\nBruag Design Factory AG\nWeinfelderstrasse 84\nCH-8580 Amriswil\n\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][87]\n[ info@bruag.ch][88]\n\n##### Products\n\n**Exterior**\n[Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][89]\n[Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][90]\n[Balcony Railings][91]\n[Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][92]\n[Balcony Acoustic Systems][93]\n[Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][94]\n[Garden Design Elements][95]\n\n**Interior**\n[Wall & Ceiling Panelling][96]\n[Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][97]\n[Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][98]\n[Stair Railings][99]\n\n##### Links\n\n[Downloads][100]\n[Request offer][101]\n[Reference Projects][102]\n[Legal notice][103]\n[Data protection][104]\n[GTC][105]\n\n##### Follow us\n\n[[instagram]][106] [[LinkedIn]][107]\nRealisation through [ViDYO GmbH][108]\nEnglish\n[Deutsch][109][Fran\u00e7ais][110][Italiano][111][Espa\u00f1ol][112]\n\n[1]: /contact/contact/contact-2/\n[2]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[3]: https://bruag.ch/ueber-uns/\n[4]: https://bruag.fr/notre-equipe/\n[5]: https://bruag.it/la-nostra-squadra/\n[6]: https://bruag.es/quienes-somos/\n[7]: /\n[8]: /\n[9]: #\n[10]: /exterior/back-ventilated-facades/\n[11]: /exterior/perforated-facades/\n[12]: /exterior/balcony-claddings/\n[13]: /exterior/schiebe-falt-beschattungselemente/\n[14]: /exterior/balcony-acoustics/\n[15]: /exterior/balkontrennwaende/\n[16]: /exterior/garden-applications/\n[17]: #\n[18]: /interior/wand-deckenverkleidungen/\n[19]: /interior/room-dividers-wall-claddings/\n[20]: /interior/akustiksysteme-noise-virus-catcher/\n[21]: /interior/stair-railings/\n[22]: /materials/\n[23]: /downloads/\n[24]: /references/\n[25]: /about-us/\n[26]: #\n[27]: /contact/contact/\n[28]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[29]: /contact/muster-bestellung/\n[30]: /\n[31]: /exterior/back-ventilated-facades/\n[32]: /exterior/perforated-facades/\n[33]: /exterior/balcony-claddings/\n[34]: /exterior/schiebe-falt-beschattungselemente/\n[35]: /exterior/balcony-acoustics/\n[36]: /exterior/balkontrennwaende/\n[37]: /exterior/garden-applications/\n[38]: /interior/wand-deckenverkleidungen/\n[39]: /interior/room-dividers-wall-claddings/\n[40]: /interior/akustiksysteme-noise-virus-catcher/\n[41]: /interior/stair-railings/\n[42]: /materials/\n[43]: /downloads/\n[44]: /references/\n[45]: /about-us/\n[46]: /contact/contact/\n[47]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[48]: /contact/muster-bestellung/\n[49]: /exterior/back-ventilated-facades/\n[50]: /exterior/perforated-facades/\n[51]: /exterior/balcony-claddings/\n[52]: /exterior/schiebe-falt-beschattungselemente/\n[53]: /exterior/balcony-acoustics/\n[54]: /exterior/balkontrennwaende/\n[55]: /exterior/garden-applications/\n[56]: /interior/wand-deckenverkleidungen/\n[57]: /interior/room-dividers-wall-claddings/\n[58]: /interior/akustiksysteme-noise-virus-catcher/\n[59]: /interior/stair-railings/\n[60]: /contact/contact/\n[61]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[62]: /contact/muster-bestellung/\n[63]: mailto:manuel.zuellig@bruag.ch\n[64]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[65]: mailto:nina.zuellig@bruag.ch\n[66]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[67]: mailto:markus.bruehwiler@bruag.ch\n[68]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[69]: mailto:joerg.kreuder@bruag.ch\n[70]: tel:+49 151 52943714\n[71]: mailto:marcel.briegmann@bruag.ch\n[72]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[73]: mailto:raffaela.paolucci@bruag.ch\n[74]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[75]: mailto:remo.berger@bruag.ch\n[76]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[77]: mailto:avor@bruag.ch\n[78]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[79]: mailto:alessandra.bulut@bruag.ch\n[80]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[81]: mailto:marketing@bruag.ch\n[82]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[83]: mailto:tarek.adidou@bruag.ch\n[84]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[85]: /downloads/\n[86]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[87]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[88]: mailto:info@bruag.ch\n[89]: /exterior/back-ventilated-facades/\n[90]: /exterior/perforated-facades/\n[91]: /exterior/balcony-claddings/\n[92]: /exterior/schiebe-falt-beschattungselemente/\n[93]: /exterior/balcony-acoustics/\n[94]: /exterior/balkontrennwaende/\n[95]: /exterior/garden-applications/\n[96]: /interior/wand-deckenverkleidungen/\n[97]: /interior/room-dividers-wall-claddings/\n[98]: /interior/akustiksysteme-noise-virus-catcher/\n[99]: /interior/stair-railings/\n[100]: /downloads/\n[101]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[102]: /references/\n[103]: /disclaimer/\n[104]: /privacy-policy/\n[105]: /agb/\n[106]: https://www.instagram.com/bruagag/\n[107]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/bruag-innovation-for-architecture/\n[108]: https://vidyo.ch\n[109]: http