            "url": "https://bruag.com/contact/offerte-anfragen/",
            "text": "[ [send us an e-mail: info@bruag.ch] ][1] [ [call now: info@bruag.ch] ][2]\nEnglish\n[Deutsch][3][Fran\u00e7ais][4][Italiano][5][Espa\u00f1ol][6]\n[ [Bruag Logo] ][7]\n* [Home][8]\n* [Exterior][9]\n* [Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][10]\n* [Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][11]\n* [Balcony Railings][12]\n* [Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][13]\n* [Balcony Acoustic Systems][14]\n* [Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][15]\n* [Garden Design Elements][16]\n* [Interior][17]\n* [Wall & Ceiling Panelling][18]\n* [Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][19]\n* [Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][20]\n* [Stair Railings][21]\n* [Materials][22]\n* [Downloads][23]\n* [References][24]\n* [About us][25]\n* [Contact][26]\n* [Contact][27]\n* [Offer Request][28]\n* [Sample Order][29]\n[ [Bruag Logo] ][30]\n* Exterior\n* [Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][31]\n* [Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][32]\n* [Balcony Railings][33]\n* [Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][34]\n* [Balcony Acoustic Systems][35]\n* [Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][36]\n* [Garden Design Elements][37]\n* Interior\n* [Wall & Ceiling Panelling][38]\n* [Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][39]\n* [Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][40]\n* [Stair Railings][41]\n* [Materials][42]\n* [Downloads][43]\n* [References][44]\n* [About us][45]\n* Contact\n* [Contact][46]\n* [Offer Request][47]\n* [Sample Order][48]\n[ Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades ][49]\n[ Perforated Fa\u00e7ades ][50]\n[ Balcony Railings ][51]\n[ Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements ][52]\n[ Balcony Acoustic Systems ][53]\n[ Balcony Partitions & Cabinets ][54]\n[ Garden Design Elements ][55]\n[ Wall & Ceiling Panelling ][56]\n[ Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements ][57]\n[ Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae ][58]\n[ Stair Railings ][59]\n[ Contact ][60]\n[ Offer Request ][61]\n[ Sample Order ][62]\n\n# Offer Request\n\nJust fill in the information asked on the right side and we will be happy to send you a quotation.\nPlease consider that our offer does not include installation at site, but only the panel material.\n\nThe pricing of the perforated panels depend a lot on the complexity of the design chosen (price\nlevel 1 to price level 5 categories). We have about 100 perforation patterns you can choose out of*\nor you can also design your own perforation pattern. Important for you to know: customised designs\nare usually not more expensive than choosing perforations of this list. Your design is just being\ncategorized into 1-5 (price level) according to the complexity of laser cutting. Please indicate at\nleast the category of design you are thinking of so we can give you the correct pricing (category 1,\n2, 3, 4 or 5).\n\nDo not hesitate to contact us in case of any questions.\n\n*Depending on the area of application, there are slightly different demands on the perforation\ndesign. While there is basically no size limit for the individual cut-outs in applications such as\nwall cladding or perforated facades, the ornaments for areas such as balcony balustrades or\nbanisters must on the one hand avoid climbing and be sufficiently stable to prevent falls. That is\nwhy we have different perforation collections:\n\n[ Design Collection for Balcony Balustrades & Stair Railings ][63] [ Design Collection for\nPerforated Fa\u00e7ades ][64] [ Design Collection for other Applications (e.g. Wall Cladding, Ceilings\netc) ][65]\n[Offerte Anfragen]\nTitle*\nPlease chooseMrs.Mr.Diverse\nFirst name*\nSurname*\nE-Mail-Adresse*\nPhone number*\nYour company name\nAddress (Street, House number, Postal code, City)*\nCountry*\nApplication\nPlease chooseRoom Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00aeVentilated FacadesWall & Ceiling\nPanellingBalcony RailingsGarden Design ElementsPerforated FacadesBalcony Acoustic SystemsStair\nRailingsSliding, Folding & Shading ElementsBalcony Partitions & CabinetsPartition Wall & Room\nDividing Elements\nIntended design category\nPlease chooseNo designCategory 1Category 2Category 3Category 4Category 5\nExact type of design\nApproximate number of square metres*\nProject name*\nArchitect\nRemarks\nFile Attachment to the Enquiry\nPlease do not fill in.\nSend\n[[Downloads]][66] [[Request offer]][67]\n[Bruag Logo]\n\n##### Contact\n\nBruag Design Factory AG\nWeinfelderstrasse 84\nCH-8580 Amriswil\n\n[ +41 71 414 00 90][68]\n[ info@bruag.ch][69]\n\n##### Products\n\n**Exterior**\n[Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][70]\n[Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][71]\n[Balcony Railings][72]\n[Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][73]\n[Balcony Acoustic Systems][74]\n[Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][75]\n[Garden Design Elements][76]\n\n**Interior**\n[Wall & Ceiling Panelling][77]\n[Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][78]\n[Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][79]\n[Stair Railings][80]\n\n##### Links\n\n[Downloads][81]\n[Request offer][82]\n[Reference Projects][83]\n[Legal notice][84]\n[Data protection][85]\n[GTC][86]\n\n##### Follow us\n\n[[instagram]][87] [[LinkedIn]][88]\nRealisation through [ViDYO GmbH][89]\nEnglish\n[Deutsch][90][Fran\u00e7ais][91][Italiano][92][Espa\u00f1ol][93]\n\n[1]: /contact/contact/contact-2/\n[2]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[3]: https://bruag.ch/kontakt/offerte-anfragen/\n[4]: https://bruag.fr/contact/demande-doffre/\n[5]: https://bruag.it/contatto/richiesta-di-offerta/\n[6]: https://bruag.es/contacto/solicitar-una-oferta/\n[7]: /\n[8]: /\n[9]: #\n[10]: /exterior/back-ventilated-facades/\n[11]: /exterior/perforated-facades/\n[12]: /exterior/balcony-claddings/\n[13]: /exterior/schiebe-falt-beschattungselemente/\n[14]: /exterior/balcony-acoustics/\n[15]: /exterior/balkontrennwaende/\n[16]: /exterior/garden-applications/\n[17]: #\n[18]: /interior/wand-deckenverkleidungen/\n[19]: /interior/room-dividers-wall-claddings/\n[20]: /interior/akustiksysteme-noise-virus-catcher/\n[21]: /interior/stair-railings/\n[22]: /materials/\n[23]: /downloads/\n[24]: /references/\n[25]: /about-us/\n[26]: #\n[27]: /contact/contact/\n[28]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[29]: /contact/muster-bestellung/\n[30]: /\n[31]: /exterior/back-ventilated-facades/\n[32]: /exterior/perforated-facades/\n[33]: /exterior/balcony-claddings/\n[34]: /exterior/schiebe-falt-beschattungselemente/\n[35]: /exterior/balcony-acoustics/\n[36]: /exterior/balkontrennwaende/\n[37]: /exterior/garden-applications/\n[38]: /interior/wand-deckenverkleidungen/\n[39]: /interior/room-dividers-wall-claddings/\n[40]: /interior/akustiksysteme-noise-virus-catcher/\n[41]: /interior/stair-railings/\n[42]: /materials/\n[43]: /downloads/\n[44]: /references/\n[45]: /about-us/\n[46]: /contact/contact/\n[47]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[48]: /contact/muster-bestellung/\n[49]: /exterior/back-ventilated-facades/\n[50]: /exterior/perforated-facades/\n[51]: /exterior/balcony-claddings/\n[52]: /exterior/schiebe-falt-beschattungselemente/\n[53]: /exterior/balcony-acoustics/\n[54]: /exterior/balkontrennwaende/\n[55]: /exterior/garden-applications/\n[56]: /interior/wand-deckenverkleidungen/\n[57]: /interior/room-dividers-wall-claddings/\n[58]: /interior/akustiksysteme-noise-virus-catcher/\n[59]: /interior/stair-railings/\n[60]: /contact/contact/\n[61]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[62]: /contact/muster-bestellung/\n[63]: /media/designkollektion_fuer_balkonbruestungen_treppengelaender_v2.0_1.pdf\n[64]: /media/designkollektion_fuer_perforierte_fassaden_v2.0_1.pdf\n[65]: /media/kollektion-mit-perforationen-bruag.pdf\n[66]: /downloads/\n[67]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[68]: tel:+41 71 414 00 90\n[69]: mailto:info@bruag.ch\n[70]: /exterior/back-ventilated-facades/\n[71]: /exterior/perforated-facades/\n[72]: /exterior/balcony-claddings/\n[73]: /exterior/schiebe-falt-beschattungselemente/\n[74]: /exterior/balcony-acoustics/\n[75]: /exterior/balkontrennwaende/\n[76]: /exterior/garden-applications/\n[77]: /interior/wand-deckenverkleidungen/\n[78]: /interior/room-dividers-wall-claddings/\n[79]: /interior/akustiksysteme-noise-virus-catcher/\n[80]: /interior/stair-railings/\n[81]: /downloads/\n[82]: /contact/offerte-anfragen/\n[83]: /references/\n[84]: /disclaimer/\n[85]: /privacy-policy/\n[86]: /agb/\n[87]: https://www.instagram.com/bruagag/\n[88]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/bruag-innovation-for-architecture/\n[89]: https://vidyo.ch\n[90]: https://bruag.ch/kontakt/offerte-anfragen/\n[91]: https://bruag.fr/contact/demande-doffre/\n[92]: https://bruag.it/contatto/richiesta-di-offerta/\n[93]: https://bruag.es/contacto/solicitar-una-oferta/"
