            "url": "https://bruag.com/contact/muster-bestellung/",
            "text": "[ [send us an e-mail: info@bruag.ch] ][1] [ [call now: info@bruag.ch] ][2]\nEnglish\n[Deutsch][3][Fran\u00e7ais][4][Italiano][5][Espa\u00f1ol][6]\n[ [Bruag Logo] ][7]\n* [Home][8]\n* [Exterior][9]\n* [Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][10]\n* [Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][11]\n* [Balcony Railings][12]\n* [Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][13]\n* [Balcony Acoustic Systems][14]\n* [Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][15]\n* [Garden Design Elements][16]\n* [Interior][17]\n* [Wall & Ceiling Panelling][18]\n* [Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][19]\n* [Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][20]\n* [Stair Railings][21]\n* [Materials][22]\n* [Downloads][23]\n* [References][24]\n* [About us][25]\n* [Contact][26]\n* [Contact][27]\n* [Offer Request][28]\n* [Sample Order][29]\n[ [Bruag Logo] ][30]\n* Exterior\n* [Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][31]\n* [Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][32]\n* [Balcony Railings][33]\n* [Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][34]\n* [Balcony Acoustic Systems][35]\n* [Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][36]\n* [Garden Design Elements][37]\n* Interior\n* [Wall & Ceiling Panelling][38]\n* [Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][39]\n* [Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][40]\n* [Stair Railings][41]\n* [Materials][42]\n* [Downloads][43]\n* [References][44]\n* [About us][45]\n* Contact\n* [Contact][46]\n* [Offer Request][47]\n* [Sample Order][48]\n[ Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades ][49]\n[ Perforated Fa\u00e7ades ][50]\n[ Balcony Railings ][51]\n[ Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements ][52]\n[ Balcony Acoustic Systems ][53]\n[ Balcony Partitions & Cabinets ][54]\n[ Garden Design Elements ][55]\n[ Wall & Ceiling Panelling ][56]\n[ Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements ][57]\n[ Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae ][58]\n[ Stair Railings ][59]\n[ Contact ][60]\n[ Offer Request ][61]\n[ Sample Order ][62]\n\n# Sample Order\n\nWe would be happy to send you one or two A4-size samples free of charge if you have a specific\nproject. For such a regular sample, you may use the form on the right. Please indicate more\ninformation on your project in the notes section. The more information we get, the better we can\nsupport you with corresponding materials. Please do not hesitate to contact us for samples in larger\nformats or custom-makde products with individuel perforations. We will be glad to support you where\npossible.\n\nWhen specifying the desired material, please take into account the respective field of application\nof the material:\n* CELLON\u00ae: Outdoor Applications (e.g. fa\u00e7ades, balcony parapets, privacy screens)\n* FORMBOARD TOP PINE\u00ae: Protected Outdoor Applications (e.g. soffits, balcony acoustics)\n* MDF: Indoor Applications\n* OAK PLYWOOD: Indoor Applications\n\n[ \u00dcbersicht an erh\u00e4ltlichen A4-Materialien ][63]\n[Muster Bestellung]\nTitle*\nPlease selectMrs.Mr.Diverse\nFirst name*\nSurname*\nE-Mail-Adresse*\nPhone number*\nYour company name\nAddress (Street, House number, Postal code, City)*\nZIP Code*\nPlace*\nCountry*\nYour position in the construction project\nPlease chooseInvestorGeneral ContractorArchitectDesignerMetal workerTimber constructorFa\u00e7ade\nconstructorCarpenterPrivate building ownerOthers\nApplication\nPlease chooseRoom Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00aeVentilated FacadesWall & Ceiling\nPanellingBalcony RailingsGarden Design ElementsPerforated FacadesBalcony Acoustic SystemsStair\nRailingsSliding, Folding & Shading ElementsBalcony Partitions & CabinetsPartition Wall & Room\nDividing Elements\nApproximate number of square metres*\nProject name\nProject street\nProject city\nArchitect\nMaterial for sample\nCELLON\u00ae\nFORMBOARD TOP PINE\u00ae\nMDF\nOAK PLYWOOD\n(please tick only the material that fits your application, see overview above left) and not all\nmaterials.\nDesign(s) if specific request see list\nRemarks\nFile Attachment to the Enquiry\nPlease do not fill in.\nSend\n[[Downloads]][64] [[Request offer]][65]\n[Bruag Logo]\n\n