 [Natural Mica Colors][138]\n* [Pigment Powder Colors][139]\n* [Soap Color Bars][140]\n* [ Flavors ][141]\n* [Browse All Alphabetically][142]\n* [Water Soluble Flavors][143]\n* [Seeds][144]\n* [Other Ingredients & Chemicals][145]\n* [Bulk Supplements][146]\n* [ Packaging ][147]\n* [Plastic Bottles][148]\n* [Plastic Jars][149]\n* [Crates and Baskets][150]\n* [Unique Packaging][151]\n* [Custom Printed Labels][152]\n* [Pre-Designed Label Templates][153]\n* [ Shipping Supplies ][154]\n* [Bubble Mailers (envelopes) ][155]\n* [Labels][156]\n* [Stretch Wrap][157]\n* [Corrugated Boxes][158]\n* [Tape][159]\n* [ Closures ][160]\n* [Bottle Caps][161]\n* [Jar Lids][162]\n* [Pumps][163]\n* [Sprayers][164]\n* [Rollon Bottles][165]\n* [Stand Up Pouches][166]\n* [Glass Bottles][167]\n* [Glass Apothecary Jars][168]\n* [Lip Balm Tubes, Jars and Tins][169]\n* [Decorative Bags][170]\n* [Metal Bottles, Jars and Tins][171]\n* [ Hot Items ][172]\n* [ Featured Items! ][173]\n* [Pumpkin Spice is Back!][174]\n* [Radha Beauty][175]\n* [Gift Ready][176]\n* [Ready To Label Products][177]\n* [Metaphysics][178]\n* [Beauty Supply][179]\n* [Books][180]\n* [Tools and Equipment][181]\n* [Unique Items][182]\n* [Bath & Body Inspired Lotions][183]\n* [ Wholesale ][184]\n* [ Clearance ][185]\n* [Beauty Supply][186]\n* [Candles][187]\n* [Clearance Bath Bombs][188]\n* [External Pain (Topical)][189]\n* [Masks][190]\n* [Miscellaneous][191]\n* [Raw Material][192]\n* [Discontinued Fragrance Oils][193]\n* [Decorative Botanicals][194]\n* [Discontinued][195]\n* [Components][196]\n* [ Health ][197]\n* [Hand Sanitizer][198]\n* [Personal Care][199]\n* [Massage][200]\n* [Vitamins & Supplements][201]\n* [Food][202]\n* [Radha Beauty][203]\n* [Foaming Hand Soap][204]\n* [Himalayan Salt Lamps][205]\n* [Diffusers and Reeds][206]\n* [Sign in][207] or [Register][208]\n* Home\n\n# About Us\n\nBulk Apothecary was founded in mid 2010 as a small brick & mortar specialty retailer in Streetsboro,\nOhio and has since grown to become one of the nation's largest online suppliers of natural\ningredients and essential oils. Our main focus from the beginning was soap and candle making\nsupplies, but word of our fantastic prices, amazing quality and excellent customer service spread.\nWithin 3 years, we expanded our offering to a wide range of specialty ingredients and vitamin\nsupplements and had a dominant online presence that was growing by the day. Today, we still operate\nour small store in Streetsboro, Ohio but also have an online presence that's growth is nothing short\nof amazing. This growth has come from a strong focus on our 5 founding principles.\n1. We source the finest quality ingredients and supplies from ethical producers around the world.\n2. We supply all of our products at market leading prices with no gimmicks.\n3. We never sacrifice quality for price.\n4. The customer is always right and customers should always be treated the way our customer service\nreps would like to be treated.\n5. Appreciate every customer, large and small and do your best to service them.\n\nFrom our experience if you stick to your principles, the business will take care of itself. These\nbeliefs have allowed us to do great things.\n\nWe now also have Nature's Oil line of products under our corporate umbrella. Nature's Oil is a\ncomplete line of natural oils and supplements that can be found in your local health food, grocery,\nand craft store.\n\n[ \u00d7 ][209]\n\n[[Facebook]][210] [[Pinterest]][211] [[Wordpress]][212]\n\n### All Major\n### Payments Accepted\n* [Facebook][213]\n* [TikTok][214]\n* [Pin It][215]\n* [Instagram][216]\n* YOUR ORDER\n* [Return Policy][217]\n* [Shipping Policy][218]\n* [Privacy Policy][219]\n* [Terms & Conditions][220]\n* [Help][221]\n* Your Account\n* [Sign In][222]\n* [My Account][223]\n* [View Cart][224]\n* [My Wishlist][225]\n* [Checkout][226]\n* [Manage Cookie Preferences][227]\n* Bulk Apothecary\n* [About Us][228]\n* [Quality][229]\n* [Best Price Guarantee][230]\n* [Blo