            "text": "[480-595-3157][1] [[email protected]][2]\n* [ Facebook ][3]\n* [ Facebook ][4]\n* [Account][5]\n* [Cart][6]\n[ [Cave Creek Olive Oil] ][7]\n* [Home][8]\n* [Store][9]\n* [Oils][10]\n* [Fused / Infused Olive Oils][11]\n* [Ultra Premium Extra Virgin Olive Oil][12]\n* [Specialty Oils][13]\n* [Avocado Oils][14]\n* [Vinegars][15]\n* [Dark Balsamics][16]\n* [White Balsamics][17]\n* [Specialty Vinegars][18]\n* [Gourmet Foods & Spices][19]\n* [Chocolate Sauces][20]\n* [Honey][21]\n* [Mustards & Ketchups][22]\n* [Frog Balls & Specialty Items][23]\n* [Pestos][24]\n* [Prickly Pear & Jalapeno Products][25]\n* [Salsa, Hot Sauces & BBQ][26]\n* [Spices][27]\n* [Gifts][28]\n* [Accessories][29]\n* [Books][30]\n* [Gift Sets][31]\n* [Skin Care Products][32]\n* [Gift Cards][33]\n* [Cart][34]\n* [Account][35]\n* [About Us][36]\n* [In The News][37]\n* [Learning Center][38]\n* [Recipes][39]\nSelect Page\n\n# About Us\n\nDrop by, relax and enjoy some classic western charm and friendly customer service while tasting our\npremium olive oils and balsamic vinegars.\n\nThere will be no beer and whiskey allowed at our bar, but plenty of shots of the freshest olive oils\nfrom around the world. And corked, just for you.\n\nIt\u2019s a tasting experience! So come on by and we\u2019ll show you the ropes to a healthy and fun way to\nenjoy the flavors of one of nature\u2019s finest culinary delights! With over 50 products on tap (bottled\non the spot) we are sure we can help you add a little flair to your next meal.\n\n## Proud Proprietors\n\nRich and Martha Bates are the proud owners of CAVE CREEK OLIVE OIL COMPANY. Their resume and\nachievements are extensive so let\u2019s condense their history to three points:\n* Both Rich and Martha have each been in the restaurant business for 30 years. Most of those years\nwere in our great Grand Canyon State.\n* Building and maintaining quality service were both of their industry trademarks and now they are\nbringing that legacy (along with their passion for fresh food and products) to their store at the\nCave Creek location.\n* Encouraging happy and healthy lifestyles for everyone to taste and enjoy!\n\n## Our Team\n\n[Rich]\n\n#### Rich\n\nOwner\n\n[Martha]\n\n#### Martha\n\nOwner\n\n[Katie]\n\n#### Katie\n\nAssociate\n\n### Store Hours\n\nMonday- Saturday: 10:00am - 5:30pm\nSunday: 10:00am - 4:00pm\nClosed: New Years Day, Easter, Thanksgiving, Christmas\n\n### Contact Us\n\n[480.595.3157][40]\n[[email protected]][41]\n\n6201 E. Cave Creek Rd. Ste. A Cave Creek, AZ 85331\n\n### Send Us a Note!\n\nName\nEmail Address\nMessage\nSubmit\n\n## CC Olive Oil on Facebook\n\n> [Cave Creek Olive Oil Company][42]\n* [[TripAdvisor]][43]\n\n[Check out Cave Creek Olive Oil Company on Yelp][44]\n[[Cave Creek Olive Oil Company BBB Business Review]][45]\n[Non-GMO Project Logo]\n[Ultra-Premium Extra Virgin Olive Oil]\n\n\u00a9 2017-26 Cave Creek Olive Oil \u00b7 [Web Site Design & SEO by Unleashed][46]\n* [Follow][47]\n* [Follow][48]\n* [Follow][49]\n\n[Cave Creek Olive Oil Company Logo]\n\n## Subscribe To Our Newsletter\n\nYes, send me notifications of new products, free recipes, and store sales! Your email is safe with\nus and is for our eyes only. Thank you friends! Come visit us soon!\n\nSUBSCRIBE!\n\n## You have Successfully Subscribed!\n\n[1]: tel:480-595-3157\n[2]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#c9aaa8bfacaabbacaca2a6a5a0bfaca6a0a589aea4a8a0a5e7aaa6a4\n[3]: https://www.facebook.com/pages/Cave-Creek-Olive-Oil-Company/667724989986112\n[4]: https://www.facebook.com/pages/Cave-Creek-Olive-Oil-Company/667724989986112\n[5]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/account/\n[6]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/cart/\n[7]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/\n[8]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/\n[9]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/store/\n[10]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/oils/\n[11]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/oils/fused-infused-olive-oils/\n[12]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/oils/ultra-premium-extra-virgin-olive-oil/\n[13]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/oils/specialty-oils/\n[14]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/oils/avocado-oils/\n[15]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/vinegars/\n[16]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/vinegars/dark-balsamics/\n[17]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/vinegars/white-balsamics/\n[18]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/vinegars/specialty-vinegars/\n[19]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/\n[20]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/chocolate-sauces/\n[21]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/honey/\n[22]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/mustards-ketchups/\n[23]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/frog-balls-specialty-items/\n[24]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/pestos/\n[25]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/prickly-pear-jalapeno-products/\n[26]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/salsa-hot-sauces-bbq/\n[27]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gourmet-foods-spices/spices/\n[28]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gifts/\n[29]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gifts/accessories/\n[30]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gifts/books/\n[31]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gifts/gift-sets/\n[32]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gifts/skin-care-products/\n[33]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/gift-cards/\n[34]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/cart/\n[35]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/account/\n[36]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/about-us/\n[37]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/in-the-news/\n[38]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/learning-center/\n[39]: https://cavecreekoliveoil.com/recipes/\n[40]: tel:480.595.3157\n[41]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#86e5e7f0e3e5f4e3e3ede9eaeff0e3e9efeac6e1ebe7efeaa8e5e9eb\n[42]: https://www.facebook.com/cavecreekoliveoilcompany\n[43]: https://www.tripadvisor.com/\n[44]: https://yelp.com/biz/cave-creek-olive-oil-company-cave-creek?utm_medium=badge_star_rating_revi\news&utm_source=biz_review_badge\n[45]: https://www.bbb.org/us/az/cave-creek/profil