1 Exam Pattern \u2022 \ud83d\udcdd PYQs (10+ Years) \u2022 \ud83e\udde0 10K+ Quizzes \u2022 \ud83d\udcd8 Topic-wise Notes \u2022 &#038; More\n\nCovering 50+ Competitive Exams\n\n\ud83d\udcda SSC &#8211; CGL, CHSL, MTS &#038; More\n\ud83d\udcda RRB &#8211; NTPC, Group D, ALP &#038; More\n\ud83d\udcda UPSC &#8211; CSE, CDS, CAPF &#038; More\n\ud83d\udcda State PSC &#8211; UPPSC, BPSC, MPPSC &#038; More\n\ud83d\udcda Banking &#8211; IBPS PO, SBI Clerk &#038; More\n\ud83d\udcda ESE/IES &#8211; Technical + GS Full Coverage\n\ud83d\udcda GATE &#8211; All Branches Covered\n\ud83d\udcda More &#8211; Popular Exams\n\nStudents\n\nExams\n\nPYQs\n\nExams Overview\nExam Info \u00b7 Syllabus \u00b7 Salary \u00b7 PYQs \u00b7 Cutoff \u00b7 More\n\nExams Overview\n\nCalculator\n\nAll Exams 7\n\nSSC 3\n\nBanking 2\n\nRailway 2\n\nStart typing\u2026 Esc to close\n\nESE NOTES EDUCATION\n\nSkills Focused Online Courses\n\nCivil Engineering\n\nDownload App\n\nSTART LEARNING\n\nCalculationClub.Com\n\nIf you&#8217;re looking for a website that provides all types of calculators and conversion tools, then CalculationClub . com is your final destination. Whether you are a student, professional, or just curious, CalculationClub offers a variety of tools to help you solve any type of problem. Our collection includes unit converters , random generators, text tools, and much more.\n\nResultJano.Com Promotion\n\nResultJano.Com\n\nIf you\u2019re looking for a website that provides all types of government job updates\nand exam-related information, then ResultJano.com is your final destination.\nWhether you are a student, job seeker, or preparing for competitive exams,\nResultJano offers the latest notifications, admit cards, results, and much more.\nVisit ResultJano.Com\n\nIf you want to fill the SSC CGL 2026, then please visit Resultjano.com\nSSC CGL 2026 Recruitment &#8211; Apply Now for 12,256 Posts\n\nDirect Notes In PDF\n\nPDF Notes\n\nSurveying &#038; Engineering Geology Notes by Jaspal Sir\n\n3 July 2024\n\nHello, Engineers! Are you searching for the latest handwritten Surveying &amp; Engineering Geology Notes ? If yes, then you are on the right platform.\nRead More\n\nPDF Notes\n\nEngineering Hydrology Notes by Jaspal Sir\n\n3 July 2024\n\nHello, Engineers! Are you searching for the latest handwritten Engineering Hydrology Notes ? If yes, then you are on the right platform. A total 7 chapters are covered in these notes.\nRead More\n\nPDF Notes\n\nOpen Channel Flow Notes by Jaspal Sir\n\n3 July 2024\n\nHello, Engineers! Are you searching for the latest handwritten Open Channel Flow notes? If yes, then you are on the right platform. Total 6 Chapter Covered in this Notes.\nRead More\n\nPDF Notes\n\n[PDF] Irrigation Engineering Notes by Jaspal Sir\n\n3 July 2024\n\nHello, Engineers! Are you searching for the latest handwritten Irrigation Engineering Notes? If yes, then you are on the right platform. Total 11 Chapter Covered in this Notes.\nRead More\n\n&hellip;\nNext \u00bb\n\nSUBJECT\n\nSurveying\n\nHighway En..\n\nSoil Mech..\n\nNew Posts \u2713\n\nSSC JE PYQP\n\nSSC JE Electrical Engineering PYQ Papers PDF (2009\u20132024)\n\n26 December 2025\n\nPractice SSC JE Electrical Engineering PYQP to understand exam pattern, important topics, and question trends. Download year-wise SSC JE EE papers.\nRead More\n\nSSC JE PYQP\n\nSSC JE Mechanical Engineering PYQ Papers PDF (2008\u20132024)\n\n25 December 2025\n\nDownload SSC JE Mechanical Engineering PYQ Papers PDF (2008\u20132024) for Prelims &amp; Mains. Year-wise question papers with exam pattern &amp; preparation tips.\nRead More\n\nSSC JE PYQP\n\nSSC JE Previous Year Question Paper PDF- Civil (2010\u20132024)\n\n11 October 2025\n\nDownload SSC JE Civil previous year question papers in PDF. Understand exam pattern, important topics, and question trends for SSC JE CE.\nRead More\n\nPDF Notes\n\nSurveying &#038; Engineering Geology Notes by Jaspal Sir\n\n3 July 2024\n\nHello, Engineers! Are you searching for the latest handwritten Surveying &amp; Engineering Geology Notes ? If yes, then you are on the right platform.\nRead More\n\n&hellip;\nNext \u00bb\n\nOpen Channel Flow \u2713\n\nOpen Channel Flow\n\nOpen Channel Flow &#8211; Introduction (Chapter-1)\n\n6 June 2022\n\nOpen channel flow refers to the flow of liquid in channel open to atmosphere or in partially filled conduit (Pipe). Example- River, Flood, Rivulets, Torrent, Sewers carrying sewage, Rode side Gutter. Detailed discuss about OCF.\nRead More\n\nOpen Channel Flow\n\nUniform Flow- Open Channel Flow (Chapter-2)\n\n12 June 2022\n\nA flow in an open channel is said to be uniform if its properties remain constant with respect to space. Detailed discussion about Uniform Flow.\nRead More\n\nOpen Channel Flow\n\nEnergy Depth Relationship- Open Channel Flow (Chapter-3)\n\n12 June 2022\n\nEnergy depth relationship is the third chapter of the open channel flow. Detailed discussion about specific energy, critical depth, relationship between specific energy and depth of flow, section factor z, relation between discharge &amp; depth of flow, channel transition.\nRead More\n\nOpen Channel Flow\n\nGradually Varied Flow- Open Channel Flow (Chapter-4)\n\n12 June 2022\n\nThe gradually varied flow (GVF) is defined as steady non- uniform flow, where the depth of flow varies gradually from section to section along the length of channel. (A steady non-uniform flow in a prismatic channel with gradual changes in its water surface elevation is termed as gradually varied flow (GVF).\nRead More\n\nNext \u00bb\n\nSurveying \u2713\n\nSurveying\n\nFundamentals Of Surveying (Part-1)\n\n2 August 2021\n\nIn fundamentals of surveying (part-1), we details analysis about surveying, classification of survey, principal of surveying, instruments used for various types of measurement.Etc\nRead More\n\nSurveying\n\nFundamentals Of Surveying (Part-2)\n\n4 August 2021\n\nIn fundamentals of surveying (part-2), we details analysis about plan &amp; map, scale, representation of scale- engineer\u2019s scale, representation fraction (rf), graphical scale. Shrinkage factor or shrinkage ratio, error due to shrinkage of map, error due to wrong measuring scale, type of scales- plane scale, diagonal scale, vernier scale (direct vernier, retrograde vernier, extended vernier, double vernier).\nRead More\n\nSurveying\n\nLinear Measurements (Chain Survey)\n\n9 August 2021\n\nIn liner measurements,we details discuss about procedure in chain surveying,basic definition of chain surveying- main station, tie station, main survey line, tie line/  [ Skip to content][1]\n[[ESE NOTES]][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [Blog][4]\n* [Calculator][5]\n* [About][6]\n* [Contact][7]\n[][8][][9]\n[[ESE NOTES]][10]\nMenu\n* [Civil Engineering][11]\n* [Highway Engineering][12]\n* [Soil Mechanics][13]\n* [Surveying][14]\n* [Open Channel Flow][15]\n* [Open Channel Flow \u2013 Introduction (Chapter-1)][16]\n* [Uniform Flow- Open Channel Flow (Chapter-2)][17]\n* [Energy Depth Relationship- Open Channel Flow (Chapter-3)][18]\n* [Gradually Varied Flow- Open Channel Flow (Chapter-4)][19]\n* [Rapidly Varied Flow: Hydraulic Jump- Open Channel Flow (Chapter-5)][20]\n* [Unsteady Flow: Surge- Open Channel Flow (Chapter-6)][21]\n* [Previous Year Paper][22]\n* [Civil Engineering PDF Notes][23]\n* * * [Environmental Engineering Notes by Jaspal Sir][24]\n* [Surveying & Engineering Geology Notes by Jaspal Sir][25]\n* [Structural Engineering][26]\n* [[PDF] Engineering Mechanics Notes (Handwritten) by Jaspal Sir][27]\n* [Building Construction Notes PDF by Jaspal Sir | Building Materials and Construction][28]\n* [Building Materials PDF Handwritten Notes by Jaspal Sir | Building Materials and\nConstruction][29]\n* [[PDF] Strength of Materials PDF Notes by Jaspal Sir][30]\n* [[PDF] Structure Analysis Notes by Jaspal Sir][31]\n* [[PDF] Reinforced Cement Concrete Notes by Jaspal Sir][32]\n* [Design of Steel Structures PDF Notes by Jaspal Sir][33]\n* [Estimation Costing and Valuation PDF Notes by Jaspal Sir][34]\n* [[PDF] CPM & PERT Notes by Jaspal Sir][35]\n* [Geotechnical Engineering][36]\n* [Geotechnical Engineering- Soil Mechanics PDF Notes by Jaspal Sir][37]\n* [Geotechnical Engineering- Foundation Engineering Notes by Jaspal Sir][38]\n* [Transportation Engineering][39]\n* [Highway Engineering Pdf Notes by Jaspal Sir][40]\n* [[PDF] Railway Engineering Notes by Jaspal Sir][41]\n* [Airport Engineering Notes PDF by Jaspal Sir][42]\n* [Water Resources Engineering][43]\n* [Fluid Mechanics Notes PDF by Jaspal Sir][44]\n* [[PDF] Hydraulic Machines Notes by Jaspal Sir][45]\n* [[PDF] Irrigation Engineering Notes by Jaspal Sir][46]\n* [Open Channel Flow Notes by Jaspal Sir][47]\n* [Engineering Hydrology Notes by Jaspal Sir][48]\n\n# About\n\n[ESE notes title logo]\n\n## Civil Engineering\n\nSince 2021, **ESE NOTES** has been continuously providing the topic on its site as well as improving\nit (without any cost).\n\nToday, there are many online education websites available on the internet that seem to be complete\nin their way but are still unable to fully satisfy the students or competitive exam aspirants.\n**ESE NOTES** is a website dedicated to education. We hope that the information on this website will\nbe useful to students and those preparing for competitive exams. This website\u2019s content is\nbeneficial to BTech students as well as those preparing for various competitive exams (e.g.,\nRAILWAY, SSC JE, and other governmental exams.).\nIn the quizzes, we also present a large number of questions organized by subject. The quizzes are\norganized by chapter, making it easy for students to assess their understanding of the material.\nThis instructional website provides in-depth and up-to-date information on the topics.\nThe primary goal of this educational website is to make studying easier for students and competitive\nexam candidates who require relevant information or expertise.\nThis educational website also aims to inform visitors who want to learn more about various subject\nareas. Finally, we hope that this website will aid readers in gaining a better understanding of the\nvarious topics.\n\n[ese app icon]\n[ESE notes title logo]\n\nSize 3-5MB\n\nThis app is not available on the play store. Soon this app will be available on the play store.\n\nThis app is secure and does not collect any kind of data.\n\nThis is an original APK file, it\u2019s safe to download and free of any virus.\n\nAPK (1) is support only portrait mode. And APK (2) supports both portrait and landscape modes.\n\nDownload APK (1)\nDownload APK (2)\n\n## Support Us\n\nDear Friends,\n\nRunning a free and helpful website like"
