[39]\n[ Services ][40]\n[ PROJECTS ][41]\nSAMPLES\n[ KOL Samples ][42]\n[ TONALITY Samples ][43]\n[ CONTACT ][44]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\nFolder: exo\n][45]\n[ Back ][46]\nTeam\n][47]\nCareers\n][48]\nFolder: K\u00d8L\u00ae FIBER CEMENT\n][49]\n[ Back ][50]\nApplications\n][51]\nTextures & Colors\n][52]\nTotal Facade Delivery\n][53]\nManufacturing & History\n][54]\nTechnical Information\n][55]\nFolder: PRODUCTS\n][56]\n[ Back ][57]\nSUB-FRAMING SYSTEMS\n][58]\nTONALITY\u00ae Terracotta\n][59]\nSKALA FC Architectural Siding\n][60]\nSKALA K Clay Shingle\n][61]\nRustikotta\n][62]\nexoTHERM\n][63]\nexoGIRT FRP Z-GIRT\n][64]\nServices\n][65]\nPROJECTS\n][66]\nFolder: SAMPLES\n][67]\n[ Back ][68]\nKOL Samples\n][69]\nTONALITY Samples\n][70]\nCONTACT\n][71]\n\n# **We Deliver Total Facades\u2122**\n\nWe specialize in creating exceptional facades through meticulous planning, engineering, and design.\nOur integrated services include providing a complete range of high-quality hardware components and a\ndiverse selection of exterior and interior facade panels. Whether you require a total package or\nindividual services, we deliver tailored solutions that enhance the beauty and functionality of your\nbuilding's rainscreen system.\n* ## 1. Comprehensive Planning, Engineering & Design\n\nOur Total Facade solution begins with meticulous planning and expert design services. Our team\ncollaborates with architects, contractors, and developers in creating precise drawings and\nengineering specifications for the rainscreen system. With a focus on efficiency and\nfunctionality, we ensure that every detail is carefully considered to meet the project's unique\nrequirements.\n* ## 2. Complete Hardware Package\n\nWe provide a comprehensive range of high-quality hardware components, including rails, adjustable\nclips, FRP girts, and fasteners essential for the structural integrity of the rainscreen system.\nOur in-house manufacturing and sourcing capabilities ensure reliable and compatible hardware,\nsimplifying the installation process for installers and contractors. With our complete hardware\npackage, you can trust that all the necessary elements are readily available.\n* ## 3. Diverse Cladding Options\n\nChoose from a wide variety of cladding panel materials, including fiber cement, terracotta, stone,\nmetal, and HPL panels. Our extensive range allows architects and developers to achieve their\ndesired aesthetic while maintaining the functionality of the rainscreen system. We offer durable\nand visually appealing options that cater to diverse design preferences, providing flexibility and\ncreative freedom.\n\n[ How Can We Help? ][72]\n][73] [\n][74]\n\n[Home][75]\n[Services][76]\n[Sub-Framing Systems][77]\n[K\u00d8L Fiber Cement][78]\n[TONALITY Terracotta][79]\n[exoTHERM][80]\n\n[SKALA K\n][81]\n[exoGIRT][82]\n[Projects][83]\n[Privacy Policy][84]\n[Terms of Service][85]\n[Contact Us][86]\n\n\u00a9 2026 exo. All rights reserved. All content on this website is the property of **exo** and is\nprotected by U.S. and international copyright laws. You may not use or reproduce any content without\nour prior written consent. For inquiries, please contact us at [**here**][87].\n\nexo, 528 Braddock Avenue, RIDC Keystone Commons, Turtle Creek, PA 15145\n\n[1]: /cart\n[2]: #page\n[3]: /\n[4]: /\n[5]: /exo-team\n[6]: /careers\n[7]: /kol-applications\n[8]: /kol-textures-colors\n[9]: /kol-total-facade-delivery\n[10]: /kol-manufacturing\n[11]: /technical-information\n[12]: /sub-framing-systems\n[13]: /exo-terracotta-tonality\n[14]: /skala-architectural-siding\n[15]: /skala-clay-shingle\n[16]: /rustikotta\n[17]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[18]: /exogirt\n[19]: /services\n[20]: /projects\n[21]: /kol-samples\n[22]: /tonality-samples\n[23]: /contact\n[24]: /\n[25]: /\n[26]: /exo-team\n[27]: /careers\n[28]: /kol-applications\n[29]: /kol-textures-colors\n[30]: /kol-total-facade-delivery\n[31]: /kol-manufacturing\n[32]: /technical-information\n[33]: /sub-framing-systems\