            "text": "][1]\n[ Skip to Content ][2]\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][3]\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][4]\nexo\n[ Team ][5]\n[ Careers ][6]\nK\u00d8L\u00ae FIBER CEMENT\n[ Applications ][7]\n[ Textures & Colors ][8]\n[ Total Facade Delivery ][9]\n[ Manufacturing & History ][10]\n[ Technical Information ][11]\nPRODUCTS\n[ SUB-FRAMING SYSTEMS ][12]\n[ TONALITY\u00ae Terracotta ][13]\n[ SKALA FC Architectural Siding ][14]\n[ SKALA K Clay Shingle ][15]\n[ Rustikotta ][16]\n[ exoTHERM ][17]\n[ exoGIRT FRP Z-GIRT ][18]\n[ Services ][19]\n[ PROJECTS ][20]\nSAMPLES\n[ KOL Samples ][21]\n[ TONALITY Samples ][22]\n[ CONTACT ][23]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][24]\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][25]\nexo\n[ Team ][26]\n[ Careers ][27]\nK\u00d8L\u00ae FIBER CEMENT\n[ Applications ][28]\n[ Textures & Colors ][29]\n[ Total Facade Delivery ][30]\n[ Manufacturing & History ][31]\n[ Technical Information ][32]\nPRODUCTS\n[ SUB-FRAMING SYSTEMS ][33]\n[ TONALITY\u00ae Terracotta ][34]\n[ SKALA FC Architectural Siding ][35]\n[ SKALA K Clay Shingle ][36]\n[ Rustikotta ][37]\n[ exoTHERM ][38]\n[ exoGIRT FRP Z-GIRT ][39]\n[ Services ][40]\n[ PROJECTS ][41]\nSAMPLES\n[ KOL Samples ][42]\n[ TONALITY Samples ][43]\n[ CONTACT ][44]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\nFolder: exo\n][45]\n[ Back ][46]\nTeam\n][47]\nCareers\n][48]\nFolder: K\u00d8L\u00ae FIBER CEMENT\n][49]\n[ Back ][50]\nApplications\n][51]\nTextures & Colors\n][52]\nTotal Facade Delivery\n][53]\nManufacturing & History\n][54]\nTechnical Information\n][55]\nFolder: PRODUCTS\n][56]\n[ Back ][57]\nSUB-FRAMING SYSTEMS\n][58]\nTONALITY\u00ae Terracotta\n][59]\nSKALA FC Architectural Siding\n][60]\nSKALA K Clay Shingle\n][61]\nRustikotta\n][62]\nexoTHERM\n][63]\nexoGIRT FRP Z-GIRT\n][64]\nServices\n][65]\nPROJECTS\n][66]\nFolder: SAMPLES\n][67]\n[ Back ][68]\nKOL Samples\n][69]\nTONALITY Samples\n][70]\nCONTACT\n][71]\n[Modern university campus building with curved white facade, brown and blue glass sections,\nsurrounded by green landscaping, walkways, and students walking around, under a blue sky with\nclouds.]\n[570 Fulton]\n[Close-up of a modern architectural siding with a textured surface, emphasizing the SKALA\nArchitectural Siding branding.]\n[Modern multi-story residential building with large windows, a brick ground level, and surrounded by\ngreenery.]\n[Close-up view of a modern, geometric high-rise building with angular window frames and white\nexterior panels against a clear blue sky.]\nSlide 1 Slide 1 (current slide) Slide 2 Slide 2 (current slide) Slide 3 Slide 3 (current slide)\nSlide 4 Slide 4 (current slide) Slide 5 Slide 5 (current slide)\n[Modern university campus building with curved white facade, brown and blue glass sections,\nsurrounded by green landscaping, walkways, and students walking around, under a blue sky with\nclouds.]\n[570 Fulton]\n[Close-up of a modern architectural siding with a textured surface, emphasizing the SKALA\nArchitectural Siding branding.]\n[Modern multi-story residential building with large windows, a brick ground level, and surrounded by\ngreenery.]\n[Close-up view of a modern, geometric high-rise building with angular window frames and white\nexterior panels against a clear blue sky.]\n\n# **exoSURFACES**\n\nexo Surfaces provides advanced facade solutions that bridge design intent with performance reality.\nWe engineer and supply fully integrated rainscreen systems for architects, engineers, installers,\nand building owners seeking precision, durability, and compliance with today\u2019s energy and code\nstandards. Our expertise spans thermally broken sub-framing systems\u2014such as the Passive\nHouse\u2013certified [**exoTHERM**][72] bracket and FRP [**exoGIRT**][73]\u2014as well as complete material\nsolutions including [**K\u00d8L High-Density Fiber Cement**][74] and [**TONALITY\u00ae Terracotta**][75]\ncladding. Through early collaboration and technical coordination, we help project teams achieve\nfacades that are efficient to install, resilient over time, and expressive of each building\u2019s\narchitectural intent.\n* [Discover design flexibility, enduring durability, and timeless elegance with K\u00d8L High Density\nFiber Cement architectural facade panels.]\n\n## K\u00d8L Fiber Cement\n\nDiscover design flexibility, enduring durability, and timeless elegance with **K\u00d8L High-Density\nFiber Cement** architectural facade panels.\n\n[Specify K\u00d8L][76]\n* [The industry\u2019s only adjustable FRP bracket, exoTHERM is Passive House Certified and thermally\nisolated by design\u2014eliminating thermal bridges while supporting code-compliant rainscreen cladding\nsystems.]\n\n## exoTHERM FRP Bracket\n\nThe industry\u2019s only adjustable FRP bracket, **exoTHERM** is Passive House Certified and thermally\nisolated by design\u2014eliminating thermal bridges while supporting code-compliant rainscreen cladding\nsystems.\n\n[learn more about exoTHERM][77]\n* [The newly formulated FRP exoGIRT offers best-in-class strength, withstanding bending, screw\npull-out, and other structural stresses.]\n\n## exoGIRT\u2122\n\nThe newly formulated FRP **exoGIRT** offers best-in-class strength, withstanding bending, screw\npull-out, and other structural stresses.\n\n[Explore exoGIRT][78]\n\n][79] [\n][80]\n\n[Home][81]\n[Services][82]\n[Sub-Framing Systems][83]\n[K\u00d8L Fiber Cement][84]\n[TONALITY Terracotta][85]\n[exoTHERM][86]\n\n[SKALA K\n][87]\n[exoGIRT][88]\n[Projects][89]\n[Privacy Policy][90]\n[Terms of Service][91]\n[Contact Us][92]\n\n\u00a9 2026 exo. All rights reserved. All content on this website is the property of **exo** and is\nprotected by U.S. and international copyright laws. You may not use or reproduce any content without\nour prior written consent. For inquiries, please contact us at [**here**][93].\n\nexo, 528 Braddock Avenue, RIDC Keystone Commons, Turtle Creek, PA 15145\n\n[1]: /cart\n[2]: #page\n[3]: /\n[4]: /\n[5]: /exo-team\n[6]: /careers\n[7]: /kol-applications\n[8]: /kol-textures-colors\n[9]: /kol-total-facade-delivery\n[10]: /kol-manufacturing\n[11]: /technical-information\n[12]: /sub-framing-systems\n[13]: /exo-terracotta-tonality\n[14]: /skala-architectural-siding\n[15]: /skala-clay-shingle\n[16]: /rustikotta\n[17]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[18]: /exogirt\n[19]: /services\n[20]: /projects\n[21]: /kol-samples\n[22]: /tonality-samples\n[23]: /contact\n[24]: /\n[25]: /\n[26]: /exo-team\n[27]: /careers\n[28]: /kol-applications\n[29]: /kol-textures-colors\n[30]: /kol-total-facade-delivery\n[31]: /kol-manufacturing\n[32]: /technical-information\n[33]: /sub-framing-systems\n[34]: /exo-terracotta-tonality\n[35]: /skala-architectural-siding\n[36]: /skala-clay-shingle\n[37]: /rustikotta\n[38]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[39]: /exogirt\n[40]: /services\n[41]: /projects\n[42]: /kol-samples\n[43]: /tonality-samples\n[44]: /contact\n[45]: /exo-surfaces\n[46]: /\n[47]: /exo-team\n[48]: /careers\n[49]: /kol-high-density-fiber-cement\n[50]: /\n[51]: /kol-applications\n[52]: /kol-textures-colors\n[53]: /kol-total-facade-delivery\n[54]: /kol-manufacturing\n[55]: /technical-information\n[56]: /products\n[57]: /\n[58]: /sub-framing-systems\n[59]: /exo-terracotta-tonality\n[60]: /skala-architectural-siding\n[61]: /skala-clay-shingle\n[62]: /rustikotta\n[63]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[64]: /exogirt\n[65]: /services\n[66]: /projects\n[67]: /samples\n[68]: /\n[69]: /kol-samples\n[70]: /tonality-samples\n[71]: /contact\n[72]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[73]: /exogirt\n[74]: /kol-applications\n[75]: /exo-terracotta\n[76]: /kol-applications\n[77]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[78]: /exogirt\n[79]: https://www.instagram.com/exosurfaces/\n[80]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/exo-surfaces\n[81]: /exo-surfaces\n[82]: /services\n[83]: /sub-framing-systems\n[84]: /kol-applications\n[85]: /exo-terracotta\n[86]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[87]: /skala-clay-shingle\n[88]: /exogirt\n[89]: /projects\n[90]: /privacy-policy\n[91]: /terms-of-service\n[92]: /contact\n[93]: /contact"
