            "text": "][1]\n[ Skip to Content ][2]\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][3]\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][4]\nexo\n[ Team ][5]\n[ Careers ][6]\nK\u00d8L\u00ae FIBER CEMENT\n[ Applications ][7]\n[ Textures & Colors ][8]\n[ Total Facade Delivery ][9]\n[ Manufacturing & History ][10]\n[ Technical Information ][11]\nPRODUCTS\n[ SUB-FRAMING SYSTEMS ][12]\n[ TONALITY\u00ae Terracotta ][13]\n[ SKALA FC Architectural Siding ][14]\n[ SKALA K Clay Shingle ][15]\n[ Rustikotta ][16]\n[ exoTHERM ][17]\n[ exoGIRT FRP Z-GIRT ][18]\n[ Services ][19]\n[ PROJECTS ][20]\nSAMPLES\n[ KOL Samples ][21]\n[ TONALITY Samples ][22]\n[ CONTACT ][23]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][24]\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][25]\nexo\n[ Team ][26]\n[ Careers ][27]\nK\u00d8L\u00ae FIBER CEMENT\n[ Applications ][28]\n[ Textures & Colors ][29]\n[ Total Facade Delivery ][30]\n[ Manufacturing & History ][31]\n[ Technical Information ][32]\nPRODUCTS\n[ SUB-FRAMING SYSTEMS ][33]\n[ TONALITY\u00ae Terracotta ][34]\n[ SKALA FC Architectural Siding ][35]\n[ SKALA K Clay Shingle ][36]\n[ Rustikotta ][37]\n[ exoTHERM ][38]\n[ exoGIRT FRP Z-GIRT ][39]\n[ Services ][40]\n[ PROJECTS ][41]\nSAMPLES\n[ KOL Samples ][42]\n[ TONALITY Samples ][43]\n[ CONTACT ][44]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\nFolder: exo\n][45]\n[ Back ][46]\nTeam\n][47]\nCareers\n][48]\nFolder: K\u00d8L\u00ae FIBER CEMENT\n][49]\n[ Back ][50]\nApplications\n][51]\nTextures & Colors\n][52]\nTotal Facade Delivery\n][53]\nManufacturing & History\n][54]\nTechnical Information\n][55]\nFolder: PRODUCTS\n][56]\n[ Back ][57]\nSUB-FRAMING SYSTEMS\n][58]\nTONALITY\u00ae Terracotta\n][59]\nSKALA FC Architectural Siding\n][60]\nSKALA K Clay Shingle\n][61]\nRustikotta\n][62]\nexoTHERM\n][63]\nexoGIRT FRP Z-GIRT\n][64]\nServices\n][65]\nPROJECTS\n][66]\nFolder: SAMPLES\n][67]\n[ Back ][68]\nKOL Samples\n][69]\nTONALITY Samples\n][70]\nCONTACT\n][71]\n\n# **Contact us!**\n\nOur team of experts is ready to assist you in achieving your architectural vision. Whether you need\nrainscreen systems, facade materials, engineering services, or hardware components, we have you\ncovered. Contact us today to discuss your project requirements and discover how exo Surfaces can\nbring your ideas to life. Let's build something extraordinary together!\n\n][72] [\n][73]\n\n[Home][74]\n[Services][75]\n[Sub-Framing Systems][76]\n[K\u00d8L Fiber Cement][77]\n[TONALITY Terracotta][78]\n[exoTHERM][79]\n\n[SKALA K\n][80]\n[exoGIRT][81]\n[Projects][82]\n[Privacy Policy][83]\n[Terms of Service][84]\n[Contact Us][85]\n\n\u00a9 2026 exo. All rights reserved. All content on this website is the property of **exo** and is\nprotected by U.S. and international copyright laws. You may not use or reproduce any content without\nour prior written consent. For inquiries, please contact us at [**here**][86].\n\nexo, 528 Braddock Avenue, RIDC Keystone Commons, Turtle Creek, PA 15145\n\n[1]: /cart\n[2]: #page\n[3]: /\n[4]: /\n[5]: /exo-team\n[6]: /careers\n[7]: /kol-applications\n[8]: /kol-textures-colors\n[9]: /kol-total-facade-delivery\n[10]: /kol-manufacturing\n[11]: /technical-information\n[12]: /sub-framing-systems\n[13]: /exo-terracotta-tonality\n[14]: /skala-architectural-siding\n[15]: /skala-clay-shingle\n[16]: /rustikotta\n[17]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[18]: /exogirt\n[19]: /services\n[20]: /projects\n[21]: /kol-samples\n[22]: /tonality-samples\n[23]: /contact\n[24]: /\n[25]: /\n[26]: /exo-team\n[27]: /careers\n[28]: /kol-applications\n[29]: /kol-textures-colors\n[30]: /kol-total-facade-delivery\n[31]: /kol-manufacturing\n[32]: /technical-information\n[33]: /sub-framing-systems\n[34]: /exo-terracotta-tonality\n[35]: /skala-architectural-siding\n[36]: /skala-clay-shingle\n[37]: /rustikotta\n[38]: /exotherm-rainscreen-bracket\n[39]: /exogirt\n[40]: /services\n[41]: /projects\n[42]: /kol-samples\n[43]: /tonality-samples\n[44]: /contact\n[45]: /exo-surfaces\n[46]: /\n[47]: /exo-team\n[48]: /careers\n[49]: /kol-high-density-fiber-cement\n[50]: /\n[51]: /kol-applications\n[52]: /