you on how we can partner:\n\n**GENERAL CONTACTS FOR ADVERTISING OPPORTUNITIES: **\n\nFW Africa\n\nTel / WhatsApp: +254 725 343 932\n\nEmail: info(at)fwafrica.net\n\n**CONTACTS FOR PRESS RELEASES & COMPANY FEATURES**\n\nEmail: press(at)fwafrica.net\n\nTel / WhatsApp: +254 725 343 932\n\n**CONTACTS FOR EVENTS PARTNERSHIPS OR ENQUIRIES**\n\nEmail: info(at)fwafrica.net\n\nTel / WhatsApp: +254 725 343 932\n\n[SEND ADVERTISING ENQUIRY][39]\nSearch\nSearch\n\nLATEST DIGITAL MAGAZINE\n\nUPCOMING PARTNER EVENTS\n\n[**AFMASS Food Expo Kenya & Eastern Africa**][40] \u2013 July 15-17, 2026 \u2013 Nairobi, Kenya\n\n**[Africa Manufacturing Awards][41]** \u2013 July 16, 2026 \u2013 Nairobi, Kenya\n\n[**AFMASS Food Expo Nigeria & Western Africa**][42] \u2013 September 15-17, 2026 \u2013 Lagos, Nigeria\n\n[**SIAL Paris**][43] \u2013 October 17-21, 2026 \u2013 Paris Norde Villepinte, Paris, Francs\n\n*To partner with us to promote your event, [contact us][44]. Terms and conditions apply*\n\nTRENDING NEWS TODAY\n* [Diageo CEO Dave Lewis targetting cost cuts, staff reductions ][45] June 19, 2026\n* [Campari Group Executive Patrick Piana appointed President of Spirits Europe ][46] June 19, 2026\n* [Japanese hotel chains increase certified seafood purchases][47] June 18, 2026\n* [D\u00f6hler expands Georgia facility to boost natural flavor production, innovation capacity][48] June\n16, 2026\n* [AB InBev appoints Mondelez CEO Dirk Van de Put as Chairman ][49] June 18, 2026\n\nNews Archives\n\nNews Archives Select Month June 2026 May 2026 April 2026 March 2026 February 2026 January 2026\nDecember 2025 November 2025 October 2025 September 2025 August 2025 July 2025 June 2025 May 2025\nApril 2025 March 2025 February 2025 January 2025 December 2024 November 2024 October 2024 September\n2024 August 2024 July 2024 June 2024 May 2024 April 2024 March 2024 February 2024 January 2024\nDecember 2023 November 2023 October 2023 September 2023 August 2023 July 2023 June 2023 May 2023\nApril 2023 March 2023 February 2023 January 2023 December 2022 November 2022 October 2022 September\n2022 August 2022 July 2022 June 2022 May 2022 April 2022 March 2022 February 2022 January 2022\nDecember 2021 November 2021 October 2021 September 2021 August 2021 July 2021 June 2021 May 2021\nApril 2021 March 2021 February 2021 January 2021 December 2020 November 2020\n\n### **ABOUT US**\n\nWe organise some of the most impactful face-to-face and virtual trade events and publish leading\nmagazines and websites that bring Africa to the World and the World to Africa. We believe that when\npeople come together, networks grow, and businesses thrive.\n\nFind more about us on our corporate website [www.fwafrica.net][50]\n\n### **QUICK LINKS**\n\n[Advertise with Us][51]\n\n[Send Us Press Releases][52]\n\n### **RELATED MAGAZINES**\n\n[Dairy Business Middle East & Africa][53]\n\n[Milling Middle East & Africa][54]\n\n[Feed Business Middle East & Africa][55]\n\n[HORECA Middle East & Africa][56]\n\n[Sustainable Packaging Middle East & Africa][57]\n\n[Home & Personal Care Middle East & Africa][58]\n\n[AgriTech Middle East & Africa][59]\n\n[HealthCare Middle East & Africa][60]\n\n### **CONTACT US**\n\nFW Africa\n\nP.O. Box 1874-00621, Nairobi, Kenya\n\nTel: +254 725 34 39 32\n\nEmail: info(at)fwafrica.net\n\n\u00a9 2026 Food Business Middle East & Africa - No.1 Food & Beverage Formulation, Processing & Packaging\nPublication .\n\n[1]: #page__main\n[2]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/\n[3]: https://foodbusinessmea.com/press-releases/\n[4]: https://foodbusinessmea.com/advertise/\n[5]: https://www.foodbusinessafrica.com/\n[6]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/beverages/\n[7]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/beverages/\n[8]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/meat-poultry/\n[9]: https://www.foodbusinessafrica.com/coffee-tea-cocoa/\n[10]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/sugar-confectionery/\n[11]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/about/\n[12]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/about/\n[13]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/past-issues/\n[14]: http://eepurl.com/HuyXT\n[15]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/contributors/\n[16]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/press-releases/\n[17]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/advertise/\n[18]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/advertise/\n[19]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/media-kit-editorial-calendar/\n[20]: https://www.fwafrica.net/advertising-webinar-enquiries/\n[21]: https://www.afmass.com\n[22]: https://www.kenyafooddrinkfestival.com\n[23]: http://www.manawards.fwafrica.net\n[24]: https://www.afripackexpo.com\n[25]: https://www.africafarmtechexpo.com\n[26]: https://africadairysummit.com\n[27]: https://www.africahorecaexpo.com\n[28]: https://www.africafoodsafetysummit.com\n[29]: https://www.foodsafetyafrica.net/\n[30]: https://www.DAIRYbusinessafrica.com\n[31]: https://www.millingmea.com\n[32]: https://animalfeedmea.com\n[33]: https://www.sustainabilitymea.com\n[34]: https://HOTELHOSPITALITYMEA.com\n[35]: https://www.agritechmea.com\n[36]: https://www.hpcmagmea.com\n[37]: https://www.healthcaremea.com\n[38]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/contact/\n[39]: https://www.fwafrica.net/advertising-webinar-enquiries/\n[40]: https://www.afmass.com/east\n[41]: http://www.manawards.fwafrica.net/food\n[42]: https://www.afmass.com/west\n[43]: http://www.sialparis.com/en\n[44]: https://www.foodbusinessafrica.com/contact/\n[45]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/diageo-ceo-dave-lewis-targetting-cost-cuts-staff-reductions/\n[46]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/campari-group-executive-patrick-piana-appointed-president-of-s\npirits-europe/\n[47]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/japanese-hotel-chains-increase-certified-seafood-purchases/\n[48]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/dohler-expands-georgia-facility-to-boost-natural-flavor-produc\ntion-innovation-capacity/\n[49]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/ab-inbev-appoints-mondelez-ceo-dirk-van-de-put-as-chairman/\n[50]: https://www.fwafrica.net\n[51]: https://www.foodbusinessmea.com/advertise\n[52]