        "email": "sales@healthgenesis.com",
        "phone": "(305) 861-0898",
        "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/health-genesis-corp",
        "website": "https://healthgenesis.com",
        "industries": "Beauty & Skincare Supplements; Sports Nutrition; Immune Support; Digestive Health; Women's Health; Men's Health",
        "products": "Private Label Supplements; Contract Supplement Manufacturing; Nutraceutical Manufacturing; International Vitamin Manufacturing",
        "certifications": "NSF Certified Facilities; FDA Compliant Operations",
        "distributors": "",
        "customers": "",
        "partnerships": "",
        "crawl_text": "Health Genesis Corporation Private Label Supplement Manufacturer FDA Compliant Operations NSF Certified Facilities FDA Compliant Operations 25+ years of industry experience Custom formulation expertise Full-service support from concept to fulfillment cGMP Certified Facility FDA-compliant manufacturing 4131 SW 47th Ave Suite 1404, Davie, FL 33314 Private Label Supplement Manufacturer USA\n\nSkip to content\n\nProducts\n\nClose Products\n\nOpen Products\n\nProducts A-Z\n\nProducts by Category\n\nBulk Supplements\n\nRaw Materials\n\nServices\n\nClose Services\n\nOpen Services\n\nContract Supplement Manufacturing\n\nPrivate Label Supplements\n\nCo-Packing Services\n\nInternational Opportunities\n\nLabel and Graphic Design\n\nResources\n\nClose Resources\n\nOpen Resources\n\nBlogs &amp; Insights\n\nIndustry Events\n\nCollaboration Beyond Manufacturing\n\nCommunity Outreach\n\nStick Packs Are Becoming the Default Format for Powder Supplements\n\nLearn More &gt;\n\nAbout\n\n(305) 861-0898\n\nContact\n\nPrivate Label Supplement Manufacturer in the USA\nReady to start your own supplement company? We're among the best private label supplement manufacturers, helping entrepreneurs launch successful brands with custom formulations, low minimum orders, and complete support from concept to shelf.\n\nBook Your Free Consultation Start Your Brand Today\n\nSCALE YOUR BUSINESS CONFIDENTLY\nTrusted Contract Manufacturing Partners Since 1998\nGrowing fast? Our contract supplement manufacturing expertise helps established brands scale reliably. With FDA-registered facilities and 25+ years of experience, we deliver American-made supplements that meet your quality standards and timelines.\n\nBook Your Free Consultation Scale Your Production\n\nWhy Leading Brands Choose Health Genesis\n\nHealth Genesis is a trusted private label supplement manufacturer with over 25 years of industry-leading experience. We specialize in custom formulations, contract manufacturing, and comprehensive B2B solutions for vitamins, supplements, and nutraceuticals.\n\n25+\n\nYears Manufacturing Excellence\n\n10,000+\n\nSuccessful Product Launches\n\nNSF\n\nCertified Facilities\n\nFDA\n\nCompliant Operations\n\nOur Manufacturing Services\n\nComprehensive Solutions for Every Stage of Your Supplement Business\n\nFrom first idea to finished product, Health Genesis handles every stage of supplement production. Pick the service that fits where your brand is today.\n\nPrivate Label Supplements\n\nYour Brand. Our Expertise.\n\nWe make it easy to launch a supplement line \u2014 even if you&#8217;re starting from scratch. Choose from 600+ ready-to-manufacture formulas or work with our team to create something custom. Low minimums mean you can test the market before scaling.\n\nWhy Choose Our Private Label Manufacturing:\n\n600+ formulas ready to brand as your own\n\nLow MOQs designed for new and growing brands\n\nPrivate label vitamin companies branding support\n\nLaunch Your Private Label Brand &gt;\n\nContract Supplement Manufacturing\n\nScale Without Compromise\n\nWhen your brand outgrows its current manufacturer, Health Genesis is ready. Our FDA-registered, cGMP-certified facility handles high-volume runs with the same quality controls that built our 25-year reputation. Your specs, your timeline, our guarantee.\n\nContract Manufacturing Advantages:\n\nFDA-registered, NSF-certified USA facility\n\nConsistent quality across every production run\n\nFlexible capacity for brands at any growth stage\n\nExplore Contract Manufacturing &gt;\n\nNutraceutical Manufacturing\n\nAlready Have a Formula? We'll Handle the Rest.\n\nIf your product is ready but production is the bottleneck, our co-packing services fill the gap. We work with finished formulas and bulk materials across capsules, tablets, powders, softgels, and more \u2014 getting your product to market faster.\n\nNutraceutical Manufacturing Benefits:\n\nMultiple delivery formats: capsules, tablets, powders, softgels\n\nHandles bulk materials and finished formulas\n\nFaster time-to-market with turnkey fulfillment support\n\nLearn About Co-Packing &gt;\n\nVitamin Manufacturing\n\nTake Your Brand Global\n\nHealth Genesis supports brands entering international markets with USA-manufactured supplements that meet global compliance standards. From vitamins to specialty formulas, we help you navigate regulatory requirements and position American-made quality as your competitive edge.\n\nInternational Vitamin Manufacturing:\n\nUSA-manufactured products with international compliance support\n\nVitamins, minerals, and specialty formulas for global markets\n\nExperienced team navigating export and labeling requirements\n\nExplore International Opportunities &gt;\n\nIndustries We Serve As A Private Label Supplement Manufacturer\n\nToday, supplement brands need specialized expertise. We serve diverse market segments and we always stay current with emerging wellness trends.\n\nBeauty &amp; Skincare Supplements\n\nBeauty-from-within products are trending right now. We specialize in collagen, biotin, and comprehensive skin health supplements.\n\nSports Nutrition\n\nSports nutrition requires specialized expertise. We manufacture protein powders, pre-workouts, and performance supplements tailored for athletes.\n\nImmune Support\n\nImmune health remains important to consumers. We produce vitamin C and zinc formulations. We also create elderberry and immune-boosting blends.\n\nDigestive Health\n\nGut health has become a major wellness trend. We create probiotics, prebiotics, and digestive enzymes that promote healthy digestion.\n\nWomen's Health\n\nWomen&#8217;s health demands targeted attention. We develop specialized supplements designed specifically for female wellness and vitality.\n\nMen's Health\n\nMen&#8217;s health requires targeted solutions. We develop comprehensive formulations that address men&#8217;s unique wellness needs throughout different life stages.\n\nWHY CHOOSE HEALTH GENESIS\n\n25+ years of proven excellence with thousands of successful product launches. We&#8217;re among the best supplement manufacturing companies, helping private label supplement manufacturers achieve market leadership through FDA-registered facilities and quality supplement manufacturing standards.\n\nEXPERT PARTNERS\n\nWith Health Genesis Corporation at your side, you can rest assured in knowing that your product and image will be developed by a team of talented and visionary professionals.\n\nReady to Partner with a Leading Private Label Supplement Manufacturer?\n\nDon&#8217;t let your supplement brand get lost in today&#8217;s crowded market. Partner with Health Genesis and leverage our 25+ years of manufacturing expertise to create products that outperform your competition.\n\nBook Your Manufacturing Consultation\n\nQuality, Integrity, and Accountability.\n\n(305) 861-0898\n\nToll Free 1-800-595-6593\n\nRequest a Meeting\n\nHealth Genesis Corporation\n4131 SW 47th Ave Suite 1404\nDavie, FL 33314\n\nContract Manufacturing\n\nPrivate Label\n\nRaw Materials\n\nBulk Caps, Tabs &amp; Softgels\n\nCo-Packing Services\n\nInternational Opportunities\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nProp 65 Compliance\n\nHGC Booklet\n\nJoin The Newsletter\n\nEmail\n\nSend\n\nFollow Us\n\nLinkedin\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nX-twitter\n\n\u00a9 2026 Health Genesis. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\u2020These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. [Skip to content][1]\n[ [Health Genesis header logo supplement manufacturer website branding] ][2]\n* Products\nClose Products Open Products\n\n## [Products A-Z][3]\n\n## [Products by Category][4]\n\n## [Bulk Supplements][5]\n\n## [Raw Materials][6]\n* Services\nClose Services Open Services\n\n## [Contract Supplement Manufacturing][7]\n\n## [Private Label Supplements][8]\n\n## [Co-Packing Services][9]\n\n## [International Opportunities][10]\n\n## [Label and Graphic Design][11]\n* Resources\nClose Resources Open Resources\n\n## [Blogs & Insights][12]\n\n## [Industry Events][13]\n\n## [Collaboration Beyond Manufacturing][14]\n\n## [Community Outreach][15]\n\n[Single-serve stick pack powder supplement designed for travel and daily convenience][Single-serve\nstick pack powder supplement designed for travel and daily convenience]\n\n## [Stick Packs Are Becoming the Default Format for Powder Supplements][16]\n\n[ Learn More > ][17]\n* [ About ][18]\n[ (305) 861-0898 ][19]\n[ Contact ][20]\nCOMPANY\n\n# About Health Genesis\n\nFamily-Owned. Florida-Based. 25+ Years of Manufacturing the Supplements Behind Hundreds of\nSuccessful Brands.\n\n[About Us Health Genesis supplement manufacturing company team expertise]\n\nHealth Genesis is a leading supplement manufacturing company dedicated to helping entrepreneurs and\nestablished brands bring their vision to life. As one of the premier private label supplement\ncompanies in the USA, we specialize in creating high-quality, custom formulations that help you\nbuild and grow your supplement brand.\n\n## What We Do\n\n### Private Label & White Label Supplements\n\nWhether you\u2019re looking to start your own supplement company or expand your existing product line,\nHealth Genesis offers comprehensive private label supplements solutions. From initial concept to\nfinished product, we handle every aspect of supplement production, including:\n* Custom supplement formulation tailored to your brand\u2019s unique needs\n* Private label vitamins including multivitamins, single vitamins, and specialized blends\n* White label supplements for fast-to-market solutions\n* Custom packaging and labeling design\n* Regulatory compliance and quality assurance\n\n### Comprehensive Manufacturing Services\n\nAs experienced supplement production companies go, Health Genesis stands out for our commitment to\nquality and innovation. Our state-of-the-art facilities produce:\n* Private label multivitamins and single-ingredient supplements\n* Custom pre workout formulations\n* Protein powders and sports nutrition products\n* Gummies private label options\n* Collagen supplements in multiple formats\n* Pet supplements for the growing animal health market\n* Probiotic formulations\n* Beauty and skincare supplements\n\n### Wholesale & Bulk Solutions\n\nFor retailers and distributors, we offer competitive wholesale vitamins and bulk vitamin options.\nOur vitamin and supplement wholesalers program provides access to premium products at scales that\nwork for your business, whether you need wholesale vitamins for resale or bulk ingredients for your\nformulations.\n\n## Why Choose Health Genesis?\n\n## Industry Expertise\n\nWith years of experience as multivitamin manufacturers in USA, we understand the complexities of the\nsupplement industry. Our team of formulators, quality control specialists, and regulatory experts\nwork together to ensure your products meet the highest standards.\n\n## Quality You Can Trust\n\nWe partner with trusted vitamin suppliers USA and source only premium ingredients. Our manufacturing\nprocesses adhere to strict quality standards, ensuring that every batch meets specifications for\npurity, potency, and safety.\n\n[ [Health Genesis supplement manufacturing facility equipment production capabilities][Health\nGenesis supplement manufacturing facility equipment production capabilities] ][21]\n\n## Low Minimums, High Standards\n\nStarting a supplement line shouldn\u2019t require a massive upfront investment. We work with businesses\nof all sizes, offering flexible minimum order quantities that make it possible to start your own\nsupplement brand without breaking the bank.\n\n## Full-Service Support\n\nFrom supplement formulation companies to finished product, we\u2019re with you every step of the way:\n* Brand your own supplements with our custom labeling and packaging\n* Formulation consultation and product development\n* Regulatory guidance and compliance support\n* Marketing and label claim review\n* Fulfillment and distribution options\n\n## Who We Serve\n\n### Entrepreneurs & Startups\n\nIf you're wondering how to start a supplement brand or how to start your own supplement company,\nwe're here to help. We guide first-time brand owners through every step of the process, from\nformulation to fulfillment.\n\n### Established Brands\n\nLooking to expand your product line or need a reli"
