            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [Health Genesis header logo supplement manufacturer website branding] ][2]\n* Products\nClose Products Open Products\n\n## [Products A-Z][3]\n\n## [Products by Category][4]\n\n## [Bulk Supplements][5]\n\n## [Raw Materials][6]\n* Services\nClose Services Open Services\n\n## [Contract Supplement Manufacturing][7]\n\n## [Private Label Supplements][8]\n\n## [Co-Packing Services][9]\n\n## [International Opportunities][10]\n\n## [Label and Graphic Design][11]\n* Resources\nClose Resources Open Resources\n\n## [Blogs & Insights][12]\n\n## [Industry Events][13]\n\n## [Collaboration Beyond Manufacturing][14]\n\n## [Community Outreach][15]\n\n[Single-serve stick pack powder supplement designed for travel and daily convenience][Single-serve\nstick pack powder supplement designed for travel and daily convenience]\n\n## [Stick Packs Are Becoming the Default Format for Powder Supplements][16]\n\n[ Learn More > ][17]\n* [ About ][18]\n[ (305) 861-0898 ][19]\n[ Contact ][20]\nCOMPANY\n\n# About Health Genesis\n\nFamily-Owned. Florida-Based. 25+ Years of Manufacturing the Supplements Behind Hundreds of\nSuccessful Brands.\n\n[About Us Health Genesis supplement manufacturing company team expertise]\n\nHealth Genesis is a leading supplement manufacturing company dedicated to helping entrepreneurs and\nestablished brands bring their vision to life. As one of the premier private label supplement\ncompanies in the USA, we specialize in creating high-quality, custom formulations that help you\nbuild and grow your supplement brand.\n\n## What We Do\n\n### Private Label & White Label Supplements\n\nWhether you\u2019re looking to start your own supplement company or expand your existing product line,\nHealth Genesis offers comprehensive private label supplements solutions. From initial concept to\nfinished product, we handle every aspect of supplement production, including:\n* Custom supplement formulation tailored to your brand\u2019s unique needs\n* Private label vitamins including multivitamins, single vitamins, and specialized blends\n* White label supplements for fast-to-market solutions\n* Custom packaging and labeling design\n* Regulatory compliance and quality assurance\n\n### Comprehensive Manufacturing Services\n\nAs experienced supplement production companies go, Health Genesis stands out for our commitment to\nquality and innovation. Our state-of-the-art facilities produce:\n* Private label multivitamins and single-ingredient supplements\n* Custom pre workout formulations\n* Protein powders and sports nutrition products\n* Gummies private label options\n* Collagen supplements in multiple formats\n* Pet supplements for the growing animal health market\n* Probiotic formulations\n* Beauty and skincare supplements\n\n### Wholesale & Bulk Solutions\n\nFor retailers and distributors, we offer competitive wholesale vitamins and bulk vitamin options.\nOur vitamin and supplement wholesalers program provides access to premium products at scales that\nwork for your business, whether you need wholesale vitamins for resale or bulk ingredients for your\nformulations.\n\n## Why Choose Health Genesis?\n\n## Industry Expertise\n\nWith years of experience as multivitamin manufacturers in USA, we understand the complexities of the\nsupplement industry. Our team of formulators, quality control specialists, and regulatory experts\nwork together to ensure your products meet the highest standards.\n\n## Quality You Can Trust\n\nWe partner with trusted vitamin suppliers USA and source only premium ingredients. Our manufacturing\nprocesses adhere to strict quality standards, ensuring that every batch meets specifications for\npurity, potency, and safety.\n\n[ [Health Genesis supplement manufacturing facility equipment production capabilities][Health\nGenesis supplement manufacturing facility equipment production capabilities] ][21]\n\n## Low Minimums, High Standards\n\nStarting a supplement line shouldn\u2019t require a massive upfront investment. We work with businesses\nof all sizes, offering flexible minimum order quantities that make it possible to start your own\nsupplement brand without breaking the bank.\n\n## Full-Service Support\n\nFrom supplement formulation companies to finished product, we\u2019re with you every step of the way:\n* Brand your own supplements with our custom labeling and packaging\n* Formulation consultation and product development\n* Regulatory guidance and compliance support\n* Marketing and label claim review\n* Fulfillment and distribution options\n\n## Who We Serve\n\n### Entrepreneurs & Startups\n\nIf you're wondering how to start a supplement brand or how to start your own supplement company,\nwe're here to help. We guide first-time brand owners through every step of the process, from\nformulation to fulfillment.\n\n### Established Brands\n\nLooking to expand your product line or need a reliable vitamin wholesalers USA partner? We work with\nestablished brands to develop innovative formulations and scale production efficiently.\n\n### Retailers & Distributors\n\nWe offer complete solutions from formulation development to finished packaging. Moreover, our\nsupplement manufacturing company handles everything, allowing you to focus on marketing and\ndistribution.\n\n### Health Practitioners\n\nWe support health practitioners who want to offer custom nutritional supplements under their own\nbrand, helping you provide personalized solutions for your patients.\n\nIndustry Leadership\n\n## Collaboration Beyond Manufacturing\n\nThrough strategic partnerships with research institutions, nonprofits, and innovative ingredient\nsuppliers, we\u2019re helping advance the science of nutrition while creating positive impact in\ncommunities worldwide. Each collaboration demonstrates how the supplement industry can drive\npurpose-led innovation and create measurable global impact.\n\n[ Read Our Partnership Stories ][22]\n\n## Ready to Get Started?\n\nLet\u2019s discuss how Health Genesis can help you create your own supplement brand. Contact us today\nfor a consultation and discover why businesses across the USA trust us as their supplement\nproduction companies partner.\n\n[ Contact ][23]\n\n**Quality, Integrity, and Accountability. **\n\n[(305) 861-0898][24]\n\nToll Free [1-800-595-6593][25]\n\n[ Request a Meeting ][26]\n\n**Health Genesis Corporation**\n4131 SW 47th Ave Suite 1404\nDavie, FL 33314\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][27]\n* [ Private Label ][28]\n* [ Raw Materials ][29]\n* [ Bulk Caps, Tabs & Softgels ][30]\n* [ Co-Packing Services ][31]\n* [ International Opportunities ][32]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][33]\n* [ Prop 65 Compliance ][34]\n* [ HGC Booklet ][35]\n\nJoin The Newsletter\n\nEmail\nSend\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ Linkedin ][36] [ Instagram ][37] [ Facebook ][38] [ X-twitter ][39]\n\u00a9 2026 Health Genesis. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\u2020These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are\nnot intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://healthgenesis.com/\n[3]: https://healthgenesis.com/products-a-z/\n[4]: https://healthgenesis.com/products-category/\n[5]: https://healthgenesis.com/bulk/\n[6]: https://healthgenesis.com/raw-materials/\n[7]: https://healthgenesis.com/contract-supplement-manufacturing/\n[8]: https://healthgenesis.com/private-label/\n[9]: https://healthgenesis.com/co-packing/\n[10]: https://healthgenesis.com/international/\n[11]: https://healthgenesis.com/label-and-graphic-design/\n[12]: https://healthgenesis.com/blogs/\n[13]: https://healthgenesis.com/events/\n[14]: https://healthgenesis.com/collaboration-beyond-manufacturing/\n[15]: https://healthgenesis.com/community/\n[16]: https://healthgenesis.com/stick-packs-are-becoming-the-default-format-for-powder-supplements/\n[17]: https://healthgenesis.com/stick-packs-are-becoming-the-default-format-for-powder-supplements/\n[18]: https://healthgenesis.com/about/\n[19]: tel:3058610898\n[20]: https://healthgenesis.com/contact/\n[21]: https://www.usda.gov/topics/organic\n[22]: https://healthgenesis.com/collaboration-beyond-manufacturing/\n[23]: #\n[24]: tel:13058610898\n[25]: tel:18005956593\n[26]: https://meetings.hubspot.com/sarah-bega/hgc-meeting-request\n[27]: https://healthgenesis.com/contract-supplement-manufacturing/\n[28]: https://healthgenesis.com/private-label/\n[29]: https://healthgenesis.com/raw-materials/\n[30]: https://healthgenesis.com/bulk/\n[31]: https://healthgenesis.com/co-packing/\n[32]: https://healthgenesis.com/international/\n[33]: https://healthgenesis.com/privacy-policy/\n[34]: https://healthgenesis.com/proposition-65/\n[35]: https://healthgenesis.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/HG-Tradeshow-Brochure-2024.pdf\n[36]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/health-genesis-corp\n[37]: https://www.instagram.com/healthgenesiscorp/\n[38]: https://www.facebook.com/healthgenesiscorp\n[39]: https://twitter.com/HealthGenesisPL"
