            "url": "https://healthgenesis.com/contact/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [Health Genesis header logo supplement manufacturer website branding][Health Genesis header logo\nsupplement manufacturer website branding] ][2]\n* Products\nClose Products Open Products\n\n## [Products A-Z][3]\n\n## [Products by Category][4]\n\n## [Bulk Supplements][5]\n\n## [Raw Materials][6]\n* Services\nClose Services Open Services\n\n## [Contract Supplement Manufacturing][7]\n\n## [Private Label Supplements][8]\n\n## [Co-Packing Services][9]\n\n## [International Opportunities][10]\n\n## [Label and Graphic Design][11]\n* Resources\nClose Resources Open Resources\n\n## [Blogs & Insights][12]\n\n## [Industry Events][13]\n\n## [Collaboration Beyond Manufacturing][14]\n\n## [Community Outreach][15]\n\n[Single-serve stick pack powder supplement designed for travel and daily convenience][Single-serve\nstick pack powder supplement designed for travel and daily convenience]\n\n## [Stick Packs Are Becoming the Default Format for Powder Supplements][16]\n\n[ Learn More > ][17]\n* [ About ][18]\n[ (305) 861-0898 ][19]\n[ Contact ][20]\n\n# Contact Us\n\nReady to launch your supplement brand? Our manufacturing experts are here to help.\n\nGet in touch with Health Genesis Corporation\u2019s supplement manufacturing team to discuss your private\nlabel, contract manufacturing, or custom formulation needs. Our experienced professionals are ready\nto guide you from concept to market-ready products.\n\n[ Request a Meeting ][21]\n\n## Get In Touch With Our Manufacturing Team\n\n### Health Genesis\n\n**Address:** 4131 SW 47th Ave Suite 1404 Davie, FL 33314\n\n**Phone:** [(305) 440-4881][22]\n\n**Phone:** [(305) 861-0898][23]\n\n**Toll Free:** [1-800-595-6593][24]\n\n**Email:** [sales@healthgenesis.com][25]\n\n**Hours:** Monday \u2013 Friday 9:00 AM \u2013 6:00 PM EST\n\n## Start Your Supplement Manufacturing Journey\n\nReady to discuss your supplement manufacturing project? Fill out the form below and one of our\nformulation experts will contact you within 24 hours to discuss your specific needs and provide a\ncustomized solution.\n\n## Why Partner With Health Genesis for Supplement Manufacturing?\n\n### 25+ Years of Experience\n\nTrusted supplement contract manufacturer since 1999\n\n### cGMP Certified Facility\n\nFDA-compliant manufacturing ensuring highest quality standards\n\n### Custom Formulation Expertise\n\nSpecialized scientists creating unique supplement formulations\n\n### Full-Service Solutions\n\nFrom concept to fulfillment, we handle your entire manufacturing process\n\n## What Our Manufacturing Partners Say\n\n***\u201cHealth Genesis does an amazing job producing our product. Their quality, reliability, and\nattention to detail are outstanding. The team is professional, communicative, and always on time. We\ntruly appreciate their hard work!\u201d ***\n\n\u2013 Abraham L.\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat are your minimum order quantities for supplement manufacturing?\n\nOur minimum order quantities vary by product type and complexity. Contact our team for specific MOQ\ninformation for your project.\n\nHow long does the supplement manufacturing process take?\n\nTimeline depends on formulation complexity and order size. Typical timelines range from 4-8 weeks\nfrom approval to delivery.\n\nDo you provide custom formulation services?\n\nYes, our experienced formulation scientists work with you to create custom supplement formulations\ntailored to your brand\u2019s specific needs.\n\nWhat certifications does your manufacturing facility have?\n\nOur facility is cGMP certified and FDA compliant, ensuring the highest quality standards for\nsupplement manufacturing.\n\nCan you help with packaging and labeling?\n\nAbsolutely. We provide comprehensive packaging and labeling services as part of our full-service\nmanufacturing solutions.\n\n## Ready to Start Manufacturing Your Supplements?\n\nDon\u2019t wait to bring your supplement vision to life. Contact Health Genesis Corporation today to\ndiscuss your manufacturing needs with our expert team. Whether you need private label solutions,\ncontract manufacturing, or custom formulation services, we\u2019re here to help you succeed in the\ncompetitive supplement market.\n\n[ Schedule Free Manufacturing Consultation ][26]\n\n## We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts!\n\n[ Leave Us a Google Review ][27]\n\n**Quality, Integrity, and Accountability. **\n\n[(305) 861-0898][28]\n\nToll Free [1-800-595-6593][29]\n\n[ Request a Meeting ][30]\n\n**Health Genesis Corporation**\n4131 SW 47th Ave Suite 1404\nDavie, FL 33314\n* [ Contract Manufacturing ][31]\n* [ Private Label ][32]\n* [ Raw Materials ][33]\n* [ Bulk Caps, Tabs & Softgels ][34]\n* [ Co-Packing Services ][35]\n* [ International Opportunities ][36]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][37]\n* [ Prop 65 Compliance ][38]\n* [ HGC Booklet ][39]\n\nJoin The Newsletter\n\nEmail\nSend\n\nFollow Us\n\n[ Linkedin ][40] [ Instagram ][41] [ Facebook ][42] [ X-twitter ][43]\n\u00a9 2026 Health Genesis. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\u2020These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are\nnot intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://healthgenesis.com/\n[3]: https://healthgenesis.com/products-a-z/\n[4]: https://healthgenesis.com/products-category/\n[5]: https://healthgenesis.com/bulk/\n[6]: https://healthgenesis.com/raw-materials/\n[7]: https://healthgenesis.com/contract-supplement-manufacturing/\n[8]: https://healthgenesis.com/private-label/\n[9]: https://healthgenesis.com/co-packing/\n[10]: https://healthgenesis.com/international/\n[11]: https://healthgenesis.com/label-and-graphic-design/\n[12]: https://healthgenesis.com/blogs/\n[13]: https://healthgenesis.com/events/\n[14]: https://healthgenesis.com/collaboration-beyond-manufacturing/\n[15]: https://healthgenesis.com/community/\n[16]: https://healthgenesis.com/stick-packs-are-becoming-the-default-format-for-powder-supplements/\n[17]: https://healthgenesis.com/stick-packs-are-becoming-the-default-format-for-powder-supplements/\n[18]: https://healthgenesis.com/about/\n[19]: tel:3058610898\n[20]: https://healthgenesis.com/contact/\n[21]: https://meetings.hubspot.com/sarah-bega/hgc-meeting-request\n[22]: tel:3054404881\n[23]: tel:3058610898\n[24]: tel:18005956593\n[25]: mailto:sales@healthgenesis.com\n[26]: https://meetings.hubspot.com/sarah-bega/hgc-meeting-request\n[27]: https://g.page/r/CU9_m-EpEXUKEAI/review\n[28]: tel:13058610898\n[29]: tel:18005956593\n[30]: https://meetings.hubspot.com/sarah-bega/hgc-meeting-request\n[31]: https://healthgenesis.com/contract-supplement-manufacturing/\n[32]: https://healthgenesis.com/private-label/\n[33]: https://healthgenesis.com/raw-materials/\n[34]: https://healthgenesis.com/bulk/\n[35]: https://healthgenesis.com/co-packing/\n[36]: https://healthgenesis.com/international/\n[37]: https://healthgenesis.com/privacy-policy/\n[38]: https://healthgenesis.com/proposition-65/\n[39]: https://healthgenesis.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/HG-Tradeshow-Brochure-2024.pdf\n[40]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/health-genesis-corp\n[41]: https://www.instagram.com/healthgenesiscorp/\n[42]: https://www.facebook.com/healthgenesiscorp\n[43]: https://twitter.com/HealthGenesisPL"
