atural Isolates ][75]\n    * [Cuminic Aldehyde][76]\n    * [Gamma Terpinene 99%][77]\n    * [L-Limonene][78]\n    * [Methyl Chavicol][79]\n    * [Para Cymene 98%][80]\n    * [Thymol Natural][81]\n* [Gallery][82]\n* [Our Quality][83]\n* [Contact Us ][84]\n\n#### Welcome To \" Indian Spice Oil Industries \"\n\nA Indian Spice Oil Industries is a leading name in the world of Natural Essential Oils. Our oils are\nbest known for it's Quality, Purity, Effectiveness and High Medicinal Value .\n\n### ABOUT US\n\nOur range is recognized globally for purity, effectiveness, high medicinal value and quality. Thus,\nthese are demanded in food processing, perfume manufacturing, cosmetics and pharmaceutical\nindustries, spa and aromatherapy center. We ensure to deliver best quality natural products as we\npractice constant quality checking procedures in our working methodology. [Read More][85]\n\n### Our Hot Products\n* ## Ajwain Seed Oil\n  \n  Ajwain is used as medicinal plant in traditional Ayurvedic medicine; primarily for stomach\n  disorders such as indigestion, flatulence.\n* [[ajwain oil]][86]\n\n* ## Basil Oil\n  \n  Basil Oil is a highly aromatic essential oil known for its refreshing herbal aroma, strong\n  antibacterial properties.\n* [[basil oil]][87]\n\n* ## Celery Seed Oil\n  \n  Celery (Apium graveolens) is a marshland plant in the family Apiaceae that has been cultivated as\n  a vegetable since antiquity.\n\n* ## Dill seed Oil\n  \n  Dill Seed (Anethum graveolens) is an annual herb in the celery family Apiaceae. It is the only\n  species in the genus Anethum.\n* \n\n* ## Fennel Seed Oil\n  \n  Fennel (Foeniculum vulgare) is a flowering plant species in the carrot family. It is a hardy,\n  perennial herb with yellow flowers and feathery leaves.\n\n* ## Thymol Natural\n  \n  Thymol is a natural monoterpene phenol derivative of cymene, C10H14O, isomeric with carvacrol,\n  found in oil of Ajwain.\n* [[thymol crystals]][88]\n\n##### PURITY IN EVERY DROP...\n\n### Our Products\n\n#### Natural Spice Oils\n\n[Natural Spice Oils]\n\nSpice oil is a spice derivative that are extracted generally by steam distillation process.These\noils are the volatile components present in spices and provide the aroma and flavor of the spice\nthey are made from. India is one of the top most producers of spice oils and contributes to around\n70% of the total spice oil production. Countries including USA, EU, Japan and other middle eastern\ncountries are major importers of spice oil. The exports of Indian spice oils has been rising\nsignificantly in the last few years owing to a sharp rise of demand in the food sector. [Read\nMore][89]\n\n#### Pure Essential Oils\n\nAn essential oil is a concentrated hydrophobic liquid containing volatile aroma compounds from\nplants. Essential oils are also known as volatile oils, ethereal oils, aetherolea, or simply as the\noil of the plant from which they were extracted.An oil is \"essential\" in the sense that it contains\nthe \"essence of\" the plant's fragrance\u2014the characteristic fragrance of the plant from which it is\nderived.They are used in perfumes, cosmetics, soaps and other products, for flavoring food and\ndrink, and for adding scents to incense and household cleaning products.[Read More][90]\n\n#### Natural Isolates\n\nNatural Isolates are important in the development process of custom scents. Isolates can be valuable\nwhen a specific scent is necessary for the creation of a specific scent profile, and when a certain\namount of delicacy is needed to create a fragrance. Ingredients such as these are important for\ncompanies that are in search of pure, quality ingredients for lines emphasizing the natural healing,\nrestorative powers of Essential Oils and Isolates as well as for those companies which are seeking a\nsimple solution to their fragrance needs. [Read More][91]\n\n#### Upcoming Products\n\nOur upcoming products range includes calamus root oil, kapoor kachri oil, parsley seed oil, sugandh\nmantri oil etc. These oils are extracted through very refined process with all quality check ups .\nCalamus Root Oil is used for Rejuvenating the senses in times of occasional stress. Kapoor Kachri\nOil is useful in local inflammations, nausea, asthma, bronchitis, hiccups. Parsley Seed Oil is an\nAntiseptic, Astringent . While Sugandh mantri essential oil is known for high purity and have a\nmesmerizing aroma that makes them widely used in aromatherapy. [Read More][92]\n\n### INFORMATION\n* [Home][93]\n* [About][94]\n* [Gallery][95]\n* [Our Quality][96]\n* [Contact Us][97]\n\n### CATEGORIES\n* [Natural Spice Oils][98]\n* [Natural Essential Oils][99]\n* [Natural Isolates][100]\n* [Natural Carrier Oils][101]\n* [Private Policy][102]\n\n### Follow Us On\n* \u00a0\u00a0\n* \u00a0\u00a0\n* \u00a0\u00a0\n\n### Contact Us Us\n* **Indian Spice Oils Industries**\n* **Gagandeep Singh**\n* **Address : **AN-34,35,36, Masuri Gulawati Road, UPSIDC Industrial Area Phase \u2013 III, Ghaziabad -\n  201015, Uttar Pradesh, India\n* **Mobile No :** +91-9818383839\n* **Email :** [info@indianspiceoil.com][103]\n* **Website :** [www.indianspiceoil.com][104]\n\n\u00a9 2025, Indian Spice Oil Industries. All Rights Reserved. \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n\n[ ][105]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: #\n[3]: about.html\n[4]: our-infrastructure.html\n[5]: #\n[6]: natural-spice-oils.html\n[7]: ajwain-oil.html\n[8]: black-pepper-oil.html\n[9]: cardmom-oil.html\n[10]: carrot-seed-oil.html\n[11]: celery-seed-oil.html\n[12]: Cumin-Seed-Oil.html\n[13]: dill-seed-oil.html\n[14]: fennel-seed-oil.html\n[15]: nutmeg-oil.html\n[16]: natural-essential-oils.html\n[17]: basil-oil.html\n[18]: bosellia-frankincense-oil.html\n[19]: Bergamot-Oil.html\n[20]: citronella-oil.html\n[21]: cypriot-oil.html\n[22]: clove-oil.html\n[23]: Cajeput-Oil.html\n[24]: calamus-root-oil.html\n[25]: Cassia-Oil.html\n[26]: euclyptus-oil.html\n[27]: Geranium-Oil.html\n[28]: Grapefruit-Oil.html\n[29]: juniper-berry-oil.html\n[30]: jamrosa.html\n[31]: Jasmine-Oil.html\n[32]: kapoor-kachri-oil.html\n[33]: lemon-grass-oil.html\n[34]: Lavender-Oil.html\n[35]: Lemon-Oil.html\n[36]: Lime-Oil.html\n[37]: Mandarin-Oil.html\n[38]: Neroli-Oil.html\n[39]: palmarosa-oil.html\n[40]: peppermint-oil.html\n[41]: parsley-seed-oil.html\n[42]: Rose-Oil.html\n[43]: Rosemary-Oil.html\n[44]: spearmint-oil.html\n[45]: sugandh-mantri-oil.html\n[46]: red-thyme-oil.html\n[47]: Tea-Tree-Oil.html\n[48]: Ylang-Ylang-Oil.html\n[49]: winter-green-oil.html\n[50]: carrier-oils.html\n[51]: almond-oil.html\n[52]: apricot-oil.html\n[53]: argan-oil.html\n[54]: avocado-oil.html\n[55]: aloevera-oil.html\n[56]: borage-oil.html\n[57]: castor-oil.html\n[58]: coconut-oil.html\n[59]: evening-primrose-oil.html\n[60]: Flaxseed-Oil.html\n[61]: grape-seed-oil.html\n[62]: hazelnut-oil.html\n[63]: jojoba-oil.html\n[64]: kalonji-oil.html\n[65]: moringa-oil.html\n[66]: neem-oil.html\n[67]: olive-oil.html\n[68]: peanut-oil.html\n[69]: pumpkin-seed-oil.html\n[70]: rosehip-oil.html\n[71]: sesame-oil.html\n[72]: walnut-oil.html\n[73]: wheat-germ-oil.html\n[74]: watermelon-seed-oil.html\n[75]: natural-isolates.html\n[76]: cuminic-aldehyde.html\n[77]: gamma-terpinene.html\n[78]: l-limonene.html\n[79]: methyl-chavicol.html\n[80]: para-cymene.html\n[81]: thymol-natural.html\n[82]: gallery.html\n[83]: quality-certifications.html\n[84]: contact.html\n[85]: https://indianspiceoil.com/about.html\n[86]: ajwain-oil.html\n[87]: basil-oil.html\n[88]: thymol-natural.html\n[89]: https://www.indianspiceoil.com/natural-spice-oils.html\n[90]: https://www.indianspiceoil.com/natural-essential-oils.html\n[91]: https://www.indianspiceoil.com/natural-isolates.html\n[92]: https://www.indianspiceoil.com/upcoming-products.html\n[93]: /\n[94]: about.html\n[95]: gallery.html\n[96]: quality-certifications.html\n[97]: contact.html\n[98]: natural-spice-oils.html\n[99]: natural-essential-oils.html\n[100]: natural-isolates.html\n[101]: carrier-oils.html\n[102]: pvtpolicy.html\n[103]: mailto:info@indianspiceoil.