            "text": "Strategic Food Packaging Design &amp; Branding Agency - Jenn David Design\n\nOur Work\n\nCase Studies Packaging Logos Websites Marketing Materials\n\nAbout\n\nAbout Our Process Our Team What Clients Say\n\nServices\nResources\n\nArticles Strategic Guides Expert Advice Book Video Series\n\nContact\nGet Started\n\nOur Work\n\nCase Studies Packaging Logos Websites Marketing Materials\n\nAbout\n\nAbout Our Process Our Team What Clients Say\n\nServices\nResources\n\nArticles Strategic Guides Expert Advice Book Video Series\n\nContact\nGet Started\n\nWe partner with specialty food brands to create powerful, distinct, strategic design that commands attention and gets results.\n\nAre you ready to revolutionize your brand?\n\nCreative Food Packaging Design & Food Branding Agency\n\nWe speak specialty food\n\nWe know consumer preferences, emerging trends, best practices, and FDA compliance.\n\nWhat we do >\n\nWe deliver results\n\nAs your strategic partner, we help you exceed goals and consistently surpass expectations.\n\nView case studies >\n\nWe make it easy\n\nWhether you're a startup or a large corporation, we free up time so you can do more of what you do best.\n\nSee our process >\n\nSee how we\u2019ve helped hundreds of brands achieve outstanding results:\n\nFOOD PACKAGING &amp; BRANDING DESIGN SERVICES\n\nBRAND DESIGN &amp; DEVELOPMENT\n\nSTRATEGIC PACKAGING DESIGN\n\nMARKETING MATERIALS\n\nWEBSITE\nDESIGN\n\nSpecialty Food Case Studies\n\nView Case Studies\n\n&ldquo;Our business has tripled, our sales have increased, and we went from a local brand to national&rdquo;\n\n&ldquo;Jenn David Design transformed the look of our product entirely and breathed new life into our brand as a result. The new look is beautiful, classy, fresh, and modern look that we are still getting compliments on after all these years. We could not be happier with the work, and responses and deliverables have always been timely. Jenn worked with us to bring our vision to life and even created supplemental marketing materials that are stylistically consistent and aligned with our look. Since working with Jenn David Design, our business has tripled, our sales have increased, and we went from a local brand to national! We know, without a doubt, that their work elevated our brand and was a large part in our growth. Packaging is what lures in a prospective customer, especially when they are on the brink of discovering a new, unfamiliar brand. And Jenn David Design made sure our packaging is buttoned up, polished, and inviting!&rdquo;\n\n&mdash;Tenny A.,\nLemonette\n\nRead More\n\n&ldquo;Magnificent creative strategist &#038; businesswoman&rdquo;\n\n&ldquo;I\u2019ve worked with Jenn David Design for 5 years and we\u2019ve launched many brands and products together. I am yet to find a design firm capable of delivering similar quality work with a fair price tag and comparable turnaround times. Regardless of project scope or timeframe, JDD delivers time and time again, and I\u2019m not easy to please. On any given day we juggle 10 projects! JDD is well-equipped to take a concept from blue sky through pre- and post-production, liaising with vendors and multiple departments in our organization with meticulous attention to every single project detail. This is something larger agencies can\u2019t touch. Jenn\u2019s infrastructure is not heavily layered and she is a magnificent creative strategist &amp; businesswoman. JDD\u2019s customer service is of such nature that I still feel as if I am her only and most valued customer.&rdquo;\n\n&mdash;Lize,\n[Company name confidential]\n\nRead More\n\n&ldquo;Rare combination of creative conceptualization and incredible design&rdquo;\n\n&ldquo;Jenn David Design is a rare combination of creative conceptualization and incredible design\u2014we are simply thrilled with the results! Working with Jenn is effortless\u2014she has the business savvy to quickly grasp concepts and turn out exceptional visuals with very few revisions required\u2014and all within the committed deadlines. I can't say enough about the quality, speed, attention to detail and effectiveness of JDD\u2019s work. We will continue to partner with Jenn David Design in the future.&rdquo;\n\n&mdash;Petra M.,\nUnion Jack\u2019s Tea\n\nRead More\n\n&ldquo;They were thoughtful, responsive, and timely&rdquo;\n\n&ldquo;Jenn and her team are fantastic to work with and amazing designers. I had a West African hot sauce I was looking to bring to market with very specific and unique design needs. Jenn and her team created a great label, logo, and brand for the product. They were thoughtful, responsive, and timely. I get compliments from everyone on our packaging all thanks to Jenn and her team.&rdquo;\n\n&mdash;Lara S.,\nVolta Foods\n\nRead More\n\n&ldquo;60% growth in sales within 6 months&rdquo;\n\n&ldquo;Working with Jenn and her team on Whisps made my job easy! In a fast-moving environment, Jenn and her team took our very tight timelines and complicated projects, and created amazing work. They were able to create packaging, selling tools, and a look and feel that garnered a 60% growth in sales within 6 months. I am forever thankful to them!&rdquo;\n\n&mdash;Amanda T.,\nWhisps\n\nRead More\n\n&ldquo;All of the work was meticulously thought-out, efficient and creative&rdquo;\n\n&ldquo;Jenn David Design has made creating our brand not only beautiful, but seamless. They helped with designing the look and feel of the logo, as well as all of the packaging on an entire line of products. All of the work was meticulously thought-out, efficient and creative. I am so thankful to Jenn David Design and will continue to work with them on all new projects and products down the line!&rdquo;\n\n&mdash;Amanda T.,\nOlive + Grayce Apothecary\n\nRead More\n\nLatest Articles\n\nColors &#038; Design That Work Best in Costco Food Packaging\n\nStop Using Cliches to Describe Your Food Product\n\nWhy Cheap Online Design is a Bad Idea for Food Brands\n\nThink of Your Food Packaging in a New Way\n\nHow to Make Your Food Packaging Iconic\n\n2025\u20132026 Food Packaging Design Trends Forecast\n\nHow to Disrupt a Food Category\n\n2023-2024 Food Packaging Design Trends Forecast\n\nMore Articles\n\nGet Our Free Guides\n\nAre you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\nGet Started\n\nAs Featured In:\n\nh&#101;ll&#111;&#64;j&#101;n&#110;&#100;&#97;&#118;&#105;d&#46;c&#111;m\n\n6&#49;9&#32;31&#56;&#32;1&#55;&#53;&#56;\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms and Conditions\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n\nPhone\n\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName *\n\nFirst Name *\n\nEmail *\n\n&#916;\n\n&copy; 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\n\nAll rights reserved\n\nShare\nTweet\nPin"
