            "url": "https://jenndavid.com/about/",
            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n# Jenn David Design: Food Branding & Packaging Design Company\n\n[process_background]\n\n## Food Package Design\n\nWe are a [food packaging design][42] company that has over 20 years of experience partnering with\nspecialty food brands to create powerful, distinct, cohesive creative food packaging design and\nbranding that commands attention and gets results. With our full spectrum of [services][43]\u2014from\nfood package design and food branding design to [ecommerce food packaging design websites][44] and\n[collateral][45]\u2014you get consistent branding and seamless communication across all platforms,\nresulting in a stronger brand impact.\n\nWhat sets us apart is our deep knowledge of the specialty food industry, the specialty food\nconsumer, [FDA compliance][46], industry trends, and food brand experience, and consumer values and\ndesires. We have been specializing in food packaging and branding for nearly two decades, and you\nget all of our expertise and knowledge on each project we partner with you on.\n\nBased in California, we work with clients all over the country and internationally.\n\nLinks:\n\n[**Meet our team**][47]\n\n[**Learn about our process**][48]\n\n**[Hear what clients have to say][49]**\n\nInterested in partnering with us? **[Get started today][50]**.\n\n##### JDD Through The Years\n\n[Share][51]\n[Tweet][52]\n[Pin][53]\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][54]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][55]\n[619 318 1758][56]\n[Privacy Policy][57]\n[Terms and Conditions][58]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* X/Twitter\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[4]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[5]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[6]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[7]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[8]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[9]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[10]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[11]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[12]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[13]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[14]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[15]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[16]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[17]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[18]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[19]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[20]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[21]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[22]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[23]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[24]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[25]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[26]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[27]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[28]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[29]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[30]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[31]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[32]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[33]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[34]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[35]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[36]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[37]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[38]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[39]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[40]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[41]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[42]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[43]: /services/\n[44]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[45]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[46]: https://jenndavid.com/fda-food-packaging-claims-made-easy/\n[47]: /about/our-team/\n[48]: /about/how-we-work/\n[49]: /testimonials/\n[50]: /get-started/\n[51]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fabout%2F\n[52]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Jenn+David+Design%3A+Food+Branding+%26+Packaging+Design+\nCompany&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fabout%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[53]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fabout%2F\n[54]: /get-started/\n[55]: mailto:hello@jenndavid.com\n[56]: tel:619 318 1758\n[57]: /privacy-policy/\n[58]: /terms/"
