            "url": "https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/",
            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n# Creative Food Packaging & Branding Design Process\n\n[process_background]\n\n## How We Work\n\n## Our goal is to make working with us as easy as possible for you and your team.\n\nYou don\u2019t have to have the answers or figure out what the design should look like. We advise and\nguide you throughout the entire design process. Our partnership will:\n\n[Set your brand apart]\n\n**Set your\nbrand apart**\nfrom competitors\n\n[duets]\n\nMaximize packaging as the\n**most important\nselling tool**\n\n[london tea]\n\nCreate a strong\n**emotional\nconnection**\n\n[lemonede ]\n\nAchieve results such as\n**increasing sales &\nextending brand reach**\n\n### We are not afraid to take calculated risks in our work that will pay off.\n\nYour product loses when you play it safe with a product or brand that is \u201cexpected\u201d or \u201cfits in\u201d\nwith competing brands. You want an iconic, memorable, phenomenal brand with unique food packaging,\nand that takes bold moves, big plays, and grabs the consumers attention.\n\n### We know the rules and when to break them.\n\nWe know when to respect and follow the rules, but we also know when it makes sense to break them and\nwhy. We are not afraid to say no to ideas that won\u2019t work and we will tell you why\u2014you won\u2019t find\nany order-takers here. We listen to you and are not afraid to say yes to great ideas that you bring\nto the table. You will find a true partnership here that goes both ways and will raise your [food\npackaging design][42] above the competition.\n\n### Our team becomes part of your team.\n\nWhen you work with Jenn David Design, you benefit from the knowledge and expertise of our team as\nwell as our extended team of [food designers][43]\u2014including print vendors, online focus group\ntesting, photography, video, and more.\n\n### Your success is our success.\n\nWe do not hesitate to go the extra mile to achieve truly phenomenal [food package design and\nbranding results][44]. The magic happens when we see the success you achieve as a result of our\npartnership. After our initial project is completed, we\u2019re here for anything else you need. Whether\nit be for new food branding ideas, creating new innovative food packaging designs, or [designing a\nfood or beverage website][45] to match your successful package design.\n\n##### Are you ready? [Let\u2019s talk][46].\n\n[Share][47]\n[Tweet][48]\n[Pin][49]\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][50]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][51]\n[619 318 1758][52]\n[Privacy Policy][53]\n[Terms and Conditions][54]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* X/Twitter\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[4]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[5]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[6]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[7]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[8]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[9]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[10]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[11]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[12]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[13]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[14]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[15]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[16]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[17]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[18]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[19]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[20]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[21]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[22]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[23]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[24]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[25]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[26]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[27]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[28]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[29]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[30]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[31]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[32]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[33]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[34]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[35]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[36]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[37]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[38]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[39]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[40]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[41]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[42]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[43]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[44]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[45]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[46]: /get-started/\n[47]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fabout%2Fhow-we-work%2F\n[48]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Creative+Food+Packaging+%26+Branding+Design+Process&url=\nhttps%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fabout%2Fhow-we-work%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[49]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fabout%2Fhow-we-work\n%2F\n[50]: /get-started/\n[51]: mailto:hello@jenndavid.com\n[52]: tel:619 318 1758\n[53]: /privacy-policy/\n[54]: /terms/"
