            "url": "https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/",
            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n# About\n\n[Jenn_David_Connolly]\n\n## Jenn David Connolly\n\n### Creative Strategist\n\nJenn David Connolly is the founder and creative strategist of Jenn David Design, a California-based\ndesign studio partnering exclusively with food brands. For over two decades, Jenn has been designing\n**bold, iconic food brands** that stand out as distinctive leaders in their categories and achieve\noutstanding success\u2014through **solid strategy, a curious mind, and exceptional creativity.**\n\nThriving on her passion for food, design, and helping food brands be amazing, Jenn aims to **set a\nnew precedent for exceptional creativity and strategy in food brand design**. Her strategic process\npromotes a strong, meaningful, authentic connection between food brands and their audiences.\n\n**Jenn is frequently featured** as a contributing writer in industry publications such as Specialty\nFood Association, Brand Packaging, Packaging Strategies, Food & Beverage Packaging, The Dieline,\nGourmet News, Graphic Design USA and more. Jenn\u2019s work as a food brand designer and food packaging\ndesign specialist has been featured in Communication Arts, Print Magazine and HOW Design, as well as\nnumerous design books.\n\n**Jenn David Design has partnered with** clients such as Whisps, Vevan, La Tourangelle, Orwasher\u2019s,\nClyde\u2019s Donuts, Cooper Street Cookies, Cantella\u2019s, Williams-Sonoma, Jada Brands, Lemonette, Chosen\nFoods, Pepper Creek Farms, Madelaine Chocolate Co., Sauce Goddess, Schuman Cheese, Mistubushi Food\nProducts, as well as **many** **emerging, trendsetting, and disruptive food brands**.\n\n[Share][42]\n[Tweet][43]\n[Pin][44]\n\n## Food Packaging Designers and Strategists\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][45]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][46]\n[619 318 1758][47]\n[Privacy Policy][48]\n[Terms and Conditions][49]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* Email\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[4]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[5]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[6]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[7]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[8]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[9]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[10]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[11]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[12]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[13]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[14]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[15]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[16]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[17]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[18]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[19]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[20]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[21]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[22]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[23]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[24]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[25]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[26]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[27]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[28]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[29]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[30]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[31]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[32]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[33]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[34]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[35]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[36]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[37]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[38]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[39]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[40]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[41]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[42]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fteam%2Fjenn-david-connolly%\n[43]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Jenn+David+Connolly&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fte\nam%2Fjenn-david-connolly%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[44]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fteam%2Fjenn-david-c\nonnolly%2F\n[45]: /get-started/\n[46]: mailto:hello@jenndavid.com\n[47]: tel:619 318 1758\n[48]: /privacy-policy/\n[49]: /terms/"
