          {
            "url": "https://jenndavid.com/services/",
            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n# Full-Service Food Packaging Design Agency\n\n[La-Tourangelle-packaging-jenn-daivid-design]\n\nWe offer a large array of [food packaging design][42] services for specialty food brands to create\npowerful, distinct, strategic design that commands attention and gets results.\n\n### Specialty Food is Our Specialty\n\nWe only work with food and beverage brands, so we have extensive knowledge of the industry, the\nspecialty food and beverage consumer, emerging trends, best practices, and FDA compliance. Our\nexpertise runs deep, as we have been doing this for over 20 years. **[Get a taste of our work\nhere][43]**.\n\n### We Get Results\n\nWe do more than create distinctive packaging design\u2014we produce results that transform brands. We\nhelp launch brands, create new products, and expand your customer base. See what [**our clients have\nto say**][44], and check out our recent **[case studies][45]**.\n\n### We Do the Whole Package\n\nFrom startups to mid-sized companies to large corporations, we partner with you and your team to\ndesign eye-catching new packaging and branding, redesign existing food and beverage packaging and\nbranding, launch new brands and products, and design and **[develop custom food and beverage\nwebsites][46]**. Additionally, we do supporting brand elements such as sell sheets, trade show booth\ndesign, product brochures and catalogs, and more.\n\n## Services Offered:\n\n##### Packaging:\n* Packaging strategy & design\n* Packaging redesign/refresh\n* Structural design\n* Container selection\n* Materials & vendor sourcing\n* Content strategy & copywriting\n\n##### Branding:\n* [Logo design][47]\n* Logo redesign/refresh\n* Brand story development\n\n##### Websites:\n* Custom [website design][48] and development\n* Custom WordPress builds\n* Ecommerce\n* Content strategy & copywriting\n\n##### Point-of-purchase (POP):\n* Point-of-purchase display design\n* Display shipper design\n* Counter display design\n* Floor display design\n* Shelf signage & shelf talkers\n\n##### Print collateral:\n* Catalogs\n* Sell sheets\n* Brochures\n\n##### Trade show:\n* Trade show booth design\n* Banners\n* Signage\n\n##### Other:\n* Vehicle wrap design\n\nTake a look at our extensive **[portfolio of food and beverage design work][49]**.\n\n[Share][50]\n[Tweet][51]\n[Pin][52]\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][53]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][54]\n[619 318 1758][55]\n[Privacy Policy][56]\n[Terms and Conditions][57]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* URL\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[4]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[5]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[6]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[7]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[8]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[9]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[10]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[11]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[12]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[13]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[14]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[15]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[16]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[17]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[18]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[19]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[20]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[21]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[22]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[23]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[24]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[25]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[26]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[27]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[28]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[29]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[30]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[31]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[32]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[33]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[34]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[35]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[36]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[37]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[38]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[39]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[40]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[41]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[42]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[43]: /our-work/packaging/\n[44]: /testimonials/\n[45]: /case-studies/\n[46]: /our-work/websites/\n[47]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[48]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[49]: /our-work/packaging/\n[50]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fservices%2F\n[51]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Full-Service+Food+Packaging+Design+Agency&url=https%3A%2\nF%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fservices%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[52]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fservices%2F\n[53]: /get-started/\n[54]: mailto:hello@jenndavid.com\n[55]: tel:619 318 1758\n[56]: /privacy-policy/\n[57]: /terms/"
