            "url": "https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/la-tourangelle-artisan-oils/",
            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n##### [Case Studies][42]\n\n##### [Packaging][43]\n\n###### [New work][44]\n\n###### [Beverages][45]\n\n###### [Frozen & Refrigerated ][46]\n\n###### [Baking & Bakery Goods][47]\n\n###### [Candy][48]\n\n###### [Teas][49]\n\n###### [Spices][50]\n\n###### [Health][51]\n\n###### [Oils][52]\n\n###### [Sauces & Condiments][53]\n\n###### [Snacks & Cookies][54]\n\n###### [Body Care][55]\n\n###### [Pantry][56]\n\n###### [Cheese][57]\n\n##### [Logos][58]\n\n##### [Websites][59]\n\n##### [Marketing Materials][60]\n\n[Our Work][61] > [Case Studies][62] > La Tourangelle Artisan Oils\n\n# La Tourangelle Artisan Oils\n\n[LaTourangelle_Case_Study-e1575283314950]\n\n## Creating an Icon in the Industry\n\nJenn David Design created the [package design][63] for the introduction of La Tourangelle to the\nNorth American market almost 20 years ago and in the process created a timeless, iconic design that\nhas sustained the growth of over 80 SKUs while retaining the very same brand design.\n\n## A Nod to the Past While Looking Ahead\n\nA family-run oil mill, La Tourangelle was founded 150 years ago in the idyllic French town of\nSaumur. In 2002, the owner\u2019s son expanded La Tourangelle operations to the United States. The goal\nwas to expand their reach to a new market while strictly maintaining their authentic traditional\noil-making methods.\n\n## Design That Remains Steady and Strong\n\nJDD designed the packaging for La Tourangelle for the U.S. market, striking the balance of honoring\ntheir venerated French heritage while appealing to a contemporary market. La Tourangelle has since\nexpanded into stores across the country, supported by a design that remains fresh and relevant.\n\n## Accommodating an Expanding Line\n\nBeginning with just four products, JDD has since helped La Tourangelle expand the line into upwards\nof 100 SKUs. The design was intentionally flexible enough to accommodate different sizes and\nproducts yet maintain its iconic look across the extensive line. The products\u2019 bold colors stand out\nin retail, and the arch on the front panel has become synonymous with the La Tourangelle brand.\n\n## Supporting an Internal Team\n\nJDD has partnered with La Tourangelle since its establishment in North America, supporting and\naugmenting the efforts of their internal marketing and design team throughout nearly two decades.\nWhile their design needs varied depending on their internal configurations over the years, JDD has\nbeen there in whatever capacity was needed and still is to this day.\n\n[Share][64]\n[Tweet][65]\n[Pin][66]\n[Next Case Study][67] \u00bb\n[Share][68]\n[Tweet][69]\n[Pin][70]\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][71]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][72]\n[619 318 1758][73]\n[Privacy Policy][74]\n[Terms and Conditions][75]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* Facebook\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[4]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[5]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[6]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[7]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[8]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[9]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[10]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[11]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[12]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[13]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[14]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[15]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[16]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[17]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[18]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[19]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[20]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[21]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[22]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[23]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[24]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[25]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[26]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[27]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[28]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[29]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[30]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[31]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[32]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[33]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[34]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[35]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[36]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[37]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[38]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[39]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[40]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[41]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[42]: /case-studies/\n[43]: /our-work/packaging/\n[44]: /our-work/new-work\n[45]: /our-work/beverages\n[46]: /our-work/frozen-refrigerated-foods\n[47]: /our-work/baking\n[48]: /our-work/candy\n[49]: /our-work/teas\n[50]: /our-work/spices\n[51]: /our-work/health\n[52]: /our-work/oils\n[53]: /our-work/sauces-condiments\n[54]: /our-work/snacks-cookies\n[55]: /our-work/body-care\n[56]: /our-work/pantry\n[57]: /our-work/cheese\n[58]: /our-work/logo-design/\n[59]: /our-work/websites/\n[60]: /our-work/marketing-materials\n[61]: /our-work/\n[62]: /case-studies/\n[63]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[64]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fla-tourangel\nle-artisan-oils%2F\n[65]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=La+Tourangelle+Artisan+Oils&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.\ncom%2Fcase-studies%2Fla-tourangelle-artisan-oils%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[66]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fla-t\nourangelle-artisan-oils%2F\n[67]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/whisps-cheese-crisps/\n[68]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fla-tourangel\nle-artisan-oils%2F\n[69]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=La+Tourangelle+Artisan+Oils&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.\ncom%2Fcase-studies%2Fla-tourangelle-artisan-oils%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[70]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fla-t\nourangelle-artisan-oils%2F\n[71]: /get-started/\n[72]: mailto:hello@jenndavid.com\n[73]: tel:619 318 1758\n[74]: /privacy-policy/\n[75]: /terms/"
