            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina][Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n##### [Case Studies][42]\n\n##### [Packaging][43]\n\n###### [New work][44]\n\n###### [Beverages][45]\n\n###### [Frozen & Refrigerated ][46]\n\n###### [Baking & Bakery Goods][47]\n\n###### [Candy][48]\n\n###### [Teas][49]\n\n###### [Spices][50]\n\n###### [Health][51]\n\n###### [Oils][52]\n\n###### [Sauces & Condiments][53]\n\n###### [Snacks & Cookies][54]\n\n###### [Body Care][55]\n\n###### [Pantry][56]\n\n###### [Cheese][57]\n\n##### [Logos][58]\n\n##### [Websites][59]\n\n##### [Marketing Materials][60]\n\n[Our Work][61] > [Case Studies][62] > Whisps Cheese Crisps\n\n# Whisps Cheese Crisps\n\n[Whisps_Case_Study][Whisps_Case_Study]\n\n## ROI of Design: 60% increase in Sales After a Redesign\n\nWhisps attributes a significant increase in sales solely to a new brand redesign by Jenn David\nDesign.\n\n## New Design to go with a New Direction for Whisps\n\nThey\u2019re light. They\u2019re airy. Whisps are 100% cheese crisps that were initially positioned as a\ngourmet cheese snack to be used on salads and soups. Whisps received a positive thumbs-up in the\nmarket right from the start. (Because cheese lovers can\u2019t get enough cheese.)\n\nA few years later, Jenn David Design helped reposition Whisps as a fun, high-protein snack. The\ngraphics needed to convey a fresh sense of energy and whimsy.\n\n## Communicating the New Positioning\n\nThe white background communicates the purity of this 100% cheese product. The custom, hand-lettered\nlogo imparts fun and whimsy, while the bold use of orange captures the attention of shoppers. The\ngraphics are slightly distressed, which mimics the texture of the Whisps. The cheese crisps appear\nto float around the front of the package\u2014a fun way to communicate the whisper-lightness of Whisps.\n\n## More Ways to Have Fun with Whisps\n\nThe back of the package reinforces product benefits and gives users a little inspiration on how to\nuse Whisps, beyond just snacking. How about a salad topper? Or as a high-protein, gluten-free\nbreadcrumbs or topping? There are many ways to \u201cWhisp up your life.\u201d\n\n\u201cJenn and her team were able to create packaging, selling tools, and a look and feel that garnered a\n60% growth in sales within 6 months.\u201d *\u2014Amanda T., Whisps*\n\n## Design is a Catalyst for Sales\n\nJust six months after the new design launched in stores, sales increased dramatically in just 6\nmonths. Since nothing else had changed with the marketing, Whisps attributes the dramatic increase\nin sales entirely to the new design.\n\n## An Expanded Product Line Expands the Customer Base\n\nWhisps initially launched with three varieties: Parmesan, Cheddar, and Asiago & Pepper Jack cheese\ncrisps. With the launch of the new design, the line expands to include three mouthwatering flavors:\nTomato Basil (Parmesan Cheese) and Bacon BBQ (Cheddar Cheese).\n\nJenn David Design continues to work with the Whisps brand as they grow their line even further.\n\n[Share][63]\n[Tweet][64]\n[Pin][65]\n\u00ab [Previous Case Study][66]\n[Next Case Study][67] \u00bb\n[Share][68]\n[Tweet][69]\n[Pin][70]\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][71]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][72]\n[619 318 1758][73]\n[Privacy Policy][74]\n[Terms and Conditions][75]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* Phone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[4]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[5]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[6]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[7]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[8]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[9]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[10]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[11]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[12]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[13]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[14]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[15]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[16]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[17]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[18]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[19]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[20]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[21]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[22]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[23]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[24]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[25]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[26]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[27]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[28]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[29]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[30]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[31]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[32]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[33]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[34]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[35]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[36]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[37]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[38]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[39]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[40]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[41]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[42]: /case-studies/\n[43]: /our-work/packaging/\n[44]: /our-work/new-work\n[45]: /our-work/beverages\n[46]: /our-work/frozen-refrigerated-foods\n[47]: /our-work/baking\n[48]: /our-work/candy\n[49]: /our-work/teas\n[50]: /our-work/spices\n[51]: /our-work/health\n[52]: /our-work/oils\n[53]: /our-work/sauces-condiments\n[54]: /our-work/snacks-cookies\n[55]: /our-work/body-care\n[56]: /our-work/pantry\n[57]: /our-work/cheese\n[58]: /our-work/logo-design/\n[59]: /our-work/websites/\n[60]: /our-work/marketing-materials\n[61]: /our-work/\n[62]: /case-studies/\n[63]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fwhisps-chees\ne-crisps%2F\n[64]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Whisps+Cheese+Crisps&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fc\nase-studies%2Fwhisps-cheese-crisps%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[65]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fwhis\nps-cheese-crisps%2F\n[66]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/la-tourangelle-artisan-oils/\n[67]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/my-red-tea/\n[68]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fwhisps-chees\ne-crisps%2F\n[69]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Whisps+Cheese+Crisps&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fc\nase-studies%2Fwhisps-cheese-crisps%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[70]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fwhis\nps-cheese-crisps%2F\n[71]: /get-started/\n[72]: mailto:hello@jenndavid.com\n[73]: tel:619 318 1758\n[74]: /privacy-policy/\n[75]: /terms/"
