            "url": "https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/my-red-tea/",
            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n##### [Case Studies][42]\n\n##### [Packaging][43]\n\n###### [New work][44]\n\n###### [Beverages][45]\n\n###### [Frozen & Refrigerated ][46]\n\n###### [Baking & Bakery Goods][47]\n\n###### [Candy][48]\n\n###### [Teas][49]\n\n###### [Spices][50]\n\n###### [Health][51]\n\n###### [Oils][52]\n\n###### [Sauces & Condiments][53]\n\n###### [Snacks & Cookies][54]\n\n###### [Body Care][55]\n\n###### [Pantry][56]\n\n###### [Cheese][57]\n\n##### [Logos][58]\n\n##### [Websites][59]\n\n##### [Marketing Materials][60]\n\n[Our Work][61] > [Case Studies][62] > My Red Tea\n\n# My Red Tea\n\n[Rooibos_Case_Study]\n\n## Becoming an Online Bestseller\n\nJenn David Design created a [package design][63] for **my red tea **that evokes the colors of their\nSouth African homeland to help the brand become a best-seller on Amazon.\n\n## From South Africa with Love\n\nA South African transplant to California created **my red tea** to share the Organic Rooibos tea\nthat is only grown in her native South Africa. Known to generations of South Africans, rooibos\n(pronounced ROY-boss) is red-hued, naturally high in antioxidants and caffeine-free.\n\n## A focus on Online Sales\n\n**my red tea **is sold exclusively online to minimize costs and to own the relationship with the\ncustomer. **my red tea **partnered with Jenn David Design to develop their branding and packaging\nfor the launch of this new brand.\n\n## Brilliant Hues Evoke the Beauty and Culture of South Africa\n\nThe bright colors of the resulting design not only connect with the aesthetic of South African\nculture but also create an especially eye-catching thumbnail, which is crucial to successful online\nsales. Within the first year after launching, **my red tea** became the top-seller on Amazon in\ntheir category and an Amazon Preferred product.\n\n## Design Supports the Brand Story\n\n**my red tea** has a passion for health, fairness, and the environment. The name is explained: \u201c**my\nred tea** was created to incorporate you\u2014it\u2019s your red tea, your body, and your wellbeing\u2014and it\u2019s\nour farmers\u2019 red tea too, and they\u2019re proud of it.\u201d Important symbols to the rooibos plant are\nfeatured in the design\u2014such as the donkey and cart which are used to transport the harvested plants\nthroughout the Cederberg mountains, as well as the bees which pollinate the plants (\u201c\u2026it\u2019s their red\ntea too!\u201d)\n\nJenn David Design continues to design the evolving product line to include loose-leaf tea, tagged\ntea bags, additional sizes and a foray into body creams.\n\n[Share][64]\n[Tweet][65]\n[Pin][66]\n\u00ab [Previous Case Study][67]\n[Next Case Study][68] \u00bb\n[Share][69]\n[Tweet][70]\n[Pin][71]\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][72]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][73]\n[619 318 1758][74]\n[Privacy Policy][75]\n[Terms and Conditions][76]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* Facebook\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[4]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[5]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[6]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[7]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[8]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[9]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[10]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[11]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[12]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[13]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[14]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[15]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[16]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[17]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[18]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[19]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[20]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[21]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[22]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[23]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[24]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[25]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[26]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[27]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[28]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[29]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[30]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[31]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[32]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[33]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[34]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[35]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[36]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/strategic-guides/\n[37]: https://jenndavid.com/signup/\n[38]: https://jenndavid.com/book/\n[39]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/video-series/\n[40]: https://jenndavid.com/contact-us/\n[41]: https://jenndavid.com/get-started/\n[42]: /case-studies/\n[43]: /our-work/packaging/\n[44]: /our-work/new-work\n[45]: /our-work/beverages\n[46]: /our-work/frozen-refrigerated-foods\n[47]: /our-work/baking\n[48]: /our-work/candy\n[49]: /our-work/teas\n[50]: /our-work/spices\n[51]: /our-work/health\n[52]: /our-work/oils\n[53]: /our-work/sauces-condiments\n[54]: /our-work/snacks-cookies\n[55]: /our-work/body-care\n[56]: /our-work/pantry\n[57]: /our-work/cheese\n[58]: /our-work/logo-design/\n[59]: /our-work/websites/\n[60]: /our-work/marketing-materials\n[61]: /our-work/\n[62]: /case-studies/\n[63]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[64]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fmy-red-tea%2\n[65]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=My+Red+Tea&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studie\ns%2Fmy-red-tea%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[66]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fmy-r\ned-tea%2F\n[67]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/whisps-cheese-crisps/\n[68]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/pepper-creek-farms/\n[69]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fmy-red-tea%2\n[70]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=My+Red+Tea&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studie\ns%2Fmy-red-tea%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[71]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fmy-r\ned-tea%2F\n[72]: /get-started/\n[73]: mailto:hello@jenndavid.com\n[74]: tel:619 318 1758\n[75]: /privacy-policy/\n[76]: /terms/"
