            "url": "https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/pepper-creek-farms/",
            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n##### [Case Studies][42]\n\n##### [Packaging][43]\n\n###### [New work][44]\n\n###### [Beverages][45]\n\n###### [Frozen & Refrigerated ][46]\n\n###### [Baking & Bakery Goods][47]\n\n###### [Candy][48]\n\n###### [Teas][49]\n\n###### [Spices][50]\n\n###### [Health][51]\n\n###### [Oils][52]\n\n###### [Sauces & Condiments][53]\n\n###### [Snacks & Cookies][54]\n\n###### [Body Care][55]\n\n###### [Pantry][56]\n\n###### [Cheese][57]\n\n##### [Logos][58]\n\n##### [Websites][59]\n\n##### [Marketing Materials][60]\n\n[Our Work][61] > [Case Studies][62] > Pepper Creek Farms\n\n# Pepper Creek Farms\n\n[Pepper_Creeks_Farms_Case_Study]\n\n## The Power of a Long-Term Partnership\n\nBeginning with packaging and extending the brand through website, catalog, trade show signage, and\nprint and digital advertising, Jenn David Design was crucial in establishing Pepper Creek Farms as a\nnational brand.\n\n## A Brand from America\u2019s Heartland\n\nPepper Creek Farms is based in Lawton, Oklahoma, located at the base of the Wichita Mountains.\nPepper Creek Farms is a family-owned business dedicated to locally grown ingredients and cooking in\nsmall batches to preserve the integrity and fresh flavors of ingredients.\n\n## It Begins with Packaging\n\nHaving partnered with Pepper Creek Farms since 2008, Jenn David Design has since designed or\nredesigned nearly all of the products in the extensive Pepper Creek Farms assortment. The\npartnership began with the [packaging design][63], and through a complete package of design\nservices, JDD revamped their website, trade show booth signage, catalog, as well as print and\ndigital ads for trade and consumer.\n\n## A Family Business Expands\n\nOver the past 12 years having partnered with JDD, Pepper Creek Farms has expanded their national\npresence while still maintaining the feel of a family-run business\u2014committed to quality ingredients\nand fresh flavors that enhance cherished family recipes. Jenn David Design is proud to have been an\nessential partner in this growth and their continued success.\n\n[Share][64]\n[Tweet][65]\n[Pin][66]\n\u00ab [Previous Case Study][67]\n[Share][68]\n[Tweet][69]\n[Pin][70]\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][71]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][72]\n[619 318 1758][73]\n[Privacy Policy][74]\n[Terms and Conditions][75]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* Name\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/\n[4]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/packaging/\n[5]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/logo-design/\n[6]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/websites/\n[7]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/marketing-materials/\n[8]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[9]: https://jenndavid.com/about/\n[10]: https://jenndavid.com/about/how-we-work/\n[11]: https://jenndavid.com/about/our-team/\n[12]: https://jenndavid.com/testimonials/\n[13]: https://jenndavid.com/services/\n[14]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/\n[15]: https://jenndavid.com/blog/\n[16]: https://jenndavid.com/resources/s