erest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fpepp\ner-creek-farms%2F\n[67]: https://jenndavid.com/case-studies/my-red-tea/\n[68]: https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fpepper-creek\n-farms%2F\n[69]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Pepper+Creek+Farms&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcas\ne-studies%2Fpepper-creek-farms%2F&via=jenndaviddesign\n[70]: https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjenndavid.com%2Fcase-studies%2Fpepp\ner-creek-farms%2F\n[71]: /get-started/\n[72]: mailto:hello@jenndavid.com\n[73]: tel:619 318 1758\n[74]: /privacy-policy/\n[75]: /terms/"
