            "text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n[Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n[About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n[Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n[Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n[About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n[Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n# Capabilities\n\n### Packaging:\n* Packaging design\n* Structural design\n* Container selection\n* Materials sourcing\n* Content writing\n* FDA compliance\n* FDA compliance reviews\n\n### Websites:\n* Website design & development\n* Ecommerce\n* Email marketing\n* Content writing\n\n### Identity:\n* Logo design\n* Identity systems\n* Branding guidelines\n* Business cards\n* Letterhead\n\n### Print Collateral:\n* Catalogs\n* Sell sheets\n* Brochures\n* Direct mail\n* Advertisements\n\n### Signage:\n* Banners/Signage\n* Trade Show Booth Design\n* Point-of-Purchase (POP) Displays\n* Vehicle Wraps\n\nHave a need for something that\u2019s not listed here? [Just ask.][42]\n\n[What can we do for you?][43]\n\n[Share][44]\n[Tweet][45]\n[Pin][46]\n\n#### Are you ready? Let\u2019s make your brand fresh and amazing.\n\n[Get Started][47]\n\n##### As Featured In:\n\n[hello@jenndavid.com][48]\n[619 318 1758][49]\n[Privacy Policy][50]\n[Terms and Conditions][51]\n\nGet expert advice in your inbox.\n* Name\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n* Name*\nFirst Name *\n* Email*\n\n\u00a9 2002-2026 Jenn David Design\nAll rights reserved\n\n[1]: https://jenndavid.com/\n[2]: https://jenndavid.com/our-work/\n[3]: https://jenndavid