            "url": "https://www.oand3.com/products/halal/",
            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] Halal\n\n# Halal\n\nFrom food to personal care, these natural oil ingredients adhere to Islamic principles, ensuring a\nseamless blend of tradition and quality.\n* All\n* Absolutes\n* Butters\n* Cold Pressed\n* Essential Oils\n* Exfoliants\n* Extracts\n* Infused Oils\n* Refined Oils\n* Soap Bases\n* Waters\n* Waxes\n\nStatus Organic Halal Carrier Oils Zero Waste Upcycled\nFunctionality Acne-Fighting Anti-Aging Anti-Inflammatory Antimicrobial Antioxidant Candle Making\nCleansing Cooling Easily-Absorbed Emollient Emulsifying Energising Exfoliating Healing & Soothing\nMoisturising & Hydrating Regenerative Scar Healing Sebum Control Skin Brightening Skin Tightening\nStress Relief Warming\nKey Compounds Linoleic Acid Oleic Acid Palmitic Acid Stearic Acid\nAroma Aromatic Balsamic Camphorous Characteristic Citrus Earthy Floral Fresh Fruity Herbal Marine\nMedicinal Minty Neutral Nutty Oriental Smoky Spicy Sweet Woody\nColour Amber Beige Beige-Brown Blue Brown Brown-Black Brown-Yellow Brown/Orange Clear Clear-Pale\nColourless Colourless-Yellow Cream Cream-White Dark Blue Dark Brown Dark Gold Dark Green Dark Orange\nDark Red Dark Yellow Deep Yellow Gold Gold-Yellow Golden Green Green-Yellow Greenish Greenish Yellow\nGrey Light Blue Light Brown LIGHT CREAM Light Green Light Pink Light Tan Light Yellow Off-White\nOpaque Orange Orange-Red Orange-Yellow Pale Pale Blue Pale Yellow Red Red-Brown White Whitish Yellow\nYellow Yellowish\nOrigin Africa Albania Argentina Asia Australia Austria Available upon request Belgium Bolivia Brazil\nBulgaria Burkina Faso Canada Chile China Colombia Comoros C\u00f4te d'Ivoire Croatia Czech Republic\nDenmark Dominica Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt El Salvador Europe France Georgia Germany Ghana\nGreece Guatemala Hungary India Indonesia Israel Italy Japan Kenya Latvia Lithuania Madagascar\nMalaysia Mexico Moldova Morocco Nepal Netherlands New Zealand Nigeria North America Oceania Paraguay\nPeru Philippines Poland Portugal Romania Somalia South Africa South America Spain Sri Lanka Sudan\nSweden Thailand Tunisia Turkey Uganda Ukraine United Kingdom USA Uzbekistan Venezuela Vietnam\nZimbabwe\nShowing 7 of 22 products\nSort A-Z Sort by Latest Sort by Oldest\n[ ][60]\n* Refined Oils\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n[Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined][61]\n\nIntroducing Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined. Crafted to precision, our oil adheres to the BP73\nspecification, ensuring unrivaled quality. From skincare to culinary creations, elevate your\nproducts with this versatile, cost-effective gem.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\n* Skin Tightening\nINCI code **Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil (according to BP73 specification...** Product Code **K0006**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n[ ][62]\n* Exfoliants\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Apricot Stones Irradiated, Exfoliant][63]\n\nDiscover Irradiated Apricot Stones Exfoliant, a natural exfoliant made from crushed apricot stones.\nIt effectively removes dead skin cells, revealing smoother, brighter skin. Suitable for all skin\ntypes, even sensitive.\n\nFunctionality\n* Exfoliating\nINCI code **Prunus Armeniaca Seed Powder** Product Code **K0032**\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][64]\n* Cold Pressed\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n[Argan Oil, Cold Pressed Deodorised (Commercial Grade)][65]\n\nIntroducing Argan Oil, Cold Pressed Deodorised \u2013 a cost-effective, versatile solution for various\napplications. Don\u2019t limit yourself; it\u2019s suitable for skin, hair, and more. Get the benefits without\nthe smell\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Antioxidant\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Tightening\nINCI code **Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil & Olus Oil** Product Code **K0034**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n[ ][66]\n* Cold Pressed\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Organic\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Argan Oil, Cold Pressed Deodorised Organic][67]\n\nUnleash the versatility of Argan Oil! Sourced from Moroccan cooperatives, this high-grade oil offers\na myriad of benefits. We\u2019ve crafted a lightly deodorized version to retain the benefits while\neliminating the aroma.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Antioxidant\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Tightening\nINCI code **Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil** Product Code **K0035**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Organic\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][68]\n* Refined Oils\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n[Avocado Oil, Refined][69]\n\nUnlock the secret to vibrant skin and hair with O&3\u2019s Refined Avocado Oil. A beauty staple with a\nrich history, this oil is perfect for moisturizing, nourishing, and protecting. Get yours now!\n\nFunctionality\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Tightening\nINCI code **Persea Gratissima Oil** Product Code **K0042**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n[ ][70]\n* Essential Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n[Bergamot (Furocoumarin Free), Essential Oil (COSMOS Natural)][71]\n\nUnearth the captivating allure of Bergamot FCF (Furocoumarin Free) Essential Oil (Natural). Its\ninvigorating aroma from the Bergamot orange tree rind offers versatile medicinal benefits for skin\nand hair, and a calming, uplifting presence in aromatherapy.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Antimicrobial\n* Cleansing\n* Cooling\n* Skin Brightening\nINCI code **Parfum & Citrus Aurantium Bergamia Fruit Oil** Product Code **K0060**\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n* Refined Oils\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Camellia Oil (Oleifera), Refined][72]\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Refined Camellia Oil (Oleifera). Derived from Camellia\noleifera, an emblem of longevity, this versatile oil nourishes skin and hair. Explore nature\u2019s\nriches now!\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Regenerative\n* Skin Tightening\nINCI code **Camellia Oleifera Seed Oil** Product Code **K0091**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Halal\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\nLoad more 1 [2][73] [3][74] [4][75] [Next \u00bb][76]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nX/Twitter\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][77]\n* [Instagram][78]\n[Contact Us][79]\n[Get in touch][80] [Get a quote][81]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][82]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][83]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][84]\n[Products][85]\n[Absolutes][86] [Cosmetic Butters][87] [Cold-Pressed Oils][88] [Essential Oils][89] [Exfoliants][90]\n[Extracts][91] [Infusions][92] [Refined Oils][93] [Soap Bases][94] [Waters][95] [Waxes][96]\n[Download Product Brochure][97]\n[Industries][98]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][99] [Aromatherapy & Massage][100] [Candles & Home Fragrance][101]\n[Household & Cleaning][102] [Food & Beverage][103] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][104]\n[Pharmaceuticals][105] [Animal & Pet Care][106]\n[What We Offer][107]\n[Contract Manufacturing][108] [Formulation][109] [FAQs][110]\n[Our Story][111]\n[Vision & Values][112] [Careers][113] [Sustainability][114] [Stories][115]\n* [Terms & Conditions][116]\n* [Privacy Policy][117]\n* [Cookies][118]\n\n*\u00a92024 O&3 Limited, All rights reserved. VAT: 285-401-700. Company Reg No: 11052797. Times House,\nThrowley Way, Sutton, England, SM1 4AF*\n\n[Back to top][119]\nClose\nC