er\n* Vegan\n[ ][65]\n* Cold Pressed\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Kosher\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Castor Oil, Cold Pressed Organic][66]\n\nUnveil the ancient wonders of Castor Oil, Cold Pressed Organic. A timeless elixir treasured for its\nremarkable medicinal and cosmetic virtues. Elevate your formulations with its diverse benefits for\nskin, hair, and more.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Cleansing\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\nINCI code **Ricinus Communis Seed Oil** Product Code **K0109**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Kosher\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][67]\n* Essential Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Kosher\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n[Cinnamon Leaf, Essential Oil Organic][68]\n\nExperience the Organic Cinnamon Leaf Essential Oil: A healing tradition, renowned anti-inflammatory,\nantibacterial, and antifungal properties. Celebrated in aromatherapy for invigoration. Elevate your\nproducts with its enchanting allure. Click to explore!\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Antimicrobial\n* Cleansing\n* Warming\nINCI code **Cinnamomum Zeylanicum Leaf Oil** Product Code **K0132**\n* Gluten Free\n* Kosher\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n[ ][69]\n* Butters\n* Gluten Free\n* Kosher\n* Vegan\n[Cocoa Butter, Deodorised][70]\n\nEmbark on a Journey with Deodorised Cocoa Butter: Elevate your creations with this exceptional,\nstable ingredient. Perfect for body butters, hand creams, and more, offering emollient benefits.\nAchieve lasting quality today!\n\nFunctionality\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Healing & Soothing\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\nINCI code **Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter** Product Code **K0144**\n* Gluten Free\n* Kosher\n* Vegan\n[ ][71]\n* Refined Oils\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Kosher\n* Vegan\n[Coconut Oil, Fractionated][72]\n\nDiscover Nature\u2019s Secret: Fractionated Coconut Oil (MCT). Impeccable absorbency, non-greasy finish,\nand radiant skin await. Packed with nutrients and eco-conscious, it transforms your 