arch]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] Organic\n\n# Organic\n\nMeticulously cultivated without synthetic additives, from food to skincare, elevate formulations\nwith the pure, natural essence of our organic products.\n* All\n* Absolutes\n* Butters\n* Cold Pressed\n* Essential Oils\n* Exfoliants\n* Extracts\n* Infused Oils\n* Refined Oils\n* Soap Bases\n* Waters\n* Waxes\n\nStatus Organic Halal Carrier Oils Zero Waste Upcycled\nFunctionality Acne-Fighting Anti-Aging Anti-Inflammatory Antimicrobial Antioxidant Candle Making\nCleansing Cooling Easily-Absorbed Emollient Emulsifying Energising Exfoliating Healing & Soothing\nMoisturising & Hydrating Regenerative Scar Healing Sebum Control Skin Brightening Skin Tightening\nStress Relief Warming\nKey Compounds Linoleic Acid Oleic Acid Palmitic Acid Stearic Acid\nAroma Aromatic Balsamic Camphorous Characteristic Citrus Earthy Floral Fresh Fruity Herbal Marine\nMedicinal Minty Neutral Nutty Oriental Smoky Spicy Sweet Woody\nColour Amber Beige Beige-Brown Blue Brown Brown-Black Brown-Yellow Brown/Orange Clear Clear-Pale\nColourless Colourless-Yellow Cream Cream-White Dark Blue Dark Brown Dark Gold Dark Green Dark Orange\nDark Red Dark Yellow Deep Yellow Gold Gold-Yellow Golden Green Green-Yellow Greenish Greenish Yellow\nGrey Light Blue Light Brown LIGHT CREAM Light Green Light Pink Light Tan Light Yellow Off-White\nOpaque Orange Orange-Red Orange-Yellow Pale Pale Blue Pale Yellow Red Red-Brown White Whitish Yellow\nYellow Yellowish\nOrigin Africa Albania Argentina Asia Australia Austria Available upon request Belgium Bolivia Brazil\nBulgaria Burkina Faso Canada Chile China Colombia Comoros C\u00f4te d'Ivoire Croatia Czech Republic\nDenmark Dominica Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt El Salvador Europe France Georgia Germany Ghana\nGreece Guatemala Hungary India Indonesia Israel Italy Japan Kenya Latvia Lithuania Madagascar\nMalaysia Mexico Moldova Morocco Nepal Netherlands New Zealand Nigeria North America Oceania Paraguay\nPeru Philippines Poland Portugal Romania Somalia South Africa South America Spain Sri Lanka Sudan\nSweden Thailand Tunisia Turkey Uganda Ukraine United Kingdom USA Uzbekistan Venezuela Vietnam\nZimbabwe\nShowing 7 of 248 products\nSort A-Z Sort by Latest Sort by Oldest\n[ ][60]\n* Cold Pressed\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Acai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic][61]\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Cold Pressed Acai Berry Oil, a hidden Amazonian treasure!\nFusing tradition with modern skincare magic, it\u2019s nature\u2019s legacy for your products.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Antioxidant\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\nINCI code **Euterpe Oleracea Fruit Oil** Product Code **K0003**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][62]\n* Cold Pressed\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Almond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed Organic][63]\n\nUnlock the natural potency of Almond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed \u2013 meticulously extracted to preserve\nraw nutrients. Ideal for sensitive skin, it soothes irritation, perfect for massage oils, and\nnourishing formulations. Elevate your skincare now!\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\n* Skin Tightening\nINCI code **Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil** Product Code **K0009**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][64]\n* Extracts\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n[Aloe Vera 200:1, Powder Organic][65]\n\nExperience the versatility of Aloe Vera Powder Organic, a natural wonder for skin, hair, and overall\nhealth. Renowned for soothing, healing, and reducing inflammation, it\u2019s rich in vitamins, minerals,\nand antioxidants.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Antioxidant\n* Cleansing\n* Healing & Soothing\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\nINCI code **Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Powder** Product Code **K0018**\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n* Extracts\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n[Amaranth Oil, Co2 Extract Organic][66]\n\nIndulge in the nourishing benefits of Amaranth Oil, Co2 Extract Organic\u2014a versatile elixir for both\nhair and skin care. Rich in essential fatty acids and antioxidants, it promotes skin and hair\nhealth. Contact us for more information or to request a quote/sample!\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Emollient\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\nINCI code **Amaranthus Caudatus Seed Extract & Rosmarinus Officinalis Le...** Product Code **K0869**\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n* Cold Pressed\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Amaranth Oil, Cold Pressed Organic][67]\n\nElevate your beauty regimen with Amaranth Oil, Cold Pressed Organic. A versatile, certified organic,\nand cruelty-free elixir rich in fatty acids, antioxidants, and essential fatty acids for nourished\nand protected hair and skin. Click for natural radiance!\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Antioxidant\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\nINCI code **Amaranthus Spinosus Seed Oil** Product Code **K0022**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][68]\n* Infused Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n[Amla, Infused in Castor Oil Organic][69]\n\nEmbark on a journey with Amla Oil, Infused in Castor Oil Organic\u2014an ancient elixir revered in\ntraditional Indian medicine. Rich in vitamin C and antioxidants, it revitalizes skin and hair. Order\na sample or request a quote today!\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Healing & Soothing\nINCI code **Emblica Officinalis Fruit & Ricinus Communis Seed Oil** Product Code **K1390**\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n[ ][70]\n* Infused Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\n[Amla, Infused in Sesame Oil Organic][71]\n\nDiscover the magic of Amla, Infused in Sesame Oil Organic\u2014an ancient elixir rooted in traditional\nIndian medicine. Packed with vitamin C and antioxidants, it revitalizes skin and hair. Order a\nsample or request a quote now!\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Inflammatory\n* Healing & Soothing\nINCI code **Emblica Officinalis Fruit & Sesamum Indicum Seed Oil** Product Code **K1204**\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Vegan\nLoad more 1 [2][72] [3][73] \u2026 [36][74] [Next \u00bb][75]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nInstagram\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][76]\n* [Instagram][77]\n[Contact Us][78]\n[Get in touch][79] [Get a quote][80]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][81]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][82]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][83]\n[Products][84]\n[Absolutes][85] [Cosmetic Butters][86] [Cold-Pressed Oils][87] [Essential Oils][88] [Exfoliants][89]\n[Extracts][90] [Infusions][91] [Refined Oils][92] [Soap Bases][93] [Waters][94] [Waxes][95]\n[Download Product Brochure][96]\n[Industries][97]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][98] [Aromatherapy & Massage][99] [Candles & Home Fragrance][100] [Household\n& Cleaning][101] [Food & Beverage][102] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][103]\n[Pharmaceuticals][104] [Animal & Pet Care][105]\n[What We Offer][106]\n[Contract Manufacturing][107] [Formulation][108] [FAQs][109]\n[Our Story][110]\n[Vision & Values][111] [Careers][112] [Sustainability][113] [Stories][114]\n* [Terms & Conditions][115]\n* [Privacy Policy][116]\n* [Cookies][117]\n\n*\u00a92024 O&3 Limited, All rights reserved. VAT: 285-401-700. Company Reg No: 11052797. Times House,\nThrowley Way, Sutton, England, SM1 4AF*\n\n[Back to top][118]\nClose\nClose\nClose\nClose\n\n[1]: https://www.oand3.com\n[2]: