            "url": "https://www.oand3.com/contact-us/",
            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] Get in Touch\n\n# Get in Touch\n\nLet\u2019s talk.\n\n#### UK\n\nThe birthplace of our journey, O&3 UK proudly draws upon over 40 years of British family heritage\nand expertise in the wholesale natural oils sector.\n\n#### USA\n\nCatering to customers across Northern, Central, and Southern America, our proficient US team\ndiligently sources the finest quality oils from our manufacturing sites in both the UK and Poland.\n\n#### EU\n\nDedicated to providing exceptional oils and service to our valued European clients, our\nstate-of-the-art facility in Warka, Poland, is committed to ensuring excellence with every shipment.\n\n### Are You a New Customer?\n\nApply to get your account open and product on its way.\n\n[Fill out our client application][59]\n\n### United Kingdom\n\n**O&3 Limited\n**Units 2, 3 & 5\nAthelstan Business Park\nHanwell Lane, Hutton Conyers\nRipon, North Yorkshire\nHG4 5BF, UK\n\n[+44 (0)1765 522 120][60]\n\n[[email protected]][61]\n\nplantings.rang.jeeps\n\n[Get Directions][62]\n\n### Europe\n\n**O&3 Polska sp. z.o.o**\nLaski 41\n05-660 Warka\nPolska\n\n[+44 (0)1765 522 120][63]\n\n[[email protected]][64]\n\nsprinkler.mannerly.juggle\n\n[Get Directions][65]\n\n### United States\n\n**O&3 Inc.**\nNew York\nU.S.A.\n\n[+44 (0)1765 522 120][66]\n\n[[email protected]][67]\n\n[Get Directions][68]\n\n## Make an enquiry\n\nPhone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nWhat is your enquiry about?(Required)\nGeneral enquirySalesLogisticsCareers\nYour name(Required)\nCompany name(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nPhone\nCountry(Required)\nCity / Town\nYour message(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n\n## Are You a New Customer?\n\nApply to get your account open and product on its way\n\n[Fill out our client application][69]\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nCompany\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][70]\n* [Instagram][71]\n[Contact Us][72]\n[Get in touch][73] [Get a quote][74]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][75]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][76]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][77]\n[Products][78]\n[Absolutes][79] [Cosmetic Butters][80] [Cold-Pressed Oils][81] [Essential Oils][82] [Exfoliants][83]\n[Extracts][84] [Infusions][85] [Refined Oils][86] [Soap Bases][87] [Waters][88] [Waxes][89]\n[Download Product Brochure][90]\n[Industries][91]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][92] [Aromatherapy & Massage][93] [Candles & Home Fragrance][94] [Household\n& Cleaning][95] [Food & Beverage][96] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][97] [Pharmaceuticals][98]\n[Animal & Pet Care][99]\n[What We Offer][100]\n[Contract Manufacturing][101] [Formulation][102] [FAQs][103]\n[Our Story][104]\n[Vision & Values][105] [Careers][106] [Sustainability][107] [Stories][108]\n* [Terms & Conditions][109]\n* [Privacy Policy][110]\n* [Cookies][111]\n\n*\u00a92024 O&3 Limited, All rights reserved. VAT: 285-401-700. Company Reg No: 11052797. Times House,\nThrowley Way, Sutton, England, SM1 4AF*\n\n[Back to top][112]\nClose\nClose\nClose\nClose\n\n[1]: https://www.oand3.com\n[2]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[3]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[4]: https://www.oand3.com/product-finder/\n[5]: https://www.oand3.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/O_3_Product_Brochure_compressed.pdf\n[6]: /products/\n[7]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/absolutes/\n[8]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/butters/\n[9]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/cold-pressed-oils/\n[10]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/essential-oils/\n[11]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/exfoliants/\n[12]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/extracts/\n[13]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/infusions/\n[14]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/refined-oils/\n[15]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/soap-bases/\n[16]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/waters/\n[17]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/waxes/\n[18]: https://www.oand3.com/products/organic/\n[19]: https://www.oand3.com/products/gluten-free/\n[20]: https://www.oand3.com/products/vegan-friendly/\n[21]: https://www.oand3.com/products/kosher/\n[22]: https://www.oand3.com/products/carrier-oils/\n[23]: https://www.oand3.com/products/halal/\n[24]: https://www.oand3.com/industries/\n[25]: https://www.oand3.com/industries/\n[26]: /industries/beauty-and-personal-care/\n[27]: /industries/aromatherapy-and-massage/\n[28]: /industries/candles-and-home-fragrance/\n[29]: https://www.oand3.com/industries/household-and-cleaning/\n[30]: https://www.oand3.com/industries/food-and-beverage/\n[31]: https://www.oand3.com/industries/nutritional-vitamins-supplements/\n[32]: https://www.oand3.com/industries/pharmaceuticals/\n[33]: https://www.oand3.com/industries/animal-and-pet-care/\n[34]: /what-we-offer/\n[35]: /what-we-offer/contract-manufacturing/\n[36]: /what-we-offer/contract-manufacturing/\n[37]: /what-we-offer/formulation/\n[38]: /what-we-offer/formulation/\n[39]: https://www.oand3.com/faqs/\n[40]: https://www.oand3.com/faqs/\n[41]: /sustainability/\n[42]: /sustainability/sourcing-and-origin/\n[43]: /sustainability/sourcing-and-origin/\n[44]: /sustainability/zero-waste/\n[45]: /sustainability/zero-waste/\n[46]: /sustainability/sustainable-beauty/\n[47]: /sustainability/sustainable-beauty/\n[48]: https://www.oand3.com/sustainability/accreditation/\n[49]: /our-story/\n[50]: /our-story/vision-and-values/\n[51]: https://www.oand3.com/our-story/vision-and-values/\n[52]: /careers/\n[53]: https://www.oand3.com/careers/\n[54]: https://www.oand3.com/product-finder/\n[55]: /stories/\n[56]: /contact-us/\n[57]: