            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] Products\n\n# Products\n\nNatural oil sourcing made simple.\n* [All][59]\n* Absolutes\n* Butters\n* Cold Pressed\n* Essential Oils\n* Exfoliants\n* Extracts\n* Infused Oils\n* Refined Oils\n* Soap Bases\n* Waters\n* Waxes\n\nStatus Organic Halal Carrier Oils Zero Waste Upcycled\nFunctionality Acne-Fighting Anti-Aging Anti-Inflammatory Antimicrobial Antioxidant Candle Making\nCleansing Cooling Easily-Absorbed Emollient Emulsifying Energising Exfoliating Healing & Soothing\nMoisturising & Hydrating Regenerative Scar Healing Sebum Control Skin Brightening Skin Tightening\nStress Relief Warming\nKey Compounds Linoleic Acid Oleic Acid Palmitic Acid Stearic Acid\nAroma Aromatic Balsamic Camphorous Characteristic Citrus Earthy Floral Fresh Fruity Herbal Marine\nMedicinal Minty Neutral Nutty Oriental Smoky Spicy Sweet Woody\nColour Amber Beige Beige-Brown Blue Brown Brown-Black Brown-Yellow Brown/Orange Clear Clear-Pale\nColourless Colourless-Yellow Cream Cream-White Dark Blue Dark Brown Dark Gold Dark Green Dark Orange\nDark Red Dark Yellow Deep Yellow Gold Gold-Yellow Golden Green Green-Yellow Greenish Greenish Yellow\nGrey Light Blue Light Brown LIGHT CREAM Light Green Light Pink Light Tan Light Yellow Off-White\nOpaque Orange Orange-Red Orange-Yellow Pale Pale Blue Pale Yellow Red Red-Brown White Whitish Yellow\nYellow Yellowish\nOrigin Africa Albania Argentina Asia Australia Austria Available upon request Belgium Bolivia Brazil\nBulgaria Burkina Faso Canada Chile China Colombia Comoros C\u00f4te d'Ivoire Croatia Czech Republic\nDenmark Dominica Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt El Salvador Europe France Georgia Germany Ghana\nGreece Guatemala Hungary India Indonesia Israel Italy Japan Kenya Latvia Lithuania Madagascar\nMalaysia Mexico Moldova Morocco Nepal Netherlands New Zealand Nigeria North America Oceania Paraguay\nPeru Philippines Poland Portugal Romania Somalia South Africa South America Spain Sri Lanka Sudan\nSweden Thailand Tunisia Turkey Uganda Ukraine United Kingdom USA Uzbekistan Venezuela Vietnam\nZimbabwe\nShowing 7 of 885 products\nSort A-Z Sort by Latest Sort by Oldest\n[ ][60]\n* Soap Bases\n* Vegan\n[3 in 1 Body Wash Liquid Base][61]\n\nEasy to use and gentle on the skin, the 3-in-1 Body Wash Base is ready for customisation. Add\nfragrance, colour, and more to create bubble bath, hand wash or shower gel products.\n\nFunctionality\n* Emollient\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Regenerative\nINCI code **-** Product Code **K0721**\n* Vegan\n[ ][62]\n* Soap Bases\n* Vegan\n[3 in 1 Body Wash Liquid Base][63]\n\nEasy to use and gentle on the skin, the 3-in-1 Body Wash Base is ready for customisation. Add\nfragrance, colour, and more to create bubble bath, hand wash or shower gel products.\n\nINCI code **-** Product Code **K0697**\n* Vegan\n[ ][64]\n* Refined Oils\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Vegan\n[Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe), Refined][65]\n\nDiscover the hidden gem of South Africa \u2013 Abyssinian Seed Oil! Rich in natural wonders, this elixir\nrevitalises skin and hair. Embrace nature\u2019s essence in your creations today \u2013 Request a quote or\nsample now.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Cleansing\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\nINCI code **Crambe Abyssinica Seed Oil** Product Code **K0001**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Vegan\n[ ][66]\n* Cold Pressed\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Acai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed][67]\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Cold Pressed Acai Berry Oil! Sourced from the Brazilian\nAmazon, this elixir blends tradition with modern functionality\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Antioxidant\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\nINCI code **Euterpe Oleracea Fruit Oil** Product Code **K0002**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][68]\n* Cold Pressed\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Acai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic][69]\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Cold Pressed Acai Berry Oil, a hidden Amazonian treasure!\nFusing tradition with modern skincare magic, it\u2019s nature\u2019s legacy for your products.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Antioxidant\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\nINCI code **Euterpe Oleracea Fruit Oil** Product Code **K0003**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Organic\n* Upcycled\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][70]\n* Butters\n* Gluten Free\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural)][71]\n\nIndulge in luxury with Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural), a velvety emollient imbued with the\nmagic of Amazonian berries! Crafted from treasured super-berries, it adds tradition and modern\nskincare to your formulations.\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\nINCI code **Euterpe Oleracea Pulp Powder & Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) B...** Product Code **K0004**\n* Gluten Free\n* Vegan\n* Zero-Waste\n[ ][72]\n* Refined Oils\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Vegan\n[Ahiflower Seed Oil, Refined][73]\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Ahiflower Seed Oil, Refined\u2014a lightweight, nourishing marvel\nfor all skin types. Reduce fine lines, hydrate, and enhance your formulations with eco-friendly\ngoodness. Order a sample now!\n\nFunctionality\n* Anti-Aging\n* Cleansing\n* Easily-Absorbed\n* Moisturising & Hydrating\n* Skin Brightening\nINCI code **Buglossoides Arvensis Seed Oil** Product Code **K1426**\n* Carrier Oils\n* Gluten Free\n* Vegan\nLoad more 1 [2][74] [3][75] \u2026 [127][76] [Next \u00bb][77]\n\n## All Products\n\nFrom essential, refined, and cold pressed oils, butters, waxes, exfoliants, and more \u2013 explore the\nfull product range now!\n\n[Download the Product List][78]\n\n## Can\u2019t find what you\u2019re looking for?\n\n[Help me choose][79]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nFacebook\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][80]\n* [Instagram][81]\n[Contact Us][82]\n[Get in touch][83] [Get a quote][84]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][85]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][86]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][87]\n[Products][88]\n[Absolutes][89] [Cosmetic Butters][90] [Cold-Pressed Oils][91] [Essential Oils][92] [Exfoliants][93]\n[Extracts][94] [Infusions][95] [Refined Oils][96] [Soap Bases][97] [Waters][98] [Waxes][99]\n[Download Product Brochure][100]\n[Industries][101]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][102] [Aromatherapy & Massage][103] [Candles & Home Fragrance][104]\n[Household & Cleaning][105] [Food & Beverage][106] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][107]\n[Pharmaceuticals][108] [Animal & Pet Care][109]\n[What We Offer][110]\n[Contract Manufacturing][111] [Formulation][112] [FAQs][113]\n[Our Story][114]\n[Vision & Values][115] [Careers][116] [Sustainability][117] [Stories][118]\n* [Terms & Conditions][119]\n* [Privacy Policy][120]\n* [Cookies][121]\n\n*\u00a92024 O&3 Limited, All rights reserved. VAT: 285-401-700. Company Reg No: 11052797. Times House,\nThrowley Way, Sutton, England, SM1 4AF*\n\n[Back to top][122]\nClose\nClose\nClose\nClose\n\n[1]: https://www.oand3.com\n[2]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[3]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[4]: https://www.oand3.com/product-finder/\n[5]: https://www.oand3.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/O_3_Product_Brochure_compressed.pdf\n[6]: /products/\n[7]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/absolutes/\n[8]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/butters/\n[9]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/cold-pressed-oils/\n[10]: https://w