            "url": "https://www.oand3.com/product/abyssinian-seed-oil-crambe-refined/",
            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Refined Oils][60] Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe), Refined\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Refined Oils\n\n# Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe), Refined\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nUnearth the captivating allure of Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe) and unveil nature's marvels for the\nskin and hair!\n\nDerived from the enchanting landscapes of South Africa, Abyssinian Seed Oil is a well-kept treasure.\nIt's remarkable properties have been held in reverence by indigenous communities.\n\nAbyssinian Seed Oil stands as a dynamic repository of vitality, infused with vitamins and\nantioxidants that combat the ravages of time and environmental forces. Its anti-inflammatory\nattributes tenderly pacify even the most sensitive skin and foster the growth of lustrous hair.\n\nEmbark upon a journey with Abyssinian Seed Oil today! Infuse your creations with this exceptional\ningredient. Whether you seek transformation through skincare or haircare, request a quotation or\norder a sample, and embrace the essence of nature within your formulations!\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Body Lotion\n* Body Oil\n* Hair Butter\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Cream\n* Hair Oil\n* Hair Pomade\n* Hair Serum\n* Product code\n\nK0001\n* INCI Listing Crambe Abyssinica Seed Oil\n* Manufacturing Method Refined\n* CAS Number 2245025-38-9\n* Origin\n[Africa flag] Africa\n[South Africa flag] South Africa\n* EINCS Not Listed.\n* Aroma Characteristic, Earthy, Herbal, Nutty\n* Colour\n\nLight Yellow\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Anti-Aging\n\nPacked with antioxidants, it helps fight free radicals and reduce the signs of ageing. It promotes\nthe production of collagen, improving skin elasticity and firmness, and diminishing the appearance\nof fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n### Cleansing\n\nActs as a natural cleanser, effectively removing dirt, impurities, and excess oil from the skin and\nhair. It helps keep pores clean and clear, reducing the risk of acne and promoting a fresh,\nrevitalised appearance.\n\n### Easily-Absorbed\n\nQuickly absorbs into the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Lightweight and ensures fast\npenetration, delivering essential nutrients and hydration for a smooth and nourished complexion.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n### Skin Brightening\n\nContains natural skin-brightening properties. It helps even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of\ndark spots and hyperpigmentation, and promote a more radiant complexion.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nAbyssinian Seed Oil is a true beauty elixir, known for its lightweight texture and remarkable\nmoisturising properties. Packed with essential fatty acids, this oil helps replenish and retain\nmoisture in the skin, promoting a soft and supple complexion. It nourishes and soothes the skin,\nreducing dryness and irritation, and leaving it with a radiant glow. Abyssinian Seed Oil also\npossesses anti-aging properties, helping to smooth the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and\nimproving overall skin texture. Incorporate this refined oil into your skincare routine for a truly\nindulgent experience.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nRevitalise your hair with the enriching power of Abyssinian Seed Oil. This lightweight oil\npenetrates deeply into the hair shaft, providing intense hydration and restoring shine to dull and\ndamaged hair. It nourishes and conditions the hair, helping to prevent breakage and split ends,\nwhile promoting smoothness and manageability. Abyssinian Seed Oil also protects the hair from\nenvironmental stressors, such as heat and pollution, leaving it healthy and vibrant. Add this\nrefined oil to your hair care formulations and enjoy lustrous locks that turn heads.\n\n## Extraction process\n\nRefining is an extraction method that purifies oils by removing impurities and undesirable elements.\nIt includes techniques such as degumming, neutralisation, bleaching, and deodorisation to enhance\nthe quality, stability, and versatility of the oil for various applications.\n\n[Find out more][68]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe) and what plant is it derived from?\n\nAbyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe), Refined is a vegetable oil extracted from the seeds, kernels, or fruit\nof its source plant. Refining removes impurities, colour, and odour to produce a consistent,\nshelf-stable oil suitable for a wide range of cosmetic formulations. O&3 sources this oil from\nvetted suppliers to ensure quality and traceability.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe)?\n\nAbyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe), Refined is a valued emollient that helps restore and maintain the\nskin's natural moisture barrier. It absorbs readily without leaving a heavy, greasy residue, making\nit suitable for moisturisers, serums, and body oils. Its fatty acid profile supports skin\nsuppleness, and it contains antioxidants that help protect against environmental stressors and signs\nof premature ageing.\n\n### How can Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe) benefit hair and scalp care formulations?\n\nIn hair care, Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe), Refined provides deep conditioning and nourishment,\nhelping to smooth the cuticle, reduce frizz, and restore shine to dry or damaged hair. It can be\nused in pre-shampoo treatments, hair oils, and serums. Applied to the scalp, it helps balance\nmoisture levels and supports a healthy follicle environment.\n\n### What are the key fatty acids found in Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe)?\n\nAbyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe), Refined contains a blend of beneficial fatty acids typical of its\nbotanical source family, which may include oleic acid (for softening and nourishment), linoleic acid\n(for barrier repair and anti-inflammatory properties), and palmitic acid (for a protective,\nemollient effect). The exact fatty acid profile is available on the product specification sheet.\n\n### What certifications does Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe) carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Full certification documentation, including specification\nsheets, allergen declarations, and MSDS, is available to download below.\n\n### What cosmetic products can I formulate with Abyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe)?\n\nAbyssinian Seed Oil (Crambe), Refined is a versatile base ingredient suitable for formulating body\noils, facial serums, moisturisers, body butters, hair oils, hair serums, scalp treatments, and\nmassage oils. Its texture and absorption profile make it compatible with both leave-on and rinse-off\nformulations.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][69][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][70][MSDS][71][Specifications][72][Product\nStatements][73][Product Marketing Sheet][74]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][75]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][76]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][77]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][78]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][83]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][84]\n5 mins\nThe Alchemist & The Algorithm: Why AI is the New Best Friend of Natural Ingredients\nRead more\n][85]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][86]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nInstagram\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][87]\n* [Instagram][88]\n[Contact Us][89]\n[Get in touch][90] [Get a quote][91]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][92]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][93]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][94]\n[Products][95]\n[Absolutes][96] [Cosmetic Butters][97] [Cold-Pressed Oils][98] [Essential Oils][99]\n[Exfoliants][100] [Extracts][101] [Infusions][102] [Refined Oils][103] [Soap Bases][104]\n[Waters][105] [Waxes][106] [Download Product Brochure][107]\n[Industries][108]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][109] [Aromatherapy & Massage][110] [Candles & Home Fragrance][111]\n[Household & Cleaning][112] [Food & Beverage][11"
