            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Cold Pressed][60] Acai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Cold Pressed\n\n# Acai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n* Zero Waste\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Acai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed, and delve into the riches of\nnature for the skin and hair!\n\nWild harvested by cooperatives in the heart of the Brazilian Amazon, this cold pressed oil exudes\nfunctionality. Harvested from the super-berry that has been treasured by Amazonian tribes for\ngenerations, this elixir holds not only its remarkable healing properties but also a tale of legacy\nand tradition.\n\nThis oil is a supremely functional ingredient for incorporating into natural cosmetic lines. Its\nbackground story is as captivating as the oil's efficacy itself, resonating with decades of use by\nindigenous communities for both consumption and healing purposes.\n\nElevate products with this exceptional ingredient, infusing them with the essence of tradition and\nmodern functionality. Request a quote or secure a sample, and become part of the narrative that\nspans generations!\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Body Lotion\n* Body Oil\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Oil\n* Hair Serum\n* Moisturiser\n* Scalp Treatment\n* Product code\n\nK0002\n* INCI Listing Euterpe Oleracea Fruit Oil\n* Manufacturing Method Cold Pressed\n* CAS Number 879496-95-4 ; 861902-11-6; 906351-38-0\n* Origin\n[Brazil flag] Brazil\n[South America flag] South America\n* EINCS Not Listed.\n* Aroma Characteristic, Fruity, Sweet\n* Colour\n\nDark Green, Green\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Anti-Aging\n\nPacked with antioxidants, it helps fight free radicals and reduce the signs of ageing. It promotes\nthe production of collagen, improving skin elasticity and firmness, and diminishing the appearance\nof fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n### Antioxidant\n\nRich in antioxidants, it shields the skin from environmental stressors, neutralising free radicals\nand promoting a youthful appearance. As well as enhancing skin resilience, reducing oxidative\ndamage, and fostering a radiant, revitalised complexion.\n\n### Easily-Absorbed\n\nQuickly absorbs into the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Lightweight and ensures fast\npenetration, delivering essential nutrients and hydration for a smooth and nourished complexion.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n### Skin Brightening\n\nContains natural skin-brightening properties. It helps even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of\ndark spots and hyperpigmentation, and promote a more radiant complexion.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nImmerse your skin in the nourishing embrace of Acai Berry Oil. Abundant in antioxidants, this oil\nhelps protect your skin from environmental aggressors and free radicals, reducing the signs of aging\nand promoting a youthful complexion. It deeply hydrates and nourishes the skin, restoring its\nnatural vitality and radiance. Acai Berry Oil also aids in skin regeneration, enhancing the overall\ntexture and tone. Incorporate this cold-pressed oil into your skincare routine for a revitalising\nexperience that unveils your skin's true potential.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nElevate your hair care routine with the enriching benefits of Acai Berry Oil. This cold-pressed oil\nprovides deep hydration and nourishment to your hair, revitalising dry and damaged strands. It\nstrengthens the hair follicles, reducing breakage and promoting healthy hair growth. Acai Berry Oil\nalso imparts a natural shine, leaving your locks lustrous and full of life. Protect your hair from\nenvironmental stressors with this antioxidant-rich oil, and experience the transformative power of\nnature's bounty.\n\n## Extraction process\n\nCold-pressed extraction is a method used to extract natural oils from various plant-based sources.\nIt involves applying mechanical pressure to the source material without the use of heat or\nchemicals, resulting in a pure and unrefined oil.\n\n[Find out more][68]\n\n## Related products\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural)\n\nIndulge in luxury with Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural), a velvety emollient imbued with the\nmagic of Amazonian berries! Crafted from treasured super-berries, it adds tradition and modern\nskincare to your formulations.\n\nView product\n][69]\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Cold Pressed Acai Berry Oil, a hidden Amazonian treasure!\nFusing tradition with modern skincare magic, it\u2019s nature\u2019s legacy for your products.\n\nView product\n][70]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Acai Berry Oil and what plant is it derived from?\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed is a vegetable oil extracted from the seeds, kernels, or fruit of its\nsource plant. Cold pressing preserves the oil's natural fatty acids, antioxidants, and\nphytonutrients without the use of heat or solvents, resulting in a richer, more nutrient-dense oil.\nO&3 sources this oil from vetted suppliers to ensure quality and traceability.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Acai Berry Oil?\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed is a valued emollient that helps restore and maintain the skin's\nnatural moisture barrier. It absorbs readily without leaving a heavy, greasy residue, making it\nsuitable for moisturisers, serums, and body oils. Its fatty acid profile supports skin suppleness,\nand it contains antioxidants that help protect against environmental stressors and signs of\npremature ageing.\n\n### How can Acai Berry Oil benefit hair and scalp care formulations?\n\nIn hair care, Acai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed provides deep conditioning and nourishment, helping to\nsmooth the cuticle, reduce frizz, and restore shine to dry or damaged hair. It can be used in\npre-shampoo treatments, hair oils, and serums. Applied to the scalp, it helps balance moisture\nlevels and supports a healthy follicle environment.\n\n### What are the key fatty acids found in Acai Berry Oil?\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed contains a blend of beneficial fatty acids typical of its botanical\nsource family, which may include oleic acid (for softening and nourishment), linoleic acid (for\nbarrier repair and anti-inflammatory properties), and palmitic acid (for a protective, emollient\neffect). The exact fatty acid profile is available on the product specification sheet.\n\n### What certifications does Acai Berry Oil carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Full certification documentation, including specification\nsheets, allergen declarations, and MSDS, is available to download below.\n\n### What cosmetic products can I formulate with Acai Berry Oil?\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed is a versatile base ingredient suitable for formulating body oils,\nfacial serums, moisturisers, body butters, hair oils, hair serums, scalp treatments, and massage\noils. Its texture and absorption profile make it compatible with both leave-on and rinse-off\nformulations.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][71][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][72][MSDS][73][Specifications][74][Product\nStatements][75][Product Marketing Sheet][76]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][77]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][78]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][83]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][84]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][85]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][86]\n5 mins\nThe Alchemist & The Algorithm: Why AI is the New Best Friend of Natural Ingredients\nRead more\n][87]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][88]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ah