d firmness, and diminishing the appearance\nof fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n### Antioxidant\n\nRich in antioxidants, it shields the skin from environmental stressors, neutralising free radicals\nand promoting a youthful appearance. As well as enhancing skin resilience, reducing oxidative\ndamage, and fostering a radiant, revitalised complexion.\n\n### Easily-Absorbed\n\nQuickly absorbs into the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Lightweight and ensures fast\npenetration, delivering essential nutrients and hydration for a smooth and nourished complexion.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n### Skin Brightening\n\nContains natural skin-brightening properties. It helps even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of\ndark spots and hyperpigmentation, and promote a more radiant complexion.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nAcai Berry Oil is a powerhouse of antioxidants and essential fatty acids, which help nourish and\nprotect the skin. It provides deep moisturization, reduces the appearance of fine lines and\nwrinkles, and promotes a youthful complexion. The oil's antioxidant properties help combat free\nradicals and environmental damage, while its moisturising effects enhance skin elasticity and\nsuppleness. Incorporate this cold-pressed organic oil into your skincare routine for a natural and\nrevitalising boost.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nAcai Berry Oil nourishes and strengthens the hair, promoting shine, softness, and manageability. Its\nmoisturising properties help combat dryness and frizz, while its antioxidant content protects\nagainst damage from environmental stressors. Regular use of Acai Berry Oil can help improve hair\nhealth, enhance texture, and restore vitality.\n\n## Extraction process\n\nCold-pressed extraction is a method used to extract natural oils from various plant-based sources.\nIt involves applying mechanical pressure to the source material without the use of heat or\nchemicals, resulting in a pure and unrefined oil.\n\n[Find out more][68]\n\n## Related products\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural)\n\nIndulge in luxury with Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural), a velvety emollient imbued with the\nmagic of Amazonian berries! Crafted from treasured super-berries, it adds tradition and modern\nskincare to your formulations.\n\nView product\n][69]\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Cold Pressed Acai Berry Oil! Sourced from the Brazilian\nAmazon, this elixir blends tradition with modern functionality\n\nView product\n][70]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Acai Berry Oil and what plant is it derived from?\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic is a vegetable oil extracted from the seeds, kernels, or fruit\nof its source plant. Cold pressing preserves the oil's natural fatty acids, antioxidants, and\nphytonutrients without the use of heat or solvents, resulting in a richer, more nutrient-dense oil.\nO&3 sources this oil from vetted suppliers to ensure quality and traceability.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Acai Berry Oil?\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic is a valued emollient that helps restore and maintain the\nskin's natural moisture barrier. It absorbs readily without leaving a heavy, greasy residue, making\nit suitable for moisturisers, serums, and body oils. Its fatty acid profile supports skin\nsuppleness, and it contains antioxidants that help protect against environmental stressors and signs\nof premature ageing.\n\n### How can Acai Berry Oil benefit hair and scalp care formulations?\n\nIn hair care, Acai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic provides deep conditioning and nourishment,\nhelping to smooth the cuticle, reduce frizz, and restore shine to dry or damaged hair. It can be\nused in pre-shampoo treatments, hair oils, and serums. Applied to the scalp, it helps balance\nmoisture levels and supports a healthy follicle environment.\n\n### What are the key fatty acids found in Acai Berry Oil?\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic contains a blend of beneficial fatty acids typical of its\nbotanical source family, which may include oleic acid (for softening and nourishment), linoleic acid\n(for barrier repair and anti-inflammatory properties), and palmitic acid (for a protective,\nemollient effect). The exact fatty acid profile is available on the product specification sheet.\n\n### What certifications does Acai Berry Oil carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free, and carries organic certification. Full certification\ndocumentation, including specification sheets, allergen declarations, and MSDS, is available to\ndownload below.\n\n### What cosmetic products can I formulate with Acai Berry Oil?\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic is a versatile base ingredient suitable for formulating body\noils, facial serums, moisturisers, body butters, hair oils, hair serums, scalp treatments, and\nmassage oils. Its texture and absorption profile make it compatible with both leave-on and rinse-off\nformulations.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][71][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][72][MSDS][73][Specifications][74][Product\nStatements][75][Product Marketing Sheet][76]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your 