arch]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Butters][60] Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural)\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Butters\n\n# Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural)\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n* Zero Waste\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nExperience the luxurious Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural), a velvety emollient enriched with the\ngoodness of Acai Berries!\n\nWild harvested by cooperatives in the heart of the Brazilian Amazon, the super-berry that has been\ntreasured by Amazonian tribes for generations and holds not only its remarkable healing properties\nbut also a tale of legacy and tradition.\n\nThis butter is a supremely functional ingredient for incorporating into natural cosmetic lines. It\ndeeply moisturises the skin, leaving it soft and supple and melts on contact, making it ideal for\nmassages and body care products.\n\nElevate formulations with this exceptional ingredient, capturing the essence of tradition and modern\nfunctionality. Request a quote or secure a sample today, and become part of the narrative that spans\ngenerations!\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Hair Butter\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Cream\n* Hair Pomade\n* Product code\n\nK0004\n* INCI Listing Euterpe Oleracea Pulp Powder & Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter & Elaeis Guineensis\n(Palm) Butter & Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil\n* Manufacturing Method Blended\n* CAS Number 879496-95-4; 906351-38-0/ 194043-92-0; 91080-23-8 / 8002-75-3 / 90045-98-0\n* Origin\nAvailable upon request\n* EINCS Not Listed / 293-515-7 / 232-316-1 / 289-964-3\n* Aroma Characteristic, Fruity, Sweet\n* Colour\n\nOff-White\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Anti-Aging\n\nPacked with antioxidants, it helps fight free radicals and reduce the signs of ageing. It promotes\nthe production of collagen, improving skin elasticity and firmness, and diminishing the appearance\nof fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n### Easily-Absorbed\n\nQuickly absorbs into the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Lightweight and ensures fast\npenetration, delivering essential nutrients and hydration for a smooth and nourished complexion.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n### Skin Brightening\n\nContains natural skin-brightening properties. It helps even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of\ndark spots and hyperpigmentation, and promote a more radiant complexion.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) provides intensive hydration and nourishment to the skin. It\nmelts upon contact, making it easy to spread and deeply penetrate the skin's layers. The butter's\nantioxidant properties help protect against free radicals and environmental damage, while its\nemollient nature leaves the skin feeling silky smooth. Incorporate this butter into your body care\nroutine to indulge in its luxurious texture and enjoy the skin-replenishing benefits of Acai\nBerries.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) is a rich and emollient treatment for dry and damaged hair. It\ndeeply moisturises and conditions the hair, promoting softness, shine, and manageability. The\nbutter's antioxidant content helps protect against environmental stressors, while its nourishing\nproperties repair and strengthen the hair follicles. Incorporate this organic butter into your hair\ncare routine to Revitalise and restore your locks.\n\n## Related products\n\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed Organic\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Cold Pressed Acai Berry Oil, a hidden Amazonian treasure!\nFusing tradition with modern skincare magic, it\u2019s nature\u2019s legacy for your products.\n\nView product\n][68]\nAcai Berry Oil, Cold Pressed\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Cold Pressed Acai Berry Oil! Sourced from the Brazilian\nAmazon, this elixir blends tradition with modern functionality\n\nView product\n][69]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) and where does it come from?\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) is a solid or semi-solid plant-derived fat extracted from the\nseeds, nuts, or fruit of its source plant. It melts on contact with skin, delivering a rich,\nnourishing experience. O&3 sources this butter from specialist suppliers committed to responsible\nharvesting practices.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural)?\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) is deeply moisturising and emollient, ideal for dry, rough, or\nsensitive skin. It forms a protective layer on the skin's surface to lock in moisture, while its\nfatty acid and antioxidant content supports skin regeneration, improves elasticity, and helps to\nsoothe irritation.\n\n### How do I melt and incorporate Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) into formulations?\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) can be melted using a bain-marie (double boiler) at a low,\ncontrolled temperature - typically between 40\u00b0C and 70\u00b0C depending on the specific butter's melting\npoint. Once melted, it can be blended with liquid oils, waxes, and actives to create balms, body\nbutters, lotions, and hair treatments. Avoid overheating to preserve its beneficial properties.\n\n### Is Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) suitable for sensitive or allergy-prone skin?\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) is generally well tolerated, though individual sensitivities\nvary. As with all new ingredients, a patch test is recommended before wider application. Full\nallergen declaration documentation is available from O&3 to support your safety assessment and\ncompliance requirements.\n\n### What certifications does Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Supporting documentation including allergen declarations,\nMSDS, and product specifications can be downloaded below.\n\n### What products can I make with Acai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural)?\n\nAcai Berry, Butter (COSMOS Natural) is an excellent addition to body butters, balms, lip products,\nsolid lotion bars, hair butters, hair masks, and intensive moisturisers. Its rich texture makes it\nespecially suited to products targeting dry skin, eczema-prone skin, or damaged hair.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[MSDS][70][Product Statements][71][Product Marketing Sheet][72]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][73]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][74]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][75]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][76]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][77]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][78]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][81]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][82]\n5 mins\nThe Alchemist & The Algorithm: Why AI is the New Best Friend of Natural Ingredients\nRead more\n][83]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][84]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][85]\n* [Instagram][86]\n[Contact Us][87]\n[Get in touch][88] [Get a quote][89]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][90]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][91]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][92]\n[Products][93]\n[Absolutes][94] [Cosmetic Butters][95] [Cold-Pressed Oils][96] [Essential Oils][97] [Exfoliants][98]\n[Extracts][99] [Infusions][100] [Refined Oils][101] [Soap Bases][102] [Waters][103] [Waxes][104]\n[Download Product Brochure][105]\n[Industries][106]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][107] [Aromatherapy & Massage][108] [Candles & Home Fragrance][109]\n[Household & Cleaning][110] [Food & Beverage][111] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][112]\n[Pharmaceuticals][113] [Animal & Pet Care][11