            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Refined Oils][60] Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Refined Oils\n\n# Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nIntroducing Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined.\n\nThis oil adheres to the BP73 specification. Please ensure you select the right grade, appropriate to\nyou as we have offer many grades of Almond.\n\nThis incredibly cost effective ingredient is often used as a base for cosmetic formulations due to\nits versatility and long lasting shelf life. From soap and shampoo to massage oil and face cream,\nthis material is according to the BP73 monograph specification (which does not include nor is it\ntested for sterol analysis). If you need full sterol analysis, please see Almond (Sweet) EP9 Oil,\nRefined (K0007).\n\nContact us today for a quote or order a sample and elevate your products with Almond (Sweet) BP73\nOil, Refined.\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Body Lotion\n* Body Oil\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Oil\n* Hair Serum\n* Moisturiser\n* Scalp Treatment\n* Product code\n\nK0006\n* INCI Listing Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil (according to BP73 specification)\n* Manufacturing Method Refined\n* CAS Number N/A\n* Origin\nEurope\n[Spain flag] Spain\n* EINCS N/A\n* Aroma Neutral\n* Colour\n\nLight Yellow\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Anti-Aging\n\nPacked with antioxidants, it helps fight free radicals and reduce the signs of ageing. It promotes\nthe production of collagen, improving skin elasticity and firmness, and diminishing the appearance\nof fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n### Easily-Absorbed\n\nQuickly absorbs into the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Lightweight and ensures fast\npenetration, delivering essential nutrients and hydration for a smooth and nourished complexion.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n### Skin Brightening\n\nContains natural skin-brightening properties. It helps even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of\ndark spots and hyperpigmentation, and promote a more radiant complexion.\n\n### Skin Tightening\n\nPromotes skin elasticity and firmness, reducing the appearance of wrinkles. It helps maintain a\nyouthful and lifted look by supporting collagen production, giving the skin a tighter and more toned\nfeel.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nRefined Sweet Almond Oil provides deep moisturization to the skin, leaving it soft and supple. Its\nnourishing properties help soothe dryness and irritation, while its conditioning effects improve the\nskin's texture. This oil is well-suited for a wide range of skincare products, delivering\nexceptional results and a luxurious feel. Incorporate it into your routine for its versatility and\nskin-loving benefits.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nSweet Almond Oil is a versatile oil that benefits the hair in multiple ways. It provides deep\nhydration, nourishment, and conditioning, promoting smoothness, shine, and manageability. The oil's\nlightweight nature ensures it doesn't weigh the hair down, making it suitable for various hair\ntypes. Whether used as a standalone oil or as an ingredient in hair care formulations, Sweet Almond\nOil helps achieve healthy and beautiful hair.\n\n## Extraction process\n\nRefining is an extraction method that purifies oils by removing impurities and undesirable elements.\nIt includes techniques such as degumming, neutralisation, bleaching, and deodorisation to enhance\nthe quality, stability, and versatility of the oil for various applications.\n\n[Find out more][68]\n\n## Related products\n\nNatural Benzaldehyde Oil (EU Nat Compliant)\n\nIndulge in the classic almond aroma with Almond Bitter (Natural Benzaldehyde), Essential Oil (EU Nat\nCompliant). Time-tested for relaxation and skincare, it\u2019s a 100% natural and ethical choice. Click\nto unwind and nourish your senses.\n\nView product\n][69]\nAlmond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated)\n\nUnearth the natural beauty of Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated). Crafted from cracked\nalmond shells, this sustainable exfoliant rejuvenates your skin while being eco-friendly and gentle.\n\nView product\n][70]\nAlmond (Sweet), Wax\n\nEmbrace the natural allure of Almond (Sweet) Wax \u2013 a chemical-free, sustainable treasure. From lip\ncare to candles, it\u2019s the embodiment of versatility and stability. Elevate your creations with this\npure wonder.\n\nView product\n][71]\nAlmond (Sweet), Butter\n\nIntroducing Almond (Sweet) Butter \u2013 the secret to fresher, more effective beauty products. Packed\nwith vitamins and essential fatty acids, it\u2019s cost-effective and easy to use. Elevate your\nformulations today\n\nView product\n][72]\nAlmond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed Organic\n\nUnlock the natural potency of Almond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed \u2013 meticulously extracted to preserve\nraw nutrients. Ideal for sensitive skin, it soothes irritation, perfect for massage oils, and\nnourishing formulations. Elevate your skincare now!\n\nView product\n][73]\nAlmond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed\n\nUnveil the natural magic of Almond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed. With meticulous Cold Press extraction,\nit retains raw nutrients. Ideal for sensitive skin, soothing discomfort, and nourishing deeply\n\nView product\n][74]\nAlmond (Sweet), Cosmetic & Food Grade Oil Refined\n\nElevate your products with Almond (Sweet) Cosmetic & Food Grade Oil, Refined. Meticulously sourced\nand refined to the highest standards, this versatile ingredient is a nourishing gem for skincare and\nculinary creations\n\nView product\n][75]\nAlmond (Sweet) EP9 Oil, Refined\n\nElevate your products with Almond (Sweet) EP9 Oil, Refined. Crafted to perfection, it adheres to\nstringent EP9 standards and boasts essential nutrients. From skincare to culinary delights, enhance\nyour creations.\n\nView product\n][76]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil and what plant is it derived from?\n\nAlmond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined is a vegetable oil extracted from the seeds, kernels, or fruit of\nits source plant. Refining removes impurities, colour, and odour to produce a consistent,\nshelf-stable oil suitable for a wide range of cosmetic formulations. O&3 sources this oil from\nvetted suppliers to ensure quality and traceability.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil?\n\nAlmond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined is a valued emollient that helps restore and maintain the skin's\nnatural moisture barrier. It absorbs readily without leaving a heavy, greasy residue, making it\nsuitable for moisturisers, serums, and body oils. Its fatty acid profile supports skin suppleness,\nand it contains antioxidants that help protect against environmental stressors and signs of\npremature ageing.\n\n### How can Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil benefit hair and scalp care formulations?\n\nIn hair care, Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined provides deep conditioning and nourishment, helping\nto smooth the cuticle, reduce frizz, and restore shine to dry or damaged hair. It can be used in\npre-shampoo treatments, hair oils, and serums. Applied to the scalp, it helps balance moisture\nlevels and supports a healthy follicle environment.\n\n### What are the key fatty acids found in Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil?\n\nAlmond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined contains a blend of beneficial fatty acids typical of its botanical\nsource family, which may include oleic acid (for softening and nourishment), linoleic acid (for\nbarrier repair and anti-inflammatory properties), and palmitic acid (for a protective, emollient\neffect). The exact fatty acid profile is available on the product specification sheet.\n\n### What certifications does Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Full certification documentation, including specification\nsheets, allergen declarations, and MSDS, is available to download below.\n\n### What cosmetic products can I formulate with Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil?\n\nAlmond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined is a versatile base ingredient suitable for formulating body oils,\nfacial serums, moisturisers, body butters, hair oils, hair serums, scalp treatments, and massage\noils. Its texture and absorption profile make it compatible with both leave-on and rinse-off\nformulations.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][77][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][78][MSDS][79][Specifications][80][Product\nStatements][81][Product Marketing Sheet][82]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][83]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][84]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][85]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][86]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][87]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][88]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oil"
