            "url": "https://www.oand3.com/product/amla-infused-in-sunflower-oil-organic/",
            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Infused Oils][60] Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Infused Oils\n\n# Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n* Organic\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nAmla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic is a natural oil packed with antioxidants and essential fatty\nacids. It is ideal for nourishing and protecting the skin, and can also be used to promote hair\ngrowth and reduce dandruff.\n\nIt is known for its ability to heal wounds, reduce inflammation, and protect the skin from damage,\nas well as being a good source of vitamin C, which is an essential nutrient for healthy skin.\n\nAmla, Infused in Sunflower Oil is a high-quality oil that is produced using a sustainable and\nethical process. It is also non-irritating and non-comedogenic, making it safe for all skin types.\n\nTo learn more about Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic or to request a quote or order a sample,\nplease contact us today!\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Body Lotion\n* Body Oil\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Oil\n* Hair Serum\n* Moisturiser\n* Scalp Treatment\n* Product code\n\nK0776\n* INCI Listing Emblica Officinalis Fruit & Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil\n* Manufacturing Method Infused\n* CAS Number 90028-28-7 & 8001-21-6\n* Origin\nEurope\n[Poland flag] Poland\n[United Kingdom flag] United Kingdom\n* EINCS 289-817-3 & 232-273-9\n* Aroma Characteristic, Earthy\n* Colour\n\nGold-Yellow\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Anti-Aging\n\nPacked with antioxidants, it helps fight free radicals and reduce the signs of ageing. It promotes\nthe production of collagen, improving skin elasticity and firmness, and diminishing the appearance\nof fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n### Anti-Inflammatory\n\nPowerful anti-inflammatory properties help soothe and calm irritated skin, reducing redness and\ninflammation, whilst providing relief from discomfort and promoting a balanced complexion for\nhealthier-looking skin.\n\n### Antioxidant\n\nRich in antioxidants, it shields the skin from environmental stressors, neutralising free radicals\nand promoting a youthful appearance. As well as enhancing skin resilience, reducing oxidative\ndamage, and fostering a radiant, revitalised complexion.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nAmla infused in sunflower oil combines the benefits of amla's antioxidants and nutrients with the\nnourishing properties of sunflower oil. It can help improve skin health, provide hydration, and\ncontribute to a radiant complexion. This organic infusion can be a valuable addition to your natural\nskincare routine.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nNourish and revitalize your hair with Organic Amla Infused in Sunflower Oil. This infusion adds\nshine, reduces frizz, and supports a healthy scalp. Elevate your haircare formulations with the\norganic nourishment of amla in sunflower oil.\n\n## Related products\n\nAmla, Infused in Sunflower Oil\n\nExperience Amla Infused in Sunflower Oil, a natural treasure brimming with antioxidants and\nessential fatty acids. Ideal for skin nourishment, hair growth, and dandruff reduction. Discover its\nhealing, anti-inflammatory, and protective powers today!\n\nView product\n][68]\nAmla Oil, Cold Pressed\n\n\u201cDiscover the secret to radiant beauty with Amla Oil, Cold Pressed! Harvested from the revered Amla\nfruit, this ancient elixir is your path to luminous skin, lustrous hair, and timeless allure.\u201d\n\nView product\n][69]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic and how is it made?\n\nAmla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic is produced by macerating botanical material - flowers,\nroots, berries, or herbs - in a base carrier oil over an extended period. This process draws the\nactive phytonutrients, pigments, and beneficial compounds from the botanical into the oil, creating\na nutrient-rich infusion ready to use in cosmetic formulations.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic?\n\nAmla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic combines the nourishing properties of its base carrier oil\nwith the specific active compounds from the infused botanical. This creates a multifunctional\ningredient that delivers both broad emollient benefits and targeted activity - such as\nanti-inflammatory, antioxidant, or skin-soothing effects - depending on the botanical used.\n\n### What is the base oil used in Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic and why was it chosen?\n\nThe base oil in Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic has been selected for its lightweight\ntexture, good skin absorption, and compatibility with the infused botanical material. The carrier\noil serves as the delivery medium for the active compounds, ensuring they penetrate effectively into\nthe skin.\n\n### How can I use Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic in my formulations?\n\nAmla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic can be used directly as a facial or body oil, or incorporated\ninto creams, lotions, serums, balms, and hair care products. It blends easily with other carrier\noils and is compatible with a wide range of cosmetic ingredients. Recommended usage levels typically\nrange from 5\u2013100% depending on the application.\n\n### Is Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic suitable for sensitive skin?\n\nThe suitability of Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic for sensitive skin depends on the specific\nbotanical used in the infusion. Many of O&3's infused oils use botanicals known for their calming or\nanti-inflammatory properties. As with all new ingredients, a patch test is recommended. Full\nallergen documentation is available on the product page.\n\n### What certifications does Amla, Infused in Sunflower Oil Organic carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free, and carries organic certification. Supporting documentation\nincluding allergen declarations, MSDS, and product specifications can be downloaded below.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][70][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][71][MSDS][72][Specifications][73][Product\nStatements][74][Product Marketing Sheet][75]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][76]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][77]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][78]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][83]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n8 mins\nWorld Rainforest Day: Celebrating The Amazon Rainforest and its Natural Treasures\nRead more\n][84]\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][85]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][86]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][87]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][88]\n* [Instagram][89]\n[Contact Us][90]\n[Get in touch][91] [Get a quote][92]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][93]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][94]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][95]\n[Products][96]\n[Absolutes][97] [Cosmetic Butters][98] [Cold-Pressed Oils][99] [Essential Oils][100]\n[Exfoliants][101] [Extracts][102] [Infusions][103] [Refined Oils][104] [Soap Bases][105]\n[Waters][106] [Waxes][107] [Download Product Brochure][108]\n[Industries][109]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][110] [Aromatherapy & Massage][111] [Candles & Home Fragrance][112]\n[Household & Cleaning][113] [Food & Beverage][114] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][115]\n[Pharmaceuticals][116] [Animal & Pet Care][117]\n[What We Offer][118]\n[Contract Manufacturing][119] [Formulation][120] [FAQs][121]\n[Our Story][122]\n[Vision & Values][123] [Careers][124] [Sustainability][125] [Stories][126]\n* [Terms & Conditions][127]\n* [Privacy Policy][128]\n* [Cookies][129]\n\n*\u00a92024 O&3 Limited, All rights reserved. VAT: 285-401-700. Company Reg No: 11052797. Times House,\nThrowley Way, Sutton, England, SM1 4AF*\n\n[Back to top][130]\nClose\nClose\nClose\nClose\n\n[1]: https://www.oand3.com\n[2]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[3]:"
