            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Essential Oils][60] Aniseed, Essential Oil\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Essential Oils\n\n# Aniseed, Essential Oil\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nIntroducing Aniseed Essential Oil, a versatile and powerful essential oil with a variety of\nbenefits. Discover its amazing aroma and therapeutic properties today!\n\nAniseed Essential Oil has been used for centuries for its medicinal and aromatic properties. It is\nextracted from the seeds of the anise plant, which is native to the Mediterranean region. Aniseed\nhas been used in traditional Chinese medicine for thousands of years, and it was also popular in\nancient Egypt and Greece.\n\nIt is a natural anti-inflammatory and can help to soothe and reduce inflammation. It also has\nantimicrobial properties and can help to fight infection.\n\nOrder your sample of Aniseed Essential Oil or request a quote and experience the benefits in your\nformulations today!\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Body Lotion\n* Body Oil\n* Product code\n\nK0026\n* INCI Listing Illicium Verum Fruit Oil\n* Manufacturing Method Steam Distilled\n* CAS Number 84650-59-9\n* Origin\nAsia\n[China flag] China\n* EINCS 283-518-1\n* Aroma Characteristic, Spicy, Sweet\n* Colour\n\nClear, Light Yellow\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Anti-Inflammatory\n\nPowerful anti-inflammatory properties help soothe and calm irritated skin, reducing redness and\ninflammation, whilst providing relief from discomfort and promoting a balanced complexion for\nhealthier-looking skin.\n\n### Antimicrobial\n\nWith potent antimicrobial features, it effectively combats harmful microbes, preventing infections\nand promoting skin health. It supports a clean and clear complexion, safeguarding against unwanted\nbacteria.\n\n### Warming\n\nIntroduces a gentle warming sensation to the skin, providing a comforting and soothing effect. This\nproperty is ideal for products designed to promote relaxation, especially in massage oils or creams\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nAniseed Essential Oil offers calming and soothing properties, helping to relax the mind and promote\na sense of well-being. The sweet and licorice-like scent creates a comforting and relaxing ambiance.\nIncorporate Aniseed Essential Oil into your products for its aromatic and soothing benefits.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nAniseed Essential Oil can be used in hair care products for its aromatic and invigorating effects on\nthe scalp. It helps to stimulate the senses and provide a refreshing sensation. Incorporate Aniseed\nEssential Oil into your hair care formulations for its aromatic benefits on the scalp.\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Aniseed essential oil and where does it come from?\n\nAniseed, Essential Oil is a pure aromatic extract obtained through steam distillation (or cold\nexpression, where applicable) of the plant's botanical material. O&3 sources its essential oils from\nspecialist growers and distillers worldwide, selecting origins that deliver the most consistent\nquality and authentic chemical profile.\n\n### What are the key aromatic and therapeutic properties of Aniseed essential oil?\n\nAniseed, Essential Oil carries a characteristic aroma profile that makes it a popular choice in\nperfumery, aromatherapy, and functional cosmetics. It is widely valued for its potential\nantimicrobial, antioxidant, and skin-conditioning properties, though specific activity depends on\nthe chemotype and batch chemistry.\n\n### How should I safely dilute Aniseed essential oil for use on skin?\n\nEssential oils should always be diluted in a suitable carrier oil before applying to skin. A typical\nusage level is 0.5\u20132% in leave-on products and up to 3\u20134% in rinse-off formulations. Always perform\na patch test before use, and consult current IFRA guidelines for Aniseed specifically, as maximum\nusage levels vary by application category.\n\n### What carrier oils blend well with Aniseed essential oil?\n\nAniseed essential oil can be diluted in a wide range of carrier oils. Lightweight, easily absorbed\noptions such as Jojoba Golden Oil, Fractionated Coconut Oil, or Sweet Almond Oil are popular\nchoices. For richer formulations, Argan Oil or Rosehip Seed Oil work well.\n\n### What essential oils complement Aniseed in a blend?\n\nAniseed is a versatile blending component that works harmoniously with complementary botanical\nextracts. Citrus oils, florals, woods, and resins are common blending partners depending on the\ndesired fragrance direction. We recommend small-scale trials to find your ideal ratio before scaling\nup.\n\n### What cosmetic products can Aniseed essential oil be used in?\n\nAniseed, Essential Oil is suitable for a wide range of applications including facial serums, body\noils, massage blends, hair care products, candles, and room sprays. It can also be incorporated into\nsolid bars, balms, and creams where a small percentage of active essential oil is desirable.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][68][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][69][MSDS][70][Specifications][71][IFRA\nStatement][72][Product Statements][73][Product Marketing Sheet][74]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][75]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][76]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][77]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][78]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n8 mins\nWorld Rainforest Day: Celebrating The Amazon Rainforest and its Natural Treasures\nRead more\n][83]\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][84]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][85]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][86]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nCompany\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][87]\n* [Instagram][88]\n[Contact Us][89]\n[Get in touch][90] [Get a quote][91]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][92]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][93]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][94]\n[Products][95]\n[Absolutes][96] [Cosmetic Butters][97] [Cold-Pressed Oils][98] [Essential Oils][99]\n[Exfoliants][100] [Extracts][101] [Infusions][102] [Refined Oils][103] [Soap Bases][104]\n[Waters][105] [Waxes][106] [Download Product Brochure][107]\n[Industries][108]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][109] [Aromatherapy & Massage][110] [Candles & Home Fragrance][111]\n[Household & Cleaning][112] [Food & Beverage][113] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][114]\n[Pharmaceuticals][115] [Animal & Pet Care][116]\n[What We Offer][117]\n[Contract Manufacturing][118] [Formulation][119] [FAQs][120]\n[Our Story][121]\n[Vision & Values][122] [Careers][123] [Sustainability][124] [Stories][125]\n* [Terms & Conditions][126]\n* [Privacy Policy][127]\n* [Cookies][128]\n\n*\u00a92024 O&3 Limited, All rights reserved. VAT: 285-401-700. Company Reg No: 11052797. Times House,\nThrowley Way, Sutton, England, SM1 4AF*\n\n[Back to top][129]\nClose\nClose\nClose\nClose\n\n[1]: https://www.oand3.com\n[2]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[3]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[4]: https://www.oand3.com/product-finder/\n[5]: https://www.oand3.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/O_3_Product_Brochure_compressed.pdf\n[6]: /products/\n[7]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/absolutes/\n[8]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/butters/\n[9]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/cold-pressed-oils/\n[10]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/essential-oils/\n[11]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/exfoliants/\n[12]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/extracts/\n[13]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/infusions/\n[14]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/refined-oils/\n[15]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/soap-bases/\n[16]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/waters/\n[17]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/waxes/\n[18]: https://www.oand3.com/products/organic/\n[19]: https://www.oand3.com/products/gluten-free/\n[20]: https://www.oand3.com/products/vegan-friendly/\n[21]: https://www.oand3.com/products/kosher/\n[22]: https://www.oand3.com/products/carrier-oils/\n[23]: https://www.oand3.com"
