            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Butters][60] Almond (Sweet), Butter\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Butters\n\n# Almond (Sweet), Butter\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nIntroducing Almond (Sweet) Butter, a perfect mix of fatty acids and hydrogenated vegetable oil, this\nremarkable product contains an extra ingredient that significantly reduces oxidation, ensuring your\nbeauty products stay fresh and effective.\n\nNot only cost-effective, but also incredibly easy to use, our Almond (Sweet) Butter is rich in\nvitamins and essential fatty acids. Most popularly used in face creams, body lotions, soaps and lip\ncare products, it is renowned for its calming properties and can be used to soothe skin irritation,\nhydrate, and repair damaged skin, making it a super moisturiser.\n\nTo elevate your formulations by seamlessly blending this versatile ingredient with essential oils\nand creating a personalised skincare experience; request a quote or order a sample today.\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Hair Butter\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Cream\n* Hair Pomade\n* Product code\n\nK0010\n* INCI Listing Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil & Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil\n* Manufacturing Method Hydrogenated\n* CAS Number 8007-69-0 / 90320-37-9 & 68334-28-1\n* Origin\nEurope\n[Italy flag] Italy\n* EINCS - / 291-063-5 & 269-820-6\n* Aroma Neutral\n* Colour\n\nOff-White\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Easily-Absorbed\n\nQuickly absorbs into the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Lightweight and ensures fast\npenetration, delivering essential nutrients and hydration for a smooth and nourished complexion.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n### Skin Brightening\n\nContains natural skin-brightening properties. It helps even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of\ndark spots and hyperpigmentation, and promote a more radiant complexion.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nAlmond (Sweet) Butter is a natural product derived from sweet almonds. It offers various skin\nbenefits due to its rich composition of vitamins, minerals, and fatty acids. The butter provides\ndeep hydration and nourishment to the skin, leaving it Moisturised, soft, and smooth. It helps to\nimprove the skin's elasticity and firmness, reducing the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines.\nAlmond (Sweet) Butter also possesses emollient properties, which help soothe and calm the skin,\nrelieving dryness, itching, and irritation. Incorporate this natural butter into your skincare\nroutine for its Moisturising and skin-nourishing effects.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nWhen applied to the hair, Almond (Sweet) Butter can help provide hydration, moisture, and shine. It\ncan be used as a natural hair conditioner, helping to soften and smooth the hair strands. The\nemollient properties of the butter can also assist in reducing frizz and flyaways, promoting a more\nmanageable and healthy-looking hair appearance. Additionally, the nutrients present in Almond\n(Sweet) Butter can nourish the scalp and contribute to overall hair health. While its primary use is\nfor skincare, it can offer some benefits when incorporated into hair care routines.\n\n## Related products\n\nNatural Benzaldehyde Oil (EU Nat Compliant)\n\nIndulge in the classic almond aroma with Almond Bitter (Natural Benzaldehyde), Essential Oil (EU Nat\nCompliant). Time-tested for relaxation and skincare, it\u2019s a 100% natural and ethical choice. Click\nto unwind and nourish your senses.\n\nView product\n][68]\nAlmond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated)\n\nUnearth the natural beauty of Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated). Crafted from cracked\nalmond shells, this sustainable exfoliant rejuvenates your skin while being eco-friendly and gentle.\n\nView product\n][69]\nAlmond (Sweet), Wax\n\nEmbrace the natural allure of Almond (Sweet) Wax \u2013 a chemical-free, sustainable treasure. From lip\ncare to candles, it\u2019s the embodiment of versatility and stability. Elevate your creations with this\npure wonder.\n\nView product\n][70]\nAlmond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed Organic\n\nUnlock the natural potency of Almond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed \u2013 meticulously extracted to preserve\nraw nutrients. Ideal for sensitive skin, it soothes irritation, perfect for massage oils, and\nnourishing formulations. Elevate your skincare now!\n\nView product\n][71]\nAlmond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed\n\nUnveil the natural magic of Almond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed. With meticulous Cold Press extraction,\nit retains raw nutrients. Ideal for sensitive skin, soothing discomfort, and nourishing deeply\n\nView product\n][72]\nAlmond (Sweet), Cosmetic & Food Grade Oil Refined\n\nElevate your products with Almond (Sweet) Cosmetic & Food Grade Oil, Refined. Meticulously sourced\nand refined to the highest standards, this versatile ingredient is a nourishing gem for skincare and\nculinary creations\n\nView product\n][73]\nAlmond (Sweet) EP9 Oil, Refined\n\nElevate your products with Almond (Sweet) EP9 Oil, Refined. Crafted to perfection, it adheres to\nstringent EP9 standards and boasts essential nutrients. From skincare to culinary delights, enhance\nyour creations.\n\nView product\n][74]\nAlmond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined\n\nIntroducing Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined. Crafted to precision, our oil adheres to the BP73\nspecification, ensuring unrivaled quality. From skincare to culinary creations, elevate your\nproducts with this versatile, cost-effective gem.\n\nView product\n][75]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Almond (Sweet), Butter and where does it come from?\n\nAlmond (Sweet), Butter is a solid or semi-solid plant-derived fat extracted from the seeds, nuts, or\nfruit of its source plant. It melts on contact with skin, delivering a rich, nourishing experience.\nO&3 sources this butter from specialist suppliers committed to responsible harvesting practices.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Almond (Sweet), Butter?\n\nAlmond (Sweet), Butter is deeply moisturising and emollient, ideal for dry, rough, or sensitive\nskin. It forms a protective layer on the skin's surface to lock in moisture, while its fatty acid\nand antioxidant content supports skin regeneration, improves elasticity, and helps to soothe\nirritation.\n\n### How do I melt and incorporate Almond (Sweet), Butter into formulations?\n\nAlmond (Sweet), Butter can be melted using a bain-marie (double boiler) at a low, controlled\ntemperature - typically between 40\u00b0C and 70\u00b0C depending on the specific butter's melting point. Once\nmelted, it can be blended with liquid oils, waxes, and actives to create balms, body butters,\nlotions, and hair treatments. Avoid overheating to preserve its beneficial properties.\n\n### Is Almond (Sweet), Butter suitable for sensitive or allergy-prone skin?\n\nAlmond (Sweet), Butter is generally well tolerated, though individual sensitivities vary. As with\nall new ingredients, a patch test is recommended before wider application. Full allergen declaration\ndocumentation is available from O&3 to support your safety assessment and compliance requirements.\n\n### What certifications does Almond (Sweet), Butter carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Supporting documentation including allergen declarations,\nMSDS, and product specifications can be downloaded below.\n\n### What products can I make with Almond (Sweet), Butter?\n\nAlmond (Sweet), Butter is an excellent addition to body butters, balms, lip products, solid lotion\nbars, hair butters, hair masks, and intensive moisturisers. Its rich texture makes it especially\nsuited to products targeting dry skin, eczema-prone skin, or damaged hair.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Product Statements][76][Product Marketing Sheet][77]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][78]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][83]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][84]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][85]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n8 mins\nWorld Rainforest Day: Celebrating The Amazon Rainforest and its Natural Treasures\nRead more\n][86]\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][87]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][88]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][89]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global netwo"
