            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Exfoliants][60] Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated)\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Exfoliants\n\n# Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated)\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n* Zero Waste\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nLooking for a natural, sustainable, and effective exfoliant? Look no further than our Almond (Sweet)\nShells, Exfoliant (Irradiated)! This unique exfoliant is made from cracked almond shells, which are\na by-product of the almond oil production process. By using almond shells, we are able to reduce\nwaste and create a product that is good for the skin and the environment.\n\nAlmond shells have been used for centuries as a natural exfoliator. The coarse texture helps to\nremove dead skin cells and reveal fresh, glowing skin underneath. They are also a good source of\nvitamins and minerals, which can help to nourish and protect the skin.\n\nIt is also chemical-free, which means that it is gentle on the skin.\n\nTo learn more about our Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated), get a quote or order a\nsample, get in touch today!\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Scrub\n* Product code\n\nK0012\n* INCI Listing Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Shell Powder\n* Manufacturing Method Irradiated\n* CAS Number 90320-37-9\n* Origin\nEurope\n[Spain flag] Spain\n* EINCS 291-063-5\n* Aroma Neutral\n* Colour\n\nBrown\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Exfoliating\n\nGently removes dead skin cells from the surface, promoting a smoother and more radiant complexion.\nIt unclogs pores, reduces the appearance of blackheads and whiteheads, and enhances the skin\u2019s\nnatural renewal process.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nSweet Almond Shells act as a natural exfoliant, gently removing dead skin cells and impurities from\nthe skin's surface. The fine particles of the shells provide effective exfoliation without causing\nirritation or damage to the skin. Regular use of products containing Sweet Almond Shells can help\nimprove skin texture, promote cell turnover, and reveal a smoother and brighter complexion.\nIncorporate Sweet Almond Shells into your exfoliating products for their natural and gentle\nexfoliating properties.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nRevitalize and exfoliate your scalp with Irradiated Sweet Almond Shells. This exfoliant gently\nremoves impurities, promoting a healthy scalp and improved hair texture. Enhance your haircare\nformulations with the exfoliating properties of irradiated sweet almond shells.\n\n## Related products\n\nNatural Benzaldehyde Oil (EU Nat Compliant)\n\nIndulge in the classic almond aroma with Almond Bitter (Natural Benzaldehyde), Essential Oil (EU Nat\nCompliant). Time-tested for relaxation and skincare, it\u2019s a 100% natural and ethical choice. Click\nto unwind and nourish your senses.\n\nView product\n][68]\nAlmond (Sweet), Wax\n\nEmbrace the natural allure of Almond (Sweet) Wax \u2013 a chemical-free, sustainable treasure. From lip\ncare to candles, it\u2019s the embodiment of versatility and stability. Elevate your creations with this\npure wonder.\n\nView product\n][69]\nAlmond (Sweet), Butter\n\nIntroducing Almond (Sweet) Butter \u2013 the secret to fresher, more effective beauty products. Packed\nwith vitamins and essential fatty acids, it\u2019s cost-effective and easy to use. Elevate your\nformulations today\n\nView product\n][70]\nAlmond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed Organic\n\nUnlock the natural potency of Almond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed \u2013 meticulously extracted to preserve\nraw nutrients. Ideal for sensitive skin, it soothes irritation, perfect for massage oils, and\nnourishing formulations. Elevate your skincare now!\n\nView product\n][71]\nAlmond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed\n\nUnveil the natural magic of Almond (Sweet) Oil, Cold Pressed. With meticulous Cold Press extraction,\nit retains raw nutrients. Ideal for sensitive skin, soothing discomfort, and nourishing deeply\n\nView product\n][72]\nAlmond (Sweet), Cosmetic & Food Grade Oil Refined\n\nElevate your products with Almond (Sweet) Cosmetic & Food Grade Oil, Refined. Meticulously sourced\nand refined to the highest standards, this versatile ingredient is a nourishing gem for skincare and\nculinary creations\n\nView product\n][73]\nAlmond (Sweet) EP9 Oil, Refined\n\nElevate your products with Almond (Sweet) EP9 Oil, Refined. Crafted to perfection, it adheres to\nstringent EP9 standards and boasts essential nutrients. From skincare to culinary delights, enhance\nyour creations.\n\nView product\n][74]\nAlmond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined\n\nIntroducing Almond (Sweet) BP73 Oil, Refined. Crafted to precision, our oil adheres to the BP73\nspecification, ensuring unrivaled quality. From skincare to culinary creations, elevate your\nproducts with this versatile, cost-effective gem.\n\nView product\n][75]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) and what is it made from?\n\nAlmond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) is a natural exfoliant derived from plant material,\nproviding gentle-to-medium mechanical exfoliation when incorporated into scrubs, cleansers, and body\ncare products. It is a biodegradable alternative to synthetic microbeads, making it a more\nenvironmentally responsible choice for rinse-off formulations.\n\n### What particle size is Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) and what skin types is it\n### suitable for?\n\nParticle size information for Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) is provided on the\nproduct specification sheet. Finer grades are suitable for facial scrubs and sensitive skin, while\ncoarser grades are better suited to body scrubs and foot care products. O&3 offers multiple grades\nfor different applications.\n\n### Is Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) biodegradable and environmentally friendly?\n\nYes - Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) is a naturally derived, biodegradable exfoliant.\nIt does not contribute to microplastic pollution, making it a compliant and sustainable choice for\nrinse-off cosmetic formulations under current EU regulations on intentionally added microplastics.\n\n### How do I use Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) in a formulation?\n\nAlmond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) is typically incorporated into the finished product at\nthe end of the manufacturing process (cool-down phase) to preserve particle integrity. Recommended\nusage levels vary by application - typically 5\u201320% in body scrubs and 1\u20135% in facial exfoliants. It\ncan be combined with other exfoliants or actives for enhanced effect.\n\n### What products can I make using Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated)?\n\nAlmond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) is ideal for body scrubs, sugar scrubs, facial\nexfoliants, foot scrubs, cleansing bars, exfoliating masks, and bath salts. It blends well with\ncarrier oils, butters, and emulsifying agents to create a wide variety of textures and finishes.\n\n### Does Almond (Sweet) Shells, Exfoliant (Irradiated) require irradiation and what does that mean?\n\nSome of our exfoliant grades are irradiated - a standard food-safety process that uses ionising\nradiation to reduce microbial load, ensuring the material meets cosmetic-grade safety requirements.\nIrradiation does not make the product radioactive and is widely used in the food and cosmetics\nindustry.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][76][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][77][MSDS][78][Specifications][79][Product\nStatements][80][Product Marketing Sheet][81]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][83]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][84]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][85]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][86]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][87]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][88]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][89]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][90]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][91]\n5 mins\nThe Alchemist & The Algorithm: Why AI is the New Best Friend of Natural Ingredients\nRead more\n][92]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][93]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nLinkedIn\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][94]\n* [Ins"
