            "url": "https://www.oand3.com/product/annatto-oily-extract/",
            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Infused Oils][60] Annatto, Oily Extract\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Infused Oils\n\n# Annatto, Oily Extract\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nIntroducing Annatto, Oily Extract, the brilliant extract with antioxidant benefits.\n\nAnnatto, Oily Extract is a vibrant essence derived from the seeds of the Annatto tree, indigenous to\nCentral and South America and is renowned for its rich crimson hue and antioxidant and\nskin-conditioning benefits.\n\nPerfect for adding into a range of cosmetics and personal care items, including lipsticks, lip\nbalms, and sunscreens, Annatto, Oily Extract also serves as a natural food dye. Moreover, it boasts\nnon-comedogenic properties, ensuring pores remain unblocked, and it is hypoallergenic, suitable for\nall skin types.\n\nUnlock the magic of Annato, Oily Extract today! Formulate your products with this wonder ingredient\nfor amazing results. Get a quote or order a sample and embrace nature's gift in your formulations!\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Body Lotion\n* Body Oil\n* Product code\n\nK0027\n* INCI Listing Bixa Orellana Seed Extract & Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil & Tocopherol\n* Manufacturing Method Infused\n* CAS Number Not Listed / 8001-21-6 / 59-02-9\n* Origin\n[Brazil flag] Brazil\n[South America flag] South America\n* EINCS Not Listed / 232-273-9 / 200-412-2\n* Aroma Characteristic, Earthy\n* Colour\n\nOrange-Red\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Antioxidant\n\nRich in antioxidants, it shields the skin from environmental stressors, neutralising free radicals\nand promoting a youthful appearance. As well as enhancing skin resilience, reducing oxidative\ndamage, and fostering a radiant, revitalised complexion.\n\n### Skin Brightening\n\nContains natural skin-brightening properties. It helps even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of\ndark spots and hyperpigmentation, and promote a more radiant complexion.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nAnnatto Oily Extract is rich in antioxidants, helping to protect the skin from free radicals and\nenvironmental damage. The extract provides nourishment and conditioning benefits, promoting a\nhealthy complexion. Its natural orange-red color can be used to enhance the appearance of cosmetic\nformulations. Incorporate Annatto Oily Extract into your skincare products for its antioxidant and\nskin-conditioning properties.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nAniseed Essential Oil offers various benefits for the hair. It has stimulating properties that can\npromote blood circulation in the scalp, which may contribute to improved hair growth. The oil's\nantifungal and antibacterial properties can help combat scalp issues such as dandruff or fungal\ninfections. Aniseed Essential Oil also has a pleasant aroma that can be used in hair care products\nto provide a refreshing and invigorating scent. However, it's important to note that Aniseed\nEssential Oil is highly concentrated and should be used with caution. Dilution in a carrier oil is\nrecommended before applying it to the hair or scalp. Incorporating this essential oil into your hair\ncare routine can enhance the overall health and fragrance of your hair.\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Annatto, Oily Extract and how is it made?\n\nAnnatto, Oily Extract is a concentrated botanical extract derived from its source plant material.\nThe extraction process isolates the key bioactive compounds - such as polyphenols, antioxidants, or\nskin-active phytochemicals - delivering them in a form that is easy to incorporate into cosmetic\nformulations.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Annatto, Oily Extract?\n\nAnnatto, Oily Extract delivers the targeted bioactive compounds of its source botanical in a\nconcentrated, readily usable form. Depending on the specific plant source, these compounds may offer\nantioxidant, anti-inflammatory, brightening, or skin-regenerating properties. It is a popular\ninclusion in serums, toners, and treatment products.\n\n### How do I use Annatto, Oily Extract in formulations?\n\nAnnatto, Oily Extract is typically used at low inclusion levels - generally 0.5\u20135% - in the water or\noil phase depending on its solubility. It blends well into serums, toners, creams, and lotions.\nRecommended usage levels and phase compatibility are detailed in the specification sheet available\non the product page.\n\n### Is Annatto, Oily Extract suitable for natural and organic formulations?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. For COSMOS or other certified-natural formulations, please\nverify compatibility with your certification body using the documentation available on the product\npage.\n\n### What certifications does Annatto, Oily Extract carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Full certification documentation including MSDS and allergen\ndeclarations is available to download below.\n\n### What documentation is available for Annatto, Oily Extract?\n\nTechnical documentation for Annatto, Oily Extract - including specification sheets, allergen\ndeclarations, and MSDS can be downloaded below.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][68][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][69][MSDS][70][Specifications][71][Product\nStatements][72][Product Marketing Sheet][73]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][74]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][75]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][76]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][77]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][78]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][82]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][83]\n5 mins\nThe Alchemist & The Algorithm: Why AI is the New Best Friend of Natural Ingredients\nRead more\n][84]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][85]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nPhone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][86]\n* [Instagram][87]\n[Contact Us][88]\n[Get in touch][89] [Get a quote][90]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][91]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][92]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][93]\n[Products][94]\n[Absolutes][95] [Cosmetic Butters][96] [Cold-Pressed Oils][97] [Essential Oils][98] [Exfoliants][99]\n[Extracts][100] [Infusions][101] [Refined Oils][102] [Soap Bases][103] [Waters][104] [Waxes][105]\n[Download Product Brochure][106]\n[Industries][107]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][108] [Aromatherapy & Massage][109] [Candles & Home Fragrance][110]\n[Household & Cleaning][111] [Food & Beverage][112] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][113]\n[Pharmaceuticals][114] [Animal & Pet Care][115]\n[What We Offer][116]\n[Contract Manufacturing][117] [Formulation][118] [FAQs][119]\n[Our Story][120]\n[Vision & Values][121] [Careers][122] [Sustainability][123] [Stories][124]\n* [Terms & Conditions][125]\n* [Privacy Policy][126]\n* [Cookies][127]\n\n*\u00a92024 O&3 Limited, All rights reserved. VAT: 285-401-700. Company Reg No: 11052797. Times House,\nThrowley Way, Sutton, England, SM1 4AF*\n\n[Back to top][128]\nClose\nClose\nClose\nClose\n\n[1]: https://www.oand3.com\n[2]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[3]: https://www.oand3.com/products/\n[4]: https://www.oand3.com/product-finder/\n[5]: https://www.oand3.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/O_3_Product_Brochure_compressed.pdf\n[6]: /products/\n[7]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/absolutes/\n[8]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/butters/\n[9]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/cold-pressed-oils/\n[10]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/essential-oils/\n[11]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/exfoliants/\n[12]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/extracts/\n[13]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/infusions/\n[14]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/refined-oils/\n[15]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/soap-bases/\n[16]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/waters/\n[17]: https://www.oand3.com/wholesale-products/waxes/\n[18]: https://www.oand3.com/products/organic/\n[19]: https://www.oand3.com/products/gluten-free/\n[20]: https://www.oand3.com/products/vegan-friendly/\n[21]: https://www.oand3.com/products/ko"
