            "url": "https://www.oand3.com/product/apple-seed-oil-cold-pressed/",
            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Cold Pressed][60] Apple Seed Oil, Cold Pressed\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Cold Pressed\n\n# Apple Seed Oil, Cold Pressed\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n* Zero Waste\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nUnique, different, versatile, and functional \u2013 Experience the essence of nature's rejuvenation with\nCold-Pressed Apple Seed Oil and add fresh radiance to formulations!\n\nThe apple seeds are a by-product of the fruit juice industry, so no waste. We collect the seeds (a\nlot of them!) and then press away. This completely natural cold pressing method delivers a\nstunningly fresh, light \u201cmarzipan\u201d aromatic oil.\n\nCold-Pressed Apple Seed Oil is a treasure trove of vitamins and omega fatty acids, working wonders\nfor the skin and hair. Its lightweight, non-greasy formula nourishes deeply, to create a\nvelvety-smooth complexion and lustrous locks.\n\nRevel in the magic of Cold-Pressed Apple Seed Oil! Formulate your skincare and haircare products\nwith this luscious oil for unparalleled results. Get a quote or order a sample today and embrace the\npure essence of nature.\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Body Lotion\n* Body Oil\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Oil\n* Moisturiser\n* Scalp Treatment\n* Product code\n\nK0028\n* INCI Listing Pyrus Malus Seed Oil\n* Manufacturing Method Cold Pressed\n* CAS Number 85251-63-4\n* Origin\nEurope\n[Poland flag] Poland\n* EINCS 286-475-7\n* Aroma Characteristic, Fruity, Nutty\n* Colour\n\nYellow, Light Green\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Anti-Aging\n\nPacked with antioxidants, it helps fight free radicals and reduce the signs of ageing. It promotes\nthe production of collagen, improving skin elasticity and firmness, and diminishing the appearance\nof fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n### Anti-Inflammatory\n\nPowerful anti-inflammatory properties help soothe and calm irritated skin, reducing redness and\ninflammation, whilst providing relief from discomfort and promoting a balanced complexion for\nhealthier-looking skin.\n\n### Antioxidant\n\nRich in antioxidants, it shields the skin from environmental stressors, neutralising free radicals\nand promoting a youthful appearance. As well as enhancing skin resilience, reducing oxidative\ndamage, and fostering a radiant, revitalised complexion.\n\n### Easily-Absorbed\n\nQuickly absorbs into the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Lightweight and ensures fast\npenetration, delivering essential nutrients and hydration for a smooth and nourished complexion.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nCold Pressed Apple Seed Oil provides hydration and nourishment to the skin. It helps to improve the\nskin's texture, promote a healthy complexion, and protect against free radicals with its antioxidant\nproperties. The oil's lightweight texture ensures easy absorption, leaving the skin soft, smooth,\nand Revitalised. Incorporate Cold Pressed Apple Seed Oil into your skincare routine for its\nhydrating and antioxidant-rich benefits.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nCold-Pressed Apple Seed Oil offers a range of nourishing benefits for the hair. Rich in essential\nfatty acids, vitamins, and antioxidants, it helps moisturize and condition the hair, reducing\ndryness and promoting softness and shine. This lightweight oil supports overall hair health by\nstrengthening the hair shaft and helping to prevent breakage and split ends. Its soothing properties\ncan also help calm an irritated or sensitive scalp, making it suitable for those with dry or flaky\nscalp conditions. Incorporating cold-pressed apple seed oil into your hair care routine can enhance\nmanageability and promote healthier, more vibrant hair over time.\n\n## Extraction process\n\nCold-pressed extraction is a method used to extract natural oils from various plant-based sources.\nIt involves applying mechanical pressure to the source material without the use of heat or\nchemicals, resulting in a pure and unrefined oil.\n\n[Find out more][68]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Apple Seed Oil and what plant is it derived from?\n\nApple Seed Oil, Cold Pressed is a vegetable oil extracted from the seeds, kernels, or fruit of its\nsource plant. Cold pressing preserves the oil's natural fatty acids, antioxidants, and\nphytonutrients without the use of heat or solvents, resulting in a richer, more nutrient-dense oil.\nO&3 sources this oil from vetted suppliers to ensure quality and traceability.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Apple Seed Oil?\n\nApple Seed Oil, Cold Pressed is a valued emollient that helps restore and maintain the skin's\nnatural moisture barrier. It absorbs readily without leaving a heavy, greasy residue, making it\nsuitable for moisturisers, serums, and body oils. Its fatty acid profile supports skin suppleness,\nand it contains antioxidants that help protect against environmental stressors and signs of\npremature ageing.\n\n### How can Apple Seed Oil benefit hair and scalp care formulations?\n\nIn hair care, Apple Seed Oil, Cold Pressed provides deep conditioning and nourishment, helping to\nsmooth the cuticle, reduce frizz, and restore shine to dry or damaged hair. It can be used in\npre-shampoo treatments, hair oils, and serums. Applied to the scalp, it helps balance moisture\nlevels and supports a healthy follicle environment.\n\n### What are the key fatty acids found in Apple Seed Oil?\n\nApple Seed Oil, Cold Pressed contains a blend of beneficial fatty acids typical of its botanical\nsource family, which may include oleic acid (for softening and nourishment), linoleic acid (for\nbarrier repair and anti-inflammatory properties), and palmitic acid (for a protective, emollient\neffect). The exact fatty acid profile is available on the product specification sheet.\n\n### What certifications does Apple Seed Oil carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Full certification documentation, including specification\nsheets, allergen declarations, and MSDS, is available to download below.\n\n### What cosmetic products can I formulate with Apple Seed Oil?\n\nApple Seed Oil, Cold Pressed is a versatile base ingredient suitable for formulating body oils,\nfacial serums, moisturisers, body butters, hair oils, hair serums, scalp treatments, and massage\noils. Its texture and absorption profile make it compatible with both leave-on and rinse-off\nformulations.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][69][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][70][MSDS][71][Specifications][72][Product\nStatements][73][Product Marketing Sheet][74]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][75]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][76]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][77]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][78]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][83]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][84]\n5 mins\nThe Alchemist & The Algorithm: Why AI is the New Best Friend of Natural Ingredients\nRead more\n][85]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][86]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nPhone\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][87]\n* [Instagram][88]\n[Contact Us][89]\n[Get in touch][90] [Get a quote][91]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][92]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][93]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][94]\n[Products][95]\n[Absolutes][96] [Cosmetic Butters][97] [Cold-Pressed Oils][98] [Essential Oils][99]\n[Exfoliants][100] [Extracts][101] [Infusions][102] [Refined Oils][103] [Soap Bases][104]\n[Waters][105] [Waxes][106] [Download Product Brochure][107]\n[Industries][108]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][109] [Aromatherapy & Massage][110] [Candles & Home Fragrance][111]\n[Household & Cleaning][112] [Food & Beverage][113] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][114]\n[Pharmaceuticals][115] [Animal & Pet Care][116]\n[What We Offer][117]\n[Contract Manufacturing][118] [Formulation][119] [FAQs][120]\n[Ou"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://www.oand3.com/product/apricot-kernel-butter/",
            "text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\nProducts\n[View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\nCategory\n[All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n\n[Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\nType\n[Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\nIndustries\n[Industries][25]\n[Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n[Household & Cleaning][29]\n\n[Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\nCare][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\nWhat We Offer\n[Contract Manufacturing][35]\n[Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n[Formulation][37]\n[Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\nto life.][38]\n[FAQs][39]\n[Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\nthe questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\nSustainability\n[Sourcing and Origin][42]\n[Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\nsupport.][43]\n[Zero Waste][44]\n[Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\nworld.][45]\n[Sustainable Beauty][46]\n[Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\nintegrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\nOur Story\n[Vision & Values][50]\n[It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\nmore natural oil ingredients.][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Butters][60] Apricot Kernel, Butter\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Butters\n\n# Apricot Kernel, Butter\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nApricot Kernel Butter is a versatile and nourishing butter that is perfect for use in personal care\nproducts. It is made by mixing apricot kernel oil with fatty acids and hydrogenated vegetable oil,\nand vitamin E is added to reduce the rate of oxidation. It is an excellent carrier butter to blend\nwith other oils, mainly essential oils.\n\nAn excellent emollient, Apricot Kernel Butter can help to protect the skin from irritation and\ndamage and helps to soften and moisturise the skin, whilst providing a good source of vitamins,\nincluding vitamins A, C, and E, which are all beneficial for the skin.\n\nIt is a great choice for use in face and body creams, lotions, soaps, and lip care products.\n\nTry Apricot Kernel Butter in your formulations today and request a quote or order a sample now.\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Butter\n* Body Care\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Pomade\n* Product code\n\nK0029\n* INCI Listing Prunus Armeniaca Kernel Oil & Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil & Tocopherol\n* Manufacturing Method Hydrogenated\n* CAS Number 68650-44-2 / 72869-69-3 & 68334-28-1 & 59-02-9\n* Origin\nAsia\n[Turkey flag] Turkey\n* EINCS 272-046-1 & 269-820-6 & 200-412-2\n* Aroma Neutral\n* Colour\n\nOff-White\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Easily-Absorbed\n\nQuickly absorbs into the skin without leaving a greasy residue. Lightweight and ensures fast\npenetration, delivering essential nutrients and hydration for a smooth and nourished complexion.\n\n### Healing & Soothing\n\nWith its anti-inflammatory properties, it soothes irritated and inflamed skin. It aids in the\nhealing process, making it beneficial for conditions such as acne, eczema, and rosacea.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nApricot Kernel Butter provides deep moisturization to the skin, leaving it soft, smooth, and\nhydrated. It helps to improve the skin's texture and promote a healthy complexion. The butter's\nnourishing properties make it suitable for body care products and massage treatments, delivering\nindulgent and moisturising benefits. Incorporate Apricot Kernel Butter into your skincare routine\nfor a luxurious and nourishing skincare experience.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nApricot Kernel Butter can be used in hair care products as a conditioning treatment. It deeply\nnourishes and moisturises the hair, promoting softness, shine, and manageability. The emollient\ntexture of the butter helps to restore vitality to dry and damaged hair. Incorporate Apricot Kernel\nButter into your hair care formulations or use it as a standalone treatment for its moisturising and\nnourishing effects on the hair.\n\n## Related products\n\nApricot Stones Irradiated, Exfoliant\n\nDiscover Irradiated Apricot Stones Exfoliant, a natural exfoliant made from crushed apricot stones.\nIt effectively removes dead skin cells, revealing smoother, brighter skin. Suitable for all skin\ntypes, even sensitive.\n\nView product\n][68]\nAlmond & Apricot Oil, Blend\n\nExperience a harmonious blend of nature and nourishment with Almond & Apricot Oil Blend. Crafted to\nperfection, this elixir combines the richness of almonds and apricots, delivering a transformative\nskincare experience.\n\nView product\n][69]\nApricot Kernel Oil, Refined\n\nDiscover Refined Apricot Kernel Oil, a lighter and purified version. It\u2019s easily absorbed and rich\nin vitamins A, C, and E, perfect for personal care. Ideal for all skin types, even oily and\nacne-prone\n\nView product\n][70]\nApricot Kernel Oil, Cold Pressed Organic\n\nUnlock the power of Cold-Pressed Organic Apricot Kernel Oil. Rich in vitamins A, C, and E, plus\nessential fatty acids, it\u2019s perfect for personal care. Ideal for all skin types, even oily and\nacne-prone. Try it in your formulations today!\n\nView product\n][71]\nApricot Kernel Oil, Cold Pressed\n\nReveal the beauty secret within Apricot Kernel Oil, Cold Pressed. Lightweight, vitamin-rich (A, C,\nand E), and suitable for all skin types, it\u2019s perfect for personal care products. Elevate your face\nmasks, creams, and more!\n\nView product\n][72]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Apricot Kernel, Butter and where does it come from?\n\nApricot Kernel, Butter is a solid or semi-solid plant-derived fat extracted from the seeds, nuts, or\nfruit of its source plant. It melts on contact with skin, delivering a rich, nourishing experience.\nO&3 sources this butter from specialist suppliers committed to responsible harvesting practices.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Apricot Kernel, Butter?\n\nApricot Kernel, Butter is deeply moisturising and emollient, ideal for dry, rough, or sensitive\nskin. It forms a protective layer on the skin's surface to lock in moisture, while its fatty acid\nand antioxidant content supports skin regeneration, improves elasticity, and helps to soothe\nirritation.\n\n### How do I melt and incorporate Apricot Kernel, Butter into formulations?\n\nApricot Kernel, Butter can be melted using a bain-marie (double boiler) at a low, controlled\ntemperature - typically between 40\u00b0C and 70\u00b0C depending on the specific butter's melting point. Once\nmelted, it can be blended with liquid oils, waxes, and actives to create balms, body butters,\nlotions, and hair treatments. Avoid overheating to preserve its beneficial properties.\n\n### Is Apricot Kernel, Butter suitable for sensitive or allergy-prone skin?\n\nApricot Kernel, Butter is generally well tolerated, though individual sensitivities vary. As with\nall new ingredients, a patch test is recommended before wider application. Full allergen declaration\ndocumentation is available from O&3 to support your safety assessment and compliance requirements.\n\n### What certifications does Apricot Kernel, Butter carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Supporting documentation including allergen declarations,\nMSDS, and product specifications can be downloaded below.\n\n### What products can I make with Apricot Kernel, Butter?\n\nApricot Kernel, Butter is an excellent addition to body butters, balms, lip products, solid lotion\nbars, hair butters, hair masks, and intensive moisturisers. Its rich texture makes it especially\nsuited to products targeting dry skin, eczema-prone skin, or damaged hair.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][73][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][74][MSDS][75][Specifications][76][Product\nStatements][77][Product Marketing Sheet][78]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][79]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][80]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][83]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][84]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][85]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][86]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][87]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][88]\n5 mins\nThe Alchemist & The Algorithm: Why AI is the New Best Friend of Natural Ingredients\nRead more\n][89]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][90]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pack sizes, grades and formats available.\n\nTechnical Documents\n\nAll documents readily available to download.\n\n## Get Ahead of The Game\n\nSign up to receive the hottest natural industry trends.\n\nCompany\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nName(Required)\nEmail\nSign up\nSocial\n* [LinkedIn][91]\n* [Instagram][92]\n[Contact Us][93]\n[Get in touch][94] [Get a quote][95]\n* **O&3 UK** [+44 (0)1765 522120][96]\n* **O&3 Europe** [+44 (0)1765 522120][97]\n* **O&3 US** [+44 (0)1765 522120][98]\n[Products][99]\n[Absolutes][100] [Cosmetic Butters][101] [Cold-Pressed Oils][102] [Essential Oils][103]\n[Exfoliants][104] [Extracts][10