arch]\n[Home][58] [Products][59] [Extracts][60] Aloe Vera 200:1, Powder\nSkip to\n* [Overview & specification][61]\n* [Documentation][62]\n* [Benefits][63]\n* [FAQs][64]\n* Extracts\n\n# Aloe Vera 200:1, Powder\n* Vegan\n* Cruelty-Free\n\n[Make an enquiry][65] [Request a sample][66]\n\nAloe Vera Powder is a versatile ingredient that can be used for a variety of purposes, including\nskin care, hair care, and overall health.\n\nIt is known for its ability to soothe and heal the skin, reduce inflammation, and promote wound\nhealing. Aloe vera is also a good source of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, which can benefit\nthe overall health of the body.\n\nIt can be used to make a variety of products, including face masks, hair masks, and smoothies. It\ncan also be added to other products, such as lotions, shampoos, and conditioners.\n\nTo learn more about Aloe Vera Powder, request a quote or order a sample from us today!\n\n## What can it be used in?\n* Body Care\n* Body Lotion\n* Facial Care\n* Facial Mask\n* Facial Mist\n* Facial Toner\n* Hair Care\n* Hair Mask\n* Hair Serum\n* Lip Care\n* Product code\n\nK0546\n* INCI Listing Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Powder\n* Manufacturing Method n / a\n* CAS Number 85507-69-3 / 94349-62-9\n* Origin\nAsia\n[China flag] China\n* EINCS 287-390-8 / 305-181-2\n* Aroma Neutral\n* Colour\n\nOff-White\n* Brand\n\nO&3\n\n[Download product information][67]\n\n## Functionality\n\n### Anti-Inflammatory\n\nPowerful anti-inflammatory properties help soothe and calm irritated skin, reducing redness and\ninflammation, whilst providing relief from discomfort and promoting a balanced complexion for\nhealthier-looking skin.\n\n### Antioxidant\n\nRich in antioxidants, it shields the skin from environmental stressors, neutralising free radicals\nand promoting a youthful appearance. As well as enhancing skin resilience, reducing oxidative\ndamage, and fostering a radiant, revitalised complexion.\n\n### Cleansing\n\nActs as a natural cleanser, effectively removing dirt, impurities, and excess oil from the skin and\nhair. It helps keep pores clean and clear, reducing the risk of acne and promoting a fresh,\nrevitalised appearance.\n\n### Healing & Soothing\n\nWith its anti-inflammatory properties, it soothes irritated and inflamed skin. It aids in the\nhealing process, making it beneficial for conditions such as acne, eczema, and rosacea.\n\n### Moisturising & Hydrating\n\nDeeply moisturising, helping to hydrate and nourish the skin and hair. It forms a protective\nbarrier, preventing moisture loss and leaving the skin and hair feeling soft and supple.\n\n[Lady rubbing cream into her hands]\n\n## Skin Benefits\n\nAloe Vera 200:1 Powder is renowned for its soothing and hydrating properties. It helps to calm\nirritated skin, reduce redness, and provide a boost of hydration. The concentrated form of Aloe Vera\nextract enhances the skin's natural healing processes and promotes a healthy complexion. Incorporate\nAloe Vera 200:1 Powder into your skincare formulations to enjoy the nourishing and rejuvenating\nbenefits of Aloe Vera.\n\n[Lady with long dark hair holding a pipette of oil.]\n\n## Hair Benefits\n\nAloe Vera 200:1 Powder is a concentrated form of Aloe Vera that is commonly used in hair care\nproducts. It provides hydrating, Moisturising, and soothing benefits to the hair and scalp. It helps\nimprove scalp health, reduce dryness, and promote healthy hair growth. Incorporating this powder\ninto your hair care formulations can contribute to nourished and Revitalised hair.\n\n## Related products\n\nAloe Vera, Butter\n\nEmbark on a transformative journey with Aloe Vera Butter to soothe and heal the skin, and reduce\ninflammation. Get a quote or order a sample today!\n\nView product\n][68]\nAloe Vera, Cosmetic Clear Gel\n\nIntroducing Aloe Vera Clear Gel \u2013 your versatile skincare solution. This lightweight, non-greasy gel\nharnesses the healing power of aloe to soothe, nourish, and refresh all skin types. Experience its\nrevitalizing effects!\n\nView product\n][69]\nAloe Vera 200:1, Powder Organic\n\nExperience the versatility of Aloe Vera Powder Organic, a natural wonder for skin, hair, and overall\nhealth. Renowned for soothing, healing, and reducing inflammation, it\u2019s rich in vitamins, minerals,\nand antioxidants.\n\nView product\n][70]\nAloe Vera 1:1, Juice\n\nUnlock the versatility of Aloe Vera 1:1 Juice! Soothe, nourish, and reduce inflammation with its\nvitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Improve skin health and diminish fine lines. Elevate hair\nhealth, reduce frizz, and tackle dandruff. Click for total well-being!\n\nView product\n][71]\nAloe Vera, Oily Extract in Sunflower\n\nExplore the hydrating wonders of Aloe Vera, Oily Extract in Sunflower. This formula ensures easy\nabsorption, leaving skin soft and smooth. Harness aloe vera\u2019s natural benefits and vitamin E for\nskin protection\n\nView product\n][72]\nAloe Vera, Oily Extract in Coconut\n\nDiscover natural skin rejuvenation with Aloe Vera, Oily Extract in Coconut. Hydrate, soothe, and\nprotect your skin with this high-quality blend. Sustainably produced, it\u2019s the ideal choice for\npersonal care products.\n\nView product\n][73]\nAloe Vera 10:1, Concentrate\n\nExperience the time-honored magic of Aloe Vera 10:1 Concentrate. Nourish, soothe, and protect your\nskin with this high-quality concentrate. Produced sustainably and ethically, it\u2019s perfect for your\npersonal care products. Click for revitalized skin!\n\nView product\n][74]\n\n## FAQs\n\n### What is Aloe Vera 200:1 Powder and what makes aloe vera such a valued cosmetic ingredient?\n\nAloe Vera 200:1, Powder is derived from the inner leaf gel of the Aloe barbadensis Miller plant, one\nof the most widely researched and historically used botanicals in skincare. Aloe vera is renowned\nfor its cooling, soothing, hydrating, and healing properties, and has been used for thousands of\nyears for skin and hair care. O&3 offers aloe vera in multiple formats - from fresh-equivalent juice\nto concentrated powders and oily extracts - to suit different formulation requirements.\n\n### What are the skin benefits of Aloe Vera 200:1 Powder?\n\nAloe vera is a multi-functional skin ingredient that delivers hydration, soothes irritation, reduces\nredness, and supports skin repair. It contains polysaccharides (particularly acemannan), vitamins C\nand E, enzymes, and anti-inflammatory compounds. It is particularly beneficial for sunburned,\nirritated, sensitive, or dehydrated skin, and is commonly used in after-sun, calming, and\nbrightening formulations.\n\n### How do I use Aloe Vera 200:1 Powder in my formulations?\n\nAloe Vera 200:1, Powder can be incorporated into the water phase of creams, lotions, gels, and\ntoners. The format (juice, concentrate, powder, gel, or oily extract) determines the method of use:\nconcentrated powders need to be reconstituted at the appropriate ratio before use. Refer to the\nproduct specification for recommended inclusion levels.\n\n### What is the concentration of Aloe Vera 200:1 Powder and what does the ratio mean?\n\n200:1 means 200 parts of fresh aloe vera leaf were used to produce 1 part of this powder - an\nexceptionally concentrated, highly active form that is reconstituted at low levels (typically\n0.1\u20131%).\n\n### Is Aloe Vera 200:1 Powder suitable for sensitive skin formulations?\n\nYes - aloe vera is one of the most gentle and widely tolerated cosmetic ingredients available, and\nis frequently used specifically in formulations for sensitive, reactive, or compromised skin. It is\nsuitable for facial products, baby care, after-sun, and calming ranges. It is certified vegan and\ncruelty-free.\n\n### What certifications does Aloe Vera 200:1 Powder carry?\n\nIt is certified vegan and cruelty-free. Full documentation including specification sheets, allergen\ndeclarations, and MSDS is available to download below.\n\n## Technical documents, ready when you are\n\nPlease enter your details to download our documents.\n\nName(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nConsent\nDo your R&D team want to hear about new and exciting oils we are producing? If so, tick this box and\nwhen we have something new to share, we will let you know. A good way to get ahead of the naturals\ngame! All data collected is held according to our Privacy Policy.\nSubmit\n[Allergen Declaration][75][Manufacturing Flow & INCI][76][MSDS][77][Specifications][78][Product\nStatements][79][Product Marketing Sheet][80]\n\n## Industries we work with\n\nDiscover a range of natural product categories like no other \u2013 each a celebration of our planet\u2019s\nfinest ingredients, thoughtfully produced to enhance your product formulations.\n\nBeauty and Personal Care\n\nElevate skincare, hair care products, and beyond with our premium oils, promoting healthier beauty\nroutines.\n\nSee more\n][81]\nAromatherapy and Massage\n\nInfuse serenity into your product lines with our essential oils, ideal for aromatherapy and soothing\nmassages.\n\nSee more\n][82]\nCandles and Home Fragrance\n\nCraft exquisite scents for candles and home ambiance using our finest fragrant oils in your\nformulations.\n\nSee more\n][83]\nHousehold and cleaning\n\nEnhance cleaning solutions with our eco-friendly oils, ensuring effectiveness and sustainability.\n\nSee more\n][84]\nFood and Beverage\n\nEnsure excellence in culinary creations and beverages with our array of natural oils.\n\nSee more\n][85]\nNutritional, vitamins and sumplements\n\nWe provide premium, pure oils to enhance the quality of supplement formulations.\n\nSee more\n][86]\nPharmaceuticals\n\nDiscover our top-tier oils for pharmaceutical applications, ensuring your product line meets the\nhighest standards.\n\nSee more\n][87]\nAnimal and pet care\n\nPromote pet well-being by integrating our safe and effective oils into pet care products.\n\nSee more\n][88]\nScroll for more\n\n## Stories\n\n5 mins\nThe New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care\nRead more\n][89]\n3 mins\nIngredient Spotlight: Illipe Butter\nRead more\n][90]\n5 mins\nThe Alchemist & The Algorithm: Why AI is the New Best Friend of Natural Ingredients\nRead more\n][91]\n\n## Not sure this product is right for you?\n\n[Help me choose][92]\n\nFast Global Delivery\n\nFast lead times. Agile logistics. Global network.\n\nLarge Product Library\n\nA variety of pa"
