llBasell plans to close its 260,000 t/yr polypropylene unit in Brindisi, Italy, by the end of\n2026 following the shutdown of Eni's nearby cracker, which supplied propylene feedstock.\n\n[Learn More][68]\n[Blogs]Blogs\n\n### The Fundamentals of Financial Risk and Financial Risk Management\n\nJun 19, 2026\n\nFinancial risk management is the process that involves the practice of identifying and managing\npotential finance-related risks to minimize their impact on the organization and its business\noperations.\n\n[Learn More][69]\n[News & Articles]News & Articles\n\n### Diethylene Glycol Prices Hold Firm Despite Weak Resin Demand\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\nChina's diethylene glycol market remained firm in June as maintenance shutdowns at major EG and DEG\nunits reduced domestic output and limited East China inventories.\n\n[Learn More][70]\n[Blogs]Blogs\n\n### Salicylic Acid\u2019s Widespread Application in Cosmetic Industry is Leading to Its High Demand\n\nApr 2, 2026\n\nSalicylic acid is a monohydroxybenzoic acid, which is benzoic acid with an ortho hydroxy group. It\nis derived from the bark of white willow and wintergreen leaves. It functions as an antiinfective,\nantifungal, keratolytic inhibitor, plant metabolite, algal metabolite, and plant hormone.\n\n[Learn More][71]\n[News & Articles]News & Articles\n\n### Dichloromethane Market Recovers After Early June Drop as Demand Stays Weak\n\nJun 22, 2026\n\nChina's dichloromethane market recovered in mid-June after an early-month price drop, with Shandong\nbulk prices rebounding from 2,025 yuan per tonne to 2,080 yuan per tonne.\n\n[Learn More][72]\n[Blogs]Blogs\n\n### The Market Overview of Salicylic Acid and its Growing Demand\n\nMar 27, 2026\n\nThe blog comprises the definition, production process, and pricing analysis of Salicylic acid. It\nalso covers market drivers and key players.\n\n[Learn More][73]\n[News & Articles]News & Articles\n\n### Turkey Emerges as Growing Almond Export Destination as India Volumes Decline\n\