            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][2]\n[Account ][3]\nCart 0\n][4]\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][5]\n[ Shop ][6]\n[ ACCESSORIES ][7] [ BEST SELLERS ][8] [ BEVERAGES ][9] [ GIFT SETS ][10] [ GROCERY ][11] [ HOME &\nBODY ][12] [ NEW ARRIVALS ][13] [ SMOOTHIE ][14] [ WELLNESS ][15]\n[ About ][16]\n[ Our Story ][17] [ FAQs ][18] [ Locations ][19] [ Manage Subscription ][20]\n[Account ][21]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\nCart 0\n][22]\nShop Show menu\nExit menu Shop\n[ ACCESSORIES ][23]\n[ BEST SELLERS ][24]\n[ BEVERAGES ][25]\n[ GIFT SETS ][26]\n[ GROCERY ][27]\n[ HOME & BODY ][28]\n[ NEW ARRIVALS ][29]\n[ SMOOTHIE ][30]\n[ WELLNESS ][31]\nAbout Show menu\nExit menu [ About ][32]\n[ Our Story ][33]\n[ FAQs ][34]\n[ Locations ][35]\n[ Manage Subscription ][36]\n\n### BASKET 0\n\nAdd order notes\nLeave a note about your order\n\n##### Sorry, looks like we don't have enough of this product.\n\nPair with\nSubtotal Free\nCheck Out\n*Shipping, taxes, and discount codes are calculated at checkout*\n\nYour Cart is Empty\n\n[ Shop ][37]\n[ About ][38]\n[Marianna Hewitt Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit]\n[Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit by Marianna Hewitt]\n[Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit Ingredients Layout]\n[Marianna Hewitt Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit with Summer Fridays]\n[[Marianna Hewitt Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit] ][39]\n[[Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit by Marianna Hewitt] ][40]\n[[Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit Ingredients Layout] ][41]\n[[Marianna Hewitt Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit with Summer Fridays] ][42]\n[Marianna Hewitt Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit]\n[Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit by Marianna Hewitt]\n[Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit Ingredients Layout]\n[Marianna Hewitt Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit with Summer Fridays]\n[[Marianna Hewitt Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit] ][43]\n[[Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit by Marianna Hewitt] ][44]\n[[Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit Ingredients Layout] ][45]\n[[Marianna Hewitt Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit with Summer Fridays] ][46]\n\n**Ships 6/22 - 6/24 in order of purchase**\n\n[Home][47] Erewhon Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit\n\n# Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit | Makes 4 Smoothies\n\nRegular price $100.00\nUnit price / per\n[Shipping][48] calculated at checkout.\n{\"in_cart_html\"=>\" {{ quantity }} in cart\",\n\"decrease\"=>\"Decrease quantity for {{ product }}\", \"multiples_of\"=>\"Increments of {{ quantity }}\",\n\"minimum_of\"=>\"Minimum of {{ quantity }}\", \"maximum_of\"=>\"Maximum of {{ quantity }}\"} (0 in cart)\n* [ 1 ][49]\n* [ 2 ][50]\n* [ 3 ][51]\n* [ 4 ][52]\n* [ 5 ][53]\n* [ 6 ][54]\n* [ 7 ][55]\n* [ 8 ][56]\n* [ 9 ][57]\n* [ 10 + ][58]\nDecrease quantity for Coconut Cloud Smoothie Kit | Makes 4 Smoothies Increase button quantity -\nCoconut Cloud Smoothie Kit | Makes 4 Smoothies\">\nAdd to cart$100.00\n* Description\n* Ingredients\n* Care Instructions\nSee All See All\n\nEach kit makes four 20-oz smoothies and arrives with all the ingredients pre-portioned and ready to\nblend. Thoughtfully prepared to recreate the Tonic Bar original, complete with Erewhon cups, lids,\nand straws for serving. All you need is a blender, measuring spoons, and scissors.\n\nWhat's inside:\n* Step-by-Step Recipe Card\n* 1 Carton MALK Organic Almond Milk\n* 2 Sachets BlueMajik\u00ae Spirulina\n* 4 Packs Organic Coconut Cream\n* 8 Pre-Batched Packs Erewhon Organic Fruit Blend\n* 4 20-oz Erewhon Cups with Lids and Straws\n\nRead more\n\nOrganic Pineapple, Organic Banana, Organic Avocado, Organic Grassfed Vanilla Collagen, Organic\nAlmond Butter, Organic Tahitian Vanilla Extract, Vitamin C, Blue Majik\u00ae Spirulina, Organic Coconut\nCream\n\nALLERGENS: Tree Nuts (Almonds, Coconut), Dairy\n\nRead more\n\nThis kit is highly perishable. For optimal freshness, we recommend immediate smoothie preparation\nupon arrival. If you are not making all four smoothies right away, please follow the storage\nrequirements below for each provided item.\n\nThis kit is highly perishable. For best results, prepare immediately upon arrival.\n\nIf not using all servings, store items as follows:\n* **Erewhon Organic Fruit Blend:** Freeze immediately.\n* **Organic Coconut Cream Packs:** Freeze immediately. Reseal and return to the freezer after use.\n* **Blue Majik\u00ae:** Store at room temperature, reseal in an airtight bag after use\n\n**MALK Organic Almond Milk:** Store at room temperature. Refrigerate after opening.\n\n**Disclaimer:** *The Erewhon Smoothie Kit is perishable and must remain correctly stored to ensure\nthe highest level of ingredient quality and food safety. Therefore, it is important that you follow\nthe storage instructions immediately after delivery. *\n\n**Warning: **Box contains dry ice. Avoid direct skin contact as it can cause burns. To dispose of\ndry ice, follow these precautions:\n* **Do not throw it in the trash, sink, or toilet.** Dry ice sublimates (turns directly from solid\nto gas) and can cause pipes or containers to crack or even explode if sealed.\n* **Choose a well-ventilated area.** Place the dry ice in an open space with plenty of airflow.\nNever dispose of it in a small, closed room or car\u2014it releases carbon dioxide gas, which can\ndisplace oxygen.\n* **Let it sublimate naturally.** Put the dry ice in a sturdy, open container (like a cooler or\nmetal bowl) and simply leave it at room temperature. It will gradually disappear as it turns into\ngas.\n* **Handle with care.** Always use insulated gloves or tongs when touching dry ice\u2014it can cause\nsevere frostbite.\n\nRead more\n\nRecommended:\n\n[hailey bieber smoothie]\n][59]\n\nStrawberry Glaze Skin Smoothie Kit | Makes 4 Smoothies\n\n$100.00\n\n][60]\nAdd\n[Erewhon Kefir Soda Passion Fruit Orange Guava (POG) 6-Pack \u2013 tropical probiotic sparkling drink,\nsupports gut health, vibrant passion fruit, orange, and guava flavor]\n][61]\n\nKefir Soda Passion Fruit Orange Guava (POG) | 6-Pack\n\n$35.00\n\n][62]\nAdd\n[Erewhon -Organic Chocolate Macaroon]\n][63]\n\nChocolate Macaroon\n\n$21.00\n\n][64]\nAdd\nFAQs\n\n### What if I'm not making my smoothies right away?\n\nPlease adhere to the following storage guidelines:\n\n**Coconut Cloud Organic Fruit Blend:** Freeze immediately, use within 180 days.\n\n**Organic Coconut Cream: **Freeze immediately, use within 180 days.\n\n**MALK Shelf Life:** Shelf stable for up to 180 days. Refrigerate after opening and enjoy within\n7-10 days of opening for optimal flavor.\n\n### Questions or Feedback?\n\nVisit [erewhon.com/smoothie-kit-feedback][65] to give us feedback on your Erewhon Smoothie Kit\nexperience.\n\n### Perishable\n\nThe Erewhon Smoothie Kit is perishable and must remain correctly stored to ensure the highest level\nof ingredient quality and food safety. Therefore, it is important that you follow the storage\ninstructions immediately after delivery.\n\nAbout us\n\n### Our Story\n\nFamily-owned since 1968, Erewhon is Certified Organic Grocer & Certified B Corp. We\u2019re dedicated to\nnutrient-dense foods, local farms, and uncompromising quality that fosters a community of care and\npositive change.\n\n### Our Standards\n\nWe source organic, biodynamic, and regenerative products that honor the planet, support local farms,\nand nourish our community. Our protein is grass-fed, cage-free, and ethically raised, and our\nseafood is sustainably sourced and kept fresh without chemicals.\n\n### Our Commitment\n\nWe champion fair trade, fair wages, and eco-conscious practices. From low-impact packaging to\nsustainable household and beauty products, we partner with businesses and organizations that share\nour mission of creating a healthier planet.\n* Recommended\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][66]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscri