            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][2]\n[Account ][3]\nCart 0\n][4]\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][5]\n[ Shop ][6]\n[ ACCESSORIES ][7] [ BEST SELLERS ][8] [ BEVERAGES ][9] [ GIFT SETS ][10] [ GROCERY ][11] [ HOME &\nBODY ][12] [ NEW ARRIVALS ][13] [ SMOOTHIE ][14] [ WELLNESS ][15]\n[ About ][16]\n[ Our Story ][17] [ FAQs ][18] [ Locations ][19] [ Manage Subscription ][20]\n[Account ][21]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\nCart 0\n][22]\nShop Show menu\nExit menu Shop\n[ ACCESSORIES ][23]\n[ BEST SELLERS ][24]\n[ BEVERAGES ][25]\n[ GIFT SETS ][26]\n[ GROCERY ][27]\n[ HOME & BODY ][28]\n[ NEW ARRIVALS ][29]\n[ SMOOTHIE ][30]\n[ WELLNESS ][31]\nAbout Show menu\nExit menu [ About ][32]\n[ Our Story ][33]\n[ FAQs ][34]\n[ Locations ][35]\n[ Manage Subscription ][36]\n\n### BASKET 0\n\nAdd order notes\nLeave a note about your order\n\n##### Sorry, looks like we don't have enough of this product.\n\nPair with\nSubtotal Free\nCheck Out\n*Shipping, taxes, and discount codes are calculated at checkout*\n\nYour Cart is Empty\n\n[ Shop ][37]\n[ About ][38]\n[A clear glass food storage container with a lid, featuring the brand name 'EREWHON' and the phrase\n'HELP SAVE OUR PLANET' on the lid.]\n[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers]\n[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers]\n[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers]\n[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers]\n[[A clear glass food storage container with a lid, featuring the brand name 'EREWHON' and the phrase\n'HELP SAVE OUR PLANET' on the lid.] ][39]\n[[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers] ][40]\n[[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers] ][41]\n[[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers] ][42]\n[[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers] ][43]\n[A clear glass food storage container with a lid, featuring the brand name 'EREWHON' and the phrase\n'HELP SAVE OUR PLANET' on the lid.]\n[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers]\n[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers]\n[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers]\n[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers]\n[[A clear glass food storage container with a lid, featuring the brand name 'EREWHON' and the phrase\n'HELP SAVE OUR PLANET' on the lid.] ][44]\n[[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers] ][45]\n[[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers] ][46]\n[[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers] ][47]\n[[Erewhon -Erewhon Large Glass Storage Containers] ][48]\n[Home][49] Erewhon Glass Storage Containers | Large\n\n# Glass Storage Containers | Large\n\nRegular price $16.00\nUnit price / per\n[Shipping][50] calculated at checkout.\n{\"in_cart_html\"=>\" {{ quantity }} in cart\",\n\"decrease\"=>\"Decrease quantity for {{ product }}\", \"multiples_of\"=>\"Increments of {{ quantity }}\",\n\"minimum_of\"=>\"Minimum of {{ quantity }}\", \"maximum_of\"=>\"Maximum of {{ quantity }}\"} (0 in cart)\n* [ 1 ][51]\n* [ 2 ][52]\n* [ 3 ][53]\n* [ 4 ][54]\n* [ 5 ][55]\n* [ 6 ][56]\n* [ 7 ][57]\n* [ 8 ][58]\n* [ 9 ][59]\n* [ 10 + ][60]\nDecrease quantity for Glass Storage Containers | Large Increase button quantity - Glass Storage\nContainers | Large\">\nAdd to cart$16.00\n* Description\n* Erewhon Home Products\n* Care\nSee All See All\n\nIntroducing the Erewhon Glass Food Storage Container, featuring our large single-compartment model.\nThis elegantly designed container measures 8.75\" x 6.5\" x 2\", providing ample space for storing a\nvariety of foods. Crafted from high-quality, eco-friendly glass, it showcases both practicality and\na commitment to sustainability.\n\nRead more\n\nErewhon offers premium home products crafted from the finest materials that are eco-friendly,\nsustainable, and ethically made. Discover top-sellers for every room and elevate your home.\n\nRead more\n\nTo clean, use plastic or nylon non-scratch sponges with water and detergent. For tough, baked-on\nfood, soak the glass first, then gently scrub with non-scratch materials.\n\nRead more\n\nRecommended:\n\n[Black Erewhon tote bag with the brand name 'EREWHON' printed in white on the front.]\n][61]\n\nShopper Bag | Black\n\n$60.00\n\n][62]Out of stock\n\n#### Glass Storage Containers | Large\n\n$16.00\nAdd to cart\nOUR STORY\n[PRODUCE_WALL_01]\n\n### The Erewhon Standard\n\nErewhon prioritizes organic, pesticide-free produce, non-GMO, and non-irradiated foods. It demands\ngrass-fed, cage-free proteins adhering to animal welfare practices and ensures seafood is\nsustainably sourced. It supports regenerative, biodynamic farming for soil health, biodiversity, and\nsustainability.\n\nEmphasis is placed on seasonal, locally sourced goods to minimize carbon emissions, and the\nimportance of family-owned farms is recognized, all underpinned by stringent certifications.\n\n### About Erewhon\n\nErewhon, a Certified Organic Retailer and Certified B Corp, has maintained an unwavering commitment\nsince the late 1960s to provide foods and products that significantly impact our customers' lives.\n\nIt transcends the traditional grocery store role, fostering a community united by a passion for\npure, healthful products that safeguard both human health and the environment.\n\n[EREWHON_FARMS_R5_3]\n\n### We Support\n\nWe champion fair-trade practices and fair wages, ensuring all products are ethically sourced. Our\ncommitment extends to low-impact packaging and supporting eco-conscious businesses, alongside a\nselection of green household, skin, and beauty products.\n\nWe pride ourselves on collaborating with neighbors and organizations that share our mission of being\na force for good on the planet.\n\nErewhon\n\n## Reusable & Dishwasher Safe\n\nErewhon Glass Food Storage Containers come in three convenient sizes, combining style with a\ncommitment to sustainability. These eco-friendly, durable containers are reusable, dishwasher safe,\nand designed for everyday practicality.\n\nThe lids feature the message **\"Help Save Our Planet,\"** representing a strong environmental focus,\nmaking them an excellent choice for anyone passionate about sustainable living\n\n[ Shop Home Products][63]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Fridge Organizer and Storage\n\nTransform your refrigerator into an orderly haven with these neatly stackable containers, optimizing\nfridge space.\n\nTheir clear, sturdy glass construction ensures visibility for efficient organization and easy\naccess. Ideal for a clutter-free, eco-friendly kitchen, they promote smart storage and sustainable\nliving.\n\n[ Shop Pantry Items][64]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Save Your Next Meal\n\nErewhon's Glass Food Storage Containers, available in three sizes, align with our eco-conscious\nmission by optimizing fridge space and minimizing clutter.\n\nTheir clear, durable glass design ensures easy content visibility and access, perfect for portion\ncontrol and diverse meals. Stackable and eco-friendly, they embody sustainable living, reflecting a\ncommitment to environmental stewardship in every organized, efficient kitchen.\n\n[ Shop Best Sellers][65]\nFAQ\n\n### Does my Erewhon membership apply to my order?\n\nErewhon memberships do not apply for Shopify orders. No loyalty points will be accrued for your\norder, nor can loyalty points be redeemed on the Shopify platform.\n\n### When will my order ship?\n\nOrders ship within 1 day after your order has been placed.\n\nAll perishable orders are shipped by 2-day air from Monday through Wednesday, before 1 pm PST. This\nensures that your products arrive in optimal condition. Please refrigerate your items immediately\nonce received.\n\n### How can I get a refund?\n\nAll sales are final and refunds are not accepted.\n\n### How long does it take to receive my order?\n\nFor UPS ground, orders are received within 3-5 business days.\n\nFor UPS Express: 2 business days. And for overnight, the next business day.\n\nShipping\n\n### International shipping\n\nWe currently ship to Canada & the U.K. More locations to come!\n\n### Order tracking\n\nTracking info will be emailed as soon as your order has been shipped.\n\n### Get in touch\n\nPlease email [shopify@enfmkt.com][66] for any questions about your order.\n* Related products\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][67]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscribed!*\nJoin\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][68] and [Terms of Service][69]\napply.\n\nMain menu\n* [Shop][70]\n* [About][71]\nContact\n\nOrder Related Inquiries: [ship@erewhon.com][72]\n\nGeneral Inquiries: [customerservice@erewhon.com][73]\n\n## Currency\n\n[India] USD $\n* [[Afghanistan] Afghanistan (USD $) ][74]\n* [[\u00c5land Islands] \u00c5land Islands (USD $) ][75]\n* [[Albania] Albania (USD $) ][76]\n* [[Algeria] Algeria (USD $) ][77]\n* [[Andorra] Andorra (USD $) ][78]\n* [[Angola] Angola (USD $) ][79]\n* [[Anguilla] Anguilla (USD $) ][80]\n* [[Antigua &amp; Barbuda] Antigua & Barbuda (USD $) ][81]\n* [[Argentina] Argentina (USD $) ][82]\n* [[Armenia] Armenia (USD $) ][83]\n* [[Aruba] Aruba (USD $) ][84]\n* [[Ascension Island] Ascension Island (USD $) ][85]\n* [[Australia] Australia (USD $) ][86]\n* [[Austria] Austria (USD $) ][87]\n* [[Azerbaijan] Azerbaijan (USD $) ][88]\n* [[Bahamas] Bahamas (USD $) ][89]\n* [[Bahrain] Bahrain (USD $) ][90]\n* [[Bangladesh] Bangladesh (USD $) ][91]\n* [[Barbados] Barbados (USD $) ][92]\n* [[Belarus] Belarus (USD $) ][93]\n* [[Belgium] Belgium (USD $) ][94]\n* [[Belize] Belize (USD $) ][95]\n* [[Benin] Benin (USD $) ][96]\n* [[Bermuda] Bermuda (USD $) ][97]\n* [[Bhutan] Bhutan (USD $) ][98]\n* [[Bolivia] Bolivia (USD $) ][99]\n* [[Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina] Bosnia & Herzegovina (USD $) ][100]\n* [[Botswana] Botswana (USD $) ][101]\n* [[Brazil] Brazil (USD $) ][102]\n* [[Briti