            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][2]\n[Account ][3]\nCart 0\n][4]\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][5]\n[ Shop ][6]\n[ ACCESSORIES ][7] [ BEST SELLERS ][8] [ BEVERAGES ][9] [ GIFT SETS ][10] [ GROCERY ][11] [ HOME &\nBODY ][12] [ NEW ARRIVALS ][13] [ SMOOTHIE ][14] [ WELLNESS ][15]\n[ About ][16]\n[ Our Story ][17] [ FAQs ][18] [ Locations ][19] [ Manage Subscription ][20]\n[Account ][21]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\nCart 0\n][22]\nShop Show menu\nExit menu Shop\n[ ACCESSORIES ][23]\n[ BEST SELLERS ][24]\n[ BEVERAGES ][25]\n[ GIFT SETS ][26]\n[ GROCERY ][27]\n[ HOME & BODY ][28]\n[ NEW ARRIVALS ][29]\n[ SMOOTHIE ][30]\n[ WELLNESS ][31]\nAbout Show menu\nExit menu [ About ][32]\n[ Our Story ][33]\n[ FAQs ][34]\n[ Locations ][35]\n[ Manage Subscription ][36]\n\n### BASKET 0\n\nAdd order notes\nLeave a note about your order\n\n##### Sorry, looks like we don't have enough of this product.\n\nPair with\nSubtotal Free\nCheck Out\n*Shipping, taxes, and discount codes are calculated at checkout*\n\nYour Cart is Empty\n\n[ Shop ][37]\n[ About ][38]\n[Erewhon Kefir Soda Ginger 6-Pack \u2013 probiotic sparkling drink with bold ginger flavor, supports gut\nhealth and digestion, small-batch crafted]\n[Erewhon Kefir Soda Ginger 6-Pack \u2013 probiotic sparkling drink with bold ginger flavor, supports gut\nhealth and digestion, small-batch crafted]\n[Home][39] Erewhon Kefir Soda Ginger | 6-pack\n\n# Kefir Soda Ginger | 6-pack\n\nRegular price $35.00\nUnit price / per\n[Shipping][40] calculated at checkout.\n{\"in_cart_html\"=>\" {{ quantity }} in cart\",\n\"decrease\"=>\"Decrease quantity for {{ product }}\", \"multiples_of\"=>\"Increments of {{ quantity }}\",\n\"minimum_of\"=>\"Minimum of {{ quantity }}\", \"maximum_of\"=>\"Maximum of {{ quantity }}\"} (0 in cart)\n* [ 1 ][41]\n* [ 2 ][42]\n* [ 3 ][43]\n* [ 4 ][44]\n* [ 5 ][45]\n* [ 6 ][46]\n* [ 7 ][47]\n* [ 8 ][48]\n* [ 9 ][49]\n* [ 10 + ][50]\nDecrease quantity for Kefir Soda Ginger | 6-pack Increase button quantity - Kefir Soda Ginger |\n6-pack\">\nAdd to cart$35.00\n* Description\n* Erewhon Beverages\n* Care\nSee All See All\n\nRefresh your palate with Erewhon's Kefir Soda Ginger. This six-pack offers a zesty blend of artesian\nspring water and kefir cultures, creating an effervescent, gut-friendly beverage. Each bottle is\nnaturally sweetened with a sharp ginger flavor that delivers a refreshing kick. Packed with 24\nprobiotic strains, it supports a healthy microbiome, enhancing digestive wellness.\n\nCompletely free from refined sugars and artificial additives, this drink is a healthy choice. Place\nyour orders before 1 pm PST, Monday through Wednesday, for 2-day air shipping to ensure optimal\nfreshness. Remember to refrigerate immediately upon arrival.\n\n**Orders ship from Monday through Wednesday** **by 2-day air. Please refrigerate upon delivery.**\n\nRead more\n\nExplore the hand-picked selection from the Erewhon Beverage wall, designed to quench your thirst\nwith a sip of delightful and nutritious refreshment.\n\nOur range includes everything from invigorating non-alcoholic drinks to naturally fermented Kefir\nsoda, each crafted to offer a unique taste experience.\n\nRead more\n\nPlease refrigerate Erewhon Kefir Soda and Erewhon Kombucha immediately upon delivery to preserve\nfreshness, flavor, and active live cultures.\n\nRead more\n\nRecommended:\n\n[Erewhon Wide Mouth Stainless Steel Bottle, 32 oz]\n][51]\n\nWide Mouth Stainless Steel Bottle - 32 oz\n\n$58.00\n\n][52]\nAdd\n\n#### Kefir Soda Ginger | 6-pack\n\n$35.00\nAdd to cart\nOUR STORY\n[PRODUCE_WALL_01]\n\n### The Erewhon Standard\n\nEverything at Erewhon has been curated to support your health journey. As a Certified Organic\nGrocer, we seek out organic, biodynamic, and regenerative products that respect the planet, nourish\nour community, and support local farms.\n\nIn our Protein department, we stock grass-fed, cage-free products that adhere to animal welfare\npractices. Our seafood is sustainably sourced and packaged with cold chain technology to ensure\nfreshness without chemicals or unnatural preservatives.\n\n### About Erewhon\n\nErewhon is an independent, family-owned Certified B Corp and Certified Organic Retailer with 10\nlocations across Southern California. Since 1968, we\u2019ve been providing organic, ethically-sourced\nfoods to our community.\n\nWe\u2019re committed to sourcing healthy, nutrient-dense products, backing local growers and brands, and\nsupporting the environment.\n\nRecognized for our uncompromising quality standards and customer service, we sustain a community\ncentered in caring, curiosity, and positive change.\n\n[EREWHON_FARMS_R5_3]\n\n### We Support\n\nWe pride ourselves on collaborating with partners who share our mission of being a force for good on\nthe planet.\n\nBy championing fair-trade practices and fair wages, we ensure that all of our products are ethically\nsourced.\n\nWe give preference to items with stringent third-party certifications, including:\n\n[KEFIR-SODA_ALL_1] [KEFIR-SODA_ALL_1]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Kefir Soda\n\nErewhon Kefir Soda is packed with probiotics and yeasts to support a healthy microbiome. Each can\ncontains Artesian spring water, active Kefir cultures, and cold-pressed juices for an effervescent\ndrink with zero refined sugars.\n\nAvailable in five refreshing flavors: POG, Green Apple Jasmine, Watermelon Lime, Ginger, and Peaches\n& Cream.\n\n[ SHOP KEFIR SODA][53]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Beverages\n\nQuench your thirst with our collection of flavor-forward beverages. Made with natural ingredients so\nyou can feel good about what you\u2019re sipping**.**\n\n[ Shop Beverages][54]\n[MALIBU_LIFESTYLE_1638] [MALIBU_LIFESTYLE_1638]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Best Sellers\n\nA curated selection of our favorite foods and wellness products\u2014from wildcrafted sea moss to\nnutritional supplements.\n\n[ Shop Now][55]\nFAQ\n\n### Does my Erewhon membership apply to my order?\n\nErewhon memberships do not apply for Shopify orders. No loyalty points will be accrued for your\norder, nor can loyalty points be redeemed on the Shopify platform.\n\n### When will my order ship?\n\nOrders ship within 1 day after your order has been placed.\n\nAll perishable orders are shipped by 2-day air from Monday through Wednesday, before 1 pm PST. This\nensures that your products arrive in optimal condition. Please refrigerate your items immediately\nonce received.\n\n### How can I get a refund?\n\nAll sales are final and refunds are not accepted.\n\n### How long does it take to receive my order?\n\nFor UPS ground, orders are received within 3-5 business days.\n\nFor UPS Express: 2 business days. And for overnight, the next business day.\n\nShipping\n\n### International shipping\n\nWe currently ship to Canada & the U.K. More locations to come!\n\n### Order tracking\n\nTracking info will be emailed as soon as your order has been shipped.\n\n### Get in touch\n\nPlease email [shopify@enfmkt.com][56] for any questions about your order.\n* Related products\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][57]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscribed!*\nJoin\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][58] and [Terms of Service][59]\napply.\n\nMain menu\n* [Shop][60]\n* [About][61]\nContact\n\nOrder Related Inquiries: [ship@erewhon.com][62]\n\nGeneral Inquiries: [customerservice@erewhon.com][63]\n\n## Currency\n\n[India] USD $\n* [[Afghanistan] Afghanistan (USD $) ][64]\n* [[\u00c5land Islands] \u00c5land Islands (USD $) ][65]\n* [[Albania] Albania (USD $) ][66]\n* [[Algeria] Algeria (USD $) ][67]\n* [[Andorra] Andorra (USD $) ][68]\n* [[Angola] Angola (USD $) ][69]\n* [[Anguilla] Anguilla (USD $) ][70]\n* [[Antigua &amp; Barbuda] Antigua & Barbuda (USD $)