            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][2]\n[Account ][3]\nCart 0\n][4]\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][5]\n[ Shop ][6]\n[ ACCESSORIES ][7] [ BEST SELLERS ][8] [ BEVERAGES ][9] [ GIFT SETS ][10] [ GROCERY ][11] [ HOME &\nBODY ][12] [ NEW ARRIVALS ][13] [ SMOOTHIE ][14] [ WELLNESS ][15]\n[ About ][16]\n[ Our Story ][17] [ FAQs ][18] [ Locations ][19] [ Manage Subscription ][20]\n[Account ][21]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\nCart 0\n][22]\nShop Show menu\nExit menu Shop\n[ ACCESSORIES ][23]\n[ BEST SELLERS ][24]\n[ BEVERAGES ][25]\n[ GIFT SETS ][26]\n[ GROCERY ][27]\n[ HOME & BODY ][28]\n[ NEW ARRIVALS ][29]\n[ SMOOTHIE ][30]\n[ WELLNESS ][31]\nAbout Show menu\nExit menu [ About ][32]\n[ Our Story ][33]\n[ FAQs ][34]\n[ Locations ][35]\n[ Manage Subscription ][36]\n\n### BASKET 0\n\nAdd order notes\nLeave a note about your order\n\n##### Sorry, looks like we don't have enough of this product.\n\nPair with\nSubtotal Free\nCheck Out\n*Shipping, taxes, and discount codes are calculated at checkout*\n\nYour Cart is Empty\n\n[ Shop ][37]\n[ About ][38]\n[Erewhon Jar of Organic Chicken Bone Broth]\n[[Erewhon Jar of Organic Chicken Bone Broth] ][39]\n[Home][40] Erewhon Chicken Bone Broth - Shipped\n\n# Chicken Bone Broth\n\nRegular price $50.00\nUnit price / per\n[Shipping][41] calculated at checkout.\n\nOur seasonal sale ends soon\n\n**00** Days\n**05** Hours\n**58** Minutes\n**04** Seconds\nSize\nBuild Your 2 Pack\nBuild Your 2 Pack Variant sold out or unavailable\nChoose Flavors:\n[Gingersnap]\nBeef Bone Broth\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nChicken Bone Broth\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nChicken Noodle Soup\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nChicken Soup\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nChicken Vegetable Soup\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nLentil Soup\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nRoasted Chicken Bone Broth\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nMighty Greens Soup\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nTurkey Chili\n- 0 +\n{\"in_cart_html\"=>\" {{ quantity }} in cart\",\n\"decrease\"=>\"Decrease quantity for {{ product }}\", \"multiples_of\"=>\"Increments of {{ quantity }}\",\n\"minimum_of\"=>\"Minimum of {{ quantity }}\", \"maximum_of\"=>\"Maximum of {{ quantity }}\"} (0 in cart)\n* [ 1 ][42]\n* [ 2 ][43]\n* [ 3 ][44]\n* [ 4 ][45]\n* [ 5 ][46]\n* [ 6 ][47]\n* [ 7 ][48]\n* [ 8 ][49]\n* [ 9 ][50]\n* [ 10 + ][51]\nDecrease quantity for Chicken Bone Broth Increase button quantity - Chicken Bone Broth\">\nAdd to cart$50.00\n\nErewhon Chicken Bone Broth, offered in a 32 oz container it brings a foundational layer of richness\nand nutrients to your culinary creations. Made with filtered water, chicken bones, and a harmonious\nblend of vegetables and herbs, it's seasoned to perfection with sea salt and black pepper. This\nbroth enriches meals with its depth of flavor, serving as a versatile and nourishing ingredient for\nsoups, stews, or simply enjoyed on its own.\n\nIngredients: Filtered water, organic chicken bones, organic onion, organic carrot, organic celery,\norganic parsley, organic garlic, sea salt, organic black pepper.\n\nRead more\n\nRecommended:\n\n[Erewhon Liposomal Vitamin C]\n][52]\n\nLiposomal Vitamin C | Citrus Vanilla (30 ct)\n\n$74.00\n\n][53]\nAdd\n\nShipped 2-day air from Monday - Wednesday before 1 pm PST.\n\n[{\"variant_id\":\"44354411233418\" , \"preorder\":\"false\" , \"final_sale\":\"\"}]\n\n### DESCRIPTION\n\nErewhon Organic Chicken Bone Broth\n\nErewhon Organic Chicken Bone Broth, offered in a 32 oz container with a 30-day shelf life, brings a\nfoundational layer of richness and nutrients to your culinary creations. Made with filtered water,\norganic chicken bones, and a harmonious blend of organic vegetables and herbs, it's seasoned to\nperfection with sea salt and organic black pepper. This broth enriches meals with its depth of\nflavor, serving as a versatile and nourishing ingredient for soups, stews, or simply enjoyed on its\nown.\n\nIngredients: Filtered water, organic chicken bones, organic onion, organic carrot, organic celery,\norganic parsley, organic garlic, sea salt, organic black pepper.\n\n30-Day Shelf Life\n\nErewhon Soup, with a 30-day shelf life, should be refrigerated at 35-40\u00b0F upon receipt to maintain\nits organic taste and nutritional value for optimal enjoyment.\n\nShipping Monday - Wednesday\n\nAll perishable orders are shipped by 2-day air from Monday through Wednesday, before 1 pm PST. This\nensures that your products arrive in optimal condition. Please refrigerate your items immediately\nonce received.\n\n[Erewhon - SOUP_ASSORTED_LIFESTYLE_4_2] [Erewhon - SOUP_ASSORTED_LIFESTYLE_4_2]\n\nEREWHON SOUP\n\n## Pure Ingredients, Pure Pleasure\n\nErewhon brings you a range of organic soups that stand testament to the purity of nature and the joy\nof eating well. Crafted with care and cooked slowly to preserve flavor and nutrition, our soups\noffer a wholesome escape to those who appreciate the finer, simpler things in life. Indulge in the\nvariety, from Bone Broths to Vegetable Soups, each sip promising a return to natural goodness.\n\n[ Shop Soup][54]\n\nEREWHON SOUP\n\n## Nourish with Comfort and Authenticity\n\nEmbrace the comfort of home with Erewhon's Organic Soups. Blending organic ingredients with soulful\nrecipes, our soups are a return to what truly matters in food: authenticity, nutrition, and taste.\nFrom the heartening embrace of Chicken Matzo Ball Soup to the enriching goodness of our Vegetable\nBroth, each variant is a warm invitation to moments of serenity and satisfaction.\n\n[ SHOP BEST SELLERS][55]\n[SOUP_ASSORTED_LIFESTYLE_5] [SOUP_ASSORTED_LIFESTYLE_5]\n[SOUP_ASSORTED_LIFESTYLE_1] [SOUP_ASSORTED_LIFESTYLE_1]\n\nEREWHON SOUP\n\n## A Symphony of Organic Flavors\n\nDiscover the genuine taste of simplicity and wholesomeness with Erewhon's Organic Soup Collection.\nOur soups, from the nourishing depth of bone broths to the heartwarming richness of classic recipes,\nare meticulously prepared using only the finest organic ingredients. Each spoonful is a celebration\nof nature's best, crafted to bring comfort and joy to your dining experience.\n\n[ SHOP SOUP][56]\nOUR STORY\n[PRODUCE_WALL_01]\n\n### The Erewhon Standard\n\nErewhon prioritizes organic, pesticide-free produce, non-GMO, and non-irradiated foods. It demands\ngrass-fed, cage-free proteins adhering to animal welfare practices and ensures seafood is\nsustainably sourced. It supports regenerative, biodynamic farming for soil health, biodiversity, and\nsustainability.\n\nEmphasis is placed on seasonal, locally sourced goods to minimize carbon emissions, and the\nimportance of family-owned farms is recognized, all underpinned by stringent certifications.\n\n[Erewhon_Studio_City1_Carlos_R]\n\n### About Erewhon\n\nErewhon, a Certified Organic Retailer and Certified B Corp, has maintained an unwavering commitment\nsince the late 1960s to provide foods and products that significantly impact our customers' lives.\n\nIt transcends the traditional grocery store role, fostering a community united by a passion for\npure, healthful products that safeguard both human health and the environment.\n\n[EREWHON_FARMS_R5_3]\n\n### We Support\n\nWe champion fair-trade practices and fair wages, ensuring all products are ethically sourced. Our\ncommitment extends to low-impact packaging and supporting eco-conscious businesses, alongside a\nselection of green household, skin, and beauty products.\n\nWe pride ourselves on collaborating with neighbors and organizations that share our mission of being\na force for good on the planet.\n* Related products\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][57]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscribed!*\nJoin\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][58] and [Terms of Service][59]\napply.\n\nMain menu\n* [Shop][60]\n* [About][61]\nContac