den Sol Sea Moss Gel\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nNeptune Blue Sea Moss Gel\n- 0 +\n[Gingersnap]\nCosmic Berry Sea Moss Gel\n- 0 +\n{\"in_cart_html\"=>\" {{ quantity }} in cart\",\n\"decrease\"=>\"Decrease quantity for {{ product }}\", \"multiples_of\"=>\"Increments of {{ quantity }}\",\n\"minimum_of\"=>\"Minimum of {{ quantity }}\", \"maximum_of\"=>\"Maximum of {{ quantity }}\"} (0 in cart)\n* [ 1 ][45]\n* [ 2 ][46]\n* [ 3 ][47]\n* [ 4 ][48]\n* [ 5 ][49]\n* [ 6 ][50]\n* [ 7 ][51]\n* [ 8 ][52]\n* [ 9 ][53]\n* [ 10 + ][54]\nDecrease quantity for Cosmic Berry Sea Moss Gel Increase button quantity - Cosmic Berry Sea Moss\nGel\">\nAdd to cart$88.00\n\nHarvested from the pristine waters of the Caribbean, Erewhon Sea Moss is a vegan, gluten-free source\nof antioxidants & essential minerals. Through the Full Spectrum Process, in which the algae is\nslowly dried in shade rooms, each harvest maintains its natural nutrients and colors.\n\nOur Cosmic Berry formula is powered by elderberries and aronia berries, with notes of warm cinnamon\n& spice.\n\n*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not\nintended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.*\n\nRead more\n\nRecommended:\n\n[Erewhon Liposomal Vitamin C]\n][55]\n\nLiposomal Vitamin C | Citrus Vanilla (30 ct)\n\n$74.00\n\n][56]\nAdd\n\nShipped 2-day air from Monday - Wednesday before 1 pm PST.\n\n[{\"variant_id\":\"43248569712778\" , \"preorder\":\"false\" ,\n\"final_sale\":\"\"},{\"variant_id\":\"43254335701130\" , \"preorder\":\"false\" , \"final_sale\":\"\"}]\n\n### DESCRIPTION\n\nCosmic Berry Sea Moss Gel\n\nHarnesses the incredible benefits of elderberry and other potent herbs such as star anise, rose\nhips, ginger, and cloves to fortify your immune system with our Erewhon Cosmic Berry Sea Moss Gel.\n\nInfused with reverse osmosis water and lime, this superfood tonic can be seamlessly incorporated\ninto your wellness routine, offering a natural boost to health and well-being.\n\nErewhon Wellness Products\n\nEnhance your path to well-being with Erewhon Wellness Products. Our meticulously curated collection\noffers a harmonious blend of natural, organic, and non-toxic choices, designed to nurture both body\nand mind. Dive into a radiant lifestyle, where every product reflects our commitment to genuine\nhealth and holistic wellness.\n\nShipping Monday - Wednesday\n\nAll perishable orders are shipped by 2-day air from Monday through Wednesday, before 1 pm PST. This\nensures that your products arrive in optimal condition. Please refrigerate your items immediately\nonce received.\n\nHow to use?\n\nConsume 1-3 tablespoons of gel 1x daily by itself or in your favorite recipes.\n\n[Our_Sea_Moss_sourced_from_St] [Our_Sea_Moss_sourced_from_St]\n\nZero Preservatives\n\n## Erewhon Sea Moss Gel\n\nErewhon's Full Spectrum Sea Moss is a game-changer in holistic wellness. Why? It harnesses the power\nof the full spectrum, meaning you reap the benefits of Purple, Gold, and Green Sea Moss, all grown\nand harvested together.\n\nThis unique blend not only offers the inherent advantages of Sea Moss but also introduces the potent\nantioxidants of anthocyanins, commonly found in purple foods like blueberries and black rice.\n\nChoose Erewhon's Full Spectrum Sea Moss for a comprehensive approach to well-being.\n\n[ SHOP BEST SELLERS][57]\n\nEREWHON SEA MOSS GEL\n\n## What Makes Our Sea Moss Special?\n\nOur Sea Moss, sourced from St. Lucia's pristine waters, is special due to its \"Genus Gracilaria\"\nvariety, a multi-colored full spectrum blend of Purple, Gold, and Green Sea Moss.\n\nWild-harvested and carefully dried, it retains natural color and phytonutrients. The Full Spectrum\nprocess ensures high antioxidants, including anthocyanins found in berries, and a boost of\nChlorophyll.\n\nThis unique combination offers a plethora of essential vitamins and minerals.\n\n[ SHOP WELLNESS PRODUCTS][58]\n[sea_moss_gel_group_falling] [sea_moss_gel_group_falling]\n[Erewhon - Sea_Moss_Group_1] [Erewhon - Sea_Moss_Group_1]\n\nEREWHON SEA MOSS GEL\n\n## Zero Preservatives\n\nErewhon Sea Moss Gel stands out with its commitment to purity, containing zero preservatives and\nbinders.\n\nBy avoiding binders like gluten and polysorbate, the product remains untainted and closer to its\nnatural state. This not only ensures a genuine sea moss experience but also reduces potential\nallergens and additives.\n\nChoosing Erewhon means embracing a cleaner, more natural wellness journey, free from unnecessary and\npotentially harmful additives.\n\n[ SHOP WELLNESS PRODUCTS][59]\nOUR STORY\n[PRODUCE_WALL_01]\n\n### The Erewhon Standard\n\nErewhon prioritizes organic, pesticide-free produce, non-GMO, and non-irradiated foods. It demands\ngrass-fed, cage-free proteins adhering to animal welfare practices and ensures seafood is\nsustainably sourced. It supports regenerative, biodynamic farming for soil health, biodiversity, and\nsustainability.\n\nEmphasis is placed on seasonal, locally sourced goods to minimize carbon emissions, and the\nimportance of family-owned farms is recognized, all underpinned by stringent certifications.\n\n[Erewhon_Studio_City1_Carlos_R]\n\n### About Erewhon\n\nErewhon, a Certified Organic Retailer and Certified B Corp, has maintained an unwavering commitment\nsince the late 1960s to provide foods and products that significantly impact our customers' lives.\n\nIt transcends the traditional grocery store role, fostering a community united by a passion for\npure, healthful products that safeguard both human health and the environment.\n\n[EREWHON_FARMS_R5_3]\n\n### We Support\n\nWe champion fair-trade practices and fair wages, ensuring all products are ethically sourced. Our\ncommitment extends to low-impact packaging and supporting eco-conscious businesses, alongside a\nselection of green household, skin, and beauty products.\n\nWe pride ourselves on collaborating with neighbors and organizations that share our mission of being\na force for good on the planet.\n* Related products\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][60]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscribed!*\nJoin\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][61] and [Terms of Service][62]\napply.\n\nMain menu\n* [Shop][63]\n* [About][64]\nContact\n\nOrder Related Inquiries: [ship@erewhon.com][65]\n\nGeneral Inquiries: [customerservice@erewhon.com][66]\n\n## Currency\n\n[India] USD $\n* [[Afghanistan] Afghanistan (USD $) ][67]\n* [[\u00c5land Islands] \u00c5land Islands (USD $) ][68]\n* [[Albania] Albania (USD $) ][69]\n* [[Algeria] Algeria (USD $) ][70]\n* [[Andorra] Andorra (USD $) ][71]\n* [[Angola] Angola (USD $) ][72]\n* [[Anguilla] Anguilla (USD $) ][73]\n* [[Antigua &amp; Barbuda] Antigua & Barbuda (USD $) ][74]\n* [[Argentina] Argentina (USD $) ][75]\n* [[Armenia] Armenia (USD $) ][76]\n* [[Aruba] Aruba (USD $) ][77]\n* [[Ascension Island] Ascension Island (USD $) ][78]\n* [[Australia] Australia (USD $) ][79]\n* [[Austria] Austria (USD $) ][80]\n* [[Azerbaijan] Azerbaijan (USD $) ][81]\n* [[Bahamas] Bahamas (USD $) ][82]\n* [[Bahrain] Bahrain (USD $) ][83]\n* [[Bangladesh] Bangladesh (USD $) ][84]\n* [[Barbados] Barbados (USD $) ][85]\n* [[Belarus] Belarus (USD $) ][86]\n* [[Belgium] Belgium (USD $) ][87]\n* [[Belize] Belize (USD $) ][88]\n* [[Benin] Benin (USD $) ][89]\n* [[Bermuda] Bermuda (USD $) ][90]\n* [[Bhutan] Bhutan (USD $) ][91]\n* [[Bolivia] Bolivia (USD $) ][92]\n* [[Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina] Bosnia & Herzegovina (USD $) ][93]\n* [[Botswana] Botswana (USD $) ][94]\n* [[Brazil] Brazil (USD $) ][95]\n* [[British Indian Ocean Territory] British Indian Ocean Territory (USD $) ][96]\n* [[British Virgin Islands] British Virgin Islands (USD $) ][97]\n* [[Brunei] Brunei (USD $) ][98]\n* [[Bulgaria] Bulgaria (USD $) ][99]\n* [[Burkina Faso] Burkina Faso (USD 