n* [ 9 ][49]\n* [ 10 + ][50]\nDecrease quantity for Erewhon E-Gift Card (For Online Orders Only) Increase button quantity -\nErewhon E-Gift Card (For Online Orders Only)\">\nAdd to cart$50.00\n* Description\n* Erewhon Gift Sets\n* Care\nSee All See All\n\nGive friends and family the gift of Erewhon with an online gift card\u2014redeemable exclusively at\nship.erewhon.com. ********\n\n**For our IN-STORE redeemable gift cards, please click [here][51]**\n\nRead more\n\nExplore the unique range of Erewhon specialty gift sets, perfect for any occasion. Each set is\nthoughtfully assembled to match specific interests and needs, from health and wellness to culinary\ndelights and home comfort. These carefully curated collections provide a luxurious and practical way\nto enrich daily life, making them ideal for thoughtful gifts or personal indulgence.\n\nRead more\n\nStore in a cool, dry place.\n\nRead more\n\nRecommended:\n\n[Erewhon Liposomal Glutathione]\n][52]\n\nLiposomal Glutathione | Pineapple Orange (30 ct)\n\n$100.00\n\n][53]\nAdd\n\n#### Erewhon E-Gift Card (For Online Orders Only)\n\n$50.00\nConfigure\nOUR STORY\n[PRODUCE_WALL_01]\n\n### The Erewhon Standard\n\nErewhon prioritizes organic, pesticide-free produce, non-GMO, and non-irradiated foods. It demands\ngrass-fed, cage-free proteins adhering to animal welfare practices and ensures seafood is\nsustainably sourced. It supports regenerative, biodynamic farming for soil health, biodiversity, and\nsustainability.\n\nEmphasis is placed on seasonal, locally sourced goods to minimize carbon emissions, and the\nimportance of family-owned farms is recognized, all underpinned by stringent certifications.\n\n### About Erewhon\n\nErewhon, a Certified Organic Retailer and Certified B Corp, has maintained an unwavering commitment\nsince the late 1960s to provide foods and products that significantly impact our customers' lives.\n\nIt transcends the traditional grocery store role, fostering a community united by a passion for\npure, healthful products that safeguard both human health and the environment.\n\n[EREWHON_FARMS_R5_3]\n\n### We Support\n\nWe champion fair-trade practices and fair wages, ensuring all products are ethically sourced. Our\ncommitment extends to low-impact packaging and supporting eco-conscious businesses, alongside a\nselection of green household, skin, and beauty products.\n\nWe pride ourselves on collaborating with neighbors and organizations that share our mission of being\na force for good on the planet.\n\n[GIFTS_SETS] [GIFTS_SETS]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Bath & Body\n\nNatural, eco-friendly soaps & lotions made with wildcrafted ingredients. Designed to nourish your\nskin: the largest organ in the body.\n\n[ SHOP BATH & BODY][54]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Home Gift Sets\n\nWarm your home with our collection of artisanal soaps, candles, and skincare products. Featuring the\nVetiver Bar Soap, the Moss & Dark Musk Candle, Erewhon Hand & Body Lotion, Erewhon Body Wash, and a\nbundle of Palo Santo to purify any space.\n\n[ Shop Gift Sets][55]\n[GIFTS_SETS-1] [GIFTS_SETS-1]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Best Sellers\n\nA curated selection of our favorite foods and wellness products\u2014from wildcrafted sea moss to\nnutritional supplements.\n\n[ Shop Now][56]\nFAQ\n\n### Does my Erewhon membership apply to my order?\n\nErewhon memberships do not apply for Shopify orders. No loyalty points will be accrued for your\norder, nor can loyalty points be redeemed on the Shopify platform.\n\n### When will my order ship?\n\nOrders ship within 1 day after your order has been placed.\n\nAll perishable orders are shipped by 2-day air from Monday through Wednesday, before 1 pm PST. This\nensures that your products arrive in optimal condition. Please refrigerate your items immediately\nonce received.\n\n### How can I get a refund?\n\nAll sales are final and refunds are not accepted.\n\n### How long does it take to receive my order?\n\nFor UPS ground, orders are received within 3-5 business days.\n\nFor UPS Express: 2 business days. And for overnight, the next business day.\n\nShipping\n\n### International shipping\n\nWe currently ship to Canada & the U.K. More locations to come!\n\n### Order tracking\n\nTracking info will be emailed as soon as your order has been shipped.\n\n### Get in touch\n\nPlease email [shopify@enfmkt.com][57] for any questions about your order.\n* Related products\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][58]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscribed!*\nJoin\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][59] and [Terms of Service][60]\napply.\n\nMain menu\n* [Shop][61]\n* [About][62]\nContact\n\nOrder Related Inquiries: [ship@erewhon.com][63]\n\nGeneral Inquiries: [customerservice@erewhon.com][64]\n\n## Currency\n\n[India] USD $\n* [[Afghanistan] Afghanistan (USD $) ][65]\n* [[\u00c5land Islands] \u00c5land Islands (USD $) ][66]\n* [[Albania] Albania (USD $) ][67]\n* [[Algeria] Algeria (USD $) ][68]\n* [[Andorra] Andorra (USD $) ][69]\n* [[Angola] Angola (USD $) ][70]\n* [[Anguilla] Anguilla (USD $) ][71]\n* [[Antigua &amp; Barbuda] Antigua & Barbuda (USD $) ][72]\n* [[Argentina] Argentina (USD $) ][73]\n* [[Armenia] Armenia (USD $) ][74]\n* [[Aruba] Aruba (USD $) ][75]\n* [[Ascension Island] Ascension Island (USD $) ][76]\n* [[Australia] Australia (USD $) ][77]\n* [[Austria] Austria (USD $) ][78]\n* [[Azerbaijan] Azerbaijan (USD $) ][79]\n* [[Bahamas] Bahamas (USD $) ][80]\n* [[Bahrain] Bahrain (USD $) ][81]\n* [[Bangladesh] Bangladesh (USD $) ][82]\n* [[Barbados] Barbados (USD $) ][83]\n* [[Belarus] Belarus (USD $) ][84]\n* [[Belgium] Belgium (USD $) ][85]\n* [[Belize] Belize (USD $) ][86]\n* [[Benin] Benin (USD $) ][87]\n* [[Bermuda] Bermuda (USD $) ][88]\n* [[Bhutan] Bhutan (USD $) ][89]\n* [[Bolivia] Bolivia (USD $) ][90]\n* [[Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina] Bosnia & Herzegovina (USD $) ][91]\n* [[