            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][2]\n[Account ][3]\nCart 0\n][4]\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][5]\n[ Shop ][6]\n[ ACCESSORIES ][7] [ BEST SELLERS ][8] [ BEVERAGES ][9] [ GIFT SETS ][10] [ GROCERY ][11] [ HOME &\nBODY ][12] [ NEW ARRIVALS ][13] [ SMOOTHIE ][14] [ WELLNESS ][15]\n[ About ][16]\n[ Our Story ][17] [ FAQs ][18] [ Locations ][19] [ Manage Subscription ][20]\n[Account ][21]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\nCart 0\n][22]\nShop Show menu\nExit menu Shop\n[ ACCESSORIES ][23]\n[ BEST SELLERS ][24]\n[ BEVERAGES ][25]\n[ GIFT SETS ][26]\n[ GROCERY ][27]\n[ HOME & BODY ][28]\n[ NEW ARRIVALS ][29]\n[ SMOOTHIE ][30]\n[ WELLNESS ][31]\nAbout Show menu\nExit menu [ About ][32]\n[ Our Story ][33]\n[ FAQs ][34]\n[ Locations ][35]\n[ Manage Subscription ][36]\n\n### BASKET 0\n\nAdd order notes\nLeave a note about your order\n\n##### Sorry, looks like we don't have enough of this product.\n\nPair with\nSubtotal Free\nCheck Out\n*Shipping, taxes, and discount codes are calculated at checkout*\n\nYour Cart is Empty\n\n[ Shop ][37]\n[ About ][38]\n[Erewhon Liquid Hand Soap Aesop Alternative]\n[Erewhon Liquid Hand Soap Aesop Alternative]\n[Home][39] Erewhon Liquid Hand Soap\n\n# Liquid Hand Soap\n\nRegular price $32.00\nUnit price / per\n[Shipping][40] calculated at checkout.\n{\"in_cart_html\"=>\" {{ quantity }} in cart\",\n\"decrease\"=>\"Decrease quantity for {{ product }}\", \"multiples_of\"=>\"Increments of {{ quantity }}\",\n\"minimum_of\"=>\"Minimum of {{ quantity }}\", \"maximum_of\"=>\"Maximum of {{ quantity }}\"} (0 in cart)\n* [ 1 ][41]\n* [ 2 ][42]\n* [ 3 ][43]\n* [ 4 ][44]\n* [ 5 ][45]\n* [ 6 ][46]\n* [ 7 ][47]\n* [ 8 ][48]\n* [ 9 ][49]\n* [ 10 + ][50]\nDecrease quantity for Liquid Hand Soap Increase button quantity - Liquid Hand Soap\">\nAdd to cart$32.00\n* Description\n* Personal Care & Beauty\n* Care\nSee All See All\n\nErewhon Premium Liquid Hand Soap is made with a natural blend of Cedarwood, Lavender, Orange, and\nRosemary essential oils. With coconut oil and botanical extracts, this soap simultaneously hydrates\nand cleanses skin.\n\n100% plant-based and made in Los Angeles. Free from sulfates, parabens, phthalates, phosphates and\ndyes.\n\nRead more\n\nErewhon's Personal Care & Beauty collection embodies a commitment to holistic wellness, offering a\nluxurious selection of bath, body, and skincare products. Each product is meticulously crafted from\npremium, natural ingredients and produced in small batches to ensure quality and potency.\n\nWith a strong emphasis on eco-conscious practices, our range is designed to nourish and rejuvenate\nevery skin type, enhancing natural beauty and promoting a healthy, radiant complexion for overall\nwell-being.\n\nRead more\n\nFollow instructions for proper care and maintenance of our personal care and beauty products.\n\nRead more\n\nRecommended:\n\n[Erewhon -Bar Soap | Rose Geranium]\n][51]\n\nErewhon Bar Soap | Rose Geranium\n\n$23.00\n\n][52]\nAdd\n\n#### Liquid Hand Soap\n\n$32.00\nAdd to cart\nOUR STORY\n[PRODUCE_WALL_01]\n\n### The Erewhon Standard\n\nErewhon prioritizes organic, pesticide-free produce, non-GMO, and non-irradiated foods. It demands\ngrass-fed, cage-free proteins adhering to animal welfare practices and ensures seafood is\nsustainably sourced. It supports regenerative, biodynamic farming for soil health, biodiversity, and\nsustainability.\n\nEmphasis is placed on seasonal, locally sourced goods to minimize carbon emissions, and the\nimportance of family-owned farms is recognized, all underpinned by stringent certifications.\n\n### About Erewhon\n\nErewhon, a Certified Organic Retailer and Certified B Corp, has maintained an unwavering commitment\nsince the late 1960s to provide foods and products that significantly impact our customers' lives.\n\nIt transcends the traditional grocery store role, fostering a community united by a passion for\npure, healthful products that safeguard both human health and the environment.\n\n[EREWHON_FARMS_R5_3]\n\n### We Support\n\nWe champion fair-trade practices and fair wages, ensuring all products are ethically sourced. Our\ncommitment extends to low-impact packaging and supporting eco-conscious businesses, alongside a\nselection of green household, skin, and beauty products.\n\nWe pride ourselves on collaborating with neighbors and organizations that share our mission of being\na force for good on the planet.\n\n[BATH_BODY-2] [BATH_BODY-2]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Personal Care & Beauty\n\nErewhon's Personal Care & Beauty collection offers a holistic approach to wellness with its\nluxurious range of bath, body, and skincare products. Each item is carefully crafted from\nhigh-quality, natural ingredients and handmade in small batches.\n\nEmphasizing eco-conscious practices, Erewhon's products are designed to nourish and rejuvenate from\nhead to toe, catering to all skin types with a focus on promoting a healthy, radiant complexion and\noverall well-being.\n\n[ SHOP NOW][53]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Skincare Essentials\n\nErewhon Skincare is made with wildcrafted herbs and natural ingredients to support every skin type.\nEach product is cold-processed to maintain the vitality of live plant ingredients.\n\n[ Shop Skincare][54]\n[EREWHON_CLEANSERS_184] [EREWHON_CLEANSERS_184]\n[BATH_BODY-1] [BATH_BODY-1]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Best Sellers\n\nA curated selection of our favorite foods and wellness products\u2014from wildcrafted sea moss to\nnutritional supplements.\n\n[ Shop Now][55]\nFAQ\n\n### Does my Erewhon membership apply to my order?\n\nErewhon memberships do not apply for Shopify orders. No loyalty points will be accrued for your\norder, nor can loyalty points be redeemed on the Shopify platform.\n\n### When will my order ship?\n\nOrders ship within 1 day after your order has been placed.\n\nAll perishable orders are shipped by 2-day air from Monday through Wednesday, before 1 pm PST. This\nensures that your products arrive in optimal condition. Please refrigerate your items immediately\nonce received.\n\n### How can I get a refund?\n\nAll sales are final and refunds are not accepted.\n\n### How long does it take to receive my order?\n\nFor UPS ground, orders are received within 3-5 business days.\n\nFor UPS Express: 2 business days. And for overnight, the next business day.\n\nShipping\n\n### International shipping\n\nWe currently ship to Canada & the U.K. More locations to come!\n\n### Order tracking\n\nTracking info will be emailed as soon as your order has been shipped.\n\n### Get in touch\n\nPlease email [shopify@enfmkt.com][56] for any questions about your order.\n* Related products\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][57]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscribed!*\nJoin\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][58] and [Terms of Service][59]\napply.\n\nMain menu\n* [Shop][60]\n* [About][61]\nContact\n\nOrder Related Inquiries: [ship@erewhon.com][62]\n\nGeneral Inquiries: [customerservice@erewhon.com][63]\n\n## Currency\n\n[India] USD $\n* [[Afghanistan] Afghanistan (USD $) ][64]\n* [[\u00c5land Islands] \u00c5land Islands (USD $) ][65]\n* [[Albania] Albania (USD $) ][66]\n* [[Algeria] Algeria (USD $) ][67]\n* [[Andorra] Andorra (USD $) ][68]\n* [[Angola] Angola (USD $) ][69]\n* [[Anguilla] Anguilla (USD $) ][70]\n* [[Antigua &amp; Barbuda] Antigua & Barbuda (USD $) ][71]\n* [[Argentina] Argentina (USD $) ][72]\n* [[Armenia] Armenia (USD $) ][73]\n* [[Aruba] Aruba (USD $) ][74]\n* [[Ascension Island] Ascension Island (USD $) ][75]\n* [[Australia] Australia (USD $) ][76]\n* [[Austria] Austria (USD $) ][77]\n* [[Azerbaijan] Azerbaijan (USD $) ][78]\n* [[Bahamas] Bahamas (USD $) ][79]\n* [[Bahrain] Bahrain (USD $) ][80]\n* [[Bangladesh] Bangladesh (USD $) ][81]\n* 