            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][2]\n[Account ][3]\nCart 0\n][4]\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][5]\n[ Shop ][6]\n[ ACCESSORIES ][7] [ BEST SELLERS ][8] [ BEVERAGES ][9] [ GIFT SETS ][10] [ GROCERY ][11] [ HOME &\nBODY ][12] [ NEW ARRIVALS ][13] [ SMOOTHIE ][14] [ WELLNESS ][15]\n[ About ][16]\n[ Our Story ][17] [ FAQs ][18] [ Locations ][19] [ Manage Subscription ][20]\n[Account ][21]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\nCart 0\n][22]\nShop Show menu\nExit menu Shop\n[ ACCESSORIES ][23]\n[ BEST SELLERS ][24]\n[ BEVERAGES ][25]\n[ GIFT SETS ][26]\n[ GROCERY ][27]\n[ HOME & BODY ][28]\n[ NEW ARRIVALS ][29]\n[ SMOOTHIE ][30]\n[ WELLNESS ][31]\nAbout Show menu\nExit menu [ About ][32]\n[ Our Story ][33]\n[ FAQs ][34]\n[ Locations ][35]\n[ Manage Subscription ][36]\n\n### BASKET 0\n\nAdd order notes\nLeave a note about your order\n\n##### Sorry, looks like we don't have enough of this product.\n\nPair with\nSubtotal Free\nCheck Out\n*Shipping, taxes, and discount codes are calculated at checkout*\n\nYour Cart is Empty\n\n[ Shop ][37]\n[ About ][38]\n[Black cooler bag with 'EREWHON' text on a white background]\n[Erewhon Cooler Bag, Black]\n[Erewhon Cooler Bag, Black]\n[[Black cooler bag with 'EREWHON' text on a white background] ][39]\n[[Erewhon Cooler Bag, Black] ][40]\n[[Erewhon Cooler Bag, Black] ][41]\n[Black cooler bag with 'EREWHON' text on a white background]\n[Erewhon Cooler Bag, Black]\n[Erewhon Cooler Bag, Black]\n[[Black cooler bag with 'EREWHON' text on a white background] ][42]\n[[Erewhon Cooler Bag, Black] ][43]\n[[Erewhon Cooler Bag, Black] ][44]\n[Home][45] Erewhon Insulated Cooler Bag - Black\n\n# Cooler Bag | Black\n\nRegular price $120.00\nUnit price / per\n[Shipping][46] calculated at checkout.\n{\"in_cart_html\"=>\" {{ quantity }} in cart\",\n\"decrease\"=>\"Decrease quantity for {{ product }}\", \"multiples_of\"=>\"Increments of {{ quantity }}\",\n\"minimum_of\"=>\"Minimum of {{ quantity }}\", \"maximum_of\"=>\"Maximum of {{ quantity }}\"} (0 in cart)\n* [ 1 ][47]\n* [ 2 ][48]\n* [ 3 ][49]\n* [ 4 ][50]\n* [ 5 ][51]\n* [ 6 ][52]\n* [ 7 ][53]\n* [ 8 ][54]\n* [ 9 ][55]\n* [ 10 + ][56]\nDecrease quantity for Cooler Bag | Black Increase button quantity - Cooler Bag | Black\">\nAdd to cart$120.00\n\n* Description\n* Erewhon Merch\n* Care\nSee All See All\n\nThe Erewhon insulated cooler bag in black is crafted from 100% organic cotton, sustainably dyed and\nwax-coated for water repellence. Handcrafted with care, this bag is perfect for your daily\nessentials. Its thoughtful design and eco-friendly materials make it a stylish and responsible\nchoice for anyone on the go. Embrace sustainability and functionality with this elegant insulated\nbag, tailored for your everyday needs.\n\nRead more\n\nDiscover the exclusive range of Erewhon Merch, featuring limited edition accessories, aprons, bags,\nhats, and tumblers. Each item encapsulates unique design and premium quality. Due to high demand,\nthese coveted pieces sell out quickly. Don't miss your chance to own a part of the Erewhon lifestyle\n\nRead more\n* Spot clean only\n* Gently dab with a damp cloth to remove dirt\n* Pat dry with a clean towel\n* Do not machine wash, bleach or tumble dry\n* Air dry away from direct sunlight to maintain shape and color\nRead more\nOUR STORY\n[PRODUCE_WALL_01]\n\n### The Erewhon Standard\n\nEverything at Erewhon has been curated to support your health journey. As a Certified Organic\nGrocer, we seek out organic, biodynamic, and regenerative products that respect the planet, nourish\nour community, and support local farms.\n\nIn our Protein department, we stock grass-fed, cage-free products that adhere to animal welfare\npractices. Our seafood is sustainably sourced and packaged with cold chain technology to ensure\nfreshness without chemicals or unnatural preservatives.\n\n### About Erewhon\n\nErewhon is an independent, family-owned Certified B Corp and Certified Organic Retailer with 10\nlocations across Southern California. Since 1968, we\u2019ve been providing organic, ethically-sourced\nfoods to our community.\n\nWe\u2019re committed to sourcing healthy, nutrient-dense products, backing local growers and brands, and\nsupporting the environment.\n\nRecognized for our uncompromising quality standards and customer service, we sustain a community\ncentered in caring, curiosity, and positive change.\n\n[EREWHON_FARMS_R5_3]\n\n### We Support\n\nWe champion fair-trade practices and fair wages, ensuring all products are ethically sourced. Our\ncommitment extends to low-impact packaging and supporting eco-conscious businesses, alongside a\nselection of green household, skin, and beauty products.\n\nWe pride ourselves on collaborating with neighbors and organizations that share our mission of being\na force for good on the planet.\n\nErewhon\n\n## Bag and Tote Collection\n\nErewhon bags and totes are designed for grocery hauls, travel, and everything in-between. Each color\nis made in limited batches, so supplies are limited.\n\n[ SHOP BAGS][57]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Natural Candle Collection\n\nOur Natural Candle Collection is made with essential oils, lead-free wicks, and non-GMO soy wax.\nEach candle is hand-poured without artificial chemicals or paraffins, ensuring a clean burn for up\nto 55 hours.\n\n[ Shop Candles][58]\n[APPAREL-1] [APPAREL-1]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Best Sellers\n\nA curated selection of our favorite foods and wellness products\u2014from wildcrafted sea moss to\nnutritional supplements.\n\n[ SHOP NOW][59]\nFAQ\n\n### Does my Erewhon membership apply to my order?\n\nErewhon memberships do not apply for Shopify orders. No loyalty points will be accrued for your\norder, nor can loyalty points be redeemed on the Shopify platform.\n\n### When will my order ship?\n\nOrders ship within 1 day after your order has been placed.\n\nAll perishable orders are shipped by 2-day air from Monday through Wednesday, before 1 pm PST. This\nensures that your products arrive in optimal condition. Please refrigerate your items immediately\nonce received.\n\n### How can I get a refund?\n\nAll sales are final and refunds are not accepted.\n\n### How long does it take to receive my order?\n\nFor UPS ground, orders are received within 3-5 business days.\n\nFor UPS Express: 2 business days. And for overnight, the next business day.\n\nShipping\n\n### International shipping\n\nWe currently ship to Canada & the U.K. More locations to come!\n\n### Order tracking\n\nTracking info will be emailed as soon as your order has been shipped.\n\n### Get in touch\n\nPlease email [shopify@enfmkt.com][60] for any questions about your order.\n* Related products\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][61]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscribed!*\nJoin\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][62] and [Terms of Service][63]\napply.\n\nMain menu\n* [Shop][64]\n* [About][65]\nContact\n\nOrder Related Inquiries: [ship@erewhon.com][66]\n\nGeneral Inquiries: [customerservice@erewhon.com][67]\n\n## Currency\n\n[India] USD $\n* [[Afghanistan] Afghanistan (USD $) ][68]\n* [[\u00c5land Islands] \u00c5land Islands (USD $) ][69]\n* [[Albania] Albania (USD $) ][70]\n* [[Algeria] Algeria (USD $) ][71]\n* [[Andorra] Andorra (USD $) ][72]\n* [[Angola] Angola (USD $) ][73]\n* [[Anguilla] Anguilla (USD $) ][74]\n* [[Antigua &amp; Barbuda] Antigua & Barbuda (USD $) ][75]\n* [[Argentina] Argentina (USD $) ][76]\n* [[Armenia] Armenia (USD $) ][77]\n* [[Aruba] Aruba (USD $) ][78]\n* [[Ascension Island] Ascension Island (USD $) ][79]\n* [[Australia] Australia (USD $) ][80]\n* [[Austria] Austria (USD $) ][81]\n* [[Azerbaijan] Azerbaijan (USD $) ][82]\n* [[Bahamas] Bahamas (USD $) ][83]\n* [[Bahrain] Bahrain (USD $) ][84]\n* [[Banglad