            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][2]\n[Account ][3]\nCart 0\n][4]\n[[Erewhon - EREWHON-LOGO-WHT_2_abc6dd65-0c63-4e45-b3ad-37139e7df0d4] ][5]\n[ Shop ][6]\n[ ACCESSORIES ][7] [ BEST SELLERS ][8] [ BEVERAGES ][9] [ GIFT SETS ][10] [ GROCERY ][11] [ HOME &\nBODY ][12] [ NEW ARRIVALS ][13] [ SMOOTHIE ][14] [ WELLNESS ][15]\n[ About ][16]\n[ Our Story ][17] [ FAQs ][18] [ Locations ][19] [ Manage Subscription ][20]\n[Account ][21]\nSearch\nSearch Clear\nCart 0\n][22]\nShop Show menu\nExit menu Shop\n[ ACCESSORIES ][23]\n[ BEST SELLERS ][24]\n[ BEVERAGES ][25]\n[ GIFT SETS ][26]\n[ GROCERY ][27]\n[ HOME & BODY ][28]\n[ NEW ARRIVALS ][29]\n[ SMOOTHIE ][30]\n[ WELLNESS ][31]\nAbout Show menu\nExit menu [ About ][32]\n[ Our Story ][33]\n[ FAQs ][34]\n[ Locations ][35]\n[ Manage Subscription ][36]\n\n### BASKET 0\n\nAdd order notes\nLeave a note about your order\n\n##### Sorry, looks like we don't have enough of this product.\n\nPair with\nSubtotal Free\nCheck Out\n*Shipping, taxes, and discount codes are calculated at checkout*\n\nYour Cart is Empty\n\n[ Shop ][37]\n[ About ][38]\n[#Color_black]\n[#Color_tidal-blue]\n[#Color_sandstone]\n[#Color_thousand-hills]\n[#Color_evergreen]\n[#Color_basal]\n[[#Color_black] ][39]\n[[#Color_tidal-blue] ][40]\n[[#Color_sandstone] ][41]\n[[#Color_thousand-hills] ][42]\n[[#Color_evergreen] ][43]\n[[#Color_basal] ][44]\n[#Color_black]\n[#Color_tidal-blue]\n[#Color_sandstone]\n[#Color_thousand-hills]\n[#Color_evergreen]\n[#Color_basal]\n[[#Color_black] ][45]\n[[#Color_tidal-blue] ][46]\n[[#Color_sandstone] ][47]\n[[#Color_thousand-hills] ][48]\n[[#Color_evergreen] ][49]\n[[#Color_basal] ][50]\n[Home][51] Erewhon Wide Mouth Stainless Steel Bottle | 32 oz\n\n# Wide Mouth Stainless Steel Bottle | 32 oz\n\nRegular price $65.00\nUnit price / per\n[Shipping][52] calculated at checkout.\nColor\nSandstone\nBlack Variant sold out or unavailable Sandstone Variant sold out or unavailable Thousand Hills\nVariant sold out or unavailable Tidal Blue Variant sold out or unavailable Basal Variant sold out or\nunavailable Evergreen Variant sold out or unavailable\n{\"in_cart_html\"=>\" {{ quantity }} in cart\",\n\"decrease\"=>\"Decrease quantity for {{ product }}\", \"multiples_of\"=>\"Increments of {{ quantity }}\",\n\"minimum_of\"=>\"Minimum of {{ quantity }}\", \"maximum_of\"=>\"Maximum of {{ quantity }}\"} (0 in cart)\n* [ 1 ][53]\n* [ 2 ][54]\n* [ 3 ][55]\n* [ 4 ][56]\n* [ 5 ][57]\n* [ 6 ][58]\n* [ 7 ][59]\n* [ 8 ][60]\n* [ 9 ][61]\n* [ 10 + ][62]\nDecrease quantity for Wide Mouth Stainless Steel Bottle | 32 oz Increase button quantity - Wide\nMouth Stainless Steel Bottle | 32 oz\">\nAdd to cart$65.00\n\n* Description\n* Shipping & Returns\n* Care\nSee All See All\n\nBuilt from 18/8 stainless steel with Thermo 3D double-wall insulation, the Erewhon Wide Mouth\nStainless Steel Bottle keeps drinks at the right temperature from morning to night. The wide mouth\nopening makes filling, drinking, and cleaning straightforward. Powder-coated finish adds durability\nwithout sacrificing a clean look. BPA-free and spill-resistant. Available in a range of colorways to\nsuit any preference.\n\nRead more\n\nThis product ships directly from MiiR and arrives separately. Please contact [MiiR][63] for details\nor instructions. Note that returns cannot be processed directly through us for this item.\n\nRead more\n\nWash before first use and thoroughly after each use to ensure best results. Do not use wire or\nabrasive brush for cleaning. After washing, let individual components air dry. Body is dishwasher\nsafe, plastic pieces top rack dishwasher safe. Do not freeze, do not microwave, do not bleach, do\nnot fill with more than 33oz of liquid. Not for use on a stovetop.\n\nRead more\n\nRecommended:\n\n[Black Erewhon tote bag with the brand name 'EREWHON' printed in white on the front.]\n][64]\n\nShopper Bag | Black\n\n$60.00\n\n][65]Out of stock\n[Erewhon - Organic Paleo Coconut Granola]\n][66]\n\nPaleo Coconut Granola\n\n$18.00\n\n][67]\nAdd\n[Erewhon Organic Chocolate Almond Biscotti]\n][68]\n\nChocolate Almond Biscotti\n\n$18.00\n\n][69]\nAdd\n[Erewhon -Organic Sea Salt Artisanal Popcorn]\n][70]\n\nArtisanal Sea Salt Popcorn\n\n$10.00\n\n][71]\nAdd\n\n#### Wide Mouth Stainless Steel Bottle | 32 oz\n\n$65.00\nConfigure\nOUR STORY\n[PRODUCE_WALL_01]\n\n### The Erewhon Standard\n\nErewhon prioritizes organic, pesticide-free produce, non-GMO, and non-irradiated foods. It demands\ngrass-fed, cage-free proteins adhering to animal welfare practices and ensures seafood is\nsustainably sourced. It supports regenerative, biodynamic farming for soil health, biodiversity, and\nsustainability.\n\nEmphasis is placed on seasonal, locally sourced goods to minimize carbon emissions, and the\nimportance of family-owned farms is recognized, all underpinned by stringent certifications.\n\n### About Erewhon\n\nErewhon, a Certified Organic Retailer and Certified B Corp, has maintained an unwavering commitment\nsince the late 1960s to provide foods and products that significantly impact our customers' lives.\n\nIt transcends the traditional grocery store role, fostering a community united by a passion for\npure, healthful products that safeguard both human health and the environment.\n\n[EREWHON_FARMS_R5_3]\n\n### We Support\n\nWe champion fair-trade practices and fair wages, ensuring all products are ethically sourced. Our\ncommitment extends to low-impact packaging and supporting eco-conscious businesses, alongside a\nselection of green household, skin, and beauty products.\n\nWe pride ourselves on collaborating with neighbors and organizations that share our mission of being\na force for good on the planet.\n\nErewhon\n\n## Wellness\n\nA collection of natural vitamins & supplements that you can trust. Designed to support your body and\nhelp you feel your very best.\n\n[ SHOP ESSENTIALS][72]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Essentials\n\nImmerse yourself in tranquility with the Erewhon Home Gift Box, expertly crafted to transform your\nspace into a haven of luxury and peace. Begin with the enchanting Moss & Dark Musk Candle, its\nsoothing scents of earthy moss and deep musk enveloping your room in comfort. Purify with the\nVetiver Bar Soap, infused with French green clay and essential oils.\n\nOur Hand & Body Lotion and Body Wash offer deep hydration with botanical oils, enhancing your daily\nritual. The sacred Anima Mundi Palo Santo completes the set, uplifting spirit and space alike. This\ncollection nurtures both body and soul, embodying a commitment to holistic wellbeing.\n\n[ Shop Wellness][73]\n[Untitled_design_-_2024-04-18T131443] [Untitled_design_-_2024-04-18T131443]\n\nErewhon\n\n## Best Sellers\n\nErewhon's best sellers are a curated selection of top-quality, health-conscious products.\n\nFrom organic foods to eco-friendly goods, these favorites embody wellness and sustainability for the\nconscious consumer.\n\n[ Shop Now][74]\nFAQ\n\n### Does my Erewhon membership apply to my order?\n\nErewhon memberships do not apply for Shopify orders. No loyalty points will be accrued for your\norder, nor can loyalty points be redeemed on the Shopify platform.\n\n### When will my order ship?\n\nOrders ship within 1 day after your order has been placed.\n\nAll perishable orders are shipped by 2-day air from Monday through Wednesday, before 1 pm PST. This\nensures that your products arrive in optimal condition. Please refrigerate your items immediately\nonce received.\n\n### How can I get a refund?\n\nAll sales are final and refunds are not accepted.\n\n### How long does it take to receive my order?\n\nThis product ships overnight directly from Regiis Ova and arrives separately. Contact Regiis Ova for\ndetails or instructions. Note that returns cannot be processed directly through us for this item.\n\nShipping\n\n### International shipping\n\nWe currently ship to Canada & the U.K. More locations to come!\n\n### Order tracking\n\nTracking info will be emailed as soon as your order has been shipped.\n\n### Get in touch\n\nPlease email [shopify@enfmkt.com][75] for any questions about your order.\n* Related products\n* Recently viewed\n\nSee All See All\n[[EREWHON-LOGO-BLK_5] ][76]\n\n## Newsletter\n\nSubscribe for special offers and the latest updates in heath, wellness, and nutrition.\n\n*This customer is already subscribed!*\nJoin\n\nThis site is protected by hCaptcha and the hCaptcha [Privacy Policy][77] and [Terms of Service][78]\napply.\n\nMain menu\n* [Shop][79]\n* [About][80]\nContact\n\nOrder Related Inquiries: [ship@erewhon.com][81]\n\nGeneral Inquiries: [customerservice@erewhon.com][82]\n\n## Currency\n\n[India] USD $\n* [[Afghanistan] Afghanistan (USD $) ][83]\n* [[\u00c5land Islands] \u00c5land Islands (USD $) ][84]\n* [[Albania] Albania (USD $) ][85]\n* [[Algeria] Algeria (USD $) ][86]\n* [[Andorra] Andorra (USD $) ][87]\n* [[Angola] Angola (USD $) ][88]\n* [[Anguilla] Anguilla (USD $) ][89]\n* [[Antigua &amp; Barbuda] Antigua & Barbuda (USD $) ][90]\n* [[Argentina] Argentina (USD $) ][91]\n* [[Armenia] Armenia (USD $) ][92]\n* [[Aruba] Aruba (USD $) ][93]\n* [[Ascension Island] Ascension Island (USD $) ][94]\n* [[Australia] Australia (USD $) ][95]\n* [[Austria] Austria (USD $) ][96]\n* [[Azerbaijan] Azerbaijan (USD $) ][97]\n* [[Bahamas] Bahamas (USD $) ][98]\n* [[Bahrain] Bahrain (USD $) ][99]\n* [[Bangladesh] Bangladesh (USD $) ][100]\n* [[Barbados] Barbados (USD $) ][101]\n* [[Belarus] Belarus (USD $) ][102]\n* [[Belgium] Belgium (USD $) ][103]\n* [[Belize] Belize (USD $) ][104]\n* [[Benin] Benin (USD $) ][105]\n* [[Bermuda] Bermuda (USD $) ][106]\n* [[Bhutan] Bhutan (USD $) ][107]\n* [[Bolivia] Bolivia (USD $) ][108]\n* [[Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina] Bosnia & Herzegovina (USD $) ][109]\n* [[Botswana] Botswana (USD $) ][110]\n* [[Brazil] Brazil (USD $) ][111]\n* [[British Indian Ocean Territory] British Indian Ocean Territory (USD $) ][112]\n* [