        "crawl_text": "Scholars International Institute of Technology Educational Institution Accredited Global ACTD-US QAHE-UK Excellence in Education Awards 2025 Award of Excellence 2025 Excellence in Distance Learning - Education Global Awards 2024 Best Self-paced Tech Education & eLearning Entity 2023 Affordable education through scholarships High-quality education from industry experts Flexible learning options available 24/7 Accredited by International Association for Quality Assurance in Pre-Tertiary & Higher Education (QAHE) Not specified Global SIIT has over 800,000 enrolled students and 95,000 trainees with a 97% satisfaction rating. Democratizing access to education Providing industry-relevant training Offering flexible learning options Expanding global reach Increasing demand for online education One of the largest and most diverse educational institutions globally. Growing online education market Partnerships with top-tier organizations like Microsoft and Google SIIT - Scholars International Institute of Technology&trade;\n\nLogin\n\nScholarship\n\nAlumni\n\nVisit\n\n-->\n\nMedia\n\nSearch for:\n\nSearch\n\nHome\n\nInstitute\n\nAlumni\n\nAwards\n\nAccreditation\n\nPress Releases\n\nCollege 02\n\n-->\n\nAcademics\n\nSchool of Technical Training\n\nSchool of Vocational Training\n\nSchool of Professional Studies\n\nCertification Information\n\nMajors\n\nMajors\n\n-->\n\nAdmissions\n\nDiploma\n\nAdvanced Diploma\n\nMaster Diploma\n\nAll Course Programs\n\nPartnerships\n\nResources\n\nNews\n\nBlogs\n\nCareers\n\nTutorials\n\nGuest Posts\n\nTools & Apps\n\nSIIT - Scholars International Institute of Technology March 22, 2021\n2021-05-04 8:28\n\nSIIT Institute\n\nDiscover\nthe\nworld\npossibility\nwith\nSIIT\n\n2025/2026\nApplications\nare\nNow\nOpen\n\nAdmissions\n\nTransforming lives through skills education\n\n2025/2026\nApplications\nare\nNow\nOpen\n\nAdmissions\n\nGet\ntrained\nby experts around\nthe\nworld\n\n2025/2026\nApplications\nare\nNow\nOpen\n\nAdmissions\n\nNews & Updates\n\nView all news\n\nAlumni Research\n\nAutism rates have increased and show differences in ethnic minorities\n\nAdmin\n\nMar 17, 2021\n\nStudent life Student story\n\nMost students say their mental health suffered in pandemic\n\nAdmin\n\nJan 25, 2021\n\nCareer Research\n\nMost students pleased with their digital learning\n\nAdmin\n\nJan 23, 2021\n\nResearch Student life\n\nGender inequality in higher education persists\n\nAdmin\n\nJan 22, 2021\n\n-->\n\nWelcome to Scholars International Institute of Technology - SIIT\n\nSIIT was established with a bold mission: to democratize access to high-quality, industry-relevant education for learners and professionals around the world.\n\nSIIT offers certified technical courses, vocational training and professional studies online.\n\nRead\nmore\n\nWhy Choose SIIT\n\nWe Are One of The Largest, Most\nDiverse Institute in The World\n\nAffordability\n\nOur\nscholarship\nprogram\nmakes\nSIIT courses affordable\nfor\nevery\nstudent\nthroughout\nthe\nworld.\n\nLearn\nmore\n\nHigh Quality\n\neducation\nSIIT\nhas\nlimitless\npossibilities.\nOur\ncourses\nare\ntaught\nindustry experts and professionals.\n\nLearn\nmore\n\nAccessibility\n\nOur\n\nsystem\ncreates\nopen\nopportunities\nfor all\nlearners,\nwith\neasy access 24/7, offering flexibility and convenience.\n\nLearn\nmore\n\nWe're SIIT\n\n& We're Different\n\nWe are making skills learning more\nrelevant, open and\ntransformational.\n\n800,000+\nEnrolled\n\n95,000+\nTrainees\n\n97%\nSatisfaction Rating\n\n30,000+\nSocial Followers\n\nStudying\nat SIIT\n\nAccredited Diploma Programs Online\n\nSchool of Technical Training\n\nThe school of technical training focuses on providing specialized, practical, and hands-on training in technical fields. This program is designed to equip students with the skills and knowledge necessary to pursue careers in industries that require technical expertise.\n\nSchool of Vocational Training\n\nThe school of vocational training focuses on teaching vocational trades and skills needed for various career pursuit. This program is designed to prepare students for immediate employment by offering practical training, hands-on experience in specific fields.\n\nSchool of Professional Studies\n\nThe school of professional studies offers programs tailored to working professionals, adult learners and students seeking to enhance their skills and advance their careers in specific fields.\n\nCertification Information\n\nCertification\n\nGraduate online with Accredited Diploma widely recognized.\n\nRead More &raquo; &raquo;\n\nDiploma\n\nCertifies the completion of Diploma programs..\n\nRead More &raquo; &raquo;\n\nMaster Diploma\n\nCertifies the completion of Master Diploma programs..\n\nRead More &raquo; &raquo;\n\nMore\nInformation\n\nAwards and Media Coverage\n\nView all awards\n\nAwarded By : International Association for Quality Assurance in Pre-Tertiary & Higher Education (QAHE)\n\nExcellence in Education Awards 2025\n\nYear\n\n2024 - 2025\n\nAwarded By : E2 Media Awards\n\nAward of Excellence 2025\n\nYear\n\n2025\n\nAwarded By : International Elite 100\n\nExcellence in Distance Learning - Education Global Awards\n\nYear\n\n2024\n\nAwarded By : Corporate Vision Awards\n\nBest Self-paced Tech Education & eLearning Entity\n\nYear\n\n2023\n\nAwards and Recognition\n\nView all awards\n\n-->\n\nMedia Partner EduBirdie\n\nRecognition by EduBirdie\n\nYear\n\n2024 / 2025\n\nMedia Partner Custom Writings\n\nRecognition by Custom Writings\n\nYear\n\n2024 / 2025\n\nMedia Partner Paddy Power\n\nRecognition by Paddy Power\n\nYear\n\n2024 / 2025\n\nMedia Partner Ahelp\n\nRecognition by Academic Help\n\nYear\n\n2024 / 2025\n\nGoogle\n\nMicrosoft\n\nAdobe\n\nCisco\n\nCompTIA\n\nOracle\n\nCoursera -->\n\nStanford\n\nCambridge\n\ncasino non AAMS\n\nAccredited Online Paralegal Program WTI\n-->\n\nAccredited Online Paralegal Program WTI -->\n\nAccredited Online Paralegal Program WTI\n\nOffshore Software Development Company\n\nCoursera\n\n-->\n\n~ Top Partners ~\n\nWhat Students Are Saying\n\nView all testimonials\n\n-->\n\nAlumni E. Justin\n\n\"Thanks very much. You are among individuals/group making this world a better place to live in.\"\n\nAlumni A. Emma\n\n\"I write to thank the management for this renounced opportunity for me to study and obtained diploma certificate online!\"\n\nAlumni Philip M.\n\n\"I want to thank you for giving me a chance to become a computer engineer, thanks guys. God bless you guys.\"\n\nAlumni Francis A.\n\n\"I must say that SIIT has affected my life positively that my unborn generation will never lack nor suffer any hardship. Graphic design is in our everyday life.\"\n\nWE BELIEVE THAT TECH EDUCATION IS FOR EVERYONE!\n\nUnlock Your Potential with Accredited Online Training Courses\n\nStaying ahead in today&rsquo;s fast-paced and highly competitive world requires more than just talent\u2014it requires continuous learning and professional growth. That&rsquo;s why we&rsquo;re committed to helping individuals and organizations succeed through Professional Training programs designed for real-world results.\n\nWhether you're just starting your career or seeking to level up your current skills, our platform offers a comprehensive range of Accredited Online Training Courses tailored to your goals. From technical studies and business management to IT skills and software development, we deliver world-class learning experiences at your fingertips. Our training partners are Top Tier including: Microsoft, Google, Oracle, Cisco, Cambridge, NPTEL amongst others.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Why Choose Our Online Professional Training Platform?\n\nOur vision is simple: to empower learners through flexible, high-quality, and industry-relevant training . We understand that every learner is different, which is why we offer self-paced, instructor-led, and hybrid formats that adapt to your schedule and learning style.\n\nOur catalog of Professional Development Courses Online is designed by industry experts, certified trainers, and thought leaders across various fields. Each course is built to equip you with in-demand skills that employers value most in today's dynamic marketplace.\n\nWhether you're a student, job seeker, entrepreneur, or working professional, we have a course that fits your path to success.\n\nWe are committed to bridging the gap between education and employability. Our programs combine practical, industry-driven learning with international accreditation, making our certifications relevant across borders.\n\nRelevant skills education focused\n\nInternationally accredited certifications (ACTD-US & QAHE-UK)\n\nFlexible online learning programs\n\nCareer-focused curriculum designed for today\u2019s workforce\n\nTrainers from multiple countries and industries\n\n\ud83c\udf93 Explore Our Certificate Courses Online\n\nEarn recognized credentials that showcase your skills and commitment to continuous improvement. Our Certificate Courses Online are not only accessible from anywhere in the world but are also aligned with global standards and frameworks. Each certificate adds credibility to your resume and opens doors to new opportunities across industries such as:\n\nInformation Technology &amp; Cybersecurity\n\nDigital Marketing &amp; eCommerce\n\nBusiness Management &amp; Leadership\n\nData Analysis &amp; Artificial Intelligence\n\nHuman Resources &amp; Project Management\n\nSoftware, IT &amp; Programming\n\nBy enrolling in our  siit.co SIIT - Scholars International Institute of Technology&trade;\n\nLogin\n\nScholarship\n\nAlumni\n\nVisit\n\n-->\n\nMedia\n\nSearch for:\n\nSearch\n\nHome\n\nInstitute\n\nAlumni\n\nAwards\n\nAccreditation\n\nPress Releases\n\nCollege 02\n\n-->\n\nAcademics\n\nSchool of Technical Training\n\nSchool of Vocational Training\n\nSchool of Professional Studies\n\nCertification Information\n\nMajors\n\nMajors\n\n-->\n\nAdmissions\n\nDiploma\n\nAdvanced Diploma\n\nMaster Diploma\n\nAll Course Programs\n\nPartne