        "crawl_text": "Siz Agro PLC Commitment to sustainability Management of the entire coffee production process from farm to export Strong partnerships with international buyers 4th floor , office number 403 HMM Tower Addis Ababa, Ethiopia Ethiopia Siz Agro PLC\n\nSkip to content\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nProducts\n\nOur Operations\n\nBlogs\n\nContact Us\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedin\n\nWhatsapp\n\nWelcome To Siz Agro Plc\n\nAvocado Oil and Coffee Producer/Exporter\n\nFounded in 2017 by two partners with extensive experience in coffee supply and import-export trade.\n\nAbout Us\n\nContact Us\n\nWelcome To Siz Agro Plc\n\nAvocado Oil and Coffee Producer/Exporter\n\nFounded in 2017 by two partners with extensive experience in coffee supply and import-export trade.\n\nAbout Us\n\nContact Us\n\nAbout Us\n\nSiz Agro Plc is a leading coffee producer and exporter dedicated to delivering highquality green coffee to customers worldwide. With a deep passion for coffee and a commitment to sustainability, we have established ourselves as a reputed player in the coffee industry. In addition to coffee, we have a newly established avocado oil manufacturing company, dedicated to producing premium quality avocado oil for various culinary and cosmetic applications. With a focus on excellence and innovation, we aim to become a trusted provider of avocado oil in the market.\n\nPermanent Employees\n\n2500+\n\nTemporary Employees\n\n20,000+\n\nFarmers Collaboration\n\nMore About Us\n\nProduction\n\nOur company takes pride in our carefully cultivated coffee beans sourced from Sidama, South Ethiopia, and Oromia regions, known for their exceptional coffee growing conditions. We employ traditional techniques to ensure superior quality from seed to cup. Our skilled team of coffee experts oversees every step of the production process.\nOur company utilizes state of the art technology and carefully selected avocados to extract oil of the highest standard. Our manufacturing facility adheres to strict hygiene and safety regulations to ensure the production of\nsafe and top-quality avocado oil.\n\nWhy Choose Siz Agro Plc\n\nQuality Assurance\n\nWe maintain stringent quality control measures throughout the production process. Our beans as well as Each batch of avocado oil undergoes rigorous testing to ensure it meets our exacting standards.\n\nExport Services\n\nAs a reliable exporter, we specialize in facilitating seamless international trade. We have established strong partnerships with green coffee and avocado oil buyers worldwide, enabling us to reach in various markets.\n\nUnique Selling Proposition\n\nSiz Agro Plc is a distinguished exporter from Ethiopia, uniquely managing the entire coffee production process from farm to export. With a commitment to quality and sustainability, we oversee every step, ensuring that our coffee meets the highest standards from cultivation to your warehouse. Additionally, we are proud producers and exporters of premium avocado oil, delivering excellence to your business.\n\nGrowth\n\nGrowth is part of our DNA. Our potential to grow is immeasurable. We focus on business opportunities with a view to create volume with quality and cost efficiencies in our operations. Our business has grown significantly in the last 7 years, and we continue to invest to build a scalable business.\n\nAt A Glance\n\nFarms\n\nManufacturing Sites\n\nFarmers\n\nTemporary Employees\n\nFarms\n\nManufacturing Sites\n\nFarmers\n\nOur Gallery\n\ndefault\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nLinkedIn\n\ninfo@sizagro.com\n\n+(251) 911-233-744\n\n4th floor , office number 403 HMM Tower Addis Ababa, Ethiopia\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedin\n\nWhatsapp\n\n2024 \u00a9 Siz Agro Plc | All Right Reserved.\n\nScroll to Top\n\nWhatsApp us [ Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Our Operations][5]\n* [Blogs][6]\n* [Contact Us][7]\n[ Instagram ][8] [ Facebook ][9] [ Linkedin ][10] [ Whatsapp ][11]\n\n## About Us\n\n### Welcome To Siz Agro Plc\n\nSiz Agro PLC is a leading coffee producer and exporter dedicated to delivering highquality green\ncoffee to customers worldwide. With a deep passion for coffee and a commitment to sustainability, we\nhave established ourselves as a reputed player in the coffee industry. In addition to coffee, we\nhave a newly established avocado oil manufacturing company, dedicated to producing premium quality\navocado oil for various culinary and cosmetic applications. With a focus on excellence and\ninnovation, we aim to become a trusted provider of avocado oil in the market.\n\n### At A Glance\n\nETB Revenue\n0 M\nFarms\nManufacturing Sites\nFarmers\n0 +\nTemporary Employees\n0 +\nFarms\nManufacturing Sites\nFarmers\n0 +\n\n### What Our Customer Says\n\nAs a coffee shop owner, finding the right supplier is crucial. SIZ Agro has consistently delivered\ntop-quality beans that our customers rave about. Their commitment to excellence and timely\ndeliveries make them a trusted partner in our business.\nEmma L.\nCaf\u00e9 Owner\nWe've been sourcing coffee from SIZ Agro for years, and they\u2019ve always met our high standards. Their\nexpertise in coffee exportation and knowledge of international markets are unmatched. They make the\nentire process seamless.\nJuan P.\nCoffee Distributor\nSIZ Agro stands out not only for the rich flavor of their coffee but also for their commitment to\nsustainable farming practices. It\u2019s reassuring to work with a company that values the environment as\nmuch as we do.\nSarah T.\nOrganic Grocer\n* info@sizagro.com\n\n### [+(251) 911-233-744 ][12]\n* [ 4th floor , office number 403 HMM Tower Addis Ababa, Ethiopia ][13]\n\n[ Instagram ][14] [ Facebook ][15] [ Linkedin ][16] [ Whatsapp ][17]\n\n2024 \u00a9 Siz Agro Plc | All Right Reserved.\n\nScroll to Top\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://sizagro.com/\n[3]: https://sizagro.com/about-us/\n[4]: https://sizagro.com/products/\n[5]: https://sizagro.com/our-operations/\n[6]: https://sizagro.com/blogs/\n[7]: https://sizagro.com/contact-us/\n[8]: https://www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[9]: https://www.facebook.com/coffeeexporter/\n[10]: https://www.linkedin.com/authwall?trk=bf&trkInfo=AQEXOWzTUer1dAAAAZNqcedw2zKS6Nso1hsyNfIGCr6zL\nRis3-AFcziMAfWP4Frd9w0Ct0MxgSNZ1jsKRxhxEf2yWStw4an_ZAKXQ8uQGmmuT1DUyCOMJWG9tpONWe-PGvgL0nI=&original\n_referer=&sessionRedirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsiz-agro-plc-4b3686152%3Futm_source%\n3Dshare%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_via%26utm_content%3Dprofile%26utm_medium%3Dios_app\n[11]: https://wa.me/251911233744\n[12]: tel:+(251)%20911-23-3744\n[13]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/i3p9HCsmZjVxa2eQ8\n[14]: https://www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[15]: https://www.facebook.com/coffeeexporter/\n[16]: https://www.linkedin.com/authwall?trk=bf&trkInfo=AQEXOWzTUer1dAAAAZNqcedw2zKS6Nso1hsyNfIGCr6zL\nRis3-AFcziMAfWP4Frd9w0Ct0MxgSNZ1jsKRxhxEf2yWStw4an_ZAKXQ8uQGmmuT1DUyCOMJWG9tpONWe-PGvgL0nI=&original\n_referer=&sessionRedirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsiz-agro-plc-4b3686152%3Futm_source%\n3Dshare%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_via%26utm_content%3Dprofile%26utm_medium%3Dios_app\n[17]: https://wa.me/251911233744 [ Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Our Operations][5]\n* [Blogs][6]\n* [Contact Us][7]\n[ Instagram ][8] [ Facebook ][9] [ Linkedin ][10] [ Whatsapp ][11]\n\n## Products\n\n### Production\n\nOur company takes pride in our carefully cultivated coffee beans sourced from Sidama, South\nEthiopia, and Oromia regions, known for their exceptional coffee growing conditions. We employ\ntraditional\ntechniques to ensure superior quality from seed to cup. Our skilled team of coffee experts oversees\nevery step of the production process.\nOur company utilizes state of the art technology and carefully selected avocados to extract oil of\nthe highest standard. Our manufacturing facility adheres to strict hygiene and safety regulations to\nensure the production of\nsafe and top-quality avocado oil.\n\n### Why Choose Siz Agro Plc\n\n#### Quality Assurance\n\nWe maintain stringent quality control measures throughout the production process. Our beans as well\nas Each batch of avocado oil undergoes rigorous testing to ensure it meets our exacting standards.\n\n#### Export Services\n\nAs a reliable exporter, we specialize in facilitating seamless international trade. We have\nestablished strong partnerships with green coffee and avocado oil buyers worldwide, enabling us to\nreach in various markets.\n\n#### Unique Selling Proposition\n\nSiz Agro Plc is a distinguished exporter from Ethiopia, uniquely managing the entire coffee\nproduction process from farm to export. With a commitment to quality and sustainability, we oversee\nevery step, ensuring that our coffee meets the highest standards from cultivation to your warehouse.\nAdditionally, we are proud producers and exporters of premium avocado oil, delivering excellence to\nyour business.\n\n#### Growth\n\nGrowth is part of our DNA. Our potential to grow is immeasurable. We focus on business opportunities\nwith a view to create volume with quality and cost efficiencies in our operations. Our business has\ngrown significantly in the last 7 years, and we continue to invest to build a scalable business.\n\n### What Our Customer Says\n\nAs a coffee shop owner, finding the right supplier is crucial. SIZ Agro has consistently delivered\ntop-quality beans that our customers rave about. Their commitment to excellence and timely\ndeliveries make them a trusted partner in our business.\nEmma L.\nCaf\u00e9 Owner\nWe've been sourcing coffee from SIZ Agro for years, and they\u2019ve always met our high standards. Their\nexpertise in coffee exportation and knowledge of international markets are unmatched. They make the\nentire process seamless.\nJuan P.\nCoffee Distributor\nSIZ Agro stands out not only for the rich flavor of their coffee but also for their commitment to\nsustainable farming practices. It\u2019s reassuring to work with a company that values the environment as\nmuch as we do.\nSarah T.\nOrganic Grocer\n* info@sizagro.com\n\n### [+(251) 911-233-744 ][12]\n* [ 4th floor , office number 403 HMM Tower Addis Ababa, Ethiopia ][13]\n\n[ Instagram ][14] [ Facebook ][15] [ Linkedin ][16] [ Whatsapp ][17]\n\n2024 \u00a9 Siz Agro Plc | All Right Reserved.\n\nScroll to Top\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://sizagro.com/\n[3]: https://sizagro.com/about-us/\n[4]: https://sizagro.com/products/\n[5]: https://sizagro.com/our-operations/\n[6]: https://sizagro.com/blogs/\n[7]: https://sizagro.com/contact-us/\n[8]: https://www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[9]: https://www.facebook.com/coffeeexporter/\n[10]: https://www.linkedin.com/authwall?trk=bf&trkInfo=AQEXOWzTUer1dAAAAZNqcedw2zKS6Nso1hsyNfIGCr6zL\nRis3-AFcziMAfWP4Frd9w0Ct0MxgSNZ1jsKRxhxEf2yWStw4an_ZAKXQ8uQGmmuT1DUyCOMJWG9tpONWe-PGvgL0nI=&original\n_referer=&sessionRedirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsiz-agro-plc-4b3686152%3Futm_source%\n3Dshare%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_via%26utm_content%3Dprofile%26utm_medium%3Dios_app\n[11]: https://wa.me/251911233744\n[12]: tel:+(251)%20911-23-3744\n[13]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/i3p9HCsmZjVxa2eQ8\n[14]: https://www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[15]: https://www.facebook.com/coffeeexporter/\n[16]: https://www.linkedin.com/authwall?trk=bf&trkInfo=AQEXOWzTUer1dAAAAZNqcedw2zKS6Nso1hsyNfIGCr6zL\nRis3-AFcziMAfWP4Frd9w0Ct0MxgSNZ1jsKRxhxEf2yWStw4an_ZAKXQ8uQGmmuT1DUyCOMJWG9tpONWe-PGvgL0nI=&original\n_referer=&sessionRedirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsiz-agro-plc-4b3686152%3Futm_source%\n3Dshare%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_via%26utm_content%3Dprofile%26utm_medium%3Dios_app\n[17]: https://wa.me/251911233744 [ Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Our Operations][5]\n* [Blogs][6]\n* [Contact Us][7]\n[ Instagram ][8] [ Facebook ][9] [ Linkedin ][10] [ Whatsapp ][11]\n\n# Contact Us\n\n## Contact Us\n\n### Get In Touch\n\nFounded in 2017 by two partners with 