//www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[18]: https://www.facebook.com/coffeeexporter/\n[19]: https://www.linkedin.com/authwall?trk=bf&trkInfo=AQEXOWzTUer1dAAAAZNqcedw2zKS6Nso1hsyNfIGCr6zL\nRis3-AFcziMAfWP4Frd9w0Ct0MxgSNZ1jsKRxhxEf2yWStw4an_ZAKXQ8uQGmmuT1DUyCOMJWG9tpONWe-PGvgL0nI=&original\n_referer=&sessionRedirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsiz-agro-plc-4b3686152%3Futm_source%\n3Dshare%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_via%26utm_content%3Dprofile%26utm_medium%3Dios_app\n[20]: https://wa.me/251911233744"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://sizagro.com/about",
            "text": "[ Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Products][4]\n* [Our Operations][5]\n* [Blogs][6]\n* [Contact Us][7]\n[ Instagram ][8] [ Facebook ][9] [ Linkedin ][10] [ Whatsapp ][11]\n\n## About Us\n\n### Welcome To Siz Agro Plc\n\nSiz Agro PLC is a leading coffee producer and exporter dedicated to delivering highquality green\ncoffee to customers worldwide. With a deep passion for coffee and a commitment to sustainability, we\nhave established ourselves as a reputed player in the coffee industry. In addition to coffee, we\nhave a newly established avocado oil manufacturing company, dedicated to producing premium quality\navocado oil for various culinary and cosmetic applications. With a focus on excellence and\ninnovation, we aim to become a trusted provider of avocado oil in the market.\n\n### At A Glance\n\nETB Revenue\n0 M\nFarms\nManufacturing Sites\nFarmers\n0 +\nTemporary Employees\n0 +\nFarms\nManufacturing Sites\nFarmers\n0 +\n\n### What Our Customer Says\n\nAs a coffee shop owner, finding the right supplier is crucial. SIZ Agro has consistently delivered\ntop-quality beans that our customers rave about. Their commitment to excellence and timely\ndeliveries make them a trusted partner in our business.\nEmma L.\nCaf\u00e9 Owner\nWe've been sourcing coffee from SIZ Agro for years, and they\u2019ve always met our high standards. Their\nexpertise in coffee exportation and knowledge of international markets are unmatched. They make the\nentire process seamless.\nJuan P.\nCoffee Distributor\nSIZ Agro stands out not only for the rich flavor of their coffee but also for their commitment to\nsustainable farming practices. It\u2019s reassuring to work with a company that values the environment as\nmuch as we do.\nSarah T.\nOrganic Grocer\n* info@sizagro.com\n\n### [+(251) 911-233-744 ][12]\n* [ 4th floor , office number 403 HMM Tower Addis Ababa, Ethiopia ][13]\n\n[ Instagram ][14] [ Facebook ][15] [ Linkedin ][16] [ Whatsapp ][17]\n\n2024 \u00a9 Siz Agro Plc | All Right Reserved.\n\nScroll to Top\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://sizagro.com/\n[3]: https://sizagro.com/about-us/\n[4]: https://sizagro.com/products/\n[5]: https://sizagro.com/our-operations/\n[6]: https://sizagro.com/blogs/\n[7]: https://sizagro.com/contact-us/\n[8]: https://www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[9]: https://www.facebook.com/coffeeexporter/\n[10]: https://www.linkedin.com/authwall?trk=bf&trkInfo=AQEXOWzTUer1dAAAAZNqcedw2zKS6Nso1hsyNfIGCr6zL\nRis3-AFcziMAfWP4Frd9w0Ct0MxgSNZ1jsKRxhxEf2yWStw4an_ZAKXQ8uQGmmuT1DUyCOMJWG9tpONWe-PGvgL0nI=&original\n_referer=&sessionRedirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsiz-agro-plc-4b3686152%3Futm_source%\n3Dshare%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_via%26utm_content%3Dprofile%26utm_medium%3Dios_app\n[11]: https://wa.me/251911233744\n[12]: tel:+(251)%20911-23-3744\n[13]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/i3p9HCsmZjVxa2eQ8\n[14]: https://www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[15]: https://www.facebook.com/coffeeexporter/\n[16]: https://www.linkedin.com/authwall?trk=bf&trkInfo=AQEXOWzTUer1dAAAAZNqcedw2zKS6Nso1hsyNfIGCr6zL\nRis3-AFcziMAfWP4Frd9w0Ct0MxgSNZ1jsKRxhxEf2yWStw4an_ZAKXQ8uQGmmuT1DUyCOMJWG9tpONWe-PGvgL0nI=&original\n_referer=&sessionRedirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsiz-agro-plc-4b3686152%3Futm_source%\n3Dshare%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_via%26utm_content%3Dprofile%26utm_medium%3Dios_app\n[17]: https://wa.me/251911233744"
