            "text": "Leading Agricultural Processing Equipment Supplier - GQ Agri\n\nSkip to content\n\nNo results\n\nAnimal Fat Processing\n\nAnimal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment\n\nAnimal Fat Oil Refining Equipment\n\nAnimal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment\n\nOil Press\n\nScrew Oil Press\n\nHydraulic Oil Press\n\nTemperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press\n\nDiesel Powered Oil Press\n\nMobile Commercial Oil Press Machine\n\nOil Filter Machine\n\nRefinery Equipment\n\nCentrifugal Oil Filter\n\nPlate and Frame Filter Press\n\nVacuum Oil Filter\n\nPneumatic Oil Filter\n\nFilling Machine\n\nRoasting Machine\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nNews\n\nWhite Paper\n\nContact Us Now\n\nGet Quote\n\nAnimal Fat Processing\n\nAnimal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment\n\nAnimal Fat Oil Refining Equipment\n\nAnimal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment\n\nOil Press\n\nScrew Oil Press\n\nHydraulic Oil Press\n\nTemperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press\n\nDiesel Powered Oil Press\n\nMobile Commercial Oil Press Machine\n\nOil Filter Machine\n\nRefinery Equipment\n\nCentrifugal Oil Filter\n\nPlate and Frame Filter Press\n\nVacuum Oil Filter\n\nPneumatic Oil Filter\n\nFilling Machine\n\nRoasting Machine\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nNews\n\nWhite Paper\n\nSearch\n\nGet Quote\n\nMenu\n\nReliable agricultural processing equipment\n\nWe are committed to providing efficient and reliable small and medium-sized agricultural processing equipment to farmers and agricultural practitioners around the world, helping agricultural production efficiency, reducing operating costs, and doubling income.\n\nJoin Early Access\n\nPioneer Program\n\nSolve These 3 Problems in Your Farm\n\nLow efficiency and unreliability\n\nRust-proof treatment in tropical climate to ensure efficient operation\n\nIs the power unstable\n\nDiesel/electric dual-powered model\n\nThe equipment is too expensive\n\nThe price is only 2/5 of European and American brands\n\nPopular products\n\nMachines Designed for Your Success\n\nAnimal fat processing equipment\n\nautomatic oil press Machine\n\nOil Filter Machine\n\nRoasting machine\n\nFilling machine\n\nTrusted by Farmers Worldwide\n\nSince 2010, GQ-Agri has provided reliable, affordable processing solutions to small-scale farmers and agripreneurs/cooperatives in over 20 countries. Our rugged equipment helps farmers increase productivity by 30-50% while reducing processing time by 70% compared to traditional methods. With 15+ years of engineering expertise, each machine has a lifespan of over 5 years &#8211; twice the industry average for similar equipment. Committed to ensuring your long-term success after your purchase.\n\nCustomer Testimonials\n\nCustomer Feedback from All Over the World\n\nNow My Kids Can Go to University!\nBefore GQ-Ari, I sold raw coconuts for 2,500 IDR/kg. With the DY-200 oil press, I now earn 35,000 IDR/liter of virgin oil. My 4-worker family processes 120kg/day - income jumped from 300,000 IDR to 4.2 million IDR daily. Last month, I opened a bank account for my daughter's medical school.\n\nAhmad Yusuf Coconut Oil Producer\n\nAfter the floods destroyed my crops, I used GQ-Ari's press to turn waste rice bran into oil. From 1kg bran (worth 5,000 VND) I extract 300ml oil selling for 45,000 VND. My 3-woman collective now earns 12 million VND/month - enough to replant our fields AND buy a solar dryer.\n\nL\u00ea Th\u1ecb H\u01b0\u01a1ng Rice Bran Oil Entrepreneur\n\nUsed to sell kernels to factories at 1.8 MYR/kg. With the NK-150 sheller, I process 300kg/day into premium kernels (4.5 MYR/kg). In 18 months, I upgraded from motorcycle delivery to owning a 600\u33a1 processing shed with 6 local employees.\n\nRajesh Kumar Palm Kernel Processor\n\nOur 13 members spent 150 PHP/day transporting copra to mills. The GQ-Ari CP-80 press lets us process 80 nuts/hour onsite. Now we sell bottled oil at 120 PHP/250ml instead of 35 PHP/kg for copra - income up by 340%. No More 4AM Trips to the Mill.\n\nMaria Dela Cruz Coconut Farmers' Cooperative President\n\nMiddlemen paid 15 GHS/kg for raw nuts. My wife's women's group uses the SB-05 sheller to produce 50kg/day of premium kernels (42 GHS/kg). We bought 2 more machines and built a nursery school from the profits. The children call it 'the shea butter school\n\nKwame Osei Shea Nut Collector\n\nExporters bought our sacha inchi seeds for 12 PEN/kg. With GQ-Ari's cold press, we now bottle organic oil (85 PEN/100ml). 20 families increased annual income from 8,000 PEN to 34,000 PEN. We just installed WiFi for the village school using oil profits.\n\nCarlos Quispe Indigenous Farming Association\n\nBuy any machine now and have a chance to get 100 pieces of \"portable oil storage bag with spout\" for free.\n\nParticipate now\n\nMedia resources\n\nVarious media resources help agricultural development\n\nDifferences of Commercial Oil Press Machine Types\n\nGQ_Agri\n\nJuly 7, 2025\n\nWhat Is a Commercial Oil Press Machine? What are the types of commercial oilseed oil presses? Summary Table of Oil Press Machine Types. Need Help Choosing Your Commercial Oil Press?\n\nRead More \u00bb\n\nThe Difference Between Vacuum Oil Filter and Pneumatic Oil Filter\n\nGQ_Agri\n\nAugust 22, 2025\n\nA farmer-turned-businessman stands and gazes at two machines in a small oil mill just outside Kampala, and the machines are\n\nRead More \u00bb\n\nOptimizing Roasting Time and Temperature to Improve Oil Production\n\nGQ_Agri\n\nNovember 13, 2025\n\nI encountered some small and medium-sized oil pressing plants that were trying to control the moisture and heat of the\n\nRead More \u00bb\n\nCrop Roasting Machine Types and Selection Guide.\n\nGQ_Agri\n\nNovember 7, 2025\n\nI visited dozens of small and medium-sized oil mills in West Africa and Southeast Asia, and one sentence always lingered\n\nRead More \u00bb\n\nSmall Machines, Big Harvests\n\nEmpower Your Farm Business with GQ-Agri\n\nStart Your Agri-Business Upgrade Today\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale farming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China, we have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small and medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual agricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products cover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land machinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\nProducts\n\nAnimal Fat Processing\n\nOil Press\n\nOil Filter Machine\n\nRoasting Machine\n\nFilling Machine\n\nCleaning Machine\n\nLand Clearing Vehicle\n\nOther Equipment\n\nInformation\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nBlog\n\nCookie Policy\n\nContact Us\n\nHead Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District, Shenzhen, China\n\n(+86) 15070647529\n\n[email&#160;protected]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - GQ Agri All rights reserved | Sitemap\n\nTerms &amp; Conditions | Privacy Policy\n\nEnglish\n\nIndonesian\n\nMalay\n\nSwahili\n\nVietnamese\n\nArabic\nEnglish"
