            "url": "https://smallagrimachinery.com/about/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n## About Us\n\n## GQ-Agri \u2013 Your Partner in Rural Prosperity\n\nEmpowering Small Farms, Building Rural Futures\n\nGQ-Agri believes that small-scale agriculture should not mean small-scale profits. As China\u2019s\nleading agricultural machinery supplier, we design affordable, durable and easy-to-use small and\nmedium-sized agricultural processing equipment \u2013 from oil presses to fruit shellers \u2013 to help\nfarmers and agricultural entrepreneurs around the world transform raw crops into higher-value\nproducts.\n\nWith more than 15 years of engineering expertise, ISO-certified manufacturing and localized design,\nwe are committed to bridging the gap between tradition and technology. Our machines are more than\ntools, they are profit multipliers. By reducing post-harvest waste, saving labor time and enabling\non-farm processing, we help farmers increase their income from land harvest by 30-50%.\n\n## Our Journey\n\nFrom Local Roots to Global Impact\n* #### 2010 - Getting Started\n\nFounded by a team of agricultural engineers and rural development experts, we began prototyping\nsmall processing machines for rural cooperatives in China.\n* #### 2013 - First Breakthrough\n\nLaunched our flagship diesel/electric dual-powered oil press, adopted by more than 200 farmers in\nYunnan Province.\n* #### 2015 - Quality Milestone\n\nAchieved ISO 9001 certification and developed patented heat-resistant components for tropical\nclimates - a key step towards global readiness.\n* #### 2020 - Going Global\n\nEntering farmers\u2019 homes in more than 20 countries, with a customer retention rate of 98%,\nproviding customers with localized solutions tailored to local conditions.\nDevelop product lines for various production equipment, including oil pressing, animal oil\nprocessing, land machinery, and auxiliary agricultural equipment.\n* #### 2025 - Going Online\n\nOfficially launched online business, reaching more agricultural practitioners in need from\nindependent websites and social media platforms, accelerating the revitalization of rural futures.\n\nProfessional Experience\n0 + Y\nResponse\n0 H\nWarranty\n0 Y\nHelped farmers\n0 +\nServed countries\n\uff1e 0\nOil yield increased by\n0 %\nTropical environment simulated tests\n0 +\nDaily production capacity increased\n0 %\n\n## Company Values\n\nWe refuse to make flashy machines. Every GQ equipment will be your powerful partner.\n* Innovation for All: Let advanced technology benefit every agricultural practitioner, regardless of\nsize.\n* Quality That Lasts: With durability and reliability as the core, it can adapt to the most\ndemanding operating environments.\n* Local Impact, Global Vision: Rooted in local needs, providing reliable products of global\nstandards.\n* Diversified development: Not only help farmers\u2019 income, but also support agricultural processing\nentrepreneurs and communities to revitalize agriculture.\n* Sustainability in Action: Promote the efficient use of agricultural resources and help the\ndevelopment of green agriculture.\n* Designed for Your Success: The machine not only copes with harsh environments, but is also a good\nhelper to increase income.\n\n## Your Partner in Agri-Innovation\n\n**Customer First:** We go deep into the farm, listen to the needs of agricultural practitioners, and\nincorporate them into the design and development of machines.\n**Continuous Learning:** Continuously learn global agricultural trends and incorporate the latest\ntechnology into product design.\n**Social Responsibility:** We are committed to improving farmers\u2019 income and promoting social and\neconomic development through agricultural mechanization.\n\n[Warehouse display Oil Press][Warehouse display Oil Press]\n[Hydraulic oil press display][Hydraulic oil press display]\n[Export to Southeast Asia GQ AgriGQ Agri][Export to Southeast Asia GQ AgriGQ Agri]\n[Customer service visit GQ Agri][Customer service visit GQ Agri]\n[A corner of the factory Agricultural machinery manufacturer][A corner of the factory Agricultural\nmachinery manufacturer]\n[Headquarters exhibition][Headquarters exhibition]\n[QY_logo][QY_logo]\n[QF LOGO][QF LOGO]\n[GX logo][GX logo]\n[LF LOGO][LF LOGO]\n[double elephant logo][double elephant logo]\n[MC LOGO][MC LOGO]\n\n## Industry Certifications\n\nIndustry compliance certification\n\n### Pioneer Program\n\nApply to become a local early seed user and receive a 10% equipment subsidy. Record your success\nstory with us and earn commissions by building a local dealer network. Participate in discussions\nabout new machine improvements and have the opportunity to qualify for a trial.\n\n**List of benefits:**\n* Enjoy a 10% discount on preferential prices;\n* Participate in product improvement discussions to get a chance to try new products;\n* Successful referrals will receive extra cash rewards from the company;\n\n### Agency Distribution\n\nooperate with farm cooperatives, churches/mosques and entrepreneurs for sales to help young people\nreturn to their hometowns to start businesses. Use the agent distribution mechanism to get cash\nback. Selling a combination of agricultural processing equipment to accelerate the revitalization of\nlocal agricultural income.\n\n**List of benefits:**\n* Get 10% cash bonus on every sale;\n* Top 3 bonus pool every quarter (US$300-1000);\n* Ex-factory price of the combination of supporting equipment;\n\n## Media resources\n\nBuilding the Future Together\n\n### Usage guide\n\n### Usage guide\n\nGuide to the use, commissioning and maintenance of agricultural machinery\n\n### Income generation guide\n\n### Income generation guide\n\nAnalysis of various agricultural markets and entrepreneurship guides\n\n### Basic blog\n\n### Basic blog\n\nUnderstand agricultural machinery technology and product information\n\n### Useful resources\n\n### Useful resources\n\nVarious valuable white papers and video resources\n\n## Increase your agricultural income\n\n#### Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n#### Contact\n\n86+15070647529\n[[email protected]][55]\n\n#### Open Hours\n\nMonday-Saturday 8 am - 6pm\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nPhone *\nEmail address *\nType *Oil PressOil FilterRoasting MachineFilling MachineAnimal Oil Processing EquipmentScreening\nMachine\nUsed For *\nParagraph Text *\nRequest a quote[Loading][Loading]\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale\nfarming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China,\nwe have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small\nand medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual\nagricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products\ncover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land\nmachinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\n##### Products\n* [Animal Fat Processing][56]\n* [Oil Press][57]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][58]\n* [Roasting Machine][59]\n* [Filling Machine][60]\n* [Cleaning Machine][61]\n* [Land Clearing Vehicle][62]\n* Other Equipment\n\n##### Information\n* [Home][63]\n* [About Us][64]\n* [Blog][65]\n* [Cookie Policy][66]\n* [Contact Us][67]\n\n##### Head Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n(+86) 15070647529\n[email protected]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - GQ Agri All rights reserved | [Sitemap][68]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][69] | [Privacy Policy][70]\n\n[ [en_US]English ][71]\n[ [id_ID][id_ID]Indonesian ][72] [ [ms_MY][ms_MY]Malay ][73] [ [sw][sw]Swahili ][74] [\n[vi][vi]Vietnamese ][75] [ [ar][ar]Arabic ][76] [[en_US]English][77]\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[3]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/\n[4]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-rendering-equipment/\n[5]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-refining-equipment/\n[6]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat