            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri][GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press machine\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press machine]][55]\n[[Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press machine - Image 2]][56]\n[[Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press machine - Image 3]][57]\n[[Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press machine - Image 4]][58]\n[[Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press machine - Image 5]][59]\n[[Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press machine - Image 6]][60]\n[Home][61] / [Oil Press Machine][62] / Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press\nmachine\n* **Easy to operate:** One-button start of automatic pressing, no professional technical knowledge\nrequired, zero-based oil pressing can be achieved.\n* **Multiple models:** Multiple different oil pressing equipment models are available to adapt to\ndifferent outputs, power and personalized needs.\n* **Hot and cold double pressing:** Supports both hot and cold pressing methods, which can ensure\nthe oil yield of high-oil crops, and can also provide cold pressing in the oil pressing operations\nthat need to maintain natural flavors such as olives and avocados.\n* **Can press a variety of crops:** can press peanuts, soybeans, olive oil, rapeseed, sesame, basil\noil, flax seeds, sunflower seeds, walnuts, palm kernels, almonds, sunflower seeds, tung seeds,\npine nuts, avocados, coconuts and other crops, realizing one machine for multiple uses.\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\nCategory [Oil Press Machine][64] Tag [Hydraulic Oil Press Machine][65]\n\nDescription\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Multifunctional vertical hydraulic automatic Cold oil press**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMod\u2502Cylinder \u2502Dimension\u2502Weight\u2502Pressur\u2502Working \u2502Heater \u2502Temperatu\u2502Each \u2502Hourly \u2502Motor\nel \u2502diameter \u2502s (m) \u2502(kg) \u2502e (KN) \u2502Pressure \u2502Power (W)\u2502re (\u00b0C) \u2502loading \u2502output \u2502Power\n\u2502(mm) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(Mpa) \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(kg) \u2502(kg/h) \u2502(kW)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nYZ-\u2502150 \u25020.7 \u00d7 0.8\u2502240 \u2502650 \u250255\u201360 \u2502600 \u250250\u201360 \u25022 \u250220 \u25020.75\n150\u2502 \u2502\u