2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n*One-year warranty for the whole machine; plastic inner packaging + wooden box outer packaging\nensures transportation safety;\n*The above specifications are for reference only. The machine is constantly being upgraded, so the\nparameters may differ from the actual ones. Please understand.\n\n### Introduction\n\nThis hydraulic oil press uses a hydraulic cylinder to generate huge pressure in the press chamber to\nseparate oil from the oil material. The grease is discharged from the gap between the pressing rod\nand the pressing ring. This hydraulic cold press offers high pressing efficiency, with a single\npress time ranging from 5 to 20 minutes (depending on the machine model and the weight of the raw\nmaterial).\nIt has a strong production capacity and can produce 95% of the oil crops on the market. Whether it\nis peanuts, soybeans, rapeseed or other common oil crops, our oil press can produce efficiently and\nproduce high-quality vegetable oil.\nThe oil press is equipped with a one-button start function, just press the button to start the\nmachine. The oil pressing process can be easily started without complicated settings and\nadjustments. The machine complies with CE and ISO certification.\n*Core components (motor, pressure vessel, PLC, gear, bearing, engine, gearbox) are guaranteed for\none year.\n\n## Other machines\n\nOther agricultural processing machines that may interest you\n\n## Related products\n* [[Diesel-electric dual-power 3-4 wheel screw oil press][Diesel-electric dual-power 3-4 wheel screw\noil press]][66]\n\n## [Diesel-electric dual-power 3-4 wheel screw oil press machine][67]\n* [Oil Press Machine][68]\n* [[Commercial fully automatic hydraulic oil press can be customized with single and double barrels\n(1)][Commercial fully automatic hydraulic oil press can be customized with single and double\nbarrels (1)]][69]\n\n## [Commercial fully automatic hydraulic oil press machine can be customized with single and\n## double barrels][70]\n* [Oil Press Machine][71]\n* [[S01 Mobile commercial fully automatic 304 stainless steel temperature-controlled screw oil press\nMachine][S01 Mobile commercial fully automatic 304 stainless steel temperature-controlled screw\noil press Machine]][72]\n\n## [Mobile commercial fully automatic 304 stainless steel temperature-controlled screw oil press\n## Machine][73]\n* [Oil Press Machine][74]\n* [[Customizable fully automatic spiral pressure cooking oil press (3)][Customizable fully automatic\nspiral pressure cooking oil press (3)]][75]\n\n## [Customizable fully automatic spiral pressure cooking oil press][76]\n* [Oil Press Machine][77]\n\n## Increase your agricultural income\n\nGet ready for the upcoming harvest season with limited-time offers on new GQ Agri equipment.\n\n#### Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n#### Contact\n\n86+15070647529\n[[email protected]][78]\n\n#### Open Hours\n\nMonday-Saturday 8 am - 6pm\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nPhone *\nEmail address *\nType *Oil PressOil FilterRoasting MachineFilling MachineAnimal Oil Processing EquipmentScreening\nMachine\nUsed For *\nParagraph Text *\nRequest a quote[Loading][Loading]\n[][79]\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale\nfarming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China,\nwe have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small\nand medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual\nagricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products\ncover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land\nmachinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\n##### Products\n* [Animal Fat Processing][80]\n* [Oil Press][81]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][82]\n* [Roasting Machine][83]\n* [Filling Machine][84]\n* [Cleaning Machine][85]\n* [Land Clearing Vehicle][86]\n* Other Equipment\n\n##### Information\n* [Home][87]\n* [About Us][88]\n* [Blog][89]\n* [Cookie Policy][90]\n* [Contact Us][91]\n\n##### Head Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n(+86) 15070647529\n[email protected]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - GQ Agri All rights reserved | [Sitemap][92]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][93] | [Privacy Policy][94]\n\n[ [en_US][en_US]English ][95]\n[ [id_ID][id_ID]Indonesian ][96] [ [ms_MY][ms_MY]Malay ][97] [ [sw][sw]Swahili ][98] [\n[vi][vi]Vietnamese ][99] [ [ar][ar]Arabic ][100] [[en_US][en_US]English][101]\n[ ][102]\n\nMake advanced technology accessible to every agricultural practitioner, regardless of scale.\nTransform your crops into sustainable income and revitalize rural futures.\n\n## Get it now\n\nGet professional purchasing assistance now\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nDaily Output\nDescription\nSend\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[3]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/\n[4]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-rendering-equipment/\n[5]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-refining-equipment/\n[6]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-oil-fractionation-and-dewaxing-equi\npment/\n[7]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/\n[8]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/screw-oil-press/\n[9]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/hydraulic-oil-press/\n[10]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/temperature-controlled-oil-filter-integrated-oil-pres\n[11]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/diesel-powered-oil-press/\n[12]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/mobile-commercial-oil-press-machine/\n[13]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/edible-oil-filter-machine/\n[14]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/refinery-equipment/\n[15]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/centrifugal-oil-filter/\n[16]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/plate-and-frame-filter-press/\n[17]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/vacuum-oil-filter/\n[18]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/pneumatic-oil-filter/\n[19]"
