u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nKLM-600\u2502380V \u250222 kW \u25021400 r/min\u25021700 \u00d7 1000 \u00d7 1400\u2502350 kg\u25022.0\u20133.0 t/h\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n**If the above models do not meet your production requirements, customized solutions are available\nupon request.\n*The above specifications are for reference only. The machine is constantly being upgraded, so the\nparameters may differ from the actual ones. Please understand.*\n\n## Other machines\n\nOther agricultural processing machines that may interest you\n\n## Related products\n* [[High-quality, multi-functional peeling and pitting machine/fruit pulp separator][High-quality,\nmulti-functional peeling and pitting machine/fruit pulp separator]][67]\n\n## [High-quality, multi-functional peeling and pitting machine/fruit pulp separator][68]\n* [Auxiliary Equipment][69], [Centrifuge][70]\n* [[Forestry drum crusher, tracked isolation belt land clearing vehicle][Forestry drum crusher,\ntracked isolation belt land clearing vehicle]][71]\n\n## [Forestry drum crusher, tracked isolation belt land clearing vehicle][72]\n* [Auxiliary Equipment][73], [Skid Steer Loader][74]\n\n## Increase your agricultural income\n\nGet ready for the upcoming harvest season with limited-time offers on new GQ Agri equipment.\n\n#### Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n#### Contact\n\n86+15070647529\n[[email protected]][75]\n\n#### Open Hours\n\nMonday-Saturday 8 am - 6pm\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nPhone *\nEmail address *\nType *Oil PressOil FilterRoasting MachineFilling MachineAnimal Oil Processing EquipmentScreening\nMachine\nUsed For *\nParagraph Text *\nRequest a quote[Loading][Loading]\n[][76]\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale\nfarming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China,\nwe have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small\nand medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual\nagricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products\ncover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land\nmachinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\n##### Products\n* [Animal Fat Processing][77]\n* [Oil Press][78]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][79]\n* [Roasting Machine][80]\n* [Filling Machine][81]\n* [Cleaning Machine][82]\n* [Land Clearing Vehicle][83]\n* Other Equipment\n\n##### Information\n* [Home][84]\n* [About Us][85]\n* [Blog][86]\n* [Cookie Policy][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n\n##### Head Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n(+86) 15070647529\n[email protected]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - GQ Agri All rights reserved | [Sitemap][89]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][90] | [Privacy Policy][91]\n\n[ [en_US][en_US]English ][92]\n[ [id_ID][id_ID]Indonesian ][93] [ [ms_MY][ms_MY]Malay ][94] [ [sw][sw]Swahili ][95] [\n[vi][vi]Vietnamese ][96] [ [ar][ar]Arabic ][97] [[en_US][en_US]English][98]\n[ ][99]\n\nMake advanced technology accessible to every agricultural practitioner, regardless of scale.\nTransform your crops into sustainable income and revitalize rural futures.\n\n## Get it now\n\nGet professional purchasing assistance now\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nDaily Output\nDescription\nSend\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[3]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/\n[4]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-rendering-equipment/\n[5]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-refining-equipment/\n[6]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-oil-fractionation-and-dewaxing-equi\npment/\n[7]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/\n[8]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/screw-oil-press/\n[9]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/hydraulic-oil-press/\n[10]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/temperature-controlled-oil-filter-integrated-oil-pres\n[11]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/diesel-powered-oil-press/\n[12]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/mobile-commercial-oil-press-machine/\n[13]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/edible-oil-filter-machine/\n[14]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/refinery-equipment/\n[15]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/centrifugal-oil-filter/\n[16]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/plate-and-frame-filter-press/\n[17]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/vacuu"
