            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Semi-automatic 12/14/18 rotary siphon liquid quantitative gravity filling machine\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Semi-automatic 121418 rotary siphon liquid quantitative gravity filling machine 6]][55]\n[[Semi-automatic 12/14/18 rotary siphon liquid quantitative gravity filling machine - Image 2]][56]\n[[Semi-automatic 121418 rotary siphon liquid quantitative gravity filling machine 1]][57]\n[[Semi-automatic 12/14/18 rotary siphon liquid quantitative gravity filling machine - Image 4]][58]\n[[Semi-automatic 12/14/18 rotary siphon liquid quantitative gravity filling machine - Image 5]][59]\n[[Semi-automatic 12/14/18 rotary siphon liquid quantitative gravity filling machine - Image 6]][60]\n[Home][61] / [Filling Machine][62] / Semi-automatic 12/14/18 rotary siphon liquid quantitative\ngravity filling machine\n* ********Versatile Filling for Various Liquids:****\nEfficiently fills a wide range of low-viscosity liquids, including wines, juices, oils, and more.\n* ********Food-Grade Stainless Steel Construction:****\nConstructed from SUS304 stainless steel (optional SS316), ensuring durability and food safety.\n* ********Customizable to Your Production Needs:****\nAvailable in 12 to 18 filling nozzles, with adjustable height and customizable bottle sizes and\ncap diameters.\n* ********Low Noise and Energy Efficient:****\nDesigned with siphon gravity filling technology for quiet, low-energy operation and uniform fill\nlevels.\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\nCategory [Filling Machine][64] Tag [Gravity Filling Machine][65]\n\nDescription\n\n## Information\n\nThe Semi-Automatic Rotary Siphon Gravity Filling Machine is a high-performance filling system\ndesigned for bottling low-viscosity, non-foaming liquids like wine, vodka, whiskey, vinegar, edible\noils, beverages, fruit juices, mineral water, and soy sauce. Made from food-grade SUS304 stainless\nsteel, this machine is also available with SS316 for added durability and corrosion resistance,\nmaking it perfect for industries requiring hygienic standards, such as food and beverage production.\n\nThis rotary filling machine utilizes a siphon gravity system, a time-tested principle that allows\nfor precise and consistent liquid filling. The siphon system provides low energy consumption,\nminimal noise, and uniform liquid levels inside each bottle, offering a clean and professional\npresentation. It ensures the liquid flows gently along the bottle\u2019s inner walls, reducing the risk\nof foaming and overflow, which is crucial for maintaining product quality and visual appeal.\n\nThe machine can be fitted with 12, 14, 16, or 18 filling nozzles, allowing for a production capacity\nof 1000-1500 bottles per hour. It is suitable for various bottle types, including glass, PET, and\nother plastic bottles with specific hardness. The bottle and cap sizes are adjustable, and the\nsystem can accommodate bottle heights between 100-320mm and cap diameters ranging from 55mm to\n100mm. Custom configurations are available based on customer requirements, ensuring that the machine\nis adaptable to different production environments.\n\nThe adjustable filling height makes it versatile for handling bottles of different sizes, while the\nmovable filling nozzles ensure precise control over liquid levels. This ensures that all bottles are\nfilled to the desired level, maintaining consistency across your entire product line. The machine\u2019s\neasy integration with other equipment such as bottle washers, capping machines, labeling machines,\nand carton sealers, allows for seamless operation as part of a fully automated production line.\n\nThe semi-automatic operation of this machine provides ease of use, reducing the labor required for\nfilling tasks while maintaining high output and accuracy. Its modular design ensures that the\nmachine is easy to maintain, clean, and service, offering a long-lasting solution for small to\nmedium-sized production facilities.\n\n### ****Ideal for a Range of Industries********.****\n\nThis machine is highly effective in industries such as beverages, food production, pharmaceuticals,\nand cosmetics, where filling large quantities of liquid products in a consistent, high-quality\nmanner is essential. The flexible design and advanced technology ensure that it meets a wide range\nof bottling needs, from small batch to high-volume production.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Semi-automatic Rotary Siphon Gravity Filling Machine**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nItem \u2502Specification\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nProduction Capacity \u25021000\u20131500 BPH / hour\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250