            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri][GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press 2]][55]\n[[Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press 1]][56]\n[[Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press 4]][57]\n[[Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press 3]][58]\n[[Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press L 5]][59]\n[[Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press L 9]][60]\n[[Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press L 8]][61]\n[[Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press L 7]][62]\n[Home][63] / [Oil Filter Machine][64] / Food-grade commercial high-precision stainless steel plate\nand frame filter press\n* ********Premium Food-Grade Stainless Steel Construction:****\nDurable 304/316L stainless steel meets strict sanitary standards for food, pharmaceutical, and\nbeverage processing.\n* ********High-Precision Multi-Layer Filtration System:****\nAdvanced plate and frame design with customizable filter media delivers exceptional solid-liquid\nseparation and clarity.\n* ********Customizable and Scalable for Any Production Need:****\nEasily adjust filter area, number of plates, or media type to match throughput and precision\nrequirements.\n* ********Low Maintenance, Efficient and Cost-Effective Operation:****\nSmooth surfaces, quick cleaning and energy-efficient pump design reduce downtime and overall\noperational costs.\n[ Get a Quote ][65]\nCategory [Oil Filter Machine][66] Tag [Plate oil filter Press][67]\n\nDescription\n\n### Information\n\nThe Food-Grade Commercial High-Precision Stainless Steel Plate and Frame Filter Press is engineered\nfor demanding liquid clarification and purification tasks across food processing, chemical, and\npharmaceutical industries. Whether you are clarifying fruit juices, producing high-quality beverage\nproducts, or purifying liquid medicines, this filter press delivers reliable performance with\nsanitary construction and flexible filtration options. Its robust design is ideal for B-to-B\nindustrial applications requiring precision, hygiene, and scalability in production.\nThis filter press combines multi-layer stainless steel plates with adaptable filter media\u2014such as\nfilter cloth, paper, or membranes\u2014so you can achieve targeted filtration levels from coarse\npre-filtration to ultra-fine clarification (e.g., < 0.22 \u03bcm). Its high-precision filtration\narchitecture minimizes solid loss and optimizes throughput, helping businesses maintain consistency\nand product quality.\n\n### ****Structure and Sanitary Design.****\n\nConstructed from high-grade 304 or optional 316L stainless steel, the filter press resists corrosion\nand meets stringent sanitary requirements for food and pharma environments. The plate and frame\nassembly creates a large filter surface area where liquid is forced through filter media under\ncontrolled pressure, separating solids efficiently.\n\nThe smooth stainless surfaces not only prevent contamination and food residue buildup but also\nsimplify cleaning and sanitation procedures\u2014critical for compliance with FDA, EU, and other\ninternational food safety regulations. This ensures a hygienic production line and minimizes the\nrisk of microbial growth or cross-contamination during operation.\n\n### ****Advanced Filtration Performance.****\n\nAt the heart of this machine is an optimized plate and frame system designed for maximum filtration\nprecision and efficiency. Each plate holds a designated filter medium, which can be tailored to your\napplication\u2014whether you need coarse impurity removal in beverage processing or ultra-fine\nclarification in pharmaceutical liquid production.\n\nWith scalable plate layers and filter area, the unit adapts easily to higher production volumes\nwithout sacrificing clarity or quality. High filtration pressure and intelligent flow distribution\nproduce a consistent separation process, reducing downtime while improving throughput. This modular\napproach allows you to customize your filtration setup based on product type, particulate load, and\nrequired output rate.\n\n### ****Customizable and Scalable Solutions.****\n\nOne of the standout features of this filter press is its flexibility. You can adjust the number of\nplates and filter area according to your production capacity requirements, making it suitable for\nboth small-scale operations and large industrial outputs. Custom configurations also allow\nintegration with automated control systems, auxiliary pumps, or membrane compression systems for\nenhanced performance.\nThis scalability means you don\u2019t have to compromise on performance as your production grows. Food\nand beverage processors can upgrade filter modules or expand plate numbers to handle higher volumes\nof juice, oil, wine, dairy, or other liquids with ease.\n\n### ****Efficient Operation and Cost Savings.****\n\nEfficiency and ease of maintenance are built into every aspect of this machine. The stainless steel\nconstruction minimizes cleaning time and increases resistance to wear, while the optimized\nfiltration flow reduces energy consumption. Pumps and motors are configured for low-power usage,\nensuring operational costs stay manageable even during continuous production cycles.\nSmooth and accessible filter plates facilitate rapid cleaning and quick filter media replacement,\nwhich helps reduce labor costs and downtime between cycles. The design also reduces liquid loss\nduring filtration, improving resource efficiency and lowering the cost per unit of production.\n\nEngineered for precision, durability, and sanitary performance, this food-grade stainless steel\nplate and frame filter press is a reliable choice for industrial filtration needs. Whether your\nfocus is on exceptional clarity for beverage processing or rigorous purification for pharmaceutical\nliquids, its customizable configuration, robust stainless construction, and high-efficiency design\nensure it supports your production goals while maintaining operational cost advantages.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**High-precision stainless steel plate and frame filter press**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502GQYD-38 \u2502GQYD-63\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFiltration Area \u250230 m\u00b2 \u250250 m\u00b2\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nOverall Dimensions (L\u00d7W\u00d7H)\u25021350 \u00d7 820 \u00d7 1300 mm \u25022150 \u00d7 850 \u00d7 1380 mm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMachine Weight \u2502437 kg \u2502640 kg\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nCustomization \u2502Custom specifications available upon request\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n*The above specifications are for reference only. The machine is constantly being upgraded, so the\nparameters may differ from the actual ones. Please understand.\n\n## Other machines\n\nOther agricultural processing machines that may interest you\n\n## Related products\n* [[Vegetable oil filter machine Hydration centrifugal oil filter machine (7)][Vegetable oil filter\nmachine Hydration centrifugal oil filter machine (7)]][68]\n\n## [Vegetable oil filter machine Hydration centrifugal oil filter machine][69]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][70]\n* [[Simple 304 stainless steel air pressure edible oil filter 4][Simple 304 stainless steel air\npressure edible oil filter 4]][71]\n\n## [Simple 304 stainless steel air pressure edible oil filter][72]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][73]\n* [[Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and filtration\nequipment 1][Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and\nfiltration equipment 1]][74]\n\n## [Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and filtration\n## equipment][75]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][76]\n* [[Vacuum Oil filter for filtering crude oil in vegetable oil processing plants 3][Vacuum Oil\nfilter for filtering crude oil in vegetable oil processing plants 3]][77]\n\n## [Vacuum Oil filter for filtering crude oil in vegetable oil processing plants][78]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][79]\n\n## Increase your agricultural income\n\nGet ready for the upcoming harvest season with limited-time offers on new GQ Agri equipment.\n\n#### Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n#### Contact\n\n86+15070647529\n[[email protected]][80]\n\n#### Open Hours\n\nMonday-Saturday 8 am - 6pm\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nPhone *\nEmail address *\nType *Oil PressOil FilterRoasting MachineFilling MachineAnimal Oil Processing EquipmentScreening\nMachine\nUsed For *\nParagraph Text *\nRequest a quote[Loading][Loading]\n[][81]\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale\nfarming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China,\nwe have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small\nand medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual\nagricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products\ncover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land\nmachinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\n##### Products\n* [Animal Fat Processing][82]\n* [Oil Press][83]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][84]\n* [Roasting Machine][85]\n* [Filling Machine][86]\n* [Cleaning Machine][87]\n* [Land Clearing Vehicle][88]\n* Other Equipment\n\n##### Information\n* [Home][89]\n* [About Us][90]\n* [Blog][91]\n* [Cookie Policy][92]\n* [Contact Us][93]\n\n##### Head Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone"
