            "url": "https://smallagrimachinery.com/product/manual-cast-iron-plate-frame-oil-filter-press-machine/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine 1]][55]\n[[Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine 2]][56]\n[[Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine 4]][57]\n[[Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine 5]][58]\n[[Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine 3]][59]\n[[Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine 6]][60]\n[Home][61] / [Oil Filter Machine][62] / Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine\n* ********High-Temperature Resistance for Diverse Applications:****The cast iron plate frame design\nensures the filter press can handle high-temperature materials like edible oils, chemicals, and\npharmaceuticals.\n* ********Long-lasting Durability with Cast Iron Construction:****The use of high-quality cast iron\nfor the filter plates and frame ensures long-lasting performance under demanding conditions.\n* ********User-Friendly Manual Operation:****Simple manual screw-driven mechanism for easy\noperation, making it accessible even for first-time users.\n* ********Compact and Cost-Effective Design:****Compact structure that saves space and reduces\noperational costs while maintaining high filtration efficiency.\n* ********Wide range of uses:****widely used in the filtration of various nuts and oilseed food\noils, such as peanut oil, soybean oil, rapeseed oil, sesame oil, sunflower oil, etc.\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\nCategory [Oil Filter Machine][64] Tag [Plate oil filter Press][65]\n\nDescription\n\n### Introduction\n\nThe Manual Cast Iron Plate Frame Oil Filter Press Machine is a robust and reliable solution for oil\nfiltration, particularly suited for agricultural oil extraction. This machine is ideal for small to\nmedium-scale oil mills, offering exceptional performance for filtering edible oils, chemicals,\npharmaceuticals, and more.\n\nThe core components include a manual screw-driven system that exerts pressure on the oil to separate\nimpurities, with filtered oil flowing out through a dedicated oil pipe. The use of high-strength\ncast iron for the filter plates ensures durability and high-temperature resistance, making it\nsuitable for filtering high-temperature materials like gelatin and oils. The sturdy carbon steel\nmain beam is sandblasted for added corrosion resistance and structural integrity.\nEquipped with essential accessories such as water pumps, faucets, and pressure gauges, this filter\npress is easy to use and maintain. Its user-friendly manual operation system allows even new\noperators to quickly get up to speed. The filtration process is highly effective, with appropriate\nfilter cloths selected based on the liquid type, ensuring optimal results.\n\nThe compact design saves valuable space in agricultural oil extraction facilities, offering a\ncost-effective solution without compromising on quality or filtration efficiency. Whether for edible\noils or other liquids in the food and chemical industries, this filter press provides a reliable,\nlow-maintenance solution for agricultural oil mills.\nIdeal for agricultural processors looking for efficient, long-lasting, and easy-to-use equipment for\ntheir oil filtration needs.\n\n* According to the filtration liquid, the oil is filtered with the appropriate filter cloth, and the\nfiltration effect is better.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Manual cast iron plate frame Oil Filter Press Machine\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2