            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n7]][55]\n[[Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n1]][56]\n[[Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n9]][57]\n[[Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n8]][58]\n[[Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n2]][59]\n[[Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n3]][60]\n[[Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n5]][61]\n[[Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n4]][62]\n[Home][63] / [Oil Filter Machine][64] / Large industrial grade high temperature resistant cast iron\nplate frame Filter Press Machine\n* ********High-Temperature Resistant Cast Iron Plates:****Made of premium ductile cast iron, the\nfilter plates are engineered to withstand high-pressure and high-temperature filtration\u2014ideal for\nhot-pressed edible oils like palm or sunflower oil.\n* ********Heavy-Duty Frame with Long Service Life:****The main frame is built from high-strength\ncarbon steel with sandblasted anti-corrosion treatment, ensuring excellent structural integrity\nand durability under constant industrial use.\n* ********Hydraulic System for Easy Operation:****Equipped with a reliable hydraulic system,\nincluding a cylinder, pressure gauge, and station, the press enables automatic clamping and\npressure retention with minimal manual labor.\n* ********Designed for Agricultural & Industrial Liquid Filtration:****Perfect for use in small to\nmid-size edible oil processing facilities and agricultural liquid filtration lines, especially\nwhere heat and solids content demand robust filtration performance.\n[ Get a Quote ][65]\nCategory [Oil Filter Machine][66] Tag [Plate oil filter Press][67]\n\nDescription\n\n### Introduction\n\nThe large cast iron plate and frame filter press machine is designed for high-pressure,\nhigh-temperature filtration applications\u2014especially in agricultural oil pressing operations and\nindustrial fluid purification processes. It is built with ductile cast iron filter plates, offering\nsuperior resistance to thermal stress and mechanical load. This makes it particularly effective for\nhot-pressed oil filtration, such as palm oil, peanut oil, or sunflower oil, where conventional\nfilter presses might fail.\nThe frame structure is made from heavy-duty cast iron and carbon steel, treated with sandblasting to\nresist corrosion, deformation, and wear, ensuring long-term stability in demanding environments.\nIt features an integrated hydraulic system for automatic plate clamping and pressure maintenance,\nreducing the need for manual operation and improving filtering consistency. The electrical control\ncabinet supports automatic pressing and pressure retention, with manual functions for cake\ndischarge.\nWhether you\u2019re filtering edible oils, gelatin, or industrial liquids with high solid content, this\npress delivers efficient, stable, and clean results. It is especially suited for rural oil\nprocessing plants, small-scale agri-enterprises, or industrial-grade filtration lines that handle\nheated, viscous liquids.\n\n#### ****Machine structure:****\n* Plate and frame filter press hydraulic system: including hydraulic cylinder, pressure gauge,\nhydraulic station.\n* Filter press frame: The frame material is made of cast iron, which is sturdy and durable with a\nlong service life.\n* Electric control cabinet: automatic clamping, automatic pressure maintenance, manual plate\nopening, manual filter cake unloading.\n* Filter plate and filter frame: The filter plate and filter frame are made of ductile iron, which\nhas strong high temperature resistance and is suitable for high-strength cast iron filter plates\nto filter high-temperature materials.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Large industrial grade cast iron plate frame Filter Press Machine\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMode\u2502Plate \u2502Filtering \u2502Number of Filter\u2502Thickness of \u2502Filter Chamber \u2502Weight\u2502Outline\nl \u2502Size (mm)\u2502Area (m\u00b2) \u2502Plates (pcs) \u2502Filter Cake (mm)\u2502Volume (L) \u2502(kg) \u2502Dimension\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502 \u2502(L*W*H)(mm)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2