            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Industrial edible oil refining machine vegetable oil filter equipment\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Industrial edible oil refining machine vegetable oil filter equipment 2]][55]\n[[Industrial edible oil refining machine vegetable oil filter equipment 5]][56]\n[[Industrial edible oil refining machine vegetable oil filter equipment 1]][57]\n[[Industrial edible oil refining machine vegetable oil filter equipment 6]][58]\n[[Industrial edible oil refining machine vegetable oil filter equipment 3]][59]\n[[Industrial edible oil refining machine vegetable oil filter equipment 4]][60]\n[Home][61] / [Oil Filter Machine][62] / Industrial edible oil refining machine vegetable oil filter\nequipment\n* ********Food-Grade Stainless Steel Construction********:****Polished stainless steel ensures\nhygiene and durability, fully compliant with food machinery standards.\n* ********Advanced Multi-Stage Oil Purification********:****Combines degumming, deacidification,\nbleaching, deodorization, and dewaxing for crystal-clear edible oil.\n* ********Customizable Capacity and Filtration Line Integration********:****Multiple models\navailable to suit any oil mill; can be integrated with plate frame filters for stronger\nfiltration.\n* ********High Oil Purity, Ready for Bottling********: ****Delivers refined oil free from impurities\n\u2014 clear, healthy, and market-ready straight from your line.\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\nCategory [Oil Filter Machine][64] Tag [Refinery Equipment][65]\n\nDescription\n\n## Introduction\n\nOur industrial edible oil refining machine is built with polished food-grade stainless steel,\nensuring superior hygiene, durability, and compliance with strict food production standards. This\nmulti-functional equipment provides a complete professional oil refining process, ****including\ndehydration, water degumming, alkali deacidification, vacuum bleaching with clay, deodorization to\nremove unwanted odors, and dewaxing to eliminate waxes that can affect oil quality.****\n\nWhether you work with soybean, peanut, sunflower seed, cottonseed, rapeseed, flaxseed, rice bran,\ncoconut, palm, or any other vegetable oil, this refining machine helps you transform crude oil into\nhigh-purity, clear, healthy edible oil ready for ****direct bottling and sale****.\n\nWhat makes our solution truly flexible is its wide range of ****customizable models****, meeting the\nneeds of home processors, small workshops, or full-scale edible oil plants. For customers seeking\nextra strong filtration capability, ****our refinery equipment can be integrated with plate frame\noil filter machines,**** forming a powerful continuous filtration production line that achieves the\nhighest levels of oil clarity and safety.\n\nWith low investment cost and energy efficiency, this versatile oil filter equipment helps you\nmaximize yield and product value while ensuring your final oil meets the purest food-grade\nstandards. Build your trusted, green, healthy cooking oil brand with equipment that\u2019s engineered for\nreliability, easy operation, and excellent results every time.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Popular Small-scale Refining Equipment**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\