            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri][GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers Complete refining system\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers. Large-scale refining system]][55]\n[[Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers. Medium-sized refining system 2]][56]\n[[Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers: Dephosphorization tank +\ndecolorization tank + plate and frame filter press]][57]\n[[Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers: Small-scale agitated hydration\ndephosphorization drum + vacuum decolorization tank + plate and frame filter press]][58]\n[[Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers: Small-scale vacuum deodorization\ntank]][59]\n[[Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers. Medium-sized refining system]][60]\n[[Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers. Medium-sized refining system 2]][61]\n[Home][62] / [Oil Filter Machine][63] / Customized refinery equipment for edible oil manufacturers\nComplete refining system\n* ********Customizable Design for Different Scales:****Tailored refinery systems suitable for farm\noil mills, small-to-medium edible oil plants, and commercial processing enterprises.\n* ********Complete Multi-Stage Refining Process:****Performs degumming, deacidification,\ndehydration, decolorization, and deodorization to deliver high-quality edible oil.\n* ********Food-Grade Stainless Steel & Hygienic Construction:****All tanks and pipelines use\npolished food-grade stainless steel for safe, contamination-free production.\n* ********Easy Operation with High Efficiency:****Simple design, convenient installation, and quick\ntraining allow efficient production with minimal labor.\n[ Get a Quote ][64]\nCategory [Oil Filter Machine][65] Tag [Refinery Equipment][66]\n\nDescription\n\n## Introduction\n\nThis fully customized edible oil refining system is designed to meet the diverse processing needs of\nfarms, small oil mills, and medium-sized edible oil producers. This fully integrated refinery\nequipment converts crude vegetable oil into high-quality, market-ready edible oil. All oil storage\nand oil pipes in the refining system are made of food-grade stainless steel and are finely polished.\nIt provides complete fine filtration for crude oil, including degumming and dephosphorization,\ndeacidification, dehydration, and decolorization, ensuring safe and hygienic oil production.\n\nThis system is widely used to process a variety of vegetable oils, including:\nPeanut oil, rapeseed oil, soybean oil, sunflower oil, flaxseed oil, walnut oil, sesame oil, hemp\nseed oil, hemp flower oil, pumpkin oil, black cumin oil (black seed oil), nigella sativa oil, cactus\nseed oil, grapeseed oil, coconut oil, hazelnut oil, peanut oil, almond oil, jajoba seed oil,\npomegranate seed oil, castor seed oil, rapeseed oil, melon seed oil, cumin seed oil, apricot kernel\noil, mustard seed oil, nettle seed oil, neem seed oil, raspberry oil, pepper seed oil, rosehip seed\noil, cocoa bean oil, cocoa nib oil, thistle seed oil, blueberry seed oil, tamanu seed oil, inca\ninchi oil, coriander oil, fennel seed oil, shea butter, and other hot-pressed and cold-pressed\nedible oils.\n\nRegardless of the edible vegetable oil being processed, this refinery machine offers customizable\nconfigurations tailored to the scale of your business. Customization options include agitated\ncentrifugal degumming tanks, neutralization tanks, decolorization tanks, deodorization tanks, and an\noptional plate and frame filter press. This complete refining equipment achieves first-class edible\noil standards in a single refining step, ensuring smooth market access.\n\n### ****Refinery ********M********achine ********W********orkflow:****\n1. Hydration degumming: This degumming method utilizes the hydrophilic phospholipids present in\ncolloidal impurities. A certain amount of water or electrolytes is added to the crude oil to\ncause the phospholipids to absorb water, swell, aggregate, and separate. During the degumming\nprocess, phospholipids are the primary coagulation and precipitation agents, in addition to\nproline, mucus, and a small amount of metal ions that can bind to phospholipids.\n2. Alkali refining and neutralization deacidification: All unrefined oils and fats contain a certain\namount of free fatty acids. The process of removing these free fatty acids from oils and fats is\ncalled deacidification. Deacidification methods include alkali refining, distillation, ASE, and\nesterification.\n3. Adsorption decolorization: Oil is decolorized by adsorption using bleaching clay, activated clay,\nactivated carbon, and other materials.\n4. High-Temperature Deodorization: Utilizing the oil\u2019s low volatility, steam distillation is\nperformed under high-temperature, high-vacuum conditions to remove unpleasant odors and volatile\ncomponents.\n\n### ****Functions and Applications:****\n\nThis refining equipment effectively removes various impurities, including phospholipids, free fatty\nacids, moisture, and odor-causing substances, from crude oil (which can affect its edible value and\nstorage stability). This process eliminates excessive oil processing, resulting in a clear, stable,\nhigh-quality edible oil that meets food industry standards and extends its shelf life.\n\n## Other machines\n\nOther agricultural processing machines that may interest you\n\n## Related products\n* [[Simple 304 stainless steel air pressure edible oil filter 4][Simple 304 stainless steel air\npressure edible oil filter 4]][67]\n\n## [Simple 304 stainless steel air pressure edible oil filter][68]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][69]\n* [[Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter 1][Oil mill edible oil filter machine\ncentrifugal oil filter 1]][70]\n\n## [Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter][71]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][72]\n* [[Brand high quality Air Pressure Oil Filter Machine edible oil filtration 1][Brand high quality\nAir Pressure Oil Filter Machine edible oil filtration 1]][73]\n\n## [Brand high quality Air Pneumatic Oil Filter Machine edible oil filtration][74]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][75]\n* [[Vegetable oil filter machine Hydration centrifugal oil filter machine (7)][Vegetable oil filter\nmachine Hydration centrifugal oil filter machine (7)]][76]\n\n## [Vegetable oil filter machine Hydration centrifugal oil filter machine][77]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][78]\n\n## Increase your agricultural income\n\nGet ready for the upcoming harvest season with limited-time offers on new GQ Agri equipment.\n\n#### Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n#### Contact\n\n86+15070647529\n[[email protected]][79]\n\n#### Open Hours\n\nMonday-Saturday 8 am - 6pm\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nPhone *\nEmail address *\nType *Oil PressOil FilterRoasting MachineFilling MachineAnimal Oil Processing EquipmentScreening\nMachine\nUsed For *\nParagraph Text *\nRequest a quote[Loading][Loading]\n[][80]\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale\nfarming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China,\nwe have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small\nand medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual\nagricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products\ncover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land\nmachinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\n##### Products\n* [Animal Fat Processing][81]\n* [Oil Press][82]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][83]\n* [Roasting Machine][84]\n* [Filling Machine][85]\n* [Cleaning Machine][86]\n* [Land Clearing Vehicle][87]\n* Other Equipment\n\n##### Information\n* [Home][88]\n* [About Us][89]\n* [Blog][90]\n* [Cookie Policy][91]\n* [Contact Us][92]\n\n##### Head Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n(+86) 15070647529\n[email protected]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - GQ Agri All rights reserved | [Sitemap][93]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][94] | [Privacy Policy][95]\n\n[ [en_US][en_US]English ][96]\n[ [id_ID][id_ID]Indonesian ][97] [ [ms_MY][ms_MY]Malay ][98] [ [sw][sw]Swahili ][99] [\n[vi][vi]Vietnamese ][100] [ [ar][ar]Arabic ][101] [[en_US][en_US]English][102]\n[ ][103]\n\nMake advanced technology accessible to every agricultural practitioner, regardless of scale.\nTransform your crops into sustainable income and revitalize rural futures.\n\n## Get it now\n\nGet professional purchasing assistance now\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nDaily Output\nDescription\nSend\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[3]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/\n[4]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-rendering-equipment/\n[5]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-refining-equipment/\n[6]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-oil-fractionation-and-dewaxing-equi\npment/\n[7]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/\n[8]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/screw-oil-press/\n[9]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/hydraulic-oil-press/\n[10]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/temperature-controlled-oil-filter-integrated-oil-pres\n[11]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/diesel-powered-oil-press/\n[12]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/mobile-commercial-oil-press-machine/\n[13]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/edible-oil-filter-machine/\n[14]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/refinery-equipment/\n[15]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/centrifugal-oil-filter/\n[16]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/plate-and-frame-filter-press/\n[17]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/vacuum-oil-filter/\n[18]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/pneumatic-oil-filter/\n[19]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/filling-m"
