            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and filtration\n# equipment\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and filtration\nequipment 1]][55]\n[[Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and filtration\nequipment 7]][56]\n[[Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and filtration\nequipment 4]][57]\n[[Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and filtration\nequipment 5]][58]\n[[Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil decolorization, deodorization and filtration\nequipment 6]][59]\n[Home][60] / [Oil Filter Machine][61] / Farm edible oil Refinery machine Vegetable oil\ndecolorization, deodorization and filtration equipment\n* **Comprehensive Oil Refining in One Machine:** Removes phospholipids, free fatty acids, moisture,\nand impurities for premium edible oil.\n* **Seamless Integration with Oil Press Machines:** Easily connects with screw oil press units to\nform a complete edible oil production line.\n* **Durable Stainless Steel Construction:** Corrosion-resistant, high-temperature-tolerant design\nensures long service life and food-grade safety.\n* **Compact, Cost-Effective and User-Friendly:** Small footprint, low energy consumption, and easy\noperation make it ideal for small to medium-scale processors.\n[ Get a Quote ][62]\nCategory [Oil Filter Machine][63] Tag [Refinery Equipment][64]\n\nDescription\n\n## Introduction\n\nOur Edible Oil Refinery Machine is designed to refine crude oil extracted from more than 20 types of\noil-bearing seeds, including peanuts, sesame, rapeseed, soybeans, sunflower seeds, and linseeds. It\nplays a vital role in producing high-quality edible oil by effectively removing impurities,\nphospholipids, free fatty acids, moisture, and odor. These harmful substances in crude oil not only\naffect taste and shelf life but also cause difficulties in deep processing. After refining, the oil\nmeets national food safety standards, resists rancidity, stores well, and produces minimal smoke\nduring cooking while preserving natural flavor.\n\nThis refinery unit adopts a stainless-steel construction, providing excellent corrosion resistance\nand temperature tolerance. The system integrates dephosphorization, neutralization, dehydration,\ndecolorization, and deodorization processes within one compact unit, ensuring stable performance and\nconsistent oil quality. With a streamlined design and easy operation, it is suitable for oil shops,\nfood processing factories, and small to medium oil producers seeking higher profitability and\nproduct value.\n\nImportantly, this machine can be seamlessly connected to oil press machines, forming a full oil\nproduction line from pressing to refining. This integration reduces manual handling, improves\nprocessing efficiency, and provides a fast return on investment for users aiming to deliver\nhigh-quality, market-ready edible oil.\n\n### Features:\n* Made of stainless steel, corrosion-resistant and high-temperature resistant.\n* Simple design and exquisite appearance.\n* Easy to use and stable operation.\n* Achieve multiple functions such as dephosphorization, dealkali, and dehydration of oil products.\n* Refined oil has excellent quality.\n* Applicable to the refining of various oil crops and has a wide range of uses.\n* Low investment cost and high rate of return.\n\n[GD Standard model of refining equipment][GD Standard model of refining equipment]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25