            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter 1]][55]\n[[Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter 9]][56]\n[[Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter 7]][57]\n[[Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter 8]][58]\n[[Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter 3]][59]\n[[Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter 4]][60]\n[[Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter 6]][61]\n[Home][62] / [Oil Filter Machine][63] / Oil mill edible oil filter machine centrifugal oil filter\n* ********Rapid and Effective Oil-Residue Separation********:****The upgraded centrifugal force\ndesign ensures maximum separation of oil and impurities, producing cleaner crude oil in just\nminutes.\n* ********Compact Design with High Flow Capacity********:****Small footprint but capable of\nprocessing 5\u201340 kg crude oil per cycle, ideal for farm oil presses and small oil workshops.\n* ********Easy Operation with Low Maintenance********:****No filter cloth needed; residue only needs\nremoval once per 1000 kg, saving time and labor costs.\n* ********Stable Operation with Advanced Shock Absorption********:****Precision-balanced drum with\ntriple rubber dampers keeps operation safe, smooth, and quiet\u2014no need for anchor bolts.\n[ Get a Quote ][64]\nCategory [Oil Filter Machine][65] Tag [Centrifugal oil filter][66]\n\nDescription\n\n### **Introduction**\n\nThis upgraded centrifugal oil filter machine is specially built for farm oil mills and small\nvegetable oil pressing workshops. It uses high-speed centrifugal force to efficiently separate\nsolids from crude oil, ensuring your pressed oil is cleaner and clearer.\n* ****Robust Construction****\nThe filter barrel is formed with a precision spinning process, finely ground and balanced to solve\nthe high-speed drum balance problem. This ensures safe, stable, and reliable performance during\ncontinuous operation.\n* ****Optimized Design Details****\nKey parts like the oil inlet and outlet are carefully designed: the oil inlet is wide for easy\npouring, and the duckbill-shaped oil outlet prevents clogging and makes cleaning simple. The\nfood-grade stainless steel filter bucket has a smooth inner wall for easy residue removal.\n* ****High Efficiency for Small-Scale Producers****\nOne cycle filters 5\u201340 kg of crude oil in just 3\u20134 minutes. It works well for crude oil filtration\nfrom rapeseed, peanut, sesame, camellia seeds, and more. No need for frequent cleaning\u2014remove\nresidue once every 1000 kg to maintain high output and lower operating costs.\n* ****User-Friendly and Cost-Effective****\nNo filter cloth required means less maintenance and lower costs. The built-in shock absorbers\nprevent vibration and keep the machine running smoothly without needing to bolt it to the ground.\n\nThis makes it an ideal choice for farmers, small oil press mills, and any agricultural oil\nprocessing business wanting to improve oil quality, reduce impurities, and deliver clear,\nmarket-ready vegetable oil.\n\n#### ****Description of the Design:****\n\nApplication of the high science and technology, the drum requires high balance, slightly deviation\nwill cause the high speed rotating of the drum as a vibrator, which will make the oil shock,\neventually liquid-solid resonance occurs, although we have the protection of the outer protector to\nkeep away from the danger, it will cause internal parts damage. The tank is simplified by special\ntouch pressure forming, after fine grinding and die-vibration, and inside and outside fine\nworkmanship by the axial movement of the centripetal force to balance the centrifugal force, and\nsolve the problem of the balance of high speed rotation drum. Keep the balanced operation of the\nmachine,with stable security, safety performance .This machine is equipped with damping device of\ndomestic initiation.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Oil mill edible oil centrifugal oil filter machine\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502GQ-60 \u2502GQ-90 \u2502GQ-130\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nMotor \u25021.5kw \u25023kw \u250240kw\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nTransfer method\u2502Belt transfer \u2502Belt transfer \u2502Belt transfer\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u