            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Upgraded high-pressure hydraulic oil press for industrial cold-pressed oil\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Upgraded high-pressure hydraulic oil press for industrial cold-pressed oil double-barrel1]][55]\n[[Upgraded high-pressure hydraulic oil press for industrial cold-pressed oil Single-barrel 4]][56]\n[[Upgraded high-pressure hydraulic oil press for industrial cold-pressed oil Single-barrel 5]][57]\n[[Upgraded high-pressure hydraulic oil press for industrial cold-pressed oil Single-barrel 6]][58]\n[[Upgraded high-pressure hydraulic oil press for industrial cold-pressed oil 2]][59]\n[[Upgraded high-pressure hydraulic oil press for industrial cold-pressed oil 3]][60]\n[Home][61] / [Oil Press Machine][62] / Upgraded high-pressure hydraulic oil press for industrial\ncold-pressed oil\n* ********High-Pressure Cold Extraction for Premium Oils:****\nEnsures faster extraction with powerful hydraulic pressure while preserving delicate flavors and\nnutrients.\n* ********Single or Dual Barrel Flexibility:****\nCustomizable setup allows choice between single or dual hydraulic barrels to match production\nneeds.\n* ********Durable, Food-Grade Construction:****\nBuilt with stainless steel or thick carbon steel, designed for longevity, corrosion resistance,\nand cleanability.\n* ********Energy Efficient, Low Residual Oil, Eco-Friendly:****\nDelivers high yield with minimal waste using low-temperature hydraulic operation, ideal for\neco-conscious production.\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\nCategory [Oil Press Machine][64] Tag [Hydraulic Oil Press Machine][65]\n\nDescription\n\nThis machine is engineered for discerning producers aiming to extract high-end cold-pressed oils\nfrom crops like sesame, walnuts, sunflower, avocado, olives, coconut kernel, peanut, and shea nut.\nFeaturing a high-pressure strip hydraulic barrel, it accelerates oil extraction speed, outperforming\nconventional models while preserving natural flavors, nutrients, and vibrant color through gentle\nlow-temperature hydraulic pressure. With CE and RoHS certifications, this oil press combines safety,\nefficiency, and quality\u2014making it perfect for small factories and workshops.\n\n### ****Structure & Materials********.****\n\nThe press is constructed with thick carbon steel or stainless steel components, ensuring durability\nand corrosion resistance. The hydraulic barrel, optimized for strip-style pressing, withstands\nintense pressure and prolonged use. Sealed, low-temperature hydraulic operation guarantees energy\nefficiency, reduced oil waste, and improved environmental performance. Available in single or\ndual-barrel variants, the system offers production flexibility without compromising on stability or\noutput.\n\n### ****Filtration & Oil Yield Efficiency********.****\n\nA standout feature is the low residual oil content in press cake, meaning more oil is recovered with\neach cycle. The hydraulic system\u2019s precision performance reduces energy consumption and waste,\naligning with sustainable production principles. Ideal for premium cold-pressed oil businesses, the\nmachine ensures consistent yield and quality.\n\n### ****Easy Operation & Maintenance********.****\n\nDesigned with user convenience in mind, the press features a straightforward hydraulic mechanism\nthat is easy to operate and maintain. The robust cylinder structure tolerates high pressure while\nremaining simple to clean. Rubber-mounted wheels make the unit mobile and accessible. Supporting\nboth single and dual-barrel configurations allows operators to scale output according to demand,\nkeeping production agile.\n\n### ****Working Principle********.****\n\nOil-bearing materials are loaded into the hydraulic barrel, where a downward piston applies steady\nforce. Oil flows out through narrow strip gaps and is channeled to a collection tray before entering\nthe storage vessel. This cold-press hydraulic action seals in oil quality and cuts oxidative\ndegradation\u2014ideal for extracting fresh, nutrient-rich oils.\n\n### ****Accessories & Service********.****\n\nWe proudly offer a 1-year warranty and lifetime maintenance support, ensuring your press delivers\nperformance for years to come. Our certifications (CE, RoHS) guarantee compatibility with global\nmarkets and adherence to stringent safety standards.\n\nOur Upgraded High-Pressure Strip Hydraulic Cold Oil Press is a significant enhancement over\n[previous old model hydraulic cold press][66], especially for users seeking accelerated processing\nand high-quality results. Whether you require a single or dual-barrel setup, energy savings, or\nlow-waste refining, this machine delivers. It stands out as the ideal choice for high-end oil\nproducers focused on health, efficiency, and eco-friendly operations.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Upgraded high-pressure strip hydraulic oil press**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u25026GQ-400 (Strip row, single pressing \u25026GQ-400 (Strip row, double pressing\n\u2502cylinder) \u2502cylinder)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSingle-drum capacity \u250260-80 \u250260-80\n(kg) \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nPressing time per \u250220-25 \u250220-25\ncycle \u2502 \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nNumber of presses p