            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri][GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Automatic food dryer oil press roasting machine can be customized\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Automatic food dryer oil press roasting machine can be customized (2)]][55]\n[Home][56] / [Roasting Machine][57] / Automatic food dryer oil press roasting machine can be\ncustomized\n* ********Simple operation:****automatic temperature control, one-button baking, one-button\ndischarging, simple and convenient.\n* ********Multiple models:****There are many different baking machine models to choose from, meeting\nthe needs of different scenarios such as personal farms and large-scale baking processing.\n* ********Wide range of uses: ****Suitable for roasting and drying of all oil pressing raw\nmaterials, health care product raw materials, Chinese medicinal materials raw materials, and\ncondiments and spices.\n[ Get a Quote ][58]\nCategory [Roasting Machine][59] Tag [Drum roasting machine][60]\n\nDescription\n\n### Introduction\n\nThis drum roasting machine consists of two parts: a box and a drum. The main body adopts a\ncountercurrent tower internal circulation structure. The overall modular structure is convenient for\ndisassembly and transportation. It occupies a small area, has good drying quality, low labor\noperation intensity, and low equipment cost.\nThe heating system and the drum are integrated into a single design, featuring a compact structure,\nlow energy consumption and high thermal efficiency. The multifunctional rotary dryer puts the\nmaterial into the machine by controlling the equipment motor and transmission mechanism, and the\nmotor drives the dryer to achieve material mixing, stirring, and drying.\nSuitable for all oil pressing raw materials, health care product raw materials, Chinese herbal\nmedicine raw materials, and condiment and spice processing. For example, roasting peanuts, melon\nseeds, walnuts, sesame seeds, soybeans, hazelnuts, pine nuts, coffee beans, chestnuts, pistachios\nand other dried fruits and oilseeds. Suitable for shopping malls, supermarkets and other places. It\nmeets the current international requirements for the quality of drying and baking of various crops.\nIt is green and environmentally friendly, heat-insulating and energy-saving, luxurious and hygienic,\nconvenient and fast, labor-saving and time-saving, and has high yields. It is currently an ideal\nroasting equipment.\n\n#### Functional Highlights:\n\nEquipped with a special funnel, feeding is very convenient, funnel-type feeding, time-saving and\nlabor-saving, and has an automatic pouring function.\nThe drum is equipped with stirring blades, and adopts an inertial stirring method, which is more\nuniform, efficient, and evenly heated than the manual active stirring method.\nThe arc heating tube group is heated and durable. Equipped with a thermostat, the temperature can be\nadjusted at will.\nHigh-quality copper core motor, equipped with a thermal sensor protector, can be used safely in any\nenvironment.\nFully automatic temperature control, using digital display temperature controller, automatic alarm\nwhen reaching the specified temperature, one-button baking, one-button discharging, simple and\nconvenient.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Dryer oil press roasting machine\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250