u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n180 \u2502180 mm \u250272 r/min \u250230 kW \u25022900 \u00d7 2550 \u00d7 2250 mm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n200 \u2502200 mm \u250272 r/min \u250237 kW \u25023100 \u00d7 2550 \u00d7 2250 mm\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n*The above specifications are for reference only. The machine is constantly being upgraded, so the\nparameters may differ from the actual ones. Please understand.\n*One-year warranty for the whole machine; plastic inner packaging + wooden box outer packaging\nensures transportation safety;\n\n### Introduction\n\nThis spiral temperature control and oil filter integrated oil press we developed combines cold\npressing and hot pressing functions to ensure the best oil yield while retaining the nutritional\nvalue of the oil. The integrated temperature control system can be precisely adjusted and is\nsuitable for various oil seeds such as peanuts, soybeans, flax seeds, tea seeds, cactus, coconuts,\nalmonds, palm kernels, sunflower seeds and sesame. In addition, the integrated air compression\nfiltration system ensures that the extracted oil is pure and flawless and can be eaten directly\nwithout additional processing.\n\nThe machine is made of 316 food-grade stainless steel to ensure durability and hygiene, which is\nessential to maintain the quality of the oil. Its user-friendly interface simplifies operation,\nmaking it easy for even oil press novices to get started. Whether you are a small-scale producer or\na large-scale enterprise, this machine will meet your needs, providing stable performance and\nefficient operation.\n\nIncorporating this oil press into your production line means embracing reliability, quality and\ninnovation. It is more than just a machine; it is a step towards increasing your oil production to\nmeet modern standards and consumer expectations.\n\n## Other machines\n\nOther agricultural processing machines that may interest you\n\n## Related products\n* [[Heavy duty large capacity round row screw oil press machine][Heavy duty large capacity round row\nscrew oil press machine]][66]\n\n## [Heavy duty large capacity round row screw oil press machine][67]\n* [Oil Press Machine][68]\n* [[Small commercial temperature-controlled cold press oil press 1][Small commercial\ntemperature-controlled cold press oil press 1]][69]\n\n## [Small commercial temperature-controlled cold press oil press][70]\n* [Oil Press Machine][71]\n* [[Commercial single screw screw high oil output round row oil press (3)][Commercial single screw\nscrew high oil output round row oil press (3)]][72]\n\n## [Commercial single screw screw high oil output round row oil press][73]\n* [Oil Press Machine][74]\n* [[Customizable fully automatic spiral pressure cooking oil press (3)][Customizable fully automatic\nspiral pressure cooking oil press (3)]][75]\n\n## [Customizable fully automatic spiral pressure cooking oil press][76]\n* [Oil Press Machine][77]\n\n## Increase your agricultural income\n\nGet ready for the upcoming harvest season with limited-time offers on new GQ Agri equipment.\n\n#### Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n#### Contact\n\n86+15070647529\n[[email protected]][78]\n\n#### Open Hours\n\nMonday-Saturday 8 am - 6pm\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nPhone *\nEmail address *\nType *Oil PressOil FilterRoasting MachineFilling MachineAnimal Oil Processing EquipmentScreening\nMachine\nUsed For *\nParagraph Text *\nRequest a quote[Loading][Loading]\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale\nfarming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China,\nwe have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small\nand medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual\nagricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products\ncover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land\nmachinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\n##### Products\n* [Animal Fat Processing][79]\n* [Oil Press][80]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][81]\n* [Roasting Machine][82]\n* [Filling Machine][83]\n* [Cleaning Machine][84]\n* [Land Clearing Vehicle][85]\n* Other Equipment\n\n##### Information\n* [Home][86]\n* [About Us][87]\n* [Blog][88]\n* [Cookie Policy][89]\n* [Contact Us][90]\n\n##### Head Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n(+86) 15070647529\n[email protected]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - GQ Agri All rights reserved | [Sitemap][91]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][92] | [Privacy Policy][93]\n\n[ [en_US]English ][94]\n[ [id_ID][id_ID]Indonesian ][95] [ [ms_MY][ms_MY]Malay ][96] [ [sw][sw]Swahili ][97] [\n[vi][vi]Vietnamese ][98] [ [ar][ar]Arabic ][99] [[en_US]English][100]\n\nMake advanced technology accessible to every agricultural practitioner, regardless of scale.\nTransform your crops into sustainable income and revitalize rural futures.\n\n## Get it now\n\nGet professional purchasing assistance now\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nDaily Output\nDescription\nSend\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[3]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/\n[4]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-rendering-equipment/\n[5]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-refining-equipment/\n[6]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-oil-f"
