            "url": "https://smallagrimachinery.com/product/affordable-dual-nozzle-500ml-5000ml-piston-type-dosing-edible-oil-filling-machine/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri][GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Affordable dual-nozzle 500ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Affordable dual-nozzle 100ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine 1]][55]\n[[Affordable dual-nozzle 100ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine 5]][56]\n[[Affordable dual-nozzle 100ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine 6]][57]\n[[Affordable dual-nozzle 100ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine 3]][58]\n[[Affordable dual-nozzle 100ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine 8]][59]\n[[Affordable dual-nozzle 100ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine 4]][60]\n[Home][61] / [Filling Machine][62] / Affordable dual-nozzle 500ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible\noil filling machine\n* ********Wide Filling Range (500ml\u20135000ml capacity): ****Covers a broad volume spectrum, suitable\nfor both small retail bottles and large containers.\n* ********High Efficiency with Dual Nozzles: ****Achieves 100\u2013300 bottles per hour, reducing manual\nlabor and increasing production speed.\n* ********Precision Piston Dosing System:****Ensures accurate filling with anti-drip nozzles,\nminimizing waste and preventing spillage.\n* ********Versatile Applications Across Industries:****Handles edible oils, viscous liquids,\ndetergents, honey, lubricants, and more with consistent performance.\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\nCategory [Filling Machine][64] Tag [Piston filling machine][65]\n\nDescription\n\n## Introduction\n\nThe Dual-nozzle 500ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine is a reliable\nsemi-automatic solution designed to meet the diverse filling needs of small to medium-scale\nproduction lines. Engineered for versatility, precision, and efficiency, this machine is\nparticularly well-suited for handling viscous liquids such as edible oils, honey, lubricants,\ndetergents, and other semi-thick products. With its adjustable filling range of 500ml to 5000ml and\na speed of 100\u2013300 bottles per hour, it provides an ideal balance between flexibility and\nproductivity for businesses looking to scale operations.\n* ****Compact Structure and Durable Design:\n****Built with a sturdy frame and compact layout, the machine integrates core components such as\nmagnetic cylinders, dosing valves, piston chambers, and electrical control elements into one\nefficient system. Its space-saving design allows it to fit seamlessly into workshops or\nsmall-scale production facilities without compromising on performance. The use of high-quality\nmaterials ensures durability, long service life, and reliable operation under continuous\nworkloads.\n* ****Piston Dosing Mechanism for Accuracy:\n****At the heart of this filling machine lies its piston volumetric dosing technology. The piston,\npowered by an air cylinder, moves back and forth inside the dosing chamber to draw in and dispense\nthe exact volume of liquid required. This precise mechanism guarantees high filling accuracy, even\nwith viscous or sticky products. The anti-drip nozzle design further ensures that no spillage or\nleakage occurs during the filling process, maintaining clean production lines and reducing\nmaterial waste.\n* ****Adjustable Nozzles for Multiple Bottle Sizes:\n****The machine is equipped with adjustable-height filling nozzles, making it suitable for a wide\nrange of bottle shapes and sizes. Whether filling small retail bottles of 500ml or large\ncontainers up to 5000ml, the operator can easily adjust the nozzle position to match different\npackaging requirements. This adaptability saves time when switching between products and ensures\nconsistent performance across different packaging lines.\n* ****User-Friendly Operation and Control:\n****Although semi-automatic, the machine employs sensor-assisted control and pneumatic actuation,\nsimplifying operation for users. Operators can set the filling volume, adjust the filling speed,\nand manage production cycles through a straightforward control interface. With its easy-to-use\nsettings and mechanical positioning system, the machine reduces operator workload while\nmaintaining high consistency.\n* ****Flexible Speed and Foam Prevention:\n****The filling speed is fully adjustable, which allows operators to tailor the process according\nto the type of product being filled. Slower speeds can be selected for foamy or highly viscous\nliquids to prevent overflow, while higher speeds maximize throughput for free-flowing oils. This\nadaptability ensures smooth operation across different product lines without sacrificing\nprecision.\n\n### ****Wide Range of Applications.****\n\nThanks to its broad compatibility with viscous and semi-viscous liquids, this piston-type filling\nmachine is widely applied in industries such as:\n* Food processing: soybean oil, peanut oil, olive oil, sesame oil, blended oils, honey, syrups.\n* Household chemicals: dishwashing liquid, hand sanitizers, liquid soaps, cleaning detergents.\n* Industrial products: lubricants, motor oils, and other dense fluids requiring accurate filling.\n\nIts versatile performance makes it a valuable asset for businesses catering to diverse markets, from\nfood and beverage producers to cosmetics and industrial chemical suppliers.\n\nThe Affordable dual-nozzle 500ml\u20135000ml piston-type dosing filling machine combines accuracy,\nefficiency, and adaptability in one compact system. Designed to handle a variety of viscous liquids,\nit offers a practical solution for small and medium-scale producers seeking reliable filling\nperformance. With its wide volume range, dual-nozzle design, and piston dosing mechanism, this\nmachine ensures precision filling with minimal waste, while its user-friendly operation allows\nbusinesses to optimize production with ease.\nWhether you are filling edible oils, honey, detergents, or lubricants, this piston-type machine\ndelivers consistent results, helping your production line meet both market demand and quality\nexpectations.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250