            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri][GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Semi-automatic 4/6-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Semi-automatic 4-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine (6)]][55]\n[[Semi-automatic 4-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine (5)]][56]\n[[Semi-automatic 4-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine (3)]][57]\n[[Semi-automatic 4-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine (2)]][58]\n[[Semi-automatic 4-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine (1)]][59]\n[[Semi-automatic 4-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine (4)]][60]\n[Home][61] / [Filling Machine][62] / Semi-automatic 4/6-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling\nmachine\n* **Multi-head Options for Every Scale of Production** \u2013 Choose from 2, 4, or 6 filling heads to\nmatch your output needs.\n* **Fast, Accurate, and Drip-free Filling Performance** \u2013 Delivers clean results with zero product\nleakage.\n* **Touchscreen PLC Control for Easy Operation** \u2013 Quick setup, flexible adjustments, and improved\nefficiency.\n* **Built for Hygiene and Durability** \u2013 Stainless steel structure, corrosion-resistant, and easy to\nsanitize.\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\nCategory [Filling Machine][64] Tag [Piston filling machine][65]\n\nDescription\n\n## Introduction\n\nLooking for a filling machine that combines accuracy, speed, and flexibility? The Semi-automatic\nflow meter gear pump filling machine is designed to simplify your production process, delivering\nprecise and efficient filling for containers between 1L and 20L. Whether you\u2019re filling edible oil,\nlubricants, detergents, or chemicals, this machine is built to handle your needs reliably.\n\n#### ****Why Choose This Filling Machine?****\n\nUnlike conventional machines that rely on mechanical adjustments, this model integrates flow meter\nmeasurement, gear pump technology, and PLC electronic control in one system. The result is a filling\nsolution that is more accurate, hygienic, and easier to use.\n\n### ****Designed for Accuracy and Efficiency:****\n* Equipped with premium alloy gear pumps for high-precision filling.\n* No need for elevated oil tanks, reducing costs and safety risks.\n* Anti-drip filling nozzles with vacuum suction design ensure clean filling without leakage.\n\n#### ****Customizable to Match Your Production Needs:****\n\nThis model is available in three configurations:\n* 2-head machine \u2013 Best for smaller batches or entry-level production.\n* 4-head machine \u2013 Ideal for medium-volume operations seeking efficiency.\n* 6-head machine \u2013 Perfect for high-output factories that need speed.\n\nWhether you\u2019re a startup or an established factory, there\u2019s a suitable version for your capacity\nrequirements.\n\n****User-friendly Operation:****\n\nWith its touchscreen PLC panel, operators can easily set and adjust filling parameters in seconds.\nThe stainless-steel conveyor with roller design makes handling containers smoother while reducing\nlabor fatigue. Meanwhile, the integrated frequency converter allows adjustable pump speeds, giving\nmore flexibility for different types of liquid products.\n\n****Hygienic and Durable Construction:****\n\nMade of stainless steel square tube framework, the machine resists corrosion and ensures compliance\nwith food-grade standards. Its robust structure makes it ideal for industries where both cleanliness\nand durability are essential.\n\n****Wide Application Range:****\n* Edible oils such as sunflower oil, peanut oil, and soybean oil;\n* Lubricating and industrial oils;\n* Household chemical liquids, detergents, and cleaners;\n* Agricultural and industrial solutions;\n\nThe Semi-automatic 2/4/6-head flow meter filling machine is a future-proof investment that adapts to\nyour production scale. By offering high accuracy, flexible configurations, and easy operation, it\nallows businesses to increase productivity while keeping costs under control.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Semi-automatic flowmeter pump metered filling machine\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502GQZR-2 \u2502GQZR-4 \u2502GQZR-6\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFilling Heads \u25022 \u25024 \u25026\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFilling Volume \u2502500-5000ml;5000-25000ml;\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFilling Accuracy\u2502\u00b10.5%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2