            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine 1]][55]\n[[Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine 2]][56]\n[[Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine 4]][57]\n[[Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine 3]][58]\n[[Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine 5]][59]\n[Home][60] / [Filling Machine][61] / Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling\nmachine\n* **Flexible Filling Options for 1\u201320L Containers** \u2013 Suitable for edible oil, lubricants,\nchemicals, and other liquid products.\n* **High Precision Flow Meter & Gear Pump System** \u2013 Ensures accurate, consistent, and efficient\nfilling with minimal waste.\n* **Three Configurations: 2, 4, or 6 Filling Heads** \u2013 Adaptable to different production capacities\nand batch sizes.\n* **Durable Stainless Steel Construction with Easy Cleaning** \u2013 Hygienic, corrosion-resistant, and\ndesigned for long service life.\n[ Get a Quote ][62]\nCategory [Filling Machine][63] Tag [Piston filling machine][64]\n\nDescription\n\n## Introduction\n\nThe Semi-automatic flow meter gear pump filling machine is a versatile solution designed for liquid\nfilling applications across industries such as food, edible oil, lubricants, chemicals, and\npharmaceuticals. Engineered with a PLC control system, precision gear pumps, and a reliable flow\nmeter, this machine combines automation, accuracy, and flexibility. Its adaptable design allows\nfilling from 1L to 20L containers, making it a practical investment for both small and medium-scale\nproduction lines.\n* ********Robust Stainless Steel Construction:********\n****The entire frame is manufactured from high-grade stainless steel square tubing, ensuring\ndurability and strong resistance to corrosion. This construction not only guarantees long-term\nreliability but also simplifies cleaning and sanitation, meeting strict hygiene standards in food\nand chemical industries.\n* ********Advanced PLC Control System:********\n****Unlike traditional mechanical adjustments, the filling volume on this machine is set\nelectronically via an intuitive touchscreen interface. The central PLC processor controls all\nparameters, allowing operators to easily switch between filling volumes, flow speeds, and\ncontainer sizes. This not only improves production efficiency but also minimizes operator\nworkload.\n* ********Precision Gear Pump Technology:********\n****At the heart of the system lies a 0.2-grade alloy gear pump, engineered for self-priming and\ndelivering high filling accuracy without the need for elevated storage tanks. This innovation\nreduces installation costs and eliminates potential safety risks. Combined with the flow meter, it\nensures consistent dosage and smooth operation with minimal waste.\n* ********Anti-drip Filling Valves:********\n****The machine is equipped with customizable filling nozzles (umbrella valve or column valve),\nmanufactured to industrial precision. Each nozzle incorporates anti-drip and vacuum suction\nfeatures, ensuring no leakage, clean container filling, and reduced product loss.\n\n### ****Flexible Configurations for Different Capacities.****\n\nTo match different production requirements, this filling machine comes in three models:\n* 2-head version \u2013 Ideal for lower output and small-scale operations.\n* 4-head version \u2013 Balanced for mid-scale production lines.\n* 6-head version \u2013 High-speed option for larger batch operations.\n\nThis modular design ensures that customers can select the most suitable machine according to their\nfilling volume and output capacity.The machine features a stainless-steel roller conveyor, reducing\nlabor intensity while keeping maintenance costs low. The integrated variable frequency drive (VFD)\nallows precise control of pump speed, enabling adjustable filling speeds for different liquid\nviscosities.\n\n### ****Applications.****\n* Edible oils (vegetable oil, sunflower oil, peanut oil, etc.)\n* Lubricants and industrial oils\n* Chemical solutions and solvents\n* Liquid detergents and cleaning agents\n\nThe Semi-automatic 2/4/6-head gear pump flow meter filling machine is a reliable, accurate, and\ncost-efficient solution for a wide range of liquid filling operations. With its stainless steel\nbody, advanced PLC controls, and customizable filling capacity, it provides unmatched flexibility\nand long-term value for growing businesses.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Semi-automatic flowmeter pump metered filling machine\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502GQZR-2 \u2502GQZR-4 \u2502GQZR-6\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFilling Heads \u25022 \u25024 \u25026\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2