\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n*The above parameters are for reference only. Due to continuous machine upgrades, actual\nspecifications may differ. Please understand.\n\n[Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine Details 2][Semi-automatic\n2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine Details 2] [Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump\nPLC flow meter piston filling machine Details 3][Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter\npiston filling machine Details 3] [Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling\nmachine Details 4][Semi-automatic 2-head gear pump PLC flow meter piston filling machine Details 4]\n\n## Other machines\n\nOther agricultural processing machines that may interest you\n\n## Related products\n* [[Affordable dual-nozzle 100ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine 1][Affordable\ndual-nozzle 100ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine 1]][65]\n\n## [Affordable dual-nozzle 500ml-5000ml piston-type dosing edible oil filling machine][66]\n* [Filling Machine][67]\n* [[Fully automatic servo pump gravity type multi-head linear 12 filling machine 1][Fully automatic\nservo pump gravity type multi-head linear 12 filling machine 1]][68]\n\n## [Fully automatic servo pump gravity type multi-head linear filling machine][69]\n* [Filling Machine][70]\n* [[Semi-automatic horizontal pneumatic gravity liquid filling machine with 6 heads\n1][Semi-automatic horizontal pneumatic gravity liquid filling machine with 6 heads 1]][71]\n\n## [Semi-automatic horizontal pneumatic gravity liquid filling machine with multiple heads][72]\n* [Filling Machine][73]\n* [[Commercial simple small automatic desktop quantitative liquid paste filling machine No\nhopper][Commercial simple small automatic desktop quantitative liquid paste filling machine No\nhopper]][74]\n\n## [Commercial simple small automatic desktop quantitative liquid paste filling machine][75]\n* [Filling Machine][76]\n\n## Increase your agricultural income\n\nGet ready for the upcoming harvest season with limited-time offers on new GQ Agri equipment.\n\n#### Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n#### Contact\n\n86+15070647529\n[[email protected]][77]\n\n#### Open Hours\n\nMonday-Saturday 8 am - 6pm\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nPhone *\nEmail address *\nType *Oil PressOil FilterRoasting MachineFilling MachineAnimal Oil Processing EquipmentScreening\nMachine\nUsed For *\nParagraph Text *\nRequest a quote[Loading][Loading]\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale\nfarming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China,\nwe have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small\nand medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual\nagricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products\ncover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land\nmachinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\n##### Products\n* [Animal Fat Processing][78]\n* [Oil Press][79]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][80]\n* [Roasting Machine][81]\n* [Filling Machine][82]\n* [Cleaning Machine][83]\n* [Land Clearing Vehicle][84]\n* Other Equipment\n\n##### Information\n* [Home][85]\n* [About Us][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Cookie Policy][88]\n* [Contact Us][89]\n\n##### Head Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n(+86) 15070647529\n[email protected]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - GQ Agri All rights reserved | [Sitemap][90]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][91] | [Privacy Policy][92]\n\n[ [en_US]English ][93]\n[ [id_ID][id_ID]Indonesian ][94] [ [ms_MY][ms_MY]Malay ][95] [ [sw][sw]Swahili ][96] [\n[vi][vi]Vietnamese ][97] [ [ar][ar]Arabic ][98] [[en_US]English][99]\n\nMake advanced technology accessible to every agricultural practitioner, regardless of scale.\nTransform your crops into sustainable income and revitalize rural futures.\n\n## Get it now\n\nGet professional purchasing assistance now\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nDaily Output\nDescription\nSend\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[3]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/\n[4]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-rendering-equipment/\n[5]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-refining-equipment/\n[6]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-oil-fractionation-and-dewaxing-equi\npment/\n[7]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/\n[8]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/screw-oil-press/\n"
