            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri][GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling machine wholesale price\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling machine wholesale price Dual-head\n1]][55]\n[[Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling machine wholesale price 1]][56]\n[[Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling machine wholesale price 8]][57]\n[[Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling machine wholesale price - Image 4]][58]\n[[Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling machine wholesale price 2]][59]\n[[Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling machine wholesale price - Image 6]][60]\n[[Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling machine wholesale price - Image 7]][61]\n[Home][62] / [Filling Machine][63] / Small pneumatic gravity quantitative paste liquid filling\nmachine wholesale price\n* ********Precise Semi-Auto Filling by Piston & Gravity:****\nCombines cylinder-driven piston control with gravity to deliver accurate, consistent fill volumes\nwith controlled speed.\n* ********Flexible Single- or Dual-Head Configuration:****\nChoose between single-head or dual-head models to match your required production rate and output\ntargets.\n* ********Wide Industry & Product Compatibility:****\nIdeal for sectors like food, cosmetics, chemical, beverage, and more\u2014fills everything from water\nand juice to honey, sauces, syrups, creams, and gels.\n* ********Customizable Volume & Flow Control:****\nAdjustable fill settings via air cylinder or reed switch for fast or slow filling, plus easily set\nexact dose by pressing the fill button.\n[ Get a Quote ][64]\nCategory [Filling Machine][65] Tag [Gravity Filling Machine][66]\n\nDescription\n\n## Introduction\n\nThe Small Pneumatic Gravity Quantitative Paste Liquid Filling Machine is a semi-automatic,\npiston-based filler with a 5 L customizable hopper\u2014built to combine pneumatic precision with gravity\nfor stable, accurate fills. Simply set your desired quantity once, and each button press delivers\nthe exact volume\u2014whether you\u2019re filling sauces, creams, oils, or thin liquids like juice or water.\nWith low maintenance needs, compact design, and adaptable operation, it\u2019s perfect for\nsmall-to-medium batch production across multiple industries.\n\n#### ****Versatile Structure & Functionality********.****\n\nThis machine operates through a headset piston driven by a pneumatic cylinder that draws and\ndispenses product via a three-way rotary valve. A reed switch allows fine control of cylinder\nstroke, enabling either rapid or gentle fill speeds. You can freely adjust the hopper size, choose\nsingle- or dual-head versions, and precisely set filling quantities at the click of a button.\nPneumatic actuation combined with gravity ensures consistent dosing, confident performance, and low\nmechanical complexity.\n\n#### ****Optimal for Diverse Applications********.****\n\nIt shines in packaging across food, beverage, chemical, cosmetics, and daily-use goods. Perfect for\nfilling a wide range of fluids, including milk, beer, oil, juices, powders, viscous liquids like\nhoney, sauces, pastes (ketchup, peanut butter, fruit jam), paint, shampoo, yogurt, glue, and more.\nWhether you\u2019re scaling production or dealing with delicate or dense fluids, this filler adapts to\nyour product type and consistency.\n\n### ****Why It Works for You********?****\n* Easy to Operate & Maintain: Minimal mechanical complexity ensures quick setup, cleaning, and\noperator training.\n* Scalable Output: Single-head for modest output, dual-head for doubled throughput without new\nequipment.\n* Highly Customizable: From hopper size to actuation speed, adjust to your product flow and\npackaging format.\n* Clean & Safe: Stainless steel components and pneumatic control meet hygiene standards while\nminimizing contamination and wear.\n\nLet\u2019s say you run a boutique condiment operation and need to fill 250 ml bottles of salad dressing.\nLoad your custom-sized hopper, dial in the desired volume, and press the fill button\u2014this machine\ndelivers consistent, clean fills with speed and repeatability. Want to double your throughput as\ndemand rises? Simply switch to the dual-head variant\u2014no overhaul needed.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n**Small pneumatic gravity quantitative filling machine**\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel \u2502GQ-G1WG\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25