            "url": "https://smallagrimachinery.com/product/automatic-hydraulic-oil-press-machine-with-multiple-piston-models/",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n* [Screw Oil Press][8]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n* [Refinery Equipment][14]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n* [Contact][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n* [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n* [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n* [Screw Oil Press][36]\n* [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n* [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n* [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n* [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n* [Refinery Equipment][42]\n* [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n* [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n* [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n* [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n* [News][51]\n* [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Automatic hydraulic oil press machine with multiple piston models\n\nUnleash the full potential of your farm with GQ-Agri\u2019s reliable oil press machine. Our affordable,\ndurable equipment is perfect for smallholders and community agripreneurs. It can help you extract\nhigh-quality oil from various seeds and nuts to help rural economic growth and development.\n\n[[Automatic hydraulic oil press with multiple piston models 280]][55]\n[[Automatic hydraulic oil press with multiple piston models 320 strip-row press cylinder]][56]\n[[Automatic hydraulic oil press with multiple piston models 320 drilled press cylinder]][57]\n[Home][58] / [Oil Press Machine][59] / Automatic hydraulic oil press machine with multiple piston\nmodels\n* **Two types of press cylinders:** There are two types of press steel options, strip-row press\ncylinder and drilled press cylinder, to meet different oil needs.\n* **Two models:** Two different models of hydraulic oil presses correspond to two piston diameter\nsizes, 280mm and 320mm.\n* **High oil yield:** 30MPa pressure and slow pressing significantly improve oil yield.\n\n* Each pressing time is about 2 hours, depending on the type of raw material (hardness of the\nmaterial). For a faster, more powerful version, [please see our GQYS model.][60]\n\n[ Get a Quote ][61]\nCategory [Oil Press Machine][62] Tag [Hydraulic Oil Press Machine][63]\n\nDescription\n\n[Automatic hydraulic oil press with multiple piston models 280]\n\n#### 280 Equipment Technical Parameters:\n* Matching power: 3kw;\n* Diameter of barrel: 480mm;\n* Height of barrel: 800mm;\n* Daily processing capacity: 1000kg/24h;\n* Piston diameter: 280mm;\n* Oil top stroke: 750mm;\n* Frame: channel steel;\n* Working pressure: 30mpa;\n* Dimensions: 1250*1250*2400;\n\n[Automatic hydraulic oil press with multiple piston models 320 drilled press cylinder][Automatic\nhydraulic oil press with multiple piston models 320 drilled press cylinder]\n\n#### 320 Drilled Press Cylinder Model: (for low-fat raw materials)\n* Matching power: 3kw;\n* Diameter of barrel: 410mm;\n* Height of barrel: 800mm;\n* Daily processing capacity: 1500kg/24h;\n* Diameter of piston: 320mm;\n* Oil top stroke: 750mm;\n* Frame: channel steel;\n* Working pressure: 30mpa;\n* Dimensions: 1250*1250*2400;\n\n[Automatic hydraulic oil press with multiple piston models 320 strip-row press cylinder][Automatic\nhydraulic oil press with multiple piston models 320 strip-row press cylinder]\n\n#### 320 Strip-row Press Cylinder Model: (for high-fat raw materials)\n* Matching power: 3kw;\n* Diameter of barrel: 410mm;\n* Height of barrel: 800mm;\n* Daily processing capacity: 1500kg/24h;\n* Diameter of piston: 320mm;\n* Oil top stroke: 750mm;\n* Frame: steel plate;\n* Working pressure: 30mpa;\n* Dimensions: 1250*1250*2400;\n\n## Other machines\n\nOther agricultural processing machines that may interest you\n\n## Related products\n* [[Hot and cold oil press machine can be customized in model and power type (4)][Hot and cold oil\npress machine can be customized in model and power type (4)]][64]\n\n## [Hot and cold oil press machine can be customized in model and power type][65]\n* [Oil Press Machine][66]\n* [[S03 Mobile commercial fully automatic 304 stainless steel temperature-controlled screw oil press\nMachine][S03 Mobile commercial fully automatic 304 stainless steel temperature-controlled screw\noil press Machine]][67]\n\n## [Mobile 304 stainless steel temperature-controlled MINI screw oil press S03][68]\n* [Oil Press Machine][69]\n* [[Big Capacity Red Oil Extractor Palm Fruit Electric or Diesel Oil Press Machine 1][Big Capacity\nRed Oil Extractor Palm Fruit Electric or Diesel Oil Press Machine 1]][70]\n\n## [Big Capacity Red Oil Extractor Palm Fruit Electric or Diesel Oil Press Machine][71]\n* [Oil Press Machine][72]\n* [[Customized spiral temperature-controlled oil filter integrated oil press (1)][Customized spiral\ntemperature-controlled oil filter integrated oil press (1)]][73]\n\n## [Customized spiral temperature-controlled oil filter integrated oil press machine][74]\n* [Oil Press Machine][75]\n\n## Increase your agricultural income\n\nGet ready for the upcoming harvest season with limited-time offers on new GQ Agri equipment.\n\n#### Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n#### Contact\n\n86+15070647529\n[[email protected]][76]\n\n#### Open Hours\n\nMonday-Saturday 8 am - 6pm\n\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nPlease enable JavaScript in your browser to complete this form.\nName *\nPhone *\nEmail address *\nType *Oil PressOil FilterRoasting MachineFilling MachineAnimal Oil Processing EquipmentScreening\nMachine\nUsed For *\nParagraph Text *\nRequest a quote[Loading][Loading]\n\nGQ-Agri is a leading agricultural machinery manufacturer from China, and we believe that small-scale\nfarming should not mean small-scale profits. As a leading agricultural machinery supplier in China,\nwe have long been committed to designing and developing affordable, durable and easy-to-use small\nand medium-sized agricultural processing equipment. Focus on helping global farmers and individual\nagricultural processing entrepreneurs transform raw crops into higher-value products. Our products\ncover oilseed pressing equipment, animal oil processing equipment, refining equipment, land\nmachinery, etc., aiming to improve production efficiency and reduce operating costs.\n\n##### Products\n* [Animal Fat Processing][77]\n* [Oil Press][78]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][79]\n* [Roasting Machine][80]\n* [Filling Machine][81]\n* [Cleaning Machine][82]\n* [Land Clearing Vehicle][83]\n* Other Equipment\n\n##### Information\n* [Home][84]\n* [About Us][85]\n* [Blog][86]\n* [Cookie Policy][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n\n##### Head Office\n\nBuilding 10, Xueziwei Industrial Zone C, Yabian Community, Shajing Street, Bao'an District,\nShenzhen, China\n\n(+86) 15070647529\n[email protected]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 - GQ Agri All rights reserved | [Sitemap][89]\n\n[Terms & Conditions][90] | [Privacy Policy][91]\n\n[ [en_US]English ][92]\n[ [id_ID][id_ID]Indonesian ][93] [ [ms_MY][ms_MY]Malay ][94] [ [sw][sw]Swahili ][95] [\n[vi][vi]Vietnamese ][96] [ [ar][ar]Arabic ][97] [[en_US]English][98]\n\nMake advanced technology accessible to every agricultural practitioner, regardless of scale.\nTransform your crops into sustainable income and revitalize rural futures.\n\n## Get it now\n\nGet professional purchasing assistance now\n\nName\nEmail\nPhone\nDaily Output\nDescription\nSend\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[3]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/\n[4]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-rendering-equipment/\n[5]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-refining-equipment/\n[6]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-oil-fractionation-and-dewaxing-equi\npment/\n[7]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/\n[8]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/screw-oil-press/\n[9]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/hydraulic-oil-press/\n[10]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/temperature-controlled-oil-filter-integrated-oil-pres\n[11]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/diesel-powered-oil-press/\n[12]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/mobile-commercial-oil-press-machine/\n[13]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/edible-oil-filter-machine/\n[14]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/refinery-equipment/\n[15]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/centrifugal-oil-filter/\n[16]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/plate-and-frame-filter-press/\n[17]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/vacuum-oil-filter/\n[18]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/pneumatic-oil-filter/\n[19]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/filling-machine/\n[20]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/roasting-machine/\n[21]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/about/\n[22]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/contact/\n[23]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/blog/\n[24]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/white-paper/\n[25]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/get-a-quote/\n[26]: #\n[27]: #\n[28]: #\n[29]: #\n[30]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[31]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/\n[32]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-rendering-equipment/\n[33]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-fat-oil-refining-equipment/\n[34]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/animal-fat-processing/animal-oil-fractionation-and-dewaxing-equ\nipment/\n[35]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/\n[36]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/screw-oil-press/\n[37]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/hydraulic-oil-press/\n[38]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/temperature-controlled-oil-filter-integrated-oil-pres\n[39]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/diesel-powered-oil-press/\n[40]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-press/mobile-commercial-oil-press-machine/\n[41]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/edible-oil-filter-machine/\n[42]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/refinery-equipment/\n[43]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/centrifugal-oil-filter/\n[44]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/plate-and-frame-filter-press/\n[45]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/vacuum-oil-filter/\n[46]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/oil-filter-machine/pneumatic-oil-filter/\n[47]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/filling-machine/\n[48]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/roasting-machine/\n[49]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/about/\n[50]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/contact/\n[51]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/blog/\n[52]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/white-paper/\n[53]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/get-a-quote/\n[54]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/\n[55]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Automatic-hydraulic-oil-press-with-m\nultiple-piston-models-280.webp\n[56]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Automatic-hydraulic-oil-press-with-m\nultiple-piston-models-320-\u6761\u5f62\u538b\u69a8\u6876\u6b3e.webp\n[57]: https://smallagrimachinery.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/A