            "text": "Avocado Oil for Healthiest Cooking - Soilmates\n\nShop\n\nStories\n\nAbout\n\n'Ugly' Gems\n\nHello Chef\n\nAccount\n\nCart\n\nShop\n\nAll products\n\nOils\n\nSale\n\nSpecials\n\nRecipe & stories\n\nAbout\n\nUgly Gems\n\nHello Chef\n\nAbout\n\nAbout us\n\nSoil to oil\n\nUgly Gems\n\nAmbassadors\n\nContact\n\nAccount\n\nAll products\n\nOils\n\nSale\n\nSpecials\n\nSale\n\nAbout us\n\nSoil to oil\n\nUgly Gems\n\nAmbassadors\n\nContact\n\nChange region/language\n\nRegion\n\nAustria (EUR\n\nBelgium (EUR\n\nBulgaria (EUR\n\nCroatia (EUR\n\nCyprus (EUR\n\nCzechia (EUR\n\nDenmark (EUR\n\nEstonia (EUR\n\nFinland (EUR\n\nFrance (EUR\n\nGermany (EUR\n\nGreece (EUR\n\nHungary (EUR\n\nIreland (EUR\n\nItaly (EUR\n\nLatvia (EUR\n\nLithuania (EUR\n\nLuxembourg (EUR\n\nMalta (EUR\n\nNetherlands (EUR\n\nNorway (EUR\n\nPoland (EUR\n\nPortugal (EUR\n\nRomania (EUR\n\nSlovakia (EUR\n\nSlovenia (EUR\n\nSpain (EUR\n\nSweden (EUR\n\nSwitzerland (EUR\n\nUnited Kingdom (GBP\n\nLanguage\n\nEnglish\n\nDutch\n\nGerman\n\nConfirm\n\nCancel\n\nHi there mate!\n\nYou're looking good! But for us it\u2019s the inside that counts.\n\nYou're looking good! But for us it\u2019s the inside that counts.\n\nSHOP\n\nShop\n\nShop\n\nView all\n\nOils\n\nSpecials\n\nHello Chef\n\nView all\n\nDid you know? More than 20% of all avocados get tossed away for being \u2018too ugly\u2019. That\u2019s over a million avocados a day in Europe alone! This is when Soilmates come in, rescue them and squeeze out the good stuff. The result? The superhero of cooking oils.\nYep, beauty is on the inside, mates!\n100% pure avocado oil: \u2713 Perfect for cooking \u2713 Ideal for frying \u2713 Excellent for roasting \u2713 Great for baking \u2713 Delicious on the BBQ\n\nPopular products Popular products\nPopular products Popular products\n\nPopular products Popular products\nPopular products Popular products\n\nView all\n\nBestseller\n\nAvocado Oil\n\n\u20ac8,99\n\nAvocado Oil\n\n\u20ac8,99\n\nOur number one be