][163]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Premium][164]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Economy][165]\n* [Clear Vinyl Curtains][166]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][167]\n* [Food & Beverage][168]\n* [Food Safety Clean Curtains][169]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][170]\n* [Freezer Strip Curtains][171]\n* [Insulated Warehouse Curtains \u2013 Foldable][172]\n* [Dock Door Screens][173]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][174]\n* [Insulatied Warehouse Curtains \u2013 Stationary][175]\n* [Vinyl Pallet Covers][176]\n* [Manufacturing & Industrial][177]\n* [Accordion Fold Curtains][178]\n* [Anti Static Curtains][179]\n* [Industrial Blackout Curtains][180]\n* [Industrial Roll Up Curtains][181]\n* [Canvas Weld Curtains][182]\n* [Welding Screens][183]\n* [Welding Booth Enclosures][184]\n* [Welding Curtain Rolls][185]\n* [Welding Curtain Partitions][186]\n* [Welding Strip Curtains][187]\n* [Welding Blankets][188]\n* [Welding Blanket Rolls][189]\n* [Machine Equipment Covers][190]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Premium][191]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Economy][192]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][193]\n* [Bollard Post Covers][194]\n* [Warehouse Curtains & Enclosures][195]\n* [Acoustic Screens][196]\n* [Sound Blankets][197]\n* [Sound Curtains \u2013 Folding][198]\n* [Sound Curtains][199]\n* [Outdoor Sound Curtains][200]\n* [Construction Sound Curtains][201]\n* [Pharmaceutical][202]\n* [Accordion Fold Curtains][203]\n* [Anti Static Curtains][204]\n* [Chemical Safety Curtains][205]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][206]\n* [Transportation][207]\n* [Trailer Strip Curtains][208]\n* [Loading Dock Enclosures][209]\n* [Request a Quote][210]\n* [Resources][211]\n* * [Revit BIM Models][212]\n* [Catalogs][213]\n* [Blog][214]\n* [Fabric Specifications & Data Sheets][215]\n* [Hardware Specifications & Data Sheets][216]\n* [Guides & Calculators][217]\n* [Installation Instructions][218]\n* [FAQ][219]\n* [About Us][220]\n* [Contact][221]\n[U.S. Manufacturer]\nU.S. Manufacturer American made \u00b7 [Iron Clad Warranty][222]\n100-Year Family Heritage SteelGuard est. 2005\n4,000+ Orders Per Year Trusted by industry nationwide\nBIM\n[Revit / BIM Files][223] For architects & engineers\n\n# Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Steel Guard Main Image ID5462]\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Steel Guard Main Image ID3136]\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Steel Guard Main Image ID4243]\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Steel Guard Main Image ID4244]\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Thumbnail Image ID3136]\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Thumbnail Image ID5462]\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Thumbnail Image ID3136]\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Thumbnail Image ID4243]\n* [Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control Thumbnail Image ID4244]\n\n## Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains for Industrial Noise Control\n\nOutdoor sound barrier curtains are designed to reduce noise levels and control sound in exterior\nindustrial environments. Steel Guard Safety outdoor noise control systems are engineered for\npermanent or semi-permanent installation to reduce noise from equipment, machinery, and facility\noperations near public or residential areas.\n\nThese outdoor sound barrier curtains can be installed on existing walls, fencing, or custom support\nstructures to create effective noise reduction barriers. Built for durability, they are constructed\nusing weather-resistant materials including fiberglass sound absorption layers and optional mass\nloaded vinyl (MLV) for enhanced sound blocking.\n\nFor temporary job site applications, explore our\n[construction noise barriers][224] designed for portable and short-term noise control.\n\n## Benefits of Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtains\n* **Reduce noise from industrial equipment, compressors, and mechanical systems**\n* **Designed for outdoor environments with weather-resistant materials**\n* **Help maintain compliant noise levels in surrounding residential and commercial areas**\n* **Custom configurations for mounting to fences, walls, or structural frames**\n\nFor a complete range of solutions, explore our [industrial noise control products][225] designed for\nindustrial and commercial environments.\n\nFor indoor or flexible applications, see our [industrial sound curtains][226] for versatile noise\ncontrol solutions.\n\n## Outdoor Noise Control Applications\n\nOutdoor sound barrier curtain systems are commonly used in industrial facilities, mechanical yards,\nand equipment enclosures where long-term noise reduction is required.\n* Industrial equipment noise control\n* Mechanical yard sound barriers\n* Compressor and generator enclosures\n* Facility perimeter noise reduction\n* Outdoor HVAC and mechanical system noise control\n\n## Durable Outdoor Sound Barrier Systems\n\nSteel Guard Safety outdoor sound barrier curtains are designed to withstand harsh environmental\nconditions while maintaining consistent acoustic performance. Available in multiple thicknesses\nincluding 2-inch and 4-inch fiberglass assemblies, these systems can be customized to meet specific\nsound reduction requirements.\n\nOptional configurations include mass loaded vinyl barriers for increased sound blocking performance,\nas well as reinforced mounting systems for long-term outdoor installations. Materials are resistant\nto moisture, mold, and environmental wear, ensuring long-lasting performance in demanding\nconditions.\n\nOutdoor sound barrier curtains are a reliable solution for reducing noise pollution and improving\nenvironmental compliance in industrial and commercial settings.\n\n**Download our Revit BIM files for easy integration into your Outdoor Sound Barrier Curtain\nProject**\n\n[[Autodesk Revit] Open Revit Library][227]\n* [REQUEST QUOTE][228]\n\n## Additional Information:\n\n### Types of Outdoor Sound Barrier Panels\n\nFor more information on designing your Outdoor Sound Barrier Panels and Curtains , or do get a\nquote, contact one of our Experienced Sales Staff at 1-800-347-8368\n\n**SEE MATERIALS SECTION FOR MORE DETAILED SOUND ATTENUATION CHARTS**\n* **SCC-9 EXT \u2013** Silicone Coated Vinyl Front and Back Quilted to a 2\u2033 Fiberglass Batting \u2013 STC 19\n* **SCC-12 EXT** \u2013 Silicone Coated Vinyl Front Quilted to a 1\u2033 Fiberglass B"
