][163]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Premium][164]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Economy][165]\n* [Clear Vinyl Curtains][166]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][167]\n* [Food & Beverage][168]\n* [Food Safety Clean Curtains][169]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][170]\n* [Freezer Strip Curtains][171]\n* [Insulated Warehouse Curtains \u2013 Foldable][172]\n* [Dock Door Screens][173]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][174]\n* [Insulatied Warehouse Curtains \u2013 Stationary][175]\n* [Vinyl Pallet Covers][176]\n* [Manufacturing & Industrial][177]\n* [Accordion Fold Curtains][178]\n* [Anti Static Curtains][179]\n* [Industrial Blackout Curtains][180]\n* [Industrial Roll Up Curtains][181]\n* [Canvas Weld Curtains][182]\n* [Welding Screens][183]\n* [Welding Booth Enclosures][184]\n* [Welding Curtain Rolls][185]\n* [Welding Curtain Partitions][186]\n* [Welding Strip Curtains][187]\n* [Welding Blankets][188]\n* [Welding Blanket Rolls][189]\n* [Machine Equipment Covers][190]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Premium][191]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Economy][192]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][193]\n* [Bollard Post Covers][194]\n* [Warehouse Curtains & Enclosures][195]\n* [Acoustic Screens][196]\n* [Sound Blankets][197]\n* [Sound Curtains \u2013 Folding][198]\n* [Sound Curtains][199]\n* [Outdoor Sound Curtains][200]\n* [Construction Sound Curtains][201]\n* [Pharmaceutical][202]\n* [Accordion Fold Curtains][203]\n* [Anti Static Curtains][204]\n* [Chemical Safety Curtains][205]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][206]\n* [Transportation][207]\n* [Trailer Strip Curtains][208]\n* [Loading Dock Enclosures][209]\n* [Request a Quote][210]\n* [Resources][211]\n* * [Revit BIM Models][212]\n* [Catalogs][213]\n* [Blog][214]\n* [Fabric Specifications & Data Sheets][215]\n* [Hardware Specifications & Data Sheets][216]\n* [Guides & Calculators][217]\n* [Installation Instructions][218]\n* [FAQ][219]\n* [About Us][220]\n* [Contact][221]\n[U.S. Manufacturer]\nU.S. Manufacturer American made \u00b7 [Iron Clad Warranty][222]\n100-Year Family Heritage SteelGuard est. 2005\n4,000+ Orders Per Year Trusted by industry nationwide\nBIM\n[Revit / BIM Files][223] For architects & engineers\n\n# Portable Acoustic Screens for Industrial Noise Control\n* [Portable Acoustic Screens for Industrial Noise Control Steel Guard Main Image ID1962]\n* [Portable Acoustic Screens for Industrial Noise Control Thumbnail Image ID277]\n* [Portable Acoustic Screens for Industrial Noise Control Thumbnail Image ID1962]\n\n## Industrial Portable Acoustic Screens and Noise Barriers\n\nPortable acoustic screens provide a flexible solution for reducing noise from machinery and\nindustrial processes. Steel Guard Safety portable noise barriers are designed to absorb and block\nsound while allowing easy repositioning within a facility.\n\n**Portable acoustic screens are ideal for facilities that require temporary or movable noise control\nsolutions without permanent installation.**\n\nSound Shield acoustic screens combine quilted fiberglass sound absorption with mass loaded composite\nmaterials to control both reflected and transmitted noise. This dual-layer design helps reduce\nambient noise while blocking lower frequency sound from equipment and machinery.\n\nFor fixed installations, explore our\n[industrial sound curtains][224],\nor view our complete range of\n[industrial noise control products][225].\n\n## Flexible and Modular Noise Control Design\n\nPortable acoustic screens are modular and can be configured into two, three, or four-sided\nenclosures. Panels can be connected with hinges to create adjustable layouts, making them ideal for\nisolating noise at the source.\n\nOptional caster wheels allow screens to be easily moved and repositioned as needed. Each system is\nbuilt with a heavy-duty 16-gauge galvanized steel frame for durability and long-term use in\nindustrial environments.\n\n**Common Applications for Acoustic Screens**\n* Compressor enclosures\n* Grinding and cutting equipment\n* Printing press noise control\n* Equipment noise barriers\n* Blower and fan noise reduction\n\n**Download our Revit BIM files for easy integration into your Acoustic Screens Project**\n\n[[Autodesk Revit] Open Revit Library][226]\n* [REQUEST QUOTE][227]\n\n## Additional Information:\n\n## Materials for Portable Acoustic Screens\n* **SCC-10** \u2013 1\u2033 Fiberglass Batting with Vinyl Quilted Front Plus 1 lb/sq ft Mass Loaded Vinyl Plus\n1\u2033 Fiberglass Back with Quilted Vinyl \u2013 STC 29 \u2013 [See More Details][228]\n* **SCC-12** \u2013 1\u2033 Fiberglass Batting with Vinyl Quilted Front Plus 1 lb/sq ft Mass Loaded Vinyl Back\n\u2013 STC 27 \u2013 [See More Details][229]\n* **SCC-13** \u2013 2\u2033 Fiberglass Batting with Vinyl Quilted Front Plus 1 lb/sq ft Mass Loaded Vinyl Back\n\u2013 STC 32 \u2013 [See More Details][230]\n\n**SEE MATERIALS TAB FOR MORE DETAILS**\n\n## When to Use Portable Acoustic Screens vs Other Noise Control Solutions\n\nPortable acoustic screens are ideal when noise control needs to be flexible or temporary. Unlike\nfixed sound curtains or full enclosures, acoustic screens can be repositioned as needed to isolate\nnoise from different equipment or work areas.\n\n* Features\n* Materials\n* FAQ\n* Literature\n\n### Sound Shield Acoustic Screens\n\n[Sound Shield Acoustic Screens]\n\n### SCC-10\n\n[Front - 1\" Vinyl Quilted Fiberglass + Interior - 1 lb/sq ft Mass Loaded Vinyl + Back - 1\" Vinyl\nQuilted FiberglassNRC .75STC 29]\n\nFront - 1\" Vinyl Quilted Fiberglass + Interior - 1 lb/sq ft Mass Loaded Vinyl + Back - 1\" Vinyl\nQuilted Fiberglass\nNRC .75\nSTC 29\n\n#### SOUND ABSORPTION (HZ) PER ASTM C423\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel Number\u2502125\u2502250\u2502500\u25021000\u25022000\u25024000\u2502NRC\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSCC-10 \u2502.18\u2502.62\u2502.89\u2502.84 \u2502.60 \u2502.45 \u2502.75\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n#### SOUND TRANSMISSION LOSS (HZ) PER ASTM E90 & E413\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nModel Number\u2502Barrier\u2502125\u2502250\u2502500\u25021000\u25022000\u25024000\u2502STC\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSCC-10 \u25021 lb. \u250212 \u250216 \u250227 \u250240 \u250244 \u250243 \u250229\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSSC-11 \u25022 lb. \u250219 \u250222 \u250228 \u250240 \u250256 \u250261 \u250233\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n### SCC-12 & SCC-13\n\n[Front - 1\" Vinyl Quilted Fiberglass + 1 lb/sq ft Mass Loaded Vinyl NRC .70STC 27]\n\nFront - 1\" Vinyl Quilted Fiberglass + 1 lb/sq ft Mass Loaded Vinyl\nNRC .70\nSTC 27\n\n[Front - 2\" Vinyl Quilted Fiberglass + - 1 lb/sq ft Mass Loaded Vinyl Back NRC .70STC 27]\n\nFront - 2\" Vinyl Quilted Fiberglass + - 1 lb/sq ft"
