][163]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Premium][164]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Economy][165]\n* [Clear Vinyl Curtains][166]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][167]\n* [Food & Beverage][168]\n* [Food Safety Clean Curtains][169]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][170]\n* [Freezer Strip Curtains][171]\n* [Insulated Warehouse Curtains \u2013 Foldable][172]\n* [Dock Door Screens][173]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][174]\n* [Insulatied Warehouse Curtains \u2013 Stationary][175]\n* [Vinyl Pallet Covers][176]\n* [Manufacturing & Industrial][177]\n* [Accordion Fold Curtains][178]\n* [Anti Static Curtains][179]\n* [Industrial Blackout Curtains][180]\n* [Industrial Roll Up Curtains][181]\n* [Canvas Weld Curtains][182]\n* [Welding Screens][183]\n* [Welding Booth Enclosures][184]\n* [Welding Curtain Rolls][185]\n* [Welding Curtain Partitions][186]\n* [Welding Strip Curtains][187]\n* [Welding Blankets][188]\n* [Welding Blanket Rolls][189]\n* [Machine Equipment Covers][190]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Premium][191]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Economy][192]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][193]\n* [Bollard Post Covers][194]\n* [Warehouse Curtains & Enclosures][195]\n* [Acoustic Screens][196]\n* [Sound Blankets][197]\n* [Sound Curtains \u2013 Folding][198]\n* [Sound Curtains][199]\n* [Outdoor Sound Curtains][200]\n* [Construction Sound Curtains][201]\n* [Pharmaceutical][202]\n* [Accordion Fold Curtains][203]\n* [Anti Static Curtains][204]\n* [Chemical Safety Curtains][205]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][206]\n* [Transportation][207]\n* [Trailer Strip Curtains][208]\n* [Loading Dock Enclosures][209]\n* [Request a Quote][210]\n* [Resources][211]\n* * [Revit BIM Models][212]\n* [Catalogs][213]\n* [Blog][214]\n* [Fabric Specifications & Data Sheets][215]\n* [Hardware Specifications & Data Sheets][216]\n* [Guides & Calculators][217]\n* [Installation Instructions][218]\n* [FAQ][219]\n* [About Us][220]\n* [Contact][221]\n[U.S. Manufacturer]\nU.S. Manufacturer American made \u00b7 [Iron Clad Warranty][222]\n100-Year Family Heritage SteelGuard est. 2005\n4,000+ Orders Per Year Trusted by industry nationwide\nBIM\n[Revit / BIM Files][223] For architects & engineers\n\n# Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Steel Guard Main Image ID1961]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Steel Guard Main Image ID2975]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Steel Guard Main Image ID4943]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Steel Guard Main Image ID4142]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Steel Guard Main Image ID3118]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Thumbnail Image ID1961]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Thumbnail Image ID1961]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Thumbnail Image ID2975]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Thumbnail Image ID4943]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Thumbnail Image ID4142]\n* [Industrial Soundproof Curtains | Noise Control Curtains Thumbnail Image ID3118]\n\n## Industrial Soundproof Curtains & Sound Dampening Barriers\n\n**High-performance industrial soundproof curtains designed for noise control, sound containment, and\nacoustic barrier applications in manufacturing and industrial facilities.**\n\nIndustrial soundproof curtains are made from sound absorbing and sound dampening materials to keep\nnoise at OSHA safe levels. These quilted industrial soundproof curtains offer sound reduction to a\nTransmission Class up to **STC 33**. Sound Shield Noise Control Curtains are ideal for making\nacoustic enclosures or dividing rooms to absorb and block sound.\n\nAll Sound Shield industrial soundproof curtains contain an exterior quilted fiberglass layer\ncombined with interior layers of **mass loaded vinyl (MLV)** to effectively reduce excessive noise.\nThe noise control curtains can also be equipped with our track and roller system to allow easy\naccess for people and equipment. For facilities requiring a complete solution, explore our full line\nof [industrial noise control solutions][224] designed to reduce sound levels and improve workplace\nenvironments.\n\nSteel Guard Safety Sound Shield Curtains are also commonly referred to as industrial sound dampening\ncurtains, industrial acoustic curtains, and industrial sound curtains. While no flexible curtain\nsystem can completely eliminate sound, these systems are engineered to significantly reduce noise\ntransmission and improve acoustic control in industrial environments.\n\nExcellent for use in soundproofing warehouses, industrial machinery, auditoriums, and more. Besides\nmaking the workplace speech intelligible, [industrial noise control curtains can help prevent noise\ninduced hearing loss][225] by supporting compliance with OSHA occupational noise exposure\nguidelines.\n\n## Sound Curtains vs Sound Blankets\n\nWhile both sound curtains and sound blankets are used for industrial noise control, they serve\ndifferent purposes. Sound curtains are flexible barrier systems typically used to enclose machinery\nor divide work areas, providing both sound blocking and absorption. Sound blankets are more commonly\nmounted to walls or wrapped around equipment to absorb sound and reduce reverberation. For equipment\nwrapping and wall-mounted applications see our [industrial sound blankets][226].\n\n## Industrial Soundproof Curtain Applications\n* In-plant noise control curtain dividers\n* Soundproof curtain enclosures\n* Acoustical curtain dividers\n* Acoustic enclosures for industrial equipment\n* Heavy machine enclosures\n* Compressor and blower housing\n* Flexible industrial doorways\n* Drive-through sound barrier openings\n* Stamping press noise enclosures\n* Noise reverberation control in large spaces\n* Temporary construction noise barriers\n* Soundproofing wall panels and partitions\n* Fan and ventilation system enclosures\n* Grinding and compactor noise control\n* Flexible room dividers for industrial use\n\n**SEE MATERIAL OPTIONS IN TAB BELOW**\n\n**Download our Revit BIM files for easy integration into your industrial sound curtain project**\n\n[[Autodesk Revit] Open Revit Library][227]\n* [REQUEST QUOTE][228]\n\n## Additional Information:\n\n## Related Sound Curtain and Noise Control Products\n* [Folding Sound Curtains][229]\n* [Acoustic Screens][230]\n* [Acoustic Enclosures]["
