][163]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Premium][164]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Economy][165]\n* [Clear Vinyl Curtains][166]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][167]\n* [Food & Beverage][168]\n* [Food Safety Clean Curtains][169]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][170]\n* [Freezer Strip Curtains][171]\n* [Insulated Warehouse Curtains \u2013 Foldable][172]\n* [Dock Door Screens][173]\n* [Insulated Pallet Covers][174]\n* [Insulatied Warehouse Curtains \u2013 Stationary][175]\n* [Vinyl Pallet Covers][176]\n* [Manufacturing & Industrial][177]\n* [Accordion Fold Curtains][178]\n* [Anti Static Curtains][179]\n* [Industrial Blackout Curtains][180]\n* [Industrial Roll Up Curtains][181]\n* [Canvas Weld Curtains][182]\n* [Welding Screens][183]\n* [Welding Booth Enclosures][184]\n* [Welding Curtain Rolls][185]\n* [Welding Curtain Partitions][186]\n* [Welding Strip Curtains][187]\n* [Welding Blankets][188]\n* [Welding Blanket Rolls][189]\n* [Machine Equipment Covers][190]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Premium][191]\n* [Machine Safety Fencing \u2013 Economy][192]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][193]\n* [Bollard Post Covers][194]\n* [Warehouse Curtains & Enclosures][195]\n* [Acoustic Screens][196]\n* [Sound Blankets][197]\n* [Sound Curtains \u2013 Folding][198]\n* [Sound Curtains][199]\n* [Outdoor Sound Curtains][200]\n* [Construction Sound Curtains][201]\n* [Pharmaceutical][202]\n* [Accordion Fold Curtains][203]\n* [Anti Static Curtains][204]\n* [Chemical Safety Curtains][205]\n* [Clear PVC Strip Curtains][206]\n* [Transportation][207]\n* [Trailer Strip Curtains][208]\n* [Loading Dock Enclosures][209]\n* [Request a Quote][210]\n* [Resources][211]\n* * [Revit BIM Models][212]\n* [Catalogs][213]\n* [Blog][214]\n* [Fabric Specifications & Data Sheets][215]\n* [Hardware Specifications & Data Sheets][216]\n* [Guides & Calculators][217]\n* [Installation Instructions][218]\n* [FAQ][219]\n* [About Us][220]\n* [Contact][221]\n[U.S. Manufacturer]\nU.S. Manufacturer American made \u00b7 [Iron Clad Warranty][222]\n100-Year Family Heritage SteelGuard est. 2005\n4,000+ Orders Per Year Trusted by industry nationwide\nBIM\n[Revit / BIM Files][223] For architects & engineers\n\n# Hydraulic Press Guards for Industrial Safety & Machine Protection\n* [Hydraulic Press Guards for Industrial Safety & Machine Protection Steel Guard Main Image ID4713]\n* [Hydraulic Press Guards for Industrial Safety & Machine Protection Steel Guard Main Image ID4711]\n* [Hydraulic Press Guards for Industrial Safety & Machine Protection Thumbnail Image ID4712]\n* [Hydraulic Press Guards for Industrial Safety & Machine Protection Thumbnail Image ID4713]\n* [Hydraulic Press Guards for Industrial Safety & Machine Protection Thumbnail Image ID4711]\n\n**Hydraulic press guards** from **Steel Guard Safety** provide a flexible and effective solution for\nprotecting operators, equipment, and surrounding work areas from hazards associated with press\noperations. These curtain-based systems help create controlled safety zones without limiting\nvisibility or workflow.\n\nAs part of our [industrial curtain systems][224], these solutions offer a cost-effective alternative\nto rigid guarding while maintaining accessibility and flexibility.\n\n**Request a Quote or Configure Your Hydraulic Press Guard System Today**\n\n## Protect Operators from Press Hazards\n\n**Hydraulic press safety curtains** help contain debris, reduce exposure to moving parts, and create\nseparation between operators and dangerous machinery.\n\nMachine guarding is a critical component of workplace safety, as outlined by the [Occupational\nSafety and Health Administration (OSHA)][225], making proper barrier systems essential in press\nenvironments.\n* Protect workers from moving press components\n* Contain debris and material ejection\n* Improve overall workplace safety\n* Create controlled machine operation zones\n\n## Flexible Machine Guarding Without Permanent Barriers\n\nUnlike rigid guards, **hydraulic press guard curtains** provide a flexible solution that can be\nopened, moved, or reconfigured as needed.\n\nThese systems are often used alongside broader [industrial curtain wall systems][226] to create\ncomplete machine guarding and facility zoning solutions.\n* Easy access for maintenance and setup\n* Retractable or movable configurations\n* Fast installation with minimal downtime\n* Cost-effective alternative to fixed guarding\n\n## Durable Curtain Systems for Press Environments\n\nOur **press guarding curtains** are built to withstand demanding industrial conditions, including\nimpact, debris, and repeated use.\n* Heavy-duty vinyl materials for durability\n* Reinforced seams and mounting points\n* Optional clear panels for visibility\n* Custom configurations for specific press setups\n\n## Applications for Hydraulic Press Guards\n\n**Hydraulic press safety curtains** are used across industries where press operations require\nprotection and separation.\n* Metal stamping and forming operations\n* Fabrication and manufacturing facilities\n* Automotive and heavy equipment production\n* Industrial machining environments\n\n## Custom Machine Guarding Solutions\n\nEvery **hydraulic press guard system** is custom designed to fit your equipment, layout, and safety\nrequirements.\n* Custom sizes and configurations\n* Compatible with track and mounting systems\n* Integration with existing safety setups\n* Designed for long-term industrial use\n\n### Features and Benefits of Hydraulic Press Guard Kits\n\n**\u2022 1/4 in19 gauge Weave Curtain allows view of the machine process clearly while maintaining\nsafety**\n**\u2022 Choose from over 40 standard sizes to fit hydraulic presses ranging from 10 to 200 tons.**\n**\u2022 Hook and Track Pipe System Allows Quick Entry to Machine Press**\n**\u2022 Fireproof and low maintenance, with excellent corrosion resistance**\n**\u2022 Our Metal Mesh exceeds ISC/GSA Performance Condition 3b criteria for protection from glass\nfragment hazards during explosions. (GSA-TS01-2003)**\n\nNote: 3/8\u2033 diameter mounting hardware not included\n\nNote: Each Hydraulic Press Guards Kit only protects one side of the press\n\nNote: If your Press Width falls between two size options, choose the next larger size.Choose the\nheight nearest to your Press Height in Inches.\n* [REQUEST QUOTE][227]\n\n## Additional Information:\n\n## Improve Safety, Compliance & Productivity\n\nProper guarding not only protects workers but also improves workflow by organizing work zones and\nreducing interruptions. **Hydraulic press guard curtains** help faci"
