on Clad Warranty][222]\n100-Year Family Heritage SteelGuard est. 2005\n4,000+ Orders Per Year Trusted by industry nationwide\nBIM\n[Revit / BIM Files][223] For architects & engineers\n\n# Products\n\nSteel Guard Safety\u2019s Barrier Protection Products are the perfect solution to create a safe, secure\nworkspace! The customizable products makes it easy for businesses of all sizes and needs \u2013 choose\nfrom multiple materials, sizes and configurations. Utilize vinyl curtain walls as noise-reducing\nenclosures or segment off specific areas with boundaries that meet your facility\u2019s safety\nrequirements.\n\nOur Wide Breadth of Products Provide Barrier Protection in almost and Environment. With Curtains,\nCovers Tarps, and Doors that Block Dust, Dirt, Weld Sparks, Paint, Water, Chemicals, Temperature,\nand Many other Hazards. Our Custom Curtain Walls are great for efficiently Dividing up Warehouses\nfor more useable space.\n\n[Link for Industrial Curtains][224]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Industrial Curtains]\n\n## Industrial Curtains\n\nAvailable in Many Varieties for Dust, Paint, Grinding or Even Temperature Control. Divide Work Space\nMore Efficiently. Available in Stock and Custom Sizes, Colors, & Options.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Warehouse Curtains][225]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Warehouse Curtains]\n\n## Warehouse Curtains\n\nDivide Off Warehouse Space for Manufacturing Processes, Tenants, or Freezer and Refrigerated Space.\nCustom Designed, and Modular for Flexible Spare Requirements.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Noise Control Solutions][226]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Noise Control Solutions]\n\n## Noise Control Solutions\n\nAttenuate Harmful Noise in Industrial, Commercial, Construction, or Even Sound Studios. A Variety of\nSound Curtains, Blankets,& Baffles to Help Keep Noise to Safe Levels\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Welding Curtains and Screens][227]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Welding Curtains and Screens]\n\n## Welding Curtains and Screens\n\nWelding Barrier Solutions for MIG, TIG, Stick Welding, Plasma Cutting & More. All Screens and\nCurtains are Certified Flame Retardant Stock & Custom Products\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Garage Divider Curtains][228]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Garage Divider Curtains]\n\n## Garage Divider Curtains\n\nDivide Processes in Collision Repair Facilities like Painting, Finishing, Wash Down and More. Stock\nand Custom Collision Repair Curtain Walls Available.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Welding Blankets][229]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Welding Blankets]\n\n## Welding Blankets\n\nA Wide Variety of High Temperature Materials for Welding, Heat Treating, and High Heat Barriers.\nFiberglass and Silica Varieties with Protection up to 2000 Degrees.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Industrial Room Dividers][230]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Industrial Room Dividers]\n\n## Industrial Room Dividers\n\nClear Curtain Dividers for Separation in Plants, Warehouses, Schools, Gyms, and More. Portable or\nStationary Products in Custom or Stock Barriers.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Strip Curtains][231]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Strip Curtains]\n\n## Strip Curtains\n\nClear or Colored Transparent Strip Curtains for protection from dust, temperature, welding or even\nSound. Used in Warehouses, Factories, Freezers, Convenience Stores and More.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Machine Guard Safety Fence][232]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Machine Guard Safety Fence]\n\n## Machine Guard Safety Fence\n\nMachine Shield Safety Fencing Provides Barrier Protection for Robotic Welding Cells, Tool Cribs,\nPalletization Lines, Manufacturing Lines, and More.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for High Temperature Curtains][233]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety High Temperature Curtains]\n\n## High Temperature Curtains\n\nCustom Designed Solutions Using our Industrial High Temperature Materials with up to 2000 Degrees of\nProtection. Use them in Ovens, Curing Lines, Foundries\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Barn Curtains][234]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Barn Curtains]\n\n## Barn Curtains\n\nCreate Temperature and Gases Controlled Properly During All Months of the year with Barn Curtains.\nGreat for Temperature Control in Livestock, Pig, or Horse Barns.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Vinyl Roll Up Doors][235]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Vinyl Roll Up Doors]\n\n## Vinyl Roll Up Doors\n\nVinyl Roll Up Doors Provide Quick Access to Adjoining Rooms, Docks, Garages, and More. Available in\nHigh Speed Versions or Varying Materials Like Mesh for Air Flow.\nLEARN MORE\n[Link for Tarps][236]\n\n[Steel Guard Safety Tarps]\n\n## Tarps\n\nA Wide Variety of Poly, and Vinyl Tarps with Varying Thicknesses, Colors, and Weights. Choose the\nRight Tarp for Yo"
