 TASTE ADVENTURE DO YOU CHOOSE?\nJoin us on a taste adventure with Chef Mark Southon.\nCreate deliciously healthy dishes at home with award-winning Grove Avocado Oil.\ncreate!\n][77]\n[\nCold pressed from a super fruit\nOur Story\n][78]\n[\nYour ultimate baking partner\nRecipes\n][79]\n\n## Get your free recipe book now!\n\n[ Click Here ][80]\n\n#### Proud recipients of the Superior Award from\n\n#### the International Institute of Taste, Belgium\n\n#### Proud recipients of the Superior Award from the International Institute of Taste, Belgium\n\n# Health Benefits\n\n### IT\u2019S GOOD FOR YOU\n\nThe amazing avocado has many distinctive health benefits and is classed as a superfood by many. On\ntop of the many health benefits here are a few: It may reduce cholesterol, improve heart health and\nlower blood pressure. It\u2019s high in rich Oleic Acid, a very healthy fat. The essential fats found\navocados are essential for digestion and nutrient absorption because they nourish the lining of the\ngut. It\u2019s an all-round super food!\n\n### IT HAS A HIGH SMOKE POINT\n\nNot every oil is created equal. The benefit of avocado oil is that it can be heated to very high\ntemperatures. Why is this good? When oil is heated past its smoke point, the fat starts to break\ndown, releasing free radicals and any health benefit that the oil had is lost.\n\n### EXTRA VIRGIN COLD PRESSED\n\nExtra Virgin is the highest grade of avocado oil, produced from the pressing of good quality\navocados. Produced at low temperatures, without chemicals the oil is 100% pure and natural. Cold\npressing from the first press of the avocado fruit means retains the same high level of nutrients,\nnatural flavour, aroma and colour found in fresh avocado.\n\n### 16 AVOCADOS IN EVERY BOTTLE\n\nEvery one of our 250ml bottles contains 16 cold pressed avocados. Quality Avocado Oil should have a\ntaste and colour characteristics of the fresh avocado fruit and be a dark vibrant green. We house\nour oil in dark glass bottles, which keeps out light and oxygen retaining the quality of the oil\n\n### IT\u2019S GOOD FOR YOU\n\nThe amazing avocado has many distinctive health benefits and is classed as a superfood by many. On\ntop of the many health benefits here are a few: It may reduce cholesterol, improve heart health and\nlower blood pressure. It\u2019s high in rich Oleic Acid, a very healthy fat. The essential fats found\navocados are essential for digestion and nutrient absorption because they nourish the lining of the\ngut. It\u2019s an all-round super food!\n\n### EXTRA VIRGIN COLD PRESSED\n\nExtra Virgin is the highest grade of avocado oil, produced from the pressing of good quality\navocados. Produced at low temperatures, without chemicals the oil is 100% pure and natural. Cold\npressing from the first press of the avocado fruit means retains the same high level of nutrients,\nnatural flavour, aroma and colour found in fresh avocado.\n\n### IT HAS A HIGH SMOKE POINT\n\nNot every oil is created equal. The benefit of avocado oil is that it can be heated to very high\ntemperatures. Why is this good? When oil is heated past its smoke point, the fat starts to break\ndown, releasing free radicals and [ Get your Free Sweet Recipe Booklet now! ][1]\n* [Shop][2]\n* [Health Benefits][3]\n* [Recipes][4]\n* [Shop][5]\n* [Health Benefits][6]\n* [Recipes][7]\n* [New Zealand][8]\n* [Australia][9]\n* [Home][10]\n* [Shop][11]\n  * [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][12]\n  * [Chilli Avocado Oil][13]\n  * [Garlic Avocado Oil][14]\n  * [Lemon Pepper Avocado Oil][15]\n  * [Lime Avocado Oil][16]\n  * [Organic Avocado Oil][17]\n  * [GOOD By Grove][18]\n* [Health Benefits][19]\n* [Recipes][20]\n* [Our Story][21]\n* [Blog][22]\n* [Contact Us][23]\n  * [Distributors][24]\n  * [Delivery Info][25]\n  * [Payment Info][26]\n  * [Refunds & Returns][27]\n  * [Security & Privacy][28]\n* [My Account][29]\n* [New Zealand][30]\n* [Australia][31]\n* [Home][32]\n* [Shop][33]\n  * [Extra Virgin Avocado Oil][34]\n  *