 matters:\nquality, integrity, and real food. Our oil is never chemically extracted, deodorized, or\naltered\u2014just 100% pure, extra virgin avocado oil made the traditional way.\n\nBella Vado avocado oil is:\n\nUSA-made, from California-grown avocados\n\nCold-pressed, unrefined, and unfiltered\n\nNaturally Non-GMO, vegan, gluten-free, and high in heart-healthy fats\n\nA versatile culinary oil perfect for dressings, saut\u00e9ing, roasting, and more\n\nFrom our grove to your table, we invite you to taste the difference that freshness, family values,\nand California sunshine make.\n\n## The Heart of the Avocado\n\nLooking back, it\u2019s hard to believe how quickly it all flew by. Late-night bottling parties where we\ncalled in all our kids and their friends\u2014well bribed with pizza and music. Grueling 72-hour oil\npressing marathons with rotating sleep shifts\u2014while half of us still worked full-time jobs. We were\nall in. We hustled. We stayed heads down. We loved the craft of turning our avocados into oil.\n\nWe poured ourselves into perfecting our oil, always analyzing, adjusting, and improving our process\nyear after year.\n\nTo us, It was always more than a product available on store shelves, quietly traveling in your\nshopping cart and then patiently sitting on your kitchen counter.\n\n\u00a0**Bella Vado is the heart of the avocado!**\n\n## SHOP\n\n[\nCulinary\n][46]\n[\nBody\n][47]\n[\nBundles & Gifts\n][48]\n\n## CASE DISCOUNTS AVAILABLE!\n\nAre you loving the Avocado Oil so much that you want to buy 6 bottles at a time?! We have you\ncovered! Select your favorite 6 bottles of Avocado Oil\u00a0and the discount will be applied in your\ncart.\n\n[ Case of Oil ][49]\n\n## Featured Item\n\n[\n[Bread Dip Bundle]\n[Bread Dip Bundle] ][50]\n\nSave\nRs. 400\n\n[ Bread Dip Bundle \u2014 Sale price Rs. 2,900 ][51]\n[\n[USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)]\n[USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil (250 ml)] ][52]\n[ USDA Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oi