        "crawl_text": "[[Calavo logo]][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Company][3]\n  * [About][4]\n  * [Our People][5]\n  * [Careers][6]\n* [Products][7]\n  * [Our Products][8]\n  * [Farm to Table][9]\n  * [Recipes][10]\n  * [Avo Fun Facts][11]\n* [INVESTORS][12]\n* [Contact][13]\n* [Trade][14]\n[[Calavo logo]][15]\n* [Home][16]\n* [Company][17]\n  * [About][18]\n  * [Our People][19]\n  * [Careers][20]\n* [Products][21]\n  * [Our Products][22]\n  * [Farm to Table][23]\n  * [Recipes][24]\n  * [Avo Fun Facts][25]\n* [INVESTORS][26]\n* [Contact][27]\n* [Trade][28]\nQ\n\n### AVOCADOS\n\n### TOMATOES\n\n### HAWAIIAN PAPAYAS\n\n### GUACAMOLE & DIPS\n\n### ORGANICS\n\n## For over 100 years, our passion has always been bringing delicious and nutritious food to your\n## dinner table.\n\n[About][29]\n\nThe Calavo way\n\nOur core values are our guiding principles: Drive, Respect, Innovation, Stewardship, and Quality.\n\n## \n## Fabulously\n## fresh\n\nFarm-fresh produce\nfrom our family to yours.\n\n#### Convenience\n#### without\n#### compromise\n\nReady-to-eat guacamole, dips & spreads.\nSave time, with peace of mind.\n\n#### fresh avocados\n\n#### farm fresh tomatoes\n\n#### hawaiian papayas\n\n#### guacamole & dips\n\n#### organics\n\n[bowl filled with salad and topped with avocados]\n\nQuality you can\ncount on\n\nOur standards match yours. Rest assured that you are getting the very best.\n\n## FARM TO TABLE\n\n[More][30]\n\n## partners\n\n[More][31]\n[grilled shrimp and avocados]\n\n## recipes\n\n[More][32]\n\n## Integrity - Dependability - Trust\n\nDelivering the highest quality products for over 100 years\n\n[More][33]\n[[Calavo logo]][34]\n\n#### Headquarters\n\nCalavo Growers, Inc.\n1141A Cummings Road\nSanta Paula, CA 93060\n[hello@calavo.com][35]\n[805.525.1245][36]\n\n#### investor relations\n\nFinancial Profiles\nAlex Villalta\n[calavo@finprofiles.com][37]\n\n#### *Calavo is an Equal Opportunity and [E-Verify][38] Employer*\n\nGrowers\n\ncareers\n\n\u00a9 2025 Calavo Grower