 people, supporting communities, and\nprotecting the planet. Through regenerative farming, sustainable practices, and recyclable\npackaging, we\u2019re here to empower home cooks to create with care.\n\n[ Discover The Story ][117]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### California Walnut Oil\n\nOur Roasted Walnut Oil is slowly roasted, expeller-pressed from California walnuts for a tempting\nnutty flavor that elevates salad dressings, baked goods and any dish it\u2019s drizzled over.\n\n[ Shop Now ][118]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### Toasted Sesame Oil\n\nOur Toasted Sesame Oil has a delightfully bold and complex flavor that doesn\u2019t overpower.\nGolden-brown and delicious, it adds rich nutty flavors to your vinaigrette, stir fry or marinade.\n\n[ Shop Now ][119]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### Smooth & Fruity\n\nVersatile, fresh, and sourced from the best, this olive oil is bursting with antioxidants and\nbeautifully balanced flavors. It\u2019s always cold pressed from early harvested, organic Spanish Olives.\n\n[ Shop Now ][120]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### Bright & Peppery\n\nThis cold-pressed, organic Spanish olive oil boasts high antioxidants and a peppery finish. Each\nbatch is made from early harvested olives, lab-tested an [La Tourangelle] [La Tourangelle]\n* [Shop][1]\n  See more \"Close Cart\"\n  * [Olive Oils][2]\n  * [Avocado Oils][3]\n  * [Neutral Oils][4]\n  * [Sprays][5]\n  * [Specialty Oils][6]\n  * [Salad Dressings][7]\n  * [Gifts][8]\n  * [Mill Tour][9]\n* [Recipes][10]\n  See more \"Close Cart\"\n  * [Recipes by Meal][11]\n    See more \"Close Cart\"\n    * [Breakfast][12]\n    * [Entr\u00e9es ][13]\n    * [Barbeque][14]\n    * [Salad][15]\n    * [Sides][16]\n    * [Quick Meals][17]\n    * [Desserts][18]\n    * [Cocktails][19]\n  * [Cooking Oil Recipes][20]\n    See more \"Close Cart\"\n    * [Avocado Oil][21]\n    * [Canola Oil][22]\n    * [Coconut Oil][23]\n    * [Grapeseed Oil][24]