us, it adds rich nutty flavors to your vinaigrette, stir fry or marinade.\n\n[ Shop Now ][119]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### Smooth & Fruity\n\nVersatile, fresh, and sourced from the best, this olive oil is bursting with antioxidants and\nbeautifully balanced flavors. It\u2019s always cold pressed from early harvested, organic Spanish Olives.\n\n[ Shop Now ][120]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### Bright & Peppery\n\nThis cold-pressed, organic Spanish olive oil boasts high antioxidants and a peppery finish. Each\nbatch is made from early harvested olives, lab-tested and packaged in our signature light-blocking\ntins.\n\n[ Shop Now ][121]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### Full & Vibrant\n\nWe partner with small farms in southern Greece to create are generative certified oil, made\nexclusively from olives grown using sustainable practices for full flavor you can feel good about.\n\n[ Shop Now ][122]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### Rich & Robust\n\nSourced from the sun-kissed groves of California, this Extra Virgin Olive Oil brings a taste of\ngolden warmth to your kitchen. With a medium-high smoke point, it\u2019s as versatile as it is\ndelightful.\n\n[ Shop Now ][123]\n\n##### Why is Our\n##### Oil Better?\n\n##### Salads & Saut\u00e9\n\nPressed from the pulp of premium Avocados, this emerald-green oil combines Extra Virgin and refined\nAvocado Oils. It\u2019s balanced flavor and high-quality make it perfect for medium heat applications.\n\n[ Shop Now ][124]\nPrev Next\n\n##### Avocado Oil for\n##### Every Occasion\n\n##### Salads & Saut\u00e9\n\n**Cooking Temperature:** Medium-High\n**Cooking Uses: **Saut\u00e9, salads, bake\n**Flavor:** Mild\n\n[ Shop Now ][125]\n\n##### Avocado Oil for\n##### Every Occasion\n\n##### Drip & Drizzle\n\n**Cooking Temperature:** Medium\n**Cooking Uses: **Drizzle, dips, salads\n**Flavor:** Bold\n\n[ Shop Now ][126]\n\n##### Avocado Oil for\n##### Every Occasion\n\n##### Sear 