        "crawl_text": "[\n][1]\n* Our story\n* Our products\n* [\n  For growers\n  ][2]\n* [\n  News\n  ][3]\n* [\n  Careers\n  ][4]\n[Contact us][5]\nWe are a leading global avocado company.\n\nFor over 75 years we have been the trusted supplier of avocados, fresh fruits, and plant based\nproducts to international retail, foodservice, and wholesale customers.\n\n[See our products][6]\n[About our company][7]\n\n\u201cA global avocado leader, but that\u2019s only one aspect, we do so much more.\u201d\n\n[Chris Bush]\nChris Bush\n\nGroup CEO at Westfalia Fruit\n\n[See all our products][8]\n\n\u201cA global avocado leader, but that\u2019s only one aspect, we do so much more.\u201d\n\n[Chris Bush]\nChris Bush\n\nGroup CEO at Westfalia Fruit\n\n[See all our products][9]\nSustainability\nWe strive to minimise our environmental impact.\n\nWe do so by reducing waste, carbon emissions, and the use of hazardous materials wherever possible\nwhile using resources more efficiently.\n\n[Learn more about our sustainability approach][10]\n[image]\n[image]\n[symbol quote]\n\nWe are proud to maintain the most diverse avocado-growing footprint in the world.\n\n[Chris Bush]\nChris Bush\n\nGroup CEO at Westfalia Fruit\n\nOur history\n\nAiming for excellence since 1949.\n\nAs we've grown and evolved over 75 years, our dedication to our founders legacy remains unwavering.\n\n[Discover our history][11]\nOur Story\nDiscover our fruits journey from pit to plate\n\nExplore our commitment to sustainability and discover how we are making a positive impact on the\nenvironment and communities.\n\n[Learn more][12]\n[Visual][Visual]\n[Visual][Visual]\nFor growers\nWorld-class trees based on science\n[Learn about our avocado trees][13]\nInnovations\nPioneering is in our DNA\n[Learn about our innovations][14]\nOur news\n[See all news][15]\n[\nWestfalia Fruit Appoints Avocado Industry Expert Tommy Padilla as President, North America\n19 Jun 2026\nCompany\n][16]\n[\nAvocado all day, every day: Westfalia Fruit unlocks new consumption moments at PLMA 2026\n19 May 2026\nInnovation & Market\n][17]\n[\nWestfalia Fruit Continues to Unlock Value in the Supply Chain through its \u2018Whole Tree\u2019 Approach\n17 Feb 2026\nSustainability & Innovation\n][18]\nWe love avocados.\n\nDiscover our range of avocado based recipes and the health benefits.\u00a0\n\n[See our recipes][19]\n[decorative][decorative]\n[decorative][decorative]\n[decorative][decorative]\n[decorative][decorative]\n[decorative][decorative]\n[decorative][decorative]\n[decorative][decorative]\n[background illustration]\nWestfalia Fruit is a leading global avocado company.\n[\n][20][\n][21][\n][22][\n][23]\n\nOur story\n\n[Company overview][24]\n[Sustainability][25]\n[Our history][26]\n[Community Support][27]\n[Innovation][28]\n[Accreditations][29]\n\nOur products\n\n[See all our products][30]\n[Avocados][31]\n[Fresh produce][32]\n[Processed products][33]\n\nFor growers\n\n[Everything for growers][34]\n\nNews\n\n[Our news][35]\n\nCareers\n\n[Our careers][36]\n\nContact\n\n[Contact us][37]\n[[Westfalia Fruit logo]][38]\n\u00a9 2026 Westfalia Fruit\n[Disclaimer][39]\n[Privacy policy & Terms of Use][40]\n[Modern Slavery Act][41]\n[PPN0621 CRP][42]\n[Official documents][43]\n\u00a9 2026 Westfalia Fruit\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: https://westfaliafruit.com/for-growers\n[3]: https://westfaliafruit.com/news\n[4]: https://westfaliafruit.com/careers\n[5]: https://westfaliafruit.com/contact-us\n[6]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products\n[7]: https://westfaliafruit.com/company-overview\n[8]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products\n[9]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-products\n[10]: https://westfaliafruit.com/innovation\n[11]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-history\n[12]: https://westfaliafruit.com/our-story\n[13]: https://westfaliafruit.com/for-growers\n[14]: https://westfaliafruit.com/innovation\n[15]: https://westfaliafruit.com/news\n[16]: https://westfaliafruit.com/news/82/westfalia-fruit-appoints-avocado-industry-expert-to