        "crawl_text": "[\n0\n][1]\n[ Skip to Content ][2]\n[ [Whole Foods Market UK] ][3]\n[ Order Online ][4]\n[ Recipes ][5]\n[ Find a Store ][6]\n[ Work With Us ][7]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n[ [Whole Foods Market UK] ][8]\n[ Order Online ][9]\n[ Recipes ][10]\n[ Find a Store ][11]\n[ Work With Us ][12]\n[\nOrder Online\n][13]\n[\nRecipes\n][14]\n[\nFind a Store\n][15]\n[\nWork With Us\n][16]\n\n### We\u2019ve Grown!\n\nDiscover your new nearest store in London.\n\n[ Discover More ][17]\n\n### Rose Sale\n\nSoak up the sunshine with our Rose Sale and discover beautifully crafted pieces at prices that feel\nas light and refreshing as summer.\n\n[ Find a Store ][18]\n[Various colourful vegetables in a brown bag]\n\n### **Order pizzas, salads and more favourites.**\n\n[Whole Foods Market UK shopping website on a smartphone]\n\nChoose from hundreds of our favourite products and get them delivered to your door in a flash with\n**Deliveroo**.\n\n[ Shop now on Deliveroo ][19]\n\n### **Discover Our Latest &\n### Greatest**\n\nCheck out what's hot right now, including limited-time-only savings, new finds and seasonal\nfavourites.\n\n**Mother Root Ginger Alcohol-Free Aperitif**\n\n**Wye Valley Asparagus**\n\n**Heritage tomatoes**\n\n**Henners Pinot Noir Rose**\n\n**TRIP Cherry Lemon**\n\n[ [A field of green lettuce] ][20]\n\n### Our purpose is to nourish people and the planet.\n\n[Illustration of carrots]\n[Whole Foods Market UK white logo]\n\n#### Shopping\n\n[**Gift Cards**][21]\n\n[**Deliveroo**][22]\n\n[**Recipes**][23]\n\n#### Mission in Action\n\n[**Quality Standards**][24]\n\n[**Community Giving**][25]\n\n[**Environmental Stewardship**][26]\n\n#### About\n\n[**Book a Demo**][27]\n\n[**Our Values**][28]\n\n[**Join us as a Team Member**][29]\n\n[**Information and Potential Suppliers**][30]\n\n[**Gender Pay Gap**][31]\n\n[**Modern Slavery Act**][32]\n\n[**Customer Review Policy**][33]\n\n#### Need Help?\n\n[**Contact Us \u2794**][34]\n\n#### Connect With Us\n\n[\n][35] [\n][36] [\n][37]\n[ Sign up for email ][38]\n\n*This link will take you to our sign up page on Amazon website.\n\nCookie Settings\n\nCopyright 2022 Amazon Technologies, Inc. - [Privacy Notice][39]\u00a0| [Terms and Conditions][40]\u00a0 I\n[Cookie Notice][41]\n\n[WholeFoodsMarket.co.uk][42]\u00a0is the trading name of Fresh & Wild Limited. Registered in England and\nWales. Address:\u00a063 \u2013 97 Kensington High Street, London, W8 5SE, United Kingdom. Registration\nNumber:\u00a03576009. VAT:\u00a0722 786 517\n\"Whole Foods Market\" is a registered trademark of Amazon Technologies, Inc\n\n[Corporate Policies][43]\n\n[1]: /cart\n[2]: #page\n[3]: /\n[4]: /online-ordering\n[5]: /find-a-recipe\n[6]: /find-a-store\n[7]: /information-potential-suppliers\n[8]: /\n[9]: /online-ordering\n[10]: /find-a-recipe\n[11]: /find-a-store\n[12]: /information-potential-suppliers\n[13]: /online-ordering\n[14]: /find-a-recipe\n[15]: /find-a-store\n[16]: /information-potential-suppliers\n[17]: /newstoreopenings\n[18]: /find-a-store\n[19]: https://deliveroo.co.uk/brands/whole-foods-market\n[20]: /core-values\n[21]: https://wwws-uk1.givex.com/cws4.0/wfmuk/\n[22]: https://deliveroo.co.uk/brands/whole-foods-market\n[23]: /recipes\n[24]: /quality-standards\n[25]: /community-giving\n[26]: /environmental-stewardship\n[27]: /demo-guidelines\n[28]: /our-values\n[29]: https://careers.wholefoods.com/en-gb\n[30]: https://www.wholefoodsmarket.co.uk/information-potential-suppliers \n[31]: /gender-pay-gap\n[32]: /s/2025_Amazon_Modern_Slavery_Statement-xdkl.pdf\n[33]: /customer-reviews\n[34]: /customer-service\n[35]: https://www.instagram.com/wholefoodsuk/ \n[36]: https://www.facebook.com/wholefoodsUK/ \n[37]: https://twitter.com/wholefoodsuk \n[38]: https://www.amazon.com/ap/signin?clientContext=130-5036023-2089249&language=en_US&marketPlaceI\nd=A1QRSCDALJFUQ9&openid.assoc_handle=amzn_wfm_web_us&openid.claimed_id=http%3A%2F%2Fspecs.openid.net\n%2Fauth%2F2.0%2Fidentifier_select&open