        "crawl_text": "Translate this page\n[Membership][1] [Member Login][2]\n[[website-logo2]][3]\n* [MEMBERS][4]\n* [SEAL PROGRAMS][5]\n  * [NAOOA Certified][6]\n  * [Extra Virgin Alliance][7]\n  * [AHA Heart Check\u00ae\ufe0f\ufe0f\ufe0f\ufe0f\ufe0f][8]\n* [CONSUMERS][9]\n* [TRADE][10]\n* [NEWS][11]\n* [CONTACT][12]\n\n# Olive Oil from Tree to Table\n\nDiscover the ultimate guide to olive oil\u2014everything you need to know, plus answers to all your\nquestions in one place!\n\n[ Read It Now ][13]\n\n# 2024 NAOOA Olive Oil Testing Report\n\nThe North American Olive Oil Association (NAOOA), whose members represent over three-quarters of the\nolive oil\u00a0sold in the United States, completed the nation's most comprehensive, rigorous olive oil\ntesting study to date\n\n[ Learn More ][14]\n\n# Celebrate the Health\n# and Versatility of\n# Olive Oil\n\nWelcome to About Olive Oil, brought to you by the North American Olive Oil Association. At the\nNAOOA, we celebrate the health and versatility of all types of olive oil for all consumers in North\nAmerica.\n\n# Olive Oil Education\n\nLearn about how olive oil is made, buying and usage tips and more.\n\n[ View Resources ][15]\n\n#### About Olive Oil Blog Post Categories\n\n[All][16] [ Olive Oil Facts ][17] [ Recipes ][18] [ Olive Oil for Health ][19] [ Cooking\u00a0with Olive\nOil ][20] [ Buying\u00a0Olive Oil ][21] [ Olive Oil Quality ][22]\nAll Olive Oil Facts Recipes Olive Oil for Health Cooking\u00a0with Olive Oil Buying\u00a0Olive Oil Olive Oil\nQuality\n\n## Most Recent Blog Posts\n\n[\n\n###### About Olive Oil\n\n##### What Does \u201cFirst Cold Pressed\u201d Olive Oil Actually Mean?\n\nJune 15, 2026\n\n][23]\n[\n\n###### Olive Oil Recipes\n\n##### Extra Virgin Olive Oil Granola: An Easy Breakfast Upgrade\n\nJune 1, 2026\n\n][24]\n[\n\n##### Olive Oil and Endometriosis: Why Anti-Inflammatory Fats Matter\n\nMay 21, 2026\n\n][25]\n[\n\n###### Cooking With Olive Oil\n\n##### Can You Cook Asian Food with Olive Oil? Yes \u2014 Here\u2019s How\n\nMay 15, 2026\n\n][26]\n[\n\n###### Buying Olive Oil\n\n##### What Butter Teaches Us About Buying Olive Oil\n\nApril 14, 2026\n\n][27]\n[\n\n###### Cooking With Olive Oil\n\n##### Read This Before You Reach for Avocado Oil for High-Heat Cooking\n\nMarch 2, 2026\n\n][28]\n[\n\n###### Olive Oil Recipes\n\n##### Chef Dorian Shows Us How to Fry Chicken in Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\nFebruary 20, 2026\n\n][29]\n[\n\n###### Olive Oil for Health\n\n##### Mediterranean Diet Ranked Best Diet for 9th Year in a Row\n\nFebruary 11, 2026\n\n][30]\n[\n\n##### The New Dietary Guidelines Embrace Food Is Medicine\u2014and Put Olive Oil Front and Center\n\nJanuary 14, 2026\n\n][31]\n[\n\n###### Olive Oil for Health\n\n##### New Year, Better Nutrition: Why Olive Oil Helps You Get More From Vegetables\n\nJanuary 6, 2026\n\n][32]\n[\n\n###### Olive Oil Recipes\n\n##### Holiday Mixology Magic: Silky, Flavor-Packed Olive Oil Cocktails\n\nDecember 9, 2025\n\n][33]\n[\n\n###### Olive Oil Recipes\n\n##### In the Holiday Spirit: Festive Recipes Made Better with Extra Virgin Olive Oil\n\nDecember 7, 2025\n\n][34]\n[1][35] [2][36] [3][37] [4][38] [5][39]\n\n# The Basics of Olive Oil\n\nWatch our video series to learn all about olive oil\n\n[ Watch ][40]\n\n# Olive Oil 101\n\nDownload our 1 page intro to olive oil\n\n[ Download ][41]\n\n# Olive Oil Smoke Point\n\nSmoke point is not a good indicator of a cooking oil's stability. Extra virgin olive oil is more\nchemically stable at those heats than other common cooking oils.\n\n[ Learn More ][42]\n\n## For more information\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive announcements and alerts about upcoming blogs and information.\n\n\n[logo-certified]The North American Olive Oil Association is committed to supplying North American\nconsumers with quality products in a fair and competitive environment; to fostering a clear\nunderstanding of the different grades of olive oil; and to expounding the benefits of olive oil in\nnut