        "crawl_text": "* [[Espa\u00f1ol]Espa\u00f1ol][1]\n[ONLINE SHOP][2]\n[ [Aceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola][Aceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola] ][3]\nPrimary Menu\n* [Olive grove][4]\n* [Factory][5]\n* [Bulk][6]\n* [Bottled Oil][7]\n  * [Ol\u00edria Oils][8]\n  * [TuAceite Oils][9]\n  * [Aceisol Oil][10]\n* [Avocado Oil][11]\n* [Awards][12]\n* [Contact][13]\nTradition and ACEITERA PENINSULAR ESPA\u00d1OLA in Olive Oil experience Tradition and ACEITERA PENINSULAR\nESPA\u00d1OLA in Olive Oil experience Tradition and ACEITERA PENINSULAR ESPA\u00d1OLA in Olive Oil experience\nAceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola\n\nAceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola S.L (APE) is a family run company, working in the world of olive oil\nfor five generations; a successful trajectory owed to our products and excellent results.\nWe are located in Priego de Cordoba, right in the epicenter of the best production zone of extra\nvirgin olive oil in Spain.\n\n## THE PROCESS\n\nCOLLECTION PERIOD\n\nFrom the second fortnight to the last days of december or January, depending on the variety and the\nmaturation of the fruit\n\nEXTRACTION\n\nOnly by physical means and mechanical procedures so to guarantee the quality of a truly unique\nproduct; extra virgin olive oil and virgin olive oil. Separately, we offer olive oil and refined\nolive oil.\n\nSTORAGE\n\nThe olive oil is safely stored in inox deposits, with a controlled temperature which guarantees the\noptimum conservation of the olives fruit and its properties.\n\nBOTTLED OIL\n\nOur bottling factory with its great versatility, can adapt to the needs of each and every one of our\nclients.\n\n## TU ACEITE DE SIEMPRE\n\nOur vast experience in the world of olive oil is perfectly reflected in this range of olive oils,\nunder the brand \u201cTuAceitedeSiempre\u201d. Discover en EVOO which will wake up all your senses.\n\n[DISCOVER OUR RANGE OF OLIVE OILS][14]\n\n#### Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n#### Organic Refined Avocado Oil\n\n#### Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n#### Refined Avocado Oil\n\n[MORE INFORMATION][15]\n\n## CERTIFIED WARANTY\n\nIn accordance with our philosophy of offering high quality products, we have the IFS FOOD\n(International Feature Standard Food Standard) certification, which supports the high level of\nrequirement in compliance with production, quality and hygiene standards. As well as the\ncertification of organic production with the European seal of organic farming; and the Kosher\ncertification.\n\n## OUR VALORS\n\n#### OUR QUALITY\n\nIt is guaranteed by our own laboratory, with highly qualified professionals and knowledge of the\nspecific market in which each client operates.\n\n#### OUR AGILITY\n\nThanks to the knowlegde and the history of the business men, we can make tailore-made operations,\nright away, for each one of our clients.\n\n#### OUR SERIOUSNESS\n\nThe guarantee ACEITERA PENINSULAR. Our financial stability gives us the ability to offer a highly\ncompetitive service and absolute confidence to our clients.\n\n## THE FACTORY\n\nAll our olive oils are produced in our own factory, which has the best structure and the appropriate\nmachinery. Alongside the experienced work force, all necessary procedures are carried out to produce\nextra virgin and virgin olive oil , with maximum rigor and quality control.\n\n[SEE THE FACTORY][16]\n\n## CONTACT\n\nC/ Rihuelo, S/N. 14800, Priego de C\u00f3rdoba (C\u00d3RDOBA)\nEmail: sales@aceiterapeninsular.com\n\n### Telephone : [+34 957547294 , +34 673286297][17]\n\nAdress:\nC/ Rihuelo s/n. 14800 Priego de C\u00f3rdoba.\nC\u00d3RDOBA (Espa\u00f1a)\n\nTelephone; +34 957547294 , +34 673286297\nE-mail [Email: sales@aceiterapeninsular.com][18]\nWeb: [www.aceiterapeninsular.com][19]\n\n[OLIVE GROVE][20]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0 \u00a0[FACTORY][21]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0 \u00a0[BULK][22]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0 \u00a0[BOTTLED OIL][23]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0 \u00a0[BLOG][24]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0\n\u00a0[CONTACT][25]\n\nAceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola, S.L. ha sido beneficiaria del Fondo Europeo de Desarrollo Regional\ncuyo objetivo es mejorar el uso y la calidad de las tecnolog\u00edas de la informaci\u00f3n y de las\ncomunicaciones y el acceso a las mismas y gracias a soluciones de comercio electr\u00f3nico, servicio de\npromoci\u00f3n online, anal\u00edtica web y soluciones de gesti\u00f3n integral (ERP). Esta acci\u00f3n ha tenido lugar\ndurante 2018. Para ello ha contado con el apoyo del programa TICC\u00e1maras 2018 de la C\u00e1mara de\nComercio de C\u00f3rdoba.\n\nAceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola, S.L. ha sido beneficiaria del Fondo Europeo de Desarrollo Regional\ncuyo objetivo es potenciar la investigaci\u00f3n, el desarrollo tecnol\u00f3gico y la innovaci\u00f3n y gracias al\nque ha podido incorporar la innovaci\u00f3n de\u00a0 Certificaci\u00f3n IFS, de Implantaci\u00f3n y certificaci\u00f3n BRC y\nSistema de gesti\u00f3n de calidad ISO 9001. Esta acci\u00f3n ha tenido lugar durante 2018. Para ello ha\ncontado con el apoyo del programa InnoC\u00e1maras 2018 de la C\u00e1mara de Comercio de C\u00f3rdoba.\n**Una manera de hacer Europa**\n\n*Aceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola \u00a9\u00a02018[ Legal disclaimer and privacy policy][26]. [Cookie policy][27]*\n\n[Revocar el consentimiento a la pol\u00edtica de cookies][28]\n\nEste sitio web usa cookies propias y de terceros para mejorar nuestros servicios y recoger\n**informaci\u00f3n an\u00f3nima** sobre su navegaci\u00f3n. Si pulsa \"acepto\" o continua navegando consideraremos * [[Espa\u00f1ol]Espa\u00f1ol][1]\n[ONLINE SHOP][2]\n[ [Aceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola][Aceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola] ][3]\nPrimary Menu\n* [Olive grove][4]\n* [Factory][5]\n* [Bulk][6]\n* [Bottled Oil][7]\n  * [Ol\u00edria Oils][8]\n  * [TuAceite Oils][9]\n  * [Aceisol Oil][10]\n* [Avocado Oil][11]\n* [Awards][12]\n* [Contact][13]\nTradition and ACEITERA PENINSULAR ESPA\u00d1OLA in Olive Oil experience Tradition and ACEITERA PENINSULAR\nESPA\u00d1OLA in Olive Oil experience Tradition and ACEITERA PENINSULAR ESPA\u00d1OLA in Olive Oil experience\nAceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola\n\nAceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola S.L (APE) is a family run company, working in the world of olive oil\nfor five generations; a successful trajectory owed to our products and excellent results.\nWe are located in Priego de Cordoba, right in the epicenter of the best production zone of extra\nvirgin olive oil in Spain.\n\n## THE PROCESS\n\nCOLLECTION PERIOD\n\nFrom the second fortnight to the last days of december or January, depending on the variety and the\nmaturation of the fruit\n\nEXTRACTION\n\nOnly by physical means and mechanical procedures so to guarantee the quality of a truly unique\nproduct; extra virgin olive oil and virgin olive oil. Separately, we offer olive oil and refined\nolive oil.\n\nSTORAGE\n\nThe olive oil is safely stored in inox deposits, with a controlled temperature which guarantees the\noptimum conservation of the olives fruit and its properties.\n\nBOTTLED OIL\n\nOur bottling factory with its great versatility, can adapt to the needs of each and every one of our\nclients.\n\n## TU ACEITE DE SIEMPRE\n\nOur vast experience in the world of olive oil is perfectly reflected in this range of olive oils,\nunder the brand \u201cTuAceitedeSiempre\u201d. Discover en EVOO which will wake up all your senses.\n\n[DISCOVER OUR RANGE OF OLIVE OILS][14]\n\n#### Organic Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n#### Organic Refined Avocado Oil\n\n#### Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n#### Refined Avocado Oil\n\n[MORE INFORMATION][15]\n\n## CERTIFIED WARANTY\n\nIn accordance with our philosophy of offering high quality products, we have the IFS FOOD\n(International Feature Standard Food Standard) certification, which supports the high level of\nrequirement in compliance with production, quality and hygiene standards. As well as the\ncertification of organic production with the European seal of organic farming; and the Kosher\ncertification.\n\n## OUR VALORS\n\n#### OUR QUALITY\n\nIt is guaranteed by our own laboratory, with highly qualified professionals and knowledge of the\nspecific market in which each client operates.\n\n#### OUR AGILITY\n\nThanks to the knowlegde and the history of the business men, we can make tailore-made operations,\nright away, for each one of our clients.\n\n#### OUR SERIOUSNESS\n\nThe guarantee ACEITERA PENINSULAR. Our financial stability gives us the ability to offer a highly\ncompetitive service and absolute confidence to our clients.\n\n## THE FACTORY\n\nAll our olive oils are produced in our own factory, which has the best structure and the appropriate\nmachinery. Alongside the experienced work force, all necessary procedures are carried out to produce\nextra virgin and virgin olive oil , with maximum rigor and quality control.\n\n[SEE THE FACTORY][16]\n\n## CONTACT\n\nC/ Rihuelo, S/N. 14800, Priego de C\u00f3rdoba (C\u00d3RDOBA)\nEmail: sales@aceiterapeninsular.com\n\n### Telephone : [+34 957547294 , +34 673286297][17]\n\nAdress:\nC/ Rihuelo s/n. 14800 Priego de C\u00f3rdoba.\nC\u00d3RDOBA (Espa\u00f1a)\n\nTelephone; +34 957547294 , +34 673286297\nE-mail [Email: sales@aceiterapeninsular.com][18]\nWeb: [www.aceiterapeninsular.com][19]\n\n[OLIVE GROVE][20]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0 \u00a0[FACTORY][21]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0 \u00a0[BULK][22]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0 \u00a0[BOTTLED OIL][23]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0 \u00a0[BLOG][24]\u00a0 \u00a0|\u00a0\n\u00a0[CONTACT][25]\n\nAceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola, S.L. ha sido beneficiaria del Fondo Europeo de Desarrollo Regional\ncuyo objetivo es mejorar el uso y la calidad de las tecnolog\u00edas de la informaci\u00f3n y de las\ncomunicaciones y el acceso a las mismas y gracias a soluciones de comercio electr\u00f3nico, servicio de\npromoci\u00f3n online, anal\u00edtica web y soluciones de gesti\u00f3n integral (ERP). Esta acci\u00f3n ha tenido lugar\ndurante 2018. Para ello ha contado con el apoyo del programa TICC\u00e1maras 2018 de la C\u00e1mara de\nComercio de C\u00f3rdoba.\n\nAceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola, S.L. ha sido beneficiaria del Fondo Europeo de Desarrollo Regional\ncuyo objetivo es potenciar la investigaci\u00f3n, el desarrollo tecnol\u00f3gico y la innovaci\u00f3n y gracias al\nque ha podido incorporar la innovaci\u00f3n de\u00a0 Certificaci\u00f3n IFS, de Implantaci\u00f3n y certificaci\u00f3n BRC y\nSistema de gesti\u00f3n de calidad ISO 9001. Esta acci\u00f3n ha tenido lugar durante 2018. Para ello ha\ncontado con el apoyo del programa InnoC\u00e1maras 2018 de la C\u00e1mara de Comercio de C\u00f3rdoba.\n**Una manera de hacer Europa**\n\n*Aceitera Peninsular Espa\u00f1ola \u00a9\u00a02018[ Legal disclaimer and privacy policy][26]. [Cookie policy][27]*\n\n[Revocar el consentimiento a la pol\u00edtica de cookies][28]\n\nEste sitio web usa cookies propias y de terceros para mejorar nuestros servicios y recoger\n**informaci\u00f3n an\u00f3nima** sobre su navegaci\u00f3n. Si pulsa \"acepto\" o continua navegando consideraremos\nque admite el uso e instalaci\u00f3n en su equipo o dispositivo. Puede visitar nuestra Pol\u00edtica de\nCookies.[Acepto la pol\u00edtica de cookies][29][No cargar las cookies][30][Ver pol\u00edtica de cookies][31]\n[Revocar el consentimiento a la pol\u00edtica de cookies][32]\n\n[1]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/\n[2]: https://www.tuaceitedesiempre.com/tienda/\n[3]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/home/\n[4]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/olive-grove/\n[5]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/vegetal-oil-factory/\n[6]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/bulk/\n[7]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/bottled-oil/\n[8]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/bottled-oil/oliria-oils/\n[9]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/bottled-oil/tuaceite-oils/\n[10]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/bottled-oil/aceisol-oil/\n[11]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/avocado-oil/\n[12]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/awards/\n[13]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/contact/\n[14]: /en/bottled-oil/tuaceite-oils/\n[15]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/en/avocado-oil/\n[16]: /en/vegetal-oil-factory/\n[17]: callto:+34 673286297\n[18]: mailto:Email: sales@aceiterapeninsular.com\n[19]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com\n[20]: /en/olive-grove/\n[21]: /en/vegetal-oil-factory/\n[22]: /en/bulk/\n[23]: /en/bottled-oil/\n[24]: /blog\n[25]: /en/contact/\n[26]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/aviso-legal-y-politica-de-privacidad/\n[27]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/politica-de-cookies/\n[28]: #\n[29]: #\n[30]: #\n[31]: https://www.aceiterapeninsular.com/politica-de-cookies/\n[32]: # aceiterapeninsular.com"
