        "crawl_text": "[ [logo] ][1]\n[ Oils ][2] [ Grains & Seeds ][3] [ Trucking ][4] [ Marianne\u2019s ][5]\n[ About ][6] [ Get in Touch ][7]\n[ [logo] ][8]\n[ Oils ][9] [ Grains & Seeds ][10] [ Trucking ][11] [ Marianne\u2019s ][12]\n[ About ][13] [ Get in Touch ][14]\n[ [logo] ][15]\n[ Oils ][16] [ Grains & Seeds ][17] [ Trucking ][18] [ Marianne\u2019s ][19] [ About ][20]\n[ Get in Touch ][21]\n\n# Nourishing lives for generations to come\n\nADAMS GROUP\n\n## An integrated food company delivering solutions for businesses and consumers across the globe\n\n## Specialty at Scale\n\nPreferred global supplier of high-quality seeds, grains, and specialty oils for global leaders and\nemerging brands.\n\n## Consumer Brands\n\nExtending our heritage directly to households through Marianne\u2019s, 100% pure avocado oils and beef\ntallows - evolving over time from pantry staples to high-quality, better-for-you foods\n\n## Logistics\n\nEnd-to-end supply chain and transportation solutions from storage to on-time delivery - powered by\nvertically integrated operations that ensure consistency, efficiency, and reliability.\n\nONE COMPANY, MULTIPLE OFFERINGS\n\n## Trusted partner to leading companies and emerging brands\n\n### Oils\n\nTrusted partner to leading global companies and emerging brands\n\n[ Visit Oils ][22]\n\n### Grains & Seeds\n\nProcessing and merchandising grains and seeds with extensive storage capabilities across our\nNorthern California facilities.\n\n[ Visit Grains & Seeds ][23]\n\n### Trucking\n\nComputerized dispatch, radio, and GPS-enabled fleet providing reliable, on-time transportation.\n\n[ Visit Trucking ][24]\n[food][food]\nOUR GOOD FOOD EQUATION\n\n## Food crafted with integrity from seed-to-shelf\n\n+ NOURISHES PEOPLE IN THE RIGHT WAY\n+ ALIGNED WITH THE ENVIRONMENT\n+ MADE WITH QUALITY INGREDIENTS\n+ CREATED WITH EXPERTISE & CARE\n+ INTENTIONALLY CULTIVATED\n[Cake][Cake]\nMARIANNE'S\n\n## Bringing our family heritage directly to your kitchen\n\n100% Pure Avocado Oils & Beef Tallows.\n\n[ Learn More ][25]\nABOUT US\n\n## Doing it right since 1920\n\n[Good Food Badge][Good Food Badge]\n\n## Quality\n\n## Advanced facilities\n\n## Global sourcing\n\n## Sustainability\n\n[ About Us ][26]\n[flower][flower]\n[flower][flower]\n[get start][get start]\n\n## Let's get started\n\nStrong partnerships build strong business. Let's connect.\n\n[ Contact Us ][27]\nOFFERINGS\n[ Oils ][28] [ Grains & Seeds ][29] [ Trucking ][30]\nBrands\n[ Marianne\u2019s ][31]\nCompany\n[ About ][32] [ Contact ][33] [ Careers ][34]\n\nBy subscribing you agree to our [Privacy Policy][35] and provide consent to receive updates from\nAdams Group.\n\n[Footer Logo][Footer Logo]\n\n\u00a92026 ADAMS GROUP. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\n\n[ PRIVACY POLICY ][36] [ TERMS & CONDITIONS ][37]\n[ ADAMS AUSTRALIA ][38]\n\n[1]: https://adamsgrp.com\n[2]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[3]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[4]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[5]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[6]: https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/\n[7]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[8]: https://adamsgrp.com\n[9]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[10]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[11]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[12]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[13]: https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/\n[14]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[15]: https://adamsgrp.com\n[16]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[17]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[18]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[19]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[20]: https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/\n[21]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[22]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[23]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[24]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[25]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[26]: https://adamsgrp.com/about-us/\n[27]: https://adamsgrp.com/contact/\n[28]: https://adamsgrp.com/oils/\n[29]: https://adamsgrp.com/grains-seeds/\n[30]: https://adamsgrp.com/trucking/\n[31]: https://adamsgrp.com/mariannes/\n[32]: https://adamsgrp.