        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Products][2]\n  * Aluminium Composite Panel\n    * [Aluminium Sign Board][3]\n    * [Fireproof][4]\n    * [Wooden Finishes][5]\n    * [Marble Finishes][6]\n    * [Mirror Finishes][7]\n    * [Brushed Finishes][8]\n    * [PE][9]\n    * [PVDF][10]\n  * [Metal Honeycomb Panel][11]\n  * [Metal Ceiling System][12]\n* [Applications][13]\n  * [Exterior Facade][14]\n  * [Interior Design][15]\n  * [Sign & Display][16]\n  * [Ceiling System][17]\n* [Company][18]\n  * [About Us][19]\n  * [Why ALCLOUD][20]\n  * [Projects][21]\n  * [Distribution][22]\n  * [Supports][23]\n  * [Privacy Policy][24]\n  * [Blogs][25]\n* [Architectural Partnership][26]\n* [Products][27]\n  * Aluminium Composite Panel\n    * [Aluminium Sign Board][28]\n    * [Fireproof][29]\n    * [Wooden Finishes][30]\n    * [Marble Finishes][31]\n    * [Mirror Finishes][32]\n    * [Brushed Finishes][33]\n    * [PE][34]\n    * [PVDF][35]\n  * [Metal Honeycomb Panel][36]\n  * [Metal Ceiling System][37]\n* [Applications][38]\n  * [Exterior Facade][39]\n  * [Interior Design][40]\n  * [Sign & Display][41]\n  * [Ceiling System][42]\n* [Company][43]\n  * [About Us][44]\n  * [Why ALCLOUD][45]\n  * [Projects][46]\n  * [Distribution][47]\n  * [Supports][48]\n  * [Privacy Policy][49]\n  * [Blogs][50]\n* [Architectural Partnership][51]\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][52]\n\n# Your Architectural Aluminium Specialist\n\nAluminium Composite Panel | Aluminium Honeycomb Panel | Aluminium Ceiling Panel\nALCLOUD\u00ae | Freeing Your Design Like Clouds\n[ Send Inquiry ][53]\n\n## Full ACP&ACM Capabilities\n\nALCLOUD\u00ae offers full of ACP & ACM with Stylish Yet durable panel for Your Facade, Interior Design\nand Signage.\n\n## Custom Metal Ceiling\n\nALCLOUD is capable of supplying full kinds of metal ceiling panel materials, either machined\naluminum panels or aluminum profiles and can be powder coated or painted.\n\n## Architectural Panel Specialist\n\nAs a manufacturer of architectural metal panels, we are pleased to share our manufacturing\nadvantages and strong supply chain of building and decorative materials with our global customers.\n\nYears of Experience\n0\nAnnual average m2 of Decoration Material\n1000 +\nEmployee\n100 +\nProjects\n1000 +\nWho We are\nWho We are\n\nALCLOUD is the First-class Quality Manufacturer in China that provides a complete line of Aluminium\nComposite Panel, Metal Ceiling System and One-stop solution for Architectural Aluminium Panels.\n\nEstablished in 2003, ALCLOUD\u00ae is proud to be a global brand of ShanDong FAME Group, a Specialist in\nmanufacturing and supplying of Building Decorative Metal Panel.\u00a0\n\n[ Exploring More ][54]\n\n## ALCLOUD\u00ae\u00a0Aluminium Panel For Your Applications\n\nFULL CEILING & WALL SYSTEMS\nApplications\nApplications\n[ Exterior Wall System ][55]\n[ Interior Wall Design ][56]\n[ Find Out More ][57]\n[ Sign & Display ][58]\n[ Metal Ceiling System ][59]\n\n## Featured Products\n\nMirror ACM Panel\nMirror Finish ACM Panel are available with an anodized mirror finish or with optional laminated\ncolorless passivated polymer films to make the final product hygienic and environmentally compliant.\n[ View More ][60]\nWooden ACM Panel\nWooden Aluminium Composite panels have a fantastic look and feel durability like natural wood but\nwithout problems like a heavyweight, higher costs, & much maintenance.\n[ View More ][61]\nMarble ACM Panel\nMarble ACM panel has realistic looks, rigidity & feel of natural stones. Marble panels are much\nlighter, more durable, & affordable than natural marble.\n[ View More ][62]\nFireproof Aluminium Composite Panel\n\nFireproof Aluminium Composite Panel is a new type of metal-plastic composite material made of a\nspecial flame-retardant modified polyethylene plastic core material through polymer adhesive film\n(or hot melt adhesive) by hot pressing and painted aluminum sheet.\n\n[ View More ][63]\nAluminium Honeycomb Panel\nHoneycomb Panels are the future of every industry, from Aerospace to making Trashcans, because a\nHoneycomb panel has less weight but more tensile & compression strength than a solid panel of the\nsame height & material.\n[ View More ][64]\nAluminium Ceiling Panel\nAluminium ceiling tiles & panels are the most popular metal material for interior design ceiling\nsystems due to their light weight and strength.\n[ View More ][65]\n\n## Why ALCLOUD\u00ae is Trusted by\u00a015000+ Projects\n\nSubmit a Quick Quote\nFull Name\nEmail\nCompany\nMessage\nSubmit\nOur Value\n\nOur Value\n\nWith 15,000+ projects implemented domestically and internationally using aluminium composite panels,\nHoneycomb panels, and aluminum ceiling panels, our product performance and assortment has thus been\nsustainably enhanced.\n\n### Aluminium Panel Specialist\n\nSelection of colors and finishes covering all your decorative design, premium ALCLOUD\u00ae Aluminium\nPanels demand to be noticed in any setting.\n\n### High-Quality\n\nPreferential selection of raw materials is the first criterion for quality assurance.\n\n### Budgetary & Cost control\n\nLowest price is not the goal, balances the quality and your budget.\n\n### Trusted Suppliers and Partners\n\nWe are committed to the spirit [Skip to content][1]\n* [Products][2]\n  * Aluminium Composite Panel\n    * [Aluminium Sign Board][3]\n    * [Fireproof][4]\n    * [Wooden Finishes][5]\n    * [Marble Finishes][6]\n    * [Mirror Finishes][7]\n    * [Brushed Finishes][8]\n    * [PE][9]\n    * [PVDF][10]\n  * [Metal Honeycomb Panel][11]\n  * [Metal Ceiling System][12]\n* [Applications][13]\n  * [Exterior Facade][14]\n  * [Interior Design][15]\n  * [Sign & Display][16]\n  * [Ceiling System][17]\n* [Company][18]\n  * [About Us][19]\n  * [Why ALCLOUD][20]\n  * [Projects][21]\n  * [Distribution][22]\n  * [Supports][23]\n  * [Privacy Policy][24]\n  * [Blogs][25]\n* [Architectural Partnership][26]\n* [Products][27]\n  * Aluminium Composite Panel\n    * [Aluminium Sign Board][28]\n    * [Fireproof][29]\n    * [Wooden Finishes][30]\n    * [Marble Finishes][31]\n    * [Mirror Finishes][32]\n    * [Brushed Finishes][33]\n    * [PE][34]\n    * [PVDF][35]\n  * [Metal Honeycomb Panel][36]\n  * [Metal Ceiling System][37]\n* [Applications][38]\n  * [Exterior Facade][39]\n  * [Interior Design][40]\n  * [Sign & Display][41]\n  * [Ceiling System][42]\n* [Company][43]\n  * [About Us][44]\n  * [Why ALCLOUD][45]\n  * [Projects][46]\n  * [Distribution][47]\n  * [Supports][48]\n  * [Privacy Policy][49]\n  * [Blogs][50]\n* [Architectural Partnership][51]\n[ REQUEST A QUOTE ][52]\n\n# Your Architectural Aluminium Specialist\n\nAluminium Composite Panel | Aluminium Honeycomb Panel | Aluminium Ceiling Panel\nALCLOUD\u00ae | Freeing Your Design Like Clouds\n[ Send Inquiry ][53]\n\n## Full ACP&ACM Capabilities\n\nALCLOUD\u00ae offers full of ACP & ACM with Stylish Yet durable panel for Your Facade, Interior Design\nand Signage.\n\n## Custom Metal Ceiling\n\nALCLOUD is capable of supplying full kinds of metal ceiling panel materials, either machined\naluminum panels or aluminum profiles and can be powder coated or painted.\n\n## Architectural Panel Specialist\n\nAs a manufacturer of architectural metal panels, we are pleased to share our manufacturing\nadvantages and strong supply chain of building and decorative materials with our global customers.\n\nYears of Experience\n0\nAnnual average m2 of Decoration Material\n1000 +\nEmployee\n100 +\nProjects\n1000 +\nWho We are\nWho We are\n\nALCLOUD is the First-class Quality Manufacturer in China that provides a complete line of Aluminium\nComposite Panel, Metal Ceiling System and One-stop solution for Architectural Aluminium Panels.\n\nEstablished in 2003, ALCLOUD\u00ae is proud to be a global brand of ShanDong FAME Group, a Specialist in\nmanufacturing and supplying of Building Decorative Metal Panel.\u00a0\n\n[ Exploring More ][54]\n\n## ALCLOUD\u00ae\u00a0Aluminium Panel For Your Applications\n\nFULL CEILING & WALL SYSTEMS\nApplications\nApplications\n[ Exterior Wall System ][55]\n[ Interior Wall Design ][56]\n[ Find Out More ][57]\n[ Sign & Display ][58]\n[ Metal Ceiling System ][59]\n\n## Featured Products\n\nMirror ACM Panel\nMirror Finish ACM Panel are available with an anodized mirror finish or with optional laminated\ncolorless passivated polymer films to make the final product hygienic and environmentally compliant.\n[ View More ][60]\nWooden ACM Panel\nWooden Aluminium Composite panels have a fantastic look and feel durability like natural wood but\nwithout problems like a heavyweight, higher costs, & much maintenance.\n[ View More ][61]\nMarble ACM Panel\nMarble ACM panel has realistic looks, rigidity & feel of natural stones. Marble panels are much\nlighter, more durable, & affordable than natural marble.\n[ View More ][62]\nFireproof Aluminium Composite Panel\n\nFireproof Aluminium Composite Panel is a new type of metal-plastic composite material made of a\nspecial flame-retardant modified polyethylene plastic core material through polymer adhesive film\n(or hot melt adhesive) by hot pressing and painted aluminum sheet.\n\n[ View More ][63]\nAluminium Honeycomb Panel\nHoneycomb Panels are the future of every industry, from Aerospace to making Trashcans, because a\nHoneycomb panel has less weight but more tensile & compression strength than a solid panel of the\nsame height & material.\n[ View More ][64]\nAluminium Ceiling Panel\nAluminium ceiling tiles & panels are the most popular metal material for interior design ceiling\nsystems due to their light weight and strength.\n[ View More ][65]\n\n## Why ALCLOUD\u00ae is Trusted by\u00a015000+ Projects\n\nSubmit a Quick Quote\nFull Name\nEmail\nCompany\nMessage\nSubmit\nOur Value\n\nOur Value\n\nWith 15,000+ projects implemented domestically and internationally using aluminium composite panels,\nHoneycomb panels, and aluminum ceiling panels, our product performance and assortment has thus been\nsustainably enhanced.\n\n### Aluminium Pa