## Beautiful\n\nOur unmatched selection of finishes will ensure a stunning project.\n* Virtually unlimited color palette.\n* Expert custom color matching.\n* Brightest colors made possible with FEVE paint.\n* Smoother finish with precision die coating.\n* Ultra matte to high gloss.\n\n### Durable\n\nBuilt to last, your finishes will maintain their brilliance for decades.\n* AAMA 2605 certified to resist fading and chalking.\n* Excellent strength to weight ratio.\n* Built-in graffiti-resistance.\n* No delamination or oil canning.\n\n### Safe\n\nUncompromising performance to support fire safety and code compliance.\n* Code compliant across North America: NFPA 285 in America and S134 in Canada.\n* Third-party verification through Intertek.\n* Code-compliant solutions with non-combustible and fire-resistant cores.\n* Technical Service staff to help navigate compliance.\n\n### For projects that won\u2019t just be beautiful, but will stay beautiful.\n### **How can the right warranty save you thousands?**\n\n[Calculate your warranty value][112]\n\n\n[ [AIA #4 Metal Composite Material (MCM) Building Code Fire Requirements]\nGet your questions answered\nSign up for this free, informative course and get AIA credit.\n\n### AIA Lunch & Learn\n\n][113]\n[\nYour success begins here\nThe first non-combustible metal composite material for the U.S. market is now available!\n\n### Introducing ALPOLIC\u2122/NC-US\n\n][114]\n[ [The Dylan featuring custom ALPOLIC MCM on the Y-columns supporting the fifth floor balcony]\nFeatured Project\nSee how ALPOLIC is helping change the landscape of Chicago's historic Fulton Market.\n\n### The Dylan\n\n][115]\n\n## Transforming the world of architectural design\n\nSpecification\nSustainability\nContinuing Education\nFire Safety\n\n### Specify ALPOLIC\n### [**For Design Flexibility**][116]\n\nNever compromise on your vision. From facades to fenestration, canopies to columns, and all the\ndetails in between, with immensely versatile MCM there\u2019s no limit to what you can achieve. Get the\nservice and support you deserve with short run capability and faster lead times.\n\nSpecifications are hard, but choosing ALPOLIC is an easy decision. For over 50 years, these products\nhave provided highly engineered solutions for even the most challenging construction and are a\nfavorite for professionals across the industry.\n\n### Design Efficiently\n### [**With Sustainable MCM**][117]\n\nGreen building begins with environmentally conscious material production. ALPOLIC provides safe and\nbeautiful MCM and reassurance that sustainability is a"
