        "crawl_text": "[GET A QUOTE][1]\n[[Aos Products Pvt. Ltd.]][2]\n[Aos Products Pvt. Ltd.]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Company][4]\n  * [About Us][5]\n  * [Company History][6]\n  * [Register Certificates][7]\n  * [Directors][8]\n* [Products][9]\n  * [ MENTHOL AND MINT OILS ][10]\n  * [ ESSENTIAL OILS ][11]\n  * [ AROMATHERAPY OILS ][12]\n  * [ SPICE OIL & OLEORESINS ][13]\n  * [ CARRIER OILS ][14]\n  * [ PINE OILS & ITS DERIVATIVES ][15]\n  * [ ALOE VERA ][16]\n  * [ NATURAL BUTTERS ][17]\n  * [ HERBAL EXTRACTS ][18]\n  * [ SPECIALITY CHEMICALS ][19]\n* [Reports][20]\n* [Blogs][21]\n  * [Essential Oils][22]\n  * [Menthol and Mint Oils][23]\n  * [Carrier Oils][24]\n  * [Spice Oil and Oleoresins][25]\n  * [Pine Oils and Derivatives][26]\n  * [Aloe Vera Products][27]\n  * [Natural Butters][28]\n  * [Health][29]\n  * [Natural Wellness][30]\n* [Events][31]\n  * [Fi Europe and Ni Europe 2019][32]\n  * [CPHI 2019][33]\n  * [Fi Hi India 2019][34]\n  * [Nusa Dua Bali 2019][35]\n  * [iPHEX 2019][36]\n  * [CPHI 2022][37]\n  * [iPHEX 2022][38]\n  * [iPHEX 2023][39]\n  * [CPHI 2023][40]\n  * [CPHI 2024][41]\n  * [iPHEX 2025][42]\n  * [CPHI 2025][43]\n* [Careers][44]\n* [Contact us][45]\n* [Essential <br>Oils]\n  Essential\n  Oils\n  We offer industry-grade essential oils in 2026, maintaining strict quality standards,\n  through our advanced laboratory and skilled technocrats with deep expertise in essential oils.\n  This ensures our customers receive pure and natural products\n  [View Products][46]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  [Shop Online][47]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n* [Menthol And <br> Mint Oils]\n  Menthol And\n  Mint Oils\n  Here, you can get Top quality Mint Oils products in 2026, such as Spearmint Oil, Peppermint Oil\n  Mentha Oil, Menthol Crystals, Water-soluble Menthol, DMO, Menthone, and its selected derivatives.\n  All these products you will get as per Pharma, Food, and Cosmetic grade.\n  [View Products][48]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  [Shop Online][49]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n* [Carrier <br> Oils]\n  Carrier\n  Oils\n  Carrier Oils are commonly obtained at AOS Products by cold pressed process. We obtained the fresh\n  and natural seed directly from former and with the help of self-developed machinery, we obtained\n  all these oil. All these oils are 100% Pure and\n  natural and specially prepared for Food, Pharma and Cosmetic industries.\n  [View Products][50]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  [Shop Online][51]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n\n## Product Categories\n\n[[MENTHOL]][52]\n\n##### [MENTHOL AND MINT OILS][53]\n\nThese products are Rabi crops, generally sown in the winter season. Sandy soil with high\nwater-holding capacity is ideal for cultivation. The plant is harvested when it reaches maturity.\n\n[View Products ][54]\n[[ESSENTIAL]][55]\n\n##### [ESSENTIAL OILS][56]\n\nEssential oils are highly concentrated plant extracts that retain the natural fragrance of plants.\nThey are obtained from aromatic parts such as flowers, roots, and bark through steam distillation.\n\n[View Products ][57]\n[[AROMATHERAPY]][58]\n\n##### [AROMATHERAPY OILS][59]\n\nAromatherapy uses oils extracted from the aromatic parts of plants to enhance an individual\u2019s health\nand mood. It is a holistic approach to healing the body and mind.\n\n[View Products ][60]\n[[SPICE]][61]\n\n##### [SPICE OIL & OLEORESINS][62]\n\nThese products are concentrated liquids derived from various spices that enhance their\ncharacteristic properties. These oils and oleoresins are widely used in the food industry.\n\n[View Products ][63]\n[[CARRIER]][64]\n\n##### [CARRIER OILS][65]\n\nSince ancient Greece and Rome, carrier oils have been used to dilute essential oils for massages,\nbaths, cosmetic applications, and medicinal purposes.\n\n[View Products ][66]\n[[PINE]][67]\n\n##### [PINE OILS & ITS DERIVATIVES][68]\n\nWe are engaged in manufacturing a wide range of pine products. These oils are obtained through steam\ndistillation of the needle-like leaves of pine trees.\n\n[View Products ][69]\n[[ALOE]][70]\n\n##### [ALOE VERA][71]\n\nAloe vera gel is a clear, transparent gel derived from plants of the Aloe genus. It is grown in\ntropical climates for agricultural and medicinal uses.\n\n[View Products ][72]\n[[NATURAL]][73]\n\n##### [NATURAL BUTTERS][74]\n\nThese products are extracted from natural plant sources such as nuts, beans, and kernels. They\nremain solid at room temperature and are rich in natural nutrients.\n\n[View Products ][75]\n[[HERBAL]][76]\n\n##### [HERBAL EXTRACTS][77]\n\nWe offer 100% natural extracts in India. Popular varieties include Amla, Ashwagandha, Brahmi, Methi,\nand Shikakai extracts.\n\n[View Products ][78]\n[[SPECIALITY]][79]\n\n##### [SPECIALITY CHEMICALS][80]\n\nWe are among the leading manufacturers and exporters of intermediate pharmaceutical ingredients in\nIndia. These chemical compounds are derived from pine products and their derivatives.\n\n[View Products ][81]\n\n# We Are Aos Products Pvt. Ltd.\n\n#### Manufacturing\n\nOur organization is well aware that if we are working on the production of natural oil in 2026, then\nwe have to work with the best science. Now, for this, we at AOS Products are committed to using such\nmachinery, which is indigenously manufactured and produces the highest quality oil with all nationa [GET A QUOTE][1]\n[[Aos Products Pvt. Ltd.]][2]\n[Aos Products Pvt. Ltd.]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Company][4]\n  * [About Us][5]\n  * [Company History][6]\n  * [Register Certificates][7]\n  * [Directors][8]\n* [Products][9]\n  * [ MENTHOL AND MINT OILS ][10]\n  * [ ESSENTIAL OILS ][11]\n  * [ AROMATHERAPY OILS ][12]\n  * [ SPICE OIL & OLEORESINS ][13]\n  * [ CARRIER OILS ][14]\n  * [ PINE OILS & ITS DERIVATIVES ][15]\n  * [ ALOE VERA ][16]\n  * [ NATURAL BUTTERS ][17]\n  * [ HERBAL EXTRACTS ][18]\n  * [ SPECIALITY CHEMICALS ][19]\n* [Reports][20]\n* [Blogs][21]\n  * [Essential Oils][22]\n  * [Menthol and Mint Oils][23]\n  * [Carrier Oils][24]\n  * [Spice Oil and Oleoresins][25]\n  * [Pine Oils and Derivatives][26]\n  * [Aloe Vera Products][27]\n  * [Natural Butters][28]\n  * [Health][29]\n  * [Natural Wellness][30]\n* [Events][31]\n  * [Fi Europe and Ni Europe 2019][32]\n  * [CPHI 2019][33]\n  * [Fi Hi India 2019][34]\n  * [Nusa Dua Bali 2019][35]\n  * [iPHEX 2019][36]\n  * [CPHI 2022][37]\n  * [iPHEX 2022][38]\n  * [iPHEX 2023][39]\n  * [CPHI 2023][40]\n  * [CPHI 2024][41]\n  * [iPHEX 2025][42]\n  * [CPHI 2025][43]\n* [Careers][44]\n* [Contact us][45]\n* [Essential <br>Oils]\n  Essential\n  Oils\n  We offer industry-grade essential oils in 2026, maintaining strict quality standards,\n  through our advanced laboratory and skilled technocrats with deep expertise in essential oils.\n  This ensures our customers receive pure and natural products\n  [View Products][46]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  [Shop Online][47]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n* [Menthol And <br> Mint Oils]\n  Menthol And\n  Mint Oils\n  Here, you can get Top quality Mint Oils products in 2026, such as Spearmint Oil, Peppermint Oil\n  Mentha Oil, Menthol Crystals, Water-soluble Menthol, DMO, Menthone, and its selected derivatives.\n  All these products you will get as per Pharma, Food, and Cosmetic grade.\n  [View Products][48]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  [Shop Online][49]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n* [Carrier <br> Oils]\n  Carrier\n  Oils\n  Carrier Oils are commonly obtained at AOS Products by cold pressed process. We obtained the fresh\n  and natural seed directly from former and with the help of self-developed machinery, we obtained\n  all these oil. All these oils are 100% Pure and\n  natural and specially prepared for Food, Pharma and Cosmetic industries.\n  [View Products][50]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  [Shop Online][51]\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n\n## Product Categories\n\n[[MENTHOL]][52]\n\n##### [MENTHOL AND MINT OILS][53]\n\nThese products are Rabi crops, generally sown in the winter season. Sandy soil with high\nwater-holding capacity is ideal for cultivation. The plant is harvested when it reaches maturity.\n\n[View Products ][54]\n[[ESSENTIAL]][55]\n\n##### [ESSENTIAL OILS][56]\n\nEssential oils are highly concentrated plant extracts that retain the natural fragrance of plants.\nThey are obtained from aromatic parts such as flowers, roots, and bark through steam distillation.\n\n[View Products ][57]\n[[AROMATHERAPY]][58]\n\n##### [AROMATHERAPY OILS][59]\n\nAromatherapy uses oils extracted from the aromatic parts of plants to enhance an individual\u2019s health\nand mood. It is a holistic approach to healing the body and mind.\n\n[View Products ][60]\n[[SPICE]][61]\n\n##### [SPICE OIL & OLEORESINS][62]\n\nThese products are concentrated liquids derived from various spices that enhance their\ncharacteristic properties. These oils and oleoresins are widely used in the food industry.\n\n[View Products ][63]\n[[CARRIER]][64]\n\n##### [CARRIER OILS][65]\n\nSince ancient Greece and Rome, carrier oils have been used to dilute essential oils for massages,\nbaths, cosmetic applications, and medicinal purposes.\n\n[View Products ][66]\n[[PINE]][67]\n\n##### [PINE OILS & ITS DERIVATIVES][68]\n\nWe are engaged in manufacturing a wide range of pine products. These oils are obtained through steam\ndistillation of the needle-like leaves of pine trees.\n\n[View Products ][69]\n[[ALOE]][70]\n\n##### [ALOE VERA][71]\n\nAloe vera gel is a clear, transparent gel derived from plants of the Aloe genus. It is grown in\ntropical climates for agricultural and medicinal uses.\n\n[View Products ][72]\n[[NATURAL]][73]\n\n##### [NATURAL BUTTERS][74]\n\nThese products are extracted from natural plant sources such as nuts, beans, and kernels. They\nremain solid at room temperature and are rich in natural nutrients.\n\n[View Products ][75]\n[[HERBAL]][76]\n\n##### [HERBAL EXTRACTS][77]\n\nWe offer 100% natural extracts in India. Popular varieties include Amla, Ashwagandha, Brahmi, Methi,\nand Shikakai extracts.\n\n[View Products ][78]\n[[SPECIALITY]][79]\n\n##### [SPECIALITY CHEMICALS][80]\n\nWe are among the leading manufacturers and exporters of intermediate pharmaceutical ingredients in\nIndia. These chemical compounds are derived from pine products and their derivatives.\n\n[View Products ][81]\n\n# We Are Aos Products Pvt. Ltd.\n\n#### Manufacturing\n\nOur organization is well aware that if we are working on the production of natural oil in 2026, then\nwe have to work with the best science. Now, for this, we at AOS Products are committed to using such\nmachinery, which is indigenously manufactured and produces the highest quality oil with all national\nstandards like GMP and HACCP-qualified plant. We would like to inform you that we use SJ304L and the\nhighest quality glass for this. You cannot compare the produced oils anywhere.\n\n#### Quality Policy\n\nWe are working as a Professional Manufacturer in India with three unique Themes: namely, providing\nSuperior Quality, 2nd Timely Delivery, and 3rd Most Important Commercially competitive prices. We at\nAOS Products are moving forward with this same professional thinking and commitment to maintaining\nour standards, and have been successful in trying to keep it the best in a very short span of time.\nWe can make it better and more useful for you. We will work on whatever there is scope for\nimprovement for that in 2026.\n\n#### Market Strategy\n\nOur company's market strategy is very simple, we are only manufacturing high-quality products with\ngood-quality raw materials directly for Pharma, Cosmetics, and Food Industries. If you use natural\nand pure oil at competitive prices with your products, then it is obvious that your quality demand\nwill be Worldwide and you will be able to do Good Business with Us. One thing we would like to keep\nyour special attention to with our products is that we only work on making natural products and\ncompletely avoid any kind of synthetic products.\n\n## Why Choose Us\n* #### Utmost Quality\n  \n  The mission of our Corporate Company is to provide Natural and 100% Pure Oils and other top\n  products in 2026, with all their therapeutic properties intact. Serving Pharmaceutical, Food, and\n  Cosmetic Industries with our premium quality products for more than 20 years. With this mission,\n  AOS Products always works as the Most Reliable, Reputable, and Trusted Essential Oils Manufacturer\n  in India.\n* #### Competitive Price\n  \n  We at AOS Products Private Limited provide impeccable quality natural products, lucrative rates,\n  and optimum services. Our prices are quoted at the most competitive price in the market because we\n  have a plant where our Company "
