        "crawl_text": "[Atomm Botanicals \u2013 Manufacturer of Plant Based Products][1]\n* [Our Story][2]\n  * [Why Atomm Botanicals][3]\n  * [Our Science][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Botanical Extracts][6]\n  * [Exotic Vegetable Oils][7]\n  * [Exotic Butters][8]\n  * [Plant Enzymes][9]\n  * [Essential Oils][10]\n  * [All Product List][11]\n* [Shop By Application][12]\n  \n  ## Shop By Application\n  \n  ### Aging\n  \n  ### Baby\n  \n  ### Eye\n  \n  ### Glow\n  \n  ### Hair + Scalp\n  \n  ### Hydration\n  \n  ### Pet Care\n  \n  ### Skincare - Body\n  \n  ### Skincare - Face\n  \n  ### Teenage\n  \n  ### Under The Sun\n  \n  ### Wellness\n\nX\nSearch for:Search Button\n* [Our Story][13]\n  * [Why Atomm Botanicals][14]\n  * [Our Science][15]\n* [Products][16]\n  * [Botanical Extracts][17]\n  * [Exotic Vegetable Oils][18]\n  * [Exotic Butters][19]\n  * [Plant Enzymes][20]\n  * [Essential Oils][21]\n  * [All Product List][22]\n* [Shop By Application][23]\n  \n  ## Shop By Application\n  \n  ### Aging\n  \n  ### Baby\n  \n  ### Eye\n  \n  ### Glow\n  \n  ### Hair + Scalp\n  \n  ### Hydration\n  \n  ### Pet Care\n  \n  ### Skincare - Body\n  \n  ### Skincare - Face\n  \n  ### Teenage\n  \n  ### Under The Sun\n  \n  ### Wellness\nX\nSearch for:Search Button\n[ Skip to content ][24]\n\n# Final Home\n\n## Extracted from nature, approved by science.\n\nAtomm Botanicals is one of the world\u2019s leading manufacturer and supplier of pure natural plant\nderivates for the use in the cosmetic and industries. We redefine the power of plant extracts\nthrough innovative extraction method by offering extracts for both water as well as oil medium.\n\nBased on more than 17 years of intensive research and development in plant cellular science and\nbotanical extraction, Atomm Botanicals is a distinctively creative brand.\u00a0Plant Extracts\u2019 journey\nstarted in 2006 and has been developing ever since. Significant scientific developments and\nbotanical discoveries have accompanied the evolution of botanical extracts. Atomm Botanicals is a\nleader in the development of natural active substances and works with partners and growers. Our R&D\nteam is dedicated to creating technology to unlock and maximise the benefits of botanical species\nfor the cosmetic and pharmaceutical industries, and they are leading research on some of the most\npotent plant-based concentrates in the world.\n\nUsing a ground-breaking extraction technique, all extracts and oils are offered\u00a0in the liquid\ncarrier matrix of the plant to harness the potent phytoactives without the use of chemicals.\nAtomm Botanicals\u2019 products\u00a0maintain\u00a0the integrity of native botany responsibly, ethically, and while\nmaintaining excellent levels of quality, service, and delivery. It bridges the gap between the\ncomplicated needs of the consumer and the actual power of untouched nature.\nAtomm botanicals procure the finest selection of top ingredients grown and brewed to deliver\npowerful nutrients to your skin. We use the finest ingredients and techniques to create herbal\nblends that will hydrate your skin without fail.\n\n## Our Products\n\nBest Sellers New Launches\n\n### Olive Extract\n\n(Olea Europaea)\n\n### Argan Oil\n\n(Argania Spinosa)\n\n### Avocado Oil\n\n(Persea Americana)\n\n### Mulberry Extract\n\n(Morus Alba)\n\n### Shea Butter\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n### Brahmi Extract\n\n(Bacopa Monnieri)\n\n### Kakadu Plum Extract\n\n(Terminalia Ferdinandiana)\n\n### Acai Berry Extract\n\n(Euterpe Oleracea)\n\n### Cocoa Oil\n\n(Theobroma Cacao)\n\n### Bakuchi Oil\n\n(Psoralea Corylifolia)\n\n### Babassu Oil\n\n(Attalea Speciosa)\n\n### Murumuru Butter\n\n(Astrocaryum Murumuru)\n\n### Shea Oil\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\nBest Sellers\nNew Launches\nBest Sellers\n\n### Brahmi Extract\n\n(Bacopa Monnieri)\n\n### Argan Oil\n\n(Argania Spinosa)\n\n### Olive Extract\n\n(Olea Europaea)\n\n### Mulberry Extract\n\n(Morus Alba)\n\n### Shea Butter\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n### Avocado Oil\n\n(Persea Americana)\n\nNew Launches\n\n### Kakadu Plum Extract\n\n(Terminalia Ferdinandiana)\n\n### Babassu Oil\n\n(Attalea Speciosa)\n\n### Acai Berry Extract\n\n(Euterpe Oleracea)\n\n### Murumuru Butter\n\n(Astrocaryum Murumuru)\n\n### Cocoa Oil\n\n(Theobroma Cacao)\n\n### Bakuchi Oil\n\n(Psoralea Corylifolia)\n\n### Shea Oil\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n## PARTNERSHIP OF THE LAND OWNERS\n\nThe original owners of this land, their knowledge, wisdom, ties to their homeland, and guardianship\nof the natural world are acknowledged by Atomm Botanicals. We honour our relationships with all of\nour growers and harvesters and show respect to the Elders of the past, present, and rising\ngenerations.\n\nAs the traditional owners and custodians of these lands, with whom we work, interact, and\ncollaborate, we wish to acknowledge and show respect to the generations of indigenous people in our\nnation who have lived in and derived their physical and spiritual needs from the forests, rivers,\nlakes, and streams of this lovely valley over many thousands of years.\n\n## PARTNERSHIP OF THE LAND OWNERS\n\nThe original owners of this land, their knowledge, wisdom, ties to their homeland, and guardianship\nof the natural world are acknowledged by Atomm Botanicals. We honour our re [Atomm Botanicals \u2013 Manufacturer of Plant Based Products][1]\n* [Our Story][2]\n  * [Why Atomm Botanicals][3]\n  * [Our Science][4]\n* [Products][5]\n  * [Botanical Extracts][6]\n  * [Exotic Vegetable Oils][7]\n  * [Exotic Butters][8]\n  * [Plant Enzymes][9]\n  * [Essential Oils][10]\n  * [All Product List][11]\n* [Shop By Application][12]\n  \n  ## Shop By Application\n  \n  ### Aging\n  \n  ### Baby\n  \n  ### Eye\n  \n  ### Glow\n  \n  ### Hair + Scalp\n  \n  ### Hydration\n  \n  ### Pet Care\n  \n  ### Skincare - Body\n  \n  ### Skincare - Face\n  \n  ### Teenage\n  \n  ### Under The Sun\n  \n  ### Wellness\n\nX\nSearch for:Search Button\n* [Our Story][13]\n  * [Why Atomm Botanical