ntaining excellent levels of quality, service, and delivery. It bridges the gap between the\ncomplicated needs of the consumer and the actual power of untouched nature.\nAtomm botanicals procure the finest selection of top ingredients grown and brewed to deliver\npowerful nutrients to your skin. We use the finest ingredients and techniques to create herbal\nblends that will hydrate your skin without fail.\n\n## Our Products\n\nBest Sellers New Launches\n\n### Olive Extract\n\n(Olea Europaea)\n\n### Argan Oil\n\n(Argania Spinosa)\n\n### Avocado Oil\n\n(Persea Americana)\n\n### Mulberry Extract\n\n(Morus Alba)\n\n### Shea Butter\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n### Brahmi Extract\n\n(Bacopa Monnieri)\n\n### Kakadu Plum Extract\n\n(Terminalia Ferdinandiana)\n\n### Acai Berry Extract\n\n(Euterpe Oleracea)\n\n### Cocoa Oil\n\n(Theobroma Cacao)\n\n### Bakuchi Oil\n\n(Psoralea Corylifolia)\n\n### Babassu Oil\n\n(Attalea Speciosa)\n\n### Murumuru Butter\n\n(Astrocaryum Murumuru)\n\n### Shea Oil\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\nBest Sellers\nNew Launches\nBest Sellers\n\n### Brahmi Extract\n\n(Bacopa Monnieri)\n\n### Argan Oil\n\n(Argania Spinosa)\n\n### Olive Extract\n\n(Olea Europaea)\n\n### Mulberry Extract\n\n(Morus Alba)\n\n### Shea Butter\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n### Avocado Oil\n\n(Persea Americana)\n\nNew Launches\n\n### Kakadu Plum Extract\n\n(Terminalia Ferdinandiana)\n\n### Babassu Oil\n\n(Attalea Speciosa)\n\n### Acai Berry Extract\n\n(Euterpe Oleracea)\n\n### Murumuru Butter\n\n(Astrocaryum Murumuru)\n\n### Cocoa Oil\n\n(Theobroma Cacao)\n\n### Bakuchi Oil\n\n(Psoralea Corylifolia)\n\n### Shea Oil\n\n(Butyrospermum Parkii)\n\n## PARTNERSHIP OF THE LAND OWNERS\n\nThe original owners of this land, their knowledge, wisdom, ties to their homeland, and guardianship\nof the natural world are acknowledged by Atomm Botanicals. We honour our relationships with all of\nour growers and harvesters and show respect to the Elders of the past, present, and rising\ngenerations.\n\nAs the traditional owners and custodians of these lands, with whom we work, interact, and\ncollaborate, we wish to acknowledge and show respect to the generations of indigenous people in our\nnation who have lived in and derived their physical and spiritual needs from the forests, rivers,\nlakes, and streams of this lovely valley over many thousands of years.\n\n## PARTNERSHIP OF THE LAND OWNERS\n\nThe original owners of this land, their knowledge, wisdom, ties to their homeland, and guardianship\nof the natural world are acknowledged by Atomm Botanicals. We honour our relationships with all of\nour growers and harvesters and show respect to the Elders of the past, present, and rising\ngenerations.\n\nAs the traditional owners and custodians of these lands, with whom we work, interact, and\ncollaborate, we wish to acknowledge and show respect to the generations of indigenous people in our\nnation who have lived in and derived their physical and spiritual needs from the forests, rivers,\nlakes, and streams of this lovely valley over many thousands of years.\n\n## QUALITY SYSTEMS AND CERTIFICATIONS\n\nATOMM BOTANICALS operates a Quality Management System, complying with the requirements of ISO\n9001:2015 for the following: Procurement, anufacturing, Testing, Warehousing and Supply of Botanical\nExtracts, in addition to our following certifications.\n\n### ISO 9001:2015\n\n### Organic Compliant\n\n### WHO GMP Compliant\n\n### FDA Compliant\n\n### HALAL Compliant\n\n### USDA Organic Compliant\n\n## Pure Plant\n## Power In\n\n## Every Drop !\n\n## Join our insta family\n\n## Follow us @atommbotanicals\n\nStay updated with our product launches, skincare routine, brand purpose and more!\n\n[ Happy Dussehra \u2728 #atommbotanicals #activeman #happ [Happy Dussehra \u2728 #atommbotanicals #activeman\n#happydussehra] ][25]\n[ Happy Ganesh Chaturthi #ganpatibappa #ganpatibappa [Happy Ganesh Chaturthi #ganpatibappa\n#ganpatibappamorya #Atommbotanicals #activeman] ][26]\n[ ATOMM 