        "crawl_text": "[ [AVODEMIA] [AVODEMIA] ][1]\n* [inquiry@avodemia.com][2] Email\n* Ruiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd, Godown No. 519 Near KPLC sub branch Location\n[Get A Quote][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n* [Services][6]\n* [Why Us][7]\n* [Blog][8]\n* [Contacts][9]\n\"Avodemia: Certified Exporters of Premium Avocado Products\" Pure, Cold-Pressed Avocado Crude Oil\nPartnering with Over 4,700+ Farmers, Committed to Quality\"\n\n## Fresh Organic Avocado\n\n**Avodemia is one of Kenya\u2019s leading avocado exporters, connecting premium-quality Kenyan avocados\nto global markets.**\nWe specialize in exporting high-quality fresh avocados that are carefully handpicked and subjected\nto strict quality control before final export, ensuring every fruit meets international standards.\nFor avocado farmers in Kenya, Avodemia offers a trusted market partner committed to quality, fair\npartnerships, and helping growers unlock the full value of their harvest.\n\n[ More About Us ][10]\n\n## Crude Avocado Oil\n\nProducer of 100% Pure & Organic Avocado Cooking Oil\nWe, are one of the largest producer of Avocado Oil in Kenya. Our Bulk crude oil and branded bottled\nproduct are exported worldwide. We produce best quality of Avocado Oil with high nutritional value.\n\n[ More About Us ][11]\n\n# Our Impact in Numbers\n\n#### [6M Kgs Annual Fresh Avocado Production][12]\n\n#### [4,700 Contracted Farmers, 81% + Certified][13]\n\n#### [1.6M Kgs Annual Oil Production][14]\n\n## Avocado PackHouse\n\nOur packhouse ensures every avocado is **graded, inspected, and packed** to meet strict export\nstandards. Each fruit is checked for **size, ripeness, and quality**, guaranteeing consistency in\nevery shipment.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[ More About Us ][15]\n\n## Certifications\n\n[sedex]\n[HACCP]\n[ISO9001]\n[ISO22000]\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][16]\n* [About Us][17]\n* [Services][18]\n* [Why Us][19]\n* [Blog][20]\n* [Contacts][21]\n\n### Recent Posts\n* [Kenya Avocado Export Season April 2026: Strategy, Challenges & Opportunities][22]\n* [Mature Avocado Tree Care Guide: Tips for Health, Growth & High Production][23]\n* [Avocado Farming in Kenya Guide: Climate, Pests, Harvest & Postharvest][24]\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n[inquiry@avodemia.com][25] Drop Us a Line\n[+ 254 705 888 444][26] Call Us Now\nRuiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd Location\n\u00a9 All right reserved 2026 Avodemia\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: https://avodemia.com/\n[2]: mailto:%69nquiry%40%61%76%6fd%65m%69%61.com\n[3]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[4]: https://avodemia.com/home/\n[5]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[6]: https://avodemia.com/products/service/\n[7]: https://avodemia.com/products/why-us/\n[8]: https://avodemia.com/blog-grid/\n[9]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[10]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[11]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[12]: #\n[13]: #\n[14]: #\n[15]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[16]: https://avodemia.com/home/\n[17]: https://avodemia.com/about-us/\n[18]: https://avodemia.com/products/service/\n[19]: https://avodemia.com/products/why-us/\n[20]: https://avodemia.com/blog-grid/\n[21]: https://avodemia.com/contacts/\n[22]: https://avodemia.com/kenya-avocado-export-season-april-2026-strategy-challenges-opportunities/\n[23]: https://avodemia.com/mature-avocado-tree-care-guide-tips-for-health-growth-high-production/\n[24]: https://avodemia.com/avocado-farming-guide-climate-pests-harvest-postharvest/\n[25]: mailto:i%6equir%79@%61%76%6fde%6dia%2e%63om\n[26]: tel:+ 254 705 888 444 [ [AVODEMIA] [AVODEMIA] ][1]\n* [inquiry@avodemia.com][2] Email\n* Ruiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd, Godown No. 519 Near KPLC sub branch Location\n[Get A Quote][3]\n* [Home][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n* [Services][6]\n* [Why Us][7]\n* [Blog][8]\n* [Contacts][9]\n\"Avodemia: Certified Exporters of Premium Avocado Products\" Pure, Cold-Pressed Avocado Crude Oil\nPartnering with Over 4,700+ Farmers, Committed to Quality\"\n\n## Fresh Organic Avocado\n\n**Avodemia is one of Kenya\u2019s leading avocado exporters, connecting premium-quality Kenyan avocados\nto global markets.**\nWe specialize in exporting high-quality fresh avocados that are carefully handpicked and subjected\nto strict quality control before final export, ensuring every fruit meets international standards.\nFor avocado farmers in Kenya, Avodemia offers a trusted market partner committed to quality, fair\npartnerships, and helping growers unlock the full value of their harvest.\n\n[ More About Us ][10]\n\n## Crude Avocado Oil\n\nProducer of 100% Pure & Organic Avocado Cooking Oil\nWe, are one of the largest producer of Avocado Oil in Kenya. Our Bulk crude oil and branded bottled\nproduct are exported worldwide. We produce best quality of Avocado Oil with high nutritional value.\n\n[ More About Us ][11]\n\n# Our Impact in Numbers\n\n#### [6M Kgs Annual Fresh Avocado Production][12]\n\n#### [4,700 Contracted Farmers, 81% + Certified][13]\n\n#### [1.6M Kgs Annual Oil Production][14]\n\n## Avocado PackHouse\n\nOur packhouse ensures every avocado is **graded, inspected, and packed** to meet strict export\nstandards. Each fruit is checked for **size, ripeness, and quality**, guaranteeing consistency in\nevery shipment.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[ More About Us ][15]\n\n## Certifications\n\n[sedex]\n[HACCP]\n[ISO9001]\n[ISO22000]\n\n### Quick Links\n* [Home][16]\n* [About Us][17]\n* [Services][18]\n* [Why Us][19]\n* [Blog][20]\n* [Contacts][21]\n\n### Recent Posts\n* [Kenya Avocado Export Season April 2026: Strategy, Challenges & Opportunities][22]\n* [Mature Avocado Tree Care Guide: Tips for Health, Growth & High Production][23]\n* [Avocado Farming in Kenya Guide: Climate, Pests, Harvest & Postharvest][24]\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n\n* *\n[inquiry@avodemia.com][25] Drop Us a Line\n[+ 254 705 888 444][26] Call Us Now\nRuiru Town, Exit 11 off Thika Rd Location\n\u00a9 All right reserved 2026 Avodemia\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: https://avodemia.com/\n[2]: mailto:%69nquiry%40%61%76%6fd%65m%69%