        "crawl_text": "[ Skip to content][1]\n\n[Avokad Fruits (K) Limited][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [How We Work][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n* [Careers][8]\n* [Gallery][9]\n* [Contact Us][10]\n\n[[AVOKAD LOGO-01]][11]X\n\n## Avokad Fruits Kenya\n\n## Your Trusted Partner for Premium Avocados and Avocado Oil\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited is proud to be Kenya\u2019s leading exporter of avocados and avocado oil,\ncatering to the growing global demand for high-quality, healthy, plant-based products.\n\n[ Explore Our Products ][12]\n\n### Premium Products\n\nDelivering high-quality avocado oil, fresh fruits, and nutritious nuts.\n\n### Sustainable Practices\n\nCommitted to eco-friendly production and responsible sourcing for the environment.\n\n### Global Reach\n\nSupplying premium plant-based products to meet international market demands.\n\n## Why Choose Us?\n\n## Nurturing Nature, Delivering Quality\n\n[ About Us ][13]\n\nAs the largest avocado exporter in East Africa, we specialize in delivering fresh avocados and\ncold-pressed avocado oil to Europe and beyond, adhering to the highest standards of quality and\nsustainability.\u00a0\n\nOur success stems from a commitment to excellence at every stage of production and processing. We\nwork closely with farmers across Embu, Meru, Kirinyaga, Nyeri, Murang\u2019a Counties, and beyond;\nconstantly empowering them through access to better markets and training in sustainable agricultural\npractices.\n\n0 +\n\n### Farmers\n\n0 M +\n\n### Fruits\n\n## About Us\n\n## Our Commitment to Sustainability\n\nAt Avokad Fruits (K) Limited, we pride ourselves on our ethical sourcing and dedication to best\nlabor practices, ensuring that every product reflects our values of integrity and sustainability. By\nleveraging cutting-edge technology and innovative processing techniques under the Export Processing\nZones (EPZ) program, we deliver avocados and avocado oil that meet the stringent quality demands of\nEuropean markets.\n\nWhether you are looking for the finest fresh avocados or nutrient-rich avocado oil, Avokad Fruits\n(K) Limited guarantees unmatched quality, a commitment to sustainability, and a passion for\nconnecting the best of Africa\u2019s produce with the world. Partner with us today and join a movement\nthat values health, taste, and community.\n\n[ Contact Us ][14]\n\n## Avokad Fruits Kenya\n\n## Delivering Excellence to the World\n\nOur strategic location in Kenya, combined with a robust supply chain, allows us to export to regions\nthat prioritize wellness and sustainability.\n\n[ Get Started ][15]\n\n## Our Products\n\n## Explore Our Premium Products\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited offers premium, sustainably sourced products for global markets, including\ncold-pressed avocado oil, fresh export-grade avocados, macadamia nuts, and mangoes. Each product\nreflects our commitment to quality, sustainability, and health-conscious consumers.\n\n[ Get Started ][16]\n\n## Avocado Oil\n\nPremium, cold-pressed, antioxidant-rich, versatile.\n\n[Order Now][17]\n\n## Macadamia Nuts\n\nButtery, rich, crunchy, high-quality.\n\n[Order Now][18]\n\n## Fresh Avocado Fruits\n\nExport-grade, handpicked, fresh, flavorful.\n\n[Order Now][19]\n\n## Mangoes\n\nDelicious, smooth, carefully processed, premium.\n\n[Order Now][20]\n\n## How We Work\n\n## From Nature to Your Table, Crafted with Care\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited offers premium, sustainably sourced products for global markets\n\n## 1\n\n## Explore Our Products\n\nBrowse our range of premium avocado oil, fresh avocados, macadamia nuts, and mangoes.\n\n## 2\n\n## Place Your Order\n\nContact us via email, phone, or our online form to request a quote or make an order.\n\n## 3\n\n## Receive Your Products\n\nWe ensure timely export and delivery, maintaining the highest quality standards throughout the\nprocess.\n\n## Become a Supplier with Avokad Fruits Kenya\n\nAre you a farmer growing high-quality avocados, macadamia and/or mangoes? Join **Avokad Fruits\nKenya**, Kenya's leading platform connecting avocados, macadamia and mango farmers with buyers\nlocally and internationally. By registering as a supplier, you gain access to a wider market, fair\nprices, and opportunities to grow your farming business.\n\n[ Register ][21]\n\nKenya\u2019s leading exporter of avocados and avocado oil, catering to the growing global demand for\nhigh-quality, healthy, plant-based products.\n\n## Useful Links\n\n[\nHome\n][22]\n[\nWho We Are\n][23]\n[\nProducts\n][24]\n[\nHow We Work\n][25]\n[\nSustainability\n][26]\n[\nCareers\n][27]\n[\nGallery\n][28]\n[\nContact Us\n][29]\n\n## Get in Touch\n* [ P.O Box 306-60100, Embu Kenya ][30]\n* [ info@avokadfruits.co.ke ][31]\n* [ +254 111 860860 ][32]\n\n## Subscribe Now\n\n\u00a92026. Avokad Fruits (K) Limited. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[\nStaff Email Login\n][33]\n[\nPrivacy Policy\n][34]\nScroll to Top\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://avokadfruits.co.ke/\n[3]: https://avokadfruits.co.ke/\n[4]: https://avokadfruits.co.ke/about-us/\n[5]: https://avokadfruits.co.ke/products/\n[6]: https://avokadfruits.co.ke/how-we-work/\n[7]: https://avokadfruits.co.ke/sustainability/\n[8]: https://avokadfruits.co.ke/careers/\n[9]: https://avokadfruits.co.ke/gal [ Skip to content][1]\n\n[Avokad Fruits (K) Limited][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [How We Work][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n* [Careers][8]\n* [Gallery][9]\n* [Contact Us][10]\n\n[[AVOKAD LOGO-01]][11]X\n\n## Avokad Fruits Kenya\n\n## Your Trusted Partner for Premium Avocados and Avocado Oil\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited is proud to be Kenya\u2019s leading exporter of avocados and avocado oil,\ncatering to the growing global demand for high-quality, healthy, plant-based products.\n\n[ Explore Our Products ][12]\n\n### Premium Products\n\nDelivering high-quality avocado oil, fresh fruits, and nutritious nuts.\n\n### Sustainable Practices\n\nCommitted to eco-friendly production and responsible sourcing for the environment.\n\n### Global Reach\n\nSupplying premium plant-based products to meet international market demands.\n\n## Why Choose Us?\n\n## Nurturing Nature, Delivering Quality\n\n[ About Us ][13]\n\nAs the largest avocado exporter in East Africa, we specialize in delivering fresh avocados and\ncold-pressed avocado oil to Europe and beyond, adhering to the highest standards of quality and\nsustainability.\u00a0\n\nOur success stems from a commitment to excellence at every stage of production and processing. We\nwork closely with farmers across Embu, Meru, Kirinyaga, Nyeri, Murang\u2019a Counties, and beyond;\nconstantly empowering them through access to better markets and training in sustainable agricultural\npractices.\n\n0 +\n\n### Farmers\n\n0 M +\n\n### Fruits\n\n## About Us\n\n## Our Commitment to Sustainability\n\nAt Avokad Fruits (K) Limited, we pride ourselves on our ethical sourcing and dedication to best\nlabor practices, ensuring that every product reflects our values of integrity and sustainability. By\nleveraging cutting-edge technology and innovative processing techniques under the Export Processing\nZones (EPZ) program, we deliver avocados and avocado oil that meet the stringent quality demands of\nEuropean markets.\n\nWhether you are looking for the finest fresh avocados or nutrient-rich avocado oil, Avokad Fruits\n(K) Limited guarantees unmatched quality, a commitment to sustainability, and a passion for\nconnecting the best of Africa\u2019s produce with the world. Partner with us today and join a movement\nthat values health, taste, and community.\n\n[ Contact Us ][14]\n\n## Avokad Fruits Kenya\n\n## Delivering Excellence to the World\n\nOur strategic location in Kenya, combined with a robust supply chain, allows us to export to regions\nthat prioritize wellness and sustainability.\n\n[ Get Started ][15]\n\n## Our Products\n\n## Explore Our Premium Products\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited offers premium, sustainably sourced products for global markets, including\ncold-pressed avocado oil, fresh export-grade avocados, macadamia nuts, and mangoes. Each product\nreflects our commitment to quality, sustainability, and health-conscious consumers.\n\n[ Get Started ][16]\n\n## Avocado Oil\n\nPremium, cold-pressed, antioxidant-rich, versatile.\n\n[Order Now][17]\n\n## Macadamia Nuts\n\nButtery, rich, crunchy, high-quality.\n\n[Order Now][18]\n\n## Fresh Avocado Fruits\n\nExport-grade, handpicked, fresh, flavorful.\n\n[Order Now][19]\n\n## Mangoes\n\nDelicious, smooth, carefully processed, premium.\n\n[Order Now][20]\n\n## How We Work\n\n## From Nature to Your Table, Crafted with Care\n\nAvokad Fruits (K) Limited offers premium, sustainably sourced products for global markets\n\n## 1\n\n## Explore Our Products\n\nBrowse our range of premium avocado oil, fresh avocados, macadamia nuts, and mangoes.\n\n## 2\n\n## Place Your Order\n\nContact us via email, phone, or our online form to request a quote or make an order.\n\n## 3\n\n## Receive Your Products\n\nWe ensure timely export and delivery, maintaining the highest quality standards throughout the\nprocess.\n\n## Become a Supplier with Avokad Fruits Kenya\n\nAre you a farmer growing high-quality avocados, macadamia and/or mangoes? Join **Avokad Fruits\nKenya**, Kenya's leading platform connecting avocados, macadamia and mango farmers with buyers\nlocally and internationally. By registering as a supplier, you gain access to a wider market, fair\nprices, and opportunities to grow your farming business.\n\n[ Register ][21]\n\nKenya\u2019s leading exporter of avocados and avocado oil, catering to the growing global demand for\nhigh-quality, healthy, plant-based products.\n\n## Useful Links\n\n[\nHome\n][22]\n[\nWho We Are\n][23]\n[\nProducts\n][24]\n[\nHow We Work\n][25]\n[\nSustainability\n][26]\n[\nCareers\n][27]\n[\nGallery\n][28]\n[\nContact Us\n][29]\n\n## Get in Touch\n* [ P.O Box 306-60100, Embu Kenya ][30]\n* [ info@avokadfruits.co.ke ][31]\n* [ +254 111 860860 ][32]\n