        "crawl_text": "Welcome to Avolio\n* [+256 744 600 000][1]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][2]\n* [Home ][3]\n* [About ][4]\n* [Our Impact ][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n  * [Why work with us][7]\n  * [Distributorship Careers][8]\n  * [Farmers][9]\n  * [Experienced Professionals][10]\n* [Media][11]\n  * [Our Stories][12]\n  * [Media Gallery][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n\nRequest For A Quote\n\n#### Leading the Way in bulk\n\n## Cold-Pressed Avocado\n## Oil Production\n\n[Explore Our Products][15] [Reach Us][16]\n\n#### Delivering sustainable\n\n## High-quality\n## avocado oil\n\n[Learn More][17] [Reach Us][18]\n\n#### Precision-engineered\n\n## Solutions for a\n## healthier future.\n\n[Learn More][19] [Reach Us][20]\n* ### Selection\n  \n  The finest selection\n* ### Cold Pressing\n  \n  Preserving Nutrients & Flavor\n* ### Filtration\n  \n  Filtered to perfection\n* ### Packaging\n  \n  More than just a product\n\n##### The Avolio Process\n\nFrom Uganda's finest avocados to your production line - our cold-pressed oils are rich in nutrients\nand flavor, available in bulk tanks for global distribution.\n\nogenix\n\n5Years Of Excellence\n\nThe Avolio Process\n\n## A Commitment to Quality and Purity\n* Innovation Meets Tradition\n\nAt Avolio Industries, we specialize in producing premium avocado oil using sustainable methods. Our\ncommitment to quality and eco-conscious practices ensures that every product supports both health\nand the environment.\n\nSetting the standard for bulk organic and crude avocado oil. Our 8-tonne per hour production line\nensures efficiency while maintaining purity and quality, shipped globally in large tanks.\n\nAvolio is an industry leader in the production and supply of 100% natural Ugandan avocado oil,\nsetting the standard for quality and sustainability in the sector. With a commitment to purity and\nexcellence, Avolio delivers avocado oil that is cold-pressed and unrefined, ensuring that every\nbottle captures the full nutritional benefits and rich flavors of the Ugandan avocados used.\n\n### Experience the pure essence of nature with Avolio\n\n[Discover more][21]\nOur Services\n\n## Premium Avocado Oil\n## and Tailored Industrial Solutions\n\nPremium Avocado Oil\n\n### Avocado Oil Production\n\nOrganic, edible, and crude avocado oil-cold-pressed using cutting-edge techniques that maintain\npurity for culinary\nand cosmetic applications.\n\n[Learn More][22]\n[Bulk Production]\n\n##### Bulk\n##### Production\n\n[Bulk Production]\n\n##### Sustainable\n##### Sourcing\n\n[Bulk Production]\n\n##### Global\n##### Shipping\n\n[Bulk Production]\n\n##### Custom Engineering\n##### Solutions\n\n[\n][23]\n\n## Be healthy & eat only\n## fresh organic vegetables\n\nOur Sourcing\n\n## Sustainably sourced from\n## small Ugandan farms\n\n\nAvolio ensures ethical practices that empower farmers and promote organic farming.\nWe guarantee the highest standards in bulk avocado oil supply for the global market.\n\nWhy Choose Avolio\n\n## Ethically sourced\n\nWe ethically source avocados from local farmers, ensuring fair compensation while promoting\nsustainable and organic farming practices.\n\n[Sustainable]\n\n#### Hass Seedlings\n\n[Sustainable]\n\n#### Empowerment\n\n[Sustainable]\n\n#### Sustainability\n\n[Sustainable]\n\n#### Organic\n\nOur Impact\n\n## What they're saying about Avolio!\n\nOur avocado oil fuels both the beauty and food industries worldwide. Through sustainable practices\nand ethical sourcing, we contribute to healthier products and stronger communities.\n\n[Avolio's Impact][24]\n\nAs a single mother of 3 kids, i have managed to provide the basic needs for my children and afford\nthem a decent education. This has all been possible because Avolio gave me an opportunity to earn.\n\n### Gloria Tereza\n\n.Distributor.\n* Largest Ugandan Avocado Oil\n  Producer.\n* ### 00\n  \n  Seeds Issued Monthly\n* ### 00\n  \n  Ltrs Processed Daily\n\nFrom the Blog Posts\n\n## Latest news updates\n## & articles\n* [by Admin][25]\n\n### [Showcasing the value addition impact. ][26]\n\n[Read More][27]\n[02][28]\n\n20 Sep\n* [by Admin][29]\n\n### [Avolio's commitment to empowerment.][30]\n\n[Read More][31]\n[02][32]\n\n20 Sep\n* [Apartment][33]\n* [by Admin][34]\n\n### [Avolio's Commitment & sustainability][35]\n\n[Read More][36]\n[02][37]\n\n20 Sep\n\nAvolio was founded by a group of motivated individuals who came together to maximize the use of\nUgandan avocados and empower local farmers in Uganda.\n\n### Explore\n* [Home][38]\n* [About Avolio][39]\n* [Our Impact][40]\n* [Contact Us][41]\n* [Our Gallery][42]\n* [FAQs][43]\n\n### Careers\n* [Why Work With Avolio][44]\n* [Farmers][45]\n* [Dstributors][46]\n* [Professionals][47]\n* [News][48]\n\n### Reach Us\n\nPlot 500, Kazinga, Namanve Industrial Area, P. O. Box 103986 Kampala, Uganda\n* [+256 744 600 000][49]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][50]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2024 by [Avolio][51] All rights reserved\n* [Developed by [Itabari]][52]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][53]\n* [+256 744 600 000][54]\n\nSend Your Request\n\n[1]: tel:256744600000\n[2]: mailto:info@avolio.co.ug\n[3]: https://avolio.co.ug/\n[4]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[5]: https://avolio.co.ug/impact\n[6]: #\n[7]: https://avolio.co.ug/about\n[8]: https://avolio.co.ug/distributors\n[9 Welcome to Avolio\n* [+256 744 600 000][1]\n* [info@avolio.co.ug][2]\n* [Home ][3]\n* [About ][4]\n* [Our Impact ][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n  * [Why work with us][7]\n  * [Distributorship Careers][8]\n  * [Farmers][9]\n  * [Experienced Professionals][10]\n* [Media][11]\n  * [Our Stories][12]\n  * [Media Gallery][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\n\nRequest For A Quote\n\n#### Leading the Way in bulk\n\n## Cold-Pressed Avocado\n## Oil Production\n\n[Explore Our Products][15] [Reach Us][16]\n\n#### Delivering sustainable\n\n## High-quality\n## avocado oil\n\n[Learn More][17] [Reach Us][18]\n\n#### Precision-engineered\n\n## Solutions for a\n## healthier future.\n\n[Learn More][19] [Reach Us][20]\n* ### Selection\n  \n  The finest sel