        "crawl_text": "[ [AvoPacific] ][1]\n[ Buy Now ][2] [ My Bag\u00a0\n0\n][3]\n[AvoPacific]\n\n# Extra! Extra *VIRGIN*\n\n[AvoPacific Avocadao Oil bottle]\n\n## Fresh off the press! The only oil you will ever need, Avopacific Extra Virgin Avocado oil.\n\n[ ][4]\n\n## Farm to Table!\n\n### We use handpicked premium avocados grown by generations of farmers in the world\u2019s top avocado\n### growing regions.\n\nWe ONLY produce 100% pure and unrefined avocado oil. We hand sort the fruit, never overprocess to\ngive you the purest emerald green oil.\n\nOur extra virgin avocado oil is carefully crafted in very small batches by our head miller using\nonly the best fruit that is sustainably grown. With Avopacific avocado oil you know what you are\ngetting.\n\n## This Avocado Oil Meets All Your Culinary Needs\n\n### Avopacific's Extra Virgin Avocado oil, is ideal for your high heat cooking like frying, grilling\n### roasting and searing.\n\nWith a buttery avocado flavor it's perfect for salad dressing, sauces, and and marinades.\n\nWith a buttery avocado flavor it's perfect for salad dressing, sauces, and and marinades.\n\n## Quality You Can Taste!\n\n### Rich Buttery in Avocado Flavor\n\nAvocado oil is rich in omegas 3, 6 and 9 \u2014 the good fats!\n\nA great source of antioxidants, our oil keeps your cells healthy and happy.\n\nThe anti-inflammatory benefits can actually offset unhealthy food choices.\n\nOur oils improve digestion, helping you process food more efficiently.\n\n> AvoPacific\u2019s extra virgin avocado oil has become a staple in my pantry\u2026 It\u2019s vibrant rich color is\n> amazing for a dressing and a salad, or to finish with a drizzle on a plate\u2026 It\u2019s flavor is pure,\n> with a hint of pepper and citrus in the background of the palette. The culinary applications are\n> endless.\u201d\n\nExecutive Chef Bradley Ogden 2x James Beard award winner, cookbook author Verified Customer\n\n> I LOVE this oil. I use AvoPacific daily. It makes a delicious buttery dressing that is super light\n> and doesn't overwhelm the dish. This is the most versatile oil and has opened up the creative box\n> for my pantry. Great job AvoPacific!!!\u201d\n\nCari Clark Chaparral Gardens- 5 Time Sofi Winner Verified Customer\n\n> AvoPacific\u2019s extra virgin avocado oil is fresh, velvety smooth, and adds a subtle avocado flavor\n> to everything I cook. It\u2019s my go-to for sauces and dressings! Thank you for an outstanding oil.\u201d\n\nDawn Doyle Verified Customer\n\n## California Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n**$29.99 (375mL)**\n\nFor the first time Avopacific has released a small batch of extra virgin avocado oil made from the\nfinest quality of California Avocados. We hand-harvested premier fruit from local California\nranches. Our avocados are ripened to perfection before pressed into a rich, emerald green oil. This\nhand crafted batch is limited addition release and once it's gone it will be gone.\n\n[Kosher]\n[Non-GMO]\n[Keto]\n[Paleo]\n[Paleo]\n375mL - Sold out\n[ [Subtract] ][5] [ [Add] ][6]\n\n## Mexico Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n**$18.99 (375ml)**\n\nAvopacific Extra Virgin Avocado Oil comes avocados grown from the Mexican state of Michoac\u00e1n. The\nconsistent climate makes for perfect conditions to grow avocados. We hand pick our fruit wait until\nit is perfectly ripe, then pressed into 100% pure avocado oil that is deep rich emerald green.\n\n[Kosher]\n[Non-GMO]\n[Keto]\n[Paleo]\n[Paleo]\n[Gluten Free]\n375ml - Sold out\n[ [Subtract] ][7] [ [Add] ][8]\n\n## Be Extra. Get Deals.\n\nSubscribe\nClose Cart\n\nShopping Bag\n\n0 [Shopping bag]\n\nYour cart is currently empty.\n\nEnable cookies to use the shopping cart\n\n\n\n[Minus] Item Quantity [Plus]\nSubtotal\n$0.00\nDiscount\n-$0.00\nShipping\nCalculated at checkout\nEstimated total\n$0.00\nSecure Checkout\n[California Extra Virgin Avocado Oil]\nCalifornia Extra Virgin Avocado Oil375mL\n375mL -$29.99 + $29.99\n[Mexico Extra Virgin Avocado Oil]\nMexico Extra Virgin Avocado Oil375ml\n375ml -$18.99 + $18.99\n[FAQS][9] [Terms][10] [Privacy][11] [AvoPacific.com][12]\n\n##### Let's Connect\n\n[[Facebook]][13] [[Instagram]][14] [[Twitter]][15] [[LinkedIn]][16] [[Email]][17]\n\n\u00a9 AvoPacific. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[111 S Rice Ave Oxnard, CA 93030.][18] [805-760-1000][19]\n[ [Back to Top] ][20]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: ../#product-slider\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: #\n[5]: #\n[6]: #\n[7]: #\n[8]: #\n[9]: /pages/faqs\n[10]: /policies/terms-of-service\n[11]: /policies/privacy-policy\n[12]: https://avopacific.com/\n[13]: https://www.facebook.com/AvoPacific-119200673322618\n[14]: https://www.instagram.com/avopacific/\n[15]: https://twitter.com/avo_pacific\n[16]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/avopacific/\n[17]: mailto:info@avopacific.com\n[18]: https://goo.gl/maps/5jCUFZHAh8YPWA6g7\n[19]: tel:+805-760-1000\n[20]: # [ [AvoPacific] ][1]\n[ Buy Now ][2] [ My Bag\u00a0\n0\n][3]\n[AvoPacific]\n\n# Extra! Extra *VIRGIN*\n\n[AvoPacific Avocadao Oil bottle]\n\n## Fresh off the press! The only oil you will ever need, Avopacific Extra Virgin Avocado oil.\n\n[ ][4]\n\n## Farm to Table!\n\n### We use handpicked premium avocados grown by generations of farmers in the world\u2019s top avocado\n### growing regions.\n\nWe ONLY produce 100% pure and unrefined avocado oil. We hand sort the fruit, never overprocess to\ngive you the purest emerald green oil.\n\nOur extra virgin avocado oil is carefully crafted in very small batches by our head miller using\nonly the best fruit that is sustainably grown. With Avopacific avocado oil you know what you are\ngetting.\n\n## This Avocado Oil Meets All Your Culinary Needs\n\n### Avopacific's Extra Virgin Avocado oil, is ideal for your high heat cooking like frying, grilling\n### roasting and searing.\n\nWith a buttery avocado flavor it's perfect for salad dressing, sauces, and and marinades.\n\nWith a buttery avocado flavor it's perfect for salad dressing, sauces, and and marinades.\n\n## Quality You Can Taste!\n\n### Rich Buttery in Avocado Flavor\n\nAvocado oil is rich in omegas 3, 6 and 9 \u2014 the good fats!\n\nA great source of antioxidants, our oil keeps your cells healthy and happy.\n\nThe anti-inflammatory benefits can actually offset unhealthy food choices.\n\nOur oils improve digestion, helping you process food more efficiently.\n\n> AvoPacific\u2019s extra virgin avocado oil has become a staple in my pantry\u2026 It\u2019s vibrant rich color is\n> amazing for a dressing and a salad, or to finish with a drizzle on a plate\u2026 It\u2019s flavor is pure,\n> with a hint of pepper and citrus in the background of the palette. The culinary applications are\n> endless.\u201d\n\nExecutive Chef Bradley Ogden 2x James Beard award winner, cookbook author Verified Customer\n\n> I LOVE this oil. I use AvoPacific daily. It makes a delicious buttery dressing that is super light\n> and doesn't overwhelm the dish. This is the most versatile oil and has opened up the creative box\n> for my pantry. Great job AvoPacific!!!\u201d\n\nCari Clark Chaparral Gardens- 5 Time Sofi Winner Verified Customer\n\n> AvoPacific\u2019s extra virgin avocado oil is fresh, velvety smooth, and adds a subtle avocado flavor\n> to everything I cook. It\u2019s my go-to for sauces and dressings! Thank you for an outstanding oil.\u201d\n\nDawn Doyle Verified Customer\n\n## California Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n**$29.99 (375mL)**\n\nFor the first time Avopacific has released a small batch of extra virgin avocado oil made from the\nfinest quality of California Avocados. We hand-harvested premier fruit from local California\nranches. Our avocados are ripened to perfection before pressed into a rich, emerald green oil. This\nhand crafted batch is limited addition release and once it's gone it will be gone.\n\n[Kosher]\n[Non-GMO]\n[Keto]\n[Paleo]\n[Paleo]\n375mL - Sold out\n[ [Subtract] ][5] [ [Add] ][6]\n\n## Mexico Extra Virgin Avocado Oil\n\n**$18.99 (375ml)**\n\nAvopacific Extra Virgin Avocado Oil comes avocados grown from the Mexican state of Michoac\u00e1n. The\nconsistent climate makes for perfect conditions to grow avocados. We hand pick our fruit wait until\nit is perfectly ripe, then pressed into 100% pure avocado oil that is deep rich emerald green.\n\n[Kosher]\n[Non-GMO]\n[Keto]\n[Paleo]\n[Paleo]\n[Gluten Free]\n375ml - Sold out\n[ [Subtract] ][7] [ [Add] ][8]\n\n## Be Extra. Get Deals.\n\nSubscribe\nClose Cart\n\nShopping Bag\n\n0 [Shopping bag]\n\nYour cart is currently empty.\n\nEnable cookies to use the shopping cart\n\n\n\n[Minus] Item Quantity [Plus]\nSubtotal\n$0.00\nDiscount\n-$0.00\nShipping\nCalculated at checkout\nEstimated total\n$0.00\nSecure Checkout\n[California Extra Virgin Avocado Oil]\nCalifornia Extra Virgin Avocado Oil375mL\n375mL -$29.99 + $29.99\n[Mexico Extra Virgin Avocado Oil]\nMexico Extra Virgin Avocado Oil375ml\n375ml -$18.99 + $18.99\n[FAQS][9] [Terms][10] [Privacy][11] [AvoPacific.com][12]\n\n##### Let's Connect\n\n[[Facebook]][13] [[Instagram]][14] [[Twitter]][15] [[LinkedIn]][16] [[Email]][17]\n\n\u00a9 AvoPacific. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[111 S Rice Ave Oxnard, CA 93030.][18] [805-760-1000][19]\n[ [Back to Top] ][20]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: ../#product-slider\n[3]: /cart\n[4]: #\n[5]: #\n[6]: #\n[7]: #\n[8]: #\n[9]: /pages/faqs\n[10]: /policies/terms-of-service\n[11]: /policies/privacy-policy\n[12]: https://avopacific.com/\n[13]: https://www.facebook.com/AvoPacific-119200673322618\n[14]: https://www.instagram.com/avopacific/\n[15]: https://twitter.com/avo_pacific\n[16]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/avopacific/\n[17]: mailto:info@avopacific.com\n[18]: https://goo.gl/maps/5jCUFZHAh8YPWA6g7\n[19]: tel:+805-760-1000\n[20]: # avopacific.com"
