        "crawl_text": "* [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n  * [The Kenyan Way][3]\n  * [Our Team][4]\n  * [Quality Management System][5]\n  * [Careers][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n  * [Giving Back to the Environment][8]\n  * [Giving Back to the Community][9]\n  * [Sourcing][10]\n* [Products][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n[ [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] ][14]\n[Search][15]\nKenya's Best Avocado Oil A reliable farming network + ethical practices = The Avopro Difference [Get\nin Touch ][16] Experts in Purity We believe in the best product we can produce. Avopro uses no\nadditives or preservatives in its oil. [Our Product ][17] Fair Trade \u2013 Sustainable Process Our\nmission is to build a long-lasting network of farmers and treat them with the respect that all\nhumans deserve. [Learn More ][18]\n\n## State-of-the-art cold press techniques give Avopro the advantage in creating antioxidant-rich\n## extra virgin or crude avocado oil optimized for pharmaceutical and beauty products.\n\n#### Reliable Supply Chain\n\nThe Avopro network consists of nearly 5,000 Kenyan farmers. You can count on us for consistency.\n\n#### 100% Natural\n\nOur avocado oil is naturally refined. We are 100% transparent with what goes into our oils\u2014pure\navocados, purely from our farms.\n\n#### Sustainable\n\nAvopro gives back to the planet and the community by making a positive impact in Sagana, Central\nKenya, and providing employment opportunities.\n\n### Our Story\n\n###### Avopro EPZ is dedicated to education and agronomy to build a sustainable business\u2014for our\n###### employees and our farmers. We have dedicated the time it takes to create organic growing\n###### conditions at our farms. This creates a better product for you and a long-lasting economy for\n###### our region.\n###### \n###### Avopro was incorporated in 2020 and holds an EPZA license under Kenyan regulations.\n\n[ More About Us ][19]\n\n## Our farmers pride themselves in knowing what it takes to grow a good fruit.\n\nWe are partnered with 80% female-owned farms, from which we ethically source our avocados to always\nbring you the safest and highest quality products. We only engage in socially, environmentally, and\neconomically responsible practices in order to benefit everyone that handles our avocados in any\nstage of the process\u2014from the farm, to you.\n\n### In the Ideal Growing Conditions of Kenya\n\n###### Avopro EPZ Ltd is located in Sagana, Kirinyaga District, in Central Kenya. This is right in\n###### the heart of the highly fertile and productive agricultural zone of the Mt Kenya region.\n###### \n###### The volcanic soils in this expansive zone, coupled with good climate, offer conditions that\n###### are very conducive for agriculture. Most of our avocados are farmed in this region\n\n[ Where to Buy ][20]\n\n#### [ Request Pricing ][21]\n\nSubmit this form and we will work with you to create a quote.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][22]\n\n#### [ Request Pricing ][23]\n\nSubmit this form and we will work with you to create a quote.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][24]\n\n#### [ Bulk Order ][25]\n\nReach out and learn more about how you can count on Avopro.\n\n[ Contact Us ][26]\n\n#### [ Bulk Order ][27]\n\nReach out and learn more about how you can count on Avopro.\n\n[ Contact Us ][28]\n\n## Certifications and Industry Partnerships\n\n## Testimonials\n\nQuality avocado oil, made with our customers in mind.\n\nAvopro oil is definitely up there with the good quality oils I\u2019ve tried. I\u2019m loving it and will\nregularly place my order through their website.\n\n#### [ Jennifer C. ][29]\n\n/ Orlando, FL\n\nAs a chef, I\u2019m in constant search for organic oils and from the first taste, Avopro's avocado oil\nsimply mind blowing. There's no oil to compare, it is simply the Awesome!\n\n#### [ Jennifer C. ][30]\n\n/ Orlando, FL\n\nBeing an experienced personnel in the field, I can say that Avopro offers the best. They have made\nthe importing process very seamless. To anybody seeking \"top-quality avocado oil,\" I strongly\nsuggest Avopro.\n\n#### [ REVEDA Exporters ][31]\n\nFounder and CEO\n\nAs a Kenyan-based business, Avopro exports premium-quality avocado oil. I definitely support Avopro\nas a trustworthy source of premium avocado oil with top customer service for any business wishing to\nexport avocado oil.\n\n#### [ KEN Exporters ][32]\n\nFounder & CEO\n\nThe team at Avopro is professional and efficient in exporting premium quality avocado oil. I highly\nrecommend Avopro for anyone looking for a reliable and high-quality avocado oil supplier.\n\n#### [ RK Exporters ][33]\n\nFounder & CEO\n\n## From Our Blog\n\nThe benefits of avocado oil and health and nutrition facts of avocados you need to know now!\n* [Avocado Oil][34]\n* [January 22, 2023][35]\n\n### [The Benefits of Avocado Oil][36]\n* [Avocado][37]\n* [January 22, 2023][38]\n\n### [Health and nutrition facts of avocados you need to know now!][39]\n* [Avocado Oil][40]\n* [January 22, 2023][41]\n\n### [What makes avocado oil a \u2018healthy cooking oil][42]\n\n[ View all posts ][43]\n[ GROWERS ][44]\n[ CAREER ][45]\n\n## Company\n\n**[+254 740 441 441][46]\n**** * [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n  * [The Kenyan Way][3]\n  * [Our Team][4]\n  * [Quality Management System][5]\n  * [Careers][6]\n* [Sustainability][7]\n  * [Giving Back to the Environment][8]\n  * [Giving Back to the Community][9]\n  * [Sourcing][10]\n* [Products][11]\n* [Request Quote][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n[ [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] [Avoprokenya-Welcome To Avoprokenya] ][14]\n[Search][15]\nKenya's Best Avocado Oil A reliable farming network + ethical practices = The Avopro Difference [Get\nin Touch ][16] Experts in Purity We believe in the best product we can produce. Avopro uses no\nadditives or preservatives in its oil. [Our Product ][17] Fair Trade \u2013 Sustainable Process Our\nmission is to build a long-lasting network of farmers and treat them with the respect that all\nhumans deserve. [Learn More ][18]\n\n## State-of-the-art cold press techniques give Avopro the advantage in creating antioxidant-rich\n## extra virgin or crude avocado oil optimized for pharmaceutical and beauty products.\n\n#### Reliable Supply Chain\n\nThe Avopro network consists of nearly 5,000 Kenyan farmers. You can count on us for consistency.\n\n#### 100% Natural\n\nOur avocado oil is naturally refined. We are 100% transparent with what goes into our oils\u2014pure\navocados, purely from our farms.\n\n#### Sustainable\n\nAvopro gives back to the planet and the community by making a positive impact in Sagana, Central\nKenya, and providing employment opportunities.\n\n### Our Story\n\n###### Avopro EPZ is dedicated to education and agronomy to build a sustainable business\u2014for our\n###### employees and our farmers. We have dedicated the time it takes to create organic growing\n###### conditions at our farms. This creates a better product for you and a long-lasting economy for\n###### our region.\n###### \n###### Avopro was incorporated in 2020 and holds an EPZA license under Kenyan regulations.\n\n[ More About Us ][19]\n\n## Our farmers pride themselves in knowing what it takes to grow a good fruit.\n\nWe are partnered with 80% female-owned farms, from which we ethically source our avocados to always\nbring you the safest and highest quality products. We only engage in socially, environmentally, and\neconomically responsible practices in order to benefit everyone that handles our avocados in any\nstage of the process\u2014from the farm, to you.\n\n### In the Ideal Growing Conditions of Kenya\n\n###### Avopro EPZ Ltd is located in Sagana, Kirinyaga District, in Central Kenya. This is right in\n###### the heart of the highly fertile and productive agricultural zone of the Mt Kenya region.\n###### \n###### The volcanic soils in this expansive zone, coupled with good climate, offer conditions that\n###### are very conducive for agriculture. Most of our avocados are farmed in this region\n\n[ Where to Buy ][20]\n\n#### [ Request Pricing ][21]\n\nSubmit this form and we will work with you to create a quote.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][22]\n\n#### [ Request Pricing ][23]\n\nSubmit this form and we will work with you to create a quote.\n\n[ Request A Quote ][24]\n\n#### [ Bulk Order ][25]\n\nReach out and learn more about how you can count on Avopro.\n\n[ Contact Us ][26]\n\n#### [ Bulk Order ][27]\n\nReach out and learn more about how you can count on Avopro.\n\n[ Contact Us ][28]\n\n## Certifications and Industry Partnerships\n\n## Testimonials\n\nQuality avocado oil, made with our customers in mind.\n\nAvopro oil is definitely up there with the good quality oils I\u2019ve tried. I\u2019m loving it and will\nregularly place my order through their website.\n\n#### [ Jennifer C. ][29]\n\n/ Orlando, FL\n\nAs a chef, I\u2019m in constant search for organic oils and from the first taste, Avopro's avocado oil\nsimply mind blowing. There's no oil to compare, it is simply the Awesome!\n\n#### [ Jennifer C. ][30]\n\n/ Orlando, FL\n\nBeing an experienced personnel in the field, I can say that Avopro offers the best. They have made\nthe importing process very seamless. To anybody seeking \"top-quality avocado oil,\" I strongly\nsuggest Avopro.\n\n#### [ REVEDA Exporters ][31]\n\nFounder and CEO\n\nAs a Kenyan-based business, Avopro exports premium-quality avocado oil. I definitely support Avopro\nas a trustworthy source of premium avocado oil with top customer service for any business wishing to\nexport avocado oil.\n\n#### [ KEN Exporters ][32]\n\nFounder & CEO\n\nThe team at Avopro is professional and efficient in exporting premium quality avocado oil. I highly\nrecommend Avopro for anyone looking for a reliable and high-quality avocado oil supplier.\n\n#### [ RK Exporters ][33]\n\nFounder & CEO\n\n## From Our Blog\n\nThe benefits of avocado oil and health and nutrition facts of avocados you need to know now!\n* [Avocado Oil][34]\n* [January 22, 2023][35]\n\n### [The Benefits of Avocado Oil][36]\n* [Avocado][37]\n* [January 22, 2023][38]\n\n### [Health and nutrition facts of avocados you need to know now!][39]\n* [Avocado Oil][40]\n* [January 22, 2023][41]\n\n### [What makes avocado oil a \u2018healthy cooking oil][42]\n\n[ View all posts ][43]\n[ GROWERS ][44]\n[ CAREER ][45]\n\n## Company\n\n**[+254 740 441 441][46]\n****[sales@avoprokenya.com][47]**\n**[info@avoprokenya.com][48]**\n* [ About Us ][49]\n* [ Sustainability/Environmental Impact ][50]\n* [ Products ][51]\n* [ Request Quote ][52]\n* [ Contact Us ][53]\n\n## Policies\n* [ Privacy policy ][54]\n* [ Refund policy ][55]\n* [ Terms of services ][56]\n* [ Order track policy ][57]\n* [ Facebook ][58]\n* [ LinkedIn ][59]\n* [ YouTube ][60]\n* [ Instagram ][61]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2023 Avopro EPZ Ltd. All rights reserved.\n* [ Disclaimer ][62]\n* [Home][63]\n* [About Us][64]\n  * [The Kenyan Way][65]\n  * [Our Team][66]\n  * [Quality Management System][67]\n  * [Careers][68]\n* [Sustainability][69]\n  * [Giving Back to the Environment][70]\n  * [Giving Back to the Community][71]\n  * [Sourcing][72]\n* [Products][73]\n* [Request Quote][74]\n* [Contact Us][75]\n\n[1]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[2]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[3]: /about-us\n[4]: /about-us#team\n[5]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/quality-management-system/\n[6]: https://avoprokenya.com/career/\n[7]: https://avoprokenya.com/sustainability-environmental-impact/\n[8]: /sustainability-environmental-impact\n[9]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#community\n[10]: /sustainability-environmental-impact#sourcing\n[11]: https://avoprokenya.com/products/\n[12]: https://avoprokenya.com/request-quote/\n[13]: https://avoprokenya.com/contact-us/\n[14]: https://avoprokenya.com/\n[15]: #g5core_search_popup\n[16]: https://avoprokenya.com/contact-us/\n[17]: https://avoprokenya.com/product/\n[18]: https://avoprokenya.com/about-us/\n[19]: https://avoprokenya.com