        "crawl_text": "[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][1]\n[Home][2]\nCompany\nBusiness\nSupport\n[Request Quote][3][Contact Us][4]\nToggle menu\n[Avocado orchard]\nPremium Kenyan Avocado Oil\n\n# From Kenya's Finest Orchards to Your Table\n\nExperience the pure essence of premium avocado oil, cold-pressed from sustainably sourced avocados\nand crafted with generations of farming expertise.\n\n[Request Sample][5][Our Story][6]\n700+\nPartner Farmers\n5+\nCountries Served\n100%\nCold-Pressed\n[Avocado oil pour]\n[Kenyan farmer]\n[Product lineup]\n[Orchard background]\n\n## Why Choose Brentwood Avo\n\nExpertise in sustainable avocado farming and oil production, delivering premium quality to\ndiscerning global markets.\n\n[Full Traceability]\n\n### Full Traceability\n\nTrack your oil from specific orchards to your facility with complete transparency and documentation.\n\n[Cold-Press Excellence]\n\n### Cold-Press Excellence\n\nOur mechanical extraction preserves nutrients and flavor without heat or chemical processing.\n\n[Certified Quality]\n\n### Certified Quality\n\nInternational certifications ensure consistent quality and safety standards for global markets.\n\n## Trusted Certifications\n\nOur commitment to quality is backed by international certifications and rigorous standards.\n\n[EU Organic]\n\n### EU Organic\n\nEU Organic Certification\n\n[AFA]\n\n### AFA\n\nAFA Certification\n\n## Growing Together\n\nOur success is rooted in sustainable partnerships with local farmers, creating positive impact\nacross Kenyan communities.\n\n700+\nPartner Farmers\nSupporting local communities\n60%\nWomen-Led Farms\nEmpowering female farmers\n100%\nSustainable Practices\nEnvironmentally responsible\n\n### Meet Our Farmers\n\n#### Our Farmer Network\n\nWe work directly with smallholder farmers across Kenya's prime avocado-growing regions and\nneighboring countries. Our network spans multiple counties and countries, bringing together\ndedicated growers who share our commitment to quality and sustainable practices.\n\n700+\n\n##### Partner Farmers\n\nSmallholder farmers across East Africa\n\n5+\n\n##### Sourcing Regions\n\nKenya, Uganda, Tanzania, Burundi, Rwanda\n\n100%\n\n##### Sustainable Practices\n\nOrganic farming and fair trade principles\n\n### Farmer Network Map\n\nClick on markers to see farmer details and locations\n\nLoading map...\nEast Africa Network\n700+ Partner Farmers\nKenya\nUganda\nTanzania\nRwanda\n[Explore Our Impact][7]\n\n## Our Process\n\nFrom orchard to export, every step is carefully controlled to deliver the highest quality avocado\noil to global markets.\n\n1\n\n### Selection\n\nHand-picked premium avocados from certified organic farms\n\nOnly the finest, fully ripened avocados make it to our processing facility\n\n2\n\n### Cold Press\n\nMechanical extraction without heat or chemicals\n\nOur cold-press method preserves all natural nutrients and flavor compounds\n\n3\n\n### Quality Assurance\n\nRigorous testing for purity, acidity, and nutritional content\n\nEvery batch undergoes comprehensive laboratory analysis and certification\n\n4\n\n### Packaging\n\nFilled into Flexi Tanks for bulk crude avocado oil export\n\nFlexi Tanks are fitted into standard 20ft containers, offering a cost-effective and hygienic\nsolution for transporting large volumes of crude avocado oil\n\n5\n\n### Export\n\nGlobal distribution with full traceability documentation\n\nTemperature-controlled logistics ensure product integrity from Kenya to your facility\n\n### Quality Guarantee\n\nEvery batch comes with complete documentation including certificates of analysis, traceability\nrecords, and quality assurance reports.\n\n## Trusted by Leading Brands Worldwide\n\nBuilding partnerships with industry leaders who value quality and sustainability.\n\n[ABASA]\n[Aceites Y Extractos Vegetales SA]\n[FOCI GROUP]\n[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][8]\n\nPremium avocado oil from Kenya's finest orchards. Committed to quality, sustainability, and\nsupporting local farmers.\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n+254 (0) 720 721 390\n[[email\u00a0protected]][9]\n\n### Company\n* [About][10]\n* [Quality][11]\n* [Sustainability][12]\n\n### Business\n* [Products][13]\n* [Export][14]\n* [Request Quote][15]\n\n### Support\n* [Resources][16]\n* [Contact][17]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Brentwood Avo Limited. All rights reserved.\n\n[Facebook][18][Twitter][19][Instagram][20][LinkedIn][21]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /quote\n[4]: /contact\n[5]: /contact?type=sample\n[6]: /about\n[7]: /sustainability\n[8]: /\n[9]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[10]: /about\n[11]: /quality\n[12]: /sustainability\n[13]: /products\n[14]: /export\n[15]: /quote\n[16]: /resources\n[17]: /contact\n[18]: #\n[19]: #\n[20]: #\n[21]: # [[Brentwood Avo Logo]][1]\n[Home][2]\nCompany\nBusiness\nSupport\n[Request Quote][3][Contact Us][4]\nToggle menu\n[Avocado orchard]\nPremium Kenyan Avocado Oil\n\n# From Kenya's Finest Orchards to Your Table\n\nExperience the pure essence of premium avocado oil, cold-pressed from sustainably sourced avocados\nand crafted with generations of farming expertise.\n\n[Request Sample][5][Our Story][6]\n700+\nPartner Farmers\n5+\nCountries Served\n100%\nCold-Pressed\n[Avocado oil pour]\n[Kenyan farmer]\n[Product lineup]\n[Orchard background]\n\n## Why Choose Brentwood Avo\n\nExpertise in sustainable avocado farming and oil production, delivering premium quality to\ndiscerning global markets.\n\n[Full Traceability]\n\n### Full Traceability\n\nTrack your oil from specific orchards to your facility with complete transparency and documentation.\n\n[Cold-Press Excellence]\n\n### Cold-Press Excellence\n\nOur mechanical extraction preserves nutrients and flavor without heat or chemical processing.\n\n[Certified Quality]\n\n### Certified Quality\n\nInternational certifications ensure consistent quality and safety standards for global markets.\n\n## Trusted Certifications\n\nOur commitment to quality is backed by international certifications and rigorous standards.\n\n[EU Organic]\n\n### EU Organic\n\nEU Organic Certification\n\n[AFA]\n\n### AFA\n\nAFA Certification\n\n## Growing Together\n\nOur success is rooted in sustainable partnerships with local farmers, creating positive impact\nacross Kenyan communities.\n\n700+\nPartner Farmers\nSupporting local communities\n60%\nWomen-Led Farms\nEmpowering female farmers\n100%\nSustainable Practices\nEnvironmentally responsible\n\n### Meet Our Farmers\n\n#### Our Farmer Network\n\nWe work directly with smallholder farmers across Kenya's prime avocado-growing regions and\nneighboring countries. Our network spans multiple counties and countries, bringing together\ndedicated growers who share our commitment to quality and sustainable practices.\n\n700+\n\n##### Partner Farmers\n\nSmallholder farmers across East Africa\n\n5+\n\n##### Sourcing Regions\n\nKenya, Uganda, Tanzania, Burundi, Rwanda\n\n100%\n\n##### Sustainable Practices\n\nOrganic farming and fair trade principles\n\n### Farmer Network Map\n\nClick on markers to see farmer details and locations\n\nLoading map...\nEast Africa Network\n700+ Partner Farmers\nKenya\nUganda\nTanzania\nRwanda\n[Explore Our Impact][7]\n\n## Our Process\n\nFrom orchard to export, every step is carefully controlled to deliver the highest quality avocado\noil to global markets.\n\n1\n\n### Selection\n\nHand-picked premium avocados from certified organic farms\n\nOnly the finest, fully ripened avocados make it to our processing facility\n\n2\n\n### Cold Press\n\nMechanical extraction without heat or chemicals\n\nOur cold-press method preserves all natural nutrients and flavor compounds\n\n3\n\n### Quality Assurance\n\nRigorous testing for purity, acidity, and nutritional content\n\nEvery batch undergoes comprehensive laboratory analysis and certification\n\n4\n\n### Packaging\n\nFilled into Flexi Tanks for bulk crude avocado oil export\n\nFlexi Tanks are fitted into standard 20ft containers, offering a cost-effective and hygienic\nsolution for transporting large volumes of crude avocado oil\n\n5\n\n### Export\n\nGlobal distribution with full traceability documentation\n\nTemperature-controlled logistics ensure product integrity from Kenya to your facility\n\n### Quality Guarantee\n\nEvery batch comes with complete documentation including certificates of analysis, traceability\nrecords, and quality assurance reports.\n\n## Trusted by Leading Brands Worldwide\n\nBuilding partnerships with industry leaders who value quality and sustainability.\n\n[ABASA]\n[Aceites Y Extractos Vegetales SA]\n[FOCI GROUP]\n[[Brentwood Avo Logo]][8]\n\nPremium avocado oil from Kenya's finest orchards. Committed to quality, sustainability, and\nsupporting local farmers.\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n+254 (0) 720 721 390\n[[email\u00a0protected]][9]\n\n### Company\n* [About][10]\n* [Quality][11]\n* [Sustainability][12]\n\n### Business\n* [Products][13]\n* [Export][14]\n* [Request Quote][15]\n\n### Support\n* [Resources][16]\n* [Contact][17]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Brentwood Avo Limited. All rights reserved.\n\n[Facebook][18][Twitter][19][Instagram][20][LinkedIn][21]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /quote\n[4]: /contact\n[5]: /contact?type=sample\n[6]: /about\n[7]: /sustainability\n[8]: /\n[9]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[10]: /about\n[11]: /quality\n[12]: /sustainability\n[13]: /products\n[14]: /export\n[15]: /quote\n[16]: /resources\n[17]: /contact\n[18]: #\n[19]: #\n[20]: #\n[21]: # brentwood.co.ke"
