Enable privacy and also a view - thanks to semi-transparent railings made of CELLON\u00ae!\n* [Treppengel\u00e4nder]\n  \n  ## **Stair Railings**\n  \n  ##### Turn your home into the ultimate stunner with a stair railing made of MDF or CELLON\u00ae!\n* [Akustiksysteme / Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae]\n  \n  ## **Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae**\n  \n  ##### Let the room acoustic systems & the Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae lower the tones to a comfortable\n  ##### level and clean the air at the same time!\n* [Balkonakustiksysteme]\n  \n  ## **Balcony Acoustic Systems**\n  \n  ##### Reduce your noise exposure and enjoy a quiet time on your balcony thanks to acoustic systems\n  ##### made of FORMBOARD TOP PINE\u00ae or CELLON\u00ae.\n* [Trennw\u00e4nde & Raumteiler]\n  \n  ## **Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements**\n  \n  ##### Create a first-class room divider made of MDF, CELLON\u00ae or OAK PLYWOOD according to your\n  ##### ideas!\n* [Hinterl\u00fcftete Fassaden]\n  \n  ## **Ventilated Facades**\n  \n  ##### Benefit from the cost-effective alternative to conventional facade\u00a0panels with CELLON\u00ae,\n  ##### available in over 3,000 colours!\n* [Wand- & Deckenverkleidungen]\n  \n  ## **Wall & Ceiling Panelling**\n  \n  ##### Design your wall and ceiling into an absolute eye-catcher made of MDF, CELLON\u00ae or OAK\n  ##### PLYWOOD!\n* [Schiebe-. Falt- und Beschattungselemente]\n  \n  ## **Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements**\n  \n  ##### Combine the useful with the aesthetic - selective and flexible protection from the sun's\n  ##### rays with CELLON\u00ae!\n* [Balkontrennw\u00e4nde]\n  \n  ## **Balcony Partitions & Cabinets**\n  \n  ##### Separate the balconies with CELLON\u00ae, enjoy more privacy and do it in style!\n* [Perforierte Fassaden]\n  \n  ## **Perforated Facades**\n  \n  ##### Design your facade from CELLON\u00ae as individually and uniquely as a fingerprint!\n\n### **Who** we are\n\nInnovation for Architecture \u2013 We make architecture come alive! Bruag Design Factory AG is your\npartner for customized building materials. We combine many years of experience in the laser\ntechnology of wood and wood-like materials as well as the surface processing of these materials. We\nnot only implement ordinary, but also innovative ideas and want to enable architecture to design\nindividual buildings with the help of our products. We are a family-run Swiss SME with a team made\nup of creative but also technically experienced people.\n\n[ to the Team ][63]\n\n##### individual\n\nMaximum freedom in shape, colour and material for creative minds: because the best innovations are\ncreated in cooperation with you. Your customised product entirely according to your wishes.\n\n##### innovativ\n\nInnovation arises where something is created and implemented. We are constantly looking for new\napplications and materials so that we can always offer you the right solution to all your\nchallenges.\n\n##### reliable\n\nTime is a rare commodity. It is all the more important that you can rely on appointments. We deliver\nmade-to-measure products in record time and oversee projects from planning to delivery under one\nroof.\n\n##### familial\n\nWe are a family-run SME without sluggish structures. We personally look after your project from the\nfirst consultation [ [send us an e-mail: info@bruag.ch] ][1] [ [call now: info@bruag.ch] ][2]\nEnglish\n[Deutsch][3][Fran\u00e7ais][4][Italiano][5][Espa\u00f1ol][6]\n[ [Bruag Logo] ][7]\n* [Home][8]\n* [Exterior][9]\n  * [Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][10]\n  * [Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][11]\n  * [Balcony Railings][12]\n  * [Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][13]\n  * [Balcony Acoustic Systems][14]\n  * [Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][15]\n  * [Garden Design Elements][16]\n* [Interior][17]\n  * [Wall & Ceiling Panelling][18]\n  * [Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][19]\n  * [Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][20]\n  * [Stair Railings][21]\n* [Materials][22]\n* [Downloads][23]\n* [References][24]\n* [About us][25]\n* [Contact][26]\n  * [Contact][27]\n  * [Offer Request][28]\n  * [Sample Order][29]\n[ [Bruag Logo] ][30]\n* Exterior\n  * [Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades][31]\n  * [Perforated Fa\u00e7ades][32]\n  * [Balcony Railings][33]\n  * [Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements][34]\n  * [Balcony Acoustic Systems][35]\n  * [Balcony Partitions & Cabinets][36]\n  * [Garden Design Elements][37]\n* Interior\n  * [Wall & Ceiling Panelling][38]\n  * [Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements][39]\n  * [Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae][40]\n  * [Stair Railings][41]\n* [Materials][42]\n* [Downloads][43]\n* [References][44]\n* [About us][45]\n* Contact\n  * [Contact][46]\n  * [Offer Request][47]\n  * [Sample Order][48]\n[ Ventilated Fa\u00e7ades ][49]\n[ Perforated Fa\u00e7ades ][50]\n[ Balcony Railings ][51]\n[ Sliding, Folding & Shading Elements ][52]\n[ Balcony Acoustic Systems ][53]\n[ Balcony Partitions & Cabinets ][54]\n[ Garden Design Elements ][55]\n[ Wall & Ceiling Panelling ][56]\n[ Partition Wall & Room Dividing Elements ][57]\n[ Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae ][58]\n[ Stair Railings ][59]\n[ Contact ][60]\n[ Offer Request ][61]\n[ Sample Order ][62]\n* [Balkonbr\u00fcstungen]\n  \n  # **Balcony Railings**\n  \n  ##### Enable privacy and also a view - thanks to semi-transparent railings made of CELLON\u00ae!\n* [Treppengel\u00e4nder]\n  \n  ## **Stair Railings**\n  \n  ##### Turn your home into the ultimate stunner with a stair railing made of MDF or CELLON\u00ae!\n* [Akustiksysteme / Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae]\n  \n  ## **Room Acoustic Systems & Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae**\n  \n  ##### Let the room acoustic systems & the Noise Virus Catcher\u00ae lower the tones to a comfortable\n  ##### level and clean the air at the same time!\n* [Balkonakustiksysteme]\n  \n  ## **Balcony Acoustic Systems**\n  \n  ##### Reduce your noise exposure and enjoy a quiet time on your balcony thanks to acoustic systems\n  