        "crawl_text": "[ Skip to content][1]\n* [Products][2]\n  * [Aluminum][3]\n  * [Stainless Steel][4]\n  * [Copper + Brass][5]\n* [Services][6]\n* [Industries][7]\n* [Certifications][8]\n* [Locations][9]\n  * [Los Angeles, CA][10]\n  * [Fresno, CA][11]\n  * [Hayward, CA][12]\n  * [Portland, OR][13]\n  * [Seattle, WA][14]\n  * [Medford, OR][15]\n  * [Spokane, WA][16]\n  * [Reno, NV][17]\n  * [Las Vegas, NV][18]\n  * [Phoenix, AZ][19]\n  * [Boise, ID][20]\n  * [Tijuana, BC][21]\n  * [Tijuana-Ensenada, BC][22]\n  * [Ensenada, Mexico][23]\n  * [Hermosillo, Mexico][24]\n  * [Guadalajara, Mexico][25]\n* [Catalog][26]\n* [Get Quote][27]\n* [Products][28]\n  * [Aluminum][29]\n  * [Stainless Steel][30]\n  * [Copper + Brass][31]\n* [Services][32]\n* [Industries][33]\n* [Certifications][34]\n* [Locations][35]\n  * [Los Angeles, CA][36]\n  * [Fresno, CA][37]\n  * [Hayward, CA][38]\n  * [Portland, OR][39]\n  * [Seattle, WA][40]\n  * [Medford, OR][41]\n  * [Spokane, WA][42]\n  * [Reno, NV][43]\n  * [Las Vegas, NV][44]\n  * [Phoenix, AZ][45]\n  * [Boise, ID][46]\n  * [Tijuana, BC][47]\n  * [Tijuana-Ensenada, BC][48]\n  * [Ensenada, Mexico][49]\n  * [Hermosillo, Mexico][50]\n  * [Guadalajara, Mexico][51]\n* [Catalog][52]\n* [Get Quote][53]\n\n# Coast Aluminum is Your Premier Supplier of Specialty Metals\n\nPrecision. Performance. Coast to Coast.\n\nFrom aerospace to construction, Coast Aluminum supplies high-quality aluminum, stainless steel,\ncopper, and brass with next-day availability, precision cutting, and expert service. Get the\nmaterials you need\u2014on time, every time.\n\n[ Explore Our Products ][54]\n[ Get a Quote ][55]\n[ Click for Full Video ][56]\n\n## Our Impact\n\nLocations\n0 +\nYears Experience\n0 +\nQuality Products\n0 +\n\n##### Explore Our Products\n\n## Specialty Metals Built for Performance\n\nAs a trusted name in metal supply, Coast Aluminum proudly offers a dynamic selection of premium\naluminum, stainless steel, copper, and brass\u2014ensuring strength, precision, and performance for every\nproject..\n\n[ Explore Our Products ][57]\n\n### Aluminum\n\nLightweight, corrosion-resistant, and highly versatile\u2014perfect for structural, architectural, and\nindustrial applications.\n\n[ Read More ][58]\n\n### Stainless Steel\n\nDurable, sleek, and built to withstand the toughest environments with excellent corrosion resistance\nand strength.\n\n[ Read More ][59]\n\n### Copper & Brass\n\nConductive, malleable, and aesthetically striking\u2014ideal for electrical, decorative, and\nprecision-engineered uses.\n\n[ Read More ][60]\n\n##### 16 Locations, One Mission\n\n## We Get You What You Need\u2014Fast\n\nWith 16 brick-and-mortar stores located across the Western United States and Northern Mexico, Coast\nAluminum ensures our customers have access to the materials and expertise needed to complete\nprojects on time and on budget.\n\n[ Find a location near you ][61]\n\n##### Why Choose Coast Aluminum?\n\n## Experience. Inventory. Results.\n\nAt Coast Aluminum, excellence isn\u2019t just a goal, it\u2019s our foundation. With an expansive catalog of\npremium aluminum and metal products, we are perfectly positioned to meet the demands of a wide range\nof industries to help build, innovate, and succeed.\n\n[ Explore Our Products ][62]\n\n### Industry Certified\n\nISO 9001:2015 and AS9120B\n\nWhat does this mean for you?\n\nThe adoption of a quality management system is a strategic decision for an organization to\ncontinuously improve their overall performance. Improved quality and service on-time delivery and a\nright the first-time attitude which leads to fewer returned products and complaints. Independent\naudits demonstrate a commitment to quality and ongoing compliance to the standard.\n\nAS9120B certification is a company-level certification that is internationally recognized and\noriginates from the International Aerospace Quality Group and is formally published in the United\nStates by the Society of Automotive Engineers (SAE). AS9120B is built directly on the ISO 9001:2015\nstandard and includes an emphasis on product safety requirements, counterfeit parts prevention, and\nperformance evaluation.\n\nAS9120B certification is intended for distribution organizations in the aviation, space, and defense\nindustries that procure and sell parts, materials, and assemblies.\n\n### Industry-Best Lead Times\n\nWith fast turnaround times and precision logistics, we help you meet tight deadlines without\nsacrificing quality.\n\n### Multiple Convenient Locations\n\nWith 16 branches across the U.S. and Mexico, we\u2019re always close by\u2014ready to serve your project\nwherever it\u2019s happening.\n\n### Top Notch Service\n\nOur expert team is here to guide you through material selection, cutting, and delivery with\nresponsive, knowledgeable support.\n\n### Premium Quality\n\nWe source and supply only the highest-grade metals, delivering reliable performance for even your\nmost demanding applications.\n\n### Contact Us\n\nGet more information on our metal supply company and service offerings, products, industry expertise\nand more.\n\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\n\n##### Industries We Serve\n\n## Built to Support What You Build\n\nCoast Aluminum proudly supports [ Skip to content][1]\n* [Products][2]\n  * [Aluminum][3]\n  * [Stainless Steel][4]\n  * [Copper + Brass][5]\n* [Services][6]\n* [Industries][7]\n* [Certifications][8]\n* [Locations][9]\n  * [Los Angeles, CA][10]\n  * [Fresno, CA][11]\n  * [Hayward, CA][12]\n  * [Portland, OR][13]\n  * [Seattle, WA][14]\n  * [Medford, OR][15]\n  * [Spokane, WA][16]\n  * [Reno, NV][17]\n  * [Las Vegas, NV][18]\n  * [Phoenix, AZ][19]\n  * [Boise, ID][20]\n  * [Tijuana, BC][21]\n  * [Tijuana-Ensenada, BC][22]\n  * [Ensenada, Mexico][23]\n  * [Hermosillo, Mexico][24]\n  * [Guadalajara, Mexico][25]\n* [Catalog][26]\n* [Get Quote][27]\n* [Products][28]\n  * [Aluminum][29]\n  * [Stainless Steel][30]\n  * [Copper + Brass][31]\n* [Services][32]\n* [Industries][33]\n* [Certifications][34]\n* [Locations][35]\n  * [Los Angeles, CA][36]\n  * [Fresno, CA][37]\n  * [Hayward, CA][38]\n  * [Portland, OR][39]\n  * [Seattle, WA][40]\n  * [Medford, OR][41]\n  * [Spokane, WA][42]\n  * [Reno, NV][43]\n  * [Las Vegas, NV][44]\n  * [Phoenix, AZ][45]\n  * [Boise, ID][46]\n  * [Tijuana, BC][47]\n  * [Tijuana-Ensenada, BC][48]\n  * [Ensenada, Mexico][49]\n  * [Hermosillo, Mexico][50]\n  * [Guadalajara, Mexico][51]\n* [Catalog][52]\n* [Get Quote][53]\n\n# Coast Aluminum is Your Premier Supplier of Specialty Metals\n\nPrecision. Performance. Coast to Coast.\n\nFrom aerospace to construction, Coast Aluminum supplies high-quality aluminum, stainless steel,\ncopper, and brass with next-day availability, precision cutting, and expert service. Get the\nmaterials you need\u2014on time, every time.\n\n[ Explore Our Products ][54]\n[ Get a Quote ][55]\n[ Click for Full Video ][56]\n\n## Our Impact\n\nLocations\n0 +\nYears Experience\n0 +\nQuality Products\n0 +\n\n##### Explore Our Products\n\n## Specialty Metals Built for Performance\n\nAs a trusted name in metal supply, Coast Aluminum proudly offers a dynamic selection of premium\naluminum, stainless steel, copper, and brass\u2014ensuring strength, precision, and performance for every\nproject..\n\n[ Explore Our Products ][57]\n\n### Aluminum\n\nLightweight, corrosion-resistant, and highly versatile\u2014perfect for structural, architectural, and\nindustrial applications.\n\n[ Read More ][58]\n\n### Stainless Steel\n\nDurable, sleek, and built to withstand the toughest environments with excellent corrosion resistance\nand strength.\n\n[ Read More ][59]\n\n### Copper & Brass\n\nConductive, malleable, and aesthetically striking\u2014ideal for electrical, decorative, and\nprecision-engineered uses.\n\n[ Read More ][60]\n\n##### 16 Locations, One Mission\n\n## We Get You What You Need\u2014Fast\n\nWith 16 brick-and-mortar stores located across the Western United States and Northern Mexico, Coast\nAluminum ensures our customers have access to the materials and expertise needed to complete\nprojects on time and on budget.\n\n[ Find a location near you ][61]\n\n##### Why Choose Coast Aluminum?\n\n## Experience. Inventory. Results.\n\nAt Coast Aluminum, excellence isn\u2019t just a goal, it\u2019s our foundation. With an expansive catalog of\npremium aluminum and metal products, we are perfectly positioned to meet the demands of a wide range\nof industries to help build, innovate, and succeed.\n\n[ Explore Our Products ][62]\n\n### Industry Certified\n\nISO 9001:2015 and AS9120B\n\nWhat does this mean for you?\n\nThe adoption of a quality management system is a strategic decision for an organization to\ncontinuously improve their overall performance. Improved quality and service on-time delivery and a\nright the first-time attitude which leads to fewer returned products and complaints. Independent\naudits demonstrate a commitment to quality and ongoing compliance to the standard.\n\nAS9120B certification is a company-level certification that is internationally recognized and\noriginates from the International Aerospace Quality Group and is formally published in the United\nStates by the Society of Automotive Engineers (SAE). AS9120B is built directly on the ISO 9001:2015\nstandard and includes an emphasis on product safety requirements, counterfeit parts prevention, and\nperformance evaluation.\n\nAS9120B certification is intended for distribution organizations in the aviation, space, and defense\nindustries that procure and sell parts, materials, and assemblies.\n\n### Industry-Best Lead Times\n\nWith fast turnaround times and precision logistics, we help you meet tight deadlines without\nsacrificing quality.\n\n### Multiple Convenient Locations\n\nWith 16 branches across the U.S. and Mexico, we\u2019re always close by\u2014ready to serve your project\nwherever it\u2019s happening.\n\n### Top Notch Service\n\nOur expert team is here to guide you through material selection, cutting, and delivery with\nresponsive, knowledgeable support.\n\n### Premium Quality\n\nWe source and supply only the highest-grade metals, delivering reliable performance for even your\nmost demanding applications.\n\n### Contact Us\n\nGet more information on our metal supply company and service offerings, products, industry expertise\nand more.\n\n[ Get a Quote ][63]\n\n##### Industries We Serve\n\n## Built to Support What You Build\n\nCoast Aluminum proudly supports a wide range of industries with high-performance metal products\nengineered for excellence. From precision materials for aviation, aerospace, and defense, to durable\nsolutions for construction, automotive, and marine applications\u2014our specialty metals are trusted\nwhere strength, reliability, and quality matter most.\n[ Our industry expertise ][64]\n\n##### Contact Us\n\n## Need Pricing Fast? Get a Custom Quote Fast\n\nGet a quote, learn about our service offerings, products, industry expertise, or have a Coast\nAluminum professional contact you directly.\n\nNotice: JavaScript is required for this content.\n\n## What our Clients Say\n\nSee what satisfied customers are saying about our excellent customer service, prompt delivery times,\nand reliable product quality.\n\n\u201cCoast Aluminum has excellent customer service, delivery turnaround time and I never had any issues\nwith their products!\u201d\nLaz A.Phoenix, AZ\n\u201cCoast Aluminum provides great service and most of our orders go to them because of their\ncompetitive pricing and lead time.\u201d\nYumi R.Mission Viejo, CA\n\u201cCoast Aluminum is one metal vendor that we as a company and me as a person have a tremendous amount\nof trust in.\u201d\nChris San Francisco, CA\n\u201cCoast aluminum is the best when it comes to Square tube, aluminum angle, Rectangle tubing, aluminum\nsheet plates etc\u201d\nRichard J.Norwalk, CA\n\u201cAlways on time & accurate. Prices are always competitive too. Great partner in the metal biz.\u201d\nShane S.Placentia, CA\n* [Aluminum][65]\n* [Stainless Steel][66]\n* [Copper + Brass][67]\n* [Services][68]\n* [Industries][69]\n* [Locations][70]\n* [Why Us?][71]\n* [Contact Us][72]\n* [Aluminum][73]\n* [Stainless Steel][74]\n* [Copper + Brass][75]\n* [Services][76]\n* [Industries][77]\n* [Locations][78]\n* [Why Us?][79]\n* [Contact Us][80]\n* [Aluminum][81]\n* [Stainless Steel][82]\n* [Copper + Brass][83]\n* [Services][84]\n* [Industries][85]\n* [Locations][86]\n* [Why Us?][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\n* [Aluminum][89]\n* [Stainless Steel][90]\n* [Copper + Brass][91]\n* [Services][92]\n* [Industr"
