une - 2 July 2026\n\n[Read more][42]\n[81st Meeting of the Executive Board]\n\n### [81st Meeting of the Executive Board][43]\n\n14 to 15 April 2026\n\n[Read more][44]\n[77th Meeting of the Consultative Committee]\n\n### [77th Meeting of the Consultative Committee][45]\n\n2 to 5 February 2026\n\n[Read more][46]\n[37th Annual Meeting of Governing Council]\n\n### [37th Annual Meeting of Governing Council][47]\n\n9 to 10 December 2025\n\n[Read more][48]\n[80th Meeting of the Executive Board]\n\n### [80th Meeting of the Executive Board][49]\n\n30 September to 1 October 2025\n\n[Read more][50]\n\n## Our Projects\n\n[[EUDR] ][51]\n\n## [ Opportunities and Challenges of the EU Deforestation Regulation in Agri-commodity Value Chains,\n## Global South ][52]\n\n[[JKCC] ][53]\n\n## [ JKCC General Supplies Ltd, Coffee, Uganda ][54]\n\n[[Ecotierra coffee] ][55]\n\n## [ Ecotierra, Coffee, Peru ][56]\n\n[[Cafe Selva] ][57]\n\n## [ Caf\u00e9 Selva, Coffee, Peru ][58]\n\n[[Sunterra coffee] ][59]\n\n## [ Sunterra, Coffee, Colombia ][60]\n\n[[RCN] ][61]\n\n## [ Robust International, Cashew, Singapore ][62]\n\n[All projects][63]\nRecent News\n[[ACT Fund first loan] ][64]\n- 15 Jun, 2026\n\n### [ The ACT Fund announces first investment to JKCC Limited in Uganda ][65]\n\n[[Michael van den Berg, ACT Fund Director/Common Fund for Commodities (left) and Kai Schlegelmilch,\nthe German Federal Ministry for the Environment, Climate Action, Nature Conservation and Nuclear\nSafety (BMKUN) (right)] ][66]\n- 12 Jun, 2026\n\n### [ The Common Fund for Commodities and the ACT Fund at the SASI Learning & Scaling Labs: Scaling\n### Sustainable Agriculture Through Partnership and Finance ][67]\n\n[[GC77_CHINA] ][68]\n- 11 Jun, 2026\n\n### [ Group of 77 and China Calls for Increased Support to the Common Fund for Commodities ][69]\n\n[[ACT-Fund_20260608] ][70]\n- 08 Jun, 2026\n\n### [ ACT Fund and CFC Recognised in Landmark FASA Report on Africa\u2019s Agri-SME Investment Landscape\n### ][71]\n\n[[UNGA_20