        "crawl_text": "[[USA made bulk oils & oil powders] Produced In USA][1]\n[1-262-710-0013][2]\n[[Connoils bulk oil & oil powder manufacturer Big Bend, Wisconsin]][3]\n* [Oils & Oil Powders][4]\n* [Ingredients ][5]\n  Seeds/Berries\n  [Grapeseed][6]\n  [Flax Seed][7]\n  [Hemp Seed][8]\n  [Pumpkin Seed][9]\n  [Black Currant][10]\n  [Safflower Seed][11]\n  [Chia Seed][12]\n  [Pomegranate][13]\n  [Black Cumin Seed][14]\n  [Strawberry Seed][15]\n  [Neem][16]\n  [Sea Buckthorn][17]\n  [Apricot Kernel][18]\n  [Sesame Seed][19]\n  [Pomace Olive][20]\n  Plants/Flowers\n  [Saw Palmetto][21]\n  [Sunflower][22]\n  [Evening Primrose][23]\n  [Rice Bran][24]\n  [Borage][25]\n  [Wheat Germ][26]\n  [Cranberry][27]\n  [Phytosterols][28]\n  [Coconut][29]\n  [Palm][30]\n  [Soy][31]\n  [Tapioca][32]\n  [Oat][33]\n  [Rosemary][34]\n  [Lavender][35]\n  [Peppermint][36]\n  [Tea Tree][37]\n  [Jojoba][38]\n  [Eucalyptus][39]\n  [Aloe Vera][40]\n  [Algae Omega-3][41]\n  Fats/Oils\n  [Hydrolyzed Collagen][42]\n  [Lecithin][43]\n  [MCT][44]\n  [Coconut][45]\n  [Whey][46]\n  [Fish Oil][47]\n  [Avocado][48]\n  [Almond][49]\n  [Olive][50]\n  [Castor Oil][51]\n  [Canola][52]\n  [CLA][53]\n  [Vegetable Oil][54]\n  [Butter][55]\n  [DHA Oil][56]\n  [Omega-3][57]\n  [Soy Lecithin][58]\n  [Sunflower Lecithin][59]\n* [Capabilities ][60]\n  * Product Forms\n    Bulk formulation & supply of raw ingredients in these forms:\n    [ Oil ][61]\n    [ Oil Powders ][62]\n    [ Capsule ][63]\n    [ Softgels ][64]\n    [ Emulsions ][65]\n    [ Bottles ][66]\n    [ Pouches ][67]\n    [ Carrier Oils ][68]\n  * Industries\n    We manufacture raw ingredients for businesses in any industry, including:\n    [ Food][69]\n    [ Drink][70]\n    [ Supplement][71]\n    [ Nutraceuticals][72]\n    [ Pet Nutrition][73]\n    [ Beauty Products][74]\n    [ Essential Oils][75]\n    [ Homeopathic Ingredients][76]\n    [ Sports Nutrition][77]\n  * Applications\n    Custom formulated raw ingredients tailored to your consumer needs:\n    People\n    Pets\n    Agriculture\n    Animal Feed\n  * Services\n  * [Bulk Supplier][78]\n  * [Wholesaler][79]\n  * [Distributor][80]\n  * [Private Labeling][81]\n  * [Formulator][82]\n  * [Manufacturer][83]\n  * [Product To Market][84]\n  * [Supply Chain][85]\n  * [Business Support][86]\n* [Our Company ][87]\n  * [News][88]\n* [Contact][89]\n* [GET A QUOTE][90]\nKnow What's Inside\nYour Oil & Oil Powders\n[Ingredients][91] [Get A Quote][92]\n\n# Raw Ingredients To Finished Products\n\nConnoils By Kraft is a leading international supplement [manufacturer][93],\u00a0[distributor][94]\nand\u00a0[wholesale supplier][95] of bulk\u00a0oil ingredients. We create\u00a0[oil and oil powders][96] meeting\nfood, nutritional and drink grade standards. Connoils By Kraft clients range from startups to big\nmultinational corporations creating gels, [capsules][97], pills,\u00a0[dried beverages][98],\n[tablets][99],\u00a0[drinks][100] and more. Connoils By Kraft can help any business create\u00a0oil and oil\npowder based product to stringent domestic or international specifications.\n\nCoconut\nCBD\nSaw Palmetto\nSunflower\nPomegranate\nPowder\nOil\n\n## We Buy, Grow or Source Oil & Oil Powder Products\n\nWe\u2019ve worked with manufacturers and companies in the [pet nutrition][101], [functional food][102],\nhealth,\u00a0[beauty][103] and\u00a0[sports nutrition][104] industries, providing customized formulations with\nthe highest potency available. Our\u00a0[experienced formulators][105] draw on industry leading training\nand technology to bring your product beyond the standards of regulatory compliance.\n\n[Get Started][106]\n\n### A Single-Source Custom Supplier\n\nWe\u2019re competitively priced in [oils and oil powders][107]. Through our Peterson Plant Products (PPP)\ncompany, we plant or source conventional, organic and biodynamic products with full traceability and\ndocumentation, ensuring you meet the regulatory standards of your industry.\n\n[Custom Formulation][108]\n\n### Cutting-Edge Drying Technology Increases Ingredient Potency\n\nBy minimizing the use of heat in transforming oils into oil powders, Connoils By Kraft maximizes the\nnutritional integrity of your product through microencapsulation. We're able to create high oil load\noil powders that are more potent than those from\u00a0[manufacturers][109] that use traditional drying\nprocesses.\n\n[Know What's Inside][110]\n\n[FDA registered manufacturer of bulk oils and oil powders]\n[DSHEA certified manufacturer of dietary supplements]\n[USDA certified Organic supplier of oils and oil powders]\n[Vegan wholesale supplier of oils and oil powders]\n[Kosher certified]\n[Non-GMO bulk oil supplier]\n[Halal certified wholesale oils and oil powders]\n\n## Get Your Product To Market, *Faster*\n\nOur customers require the flexibility to order small and large raw materials quantities. From high\noil load powders and bioactive powders with improved absorption and uptake, Connoils By Kraft\nprovides superior customer service, on-time delivery and price competitiveness. As a toll processor,\nwe can take any element (from a raw ingredient to a finished product) through our formulation\nprocess,\u00a0[private labeling/white labeling][111] and shipping direct. [[USA made bulk oils & oil powders] Produced In USA][1]\n[1-262-710-0013][2]\n[[Connoils bulk oil & oil powder manufacturer Big Bend, Wisconsin]][3]\n* [Oils & Oil Powders][4]\n* [Ingredients ][5]\n  Seeds/Berries\n  [Grapeseed][6]\n  [Flax Seed][7]\n  [Hemp Seed][8]\n  [Pumpkin Seed][9]\n  [Black Currant][10]\n  [Safflower Seed][11]\n  [Chia Seed][12]\n  [Pomegranate][13]\n  [Black Cumin Seed][14]\n  [Strawberry Seed][15]\n  [Neem][16]\n  [Sea Buckthorn][17]\n  [Apricot Kernel][18]\n  [Sesame Seed][19]\n  [Pomace Olive][20]\n  Plants/Flowers\n  [Saw Palmetto][21]\n  [Sunflower][22]\n  [Evening Primrose][23]\n  [Rice Bran][24]\n  [Borage][25]\n  [Wheat Germ][26]\n  [Cranberry][27]\n  [Phytosterols][28]\n  [Coconut][29]\n  [Palm][30]\n  [Soy][31]\n  [Tapioca][32]\n  [Oat][33]\n  [Rosemary][34]\n  [Lavender][35]\n  [Peppermint][36]\n  [Tea Tree][37]\n  [Jojoba][38]\n  [Eucalyptus][39]\n  [Aloe Vera][40]\n  [Algae Omega-3][41]\n  Fats/Oils\n  [Hydrolyzed Collagen][42]\n  [Lecithin][43]\n  [MCT][44]\n  [Coconut][45]\n  [Whey][46]\n  [Fish Oil][47]\n  [Avocado][48]\n  [Almond][49]\n  [Olive][50]\n  [Castor Oil][51]\n  [Canola][52]\n  [CLA][53]\n  [Vegetable Oil][54]\n  [Butter][55]\n  [DHA Oil][56]\n  [Omega-3][57]\n  [Soy Lecithin][58]\n  [Sunflower Lecithin][59]\n* [Capabilities ][60]\n  * Product Forms\n    Bulk formulation & supply of raw ingredients in these forms:\n    [ Oil ][61]\n    [ Oil Powders ][62]\n    [ Capsule ][63]\n    [ Softgels ][64]\n    [ Emulsions ][65]\n    [ Bottles ][66]\n    [ Pouches ][67]\n    [ Carrier Oils ][68]\n  * Industries\n    We manufacture raw ingredients for businesses in any industry, including:\n    [ Food][69]\n    [ Drink][70]\n    [ Supplement][71]\n    [ Nutraceuticals][72]\n    [ Pet Nutrition][73]\n    [ Beauty Products][74]\n    [ Essential Oils][75]\n    [ Homeopathic Ingredients][76]\n    [ Sports Nutrition][77]\n  * Applications\n    Custom formulated raw ingredients tailored to your consumer needs:\n    People\n    Pets\n    Agriculture\n    Animal Feed\n  * Services\n  * [Bulk Supplier][78]\n  * [Wholesaler][79]\n  * [Distributor][80]\n  * [Private Labeling][81]\n  * [Formulator][82]\n  * [Manufacturer][83]\n  * [Product To Market][84]\n  * [Supply Chain][85]\n  * [Business Support][86]\n* [Our Company ][87]\n  * [News][88]\n* [Contact][89]\n* [GET A QUOTE][90]\nKnow What's Inside\nYour Oil & Oil Powders\n[Ingredients][91] [Get A Quote][92]\n\n# Raw Ingredients To Finished Products\n\nConnoils By Kraft is a leading international supplement [manufacturer][93],\u00a0[distributor][94]\nand\u00a0[wholesale supplier][95] of bulk\u00a0oil ingredients. We create\u00a0[oil and oil powders][96] meeting\nfood, nutritional and drink grade standards. Connoils By Kraft clients range from startups to big\nmultinational corporations creating gels, [capsules][97], pills,\u00a0[dried beverages][98],\n[tablets][99],\u00a0[drinks][100] and more. Connoils By Kraft can help any business create\u00a0oil and oil\npowder based product to stringent domestic or international specifications.\n\nCoconut\nCBD\nSaw Palmetto\nSunflower\nPomegranate\nPowder\nOil\n\n## We Buy, Grow or Source Oil & Oil Powder Products\n\nWe\u2019ve worked with manufacturers and companies in the [pet nutrition][101], [functional food][102],\nhealth,\u00a0[beauty][103] and\u00a0[sports nutrition][104] industries, providing customized formulations with\nthe highest potency available. Our\u00a0[experienced formulators][105] draw on industry leading training\nand technology to bring your product beyond the standards of regulatory compliance.\n\n[Get Started][106]\n\n### A Single-Source Custom Supplier\n\nWe\u2019re competitively priced in [oils and oil powders][107]. Through our Peterson Plant Products (PPP)\ncompany, we plant or source conventional, organic and biodynamic products with full traceability and\ndocumentation, ensuring you meet the regulatory standards of your industry.\n\n[Custom Formulation][108]\n\n### Cutting-Edge Drying Technology Increases Ingredient Potency\n\nBy minimizing the use of heat in transforming oils into oil powders, Connoils By Kraft maximizes the\nnutritional integrity of your product through microencapsulation. We're able to create high oil load\noil powders that are more potent than those from\u00a0[manufacturers][109] that use traditional drying\nprocesses.\n\n[Know What's Inside][110]\n\n[FDA registered manufacturer of bulk oils and oil powders]\n[DSHEA certified manufacturer of dietary supplements]\n[USDA certified Organic supplier of oils and oil powders]\n[Vegan wholesale supplier of oils and oil powders]\n[Kosher certified]\n[Non-GMO bulk oil supplier]\n[Halal certified wholesale oils and oil powders]\n\n## Get Your Product To Market, *Faster*\n\nOur customers require the flexibility to order small and large raw materials quantities. From high\noil load powders and bioactive powders with improved absorption and uptake, Connoils By Kraft\nprovides superior customer service, on-time delivery and price competitiveness. As a toll processor,\nwe can take any element (from a raw ingredient to a finished product) through our formulation\nprocess,\u00a0[private labeling/white labeling][111] and shipping direct.\n\n## Oils & Oil Powders for Every Industry\n\nNational and international manufacturers, companies and distributors choose Connoils By Kraft for\nnon-gmo, organic oil and oil powder. Consumers choose our oils and oil powders for their products as\na healthy and safe option that meets all their needs. Connoils By Kraft works with companies in a\nvariety of industries, including those in:\n\n[ Food][112]\n[ Drink][113]\n[ Supplement][114]\n[ Vitamins][115]\n[ Nutraceuticals][116]\n[ Pet Nutrition][117]\n[ Sports Nutrition][118]\n[ Beauty Products][119]\n[ Essential Oils][120]\n[ Homeopathic Ingredients][121]\n[Work With Us][122]\n[[Connoils bulk capsule & tablet manufacturer Waukesha, Wisconsin USA]][123]\n[1-262-710-0013][124]\n[[Facebook]][125] [[LinkedIn]][126] [[Twitter]][127]\nHQ & Manufacturing Site:\n[W230S7115 Guthrie School Road, Big Bend, WI 53103][128]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 ConnOils By Kraft\n* [About Us][129]\n* [News][130]\n* [Contact][131]\n\n## International Product & Ingredient Manufacturer & Distributor\n\nConnoils By Kraft provides USA made bulk oils, oil powders and softgels to businesses worldwide.\nServing clients in:\n* [Australia][132]\n* [Brazil][133]\n* [Canada][134]\n* [Chile][135]\n* [China][136]\n* [Costa Rica][137]\n* [European Union][138]\n* [Hong Kong][139]\n* [India][140]\n* [Indonesia][141]\n* [Israel][142]\n* [Japan][143]\n* [Malaysia][144]\n* [Mexico][145]\n* [Morocco][146]\n* [New Zealand][147]\n* [Nigeria][148]\n* [Norway][149]\n* [Peru][150]\n* [Philippines][151]\n* [Saudi Arabia][152]\n* [Singapore][153]\n* [South Africa][154]\n* [South Korea][155]\n* [Taiwan][156]\n* [Thailand][157]\n* [United Arab Emirates][158]\n* [United Kingdom][159]\n* [United States][160]\n* [Vietnam][161]\n\n##### and anywhere precision formulated natural ingredients are needed.\n\nJavascript is required for full website functionality.\n\n[1]: /Wholesale/UnitedStatesOilsPowders\n[2]: /Contact\n[3]: /\n[4]: /OilsPowders\n[5]: /Ingredients\n[6]: /OilsPowders/GrapeSeed\n[7]: /OilsPowders/FlaxSeed\n[8]: /OilsPowders/HempSeed\n[9]: /Oils"
