brown and blue glass sections,\nsurrounded by green landscaping, walkways, and students walking around, under a blue sky with\nclouds.]\n[570 Fulton]\n[Close-up of a modern architectural siding with a textured surface, emphasizing the SKALA\nArchitectural Siding branding.]\n[Modern multi-story residential building with large windows, a brick ground level, and surrounded by\ngreenery.]\n[Close-up view of a modern, geometric high-rise building with angular window frames and white\nexterior panels against a clear blue sky.]\nSlide 1 Slide 1 (current slide) Slide 2 Slide 2 (current slide) Slide 3 Slide 3 (current slide)\nSlide 4 Slide 4 (current slide) Slide 5 Slide 5 (current slide)\n[Modern university campus building with curved white facade, brown and blue glass sections,\nsurrounded by green landscaping, walkways, and students walking around, under a blue sky with\nclouds.]\n[570 Fulton]\n[Close-up of a modern architectural siding with a textured surface, emphasizing the SKALA\nArchitectural Siding branding.]\n[Modern multi-story residential building with large windows, a brick ground level, and surrounded by\ngreenery.]\n[Close-up view of a modern, geometric high-rise building with angular window frames and white\nexterior panels against a clear blue sky.]\n\n# **exoSURFACES**\n\nexo Surfaces provides advanced facade solutions that bridge design intent with performance reality.\nWe engineer and supply fully integrated rainscreen systems for architects, engineers, installers,\nand building owners seeking precision, durability, and compliance with today\u2019s energy and code\nstandards. Our expertise spans thermally broken sub-framing systems\u2014such as the Passive\nHouse\u2013certified [**exoTHERM**][72] bracket and FRP [**exoGIRT**][73]\u2014as well as complete material\nsolutions including [**K\u00d8L High-Density Fiber Cement**][74] and [**TONALITY\u00ae Terracotta**][75]\ncladding. Through early collaboration and technical coordination, we help project teams achieve\nfacades that are efficient to install, resilient over time, and expressive of each building\u2019s\narchitectural intent.\n* [Discover design flexibility, enduring durability, and timeless elegance with K\u00d8L High Density\n  Fiber Cement architectural facade panels.]\n  \n  ## K\u00d8L Fiber Cement\n  \n  Discover design flexibility, enduring durability, and timeless elegance with **K\u00d8L High-Density\n  Fiber Cement** architectural facade panels.\n  \n  [Specify K\u00d8L][76]\n* [The industry\u2019s only adjustable FRP bracket, exoTHERM is Passive House Certified and thermally\n  isolated by design\u2014eliminating thermal bridges while supporting code-compliant rainscreen cladding\n  systems.]\n  \n  ## exoTHERM FRP Bracket\n  \n  The industry\u2019s only adjustable FRP bracket, **exoTHERM** is Passive House Certified and thermally\n  isolated by design\u2014eliminating thermal bridges while supporting code-compliant rainscreen cladding\n  systems.\n  \n  [learn more about exoTHERM][77]\n* [The newly formulated FRP exoGIRT offers best-in-class strength, withstanding bending, screw\n  pull-out, and other structural stresses.]\n  \n  ## exoGIRT\u2122\n  \n  The newly formulated FRP **exoGIRT** offers best-in-class strength, withstanding bending, screw\n  pull-out, and other structural stresses.\n  \n  [ [\n0\n][1]\n[ Skip to Content ][2]\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][3]\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][4]\nexo\n[ Team ][5]\n[ Careers ][6]\nK\u00d8L\u00ae FIBER CEMENT\n[ Applications ][7]\n[ Textures & Colors ][8]\n[ Total Facade Delivery ][9]\n[ Manufacturing & History ][10]\n[ Technical Information ][11]\nPRODUCTS\n[ SUB-FRAMING SYSTEMS ][12]\n[ TONALITY\u00ae Terracotta ][13]\n[ SKALA FC Architectural Siding ][14]\n[ SKALA K Clay Shingle ][15]\n[ Rustikotta ][16]\n[ exoTHERM ][17]\n[ exoGIRT FRP Z-GIRT ][18]\n[ Services ][19]\n[ PROJECTS ][20]\nSAMPLES\n[ KOL Samples ][21]\n[ TONALITY Samples ][22]\n[ CONTACT ][23]\nOpen Menu Close Menu\n[ [exo Surfaces] ][24]\n[ [exo Sur