        "crawl_text": "Rainscreen System Manufacturer - Frontek Porcelain Facades\n[ [Frontek] ][1]\n* [About us][2]\n* [Products][3]\n  * [Frontek Facade][4]\n    * [Textured][5]\n    * [Soft Stone Cladding Panels][6]\n    * [Stone-like Cladding Panels][7]\n    * [Wood-like Cladding Panels][8]\n    * [Colored Panels][9]\n    * [Volume][10]\n    * [Metal-like Cladding Panels][11]\n    * [Customize color][12]\n  * [XXL][13]\n  * [Argos][14]\n    * [Pavements][15]\n    * [Countertops][16]\n    * [XXL][17]\n* [Projects][18]\n* [Technical Resources][19]\n* [Educational][20]\n* [Contact us][21]\nSelect Page\n[http://Logo%20Item][http://Logo%20Item]\n[http://2][http://2]\n[http://forms%20and%20shapes%20university][http://forms%20and%20shapes%20university]\n[http://4][http://4]\n[http://5][http://5]\n[http://6][http://6]\n[http://Logo%20Item][http://Logo%20Item]\n[http://2][http://2]\n[http://forms%20and%20shapes%20university][http://forms%20and%20shapes%20university]\n[http://4][http://4]\n[http://5][http://5]\n[http://6][http://6]\n\n# Extruded porcelain facade systems\n\nThe Frontek revolutionary cladding system is double-ventilated extruded porcelain. It\u2019s **ICC\nCertified** with **Global EPDs** and offers **CRAFTMANSHIP** that blends a passion for **ART** with\nthe latest **TECHNICAL** advances. The Frontek difference.\n\n[Technical inquiry][22]\n[Installation videos][23]\n[ICC ES][ICC ES]\n[Continuing Education AIA][Continuing Education AIA]\n[NFPA][NFPA]\n[GlobalEPD][GlobalEPD]\n\n## **OUR PRODUCTS**\n\n[Frontek Facade System][Frontek Facade System]\n\nFrontek\n\n### **FACADE SYSTEM**\n\n[Frontek Custom Colors][Frontek Custom Colors]\n\nFrontek\n\n### CUSTOM COLORS\n\n[Front-Tek ARGOS Interior Panels][Front-Tek ARGOS Interior Panels]\n\nArgos\n\n### INTERIOR PANELS\n\nXXL\nExpand the possibility of facade design with our outstanding **XXL size extruded ceramic pieces**\nthat, at 1,000 x 3,000 mm, have unmatched beauty, lightness, and versatility.\n,\n[Front-Tek XXL Products][Front-Tek XXL Products]\n[Front-Tek Open Joint System][Front-Tek Open Joint System]\n\n## WHAT IS FRONTEK?\n\n**Frontek is an ICC-certified complete extruded porcelain open-jointed rainscreen system.**\n\nThe double-ventilated facade panels are extruded porcelain in an optically flat honeycomb structure.\nIt is a single source solution for the complete building envelope that meets or exceeds code\nrequirements, utilizes a standard frame and connections, while giving design teams complete design\nflexibility.\n\n**The Frontek complete system** (tiles & Plus structure) weighs only 6.55lb/sf. and come in a\nlimitless variety of colors, designs and sizes ranging from 300 x 800 mm to 1000 x 3000 mm.\n\nADVANTAGES\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Front-Tek Superior Product][Front-Tek Superior Product]\nThe system designed specifically for exterior fa\u00e7ade, it stands out for its great strength,\ndurability, and smooth installation. It\u2019s extremely hard, lightweight, and long-lasting.\nSuperior Product\n[Front-Tek Elegant Design][Front-Tek Elegant Design]\nAvailable in 80+ colors, the range of creativity is virtually limitless. Textures, sizes, and colors\ncan be manufactured and customized on request.\nElegant Design\n[Front-Tek Low Water Absorption][Front-Tek Low Water Absorption]\nAn astonishingly low water absorption rate (only 0.1%) makes for a truly weather-resistant material\nand virtaully no maintenance.\nLow Water Absorption\n[Front-Tek Resistance and Durability][Front-Tek Resistance and Durability]\nExcellent sound protection, Frontek achieves acoustic improvements around 4dBA in the range of 1000\nHz, with the ventilation layer furthering the noise barrier effect.\nAcoustic\n[Read more][24]\n\n## Download Textures, Technical Guides, and More\n\nAdd free technical resources to your project library.\nOur products exist to elevate your buildings. We invite you to use our textures, guides, wall\nassemblies and more in your projects.\n\n\u00a0\n\n**[See our technical resources \u2192][25]**\n\n## Let\u2019s talk\n\nHOW WE CAN HELP YOUR NEXT FACADE PROJECT\n\n[CONTACT US][26]\nInformation\n[About us][27] [Products][28] [Educational][29] [Resources][30] [Our Blog][31] [Contact us][32]\n[Site map][33] [Log in][34]\n[][35] [][36] [][37]\n\nCOPYRIGHT \u00a9 2024 FRONTEK USA LLC \u00b7 [PRIVACY POLICY][38]\n* \u2190\n* Contact Us!\n  \n  ### Interested in an offer? Get in touch!\n\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue to use\nthis site we will assume that you are happy with it.[Ok][39][Privacy policy][40]\n\n[1]: https://frontek-usa.com/\n[2]: https://frontek-usa.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://frontek-usa.com/products/\n[4]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-frontek-facade/\n[5]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/textured/\n[6]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/soft/\n[7]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/nature/\n[8]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/wood/\n[9]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/colored-panels/\n[10]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/volume/\n[11]: https://frontek-usa.com/texture/metal/\n[12]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-color-page/\n[13]: https://frontek-usa.com/xxl-products/\n[14]: https://frontek-usa. Rainscreen System Manufacturer - Frontek Porcelain Facades\n[ [Frontek] ][1]\n* [About us][2]\n* [Products][3]\n  * [Frontek Facade][4]\n    * [Textured][5]\n    * [Soft Stone Cladding Panels][6]\n    * [Stone-like Cladding Panels][7]\n    * [Wood-like Cladding Panels][8]\n    * [Colored Panels][9]\n    * [Volume][10]\n    * [Metal-like Cladding Panels][11]\n    * [Customize color][12]\n  * [XXL][13]\n  * [Argos][14]\n    * [Pavements][15]\n    * [Countertops][16]\n    * [XXL][17]\n* [Projects][18]\n* [Technical Resources][19]\n* [Educational][20]\n* [Contact us][21]\nSelect Page\n[http://Logo%20Item][http://Logo%20Item]\n[http://2][http://2]\n[http://forms%20and%20shapes%20university][http://forms%20and%20shapes%20university]\n[http://4][http://4]\n[http://5][http://5]\n[http://6][http://6]\n[http://Logo%20Item][http://Logo%20Item]\n[http://2][http://2]\n[http://forms%20and%20shapes%20university][http://forms%20and%20shapes%20university]\n[http://4][http://4]\n[http://5][http://5]\n[http://6][http://6]\n\n# Extruded porcelain facade systems\n\nThe Frontek revolutionary cladding system is double-ventilated extruded porcelain. It\u2019s **ICC\nCertified** with **Global EPDs** and offers **CRAFTMANSHIP** that blends a passion for **ART** with\nthe latest **TECHNICAL** advances. The Frontek difference.\n\n[Technical inquiry][22]\n[Installation videos][23]\n[ICC ES][ICC ES]\n[Continuing Education AIA][Continuing Education AIA]\n[NFPA][NFPA]\n[GlobalEPD][GlobalEPD]\n\n## **OUR PRODUCTS**\n\n[Frontek Facade System][Frontek Facade System]\n\nFrontek\n\n### **FACADE SYSTEM**\n\n[Frontek Custom Colors][Frontek Custom Colors]\n\nFrontek\n\n### CUSTOM COLORS\n\n[Front-Tek ARGOS Interior Panels][Front-Tek ARGOS Interior Panels]\n\nArgos\n\n### INTERIOR PANELS\n\nXXL\nExpand the possibility of facade design with our outstanding **XXL size extruded ceramic pieces**\nthat, at 1,000 x 3,000 mm, have unmatched beauty, lightness, and versatility.\n,\n[Front-Tek XXL Products][Front-Tek XXL Products]\n[Front-Tek Open Joint System][Front-Tek Open Joint System]\n\n## WHAT IS FRONTEK?\n\n**Frontek is an ICC-certified complete extruded porcelain open-jointed rainscreen system.**\n\nThe double-ventilated facade panels are extruded porcelain in an optically flat honeycomb structure.\nIt is a single source solution for the complete building envelope that meets or exceeds code\nrequirements, utilizes a standard frame and connections, while giving design teams complete design\nflexibility.\n\n**The Frontek complete system** (tiles & Plus structure) weighs only 6.55lb/sf. and come in a\nlimitless variety of colors, designs and sizes ranging from 300 x 800 mm to 1000 x 3000 mm.\n\nADVANTAGES\n\n\u00a0\n\n[Front-Tek Superior Product][Front-Tek Superior Product]\nThe system designed specifically for exterior fa\u00e7ade, it stands out for its great strength,\ndurability, and smooth installation. It\u2019s extremely hard, lightweight, and long-lasting.\nSuperior Product\n[Front-Tek Elegant Design][Front-Tek Elegant Design]\nAvailable in 80+ colors, the range of creativity is virtually limitless. Textures, sizes, and colors\ncan be manufactured and customized on request.\nElegant Design\n[Front-Tek Low Water Absorption][Front-Tek Low Water Absorption]\nAn astonishingly low water absorption rate (only 0.1%) makes for a truly weather-resistant material\nand virtaully no maintenance.\nLow Water Absorption\n[Front-Tek Resistance and Durability][Front-Tek Resistance and Durability]\nExcellent sound protection, Frontek achieves acoustic improvements around 4dBA in the range of 1000\nHz, with the ventilation layer furthering the noise barrier effect.\nAcoustic\n[Read more][24]\n\n## Download Textures, Technical Guides, and More\n\nAdd free technical resources to your project library.\nOur products exist to elevate your buildings. We invite you to use our textures, guides, wall\nassemblies and more in your projects.\n\n\u00a0\n\n**[See our technical resources \u2192][25]**\n\n## Let\u2019s talk\n\nHOW WE CAN HELP YOUR NEXT FACADE PROJECT\n\n[CONTACT US][26]\nInformation\n[About us][27] [Products][28] [Educational][29] [Resources][30] [Our Blog][31] [Contact us][32]\n[Site map][33] [Log in][34]\n[][35] [][36] [][37]\n\nCOPYRIGHT \u00a9 2024 FRONTEK USA LLC \u00b7 [PRIVACY POLICY][38]\n* \u2190\n* Contact Us!\n  \n  ### Interested in an offer? Get in touch!\n\nWe use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue to use\nthis site we will assume that you are happy with it.[Ok][39][Privacy policy][40]\n\n[1]: https://frontek-usa.com/\n[2]: https://frontek-usa.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://frontek-usa.com/products/\n[4]: https://frontek-usa.com/products-frontek-facade/\n[5]: https://frontek-usa