ays You Can Help Prevent a Migraine\n][48] [\n[young woman sitting on couch taking medication with water]\nMigraine Treatment Options and At-Home Remedies\n][49] [\n[Person making a peanut butter sandwich.]\nCould These 10 Foods Trigger Your Migraines?\n][50] [\n[Young black woman wearing a patterned shirt is taking a supplement pill and holding a glass of\nwater, sitting on a couch]\nHow Taking Magnesium May Bring Migraine Relief\n][51]\nJune Is Migraine Awareness Month\n[\n\n## Explore Conditions\n\nSee All Health Conditions ][52]\n[Breast Cancer][53] [Digestive Disorders][54] [Depression][55] [Heart Disease][56] [Lung Cancer][57]\n[Migraines][58] [Psoriasis][59] [Rheumatoid Arthritis][60] [Skin Conditions][61] [Type 2\nDiabetes][62] [See All Health Conditions ][63]\n[\n[A person scratching a red irritated area on their lower back.]\nHow Long Do Chronic Spontaneous Urticaria Symptoms Last?\n][64] [\n[A plate with cooked salmon and fresh spinach leaves.]\n7 Kinds of Food That Can Help With Obstructive Sleep Apnea\n][65] [\n[A woman sitting at a table using a smartphone with a laptop visible in the foreground]\nHow to Navigate Daily Tasks With Diabetic Macular Edema\n][66]\n[\n\n## Eat Well\n\nSee Tips for Eating Well ][67]\n[\n[a glass filled with pure, dark red cherry juice]\nWhat Happens to Your Sleep When You Drink Tart Cherry Juice Before Bed\n][68] [\n[Fish oil capsules displayed on a light pink background]\nFish Oil vs. Omega-3: Which Is Better For You?\n][69] [\n[Hand pours maple syrup from a glass bottle onto a stack of pancakes with fresh berries.]\nIs Maple Syrup Really Better for You Than Sugar?\n][70] [\n[two salmon filets on a plate]\nHow to Get Enough Vitamin D During the Winter Months\n][71]\n[\n\n## Move Your Body\n\nSee All Fitness ][72]\n[\n[Senior woman stretching and exercising in living room]\nWhat Taking Short Stretch Breaks During the Day May Do for Your Blood Sugar and Joint Health\n][73] [\n[Person stretching on a floor mat in a room with exercise equipment nearby.]\n6 Ways To Build Strength Without Ever Going to the Gym\n][74] [\n[Man on the left is incline walking, while woman on the right is running. ]\nIncline Walking vs. Running: Which Workout Delivers Better Results?\n][75]\n[\n\n## Relieve Anxiety\n\nSee All Mental Health ][76]\n[\n[Thoughtful businesswoman looking through window in office.]\nHow to Improve Your Emotional Wellness\n][77] [\n[Black woman running in a sunny park with wireless headphones, wearing a gray sports bra and\nleggings, smiling softly and looking ahead]\nHow Exercise Can Improve Mental Health\n][78] [\n[A young man tries to concentrate on his schoolwork ]\nWhat Is the Difference Between ADHD and Anxiety?\n][79] [\n[person with anxious attachment sitting with partner]\nWhat Does It Mean To Have an Anxious Attachment Style?\n][80]\n\n## Our Team\n\n*Health*\u2019s team of medical experts, writers, and editors are committed to ensuring our content is\nevidence-based, up-to-date, and comprehensive.\n[Medical Expert Board ][81]\n[\nDakari Quimby, PhD\nPsychologist\n][82] [\nKelly Wood, MD\nEndocrinologist\n][83]\n[Expert Writers ][84]\n[\nKirstyn Hill, PharmD, MPH\nPharmacist; Writer\n][85] [\nLindsey DeSoto [Skip to content][1]\n[\nHealth\n][2]\n* Search the site GO\n  Please fill out this field.\n* [Newsletters][3]\nSearch\nPlease fill out this field.\n* [ News ][4]\n  News\n  * [ Recalls and Food Safety ][5]\n  * [ View All ][6]\n* [ Conditions A - Z ][7]\n  Conditions A - Z\n  * [ Endometriosis ][8]\n  * [ Anxiety ][9]\n  * [ Type 2 Diabetes ][10]\n  * [ Headaches and Migraines ][11]\n  * [ Cold ][12]\n  * [ Flu ][13]\n  * [ View All ][14]\n* [ Nutrition ][15]\n  Nutrition\n  * [ Eat Well ][16]\n  * [ Nutrition Basics ][17]\n  * [ Vitamins and Supplements ][18]\n  * [ View All ][19]\n* [ Wellness ][20]\n  Wellness\n  * [ Mental Health ][21]\n  * [ Fitness ][22]\n  * [ Skincare ][23]\n  * [ Sexual Health ][24]\n  * [ View All ][25]\n* [ What to Buy ][26]\n  What to Buy\n  *