        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ [Health Genesis header logo supplement manufacturer website branding][Health Genesis header logo\nsupplement manufacturer website branding] ][2]\n* Products\n  Close Products Open Products\n  \n  ## [Products A-Z][3]\n  \n  ## [Products by Category][4]\n  \n  ## [Bulk Supplements][5]\n  \n  ## [Raw Materials][6]\n* Services\n  Close Services Open Services\n  \n  ## [Contract Supplement Manufacturing][7]\n  \n  ## [Private Label Supplements][8]\n  \n  ## [Co-Packing Services][9]\n  \n  ## [International Opportunities][10]\n  \n  ## [Label and Graphic Design][11]\n* Resources\n  Close Resources Open Resources\n  \n  ## [Blogs & Insights][12]\n  \n  ## [Industry Events][13]\n  \n  ## [Collaboration Beyond Manufacturing][14]\n  \n  ## [Community Outreach][15]\n  \n  [Single-serve stick pack powder supplement designed for travel and daily convenience][Single-serve\n  stick pack powder supplement designed for travel and daily convenience]\n  \n  ## [Stick Packs Are Becoming the Default Format for Powder Supplements][16]\n  \n  [ Learn More > ][17]\n* [ About ][18]\n[ (305) 861-0898 ][19]\n[ Contact ][20]\n[Health Genesis banner supplement manufacturing quality production facility overview][Health Genesis\nbanner supplement manufacturing quality production facility overview]\n\n# Private Label Supplement Manufacturer in the USA\n\nReady to start your own supplement company? We're among the best private label supplement\nmanufacturers, helping entrepreneurs launch successful brands with custom formulations, low minimum\norders, and complete support from concept to shelf.\n[Book Your Free Consultation][21][Start Your Brand Today][22]\n[Health Genesis banner supplement manufacturing facility production capabilities showcase][Health\nGenesis banner supplement manufacturing facility production capabilities showcase]\n\n## SCALE YOUR BUSINESS CONFIDENTLY\n\nTrusted Contract Manufacturing Partners Since 1998\nGrowing fast? Our contract supplement manufacturing expertise helps established brands scale\nreliably. With FDA-registered facilities and 25+ years of experience, we deliver American-made\nsupplements that meet your quality standards and timelines.\n[Book Your Free Consultation][23][Scale Your Production][24]\n\n## Why Leading Brands Choose Health Genesis\n\nHealth Genesis is a trusted private label supplement manufacturer with over 25 years of\nindustry-leading experience. We specialize in custom formulations, contract manufacturing, and\ncomprehensive B2B solutions for vitamins, supplements, and nutraceuticals.\n\n25+\n\nYears Manufacturing Excellence\n\n10,000+\n\nSuccessful Product Launches\n\nNSF\n\nCertified Facilities\n\nFDA\n\nCompliant Operations\n\n[Health Genesis supplement manufacturing facility equipment production capabilities][Health Genesis\nsupplement manufacturing facility equipment production capabilities]\n\n## Our Manufacturing Services\n\nComprehensive Solutions for Every Stage of Your Supplement Business\n\nFrom first idea to finished product, Health Genesis handles every stage of supplement production.\nPick the service that fits where your brand is today.\n\n### [Private Label Supplements][25]\n\nYour Brand. Our Expertise.\n\nWe make it easy to launch a supplement line \u2014 even if you\u2019re starting from scratch. Choose from 600+\nready-to-manufacture formulas or work with our team to create something custom. Low minimums mean\nyou can test the market before scaling.\n\nWhy Choose Our Private Label Manufacturing:\n* 600+ formulas ready to brand as your own\n* Low MOQs designed for new and growing brands\n* Private label vitamin companies branding support\n\n[Launch Your Private Label Brand >][26]\n\n### [Contract Supplement Manufacturing][27]\n\nScale Without Compromise\n\nWhen your brand outgrows its current manufacturer, Health Genesis is ready. Our FDA-registered,\ncGMP-certified facility handles high-volume runs with the same quality controls that built our\n25-year reputation. Your specs, your timeline, our guarantee.\n\nContract Manufacturing Advantages:\n* FDA-registered, NSF-certified USA facility\n* Consistent quality across every production run\n* Flexible capacity for brands at any growth stage\n\n[Explore Contract Manufacturing >][28]\n\n### Nutraceutical Manufacturing\n\nAlready Have a Formula? We'll Handle the Rest.\n\nIf your product is ready but production is the bottleneck, our co-packing services fill the gap. We\nwork with finished formulas and bulk materials across capsules, tablets, powders, softgels, and more\n\u2014 getting your product to market faster.\n\nNutraceutical Manufacturing Benefits:\n* Multiple delivery formats: capsules, tablets, powders, softgels\n* Handles bulk materials and finished formulas\n* Faster time-to-market with turnkey fulfillment support\n\n[Learn About Co-Packing >][29]\n\n### Vitamin Manufacturing\n\nTake Your Brand Global\n\nHealth Genesis supports brands entering international markets with USA-manufactured supplements that\nmeet global compliance standards. From vitamins to specialty formulas, we help you navigate\nregulatory requirements and position American-made qua [Skip to content][1]\n[ [Health Genesis header logo supplement manufacturer website branding][Health Genesis header logo\nsupplement manufacturer website branding] ][2]\n* Products\n  Close Products Open Products\n  \n  ## [Products A-Z][3]\n  \n  ## [Products by Category][4]\n  \n  ## [Bulk Supplements][5]\n  \n  ## [Raw Materials][6]\n* Services\n  Close Services Open Services\n  \n  ## [Contract Supplement Manufacturing][7]\n  \n  ## [Private Label Supplements][8]\n  \n  ## [Co-Packing Services][9]\n  \n  ## [International Opportunities][10]\n  \n  ## [Label and Graphic Design][11]\n* Resources\n  Close Resources Open Resources\n  \n  ## [Blogs & Insights][12]\n  \n  ## [Industry Events][13]\n  \n  ## [Collaboration Beyond Manufacturing][14]\n  \n  ## [Community Outreach][15]\n  \n  [Single-serve st