h Genesis\nsupplement manufacturing facility equipment production capabilities]\n\n## Our Manufacturing Services\n\nComprehensive Solutions for Every Stage of Your Supplement Business\n\nFrom first idea to finished product, Health Genesis handles every stage of supplement production.\nPick the service that fits where your brand is today.\n\n### [Private Label Supplements][25]\n\nYour Brand. Our Expertise.\n\nWe make it easy to launch a supplement line \u2014 even if you\u2019re starting from scratch. Choose from 600+\nready-to-manufacture formulas or work with our team to create something custom. Low minimums mean\nyou can test the market before scaling.\n\nWhy Choose Our Private Label Manufacturing:\n* 600+ formulas ready to brand as your own\n* Low MOQs designed for new and growing brands\n* Private label vitamin companies branding support\n\n[Launch Your Private Label Brand >][26]\n\n### [Contract Supplement Manufacturing][27]\n\nScale Without Compromise\n\nWhen your brand outgrows its current manufacturer, Health Genesis is ready. Our FDA-registered,\ncGMP-certified facility handles high-volume runs with the same quality controls that built our\n25-year reputation. Your specs, your timeline, our guarantee.\n\nContract Manufacturing Advantages:\n* FDA-registered, NSF-certified USA facility\n* Consistent quality across every production run\n* Flexible capacity for brands at any growth stage\n\n[Explore Contract Manufacturing >][28]\n\n### Nutraceutical Manufacturing\n\nAlready Have a Formula? We'll Handle the Rest.\n\nIf your product is ready but production is the bottleneck, our co-packing services fill the gap. We\nwork with finished formulas and bulk materials across capsules, tablets, powders, softgels, and more\n\u2014 getting your product to market faster.\n\nNutraceutical Manufacturing Benefits:\n* Multiple delivery formats: capsules, tablets, powders, softgels\n* Handles bulk materials and finished formulas\n* Faster time-to-market with turnkey fulfillment