        "crawl_text": "[[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n  [Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n  [About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n  [Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n  [Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n  [About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n  [Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n## We partner with specialty food brands to create powerful, distinct, strategic design that\n## commands attention and gets results.\n## [Are you ready to revolutionize your brand?][42]\n\n# Creative Food Packaging Design & Food Branding Agency\n\n#### We speak specialty food\n\nWe know consumer preferences, emerging trends, best practices, and FDA compliance.\n\n[What we do > ][43]\n\n#### We deliver results\n\nAs your strategic partner, we help you exceed goals and consistently surpass expectations.\n\n[View case studies > ][44]\n\n#### We make it easy\n\nWhether you're a startup or a large corporation, we free up time so you can do more of what you do\nbest.\n\n[See our process > ][45]\n\n## See how we\u2019ve helped hundreds of brands achieve outstanding results:\n\n## FOOD PACKAGING & BRANDING DESIGN SERVICES\n\n#### [ BRAND DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT ][46]\n\n[ [BRAND DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT][BRAND DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT] ][47]\n\n#### [ STRATEGIC PACKAGING DESIGN ][48]\n\n[ [STRATEGIC PACKAGING DESIGN][STRATEGIC PACKAGING DESIGN] ][49]\n\n#### [ MARKETING MATERIALS ][50]\n\n[ [MARKETING MATERIALS][MARKETING MATERIALS] ][51]\n\n#### [ WEBSITE\n#### DESIGN ][52]\n\n[ [WEBSITE DESIGN][WEBSITE DESIGN] ][53]\n\n## Specialty Food Case Studies\n\n[ [LaTourangelle_Case_Study-e1575283314950][LaTourangelle_Case_Study-e1575283314950] ][54]\n[ [Whisps_Case_Study][Whisps_Case_Study] ][55]\n[ [Rooibos_Case_Study][Rooibos_Case_Study] ][56]\n[ [Pepper_Creeks_Farms_Case_Study][Pepper_Creeks_Farms_Case_Study] ][57]\n[View Case Studies][58]\n\n#### \u201cOur business has tripled, our sales have increased, and we went from a local brand to\n#### national\u201d\n\n\u201cJenn David Design transformed the look of our product entirely and breathed new life into our brand\nas a result. The new look is beautiful, classy, fresh, and modern look that we are still getting\ncompliments on after all these years. We could not be happier with the work, and responses and\ndeliverables have always been timely. Jenn worked with us to bring our vision to life and even\ncreated supplemental marketing materials that are stylistically consistent and aligned with our\nlook. Since working with Jenn David Design, our business has tripled, our sales have increased, and\nwe went from a local brand to national! We know, without a doubt, that their work elevated our brand\nand was a large part in our growth. Packaging is what lures in a prospective customer, especially\nwhen they are on the brink of discovering a new, unfamiliar brand. And Jenn David Design made sure\nour packaging is buttoned up, polished, and inviting!\u201d\n\u2014Tenny A., Lemonette\n[Read More][59]\n\n#### \u201cMagnificent creative strategist & businesswoman\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019ve worked with Jenn David Design for 5 years and we\u2019ve launched many brands and products\ntogether. I am yet to find a design firm capable of delivering similar quality work with a fair\nprice tag and comparable turnaround times. Regardless of project scope or timeframe, JDD delivers\ntime and time again, and I\u2019m not easy to please. On any given day we juggle 10 projects! JDD is\nwell-equipped to take a concept from blue sky through pre- and post-production, liaising with\nvendors and multiple departments in our organization with meticulous attention to every single\nproject detail. This is something larger agencies can\u2019t touch. Jenn\u2019s infrastructure is not heavily\nlayered and she is a magnificent creative strategist & businesswoman. JDD\u2019s customer service is of\nsuch nature that I still feel as if I am her only and most valued customer.\u201d\n\u2014Lize, [Company name confidential]\n[Read More][60]\n\n#### \u201cRare combination of creative conceptualization and incredible design\u201d\n\n\u201cJenn David Design is a rare combination of creative conceptualization and incredible design\u2014we are\nsimply thrilled with the results! Working with Jenn is effortless\u2014she has the business savvy to\nquickly grasp concepts and turn out exceptional visuals with very few revisions required\u2014and all\nwithin the committed deadlines. I can't say enough about the quality, speed, attention to detail and\neffectiveness of JDD\u2019s work. We will continue to partner with Jenn David Design in the future.\u201d\n\u2014Petra M., Union Jack\u2019s Tea\n[Read More][61]\n\n#### \u201cThey were thoughtful, responsive, and timely\u201d\n\n\u201cJenn and her team are fantastic to work with and amazing designers. I had a West African hot sa [[Jenn-David-Design-Logo-Retina]][1]\n* [Our Work][2]\n  [Case Studies][3][Packaging][4][Logos][5][Websites][6][Marketing Materials][7]\n* [About][8]\n  [About][9][Our Process][10][Our Team][11][What Clients Say][12]\n* [Services][13]\n* [Resources][14]\n  [Articles][15][Strategic Guides][16][Expert Advice][17][Book][18][Video Series][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n* [Get Started][21]\n* [Our Work][22]\n  [Case Studies][23][Packaging][24][Logos][25][Websites][26][Marketing Materials][27]\n* [About][28]\n  [About][29][Our Process][30][Our Team][31][What Clients Say][32]\n* [Services][33]\n* [Resources][34]\n  [Articles][35][Strategic Guides][36][Expert Advice][37][Book][38][Video Series][39]\n* [Contact][40]\n* [Get Started][41]\n\n## We partner with specialty food brands to create powerful, distinct, strategic design that\n## commands attention and gets results.\n## [Are you ready to revolutionize your brand?][42]\n\n# Creative Food Packaging Design & Food Branding Agency\n\n#### We speak specialty food\n\nWe know consumer preferences, emerging trends, best practices, and FDA compliance.\n\n[What we do > ][43]\n\n#### We deliver results\n\nAs your strategic partner, we help you exceed goals and consistently surpass expectations.\n\n[View case studies > ][44]\n\n#### We make it easy\n\nWhether you're a startup or a large corporation, we free up time so you can do more of what you do\nbest.\n\n[See our process > ][45]\n\n## See how we\u2019ve helped hundreds of brands achieve outstanding results:\n\n## FOOD PACKAGING & BRANDING DESIGN SERVICES\n\n#### [ BRAND DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT ][46]\n\n[ [BRAND DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT][BRAND DESIGN & DEVELOPMENT] ][47]\n\n#### [ STRATEGIC PACKAGING DESIGN ][48]\n\n[ [STRATEGIC PACKAGING DESIGN][STRATEGIC PACKAGING DESIGN] ][49]\n\n#### [ MARKETING MATERIALS ][50]\n\n[ [MARKETING MATERIALS][MARKETING MATERIALS] ][51]\n\n#### [ WEBSITE\n#### DESIGN ][52]\n\n[ [WEBSITE DESIGN][WEBSITE DESIGN] ][53]\n\n## Specialty Food Case Studies\n\n[ [LaTourangelle_Case_Study-e1575283314950][LaTourangelle_Case_Study-e1575283314950] ][54]\n[ [Whisps_Case_Study][Whisps_Case_Study] ][55]\n[ [Rooibos_Case_Study][Rooibos_Case_Study] ][56]\n[ [Pepper_Creeks_Farms_Case_Study][Pepper_Creeks_Farms_Case_Study] ][57]\n[View Case Studies][58]\n\n#### \u201cOur business has tripled, our sales have increased, and we went from a local brand to\n#### national\u201d\n\n\u201cJenn David Design transformed the look of our product entirely and breathed new life into our brand\nas a result. The new look is beautiful, classy, fresh, and modern look that we are still getting\ncompliments on after all these years. We could not be happier with the work, and responses and\ndeliverables have always been timely. Jenn worked with us to bring our vision to life and even\ncreated supplemental marketing materials that are stylistically consistent and aligned with our\nlook. Since working with Jenn David Design, our business has tripled, our sales have increased, and\nwe went from a local brand to national! We know, without a doubt, that their work elevated our brand\nand was a large part in our growth. Packaging is what lures in a prospective customer, especially\nwhen they are on the brink of discovering a new, unfamiliar brand. And Jenn David Design made sure\nour packaging is buttoned up, polished, and inviting!\u201d\n\u2014Tenny A., Lemonette\n[Read More][59]\n\n#### \u201cMagnificent creative strategist & businesswoman\u201d\n\n\u201cI\u2019ve worked with Jenn David Design for 5 years and we\u2019ve launched many brands and products\ntogether. I am yet to find a design firm capable of delivering similar quality work with a fair\nprice tag and comparable turnaround times. Regardless of project scope or timeframe, JDD delivers\ntime and time again, and I\u2019m not easy to please. On any given day we juggle 10 projects! JDD is\nwell-equipped to take a concept from blue sky through pre- and post-production, liaising with\nvendors and multiple departments in our organization with meticulous attention to every single\nproject detail. This is something larger agencies can\u2019t touch. Jenn\u2019s infrastructure is not heavily\nlayered and she is a magnificent creative strategist & businesswoman. JDD\u2019s customer service is of\nsuch nature that I still feel as if I am her only and most valued customer.\u201d\n\u2014Lize, [Company name confidential]\n[Read More][60]\n\n#### \u201cRare combination of creative conceptualization and incredible design\u201d\n\n\u201cJenn David Design is a rare combination of creative conceptualization and incredible design\u2014we are\nsimply thrilled with the results! Working with Jenn is effortless\u2014she has the business savvy to\nquickly grasp concepts and turn out exceptional visuals with very few revisions required\u2014and all\nwithin the committed deadlines. I can't say enough about the quality, speed, attention to detail and\neffectiveness of JDD\u2019s work. We will continue to partner with Jenn David Design in the future.\u201d\n\u2014Petra M., Union Jack\u2019s Tea\n[Read More][61]\n\n#### \u201cThey were thoughtful, responsive, and timely\u201d\n\n\u201cJenn and her team are fantastic to work with and amazing designers. I had a West African hot sauce\nI was looking to bring to market with very specific and unique design needs. Jenn and her team\ncreated a great label, logo, and brand for the product. They were thoughtful, responsive, and\ntimely. I get compliments from everyone on our packaging all thanks to Jenn and her team.\u201d\n\u2014Lara S., Volta Foods\n[Read More][62]\n\n#### \u201c60% growth in sales within 6 months\u201d\n\n\u201cWorking with Jenn and her team on Whisps made my job easy! In a fast-moving environment, Jenn and\nher team took our very tight timelines and complicated projects, and created amazing work. They were\nable to create packaging, selling tools, and a look and feel that garnered a 60% growth in sales\nwithin 6 months. I am forever thankful to them!\u201d\n\u2014Amanda T., Whisps\n[Read More][63]\n\n#### \u201cAll of the work was meticulously thought-out, efficient and creative\u201d\n\n\u201cJenn David Design has made creating our brand not only beautiful, but seamless. They helped with\ndesigning the look and feel of the logo, as well as all of the packaging on an entire line of\nproducts. All of the work was meticulously thought-out, efficient and creative. I am so thankful to\nJenn David Design and will continue to work with them on all new projects and products down the\nline!\u201d\n\u2014Amanda T., Olive + Grayce Apothecary\n[Read More][64]\n\n## Latest Articles\n\n[ [Colors & Design that work best in Costco Food Packaging Design purple graphic with pizza and\ncookies packaging images][Colors & Design that work best in Costco Food Packaging Design purple\ngraphic with pizza and cookies packaging images] ][65]\n\n### [ Colors & Design That Work Best in Costco Food Packaging ][66]\n\n[ [Stop using cliches to describe your food product][Stop using cliches to describe your food\nproduct] ][67]\n\n### [ Stop Using Cliches to Describe Your Food Product ][68]\n\n[ [Why Cheap Online Design is a Bad Idea for Food Brands, with a picture of BBQ sauce and honey][Why\nCheap Online Design is a Bad Idea for Food Brands, with a picture of BBQ sauce and honey] ][69]\n\n### [ Why Cheap "
