        "crawl_text": "[[keychain-logo]][1]\nAI for Manufacturers\nAI for Brands & Retailers\n[Sign in][2][Get Access][3]\n[Get Started][4]\nWelcome to\nAI-Powered CPG\nSimplify your supply chain\nwith AI-Powered CPG\nCreate products, connect with suppliers, and manage your entire supply chain - all with the power\nof\u00a0Keychain AI.\nGenerate Products\n[Dr Pepper][Land O Lakes][Utz][Mars][Kodiak Cakes][Cadbury][Newmans\nOwn][Waterloo][Sukhis][Feastables][Dr Pepper][Land O Lakes][Utz][Mars][Kodiak\nCakes][Cadbury][Newmans Own][Waterloo][Sukhis][Feastables]\n\n## Intelligent.Connected.AI-Powered.\n\nWe're building for the future of CPG.\n\nFor Brands & Retailers\n\n### Search & Discovery\n\nBrowse thousands of suppliers, and find your next manufacturer.\n\nLearn More\n\n### Keychain 360\n\nEnterprise grade solutions to accelerate product development and sourcing.\n\nLearn More\n\nFor Manufacturers\n\n### Keychain Edge\n\nPut your marketing on autopilot and drive more business.\n\nLearn More\n\n### Keychain OS\n\nOperate and optimize every aspect of production.\n\nLearn More\nSearch & Discovery\nFind your next manufacturer.Browse Keychain's database of 50K+ global CPG manufacturers. Filter by\ncriteria like certifications, capabilities, and allergens to find exactly who you need.\n[Get access][5]\nBrowse 50,000+ Manufacturers\nSearch suppliers by product, packaging material, and more. Filter by specific criteria, like\ncertifications and allergen capabilities, to find exactly who you need.\nReceive AI Recommendations\nBring products to life with AI-powered connections across manufacturing, packaging, ingredients and\nlogistics.\nPost Projects & Find Matches\nKeychain AI instantly matches brands with vetted suppliers tailored to their exact requirements.\nGenerate AI Products & Specs\nSimply describe your needs and Keychain AI translates it into manufacturing and packaging\nrequirements.\n[Search & Discovery]\n[Search & Discovery foreground]\nKeychain 360\nFull insight into your product roadmap and supplier network.Keychain360 centralizes supplier\ndiscovery, relationship management, and product development workflows in one AI-powered platform to\nbring products to market faster.\n[Get access][6]\nMy Supply Chain\nUnlock a single source of truth for your supplier network and find cost savings and efficiencies.\nSourcing Pipeline\nTurn sourcing into a fast, repeatable process to find the right suppliers sooner.\nSupplier Analysis & Selection\nAnalyze insights and leverage recommendations to award business with speed and confidence.\nAI for Enterprise\nQuery Keychain's database and your supplier network for rapid results on manufacturer capabilities\nand fast-growing products.\n[Keychain 360]\n[Keychain 360 foreground]\nKeychain Edge\nPut your marketing on autopilot and drive more business.Drive more revenue with qualified\nopportunities, events, opportunities, newsletter automation and much more.\n[Get access][7]\nQualified Opportunities\nReceive qualified demand through our advanced matching algorithm and connect with vetted brands and\nretailers looking for suppliers.\nContent Strategy & Creation\nWork with our team of experts on creating customized content for your blog, newsletter or LinkedIn.\nTargeted Keyword Automation\nCustomize your keywords across your categories to ensure focus on what you care about. You can also\ntarget competitor terms for maximum exposure across your industry.\nOpportunity Insights\nUnlock valuable insights on inbound opportunities. Identify which brands and retailers are visiting\nyour site in real time.\n[Keychain Edge]\n[Keychain Edge foreground]\nKeychain OS\nThe AI-powered operating system for modern manufacturing.Modular, intuitive, and insight-driven,\nKeychainOS's AI-powered product suite helps you drive performance through intelligent automation.\n[Get access][8]\nIntelligent Purchasing\nPredict demand and receive system-generated purchasing recommendations based on real-time inventory,\nproduction plans, and supplier performance. Automatically identify what to buy and when, reducing\nexcess spend and preventing stock [[keychain-logo]][1]\nAI for Manufacturers\nAI for Brands & Retailers\n[Sign in][2][Get Access][3]\n[Get Started][4]\nWelcome to\nAI-Powered CPG\nSimplify your supply chain\nwith AI-Powered CPG\nCreate products, connect with suppliers, and manage your entire supply chain - all with the power\nof\u00a0Keychain AI.\nGenerate Products\n[Dr Pepper][Land O Lakes][Utz][Mars][Kodiak Cakes][Cadbury][Newmans\nOwn][Waterloo][Sukhis][Feastables][Dr Pepper][Land O Lakes][Utz][Mars][Kodiak\nCakes][Cadbury][Newmans Own][Waterloo][Sukhis][Feastables]\n\n## Intelligent.Connected.AI-Powered.\n\nWe're building for the future of CPG.\n\nFor Brands & Retailers\n\n### Search & Discovery\n\nBrowse thousands of suppliers, and find your next manufacturer.\n\nLearn More\n\n### Keychain 360\n\nEnterprise grade solutions to accelerate product development and sourcing.\n\nLearn More\n\nFor Manufacturers\n\n### Keychain Edge\n\nPut your marketing on autopilot and drive more business.\n\nLearn More\n\n### Keychain OS\n\nOperate and optimize every aspect of production.\n\nLearn More\nSearch & Discovery\nFind your next manufacturer.Browse Keychain's database of 50K+ global CPG manufacturers. Filter by\ncriteria like certifications, capabilities, and allergens to find exactly who you need.\n[Get access][5]\nBrowse 50,000+ Manufacturers\nSearch suppliers by product, packaging material, and more. Filter by specific criteria, like\ncertifications and allergen capabilities, to find exactly who you need.\nReceive AI Recommendations\nBring products to life with AI-powered connections across manufacturing, packaging, ingredients and\nlogistics.\nPost Projects & Find Matches\nKeychain AI instantly matches brands with vetted suppliers tailored to their exact requirements.\nGenerate AI Products & Specs\nSimply describe your needs and Keychain AI translates it into manufacturing and packaging\nrequirements.\n[Search & Discovery]\n[Search & Discovery foreground]\nKeychain 360\nFull insight into your product roadmap and supplier network.Keychain360 centralizes supplier\ndiscovery, relationship management, and product development workflows in one AI-powered platform to\nbring products to market faster.\n[Get access][6]\nMy Supply Chain\nUnlock a single source of truth for your supplier network and find cost savings and efficiencies.\nSourcing Pipeline\nTurn sourcing into a fast, repeatable process to find the right suppliers sooner.\nSupplier Analysis & Selection\nAnalyze insights and leverage recommendations to award business with speed and confidence.\nAI for Enterprise\nQuery Keychain's database and your supplier network for rapid results on manufacturer capabilities\nand fast-growing products.\n[Keychain 360]\n[Keychain 360 foreground]\nKeychain Edge\nPut your marketing on autopilot and drive more business.Drive more revenue with qualified\nopportunities, events, opportunities, newsletter automation and much more.\n[Get access][7]\nQualified Opportunities\nReceive qualified demand through our advanced matching algorithm and connect with vetted brands and\nretailers looking for suppliers.\nContent Strategy & Creation\nWork with our team of experts on creating customized content for your blog, newsletter or LinkedIn.\nTargeted Keyword Automation\nCustomize your keywords across your categories to ensure focus on what you care about. You can also\ntarget competitor terms for maximum exposure across your industry.\nOpportunity Insights\nUnlock valuable insights on inbound opportunities. Identify which brands and retailers are visiting\nyour site in real time.\n[Keychain Edge]\n[Keychain Edge foreground]\nKeychain OS\nThe AI-powered operating system for modern manufacturing.Modular, intuitive, and insight-driven,\nKeychainOS's AI-powered product suite helps you drive performance through intelligent automation.\n[Get access][8]\nIntelligent Purchasing\nPredict demand and receive system-generated purchasing recommendations based on real-time inventory,\nproduction plans, and supplier performance. Automatically identify what to buy and when, reducing\nexcess spend and preventing stockouts without manual planning.\nInventory Management\nContinuously track inventory levels, movement, and usage across locations with built-in intelligence\nthat surfaces risks early. The system flags shortages, overages, and discrepancies so teams can stay\nahead of issues instead of reacting to them.\nProduction Automation\nAutomate production workflows by connecting purchasing, inventory, and production planning in one\ncoordinated system. Plans adjust automatically as inputs change, eliminating manual handoffs and\nkeeping execution aligned in real time.\nEnd-to-end Traceability\nAutomatically capture and link data from raw materials through finished goods across your supply\nchain. Instantly trace products, investigate issues, and support compliance with real-time,\nauditable records.\n[Keychain OS]\n[Keychain OS foreground]\n[Ferrero]\n\n\"Keychain helps us quickly access a wide variety of manufacturers -- faster than we ever did with\nweb search or at trade shows -- providing great options to develop our external co-man network in\nNorth America.\"\n\nMichela Tonda\n\nOperations Manager, North America\n\n[Lidl]\n\n\"With Keychain, we've been able to accelerate our search for new suppliers while ensuring they meet\nour high standards for quality and cost-efficiency.\"\n\nPeter Poutre\n\nChief Buying Officer, Lidl US\n\n[GoPuff]\n\n\"Keychain has been pivotal in helping grow our private label business in both the food and non-food\nsectors. I can't say enough good things about this platform and the endless networking\nopportunities.\"\n\nJillian Jensen\n\nSenior Brand Manager, Private Label\n\n[Belgian Boys]\n\n\"A game-changer for brands like us looking to scale, giving us access to industry experts and\npartners we wouldn't have met otherwise.\"\n\nGreg Galel\n\nCEO & Co-Founder, Belgian Boys\n\n[keychain-logo-full]\n[Privacy Policy][9][Terms of Use][10][Contact Us][11][Sitemap][12]\nPopular Products\n[Keychain360 for Brands & Retailers][13][For Manufacturers][14][Manufacturing Product\nSupplier][15][Ingredient Product Supplier][16][Beauty Product Supplier][17][Packaging Product\nSupplier][18][Supplement Product Supplier][19][Knowledge Center][20][CRM][21][Food coloring\nmanufacturers][22][Deli meat manufacturers][23][Cookie manufacturers][24][Peanut\nmanufacturers][25][Baking soda manufacturers][26][Protein powder manufacturers][27][Red pepper\nflakes manufacturers][28][Chia seeds manufacturers][29][Sunflower seeds\nmanufacturers][30][Nutritional supplement manufacturers][31][Organic supplements\nmanufacturers][32][Spring water manufacturers][33][Private label supplement manufacturers][34][Salt\nmanufacturers][35][Performance gummies manufacturers][36][Private label vitamin\nmanufacturers][37][Protein bar manufacturers][38][Corned beef manufacturers][39][Health supplement\nmanufacturers][40][Private label energy drink manufacturers][41][Beef manufacturers][42][Private\nlabel chocolate bar manufacturers][43][Private label protein powder manufacturers][44][Dried fruit\nmanufacturers][45][French fries manufacturers][46][Stevia manufacturers][47][Almond\nmanufacturers][48][Private label manufacturers][49][Root beer manufacturers][50][Private label\nprobiotics manufacturers][51][Canola oil manufacturers][52][Energy drinks\nmanufacturers][53][Distilled water manufacturers][54][Flavored soda manufacturers][55][Hydration and\nelectrolyte powders manufacturers][56][Collagen supplement manufacturers][57][Mozzarella\nmanufacturers][58][Baked goods manufacturers][59][Pistachio manufacturers][60][Functional beverage\nmanufacturers][61][Keurig pods manufacturers][62][Freeze dried vegetables manufacturers][63][Brown\nrice manufacturers][64][Gelato manufacturers][65][Chewing gum manufacturers][66][Cinnamon rolls\nmanufacturers][67][Allulose manufacturers][68][Mayonnaise manufacturers][69][Cream cheese\nmanufacturers][70][Ice cream cone manufacturers][71][Sitemap][72][Manufacturer Sitemap][73][Who\nMakes Sitemap][74]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /auth/login\n[3]: /auth/signup\n[4]: /auth/signup\n[5]: /auth/signup\n[6]: /auth/signup\n[7]: /au"
