ity excellence.\u00a0\n\nOur 100% pure and effective oils are demanded in Indian and International market for effective use\nand reliable results. From food to cosmetics, pharmaceutical, aromatherapy centres and more, our\ncollection finds used in various industries.\n\n**Men Behind Successful Business Operations**\n\n**Mr. Vijay Kalsaria **is the Proprietor of the company, skilled in handling diverse business tasks.\nHis entrepreneurship skills and right approach to serving clients is the main reason of company\ngetting appreciation from local and foreign buyers. Along with Mr. Kalsaria, **Dr. Paresh Kahar **is\nleading the company as a Technical Expert.\u00a0\n\n**Our Clients**\n\nOur company is maintaining relations with industry leading names like:\n\n* KANCOR Ingredients Limited\n* Plant Lipids\n* Synthite and more.\n\n\nShow more\n[Trade Information]\n\nNature of Business\n\nExporter and Importer and Manufacturer & Supplier\n\n[Company Verification Number]\n\nGST Number\n\n24AIEPK8429K1Z0\n\n[Company Founding]\n\nYear of Establishment\n\n2002\n\n[B2b Trading]\n\nMember Since\n\n6 Years\n\n[Company Employees]\n\nNo of Staff\n\n13\n\n[Bankers]\n\nBankers\n\nKOTAK MAHINDRA BANK ,ICICI BANK\n\n**Surat, Gujarat (India) **based **K. K. Enterprise **is a trusted partner to companies in\ncosmetics, food, beverage and other industries because it brings forth premium quality **Chamomile\nOil, Wheat Germ Oil, Cumin Seed Oil, Terpineol Oil **and others.\u00a0\n\n**Research & Development**\n\nOur R&D is our biggest strength in attaining goodness in products. We have skilled researchers and\ndevelopers to ensure the best of techniques and technologies are used for production of essential\noils.\u00a0\n\n**Applications of Oils**\n\n* Our essential oils are admired for reliving tension and supporting wellness in body which is why\n  they are ideally used in aromatherapy centres.\u00a0\n* Our cold pressed carrier oils have great medicinal properties which is why they\n\n[Know 