        "crawl_text": "[[Kathy & Ray Horticultures Limited]][1]\n[[About]][2][[Development]][3][[Cooperation]][4][[Requirements]][5][[Contacts]][6]\n\n# Quality\n# avocado oil.\n# We produce\n# honestly.\n# We deliver\n# exactly on time.\n\n[avocado]\n\n### We produce a cold-pressed avocado oil substitute with a focus on sustainable production and full\n### compliance with International Standards\n\nProduction is carried out on an industrial scale using two production lines that operate year-round.\n\nWe manage the entire chain: from purchasing avocados to processing, packaging and export logistics.\n\nWe are located close to the raw material base, which allows us to significantly reduce logistics\ncosts, minimize the environmental footprint and ensure uninterrupted supplies.\n\nWe supply high-quality oil that meets food safety and traceability standards.\n\n### Sustainable development and quality proven by our customers and time\n\n#### Sustainable production\n\nWe strive for sustainable development, minimizing our ecological footprint. Our company actively\nimplements the principles of environmentally friendly production at every stage.\n\n#### Logistics optimization\n\nThe location of our production close to the raw material base allows us to significantly reduce\nlogistics costs, which makes our deliveries more efficient and accessible.\n\n#### High quality standards\n\nWe ensure that our avocado oil meets strict food safety and traceability standards, ensuring high\nquality and reliability for our customers.\n\n## We work with export traders working with organic oils, private label producers, distributors of\n## edible oils and importers of natural products, retail chains working in the natural products\n## segment and wholesale buyers.\n\n### Readiness for European requirements and standards\n\nWe work only with certified suppliers, which guarantees quality and compliance with standards.\nProducts are accompanied by the necessary documentation to confirm organic production.\n\nWe know the specifics of document flow and logistics in the USA, UAE, Israel and the EU. This helps\nto effectively organize deliveries and avoid delays\n\nWe offer various packaging formats to meet customer needs. Whether it is small packages for retail\nor large volumes for wholesale, we can offer optimal solutions.\n\nWe value flexibility and individual approach to clients. We are ready to adapt offers to your needs\nto create long-term partnerships.\n\n### Interested in cooperation? Leave a request, we will contact you quickly and discuss the details.\n\n\u00a0\n\nSubmit\n\nBy clicking the \"Submit\" button you accept the terms of the [Privacy Policy][7]\n\n[[Kathy & Ray Horticultures Limited]][8]\n\n\u00a9 2025 Kathy & Ray Horticultures Limited. All rights reserved\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n\n[+254772548095][9][info@krhorticultures.com][10]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /#about-section\n[3]: /#development-section\n[4]: /#cooperation-section\n[5]: /#requirements-section\n[6]: /#contacts-section\n[7]: /privacy?from=contacts-section\n[8]: /\n[9]: tel:+254772548095\n[10]: mailto:info@krhorticultures.com [[Kathy & Ray Horticultures Limited]][1]\n[[About]][2][[Development]][3][[Cooperation]][4][[Requirements]][5][[Contacts]][6]\n\n# Quality\n# avocado oil.\n# We produce\n# honestly.\n# We deliver\n# exactly on time.\n\n[avocado]\n\n### We produce a cold-pressed avocado oil substitute with a focus on sustainable production and full\n### compliance with International Standards\n\nProduction is carried out on an industrial scale using two production lines that operate year-round.\n\nWe manage the entire chain: from purchasing avocados to processing, packaging and export logistics.\n\nWe are located close to the raw material base, which allows us to significantly reduce logistics\ncosts, minimize the environmental footprint and ensure uninterrupted supplies.\n\nWe supply high-quality oil that meets food safety and traceability standards.\n\n### Sustainable development and quality proven by our customers and time\n\n#### Sustainable production\n\nWe strive for sustainable development, minimizing our ecological footprint. Our company actively\nimplements the principles of environmentally friendly production at every stage.\n\n#### Logistics optimization\n\nThe location of our production close to the raw material base allows us to significantly reduce\nlogistics costs, which makes our deliveries more efficient and accessible.\n\n#### High quality standards\n\nWe ensure that our avocado oil meets strict food safety and traceability standards, ensuring high\nquality and reliability for our customers.\n\n## We work with export traders working with organic oils, private label producers, distributors of\n## edible oils and importers of natural products, retail chains working in the natural products\n## segment and wholesale buyers.\n\n### Readiness for European requirements and standards\n\nWe work only with certified suppliers, which guarantees quality and compliance with standards.\nProducts are accompanied by the necessary documentation to confirm organic production.\n\nWe know the specifics of document flow and logistics in the USA, UAE, Israel and the EU. This helps\nto effectively organize deliveries and avoid delays\n\nWe offer various packaging formats to meet customer needs. Whether it is small packages for retail\nor large volumes for wholesale, we can offer optimal solutions.\n\nWe value flexibility and individual approach to clients. We are ready to adapt offers to your needs\nto create long-term partnerships.\n\n### Interested in cooperation? Leave a request, we will contact you quickly and discuss the details.\n\n\u00a0\n\nSubmit\n\nBy clicking the \"Submit\" button you accept the terms of the [Privacy Policy][7]\n\n[[Kathy & Ray Horticultures Limited]][8]\n\n\u00a9 2025 Kathy & Ray Horticultures Limited. All rights reserved\n\nNairobi, Kenya\n\n[+254772548095][9][info@krhorticultures.com][10]\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /#about-section\n[3]: /#development-section\n[4]: /#cooperation-section\n[5]: /#requirements-section\n[6]: /#contacts-section\n[7]: /privacy?from=contacts-section\n[8]: /\n[9]: tel:+254772548095\n[10]: mailto:info@krhorticultures.com krhorticultures.com"
