        "crawl_text": "### About Mevi Avocados\n\n#### Welcome to Mevi Avocados\n\nAceitera Mevi is a proud Mexican company with international presence in over 11 countries, operating\none of the biggest extra virgin avocado oil producing facilities in the world.\n\n#### Minimal Slider\n\n[ [Mevi Avocados] ][1]\n* * [ Esp][2]\n* [Main][3]\n* [About us][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Social Responsibility][6]\n* [Grupo Mevi][7]\n* [Contact][8]\n* Direct from our fields\n  Bringing the Best Avocados\n  to Whole World.\n  [ More about our products ][9]\n* Always in season!\n  Availability\n  All Year Round.\n  [ More about our products ][10]\n* International Presence\n  presence in 13 countries\n  around the world.\n  [ More about our Products ][11]\n* Avocados in every way for every day\n  Avocado growers, Packers\n  and Distributors.\n  [ More about our Process ][12]\n\n\n# \n\n# ABOUT US\n\n\n**Our Mission**\nWe are a Mexican company dedicated to the production, transformation, commercialization and export\nof avocado and derivatives at a global level, through the sustainability of our processes and\nthrough an organizational ethic based on collaborative work with its stakeholders.\n**Our Vision**\nBeing one of the best Mexican companies in the avocado and derivatives industry, recognized for the\nquality of our products, for our commitment to the environment, for the development of our\ncollaborators and our operational excellence.\n**Our Commitment**\nWe are committed to socially responsible management as part of our business strategy, having a\npositive impact on the quality of life of our employees, the community that surrounds us and the\nenvironment.\n**The Future**\nAt MEVI Avocados we approach the future with passion and confidence, with an enduring belief in the\npromise of avocado, a superfood that promotes the health and well-being of our consumers.\n\nMEVI's foundation lies in 5 CORE VALUES:\n**TRUST** We make sure that everyone involved with our company works with the same high purpose and\nethics, driving significant positive outcomes for our company and industry.\n**RESPONSABILITY** We are committed to supplying exclusively healthy products, like the avocado and\nits derivatives.\n**HONESTY** We combine professionalism with integrity in all aspects of our business, including team\nmembers and suppliers.\n**RESPECT** We recognize the capabilities and achievements of clients, team members and suppliers.\n**CUSTOMER SERVICE** We offer excellent personalized attention and responsiveness from the moment of\npurchase until the delivery of our products, with the aim of fulfilling and exceeding the\nexpectations of our customers.\n\n**ADVANTAGES OF OUR SERVICE**\nExperience: Overall knowledge of production and management of avocados since 1974. Market experience\nas a packer since 1994, and as an exporter\u2015through APEAM\u2015since 2003. Balanced Value Chain Method:\nMEVI pledges to provide the best service through this process, ensuring full control from planting\nthe avocado, to its storage and distribution.\n\n**TIMELINE**\n\n\n[Timeline]\n\n**Cold Storage:** MEVI owns Crosspoint, Inc.a South Texas cold storage facility with a 60 container\ncapacity that serves as a primary distribution point.\n\n[Crosspoint Storage]\n\n[ Social Responsibility ][13]\n\n# International Presence\n\nProviding the best Avocados with the most rich flavor, we have\npresence in 13 countries around the world.\n\n# Contact US\n\n### MEVI AVOCADOS\n\nWe are avocado growers, packers & distributors, want to visit of contact us? For commercial\ninquiries please fill out this boxes and we\u00b4ll get back to you.\n\nJalisco\nKm 2+800 Carretera Cd. Guzman - Zapotiltic\nZapotiltic, Jalisco. C.P. 49616 M\u00e9xico.\nPhone: +52 (33) 3113 4341\n\nMichoacan\nLibramiento Perib\u00e1n-Buenavista Km 0+200\nPerib\u00e1n, Michoac\u00e1n, C.P. 60440 M\u00e9xico.\nPhone: +52 (35) 4551 2461 / 4551 2353.\n\n\n###### Mevi Avocados\n\nAvocados in every way\nFor every day.\n\n###### Contact\n\nJalisco\nKm 2+800 Carretera Cd. Guzman - Zapotiltic\nZapotiltic, Jalisco. C.P. 49616\nPhone: (52) (33) 3113 4341\nexport@meviavocados.com.mx\n\n###### Certifications\n\n* SMETA\n* Global G.A.P.\n* GRASP\n* Primus GFS\n* HACCP\n\n##### Social Media\n\n[Mevi Avocados\n\u00a9 2025. All Right Reserved By Grupo Mevi ][14]\n\n[\nValidation error occured. Please enter the fields and submit it again.\nThank You ! Your email has been delivered.\n][15]\n\n[1]: #home\n[2]: esp.html\n[3]: #home\n[4]: #about\n[5]: products.html\n[6]: social_responsability.html\n[7]: grupomevi.html\n[8]: #contact\n[9]: #products\n[10]: #products\n[11]: #products\n[12]: #ourprocess\n[13]: social_responsability.html\n[14]: #\n[15]: # ### About Mevi Avocados\n\n#### Welcome to Mevi Avocados\n\nAceitera Mevi is a proud Mexican company with international presence in over 11 countries, operating\none of the biggest extra virgin avocado oil producing facilities in the world.\n\n#### Minimal Slider\n\n[ [Mevi Avocados] ][1]\n* * [ Esp][2]\n* [Main][3]\n* [About us][4]\n* [Products][5]\n* [Social Responsibility][6]\n* [Grupo Mevi][7]\n* [Contact][8]\n* Direct from our fields\n  Bringing the Best Avocados\n  to Whole World.\n  [ More about our products ][9]\n* Always in season!\n  Availability\n  All Year Round.\n  [ More about our products ][10]\n* International Presence\n  presence in 13 countries\n  around the world.\n  [ More about our Products ][11]\n* Avocados in every way for every day\n  Avocado growers, Packers\n  and Distributors.\n  [ More about our Process ][12]\n\n\n# \n\n# ABOUT US\n\n\n**Our Mission**\nWe are a Mexican company dedicated to the production, transformation, commercialization and export\nof avocado and derivatives at a global level, through the sustainability of our processes and\nthrough an organizational ethic based on collaborative work with its stakeholders.\n**Our Vision**\nBeing one of the best Mexican companies in the avocado and derivatives industry, recognized for the\nquality of our products, for our commitment to the environment, for the development of our\ncollaborators and our operational excellence.\n**Our Commitment**\nWe are committed to socially responsible management as part of our business strategy, having a\npositive impact on the quality of life of our employees, the community that surrounds us and the\nenvironment.\n**The Future**\nAt MEVI Avocados we approach the future with passion and confidence, with an enduring belief in the\npromise of avocado, a superfood that promotes the health and well-being of our consumers.\n\nMEVI's foundation lies in 5 CORE VALUES:\n**TRUST** We make sure that everyone involved with our company works with the same high purpose and\nethics, driving significant positive outcomes for our company and industry.\n**RESPONSABILITY** We are committed to supplying exclusively healthy products, like the avocado and\nits derivatives.\n**HONESTY** We combine professionalism with integrity in all aspects of our business, including team\nmembers and suppliers.\n**RESPECT** We recognize the capabilities and achievements of clients, team members and suppliers.\n**CUSTOMER SERVICE** We offer excellent personalized attention and responsiveness from the moment of\npurchase until the delivery of our products, with the aim of fulfilling and exceeding the\nexpectations of our customers.\n\n**ADVANTAGES OF OUR SERVICE**\nExperience: Overall knowledge of production and management of avocados since 1974. Market experience\nas a packer since 1994, and as an exporter\u2015through APEAM\u2015since 2003. Balanced Value Chain Method:\nMEVI pledges to provide the best service through this process, ensuring full control from planting\nthe avocado, to its storage and distribution.\n\n**TIMELINE**\n\n\n[Timeline]\n\n**Cold Storage:** MEVI owns Crosspoint, Inc.a South Texas cold storage facility with a 60 container\ncapacity that serves as a primary distribution point.\n\n[Crosspoint Storage]\n\n[ Social Responsibility ][13]\n\n# International Presence\n\nProviding the best Avocados with the most rich flavor, we have\npresence in 13 countries around the world.\n\n# Contact US\n\n### MEVI AVOCADOS\n\nWe are avocado growers, packers & distributors, want to visit of contact us? For commercial\ninquiries please fill out this boxes and we\u00b4ll get back to you.\n\nJalisco\nKm 2+800 Carretera Cd. Guzman - Zapotiltic\nZapotiltic, Jalisco. C.P. 49616 M\u00e9xico.\nPhone: +52 (33) 3113 4341\n\nMichoacan\nLibramiento Perib\u00e1n-Buenavista Km 0+200\nPerib\u00e1n, Michoac\u00e1n, C.P. 60440 M\u00e9xico.\nPhone: +52 (35) 4551 2461 / 4551 2353.\n\n\n###### Mevi Avocados\n\nAvocados in every way\nFor every day.\n\n###### Contact\n\nJalisco\nKm 2+800 Carretera Cd. Guzman - Zapotiltic\nZapotiltic, Jalisco. C.P. 49616\nPhone: (52) (33) 3113 4341\nexport@meviavocados.com.mx\n\n###### Certifications\n\n* SMETA\n* Global G.A.P.\n* GRASP\n* Primus GFS\n* HACCP\n\n##### Social Media\n\n[Mevi Avocados\n\u00a9 2025. All Right Reserved By Grupo Mevi ][14]\n\n[\nValidation error occured. Please enter the fields and submit it again.\nThank You ! Your email has been delivered.\n][15]\n\n[1]: #home\n[2]: esp.html\n[3]: #home\n[4]: #about\n[5]: products.html\n[6]: social_responsability.html\n[7]: grupomevi.html\n[8]: #contact\n[9]: #products\n[10]: #products\n[11]: #products\n[12]: #ourprocess\n[13]: social_responsability.html\n[14]: #\n[15]: # meviavocados.com"
