        "crawl_text": "* Your Trusted Fresh Avocado Growers in Tanzania!\n* Office Hour (Sun-Fri): 08:00am - 06:00pm\n\n# [[Muricado]][1]\n\n## Fresh Organic Avocado Growers\n\nToggle menu\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n  * [Who We Are][4]\n  * [Our Values & Governance][5]\n  * [Accreditation & Certificates][6]\n  * [Careers][7]\n* [Our Operations][8]\n  * [Growing & Farming][9]\n  * [Avocado Oil Extraction][10]\n  * [Packing][11]\n  * [Sell & Ship / Logistics][12]\n* [News & Blog][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\nMuricado A FRUIT FOR ALL SEASONS Eco-friendly business based on the strong values and long-term\npartnerships that we share and build with all our stakeholders [MORE ABOUT US ][15] 100% Free From\nChemicals FRESH, TASTY & HEALTHY AVOCADOS Muricado is a great supporter of certificates required to\nbe able to market our avocados globally. [Certified Worldwide ][16] [Slide]\n\n## Home\n\n#### GROW & FARM\n\n#### SOURCING\n\n#### RESEARCH\n\n#### PACKING\n\n#### SELL & SHIP\n\n#### WELCOME TO\n\n## MURICADO FRUIT SUPPLIES FROM TANZANIA\n\nMuricado is a large-scale producer grower and supplier of **Fresh **and** quality **avocados**.** We\ngrow avocados and proudly guarantee that our products are 100% free from chemicals and unnatural\nproducts.\n\nWith adequate experience in **growing, packing** and **shipping** avocados, Muricado has a deep\nunderstanding of the avocado industry. At Muricado we know it is a privilege to deliver avocados\nfrom our grower\u2019s trees to our customer\u2019s shelves. Through our vertically-integrated supply chain we\ngrow, source, pack and market quality avocados across the year and across the globe.\n\nMuricado Fruit Supplies proudly operates a state-of-the-art avocado oil facility dedicated to\nproducing high-quality, pure crude avocado oil. Our facility is equipped with advanced technology to\nensure efficient oil extraction while maintaining and preserving the natural nutrients, vitamins\nantioxidants and the natural integrity of the avocados.\n\n[More About Us][17]\n\n#### Certifications\n\n## We Are Certified At What We Do Worldwide\n\n[Global-GAP-700x500]\n01\n\n##### GLOBAL G.A.P. Certified\n\n[GRASP_hand_white]\n02\n\n##### GRASP Certified\n\n[rex image]\n03\n\n##### EU Registered & Certified Exporter\n\n[PHOTO-2021-01-16-11-05-56]\n04\n\n##### Muricado Certification Standards\n\n#### OUR COMPANY BLOG\n\n## Check Our Latest News\n\n#### [AVOCADO BECOMES THE NEW GREEN GOLD FOR TANZANIA][18]\n\nData revealed by Tanzania\u2019s private sector horticultural apex body s...\n\n#### [The Rising Star of Tanzanian Avocado Horticulture][19]\n\nAs more farmers in Tanzania turn towards Avocado production, EU-EAC MA...\n\n#### [Tanzania\u2019s Government Sets aside $94 Million to Boost Farming][20]\n\nThe Tanzanian government has promised to issue $94 million in loans to...\n\n#### [Avocado: Nutrition, Benefits, & Side Effects][21]\n\nThe top health benefits of avocados are many, given that they contain...\n\n#### [Amazing Avocado Health Benefits, Nutritional Facts & Beauty tips][22]\n\nAvocado is one of the most popular \u201csuperfoods\u201d trending right now...\n\n##### About Muricado\n\nMuricado is a producer and supplier of organic avocados. We grow delicious avocados and proudly\nguarantee that our products are 100% free from chemicals and unnatural products.\n\n##### Social Media\n\n[[Facebook]][23]\n[[Facebook]][24]\n[ [fb-share-icon]][25]\n[[Instagram]][26]\n[[Follow by Email]][27]\n\n###### [Find Us On Map ][28]\n\n### Recent News\n* August 25, 2019[AVOCADO BECOMES THE NEW GREEN GOLD FOR TANZANIA][29]\n* August 23, 2019[The Rising Star of Tanzanian Avocado Horticulture][30]\n\n##### Get in touch\n* Mfriga, Njombe\n  Tanzania\n* (+255) 742 618 732\n* [info@muricado.com][31]\n\nCopyright \u00a9\u00a0[Muricado][32]. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: https://www.muricado.com/\n[2]: https://www.muricado.com/\n[3]: #\n[4]: https://www.muricado.com/about-us1/\n[5]: https://www.muricado.com/values-governance/\n[6]: https://www.muricado.com/accreditation-certificates/\n[7]: https://www.muricado.com/careers/\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://www.muricado.com/service/growing-farming/\n[10]: https://www.muricado.com/service/avocado-oil-extraction/\n[11]: https://www.muricado.com/service/packing/\n[12]: https://www.muricado.com/service/sell-ship-logistics/\n[13]: https://www.muricado.com/blog-grid-view/\n[14]: https://www.muricado.com/contact-us/\n[15]: #\n[16]: #\n[17]: http://www.muricado.com/about-us1/\n[18]: https://www.muricado.com/outdoor-vintage-flower-garden-decor-2/\n[19]: https://www.muricado.com/grow-your-own-back-yard-garden-for-better-life/\n[20]: https://www.muricado.com/rural-infrastructure-for-agriculture/\n[21]: https://www.muricado.com/better-nature-for-better-world/\n[22]: https://www.muricado.com/landscaping-methods-prevent-water-problems/\n[23]: https://www.facebook.com/Muricado-Avocado-180039633672382/?ref=pages_you_manage\n[24]: https://www.facebook.com/Muricado-Avocado-180039633672382/?ref=pages_you_manage\n[25]: https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.muricado.com%2F\n[26]: https://www.instagram.com/muricado_avocado/\n[27]: https://api.follow.it/widgets/icon/TGtVT0Q0Y0tt * Your Trusted Fresh Avocado Growers in Tanzania!\n* Office Hour (Sun-Fri): 08:00am - 06:00pm\n\n# [[Muricado]][1]\n\n## Fresh Organic Avocado Growers\n\nToggle menu\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n  * [Who We Are][4]\n  * [Our Values & Governance][5]\n  * [Accreditation & Certificates][6]\n  * [Careers][7]\n* [Our Operations][8]\n  * [Growing & Farming][9]\n  * [Avocado Oil Extraction][10]\n  * [Packing][11]\n  * [Sell & Ship / Logistics][12]\n* [News & Blog][13]\n* [Contact Us][14]\nMuricado A FRUIT FOR ALL SEASONS Eco-friendly business based on the strong values and long-term\npartnerships that we share and build with all our stakeholders [MORE ABOUT US ][15] 100% Free From\nChemicals FRESH, TASTY & HEALTHY AVOCADOS Muricado is a great supporter of certificates required to\nbe able to market our avocados globally. [Certified Worldwide ][16] [Slide]\n\n## Home\n\n#### GROW & FARM\n\n#### SOURCING\n\n#### RESEARCH\n\n#### PACKING\n\n#### SELL & SHIP\n\n#### WELCOME TO\n\n## MURICADO FRUIT SUPPLIES FROM TANZANIA\n\nMuricado is a large-scale producer grower and supplier of **Fresh **and** quality **avocados**.** We\ngrow avocados and proudly guarantee that our products are 100% free from chemicals and unnatural\nproducts.\n\nWith adequate experience in **growing, packing** and **shipping** avocados, Muricado has a deep\nunderstanding of the avocado industry. At Muricado we know it is a privilege to deliver avocados\nfrom our grower\u2019s trees to our customer\u2019s shelves. Through our vertically-integrated supply chain we\ngrow, source, pack and market quality avocados across the year and across the globe.\n\nMuricado Fruit Supplies proudly operates a state-of-the-art avocado oil facility dedicated to\nproducing high-quality, pure crude avocado oil. Our facility is equipped with advanced technology to\nensure efficient oil extraction while maintaining and preserving the natural nutrients, vitamins\nantioxidants and the natural integrity of the avocados.\n\n[More About Us][17]\n\n#### Certifications\n\n## We Are Certified At What We Do Worldwide\n\n[Global-GAP-700x500]\n01\n\n##### GLOBAL G.A.P. Certified\n\n[GRASP_hand_white]\n02\n\n##### GRASP Certified\n\n[rex image]\n03\n\n##### EU Registered & Certified Exporter\n\n[PHOTO-2021-01-16-11-05-56]\n04\n\n##### Muricado Certification Standards\n\n#### OUR COMPANY BLOG\n\n## Check Our Latest News\n\n#### [AVOCADO BECOMES THE NEW GREEN GOLD FOR TANZANIA][18]\n\nData revealed by Tanzania\u2019s private sector horticultural apex body s...\n\n#### [The Rising Star of Tanzanian Avocado Horticulture][19]\n\nAs more farmers in Tanzania turn towards Avocado production, EU-EAC MA...\n\n#### [Tanzania\u2019s Government Sets aside $94 Million to Boost Farming][20]\n\nThe Tanzanian governmen