 create products that blend science with nature.\n\n### hair care\n\n### skin care\n\n### body care\n\n### pet care\n\n### men\u2019s grooming care\n\n## Featured collections\n\nOur featured collections showcase the diversity and innovation we bring to skincare and personal\ncare manufacturing. From nourishing face serums and gentle soaps to revitalizing shampoos and\nrefreshing hand washes, we deliver high-quality formulations that meet global standards. Beyond\nthese, our expertise also covers moisturizers, face creams, body lotions, hair oils, conditioners,\nfacial cleansers, scrubs, sunscreens, toners, masks, lip balms, baby care, men\u2019s grooming\nessentials, and so on.\n\n[Face Serums][36]\n[Soaps][37]\n[Shampoos][38]\n[Hand Washes][39]\n\n## Connect with experts!\n\nLet\u2019s create something extraordinary together! Whether you\u2019re looking for private-label solutions,\ncustom formulations, or innovative packaging, we India\u2019s leading OEM manufacturer are here to turn\nyour ideas into high-quality products your customers will love. Fill out the form below, and our\nteam will get in touch to kickstart your journey toward success. Let\u2019s make it happen!\n\n[Submit Enquiry][40] [Call Now][41]\n\n\n## Testimonials\n\n[ [ [Naturo & Orgo] ][1]\n[ [Naturo & Orgo] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* [Services][5]\n  * [Contract Manufacturing][6]\n  * [Private Label Service][7]\n  * [Custom Formulations][8]\n  * [Custom Packaging][9]\n* [Products][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Blogs][12]\n  * [Business][13]\n  * [Body Care][14]\n  * [Hair Care][15]\n  * [Skin Care][16]\n  * [Baby Care][17]\n  * [Pet Care][18]\nSearch Site\nType and hit enter to search\n\n\n[ 0 Shopping Cart ][19]\n\n## Cart\n\nContact Us\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n\u00d7\n\n\n# Let\u2019s Build Your Dream Personal\n# Care Brand Together!\n\n[Submit Enquiry][20] [Call Now][21]\n\n## Choose from our services\n\nNaturo & Orgo is a leading personal care and cosmetic manufacturer in India that of