d products in huge quantities at the best prices possible.\n\n100% Pure\nAffordable Prices\nBest Price\nFair Deal\n\n### Why Choose Us\n\n##### Hassle-Free Services\n\nWe strive to positively impact the quality of lives of all the people around us or in any remote\ncorner of the world by providing the best, most efficient & hassle-free services possible.\n\nStrong Global Presence\nEasy Payment Options\nFast & Efficient Shipping\nBespoke Packaging\n\n## Reliable\n\nNatura Vitalis is an ISO 9001: 2015 certified and GMP accreted company. We are equipped with latest\ntechnology-based manufacturing units and we have ultra-modern in-house labs with GCMS, HPLC, TLC,\nUV-Spectrophotometer etc. and all our products comes with proper lab test reports.\n\n## Precise\n\nWe ensure the therapeutic quality and purity of our products through a stringent Quality Assurance\nProgram and rigorous testing procedure. We strive to achieve 100% accuracy in matching the exact\nproduct specifications provided by our clients. We ensure client specified packaging with 100%\ntimely deliveries.\n\n## Consistent\n\nOur raw materials come directly from the source. We have development personal relationships with\nwild-crafters and cultivators from unspoiled regions of the earth. We are globally exporting to more\nthan 30 countries and consistently growing in this field. Complete quality control, manufacturing &\ntesting of products in our hands ensures consistent supplies and same quality of products.\n\n[nvitalis Shape]\n\n#### Members Of\n* **FIEO** \u2013 Federation of Indian Export Organs\n* **Spices Board**\n* **Tobacco Board**\n* **EOAI \u2013** Essential Oil Association of India\n* **FAFAI \u2013** Flavors And Fragrance Association of India\n* **CHEMEXCIL \u2013** Basic Chemical, Pharmaceuticals & Cosmetic Export Promotion Council (set-up by\n  Ministry of Commerce, Govt. of India)\n* **FICCI \u2013** Federation Of Indian Chambers Of Commerce & Industries.\n\n#### Industry We Serve\n* Flavour & Fragrance\n* Tobacco & Nicotine\n* Pharmaceutical\n* Cosmetic\n* Aroma Therapy\n* Spa\n* Drinks/Beverages\n* Herbal Cosmetics\n\n#### Our USP\n* Our quality control department is well equipped with a high-tech in house laboratory consisting of\n  analytical instruments like HPLC, GC, GCMS, UV-VIS Spectrophotometer etc.\n* At Natura Vitalis Industries, we offer 100% pure high-grade products at affordable prices.\n* Bespoke Packaging & Custom Formulation\n* Highly skilled workforce.\n* A professionally managed organization.\n* Rich experience of this industry.\n* Conform to the exacting International Standards.\n* Multiple trusted payment options for your ease.\n* Strong Global Presence\n\n[group-5]\n\n### 100% Natural\n\nOur offered products range is completely pure with no adulteration or mixing. Never compromise on\nquality and commitment.\n\n### Best Price\n\nWe offer 100% pure, high-grade products at competitive and affordable prices.\n\n### Our Products\n\nOur products are 100% natural, high-grade & are tested by experts in our in-house lab.\n\n# Browse Products by Category\n\n**OUR 100% Pure & Natural WORLDWIDE APPRECIATED PRODUCT**\n\n[View All Products][28]\nCaffeine ExtractEssential OilsHerbal ExtractsOleoresinsC 100% Customer Satisfaction\n\nQuality is our Priority\n\nNatural and Pure\n\nWorldwide Shipping\n\n[ [Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt. Ltd.]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][1]\n[partner logo]\n[ [nvitalis Logo]\n\n### Natura Vitalis Industries Pvt Ltd\n\nReliable. Precise. Consistent.\n][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* Company\n  * [About Us][4]\n  * [Facility][5]\n  * [USP][6]\n  * [Industries We Serve][7]\n  * [Business Verticals][8]\n  * [CSR][9]\n* [Products][10]\n  * [Caffeine Anhydrous][11]\n  * [Natural Caffeine][12]\n  * [Essential Oils][13]\n  * [Herbal Extracts][14]\n  * [Oleoresins][15]\n  * [Carrier Oils][16]\n* [Quality Assurance][17]\n* [Packaging][18]\n* [Shipping][19]\n* [Payment][20]\n* [Blog][21]\