        "crawl_text": "[ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\n  Products\n  [View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\n  Category\n  [All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n  \u00a0\n  [Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\n  Type\n  [Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\n  Industries\n  [Industries][25]\n  [Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n  [Household & Cleaning][29]\n  \u00a0\n  [Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\n  Care][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\n  What We Offer\n  [Contract Manufacturing][35]\n  [Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n  [Formulation][37]\n  [Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\n  to life.][38]\n  [FAQs][39]\n  [Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\n  the questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\n  Sustainability\n  [Sourcing and Origin][42]\n  [Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\n  support.][43]\n  [Zero Waste][44]\n  [Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\n  world.][45]\n  [Sustainable Beauty][46]\n  [Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\n  integrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\n  Our Story\n  [Vision & Values][50]\n  [It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\n  more natural oil ingredients.][51]\n  [Careers][52]\n  [Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n\n# Your Home for Wholesale Natural Ingredients\n\nIn Search of the Perfect Ingredient for Your Formulation?\n\n[Help Me Choose][58]\n\n## Natural Oil Sourcing Made Simple\n\nO&3 is a trusted provider of high-quality, ethically sourced natural oils for a wide range of\napplications.\n\nFrom skin care to culinary use, we have the perfect ingredient to meet your requirements.\n\n[Browse All Products][59]\nCold-Pressed Oils\n\nNatural oil extraction method preserving nutrients without heat or chemicals for a greener future.\n\n[Find Out More ][60]\nEssential Oils\n\nConcentrated plant extracts, often used for therapeutic benefits, anti-inflammatory, antibacterial,\nand antioxidant properties.\n\n[Find Out More ][61]\nInfused Oils\n\nCarrier oils infused with plant materials, enhancing properties and fragrance for various\nformulations.\n\n[Find Out More ][62]\nButters\n\nMoisturising and protective natural butters derived from plants, offering a range of benefits.\n\n[Find Out More ][63]\nRefined Oils\n\nClean and neutral oils vital for formulations, offering versatility, typically odourless, and\ncolourless.\n\n[Find Out More ][64]\nSoap Bases\n\nFrom new indie brands to established manufacturers, soap bases are an essential ingredient for\ncreating innovative soap products.\n\n[Find Out More ][65]\nExtracts\n\nConcentrated plant, herb, and fruit essences with unique properties for culinary, cosmetic, and\npharmaceutical use.\n\n[Find Out More ][66]\nExfoliants\n\nSustainable scrubs made from raw plant materials, providing a natural and effective solution for\ndead skin cell removal.\n\n[Find Out More ][67]\nWaters\n\nWaters are gaining popularity in cosmetics and haircare for natural therapeutic properties in\nformulations.\n\n[Find Out More ][68]\nWaxes\n\nVersatile waxes enriched with vitamins for stability, used in lip care, hair wax, candles, face\nmasks.\n\n[Find Out More ][69]\nAbsolutes\n\nConcentrated plant essences, great for perfumery and cosmetics, adding depth, richness, and lasting\npower.\n\n[Find Out More ][70]\nScroll for more\n\n## Finding the Perfect Ingredient\n\nUse our product finder to discover unique ingredients with specific functionality, aroma and colour\nfrom our extensive product range \u2013 find the perfect ingredients to enhance your formulations now.\n\n[Find Products][71]\n\n## Empowering Industries\n\nFrom beauty and personal care to pharmaceuticals, animal and pet care, harness our expertise to fuel\nyour success and become market leaders in your industry.\n\n[Industries We Serve][72]\n\n## Wellness in Beauty & Personal Care Trend Report 2026\n\nIn 2026 \u2026 The beauty and personal care landscape continues to evolve toward wellness-focused,\ningredient-led product development.\n\nOur new free annual report for product developers & formulators highlights six key product\ndevelopment trends shaping 2026, informed by formulation behaviour, consumer usage patterns and\ningredient sourcing dynamics.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[2026 Beauty & Personal Care Trend Report][73]\nTransparency in every drop\n\n## Trust Is the Foundation of Et [ [O&3 logo] ][1] **Menu**\n* [Products][2]\n  Products\n  [View All Products][3] [Help Me Choose][4] [Product Brochure (pdf)][5]\n  Category\n  [All][6] [Absolutes][7] [Butters][8] [Cold-Pressed Oils][9] [Essential Oils][10] [Exfoliants][11]\n  \u00a0\n  [Extracts][12] [Infusions][13] [Refined Oils][14] [Soap Bases][15] [Waters][16] [Waxes][17]\n  Type\n  [Organic][18] [Gluten Free][19] [Vegan Friendly][20] [Kosher][21] [Carrier Oils][22] [Halal][23]\n* [Industries][24]\n  Industries\n  [Industries][25]\n  [Beauty & Personal Care][26] [Aromatherapy & Massage][27] [Candles & Home Fragrance][28]\n  [Household & Cleaning][29]\n  \u00a0\n  [Food & Beverage][30] [Nutrition, Vitamins & Supplements][31] [Pharmaceuticals][32] [Animal & Pet\n  Care][33]\n* [What We Offer][34]\n  What We Offer\n  [Contract Manufacturing][35]\n  [Optimise your operations with O&3 - Sourcing to shipping, all in one place.][36]\n  [Formulation][37]\n  [Whether a new or established brand, collaborate with our oil experts and bring your formulations\n  to life.][38]\n  [FAQs][39]\n  [Whether you're a first-time enquirer or an established customer, this page is designed to answer\n  the questions we hear most often.][40]\n* [Sustainability][41]\n  Sustainability\n  [Sourcing and Origin][42]\n  [Our global suppliers play a vital role in our commitment to sustainability and community\n  support.][43]\n  [Zero Waste][44]\n  [Explore our zero-waste ingredients and create formulations that contribute to a greener\n  world.][45]\n  [Sustainable Beauty][46]\n  [Empowering brands to create exceptional formulations, blending quality and environmental\n  integrity.][47]\n* [Accreditations][48]\n* [Our Story][49]\n  Our Story\n  [Vision & Values][50]\n  [It's our mission to change the world's beauty and personal care products to be formulated with\n  more natural oil ingredients.][51]\n  [Careers][52]\n  [Join us at O&3, a leading company striving for excellence in both products and service.][53]\n* [Product Finder][54]\n* [Stories][55]\n[Contact][56] [Request a quote][57]\n[Search]\n\n# Your Home for Wholesale Natural Ingredients\n\nIn Search of the Perfect Ingredient for Your Formulation?\n\n[Help Me Choose][58]\n\n## Natural Oil Sourcing Made Simple\n\nO&3 is a trusted provider of high-quality, ethically sourced natural oils for a wide range of\napplications.\n\nFrom skin care to culinary use, we have the perfect ingredient to meet your requirements.\n\n[Browse All Products][59]\nCold-Pressed Oils\n\nNatural oil extraction method preserving nutrients without heat or chemicals for a greener future.\n\n[Find Out More ][60]\nEssential Oils\n\nConcentrated plant extracts, often used for therapeutic benefits, anti-inflammatory, antibacterial,\nand antioxidant properties.\n\n[Find Out More ][61]\nInfused Oils\n\nCarrier oils infused with plant materials, enhancing properties and fragrance for various\nformulations.\n\n[Find Out More ][62]\nButters\n\nMoisturising and protective natural butters derived from plants, offering a range of benefits.\n\n[Find Out More ][63]\nRefined Oils\n\nClean and neutral oils vital for formulations, offering versatility, typically odourless, and\ncolourless.\n\n[Find Out More ][64]\nSoap Bases\n\nFrom new indie brands to established manufacturers, soap bases are an essential ingredient for\ncreating innovative soap products.\n\n[Find Out More ][65]\nExtracts\n\nConcentrated plant, herb, and fruit essences with unique properties for culinary, cosmetic, and\npharmaceutical use.\n\n[Find Out More ][66]\nExfoliants\n\nSustainable scrubs made from raw plant materials, providing a natural and effective solution for\ndead skin cell removal.\n\n[Find Out More ][67]\nWaters\n\nWaters are gaining popularity in cosmetics and haircare for natural therapeutic properties in\nformulations.\n\n[Find Out More ][68]\nWaxes\n\nVersatile waxes enriched with vitamins for stability, used in lip care, hair wax, candles, face\nmasks.\n\n[Find Out More ][69]\nAbsolutes\n\nConcentrated plant essences, great for perfumery and cosmetics, adding depth, richness, and lasting\npower.\n\n[Find Out More ][70]\nScroll for more\n\n## Finding the Perfect Ingredient\n\nUse our product finder to discover unique ingredients with specific functionality, aroma and colour\nfrom our extensive product range \u2013 find the perfect ingredients to enhance your formulations now.\n\n[Find Products][71]\n\n## Empowering Industries\n\nFrom beauty and personal care to pharmaceuticals, animal and pet care, harness our expertise to fuel\nyour success and become market leaders in your industry.\n\n[Industries We Serve][72]\n\n## Wellness in Beauty & Personal Care Trend Report 2026\n\nIn 2026 \u2026 The beauty and personal care landscape continues to evolve toward wellness-focused,\ningredient-led product development.\n\nOur new free annual report for product developers & formulators highlights six key product\ndevelopment trends shaping 2026, informed by formulation behaviour, consumer usage patterns and\ningredient sourcing dynamics.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[2026 Beauty & Personal Care Trend Report][73]\nTransparency in every drop\n\n## Trust Is the Foundation of Ethical Sourcing\n\nThat\u2019s why we maintain the highest standards of transparency. Our customers can trace the journey of\neach ingredient and we believe in open communication regarding the wonderful places around the globe\nthat contribute to the creation of our natural oils.\n\n[Sustainability][74]\n\n## Cultivating Collaboration\n\nOur ethical sourcing journey is also a story of collaboration. We help establish outgrower\ncooperatives to provide training and employment opportunities to local smallholder farmers.\nTogether, we are planting the seeds of a better future for all.\n\n[Sourcing & Origin][75]\nOur industry recognised accreditations\n* [O3-Accreds-Block-02]\n* [O3-Accreds-Block-01]\n* [cosmos_approved_logo]\n* [Rspo_logo]\n* [usda_organic_logo]\n* [png green square for banner-01]\n* [Kosher_logo]\n\n## A Global Reach\n\nSmall lead times and hassle-free border controls.\n\n#### UK\n\nThe birthplace of our journey, O&3 UK proudly draws upon over 40 years of British family heritage\nand expertise in the wholesale natural oils sector.\n\n#### USA\n\nCatering to customers across Northern, Central, and Southern America, our US team diligently sources\nthe finest quality oils from our manufacturing sites in both the UK and EU.\n\n#### EU\n\nDedicated to providing exceptional oils and service to our valued European clients, our\nstate-of-the-art facility in Warka, Poland, is committed to ensuring excellence with every shipment.\n\n### Get In Touch\n\nWe aim for small lead times, hassle-free border controls, and quality products every time so that\nyou can concentrate on growing your business.\n\n[Contact Us][76]\n\n## Stories\n\n[View all Stories][77]\n[\n8 mins\n][78]\n[World Rainforest Day: Celebrating The Amazon Rainforest and its Natural Treasures][79] Discover the\nAmazon\u2019s remarkable botanical ingredients and their benefits for skincare and haircare. Learn how\u2026\n[Read more][80]\n[\n5 mins\n][81]\n[The New Face of Men\u2019s Wellbeing: How Natural Ingredients Are Supporting Modern Self-Care][82]\n[\n3 mins\n][83]\n[Ingredient Sp"
