        "crawl_text": "[\nonocado farm\n][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About][3]\n* [Our Products][4]\n  * [Hass Avocados][5]\n  * [Premium Habanero Chilies][6]\n  * [Pure Cold-Pressed Avocado Oil][7]\n* [Sustainability][8]\n* [Contact][9]\n* [FAQ][10]\n\n# Sustainable Farming\n# Exceptional Produce\n\n## Trusted Worldwide\n\n[ Know More ][11]\nabout us\n\nOur\u00a0Main Goal is to provide Premium-Quality Agricultural Products that meet International Standards\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises Company Limited produces premium Hass avocados, vibrant habanero chilies,\nand nutrient-rich cold-pressed avocado oil in the Njombe Highlands of Tanzania. With sustainable\nfarming, careful handling, and high-altitude growing conditions, we deliver products with\nexceptional quality, flavor, and shelf life to buyers worldwide\n\n[ Learn More About Us ][12]\n\n# Our products\n\n## From Our Farms to You\n\n[Premium Hass avocados from Njombe Highlands, Tanzania]\nHess Avocados\n\nCreamy, rich-flavored Hass avocados grown in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands.\n\n[Fresh habanero chilies from Njombe Highlands, Tanzania]\nhabanero Chilies\n\nVibrant, hand-harvested habanero chilies with intense flavor and premium quality.\n\n[Cold-pressed avocado oil from Tanzanian Hass avocados]\nAvocado Oil\n\n100% pure cold-pressed avocado oil, nutrient-rich and perfect for culinary or cosmetic use.\n\nHarvest & Logistics\n\n## **Our Harvest & Delivery Process**\n\nOur Hass avocados are harvested from February to September, ensuring peak quality and freshness,\nwhile our habanero chilies are harvested throughout the year, with multiple picking cycles depending\non maturity. We provide consistent weekly shipments of both products, with flexible delivery options\nvia air freight (3\u20134 days to Hong Kong) or sea freight (21\u201324 days). Products are packed in 4 kg or\n10 kg ventilated cartons, with private label options available for bulk orders. To maintain optimal\nquality, all produce is pre-cooled within hours of harvest and stored at 5\u20137\u00b0C, guaranteeing\nfreshness from our farms to your business.\n\n[ View Harvest Details ][13]\n[Habanero chiles, especially the Red Savina\u2026]\n[Packing house ONTWEKA EXPORTERS]\nOnocado Farm Enterprises | Tanzania's Premium Export Agribusiness [Place Your Oder][14] Onocado Farm\nEnterprises | Tanzania's Premium Export Agribusiness [CONTACT US][15]\n\n## About Us\n\nAt our farm in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands, we are passionate about cultivating the finest produce.\nDedicated to quality, sustainability, and responsible farming, we grow avocados and produce paper\nproducts that meet international standards while supporting our local communities\n\n[\nFacebook\n][16]\n[\nTwitter\n][17]\n[\nInstagram\n][18]\n[\n{{icon_label}}\n][19]\n\n## Quick Links\n* Home\n* About\n* Contact\n\n## Contact Us\n* AML Tower 3rd Floor, Sam Nujoma Rd\n* +255 (0) 719865116\n\n[ info@onocadofarm.co.tz][20]\n[ \u00a9 2025 onocado farm ][21]\nCustomize Reject All Accept All\n\u2716\n... Show more\n\u25ba Necessary Cookies Standard\nNecessary cookies enable essential site features like secure log-ins and consent preference\nadjustments. They do not store personal data.\nNone\n\u25ba Functional Cookies Remark\nFunctional cookies support features like content sharing on social media, collecting feedback, and\nenabling third-party tools.\nNone\n\u25ba Analytical Cookies Remark\nAnalytical cookies track visitor interactions, providing insights on metrics like visitor count,\nbounce rate, and traffic sources.\nNone\n\u25ba Advertisment Cookies Remark\nAdvertisement cookies deliver personalized ads based on your previous visits and analyze the\neffectiveness of ad campaigns.\nNone\n\u25ba Unclassified Cookies Remark\nUnclassified cookies are cookies that we are in the process of classifying, together with the\nproviders of individual cookies.\nNone\nReject All Save My Preferences Accept All\n[Re-consent]\n\n[1]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz\n[2]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/\n[3]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[4]: #\n[5]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/hass-avocados-2/\n[6]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/premium-habanero-chilies/\n[7]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/pure-cold-pressed-avocado-oil/\n[8]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/sustainability/\n[9]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/contact/\n[10]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/faq/\n[11]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[12]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[13]: #\n[14]: http://www.onocadofarm.co.tz/contact.html\n[15]: http://www.onocadofarm.co.tz/contact_us.html\n[16]: https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=onocadofarm.co.tz/\n[17]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=onocadofarm.co.tz/\n[18]: https://www.instagram.com/\n[19]: {{social_url}}\n[20]: mailto:info@onocadofarm.co.tz\n[21]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz [\nonocado farm\n][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About][3]\n* [Our Products][4]\n  * [Hass Avocados][5]\n  * [Premium Habanero Chilies][6]\n  * [Pure Cold-Pressed Avocado Oil][7]\n* [Sustainability][8]\n* [Contact][9]\n* [FAQ][10]\n\n# Sustainable Farming\n# Exceptional Produce\n\n## Trusted Worldwide\n\n[ Know More ][11]\nabout us\n\nOur\u00a0Main Goal is to provide Premium-Quality Agricultural Products that meet International Standards\n\nOnocado Farm Enterprises Company Limited produces premium Hass avocados, vibrant habanero chilies,\nand nutrient-rich cold-pressed avocado oil in the Njombe Highlands of Tanzania. With sustainable\nfarming, careful handling, and high-altitude growing conditions, we deliver products with\nexceptional quality, flavor, and shelf life to buyers worldwide\n\n[ Learn More About Us ][12]\n\n# Our products\n\n## From Our Farms to You\n\n[Premium Hass avocados from Njombe Highlands, Tanzania]\nHess Avocados\n\nCreamy, rich-flavored Hass avocados grown in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands.\n\n[Fresh habanero chilies from Njombe Highlands, Tanzania]\nhabanero Chilies\n\nVibrant, hand-harvested habanero chilies with intense flavor and premium quality.\n\n[Cold-pressed avocado oil from Tanzanian Hass avocados]\nAvocado Oil\n\n100% pure cold-pressed avocado oil, nutrient-rich and perfect for culinary or cosmetic use.\n\nHarvest & Logistics\n\n## **Our Harvest & Delivery Process**\n\nOur Hass avocados are harvested from February to September, ensuring peak quality and freshness,\nwhile our habanero chilies are harvested throughout the year, with multiple picking cycles depending\non maturity. We provide consistent weekly shipments of both products, with flexible delivery options\nvia air freight (3\u20134 days to Hong Kong) or sea freight (21\u201324 days). Products are packed in 4 kg or\n10 kg ventilated cartons, with private label options available for bulk orders. To maintain optimal\nquality, all produce is pre-cooled within hours of harvest and stored at 5\u20137\u00b0C, guaranteeing\nfreshness from our farms to your business.\n\n[ View Harvest Details ][13]\n[Habanero chiles, especially the Red Savina\u2026]\n[Packing house ONTWEKA EXPORTERS]\nOnocado Farm Enterprises | Tanzania's Premium Export Agribusiness [Place Your Oder][14] Onocado Farm\nEnterprises | Tanzania's Premium Export Agribusiness [CONTACT US][15]\n\n## About Us\n\nAt our farm in Tanzania\u2019s Njombe Highlands, we are passionate about cultivating the finest produce.\nDedicated to quality, sustainability, and responsible farming, we grow avocados and produce paper\nproducts that meet international standards while supporting our local communities\n\n[\nFacebook\n][16]\n[\nTwitter\n][17]\n[\nInstagram\n][18]\n[\n{{icon_label}}\n][19]\n\n## Quick Links\n* Home\n* About\n* Contact\n\n## Contact Us\n* AML Tower 3rd Floor, Sam Nujoma Rd\n* +255 (0) 719865116\n\n[ info@onocadofarm.co.tz][20]\n[ \u00a9 2025 onocado farm ][21]\nCustomize Reject All Accept All\n\u2716\n... Show more\n\u25ba Necessary Cookies Standard\nNecessary cookies enable essential site features like secure log-ins and consent preference\nadjustments. They do not store personal data.\nNone\n\u25ba Functional Cookies Remark\nFunctional cookies support features like content sharing on social media, collecting feedback, and\nenabling third-party tools.\nNone\n\u25ba Analytical Cookies Remark\nAnalytical cookies track visitor interactions, providing insights on metrics like visitor count,\nbounce rate, and traffic sources.\nNone\n\u25ba Advertisment Cookies Remark\nAdvertisement cookies deliver personalized ads based on your previous visits and analyze the\neffectiveness of ad campaigns.\nNone\n\u25ba Unclassified Cookies Remark\nUnclassified cookies are cookies that we are in the process of classifying, together with the\nproviders of individual cookies.\nNone\nReject All Save My Preferences Accept All\n[Re-consent]\n\n[1]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz\n[2]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/\n[3]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[4]: #\n[5]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/hass-avocados-2/\n[6]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/premium-habanero-chilies/\n[7]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/pure-cold-pressed-avocado-oil/\n[8]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/sustainability/\n[9]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/contact/\n[10]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/faq/\n[11]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[12]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz/about/\n[13]: #\n[14]: http://www.onocadofarm.co.tz/contact.html\n[15]: http://www.onocadofarm.co.tz/contact_us.html\n[16]: https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=onocadofarm.co.tz/\n[17]: https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=onocadofarm.co.tz/\n[18]: https://www.instagram.com/\n[19]: {{social_url}}\n[20]: mailto:info@onocadofarm.co.tz\n[21]: https://onocadofarm.co.tz onocadofarm.co.tz"
