        "crawl_text": "top of page\n\n# PACIFICA CULINARIA\n\n###### **FREE SHIPPING - ON ALL ORDERS OVER $99\u00a0 **\u00a0(Continental United States)\n\n### Gourmet Avocado Oil, Olive Oil & Premium Aged Balsamic Vinegar\n\n###### Call Now\n\n###### 1-800-622-8880\n* [[Facebook App Icon]][1]\n* [[Instagram Social Icon]][2]\n* [[Twitter App Icon]][3]\n* [[Pinterest App Icon]][4]\n* [\n  \n  Home\n  \n  ][5]\n* Our Products\n  * [Avocado Oils][6]\n  * [Vinegars][7]\n  * [Olive Oils][8]\n  * [Other Condiments][9]\n  * [Culinary Tools][10]\n  * [Gift Items][11]\n  * [Order Information][12]\n* Shop\n  * [Avocado Oil 3 Packs][13]\n  * [Avocado Oils][14]\n  * [Infused Vinegars][15]\n  * [Olive Oil][16]\n  * [Salad Packs][17]\n  * [Spicy Beans][18]\n  * [Gift Items][19]\n  * [Culinary Tools][20]\n  * [Monthly Specials][21]\n  * [All Products][22]\n* [\n  \n  Benefits and Uses\n  \n  ][23]\n* [\n  \n  Contact\n  \n  ][24]\n* [\n  \n  FAQ\n  \n  ][25]\n* More\n\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n\n##### \u00a0\n\n##### Check out our new Olive Oils and Vinegars!\n\n###### \u00a0\n\n1/5\n\n### [Special Offers][26]\n\nMonthly specials and discount prices. Our way of saying thank you for your loyal patronage!\n\n[CLICK HERE!][27]\n[Events / Farmer's Markets][28]\n[Private Label][29]\n[Corporate Gifts][30]\nBulk Oil & Vinegar\n[Wholesale Orders][31]\n[Kosher.jpeg]\n[Organicvsnongmo.jpg]\n[certifiedglutenfree.jpg]\n[Whole 30.jpg]\n[cooc-seal.png]\n[OCCertlogo.png]\n\n## What's Happening on Social Media\n\n[free ship sign 2.PNG]\n[Olive-oil-pour_spout 2.jpg]\n\n## No mess pour spout!\n\n# Pacifica Culinaria Avocado Oils, Olive Oils & Balsamic Vinegars.\n\n[About Us][32] | [Wholesale Information][33] | [Wholesale Products][34] | [Testimonials][35]\n|\u00a0[Press Room][36]\n\nAll contents and photography \u00a9 2023 Pacifica Culinaria\n\nPO Box 507\nVista, CA 92085\n\n\u00a0 Customer Service: 1-800-622-8880\u00a0 \u00a0\n\nFor any Questions, Drop us a line:\n\n[sales@pacif