        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Who We Are][3]\n* [Our Products][4]\n* [Contact Us][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* [Who We Are][7]\n* [Our Products][8]\n* [Contact Us][9]\n[ Get a Quote ][10]\n* We cultivate, harvest, and process.\n\n## The Purest Crude Avocado Oil Starts at the Source.\n\nPrimeavo Limited delivers a completely vertically integrated, 100% traceable bulk supply of premium\nHass and Fuerte crude avocado oil directly from our own Tanzanian estates to global portss\n\n## Who We Are\n\n**PRIMEAVO LIMITED** is a premier, vertically integrated agro-processing enterprise operating at the\nintersection of sustainable agriculture and industrial manufacturing. Strategically headquartered in\nDar es Salaam, Tanzania, we specialize in the commercial cultivation of world-class avocados and the\nadvanced extraction of premium crude avocado oil for global industrial, cosmetic, and pharmaceutical\nmarkets.\n\nTons Produce of Avocado Crude Oil\n0\nTanzania Sourced\n0 %\nFarmers Support\n0\nTons per Container\n0\n\n### Cultivated on Our Own Estates\n\nWe manage our own commercial farms in Njombe, protecting buyers from the inconsistent yields and\nunmonitored chemical exposures of out-grower networks.\n\n### Advanced Mechanical Processing\n\nOur modern facilities utilize chemical-free, mechanical extraction lines, guaranteeing a clean,\nhighly stable crude oil that retains its natural nutrients.\n\n### Flawless Supply Chain Control\n\nBy managing everything from harvesting in Njombe to shipping, Primeavo delivers total integration,\nbulletproof traceability, and unmatched quality control.\n\n## Verified Quality. Total Traceability.\n\nAccess the complete technical dossier of our Tanzanian Hass and Fuerte crude avocado oil, including\nextensive extraction and logistics specifications\n\n[ Download Company Profile ][11]\n\n## Premium Bulk Crude Avocado Oil\n\nTechnical Specifications & Quality Parameters\n\nProduct Classification\n\nPremium Bulk Crude Avocado Oil\n\nBotanical Cultivar Source\n\n100% Tanzania-Grown Hass and Fuerte Avocados\n\nGeographic Origin\n\nPrimeavo Owned Estates, Njombe Region, Tanzania\n\nIndustrial Processing Method\n\nHigh-efficiency mechanical extraction (Solvent-Free)\n\nPhysical Appearance\n\nRich, characteristic natural green-hued liquid\n\nRefinement Capabilities\n\nHighly optimized for seamless filtration and refinement by international buyers\n\n## Engineered for Secure International Freight\n\nTechnical Specifications & Quality Parameters\n\nTo protect the complex chemical compounds of our crude oil over long-distance ocean transit,\nPrimeavo implements strict international bulk liquid logistics protocols. Every consignment is\nshipped exclusively inside high-capacity, food-grade multi-layered flexi-tanks secured within\npristine **20-foot sea-freight containers****.**\n\nOur technical rigging features an advanced 5-bar steel bulkhead retention system, a robust unibody\n3-inch snaplock ball valve configuration, and complete interior insulation using heavy-duty\ncorrugated card linings. We provide a reliable, contamination-free arrival at any destination port\nworldwide.\n\n## Why Global Distributors Partner with Primeavo\n\n### 100% Vertically Integrated\n\nWe cultivate our own Hass and Fuerte estates in the Njombe region, shielding buyers from the\nvolatile pricing and inconsistent volumes of out-grower networks.\n\n### Chemical-Free Processing\n\nOur modern processing facility utilizes advanced mechanical extraction lines that completely omit\nharsh chemical solvents, preserving natural oil integrity.\n\n### Bulletproof Traceability\n\nBecause we own the farms and the factory, we provide complete transparency and absolute batch\ntraceability for every single flexi-tank we export.\n\n### Industrial Logistics Standards\n\nEvery consignment is rigged into low-age, strictly inspected 20ft ocean containers using premium\n24-tonne food-grade flexi-tanks and heavy-duty steel bulkheads.\n\n## Establish a Secure Supply Partnership\n\nConnect directly with our commercial team in Dar es Salaam to request custom pricing, logistics\ncoordination, or contract manufacturing variables.\n\n[ Request for Quote ][12]\n* [Home][13]\n* [Who We Are][14]\n* [Our Products][15]\n* [Contact Us][16]\n* [Home][17]\n* [Who We Are][18]\n* [Our Products][19]\n* [Contact Us][20]\n* +255 793 131 256\n* info@primeavolimited.com\nFacebook X-twitter Youtube Instagram Linkedin\n\nCopyright 2026 \u00a9 Primeavo | All Rights Reserved\n\nWebsite Design By:\u00a0[Marsha Creatives][21]\n\n## Get a Quote\n\nFill in the Form Below and Our Team will get back to you ASAP\n\nName\nPhone\nEmail\nMessage\nSend Message\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[3]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[4]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[5]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[6]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[7]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[8]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[9]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[10]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjEwMyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9\n[11]: https://primeavoli [Skip to content][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [Who We Are][3]\n* [Our Products][4]\n* [Contact Us][5]\n* [Home][6]\n* [Who We Are][7]\n* [Our Products][8]\n* [Contact Us][9]\n[ Get a Quote ][10]\n* We cultivate, harvest, and process.\n\n## The Purest Crude Avocado Oil Starts at the Source.\n\nPrimeavo Limited delivers a completely vertically integrated, 100% traceable bulk supply of premium\nHass and Fuerte crude avocado oil directly from our own Tanzanian estates to global portss\n\n## Who We Are\n\n**PRIMEAVO LIMITED** is a premier, vertically integrated agro-processing enterprise operating at the\nintersection of sustainable agriculture and industrial manufacturing. Strategically headquartered in\nDar es Salaam, Tanzania, we specialize in the commercial cultivation of world-class avocados and the\nadvanced extraction of premium crude avocado oil for global industrial, cosmetic, and pharmaceutical\nmarkets.\n\nTons Produce of Avocado Crude Oil\n0\nTanzania Sourced\n0 %\nFarmers Support\n0\nTons per Container\n0\n\n### Cultivated on Our Own Estates\n\nWe manage our own commercial farms in Njombe, protecting buyers from the inconsistent yields and\nunmonitored chemical exposures of out-grower networks.\n\n### Advanced Mechanical Processing\n\nOur modern facilities utilize chemical-free, mechanical extraction lines, guaranteeing a clean,\nhighly stable crude oil that retains its natural nutrients.\n\n### Flawless Supply Chain Control\n\nBy managing everything from harvesting in Njombe to shipping, Primeavo delivers total integration,\nbulletproof traceability, and unmatched quality control.\n\n## Verified Quality. Total Traceability.\n\nAccess the complete technical dossier of our Tanzanian Hass and Fuerte crude avocado oil, including\nextensive extraction and logistics specifications\n\n[ Download Company Profile ][11]\n\n## Premium Bulk Crude Avocado Oil\n\nTechnical Specifications & Quality Parameters\n\nProduct Classification\n\nPremium Bulk Crude Avocado Oil\n\nBotanical Cultivar Source\n\n100% Tanzania-Grown Hass and Fuerte Avocados\n\nGeographic Origin\n\nPrimeavo Owned Estates, Njombe Region, Tanzania\n\nIndustrial Processing Method\n\nHigh-efficiency mechanical extraction (Solvent-Free)\n\nPhysical Appearance\n\nRich, characteristic natural green-hued liquid\n\nRefinement Capabilities\n\nHighly optimized for seamless filtration and refinement by international buyers\n\n## Engineered for Secure International Freight\n\nTechnical Specifications & Quality Parameters\n\nTo protect the complex chemical compounds of our crude oil over long-distance ocean transit,\nPrimeavo implements strict international bulk liquid logistics protocols. Every consignment is\nshipped exclusively inside high-capacity, food-grade multi-layered flexi-tanks secured within\npristine **20-foot sea-freight containers****.**\n\nOur technical rigging features an advanced 5-bar steel bulkhead retention system, a robust unibody\n3-inch snaplock ball valve configuration, and complete interior insulation using heavy-duty\ncorrugated card linings. We provide a reliable, contamination-free arrival at any destination port\nworldwide.\n\n## Why Global Distributors Partner with Primeavo\n\n### 100% Vertically Integrated\n\nWe cultivate our own Hass and Fuerte estates in the Njombe region, shielding buyers from the\nvolatile pricing and inconsistent volumes of out-grower networks.\n\n### Chemical-Free Processing\n\nOur modern processing facility utilizes advanced mechanical extraction lines that completely omit\nharsh chemical solvents, preserving natural oil integrity.\n\n### Bulletproof Traceability\n\nBecause we own the farms and the factory, we provide complete transparency and absolute batch\ntraceability for every single flexi-tank we export.\n\n### Industrial Logistics Standards\n\nEvery consignment is rigged into low-age, strictly inspected 20ft ocean containers using premium\n24-tonne food-grade flexi-tanks and heavy-duty steel bulkheads.\n\n## Establish a Secure Supply Partnership\n\nConnect directly with our commercial team in Dar es Salaam to request custom pricing, logistics\ncoordination, or contract manufacturing variables.\n\n[ Request for Quote ][12]\n* [Home][13]\n* [Who We Are][14]\n* [Our Products][15]\n* [Contact Us][16]\n* [Home][17]\n* [Who We Are][18]\n* [Our Products][19]\n* [Contact Us][20]\n* +255 793 131 256\n* info@primeavolimited.com\nFacebook X-twitter Youtube Instagram Linkedin\n\nCopyright 2026 \u00a9 Primeavo | All Rights Reserved\n\nWebsite Design By:\u00a0[Marsha Creatives][21]\n\n## Get a Quote\n\nFill in the Form Below and Our Team will get back to you ASAP\n\nName\nPhone\nEmail\nMessage\nSend Message\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[3]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[4]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[5]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[6]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[7]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[8]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[9]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[10]: #elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjEwMyIsInRvZ2dsZSI6ZmFsc2V9\n[11]: https://primeavolimited.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PRIMEAVO-PROFILE.pdf\n[12]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[13]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[14]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[15]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[16]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[17]: https://primeavolimited.com/\n[18]: https://primeavolimited.com/who-we-are/\n[19]: https://primeavolimited.com/our-product/\n[20]: https://primeavolimited.com/contact-us/\n[21]: https://marshacreatives.co.ke/ primeavolimited.com"
