nfra][76]\n* [ Services ][77]\n  [ Contract Manufacturing ][78] [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][79] [ Private Labels ][80] [ Custom\n  Formulation ][81] [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][82] [ Skincare Manufacturer ][83] [ Third Party\n  Manufacturing ][84] [ Wholesale Supplier ][85]\n* [Magazine][86]\n* [Blog][87]\n* [Contact Us][88]\nFeatured Products\n* [Featured][89]\n* [Latest][90]\n* [Best Sellers][91]\n[ See All Products ][92]\n\n# Trusted Essential Oils Manufacturer & Global Bulk Oils Supplier\n\n## **About Us**\n\nAG ORGANICA is a leading manufacturer and B2B supplier of therapeutic-grade 100% organic essential\noils, carrier oils, and associated materials to some of the world's leading brands. We also produce\nFace Care, Body Care, Skin Care, Hair Care, Baby Care, and a variety of other services...\n* [Essential Oil Icon] Essential Oil Manufacturer\n* [Carrier Oil Icon] Carrier Oil Manufacturer\n* [Cosmetic Product Icon] Cosmetics Product Manufacturer\n* [Fragrance Icon] Fragrance Manufacturer\n\n[ Learn More ][93]\n[ISO:9001 2015 Certificate]\n[Kosher Certificate]\n[FIFO Certificate]\n[Brand logo]\n[GMO Certificate]\n[Govt Recognize Certificate]\n[Halal Certificate]\n[SMETA]\n[FDA Certificate]\n[Ayush Certificate]\n[AEO Certificate]\n[Intertek Certificate]\n\n## **OUR PRODUCTS CATEGORIES**\n\nWe offer a comprehensive selection of natural products categories :\n\n\u2022 essential oils \u2022 cold-pressed carrier oils \u2022 body butters \u2022 fragrance \u2022 aerosol \u2022 perfume \u2022 floral\nwater \u2022 hair care \u2022 face care \u2022 lip care \u2022 baby care\n\u2022 men's grooming \u2022 pet care \u2022 concern wise \u2022 and much more!\n\n[ [Bulk Essential Oil] ][94]\n\n**Essential Oil**\n\n[ [Facecare Product Manufacturer] ][95]\n\n**Face Care**\n\n[ [Wholesale Carrier Oil Supplier] ][96]\n\n**Carrier Oil**\n\n[ [Private Label Hair Care] ][97]\n\n**Hair Care**\n\n[ [Bulk Body Butter Supplier] ][98]\n\n**Body Butter**\n\n[ [Third party Lip care] ][99]\n\n**Lip Care**\n\n### **YOUR ORGANIC GROWTH PARTNER**\n\nLooking for a trusted private label or bulk manufacturer for essential oils, carrier oils, and\ncosmetic products? You've come to the right place! At AG Organica, we take pride in powering some of\nthe world\u2019s biggest brands. Whether you're launching a new line or scaling an existing one, just\nchoose your product, and we'll handle the rest.\n* **Production Capacity:** 2-3 lakh units per day\n* **Expert Team:** Skilled professionals with years of industry experience\n* **Advanced Labs:** In-house dedicated R&D for cutting-edge formulations\n* **Oil Processing Excellence:** Specialized facilities for premium oil extraction\n\nLet AG Organica take your brand to the next level!\n\n#### **YEARS OF EXPERIENCE**\n\n30+\n\n#### ** STAFF & GROWING**\n\n500+\n\n#### **PRODUCT LIST**\n\n6000+\n\n#### **COUNTRY COVERAGE**\n\n162+\n\n[Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand\nlogo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo]\n[Brand logo] [Brand logo] [Brand logo]\n\n### **OUR SOLUTIONS**\n\n[Wholesale Supplier]\n\n## Wholesale Supplier\n\n[Leading wholesale essential oils manufacturers]\n\nAs one of the [011-411-87600][1] / [+91-0120-4310497][2]\nTranslate\n* [ COMPANY ][3]\n  * [ About Us ][4]\n  * [ Media Gallery ][5]\n  * [ Event Gallary ][6]\n  * [ Market Report ][7]\n  * [ Newsletter ][8]\n  * [ Certifications & DOCs ][9]\n  * [ Frequently Ask Questions ][10]\n  * [ Policies ][11]\n  * [ Download Catalog ][12]\n* [Quality][13]\n* [Infra][14]\n* [ Services ][15]\n  * [ Contract Manufacturing ][16]\n  * [ Cosmetics Manufacturer ][17]\n  * [ Private Labels ][18]\n  * [ Custom Formulation ][19]\n  * [ Color Cosmetics Manufacturer ][20]\n  * [ Skincare Manufacturer ][21]\n  * [ Third Party Manufacturing ][22]\n  * [ Wholesale Supplier ][23]\n* [Magazine][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\n[ [AG Organica - M