        "crawl_text": "[[Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light]][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* [ABOUT][3]\n* [PRODUCT][4]\n* [CONTACT][5]\n\u2715\n\n###### WHO WE ARE\n\n## Saficado Limited:\n## Crude Avocado Oil Producer\n\n[ PRODUCT ][6]\n* [ DOWNLOAD PROFILE ][7]\n\n##### Premium Quality Avocado Oil Exports From Kenya\n* [ CALL US ][8]\n\n##### Saficado is a leading producer of premium-quality avocado oil. We employ an integrated\n##### farmer-to-factory model, sourcing directly from over 1,200 smallholder farmers.\u00a0\n\nSaficado implements a robust farm-to-market system that reliably traces the quality and origin of\navocados at the farmer level. Our dedicated team of agricultural experts, logistics professionals,\nand community advocates work diligently to ensure that every shipment complies with the highest\ninternational standards.\n\n0 +\n\n###### TONNES / YEAR\n\nSaficado has the capacity\u00a0 to produce over 1500 metric tonnes of premium quality avocado oil\nannually.\n\n0 %\n\n###### KENYAN SOURCED\n\nSourced exclusively from locally cultivated Kenyan Hass and Fuerte avocado varieties.\n\n0\n\n###### \u00a0TONNES BULK EXPORT\n\n24-tonne flexi tanks, designed for efficient and safe transportation.\u00a0\n\n0 +\n\n###### FARMERS SUPPORTED\n\nWe directly collaborate with and empower over 1,200 local farmers,\n\n[ ABOUT ][9]\n[ CONTACT ][10]\n\n###### HOW WE WORK\n\n## Our Story\n\n#### Founded in 2023 as a fresh avocado trader, Saficado evolved into a premium oil producer in\n#### 2024, driven by a strategic vision to maximize the value of Kenyan agriculture through premium\n#### avocado oil exports.\n\nStrategically positioned along Thika Superhighway, our company bridges local agricultural resources\nwith global market requirements.\n\n[ MORE ABOUT US ][11]\n\n###### SAFICADO LIMITED\n\n## Our Process\n\n##### STEP 1\n\n#### Avocado Sourcing and Collection\n* Sourcing from Kenyan Hass and Fuerte avocado varieties\n* Comprehensive farmer support program\n* Careful selection of fruits at various ripeness stages\n\n##### STEP 2\n\n#### Industrial Extraction and Processing\n* Mechanical separation of oil from avocado pulp\n* Chemical-free processing approach\n* Temperature-controlled extraction\n* Minimized waste production\n\n##### STEP 3\n\n#### Quality Assurance and Bulk Packaging\n* Precise flexi tank installation\n* Comprehensive export documentation\n* Comprehensive laboratory testing\n\n###### CONTACT\n\n## We\u2019d Love To\n## Hear From You\n\nWe value your opinion and your feedback matter to us. We typically respond within 24 hours.\n\n[ GET IN TOUCH ][12]\n\nFounded in 2023, Saficado evolved from a strategic vision to elevate African agricultural potential\nthrough specialized crude oil exports.\n\n## contact@saficado.com\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nInstagram\n\nX\n\n[Contact Us][13]\n\u00a9 2025 Saficado Limited. All rights Reserved\n\n[1]: https://saficado.com\n[2]: https://saficado.com/\n[3]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[4]: https://saficado.com/product/\n[5]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[6]: https://saficado.com/product/\n[7]: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1V_rqA3JbD8FiQ3zB5BJSizgGmPQ02-k9/view?usp=sharing\n[8]: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0jjTU-H43M\n[9]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[10]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[11]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[12]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[13]: https://saficado.com/contact/ [[Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light][Saficado-Logo-Light]][1]\n* [HOME][2]\n* [ABOUT][3]\n* [PRODUCT][4]\n* [CONTACT][5]\n\u2715\n\n###### WHO WE ARE\n\n## Saficado Limited:\n## Crude Avocado Oil Producer\n\n[ PRODUCT ][6]\n* [ DOWNLOAD PROFILE ][7]\n\n##### Premium Quality Avocado Oil Exports From Kenya\n* [ CALL US ][8]\n\n##### Saficado is a leading producer of premium-quality avocado oil. We employ an integrated\n##### farmer-to-factory model, sourcing directly from over 1,200 smallholder farmers.\u00a0\n\nSaficado implements a robust farm-to-market system that reliably traces the quality and origin of\navocados at the farmer level. Our dedicated team of agricultural experts, logistics professionals,\nand community advocates work diligently to ensure that every shipment complies with the highest\ninternational standards.\n\n0 +\n\n###### TONNES / YEAR\n\nSaficado has the capacity\u00a0 to produce over 1500 metric tonnes of premium quality avocado oil\nannually.\n\n0 %\n\n###### KENYAN SOURCED\n\nSourced exclusively from locally cultivated Kenyan Hass and Fuerte avocado varieties.\n\n0\n\n###### \u00a0TONNES BULK EXPORT\n\n24-tonne flexi tanks, designed for efficient and safe transportation.\u00a0\n\n0 +\n\n###### FARMERS SUPPORTED\n\nWe directly collaborate with and empower over 1,200 local farmers,\n\n[ ABOUT ][9]\n[ CONTACT ][10]\n\n###### HOW WE WORK\n\n## Our Story\n\n#### Founded in 2023 as a fresh avocado trader, Saficado evolved into a premium oil producer in\n#### 2024, driven by a strategic vision to maximize the value of Kenyan agriculture through premium\n#### avocado oil exports.\n\nStrategically positioned along Thika Superhighway, our company bridges local agricultural resources\nwith global market requirements.\n\n[ MORE ABOUT US ][11]\n\n###### SAFICADO LIMITED\n\n## Our Process\n\n##### STEP 1\n\n#### Avocado Sourcing and Collection\n* Sourcing from Kenyan Hass and Fuerte avocado varieties\n* Comprehensive farmer support program\n* Careful selection of fruits at various ripeness stages\n\n##### STEP 2\n\n#### Industrial Extraction and Processing\n* Mechanical separation of oil from avocado pulp\n* Chemical-free processing approach\n* Temperature-controlled extraction\n* Minimized waste production\n\n##### STEP 3\n\n#### Quality Assurance and Bulk Packaging\n* Precise flexi tank installation\n* Comprehensive export documentation\n* Comprehensive laboratory testing\n\n###### CONTACT\n\n## We\u2019d Love To\n## Hear From You\n\nWe value your opinion and your feedback matter to us. We typically respond within 24 hours.\n\n[ GET IN TOUCH ][12]\n\nFounded in 2023, Saficado evolved from a strategic vision to elevate African agricultural potential\nthrough specialized crude oil exports.\n\n## contact@saficado.com\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nInstagram\n\nX\n\n[Contact Us][13]\n\u00a9 2025 Saficado Limited. All rights Reserved\n\n[1]: https://saficado.com\n[2]: https://saficado.com/\n[3]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[4]: https://saficado.com/product/\n[5]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[6]: https://saficado.com/product/\n[7]: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1V_rqA3JbD8FiQ3zB5BJSizgGmPQ02-k9/view?usp=sharing\n[8]: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0jjTU-H43M\n[9]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[10]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[11]: https://saficado.com/about/\n[12]: https://saficado.com/contact/\n[13]: https://saficado.com/contact/ saficado.com"
