        "crawl_text": "[ [Shiv Sales] ][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Product][3]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Absolute Oils][4]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Aromatherapy Oil][5]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Aromatic Chemicals][6]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Ayurvedic Oils][7]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Butter & Clay][8]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Carrier Oils][9]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]CO2 Oils][10]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Essential Oils][11]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Flavours][12]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Fragrance][13]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Herbal Dry & Liquid Extracts][14]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Massage Oils][15]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Mint Oils][16]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Spice Oils][17]\n* [Blog & News][18]\n* [Careers][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n[images]\n\n# product\n\n[essential oil]\n\n## Partner with India\u2019s Leading Natural Oils Manufacturer and Discover Pure Excellence\n\nWe are recognized for manufacturing and delivering top-quality natural oils that set industry\nstandards.\n\n[essential oil]\n\n## Superior Grade Natural Oils, Crafted for Industrial Superiority\n\nOur oils are meticulously processed to ensure top-tier quality, empowering your products with the\nbest the industry has to offer.\n\n[essential oil]\n\n## Transform Your Offerings with Our Exceptional Quality Oils\n\nElevate your product range with oils known for purity and effectiveness, enhancing value at every\nlevel.\n\n[cipla]\n[patanjali]\n[emami]\n[bajaj]\n[himalaya]\n[dabur]\n[bajaj]\n[emami]\n[essential oils]\n\n## About Us\n\nWe at Shiv Sales believe in the power of nature and trust that nature plays a crucial role in\ngenerating an inner radiance of harmony and balance. That is why we always try our best to bring\nhumans closer to nature with our wide assortments of pure and natural essential oils. We take pride\nin the fact that we are a leading essential oil manufacturer in India, and our products are\nworld-famous. Our aim to offer our clients an incredible experience encourages us to consistently\nenhance our products without compromising our core values and the natural properties and quality of\nour essential oils.\n\n[ Explore [images]][21]\n\n## What We Offer\n\n[\n[transport]\n\n### Manufacturer & Exporter\n\nAs one of the best essential oils manufacturers & exporters, we specialize in the wholesale\ndistribution of premier natural oils.\n\n][22] [\n[essential oil]\n\n### Private Labeling\n\nWe create distinctive and premium labeling that will not only offer you a unique and tailored\nexperience but will also help you reflect your brand's identity.\n\n][23] [\n[lab]\n\n### Customer Formulations\n\nWe customize the oil formulations based on your needs and preferences, and that too without\ncompromising the quality.\n\n][24]\n\n## Product Range\n\n[essential oil] [\n\n### ESSENTIAL OILS\n\n[images] ][25]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### CARRIER OILS\n\n[images] ][26]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### HERBAL DRY & LIQUID EXTRACTS\n\n[images] ][27]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### MINT OILS\n\n[images] ][28]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### ABSOLUTE OILS\n\n[images] ][29]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### AYURVEDIC OILS\n\n[images] ][30]\n[ Explore all Categories [images]][31]\n\n## Our Certifications\n\n[certification]\n[certification]\n[certification]\n[certification]\n[certification]\n[certification]\n\n## Supply Chain\n\n[ [test lab] ][32]\n[\n\n### Sourcing of Raw Materials\n\nWe only source and use the finest raw materials from different parts of the world to ensure our\nessential oils are only made from the purest botanicals.\n\n][33]\n[ [storage] ][34]\n[\n\n### Product Development\n\nOur experts carefully distill and blend raw materials to craft premium and authentic natural oils\nwith perfection.\n\n][35]\n[ [test] ][36]\n[\n\n### Lab Testing\n\nMaintaining the quality standards is our top priority. We conduct rigorous lab testing to ensure our\nessential oils' purity, benefits and potency.\n\n][37]\n[ [meeting] ][38]\n[\n\n### Sales\n\nOur product journey remains incomplete until we engage and connect with customers and businesses who\nappreciate the value and quality of our natural essential oils.\n\n][39]\n\n## Top Reasons To Partner With Shiv Sales\n\nDiscover why choosing Shiv Sales means partnering with the best natural oil manufacturer & exporter\nthat cares about quality, sustainability and customer satisfaction.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co1.webp]\n\n#### QUALITY & PURITY\n\nWe do not consider quality as just a criterion but a commitment to stand out as the best natural oil\nmanufacturer & supplier.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co2.webp]\n\n#### INTERNATIONAL PRESENCE\n\nWe continuously aim to expand our global reach and add more countries to our map which currently\nincludes- Canada, USA, Europe and some other Gulf countries.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co3.webp]\n\n#### BROAD PRODUCT PORTFOLIO\n\nFrom essential and carrier oils to fragrances and flavors, we manufacture more than 500 products to\nmeet the growing needs of our customers.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co4.webp]\n\n#### MANUFACTURING CAPACITY\n\nOur manufacturing unit spread across 1200 m, enables us to have a manufacturing capacity of 15 tons\nper day.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp- [ [Shiv Sales] ][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Product][3]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Absolute Oils][4]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Aromatherapy Oil][5]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Aromatic Chemicals][6]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Ayurvedic Oils][7]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Butter & Clay][8]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Carrier Oils][9]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]CO2 Oils][10]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Essential Oils][11]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Flavours][12]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Fragrance][13]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Herbal Dry & Liquid Extracts][14]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Massage Oils][15]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Mint Oils][16]\n  * [[Shiv Sales]Spice Oils][17]\n* [Blog & News][18]\n* [Careers][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n[images]\n\n# product\n\n[essential oil]\n\n## Partner with India\u2019s Leading Natural Oils Manufacturer and Discover Pure Excellence\n\nWe are recognized for manufacturing and delivering top-quality natural oils that set industry\nstandards.\n\n[essential oil]\n\n## Superior Grade Natural Oils, Crafted for Industrial Superiority\n\nOur oils are meticulously processed to ensure top-tier quality, empowering your products with the\nbest the industry has to offer.\n\n[essential oil]\n\n## Transform Your Offerings with Our Exceptional Quality Oils\n\nElevate your product range with oils known for purity and effectiveness, enhancing value at every\nlevel.\n\n[cipla]\n[patanjali]\n[emami]\n[bajaj]\n[himalaya]\n[dabur]\n[bajaj]\n[emami]\n[essential oils]\n\n## About Us\n\nWe at Shiv Sales believe in the power of nature and trust that nature plays a crucial role in\ngenerating an inner radiance of harmony and balance. That is why we always try our best to bring\nhumans closer to nature with our wide assortments of pure and natural essential oils. We take pride\nin the fact that we are a leading essential oil manufacturer in India, and our products are\nworld-famous. Our aim to offer our clients an incredible experience encourages us to consistently\nenhance our products without compromising our core values and the natural properties and quality of\nour essential oils.\n\n[ Explore [images]][21]\n\n## What We Offer\n\n[\n[transport]\n\n### Manufacturer & Exporter\n\nAs one of the best essential oils manufacturers & exporters, we specialize in the wholesale\ndistribution of premier natural oils.\n\n][22] [\n[essential oil]\n\n### Private Labeling\n\nWe create distinctive and premium labeling that will not only offer you a unique and tailored\nexperience but will also help you reflect your brand's identity.\n\n][23] [\n[lab]\n\n### Customer Formulations\n\nWe customize the oil formulations based on your needs and preferences, and that too without\ncompromising the quality.\n\n][24]\n\n## Product Range\n\n[essential oil] [\n\n### ESSENTIAL OILS\n\n[images] ][25]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### CARRIER OILS\n\n[images] ][26]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### HERBAL DRY & LIQUID EXTRACTS\n\n[images] ][27]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### MINT OILS\n\n[images] ][28]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### ABSOLUTE OILS\n\n[images] ][29]\n[essential oil] [\n\n### AYURVEDIC OILS\n\n[images] ][30]\n[ Explore all Categories [images]][31]\n\n## Our Certifications\n\n[certification]\n[certification]\n[certification]\n[certification]\n[certification]\n[certification]\n\n## Supply Chain\n\n[ [test lab] ][32]\n[\n\n### Sourcing of Raw Materials\n\nWe only source and use the finest raw materials from different parts of the world to ensure our\nessential oils are only made from the purest botanicals.\n\n][33]\n[ [storage] ][34]\n[\n\n### Product Development\n\nOur experts carefully distill and blend raw materials to craft premium and authentic natural oils\nwith perfection.\n\n][35]\n[ [test] ][36]\n[\n\n### Lab Testing\n\nMaintaining the quality standards is our top priority. We conduct rigorous lab testing to ensure our\nessential oils' purity, benefits and potency.\n\n][37]\n[ [meeting] ][38]\n[\n\n### Sales\n\nOur product journey remains incomplete until we engage and connect with customers and businesses who\nappreciate the value and quality of our natural essential oils.\n\n][39]\n\n## Top Reasons To Partner With Shiv Sales\n\nDiscover why choosing Shiv Sales means partnering with the best natural oil manufacturer & exporter\nthat cares about quality, sustainability and customer satisfaction.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co1.webp]\n\n#### QUALITY & PURITY\n\nWe do not consider quality as just a criterion but a commitment to stand out as the best natural oil\nmanufacturer & supplier.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co2.webp]\n\n#### INTERNATIONAL PRESENCE\n\nWe continuously aim to expand our global reach and add more countries to our map which currently\nincludes- Canada, USA, Europe and some other Gulf countries.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co3.webp]\n\n#### BROAD PRODUCT PORTFOLIO\n\nFrom essential and carrier oils to fragrances and flavors, we manufacture more than 500 products to\nmeet the growing needs of our customers.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co4.webp]\n\n#### MANUFACTURING CAPACITY\n\nOur manufacturing unit spread across 1200 m, enables us to have a manufacturing capacity of 15 tons\nper day.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co5.webp]\n\n#### 5 WAREHOUSES\n\nOur current infrastructure setup includes multiple manufacturing units and five storage facilities\nto store materials efficiently.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co6.webp]\n\n#### ACCREDITATIONS\n\nWe proudly adhere to the highest quality standards and hold many certifications like Halal, Kosher,\nUSFDA, WHO, GMP, ISO, HACCP, ISO and FSSAI approved.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co7.webp]\n\n#### COMPLETE CUSTOMER SATISFACTION\n\nOur commitment to offering 100% customer satisfaction and consistency in maintaining product quality\nhelped us acquire over 1500 satisfied clients, both in India and globally.\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/co8.webp]\n\n#### 25+ YEARS OF EXPERIENCE\n\nOur dedication to researching and manufacturing exceptional products to exceed our customers'\nexpectations has helped us cultivate 25 years of expertise in the industry.\n\n## Blogs\n\n[ [images] ][40]\n\n###### 11 Jun 2026\n\nPure Essential Oils Manufacturer in India | Bulk Essential Oils Supplier for Cosmetics Industry\n\n[ read more ][41]\n[ [images] ][42]\n\n###### 26 May 2026\n\nBest Cosmetic Butter Manufacturer & Exporter in India\n\n[ read more ][43]\n[ [images] ][44]\n\n###### 25 May 2026\n\nBest Lavender Oil Manufacturer & Exporter in India\n\n[ read more ][45]\n[ Explore [images]][46]\n\n### QUICK LINKS\n* * [Home][47]\n  * [About Us][48]\n  * [Product][49]\n  * [Careers][50]\n  * [FAQ][51]\n\n### ADDRESS\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/location-foot.webp]\n\nHead Office\n\n252, Kotla, Mayur Vihar, Phase -1, New Delhi-110091\n\n[https://shivorganicgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/location-foot.webp]\n\nFactory\n\nB-99, Phase-2, Noida,\nUttar Pradesh -201305\n\n### CONTACT\n\n[email]\n\nFor Domestic Enquiries\n\n[info@shivorganics.com][52]\n[export@shivorganics.com][53]\n\n[email]\n\nFor International Enquiries\n\n[intsales@shivorganics.com ][54]\n\n[call]\n\nFor Domestic Enquiries\n\n[Phone: +91 9"
