        "crawl_text": "* [\n  Login\n  ][1]\n* [\n  Scholarship\n  ][2]\n* [\n  Alumni\n  ][3]\n* [\n  Media\n  ][4]\n[ [SIIT - Scholars International Institute of Technology] ][5]\nSearch for: Search\n* [\n  Home\n  ][6]\n  * [\n    Institute\n    ][7]\n  * [\n    Alumni\n    ][8]\n  * [\n    Awards\n    ][9]\n  * [\n    Accreditation\n    ][10]\n  * [\n    Press Releases\n    ][11]\n* [\n  Academics\n  ][12]\n  * [\n    School of Technical Training\n    ][13]\n  * [\n    School of Vocational Training\n    ][14]\n  * [\n    School of Professional Studies\n    ][15]\n  * [\n    Certification Information\n    ][16]\n* [\n  Admissions\n  ][17]\n  * [\n    Diploma\n    ][18]\n  * [\n    Advanced Diploma\n    ][19]\n  * [\n    Master Diploma\n    ][20]\n  * [\n    All Course Programs\n    ][21]\n* [\n  Partnerships\n  ][22]\n* [\n  Resources\n  ][23]\n  * [\n    News\n    ][24]\n  * [\n    Blogs\n    ][25]\n  * [\n    Careers\n    ][26]\n  * [\n    Tutorials\n    ][27]\n  * [\n    Guest Posts\n    ][28]\n  * [\n    Tools & Apps\n    ][29]\n\n# SIIT - Scholars International Institute of Technology\n\nMarch 22, 2021 2021-05-04 8:28\n\n## SIIT Institute\n\n### Discover the world of possibility with SIIT\n\n2025/2026 Applications are Now Open\n[\nAdmissions\n][30]\n\n### Transforming lives through skills education\n\n2025/2026 Applications are Now Open\n[\nAdmissions\n][31]\n\n### Get trained by experts around the world\n\n2025/2026 Applications are Now Open\n[\nAdmissions\n][32]\n\n## Welcome to Scholars International Institute of Technology - SIIT\n\nSIIT was established with a bold mission: to democratize access to high-quality, industry-relevant\neducation for learners and professionals around the world.\nSIIT offers certified technical courses, vocational training and professional studies online.\n[\nRead more\n][33]\n\n## Why Choose SIIT\n\nWe Are One of The Largest, Most Diverse Institute in The World\n\n### Affordability\n\nOur scholarship program makes SIIT courses affordable for every student throughout the world.\n[\nLearn more\n][34]\n\n### High Quality\n\nAn education at SIIT has limitless possibilities. Our courses are taught by industry experts and\nprofessionals.\n[\nLearn more\n][35]\n\n### Accessibility\n\nOur system creates open opportunities for all learners, with easy access 24/7, offering flexibility\nand convenience.\n[\nLearn more\n][36]\n\n### We're SIIT\n### & We're Different\n\nWe are making skills learning more relevant, open and transformational.\n\n\n800,000+\nEnrolled\n\n\n95,000+\nTrainees\n\n\n97%\nSatisfaction Rating\n\n\n30,000+\nSocial Followers\n[\n][37]\n\n## Studying at SIIT\n\nAccredited Diploma Programs Online\n[\n[library-image-box-01]\n\n### School of Technical Training\n\nThe school of technical training focuses on providing specialized, practical, and hands-on training\nin technical fields. This program is designed to equip students with the skills and knowledge\nnecessary to pursue careers in industries that require technical expertise.\n][38]\n[\n[library-image-box-02]\n\n### School of Vocational Training\n\nThe school of vocational training focuses on teaching vocational trades and skills needed for\nvarious career pursuit. This program is designed to prepare students for immediate employment by\noffering practical training, hands-on experience in specific fields.\n][39]\n[\n[library-image-box-03]\n\n### School of Professional Studies\n\nThe school of professional studies offers programs tailored to working professionals, adult learners\nand students seeking to enhance their skills and advance their careers in specific fields.\n][40]\n\n## Certification Information\n\n[\n[event-12]\nCertification\n\n### Graduate online with Accredited Diploma widely recognized.\n\nRead More \u00bb \u00bb\n][41]\n[\n[event-11]\nDiploma\n\n### Certifies the completion of Diploma programs..\n\nRead More \u00bb \u00bb\n][42]\n[\n[event-10]\nMaster Diploma\n\n### Certifies the completion of Master Diploma programs..\n\nRead More \u00bb \u00bb\n][43]\n[\nMore Information\n][44]\n\n### Awards and Media Coverage\n\n[\nView all awards\n][45]\n[ [International Association for Quality Assurance in Pre-Tertiary & Higher Education (QAHE)] ][46]\n[Awarded By: ][47] [International Association for Quality Assurance in Pre-Tertiary & Higher\nEducation (QAHE)][48]\n\n### [Excellence in Education Awards 2025][49]\n\n[ Year ][50]\n2024 - 2025\n[ [E2 Media Awards of Excellence] ][51]\n[Awarded By: ][52] [E2 Media Awards][53]\n\n### [Award of Excellence 2025 ][54]\n\n[ Year ][55]\n2025\n[ [International Elite 100] ][56]\n[Awarded By:][57][International Elite 100][58]\n\n### [Excellence in Distance Learning - Education Global Awards][59]\n\n[ Year ][60]\n2024\n[ [Corporate Vision Awards] ][61]\n[Awarded By:][62][Corporate Vision Awards][63]\n\n### [Best Self-paced Tech Education & eLearning Entity][64]\n\n[ Year ][65]\n2023\n[SIIT Media Partners]\n\n[ [blog-14] ][66]\n[Media Partner][67][EduBirdie][68]\n\n### [Recognition by EduBirdie][69]\n\n[ Year ][70]\n2024 / 2025\n[ [blog-13] ][71]\n[Media Partner][72][Custom Writings][73]\n\n### [Recognition by Custom Writings][74]\n\n[ Year ][75]\n2024 / 2025\n[ [blog-12] ][76]\n[Media Partner][77][Paddy Power][78]\n\n### [Recognition by Paddy Power][79]\n\n[ Year ][80]\n2024 / 2025\n[ [blog-11] ][81]\n[ * [\n  Login\n  ][1]\n* [\n  Scholarship\n  ][2]\n* [\n  Alumni\n  ][3]\n* [\n  Media\n  ][4]\n[ [SIIT - Scholars International Institute of Technology] ][5]\nSearch for: Search\n* [\n  Home\n  ][6]\n  * [\n    Institute\n    ][7]\n  * [\n    Alumni\n    ][8]\n  * [\n    Awards\n    ][9]\n  * [\n    Accreditation\n    ][10]\n  * [\n    Press Releases\n    ][11]\n* [\n  Academics\n  ][12]\n  * [\n    School of Technical Training\n    ][13]\n  * [\n    School of Vocational Training\n    ][14]\n  * [\n    School of Professional Studies\n    ][15]\n  * [\n    Certification Information\n    ][16]\n* [\n  Admissions\n  ][17]\n  * [\n    Diploma\n    ][18]\n  * [\n    Advanced Diploma\n    ][19]\n  * [\n    Master Diploma\n    ][20]\n  * [\n    All Course Programs\n    ][21]\n* [\n  Partnerships\n  ][22]\n* [\n  Resources\n  ][23]\n  * [\n    News\n    ][24]\n  * [\n    Blogs\n    ][25]\n  * [\n    Careers\n    ][26]\n  * [\n    Tutorials\n    ][27]\n  * [\n    Guest Posts\n    ][28]\n  * [\n    Tools & Apps\n    ][29]\n\n# SIIT - Scholars International Institute of Technology\n\nMarch 22, 2021 2021-05-04 8:28\n\n## SIIT Institute\n\n### Discover the world of possibility with SIIT\n\n2025/2026 Applications are Now Open\n[\nAdmissions\n][30]\n\n### Transforming lives through skills education\n\n2025/2026 Applications are Now Open\n[\nAdmissions\n][31]\n\n### Get trained by experts around the world\n\n2025/2026 Applications are Now Open\n[\nAdmissions\n][32]\n\n## Welcome to Scholars International Institute of Technology - SIIT\n\nSIIT was established with a bold mission: to democratize access to high-quality, industry-relevant\neducation for learners and professionals around the world.\nSIIT offers certified technical courses, vocational training and professional studies online.\n[\nRead more\n][33]\n\n## Why Choose SIIT\n\nWe Are One of The Largest, Most Diverse Institute in The World\n\n### Affordability\n\nOur scholarship program makes SIIT courses affordable for every student throughout the world.\n[\nLearn more\n][34]\n\n### High Quality\n\nAn education at SIIT has limitless possibilities. Our courses are taught by industry experts and\nprofessionals.\n[\nLearn more\n][35]\n\n### Accessibility\n\nOur system creates open opportunities for all learners, with easy access 24/7, offering flexibility\nand convenience.\n[\nLearn more\n][36]\n\n### We're SIIT\n### & We're Different\n\nWe are making skills learning more relevant, open and transformational.\n\n\n800,000+\nEnrolled\n\n\n95,000+\nTrainees\n\n\n97%\nSatisfaction Rating\n\n\n30,000+\nSocial Followers\n[\n][37]\n\n## Studying at SIIT\n\nAccredited Diploma Programs Online\n[\n[library-image-box-01]\n\n### School of Technical Training\n\nThe school of technical training focuses on providing specialized, practical, and hands-on training\nin technical fields. This program is designed to equip students with the skills and knowledge\nnecessary to pursue careers in industries that require technical expertise.\n][38]\n[\n[library-image-box-02]\n\n### School of Vocational Training\n\nThe school of vocational training focuses on teaching vocational trades and skills needed for\nvarious career pursuit. This program is designed to prepare students for immediate employment by\noffering practical training, hands-on experience in specific fields.\n][39]\n[\n[library-image-box-03]\n\n### School of Professional Studies\n\nThe school of professional studies offers programs tailored to working professionals, adult learners\nand students seeking to enhance their skills and advance their careers in specific fields.\n][40]\n\n## Certification Information\n\n[\n[event-12]\nCertification\n\n### Graduate online with Accredited Diploma widely recognized.\n\nRead More \u00bb \u00bb\n][41]\n[\n[event-11]\nDiploma\n\n### Certifies the completion of Diploma programs..\n\nRead More \u00bb \u00bb\n][42]\n[\n[event-10]\nMaster Diploma\n\n### Certifies the completion of Master Diploma programs..\n\nRead More \u00bb \u00bb\n][43]\n[\nMore Information\n][44]\n\n### Awards and Media Coverage\n\n[\nView all awards\n][45]\n[ [International Association for Quality Assurance in Pre-Tertiary & Higher Education (QAHE)] ][46]\n[Awarded By: ][47] [International Association for Quality Assurance in Pre-Tertiary & Higher\nEducation (QAHE)][48]\n\n### [Excellence in Education Awards 2025][49]\n\n[ Year ][50]\n2024 - 2025\n[ [E2 Media Awards of Excellence] ][51]\n[Awarded By: ][52] [E2 Media Awards][53]\n\n### [Award of Excellence 2025 ][54]\n\n[ Year ][55]\n2025\n[ [International Elite 100] ][56]\n[Awarded By:][57][International Elite 100][58]\n\n### [Excellence in Distance Learning - Education Global Awards][59]\n\n[ Year ][60]\n2024\n[ [Corporate Vision Awards] ][61]\n[Awarded By:][62][Corporate Vision Awards][63]\n\n### [Best Self-paced Tech Education & eLearning Entity][64]\n\n[ Year ][65]\n2023\n[SIIT Media Partners]\n\n[ [blog-14] ][66]\n[Media Partner][67][EduBirdie][68]\n\n### [Recognition by EduBirdie][69]\n\n[ Year ][70]\n2024 / 2025\n[ [blog-13] ][71]\n[Media Partner][72][Custom Writings][73]\n\n### [Recognition by Custom Writings][74]\n\n[ Year ][75]\n2024 / 2025\n[ [blog-12] ][76]\n[Media Partner][77][Paddy Power][78]\n\n### [Recognition by Paddy Power][79]\n\n[ Year ][80]\n2024 / 2025\n[ [blog-11] ][81]\n[Media Partner][82][Ahelp][83]\n\n### [Recognition by Academic Help][84]\n\n[ Year ][85]\n2024 / 2025\n[ [Google] Google ][86] [ [Microsoft] Microsoft][87] [ [Adobe] Adobe][88] [ [Cisco] Cisco][89] [\n[CompTIA] CompTIA][90] [ [Oracle] Oracle ][91] [ [Stanford University] Stanford ][92] [ [Cambridge\nUniversity] Cambridge ][93] [ [The Nation] casino non AAMS ][94]\n[Accredited Online Paralegal Program ][95] WTI\n\n[Offshore Software Development Company][96]\n\n~ Top Partners ~\n\n### What Students Are Saying\n\n[\nView all testimonials\n][97]\n[ [blog-14] ][98]\n[Alumni][99][E. Justin][100]\n\n### [ \"Thanks very much. You are among individuals/group making this world a better place to live\n### in.\"][101]\n\n[ ][102]\n[ [blog-13] ][103]\n[Alumni][104][A. Emma ][105]\n\n### [\"I write to thank the management for this renounced opportunity for me to study and obtained\n### diploma certificate online!\"][106]\n\n[ ][107]\n[ [blog-12] ][108]\n[Alumni][109][Philip M.][110]\n\n### [ \"I want to thank you for giving me a chance to become a computer engineer, thanks guys. God\n### bless you guys.\"][111]\n\n[ ][112]\n[ [blog-11] ][113]\n[Alumni][114][Francis A.][115]\n\n### [\"I must say that SIIT has affected my life positively that my unborn generation will never lack\n### nor suffer any hardship. Graphic design is in our everyday life.\"][116]\n\n[ ][117]\n\n## WE BELIEVE THAT TECH EDUCATION IS FOR EVERYONE!\n\n## **Unlock Your Potential with Accredited Online Training Courses**\n\nStaying ahead in today\u2019s fast-paced and highly competitive world requires more than just talent\u2014it\nrequires continuous learning and professional growth. That\u2019s why we\u2019re committed to helping\nindividuals and organizations succeed through **Professional Training** programs designed for\nreal-world results.\n\nWhether you're just starting your career or seeking to level up your current skills, our platform\noffers a comprehensive range of **Accredited Online Training Courses** tailored to your goals. From\ntechnical studies and business management to IT skills"
