uality nutritional oils.\n\nSanmark ranks among the top in the global market share for its evening primrose oil, borage oil, and\nperilla seed oil, and is a leading enterprise in China's flaxseed oil exports. In 2025, relying on\nits outstanding quality and consumer trust, Sanmark's avocado oil won three major certifications in\nsales, brand influence, and customer reputation.\n\n\u00a0\n\n2\n\nProduction Bases\n\n4\n\nMarketing Centers\n\n15\n\nCertifications\n\n40 +\n\nServing over 40 Countries & Regions\n\n700 +\n\nOver 700 Corporate Customers\n\n50 +\n\nOver 50 varieties of Nutritional Oils\n\n[ Learn more ][42]\n\nSustainability\n\nFollow and Respect the Rules of Nature\n\n[ [\u73af\u5883\u8d23\u4efb] ][43]\n\n[ Environmental Responsibility ][44]\n\n[ From sustainable sourcing to full-chain recycling, Sanmark implements green processing, energy\nconservation and emission reduction to establish an ecological closed-loop system, thus fulfilling\nits environmental commitments. ][45]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][46]\n\n\n[ [\u793e\u4f1a\u8d23\u4efb] ][47]\n\n[ Social Responsibility ][48]\n\n[ Sanmark is committed to public welfare assistance, ecological protection and food safety\nassurance. It fulfills its diversified social responsibilities through assisting agriculture to\nboost industries, cross-border empowerment, and employee care. ][49]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][50]\n\n\n[ [\u516c\u53f8\u6cbb\u7406] ][51]\n\n[ Corporate Governance ][52]\n\n[ Sanmark adheres to integrity in operations and fair competition, conducts business in strict\ncompliance with regulations, improves the management and supervision system, and solidifies the\nfoundation for the sound development of the enterprise. ][53]\n\n[\nMORE+\n][54]\n\n\nNews\n\nCapture real-time information and present diverse perspectives\n\nJun 11,2026\n\n[ Sixth African Avocado Congress Concludes \u2013 MGA\u2019s One-Stop Solutions Draw Industry Attention ][55]\n\nMay 26,2026\n\n[ SANMARK at the 6th International Africa Avocado Congress 2026 ][56]\n\nMay 13,2026\n\n[ First Batch of Kenya\u2019s Zero-Tariff Export Cargo Arrives at Dalian Port ][57]\n\n[ Learn more ][58]\n* [ About Us ][59]\n  * [ Enterprise Overview ][60]\n  * [ Development History ][61]\n  * [ Culture and Strategy ][62]\n  * [ Virtual Factory Tour ][63]\n  * [ News Center ][64]\n* [ Sustainability ][65]\n  * [ Environmental Responsibility ][66]\n  * [ Social Responsibility ][67]\n  * [ Corporate Governance ][68]\n* [ Quality & Innovation ][69]\n  * [ Quality Assurance ][70]\n  * [ Technological Innovation ][71]\n  * [ Global Supply Chain ][72]\n* [ Products & Services ][73]\n  * [ Products ][74]\n  * [ Services ][75]\n* [ Contact Us ][76]\n  * [ Business Contact ][77]\n  * [ Join Us ][78]\n[Linkedin WeChat ]\n\nMessages\n\nPlease fill in the form below. Our staff will contact you within 24 hours and address your issue as\nsoon as possible.\n\n\u6765\u6e90\u5730\u5740\n\u6765\u6e90\u9875\u9762\n\u59d3\u540d\n\u624b\u673a\u53f7\u7801\n\u7535\u5b50\u90ae\u4ef6\n\u7559\u8a00\u5185\u5bb9\n[ Submit ][79]\n\n[Powered by\uff1aCEglobal][80]\n\n\u4e2d\u4f01\u8de8\u5883-\u5168\u57df\u7ec4\u4ef6 \u5236\u4f5c\u524d\u8fdb\u5165CSS\u914d\u7f6e\u6837\u5f0f\n\ninfo@sanmarkltd.com\uff1a\n\n+86 400 777 8479\uff1a\n\n\u5bfc\u822a\u4e0b\u62c9\u6dfb\u52a0\u7c7b\u540d.active\n\n\u53f3\u4fa7\u5728\u7ebf\u5ba2\u670d\u6837\u5f0f 1,2,3 2\n\n\u56fe\u7247alt\u6807\u9898\u8bbe\u7f6e\uff1a \u665f\u9ea6\u5b9e\u4e1a\n\n\u8868\u5355\u9a8c\u8bc1\u63d0\u793a\u6587\u672c\uff1a \u5185\u5bb9\u4e0d\u80fd\u4e3a\u7a7a!\n\n\u5faa\u73af\u4f53\u6ca1\u6709\u5185\u5bb9\u65f6\uff1a \u5bf9\u4e0d\u8d77\uff0c\u6ca1\u6709\u627e\u5230\u5339\u914d\u7684\u7269\u54c1\u3002\n\nCSS / JS \u6587\u4ef6\u653e\u7f6e\u5730\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /About.html\n[3]: /About.html#Profile\n[4]: /About.html#History\n[5]: /About.html#Culture\n[6]: javascript:;\n[7]: /About.html#News\n[8]: /Product_Service.html\n[9]: /xtgc/1.html\n[10]: /xtgc/1.html\n[11]: /Product/1376561389321187328.html\n[12]: /Product/13