nd a commitment to sustainability, we\nhave established ourselves as a reputed player in the coffee industry. In addition to coffee, we\nhave a newly established avocado oil manufacturing company, dedicated to producing premium quality\navocado oil for various culinary and cosmetic applications. With a focus on excellence and\ninnovation, we aim to become a trusted provider of avocado oil in the market.\n\n### 63\n\nPermanent Employees\n\n### 2500+\n\nTemporary Employees\n\n### 20,000+\n\nFarmers Collaboration\n\n[ More About Us ][16]\n\n### Production\n\nOur company takes pride in our carefully cultivated coffee beans sourced from Sidama, South\nEthiopia, and Oromia regions, known for their exceptional coffee growing conditions. We employ\ntraditional techniques to ensure superior quality from seed to cup. Our skilled team of coffee\nexperts oversees every step of the production process.\nOur company utilizes state of the art technology and carefully selected avocados to extract oil of\nthe highest standard. Our manufacturing facility adheres to strict hygiene and safety regulations to\nensure the production of\nsafe and top-quality avocado oil.\n\n### Why Choose Siz Agro Plc\n\n#### Quality Assurance\n\nWe maintain stringent quality control measures throughout the production process. Our beans as well\nas Each batch of avocado oil undergoes rigorous testing to ensure it meets our exacting standards.\n\n#### Export Services\n\nAs a reliable exporter, we specialize in facilitating seamless international trade. We have\nestablished strong partnerships with green coffee and avocado oil buyers worldwide, enabling us to\nreach in various markets.\n\n#### Unique Selling Proposition\n\nSiz Agro Plc is a distinguished exporter from Ethiopia, uniquely managing the entire coffee\nproduction process from farm to export. With a commitment to quality and sustainability, we oversee\nevery step, ensuring that our coffee meets the highest standards from cultivation to your warehouse.\nAdditionally, we are proud producers and exporters of premium avocado oil, delivering excellence to\nyour business.\n\n#### Growth\n\nGrowth is part of our DNA. Our potential to grow is immeasurable. We focus on business opportunities\nwith a view to create volume with quality and cost efficiencies in our operations. Our business has\ngrown significantly in the last 7 years, and we continue to invest to build a scalable business.\n\n### At A Glance\n\nFarms\n0\nManufacturing Sites\n0\nFarmers\n0 +\nTemporary Employees\n0 +\nFarms\n0\nManufacturing Sites\n0\nFarmers\n0 +\n\n### Our Gallery\n\ndefault\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\n* info@sizagro.com\n\n### [+(251) 911-233-744 ][17]\n* [ 4th floor , office number 403 HMM Tower Addis Ababa, Ethiopia ][18]\n\n[ Instagram ][19] [ Facebook ][20] [ Linkedin ][21] [ Whatsapp ][22]\n\n2024 \u00a9 Siz Agro Plc | All Right Reserved.\n\nScroll to Top\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: https://sizagro.com/\n[3]: https://sizagro.com/about-us/\n[4]: https://sizagro.com/products/\n[5]: https://sizagro.com/our-operations/\n[6]: https://sizagro.com/blogs/\n[7]: https://sizagro.com/contact-us/\n[8]: https://www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[9]: https://www.facebook.com/coffeeexporter/\n[10]: https://www.linkedin.com/authwall?trk=bf&trkInfo=AQEXOWzTUer1dAAAAZNqcedw2zKS6Nso1hsyNfIGCr6zL\nRis3-AFcziMAfWP4Frd9w0Ct0MxgSNZ1jsKRxhxEf2yWStw4an_ZAKXQ8uQGmmuT1DUyCOMJWG9tpONWe-PGvgL0nI=&original\n_referer=&sessionRedirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsiz-agro-plc-4b3686152%3Futm_source%\n3Dshare%26utm_campaign%3Dshare_via%26utm_content%3Dprofile%26utm_medium%3Dios_app\n[11]: https://wa.me/251911233744\n[12]: https://sizagro.com/about-us/\n[13]: https://sizagro.com/contact-us/\n[14]: https://sizagro.com/about-us/\n[15]: https://sizagro.com/contact-us/\n[16]: https://sizagro.com/about-us/\n[17]: tel:+(251)%20911-23-3744\n[18]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/i3p9HCsmZjVxa2eQ8\n[19]: https://www.instagram.com/sizagroplc/\n[20]: https://www.fa