        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n  * [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n  * [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n  * [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n  * [Screw Oil Press][8]\n  * [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n  * [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n  * [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n  * [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n  * [Refinery Equipment][14]\n  * [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n  * [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n  * [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n  * [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n  * [Contact][22]\n  * [News][23]\n  * [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n  * [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n  * [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n  * [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n  * [Screw Oil Press][36]\n  * [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n  * [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n  * [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n  * [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n  * [Refinery Equipment][42]\n  * [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n  * [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n  * [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n  * [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n  * [Contact][50]\n  * [News][51]\n  * [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Reliable agricultural processing equipment\n\nWe are committed to providing efficient and reliable small and medium-sized agricultural processing\nequipment to farmers and agricultural practitioners around the world, helping agricultural\nproduction efficiency, reducing operating costs, and doubling income.\n\n[ Join Early Access ][55]\n[ Pioneer Program ][56]\n\n### Solve These 3 Problems in Your Farm\n\n#### Low efficiency and unreliability\n\nRust-proof treatment in tropical climate to ensure efficient operation\n\n#### Is the power unstable\n\nDiesel/electric dual-powered model\n\n#### The equipment is too expensive\n\nThe price is only 2/5 of European and American brands\n\n## Popular products\n\nMachines Designed for Your Success\n\n[[home Animal fat processing equipment][home Animal fat processing equipment]][57]\n\n### [Animal fat processing equipment][58]\n\n[[home Oil Press Machine][home Oil Press Machine]][59]\n\n### [automatic oil press Machine][60]\n\n[[home Oil Filter Machine][home Oil Filter Machine]][61]\n\n### [Oil Filter Machine][62]\n\n[[Roasting machine warehouse 4][Roasting machine warehouse 4]][63]\n\n### [Roasting machine][64]\n\n[[home Filling machine][home Filling machine]][65]\n\n### [Filling machine][66]\n\n## Trusted by Farmers Worldwide\n\nSince 2010, [GQ-Agri][67] has provided reliable, affordable processing solutions to small-scale\nfarmers and agripreneurs/cooperatives in over 20 countries. Our rugged equipment helps farmers\nincrease productivity by 30-50% while reducing processing time by 70% compared to traditional\nmethods. With 15+ years of engineering expertise, each machine has a lifespan of over 5 years \u2013\ntwice the industry average for similar equipment. Committed to ensuring your long-term success after\nyour purchase.\n\n[ISO White][ISO White]\n[CE White][CE White]\n[SONCAP White][SONCAP White]\n[Oil press production workshop][Oil press production workshop]\n\n## Customer Testimonials\n\nCustomer Feedback from All Over the World\n\nNow My Kids Can Go to University! Before GQ-Ari, I sold raw coconuts for 2,500 IDR/kg. With the\nDY-200 oil press, I now earn 35,000 IDR/liter of virgin oil. My 4-worker family processes 120kg/day\n- income jumped from 300,000 IDR to 4.2 million IDR daily. Last month, I opened a bank account for\nmy daughter's medical school.\nAhmad YusufCoconut Oil Producer\nAfter the floods destroyed my crops, I used GQ-Ari's press to turn waste rice bran into oil. From\n1kg bran (worth 5,000 VND) I extract 300ml oil selling for 45,000 VND. My 3-woman collective now\nearns 12 million VND/month - enough to replant our fields AND buy a solar dryer.\nL\u00ea Th\u1ecb H\u01b0\u01a1ngRice Bran Oil Entrepreneur\nUsed to sell kernels to factories at 1.8 MYR/kg. With the NK-150 sheller, I process 300kg/day into\npremium kernels (4.5 MYR/kg). In 18 months, I upgraded from motorcycle delivery to owning a 600\u33a1\nprocessing shed with 6 local employees.\nRajesh KumarPalm Kernel Processor\nOur 13 members spent 150 PHP/day transporting copra to mills. The GQ-Ari CP-80 press lets us process\n80 nuts/hour onsite. Now we sell bottled oil at 120 PHP/250ml instead of 35 PHP/kg for copra -\nincome up by 340%. No More 4AM Trips to the Mill.\nMaria Dela CruzCoconut Farmers' Cooperative President\nMiddlemen paid 15 GHS/kg for raw nuts. My wife's women's group uses the SB-05 sheller to produce\n50kg/day of premium kernels (42 GHS/kg). We bought 2 more machines and built a nursery school from\nthe [Skip to content][1]\nNo results\n[ [GQ Agri] ][2]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][3]\n  * [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][4]\n  * [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][5]\n  * [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][6]\n* [Oil Press][7]\n  * [Screw Oil Press][8]\n  * [Hydraulic Oil Press][9]\n  * [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][10]\n  * [Diesel Powered Oil Press][11]\n  * [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][12]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][13]\n  * [Refinery Equipment][14]\n  * [Centrifugal Oil Filter][15]\n  * [Plate and Frame Filter Press][16]\n  * [Vacuum Oil Filter][17]\n  * [Pneumatic Oil Filter][18]\n* [Filling Machine][19]\n* [Roasting Machine][20]\n* [About][21]\n  * [Contact][22]\n  * [News][23]\n  * [White Paper][24]\n\nContact Us Now\n\n[ Get Quote ][25]\n[ ][26] [ ][27] [ ][28] [ ][29]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][30]\n* [Animal Fat Processing][31]\n  * [Animal Fat Oil Rendering Equipment][32]\n  * [Animal Fat Oil Refining Equipment][33]\n  * [Animal Oil Fractionation and Dewaxing Equipment][34]\n* [Oil Press][35]\n  * [Screw Oil Press][36]\n  * [Hydraulic Oil Press][37]\n  * [Temperature controlled oil filter integrated oil press][38]\n  * [Diesel Powered Oil Press][39]\n  * [Mobile Commercial Oil Press Machine][40]\n* [Oil Filter Machine][41]\n  * [Refinery Equipment][42]\n  * [Centrifugal Oil Filter][43]\n  * [Plate and Frame Filter Press][44]\n  * [Vacuum Oil Filter][45]\n  * [Pneumatic Oil Filter][46]\n* [Filling Machine][47]\n* [Roasting Machine][48]\n* [About][49]\n  * [Contact][50]\n  * [News][51]\n  * [White Paper][52]\nSearch\n[ Get Quote ][53]\n[[GQ Agri][GQ Agri][GQ Agri]][54]\nMenu\n\n# Reliable agricultural processing equipment\n\nWe are committed to providing efficient and reliable small and medium-sized agricultural processing\nequipment to farmers and agricultural practitioners around the world, helping agricultural\nproduction efficiency, reducing operating costs, and doubling income.\n\n[ Join Early Access ][55]\n[ Pioneer Program ][56]\n\n### Solve These 3 Problems in Your Farm\n\n#### Low efficiency and unreliability\n\nRust-proof treatment in tropical climate to ensure efficient operation\n\n#### Is the power unstable\n\nDiesel/electric dual-powered model\n\n#### The equipment is too expensive\n\nThe price is only 2/5 of European and American brands\n\n## Popular products\n\nMachines Designed for Your Success\n\n[[home Animal fat processing equipment][home Animal fat processing equipment]][57]\n\n### [Animal fat processing equipment][58]\n\n[[home Oil Press Machine][home Oil Press Machine]][59]\n\n### [automatic oil press Machine][60]\n\n[[home Oil Filter Machine][home Oil Filter Machine]][61]\n\n### [Oil Filter Machine][62]\n\n[[Roasting machine warehouse 4][Roasting machine warehouse 4]][63]\n\n### [Roasting machine][64]\n\n[[home Filling machine][home Filling machine]][65]\n\n### [Filling machine][66]\n\n## Trusted by Farmers Worldwide\n\nSince 2010, [GQ-Agri][67] has provided reliable, affordable processing solutions to small-scale\nfarmers and agripreneurs/cooperatives in over 20 countries. Our rugged equipment helps farmers\nincrease productivity by 30-50% while reducing processing time by 70% compared to traditional\nmethods. With 15+ years of engineering expertise, each machine has a lifespan of over 5 years \u2013\ntwice the industry average for similar equipment. Committed to ensuring your long-term success after\nyour purchase.\n\n[ISO White][ISO White]\n[CE White][CE White]\n[SONCAP White][SONCAP White]\n[Oil press production workshop][Oil press production workshop]\n\n## Customer Testimonials\n\nCustomer Feedback from All Over the World\n\nNow My Kids Can Go to University! Before GQ-Ari, I sold raw coconuts for 2,500 IDR/kg. With the\nDY-200 oil press, I now earn 35,000 IDR/liter of virgin oil. My 4-worker family processes 120kg/day\n- income jumped from 300,000 IDR to 4.2 million IDR daily. Last month, I opened a bank account for\nmy daughter's medical school.\nAhmad YusufCoconut Oil Producer\nAfter the floods destroyed my crops, I used GQ-Ari's press to turn waste rice bran into oil. From\n1kg bran (worth 5,000 VND) I extract 300ml oil selling for 45,000 VND. My 3-woman collective now\nearns 12 million VND/month - enough to replant our fields AND buy a solar dryer.\nL\u00ea Th\u1ecb H\u01b0\u01a1ngRice Bran Oil Entrepreneur\nUsed to sell kernels to factories at 1.8 MYR/kg. With the NK-150 sheller, I process 300kg/day into\npremium kernels (4.5 MYR/kg). In 18 months, I upgraded from motorcycle delivery to owning a 600\u33a1\nprocessing shed with 6 local employees.\nRajesh KumarPalm Kernel Processor\nOur 13 members spent 150 PHP/day transporting copra to mills. The GQ-Ari CP-80 press lets us process\n80 nuts/hour onsite. Now we sell bottled oil at 120 PHP/250ml instead of 35 PHP/kg for copra -\nincome up by 340%. No More 4AM Trips to the Mill.\nMaria Dela CruzCoconut Farmers' Cooperative President\nMiddlemen paid 15 GHS/kg for raw nuts. My wife's women's group uses the SB-05 sheller to produce\n50kg/day of premium kernels (42 GHS/kg). We bought 2 more machines and built a nursery school from\nthe profits. The children call it 'the shea butter school\nKwame OseiShea Nut Collector\nExporters bought our sacha inchi seeds for 12 PEN/kg. With GQ-Ari's cold press, we now bottle\norganic oil (85 PEN/100ml). 20 families increased annual income from 8,000 PEN to 34,000 PEN. We\njust installed WiFi for the village school using oil profits.\nCarlos QuispeIndigenous Farming Association\n\nBuy any machine now and have a chance to get 100 pieces of \"portable oil storage bag with spout\" for\nfree.\n\nParticipate now\n\n## Media resources\n\nVarious media resources help agricultural development\n\n[\n[Commercial Oil Press Machine Types][Commercial Oil Press Machine Types]\n][68]\n\n### [ Differences of Commercial Oil Press Machine Types ][69]\n\nGQ_Agri July 7, 2025\n\nWhat Is a Commercial Oil Press Machine? What are the types of commercial oilseed oil presses?\nSummary Table of Oil Press Machine Types. Need Help Choosing Your Commercial Oil Press?\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][70]\n[\n[Oil pressing hot pressing temperature][Oil pressing hot pressing temperature]\n][71]\n\n### [ Guide to hot pressing temperatures for oil extraction from crops. ][72]\n\nGQ_Agri August 18, 2025\n\nThe press keeps going. The seeds are clean and new. But the oil flow remains low. Many processors\nmid-size processors\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][73]\n[\n[screw bar row oil press vs round row oil press machine][screw bar row oil press vs round row oil\npress machine]\n][74]\n\n### [ The Difference Between Screw Bar Row Oil Press And Round Row Oil Press ][75]\n\nGQ_Agri September 16, 2025\n\nThe high quality of oil is even available without the sacrifice of efficiency and durability, and is\nsomething I have\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][76]\n[\n[Price Analysis of Oil Press Machines][Price Analysis of Oil Press Machines]\n][77]\n\n### [ Price Analysis of Oil Press Machines for Small and Medium-Sized Oil Mills ][78]\n\nGQ_Agri December 16, 2025\n\nRecently I was in a peanut mill in Senegal and the manager there explained to me that the most\ndifficult\n\n[ Read More \u00bb ][79]\n\n## Small Machines,"
