licious goodness and ready to squeeze its way into your fridge\n(and your heart).\n18/06/2024\n][48]\n[\n[Get Nuts and cook with Soilmates Macadamia Oil!]\nGet Nuts and cook with Soilmates Macadamia Oil!\n\nHi there Soilmates! We mostly rave about Soilmates Avocado Oil, but there is a small little friend\nthat we want to put in the spotlight today. Because we are totally nuts about our 100% pure\nMacadamia Oil. It is set to take your meals from ordinary to extraordinary. Ready to see how this\ngolden liquid can help you too? Let\u2019s dive into the nutty details!\n\n29/07/2024\n][49]\n[\n[The story of Jono - our first ambassador]\nAmbassador\nThe story of Jono - our first ambassador\n\n# **Why does everything have to be beautiful in our society? And in advertising even more so?**\n\n18/06/2024\n][50] [\nView all\n][51]\nStay up to date\n\nJoin our newsletter and enjoy 10% discount on your next order to keep your guac game strong, your\nkitchen stocked with Soilmates and your inbox full of avocado joy. Be the first to know about fresh\ndrops, exclusive deals, and maybe\u2026 avocado-themed parties. (Just kidding\u2026 or are we?) Sign up now\nand become part of the Soilmates family!\n\nWe are here to help.\n* [ hello@soilmates.com ][52]\nShop\n[ All products ][53] [ Oils ][54] [ Sale ][55] [ Specials ][56]\nService\n[ FAQ ][57] [ Shipping ][58] [ Returns ][59] [ Contact ][60]\nAbout\n[ About us ][61] [ Soil to oil ][62] [ Ugly Gems ][63] [ Ambassadors ][64] [ Contact ][65]\nFollow us\n[ ][66] [ ][67] [ ][68] [ Shop ][1] [ Stories ][2] [ About ][3] [ 'Ugly' Gems ][4] [ Hello Chef ][5]\n[\n][6]\n[\nAccount ][7]\nen\n[\nCart\n0\n][8]\nShop\n* [All products][9]\n* [Oils][10]\n* [Sale][11]\n* [Specials][12]\n* [Recipe & stories][13]\n* About\n* [Ugly Gems ][14]\n* [Hello Chef][15]\nAbout\n* [About us][16]\n* [Soil to oil][17]\n* [Ugly Gems][18]\n* [Ambassadors][19]\n* [Contact][20]\n[\nAccount ][21]\nen\n[ All products ][22] [ Oils ][23] [ Sale ][24] [ Specials ][25]\n[\