        "crawl_text": "* [ABOUT][1]\n* [Privacy][2]\n* [Terms][3]\n* [cpd training][4]\nTechnical +44 (0) 191 587 9213 | General Enquiries +44 (0) 191 587 2287\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][5]\n\n# [Sotech Optima][6]\n\nBespoke Metal Rainscreen Cladding & Facade Panel Systems\n* [Rainscreen Solutions][7]\n  * * [Rainscreen Systems][8]\n      * [Optima FC+, Secret Fix Hook On Rainscreen][9]\n      * [Optima TFC+, Through Fix Cassette Rainscreen][10]\n      * [Optima Edge, SECRET FIX, FLAT PANEL APPEARANCE][11]\n      * [Optima FlatFix, Flate Plate Rainscreen][12]\n      * [OPTIMA BrickTECH, Alternative to traditional brickwork][13]\n    * [Planks][14]\n      * [OPTIMA XTR Contour][15]\n      * [Optima Clip Plank System][16]\n      * [Optima Interlock Plank Rainscreen][17]\n    * [Specialist Cladding][18]\n      * [OPTIMA Shingles][19]\n      * [OPTIMA MEADOW, Living Wall Rainscreen][20]\n      * [Optima Vertex Spandrel][21]\n    * [Ancillaries][22]\n      * [Sotech Clip on Coping][23]\n      * [Sotech Perforations][24]\n      * [Sotech Flashings][25]\n* [Resources][26]\n  * [What is Rainscreen Cladding?][27]\n  * [Fire testing][28]\n  * [CWCT][29]\n  * [SAFE HANDS Promise][30]\n  * [SUSTAINABILITY][31]\n  * [EPD][32]\n  * [Modelling Environment][33]\n  * [SOTECH VR][34]\n  * [LEARNING Zone & Showroom][35]\n* [Case Studies][36]\n* [NEWS][37]\n* [Downloads][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n\n[ Sign in ][40]\nSearch\n[ Cart 0 ][41]\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][42]\n[ Cart 0 ][43]\nPhysically tested, digitally analysed, proven at full scale. Engineered for\nPerformance [Our Systems][44] Precision manufacturing, backed by ISO-approved standards you can\ntrust. In house\nManufacturing [Our Approach][45] Scaling precision in every single detail.\nDetails\nat Scale [Award Winning Case studies][46] [contact][47] [about][48] [systems][49] prev\n0{{current_slide_index}} / next\n* [WELCOME TO SOTECH][50]\n* [What's new?][51]\n* [Modelling Environment][52]\n* [Rainscreen Systems][53]\n* [Safe Hands][54]\n* [Get in Touch][55]\n\n## SAFE, SUSTAINABLE RAINSCREEN FACADE CLADDING\n\n### SOTECH IS A LEADING DESIGNER AND MANUFACTURER OF THE OPTIMA RANGE OF ENGINEERED METAL RAINSCREEN\n### FACADE CLADDING SOLUTIONS AND ARCHITECTURAL FABRICATIONS.\n\nFrom **[secret-fix hook on fa\u00e7ade cladding solutions][56]** to **[bespoke extrusion tailored to meet\nyour design][57]**, Sotech works closely with architects, specifiers, fire consultants, main\ncontractors and installers to specify the most suitable [fa\u00e7ade cladding solution][58].\n\nOur expert team can provide cutting edge advice on the most suitable **[fa\u00e7ade cladding\nsolution][59]** for the project, as well as fire safety, design and production.\n\n### Introducing the optima range of facade cladding systems:\n* [Optima FC+ Secret Fix Hook on Facade Cladding][60]\n* [Optima TFC+ Through Fix Cassette Facade Cladding][61]\n* [Optima Edge Secret Fix Rainscreen with a Flat Plate Appearance][62]\n* [Optima XTR Contour Bespoke Tailored Extrusion][63]\n* [Optima IPC Pressed Plank Facade Cladding][64]\n* [Optima Shingles Discrete & Secret Fix][65]\n* [Optima BrickTech Non-Combustible Brick System][66]\n* [Optima Meadow Supporting Biodiversity Custom Fa\u00e7ade Cladding][67]\n* [Optima Clip Plank Rainscreen System][68]\n* [Optima Interlock Plank System][69]\n* [Optima FlatFix Flat Plate Cladding System][70]\n* [Optima Vertex Spandrels][71]\n\n[View our facade cladding systems][72]\nWe are here because of our customers, and those customers contact us project after project for\nadvice, solutions and recommendations because we care about the details in the fa\u00e7ade cladding\nsector. We share our industry knowledge generously and we go the extra mile to complete projects to\nthe highest standards, protecting the building, protecting the inhabitants, and enhancing the\nreputation of fa\u00e7ade cladding in the industry.\n\n## Sotech: Details, at Scale\n\nAs regulations tighten and scrutiny intensifies, responsibility for performance is being more\nclearly defined across the entire supply chain. In this environment, facade performance can no\nlonger be assumed through specification alone. It must be evidenced through testing and demonstrated\nin consistent delivery.\n\nAs such, facade cladding should be considered as a complete system rather than a collection of\nindividual products. Panels, brackets, rails, insulation, cavity barriers and fixings all work\ntogether, and the performance of the facade is defined by how those elements are designed, tested\nand installed as a whole, across complex schemes. It is the very definition of \u2018Details at Scale\u2019.\n\nFocusing on individual components in isolation no longer reflects how facade performance is\nassessed, or how risk is managed in practice. Ultimately, performance is proven not just in\nprinciple, but in the execution of every detail, at scale.\n\n[Learn more][73]\n\n## Bespoke Facade Cladding\n\nSotech also specialises in manufacturing bespoke, complex fa\u00e7ade cladding designs, offering a wide\nrange of architectural facade features including fins, perforations, balconies, and curves. * [ABOUT][1]\n* [Privacy][2]\n* [Terms][3]\n* [cpd training][4]\nTechnical +44 (0) 191 587 9213 | General Enquiries +44 (0) 191 587 2287\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][5]\n\n# [Sotech Optima][6]\n\nBespoke Metal Rainscreen Cladding & Facade Panel Systems\n* [Rainscreen Solutions][7]\n  * * [Rainscreen Systems][8]\n      * [Optima FC+, Secret Fix Hook On Rainscreen][9]\n      * [Optima TFC+, Through Fix Cassette Rainscreen][10]\n      * [Optima Edge, SECRET FIX, FLAT PANEL APPEARANCE][11]\n      * [Optima FlatFix, Flate Plate Rainscreen][12]\n      * [OPTIMA BrickTECH, Alternative to traditional brickwork][13]\n    * [Planks][14]\n      * [OPTIMA XTR Contour][15]\n      * [Optima Clip Plank System][16]\n      * [Optima Interlock Plank Rainscreen][17]\n    * [Specialist Cladding][18]\n      * [OPTIMA Shingles][19]\n      * [OPTIMA MEADOW, Living Wall Rainscreen][20]\n      * [Optima Vertex Spandrel][21]\n    * [Ancillaries][22]\n      * [Sotech Clip on Coping][23]\n      * [Sotech Perforations][24]\n      * [Sotech Flashings][25]\n* [Resources][26]\n  * [What is Rainscreen Cladding?][27]\n  * [Fire testing][28]\n  * [CWCT][29]\n  * [SAFE HANDS Promise][30]\n  * [SUSTAINABILITY][31]\n  * [EPD][32]\n  * [Modelling Environment][33]\n  * [SOTECH VR][34]\n  * [LEARNING Zone & Showroom][35]\n* [Case Studies][36]\n* [NEWS][37]\n* [Downloads][38]\n* [Contact Us][39]\n\n[ Sign in ][40]\nSearch\n[ Cart 0 ][41]\n[ [Sotech Optima] [Sotech Optima] ][42]\n[ Cart 0 ][43]\nPhysically tested, digitally analysed, proven at full scale. Engineered for\nPerformance [Our Systems][44] Precision manufacturing, backed by ISO-approved standards you can\ntrust. In house\nManufacturing [Our Approach][45] Scaling precision in every single detail.\nDetails\nat Scale [Award Winning Case studies][46] [contact][47] [about][48] [systems][49] prev\n0{{current_slide_index}} / next\n* [WELCOME TO SOTECH][50]\n* [What's new?][51]\n* [Modelling Environment][52]\n* [Rainscreen Systems][53]\n* [Safe Hands][54]\n* [Get in Touch][55]\n\n## SAFE, SUSTAINABLE RAINSCREEN FACADE CLADDING\n\n### SOTECH IS A LEADING DESIGNER AND MANUFACTURER OF THE OPTIMA RANGE OF ENGINEERED METAL RAINSCREEN\n### FACADE CLADDING SOLUTIONS AND ARCHITECTURAL FABRICATIONS.\n\nFrom **[secret-fix hook on fa\u00e7ade cladding solutions][56]** to **[bespoke extrusion tailored to meet\nyour design][57]**, Sotech works closely with architects, specifiers, fire consultants, main\ncontractors and installers to specify the most suitable [fa\u00e7ade cladding solution][58].\n\nOur expert team can provide cutting edge advice on the most suitable **[fa\u00e7ade cladding\nsolution][59]** for the project, as well as fire safety, design and production.\n\n### Introducing the optima range of facade cladding systems:\n* [Optima FC+ Secret Fix Hook on Facade Cladding][60]\n* [Optima TFC+ Through Fix Cassette Facade Cladding][61]\n* [Optima Edge Secret Fix Rainscreen with a Flat Plate Appearance][62]\n* [Optima XTR Contour Bespoke Tailored Extrusion][63]\n* [Optima IPC Pressed Plank Facade Cladding][64]\n* [Optima Shingles Discrete & Secret Fix][65]\n* [Optima BrickTech Non-Combustible Brick System][66]\n* [Optima Meadow Supporting Biodiversity Custom Fa\u00e7ade Cladding][67]\n* [Optima Clip Plank Rainscreen System][68]\n* [Optima Interlock Plank System][69]\n* [Optima FlatFix Flat Plate Cladding System][70]\n* [Optima Vertex Spandrels][71]\n\n[View our facade cladding systems][72]\nWe are here because of our customers, and those customers contact us project after project for\nadvice, solutions and recommendations because we care about the details in the fa\u00e7ade cladding\nsector. We share our industry knowledge generously and we go the extra mile to complete projects to\nthe highest standards, protecting the building, protecting the inhabitants, and enhancing the\nreputation of fa\u00e7ade cladding in the industry.\n\n## Sotech: Details, at Scale\n\nAs regulations tighten and scrutiny intensifies, responsibility for performance is being more\nclearly defined across the entire supply chain. In this environment, facade performance can no\nlonger be assumed through specification alone. It must be evidenced through testing and demonstrated\nin consistent delivery.\n\nAs such, facade cladding should be considered as a complete system rather than a collection of\nindividual products. Panels, brackets, rails, insulation, cavity barriers and fixings all work\ntogether, and the performance of the facade is defined by how those elements are designed, tested\nand installed as a whole, across complex schemes. It is the very definition of \u2018Details at Scale\u2019.\n\nFocusing on individual components in isolation no longer reflects how facade performance is\nassessed, or how risk is managed in practice. Ultimately, performance is proven not just in\nprinciple, but in the execution of every detail, at scale.\n\n[Learn more][73]\n\n## Bespoke Facade Cladding\n\nSotech also specialises in manufacturing bespoke, complex fa\u00e7ade cladding designs, offering a wide\nrange of architectural facade features including fins, perforations, balconies, and curves.\n\nWhether it\u2019s creating bold vertical or horizontal emphasis with feature fins, enhancing airflow and\nlight with custom perforations, or integrating balcony cladding seamlessly with the main fa\u00e7ade,\nSotech delivers innovative, high-performance fa\u00e7ade cladding solutions tailored to the most\ndemanding design visions.\n\nUtilising fire-rated fa\u00e7ade cladding materials and systems, Sotech combines aesthetic flexibility\nwith rigorous performance, ensuring safety and compliance across all its bespoke architectural\nfa\u00e7ade cladding projects.\n\n[Speak to our expert team][74]\n\n## Trusted by the Facade Cladding Industry\n\n### Dedicated to safety, sustainability and excellence, Sotech are committed to continually\n### improving, testing and enhancing their fa\u00e7ade cladding solutions.\n\nHaving tested since 2006, Sotech has always put a huge focus on fire safety in the rainscreen\ncladding industry. Today, the Optima range is available in A1 and A2 materials such as PPC\nAluminium, Anodised Aluminium, Pre-Paint Aluminium, ACM A2, Alpolic A1, Copper, Corten Steel,\nStainless Steel and Zinc. Sotech can provide true A1 non-combustible fa\u00e7ade cladding systems\ncomplete with mechanical fixings in place of adhesive.\n\nAll systems carry full CWCT certification and the Optima FC+, TFC+ and Edge have been tested to\nBS8414-2 standards, BR135 classification. Sotech is also accredited to ISO9001:2015, ISO14001:2015,\nISO45001 and we are aiming to achieve The Net Zero Carbon Buildings Commitment 2030 through our\nsupply chain. At Sotech we are always seeking improvements to protect our environmental and natural\nresources. This is why we are working towards achieving a verified EPD, not just for \u2018components\u2019\nbut for our full rainscreen systems.\n\n[Learn more][75]\nWe pride ourselves on being recognised as the safe hands in the industry, committed to providing\nsafe, sustainable fa\u00e7ade cladding solutions that are innovative and market leading in design and\nmanufacture. With over 40 years of experience in the fa"
