        "crawl_text": "[Skip to content][1]\n833 - 756-8645 (PLNTOIL)|[info@spack-international.com][2]\n[LinkedIn][3][Facebook][4][Instagram][5][X][6]\n[ [Spack International Logo] [Spack International Logo] [Spack International Logo] ][7]\nSearch for:\n* [OUR COMPANYIn control from seed to oil][8]\n* [OUR PRODUCTSOur product range][9]\n  * [Certified Organic Canola Oil][10]\n  * [Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil][11]\n  * [Organic Flaxseed Oil][12]\n  * [Certified Organic Palm Oil][13]\n  * [Organic Coconut Oil RBD][14]\n  * [Certified Organic Sunflower Oil][15]\n* [OUR QUALITYOwn laboratory for optimum quality][16]\n* [REQUEST A QUOTATIONGet a proposal that meets your needs][17]\n* [NEWSStay up to date][18]\n* [CONTACT USGet in touch with the team][19]\nSearch for:\n* [OUR COMPANYIn control from seed to oil][20]\n* [OUR PRODUCTSOur product range][21]\n  * [Certified Organic Canola Oil][22]\n  * [Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil][23]\n  * [Organic Flaxseed Oil][24]\n  * [Certified Organic Palm Oil][25]\n  * [Organic Coconut Oil RBD][26]\n  * [Certified Organic Sunflower Oil][27]\n* [OUR QUALITYOwn laboratory for optimum quality][28]\n* [REQUEST A QUOTATIONGet a proposal that meets your needs][29]\n* [NEWSStay up to date][30]\n* [CONTACT USGet in touch with the team][31]\n* [OUR COMPANYIn control from seed to oil][32]\n* [OUR PRODUCTSOur product range][33]\n  * [Certified Organic Canola Oil][34]\n  * [Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil][35]\n  * [Organic Flaxseed Oil][36]\n  * [Certified Organic Palm Oil][37]\n  * [Organic Coconut Oil RBD][38]\n  * [Certified Organic Sunflower Oil][39]\n* [OUR QUALITYOwn laboratory for optimum quality][40]\n* [REQUEST A QUOTATIONGet a proposal that meets your needs][41]\n* [NEWSStay up to date][42]\n* [CONTACT USGet in touch with the team][43]\nHome (With Grizzly Text)[Koen Zuyderwijk][44]2026-01-26T09:24:23-04:00\n[Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Coconut Oil RBD in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Flaxseed Oil in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Palm Oil in Bulk]\n[Organic oil quality control]\n\n# # We produce your organic vegetable oils in bulk at the most competitive price\n\n[\nDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGEDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGE\n][45]\n[Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Coconut Oil RBD in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Flaxseed Oil in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Palm Oil in Bulk]\n[Organic oil quality control]\n\n# # We produce your organic vegetable oils in bulk at the most competitive price\n\n[\nDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGEDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGE\n][46]\n\n# Organic Vegetable Oil\n\nWe are the leading wholesale manufacturers of organic vegetable oil and conventional oils. At Spack\nInternational, we have specialized in high-quality, certified organic oils since the year 2000. Over\ntime, we have become one of the leading organic vegetable oil suppliers. We are an ideal partner\ncompany for anyone seeking bulk organic vegetable oil. As trusted certified organic vegetable oil\nwholesalers, we ensure full control over the entire production process, from seed harvesting to oil\nproduction, in our advanced expeller and packing facilities in the Netherlands. We pride ourselves\non being among the organic vegetable oil suppliers with the most rigorous oversight at every stage.\nWe are committed to delivering the highest quality organic vegetable oil on the market and\nsupporting health-conscious and environmentally sustainable choices.\n\n[CONTACT US][47]\n\n## What Makes Us the Top Organic Vegetable Oil Supplier?\n\nFounded in 1977, we are a trusted bulk organic vegetable oil company. We are a family-owned business\nthat expanded to the U.S. in 2019. We are a team of efficient and experienced organic vegetable oil\nsuppliers, providing high-quality oils, including [organic palm oil][48], to meet the needs of\nvarious industries. Our other products include [organic canola][49] oil, palm oil, coconut oil, and\nflaxseed oil. Our New Jersey and Toronto warehouses stock IBC totes and drums to ensure fast\nwholesale organic vegetable oil availability with short lead times. We also maintain bulk storage of\nhigh-oleic [organic sunflower oil][50] in New Jersey and the Chicago area, enabling quick delivery\nvia tanker trucks. We focus on sourcing the highest-quality ingredients, offering competitive\npricing, and delivering excellent customer service. These commitments have positioned us globally as\na prominent bulk organic vegetable oil manufacturer. We are proud to be among the world\u2019s premier\norganic high-oleic sunflower oil producers. We can accommodate any bulk order size. Our delivery\noptions include railcars, ISO tanks, flexitanks, or pallets of totes and drums. Our supply of\n[organic coconut oil in bulk][51] further enhances your convenience when doing business with us.\nVarious types of coconut oil, including organic coconut oil RBD and organic virgin coconut oil, are\nsome of our beloved wholesale organic vegetable oil products. The product range is further\ndiversified by including [organic flaxseed oil][52]. These ingredient [Skip to content][1]\n833 - 756-8645 (PLNTOIL)|[info@spack-international.com][2]\n[LinkedIn][3][Facebook][4][Instagram][5][X][6]\n[ [Spack International Logo] [Spack International Logo] [Spack International Logo] ][7]\nSearch for:\n* [OUR COMPANYIn control from seed to oil][8]\n* [OUR PRODUCTSOur product range][9]\n  * [Certified Organic Canola Oil][10]\n  * [Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil][11]\n  * [Organic Flaxseed Oil][12]\n  * [Certified Organic Palm Oil][13]\n  * [Organic Coconut Oil RBD][14]\n  * [Certified Organic Sunflower Oil][15]\n* [OUR QUALITYOwn laboratory for optimum quality][16]\n* [REQUEST A QUOTATIONGet a proposal that meets your needs][17]\n* [NEWSStay up to date][18]\n* [CONTACT USGet in touch with the team][19]\nSearch for:\n* [OUR COMPANYIn control from seed to oil][20]\n* [OUR PRODUCTSOur product range][21]\n  * [Certified Organic Canola Oil][22]\n  * [Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil][23]\n  * [Organic Flaxseed Oil][24]\n  * [Certified Organic Palm Oil][25]\n  * [Organic Coconut Oil RBD][26]\n  * [Certified Organic Sunflower Oil][27]\n* [OUR QUALITYOwn laboratory for optimum quality][28]\n* [REQUEST A QUOTATIONGet a proposal that meets your needs][29]\n* [NEWSStay up to date][30]\n* [CONTACT USGet in touch with the team][31]\n* [OUR COMPANYIn control from seed to oil][32]\n* [OUR PRODUCTSOur product range][33]\n  * [Certified Organic Canola Oil][34]\n  * [Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil][35]\n  * [Organic Flaxseed Oil][36]\n  * [Certified Organic Palm Oil][37]\n  * [Organic Coconut Oil RBD][38]\n  * [Certified Organic Sunflower Oil][39]\n* [OUR QUALITYOwn laboratory for optimum quality][40]\n* [REQUEST A QUOTATIONGet a proposal that meets your needs][41]\n* [NEWSStay up to date][42]\n* [CONTACT USGet in touch with the team][43]\nHome (With Grizzly Text)[Koen Zuyderwijk][44]2026-01-26T09:24:23-04:00\n[Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Coconut Oil RBD in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Flaxseed Oil in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Palm Oil in Bulk]\n[Organic oil quality control]\n\n# # We produce your organic vegetable oils in bulk at the most competitive price\n\n[\nDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGEDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGE\n][45]\n[Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Coconut Oil RBD in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Flaxseed Oil in Bulk]\n[Certified Organic Palm Oil in Bulk]\n[Organic oil quality control]\n\n# # We produce your organic vegetable oils in bulk at the most competitive price\n\n[\nDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGEDISCOVER OUR PRODUCT RANGE\n][46]\n\n# Organic Vegetable Oil\n\nWe are the leading wholesale manufacturers of organic vegetable oil and conventional oils. At Spack\nInternational, we have specialized in high-quality, certified organic oils since the year 2000. Over\ntime, we have become one of the leading organic vegetable oil suppliers. We are an ideal partner\ncompany for anyone seeking bulk organic vegetable oil. As trusted certified organic vegetable oil\nwholesalers, we ensure full control over the entire production process, from seed harvesting to oil\nproduction, in our advanced expeller and packing facilities in the Netherlands. We pride ourselves\non being among the organic vegetable oil suppliers with the most rigorous oversight at every stage.\nWe are committed to delivering the highest quality organic vegetable oil on the market and\nsupporting health-conscious and environmentally sustainable choices.\n\n[CONTACT US][47]\n\n## What Makes Us the Top Organic Vegetable Oil Supplier?\n\nFounded in 1977, we are a trusted bulk organic vegetable oil company. We are a family-owned business\nthat expanded to the U.S. in 2019. We are a team of efficient and experienced organic vegetable oil\nsuppliers, providing high-quality oils, including [organic palm oil][48], to meet the needs of\nvarious industries. Our other products include [organic canola][49] oil, palm oil, coconut oil, and\nflaxseed oil. Our New Jersey and Toronto warehouses stock IBC totes and drums to ensure fast\nwholesale organic vegetable oil availability with short lead times. We also maintain bulk storage of\nhigh-oleic [organic sunflower oil][50] in New Jersey and the Chicago area, enabling quick delivery\nvia tanker trucks. We focus on sourcing the highest-quality ingredients, offering competitive\npricing, and delivering excellent customer service. These commitments have positioned us globally as\na prominent bulk organic vegetable oil manufacturer. We are proud to be among the world\u2019s premier\norganic high-oleic sunflower oil producers. We can accommodate any bulk order size. Our delivery\noptions include railcars, ISO tanks, flexitanks, or pallets of totes and drums. Our supply of\n[organic coconut oil in bulk][51] further enhances your convenience when doing business with us.\nVarious types of coconut oil, including organic coconut oil RBD and organic virgin coconut oil, are\nsome of our beloved wholesale organic vegetable oil products. The product range is further\ndiversified by including [organic flaxseed oil][52]. These ingredients are the backbone of numerous\nhealth-centric and eco-friendly formulations. By working with one of the most established organic\nvegetable oil wholesalers, you are opting for a partner that understands the nuances of this\nversatile oil and provides unparalleled quality and service.\n\n[CONTACT US][53]\n\n### **Our Product Line**\n\n[admin][54]2026-01-15T05:04:03-04:00\n[Spack International - Organic Canola Oil]\n\n#### [ Certified Organic Canola Oil ][55]\n\n## [Certified Organic Canola Oil][56]\n\n[admin][57]2026-01-14T09:53:20-04:00\n[Spack International - Organic Coconut Oil]\n\n#### [ Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil ][58]\n\n## [Certified Organic Virgin Coconut Oil][59]\n\n[admin][60]2026-01-26T09:35:15-04:00\n[Spack International - Organic Flaxseed Oil]\n\n#### [ Organic Flaxseed Oil ][61]\n\n## [Organic Flaxseed Oil][62]\n\n[admin][63]2026-01-15T05:06:53-04:00\n[Organic Palm Oil]\n\n#### [ Certified Organic Palm Oil ][64]\n\n## [Certified Organic Palm Oil][65]\n\n[admin][66]2026-05-18T10:31:17-04:00\n[Organic Coconut Oil RBD]\n\n#### [ Organic Coconut Oil RBD ][67]\n\n## [Organic Coconut Oil RBD][68]\n\n[admin][69]2026-01-26T09:40:06-04:00\n[sunflower seeds and oil]\n\n#### [ Certified Organic Sunflower Oil ][70]\n\n## [Certified Organic Sunflower Oil][71]\n\n### Choose Our Wholesale Organic Vegetable Oil\n\nAs a company deeply invested in this sector, we welcome you to contact us and explore the options\navailable for bulk organic vegetable oil. By getting wholesale organic vegetable oil from our\ncompany, you are choosing a path of ethical business practices, top-tier product quality, and a\npromise of fast and reliable delivery. We use the highest quality [ingredients][72] and are well\nrespected among organic vegetable oil manufacturers and suppliers globally. You can trust in our\ncommitment to organically grown products and take the next step in upgrading your inventory. Call us\ntoday to discover how our wholesale organic vegetable oil options can benefit your operations.\n\n[REQUEST A QUOTATION][73]\n\n##"
