        "crawl_text": "## center>This page needs JavaScript activated for the best user experience\n\n[*][1] [Activate Offer][2]\n[ [Sunbasket Logo] ][3]\n* [Menu][4]\n* [How It Works][5]\n* [Values][6]\n* [Menu][7]\n* [How It Works][8]\n* [Values][9]\n* [Help][10]\n* [Sign in][11]\n* [Get Started][12]\n* First Name\n  * [Sign Out][13]\n* [Complete Sign Up!][14]\n[ [Sunbasket Logo] ][15]\n* [Sign In][16]\n* [Get Started][17]\n* First Name\n  * [Sign Out][18]\n* [Complete Sign Up!][19]\n* [ View Menu ][20]\nToggle navigation\n* [Join][21]\n[ [Sunbasket Logo] ][22]\n* [My Menu][23]\n* [Schedule][24]\n* [The Beta][25]\n* [Explore][26]\n* [Earn $40][27] [Earn $40][28]\n* [Help][29]\n* [Admin][30]\n[\nSchedule\n][31]\n[\nMy Menu\n][32]\n* VIP\n  [First Name ][33]\n  * [ My Account\n    \n    dinners for people\n    , Delivery\n    \n    Chef's Table\n    \n    ][34]\n  * [ Chef's Table\n    \n    Unlock free delivery, flex-scheduling, and rewards!\n    \n    ][35]\n  * [ VIP VIP Club ][36]\n  * [ Rate Recipes ][37]\n  * [ BETA The Beta ][38]\n  * [ Earn $40 ][39]\n  * [ Wine Club ][40]\n  * [ Give Sunbasket ][41]\n  * [ Recycle ][42]\n  * [ Admin Tool][43]\n  * [Sign Out][44]\nToggle navigation\n* [ My Account\n  Credits: 0\n  \n  dinners for people\n  , Delivery\n  \n  Chef's Table\n  \n  ][45]\n* [ Chef's Table\n  \n  Unlock free delivery, flex-scheduling, and rewards!\n  \n  ][46]\n* [ VIP VIP Club ][47]\n* [ Rate Recipes ][48]\n* [ Explore ][49]\n* [ Earn $40 ][50]\n* [ Wine Club ][51]\n* [ Give Sunbasket ][52]\n* [ Recycle ][53]\n* [ Help ][54]\n* [ Admin Tool][55]\n* [Sign Out][56]\n\n# Your Kind of Healthy\n\n## Delicious meals made with clean ingredients and organic fresh produce, delivered to your door and\n## ready in minutes.\n\n[Get Started][57]\n\n### Rated a Top 10 Meal Kit\n\nUSA Today Reader's Choice\n\n### #1 Meal Kit for Healthy Eating\n\nHealthline\n\n### Best for Variety!\n\nFood Network\n\n## How It Works\n\n1\n[Salmon Dinner]\n\n### Choose your meals and extras\n\n2\n[a sun basket box surrounded by ingredients]\n\n### We deliver fresh each week\n\n3\n[stir fry noodles fresh and ready tray]\n\n### Meals ready in minutes\n\n4\n[person holding phone looking at a recipe in our app]\n\n### Skip or cancel anytime\n\n[Order Now][58]\n[chopping veggies clipart]\n\nEasy & Convenient\n\nQuick recipes designed for busy people, delivered to your door\n\nHealthy meals that delight.\n\n[usda organic seal]\n\nThe Best Quality\n\nEnjoy organic fresh produce and clean ingredients. Proud [certified organic handler][59].\n\nAlways organic fresh produce.\n\n[timer on fire clipart]\n\nMeal Planning Made Easy\n\nPut meal planning on autopilot to eat well all week\n\nCook or simply heat and eat.\n\n## Choose Easy\u2014or Easier\n\nMeal Kits for when you want to get hands-on, Pre-Made Meals when you don\u2019t. Choose one style or mix\nand match.\n\nReady in 30 minutes or less\n\nMeal Kits\n\nCook with easy-to-follow directions, featuring the best seasonal ingredients\n\nReady in less than 5 minutes\n\nPre-Made Meals\n\nDelivered fresh and ready to heat -- the quickest way to a healthy dinner or lunch\n\nReady in 30 minutes or less\nReady in less than 5 minutes\n\n## Customize Your Menu Meal Delivery for Any Lifestyle\n\nChoose a home meal delivery plan for your taste, or mix and match any of our weekly recipes\n\n[Find Your Meal Plan][60]\n[ Paleo ][61] [ Vegetarian ][62] [ Gluten-Free ][63] [ Carb-Conscious ][64] [ Keto-Friendly ][65] [\nMediterranean ][66] [ Diabetes-Friendly ][67] [ Pescatarian ][68] [ Pre-Made Meals ][69]\n[Find Your Meal Plan][70]\n[someone eating Bibimbap]\n[someone eating tacos]\n[someone eating a chicken salad]\n[Paleo]\n\n## Paleo\n\nNutrient-rich meals packed with whole foods and an abundance of meat, seafood, fruits, vegetables,\nand nuts.\n* **Calories**: About 400-800 calories per serving\n* **High in Protein**: 10-25 grams protein\n* **High in Fiber**: 5 grams fiber or more per serving\n* **Good Fats**