        "crawl_text": "[[Sunbasket Logo]][1]\n* [Menu][2]\n* [How It Works][3]\n[Get Started][4]\n\n# Your Kind of Healthy\n\nDelicious meals crafted by Award-Winning Chefs, and approved by Board-Certified Dietitians for\nhealthy weight management.\n\n[Get Started][5]\n\n###### [Switch to Sunbasket: **Get 20% Off** Your First 5 Boxes + **Free Shipping**][6]\n\n## How It Works\n\n1\n\nSignup today and get 20% off + free shipping on your first 5 boxes.\n\n2\n[pic]\n\nChoose your meals and extras\n\n3\n[pic]\n\nWe deliver fresh each week\n\n4\n[pic]\n\nMeals ready in minutes\n\n5\n[pic]\n\nSkip or cancel anytime\n\n[Order Now][7]\n[pic]\n\n## Healthy Meal Delivery\n\n##### Clean, high-quality ingredients and organic produce\n\nWe believe everyone deserves to enjoy good food made from clean, high-quality ingredients and\norganic produce. Sunbasket offers healthy meals delivered, from heat-and-eat meals to cooking kits,\nfor all tastes and lifestyles.\n\n##### Select meals and ingredients that work for you\n\nWith Sunbasket, you choose the meals and ingredients that you want. From our Fresh & Ready meals\nready in minutes to cooking kits with easy-to-follow recipes, we have an option that fits your\nschedule. And with our weekly menu featuring two dozen healthy, fresh meals, there\u2019s something for\nevery appetite: high protein and low carb choices, gluten-free ingredients, vegetarian options,\nquick-cooking meals, and much more. Stick with a meal plan or mix and match from our full menu.\n\n##### Get everything in a cold-packed home delivery package\n\nAfter you\u2019ve chosen your meals, we send you everything in a cold-packed home meal delivery package.\nOur Fresh & Ready meals come ready to heat and eat. Follow our easy cooking or heating instructions\nand you\u2019ll have a delicious meal in no time. Our healthy meal plans come with pre-portioned organic\nproduce and all the seasonings, sauces, and protein you need to cook a delicious meal.\n\n##### Healthy food at home in minutes\n\nEnjoy delicious, healthy food at home in minutes with Sunbasket\u2019s home delivery meal plans. Simple\nas that.\n\n## Weekly Meal Deliveries to Meet Your Goals\n\nPersonalize our menu to your tastes, preferences, and lifestyle \u2013 all while staying on track.\n\n[pic]\n\n##### Paleo\n\nNutrient-rich meals packed with protein. No dairy, gluten, grains, soy, or corn.\n\n[Explore Paleo Menu][8]\n[pic]\n\n##### Vegetarian\n\nA meatless balance of healthy and delicious to keep you satisfied and stoked.\n\n[Explore Vegetarian Menu][9]\n[pic]\n\n##### Carb-Conscious\n\n25-35g net carbs or fewer per serving with plenty of protein.\n\n[Explore Carb-Conscious Menu][10]\n[pic]\n\n##### Gluten-Free\n\nCrazy-delicious meals with all of the flavor and none of the gluten.\n\n[Explore Gluten-Free Menu][11]\n[pic]\n\n##### Mediterranean\n\nWhole grains, good fats, wild-caught seafood and responsibly sourced meats.\n\n[Explore Mediterranean Menu][12]\n[pic]\n\n##### Keto-Friendly\n\nHigh in protein and feel-good fats, low in carbs and calories.\n\n[Explore Keto-Freindly Menu][13]\n[pic]\n\n##### Diabetes-Friendly\n\nRecipes approved by the American Diabetes Association.\n\n[Explore Diabetes-Friendly Menu][14]\n[pic]\n\n##### Pescatarian\n\nNo meat or poultry. Vegetarian meals + wild-caught seafood.\n\n[Explore Pescatarian Menu][15]\n\n### Chef-Crafted,\n### Dietitian-Approved\n\nLooking for a new weight loss program? Stay on track with Sunbasket\u2019s ready-to-eat meals and recipe\nkits, for seamless weight management.\n* Sustainably lose weight with over 30+ weekly meal options.\n* Satisfy your palette with award-winning recipes.\n* Manage your menu on the go with Sunbasket\u2019s mobile app.\n\n[Find Your Meal Plan][16]\n\n## Discover Your New Favorites\n\nHealthy, nutrient-packed breakfasts, lunches, dinners, and snacks to keep you on track.\n\n[ [pic] ][17]\n[ [pic] ][18]\n[ [pic] ][19]\n[ [pic] ][20]\n[ [pic] ][21]\n[ [pic] ][22]\n[ [pic] ][23]\n[ [pic] ][24]\n\n### Let's do lunch.\n### And breakfast.\n\nHeck, snacks too. Add Market items to your basket for feel-good deliciousness, any time of day.\n\n[Check it Out][25]\n\n## What Our Members Are Saying\n\nI am eating and feeling better, and even losing weight. The consistency and ease of meal preparation\nis the key.\n\n###### Linda N. - Member since 2020\n\nI've lost some weight cooking for myself, and my blood pressure is lower too!!\n\n###### Elizabeth T. - Member since 2021\n\nI was able to order exclusively Paleo and even lost weight. This was the most effortlessly healthy 4\nweeks in my life!\n\n###### Alek L. - Member since 2016\n\n### Hungry Yet?\n\n[Build Your Basket][26]\n\n\nMouthwatering money-back [guarantee][27]\n\nDownload the app\n* [ [pic] ][28]\n* [ [pic] ][29]\n\nFollow Us\n\n\u00a9 2023 Sunbasket Version 5.29.5 | [Terms][30] | [Policy][31] | [Accessibility][32] | [Security][33]\n\n[1]: https://sunbasket.com\n[2]: https://sunbasket.com/menu\n[3]: #how-it-works\n[4]: https://sunbasket.com/join\n[5]: https://sunbasket.com/join\n[6]: https://sunbasket.com/join\n[7]: https://sunbasket.com/join\n[8]: https://sunbasket.com/menu\n[9]: https://sunbasket.com/menu\n[10]: https://sunbasket.com/menu\n[11]: https://sunbasket.com/menu\n[12 [[Sunbasket Logo]][1]\n* [Menu][2]\n* [How It Works][3]\n[Get Started][4]\n\n# Your Kind of Healthy\n\nDelicious meals crafted by Award-Winning Chefs, and approved by Board-Certified Dietitians for\nhealthy weight management.\n\n[Get Started][5]\n\n###### [Switch to Sunbasket: **Get 20% Off** Your First 5 Boxes + **Free Shipping**][6]\n\n## How It Works\n\n1\n\nSignup today and get 20% off + free shipping on your first 5 boxes.\n\n2\n[pic]\n\nChoose your meals and extras\n\n3\n[pic]\n\nWe deliver fresh each week\n\n4\n[pic]\n\nMeals ready in minutes\n\n5\n[pic]\n\nSkip or cancel anytime\n\n[Order Now][7]\n[pic]\n\n## Healthy Meal Delivery\n\n##### Clean, high-quality ingredients and organic produce\n\nWe believe everyone 